export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"bimcraft","name":"BimCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.9","summary":"Qaababka darbiga, kala jaridda, kala-fogaanta, fidinta iyo qufulka shabakada, heerarka hoos dhulka, cabbirrada shabakada iyo Qiyaas qorshaha, muuqaalada nuqulka ah ee leh habka shaqada iyo miisaska qalmaha, Report as, dhoofinta Collada iyo Google Earth, Scan to BIM, falanqaynta dabaysha iyo jilicsanaanta, add-ons-ka daabacaadda resin.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["waxa cusub","0.9","qoraalada sii-deynta","qaababka darbiga","afar-geesle","poligon","qaanso","khadadka la doortay","jid-raad xadka","kala-fogaan","isku xidh","sanduuq-fidin","isku khadi iyo quful","kala jar darbi","booska","dib u isku xidh","quful shabakada","ka fidi","ka cabbir","ku dar heer hoose","basement","amarka heerka","cabbirka shabakada","qiyaas qorshaha","habka shaqada","nuqulka aragta","koobi gaar ah","aragta xidhan","miiska qalmaha","daabac sida la muujiyo","warbixin ahaan","qor miisaan","soo geli svg","ku dhig qorshaha","ku dhig moodeelka","collada","dae","kmz","google earth","scan to bim","culeyska dabaysha","jilicsanaanta","finite-element","guddiga dukumentiyada","daabacaadda resin","waxa cusub","whats new","qoraalada sii-deynta","changelog","isbeddelada","0.8","0.8.1","nooca","astaamaha cusub","ka baxsan","dadka","codka","dib-u-dhawaaq","daadka","dabaysha","dhulgariir","khatarta","nolosha","ids","calaamadaha","jadwalada","guuri","isku khadi","kala qaybi","sawir","background","scan to walls","goobta civilcraft","sawirrada panelka","qaab-dhismeed","solar","pv","vrf","fan coil","cabbirka tuubada","tray kaabal","iftiin","konkreet","isbarbardhig scan","epsg","khariidad","dukumentiyada","tamplate","karbon","kharash","energyplus","mishiinka rendarka","ku fur","usd","glb","unreal","ka noqo","add-ons","pcf","calaamado","dhir","raad","qalmaha","safka","panel-ka browser-ka","qaabeynta"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"darbiyo","text":"Darbiyo","level":3},{"id":"heerarka-shabakadaha-iyo-qiyaasidda","text":"Heerarka, shabakadaha iyo qiyaasidda","level":3},{"id":"aragtiyada-xaashiyada-iyo-daabacaadda","text":"Aragtiyada, xaashiyada iyo daabacaadda","level":3},{"id":"maktabad-dhigida","text":"Maktabad: dhigida","level":3},{"id":"faylal-iyo-kaaliyayaal","text":"Faylal iyo kaaliyayaal","level":3},{"id":"falanqayn","text":"Falanqayn","level":3},{"id":"add-ons-kale-iyo-dukumentiyo","text":"Add-ons kale iyo dukumentiyo","level":3},{"id":"app-kasta-gudihiisa","text":"App kasta gudihiisa","level":2},{"id":"lagu-hagaajiyay","text":"Lagu hagaajiyay","level":2},{"id":"xaddiidyada-runta-ah","text":"Xaddiidyada runta ah","level":2},{"id":"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1","text":"Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub-2","text":"Cusub","level":3},{"id":"lagu-hagaajiyay-0-8-1","text":"Lagu hagaajiyay 0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"weli-ma-jiro-nooca-tan","text":"Weli ma jiro nooca Tan","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waa wixii isbeddelay BimCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. Laba mawduuc oo waaweyn ayaa jira: qalab darbi oo runta ah iyo aragtiyo u dhaqma sida dadka ka imanaya barnaamijyada BIM ee waaweyn ay filayaan. Waxaa ku dheeraada dhoofinta Collada, kaaliyayaasha qalabka korantada ku dhigi kara, Scan to BIM, iyo shaqada dabaysha, jilicsanaanta iyo finite-element ee tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"darbiyo\"\u003EDarbiyo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabab oo buuxa sawir.\u003C/strong\u003E Gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabab\u003C/span\u003E (ama dooro qaab liiska qaabka safka Darbiga) si aad u sawirto afar-geesle, afar-geesle la rogay, poligon 3 ilaa 64 dhinac leh, qaanso ka dhexdhexaad ah, qaanso taabasho ah, darbiyo ku saabsan khadadka la doortay, ama darbiyo ku wareegsan meel xidhan oo aad gujiso gudaheeda. Afar-geesle waa afar darbi oo leh afar geeska isku xidhan iyo hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaababka darbiga, kala jar, kala-fogaan, fidin iyo quful\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDejiso ka hor sawirka, beddel ka dib.\u003C/strong\u003E Safka Darbiga wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-fogaan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xidh\u003C/span\u003E (ka saar calaamadda si aad u sawirto darbiyo madax-bannaan). Kadib isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-fogaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq-fidin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku khadi iyo quful\u003C/span\u003E darbiyada la sawiray. Darbi la guuriyay ama la fidiyay wuxuu hayaa albaabyadiisa, daaqadihiisa iyo cabbirradiisa. Tilmaam kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJarjar darbiyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhamaadyo xor ah\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir qayb\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u isku xidh\u003C/span\u003E waxay darbi ka jaraan guji kasta ama meesha darbi kale ka gudubto. Jarid albaab marka ay tahay waa la diidaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaababka darbiga, kala jar, kala-fogaan, fidin iyo quful\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQufulo darbiyada khadadka shabakada.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro darbi ku yaal khadka shabakada oo calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuful shabakada\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E. Marka qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E shidan yahay, ku qor masaafo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri ilaa\u003C/span\u003E khad la doortay, darbiyada quflan waxay raacaan hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal darbi qaabee.\u003C/strong\u003E Gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ee darbi keliya waxaad ku xidhi kartaa sare ama saldhigga saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf hoose, waxaad wax ka beddeli kartaa qaabka muuqaalka dhinaca, waxaad janjeeyn kartaa, ama waxaad ka jari kartaa furaha darbiga aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EQaabka darbiga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererku wuxuu sheegayaa cidda dhegta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fidi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa in bilowga, dhamaadka ama dhexdhexaadka uu sii joogo markaad beddelayso dherer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka iyo cabbirka qorshaha way isku waafaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa cabbir\u003C/span\u003E (khadka dhexe, wajiga gudaha ama wajiga dibadda) wuxuu maamulaa labadaba goobta Dherer iyo cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa khadka dhexe, marka cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha hadda waxay akhrisanayaan khadka dhexe halka hore ay ka akhrisan jireen wajiga dibadda. Ka beddel safka Darbiga, gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiyo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"heerarka-shabakadaha-iyo-qiyaasidda\"\u003EHeerarka, shabakadaha iyo qiyaasidda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar heer hoose.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heer hoose\u003C/span\u003E gudaha panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa heer hoosta kan ugu hooseeya, isla dherer la mid ah, meel dherer taban (Level -1, Level -2). Waxba kale ma dhaqdho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heerarka…\u003C/span\u003E hadda aqbalaa dherarka taban. Qoridda LEVEL, LEVELS, STOREY ama STOREYS khadka amarka waxay furtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heerarka…\u003C/span\u003E, waxaana jira badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerarka\u003C/span\u003E ee menu-yada iyo tab-yada ribbon-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003EGoobaha, dhismayaasha iyo heerarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada shabakada qorshaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Markaad qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E shidan tahay, calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E si aad u sawirto masaafada u dhexeysa khadadka deriska ah iyo cabbirka guud ee ka baxsan goobooyinka qorshaha heer kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grid-dimensions\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grid-dimensions\"\u003ECabbirka shabakada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiyaas qorshaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa masaafo oo leh farqiga X iyo Y ee u dhexeeya laba guji. Waxba ma kaydsana moodeelka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure-on-the-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure-on-the-plan\"\u003EQiyaas qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiro tiirar oo isku mar ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro tiirar la socda darbi, liiska wuxuu kala kooxeeyaa nooc kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaliya kuwan hay\u003C/span\u003E. Hal guji wuxuu hayaa tiirarka oo muujinaya goobahooda wada jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal cutubka meel walba.\u003C/strong\u003E Isku xidhka, cabbirrada, qaybaha, heerarka qorshaha, culeysyada iyo natiijooyinka tab-ka qaabka, iyo qoraalka Dhibaatooyinka waxay raacaan cutubka aad doorato. Dhoofintu waxay ku sii jirtaa SI.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"aragtiyada-xaashiyada-iyo-daabacaadda\"\u003EAragtiyada, xaashiyada iyo daabacaadda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka shaqada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka shaqada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa inta u dhexeysa aragtiyada mid kasta leeyahay faallooyinkiisa iyo miisaska qalmaha, ama wada-wadaagaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/working-style\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/working-style\"\u003EHabka shaqada, aragtiyada laga nuqlay, daabacaadda qalmaha, Warbixin ahaan iyo tamplateyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul aragta.\u003C/strong\u003E Qorshayaasha, qorshayaasha saqafka, dhawaaqyada, muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada waxa loo samayn karaa sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobi gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELagu xidhay\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig koobi gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa aragta xidhan mid madax-bannaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/working-style\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/working-style\"\u003EHabka shaqada, aragtiyada laga nuqlay, daabacaadda qalmaha, Warbixin ahaan iyo tamplateyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaabac sida la arko, ama miiska qalmaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Ka-beddelka qalinka waxa lagu hayaa IFC aragta ku dhex jirta, xaashiyada iyo PDF-yadana waxay ku sawiraan sida shaashaddu u sawirto. Isla cutubkaas wuxuu daboolayaa miisaska qalmaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWarbixin ahaan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixin ahaan\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa dhul la sawiray sida waddo, darbi sida panel, ama saqaf sida rambo IFC ahaan nooca aad doorato, wuxuuna ku tiriyaa sidaas jadwalada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, Raadi, Midabka ku salaysan iyo Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawir oo guuri darbiyada, furayaasha, heerarka, cabbirrada iyo qoraalada muuqaalka dhinaca ama goynka, adiga oo leh xaashiyadaada cabbirka iyo meelaha magacyada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003ETafatirka muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Xaashiyo kasta waxay noqon kartaa landscape ama portrait. Sanduuq \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQor miisaan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ku yaal liiska miisaanka muuqaal kasta oo la dhigay (1:64, 2:1, 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;). Naqshad la dhigay waad jiidi kartaa ama furayaasha fallaadhaha ku dhaqaaqi kartaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli SVG…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu naqshadaada xaashiyada leh ka dhigaa meel-cinwaan oo leh goobo lagu qoro xaashiyo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha Maktabadda ee xaashiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta naqshadaha oo leh shayada Maktabadda waxay hesha jadwal dhibcaha Maktabadda oo aad ku dhigi karto xaashiyo kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-credits\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-credits\"\u003EDhibcaha Maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"maktabad-dhigida\"\u003EMaktabad: dhigida\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhigidu waxay raacaa aragta.\u003C/strong\u003E Aragta qorshaha, Maktabaddu waxay tusaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E; aragta 3D waxay tusaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E; Split waxay tusaa badhan kala-qaybsan oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E ekaha ugu weyn. Labada habba waxay sameeyaan isla elementka IFC. Waxaad sidoo kale jiidi kartaa kaarka Maktabadda qorshaha ama aragta 3D; qalin ama farta, riix oo sii hay, kadibna jiid. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhigida Maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"faylal-iyo-kaaliyayaal\"\u003EFaylal iyo kaaliyayaal\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECollada iyo Google Earth.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka (menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E qaababka menu-ga) wuxuu qoraa .dae, ama .kmz oo meesha uu moodeelku ku yaal khariidadda lagu dhigay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/collada\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/collada\"\u003EDhoofi moodeelka Collada ama Google Earth ahaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaaliyayaashu waxay dhigi karaan qalabka korantada.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaaliyahaaga xidhan wuxuu leeyahay qalab cusub oo ku dari, liiska, beddelka iyo tirtirka qalabka, iyo in nalalka la dejiyo. Kaaliyayaashu way damaan yihiin ilaa aad ku furto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EKa dhig kaaliyaha AI uu ka shaqeeyo moodeelkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScan to BIM (add-on).\u003C/strong\u003E Waa damaan ilaa la furo, waxaana loo baahan yahay add-on-ka Point clouds. Wuxuu soo jeediyaa dabaqyo, darbiyo, albaabyo iyo daaqado ka scan-ka, oo leh farqiga la cabbiray ee mid kasta; aqbalaadda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"falanqayn\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXogta goobta dabaysha iyo jilicsanaanta.\u003C/strong\u003E Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E: culeysyada dabaysha sida ASCE 7-10 ama 7-16 dhismo adag oo xidhan, oo leh xoog ku saabsan dabaq kasta sida kiisaska culeyska; iyo xogta goobta jilicsanaanta oo leh raadinta USGS iyo xadka naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaad qaab-dhismeed iyo finite-element.\u003C/strong\u003E Hubinta konkreetiga sida ACI 318-19, xoogagga sinaha ee u dhigma sida ASCE 7-22, dhaqdhaqaaqa dabaqa, dabaqyada iyo darbiyada sida saxanno, iyo isku-darka culeyska ee ASCE 7 iyo EN 1990. Mishiinkeenna finite-element wuxuu sameeyaa qolofyada, tetrahedra iyo falanqaynta modal. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\"\u003EHubi xubnaha konkreetiga oo samee culeysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\"\u003EFalanqaynta qaab-dhismeedka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"add-ons-kale-iyo-dukumentiyo\"\u003EAdd-ons kale iyo dukumentiyo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIftiinka gudaha (add-on).\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu dhigaa qalabka nalalka wuxuuna qoraa iftiinka lux sida lambarro gudaha qorshaha heer kasta, oo leh qiyaas dhalaalka iyo warbixin la daabici karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanel-ka dukumentiyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyada…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay qaadashada iyo celinta oo leh faylka qufulka, xarfaha nooca, xaaladaha sii-daynta iyo taariikhda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGobollada iyo birta.\u003C/strong\u003E Xirmooyinka naqshadaha iyo sharciyada dhismaha ee Koonfurta Afrika ee add-on-ka Regulations, iyo 976 cabbir birta UK ee miiska qaybta la wadaago.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-ons-ka bilaashka ah ee daabacaadda resin.\u003C/strong\u003E Slicer, taageerayaasha iyo raft, tijaabada iftiinka, iyo qaababka faylalka GOO, SL1, Chitubox iyo Anycubic, dhammaantood waa damaan ilaa la furo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-kasta-gudihiisa\"\u003EApp kasta gudihiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka aad badhan ama xakameyn ku dul joogto, waxaa soo baxa Bootstrap tooltip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETalooyinka bilowga ee meel sawir banaan waxay leedahay badhanka xirka; BimCraft wuu xasuustaa in la xiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka tab-ka panel-ka ee aan ku habboonayn hadda waa la jiidi karaa halkii laga jari lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii dukumenti la furo, tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhrisanayaa &quot;&lt;document&gt; - BimCraft | CadCraft&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E qaababka waxay yihiin liis hoos-u-dhac ah oo leh doorashooyin laba-saf ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska luqadaha ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa luqado ka badan 0.8; luqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lagu-hagaajiyay\"\u003ELagu hagaajiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuritu wuxuu shaqeeyaa tillaabooyinka,\u003C/strong\u003E iyo jiidyada, xaddiga saqafka, qalabka madax-bannaan, sawirrada iyo waddooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista darbi ma sii qalloociyo qolka.\u003C/strong\u003E Qabashada dhexe waxay darbiga u guurisaa si toosan naftiisa, geesaheeduna waxay ku dhex-siibtaan darbiyada isku xidhan. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u hesho guurinta bilaa xadka ee hore; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa 90 darajo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddelka ballacka ama nooca barta isku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E hadda wuxuu xirayaa geeska L, geeska T, barta saddex darbi iyo meesha ku xigta darbi qalloocan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuritaanka ama nuqulka koox qolal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ilaalinayaa darbiyada isku xidhan ee ka baxsan kooxda isku xidhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ilaalinayaa aqoonsiga cabbirka darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooritaanka darbi markii Sawirka la damiyo\u003C/strong\u003E ma keeno khalad gudaha Sifooyinka mar dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERendarku wuxuu u noqdaa WebGL\u003C/strong\u003E marka GPU-ga uu bilaabi waayo, halkii uu joogsan lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta EnergyPlus\u003C/strong\u003E mar kale waa la shaqayn karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDukumentiyada wuxuu furmaa wada-hadal dhexe.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, calaamadda X ama gujinta bogga mugdi ah ayaa xiraya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E waa soo baxaan\u003C/strong\u003E marka moodeel la furo, ma aha kaliya kadib markii Sawirka hal mar la shaqeeyey.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddiidyada-runta-ah\"\u003EXaddiidyada runta ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba lama daabicin qalab dhab ah. Taageerayaasha resin-ka waa kuwo cusub oo aan weli la caddeyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENatiijooyinka dabaysha, jilicsanaanta, konkreetiga iyo finite-element waa caawimo hubin injineer ah, oo lagu hubiyay qaababka xisaabta xidhan, ma aha dhismo dhab ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScan to BIM waxa lagu tijaabiyay dhismo sawir ah, ma aha scan dhab ah, waxayna helaa qolal toosan oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECollada halkan kuma furmin Blender ama Google Earth.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiyaasta iftiinka waxa lagu hubiyay raadkayaga, ma aha barnaamijyada kale ee iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka Koonfurta Afrika lama hubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka isku xidhka darbiga (butt, mitre, square off) iyo mudnaanta lakabka lama dhisin; geesaha waa mitre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Isbeddelada hore waxa ku jira xusuusta 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 ee bogga hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1\"\u003EHore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waa wixii isbeddelay BimCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. BimCraft hadda wuu jawaabi karaa su&#039;aalaha dhismaha oo wuu tijaabin karaa, iyada oo dadka, codka, biyaha, dabaysha iyo dhulgariirka ku jira, wuxuuna sawiri karaa qalabka dheeraadka ah; 0.8.1 waa nooc hagaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cusub-2\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETijaabi dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDadka dhismaha ku jira.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDadka dhismaha ku jira\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca bidix ayaa dadka u kala gudbisa ka baxitaanka degdegga ah ama imaanshaha maalinta caadiga ah qolalkaaga, albaabyadaaga iyo tallaabooyinkaaga. Waxaad arkaysaa safafka meesha dhismuhu ku yaraado, socodka ugu dheer ee laga gaaro bax kasta qol kasta, iyo inta uu qofka ugu dambeeya qaadanayo. Calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidh\u003C/span\u003E albaab si aad u aragto wixii isbeddelaya, calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETus dadka muuqaalka 3D\u003C/span\u003E si aad u daawato socodkayaasha. Natiijooyinka waxay u aaddaan Dhibaatooyinka. Waa moodel tirada dadka oo qiyaas ah oo loo isticmaalo go&#039;aamada naqshadda, ma aha shahaado amniga dab. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/people-in-the-building\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/people-in-the-building\"\u003ESocodka dadka dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhawaaqa qolka, oo maqal.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhawaaqa qolka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa wakhtiga dib-u-dhawaaqa qol kasta sida calaamadda octave (Sabine iyo Eyring) laga bilaabo cabbirkiisa iyo dusha aad doorato, oo marka aad leedahay bartilmaameed wuxuu sheegayaa inta nuugista loo baahan yahay si uu u buuxiyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu ciyaar qolkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa cod, dhaqaaq, dhawaaq xadhig ah ama faylkaaga codka oo ka gudba jawaabta impulse-ka loo xisaabiyay qolka. Qiyaasaha nuugista waa qiyamo caadi ah oo la daabacay oo aad beddeli karto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-acoustics\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-acoustics\"\u003EDhawaaqa qolka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECiyaarinta daadka, dabaysha iyo dhulgariirka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaarinta khatarta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa biyaha oo kor u kacaya qolalka, cadaadiska dabaysha dabaq kasta iyo dhulgariir gariirinaya dabaqyada, qorshe ama muuqaal dhinac oo leh jiidiye waqti. Moodallo fudud oo ay qaadayaan malo-awaalkoodu liiska; ma aha hubin code. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hazard-playback\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hazard-playback\"\u003ECiyaar daad, dabayl ama dhulgariir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa burbura sanad konton gudahood.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida nolosha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa daaqadaha, albaabyada, dhamaystirka iyo saqafka, mid kastaa leh nolosha adeegga, sannadihii la beddelo iyo, markaad qortid kharash halbeeg kasta, kharashka sanad kasta iyo qiimihiisa hadda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi jadwalka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa. Nolosha adeegga waa lambarro qorshe. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/life-cycle-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/life-cycle-view\"\u003EEeg waxa burbura sanad konton\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta konkreetiga iyo jilicsanaanta.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXubnaha kontaadada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuleysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/span\u003E ee tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E waxay hubiyaan biimaha iyo tiirarka konkreetiga sida ACI 318-19 waxayna sameeyaan xoogagga sinaha u dhigma sida ASCE 7-22 dabaqyada adag, oo leh dhaqdhaqaaqa dabaqa. Injineer ayaa hubiya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/concrete-and-seismic\"\u003EHubi xubnaha konkreetiga oo samee culeysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubi oo warbixi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa hubi IDS-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Soo rar faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.ids\u003C/code\u003E ee macmiilku siiyey oo arag elementka kasta ee aan buuxin gudaha Dhibaatooyinka, ka hor inta aadan keenin IFC. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa hubi IDS-ka\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-against-ids\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-against-ids\"\u003EKa hubi moodel IDS-ka macmiilka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamado iyo jadwalo.\u003C/strong\u003E Qeex calaamadahaaga, dejiso elementyo badan isku mar, oo samee jadwalo oo tiirarkoodu, shaandheyntoodu iyo kooxahoodu akhrisan calaamadahaas; calaamadaha waxa lagu hayaa IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\"\u003ECalaamado iyo jadwalo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa tamplate-ka specification-ka IFC-ga furan wuxuuna kaydiyaa PDF, dukumenti Word ama Markdown. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EDukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbarbardhig scan-ka moodelka.\u003C/strong\u003E Markii point cloud la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa elementka kasta inuu dhisan yahay, qayb ka dhisan, maqan ama aan la gaarin, wuxuuna muujiyaa boqolkiiba la dhisay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\"\u003EIsbarbardhig scan-ka moodelka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKarbon iyo kharash.\u003C/strong\u003E Panel-ka Karbon wuxuu isku geeyaa karbonka alaabta oo ka soo baxda miis qiyaas oo aad wax ka beddeli karto, panel-ka Kharash-na wuxuu kala qaybiyaa qiimaha jadwalka 4D. Qiyaasaha ku yimid BimCraft waa guud oo waxaa lagu calaamadiyay aan la hubin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost\"\u003EKarbonka iyo kharashka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xidhka khariidad kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENidaamka isku xirka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadanayaa lambar EPSG, aag UTM, magac ama qeexitaankaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/georeference-any-projection\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/georeference-any-projection\"\u003EIsku-xidhka juqraafiga oo leh isku-dhig kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir oo wax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri, isku khadi iyo kala qaybi.\u003C/strong\u003E Hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa Guuri (M oo keliya wali waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E). Guuri wuxuu nuqulaa markaad socoto \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tallaabo kastaa waa hal ka noqo, wuxuuna ku socdaa fadhiga Live TeamWork. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/move-align-distribute\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/move-align-distribute\"\u003EGuuri, nuqul, isku khadi iyo kala qaybi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirro hoos qorshaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa PNG, JPEG ama WebP hoosta qorshaha heerka ama dhanka tooska ah. Miisaanka dejiso laba dhibcood, oo guuri, wareeji, dhuumo iyo quful. Meel laga nuqlay MarkupCraft wuxuu ku dhex-dhajiyaa miisaanka xaashiyadiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pictures-as-backgrounds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pictures-as-backgrounds\"\u003EKu dhig sawir hoosta qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyo scan-ka ka yimid.\u003C/strong\u003E Markii scan la furo, darbiyada, albaabyada iyo qolalka waxay ku imanayaan soo jeedin aad ka aqbali karto ama diidi karto midkiiba, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Kaliya darbiyada laba jihood oo toosan ayaa la helaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/scan-to-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/scan-to-walls\"\u003EScan u rog darbiyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaad, qalmaha iyo jaad sawir.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa heer kale oo jiiran hoos qorshaha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalmaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha miisaan khadkooda gaar ah aragta mid, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir jaad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu jid sawirtay u rogaa jaad. Mesh-ka Wavefront OBJ ayaa furma. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/trace-pens-stairs-obj\"\u003ERaadi heer, qalmo iyo jaad ka sawir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhismayaasha ku wareegsan cinwaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhismayaasha iyo qaybta dhulka ee CivilCraft&#039;s Address to site helay waxay ku imanayaan soo jeedinno; calaamadee kuwa aad ku darayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-from-civilcraft\"\u003EKa bilow goobta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada panelka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirrada panelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaabeeyaa darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada alwaax ama bir fudud oo gaabis ah wuxuuna kaydiyaa liiska jarista CSV iyo sawirrada shaqada PDF. Qiyamo bilaabid, ma aha naqshad qaab-dhismeed. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/panel-drawings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/panel-drawings\"\u003ESawirrada panelka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalettada calaamadaha iyo dhirta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPalettada calaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raadiyaa calaamadaha korantada iyo biibaysta magacyadooda; ilaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhirta\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa qiyaastii 400 dhir oo leh calaamadaha qorshaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003EPalettada calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plant-list\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plant-list\"\u003EKu dhig dhir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyinka, tuubada hawada iyo tamarta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESplit, VRF iyo fan coils.\u003C/strong\u003E Unitiyada gudaha iyo dibada oo leh xidhiidhadooda, iyo khadadka qalabka oo cabbirkooda laga qaadayo miis qiyamo tusaale ah oo caadi ah oo aad beddeli karto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/split-vrf-fan-coils\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/split-vrf-fan-coils\"\u003ESplit, VRF iyo fan coils\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Panel-ka Xisaabinta wuxuu hubiyaa cabbirrada tuubada bixinta iyo tuubada hawada oo leh hoos-u-dhaca cadaadiska, wuxuu u wareejiyaa kaabloyinka sariiraha iyo tuubooyinka wuxuuna muujiyaa buuxinta, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa iftiinka laga bilaabo faylalka IES ama EULUMDAT. Qiyamaha caadiga ah waa la calaamadeeyay; qor qiyamaha code-kaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-calculations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-calculations\"\u003EXisaabinta tuubada, tuubada hawada, kaabloyinka iyo nalalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka PCF.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabka tuubada \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi PCF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa socodyada barnaamijyada xoogga tuubada iyo isometric-ka, faylka PCF ee dib loo akhriyo wuxuu sawiraa tuubadiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/piping-pcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/piping-pcf\"\u003EFaylalka qaybaha tuubada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolar PV.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku rakib kooxaha saqafka ama dhulka, hoos u dhig iyaga moodelka, qiyaas tamarta sannadlaha, hubi xadhigyada oo samee xogta jaantuska hal-khad. Moduulka bilowga iyo khasaaraha waa guud. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/solar-pv\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/solar-pv\"\u003ESolar PV\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka EnergyPlus.\u003C/strong\u003E Panel-ka Hubi EnergyPlus wuxuu qoraa moodelka sida IDF si aad ugu shaqeeyo EnergyPlus-kaaga. Shaqeynta browser-ka waxay u baahan tahay dhis aad martiqaadiso adigu, oo aad qorto cinwaankeeda; BimCraft ma qaado. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-with-energyplus\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-with-energyplus\"\u003EHubi kulaynta iyo qaboojinta EnergyPlus\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirro iyo faylal\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro barnaamijka rendarka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay doorasho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMishiinka\u003C/span\u003E. Laba mishiinka dhex-ku-jira ee aan (Fast iyo Path tracer) ayaa ah kuwa caadiga ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EFuran ku\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka faylka USD ama glTF, iyo fold-ka mashruuca Unreal faylka .zip; CadCraft Studio add-on wuxuu ku dari karaa mishiin. Plug-in-ka Unreal ee furaya mashruuca lama sii deynin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-engines\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-engines\"\u003EDooro barnaamijka sawirka soo saara\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E Gudaha CadCraft Studio, BimCraft wuxuu u sheegaa Studio tallaabo kasta oo dhammaatay si Studio u awoodo inay ka noqoto tallaabadaadii ugu dambaysay daaqadda aad ugu dambaysay isticmaashay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/undo-across-apps\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/undo-across-apps\"\u003EKa noqo barnaamijyada oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-ons faylkaaga gudihiisa.\u003C/strong\u003E IFC wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa add-ons-ka ku qoray, wuxuuna soo bandhigaa kuwa aad maqan tahay markaad furto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/add-ons-in-your-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/add-ons-in-your-file\"\u003EAdd-ons faylkaaga gudihiisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EApp kasta gudihiisa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh AI-gaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaaliyahaaga gaarka ah wuxuu maamuli karaa BimCraft isku xirka Studio, wuxuuna ka jawaabi karaa su&#039;aalaha moodelka, sida qolalka ku jira aag la siiyay. Studio ma leh AI-giisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EKa dhig kaaliyaha AI uu ka shaqeeyo moodelkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka qalabka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafafka qalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa Wrap, 2 safaf ama 1 safaf; Wrap wuu sii ahaanayaa kan caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka gelinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Dejinta trackpad-ka, qalinka, mouse-ka 3D, kontoroolka iyo MIDI waa la wadaagaa app kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka iyo Live.\u003C/strong\u003E Panel-ka digniinta iyo fadhiyada Live waxay shaqeeyaan sida hore, iyadoo hubinta cusub ee kor ku taxan ay quudinayso Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E 54 luqadood, toban ka mid ah oo cusub. Kuwa aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah oo weli ma akhriyin hooyo-af; mawduucyada caawinta badanaa Ingiriis ayey yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lagu-hagaajiyay-0-8-1\"\u003ELagu hagaajiyay 0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeynta ribbon + Project browser.\u003C/strong\u003E Insert › Import CAD, Insert › Image iyo Manage › Project Units waxay yidhaahdeen &quot;Weli lama dhisin BimCraft&quot;. Image hadda wuxuu furaa qalabka Sawir, Import CAD wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad ka samee…\u003C/span\u003E (DWG, DXF, PDF ama scan), Project Units wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E. Move iyo Align waxay shaqeeyaan qalabkooda Guuri iyo Isku khadi, Level wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heerarka…\u003C/span\u003E, Phases wuxuu furaa qaybta Marxaladaha dayactirka, Materials wuxuu furaa maktabadda agabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta fasalada DWG.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxaa loo akhriyay nooc qaldan; waa la hagaajiyay BimCraft iyo apps-ka kale ee akhriya DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuqadda wakhtiga socodka.\u003C/strong\u003E Studio iyo nooca xirmada ah hadda way beddeli karaan luqadda iyada oo aan dib loo bilaabin. Tani weli looma tijaabin dhammaan nidaamyada; noo sheeg haddii luqaddu aanay beddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka xirmada Archicad.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Earchicad_bundle.py\u003C/code\u003E, oo ah soo dejin kala gaar ah, hadda wuxuu helaa jidka Archicad, wuxuu daawadaa fooldhka ilaa 20 ilbiriqsi, wuxuuna dib u isku dayaa xagga xirmada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"weli-ma-jiro-nooca-tan\"\u003EWeli ma jiro nooca Tan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECaawinta amniga iyo naqshadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Dadka dhismaha ku jira ma leh xadka masaafada socodka ee code-ka dhismaha (waxaad qortaa xadka) mana la hubin gacanta qorshe dhab ah. Lambarada dhawaaqa, nolosha iyo khatarta waa qiyamo qorshe, ma aha hubin code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMustaqbalka cimilada iyo EnergyPlus.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro mustaqbal cimilo oo dhex-dhisan: waxaad soo rari kartaa faylka xaaladda ciyaarta daadka. Ciyaarta EnergyPlus ee browser-ka ma ku jirto nooca tan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeynta ribbon-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Material Takeoff wuxuu sii joogaa &quot;Weli lama dhisin&quot; sababtoo ah BimCraft ma lahan liiska tirada agabka, 54 qalab ribbon-ka oo kale oo jaloog ah ma lahan qalab BimCraft ah oo ka dambeeya weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaxiixa iyo nidaamyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Rakibayaasha Windows iyo .dmg-ga macOS ma leh saxiix, markaa SmartScreen wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaad dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu wad si kastaba\u003C/span\u003E, macOS wuxuu u baahan yahay midig-guji kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuran\u003C/span\u003E. Dhismaha iPad iyo iPhone looma dib-u-dhisin 0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETijaabooyinka bogga dhabta ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Tijaabooyinka browser-ka ee BimCraft ee hore qaarkood weli way fashilmaan bogga tijaabada, sida ay ahaayeen ka hor 0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Isbeddelada hore waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWaxa cusub ee 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kuwan waa wixii isbeddelay BimCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. Laba mawduuc oo waaweyn ayaa jira: qalab darbi oo runta ah iyo aragtiyo u dhaqma sida dadka ka imanaya barnaamijyada BIM ee waaweyn ay filayaan. Waxaa ku dheeraada dhoofinta Collada, kaaliyayaasha qalabka korantada ku dhigi kara, Scan to BIM, iyo shaqada dabaysha, jilicsanaanta iyo finite-element ee tab-ka Falanqayn. Cusub Darbiyo Qaabab oo buuxa sawir. Gudaha Sawir, fur Qaabab (ama dooro qaab liiska qaabka safka Darbiga) si aad u sawirto afar-geesle, afar-geesle la rogay, poligon 3 ilaa 64 dhinac leh, qaanso ka dhexdhexaad ah, qaanso taabasho ah, darbiyo ku saabsan khadadka la doortay, ama darbiyo ku wareegsan meel xidhan oo aad gujiso gudaheeda. Afar-geesle waa afar darbi oo leh afar geeska isku xidhan iyo hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Eeg Qaababka darbiga, kala jar, kala-fogaan, fidin iyo quful. Dejiso ka hor sawirka, beddel ka dib. Safka Darbiga wuxuu leeyahay Kala-fogaan iyo Isku xidh (ka saar calaamadda si aad u sawirto darbiyo madax-bannaan). Kadib isticmaal Kala-fogaan, Sanduuq-fidin iyo Isku khadi iyo quful darbiyada la sawiray. Darbi la guuriyay ama la fidiyay wuxuu hayaa albaabyadiisa, daaqadihiisa iyo cabbirradiisa. Tilmaam kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Jarjar darbiyada. Kala jar, Booska, Dhamaadyo xor ah, Tirtir qayb iyo Dib u isku xidh waxay darbi ka jaraan guji kasta ama meesha darbi kale ka gudubto. Jarid albaab marka ay tahay waa la diidaa. Eeg Qaababka darbiga, kala jar, kala-fogaan, fidin iyo quful. Qufulo darbiyada khadadka shabakada. Dooro darbi ku yaal khadka shabakada oo calaamadee Quful shabakada gudaha Sifooyinka. Marka qalabka Shabakad shidan yahay, ku qor masaafo Guuri ilaa khad la doortay, darbiyada quflan waxay raacaan hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Hal darbi qaabee. Gudaha Sifooyinka ee darbi keliya waxaad ku xidhi kartaa sare ama saldhigga saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf hoose, waxaad wax ka beddeli kartaa qaabka muuqaalka dhinaca, waxaad janjeeyn kartaa, ama waxaad ka jari kartaa furaha darbiga aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn. Eeg Qaabka darbiga. Dhererku wuxuu sheegayaa cidda dhegta. Ka fidi wuxuu go'aaminayaa in bilowga, dhamaadka ama dhexdhexaadka uu sii joogo markaad beddelayso dherer. Dhererka iyo cabbirka qorshaha way isku waafaqaan. Ka cabbir (khadka dhexe, wajiga gudaha ama wajiga dibadda) wuxuu maamulaa labadaba goobta Dherer iyo cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa khadka dhexe, marka cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha hadda waxay akhrisanayaan khadka dhexe halka hore ay ka akhrisan jireen wajiga dibadda. Ka beddel safka Darbiga, gudaha Sifooyinka ama Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo. Heerarka, shabakadaha iyo qiyaasidda Ku dar heer hoose. Ku dar heer hoose gudaha panel-ka Heerarka wuxuu ku daraa heer hoosta kan ugu hooseeya, isla dherer la mid ah, meel dherer taban (Level -1, Level -2). Waxba kale ma dhaqdho. Ku dar heerarka… hadda aqbalaa dherarka taban. Qoridda LEVEL, LEVELS, STOREY ama STOREYS khadka amarka waxay furtaa Ku dar heerarka…, waxaana jira badhanka Heerarka ee menu-yada iyo tab-yada ribbon-ka. Eeg Goobaha, dhismayaasha iyo heerarka. Cabbirrada shabakada qorshaha. Markaad qalabka Shabakad shidan tahay, calaamadee Cabbirrada si aad u sawirto masaafada u dhexeysa khadadka deriska ah iyo cabbirka guud ee ka baxsan goobooyinka qorshaha heer kasta. Eeg Cabbirka shabakada. Qiyaas qorshaha. Qiyaas oo ku jira kooxda Sawir wuxuu siinayaa masaafo oo leh farqiga X iyo Y ee u dhexeeya laba guji. Waxba ma kaydsana moodeelka. Eeg Qiyaas qorshaha. Tiro tiirar oo isku mar ah. Dooro tiirar la socda darbi, liiska wuxuu kala kooxeeyaa nooc kasta oo leh Kaliya kuwan hay. Hal guji wuxuu hayaa tiirarka oo muujinaya goobahooda wada jira. Hal cutubka meel walba. Isku xidhka, cabbirrada, qaybaha, heerarka qorshaha, culeysyada iyo natiijooyinka tab-ka qaabka, iyo qoraalka Dhibaatooyinka waxay raacaan cutubka aad doorato. Dhoofintu waxay ku sii jirtaa SI. Aragtiyada, xaashiyada iyo daabacaadda Habka shaqada. Dejinta › BimCraft › Habka shaqada wuxuu doortaa inta u dhexeysa aragtiyada mid kasta leeyahay faallooyinkiisa iyo miisaska qalmaha, ama wada-wadaagaan. Eeg Habka shaqada, aragtiyada laga nuqlay, daabacaadda qalmaha, Warbixin ahaan iyo tamplateyada. Nuqul aragta. Qorshayaasha, qorshayaasha saqafka, dhawaaqyada, muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada waxa loo samayn karaa sida Koobi gaar ah ama Lagu xidhay; Ka dhig koobi gaar ah wuxuu ka dhigaa aragta xidhan mid madax-bannaan. Eeg Habka shaqada, aragtiyada laga nuqlay, daabacaadda qalmaha, Warbixin ahaan iyo tamplateyada. Daabac sida la arko, ama miiska qalmaha. Ka-beddelka qalinka waxa lagu hayaa IFC aragta ku dhex jirta, xaashiyada iyo PDF-yadana waxay ku sawiraan sida shaashaddu u sawirto. Isla cutubkaas wuxuu daboolayaa miisaska qalmaha. Warbixin ahaan. Warbixin ahaan oo ku jira Sifooyinka wuxuu qoraa dhul la sawiray sida waddo, darbi sida panel, ama saqaf sida rambo IFC ahaan nooca aad doorato, wuxuuna ku tiriyaa sidaas jadwalada, Tirooyinka, Raadi, Midabka ku salaysan iyo Dhibaatooyinka. Tafatir muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada. Sawir oo guuri darbiyada, furayaasha, heerarka, cabbirrada iyo qoraalada muuqaalka dhinaca ama goynka, adiga oo leh xaashiyadaada cabbirka iyo meelaha magacyada. Eeg Tafatirka muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynyada. Xaashiyo. Xaashiyo kasta waxay noqon kartaa landscape ama portrait. Sanduuq Qor miisaan ayaa ku yaal liiska miisaanka muuqaal kasta oo la dhigay (1:64, 2:1, 1/4\" = 1'). Naqshad la dhigay waad jiidi kartaa ama furayaasha fallaadhaha ku dhaqaaqi kartaa, Qaababka… › Soo geli SVG… wuxuu naqshadaada xaashiyada leh ka dhigaa meel-cinwaan oo leh goobo lagu qoro xaashiyo kasta. Dhibcaha Maktabadda ee xaashiga. Qaybta naqshadaha oo leh shayada Maktabadda waxay hesha jadwal dhibcaha Maktabadda oo aad ku dhigi karto xaashiyo kasta. Eeg Dhibcaha Maktabadda. Maktabad: dhigida Dhigidu waxay raacaa aragta. Aragta qorshaha, Maktabaddu waxay tusaa Ku dhig qorshaha; aragta 3D waxay tusaa Ku dhig moodeelka; Split waxay tusaa badhan kala-qaybsan oo leh Ku dhig qorshaha ekaha ugu weyn. Labada habba waxay sameeyaan isla elementka IFC. Waxaad sidoo kale jiidi kartaa kaarka Maktabadda qorshaha ama aragta 3D; qalin ama farta, riix oo sii hay, kadibna jiid. Eeg Dhigida Maktabadda. Faylal iyo kaaliyayaal Collada iyo Google Earth. Collada ee qalabka (menu-ga Faylka qaababka menu-ga) wuxuu qoraa .dae, ama .kmz oo meesha uu moodeelku ku yaal khariidadda lagu dhigay. Eeg Dhoofi moodeelka Collada ama Google Earth ahaan. Kaaliyayaashu waxay dhigi karaan qalabka korantada. Kaaliyahaaga xidhan wuxuu leeyahay qalab cusub oo ku dari, liiska, beddelka iyo tirtirka qalabka, iyo in nalalka la dejiyo. Kaaliyayaashu way damaan yihiin ilaa aad ku furto Dejinta. Eeg Ka dhig kaaliyaha AI uu ka shaqeeyo moodeelkaaga. Scan to BIM (add-on). Waa damaan ilaa la furo, waxaana loo baahan yahay add-on-ka Point clouds. Wuxuu soo jeediyaa dabaqyo, darbiyo, albaabyo iyo daaqado ka scan-ka, oo leh farqiga la cabbiray ee mid kasta; aqbalaadda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Falanqayn Xogta goobta dabaysha iyo jilicsanaanta. Tab-ka Falanqayn: culeysyada dabaysha sida ASCE 7-10 ama 7-16 dhismo adag oo xidhan, oo leh xoog ku saabsan dabaq kasta sida kiisaska culeyska; iyo xogta goobta jilicsanaanta oo leh raadinta USGS iyo xadka naqshadda. Raad qaab-dhismeed iyo finite-element. Hubinta konkreetiga sida ACI 318-19, xoogagga sinaha ee u dhigma sida ASCE 7-22, dhaqdhaqaaqa dabaqa, dabaqyada iyo darbiyada sida saxanno, iyo isku-darka culeyska ee ASCE 7 iyo EN 1990. Mishiinkeenna finite-element wuxuu sameeyaa qolofyada, tetrahedra iyo falanqaynta modal. Eeg Hubi xubnaha konkreetiga oo samee culeysyada jilicsanaanta iyo Falanqaynta qaab-dhismeedka. Add-ons kale iyo dukumentiyo Iftiinka gudaha (add-on). Wuxuu dhigaa qalabka nalalka wuxuuna qoraa iftiinka lux sida lambarro gudaha qorshaha heer kasta, oo leh qiyaas dhalaalka iyo warbixin la daabici karo. Panel-ka dukumentiyada. Faylka › Dukumentiyada… wuxuu leeyahay qaadashada iyo celinta oo leh faylka qufulka, xarfaha nooca, xaaladaha sii-daynta iyo taariikhda. Gobollada iyo birta. Xirmooyinka naqshadaha iyo sharciyada dhismaha ee Koonfurta Afrika ee add-on-ka Regulations, iyo 976 cabbir birta UK ee miiska qaybta la wadaago. Add-ons-ka bilaashka ah ee daabacaadda resin. Slicer, taageerayaasha iyo raft, tijaabada iftiinka, iyo qaababka faylalka GOO, SL1, Chitubox iyo Anycubic, dhammaantood waa damaan ilaa la furo. App kasta gudihiisa Marka aad badhan ama xakameyn ku dul joogto, waxaa soo baxa Bootstrap tooltip. Talooyinka bilowga ee meel sawir banaan waxay leedahay badhanka xirka; BimCraft wuu xasuustaa in la xiray. Safka tab-ka panel-ka ee aan ku habboonayn hadda waa la jiidi karaa halkii laga jari lahaa. Markii dukumenti la furo, tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhrisanayaa \"\u003Cdocument\u003E - BimCraft | CadCraft\". Gudaha Dejinta › Guud › Qaabeynta qaababka waxay yihiin liis hoos-u-dhac ah oo leh doorashooyin laba-saf ah. Liiska luqadaha ee Dejinta wuxuu bixiyaa luqado ka badan 0.8; luqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah. Lagu hagaajiyay Guuritu wuxuu shaqeeyaa tillaabooyinka, iyo jiidyada, xaddiga saqafka, qalabka madax-bannaan, sawirrada iyo waddooyinka. Jiidista darbi ma sii qalloociyo qolka. Qabashada dhexe waxay darbiga u guurisaa si toosan naftiisa, geesaheeduna waxay ku dhex-siibtaan darbiyada isku xidhan. Hay Ctrl si aad u hesho guurinta bilaa xadka ee hore; Toosi wuxuu soo celinayaa 90 darajo. Beddelka ballacka ama nooca barta isku xidhan hadda wuxuu xirayaa geeska L, geeska T, barta saddex darbi iyo meesha ku xigta darbi qalloocan. Guuritaanka ama nuqulka koox qolal wuxuu ilaalinayaa darbiyada isku xidhan ee ka baxsan kooxda isku xidhan. Samee mar kale wuxuu ilaalinayaa aqoonsiga cabbirka darbiga. Dooritaanka darbi markii Sawirka la damiyo ma keeno khalad gudaha Sifooyinka mar dambe. Rendarku wuxuu u noqdaa WebGL marka GPU-ga uu bilaabi waayo, halkii uu joogsan lahaa. Hubinta EnergyPlus mar kale waa la shaqayn karaa. Dukumentiyada wuxuu furmaa wada-hadal dhexe. Esc, calaamadda X ama gujinta bogga mugdi ah ayaa xiraya. Badhamada Qorshe, Kala jar iyo 3D waa soo baxaan marka moodeel la furo, ma aha kaliya kadib markii Sawirka hal mar la shaqeeyey. Xaddiidyada runta ah Waxba lama daabicin qalab dhab ah. Taageerayaasha resin-ka waa kuwo cusub oo aan weli la caddeyn. Natiijooyinka dabaysha, jilicsanaanta, konkreetiga iyo finite-element waa caawimo hubin injineer ah, oo lagu hubiyay qaababka xisaabta xidhan, ma aha dhismo dhab ah. Scan to BIM waxa lagu tijaabiyay dhismo sawir ah, ma aha scan dhab ah, waxayna helaa qolal toosan oo keliya. Collada halkan kuma furmin Blender ama Google Earth. Qiyaasta iftiinka waxa lagu hubiyay raadkayaga, ma aha barnaamijyada kale ee iftiinka. Tirooyinka Koonfurta Afrika lama hubin. Qaababka isku xidhka darbiga (butt, mitre, square off) iyo mudnaanta lakabka lama dhisin; geesaha waa mitre. Luqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah. Waxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira Waxa weli aan la dhisin. Isbeddelada hore waxa ku jira xusuusta 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 ee bogga hoose. Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 Kuwan waa wixii isbeddelay BimCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. BimCraft hadda wuu jawaabi karaa su'aalaha dhismaha oo wuu tijaabin karaa, iyada oo dadka, codka, biyaha, dabaysha iyo dhulgariirka ku jira, wuxuuna sawiri karaa qalabka dheeraadka ah; 0.8.1 waa nooc hagaajin. Cusub Tijaabi dhismaha Dadka dhismaha ku jira. Qaybta Dadka dhismaha ku jira ee dhinaca bidix ayaa dadka u kala gudbisa ka baxitaanka degdegga ah ama imaanshaha maalinta caadiga ah qolalkaaga, albaabyadaaga iyo tallaabooyinkaaga. Waxaad arkaysaa safafka meesha dhismuhu ku yaraado, socodka ugu dheer ee laga gaaro bax kasta qol kasta, iyo inta uu qofka ugu dambeeya qaadanayo. Calaamadee Xidh albaab si aad u aragto wixii isbeddelaya, calaamadee Tus dadka muuqaalka 3D si aad u daawato socodkayaasha. Natiijooyinka waxay u aaddaan Dhibaatooyinka. Waa moodel tirada dadka oo qiyaas ah oo loo isticmaalo go'aamada naqshadda, ma aha shahaado amniga dab. Eeg Socodka dadka dhismaha. Dhawaaqa qolka, oo maqal. Qaybta Dhawaaqa qolka wuxuu siinayaa wakhtiga dib-u-dhawaaqa qol kasta sida calaamadda octave (Sabine iyo Eyring) laga bilaabo cabbirkiisa iyo dusha aad doorato, oo marka aad leedahay bartilmaameed wuxuu sheegayaa inta nuugista loo baahan yahay si uu u buuxiyo. Ku ciyaar qolkan wuxuu ciyaaraa cod, dhaqaaq, dhawaaq xadhig ah ama faylkaaga codka oo ka gudba jawaabta impulse-ka loo xisaabiyay qolka. Qiyaasaha nuugista waa qiyamo caadi ah oo la daabacay oo aad beddeli karto. Eeg Dhawaaqa qolka. Ciyaarinta daadka, dabaysha iyo dhulgariirka. Ciyaarinta khatarta wuxuu ciyaaraa biyaha oo kor u kacaya qolalka, cadaadiska dabaysha dabaq kasta iyo dhulgariir gariirinaya dabaqyada, qorshe ama muuqaal dhinac oo leh jiidiye waqti. Moodallo fudud oo ay qaadayaan malo-awaalkoodu liiska; ma aha hubin code. Eeg Ciyaar daad, dabayl ama dhulgariir. Waxa burbura sanad konton gudahood. Aragtida nolosha wuxuu liistaa daaqadaha, albaabyada, dhamaystirka iyo saqafka, mid kastaa leh nolosha adeegga, sannadihii la beddelo iyo, markaad qortid kharash halbeeg kasta, kharashka sanad kasta iyo qiimihiisa hadda. Kaydi jadwalka (CSV) wuxuu qoraa. Nolosha adeegga waa lambarro qorshe. Eeg Eeg waxa burbura sanad konton. Hubinta konkreetiga iyo jilicsanaanta. Qaybaha Xubnaha kontaadada iyo Culeysyada jilicsanaanta ee tab-ka Falanqayn waxay hubiyaan biimaha iyo tiirarka konkreetiga sida ACI 318-19 waxayna sameeyaan xoogagga sinaha u dhigma sida ASCE 7-22 dabaqyada adag, oo leh dhaqdhaqaaqa dabaqa. Injineer ayaa hubiya. Eeg Hubi xubnaha konkreetiga oo samee culeysyada jilicsanaanta. Hubi oo warbixi Ka hubi IDS-ka. Soo rar faylka .ids ee macmiilku siiyey oo arag elementka kasta ee aan buuxin gudaha Dhibaatooyinka, ka hor inta aadan keenin IFC. Fur Ka hubi IDS-ka hoosta Hubinta moodelka. Eeg Ka hubi moodel IDS-ka macmiilka. Calaamado iyo jadwalo. Qeex calaamadahaaga, dejiso elementyo badan isku mar, oo samee jadwalo oo tiirarkoodu, shaandheyntoodu iyo kooxahoodu akhrisan calaamadahaas; calaamadaha waxa lagu hayaa IFC. Eeg Calaamado iyo jadwalo. Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid. Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid wuxuu buuxiyaa tamplate-ka specification-ka IFC-ga furan wuxuuna kaydiyaa PDF, dukumenti Word ama Markdown. Eeg Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid. Isbarbardhig scan-ka moodelka. Markii point cloud la furo, Isbarbardhig wuxuu go'aamiyaa elementka kasta inuu dhisan yahay, qayb ka dhisan, maqan ama aan la gaarin, wuxuuna muujiyaa boqolkiiba la dhisay. Eeg Isbarbardhig scan-ka moodelka. Karbon iyo kharash. Panel-ka Karbon wuxuu isku geeyaa karbonka alaabta oo ka soo baxda miis qiyaas oo aad wax ka beddeli karto, panel-ka Kharash-na wuxuu kala qaybiyaa qiimaha jadwalka 4D. Qiyaasaha ku yimid BimCraft waa guud oo waxaa lagu calaamadiyay aan la hubin. Eeg Karbonka iyo kharashka. Isku-xidhka khariidad kasta. Qiyaas › Nidaamka isku xirka… wuxuu qaadanayaa lambar EPSG, aag UTM, magac ama qeexitaankaaga. Eeg Isku-xidhka juqraafiga oo leh isku-dhig kasta. Sawir oo wax ka beddel Guuri, isku khadi iyo kala qaybi. Hoosta Dhismaha; Shift+M wuxuu bilaabaa Guuri (M oo keliya wali waa Qiyaas). Guuri wuxuu nuqulaa markaad socoto C, tallaabo kastaa waa hal ka noqo, wuxuuna ku socdaa fadhiga Live TeamWork. Eeg Guuri, nuqul, isku khadi iyo kala qaybi. Sawirro hoos qorshaha. Dhismaha › Sawir wuxuu dhigaa PNG, JPEG ama WebP hoosta qorshaha heerka ama dhanka tooska ah. Miisaanka dejiso laba dhibcood, oo guuri, wareeji, dhuumo iyo quful. Meel laga nuqlay MarkupCraft wuxuu ku dhex-dhajiyaa miisaanka xaashiyadiisa. Eeg Ku dhig sawir hoosta qorshaha. Darbiyo scan-ka ka yimid. Markii scan la furo, darbiyada, albaabyada iyo qolalka waxay ku imanayaan soo jeedin aad ka aqbali karto ama diidi karto midkiiba, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Kaliya darbiyada laba jihood oo toosan ayaa la helaa. Eeg Scan u rog darbiyo. Raad, qalmaha iyo jaad sawir. Raad wuxuu muujiyaa heer kale oo jiiran hoos qorshaha, Qalmaha wuxuu siinayaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha miisaan khadkooda gaar ah aragta mid, Sawir jaad wuxuu jid sawirtay u rogaa jaad. Mesh-ka Wavefront OBJ ayaa furma. Eeg Raadi heer, qalmo iyo jaad ka sawir. Dhismayaasha ku wareegsan cinwaan. Dhismayaasha iyo qaybta dhulka ee CivilCraft's Address to site helay waxay ku imanayaan soo jeedinno; calaamadee kuwa aad ku darayso. Eeg Ka bilow goobta CivilCraft. Sawirrada panelka. Dhismaha › Sawirrada panelka wuxuu qaabeeyaa darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada alwaax ama bir fudud oo gaabis ah wuxuuna kaydiyaa liiska jarista CSV iyo sawirrada shaqada PDF. Qiyamo bilaabid, ma aha naqshad qaab-dhismeed. Eeg Sawirrada panelka. Palettada calaamadaha iyo dhirta. Dhismaha › Palettada calaamadaha wuxuu raadiyaa calaamadaha korantada iyo biibaysta magacyadooda; ilaha Dhirta ee Maktabad wuxuu liistaa qiyaastii 400 dhir oo leh calaamadaha qorshaha. Eeg Palettada calaamadaha iyo Ku dhig dhir. Tuubooyinka, tuubada hawada iyo tamarta Split, VRF iyo fan coils. Unitiyada gudaha iyo dibada oo leh xidhiidhadooda, iyo khadadka qalabka oo cabbirkooda laga qaadayo miis qiyamo tusaale ah oo caadi ah oo aad beddeli karto. Eeg Split, VRF iyo fan coils. Xisaabinta. Panel-ka Xisaabinta wuxuu hubiyaa cabbirrada tuubada bixinta iyo tuubada hawada oo leh hoos-u-dhaca cadaadiska, wuxuu u wareejiyaa kaabloyinka sariiraha iyo tuubooyinka wuxuuna muujiyaa buuxinta, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa iftiinka laga bilaabo faylalka IES ama EULUMDAT. Qiyamaha caadiga ah waa la calaamadeeyay; qor qiyamaha code-kaaga. Eeg Xisaabinta tuubada, tuubada hawada, kaabloyinka iyo nalalka. Faylalka PCF. Qalabka tuubada Dhoofi PCF wuxuu qoraa socodyada barnaamijyada xoogga tuubada iyo isometric-ka, faylka PCF ee dib loo akhriyo wuxuu sawiraa tuubadiisa. Eeg Faylalka qaybaha tuubada. Solar PV. Ku rakib kooxaha saqafka ama dhulka, hoos u dhig iyaga moodelka, qiyaas tamarta sannadlaha, hubi xadhigyada oo samee xogta jaantuska hal-khad. Moduulka bilowga iyo khasaaraha waa guud. Eeg Solar PV. Faylka EnergyPlus. Panel-ka Hubi EnergyPlus wuxuu qoraa moodelka sida IDF si aad ugu shaqeeyo EnergyPlus-kaaga. Shaqeynta browser-ka waxay u baahan tahay dhis aad martiqaadiso adigu, oo aad qorto cinwaankeeda; BimCraft ma qaado. Eeg Hubi kulaynta iyo qaboojinta EnergyPlus. Sawirro iyo faylal Dooro barnaamijka rendarka. Rendar wuxuu leeyahay doorasho Mishiinka. Laba mishiinka dhex-ku-jira ee aan (Fast iyo Path tracer) ayaa ah kuwa caadiga ah. Furan ku wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka faylka USD ama glTF, iyo fold-ka mashruuca Unreal faylka .zip; CadCraft Studio add-on wuxuu ku dari karaa mishiin. Plug-in-ka Unreal ee furaya mashruuca lama sii deynin. Eeg Dooro barnaamijka sawirka soo saara. Ka noqo Studio. Gudaha CadCraft Studio, BimCraft wuxuu u sheegaa Studio tallaabo kasta oo dhammaatay si Studio u awoodo inay ka noqoto tallaabadaadii ugu dambaysay daaqadda aad ugu dambaysay isticmaashay. Eeg Ka noqo barnaamijyada oo dhan. Add-ons faylkaaga gudihiisa. IFC wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa add-ons-ka ku qoray, wuxuuna soo bandhigaa kuwa aad maqan tahay markaad furto. Eeg Add-ons faylkaaga gudihiisa. App kasta gudihiisa Ku xidh AI-gaaga. Kaaliyahaaga gaarka ah wuxuu maamuli karaa BimCraft isku xirka Studio, wuxuuna ka jawaabi karaa su'aalaha moodelka, sida qolalka ku jira aag la siiyay. Studio ma leh AI-giisa. Eeg Ka dhig kaaliyaha AI uu ka shaqeeyo moodelkaaga. Safafka qalabka. Dejinta › Guud › Safafka qalabka wuxuu bixiyaa Wrap, 2 safaf ama 1 safaf; Wrap wuu sii ahaanayaa kan caadiga ah. Qalabka gelinta. Dejinta trackpad-ka, qalinka, mouse-ka 3D, kontoroolka iyo MIDI waa la wadaagaa app kasta. Dhibaatooyinka iyo Live. Panel-ka digniinta iyo fadhiyada Live waxay shaqeeyaan sida hore, iyadoo hubinta cusub ee kor ku taxan ay quudinayso Dhibaatooyinka. Luqadaha. 54 luqadood, toban ka mid ah oo cusub. Kuwa aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin ah oo weli ma akhriyin hooyo-af; mawduucyada caawinta badanaa Ingiriis ayey yihiin. Lagu hagaajiyay 0.8.1 Qaabeynta ribbon + Project browser. Insert › Import CAD, Insert › Image iyo Manage › Project Units waxay yidhaahdeen \"Weli lama dhisin BimCraft\". Image hadda wuxuu furaa qalabka Sawir, Import CAD wuxuu furaa Dhismaha › Naqshad ka samee… (DWG, DXF, PDF ama scan), Project Units wuxuu furaa Dejinta › Caalami › Cutubyada. Move iyo Align waxay shaqeeyaan qalabkooda Guuri iyo Isku khadi, Level wuxuu furaa Ku dar heerarka…, Phases wuxuu furaa qaybta Marxaladaha dayactirka, Materials wuxuu furaa maktabadda agabka. Qaybta fasalada DWG. Waxaa loo akhriyay nooc qaldan; waa la hagaajiyay BimCraft iyo apps-ka kale ee akhriya DWG. Luqadda wakhtiga socodka. Studio iyo nooca xirmada ah hadda way beddeli karaan luqadda iyada oo aan dib loo bilaabin. Tani weli looma tijaabin dhammaan nidaamyada; noo sheeg haddii luqaddu aanay beddelin. Qoraalka xirmada Archicad. archicad_bundle.py, oo ah soo dejin kala gaar ah, hadda wuxuu helaa jidka Archicad, wuxuu daawadaa fooldhka ilaa 20 ilbiriqsi, wuxuuna dib u isku dayaa xagga xirmada. Weli ma jiro nooca Tan Caawinta amniga iyo naqshadda. Dadka dhismaha ku jira ma leh xadka masaafada socodka ee code-ka dhismaha (waxaad qortaa xadka) mana la hubin gacanta qorshe dhab ah. Lambarada dhawaaqa, nolosha iyo khatarta waa qiyamo qorshe, ma aha hubin code. Mustaqbalka cimilada iyo EnergyPlus. Ma jiro mustaqbal cimilo oo dhex-dhisan: waxaad soo rari kartaa faylka xaaladda ciyaarta daadka. Ciyaarta EnergyPlus ee browser-ka ma ku jirto nooca tan. Qaabeynta ribbon-ka. Material Takeoff wuxuu sii joogaa \"Weli lama dhisin\" sababtoo ah BimCraft ma lahan liiska tirada agabka, 54 qalab ribbon-ka oo kale oo jaloog ah ma lahan qalab BimCraft ah oo ka dambeeya weli. Saxiixa iyo nidaamyada. Rakibayaasha Windows iyo .dmg-ga macOS ma leh saxiix, markaa SmartScreen wuxuu muujiyaa Macluumaad dheeraad ah, kadibna Ku wad si kastaba, macOS wuxuu u baahan yahay midig-guji kadibna Furan. Dhismaha iPad iyo iPhone looma dib-u-dhisin 0.8.1. Tijaabooyinka bogga dhabta ah. Tijaabooyinka browser-ka ee BimCraft ee hore qaarkood weli way fashilmaan bogga tijaabada, sida ay ahaayeen ka hor 0.8.1. Waxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira Waxa weli aan la dhisin. Isbeddelada hore waxa ku jira Waxa cusub ee 0.7.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.7 (hore)","summary":"BimCraft wuxuu ku daraa darbiyo dabaqyo badan, Koobiyee heerkan, darbiyo PDF iyo skaanka ka, habaynta darbiyadaada, qalab ballaaran, qalabka MEP oo leh ports, kala-dhigga isku-dhaca, furitaannada iyo spool-ka tuubada, dokumentiyada hantida, COBie iyo akhrinta sensorrada, samada, qorraxda, iftiinka maalinta shabakadda iyo culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta, isku-dhigga skaanada, muuqaalka toosan iyo raad-tracing kaarka garaafka, STEP iyo USD, kala-duwanaansho maktabadda, iyo wax badan oo caawiyayaasha AI.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.7","nooca hore","sheegidda sii-deynta","changelog","isbeddelada","0.7","nooca","astaamaha cusub","darbiyo dabaqyo ka","koobiyee heerkan","pdf","skaan","raad","darbiyo qorshayaasha ka","habaynta darbiyada","lakabyada","xudun","membreen","cabbirrada tixraaca","maktabadda agabka","cutubyada muuqaalka","qaab","joists","qoyska","cabbirro","qaab qorshe","astaan","hotspots","celi","heerka faahfaahinta","qoysas dhex","cabbir csv","dhex-element","qalabka","ports","xidhiidhyo","masaafooyin","furitaanno","spools","xaashiyada spool-ka","laxaad goobta","liiska jarista","dokumentiyo","cobie","sensorro","mqtt","feed toos ah","sky","qorraxda","daylight grid","kulaylka","qaboojinta","culeyska","u-value","isku-dhig skaanad","icp","e57","muuqaal toos ah","path tracing","webgpu","denoise","sky jireed","iftiin-isku-darka","safka rendar","kumbiyuutarkaaga","step","usd","xirmo mashruuc","horumari mugga","kala-duwanaansho","caawiyayaasha","add-on api","dhirta","korontada","hubinta naqshadda"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"dhis-dhismaha","text":"Dhis dhismaha","level":3},{"id":"qoysas","text":"Qoysas","level":3},{"id":"tuubooyinka-tuubada-hawada-iyo-qalabka","text":"Tuubooyinka, tuubada hawada iyo qalabka","level":3},{"id":"maamulka-dhismaha","text":"Maamulka dhismaha","level":3},{"id":"iftiinka-maalinta-iyo-tamarta","text":"Iftiinka maalinta iyo tamarta","level":3},{"id":"skaanada","text":"Skaanada","level":3},{"id":"sawirrada-iyo-muuqaalka-toosan","text":"Sawirrada iyo muuqaalka toosan","level":3},{"id":"faylasha-iyo-app-yada-kale","text":"Faylasha iyo app-yada kale","level":3},{"id":"caawiyayaasha-ai-iyo-add-ons","text":"Caawiyayaasha AI iyo add-ons","level":3},{"id":"la-beddelay","text":"La beddelay","level":2},{"id":"la-saxay","text":"La saxay","level":2},{"id":"app-kasta","text":"App kasta","level":2},{"id":"weli-ma-jiro-nooca","text":"Weli ma jiro nooca","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETani waa waxa isbeddelay BimCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Liiska waa la kooxeeyay aagga, kuwa ugu muhiimsan ee hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dhis-dhismaha\"\u003EDhis dhismaha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyo dabaqyo badan.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska dhererka qalabka Wall wuxuu bixiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa\u003C/strong\u003E heer kasta oo ka sarreeya, sida Sifooyinka darbi la doortay. Qorshayaasha heerarka ku-dhex-jira waxay muujinayaan darbiga mid khafiif ah, qolalka halkaas ayaa ku xirma, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha waxaa lagu geli karaa qorshayaasha, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-maraa\u003C/strong\u003E ee Sifooyinka wuxuu magacaabaa heerarka uu maro. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door#change-a-wall\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-hash=\"change-a-wall\"\u003EBeddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee heerkan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy this level…\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira Liiska heerarka wuxuu dib u sawiraa darbiyada heerka oo leh albaabyadooda iyo daaqadahooda, dabaqyadooda iyo saqafkooda heer kale ama heer cusub oo ka sarreeya, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah; qolalku wuxuu kaga muuqdaa iyagoo laftooda ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyo PDF ama skaan ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E hadda wuxuu aqbalaa PDF (khad shaqo ama skaan ku jira) ama qorshe skaan (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, bog badan): bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa darbiyada, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qolalka heer, oo bogga hoosta qorshihiisa ayuu ku jiraa. Raadku ma isticmaalo shabakad, ma isticmaalo moodel tababaran, natiijadu waa waxa khadadku siiyeen: heer kasta ka hubi bogga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EDarbiyada qorshayaasha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabaynta darbiyadaada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall assemblies…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhisaa nooc darbi lakab-lakab ah, oo leh xudun, god hawo iyo membreenno, iyo muuqaal leh cabbirro; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial library…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa agabka mashruuca IFC-ga; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa dusha iyo khadadka xudunta, wuxuuna raacaa darbiyada markay isbeddelaan. Waxa uu ka yimid kaaliye bulsho, Doc (drsurfbum). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EHabaynta darbiyada iyo cabbirrada tixraaca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECutubyada muuqaalka iyo qalabka muuqaalka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa dhererka feet iyo inji, inji, feet tobanle, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir, cabbirrada, jadwallada, isku-xidhka, cabbirrada iyo goyn. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku yaalliin qalabka sare, kala-jarka waa la jiidi karaa (ama lagu guuri karaa kiiboodhka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaded\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdges\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWireframe\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku yaalliin dhinaca muuqaalka, iyo dhicitaanka saqafka, saqaf-dhinaca iyo saqaf-hoosaha ayaa isla markiiba beddela saqafka la doortay. Waxa uu ka yimid kaaliye bulsho, Joel (yisraelk). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoists sagxadda iyo fidinta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFraming\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhisi karaa joists la hagaajiyay (horay) sida alwaax la jarey, isagoo doortaa taxanaha ugu yar iyo qoto-dheerka ugu yar ee gaadha fidinta, 16&quot; ama 24&quot; bartamaha, labada jihoodba; waxay gelayaan IFC-ga iyo liiska jarista. Talo ka timid miiska daabacan ee soo saaraha, ma aha injineernimo. Waxa uu ka yimid sidoo kale Joel. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/framing\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/framing\"\u003EDarbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada qaab-dhismeed\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAaladaha korontada oo badan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElectrical\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa dhibcaha xogta, telefoonka iyo codka-muuqaalka, beddelka xulashada, saacadda, thermostat-ka, qalabka kashifa qiiqa iyo kulaylka, badhanka shaqada, siren-ka, dabaaldegga, meeshka tamarta iyo sub-panel, mid kastaa leeyahay fasalka IFC gaarka ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/electrical-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/electrical-plan\"\u003EQorshaha korontada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qoysas\"\u003EQoysas\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoysas wax badan sameeya.\u003C/strong\u003E Sifooyinka waxay noqon karaan tirooyin buuxa, qoraal, agab, qalin ama buufin; qoys wuxuu sawiri karaa calaamad qorshe oo u gaar ah, wuxuu ku celin karaa jidh adag, wuxuu qaybaha u calaamayn karaa heerarka faahfaahinta dhimma, wuxuu hayn karaa qoysas kale (lug miiska), wuxuuna leeyahay hotspots ah oo la jiidi karo, oo ay ku jiraan walxaha la dhigay ee qorshaha. Cabbirrada waxay ka yimaadaan miiska CSV, sifooyinka lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003EWalax kasta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu oggolaanayaa labo albaab oo isku cabbir ah inay kala duwan yihiin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor#plan-symbol\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\" data-hash=\"plan-symbol\"\u003EWax ka beddel qoys\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families#sizes-from-a-table\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\" data-hash=\"sizes-from-a-table\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tuubooyinka-tuubada-hawada-iyo-qalabka\"\u003ETuubooyinka, tuubada hawada iyo qalabka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka leh ports.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa qalab hawo-qaade guud ah, dabaqe-socod, pump, boiler, kulaylka biyaha, terminal unit, diffuser, grille ama tank, oo cabbirkiisa lagu qoray qiimayaashaaga, isku xidhka tuubada iyo tuubada hawada oo ah ports. Mid kastaa waxaa loo kaydiyaa fasalka IFC-ga oo leh IFC ports. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EQalabka MEP oo leh ports\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocod xidhan.\u003C/strong\u003E Tuubo ama tuubada hawada laga bilaabo port waxay qaadaa cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda oo waxay ku sii xidhan tahay: pump dhaqaajiso, tuubadiisu way raacaysaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck connections\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa ports furan, dhamaadyo furan, cabbir iyo nidaam is-khilaafaya, iyo socodyo aan wax bixin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EKu xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClash check\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay kooxo diyaar ah iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes and ducts × structure\u003C/span\u003E hal guji. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck clearances\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa dahaarka socod kasta iyo meel bannaan oo aad qortid; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpenings needed\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa meelaha socodyadu darbiyada iyo sagxadaha ku gudbaan, CSV iyo dhibaatooyin BCF ahaan. Waxba lama jarayo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpool-ka tuubada birta.\u003C/strong\u003E Socod birta ah waxaa loo jaraa spool-yo lambaro leh dherer ugu dheer, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EField weld\u003C/span\u003Es aad dhigto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpool sheets (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siiyaa bog kasta spool, oo leh muuqaalkiisa isometric, dherarka jarista, fittings-ka, welds-ka iyo liiska alaabta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuct cut list\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa qaybaha tuubada hawada ee toosan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003ESpool-ka tuubada birta iyo xaashiyada spool-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qalab jiliska iyo isku-duubista, injineer ayaa cabbiray: ma jiraan socodyo, cadaadis ama isku-dheelitirnaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"maamulka-dhismaha\"\u003EMaamulka dhismaha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDokumentiyo hantida kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssets\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku xidhaa buugaagta, dammaanad-qaadka, sawirrada iyo naqshadaha hantida magac fayl oo ku yaal IFC-ga ama cinwaan web; oo keliya xidhiidhka ayaa gala IFC-ga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#documents\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"documents\"\u003EDokumentiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska COBie.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as COBie (.xlsx)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa buugga COBie 2.4 ee gudbinta, buugga COBie oo dib loo akhriyay wuxuu liistaa isbeddel kasta ka hor inta aan la riixin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E mar. Weli lama mariyin mudo COBie validator ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#cobie-spreadsheet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"cobie-spreadsheet\"\u003EMiiska COBie\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhrinta sensorrada iyo feeds toos ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Fur CSV oo akhrinta ah, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect\u003C/span\u003E si toos ah browser-ka ilaa MQTT broker-kaaga ama cinwaan nidaamka dhismahaaga ee jawaabta siiya: hantida kasta wuxuu muujiyaa akhrinta ugu dambaysa iyo jaantuska, midabka moodelka ayuu leeyahay, wuxuuna calaamadeeyaa haddii ka baxdo xadka IFC-ga lagu kaydiyay. Akhrinta waxay ku sii jirta tab-ka; erayga sirta ah waligiis lama kaydiyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#sensor-readings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"sensor-readings\"\u003EAkhrinta sensorrada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance#live-readings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-hash=\"live-readings\"\u003EAkhrinta toos ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"iftiinka-maalinta-iyo-tamarta\"\u003EIftiinka maalinta iyo tamarta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamada iyo qorraxda daaqad kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siiyaa daaqad kasta qaybta samada toosan iyo xagalka hor-istaagga, wuxuu raacaa qorraxda taariikh ka dhex-maraysa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESun through the windows on a date\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaylight factor on a grid\u003C/span\u003E qolal kasta, oo lagu sawiray qorshihiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor#vertical-sky-component-of-each-window\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-hash=\"vertical-sky-component-of-each-window\"\u003EQaybta samada toosan ee daaqad kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECuleyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeating and cooling loads\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa lumitaanka kulaylka qol kasta, kulaylkeeda sanad kasta iyada oo laga eegayo maalmaha heerkulka, iyo kulaylka ugu sarreeya ee qaboojinta, iyaga oo laga qaadayo waxa ku xidha moodelka iyo U-value kasta; U-value lagu qoray halkaas ayaa lagu qoraa IFC-ga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\"\u003EQiyaasidda culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabadaba waa qalab naqshadeed oo ku salaysan habab la daabacay, ma aha xisaabinta waafaqsanaanta, guddi kastaa waa sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"skaanada\"\u003ESkaanada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhig skaanado badan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERegister scans…\u003C/span\u003E (liiska bilowga, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu dhigaa skaanada hal farshaxan oo ah dhibcaha lammaanaha la doortay ama bartilmaameedyo la qoray, wuxuu hagaajiyaa ICP oo dhibic ilaa dhibic kadibna dhibic ilaa diyaarad, wuxuuna kaydiyaa isku-dhigga fayl mashruuc yar, wuxuuna qoraa daruuraha isku-dhigay hal fayl LAS ama E57. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003EIsku-dhig skaanado badan hal mid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sawirrada-iyo-muuqaalka-toosan\"\u003ESawirrada iyo muuqaalka toosan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka toosan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa moodelka hab waqtiga-dhabta ah dhinaca muuqaalka 3D, isagoo raacaya iyo isbeddel kasta, oo leh Walk, waqtiga maalinta iyo bilaha; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive view in a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geeyaa shaashad labaad. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/live-view\"\u003EMuuqaalka toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaad-tracing kaarka garaafka.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka WebGPU la isticmaalo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHigh quality (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shaqeeyaa raad-tracer-ka CadCraft ee kaarka garaafka, wuu joojin karaa oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EResume\u003C/span\u003E ayuu sii wadi karaa, dhammaadkana waa la nadiifiyaa; WebGPU la&#039;aan wuxuu isticmaalaa raad-tracer-ka WebGL sida hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax badan oo ku jira daaqadda Rendar\u003C/strong\u003E (kaarka garaafka, sidaas WebGPU ayuu u baahan yahay): sare jireed iyo sawirro samada, faylasha iftiinka IES, kamarad oo leh f-stop, qoto-dheer ee muuqaalka, muuqaal laba-barta, isbeddelka midabka, iyo 360° panoramas, darajo sawirka dhammaystiran, iftiin-isku-darka iyo qaybaha rendar-ka kadib rendar-ka, dhaxalka, qiiqa iyo caustics, kaydinta PNG 16-bit, EXR ama faylka rendar-ka, iyo safka rendar. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\"\u003ESamooyin iyo faylasha iftiinka kaarka garaafka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003ESafka rendar-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKumbiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendering\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour machine\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa garaafyada, nuxurka processor-ka iyo xusuusta uu browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka, iyo heerka uu rendar-ku bilaabo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/your-machine\"\u003EWaxa kumbiyuutarkaagu u rendaraa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"faylasha-iyo-app-yada-kale\"\u003EFaylasha iyo app-yada kale\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha STEP la furo.\u003C/strong\u003E Qayb \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E, qalab, ama moodel bixiye (AP203, AP214, AP242) waxay u furmaa moodel IFC yar, solid kastaa waa walax aad baarto, goyn, cabbir, oo aad IFC ahaan u kaydin karto. Midabyada iyo magacyada qaybaha assembly-ga weli lama akhrin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files#what-it-opens\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\" data-hash=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EFaylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu qoraa moodelada furan \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, oo hay-ah goobta, dhismaha, dabaqa iyo takhasuska, oo leh IFC class, GlobalId iyo sifo kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi moodelka USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMass CivilCraft-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Mass dhismo oo CivilCraft-ka muuqaalka goobta loo diro wuxuu muujiyaa tirooyinka daraasaddiisa Sifooyinka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDevelop this mass\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhisaa darbiyo heer kasta iyo sagxad ka mid ah hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/develop-a-mass\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/develop-a-mass\"\u003EHorumari mass dhismo daraasad goobeed\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha maktabadda oo leh kala-duwanaansho.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax ku imaanaysa kala-duwanaansho badan waxay leedahay doorasho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E ku jirta tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E; elementka la dhigay wuxuu ku sii haynayaa kala-duwanaanshahiisa IFC-ga, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa kuwa kale, nuqulada iyo cusboonaysiinta way ilaaliyaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EDhig oo beddel walaxda maktabadda leh kala-duwanaansho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXirmooyinka mashruuca folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject bundles\u003C/span\u003E, oo qaab kasta oo xirmada ku jira wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFuro …\u003C/strong\u003E: PDF-ka MarkupCraft-ka, DWG-ga CadCraft-ka, tab cusub. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle#open-a-layout\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-hash=\"open-a-layout\"\u003EFur qaabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"caawiyayaasha-ai-iyo-add-ons\"\u003ECaawiyayaasha AI iyo add-ons\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax badan oo caawiyayaasha AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Caawiyuhu hadda wuxuu magacyo u bedeli karaa elementyada iyo wuxuu dejin karaa qiimaha sifooyinka, wuxuu dhaqaajin karaa oo tirtiri karaa elementyada, wuxuu beddeli karaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha, wuxuu dhoofin karaa USD, iyo wuxuu rendar-ka sawir ama safka rendar-ka wuu socodsiin karaa; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EKa dhig caawiye AI uu shaqeeyo moodelkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-ons wuxuu dhisi karaa moodelka.\u003C/strong\u003E API-ga add-on-ka 1.1 wuxuu oggolaanayaa add-on inuu samayn isbeddel moodelka ah hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah (wuxuu u socdaa Live TeamWork), akhrin moodelka, iyo akhrinta socodyada tuubada iyo tuubada hawada, ports-ka, qalabka iyo spools-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-on-ka Plant\u003C/strong\u003E (la damiyay ilaa aad ku shido Dejinta › \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/strong\u003E): sifooyinka tuubada oo la hubiyay socodyada, sawirro isometric ah oo socod ah oo SVG iyo DXF ah oo leh liiska alaabta, qalab habsami oo guud oo leh nozzles lagu dhigay moodelka, router ka dhex-dhexeeya labo port, iyo hubinta habaynta warshadda. Caawiye qoraal ah, ma aha ansixin injineernimo; erayadiisu waa Ingiriisi keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-beddelay\"\u003ELa beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKumbiyuutar yar oo hore.\u003C/strong\u003E Shaashad cabbirkeedu yar yahay, BimCraft wuxuu ku bilaabaa qorshaha keliya, Qalabka Sawirka waa panel cidhiidh ah oo qorshaha ku dhex-jira, qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D way soo noqdaan marka sawirku ka baxo, muuqaalka 3D wuxuu buuxiyaa guriga oo dhan panel cidhiidh ah, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha waa la doortaa ka hor cabbirrada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeydinta sawirka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESave PNG\u003C/strong\u003E ee daaqadda Rendar hadda waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhinaceeda ah noocyada kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003EKaydi sawirka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-ka Falanqaynta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay block \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDesign checks\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu sameeyaa isku-darka culeyska ASCE 7 ama EN 1990 kiisaskaaga, wuxuuna hubiyaa qaab kasta oo bir la rogay (W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB magacyada qaabkooda iyo cabbirkooda) AISC 360 ama EN 1993-1-1, isaga oo muujinaya inta ay ka isticmaasho awoodeeda. Caawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego, qaababka la alxamay iyo qaybaha kale waxay leeyihiin &quot;lama hubin&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-saxay\"\u003ELa saxay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib-u-celinta kadib tallaabo qoys cusub oo cabbir cusub ku samaysay way fashilantay (&quot;no size&quot;). Hadda tallaabo kasta wuxuu sameeyaa isla IFC GlobalIds mar kale marka dib-u-celinta la sameeyo, sidaas awgeed dib-u-celintu waxay shaqeysaa qoysaska iyo isbeddel kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka labo qof qoys isku mid ah kaydiyeen (kal-fadhi Live TeamWork ama laba daaqadood), keydinta labaad waxay si aan qarsoon u beddeshay isbeddelkii kowaad. Hadda way diidaa oo waxay sheegtaa sida loo arko isbeddelkooda oo loo sameeyo kaagii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel ku jirta feet-ka US survey waxaa loo akhriyay 0.3048 m feet kasta halkii 0.3048006096 m, taas oo dhaqaaqday IFC kasta oo juquraafi ah feet-ka US ah ee khariiradda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatiraha qoysaska: xidhista ma dhicisiyo xiritaanka kiiboodhka bogga, Keydintiisa waxay ku sii jirtaa aragga, telefoonkuna weyn ma muujiyo, goobahaan ma kicinayaan zoom-ka telefoonka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-kasta\"\u003EApp kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis kala-go&#039;an dhererka, aagga, mugga, xagasha iyo jilicsanaanta, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda cutubyada. Ka dami cutubyada aan kula kulmin, kuwaasi way ka baxaan liisaska cutubyada; calaamadee mid, shaqada cusubi waxay ku bilaabmaysaa. Faylku wuxuu had iyo jeer ilaaliyaa cutubkiisa. BimCraft-ka liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare wuxuu raacaa beddelayaasha, calaamadda wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirrada muuqda ilaa aad ku doorato qalabka sare (doorashadaadii hore way ilaaliyaan), sanduuqyada dhererka qalabka sawirka waxay aqbalaan calaamadda cutub kasta, sida \u003Ccode\u003E3.5 m\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003ECutubyada, qiyamka qoran iyo liisaska cutubyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn dhex-dhexaad ah iyo panels-ka wada-hagaajiyaan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa wax badan shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada batanka weyn ayay haystaan). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay cinwaan yar: jiid si aad u dhigto ama u caayo panelka, ku qabo bar kale si aad u wadaagto hal qolka tabs-ka ahaan, ku xidh si uu u siib-siibo ilaa geeska, ama qarso oo ku soo celi geeska. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EQaabeynta panels-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDialogs way dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Dialog jiid cinwaankiisa si aad uga caydho sawirka; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Labajibaar cinwaanka si aad dib u dhex-dhigto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EDialog u dhaqaaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECiyaaro caawiyayaasha AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Toban codsi oo shaqeysa oo caawiyahaaga, nidaamin sawirka, hubi sawirrada, weydii moodelka su&#039;aalo, isku-geeyo qiimaha, isku day qaybta kala-duwanaanshaha... mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay qalabyadiisa iyo ogolaanshahiisa, mid kastaa waxaa dib loo ciyaaray tijaabooyinkeenna. Apps-ka AI ma leh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ECiyaaraha caawiyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cusub \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELanguage\u003C/span\u003E. Iyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E hadda waxay leeyihiin erayada apps-ka oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli dadka afkooda ah ku eegin. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, qaar ku qoran Isbaanish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta ay fashilantay (fayl nidaamkaaga weli ma jiro, shabakad la&#039;aan, saxiixa xun) halkii uu ka odhan lahaa &quot;Dhammaaday&quot;, wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa aad hesho sii deyn cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-ma-jiro-nooca\"\u003EWeli ma jiro nooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 lama saxiixin code-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta oo ku taal getcadcraft.com/download. Windows-ka, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore info\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun anyway\u003C/span\u003E. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E. CadCraft Studio weli ma ku jiro dukaanka apps-ka, ma jiro dhismaha iPad ama iPhone weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska xagasha iyo jilicsanaanta ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E waa la kaydiyay, laakiin sanduuq weli ma akhrinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaad-tracing kaarka garaafka, wixii dheeraad ah ee daaqadda Rendar iyo safka rendar-ka waxay u baahan yihiin WebGPU (la&#039;aanteed tayada sare waxay isticmaashaa raad-tracer-ka WebGL), muuqaalka toosana wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU meesha browser-ku leeyahay, haddii kale WebGL 2. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay halkan kaarka garaafka been-abuur ah oo keliya, weli kaarar garaafka dhabta ahi ma jiraan. Muuqaalka toosan BimCraft-ka ma leh scatter ama wadaago (kan ModelCraft-ka wuu leeyahay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDuubista socodka la duubay ee muuqaalka sida fiidiyo lama dhisin BimCraft-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawiyaha naqshadda: I-shape kasta oo magaceedu IFC ahaan ma aha cabbir W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB (ama cabbirkeedu ka duwan yahay) waxaa loo qaataa mid la alxamay, waxayna soo noqotaa &quot;lama hubin&quot;, sidaas oo kale tuubooyinka, angles, channels, qaybaha cararadka ah iyo torsion. Wali injineer ma eegin hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha la sawiray lama koobiyayn karo mid mid, lama rogi karo, lama muuqaali karo (heer oo dhan ayaa la koobiyeyn karaa), ma jiro darbi la jarey, Qoraalka ama kaarka qalabka ama darbi-deyn. Darbi ku xidhan darbi heer hoose ah heer sare ma gudbo jidhka 3D ee darbigaas, jadwallada waxay liistaan furitaanka heer sare sida heerkiisa darbigiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoysaska: maktabad qoysaska la wadaago mashruucyada dhexdooda ma dhisna. Qoysaska iyo heerarka la koobiyeeyay weli lama furin barnaamijyada BIM kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMEP: qalabku waa guud (xogta soo saarayaasha ma jirto); tees iyo reducers ee spools-ka birta guud ayay yihiin, ma aha miiska ASME B16.9; ports-ka walxaha maktabadda ee laga dhigay tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E lama qoro IFC-ga; waxba ma eegin injineer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd-on-ka Plant weli ma jiro socod la jidinayo oo lagu geli karo moodelka, ma lambar siin karo spools-ka isometrics-kiisa ama hubin habaynta qalabka laga dhigay maktabadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhirta maktabadda CivilCraft-ka weli lama dhigi karo tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E ee BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETamarta: ma jiro simulation saacad kasta, ma jiro habka ISO 52016-1 iyo ma jiro faylal cimilo. Hantida: ma jiro twin martigeliyaha ah oo kaydiya akhrinta ama diraya digniin marka BimCraft la xirayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhigga skaanada waa la isku dayay skaanada tijaabada, weli lama isticmaalin skaan dhabta ah oo skaanar dhabta ah; faylasha E57 weli waxay furaan ilaa 6 milyan oo dhibic iyo 512 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXirmooyinka mashruucu waxay ku furmaan BimCraft oo keliya (apps-yada kale waxay qaadaan qaabka iyada oo loo marayo \u003Cstrong\u003EFuro …\u003C/strong\u003E), xirmooyinka iyo kiitka labo-barnaamij ayaa lagu tijaabiyay bidhaa-ka-ku-celinta, weli lama tijaabin Archicad ama Revit laftooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tani waa waxa isbeddelay BimCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Liiska waa la kooxeeyay aagga, kuwa ugu muhiimsan ee hore. Cusub Dhis dhismaha Darbiyo dabaqyo badan. Liiska dhererka qalabka Wall wuxuu bixiyaa Ilaa heer kasta oo ka sarreeya, sida Sifooyinka darbi la doortay. Qorshayaasha heerarka ku-dhex-jira waxay muujinayaan darbiga mid khafiif ah, qolalka halkaas ayaa ku xirma, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha waxaa lagu geli karaa qorshayaasha, Dhex-maraa ee Sifooyinka wuxuu magacaabaa heerarka uu maro. Eeg Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad. Koobiyee heerkan. Copy this level… oo ku jira Liiska heerarka wuxuu dib u sawiraa darbiyada heerka oo leh albaabyadooda iyo daaqadahooda, dabaqyadooda iyo saqafkooda heer kale ama heer cusub oo ka sarreeya, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah; qolalku wuxuu kaga muuqdaa iyagoo laftooda ah. Eeg Sawir darbiyada. Darbiyo PDF ama skaan ka. Build › From a drawing… hadda wuxuu aqbalaa PDF (khad shaqo ama skaan ku jira) ama qorshe skaan (PNG, JPEG, TIFF, bog badan): bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa darbiyada, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qolalka heer, oo bogga hoosta qorshihiisa ayuu ku jiraa. Raadku ma isticmaalo shabakad, ma isticmaalo moodel tababaran, natiijadu waa waxa khadadku siiyeen: heer kasta ka hubi bogga. Eeg Darbiyada qorshayaasha. Habaynta darbiyadaada. Wall assemblies… wuxuu dhisaa nooc darbi lakab-lakab ah, oo leh xudun, god hawo iyo membreenno, iyo muuqaal leh cabbirro; Material library… wuxuu ilaaliyaa agabka mashruuca IFC-ga; Annotate › Reference dimension wuxuu cabbiraa dusha iyo khadadka xudunta, wuxuuna raacaa darbiyada markay isbeddelaan. Waxa uu ka yimid kaaliye bulsho, Doc (drsurfbum). Eeg Habaynta darbiyada iyo cabbirrada tixraaca. Cutubyada muuqaalka iyo qalabka muuqaalka. Units qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa dhererka feet iyo inji, inji, feet tobanle, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir, cabbirrada, jadwallada, isku-xidhka, cabbirrada iyo goyn. Plan, Split iyo 3D waxay ku yaalliin qalabka sare, kala-jarka waa la jiidi karaa (ama lagu guuri karaa kiiboodhka), Shaded, Edges iyo Wireframe waxay ku yaalliin dhinaca muuqaalka, iyo dhicitaanka saqafka, saqaf-dhinaca iyo saqaf-hoosaha ayaa isla markiiba beddela saqafka la doortay. Waxa uu ka yimid kaaliye bulsho, Joel (yisraelk). Eeg Sawir darbiyada. Joists sagxadda iyo fidinta. Framing wuxuu dhisi karaa joists la hagaajiyay (horay) sida alwaax la jarey, isagoo doortaa taxanaha ugu yar iyo qoto-dheerka ugu yar ee gaadha fidinta, 16\" ama 24\" bartamaha, labada jihoodba; waxay gelayaan IFC-ga iyo liiska jarista. Talo ka timid miiska daabacan ee soo saaraha, ma aha injineernimo. Waxa uu ka yimid sidoo kale Joel. Eeg Darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada qaab-dhismeed. Aaladaha korontada oo badan. Electrical wuxuu ku daraa dhibcaha xogta, telefoonka iyo codka-muuqaalka, beddelka xulashada, saacadda, thermostat-ka, qalabka kashifa qiiqa iyo kulaylka, badhanka shaqada, siren-ka, dabaaldegga, meeshka tamarta iyo sub-panel, mid kastaa leeyahay fasalka IFC gaarka ah. Eeg Qorshaha korontada. Qoysas Qoysas wax badan sameeya. Sifooyinka waxay noqon karaan tirooyin buuxa, qoraal, agab, qalin ama buufin; qoys wuxuu sawiri karaa calaamad qorshe oo u gaar ah, wuxuu ku celin karaa jidh adag, wuxuu qaybaha u calaamayn karaa heerarka faahfaahinta dhimma, wuxuu hayn karaa qoysas kale (lug miiska), wuxuuna leeyahay hotspots ah oo la jiidi karo, oo ay ku jiraan walxaha la dhigay ee qorshaha. Cabbirrada waxay ka yimaadaan miiska CSV, sifooyinka lagu calaamadeeyay Walax kasta wuxuu oggolaanayaa labo albaab oo isku cabbir ah inay kala duwan yihiin. Eeg Wax ka beddel qoys iyo Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda. Tuubooyinka, tuubada hawada iyo qalabka Qalabka leh ports. Build › Equipment wuxuu dhigaa qalab hawo-qaade guud ah, dabaqe-socod, pump, boiler, kulaylka biyaha, terminal unit, diffuser, grille ama tank, oo cabbirkiisa lagu qoray qiimayaashaaga, isku xidhka tuubada iyo tuubada hawada oo ah ports. Mid kastaa waxaa loo kaydiyaa fasalka IFC-ga oo leh IFC ports. Eeg Qalabka MEP oo leh ports. Socod xidhan. Tuubo ama tuubada hawada laga bilaabo port waxay qaadaa cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda oo waxay ku sii xidhan tahay: pump dhaqaajiso, tuubadiisu way raacaysaa. Check connections wuxuu liistaa ports furan, dhamaadyo furan, cabbir iyo nidaam is-khilaafaya, iyo socodyo aan wax bixin. Eeg Ku xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha ka. Clash check wuxuu leeyahay kooxo diyaar ah iyo Pipes and ducts × structure hal guji. Check clearances wuxuu isticmaalaa dahaarka socod kasta iyo meel bannaan oo aad qortid; Openings needed wuxuu liistaa meelaha socodyadu darbiyada iyo sagxadaha ku gudbaan, CSV iyo dhibaatooyin BCF ahaan. Waxba lama jarayo. Eeg Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha. Spool-ka tuubada birta. Socod birta ah waxaa loo jaraa spool-yo lambaro leh dherer ugu dheer, iyo Field welds aad dhigto; Spool sheets (PDF) wuxuu siiyaa bog kasta spool, oo leh muuqaalkiisa isometric, dherarka jarista, fittings-ka, welds-ka iyo liiska alaabta, Duct cut list wuxuu liistaa qaybaha tuubada hawada ee toosan. Eeg Spool-ka tuubada birta iyo xaashiyada spool-ka. Kuwani waa qalab jiliska iyo isku-duubista, injineer ayaa cabbiray: ma jiraan socodyo, cadaadis ama isku-dheelitirnaan. Maamulka dhismaha Dokumentiyo hantida kasta. Tab-ka Assets wuxuu ku xidhaa buugaagta, dammaanad-qaadka, sawirrada iyo naqshadaha hantida magac fayl oo ku yaal IFC-ga ama cinwaan web; oo keliya xidhiidhka ayaa gala IFC-ga. Eeg Dokumentiyada. Miiska COBie. Save as COBie (.xlsx) wuxuu qoraa buugga COBie 2.4 ee gudbinta, buugga COBie oo dib loo akhriyay wuxuu liistaa isbeddel kasta ka hor inta aan la riixin Apply mar. Weli lama mariyin mudo COBie validator ah. Eeg Miiska COBie. Akhrinta sensorrada iyo feeds toos ah. Fur CSV oo akhrinta ah, ama Connect si toos ah browser-ka ilaa MQTT broker-kaaga ama cinwaan nidaamka dhismahaaga ee jawaabta siiya: hantida kasta wuxuu muujiyaa akhrinta ugu dambaysa iyo jaantuska, midabka moodelka ayuu leeyahay, wuxuuna calaamadeeyaa haddii ka baxdo xadka IFC-ga lagu kaydiyay. Akhrinta waxay ku sii jirta tab-ka; erayga sirta ah waligiis lama kaydiyo. Eeg Akhrinta sensorrada iyo Akhrinta toos ah. Iftiinka maalinta iyo tamarta Samada iyo qorraxda daaqad kasta. Tab-ka Daylight wuxuu siiyaa daaqad kasta qaybta samada toosan iyo xagalka hor-istaagga, wuxuu raacaa qorraxda taariikh ka dhex-maraysa Sun through the windows on a date, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa Daylight factor on a grid qolal kasta, oo lagu sawiray qorshihiisa. Eeg Qaybta samada toosan ee daaqad kasta. Culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta. Heating and cooling loads wuxuu xisaabiyaa lumitaanka kulaylka qol kasta, kulaylkeeda sanad kasta iyada oo laga eegayo maalmaha heerkulka, iyo kulaylka ugu sarreeya ee qaboojinta, iyaga oo laga qaadayo waxa ku xidha moodelka iyo U-value kasta; U-value lagu qoray halkaas ayaa lagu qoraa IFC-ga. Eeg Qiyaasidda culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta. Labadaba waa qalab naqshadeed oo ku salaysan habab la daabacay, ma aha xisaabinta waafaqsanaanta, guddi kastaa waa sheegaa. Skaanada Isku-dhig skaanado badan. Register scans… (liiska bilowga, ama Show) wuxuu dhigaa skaanada hal farshaxan oo ah dhibcaha lammaanaha la doortay ama bartilmaameedyo la qoray, wuxuu hagaajiyaa ICP oo dhibic ilaa dhibic kadibna dhibic ilaa diyaarad, wuxuuna kaydiyaa isku-dhigga fayl mashruuc yar, wuxuuna qoraa daruuraha isku-dhigay hal fayl LAS ama E57. Eeg Isku-dhig skaanado badan hal mid. Sawirrada iyo muuqaalka toosan Muuqaalka toosan. Live view qalabka sare wuxuu muujiyaa moodelka hab waqtiga-dhabta ah dhinaca muuqaalka 3D, isagoo raacaya iyo isbeddel kasta, oo leh Walk, waqtiga maalinta iyo bilaha; Live view in a new window wuxuu geeyaa shaashad labaad. Eeg Muuqaalka toosan. Raad-tracing kaarka garaafka. Marka WebGPU la isticmaalo, Render › High quality (path traced) wuxuu shaqeeyaa raad-tracer-ka CadCraft ee kaarka garaafka, wuu joojin karaa oo Resume ayuu sii wadi karaa, dhammaadkana waa la nadiifiyaa; WebGPU la'aan wuxuu isticmaalaa raad-tracer-ka WebGL sida hore. Eeg Tayo sare. Wax badan oo ku jira daaqadda Rendar (kaarka garaafka, sidaas WebGPU ayuu u baahan yahay): sare jireed iyo sawirro samada, faylasha iftiinka IES, kamarad oo leh f-stop, qoto-dheer ee muuqaalka, muuqaal laba-barta, isbeddelka midabka, iyo 360° panoramas, darajo sawirka dhammaystiran, iftiin-isku-darka iyo qaybaha rendar-ka kadib rendar-ka, dhaxalka, qiiqa iyo caustics, kaydinta PNG 16-bit, EXR ama faylka rendar-ka, iyo safka rendar. Eeg Samooyin iyo faylasha iftiinka kaarka garaafka iyo Safka rendar-ka. Kumbiyuutarkaaga. Settings › BimCraft › Rendering › Your machine wuxuu muujiyaa garaafyada, nuxurka processor-ka iyo xusuusta uu browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka, iyo heerka uu rendar-ku bilaabo. Eeg Waxa kumbiyuutarkaagu u rendaraa. Faylasha iyo app-yada kale Faylasha STEP la furo. Qayb .step ama .stp, qalab, ama moodel bixiye (AP203, AP214, AP242) waxay u furmaa moodel IFC yar, solid kastaa waa walax aad baarto, goyn, cabbir, oo aad IFC ahaan u kaydin karto. Midabyada iyo magacyada qaybaha assembly-ga weli lama akhrin. Eeg Faylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo. Dhoofinta USD. USD qalabka sare wuxuu qoraa moodelada furan .usda, .usdc ama .usdz, oo hay-ah goobta, dhismaha, dabaqa iyo takhasuska, oo leh IFC class, GlobalId iyo sifo kasta. Eeg Dhoofi moodelka USD. Mass CivilCraft-ka. Mass dhismo oo CivilCraft-ka muuqaalka goobta loo diro wuxuu muujiyaa tirooyinka daraasaddiisa Sifooyinka, Develop this mass wuxuu dhisaa darbiyo heer kasta iyo sagxad ka mid ah hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Eeg Horumari mass dhismo daraasad goobeed. Walxaha maktabadda oo leh kala-duwanaansho. Walax ku imaanaysa kala-duwanaansho badan waxay leedahay doorasho Variant ku jirta tab-ka Library; elementka la dhigay wuxuu ku sii haynayaa kala-duwanaanshahiisa IFC-ga, Swap item… wuxuu liistaa kuwa kale, nuqulada iyo cusboonaysiinta way ilaaliyaan. Eeg Dhig oo beddel walaxda maktabadda leh kala-duwanaansho. Xirmooyinka mashruuca folder-ka. Open a folder wuxuu liistaa faylasha .ccbundle.zip hoosta Project bundles, oo qaab kasta oo xirmada ku jira wuxuu leeyahay Furo …: PDF-ka MarkupCraft-ka, DWG-ga CadCraft-ka, tab cusub. Eeg Fur qaabka. Caawiyayaasha AI iyo add-ons Wax badan oo caawiyayaasha AI. Caawiyuhu hadda wuxuu magacyo u bedeli karaa elementyada iyo wuxuu dejin karaa qiimaha sifooyinka, wuxuu dhaqaajin karaa oo tirtiri karaa elementyada, wuxuu beddeli karaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha, wuxuu dhoofin karaa USD, iyo wuxuu rendar-ka sawir ama safka rendar-ka wuu socodsiin karaa; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Eeg Ka dhig caawiye AI uu shaqeeyo moodelkaaga. Add-ons wuxuu dhisi karaa moodelka. API-ga add-on-ka 1.1 wuxuu oggolaanayaa add-on inuu samayn isbeddel moodelka ah hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah (wuxuu u socdaa Live TeamWork), akhrin moodelka, iyo akhrinta socodyada tuubada iyo tuubada hawada, ports-ka, qalabka iyo spools-ka. Add-on-ka Plant (la damiyay ilaa aad ku shido Dejinta › General › Add-ons): sifooyinka tuubada oo la hubiyay socodyada, sawirro isometric ah oo socod ah oo SVG iyo DXF ah oo leh liiska alaabta, qalab habsami oo guud oo leh nozzles lagu dhigay moodelka, router ka dhex-dhexeeya labo port, iyo hubinta habaynta warshadda. Caawiye qoraal ah, ma aha ansixin injineernimo; erayadiisu waa Ingiriisi keliya. La beddelay Kumbiyuutar yar oo hore. Shaashad cabbirkeedu yar yahay, BimCraft wuxuu ku bilaabaa qorshaha keliya, Qalabka Sawirka waa panel cidhiidh ah oo qorshaha ku dhex-jira, qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D way soo noqdaan marka sawirku ka baxo, muuqaalka 3D wuxuu buuxiyaa guriga oo dhan panel cidhiidh ah, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha waa la doortaa ka hor cabbirrada. Keydinta sawirka. Save PNG ee daaqadda Rendar hadda waa Save, oo Save as ayaa dhinaceeda ah noocyada kale. Eeg Kaydi sawirka. Tab-ka Falanqaynta wuxuu leeyahay block Design checks: wuxuu sameeyaa isku-darka culeyska ASCE 7 ama EN 1990 kiisaskaaga, wuxuuna hubiyaa qaab kasta oo bir la rogay (W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB magacyada qaabkooda iyo cabbirkooda) AISC 360 ama EN 1993-1-1, isaga oo muujinaya inta ay ka isticmaasho awoodeeda. Caawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego, qaababka la alxamay iyo qaybaha kale waxay leeyihiin \"lama hubin\". Eeg Hubinta naqshadda. La saxay Dib-u-celinta kadib tallaabo qoys cusub oo cabbir cusub ku samaysay way fashilantay (\"no size\"). Hadda tallaabo kasta wuxuu sameeyaa isla IFC GlobalIds mar kale marka dib-u-celinta la sameeyo, sidaas awgeed dib-u-celintu waxay shaqeysaa qoysaska iyo isbeddel kasta. Marka labo qof qoys isku mid ah kaydiyeen (kal-fadhi Live TeamWork ama laba daaqadood), keydinta labaad waxay si aan qarsoon u beddeshay isbeddelkii kowaad. Hadda way diidaa oo waxay sheegtaa sida loo arko isbeddelkooda oo loo sameeyo kaagii. Moodel ku jirta feet-ka US survey waxaa loo akhriyay 0.3048 m feet kasta halkii 0.3048006096 m, taas oo dhaqaaqday IFC kasta oo juquraafi ah feet-ka US ah ee khariiradda. Tafatiraha qoysaska: xidhista ma dhicisiyo xiritaanka kiiboodhka bogga, Keydintiisa waxay ku sii jirtaa aragga, telefoonkuna weyn ma muujiyo, goobahaan ma kicinayaan zoom-ka telefoonka. App kasta Cabbirrada. Settings › General › Units wuxuu leeyahay liis kala-go'an dhererka, aagga, mugga, xagasha iyo jilicsanaanta, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda cutubyada. Ka dami cutubyada aan kula kulmin, kuwaasi way ka baxaan liisaska cutubyada; calaamadee mid, shaqada cusubi waxay ku bilaabmaysaa. Faylku wuxuu had iyo jeer ilaaliyaa cutubkiisa. BimCraft-ka liiska Units ee qalabka sare wuxuu raacaa beddelayaasha, calaamadda wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirrada muuqda ilaa aad ku doorato qalabka sare (doorashadaadii hore way ilaaliyaan), sanduuqyada dhererka qalabka sawirka waxay aqbalaan calaamadda cutub kasta, sida 3.5 m ama 10 US ft. Eeg Cutubyada, qiyamka qoran iyo liisaska cutubyada. Qaabeyn dhex-dhexaad ah iyo panels-ka wada-hagaajiyaan. Settings › General › Layout density › Compact wuxuu geliyaa wax badan shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada batanka weyn ayay haystaan). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay cinwaan yar: jiid si aad u dhigto ama u caayo panelka, ku qabo bar kale si aad u wadaagto hal qolka tabs-ka ahaan, ku xidh si uu u siib-siibo ilaa geeska, ama qarso oo ku soo celi geeska. Eeg Qaabeynta panels-ka. Dialogs way dhaqaaqaan. Dialog jiid cinwaankiisa si aad uga caydho sawirka; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Labajibaar cinwaanka si aad dib u dhex-dhigto. Eeg Dialog u dhaqaaji. Ciyaaro caawiyayaasha AI. Toban codsi oo shaqeysa oo caawiyahaaga, nidaamin sawirka, hubi sawirrada, weydii moodelka su'aalo, isku-geeyo qiimaha, isku day qaybta kala-duwanaanshaha... mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay qalabyadiisa iyo ogolaanshahiisa, mid kastaa waxaa dib loo ciyaaray tijaabooyinkeenna. Apps-ka AI ma leh. Eeg Ciyaaraha caawiyayaasha AI. Luuqadaha. Português (Portugal) waa cusub Settings › General › Language. Iyada, Português (Brasil), Español (México) iyo Bahasa Indonesia hadda waxay leeyihiin erayada apps-ka oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli dadka afkooda ah ku eegin. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, qaar ku qoran Isbaanish. CadCraft Studio wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta ay fashilantay (fayl nidaamkaaga weli ma jiro, shabakad la'aan, saxiixa xun) halkii uu ka odhan lahaa \"Dhammaaday\", wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa aad hesho sii deyn cusub. Weli ma jiro nooca 0.7 lama saxiixin code-ka. Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta oo ku taal getcadcraft.com/download. Windows-ka, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro More info, kadibna Run anyway. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro Open. CadCraft Studio weli ma ku jiro dukaanka apps-ka, ma jiro dhismaha iPad ama iPhone weli. Liisaska xagasha iyo jilicsanaanta ee Units waa la kaydiyay, laakiin sanduuq weli ma akhrinayo. Raad-tracing kaarka garaafka, wixii dheeraad ah ee daaqadda Rendar iyo safka rendar-ka waxay u baahan yihiin WebGPU (la'aanteed tayada sare waxay isticmaashaa raad-tracer-ka WebGL), muuqaalka toosana wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU meesha browser-ku leeyahay, haddii kale WebGL 2. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay halkan kaarka garaafka been-abuur ah oo keliya, weli kaarar garaafka dhabta ahi ma jiraan. Muuqaalka toosan BimCraft-ka ma leh scatter ama wadaago (kan ModelCraft-ka wuu leeyahay). Duubista socodka la duubay ee muuqaalka sida fiidiyo lama dhisin BimCraft-ka. Caawiyaha naqshadda: I-shape kasta oo magaceedu IFC ahaan ma aha cabbir W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB (ama cabbirkeedu ka duwan yahay) waxaa loo qaataa mid la alxamay, waxayna soo noqotaa \"lama hubin\", sidaas oo kale tuubooyinka, angles, channels, qaybaha cararadka ah iyo torsion. Wali injineer ma eegin hubinta. Qaybaha la sawiray lama koobiyayn karo mid mid, lama rogi karo, lama muuqaali karo (heer oo dhan ayaa la koobiyeyn karaa), ma jiro darbi la jarey, Qoraalka ama kaarka qalabka ama darbi-deyn. Darbi ku xidhan darbi heer hoose ah heer sare ma gudbo jidhka 3D ee darbigaas, jadwallada waxay liistaan furitaanka heer sare sida heerkiisa darbigiisa. Qoysaska: maktabad qoysaska la wadaago mashruucyada dhexdooda ma dhisna. Qoysaska iyo heerarka la koobiyeeyay weli lama furin barnaamijyada BIM kale. MEP: qalabku waa guud (xogta soo saarayaasha ma jirto); tees iyo reducers ee spools-ka birta guud ayay yihiin, ma aha miiska ASME B16.9; ports-ka walxaha maktabadda ee laga dhigay tab-ka Library lama qoro IFC-ga; waxba ma eegin injineer. Add-on-ka Plant weli ma jiro socod la jidinayo oo lagu geli karo moodelka, ma lambar siin karo spools-ka isometrics-kiisa ama hubin habaynta qalabka laga dhigay maktabadda. Dhirta maktabadda CivilCraft-ka weli lama dhigi karo tab-ka Library ee BimCraft. Tamarta: ma jiro simulation saacad kasta, ma jiro habka ISO 52016-1 iyo ma jiro faylal cimilo. Hantida: ma jiro twin martigeliyaha ah oo kaydiya akhrinta ama diraya digniin marka BimCraft la xirayo. Isku-dhigga skaanada waa la isku dayay skaanada tijaabada, weli lama isticmaalin skaan dhabta ah oo skaanar dhabta ah; faylasha E57 weli waxay furaan ilaa 6 milyan oo dhibic iyo 512 MB. Xirmooyinka mashruucu waxay ku furmaan BimCraft oo keliya (apps-yada kale waxay qaadaan qaabka iyada oo loo marayo Furo …), xirmooyinka iyo kiitka labo-barnaamij ayaa lagu tijaabiyay bidhaa-ka-ku-celinta, weli lama tijaabin Archicad ama Revit laftooda. Waxa kale oo ku jira Waxa weli aan la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bilow BimCraft","summary":"Waxa BimCraft maanta sameeyo, sida aad u furto moodelkaaga ugu horreeya, u eegto 3D, mid qiime beddesho oo nuqul kaydiso.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["bilow","markii ugu horreysay","fur","ifc","rvt","dwg","bilow degdeg ah","hordhac","muujiye","bim"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-bimcraft","text":"Fur BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"fur-moodelkaaga-ugu-horreeya","text":"Fur moodelkaaga ugu horreeya","level":2},{"id":"eeg-hareeraha","text":"Eeg hareeraha","level":2},{"id":"hal-shey-oo-dhab-ah-sax-calaamad","text":"Hal shey oo dhab ah: sax calaamad","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-nuqul","text":"Kaydi nuqul","level":2},{"id":"halkii-aad-aadi-lahayd-marka-xigta","text":"Halkii aad aadi lahayd marka xigta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft waa app-ka moodelka dhismaha ee qoyska CadCraft. Markan wuxuu \u003Cstrong\u003Efuraa, akhriyaa iyo baadhaa\u003C/strong\u003E faylasha dhismaha, wuxuuna \u003Cstrong\u003Ewax ka beddelaa xogta moodelada IFC\u003C/strong\u003E. Weli ma sawirto ama ma dhisto walxo cusub. Waxaad u malayn kartaa muuqaal moodel iyo hubiye, oo sidoo kale kuu oggolaanaya inaad magacyada, calaamadaha iyo qiimaha sifooyinka ku saxdo faylka IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa uu furo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC (\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelka oo buuxa 3D: wareegid, dabaqyo, sifooyinka walxaha, iyo tafatirka magacyada iyo qiimaha sifooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska (\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaarka faylka: nooca la kaydiyay, macluumaadka mashruuca, sawirka horudhaca iyo faylasha lagu xiray. Ma jiro 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda 2D: meesha moodelka iyo dhammaan xaashiyada, lakabyada, naqshadaha lagu xiray, aragtida daabacaadda, iyo jadwal qalab oo loogu talagalay naqshadaha adeegga cuntada ee calaamadaysan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWarbixin ku saabsan moodel kasta galka ku jira: nuqullada dhowrka, xiriirinta, nuqullada dhaawacan, iyo talo ku saabsan faylka laga bilaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa oo dhan waxaa dhaca browser-kaaga, kombuyutarkaaga. \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba lama soo rarin.\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EFaylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo\u003C/a\u003E faahfaahinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-bimcraft\"\u003EFur BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur BimCraft browser casri ah. Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari oo dhan way shaqeeyaan; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EBrowser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta\u003C/a\u003E waxay liistaa kala duwanaanshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug shaashadda madhan ee qoraalka &quot;Fur moodel dhismo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, iyo desktop-ka gudaha CadCraft Studio, oo la socda apps-ka kale. Kaydinta daruuraha weli lama heli karo: faylasha kombuyutarkaaga ayaad ka furtaa oo nuqullada dib ugu kaydisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-moodelkaaga-ugu-horreeya\"\u003EFur moodelkaaga ugu horreeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka ugu degdegga badan si aad u aragto waxa BimCraft sameeyo waa fayl IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file\u003C/span\u003E dhexda shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ah \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaareeyaha faylasha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E oo xaqiiji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta xarriiqda xaaladda ee hoose ee shaashadda ku qoraysa &quot;Mishiinka IFC waa la bilaabayaa…&quot;, kadibna &quot;Joomatriga dhismaha ayaa la dhisayaa&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad arki doontaa moodelka 3D dhexda, panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E iyo liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStoreys\u003C/span\u003E bidix, iyo panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E madhan midig. Xarriiqda xaaladda waxay ku dhammaanaysaa &quot;Furay&quot; iyo tirada walxaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale fayl ka jiidi kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaareeyaha faylasha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E oo dhigi kartaa bogga. Shaashadda waxay muujinaysaa &quot;Dhig si aad u furto&quot; intaad jiidayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMishiinka IFC wuxuu ka soo rarayaa goobta markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto moodel IFC, marka laga reebo haddii BimCraft loo kaydiyay khadka ka baxsan isticmaalka. Naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF, faylasha mashruuca iyo galalka uma baahna wax dheeraad ah: akhriyeyaashoodu waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka. Haddii badhanka barta app-ka uu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, wax kasta waa la furayaa khadka ka baxsan. Haddii kale, moodelada IFC ma furmi doonaan ilaa aad dib u xiriirto, mooyaane haddii mid hore u furmay tab-kan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKhadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa tagaysaa meel aan xiriir lahayn? Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E barta app-ka oo sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. Nuqulka la kaydiyay (qiyaastii 11 MB) wuxuu ku jiraa mishiinka IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-hareeraha\"\u003EEeg hareeraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji oo jiid badhanka bidix ee mouse-ka si aad moodelka ugu wareegto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji tekerka mouse-ka si aad u weyneyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid badhanka midig ee mouse-ka si aad u guurisid muuqaalka. Trackpad Mac ah, ku hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E si aad moodelka oo dhan mar kale u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid hal farta si aad u wareegto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji laba farood si aad u weyneyso, u dhaqaaji laba farood wada si aad u guurisid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E si aad moodelka oo dhan mar kale u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-shey-oo-dhab-ah-sax-calaamad\"\u003EHal shey oo dhab ah: sax calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji darbi, albaab ama walax kasta oo moodelka ku jirta. Waa buluug, sifooyinkeeda ayaa midig ka muuqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, guji qiimaha ku xiga \u003Cstrong\u003ETag\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor calaamadda cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E ee furmaysa bidix: isbeddelkaaga waa la liisanayaa, qiimihii hore iyo kii cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-nuqul\"\u003EKaydi nuqul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hel fayl cusub galka soo dejinta. Waxaa loo magacaabay magaca asalka oo lagu daray &quot; (edited)&quot;, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EClinic (edited).ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylkaaga asalka ahi weligiis lama beddelo. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EBeddel sifooyinka IFC oo kaydi nuqul la beddelay\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu si buuxa u sharraxayaa wax ka beddelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halkii-aad-aadi-lahayd-marka-xigta\"\u003EHalkii aad aadi lahayd marka xigta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\"\u003EShaashadda BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E: dhammaan panelada magacyadooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imanaya barnaamijyada BIM kale\u003C/a\u003E: waxa kala duwan haddii aad ku barteen Revit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E: tilmaam galka mashruuca BimCraft oo u oggolow inuu faylasha kala soo saaro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EFur naqshad DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E: xaashiyada, lakabyada iyo aragtida daabacaadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"BimCraft waa app-ka moodelka dhismaha ee qoyska CadCraft. Markan wuxuu furaa, akhriyaa iyo baadhaa faylasha dhismaha, wuxuuna wax ka beddelaa xogta moodelada IFC. Weli ma sawirto ama ma dhisto walxo cusub. Waxaad u malayn kartaa muuqaal moodel iyo hubiye, oo sidoo kale kuu oggolaanaya inaad magacyada, calaamadaha iyo qiimaha sifooyinka ku saxdo faylka IFC. Waxa uu furo: Faylka Waxa aad hesho IFC (.ifc) Moodelka oo buuxa 3D: wareegid, dabaqyo, sifooyinka walxaha, iyo tafatirka magacyada iyo qiimaha sifooyinka Faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska (.rvt, .rfa, .rte, .rft) Kaarka faylka: nooca la kaydiyay, macluumaadka mashruuca, sawirka horudhaca iyo faylasha lagu xiray. Ma jiro 3D. DWG iyo DXF Naqshadda 2D: meesha moodelka iyo dhammaan xaashiyada, lakabyada, naqshadaha lagu xiray, aragtida daabacaadda, iyo jadwal qalab oo loogu talagalay naqshadaha adeegga cuntada ee calaamadaysan Galka mashruuca Warbixin ku saabsan moodel kasta galka ku jira: nuqullada dhowrka, xiriirinta, nuqullada dhaawacan, iyo talo ku saabsan faylka laga bilaabo Waxa oo dhan waxaa dhaca browser-kaaga, kombuyutarkaaga. Waxba lama soo rarin. Eeg Faylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo faahfaahinta. Fur BimCraft Fur BimCraft browser casri ah. Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari oo dhan way shaqeeyaan; Browser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta waxay liistaa kala duwanaanshaha. Sug shaashadda madhan ee qoraalka \"Fur moodel dhismo.\" BimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, iyo desktop-ka gudaha CadCraft Studio, oo la socda apps-ka kale. Kaydinta daruuraha weli lama heli karo: faylasha kombuyutarkaaga ayaad ka furtaa oo nuqullada dib ugu kaydisaa. Fur moodelkaaga ugu horreeya Habka ugu degdegga badan si aad u aragto waxa BimCraft sameeyo waa fayl IFC. Guji Choose a file dhexda shaashadda. Dooro fayl .ifc ah Finder / File Explorer / maareeyaha faylasha oo xaqiiji. Sug inta xarriiqda xaaladda ee hoose ee shaashadda ku qoraysa \"Mishiinka IFC waa la bilaabayaa…\", kadibna \"Joomatriga dhismaha ayaa la dhisayaa\". Waxaad arki doontaa moodelka 3D dhexda, panelka File iyo liiska Storeys bidix, iyo panelka Properties madhan midig. Xarriiqda xaaladda waxay ku dhammaanaysaa \"Furay\" iyo tirada walxaha. Waxaad sidoo kale fayl ka jiidi kartaa Finder / File Explorer / maareeyaha faylasha oo dhigi kartaa bogga. Shaashadda waxay muujinaysaa \"Dhig si aad u furto\" intaad jiidayso. Mishiinka IFC wuxuu ka soo rarayaa goobta markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto moodel IFC, marka laga reebo haddii BimCraft loo kaydiyay khadka ka baxsan isticmaalka. Naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF, faylasha mashruuca iyo galalka uma baahna wax dheeraad ah: akhriyeyaashoodu waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka. Haddii badhanka barta app-ka uu leeyahay Offline ready, wax kasta waa la furayaa khadka ka baxsan. Haddii kale, moodelada IFC ma furmi doonaan ilaa aad dib u xiriirto, mooyaane haddii mid hore u furmay tab-kan. Eeg Khadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan. Ma tagaysaa meel aan xiriir lahayn? Guji Save for offline barta app-ka oo sug Offline ready. Nuqulka la kaydiyay (qiyaastii 11 MB) wuxuu ku jiraa mishiinka IFC. Eeg Shaqaynta khadka ka baxsan. Eeg hareeraha Guji oo jiid badhanka bidix ee mouse-ka si aad moodelka ugu wareegto. Dhaqaaji tekerka mouse-ka si aad u weyneyso. Jiid badhanka midig ee mouse-ka si aad u guurisid muuqaalka. Trackpad Mac ah, ku hay Shift oo jiid halkii. Taabo F ama guji Fit si aad moodelka oo dhan mar kale u aragto. Jiid hal farta si aad u wareegto. Dhaqaaji laba farood si aad u weyneyso, u dhaqaaji laba farood wada si aad u guurisid. Taabo Fit si aad moodelka oo dhan mar kale u aragto. Hal shey oo dhab ah: sax calaamad Guji darbi, albaab ama walax kasta oo moodelka ku jirta. Waa buluug, sifooyinkeeda ayaa midig ka muuqda. Panelka Properties, guji qiimaha ku xiga Tag. Qor calaamadda cusub oo riix Enter. Eeg qaybta Changes ee furmaysa bidix: isbeddelkaaga waa la liisanayaa, qiimihii hore iyo kii cusub. Kaydi nuqul Guji Save as IFC qaybta Changes, ama riix Ctrl+S. Ka hel fayl cusub galka soo dejinta. Waxaa loo magacaabay magaca asalka oo lagu daray \" (edited)\", tusaale ahaan Clinic (edited).ifc. Faylkaaga asalka ahi weligiis lama beddelo. Beddel sifooyinka IFC oo kaydi nuqul la beddelay wuxuu si buuxa u sharraxayaa wax ka beddelka. Halkii aad aadi lahayd marka xigta Shaashadda BimCraft: dhammaan panelada magacyadooda. Ka imanaya barnaamijyada BIM kale: waxa kala duwan haddii aad ku barteen Revit. Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan: tilmaam galka mashruuca BimCraft oo u oggolow inuu faylasha kala soo saaro. Fur naqshad DWG ama DXF: xaashiyada, lakabyada iyo aragtida daabacaadda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"start-a-new-building","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bilow dhismo cusub","summary":"Samee moodel dhismo oo cad oo leh heerarkiisa, sawir darbiyadiisa, ka soo qaad walxo maktabadda, oo u kaydi sida IFC.","section":"start","order":15,"keywords":["cusub","dhismo cusub","cad","madhan","bilow bilowga","qaab","heerarka","dabaqyada","sagxadaha","samee","moodel"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa fiican in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa bilow moodel dhismo wax laga bilaabo halkii aad furi lahayd. BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa moodel IFC cad oo leh mashruuc, goob, dhismaha iyo heerarkiisa. Waxaad ku dhigi kartaa qalab iyo alaab heerarka maktabadda, oo waxaad u kaydin kartaa sida fayl IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada hadda waa la sawiri karaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E. Albaabada, daaqadaha, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada waa la dhisayaa xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew building\u003C/span\u003E hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EFur fayl ama gal\u003C/strong\u003E, ama bogga bilowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro inta \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerar\u003C/strong\u003E ay leedahay (1 ilaa 200).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogga heerka\u003C/strong\u003E, sagxad ilaa sagxad: tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E3000 mm\u003C/code\u003E. Lambar caadi ah waa fiit Mareykanka, millimitir meelaha kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECreate\u003C/span\u003E. Heerarka waxaa lagu rogaa 0 ka bilaabo, heer kasta wuxuu ka sarreeyaa kii hore dherer heer, waxaana loo magacaabaa Level 1, Level 2 iwm. Waxay ku muuqdaan geedka moodelka, qorshaha Level 1 wuxuu ku furmaa dhinaca muuqaalka 3D intaad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E shidan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir darbiyada: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E. Magacyada heerarka ka beddel ama joogooyinkooda panelka \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhig walxaha: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EKa dhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E. Bar-ka dhigista wuxuu liistaa heer kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E. Faylka waxaa loo bixiyaa magaca dhismaha, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003ESmith&#039;s house.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodelka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa millimitir, sida IFC4. Barnaamijyada BIM kale ayaa furi karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/strong\u003E panelka bidix waxay liistaa kaliya heerarka wax ku yaalla; geedka moodelka wuxuu liistaa dhammaantood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa aad kaydiso, dhismaha cusub wuxuu u tirsan yahay shaqo aan la kaydin. BimCraft wuu weydiiyaa ka hor intaadan furin fayl kale ama ka bixin, wuxuuna nuqul ku hayaa browser-kan haddii tab-ka la xido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka bilow moodel dhismo wax laga bilaabo halkii aad furi lahayd. BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa moodel IFC cad oo leh mashruuc, goob, dhismaha iyo heerarkiisa. Waxaad ku dhigi kartaa qalab iyo alaab heerarka maktabadda, oo waxaad u kaydin kartaa sida fayl IFC. Darbiyada hadda waa la sawiri karaa: eeg Sawir darbiyada. Albaabada, daaqadaha, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada waa la dhisayaa xiga. Tallaabooyinka Guji New building hoos Fur fayl ama gal, ama bogga bilowga. Qor Magaca dhismaha. Dooro inta Heerar ay leedahay (1 ilaa 200). Qor Joogga heerka, sagxad ilaa sagxad: tusaale ahaan 10'-0\", 10'6\" ama 3000 mm. Lambar caadi ah waa fiit Mareykanka, millimitir meelaha kale. Guji Create. Heerarka waxaa lagu rogaa 0 ka bilaabo, heer kasta wuxuu ka sarreeyaa kii hore dherer heer, waxaana loo magacaabaa Level 1, Level 2 iwm. Waxay ku muuqdaan geedka moodelka, qorshaha Level 1 wuxuu ku furmaa dhinaca muuqaalka 3D intaad Draw shidan tahay. Sawir darbiyada: eeg Sawir darbiyada. Magacyada heerarka ka beddel ama joogooyinkooda panelka Heerarka. Dhig walxaha: eeg Ka dhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda. Bar-ka dhigista wuxuu liistaa heer kasta. Guji Save as IFC. Faylka waxaa loo bixiyaa magaca dhismaha, tusaale ahaan Smith's house.ifc. Waxa fiican in la ogaado Moodelka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa millimitir, sida IFC4. Barnaamijyada BIM kale ayaa furi karaa. Dabaqyada panelka bidix waxay liistaa kaliya heerarka wax ku yaalla; geedka moodelka wuxuu liistaa dhammaantood. Ilaa aad kaydiso, dhismaha cusub wuxuu u tirsan yahay shaqo aan la kaydin. BimCraft wuu weydiiyaa ka hor intaadan furin fayl kale ama ka bixin, wuxuuna nuqul ku hayaa browser-kan haddii tab-ka la xido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shaashadda BimCraft","summary":"Safar qalab kasta, panel kasta iyo badhan kasta, magacyadooda shaashadda ku jira, iyo sida shaashaddu isu beddesho nooca faylka kasta.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["shaashad","qaabayn","panelada","toolbar","interface","ui","safar","panelka sifooyinka","browser","app bar"],"headings":[{"id":"barta-app-ka","text":"Barta app-ka","level":2},{"id":"panelka-bidix","text":"Panelka bidix","level":2},{"id":"goobta","text":"Goobta","level":2},{"id":"panelka-sifooyinka","text":"Panelka sifooyinka","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-yar","text":"Shaashad yar","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-shaashadda","text":"Qaababka shaashadda","level":2},{"id":"wixii-la-xidhiidha","text":"Wixii la xidhiidha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda BimCraft waxay leedahay bar kor ka socda iyo saddex qaybood hoosteeda: panel bidix, goobta dhexe iyo panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E midig. Waxa ku muuqda qayb kasta waxay kuxirantahay waxa aad furtay: moodel IFC, faylka mashruuca ama qoyska, naqshad ama galka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barta-app-ka\"\u003EBarta app-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarta cirka ah ee kor ka socota waxay leedahay tahay ee goobta CadCraft, ma aha BimCraft laftiisa. Bidix ilaa midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda CadCraft: waxay gaarsiinaysaa bogga hoyga CadCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca app-ka iyo menu-ka nooca. Dhismaha shaqaalaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhismaha aad socodsiinayso wuxuuna kuu ogolaanayaa inaad u beddesho nooca la sii daayay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E: bogga app-ka ee goobta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E: dejinta BimCraft laftiisa iyo kuwa apps-ka oo dhan wadaagaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E: wareejiya qaababka shaashadda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace#screen-modes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\" data-hash=\"screen-modes\"\u003EQaababka shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E: mawduucyada iftiinka iyo mugdiga. Muuqaalka 3D iyo naqshadaha 2D waxay raacaan mawduuca aad doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-bidix\"\u003EPanelka bidix\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka bidix had iyo jeer wuxuu bilaabaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFur fayl ama gal\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobta jiidista, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file, or drop a file or folder here\u003C/span\u003E. Guji si aad u doorato hal fayl, ama jiid fayl ama gal oo ku dhig (ama meel kasta bogga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E: dooro galka mashruuca oo dhan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecent folders\u003C/span\u003E: waxay muuqataa Chrome iyo Edge kadib markaad furto gal adigoo isticmaalaya doorashada galka ama markaad jiidto. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReopen\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca galka si aad dib u furto, ama × yar si aad u illowdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta, qaybaha ayaa muuqda sida ay ku habboonaadaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaybta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMarkay muuqato\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel IFC ah ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddelkaaga aan la kaydin, kan ugu cusub hore, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel ama kaarka faylka ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaqiiqooyinka faylka: cabbirka, schema ama nooca, mashruuca, qoraha, tirada walxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG ama DXF ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka, unugyada, tirada entity iyo lakabyada, xaashiyada, naqshadaha isku xirtay, qalabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFolder\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGal ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada faylasha iyo moodelada, cabbirka, dhibaatooyinka la helay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the folder\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka waxaad ka furtay gal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu kuu celinayaa warbixinta galka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad sanduuq kasta lakab kasta, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll on\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll off\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStoreys\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel IFC ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamad sanduuq kasta dabaq kasta, kan sare marka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElements\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel IFC ayaa furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada walxaha nooc kasta oo moodelku hayo (30-ka ugu badan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobta\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhexda shaashadda waxay muujinaysaa faylka furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMadhan\u003C/strong\u003E: &quot;Fur moodel dhismo.&quot; oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sharax gaaban oo qaab kasta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel IFC\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaalka 3D oo leh toolbar kor ka socda, kooxo magac leh, sida kan app-ka naqshadaynta CadCraft, astaanta qalab kasta ayaa ka sarreysa magaceeda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdges\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ENuqul, dhaji iyo laab maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdates\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECredits\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReview\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EJar moodelka IFC oo leh section plane\u003C/a\u003E); iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutput\u003C/span\u003E (render, muuqaalka nool, VR, dhoofin, rang iyo muuqaalada la kaydiyay). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E oo shidan yahay, barta Draw ee hoosteeda waxay leedahay isla muuqaalkaas: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E (heerka iyo nooca qorshaha), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E. Kubbadda muuqaalka waxay ku taal geesta hoose ee midig. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EFur moodel IFC oo eeg 3D\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa astaamaha, qoraalka ama labadaba badhamadan, wuxuu muujiyaa ama qarinayaa magacyada kooxaha, guji midig toolbar-ka si aad u habayso qalabyada iyo kooxaha. Daaqad gaaban gudaheeda toolbar-ku wuxuu ka tirtiraa magacyada hoosta astaamaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka mashruuca ama qoyska\u003C/strong\u003E: kaarka faylka, oo leh sawirka horudhaca, macluumaadka mashruuca iyo faylasha lagu xiray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/read-rvt-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/read-rvt-file\"\u003EAkhri faylka mashruuca ama qoyska\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG ama DXF\u003C/strong\u003E: safka tabs-ka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna mid kasta xaashi, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E marka naqshaddu leedahay qalab calaamadaysan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint view\u003C/span\u003E), naqshadda, iyo isku-xirka X iyo Y ee toosan geeska. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EEeg naqshadda DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EEeg naqshadda DWG ama DXF 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalka\u003C/strong\u003E: warbixinta galka, oo leh sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart here\u003C/span\u003E iyo miisaska moodelada, xidhiidhada, moodelada IFC iyo naqshadaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXarriiqda xaaladda\u003C/strong\u003E ee hoosta goobta waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa BimCraft sameynayo (&quot;Akhrinta moodelka…&quot;, &quot;Joomatriga dhismaha: 1200 ka 5400 walax&quot;) iyo wixii khaldamay, oo cas, marka wax fashilmaan. Fariimaha guusha waxay dhacaan kadib dhowr ilbiriqsi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-sifooyinka\"\u003EPanelka sifooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka midig wuxuu muujiyaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel IFC: walxda aad riixday, magaceeda, nooceeda, calaamadeeda, GlobalId iyo kooxaha sifooyinka oo dhan. Qiimayaasha aad bedeli karto waxay u eeg yihiin badhamo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003EGoobaha panelka sifooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshad: sida loo dhaqaajiyo, naqshadaha isku xirtay iyo sawirrada iyo haddii mid kasta la helay, iyo liis ah wixii \u003Cstrong\u003EAan weli la sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaarka faylka ama galka: fiiro gaaban oo ku saabsan waxa la furayo marka xigta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-yar\"\u003EShaashad yar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka daaqadda ay ka yar tahay shaashadda laptop-ka, BimCraft wuxuu isku dhejiyaa qaybahiisa: goobta kor, panelada hoosta. Bogga u sii dhaqaaji si aad u gaarto panelada. Telefoonka waxay sameeyaan hal tiir; tablet-ka laba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-shaashadda\"\u003EQaababka shaashadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E ee barta app-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E meel kasta, wuxuu wareejiyaa saddex qaab:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad buuxda, barahana weli muuqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad buuxda oo barta app-ka laga qariyay. Geeska kor u dhaaf mouse-ka ama taabo meeshaas si uu dib u soo muuqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad caadi ugu noqotid. Browser-yada aan taageerin shaashad buuxda (sida iPhone) waxay wareegaan oo keliya inta u dhexeysa caadi iyo barahana la qariyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wixii-la-xidhiidha\"\u003EWixii la xidhiidha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFuraha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EFaylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Shaashadda BimCraft waxay leedahay bar kor ka socda iyo saddex qaybood hoosteeda: panel bidix, goobta dhexe iyo panelka Properties midig. Waxa ku muuqda qayb kasta waxay kuxirantahay waxa aad furtay: moodel IFC, faylka mashruuca ama qoyska, naqshad ama galka. Barta app-ka Barta cirka ah ee kor ka socota waxay leedahay tahay ee goobta CadCraft, ma aha BimCraft laftiisa. Bidix ilaa midig: Calaamadda CadCraft: waxay gaarsiinaysaa bogga hoyga CadCraft. Magaca app-ka iyo menu-ka nooca. Dhismaha shaqaalaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhismaha aad socodsiinayso wuxuuna kuu ogolaanayaa inaad u beddesho nooca la sii daayay. About BimCraft: bogga app-ka ee goobta. Settings: dejinta BimCraft laftiisa iyo kuwa apps-ka oo dhan wadaagaan. Eeg Dejinta BimCraft. Full screen: wareejiya qaababka shaashadda. Eeg Qaababka shaashadda hoos. Paper iyo Model: mawduucyada iftiinka iyo mugdiga. Muuqaalka 3D iyo naqshadaha 2D waxay raacaan mawduuca aad doorato. Panelka bidix Panelka bidix had iyo jeer wuxuu bilaabaa Fur fayl ama gal: Goobta jiidista, Choose a file, or drop a file or folder here. Guji si aad u doorato hal fayl, ama jiid fayl ama gal oo ku dhig (ama meel kasta bogga). Open a folder: dooro galka mashruuca oo dhan. Eeg Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan. Recent folders: waxay muuqataa Chrome iyo Edge kadib markaad furto gal adigoo isticmaalaya doorashada galka ama markaad jiidto. Guji Reopen iyo magaca galka si aad dib u furto, ama × yar si aad u illowdo. Hoosta, qaybaha ayaa muuqda sida ay ku habboonaadaan: Qaybta Markay muuqato Waxa ku jira Changes Moodel IFC ah ayaa furan Wax ka beddelkaaga aan la kaydin, kan ugu cusub hore, oo leh Undo iyo Save as IFC File Moodel ama kaarka faylka ayaa furan Xaqiiqooyinka faylka: cabbirka, schema ama nooca, mashruuca, qoraha, tirada walxaha Drawing DWG ama DXF ayaa furan Qaabka, unugyada, tirada entity iyo lakabyada, xaashiyada, naqshadaha isku xirtay, qalabka Folder Gal ayaa furan Tirada faylasha iyo moodelada, cabbirka, dhibaatooyinka la helay Back to the folder Faylka waxaad ka furtay gal Wuxuu kuu celinayaa warbixinta galka Layers Naqshad ayaa furan Calaamad sanduuq kasta lakab kasta, oo leh All on iyo All off Storeys Moodel IFC ayaa furan Calaamad sanduuq kasta dabaq kasta, kan sare marka hore Elements Moodel IFC ayaa furan Tirada walxaha nooc kasta oo moodelku hayo (30-ka ugu badan) Goobta Dhexda shaashadda waxay muujinaysaa faylka furan. Madhan: \"Fur moodel dhismo.\" oo leh Choose a file iyo Open a folder, iyo sharax gaaban oo qaab kasta ah. Moodel IFC: muuqaalka 3D oo leh toolbar kor ka socda, kooxo magac leh, sida kan app-ka naqshadaynta CadCraft, astaanta qalab kasta ayaa ka sarreysa magaceeda: View (Fit, Top, Front, Side, Edges, Spaces); Edit (Undo, Redo, Copy, Paste iyo More, eeg Nuqul, dhaji iyo laab maktabadda); Model (Units iyo Draw); Library (Library, Equipment, Updates, Credits); Review (Show, Section, Walk, Measure; eeg Jar moodelka IFC oo leh section plane); iyo Output (render, muuqaalka nool, VR, dhoofin, rang iyo muuqaalada la kaydiyay). Draw oo shidan yahay, barta Draw ee hoosteeda waxay leedahay isla muuqaalkaas: View (heerka iyo nooca qorshaha), Draw, Edit iyo Library. Kubbadda muuqaalka waxay ku taal geesta hoose ee midig. Eeg Fur moodel IFC oo eeg 3D. Settings, General wuxuu doortaa astaamaha, qoraalka ama labadaba badhamadan, wuxuu muujiyaa ama qarinayaa magacyada kooxaha, guji midig toolbar-ka si aad u habayso qalabyada iyo kooxaha. Daaqad gaaban gudaheeda toolbar-ku wuxuu ka tirtiraa magacyada hoosta astaamaha. Faylka mashruuca ama qoyska: kaarka faylka, oo leh sawirka horudhaca, macluumaadka mashruuca iyo faylasha lagu xiray. Eeg Akhri faylka mashruuca ama qoyska. DWG ama DXF: safka tabs-ka (Model, kadibna mid kasta xaashi, kadibna Equipment marka naqshaddu leedahay qalab calaamadaysan, 3D, Fit iyo Print view), naqshadda, iyo isku-xirka X iyo Y ee toosan geeska. Eeg Eeg naqshadda DWG ama DXF iyo Eeg naqshadda DWG ama DXF 3D. Galka: warbixinta galka, oo leh sanduuqa Start here iyo miisaska moodelada, xidhiidhada, moodelada IFC iyo naqshadaha. Eeg Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan. Xarriiqda xaaladda ee hoosta goobta waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa BimCraft sameynayo (\"Akhrinta moodelka…\", \"Joomatriga dhismaha: 1200 ka 5400 walax\") iyo wixii khaldamay, oo cas, marka wax fashilmaan. Fariimaha guusha waxay dhacaan kadib dhowr ilbiriqsi. Panelka sifooyinka Panelka midig wuxuu muujiyaa: Moodel IFC: walxda aad riixday, magaceeda, nooceeda, calaamadeeda, GlobalId iyo kooxaha sifooyinka oo dhan. Qiimayaasha aad bedeli karto waxay u eeg yihiin badhamo. Eeg Goobaha panelka sifooyinka. Naqshad: sida loo dhaqaajiyo, naqshadaha isku xirtay iyo sawirrada iyo haddii mid kasta la helay, iyo liis ah wixii Aan weli la sawirin ah. Kaarka faylka ama galka: fiiro gaaban oo ku saabsan waxa la furayo marka xigta. Shaashad yar Marka daaqadda ay ka yar tahay shaashadda laptop-ka, BimCraft wuxuu isku dhejiyaa qaybahiisa: goobta kor, panelada hoosta. Bogga u sii dhaqaaji si aad u gaarto panelada. Telefoonka waxay sameeyaan hal tiir; tablet-ka laba. Qaababka shaashadda Badhanka Full screen ee barta app-ka, ama Ctrl+Shift+F meel kasta, wuxuu wareejiyaa saddex qaab: Caadi. Shaashad buuxda, barahana weli muuqdaan. Shaashad buuxda oo barta app-ka laga qariyay. Geeska kor u dhaaf mouse-ka ama taabo meeshaas si uu dib u soo muuqdo. Taabo Esc si aad caadi ugu noqotid. Browser-yada aan taageerin shaashad buuxda (sida iPhone) waxay wareegaan oo keliya inta u dhexeysa caadi iyo barahana la qariyay. Wixii la xidhiidha Furaha iyo mouse-ka Faylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coordinates","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isku xirka ku jira BimCraft","summary":"Meesha aad ku shaqeyso: booska mishaxa ku jira qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D, heerka aad ku jirto, asalka mashruuca iyo barta sahanka goobta.","section":"start","order":22,"keywords":["isku xirka","halkee ku jiraa","booska","mishaxa","akhriska","x y z","heer","dabaq","asalka mashruuca","asal","barta salka","barta sahanka","goobta","isku xirka khariidadda","eastings","northings","georeference","cutubyada","booska"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"halka-tirooyinku-ka-muuqdaan","text":"Halka tirooyinku ka muuqdaan","level":2},{"id":"laba-calaamadood","text":"Laba calaamadood","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi degdeg ah u ogaw meesha aad ku jirto moodelka: heerka aad ku sawirayso, sida mishaxu uga fog yahay asalka mashruuca, iyo meesha ay tahay barta sahanka goobta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-tirooyinku-ka-muuqdaan\"\u003EHalka tirooyinku ka muuqdaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka 3D kor ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca hoose ee midig, ag ku dhow kubbadda muuqaalka): dhaqaaji mishaxa moodelka kor. Sanduuqa wuxuu muujinayaa heerka dhibcaha ku yaal iyo sida uu uga sarreeyo sagxadda heerkaas, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y iyo Z\u003C/strong\u003E. Meel bannaan oo aan waxba ku jirin wuxuu akhrinayaa dhibcaha ku yaal sagxadda heerka ugu hooseeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca hoose ee midig, intii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E uu shidan yahay): heerka uu qorshuhu muujinayo iyo dhererka sagxaddiisa, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EX iyo Y\u003C/strong\u003E intii mishaxu ku jiro qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka faylku leeyahay bedelka khariidadda (waxaa lagu dhoofiyay isku xirka khariidadda), labada sanduuq waxay ku daraan \u003Cstrong\u003Eeastings iyo northings\u003C/strong\u003E ee shabakadda khariidadda, iyagoo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay (mar walba unugga waa la qoraa xagooda; fiitada iyo inji waxay muuqdaan sida fiit tobanka ah). Sawirka DWG ama DXF wuxuu hayaa cutubyadiisa: akhriskiisa mishaxa wuu magacaabaa, mana beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan X, Y iyo Z waxaa lagu qiyaasaa \u003Cstrong\u003Easalka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka lagu doortay (fiit iyo inji, inji, fiit tobanka ah, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir). Y ee togan wuxuu u tilmaamaa woqooyiga moodelka, taas oo aan had iyo jeer ahayn waqooyiga dhabta ah. Eastings iyo northings waxay raacaan isla doorashada (fiit iyo inji waxay muuqdaan sida fiit tobanka ah). Haddii unugga nidaamka khariidadda uu ka duwan yahay kan aad dooratay, wuxuu ku qoran yahay xidhka tirooyinka ka dambeeya, tusaale ahaan \u003Cem\u003E(US survey feet)\u003C/em\u003E, si sahamiyuhu u arko nidaamka laftiisa waxa lagu qoray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"laba-calaamadood\"\u003ELaba calaamadood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsalka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E (goob cas oo leh xariiq): barta 0, 0, 0 oo dhammaan isku xirka moodelka laga qiyaaso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarta sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E (goob buluug ah oo leh saddex geeska): barta tixraaca goobta, taas oo ay ku qoran yihiin latitude, longitude iyo dhererka, ama isku xirka khariidadda. Muuqaalka 3D, ku tilmaam si aad u akhrido meesha ay ku taal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka goobtu ku taal asalka mashruuca, sida dhismo cusub oo halkan lagu sawiray, hal calaamad ayaa labadaba tusta. Riix badhanka xariiqda ee sanduuqa kasta si aad u qarisid ama u muujisid calaamadaha; BimCraft wuxuu xusaa doorashadaada browser-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinku way isbeddelaan markii mishaxu dhaqaaqo, sanduuqa qorshuhuna wuxuu magacaabaa heerka aad ka dooratay liiska heerarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha way joogaan markaad wareegayso, guurinayso iyo weyneynayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u akhrido latitude iyo longitude-ka dhibic, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELocation\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas masaafooyin, bedka wejiyada iyo booska 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda taabashada ah sanduuqa 3D wax ma muujiyo ilaa aad isticmaasho mouse ama qalin. Farta ayaa muuqaalka dhaqaajisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Si degdeg ah u ogaw meesha aad ku jirto moodelka: heerka aad ku sawirayso, sida mishaxu uga fog yahay asalka mashruuca, iyo meesha ay tahay barta sahanka goobta. Halka tirooyinku ka muuqdaan Muuqaalka 3D kor ku jira (dhinaca hoose ee midig, ag ku dhow kubbadda muuqaalka): dhaqaaji mishaxa moodelka kor. Sanduuqa wuxuu muujinayaa heerka dhibcaha ku yaal iyo sida uu uga sarreeyo sagxadda heerkaas, kadibna X, Y iyo Z. Meel bannaan oo aan waxba ku jirin wuxuu akhrinayaa dhibcaha ku yaal sagxadda heerka ugu hooseeya. Qorshaha (dhinaca hoose ee midig, intii Draw uu shidan yahay): heerka uu qorshuhu muujinayo iyo dhererka sagxaddiisa, iyo X iyo Y intii mishaxu ku jiro qorshaha. Marka faylku leeyahay bedelka khariidadda (waxaa lagu dhoofiyay isku xirka khariidadda), labada sanduuq waxay ku daraan eastings iyo northings ee shabakadda khariidadda, iyagoo ku jira Units aad dooratay (mar walba unugga waa la qoraa xagooda; fiitada iyo inji waxay muuqdaan sida fiit tobanka ah). Sawirka DWG ama DXF wuxuu hayaa cutubyadiisa: akhriskiisa mishaxa wuu magacaabaa, mana beddelo. Dhammaan X, Y iyo Z waxaa lagu qiyaasaa asalka mashruuca, Units ee toolbar-ka lagu doortay (fiit iyo inji, inji, fiit tobanka ah, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir). Y ee togan wuxuu u tilmaamaa woqooyiga moodelka, taas oo aan had iyo jeer ahayn waqooyiga dhabta ah. Eastings iyo northings waxay raacaan isla doorashada (fiit iyo inji waxay muuqdaan sida fiit tobanka ah). Haddii unugga nidaamka khariidadda uu ka duwan yahay kan aad dooratay, wuxuu ku qoran yahay xidhka tirooyinka ka dambeeya, tusaale ahaan (US survey feet), si sahamiyuhu u arko nidaamka laftiisa waxa lagu qoray. Laba calaamadood Asalka mashruuca (goob cas oo leh xariiq): barta 0, 0, 0 oo dhammaan isku xirka moodelka laga qiyaaso. Barta sahanka (goob buluug ah oo leh saddex geeska): barta tixraaca goobta, taas oo ay ku qoran yihiin latitude, longitude iyo dhererka, ama isku xirka khariidadda. Muuqaalka 3D, ku tilmaam si aad u akhrido meesha ay ku taal. Marka goobtu ku taal asalka mashruuca, sida dhismo cusub oo halkan lagu sawiray, hal calaamad ayaa labadaba tusta. Riix badhanka xariiqda ee sanduuqa kasta si aad u qarisid ama u muujisid calaamadaha; BimCraft wuxuu xusaa doorashadaada browser-kan. Waxa aad arki doontid Tirooyinku way isbeddelaan markii mishaxu dhaqaaqo, sanduuqa qorshuhuna wuxuu magacaabaa heerka aad ka dooratay liiska heerarka. Calaamadaha way joogaan markaad wareegayso, guurinayso iyo weyneynayso. Si aad u akhrido latitude iyo longitude-ka dhibic, isticmaal Measure › Location: eeg Qiyaas masaafooyin, bedka wejiyada iyo booska 3D. Shaashadda taabashada ah sanduuqa 3D wax ma muujiyo ilaa aad isticmaasho mouse ama qalin. Farta ayaa muuqaalka dhaqaajisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo","summary":"Qaab kasta oo BimCraft furo, waxa uu hayo, waxa uu kaydiyo, meesha faylasha kaydsamaan, iyo waxa isbeddela browser-yada iyo marka aad khadka ka baxsan tahay.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["qaabab","fur","kaydi","dhoofin","ifc","rvt","rfa","rte","rft","dwg","dxf","step","stp","csv","soo gelin","asturnaan","cabbirka faylka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-furo","text":"Waxa uu furo","level":2},{"id":"lama-furo","text":"Lama furo","level":3},{"id":"waxa-uu-kaydiyo","text":"Waxa uu kaydiyo","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-marka-labaad","text":"Kaydinta marka labaad","level":2},{"id":"faylal-waaweyn-iyo-xusuusta","text":"Faylal waaweyn iyo xusuusta","level":2},{"id":"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-ka-baxsan","text":"Khadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-daruuraha","text":"Kaydinta daruuraha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha kombuyutarkaaga, tab-ka browser-ka gudihiisa. \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba lama soo rarin\u003C/strong\u003E CadCraft ama qof kale. Marka aad kaydiso, BimCraft wuxuu browser-ka siiyaa fayl cusub oo la soo dejiyo; weligiis ma qoro fayl aad furtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-furo\"\u003EWaxa uu furo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhamaadka magaca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelka 3D, dabaqyada, tirada walxaha iyo sifooyinka walax kasta. Magacyada, calaamadaha iyo qiimaha sifooyin keliya ayaa la beddeli karaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaarka faylka: nooca la kaydiyay, dhismaha, shaqada wadajirka, macluumaadka mashruuca, cabbirrada qoyska, faylasha lagu xiray iyo sawirka horudhaca. Ma jiro 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda 2D: meesha moodelka, xaashi kasta, lakabyada, naqshadaha lagu xiray, sawirrada iyo aragtida daabacaadda. Meesha moodelka waxaa lagu arkaa 3D. Noocyada AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 ayaa la hubiyey.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida DWG oo kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb, qalab ama moodel uu bixiyo alaab-bixiyaha (AP203, AP214, AP242) oo 3D ah: jirka adag kasta wuxuu noqdaa hal walax (building element proxy) moodel IFC yar oo ku yaal hal dabaq, oo la akhriyo sida saddex-geesood cabbirkiisa dhabta ah, isku-dhis oo qayb walba ku yaal meesha faylku dhigay. Waxay u shaqeysaa sida IFC kasta oo kale: sifooyin, qaybo, cabbir, u kaydi sida IFC. Midabada iyo geedka isku-dhiska lama akhrin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaruuraha dhibcaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan-ka muuqaalka 3D, mid ka dhinac moodelka ama keligiis: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EMuuji daruurta dhibcaha ee moodelka dhinacdiisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBundle-ka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelka oo leh muuqaalkiisa, naqshadihiisa iyo kooxaha sifooyinka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EFur bundle-ka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWarbixin ku saabsan moodel kasta, naqshad kasta iyo bundle kasta ee gudaha ku jira. Mid kasta oo IFC, moodel, naqshad ama bundle warbixinta ku jira ayaa lagu furaa guji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft ka akhriyo qaab kasta\u003C/a\u003E wuu faahfaahinayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa waa maxay faylka isagoo eegaya baytiyada hore iyo sidoo kale magaca, sidaas darteed fayl mashruuc oo kordhin aan caadi ahayn weli wuxuu furmaa kaarka faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lama-furo\"\u003ELama furo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E: BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay: &quot;.ifczip looma taageero weli. Kaydi ama dhoofi moodelka sida fayl .ifc oo caadi ah.&quot; Ka soo saar \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E (wuxuu ku jiraa \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah) ama dib u dhoofi sida IFC caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadaha DGN waxay ku jiraan warbixinta galka laakiin ma furmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF, sawirrada iyo faylasha xafiiska iyagoo keligood ma furmaan. Sawirrada waxaa loo isticmaalaa sawirro gudaha DWG, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bogagga PDF ama scan-ka u beddelaa darbiyo: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EDarbiyada laga sameeyo qorshayaal badan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-kaydiyo\"\u003EWaxa uu kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad riixdo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl IFC cusub oo leh wax ka beddelkaaga, oo magaciisu yahay &quot;\u003Cem\u003Eoriginal name\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalka soo dejinta ee browser-kaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload CSV\u003C/span\u003E jadwalka qalabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSV ee alaabta liiska ku jirta, oo magaciisu yahay &quot;\u003Cem\u003Edrawing name\u003C/em\u003E equipment.csv&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalka soo dejinta ee browser-kaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxyaabaha kale waxaa lagu kaydiyaa meesha ay ka abuurmaan, mid kasta mawduuciisa gaarka ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi moodelka USD\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E (.dae iyo Google Earth .kmz: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/collada\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/collada\"\u003EDhoofi moodelka Collada ama Google Earth\u003C/a\u003E), .glb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor rendering\u003C/span\u003E, sawirrada rendarka, xaashiyada iyo qorshayaasha PDF ahaan, jadwalada iyo liisaska CSV ahaan, dhibaatooyinka BCF, xisaab-miiska COBie, faylasha qoyska, iyo scan-yada la diiwaangeliyay LAS ama E57. BimCraft ma kaydiyo DWG, DXF ama faylasha mashruuca, mana beddelo faylasha aad furtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay kaydiyaan soo dejinta galka lagu dejiyay dejintooda, badanaa Downloads. Si aad mar kasta loo weydiiyo meesha lagu kaydiyo, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; oo ku jira dejinta soo dejinta ee browser-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox wuxuu kaydiyaa galka Downloads ilaa aad dejinteeda ku dhigto &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari wuxuu kaydiyaa Downloads ilaa aad galka kale ka dooratid \u003Cstrong\u003ESafari &gt; Settings &gt; General &gt; File download location\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-marka-labaad\"\u003EKaydinta marka labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar kasta oo la kaydiyo, moodelka oo dhan waa la soo dejiyaa, oo ay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003Edhammaan wax ka beddelka aad ka furtay ilaa hadda\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha kuwa kaliya ee ka dambeeya kaydintii ugu dambeysay. Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta oo la kaydiyo wuu madhnaadaa, sidaas darteed kaydinta ka dib ma noqon kartid. Si aad dib ugu bilowdo asalka, mar kale fur faylka asalka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylal-waaweyn-iyo-xusuusta\"\u003EFaylal waaweyn iyo xusuusta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha IFC\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu akhriyaa oo dhan xusuusta tab-ka, xisaabinta 3D-na xusuusta ayay kor ugu darta. Moodel dhan dhowr boqol megabait ah ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka badan tahay laptop-ka. Ka sarreeya 1.5 milyan saddex-geesood, xuduudaha waa la demiyaa si xusuusta loo badbaadiyo (&quot;Xuduudaha way demasan yihiin moodelada aad u waaweyn&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E lama akhriyo oo dhan. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaybaha yaryar ee uu u baahan yahay, qiyaastii 40 KB ilaa 100 KB xitaa faylku uu weyn yahay, sidaas darteed moodel dhexe oo 500 MB ah oo ku yaal diskka shabakada wuxuu furmaa wax yar gudahood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/strong\u003E waa la akhriyaa oo dhan. Naqshad aad u weyn waxay muujisaa: &quot;Naqshaddan aad ayay u weyn tahay; qayb keliya ayaa la tusayaa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalalka\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa 20,000 fayl ayaa furmaa. Waxaa la akhriyaa oo kaliya dhowr kiilo baayt oo kaarka moodel kasta u baahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EBrowser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta\u003C/a\u003E wixii ka badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKhadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurista faylasha weligiis uma baahna internet. Hal akhriye ayaa ka soo raraya goobta markii ugu horraysay ee aad u baahato: mishiinka IFC, markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto moodel IFC (&quot;Mishiinka IFC waa la bilaabayaa…&quot;). Akhriyeyaasha DWG iyo DXF waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad ka baxsan tahay khadka. Haddii badhanka barta app-ka uu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, qaababka oo dhan waa la furayaa sida caadiga ah. Haddii kale, moodelka IFC ma furmi karo ilaa aad dib u xiriirto, marka laga reebo mid hore u furmay tab-kan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EKhadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad BimCraft-ka u isticmaasho adigoon xiriir lahayn, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E barta app-ka intaad khadka ku jirto, kadibna sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu qiyaastii yahay 33 MB; wuxuu ku jiraa mishiinka IFC, sidaas darteed moodelada IFC khadka ka baxsan ayay sidoo kale ku furmaan. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E ayaa sharraxaysa nuqullada la kaydiyay guud ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-daruuraha\"\u003EKaydinta daruuraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta daruuraha weli lama heli karo. Kaydi nuqullada aad wax ka beddeshay kombuyutarkaaga ama server-ka faylalka xafiiskaaga, sida aad u kaydiso fayl kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaylashaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha kombuyutarkaaga, tab-ka browser-ka gudihiisa. Waxba lama soo rarin CadCraft ama qof kale. Marka aad kaydiso, BimCraft wuxuu browser-ka siiyaa fayl cusub oo la soo dejiyo; weligiis ma qoro fayl aad furtay. Waxa uu furo Qaabka Dhamaadka magaca Waxa aad hesho IFC .ifc Moodelka 3D, dabaqyada, tirada walxaha iyo sifooyinka walax kasta. Magacyada, calaamadaha iyo qiimaha sifooyin keliya ayaa la beddeli karaa. Faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska .rvt .rfa .rte .rft Kaarka faylka: nooca la kaydiyay, dhismaha, shaqada wadajirka, macluumaadka mashruuca, cabbirrada qoyska, faylasha lagu xiray iyo sawirka horudhaca. Ma jiro 3D. DWG .dwg Naqshadda 2D: meesha moodelka, xaashi kasta, lakabyada, naqshadaha lagu xiray, sawirrada iyo aragtida daabacaadda. Meesha moodelka waxaa lagu arkaa 3D. Noocyada AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 ayaa la hubiyey. DXF .dxf Sida DWG oo kale. STEP .step .stp Qayb, qalab ama moodel uu bixiyo alaab-bixiyaha (AP203, AP214, AP242) oo 3D ah: jirka adag kasta wuxuu noqdaa hal walax (building element proxy) moodel IFC yar oo ku yaal hal dabaq, oo la akhriyo sida saddex-geesood cabbirkiisa dhabta ah, isku-dhis oo qayb walba ku yaal meesha faylku dhigay. Waxay u shaqeysaa sida IFC kasta oo kale: sifooyin, qaybo, cabbir, u kaydi sida IFC. Midabada iyo geedka isku-dhiska lama akhrin. Daruuraha dhibcaha .las .laz .e57 .ply .pcd .ptx .pts .xyz Scan-ka muuqaalka 3D, mid ka dhinac moodelka ama keligiis: eeg Muuji daruurta dhibcaha ee moodelka dhinacdiisa. Bundle-ka mashruuca .ccbundle.zip Moodelka oo leh muuqaalkiisa, naqshadihiisa iyo kooxaha sifooyinka: eeg Fur bundle-ka mashruuca. Gal kasta Warbixin ku saabsan moodel kasta, naqshad kasta iyo bundle kasta ee gudaha ku jira. Mid kasta oo IFC, moodel, naqshad ama bundle warbixinta ku jira ayaa lagu furaa guji. Waxa BimCraft ka akhriyo qaab kasta wuu faahfaahinayaa. BimCraft wuxuu go'aamiyaa waa maxay faylka isagoo eegaya baytiyada hore iyo sidoo kale magaca, sidaas darteed fayl mashruuc oo kordhin aan caadi ahayn weli wuxuu furmaa kaarka faylka. Lama furo .ifczip iyo .ifcxml: BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay: \".ifczip looma taageero weli. Kaydi ama dhoofi moodelka sida fayl .ifc oo caadi ah.\" Ka soo saar .ifczip (wuxuu ku jiraa .ifc caadi ah) ama dib u dhoofi sida IFC caadi ah. Naqshadaha DGN waxay ku jiraan warbixinta galka laakiin ma furmaan. PDF, sawirrada iyo faylasha xafiiska iyagoo keligood ma furmaan. Sawirrada waxaa loo isticmaalaa sawirro gudaha DWG, Build › From a drawing… wuxuu bogagga PDF ama scan-ka u beddelaa darbiyo: eeg Darbiyada laga sameeyo qorshayaal badan. Waxa uu kaydiyo Waxa aad riixdo Waxa aad hesho Meesha Save as IFC Fayl IFC cusub oo leh wax ka beddelkaaga, oo magaciisu yahay \"original name (edited).ifc\" Galka soo dejinta ee browser-kaaga Download CSV jadwalka qalabka CSV ee alaabta liiska ku jirta, oo magaciisu yahay \"drawing name equipment.csv\" Galka soo dejinta ee browser-kaaga Waxyaabaha kale waxaa lagu kaydiyaa meesha ay ka abuurmaan, mid kasta mawduuciisa gaarka ah: USD (Dhoofi moodelka USD), Collada (.dae iyo Google Earth .kmz: Dhoofi moodelka Collada ama Google Earth), .glb For rendering, sawirrada rendarka, xaashiyada iyo qorshayaasha PDF ahaan, jadwalada iyo liisaska CSV ahaan, dhibaatooyinka BCF, xisaab-miiska COBie, faylasha qoyska, iyo scan-yada la diiwaangeliyay LAS ama E57. BimCraft ma kaydiyo DWG, DXF ama faylasha mashruuca, mana beddelo faylasha aad furtay. Chrome iyo Edge waxay kaydiyaan soo dejinta galka lagu dejiyay dejintooda, badanaa Downloads. Si aad mar kasta loo weydiiyo meesha lagu kaydiyo, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" oo ku jira dejinta soo dejinta ee browser-ka. Firefox wuxuu kaydiyaa galka Downloads ilaa aad dejinteeda ku dhigto \"Always ask you where to save files\". Safari wuxuu kaydiyaa Downloads ilaa aad galka kale ka dooratid Safari \u003E Settings \u003E General \u003E File download location. Kaydinta marka labaad Mar kasta oo la kaydiyo, moodelka oo dhan waa la soo dejiyaa, oo ay ku jiraan dhammaan wax ka beddelka aad ka furtay ilaa hadda, ma aha kuwa kaliya ee ka dambeeya kaydintii ugu dambeysay. Liiska Changes mar kasta oo la kaydiyo wuu madhnaadaa, sidaas darteed kaydinta ka dib ma noqon kartid. Si aad dib ugu bilowdo asalka, mar kale fur faylka asalka ah. Faylal waaweyn iyo xusuusta Faylasha IFC waxaa lagu akhriyaa oo dhan xusuusta tab-ka, xisaabinta 3D-na xusuusta ayay kor ugu darta. Moodel dhan dhowr boqol megabait ah ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka badan tahay laptop-ka. Ka sarreeya 1.5 milyan saddex-geesood, xuduudaha waa la demiyaa si xusuusta loo badbaadiyo (\"Xuduudaha way demasan yihiin moodelada aad u waaweyn\"). Faylasha mashruuca lama akhriyo oo dhan. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaybaha yaryar ee uu u baahan yahay, qiyaastii 40 KB ilaa 100 KB xitaa faylku uu weyn yahay, sidaas darteed moodel dhexe oo 500 MB ah oo ku yaal diskka shabakada wuxuu furmaa wax yar gudahood. DWG iyo DXF waa la akhriyaa oo dhan. Naqshad aad u weyn waxay muujisaa: \"Naqshaddan aad ayay u weyn tahay; qayb keliya ayaa la tusayaa.\" Galalka ilaa 20,000 fayl ayaa furmaa. Waxaa la akhriyaa oo kaliya dhowr kiilo baayt oo kaarka moodel kasta u baahan. Eeg Browser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta wixii ka badan. Khadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan Furista faylasha weligiis uma baahna internet. Hal akhriye ayaa ka soo raraya goobta markii ugu horraysay ee aad u baahato: mishiinka IFC, markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto moodel IFC (\"Mishiinka IFC waa la bilaabayaa…\"). Akhriyeyaasha DWG iyo DXF waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka. Waxaad ka baxsan tahay khadka. Haddii badhanka barta app-ka uu leeyahay Offline ready, qaababka oo dhan waa la furayaa sida caadiga ah. Haddii kale, moodelka IFC ma furmi karo ilaa aad dib u xiriirto, marka laga reebo mid hore u furmay tab-kan. Eeg Khadka ku jira iyo ka baxsan. Si aad BimCraft-ka u isticmaasho adigoon xiriir lahayn, guji Save for offline barta app-ka intaad khadka ku jirto, kadibna sug Offline ready. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu qiyaastii yahay 33 MB; wuxuu ku jiraa mishiinka IFC, sidaas darteed moodelada IFC khadka ka baxsan ayay sidoo kale ku furmaan. Shaqaynta khadka ka baxsan ayaa sharraxaysa nuqullada la kaydiyay guud ahaan. Kaydinta daruuraha Kaydinta daruuraha weli lama heli karo. Kaydi nuqullada aad wax ka beddeshay kombuyutarkaaga ama server-ka faylalka xafiiskaaga, sida aad u kaydiso fayl kasta. Eeg Faylashaaga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-ifc-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur moodel IFC oo eeg 3D","summary":"Fur fayl IFC, orbit, pan iyo zoom, oo isticmaal Ku habee, Sare, Hore iyo Dhinac si aad u ogaato jihadaada.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["ifc","3d","orbit","pan","zoom","ku habee","muuqaal sare","muuqaal hore","muuqaal dhinac","jihayn","viewcube","kamaradda"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhaqaaqida","text":"Ku dhaqaaqida","level":2},{"id":"midab-leh-geesaha-ama-qaab-shabakad","text":"Midab leh, geesaha ama qaab shabakad","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur moodel IFC, ku dhaqaaq 3D, oo u gudub muuqaalada caadiga ah. Qiyaastii shan daqiiqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad u baahan tahay fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Barnaamijyada BIM badankood ayaa midka soo saara; Revit-ka waa \u003Cstrong\u003EFile &gt; Export &gt; IFC\u003C/strong\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EHel faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC-da\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro fayl\u003C/span\u003E (ama meesha dhigista ee bidix sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylkaaga \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E oo xaqiiji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta safka xaaladda dhammaysto. Markii ugu horreysay wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;Bilaabaya IFC engine-ka…&quot;, kadibna &quot;Akhrinaya moodelka…&quot; iyo &quot;Dhisaya geometry: … ee … walxood&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg moodelka: wuxuu ku furmaa muuqaal saddex-meelood-labo ah, shaashadda ku habaysan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E qalabka moodelka kor ku yaal si aad hoos u eegto si toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E si aad hore u eegto, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E si aad dhinaca uga eegto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad ugu noqoto muuqaalka saddex-meelood-labo ee moodelka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodelka dhexda, oo geesaha madow ee khafiifka ah ay u egyihiin sawir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E bidix: magaca faylka, cabbirka, schema-ta IFC (tusaale ahaan IFC2X3 ama IFC4), magaca mashruuca, marxaladda, barnaamijka laga soo dhoofiyay, qoraalka, taariikhda dhoofinta, iyo tirada walxaha iyo saddex-geesleyaasha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ee hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka xaaladda: &quot;Waa la furay \u003Cem\u003Emagaca faylka\u003C/em\u003E: \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E walxood in \u003Cem\u003Es\u003C/em\u003E s&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhaqaaqida\"\u003EKu dhaqaaqida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrbit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka midig, ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo jiid batoonka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShiid giraanta, ama jiid batoonka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArag wax walba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka: jiid hal farta oo riixan si aad u orbit-garayso; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid si aad u muuqaalka guurto; shiid laba farood ama cadaadi si aad u zoom-garayso. Guji laba farood waa midig-guji, waxaad ku jiidi kartaa si aad u guurto, laakiin \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid ayaa ka fudud.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrbit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid hal farta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadaadi laba farood\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaajiyo laba farood wada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArag wax walba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrbit had iyo jeer wuxuu wareegaa barta dhexe ee moodelka. Muuqaalka guuritaanku wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa bartaas, sidaas darteed ka dib guur dheer orbit-ku wuu ka fogaan karaa dhexdhexaadka: guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dib u dejiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midab-leh-geesaha-ama-qaab-shabakad\"\u003EMidab leh, geesaha ama qaab shabakad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddex badhan oo yaryar oo kor ku yaal view cube-ka ayaa doorta sida moodelka loo sawiro: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab leh\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab leh oo geesaha lagu muujiyo\u003C/span\u003E (caadiga) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab shabakad\u003C/span\u003E. Waa sidoo kale amro (View menu-yada iyo liiska Customize), sidaas darteed waxay leeyihiin furayaasha gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku yaalaan safka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFilashada muuqaalo magac leh.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay afar muuqaal oo go&#039;an (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E), view cube-ka geeska hoose ee midig iyo orbit xor ah. Ma kaydiyo muuqaalada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadinta qorshayaasha iyo goynta.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhismahan ma leh qorshe 2D ama sanduuqyo goyn. Moodelka ku goy hal diyaarad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E), ama dabaqyada demi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EMuuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurista faylka mashruuca iyo filashada 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka mashruuca wuxuu u furmaa kaarka fayl. Marka hore IFC dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurista \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Ka furi (unzip) ama dhoofi \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel aad u weyn ayaa tab-ka gaabiya ama burburiya.\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EBrowsers-ka, qalabka iyo xusuusta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/inspect-element\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/inspect-element\"\u003EDooro walax oo akhri sifooyinkeeda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Fur moodel IFC, ku dhaqaaq 3D, oo u gudub muuqaalada caadiga ah. Qiyaastii shan daqiiqo. Waxaad u baahan tahay fayl .ifc. Barnaamijyada BIM badankood ayaa midka soo saara; Revit-ka waa File \u003E Export \u003E IFC. Eeg Hel faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC-da. Tallaabooyin Guji Dooro fayl (ama meesha dhigista ee bidix sare). Dooro faylkaaga .ifc oo xaqiiji. Sug inta safka xaaladda dhammaysto. Markii ugu horreysay wuxuu muujinayaa \"Bilaabaya IFC engine-ka…\", kadibna \"Akhrinaya moodelka…\" iyo \"Dhisaya geometry: … ee … walxood\". Eeg moodelka: wuxuu ku furmaa muuqaal saddex-meelood-labo ah, shaashadda ku habaysan. Guji Sare qalabka moodelka kor ku yaal si aad hoos u eegto si toosan. Guji Hore si aad hore u eegto, kadibna Dhinac si aad dhinaca uga eegto. Guji Ku habee, ama riix F, si aad ugu noqoto muuqaalka saddex-meelood-labo ee moodelka oo dhan. Waxa aad arki doontid Moodelka dhexda, oo geesaha madow ee khafiifka ah ay u egyihiin sawir. Panelka Faylka bidix: magaca faylka, cabbirka, schema-ta IFC (tusaale ahaan IFC2X3 ama IFC4), magaca mashruuca, marxaladda, barnaamijka laga soo dhoofiyay, qoraalka, taariikhda dhoofinta, iyo tirada walxaha iyo saddex-geesleyaasha. Liisaska Dabaqyada iyo Walxaha ee hoosteeda. Safka xaaladda: \"Waa la furay magaca faylka: n walxood in s s\". Ku dhaqaaqida Si aad u Samee tan Orbit Jiid batoonka bidix Muuqaalka guuri Jiid batoonka midig, ama hay Shift (ama Ctrl) oo jiid batoonka bidix Weynee Shiid giraanta, ama jiid batoonka dhexe Arag wax walba Riix F ama guji Ku habee Trackpad-ka: jiid hal farta oo riixan si aad u orbit-garayso; hay Shift ama Ctrl oo jiid si aad u muuqaalka guurto; shiid laba farood ama cadaadi si aad u zoom-garayso. Guji laba farood waa midig-guji, waxaad ku jiidi kartaa si aad u guurto, laakiin Shift iyo jiid ayaa ka fudud. Si aad u Samee tan Orbit Jiid hal farta Weynee Cadaadi laba farood Muuqaalka guuri Dhaqaajiyo laba farood wada Arag wax walba Taabo Ku habee Orbit had iyo jeer wuxuu wareegaa barta dhexe ee moodelka. Muuqaalka guuritaanku wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa bartaas, sidaas darteed ka dib guur dheer orbit-ku wuu ka fogaan karaa dhexdhexaadka: guji Ku habee si aad u dib u dejiso. Midab leh, geesaha ama qaab shabakad Saddex badhan oo yaryar oo kor ku yaal view cube-ka ayaa doorta sida moodelka loo sawiro: Midab leh, Midab leh oo geesaha lagu muujiyo (caadiga) iyo Qaab shabakad. Waa sidoo kale amro (View menu-yada iyo liiska Customize), sidaas darteed waxay leeyihiin furayaasha gaarka ah. Qorshe, Kala jar iyo 3D waxay ku yaalaan safka Muuqaal ee qalabka. Khaladaad caadi ah Filashada muuqaalo magac leh. BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay afar muuqaal oo go'an (Ku habee, Sare, Hore, Dhinac), view cube-ka geeska hoose ee midig iyo orbit xor ah. Ma kaydiyo muuqaalada. Raadinta qorshayaasha iyo goynta. Dhismahan ma leh qorshe 2D ama sanduuqyo goyn. Moodelka ku goy hal diyaarad Goyn (Goo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn), ama dabaqyada demi: Muuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha. Furista faylka mashruuca iyo filashada 3D. Faylka mashruuca wuxuu u furmaa kaarka fayl. Marka hore IFC dhoofi. Furista .ifczip. Ka furi (unzip) ama dhoofi .ifc caadi ah. Moodel aad u weyn ayaa tab-ka gaabiya ama burburiya. Eeg Browsers-ka, qalabka iyo xusuusta. Xiga Dooro walax oo akhri sifooyinkeeda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"default-policies","scope":"bimcraft","title":"\"Siyaasadaha caadiga ah: deji waxa dhismo cusub ku bilaabmo\"","summary":"Mar hal mar sheeg nooca darbiga, dabaqyada, xaashida ugu horreysa, calaamadaha LOD, unugyada iyo qalabka dhismo cusub uu ku bilaabmo, mashaariicda metric iyo imperial, oo la wadaago siyaasadaha xafiiska sida fayl yar.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["caadi","default","siyaasadaha caadiga ah","siyaasad","heerka xafiiska","caadiyada xafiiska","qaab","dhismo cusub","darbiga ugu horreeya","metric","masonry","LOD","heerka horumarinta","xaashida ugu horreysa","paper","miisaan","dabaqyada","magacyada dabaqa","qalabka darbiga","unugyada","joogga dabaqa","wadaag","export","import","json"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"siyaasadaha","text":"Siyaasadaha","level":2},{"id":"qaabaynta-jadwalka-heerka-xafiiska","text":"Qaabaynta jadwalka: heerka xafiiska","level":2},{"id":"la-wadaag-xafiiska","text":"La wadaag xafiiska","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU sheeg BimCraft waxa dhismo cusub uu ku bilaabmo, si qofna xafiiska uusan wax isku mid ah mar kasta u beddelin. Tani waa add-on: wuu damaa ilaa aad shido, siyaasad aan la dejin waxay ka tagtaa dejinta asalka ah ee BimCraft sida ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa dejinta caadiga ah ee dhismaha \u003Cstrong\u003Ecusub\u003C/strong\u003E iyo waxyaabaha \u003Cstrong\u003Ecusub\u003C/strong\u003E. Mashruuc aad horay u bilowday ma beddelmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur Dejinta, tag \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhin\u003C/span\u003E oo shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta, fur tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/span\u003E liiska bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji siyaasadaha aad rabto. Mid kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekii BimCraft-ka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ku qoran qaansada waxa uu yahay. Siyaasad leh sanduuq \u003Cstrong\u003EMetric\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EImperial\u003C/strong\u003E waxay qaadataa qiime kasta nooca mashruuca; buuxi kuwa kaliya ee aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro badhan Kaydi: isbeddel kasta waa la kaydiyaa markaad samaynayso. Qiime aan la isticmaali karin waa la diidaa, sababta ayaa la sheegaa, qiimihii hore wuu joogaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismo cusub\u003C/span\u003E. Foomka waxaa lagu buuxiyaa siyaasadahaaga, qiime kasta oo siyaasad dejisay wuxuu ku xiga \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga helay Siyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E. Wali wax beddeli kartaa mid kasta ka hor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbuur\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"siyaasadaha\"\u003ESiyaasadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada dhismo cusub\u003C/strong\u003E: unugyada waxay u beddelmaan kuwa Abuur-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirada dabaqyada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMagacyada dabaqyada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E. Magac kasta, \u003Ccode\u003E{n}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa 1, 2, 3; \u003Ccode\u003E{n0}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa 0, 1, 2; \u003Ccode\u003E{nn}\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{nn0}\u003C/code\u003E ayaa sidaas oo kale ah oo leh laba lambar. Marka \u003Ccode\u003EDabaq {nn0}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siiyaa Dabaq 00, Dabaq 01, Dabaq 02.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca darbiga ugu horreeya\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa uu sawiro qalabka darbiga marka ugu horreysa. Xafiis metric ah wuxuu ku bilaabi karaa Exterior masonry 300 mm, mashaariicda imperial waxay haysanayaan Exterior 2×6.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda LOD ee nooca darbiga bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E: heerka horumarinta (LOD 100 ilaa 500) ee sagaal nooca bilowga ah ay muujiyaan meel kasta oo nooc la liisto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EDhis garbaha darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELOD ee nooca darbi cusub la sameeyay\u003C/strong\u003E: calaamadda ay nooca cusub ku bilaabato tafatiraha nooca. Halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashida ugu horreysa\u003C/strong\u003E: warqadeeda, miisaankeeda, lambarkeeda iyo magaceeda (isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003E{level}\u003C/code\u003E si aad u hesho magaca dabaqa ugu hooseeya), ama midna xaashi ugu horreysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada qoraalka warqadda\u003C/strong\u003E (Dejinta › Global › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah): dhererka xafiiska, mm sida la daabacay, qoraallada, qoraalka cabbirka, calaamadaha, magacyada qolalka, xarfaha goobta, cinwaanka muuqaalka iyo qoraalka jadwalka. Dhismo cusub ayaa qaadaa markuu abuurmo, waxayna ku hayaa faylkiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/annotation-sizes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/annotation-sizes\"\u003ENaqshadee cabbirka dhabta ah, qor miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka firfircoon kadib Abuur\u003C/strong\u003E: Dooro, sida BimCraft isaga uu sameeyo, ama Darbi, si laba guji ee ugu horreeya qorshaha uu u sawiro darbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabaynta-jadwalka-heerka-xafiiska\"\u003EQaabaynta jadwalka: heerka xafiiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta › Global › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabaynta jadwalka (heerka xafiiska)\u003C/strong\u003E, deji sida jadwal kasta loo kooxeeyo, haddii ay leedahay wadarta-hoose iyo wadar, cinwaankeeda, iyo xarfaha tiirarka. Jadwal kasta oo aan qeexin midkiisa ayaa qaadata, cidkasta oo dejisay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHabee, kaydi oo dhoofi jadwalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-wadaag-xafiiska\"\u003ELa wadaag xafiiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta, fur tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EGlobal\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiyaasadaha caadiga ah\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca xafiiska\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad rabto. Waa la qorayaa faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi faylka\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad heleysaa fayl yar oo ku dhammaanaya \u003Ccode\u003E.ccdefaults.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKombiyuutar kale, shid add-on-ka, fur isla meeshii oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad faylka\u003C/span\u003E. Siyaasadaha faylka ayaa beddelaya kuwa kombiyuutarkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka Global wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka unugyada mashruuca cusub\u003C/strong\u003E, oo khuseeya dhammaan apps-ka leh add-on-ka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji siyaasad kasta\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta asalka ah ee BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka BimCraft wuxuu nadiifiyaa kuwa BimCraft oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku waa JSON furan oo caadi ah: liis magacyada siyaasadaha iyo qiimayaasha. Siyaasad uu faylku magacaabo oo nooca hadda aan garanayn waa laga reebayaa, waxaana lagu sheegayaa fariinta; kuwa kale ayaa soo gala.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiyaasadaha waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, dhammaan apps-ka CadCraft ee kombiyuutarkan. Lama kaydiyo faylka dhismaha, kumana wada xidhna kombiyuutarro kale: u isticmaal faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda LOD ee nooca bilowga waxay ka timid siyaasadda kombiyuutarkan. Nooc aad ka samayso nuqul nooc bilowga ah ayaa calaamadiisa ku qaada faylka dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft ma laha dejin saxnaan, sidaas darteed siyaasad saxnaan halkan ma jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhismo laga bilaabay qaab wuxuu qaadaa dabaqyada iyo xaashiyada qaabka. Siyaasadda nooca darbiga iyo tan unugyada ayaa weli khuseysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa shid add-on-ka wax kasta waa dib u noqdaan kuwa BimCraft. Siyaasadahaaga waa la kaydiyaa si loogu soo celiyo markaad dib u shidid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa U sheeg BimCraft waxa dhismo cusub uu ku bilaabmo, si qofna xafiiska uusan wax isku mid ah mar kasta u beddelin. Tani waa add-on: wuu damaa ilaa aad shido, siyaasad aan la dejin waxay ka tagtaa dejinta asalka ah ee BimCraft sida ay tahay. Kuwani waa dejinta caadiga ah ee dhismaha cusub iyo waxyaabaha cusub. Mashruuc aad horay u bilowday ma beddelmo. Tallaabooyin Fur Dejinta, tag Kordhin oo shid Siyaasadaha caadiga ah. Dejinta, fur tab-ka BimCraft oo dooro Siyaasadaha caadiga ah liiska bidix. Deji siyaasadaha aad rabto. Mid kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa kii BimCraft-ka, oo ku qoran qaansada waxa uu yahay. Siyaasad leh sanduuq Metric iyo Imperial waxay qaadataa qiime kasta nooca mashruuca; buuxi kuwa kaliya ee aad u baahan tahay. Ma jiro badhan Kaydi: isbeddel kasta waa la kaydiyaa markaad samaynayso. Qiime aan la isticmaali karin waa la diidaa, sababta ayaa la sheegaa, qiimihii hore wuu joogaa. Guji Dhismo cusub. Foomka waxaa lagu buuxiyaa siyaasadahaaga, qiime kasta oo siyaasad dejisay wuxuu ku xiga laga helay Siyaasadaha caadiga ah. Wali wax beddeli kartaa mid kasta ka hor Abuur. Siyaasadaha Unugyada dhismo cusub: unugyada waxay u beddelmaan kuwa Abuur-ka. Tirada dabaqyada, Magacyada dabaqyada iyo Dhererka dabaqa. Magac kasta, {n} wuxuu tiriyaa 1, 2, 3; {n0} wuxuu tiriyaa 0, 1, 2; {nn} iyo {nn0} ayaa sidaas oo kale ah oo leh laba lambar. Marka Dabaq {nn0} wuxuu siiyaa Dabaq 00, Dabaq 01, Dabaq 02. Nooca darbiga ugu horreeya: waxa uu sawiro qalabka darbiga marka ugu horreysa. Xafiis metric ah wuxuu ku bilaabi karaa Exterior masonry 300 mm, mashaariicda imperial waxay haysanayaan Exterior 2×6. Calaamadda LOD ee nooca darbiga bilowga: heerka horumarinta (LOD 100 ilaa 500) ee sagaal nooca bilowga ah ay muujiyaan meel kasta oo nooc la liisto. Eeg Dhis garbaha darbiyada. LOD ee nooca darbi cusub la sameeyay: calaamadda ay nooca cusub ku bilaabato tafatiraha nooca. Halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa. Xaashida ugu horreysa: warqadeeda, miisaankeeda, lambarkeeda iyo magaceeda (isticmaal {level} si aad u hesho magaca dabaqa ugu hooseeya), ama midna xaashi ugu horreysa. Cabbirrada qoraalka warqadda (Dejinta › Global › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah): dhererka xafiiska, mm sida la daabacay, qoraallada, qoraalka cabbirka, calaamadaha, magacyada qolalka, xarfaha goobta, cinwaanka muuqaalka iyo qoraalka jadwalka. Dhismo cusub ayaa qaadaa markuu abuurmo, waxayna ku hayaa faylkiisa. Eeg Naqshadee cabbirka dhabta ah, qor miisaanka. Qalabka firfircoon kadib Abuur: Dooro, sida BimCraft isaga uu sameeyo, ama Darbi, si laba guji ee ugu horreeya qorshaha uu u sawiro darbi. Qaabaynta jadwalka: heerka xafiiska Dejinta › Global › Siyaasadaha caadiga ah, hoosta Qaabaynta jadwalka (heerka xafiiska), deji sida jadwal kasta loo kooxeeyo, haddii ay leedahay wadarta-hoose iyo wadar, cinwaankeeda, iyo xarfaha tiirarka. Jadwal kasta oo aan qeexin midkiisa ayaa qaadata, cidkasta oo dejisay. Eeg Habee, kaydi oo dhoofi jadwalka. La wadaag xafiiska Dejinta, fur tab-ka Global oo dooro Siyaasadaha caadiga ah. Qor Magaca xafiiska haddii aad rabto. Waa la qorayaa faylka. Guji Kaydi faylka. Waxaad heleysaa fayl yar oo ku dhammaanaya .ccdefaults.json. Kombiyuutar kale, shid add-on-ka, fur isla meeshii oo guji Soo qaad faylka. Siyaasadaha faylka ayaa beddelaya kuwa kombiyuutarkaas. Tab-ka Global wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay Nidaamka unugyada mashruuca cusub, oo khuseeya dhammaan apps-ka leh add-on-ka, iyo Dib u deji siyaasad kasta. Dib u deji dejinta asalka ah ee BimCraft tab-ka BimCraft wuxuu nadiifiyaa kuwa BimCraft oo keliya. Waxa muhiim ah Faylku waa JSON furan oo caadi ah: liis magacyada siyaasadaha iyo qiimayaasha. Siyaasad uu faylku magacaabo oo nooca hadda aan garanayn waa laga reebayaa, waxaana lagu sheegayaa fariinta; kuwa kale ayaa soo gala. Siyaasadaha waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, dhammaan apps-ka CadCraft ee kombiyuutarkan. Lama kaydiyo faylka dhismaha, kumana wada xidhna kombiyuutarro kale: u isticmaal faylka. Calaamadda LOD ee nooca bilowga waxay ka timid siyaasadda kombiyuutarkan. Nooc aad ka samayso nuqul nooc bilowga ah ayaa calaamadiisa ku qaada faylka dhismaha. BimCraft ma laha dejin saxnaan, sidaas darteed siyaasad saxnaan halkan ma jiro. Dhismo laga bilaabay qaab wuxuu qaadaa dabaqyada iyo xaashiyada qaabka. Siyaasadda nooca darbiga iyo tan unugyada ayaa weli khuseysa. Ka shid add-on-ka wax kasta waa dib u noqdaan kuwa BimCraft. Siyaasadahaaga waa la kaydiyaa si loogu soo celiyo markaad dib u shidid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"draw-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sawir darbiyada","summary":"Sawir darbiyada qorshaha heer adigoo riixaya geeskooda ama adigoo qorayo dhererka; geeskooda ayaa isku xiraya, darbiyadana waxa loo kaydiyaa sida IFC.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["qalloocan","qaanso","khadka goobta","jihaynta","darbi","darbiyada","sawir","qorshe","qorshaha dabaqa","qol","geeska","isku xir","nooca darbiga","2x6","2x4","cmu","kongreet","joog","heer","heerar","dabaq","dherer la qoray","ortho","isku-qabsii"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"fur-qorshaha","text":"Fur qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"sawir-qol","text":"Sawir qol","level":2},{"id":"dooro-tixraaca-sawirka","text":"Dooro tixraaca sawirka","level":2},{"id":"khadka-goobta","text":"Khadka goobta","level":2},{"id":"sawir-darbi-qalloocan","text":"Sawir darbi qalloocan","level":2},{"id":"qor-dherer-halkii-aad-riixi-lahayd","text":"Qor dherer halkii aad riixi lahayd","level":2},{"id":"isku-qabsiyo","text":"Isku-qabsiyo","level":2},{"id":"beddel-ka-noqo-tirtir","text":"Beddel, ka noqo, tirtir","level":2},{"id":"heerar","text":"Heerar","level":2},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir darbiyada dhismaha qorshaha heer kasta. Riix meesha darbigu ka bilaabmo, iyo geesta kasta; BimCraft ayaa geeskooda kuu isku xiraya, darbi kasta wuxuu siinayaa lakabyadeeda (dahaadhka dibadda, dahaadhka hoose, saaruuro, dhigga gypsum …), oo wuxuu ku kordhiyaa heerka ka sarreeya. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu tusayaa darbiyada intaad sawirayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-qorshaha\"\u003EFur qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow dhis cusub (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/start-a-new-building\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/start-a-new-building\"\u003EBilow dhis cusub\u003C/a\u003E) ama fur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare. Dhis cusub ayaa furmaya isagoo horay u shaqeynaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha heer ayaa ku muuqda bidix, muuqaalka 3D ayaana midig. Dooro heerka liiska ku yaal sare qorshaha, ama batanka wareegsan ee ku xiga heerka panelka \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerar\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E waa qalabyo ku jira safka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka (amarada PLAN, SPLIT iyo furayaasha waxay shaqeeyaan sida hore). Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E qorshaha keliya, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E labadaba, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E si aad u xidho qorshaha. Markii daaqaddu ballaadhan tahay (ama cabbirka interface-ka weyn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qorshaha geeyaa sare muuqaalka 3D halkii uu ka geli lahaa dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu goynayaa heerka 4&#039;-0&quot; (1200 mm) ka sarreeya dhulkiisa, sida qorshaha dabaqa ee caadiga ah. Ku dhaq batanka si aad u weyneyso; dhex ama midig ku dhaq oo jiid si aad u guurto (ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid). Markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E uu daaran yahay, jiid fudud ayaa sidaas oo kale guuraya. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markii mouse-ku qorshaha ku jiro wuxuu buuxiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-qol\"\u003ESawir qol\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca darbiga liiska koowaad, tusaale \u003Cstrong\u003EDibadda 2×6\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGudaha 2×4\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro dherkiisa: \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa heerka ka sarreeya\u003C/strong\u003E (darbigu wuu raacayaa haddii heerkaas dhaqaajo), \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa\u003C/strong\u003E heer ka sarreeya oo darbi u dhex maraya dhowr heer (hol jaranjar leh, qol laba dherer ah, dhinac sare leh), ama \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog go&#039;an\u003C/strong\u003E oo qor. Darbi noocan oo kale wuxuu ka mid yahay heerka aad ku sawirtay; qorshayaasha heerarka uu maro wuu si fudud u iftiimiyaa, qolalku waxay ku xirmaan, waxaana ka riixi kartaa albaabo iyo daaqado qorshayaashaas. (Albaabku wuxuu taagan yahay sagxadda heerkaas). Si aad u guurto ama u beddesho darbiga laftiisa, tag heerka uu ka bilaabmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha darbiga koowaad ka bilaabanayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesta kasta. Riix kasta wuxuu sameeyaa darbi; darbiga xiga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meesha uu ka dhammaaday. Dhererka iyo xagalka waxay ku muuqdaan dhinaca mouse-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib u riix barta koowaad si aad u xidho qolka. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi ee qolku leeyahay, iyo haddii aad ku jirto habka dhexe-khadka, darbi kasta wuxuu helaa lakabkiisa dibadda oo ku yaal dibadda qolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama midig-riix, ama laba jeer-riix) si aad u joojiso adigoo aan xidhin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeeskooda wuu isku xiraa naftiisa: laba darbi ayaa kulma mitre, darbi ku dhammaada darbi kale wuxuu ku joogsadaa wajigiisa (T), saddex darbi ama ka badan meel isku mid ah ayaa wadaagaa geeska. Darbiyada isgoysta waxay ku sii jiraan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQol oo dhan mar keliya: fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabab\u003C/span\u003E si aad u sawirto afar-geesood, afar-geesood la leexiyay, poligon, qaansooyin, darbiyo khadadka la doortay ama wareegsan qaab (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaababka darbiyada, kala jar, kala fogee, fidin iyo qufulka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-tixraaca-sawirka\"\u003EDooro tixraaca sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E ka hor riixa koowaad. Markii dhinac la doorto, riixyadaada iyo dherarka aad qortay waxay sharxayaan dhinacaas; BimCraft wuxuu u rogaa dhexdhexaadka darbiga nus wadarta dhumucda, wuxuuna isku xiraa geeska xiga. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDibadda bidix\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDibadda midig\u003C/strong\u003E marka loo eego jihada aad sawirayso. Wareeg xidhan oo saacad ka soo horjeedda ah, dibaddu waa midigta; saacadda oo kale, bidixda. Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E la doorto, jirka darbiga wuxuu u gudbaa dhinaca dibadda khadkaaga; marka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E, dhinaca kale. Sawirka dhinaca wuxuu ilaaliyaa dhinaca dibadda aad dooratay markii aad xidhayso wareegga. Dhexdhexaadka, darbiyada aan xidhin qol waxay qaadanayaan dhinaca dibadda ee aad dooratay; xidhista qol waxay dhinaca dibadda ee darbi kasta ka dhigtaa dibadda qolka iyadoo laftiisa ah, jihada aad ku sawirtayna ha ahaatee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddelidda nooca darbiga, tixraaca ama dhinaca dibadda waxay joojisaa silsiladda hadda jirta. Geeska dib u soo noqda agtiisa, mitreyada dheer waxa lagu xaddidaa iyadoo lagu tagayo dhamaadyo afar-geesood ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sawirayso, dhamaadka khadka meel bannaan ayaa isku toosi kara si toosan ama dhig ah darbi dhamaadkiisa ama geesta hore. Khad jajab ah ayaa ku xiraya barta iyo mouse-ka isku-qabsaday. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa jihada sawirka sida jaranjar; markaas toosinta wuxuu joojiyaa jihadaas dhexdeeda. Dhamaadyada u dhow, dhexdhexaadyada iyo isgoysyada darbiyada waxay ka muhiimsan yihiin toosinta fogaanta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadka-goobta\"\u003EKhadka goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETixraac\u003C/strong\u003E la doorto \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E, darbigu wuxuu ilaaliyaa wajigaas sida khadka goobtiisa. Kadib, haddii darbigu noqdo mid dhumuc badan ama dibaddiisa la rogo, wajigaas wuu sii joogaa meeshiisa, darbigana wuxuu ku kobacaa ama ku rogmadaa agteeda. Darbi toosan oo geesta ku kulma wuu raacaa, sidaas awgeed geeska wuu xidhmaa. Khadka goobta waad ka beddeli kartaa ka dib \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-darbi-qalloocan\"\u003ESawir darbi qalloocan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocan\u003C/strong\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab\u003C/strong\u003E ee safka ikhtiyaarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha darbigu ka bilaabanayso, kadibna meesha uu ku dhammaado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta ku taal qaansadiisa. Ama qor dherer qaansada oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESilsiladu waxay ka sii socotaa dhamaadka darbiga. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi qalloocan wuxuu ku xirmaa darbiyada dhamaadkiisa (geeskooda iyo isku xirka T way shaqeeyaan), wuxuu sameeyaa qolal, wuxuuna haystaa albaabo iyo daaqado qaansadiisa dhexdeeda. Waxay ahaanayaan halbowlayaal toosan, oo ku toosan darbiga bartiisa dhexe, fogaantooduna waxay lagu cabbiraa qaansada. Darbi wuxuu laaban karaa ugu badnaan saddex meelood meel wareeg. Wuxuu ku xirmaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexdhexaadka qaansadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWali lama dhisin darbiyada qalloocan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar / kordhi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeeska\u003C/span\u003E, qaab-dhismeed, cabbirrada toosan ee otomaatiga ah, iyo isku-qabsiga qaansada dhexdeeda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qor-dherer-halkii-aad-riixi-lahayd\"\u003EQor dherer halkii aad riixi lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa dib riixa koowaad, qor oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sawiraa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E3810\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edarbi dheer sidaas, jihada uu tusayo mouse-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esidaas dheer, xagal sidaas (darajo, saacad ka soo horjeedda midig)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@3000,0\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta sidaas fogaan ka xigta barta ugu dambeysay, dhinac iyo sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1200,3400\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta sidaas ee qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka qalabka Darbi uu shaqeynayo, qor lambar wuxuu galaa sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E isla markiiba. Feet iyo inch-ka, lambar fudud waa inch; millimeter-ka, waa millimeter. Had iyo jeer unit-ka waad qori kartaa: \u003Ccode\u003E3.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-qabsiyo\"\u003EIsku-qabsiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaadyada darbiga, geeskooda wajiga iyo dhexdhexaadyada darbiga ayaa isku-qabsada marka mouse-ku u dhow yahay (laba-jibbaaran, saddex-geesood).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMouse-ku wuxuu isku-qabsadaa dhexdhexaadka khadka darbiga ama labada wajigiisa (calaamad afar-geesood).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta ugu dambeysay, jihadu wuxuu ku hayaa 15° kasta marka uu u dhow yahay; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu hayso 0°, 90°, 180° ama 270°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJihooyinka xor ah ayay dherarka ku wareejiyaan 1/2&quot; (ama 10 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-ka-noqo-tirtir\"\u003EBeddel, ka noqo, tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbi kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddellada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E darbiyada ayay soo celinayaan oo dib ayay u dhigaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E daaran yahay, riix darbi qorshaha si aad u doorato; muuqaalka 3D iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa raacaya. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa darbiyada la doortay, darbiyadana ay isku xiri jireen mar kale way nadiifaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerar\"\u003EHeerar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa heer kasta oo leh sare-jogga iyo dhererka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor magac cusub, sare-jog ama dherer oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Beddelidda dherer heer (ama sare-jog) waxay u dhaqaajisaa heerarka ka sarreeya qadar isku mid ah, darbiyada ilaa heerkaas ku kor socdaana way raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heer sare\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa heer sare heerka ugu sarreeya, isla dherer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heer hoose\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa heer hoos ka yaal heerka ugu hooseeya (basement), isla dherer: sare-jogiisu waa taban yahay marka heerka ugu hooseeya uu yahay 0, mana jiro heer kale oo dhaqaaqa. Ka noqo wuu ka saarayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee heerkan…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u sawiraa wixii heerka aad eegayso ku jira heer kale, ama heer cusub oo sare: darbiyadiisa oo albaabada iyo daaqadahooda, dabaqyada iyo saqafyada (ma aha saqafka dusha). Darbiyada ilaa heerka sare ku kor socday, waxay ilaa heerka ka sarreeya heerka cusub ku kor socdaan; qolalku isla markaana way muuqdaan. Hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammaantood soo celinayaa. Haddii heerka kale horay darbiyo u leeyahay, nuqulka waxaa lagu daraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu doortaa cutubyada (feet iyo inch, inch, feet decimal, millimeter, centimeter ama meter) wixii qalabyada sawirku muujiyo oo akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E. Darbi kasta waa darbi IFC leh khadka dhexdhexaadkiisa, qaabkiisa isku xiran, nooceeda iyo lakabyadiisa, \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E iyo tirooyinka saldhigga (dherer, joog, meelaha iyo mugga), si barnaamijyada BIM kale ay u furaan oo u qorsheeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada waxa lagu sawiraa khadka dhexdhexaadkooda. Dhumucdooda waxay ka timaadaa nooca darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa darbiyada halkan lagu sawiray oo buuxsan, iyo wax kasta oo kale (alaabta maktabadda, moodello ka timid barnaamijyo kale) oo laga gooyay isla diyaarad, iyo wixii ka hooseeya gooyska oo khudad khafiif ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada uu sameeyay barnaamij kale waxay ku muuqdaan qorshaha, laakiin qalabyadan wali lama beddeli karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Sawir darbiyada dhismaha qorshaha heer kasta. Riix meesha darbigu ka bilaabmo, iyo geesta kasta; BimCraft ayaa geeskooda kuu isku xiraya, darbi kasta wuxuu siinayaa lakabyadeeda (dahaadhka dibadda, dahaadhka hoose, saaruuro, dhigga gypsum …), oo wuxuu ku kordhiyaa heerka ka sarreeya. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu tusayaa darbiyada intaad sawirayso. Fur qorshaha Bilow dhis cusub (Bilow dhis cusub) ama fur moodel IFC. Riix Sawir qalabka sare. Dhis cusub ayaa furmaya isagoo horay u shaqeynaya. Qorshaha heer ayaa ku muuqda bidix, muuqaalka 3D ayaana midig. Dooro heerka liiska ku yaal sare qorshaha, ama batanka wareegsan ee ku xiga heerka panelka Heerar. Qorshe, Kala jar iyo 3D waa qalabyo ku jira safka Muuqaal ee qalabka (amarada PLAN, SPLIT iyo furayaasha waxay shaqeeyaan sida hore). Isticmaal Qorshe qorshaha keliya, Kala jar labadaba, 3D si aad u xidho qorshaha. Markii daaqaddu ballaadhan tahay (ama cabbirka interface-ka weyn), Kala jar wuxuu qorshaha geeyaa sare muuqaalka 3D halkii uu ka geli lahaa dhinac. Qorshuhu wuxuu goynayaa heerka 4'-0\" (1200 mm) ka sarreeya dhulkiisa, sida qorshaha dabaqa ee caadiga ah. Ku dhaq batanka si aad u weyneyso; dhex ama midig ku dhaq oo jiid si aad u guurto (ama hay Space oo jiid). Markii Dooro uu daaran yahay, jiid fudud ayaa sidaas oo kale guuraya. F markii mouse-ku qorshaha ku jiro wuxuu buuxiyaa. Sawir qol Riix Darbi (ama riix W). Dooro nooca darbiga liiska koowaad, tusaale Dibadda 2×6 ama Gudaha 2×4. Dooro dherkiisa: Ilaa heerka ka sarreeya (darbigu wuu raacayaa haddii heerkaas dhaqaajo), Ilaa heer ka sarreeya oo darbi u dhex maraya dhowr heer (hol jaranjar leh, qol laba dherer ah, dhinac sare leh), ama Joog go'an oo qor. Darbi noocan oo kale wuxuu ka mid yahay heerka aad ku sawirtay; qorshayaasha heerarka uu maro wuu si fudud u iftiimiyaa, qolalku waxay ku xirmaan, waxaana ka riixi kartaa albaabo iyo daaqado qorshayaashaas. (Albaabku wuxuu taagan yahay sagxadda heerkaas). Si aad u guurto ama u beddesho darbiga laftiisa, tag heerka uu ka bilaabmo. Riix meesha darbiga koowaad ka bilaabanayso. Riix geesta kasta. Riix kasta wuxuu sameeyaa darbi; darbiga xiga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meesha uu ka dhammaaday. Dhererka iyo xagalka waxay ku muuqdaan dhinaca mouse-ka. Dib u riix barta koowaad si aad u xidho qolka. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi ee qolku leeyahay, iyo haddii aad ku jirto habka dhexe-khadka, darbi kasta wuxuu helaa lakabkiisa dibadda oo ku yaal dibadda qolka. Riix Esc (ama midig-riix, ama laba jeer-riix) si aad u joojiso adigoo aan xidhin. Geeskooda wuu isku xiraa naftiisa: laba darbi ayaa kulma mitre, darbi ku dhammaada darbi kale wuxuu ku joogsadaa wajigiisa (T), saddex darbi ama ka badan meel isku mid ah ayaa wadaagaa geeska. Darbiyada isgoysta waxay ku sii jiraan sidii ay ahaayeen. Qol oo dhan mar keliya: fur Qaabab si aad u sawirto afar-geesood, afar-geesood la leexiyay, poligon, qaansooyin, darbiyo khadadka la doortay ama wareegsan qaab (eeg Qaababka darbiyada, kala jar, kala fogee, fidin iyo qufulka). Dooro tixraaca sawirka Dooro Dhexdhexaad, Dhinaca gudaha ama Dhinaca dibadda ka hor riixa koowaad. Markii dhinac la doorto, riixyadaada iyo dherarka aad qortay waxay sharxayaan dhinacaas; BimCraft wuxuu u rogaa dhexdhexaadka darbiga nus wadarta dhumucda, wuxuuna isku xiraa geeska xiga. Dooro Dibadda bidix ama Dibadda midig marka loo eego jihada aad sawirayso. Wareeg xidhan oo saacad ka soo horjeedda ah, dibaddu waa midigta; saacadda oo kale, bidixda. Marka Dhinaca gudaha la doorto, jirka darbiga wuxuu u gudbaa dhinaca dibadda khadkaaga; marka Dhinaca dibadda, dhinaca kale. Sawirka dhinaca wuxuu ilaaliyaa dhinaca dibadda aad dooratay markii aad xidhayso wareegga. Dhexdhexaadka, darbiyada aan xidhin qol waxay qaadanayaan dhinaca dibadda ee aad dooratay; xidhista qol waxay dhinaca dibadda ee darbi kasta ka dhigtaa dibadda qolka iyadoo laftiisa ah, jihada aad ku sawirtayna ha ahaatee. Beddelidda nooca darbiga, tixraaca ama dhinaca dibadda waxay joojisaa silsiladda hadda jirta. Geeska dib u soo noqda agtiisa, mitreyada dheer waxa lagu xaddidaa iyadoo lagu tagayo dhamaadyo afar-geesood ah. Intaad sawirayso, dhamaadka khadka meel bannaan ayaa isku toosi kara si toosan ama dhig ah darbi dhamaadkiisa ama geesta hore. Khad jajab ah ayaa ku xiraya barta iyo mouse-ka isku-qabsaday. Shift wuxuu ilaaliyaa jihada sawirka sida jaranjar; markaas toosinta wuxuu joojiyaa jihadaas dhexdeeda. Dhamaadyada u dhow, dhexdhexaadyada iyo isgoysyada darbiyada waxay ka muhiimsan yihiin toosinta fogaanta. Khadka goobta Marka Tixraac la doorto Dhinaca dibadda ama Dhinaca gudaha, darbigu wuxuu ilaaliyaa wajigaas sida khadka goobtiisa. Kadib, haddii darbigu noqdo mid dhumuc badan ama dibaddiisa la rogo, wajigaas wuu sii joogaa meeshiisa, darbigana wuxuu ku kobacaa ama ku rogmadaa agteeda. Darbi toosan oo geesta ku kulma wuu raacaa, sidaas awgeed geeska wuu xidhmaa. Khadka goobta waad ka beddeli kartaa ka dib Sifooyinka: eeg Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad. Sawir darbi qalloocan Riix Darbi, kadibna dooro Qalloocan liiska Qaab ee safka ikhtiyaarka. Riix meesha darbigu ka bilaabanayso, kadibna meesha uu ku dhammaado. Riix barta ku taal qaansadiisa. Ama qor dherer qaansada oo riix Enter. Silsiladu waxay ka sii socotaa dhamaadka darbiga. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Darbi qalloocan wuxuu ku xirmaa darbiyada dhamaadkiisa (geeskooda iyo isku xirka T way shaqeeyaan), wuxuu sameeyaa qolal, wuxuuna haystaa albaabo iyo daaqado qaansadiisa dhexdeeda. Waxay ahaanayaan halbowlayaal toosan, oo ku toosan darbiga bartiisa dhexe, fogaantooduna waxay lagu cabbiraa qaansada. Darbi wuxuu laaban karaa ugu badnaan saddex meelood meel wareeg. Wuxuu ku xirmaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexdhexaadka qaansadiisa. Wali lama dhisin darbiyada qalloocan: Jar / kordhi iyo Geeska, qaab-dhismeed, cabbirrada toosan ee otomaatiga ah, iyo isku-qabsiga qaansada dhexdeeda. Eeg Waxa aan wali la dhisin. Qor dherer halkii aad riixi lahayd Ka dib riixa koowaad, qor oo riix Enter: Qor Wuxuu sawiraa 12'6\" ama 3810 darbi dheer sidaas, jihada uu tusayo mouse-ka 12'6\"\u003C90 sidaas dheer, xagal sidaas (darajo, saacad ka soo horjeedda midig) @3000,0 barta sidaas fogaan ka xigta barta ugu dambeysay, dhinac iyo sare 1200,3400 barta sidaas ee qorshaha Marka qalabka Darbi uu shaqeynayo, qor lambar wuxuu galaa sanduuqa Dherer isla markiiba. Feet iyo inch-ka, lambar fudud waa inch; millimeter-ka, waa millimeter. Had iyo jeer unit-ka waad qori kartaa: 3.5 m, 10 ft, 6 1/2\". Isku-qabsiyo Dhamaadyada darbiga, geeskooda wajiga iyo dhexdhexaadyada darbiga ayaa isku-qabsada marka mouse-ku u dhow yahay (laba-jibbaaran, saddex-geesood). Mouse-ku wuxuu isku-qabsadaa dhexdhexaadka khadka darbiga ama labada wajigiisa (calaamad afar-geesood). Barta ugu dambeysay, jihadu wuxuu ku hayaa 15° kasta marka uu u dhow yahay; hay Shift si aad ugu hayso 0°, 90°, 180° ama 270°. Jihooyinka xor ah ayay dherarka ku wareejiyaan 1/2\" (ama 10 mm). Beddel, ka noqo, tirtir Darbi kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jira Isbeddellada: Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale darbiyada ayay soo celinayaan oo dib ayay u dhigaan. Marka Dooro daaran yahay, riix darbi qorshaha si aad u doorato; muuqaalka 3D iyo Sifooyinka ayaa raacaya. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa darbiyada la doortay, darbiyadana ay isku xiri jireen mar kale way nadiifaan. Heerar Panelka Heerar wuxuu liistaa heer kasta oo leh sare-jogga iyo dhererka. Qor magac cusub, sare-jog ama dherer oo riix Enter. Beddelidda dherer heer (ama sare-jog) waxay u dhaqaajisaa heerarka ka sarreeya qadar isku mid ah, darbiyada ilaa heerkaas ku kor socdaana way raacaan. Ku dar heer sare wuxuu ku daraa heer sare heerka ugu sarreeya, isla dherer. Ku dar heer hoose wuxuu ku daraa heer hoos ka yaal heerka ugu hooseeya (basement), isla dherer: sare-jogiisu waa taban yahay marka heerka ugu hooseeya uu yahay 0, mana jiro heer kale oo dhaqaaqa. Ka noqo wuu ka saarayaa. Koobiyee heerkan… wuxuu dib u sawiraa wixii heerka aad eegayso ku jira heer kale, ama heer cusub oo sare: darbiyadiisa oo albaabada iyo daaqadahooda, dabaqyada iyo saqafyada (ma aha saqafka dusha). Darbiyada ilaa heerka sare ku kor socday, waxay ilaa heerka ka sarreeya heerka cusub ku kor socdaan; qolalku isla markaana way muuqdaan. Hal Ka noqo wuxuu dhammaantood soo celinayaa. Haddii heerka kale horay darbiyo u leeyahay, nuqulka waxaa lagu daraa. Cutubyada qalabka sare wuxuu doortaa cutubyada (feet iyo inch, inch, feet decimal, millimeter, centimeter ama meter) wixii qalabyada sawirku muujiyo oo akhriyo. Kaydi Riix U kaydi sida IFC. Darbi kasta waa darbi IFC leh khadka dhexdhexaadkiisa, qaabkiisa isku xiran, nooceeda iyo lakabyadiisa, Pset_WallCommon iyo tirooyinka saldhigga (dherer, joog, meelaha iyo mugga), si barnaamijyada BIM kale ay u furaan oo u qorsheeyaan. Waxa muhiim ah Darbiyada waxa lagu sawiraa khadka dhexdhexaadkooda. Dhumucdooda waxay ka timaadaa nooca darbiga. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa darbiyada halkan lagu sawiray oo buuxsan, iyo wax kasta oo kale (alaabta maktabadda, moodello ka timid barnaamijyo kale) oo laga gooyay isla diyaarad, iyo wixii ka hooseeya gooyska oo khudad khafiif ah. Darbiyada uu sameeyay barnaamij kale waxay ku muuqdaan qorshaha, laakiin qalabyadan wali lama beddeli karo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"doors-and-windows","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Albaabada iyo daaqadaha","summary":"Geli albaabada iyo daaqadaha darbiyada la sawiray: tilmaan darbi, eeg furitaanka iyo masaafada geesaha, guji; furitaanka darbiga ayaa isagu jarmaya.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["albaab","albaabo","daaqad","daaqado","furitaan","hinge","gacan","rog","albaab fadhiya","albaab gelin","albaab jiid","albaab garaash","albaab labo","daaqad jiid","daaqad go'an","sill","header","bifold","albaab kabadh","French doors","albaab barn","sidelites","albaabka soo galka","awning","daaqad muuqaal","transom"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"geli-albaab","text":"Geli albaab","level":2},{"id":"geli-daaqad","text":"Geli daaqad","level":2},{"id":"guuri-rog-tirtir","text":"Guuri, rog, tirtir","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-diido","text":"Waxa la diido","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-kaydiyaa","text":"Waxa la kaydiyaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"daaqadda-bixitaanka-bir-bisaadka-iyo-well-ka","text":"Daaqadda bixitaanka bir-bisaadka iyo well-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeli albaabada iyo daaqadaha darbiyada aad sawiray (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E). Tilmaan darbi, albaabka ama daaqadda ayaa muujinaysa meesha uu ku taalo, waxa uu u furi doono, iyo masaafada ilaa geesaha kasta. Guji, furitaanka ayaa iskiis ka jarmaya darbiga naqshadda iyo 3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-albaab\"\u003EGeli albaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKadib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E oo shidan, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlbaab\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca: \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab dhinac-fur ah keliya\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab labo dhinac-fur ah\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab jiid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab dhex-gala\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab garaash\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab kabadh (bifold)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabo French\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab barn (darbiga)\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabka soo galka ee sidelites\u003C/strong\u003E. Cabbirkiisa caadiga ah wuxuu buuxiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E; dooro mid kale liiska cabbirka ee dhinaca, ama qor kuwa kale, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;-8&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E800\u003C/code\u003E. Liiska wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa qoysaska albaabada moodelkan (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETilmaan darbi. Astaamaha albaabka ayaa raacaya go&#039;aaga darbiga, masaafada geeska kasta ee wajiga darbiga ayaa muuqata naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlbaabku wuxuu u furmaa dhinaca darbiga uu go&#039;aanku ku sugan yahay. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u dhigto xidhashada dhinaca kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji. Albaabku waa la dhigay, qalabkuna wuu sii shaqeeyaa dhigista xigta. Tilmaan dhexda darbi, albaabku wuu isagu dhexda ka dhigaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u dhigto masaafo sax ah, tilmaan darbiga meesha geesta aad ka cabbirayso, qor masaafada (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E600\u003C/code\u003E) kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Masaafadu waxay ka bilaabmaysaa dhinaca darbiga ee dhow ilaa geeska albaabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-daaqad\"\u003EGeli daaqad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaaqad\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca: \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad go&#039;an\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad dhinac-hung keliya\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad labo dhinac-hung\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad casement\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad jiid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAwning\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad sawir\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETransom\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E (dhererka dhinaca hoose ee daaqadda ee ka sarreeya dabaqa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETilmaan darbi oo guji, ama qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sida albaabada. Daaqaddu waxay ku taalaa dibadda darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-rog-tirtir\"\u003EGuuri, rog, tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E uu shidan yahay, jiid albaab ama daaqad darbigiisa. Ku jiid darbi kale si aad halkaas ugu guurto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa albaabada iyo daaqadaha la doortay; darbigu wuu xidhmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuurinta ama tirtirida darbiga waxa ku jira ayaa guurta ama la tirtiraa. Marka bilowga darbi uu guuro khadkiisa dhinaca, albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa waxay hayaan meeshoodii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waxay soo celinayaan ama dib u soo celinayaan dhigista kasta, guurinta ama tirtirida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-diido\"\u003EWaxa la diido\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa gasho darbigaas.\u003C/strong\u003E Albaabka ama daaqadda ayaa ballaca ka weyn darbiga, ama waxay ka soo baxaysaa geeskiisa. Isku day ballac gaaban ama darbi dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa ka dheer tahay darbiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Sill-ka oo lagu daray dhererka ayaa ka sarreeya sare darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-kaydiyaa\"\u003EWaxa la kaydiyaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlbaab kasta ama daaqad kasta waa albaab ama daaqad IFC leh cabbirkeeda, hawlgalkeeda (tusaale ahaan dhinaca bidix ee dhinac-fur), nooca cabbirkeeda (nooc kasta oo qoyskiisa cabbirkeeda), \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WindowCommon\u003C/code\u003E iyo aasaaska tirooyinka, oo buuxinaya furitaanka IFC ee darbigiisa. Aagga darbiga dhinaca net-ka iyo mugga ayaa ka tagaya furitaanka. Barnaamijyada kale ee BIM way furaan sida albaab darbi ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda albaabada waxay muujisaa furan 90° oo leh furitaankooda, albaabada jiidka sida laba panel, albaabada dhex-galka sida dhex darbiga, albaabada garaashka sida xarriiq jaban oo sare, iyo daaqadaha leh foorayga iyo xarriiqyada isbiirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBallaca waa ballaca guud ee foorayga; albaabka waa ballaca ka dhimma laba jambs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka albaabada iyo daaqadaha la sawiray weli lama dhisin: samee mid kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daaqadda-bixitaanka-bir-bisaadka-iyo-well-ka\"\u003EDaaqadda bixitaanka bir-bisaadka iyo well-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBixitaanka bir-bisaadka oo leh well\u003C/strong\u003E nooca daaqadda liiska. Waxay ka bilaabataa daaqad casement oo 36 × 48 inch ah oo sill-kiisu 36 inch ka sarreeya dabaqa. Well-ku wuxuu ku yaalaa dibadda darbiga, oo leh ugu yaraan 48 inch ballac furan, 36 inch dhex-socod, iyo hoose oo 6 inch ka hooseeya sill-ka. Waxay u muuqataa xarriiqyo jaban naqshadda iyo sadex dhinac oo furan madax-la&#039;aan 3D. Well-ku waa qayb ka mid ah jidhka IFC ee daaqadda, sidaas darteed kaydinta, guurinta, cabbir-beddelka ama tirtirida daaqadda ayaa isaga la socda. Cabbir-beddelku wuxuu hayaa ugu yaraan 6 inch dhinac kasta oo jamb ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxyaabahan waa dejin naqshadeed, ma aha shahaado in ay buuxiyaan sharciga bixitaanka. Hubi gaar ahaan furitaanka dhabta ah ee soo saaraha, shuruudaha maxalliga ah, heerka dhulka, biyo-mareenka iyo sullan kasta oo loo baahan yahay. Qoto dheerida iyo dhererka well-ka waa cabbirro la dejiyay; ma raacaan dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Geli albaabada iyo daaqadaha darbiyada aad sawiray (Sawir darbiyada). Tilmaan darbi, albaabka ama daaqadda ayaa muujinaysa meesha uu ku taalo, waxa uu u furi doono, iyo masaafada ilaa geesaha kasta. Guji, furitaanka ayaa iskiis ka jarmaya darbiga naqshadda iyo 3D. Geli albaab Kadib Sawir oo shidan, guji Albaab (ama riix D). Dooro nooca: Albaab dhinac-fur ah keliya, Albaab labo dhinac-fur ah, Albaab jiid, Albaab dhex-gala, Albaab garaash, Albaab kabadh (bifold), Albaabo French, Albaab barn (darbiga) ama Albaabka soo galka ee sidelites. Cabbirkiisa caadiga ah wuxuu buuxiyaa W iyo H; dooro mid kale liiska cabbirka ee dhinaca, ama qor kuwa kale, tusaale ahaan 2'-8\" ama 800. Liiska wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa qoysaska albaabada moodelkan (eeg Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda). Tilmaan darbi. Astaamaha albaabka ayaa raacaya go'aaga darbiga, masaafada geeska kasta ee wajiga darbiga ayaa muuqata naqshadda. Albaabku wuxuu u furmaa dhinaca darbiga uu go'aanku ku sugan yahay. Riix H (ama guji Rog) si aad u dhigto xidhashada dhinaca kale. Guji. Albaabku waa la dhigay, qalabkuna wuu sii shaqeeyaa dhigista xigta. Tilmaan dhexda darbi, albaabku wuu isagu dhexda ka dhigaa. Si aad u dhigto masaafo sax ah, tilmaan darbiga meesha geesta aad ka cabbirayso, qor masaafada (tusaale ahaan 2' ama 600) kadibna riix Enter. Masaafadu waxay ka bilaabmaysaa dhinaca darbiga ee dhow ilaa geeska albaabka. Geli daaqad Guji Daaqad (ama riix N). Dooro nooca: Daaqad go'an, Daaqad dhinac-hung keliya, Daaqad labo dhinac-hung, Daaqad casement, Daaqad jiid, Awning, Daaqad sawir ama Transom, iyo W, H iyo Sill (dhererka dhinaca hoose ee daaqadda ee ka sarreeya dabaqa). Tilmaan darbi oo guji, ama qor masaafo oo riix Enter sida albaabada. Daaqaddu waxay ku taalaa dibadda darbiga. Guuri, rog, tirtir Marka Dooro uu shidan yahay, jiid albaab ama daaqad darbigiisa. Ku jiid darbi kale si aad halkaas ugu guurto. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa albaabada iyo daaqadaha la doortay; darbigu wuu xidhmaa. Guurinta ama tirtirida darbiga waxa ku jira ayaa guurta ama la tirtiraa. Marka bilowga darbi uu guuro khadkiisa dhinaca, albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa waxay hayaan meeshoodii. Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waxay soo celinayaan ama dib u soo celinayaan dhigista kasta, guurinta ama tirtirida. Waxa la diido Ma gasho darbigaas. Albaabka ama daaqadda ayaa ballaca ka weyn darbiga, ama waxay ka soo baxaysaa geeskiisa. Isku day ballac gaaban ama darbi dheer. Waa ka dheer tahay darbiga. Sill-ka oo lagu daray dhererka ayaa ka sarreeya sare darbiga. Waxa la kaydiyaa Albaab kasta ama daaqad kasta waa albaab ama daaqad IFC leh cabbirkeeda, hawlgalkeeda (tusaale ahaan dhinaca bidix ee dhinac-fur), nooca cabbirkeeda (nooc kasta oo qoyskiisa cabbirkeeda), Pset_DoorCommon ama Pset_WindowCommon iyo aasaaska tirooyinka, oo buuxinaya furitaanka IFC ee darbigiisa. Aagga darbiga dhinaca net-ka iyo mugga ayaa ka tagaya furitaanka. Barnaamijyada kale ee BIM way furaan sida albaab darbi ku jira. Waxa muhiim ah Naqshadda albaabada waxay muujisaa furan 90° oo leh furitaankooda, albaabada jiidka sida laba panel, albaabada dhex-galka sida dhex darbiga, albaabada garaashka sida xarriiq jaban oo sare, iyo daaqadaha leh foorayga iyo xarriiqyada isbiirta. Ballaca waa ballaca guud ee foorayga; albaabka waa ballaca ka dhimma laba jambs. Nuqulka albaabada iyo daaqadaha la sawiray weli lama dhisin: samee mid kale. Daaqadda bixitaanka bir-bisaadka iyo well-ka Dooro Bixitaanka bir-bisaadka oo leh well nooca daaqadda liiska. Waxay ka bilaabataa daaqad casement oo 36 × 48 inch ah oo sill-kiisu 36 inch ka sarreeya dabaqa. Well-ku wuxuu ku yaalaa dibadda darbiga, oo leh ugu yaraan 48 inch ballac furan, 36 inch dhex-socod, iyo hoose oo 6 inch ka hooseeya sill-ka. Waxay u muuqataa xarriiqyo jaban naqshadda iyo sadex dhinac oo furan madax-la'aan 3D. Well-ku waa qayb ka mid ah jidhka IFC ee daaqadda, sidaas darteed kaydinta, guurinta, cabbir-beddelka ama tirtirida daaqadda ayaa isaga la socda. Cabbir-beddelku wuxuu hayaa ugu yaraan 6 inch dhinac kasta oo jamb ah. Waxyaabahan waa dejin naqshadeed, ma aha shahaado in ay buuxiyaan sharciga bixitaanka. Hubi gaar ahaan furitaanka dhabta ah ee soo saaraha, shuruudaha maxalliga ah, heerka dhulka, biyo-mareenka iyo sullan kasta oo loo baahan yahay. Qoto dheerida iyo dhererka well-ka waa cabbirro la dejiyay; ma raacaan dhulka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"wall-assemblies","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Habaynta darbiyada iyo cabbirrada tixraaca","summary":"Nooca darbiga u samee lakab-lakab oo leh xudun cad, ilaali maktabad agab mashruuc, oo cabbir u samee dusha iyo khadadka dhexe ee ku xidhan marka darbigu isbeddelo.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["lod","heerka horumarka","lod 200","lod 300","guud","habayn darbi","nooca darbiga","lakab","xudun","dusha xudunta","khadka dhexe ee xudunta","god hawo","membreen","maktabadda agabka","agab","cabbir","cabbir tixraac","dahaar","tiir","gibsum","biroq","khadka booska","ku xidhan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-nooc-darbi","text":"Samee nooc darbi","level":2},{"id":"ku-calaamadee-nooca-heerka-horumarkiisa-lod","text":"Ku calaamadee nooca heerka horumarkiisa (LOD)","level":2},{"id":"darbiyada-guud-ee-marxaladda-sawirka","text":"Darbiyada guud ee marxaladda sawirka","level":2},{"id":"nooca-siiso-xogta-xisaabinta-qadarka","text":"Nooca siiso xogta xisaabinta qadarka","level":2},{"id":"xudunta-jiifi","text":"Xudunta jiifi","level":2},{"id":"agabka-mashruuca","text":"Agabka mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-tixraaca","text":"Cabbirrada tixraaca","level":2},{"id":"cabbir-qorshaha-oo-dhan-xeerar","text":"Cabbir qorshaha oo dhan xeerar","level":3},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee nooc darbi oo u dhigma darbiga aad dhisi doontid: dahaar dibadda, dahaar hoose, xudun tiir 5½ inji ah iyo gibsum, ama biroq, god hawo iyo darbi qaab alwaax ah. Calaamadee lakabyada ah xudunta, si cabbir ama khad goobeed u haysan karo xudunta intaas dhexdeeda finish-yadu isbeddelaan. Kadib darbiyada cabbir u samee dusheyaga iyo khadadka dhexe ee aad ula jeeddo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-nooc-darbi\"\u003ESamee nooc darbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow dhis ama fur moodel IFC oo daar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro bilow-nooc \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall type\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall assemblies…\u003C/span\u003E. Bilow-nooca wuxuu furmaa nuqul ahaan; nooca cusub magac sii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyadu waxay ka socdaan dibadda ee liiska sare ilaa gudaha ee liiska hoose. Dooro agabka lakab kasta, ku qor dhumucdiisa (cutubyada mashruuca, ama cutubyo gaar ah sida \u003Ccode\u003E12.7 mm\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), dooro shaqadiisa (dhamaystir, salka, qaab-dhismeed, dahaar kulayl, membreen) oo calaamadee lakabyada \u003Cstrong\u003EXudun\u003C/strong\u003E. Xudunta waa inay noqotaa koox joogto ah oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd layer\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa lakab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd cavity\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa god hawo oo leh hawo-marintiisa (aan la cayimin, aan hawo lahayn, hawo leh), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd membrane\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa lakab aan dhumuc magac lahayn, sida dahaarka guriga. Fallaadhaha lakabka ayey u guuraan dibadda ama gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHordhaca ayaa lakabyada u sawiraa miisaan ku haya, xudunta hoos-u-xariiqan, lambarada u dhigma safafka, oo cabbir u samaynaya lakab kasta, xudunta iyo wadarta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave type\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca cusub waxa uu ku jiraa liiska qalabka Wall iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E darbiga la doortay. Kaydinta nooca aad wax ka beddelayso waxay beddeshaa darbi kasta oo isticmaalaya; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate type\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa mid kala go&#039;an, oo keliya darbiyada aad dooratay siiya. Kaydin kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, oo ay la socdaan darbiyada uu dhaqaajiyo, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ku jira iyo cabbirrada ku xiran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod hawo ballac ayuu ku daraa. Membreen waxba ma daro: wuxuu ku sii jiraa nooca si jadwalku u helo mar dambe, mana tirsana dhumucda darbiga ama xudunta. God hawo ama membreen waligood looma tirinayo agab adag. Faylka lagu kaydiyay IFC2X3, membreenku wuxuu ku sii jiraa diiwaanka nooca laakiin laga reebaa lakabyada agabka jirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-calaamadee-nooca-heerka-horumarkiisa-lod\"\u003EKu calaamadee nooca heerka horumarkiisa (LOD)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca wuxuu sheegi karaa intee la horumariyay. Tafatiraha, \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka horumarka (LOD)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa miisaanka go&#039;an 100, 200, 300, 350, 400 iyo 500, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELama dejin\u003C/strong\u003E. Darbi guud (&quot;Wall 230 generic&quot;) waa LOD 100 ama 200; dhisme gaar ah oo leh lakabyada dhabta ah (&quot;230 biroq dhoobo, labada dhinac oo sooyo ku jirta&quot;) waa LOD 300 ama ka sarreeya. Calaamaddu waa adiga kuu dhan inaad dejiso: BimCraft ma xisaabiso, noocyada bilowgana ma leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamaddu waxay ka muuqataa magaca nooca liiska nooca ee qalabka Wall, \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E darbiga iyo liiska \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EBeddel nooca\u003C/a\u003E; warbixinta kadib beddelka waxay sheegtaa in heerku kor u kacay ama hoos u dhacay. Si aad uga aragto jadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada sida nooca\u003C/strong\u003E iyo CSV-ga, calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji LOD-ka nooca darbi kasta jadwalka darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E ee Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo: tiir dambe, LOD, ayaa lagu daraa. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC nooca ku jira (hantida \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_WallType\u003C/code\u003E, sifada \u003Ccode\u003ELOD\u003C/code\u003E, iyo diiwaanka nooca), si ay u jirto marka aad faylka mar kale furto. Calaamaddu hadda waxay ku jirtaa noocyada darbiyada oo keliya, mana ku jirto walxaha kali ah ama noocyada kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darbiyada-guud-ee-marxaladda-sawirka\"\u003EDarbiyada guud ee marxaladda sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska Nooca ee qalabka Wall wuxuu ka bilaabmaa labo darbi \u003Cstrong\u003Eguud\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbi guud 200 mm (dibadda)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbi guud 100 mm (gudaha)\u003C/strong\u003E. Mid kasta waa hal lakab oo agab guud ah, calaamaddiisuna waa LOD 200. Isticmaal markaad ogtahay meesha darbiyadu tagayaan, oo aadan weli ogeyn waxa ay ka samaysan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi nooceedu calaamadiisu tahay \u003Cstrong\u003ELOD 100\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELOD 200\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshe kasta sidii \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal qayb oo xariiqyo leh\u003C/strong\u003E heer faahfaahin kasta: lakab la&#039;aan, xariiq lakab la&#039;aan. Taasi waa run darbiyada guud iyo nooc kasta oo aad leedahay oo aad calaamaysay LOD 100 ama 200. Darbigu naftiisa waa dhamaystiran: wuxuu leeyahay dhumucdiisa, albaabyadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, qolalkiisa iyo tirada qadarradiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u horumarin, beddel nooceeda (Tafatir › Darbiyo › \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel nooca\u003C/strong\u003E, ama Nooca ee Sifooyinka). Darbiga mar dambe lama sawiro: isla darbigii ayaa qaata nooca cusub, warbixinta ayaa sheegta waxa dhaqaaqay. Nooca calaamadda LOD 300 ama ka sarreeya waxaa lagu sawiraa lakabyadiisa sida hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad darbi kasta ugu sawirto lakabyadiisa calaamadiisa kasta: Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo, ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003ESawir darbiyada nooca LOD 100 ama LOD 200 hal qayb xariiqyo leh\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlbaabyada iyo daaqadaha bilowga ahi waxay kaloo yihiin noocyo guud (cabbir iyo habka furitaanka, ma aha badeeco). Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji LOD-ka nooca darbi kasta jadwalka darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E uu shaqeynayo, jadwallada Albaabyada iyo Daaqadaha waxay u muujiyaan LOD 200.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nooca-siiso-xogta-xisaabinta-qadarka\"\u003ENooca siiso xogta xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETafatiraha nooca darbiga, \u003Cstrong\u003EXogta xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaataa waxa qiyaasuhu u baahan yahay ee darbiga, hal mar nooca: \u003Cstrong\u003Ecutubka\u003C/strong\u003E ay ka dhisan tahay (dhagax ama bilooq: magaciisa, dherer, joog iyo ballac), \u003Cstrong\u003Exidhka\u003C/strong\u003E (mortar) (magac iyo dhumucda kala-go&#039;a) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiimaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh koodka lacagta (saddex xaraf, sida USD, EUR ama ZAR) iyo waxa uu u dhigmo: mitir-dhaw ballac darbi oo net ah ama cagta, mitir ama cagta dherer darbi, ama darbi kasta. Dhammaantiis waa ikhtiyaari.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka nooca ay ku jirto. Darbi kasta oo nooca leh ayaa markaas warbixin ka bixisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada darbiga: xogta xisaabinta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa cutubka, xidhka, qiimaha iyo qiimaha oo lagu dhufto qadarka la qiyaasay, xisaabinta loo gudbiyey TakeoffCraft-ka waxay ku qaadaa walxahaas nooca darbigaas. Beddel nooca ku dhex jira, darbi kasta ayaa raacaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddex goob oo kale waa kuwo loo isticmaalo tirinta dhagaxyada ama bilooqyada iyo xidhka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQashin cutubyada, %\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu daraa tirada cutubyada. Ka tag madhan si aad u isticmaasho tirada habka cabbirka mashruuca, ama ha ahaado eber haddii habku uusan lahayn. Geli 0 si aanad u lahayn qashin, habka wax kasta oo uu leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidh dheeraad ah, %\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhagaxyada ama godadka xidhka qaata. Waxaa lagu daraa mugga xidhka. Ka tag madhan haddii aanu jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada laga dhisay cutubkan\u003C/strong\u003E: calaamadee lakab kasta oo ah geesha dhagaxa ama bilooqan. Darbi god hawo leh wuxuu leeyahay laba. Haddii midna lagu calaamadin, lakabyada xudunta ayaa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimuhu waxa kale oo uu noqon karaa mid cutub kasta oo la dalbado, mid 1000 cutub oo la dalbado ama mid m³ xidh. Meesha cutubku leeyahay dherer iyo joog, \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada darbiga: xogta xisaabinta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa cutubyada m² (ama ft²) ee geesha keliya, cutubyada la dalbado iyo mugga xidhka; qaacidooyinka waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf#bricks-blocks-and-mortar\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-hash=\"bricks-blocks-and-mortar\"\u003EDhagaxyada, bilooqyada iyo xidhka\u003C/a\u003E. Nooc waxa uu leeyahay hal cutub: labo geesood oo cutub kala duwan (geesha dibadda dhagax iyo geesha gudaha bilooq) hadda lama tirin karo hal nooc.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xudunta-jiifi\"\u003EXudunta jiifi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhig \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E darbi \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka booska\u003C/strong\u003E dusha xudunta ama khadka dhexe ee xudunta. Marka dambe finish ku darto ama dhumucdiisa kordhiso, khaddaasi waa inay sii joogaan meeshii ay joogtay, darbigu ayaa ku koraa iyada ku wareegsan; darbiyada ku kulma geeska ayaa raacaya, si geesaha toosan u xidhnaadaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agabka-mashruuca\"\u003EAgabka mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial library…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa agabka mashruuca: magaca, qaybta, dhumucda uu lakabku ku bilaabo, midabka muuqaalka, qaabka buufinta goyntiisa iyo qoraallada. Maktabadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ga mashruuca. Marka agab loo doorto lakab, lakabkaas wuxuu helaa dhumucda caadiga ah ee agabka, kaas oo markaas la beddeli karo; wax ka beddelka maktabadda mar dambe darbiyada aad horay u sawirtay cabbirkooda ma beddelo. Waxa kale oo aad agab ka samayn kartaa liiska agabka lakabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+ New material…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-tixraaca\"\u003ECabbirrada tixraaca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E: dooro u-dhig, toosan ama isku-jiid, iyo tixraac: dusha dibadda ama gudaha ee finish-ka, dusha dibadda ama gudaha ee xudunta, khadka dhexe ee darbiga ama khadka dhexe ee xudunta. Dooro darbiga koowaad, beddel tixraaca haddii aad rabto, dooro kan labaad, kadibna riix meesha xariiqda cabbirku tagayo. Labo tixraac oo ku yaal darbi keliya ayaa cabbirka wadarta ama dhumucda xudunta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimensions…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa cabbirrada muuqaalka, oo ay ku jiraan kuwii darbi lumiyay, oo leh Sifooyinka, Dib-u-xidh tixraacyada iyo Tirtir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cabbir-qorshaha-oo-dhan-xeerar\"\u003ECabbir qorshaha oo dhan xeerar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension the plan…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa dibadda qorshaha dabaqa aad eegayso: cabbirka guud dhinac kasta, safka cabbirada dhinac kasta oo dibadda ah (dhamaadka darbiyada, darbiyada ku kulma geeska, iyo albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ku jira), safafka oo lagu dhigayo si cad dhismaha ka fog. Calaamadee wixii aad rabto, akhri tirada, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the dimensions\u003C/span\u003E. Waa cabbirro tixraac caadi ah, sidaas darbiyada markay dhaqaaqaan ayay raacaan, waxaad dooran kartaa, dhaqaajin kartaa ama tirtiri kartaa midkood; dhammaan waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, mararka dambe markaad dib u socodsiiso ma abuuro mid laba ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDibadda keliya ayuu cabbiraa: qolalka dhismaha gudihiisa, darbiyada wareegsan iyo darbiyada aan u toosnayn qorshaha waxaa loo daayaa qalabyada gacanta, khadadka shabakaddana ma aha darbiyo, sidaas awgeed cabbirrada u dhexeeya shabakadaha halkan lama sameeyo. Kaaliyahaaga ku xidhan wuxuu samayn karaa isla sidaas \u003Ccode\u003Eplan_dimension\u003C/code\u003E ku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirku wuxuu ku xiran yahay darbiyada, ma aha meel shaashadda ku taal: marka darbi dhaqaaqo ama nooceeda beddelo, qiimuhu wuu raacaa. Haddii darbi la tirtiro, cabbirku wuxuu sheegaa inaanu la xallin, oo ma muujinayo tiro, ilaa aad dib u xidhto ama ka noqoto. Sanduuqa dhererka wuxuu sidoo kale aqbalaa isku-xiga qorshaha sida \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;,12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E xariiqa cabbirka meel saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada waxay u dhigmaan darbiyada BimCraft sawiray, muuqaalada qorshaha. Weli lama dhisin: cabbirrada goynta iyo dhinac-muuqaalka, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qaybaha kale, iyo lakabyada habaynta ee qorshaha iyo goynta lagu sawiray; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee nooc darbi oo u dhigma darbiga aad dhisi doontid: dahaar dibadda, dahaar hoose, xudun tiir 5½ inji ah iyo gibsum, ama biroq, god hawo iyo darbi qaab alwaax ah. Calaamadee lakabyada ah xudunta, si cabbir ama khad goobeed u haysan karo xudunta intaas dhexdeeda finish-yadu isbeddelaan. Kadib darbiyada cabbir u samee dusheyaga iyo khadadka dhexe ee aad ula jeeddo. Samee nooc darbi Bilow dhis ama fur moodel IFC oo daar Draw, kadibna dooro qalabka Wall. Dooro bilow-nooc Wall type gudahiisa oo fur Wall assemblies…. Bilow-nooca wuxuu furmaa nuqul ahaan; nooca cusub magac sii. Lakabyadu waxay ka socdaan dibadda ee liiska sare ilaa gudaha ee liiska hoose. Dooro agabka lakab kasta, ku qor dhumucdiisa (cutubyada mashruuca, ama cutubyo gaar ah sida 12.7 mm ama 1/2\"), dooro shaqadiisa (dhamaystir, salka, qaab-dhismeed, dahaar kulayl, membreen) oo calaamadee lakabyada Xudun. Xudunta waa inay noqotaa koox joogto ah oo keliya. Add layer wuxuu ku daraa lakab, Add cavity wuxuu ku daraa god hawo oo leh hawo-marintiisa (aan la cayimin, aan hawo lahayn, hawo leh), Add membrane wuxuu ku daraa lakab aan dhumuc magac lahayn, sida dahaarka guriga. Fallaadhaha lakabka ayey u guuraan dibadda ama gudaha. Hordhaca ayaa lakabyada u sawiraa miisaan ku haya, xudunta hoos-u-xariiqan, lambarada u dhigma safafka, oo cabbir u samaynaya lakab kasta, xudunta iyo wadarta. Save type. Nooca cusub waxa uu ku jiraa liiska qalabka Wall iyo Sifooyinka darbiga la doortay. Kaydinta nooca aad wax ka beddelayso waxay beddeshaa darbi kasta oo isticmaalaya; Duplicate type wuxuu sameeyaa mid kala go'an, oo keliya darbiyada aad dooratay siiya. Kaydin kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, oo ay la socdaan darbiyada uu dhaqaajiyo, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ku jira iyo cabbirrada ku xiran. God hawo ballac ayuu ku daraa. Membreen waxba ma daro: wuxuu ku sii jiraa nooca si jadwalku u helo mar dambe, mana tirsana dhumucda darbiga ama xudunta. God hawo ama membreen waligood looma tirinayo agab adag. Faylka lagu kaydiyay IFC2X3, membreenku wuxuu ku sii jiraa diiwaanka nooca laakiin laga reebaa lakabyada agabka jirka. Ku calaamadee nooca heerka horumarkiisa (LOD) Nooca wuxuu sheegi karaa intee la horumariyay. Tafatiraha, Heerka horumarka (LOD) wuxuu bixiyaa miisaanka go'an 100, 200, 300, 350, 400 iyo 500, ama Lama dejin. Darbi guud (\"Wall 230 generic\") waa LOD 100 ama 200; dhisme gaar ah oo leh lakabyada dhabta ah (\"230 biroq dhoobo, labada dhinac oo sooyo ku jirta\") waa LOD 300 ama ka sarreeya. Calaamaddu waa adiga kuu dhan inaad dejiso: BimCraft ma xisaabiso, noocyada bilowgana ma leh. Calaamaddu waxay ka muuqataa magaca nooca liiska nooca ee qalabka Wall, Sifooyinka darbiga iyo liiska Beddel nooca; warbixinta kadib beddelka waxay sheegtaa in heerku kor u kacay ama hoos u dhacay. Si aad uga aragto jadwalka Darbiyada sida nooca iyo CSV-ga, calaamadee Muuji LOD-ka nooca darbi kasta jadwalka darbiga ee Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo: tiir dambe, LOD, ayaa lagu daraa. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC nooca ku jira (hantida CadCraft_WallType, sifada LOD, iyo diiwaanka nooca), si ay u jirto marka aad faylka mar kale furto. Calaamaddu hadda waxay ku jirtaa noocyada darbiyada oo keliya, mana ku jirto walxaha kali ah ama noocyada kale. Darbiyada guud ee marxaladda sawirka Liiska Nooca ee qalabka Wall wuxuu ka bilaabmaa labo darbi guud: Darbi guud 200 mm (dibadda) iyo Darbi guud 100 mm (gudaha). Mid kasta waa hal lakab oo agab guud ah, calaamaddiisuna waa LOD 200. Isticmaal markaad ogtahay meesha darbiyadu tagayaan, oo aadan weli ogeyn waxa ay ka samaysan yihiin. Darbi nooceedu calaamadiisu tahay LOD 100 ama LOD 200 waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshe kasta sidii hal qayb oo xariiqyo leh heer faahfaahin kasta: lakab la'aan, xariiq lakab la'aan. Taasi waa run darbiyada guud iyo nooc kasta oo aad leedahay oo aad calaamaysay LOD 100 ama 200. Darbigu naftiisa waa dhamaystiran: wuxuu leeyahay dhumucdiisa, albaabyadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, qolalkiisa iyo tirada qadarradiisa. Si aad u horumarin, beddel nooceeda (Tafatir › Darbiyo › Beddel nooca, ama Nooca ee Sifooyinka). Darbiga mar dambe lama sawiro: isla darbigii ayaa qaata nooca cusub, warbixinta ayaa sheegta waxa dhaqaaqay. Nooca calaamadda LOD 300 ama ka sarreeya waxaa lagu sawiraa lakabyadiisa sida hore. Si aad darbi kasta ugu sawirto lakabyadiisa calaamadiisa kasta: Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo, ka saar Sawir darbiyada nooca LOD 100 ama LOD 200 hal qayb xariiqyo leh. Albaabyada iyo daaqadaha bilowga ahi waxay kaloo yihiin noocyo guud (cabbir iyo habka furitaanka, ma aha badeeco). Marka Muuji LOD-ka nooca darbi kasta jadwalka darbiga uu shaqeynayo, jadwallada Albaabyada iyo Daaqadaha waxay u muujiyaan LOD 200. Nooca siiso xogta xisaabinta qadarka Tafatiraha nooca darbiga, Xogta xisaabinta qadarka wuxuu qaataa waxa qiyaasuhu u baahan yahay ee darbiga, hal mar nooca: cutubka ay ka dhisan tahay (dhagax ama bilooq: magaciisa, dherer, joog iyo ballac), xidhka (mortar) (magac iyo dhumucda kala-go'a) iyo qiimaha oo leh koodka lacagta (saddex xaraf, sida USD, EUR ama ZAR) iyo waxa uu u dhigmo: mitir-dhaw ballac darbi oo net ah ama cagta, mitir ama cagta dherer darbi, ama darbi kasta. Dhammaantiis waa ikhtiyaari. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka nooca ay ku jirto. Darbi kasta oo nooca leh ayaa markaas warbixin ka bixisa: Schedules › Noocyada darbiga: xogta xisaabinta wuxuu liistaa cutubka, xidhka, qiimaha iyo qiimaha oo lagu dhufto qadarka la qiyaasay, xisaabinta loo gudbiyey TakeoffCraft-ka waxay ku qaadaa walxahaas nooca darbigaas. Beddel nooca ku dhex jira, darbi kasta ayaa raacaya. Saddex goob oo kale waa kuwo loo isticmaalo tirinta dhagaxyada ama bilooqyada iyo xidhka: Qashin cutubyada, % waxaa lagu daraa tirada cutubyada. Ka tag madhan si aad u isticmaasho tirada habka cabbirka mashruuca, ama ha ahaado eber haddii habku uusan lahayn. Geli 0 si aanad u lahayn qashin, habka wax kasta oo uu leeyahay. Xidh dheeraad ah, % waa dhagaxyada ama godadka xidhka qaata. Waxaa lagu daraa mugga xidhka. Ka tag madhan haddii aanu jirin. Lakabyada laga dhisay cutubkan: calaamadee lakab kasta oo ah geesha dhagaxa ama bilooqan. Darbi god hawo leh wuxuu leeyahay laba. Haddii midna lagu calaamadin, lakabyada xudunta ayaa la tiriyaa. Qiimuhu waxa kale oo uu noqon karaa mid cutub kasta oo la dalbado, mid 1000 cutub oo la dalbado ama mid m³ xidh. Meesha cutubku leeyahay dherer iyo joog, Noocyada darbiga: xogta xisaabinta wuxuu muujinayaa cutubyada m² (ama ft²) ee geesha keliya, cutubyada la dalbado iyo mugga xidhka; qaacidooyinka waxay ku jiraan Dhagaxyada, bilooqyada iyo xidhka. Nooc waxa uu leeyahay hal cutub: labo geesood oo cutub kala duwan (geesha dibadda dhagax iyo geesha gudaha bilooq) hadda lama tirin karo hal nooc. Xudunta jiifi Ku dhig Sifooyinka darbi Khadka booska dusha xudunta ama khadka dhexe ee xudunta. Marka dambe finish ku darto ama dhumucdiisa kordhiso, khaddaasi waa inay sii joogaan meeshii ay joogtay, darbigu ayaa ku koraa iyada ku wareegsan; darbiyada ku kulma geeska ayaa raacaya, si geesaha toosan u xidhnaadaan. Agabka mashruuca Material library… wuxuu liistaa agabka mashruuca: magaca, qaybta, dhumucda uu lakabku ku bilaabo, midabka muuqaalka, qaabka buufinta goyntiisa iyo qoraallada. Maktabadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ga mashruuca. Marka agab loo doorto lakab, lakabkaas wuxuu helaa dhumucda caadiga ah ee agabka, kaas oo markaas la beddeli karo; wax ka beddelka maktabadda mar dambe darbiyada aad horay u sawirtay cabbirkooda ma beddelo. Waxa kale oo aad agab ka samayn kartaa liiska agabka lakabka + New material…. Cabbirrada tixraaca Annotate › Reference dimension: dooro u-dhig, toosan ama isku-jiid, iyo tixraac: dusha dibadda ama gudaha ee finish-ka, dusha dibadda ama gudaha ee xudunta, khadka dhexe ee darbiga ama khadka dhexe ee xudunta. Dooro darbiga koowaad, beddel tixraaca haddii aad rabto, dooro kan labaad, kadibna riix meesha xariiqda cabbirku tagayo. Labo tixraac oo ku yaal darbi keliya ayaa cabbirka wadarta ama dhumucda xudunta. Reference dimensions… wuxuu liistaa cabbirrada muuqaalka, oo ay ku jiraan kuwii darbi lumiyay, oo leh Sifooyinka, Dib-u-xidh tixraacyada iyo Tirtir. Cabbir qorshaha oo dhan xeerar Annotate › Dimension the plan… wuxuu cabbiraa dibadda qorshaha dabaqa aad eegayso: cabbirka guud dhinac kasta, safka cabbirada dhinac kasta oo dibadda ah (dhamaadka darbiyada, darbiyada ku kulma geeska, iyo albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ku jira), safafka oo lagu dhigayo si cad dhismaha ka fog. Calaamadee wixii aad rabto, akhri tirada, kadibna Add the dimensions. Waa cabbirro tixraac caadi ah, sidaas darbiyada markay dhaqaaqaan ayay raacaan, waxaad dooran kartaa, dhaqaajin kartaa ama tirtiri kartaa midkood; dhammaan waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, mararka dambe markaad dib u socodsiiso ma abuuro mid laba ah. Dibadda keliya ayuu cabbiraa: qolalka dhismaha gudihiisa, darbiyada wareegsan iyo darbiyada aan u toosnayn qorshaha waxaa loo daayaa qalabyada gacanta, khadadka shabakaddana ma aha darbiyo, sidaas awgeed cabbirrada u dhexeeya shabakadaha halkan lama sameeyo. Kaaliyahaaga ku xidhan wuxuu samayn karaa isla sidaas plan_dimension ku. Cabbirku wuxuu ku xiran yahay darbiyada, ma aha meel shaashadda ku taal: marka darbi dhaqaaqo ama nooceeda beddelo, qiimuhu wuu raacaa. Haddii darbi la tirtiro, cabbirku wuxuu sheegaa inaanu la xallin, oo ma muujinayo tiro, ilaa aad dib u xidhto ama ka noqoto. Sanduuqa dhererka wuxuu sidoo kale aqbalaa isku-xiga qorshaha sida 10',12' xariiqa cabbirka meel saxda ah. Cabbirrada waxay u dhigmaan darbiyada BimCraft sawiray, muuqaalada qorshaha. Weli lama dhisin: cabbirrada goynta iyo dhinac-muuqaalka, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qaybaha kale, iyo lakabyada habaynta ee qorshaha iyo goynta lagu sawiray; eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin. Eeg sidoo kale Sawir darbiyada, Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad, Sifooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"wall-tools","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qaabka darbiyada, kala-jarka, kala-fogaanka, ballacmaadka iyo xidhka","summary":"Darbiyada u samee sida laydh, poligon, qaansoo, khadad la doortay ama goob ku wareegsan; kala-jar, qayb ka saar, kala-fogaan, ballacmaad sanduuq, toosi iyo xidh midba kan kale, dimension ama khadka shabakadda. Isbeddel kasta darbiyada wuu isku xidhaa oo waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah.","section":"tasks","order":17,"keywords":["beddel nooca","bedel nooca","nooca isbeddel","dib-u-dhig nooca","waxa dhaqaaqay","lod","heerka horumarka","nooca isku xidhka","miter","butt","geesood","xidhiidhka darbiyada","xiga","ku wareeg","joogso xidhiidh","ogolow xidhiidh","mudnaanta lakabka","xudun","mudnaan","isku-dhac","laydh","laydh-xagal","poligon","dhex-ku-qoran","qaansoo","dhexe","tangent arc","khadad","tab","raad","dhibic","qalin","sihir","kala-jar","kala-jar isgaar","isgaar","tirtir qayb","dib-u-xidh","kala-fogaan","koobiyee","ballacmaad sanduuq","ballacmaad","toosi","xidh","qufulka","xayeysiin","dimension","xidh cabbir","khadka shabakadda","dhaqaaji khadka shabakadda","meel-ku-dhigid","ka-fogaan xidh","xidhiidh-ka-baxay","ka-bilow","cabbir-ka-bilow","khadka dhexe","wajiga gudaha","wajiga dibadda","ka-go'"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-laydh-poligon-ama-qaansoo","text":"Samee laydh, poligon ama qaansoo","level":2},{"id":"darbiyo-khadad-hore-leh","text":"Darbiyo khadad hore leh","level":2},{"id":"dejiso-ka-hor-sawirka-ka-fogaan-iyo-xidhiidh","text":"Dejiso ka hor sawirka: ka-fogaan iyo xidhiidh","level":2},{"id":"kala-jar-tirtir-qayb-dib-u-xidh","text":"Kala-jar, tirtir qayb, dib-u-xidh","level":2},{"id":"nooca-isku-xidhka-ogoow-xidhiidh-mudnaanta-lakabka","text":"Nooca isku xidhka, Ogoow xidhiidh, mudnaanta lakabka","level":2},{"id":"beddel-nooca-darbiyo-badan","text":"Beddel nooca darbiyo badan","level":2},{"id":"kala-fogaanka-iyo-ballacmaadka-sanduuqa","text":"Kala-fogaanka iyo ballacmaadka sanduuqa","level":2},{"id":"cabbir-wax-ka-beddel-oo-xidh","text":"Cabbir wax ka beddel oo xidh","level":2},{"id":"toosi-iyo-xidh","text":"Toosi iyo xidh","level":2},{"id":"darbiyada-ku-xidh-khadadka-shabakadda","text":"Darbiyada ku xidh khadadka shabakadda","level":2},{"id":"dherer-dhinacyada-haya-iyo-waxa-uu-cabbiro","text":"Dherer: dhinacyada haya iyo waxa uu cabbiro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada samee oo beddel iyada oo la isticmaalayo cuntooyinka qalabka darbiga. Mid kastaa wuxuu ku dhammaadaa sida marka darbi laga sawiro geesahooda: geesaha ayaa iskood isku xidhma, xidhiidhyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, isbeddelka oo dhan waa hal tallaabo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ka noqodi karo. Darbiyadu aqoonsigooda ayey hayaan: darbi aad kala jartay, kala-fogeeyay ama ballacmaysay wuxuu weli yahay isla darbigii, albaabyadiisa, daaqadihiisa iyo cabbirradiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-laydh-poligon-ama-qaansoo\"\u003ESamee laydh, poligon ama qaansoo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E la daaray, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShapes\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Sawir (ama dooro qaab liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab\u003C/strong\u003E safka Darbiga). Safka Darbiga wuxuu muujinayaa nooca darbiga, tixraaca naqshadda, dhinaca dibadda iyo sare, sida qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E. Kadibna riix, ama qor meelaha (x,y · @dx,dy · @dhererka&lt;xagal · dherer ku jira hagaha):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaydh\u003C/strong\u003E: labo geesood oo ka soo horjeeda. Afar darbi, afar xidhiidh geesood, hal tallaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaydh-xagal\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha ugu horeysa ee jiifka ka bilaabato iyo dhamaadkiisa (taas ayaa u dhigta jeexjeexkiisa iyo dherkiisa), kadibna riix sadexaad si aad u samayso dhinaca kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPoligon\u003C/strong\u003E: bartamaha, kadibna geesood (\u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-ku-qoran\u003C/strong\u003E) ama bartamaha dhinac (\u003Cstrong\u003EKu-wareegsan\u003C/strong\u003E). Marka hore \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/strong\u003E (3 ilaa 64) dhig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaansoo, bartamaha\u003C/strong\u003E: bartamaha, bilowga (taas ayaa dhex-ka dhigta), dhamaadka. \u003Cstrong\u003EJihada wareegga\u003C/strong\u003E: kan ugu gaaban, xagal-saacadda ka soo horjeeda ama xagal-saacadda. Jid oo saddex meelood meel ah wareeg waxaa loo sawiraa labo darbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaansoo lamaanaha\u003C/strong\u003E: riix dhamaadka darbi, kadibna meesha qaansoo dhamaanayso. Qaansooga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhamaadka darbiga isagoo ku sii socda jihada darbiga laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab xidhan wuxuu helaa dibadda u jeedda dibadda. Marka lagu sawiro \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E, wajiga aad riixdo ayaa ah kan ku sii haya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darbiyo-khadad-hore-leh\"\u003EDarbiyo khadad hore leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro khadad\u003C/strong\u003E: riix khad darbi ayaa ku yaal. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad riixayso) si aad u qaadatid silsiladda khadadka oo dhan ee isku xidhan. Khadadku waa khadadka naqshadda muuqaalkan, tixraaca raadka iyo khadadka shabakadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaad qaab-dibadeed\u003C/strong\u003E: riix gudaha goob ay xidhaan khadadkaas ama darbiyada. Darbiyadu waxay ku wareegi doonaan goobta ugu yar ee ku wareegsan riixitaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejiso-ka-hor-sawirka-ka-fogaan-iyo-xidhiidh\"\u003EDejiso ka hor sawirka: ka-fogaan iyo xidhiidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka Darbiga wuxuu leeyahay laba goob oo kale, oo loo isticmaalo qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E iyo qaababka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa-fogaan\u003C/strong\u003E: darbiyada waxaa lagu sawiraa masaafadan khadka aad riixdo: + dhinaca bidix, − dhinaca midig, sida aad u sawirayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E: ka saar xulashada si aad u sawirto darbiyo madax-bannaan. Geesahooda waxay helaan \u003Cstrong\u003EOgoow xidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E oo ay joogaan meel kasta oo ay tagaan, ilaa aad mar kale riixdo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel darbi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-jar-tirtir-qayb-dib-u-xidh\"\u003EKala-jar, tirtir qayb, dib-u-xidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Edit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-jar\u003C/strong\u003E: riix darbi meesha laga jarayo, ama qor masaafada bilowgiisa. Darbi kale oo isgaaraya dhinaca, goynta ayaa ku dhufanaysa meesha ay kulmaan. Labada qeyb waxay leeyihiin isla nooca oo waxay ku sii xidhan yihiin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad. \u003Cstrong\u003EGaap\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka tagaa meel bannaan oo dherkaas ah oo dhexda goynta ku taal. \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha xor\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu geesaha goynta siiyaa Ogoow xidhiidh halkii (Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo › \u003Cstrong\u003EMarka darbi la kala jaro\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa midka laga bilaabo). Albaab ama daaqad waxay raacaan qaybta ay ku taal; goyn ka dhex-gudubta waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir qayb\u003C/strong\u003E: riix meesha qaybtu ka bilaabato iyo meesha ay ku dhamaanayso. Albaabka qaybta ku jira ayaa la tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-xidh\u003C/strong\u003E: riix labada qeybood ee hal darbi (toos ahaan, isla nooca). Waxay noqonayaan hal darbi mar kale, midka hore ee aad riixday, albaabyada labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nooca-isku-xidhka-ogoow-xidhiidh-mudnaanta-lakabka\"\u003ENooca isku xidhka, Ogoow xidhiidh, mudnaanta lakabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Edit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca isku xidhka\u003C/strong\u003E: riix geeska labo darbi toosan ay ku dhammaanayaan. Riix kasta wuxuu u gudbaa nooca xiga: \u003Cstrong\u003EMiter\u003C/strong\u003E (labada dhamaad oo la jaray xariiqa laga bilaabo geeska gudaha ilaa geeska dibadda, taas oo geesaha oo dhan ay ka bilaabmaan), \u003Cstrong\u003EButt\u003C/strong\u003E (darbi hal mar dhex maraa ilaa wajiga dibadda ee darbiga kale, kaas oo ku joogsada dhinaceeda) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESquare off\u003C/strong\u003E (sida butt, iyo darbiga dhex maraa dhamaadkiisu toosan yahay; xagal sax ah wuxuu u eeg yahay butt). \u003Cstrong\u003EXiga\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ayaa ka dhigaya darbiga kale kan dhex maraa. Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E ee safka wuxuu muujinayaa geeska aad ugu dambeyntii riixday. Isla labada doorasho waxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E darbi keliya: \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca isku xidhka bilowga / dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-maraa\u003C/strong\u003E. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E. Qorshaha, jidhka 3D, qolalka iyo cabbirrada ayaa raacaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeel T ah darbiga dhinaceeda la taabanayo mar kasta wuu dhex maraa. Darbiyo isgoyaan, riix (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIska-soco meesha ay isgoyaan\u003C/strong\u003E ee Sifooyinka) wuxuu sheegaa kateen ah labada midkood; taasna wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa lakabyada darbiga kateenka ah ee lagu sawiro isgoyaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENooca wuxuu u jiraa isku xidhka: wuu sii jiraa marka darbiyadu dhaqaajiyaan, wuxuuna baxaa kaliya marka xidhiidhku baxo (darbiga la tirtiro, dhamaadkaas loo kala jaro, ama dhamaadka loo siiyo Ogoow xidhiidh). Geesaha darbi wareegsan ama meelaha saddex darbi ama ka badan isku kulmaan, waxay hayaan miter. Geeska ka adag ~30 darajo, ama ka dhaadheer ~150, waxay kaloo ku soo noqotaa miter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOgoow xidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E: riix meel u dhow dhamaadka darbi. Dhamaadkaas waa la furaa: ma isku xidho waxba, meeshii darbigu tago, ilaa aad mar kale riixdo. Calaamadda goobo kadib, marka qalabku shaqaynayo. Isla beddelkan waa \u003Cstrong\u003EKa xidh bilowga / Ka xidh dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E Sifooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMudnaanta lakabka\u003C/strong\u003E: meelaha darbiyada lakabyo leh ku kulmaan, lakabka xoogga badan ayaa kan liita, sidaas xudunta waxay ku xidhmaan xudunta, finish-kuna wuxuu joogsadaa lakabka xoogga badan. Lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay mudnaan 0 ilaa 999; si caadi ah waxay ka timaadaa shaqada lakabka (qaab-dhismeed 800, salka 600, kulayl 400, membreen 300, finish 200, god 100). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayer priority\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa habaynta darbiga, halkaas oo tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EMudnaanta\u003C/strong\u003E uu dejiyo lambarka lakab kasta. Lakabyada mudnaanta isku mid ahi waxay isu joogsadaan, khadkuna waxaa lagu sawiraa oo kaliya agabyo kala duwan dhexdooda. Waxaad aragtaa qorshayaasha marka faahfaahinta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EFiican\u003C/strong\u003E, geesaha, kulanka T iyo isgoyaanka labo darbi toosan. Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo › \u003Cstrong\u003ENadiifi lakabyada darbiga marka darbiyada kulmaan\u003C/strong\u003E way damisaa. Waxay beddeshaa kaliya wixii darbiyada gudaha lagu sawiro: qaabka darbiyada iyo tirinta waxay sidii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-nooca-darbiyo-badan\"\u003EBeddel nooca darbiyo badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshayaasha fudud ka gudub shaqada qorshayaasha shaqada waa beddelka nooca inta badan: darbi guud wuxuu noqdaa dhismaha gaarka ah. Waxba dib uma sawirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro darbiyada (mid, ama badan oo leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E dhex, riix \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel nooca…\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta Nooca darbiga (ama fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Edit oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap type\u003C/span\u003E, taas oo furta isla liiska). Liiska wuxuu ku furmaa Sifooyinka, qeybta darbiyada la doortay. Ma aha wada-hadal, mana qarinayo waxba: qorshaha, muuqaalka 3D iyo doorashadu way shaqeeyaan intuu furan yahay, wuxuuna raacaa darbiyada aad doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska wuxuu muujinayaa nooc darbi kasta oo dhumuc iyo calaamad LOD ah, tusaale ahaan &quot;Wall 230 generic, LOD 200&quot; iyo &quot;230 biroq dhoobo, labada dhinac oo sooyo ku jirta, LOD 300&quot;. Noocyada darbiyada la doortay hadda waa la calaamadeeyay. Ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u yareyso: magac, dhumuc, ama \u003Ccode\u003Elod 300\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix nooc. Darbiyada la doortay oo dhan waxay isbeddelaan hal tallaabo, markaas hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa beddelka oo dhan ka noqodi karo. Xidhka x wuu xiraa liiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi kasta wuxuu ilaaliyaa khadka booskiisa. Darbi khadkiisa dhexe ku yaal wuxuu u kordhaa labada dhinac; darbi khadkiisa booska uu dhinac yahay wuxuu ilaalinayaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu kordhaa dhinaca kale, darbiyada ku xidhan geeska ayaa raacaya. Darbiyada ku xidhan darbi la beddelay ayaa raacaya. Albaabyo iyo daaqado ku jiraan darbigooda oo mar kale la goyaa dhumucda cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddelka kadib liiska wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa dhaqaaqay\u003C/strong\u003E: inta darbi ee isbeddeshay iyo nooca ay u noqdeen, dhumucda iyo LOD-ka ka hor iyo kadib, darbiyada u dhaqaaqay dhinac si ay u ilaaliyaan khadkooda booska, darbiyada ku xidhan ee raacay, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha dib loo sameeyay, iyo qol kasta oo bedeshay agabkiisa oo leh agabkiisa ka hor iyo kadib. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa wax isku mid ah hal sadar. Warbixintu way sheegtaa oo keliya; waligeed beddelka ma joojiso. Dooridda nooc ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka › Nooca darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E way samaysaa isla beddelka oo siinaysa isla warbixinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba waxood ayaa joojiya beddelka, oo markaas wax kastaba lama beddelo: albaab ama daaqad aan ku habboonayn darbigeeda (darbi wuu gaabanaadaa meesha geesuhu raacayo; ka dhig albaabka mid ballaca yar ama u guur geeska ka hor); iyo xidhka beddelku jebiyo (darbi lagu xidhay khadka shabakadda khadka dhexe ee darbiga iyo khadka booska oo wajiga ah; ka fur ama dib u celi khadka booska khadka dhexe).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka AI-ga ee ku xidhan BimCraft wuxuu samayn karaa isla beddelka (qalabyada \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_types_list\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_swap_type\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuuna helaa isla warbixinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda LOD-ka nooca waxaa lagu dejiyaa tafatiraha habaynta darbiga: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EHabaynta darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-fogaanka-iyo-ballacmaadka-sanduuqa\"\u003EKala-fogaanka iyo ballacmaadka sanduuqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-fogaan\u003C/strong\u003E: riix darbi, kadibna dhinaca si loo guuriyo, ama qor masaafada. Darbigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman ah iyo darbiyada ku xidhan ayaa ballacmaadaa. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/strong\u003E koobi isbarbar ah (oo aan ku xidhnayn asalka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBallacmaadka sanduuqa\u003C/strong\u003E: riix labo geesood oo sanduuq ah, kadibna barta laga guurayo iyo barta loo guurayo. Dhamaadka darbi kasta oo sanduuqa gudihiisa ku jira ayaa dhaqaaqa; darbi gudaha sanduuqa oo dhan wuu dhaqaaqaa, darbiyada ku dhegaya ayaa iyaguna yimaadaan; darbiyada ku gudbaya sanduuqa waa la ballacmaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir-wax-ka-beddel-oo-xidh\"\u003ECabbir wax ka beddel oo xidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro cabbir tixraac (Annotate › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReference dimension\u003C/span\u003E) oo qor qiimihiisa \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: darbiga tixraaca labaad wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, tixraaca koowaad wuu joogaa, darbiyada ku xidhnaanina way raacaan. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EXidh cabbirkan\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u ilaaliso qiimaha: marka darbi mar dambe dhaqaaqo, kan kale ayaa raacaya. Qiime xidhan lama qori karo ilaa aad ka saarto calaamadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"toosi-iyo-xidh\"\u003EToosi iyo xidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToosi iyo xidh\u003C/strong\u003E: riix wajiga darbi (ama khadka dhexe, bartamaha darbiga ku dhow) ama khadka shabakadda, kadibna wajiga darbiga ee la keeni doono khadkaas. Darbigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EXidh\u003C/strong\u003E marka hore si aad u ilaaliso toosnaanta: qufulka ayaa qorshaha ka muuqda, marka darbi mid dhaqaaqo kan kale ayaa raacaya. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E darbi wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EXidhayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E, mid kastaa leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFur\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darbiyada-ku-xidh-khadadka-shabakadda\"\u003EDarbiyada ku xidh khadadka shabakadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro darbi ku socda khad shabakadda, ama kaas oo dhamaadkiisu ku yaal, kadibna dooro khadka shabakadda \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh shabakadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Kadibna dooro khadka shabakadda qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E oo qor masaafada \u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri\u003C/strong\u003E: khadku wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, darbiyada ku xidhan ayaa raacaan, darbiyada ku xidhan ee isku xidhan ayaa raacaan, hal tallaabo. Darbi ku xidhan khadka shabakadda ma dhaqaaqi karo laftiisa (dhaqaaji khadka, ama fur darbiga); khad shabakadeed oo la rogay oo darbi xidhan uusan ku sii taagnaan karin xagal-qumman waa la diidaa. Magac u beddelka khadka wuxuu ilaaliyaa xidhka; tirtiridiisa ayaa xidhka ka saaraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dherer-dhinacyada-haya-iyo-waxa-uu-cabbiro\"\u003EDherer: dhinacyada haya iyo waxa uu cabbiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo\u003C/strong\u003E (Sifooyinka darbi keliya): \u003Cstrong\u003EBilowgu wuu hayaa\u003C/strong\u003E (dhamaadku wuu dhaqaaqaa), \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaadku wuu hayaa\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowgu wuu dhaqaaqaa) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBartamuhu wuu hayaa\u003C/strong\u003E (labada dhamaad oo nus ayay dhaqaaqaan). Intaad qorayso Dhererka, qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadeeyaa barta hayta. Darbiga ku xidhan dhamaadka dhaqaaqa wuu dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, oo wuu ilaaliyaa xagalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa cabbir\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca dhexe ee Cabbirrada qorshaha, Sifooyinka, iyo Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo): khadka dhexe, wajiga gudaha ama wajiga dibadda. Goobta Dherer iyo cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha ayaa isku mid akhriyaa, sidaas awgeed way isku waafaqaan. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa khadka dhexe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad darbi uga dhaqaajiso xidhiidhyadiisa (way jabaan, darbigu wuu sii haynayaa aqoonsigiisa), ku hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad jiidayso giraangiraha dhexe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababkan waa kuwa qalabka darbiga (bogagga 4 ilaa 9). Nooca isku xidhka iyo mudnaanta lakabka waxay u dhisan yihiin darbiyada toosan; mudnaanta lakabka waxay ku muuqataa qorshaha oo keliya (ma aha qaybaha, goynta, ama 3D, halkaas oo darbigu yahay hal jidh), ma aha dhibcaha saddex darbi ama ka badan, membreenadna lama qaado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENooca isku xidhka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa diiwaankiisa faylka IFC (magaca \u003Ccode\u003EIfcRelConnectsPathElements\u003C/code\u003E, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft join L butt 1\u003C/code\u003E), sidaas awgeed barnaamijyada kale ayay akhrin karaan isku xidhka, faylka hore ayaa miter ku furmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhayaasha iyo isku xidhka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC (xidhayaasha sidii \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_WallHolds\u003C/code\u003E mashruuca, isku xidhka sidii \u003Ccode\u003EIfcRelConnectsPathElements\u003C/code\u003E), sidaas awgeed way jiraan marka faylka mar kale furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada wareegsan waa la kala jari karaa, la isku xidhi karaa, qayb ka saari karaa; lama ballacmaadi ama lama xidhi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EQaabka darbi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Darbiyada samee oo beddel iyada oo la isticmaalayo cuntooyinka qalabka darbiga. Mid kastaa wuxuu ku dhammaadaa sida marka darbi laga sawiro geesahooda: geesaha ayaa iskood isku xidhma, xidhiidhyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, isbeddelka oo dhan waa hal tallaabo ku jirta Isbeddelada oo Undo ka noqodi karo. Darbiyadu aqoonsigooda ayey hayaan: darbi aad kala jartay, kala-fogeeyay ama ballacmaysay wuxuu weli yahay isla darbigii, albaabyadiisa, daaqadihiisa iyo cabbirradiisa. Samee laydh, poligon ama qaansoo Marka Draw la daaray, fur Shapes kooxda Sawir (ama dooro qaab liiska Qaab safka Darbiga). Safka Darbiga wuxuu muujinayaa nooca darbiga, tixraaca naqshadda, dhinaca dibadda iyo sare, sida qalabka Wall. Kadibna riix, ama qor meelaha (x,y · @dx,dy · @dhererka\u003Cxagal · dherer ku jira hagaha): Laydh: labo geesood oo ka soo horjeeda. Afar darbi, afar xidhiidh geesood, hal tallaabo. Laydh-xagal: meesha ugu horeysa ee jiifka ka bilaabato iyo dhamaadkiisa (taas ayaa u dhigta jeexjeexkiisa iyo dherkiisa), kadibna riix sadexaad si aad u samayso dhinaca kale. Poligon: bartamaha, kadibna geesood (Dhex-ku-qoran) ama bartamaha dhinac (Ku-wareegsan). Marka hore Dhinacyada (3 ilaa 64) dhig. Qaansoo, bartamaha: bartamaha, bilowga (taas ayaa dhex-ka dhigta), dhamaadka. Jihada wareegga: kan ugu gaaban, xagal-saacadda ka soo horjeeda ama xagal-saacadda. Jid oo saddex meelood meel ah wareeg waxaa loo sawiraa labo darbi. Qaansoo lamaanaha: riix dhamaadka darbi, kadibna meesha qaansoo dhamaanayso. Qaansooga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhamaadka darbiga isagoo ku sii socda jihada darbiga laftiisa. Qaab xidhan wuxuu helaa dibadda u jeedda dibadda. Marka lagu sawiro Wajiga dibadda ama Wajiga gudaha, wajiga aad riixdo ayaa ah kan ku sii haya. Darbiyo khadad hore leh Dooro khadad: riix khad darbi ayaa ku yaal. Riix Tab (ama hay Shift markaad riixayso) si aad u qaadatid silsiladda khadadka oo dhan ee isku xidhan. Khadadku waa khadadka naqshadda muuqaalkan, tixraaca raadka iyo khadadka shabakadda. Raad qaab-dibadeed: riix gudaha goob ay xidhaan khadadkaas ama darbiyada. Darbiyadu waxay ku wareegi doonaan goobta ugu yar ee ku wareegsan riixitaanka. Dejiso ka hor sawirka: ka-fogaan iyo xidhiidh Safka Darbiga wuxuu leeyahay laba goob oo kale, oo loo isticmaalo qalabka Wall iyo qaababka: Ka-fogaan: darbiyada waxaa lagu sawiraa masaafadan khadka aad riixdo: + dhinaca bidix, − dhinaca midig, sida aad u sawirayso. Xidhiidh: ka saar xulashada si aad u sawirto darbiyo madax-bannaan. Geesahooda waxay helaan Ogoow xidhiidh oo ay joogaan meel kasta oo ay tagaan, ilaa aad mar kale riixdo (eeg Beddel darbi). Kala-jar, tirtir qayb, dib-u-xidh Fur Walls kooxda Edit. Kala-jar: riix darbi meesha laga jarayo, ama qor masaafada bilowgiisa. Darbi kale oo isgaaraya dhinaca, goynta ayaa ku dhufanaysa meesha ay kulmaan. Labada qeyb waxay leeyihiin isla nooca oo waxay ku sii xidhan yihiin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad. Gaap wuxuu ka tagaa meel bannaan oo dherkaas ah oo dhexda goynta ku taal. Geesaha xor wuxuu geesaha goynta siiyaa Ogoow xidhiidh halkii (Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo › Marka darbi la kala jaro wuxuu go'aaminayaa midka laga bilaabo). Albaab ama daaqad waxay raacaan qaybta ay ku taal; goyn ka dhex-gudubta waa la diidaa. Tirtir qayb: riix meesha qaybtu ka bilaabato iyo meesha ay ku dhamaanayso. Albaabka qaybta ku jira ayaa la tirtiraa. Dib-u-xidh: riix labada qeybood ee hal darbi (toos ahaan, isla nooca). Waxay noqonayaan hal darbi mar kale, midka hore ee aad riixday, albaabyada labadaba. Nooca isku xidhka, Ogoow xidhiidh, mudnaanta lakabka Fur Walls kooxda Edit. Nooca isku xidhka: riix geeska labo darbi toosan ay ku dhammaanayaan. Riix kasta wuxuu u gudbaa nooca xiga: Miter (labada dhamaad oo la jaray xariiqa laga bilaabo geeska gudaha ilaa geeska dibadda, taas oo geesaha oo dhan ay ka bilaabmaan), Butt (darbi hal mar dhex maraa ilaa wajiga dibadda ee darbiga kale, kaas oo ku joogsada dhinaceeda) iyo Square off (sida butt, iyo darbiga dhex maraa dhamaadkiisu toosan yahay; xagal sax ah wuxuu u eeg yahay butt). Xiga, ama Tab, ayaa ka dhigaya darbiga kale kan dhex maraa. Liiska Nooca ee safka wuxuu muujinayaa geeska aad ugu dambeyntii riixday. Isla labada doorasho waxay ku jiraan Sifooyinka darbi keliya: Nooca isku xidhka bilowga / dhamaadka iyo Dhex-maraa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo ku jirta Isbeddelada. Qorshaha, jidhka 3D, qolalka iyo cabbirrada ayaa raacaya. Meel T ah darbiga dhinaceeda la taabanayo mar kasta wuu dhex maraa. Darbiyo isgoyaan, riix (ama Iska-soco meesha ay isgoyaan ee Sifooyinka) wuxuu sheegaa kateen ah labada midkood; taasna wuxuu go'aaminayaa lakabyada darbiga kateenka ah ee lagu sawiro isgoyaanka. Nooca wuxuu u jiraa isku xidhka: wuu sii jiraa marka darbiyadu dhaqaajiyaan, wuxuuna baxaa kaliya marka xidhiidhku baxo (darbiga la tirtiro, dhamaadkaas loo kala jaro, ama dhamaadka loo siiyo Ogoow xidhiidh). Geesaha darbi wareegsan ama meelaha saddex darbi ama ka badan isku kulmaan, waxay hayaan miter. Geeska ka adag ~30 darajo, ama ka dhaadheer ~150, waxay kaloo ku soo noqotaa miter. Ogoow xidhiidh: riix meel u dhow dhamaadka darbi. Dhamaadkaas waa la furaa: ma isku xidho waxba, meeshii darbigu tago, ilaa aad mar kale riixdo. Calaamadda goobo kadib, marka qalabku shaqaynayo. Isla beddelkan waa Ka xidh bilowga / Ka xidh dhamaadka Sifooyinka. Mudnaanta lakabka: meelaha darbiyada lakabyo leh ku kulmaan, lakabka xoogga badan ayaa kan liita, sidaas xudunta waxay ku xidhmaan xudunta, finish-kuna wuxuu joogsadaa lakabka xoogga badan. Lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay mudnaan 0 ilaa 999; si caadi ah waxay ka timaadaa shaqada lakabka (qaab-dhismeed 800, salka 600, kulayl 400, membreen 300, finish 200, god 100). Layer priority wuxuu furaa habaynta darbiga, halkaas oo tiirka Mudnaanta uu dejiyo lambarka lakab kasta. Lakabyada mudnaanta isku mid ahi waxay isu joogsadaan, khadkuna waxaa lagu sawiraa oo kaliya agabyo kala duwan dhexdooda. Waxaad aragtaa qorshayaasha marka faahfaahinta Dhexdhexaad ama Fiican, geesaha, kulanka T iyo isgoyaanka labo darbi toosan. Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo › Nadiifi lakabyada darbiga marka darbiyada kulmaan way damisaa. Waxay beddeshaa kaliya wixii darbiyada gudaha lagu sawiro: qaabka darbiyada iyo tirinta waxay sidii hore. Beddel nooca darbiyo badan Qorshayaasha fudud ka gudub shaqada qorshayaasha shaqada waa beddelka nooca inta badan: darbi guud wuxuu noqdaa dhismaha gaarka ah. Waxba dib uma sawirto. Dooro darbiyada (mid, ama badan oo leh Ctrl ama Shift). Sifooyinka dhex, riix Beddel nooca… hoosta Nooca darbiga (ama fur Walls kooxda Edit oo dooro Swap type, taas oo furta isla liiska). Liiska wuxuu ku furmaa Sifooyinka, qeybta darbiyada la doortay. Ma aha wada-hadal, mana qarinayo waxba: qorshaha, muuqaalka 3D iyo doorashadu way shaqeeyaan intuu furan yahay, wuxuuna raacaa darbiyada aad doorato. Liiska wuxuu muujinayaa nooc darbi kasta oo dhumuc iyo calaamad LOD ah, tusaale ahaan \"Wall 230 generic, LOD 200\" iyo \"230 biroq dhoobo, labada dhinac oo sooyo ku jirta, LOD 300\". Noocyada darbiyada la doortay hadda waa la calaamadeeyay. Ku qor Raadi si aad u yareyso: magac, dhumuc, ama lod 300. Riix nooc. Darbiyada la doortay oo dhan waxay isbeddelaan hal tallaabo, markaas hal Undo ayaa beddelka oo dhan ka noqodi karo. Xidhka x wuu xiraa liiska. Darbi kasta wuxuu ilaaliyaa khadka booskiisa. Darbi khadkiisa dhexe ku yaal wuxuu u kordhaa labada dhinac; darbi khadkiisa booska uu dhinac yahay wuxuu ilaalinayaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu kordhaa dhinaca kale, darbiyada ku xidhan geeska ayaa raacaya. Darbiyada ku xidhan darbi la beddelay ayaa raacaya. Albaabyo iyo daaqado ku jiraan darbigooda oo mar kale la goyaa dhumucda cusub. Beddelka kadib liiska wuxuu muujinayaa Waxa dhaqaaqay: inta darbi ee isbeddeshay iyo nooca ay u noqdeen, dhumucda iyo LOD-ka ka hor iyo kadib, darbiyada u dhaqaaqay dhinac si ay u ilaaliyaan khadkooda booska, darbiyada ku xidhan ee raacay, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha dib loo sameeyay, iyo qol kasta oo bedeshay agabkiisa oo leh agabkiisa ka hor iyo kadib. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa wax isku mid ah hal sadar. Warbixintu way sheegtaa oo keliya; waligeed beddelka ma joojiso. Dooridda nooc ee Sifooyinka › Nooca darbiga way samaysaa isla beddelka oo siinaysa isla warbixinta. Laba waxood ayaa joojiya beddelka, oo markaas wax kastaba lama beddelo: albaab ama daaqad aan ku habboonayn darbigeeda (darbi wuu gaabanaadaa meesha geesuhu raacayo; ka dhig albaabka mid ballaca yar ama u guur geeska ka hor); iyo xidhka beddelku jebiyo (darbi lagu xidhay khadka shabakadda khadka dhexe ee darbiga iyo khadka booska oo wajiga ah; ka fur ama dib u celi khadka booska khadka dhexe). Qalabka AI-ga ee ku xidhan BimCraft wuxuu samayn karaa isla beddelka (qalabyada wall_types_list iyo walls_swap_type) wuxuuna helaa isla warbixinta. Calaamadda LOD-ka nooca waxaa lagu dejiyaa tafatiraha habaynta darbiga: eeg Habaynta darbiyada. Kala-fogaanka iyo ballacmaadka sanduuqa Kala-fogaan: riix darbi, kadibna dhinaca si loo guuriyo, ama qor masaafada. Darbigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman ah iyo darbiyada ku xidhan ayaa ballacmaadaa. Calaamadee Koobiyee koobi isbarbar ah (oo aan ku xidhnayn asalka). Ballacmaadka sanduuqa: riix labo geesood oo sanduuq ah, kadibna barta laga guurayo iyo barta loo guurayo. Dhamaadka darbi kasta oo sanduuqa gudihiisa ku jira ayaa dhaqaaqa; darbi gudaha sanduuqa oo dhan wuu dhaqaaqaa, darbiyada ku dhegaya ayaa iyaguna yimaadaan; darbiyada ku gudbaya sanduuqa waa la ballacmaysaa. Cabbir wax ka beddel oo xidh Dooro cabbir tixraac (Annotate › Reference dimension) oo qor qiimihiisa Sifooyinka: darbiga tixraaca labaad wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, tixraaca koowaad wuu joogaa, darbiyada ku xidhnaanina way raacaan. Calaamadee Xidh cabbirkan si aad u ilaaliso qiimaha: marka darbi mar dambe dhaqaaqo, kan kale ayaa raacaya. Qiime xidhan lama qori karo ilaa aad ka saarto calaamadda. Toosi iyo xidh Toosi iyo xidh: riix wajiga darbi (ama khadka dhexe, bartamaha darbiga ku dhow) ama khadka shabakadda, kadibna wajiga darbiga ee la keeni doono khadkaas. Darbigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman. Calaamadee Xidh marka hore si aad u ilaaliso toosnaanta: qufulka ayaa qorshaha ka muuqda, marka darbi mid dhaqaaqo kan kale ayaa raacaya. Sifooyinka darbi wuxuu liistaa Xidhayaasha, mid kastaa leeyahay Fur. Darbiyada ku xidh khadadka shabakadda Dooro darbi ku socda khad shabakadda, ama kaas oo dhamaadkiisu ku yaal, kadibna dooro khadka shabakadda Sifooyinka › Ku xidh shabakadda. Kadibna dooro khadka shabakadda qalabka Grid oo qor masaafada Guuri: khadku wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, darbiyada ku xidhan ayaa raacaan, darbiyada ku xidhan ee isku xidhan ayaa raacaan, hal tallaabo. Darbi ku xidhan khadka shabakadda ma dhaqaaqi karo laftiisa (dhaqaaji khadka, ama fur darbiga); khad shabakadeed oo la rogay oo darbi xidhan uusan ku sii taagnaan karin xagal-qumman waa la diidaa. Magac u beddelka khadka wuxuu ilaaliyaa xidhka; tirtiridiisa ayaa xidhka ka saaraa. Dherer: dhinacyada haya iyo waxa uu cabbiro Laga bilaabo (Sifooyinka darbi keliya): Bilowgu wuu hayaa (dhamaadku wuu dhaqaaqaa), Dhamaadku wuu hayaa (bilowgu wuu dhaqaaqaa) ama Bartamuhu wuu hayaa (labada dhamaad oo nus ayay dhaqaaqaan). Intaad qorayso Dhererka, qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadeeyaa barta hayta. Darbiga ku xidhan dhamaadka dhaqaaqa wuu dhaqaaqaa xagal-qumman, oo wuu ilaaliyaa xagalkiisa. Ka cabbir (dhinaca dhexe ee Cabbirrada qorshaha, Sifooyinka, iyo Dejinta › BimCraft › Darbiyo): khadka dhexe, wajiga gudaha ama wajiga dibadda. Goobta Dherer iyo cabbirrada darbiyada qorshaha ayaa isku mid akhriyaa, sidaas awgeed way isku waafaqaan. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa khadka dhexe. Si aad darbi uga dhaqaajiso xidhiidhyadiisa (way jabaan, darbigu wuu sii haynayaa aqoonsigiisa), ku hay Alt markaad jiidayso giraangiraha dhexe. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Qaababkan waa kuwa qalabka darbiga (bogagga 4 ilaa 9). Nooca isku xidhka iyo mudnaanta lakabka waxay u dhisan yihiin darbiyada toosan; mudnaanta lakabka waxay ku muuqataa qorshaha oo keliya (ma aha qaybaha, goynta, ama 3D, halkaas oo darbigu yahay hal jidh), ma aha dhibcaha saddex darbi ama ka badan, membreenadna lama qaado. Nooca isku xidhka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa diiwaankiisa faylka IFC (magaca IfcRelConnectsPathElements, tusaale ahaan CadCraft join L butt 1), sidaas awgeed barnaamijyada kale ayay akhrin karaan isku xidhka, faylka hore ayaa miter ku furmaa. Xidhayaasha iyo isku xidhka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC (xidhayaasha sidii CadCraft_WallHolds mashruuca, isku xidhka sidii IfcRelConnectsPathElements), sidaas awgeed way jiraan marka faylka mar kale furto. Darbiyada wareegsan waa la kala jari karaa, la isku xidhi karaa, qayb ka saari karaa; lama ballacmaadi ama lama xidhi karo. Eeg sidoo kale Sawir darbiyada, Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad iyo Qaabka darbi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"change-a-wall-or-door","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad","summary":"Riix darbi, albaab ama daaqad la sawiray oo beddel nooceeda, cabbirkeeda, dherkeeda ama meeshiisa Sifooyinka, ama jiid qorshaha; isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["toosi","toos","90","geesi qumman","skew","xagal","ortho","cabbirka qolka","wajiga gudaha","wajiga dibadda","ka cabbir","masaafada guuritaanka","masaafada la qoray","khoorsan","qaanso","dherka qaanso","radius","khadka goobta","justification","beddel","wax ka beddel","sifooyin","nooca darbiga","dhumuc","dherer","ballac","offset-ka saldhiga","sare","dabaq","rog","cabbirka albaabka","cabbirka daaqadda","sill","masaafo","guuri","grip","jiid","beddel nooca","dhowr"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"beddel-darbi","text":"Beddel darbi","level":2},{"id":"jiid-darbi-qorshaha","text":"Jiid darbi qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"beddel-albaab-ama-daaqad","text":"Beddel albaab ama daaqad","level":2},{"id":"beddel-dhowr-marka","text":"Beddel dhowr marka","level":2},{"id":"wax-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato","text":"Wax wanaagsan inaad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel waxaad sawirtay: dooro darbi, albaab ama daaqad, kadibna qor tiro cusub oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ama jiid qorshaha. Qorshaha iyo aragtida 3D way raacaan, geesaha mar kale ayay isku xidhmaan, albaabada iyo daaqadahana darbiyadooda ayay ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-darbi\"\u003EBeddel darbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix darbiga qorshaha (ama aragtida 3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa sanduuq leh lambarrada darbiga. Beddel mid oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: nooc kale oo ka mid ah noocyada bilowga. Dhumucda iyo lakabyadu way isbedelaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhumuc\u003C/strong\u003E: dhumuc kasta. Nooca wuxuu hayaa lakabyadiisa kale, lakabka ugu weyn (studs ama block) ayaa farqiga qaadanaya, tusaale &quot;Exterior 2×6, 200 mm&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa cabbir\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka qolka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka akhrisaan oo ka dejiyaan. Wajiga dibadda waa waxa cabbirrada qorshuhu muujinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E: dhamaadka darbiga wuxuu u guurayaa khadkiisa. Darbiga ku xidhan dhamaadkaas wuxuu u guurayaa isaga oo ilaalinaya xagalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka qolka\u003C/strong\u003E (marka darbi isbarbar socda uu qolka ku yaal): qor cabbirka aad rabto. Darbigan wuu u guuraa xagal qumman, darbiyada isku xidhan waa la kala fidiyaa si ay u raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToosi xagal qumman\u003C/strong\u003E: qor sida uu u guuro darbiga xagaaga: tiro caadi ah wuxuu u guurinayaa dibadda, tiro minus ahna gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagal darbiga ku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E: xagalka darbiga ku xidhan bilowga. Qor 90 si aad u dejiso xagal qumman. Darbi aan wax ku xidhnayn wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDirection\u003C/strong\u003E, digrii laga bilaabo bari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosi\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu darbiyada ku xidhan kan dib ugu celiyaa xagal qumman, iyada oo raacaysa jihada ay ugu dheer tahay inta badan. Waxay shaqeysaa qolka ama qaabka oo dhan ee isku xidhan, darbi kasta oo aad doorato. Darbi ka fog xagal qumman oo ka badan 10 digrii ayaa xaaladdiisa sii haysa, sidaas darteed mid 45 digrii lagu dejiyay waa ammaan. Hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammaantood ka noqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDherka darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa dabaqa kor ku yaal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa dabaqaas; \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa Dabaqa 3\u003C/strong\u003E (iyo dabaq kasta oo ka sarreeya) wuxuu sameeyaa darbi dhex-maraya dabaqyada u dhexeeya; qoridda dherer ayaa dejinaysa intee ka hoos ama kor ka sarreeya dabaqaas ee sare dhamaadku. \u003Cstrong\u003EDherka go&#039;an\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa tirada aad qortay. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-mara\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa dabaqyada darbigu ka gudbo: waxa lagu sawiraa midab khafiif ah qorshayaashooda, qolalka halkaas waxay ku xidhmaan darbiga, albaabada iyo daaqadaha waxa lagu dhigi karaa darbiga qorshayaashaas. Waxa lagu guurayaa oo lagu beddelaa dabaqa uu ka bilaabmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilowga kor-u-dhiska\u003C/strong\u003E: intee ka sarreysa dabaqa darbigu ka bilaabmo. Dhamaadka sare wuu ku sii joogaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDibadda\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu lakabyada dibadda ku dhigaa dhinaca kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka goobta\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga bidix\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga midig\u003C/strong\u003E. Beddelkaasi waxba ma guuriyo. Dabadeed, darbigu markuu dhumuc badan yahay (nooca ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E) ama dibaddiisa la rogo, khadka goobta wuu sii joogaa oo darbigu wuxuu ku koraa ama ku rogmanayaa khadkaas. Darbi toos ah oo ku dhaca geesta wuu raacaa, sidaas darteed geesta waa la xidhaa. Khadka goobta darbiga la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha xariiq xaraf-ah. Dhowr darbi dooro si aad dhammaantood u dejiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDherka qaanso\u003C/strong\u003E (darbiyada khoorsan): inta dhexe ee ku khoorsan xariiqda toosa ah. 0 wuxuu sameeyaa toos; qiime taban wuxuu ku khoorsadaa dhinaca kale. Radius-ku wuxuu muuqdaa dhinaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedelada\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka noqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiid-darbi-qorshaha\"\u003EJiid darbi qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hal darbi la doortay, wuxuu muujiyaa saddex grip: mid dhamaad kasta oo afar-geesle ah, iyo mid goobta dhexe oo wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhamaad si darbigu u dheeraado, u gaabiyo ama u rogo. Waa la xidhaa sida qalabka Darbiga, wuxuuna ku xidhmaa xagal qumman darbiga kale ee ku xidhan dhamaadka kale markaad ku dhowdahay 3 digrii; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku hayaa tirooyinka qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada ku xidhan dhamaadka aad jiidayso waxay hayaan xagalkooda: dhamaadyadooda waxay ku jiidaan khadadkooda si ay ula kulmaan khadka darbiga cusub, sidaas darteed wax lama khaldamo. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jiid xor ah (dhamaadka darbiga ku xidhan ayaa kula socda, darbigaasna wuu rogmanayaa), ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad xidhiidhka darbigan uga jebiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid goobta dhexe si darbiga oo dhan u guuro xagal qumman, siduu kuu jiidayo ahaa. Dhamaadyadiisa ayaa ku jiidaya darbiyada ku xidhan, sidaas darteed darbiyadaas xagalkooda way hayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka aad goobta dhexe jiidayso si aad u guurto xor ah, marka aad rabto inaad xagalka jebiso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosi\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntii grip-ku la haysanayo, qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama daa): darbigu wuxuu u socdaa masaafadaas, sida aad jiidayay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa guuritaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbi qaanso ah oo la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa grips dhamaadka iyo grip wareegsan oo ku yaal dhexda qaansada. Jiid grip-ka wareegsan si aad u khoorsato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlbaabada iyo daaqadaha waxay ku sii jiraan darbiga. Darbi aad u gaaban oo aan ku haynin waa la diidaa, oo leh &quot;Lama geli karo darbigaas.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-albaab-ama-daaqad\"\u003EBeddel albaab ama daaqad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix albaabka ama daaqadda qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E (albaab ama daaqad kale oo isku nooc ah), \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESill\u003C/strong\u003E (daaqadaha), \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E (masaafada laga bilaabo dhamaad kasta oo wajiga darbiga ilaa geesteeda), \u003Cstrong\u003EDhegaha\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog\u003C/span\u003E (albaabada hal caleen iyo daaqadaha casement; albaabada sliding, pocket, barn iyo bifold waxay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003EOpens to\u003C/strong\u003E halkiisa; daaqadaha go&#039;an, la-dhigay iyo sawirka iyo albaabada laba-jibbaaran ma lahaan), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESwings to\u003C/strong\u003E (albaabada) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EFrame side\u003C/strong\u003E (daaqadaha) \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma jiid albaab ama daaqad darbigeeda, ama darbi kale: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EAlbaabada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-dhowr-marka\"\u003EBeddel dhowr marka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro darbiyo dhowr (ama albaabo dhowr, ama daaqado dhowr) adigoo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu soo bandhigayaa waxa ay wadaagaan: \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel nooca…\u003C/strong\u003E, dherka, cabbirka. Hal beddel ayaa dhammaantood dejisa, hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammaantood soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato\"\u003EWax wanaagsan inaad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka waxa lagu muujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E lagu doortay toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha barnaamijyada kale ka yimid waxay muujinayaan xogta IFC sida hore \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, iyada oo aan sanduuqan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Beddel waxaad sawirtay: dooro darbi, albaab ama daaqad, kadibna qor tiro cusub oo ku jirta Sifooyinka ama jiid qorshaha. Qorshaha iyo aragtida 3D way raacaan, geesaha mar kale ayay isku xidhmaan, albaabada iyo daaqadahana darbiyadooda ayay ku sii jiraan. Beddel darbi Daar Sawir iyo Dooro, kadibna riix darbiga qorshaha (ama aragtida 3D). Sifooyinka wuxuu muujiyaa sanduuq leh lambarrada darbiga. Beddel mid oo riix Enter: Nooca darbiga: nooc kale oo ka mid ah noocyada bilowga. Dhumucda iyo lakabyadu way isbedelaan. Dhumuc: dhumuc kasta. Nooca wuxuu hayaa lakabyadiisa kale, lakabka ugu weyn (studs ama block) ayaa farqiga qaadanaya, tusaale \"Exterior 2×6, 200 mm\". Ka cabbir: Khadka dhexe, Wajiga gudaha ama Wajiga dibadda. Dherer iyo Cabbirka qolka waxay ka akhrisaan oo ka dejiyaan. Wajiga dibadda waa waxa cabbirrada qorshuhu muujinayo. Dherer: dhamaadka darbiga wuxuu u guurayaa khadkiisa. Darbiga ku xidhan dhamaadkaas wuxuu u guurayaa isaga oo ilaalinaya xagalkiisa. Cabbirka qolka (marka darbi isbarbar socda uu qolka ku yaal): qor cabbirka aad rabto. Darbigan wuu u guuraa xagal qumman, darbiyada isku xidhan waa la kala fidiyaa si ay u raacaan. Toosi xagal qumman: qor sida uu u guuro darbiga xagaaga: tiro caadi ah wuxuu u guurinayaa dibadda, tiro minus ahna gudaha. Xagal darbiga ku xidhan: xagalka darbiga ku xidhan bilowga. Qor 90 si aad u dejiso xagal qumman. Darbi aan wax ku xidhnayn wuxuu muujiyaa Direction, digrii laga bilaabo bari. Toosi: wuxuu darbiyada ku xidhan kan dib ugu celiyaa xagal qumman, iyada oo raacaysa jihada ay ugu dheer tahay inta badan. Waxay shaqeysaa qolka ama qaabka oo dhan ee isku xidhan, darbi kasta oo aad doorato. Darbi ka fog xagal qumman oo ka badan 10 digrii ayaa xaaladdiisa sii haysa, sidaas darteed mid 45 digrii lagu dejiyay waa ammaan. Hal Ka noqo ayaa dhammaantood ka noqda. Dherka darbiga: Ilaa dabaqa kor ku yaal wuxuu raacaa dabaqaas; Ilaa Dabaqa 3 (iyo dabaq kasta oo ka sarreeya) wuxuu sameeyaa darbi dhex-maraya dabaqyada u dhexeeya; qoridda dherer ayaa dejinaysa intee ka hoos ama kor ka sarreeya dabaqaas ee sare dhamaadku. Dherka go'an wuxuu hayaa tirada aad qortay. Dhex-mara wuxuu liistaa dabaqyada darbigu ka gudbo: waxa lagu sawiraa midab khafiif ah qorshayaashooda, qolalka halkaas waxay ku xidhmaan darbiga, albaabada iyo daaqadaha waxa lagu dhigi karaa darbiga qorshayaashaas. Waxa lagu guurayaa oo lagu beddelaa dabaqa uu ka bilaabmo. Bilowga kor-u-dhiska: intee ka sarreysa dabaqa darbigu ka bilaabmo. Dhamaadka sare wuu ku sii joogaa. Dibadda: Rog wuxuu lakabyada dibadda ku dhigaa dhinaca kale. Khadka goobta: Khadka dhexe, Wajiga dibadda, Wajiga gudaha, Wajiga bidix ama Wajiga midig. Beddelkaasi waxba ma guuriyo. Dabadeed, darbigu markuu dhumuc badan yahay (nooca ama Dherer) ama dibaddiisa la rogo, khadka goobta wuu sii joogaa oo darbigu wuxuu ku koraa ama ku rogmanayaa khadkaas. Darbi toos ah oo ku dhaca geesta wuu raacaa, sidaas darteed geesta waa la xidhaa. Khadka goobta darbiga la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha xariiq xaraf-ah. Dhowr darbi dooro si aad dhammaantood u dejiso. Dherka qaanso (darbiyada khoorsan): inta dhexe ee ku khoorsan xariiqda toosa ah. 0 wuxuu sameeyaa toos; qiime taban wuxuu ku khoorsadaa dhinaca kale. Radius-ku wuxuu muuqdaa dhinaceeda. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta Isbedelada; Ka noqo ayaa ka noqda. Jiid darbi qorshaha Marka hal darbi la doortay, wuxuu muujiyaa saddex grip: mid dhamaad kasta oo afar-geesle ah, iyo mid goobta dhexe oo wareegsan. Jiid dhamaad si darbigu u dheeraado, u gaabiyo ama u rogo. Waa la xidhaa sida qalabka Darbiga, wuxuuna ku xidhmaa xagal qumman darbiga kale ee ku xidhan dhamaadka kale markaad ku dhowdahay 3 digrii; Shift wuxuu ku hayaa tirooyinka qorshaha. Darbiyada ku xidhan dhamaadka aad jiidayso waxay hayaan xagalkooda: dhamaadyadooda waxay ku jiidaan khadadkooda si ay ula kulmaan khadka darbiga cusub, sidaas darteed wax lama khaldamo. Hay Ctrl jiid xor ah (dhamaadka darbiga ku xidhan ayaa kula socda, darbigaasna wuu rogmanayaa), ama Alt si aad xidhiidhka darbigan uga jebiso. Jiid goobta dhexe si darbiga oo dhan u guuro xagal qumman, siduu kuu jiidayo ahaa. Dhamaadyadiisa ayaa ku jiidaya darbiyada ku xidhan, sidaas darteed darbiyadaas xagalkooda way hayaan. Hay Ctrl marka aad goobta dhexe jiidayso si aad u guurto xor ah, marka aad rabto inaad xagalka jebiso. Toosi ayaa soo celinaysa. Intii grip-ku la haysanayo, qor masaafo oo riix Enter (ama daa): darbigu wuxuu u socdaa masaafadaas, sida aad jiidayay. Esc wuu joojiyaa guuritaanka. Darbi qaanso ah oo la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa grips dhamaadka iyo grip wareegsan oo ku yaal dhexda qaansada. Jiid grip-ka wareegsan si aad u khoorsato. Albaabada iyo daaqadaha waxay ku sii jiraan darbiga. Darbi aad u gaaban oo aan ku haynin waa la diidaa, oo leh \"Lama geli karo darbigaas.\" Beddel albaab ama daaqad Riix albaabka ama daaqadda qorshaha. Sifooyinka: Nooca (albaab ama daaqad kale oo isku nooc ah), Ballac, Dherer, Sill (daaqadaha), Laga bilaabo bilowga iyo Laga bilaabo dhamaadka (masaafada laga bilaabo dhamaad kasta oo wajiga darbiga ilaa geesteeda), Dhegaha Rog (albaabada hal caleen iyo daaqadaha casement; albaabada sliding, pocket, barn iyo bifold waxay leeyihiin Opens to halkiisa; daaqadaha go'an, la-dhigay iyo sawirka iyo albaabada laba-jibbaaran ma lahaan), iyo Swings to (albaabada) ama Frame side (daaqadaha) Rog. Ama jiid albaab ama daaqad darbigeeda, ama darbi kale: eeg Albaabada iyo daaqadaha. Beddel dhowr marka Dooro darbiyo dhowr (ama albaabo dhowr, ama daaqado dhowr) adigoo Shift+guji ama Ctrl+guji. Sifooyinka wuxuu soo bandhigayaa waxa ay wadaagaan: Beddel nooca…, dherka, cabbirka. Hal beddel ayaa dhammaantood dejisa, hal Ka noqo ayaa dhammaantood soo celinaysa. Wax wanaagsan inaad ogaato Tirooyinka waxa lagu muujiyaa Cutubyada lagu doortay toolbar-ka. Darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha barnaamijyada kale ka yimid waxay muujinayaan xogta IFC sida hore Sifooyinka, iyada oo aan sanduuqan jirin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"classification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Koodhka kala saarista (Uniclass, OmniClass, UniFormat)","summary":"Ku dheji koodh kala saarista walx kasta iyo nooc kasta, dooro nidaamyada uu mashruucu isticmaalo, raadi miisaska Uniclass ee la socda app-ka, rar miisaska xafiiskaaga ee liisanka leh, oo muuji koodhadka jadwallada. Koodhadka waxa lagu qoraa faylka IFC si barnaamijyada kale u akhriyaan.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["kala saarista","kala saar","koodh","uniclass","omniclass","uniformat","nbs","csi","ef","ss","pr","miis","koodhka walxa","koodhka nooca","koodhka caadiga ah","IfcClassification","IfcClassificationReference","cobie","tiirka jadwalka","csv","liisan","licence"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"ku-dheji-walx-koodh","text":"Ku dheji walx koodh","level":2},{"id":"dooro-nidaamyada-mashruuca","text":"Dooro nidaamyada mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dheji koodh kala saarista derbiyada, sagxadaha, saqafyada, albaabada, daaqadaha iyo wax kasta oo moodelka ku jira, ilaa saddex nidaam oo isku dhinac ah: Uniclass, OmniClass iyo UniFormat. Kuwa kale iyo barnaamijyada kale waxay ku tiirsan yihiin koodhka, ma aha magaca, sidaas darteed koodhadka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC sida tixraacyo kala saarista oo barnaamij BIM kasta akhrin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dheji-walx-koodh\"\u003EKu dheji walx koodh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walx (ama dhowr) oo fur \u003Cstrong\u003EHanti\u003C/strong\u003E (Properties). Fur qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala saarista\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor koodhka sanduuqa nidaamkiisa oo riix Enter. Haddii liis koodh la rarayo, qor qayb koodh ama dhowr eray (&quot;curtain wall&quot;) oo dooro waxa la isku waafaqay: cinwaanka koodhka waa la buuxiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWuxuu khusayaa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa halka koodhku tagayo: \u003Cstrong\u003EWalxan\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENoociisa (walx kasta oo nooca ah)\u003C/strong\u003E. Koodh ku yaal nooca derbiga waxa akhrin doona derbi kasta oo nooca ah, kuwa aad ka dhigtid kadibna iyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koodhka ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta koodh kasta qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa halka uu ka yimid: lagu dhigay walxan, nooca ka soo galay, ama default-ka mashruuca ee fasalkiisa. Koodhka walxa laftiisa had iyo jeer ayaa ka adkaada kan nooca, kan nooca-na kan default-ka. Walxo badan oo la doortay, sanduuq ku qoran &quot;kala duwan&quot; macnaheedu waa ma wadaagaan koodh; hal koodh qorista waxay siinaysaa dhammaantood. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoodhka waa la qori karaa had iyo jeer, liis la rarayo ama uusan rarayn. Haddii uusan u eegin koodh nidaamkaas, ama uusan ku jirin liiska la rarayay, tilmaam ayaa sheegta oo koodhka waxa la hayaa sida aad qortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-nidaamyada-mashruuca\"\u003EDooro nidaamyada mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EXogta\u003C/strong\u003E (Data) bar-ka moodelka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala saarista\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-soocidda mashruuca…\u003C/span\u003E qaybta Hantida).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi nidaamyada uu mashruucani isticmaalo. Hantidu waxay tusi doontaa kuwaas oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUniclass\u003C/strong\u003E: miisaska Elements/ functions (EF), Systems (Ss) iyo Products (Pr) waxa ay la socdaan app-ka. Waa © NBS, waxaana liisan siiyay Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0, waana la gudbiyaa sidii ay ahayd. Wada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa tafatirka miis kasta iyo maalinta la akhriyay. Ma aha kuwa ugu cusub: daabacaha rubuc kasta ayaa kuwa cusub ku daabacaa boggiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOmniClass\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EUniFormat\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro miis koodh oo la socda app-ka, sababtoo ah daabacuhu ma oggolaanayo in miisaska la gudbiyo oo aan liisan lahayn. Ku qor koodh kasta, ama rar miiska xafiiskaaga ee liisanka leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog miis (CSV)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa miiska xafiiskaaga faylka CSV oo leh tiir koodh iyo tiir cinwaan (safka madaxa oo magacyadiisa Code, Number ama Identifier iyo Title, Name ama Description waa la helaa isagoo keligiis; haddii aysan jirin, laba tiir ee hore ayaa la isticmaalaa). Miiska waxa uu ku sii jiraa browser-kan, mana gudbo mashruuca. Koodhadka aad u dhigtay kuwa keliya ayaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Miis Uniclass oo cusub isla habkaas ayaa lagu rari karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii walxaha koodh caadi ah iyadoo la eegayo fasalkooda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa derbi, sagxad, saqaf, albaab, daaqad, sallaalad, jid kor, tiir, biim iyo alaab kasta koodh Uniclass caadi ah oo bilow ah oo miiska Elements/ functions ka yimid marka uusan lahayn koodh gaar ah. Walxaha aad sawirtid kadib ayaa mid ahaan doona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji koodhadka tiiro ahaan jadwallada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa tiir nidaam kasta jadwallada albaabada, daaqadaha, derbiyada nooca ahaan iyo qolalka, iyo CSV-kooda. Safka walxo badan wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;kala duwan&quot; marka koodhadkoodu kala duwan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoodhadka default-ka waa kala saarista CadCraft oo u gaar ah, ma aha tan daabacaha, mana ay khabiir ku hubin. Ku hubi heerka mashruucaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka, default-ku waa kala saarid dhab ah, oo lagu calaamadiyay magaca xiriirka &quot;CadCraft default&quot;, waana baxaa markii walxa ama nooca uu helo koodh gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoodhadka faylka IFC horey u lahaa waa la akhriyaa oo waa la muujiyaa, iyada oo aan loo eegin qoraalka barnaamijka kale ee magaca nidaamka. Koodhadka nidaamyada kale (xafiis gaar ah) waa la liistaa, oo lama taabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoodhadka waxa dib loo akhriyaa marka faylka dib loo furo, halkan ama barnaamij kale. Waxa kale oo lagu qaadaa IFC5 alpha (IFCX) export marka khiyaarka lab-ka uu shidan yahay, mid kaliya oo koodh lagu dhigay saqafka ka reebban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeli lama dhisin: geed lagu baadho miis heer-heer, koodhka heerarka iyo qolalka oo default-yada mashruuca ah, iyo hubinta koodh iyada oo la eegayo tafatirka lagu magacaabay faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Ku dheji koodh kala saarista derbiyada, sagxadaha, saqafyada, albaabada, daaqadaha iyo wax kasta oo moodelka ku jira, ilaa saddex nidaam oo isku dhinac ah: Uniclass, OmniClass iyo UniFormat. Kuwa kale iyo barnaamijyada kale waxay ku tiirsan yihiin koodhka, ma aha magaca, sidaas darteed koodhadka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC sida tixraacyo kala saarista oo barnaamij BIM kasta akhrin karo. Ku dheji walx koodh Dooro walx (ama dhowr) oo fur Hanti (Properties). Fur qaybta Kala saarista. Ku qor koodhka sanduuqa nidaamkiisa oo riix Enter. Haddii liis koodh la rarayo, qor qayb koodh ama dhowr eray (\"curtain wall\") oo dooro waxa la isku waafaqay: cinwaanka koodhka waa la buuxiyaa. Wuxuu khusayaa wuxuu sheegaa halka koodhku tagayo: Walxan, ama Noociisa (walx kasta oo nooca ah). Koodh ku yaal nooca derbiga waxa akhrin doona derbi kasta oo nooca ah, kuwa aad ka dhigtid kadibna iyo. Nadiifi wuxuu koodhka ka saaraa. Hoosta koodh kasta qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa halka uu ka yimid: lagu dhigay walxan, nooca ka soo galay, ama default-ka mashruuca ee fasalkiisa. Koodhka walxa laftiisa had iyo jeer ayaa ka adkaada kan nooca, kan nooca-na kan default-ka. Walxo badan oo la doortay, sanduuq ku qoran \"kala duwan\" macnaheedu waa ma wadaagaan koodh; hal koodh qorista waxay siinaysaa dhammaantood. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Koodhka waa la qori karaa had iyo jeer, liis la rarayo ama uusan rarayn. Haddii uusan u eegin koodh nidaamkaas, ama uusan ku jirin liiska la rarayay, tilmaam ayaa sheegta oo koodhka waxa la hayaa sida aad qortay. Dooro nidaamyada mashruuca Fur Xogta (Data) bar-ka moodelka oo dooro Kala saarista (ama Kala-soocidda mashruuca… qaybta Hantida). Calaamadi nidaamyada uu mashruucani isticmaalo. Hantidu waxay tusi doontaa kuwaas oo keliya. Uniclass: miisaska Elements/ functions (EF), Systems (Ss) iyo Products (Pr) waxa ay la socdaan app-ka. Waa © NBS, waxaana liisan siiyay Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0, waana la gudbiyaa sidii ay ahayd. Wada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa tafatirka miis kasta iyo maalinta la akhriyay. Ma aha kuwa ugu cusub: daabacaha rubuc kasta ayaa kuwa cusub ku daabacaa boggiisa. OmniClass iyo UniFormat: ma jiro miis koodh oo la socda app-ka, sababtoo ah daabacuhu ma oggolaanayo in miisaska la gudbiyo oo aan liisan lahayn. Ku qor koodh kasta, ama rar miiska xafiiskaaga ee liisanka leh. Rog miis (CSV)… wuxuu akhrinayaa miiska xafiiskaaga faylka CSV oo leh tiir koodh iyo tiir cinwaan (safka madaxa oo magacyadiisa Code, Number ama Identifier iyo Title, Name ama Description waa la helaa isagoo keligiis; haddii aysan jirin, laba tiir ee hore ayaa la isticmaalaa). Miiska waxa uu ku sii jiraa browser-kan, mana gudbo mashruuca. Koodhadka aad u dhigtay kuwa keliya ayaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Miis Uniclass oo cusub isla habkaas ayaa lagu rari karaa. Sii walxaha koodh caadi ah iyadoo la eegayo fasalkooda wuxuu siinayaa derbi, sagxad, saqaf, albaab, daaqad, sallaalad, jid kor, tiir, biim iyo alaab kasta koodh Uniclass caadi ah oo bilow ah oo miiska Elements/ functions ka yimid marka uusan lahayn koodh gaar ah. Walxaha aad sawirtid kadib ayaa mid ahaan doona. Muuji koodhadka tiiro ahaan jadwallada wuxuu ku daraa tiir nidaam kasta jadwallada albaabada, daaqadaha, derbiyada nooca ahaan iyo qolalka, iyo CSV-kooda. Safka walxo badan wuxuu muujinayaa \"kala duwan\" marka koodhadkoodu kala duwan yihiin. Wax la xiriira Koodhadka default-ka waa kala saarista CadCraft oo u gaar ah, ma aha tan daabacaha, mana ay khabiir ku hubin. Ku hubi heerka mashruucaaga. Faylka, default-ku waa kala saarid dhab ah, oo lagu calaamadiyay magaca xiriirka \"CadCraft default\", waana baxaa markii walxa ama nooca uu helo koodh gaar ah. Koodhadka faylka IFC horey u lahaa waa la akhriyaa oo waa la muujiyaa, iyada oo aan loo eegin qoraalka barnaamijka kale ee magaca nidaamka. Koodhadka nidaamyada kale (xafiis gaar ah) waa la liistaa, oo lama taabto. Koodhadka waxa dib loo akhriyaa marka faylka dib loo furo, halkan ama barnaamij kale. Waxa kale oo lagu qaadaa IFC5 alpha (IFCX) export marka khiyaarka lab-ka uu shidan yahay, mid kaliya oo koodh lagu dhigay saqafka ka reebban. Weli lama dhisin: geed lagu baadho miis heer-heer, koodhka heerarka iyo qolalka oo default-yada mashruuca ah, iyo hubinta koodh iyada oo la eegayo tafatirka lagu magacaabay faylka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"wall-shape","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qaabee darbi: ku lifaaq, profile, janjeer iyo furitaanno","summary":"Sare u lifaaq darbi saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf-hoose, siiso qaab muuqaal dhinac oo gaar ah, janjeer, ama geli furitaan aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn, Sifooyinka, goyn ama dhinac-muuqaal ama 3D; mid kastaa waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah.","section":"tasks","order":18,"keywords":["ku lifaaq","lifaaq sare","lifaaq aasaas","saqaf","sagxad","saqaf-hoose","gable","profile","wax ka beddel profile","muuqaal dhinac","tallaabo","parapet","janjeer","janjeersan","janjeer","lean","tilt","taper","janjeer labo","furitaan","furka darbiga","god","aan albaab lahayn","gacmo","dhinac-muuqaal","goyn","3D","muuqaalka dhinaca darbiga","dhex-u-gudub","qaab","koobiyee"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-aad-ka-samayn-karto","text":"Meelaha aad ka samayn karto","level":2},{"id":"lifaaqid-sare-ama-aasaas","text":"Lifaaqid sare ama aasaas","level":2},{"id":"wax-ka-beddel-profile","text":"Wax ka beddel profile","level":2},{"id":"janjeer-darbiga","text":"Janjeer darbiga","level":2},{"id":"furitaanno-aan-albaab-ama-daaqad-lahayn","text":"Furitaanno aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn","level":2},{"id":"muuqaal-dhinac-ama-goyn","text":"Muuqaal dhinac ama goyn","level":2},{"id":"qorshaha-iyo-3d","text":"Qorshaha iyo 3D","level":2},{"id":"qorshaha","text":"Qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"nuqullo","text":"Nuqullo","level":2},{"id":"faylka","text":"Faylka","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel qaabka darbi sare iyo hoosba qorshihiisa: sare wuxuu raaci karaa saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf-hoose, wuxuu lahaan karaa khadkiisa muuqaal dhinac, wuxuu janjeeri karaa, wuxuuna lahaan karaa furitaanno aan albaab ama daaqad ku jirin. Qorshaha darbiga, geeskiisa iyo khadka booskiisa way sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-aad-ka-samayn-karto\"\u003EMeelaha aad ka samayn karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E la daaray, riix hal darbi aad sawirtay. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa safafka darbiga, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka\u003C/strong\u003E, halkaas oo wax kasta lagu qoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal dhinac ama goyn\u003C/strong\u003E: qalinka mashruuca (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in this view\u003C/span\u003E) ayaa furta muuqaalka; halkaas darbi dooro oo jiid geeskiisa. Eeg &quot;Muuqaal dhinac ama goyn&quot; hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka wajiga darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix darbiga qorshaha. Waxay shaqeysaa darbi kasta, iyo darbi wareegsan (oo lagu muujiyo oo furan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha iyo 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: afarta amar ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E (kooxda Edit): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top / base\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlant\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg &quot;Qorshaha iyo 3D&quot; hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida kasta aad dooratid, isbeddelka waa isku mid: hal tallaabo oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka noqdiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada toosan iyo kuwa wareegsan labaduba waxay qaataan dhammaan qalabyada qaabka. Darbi wareegsan dhexdeeda, masaafooyinku waxay socdaan qoskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lifaaqid-sare-ama-aasaas\"\u003ELifaaqid sare ama aasaas\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaq sare\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf-hoose. Sare ee darbigu wuxuu raacaa hoosta waxa aad dooratay, toos ka sare geesta kasta ee darbiga. Saqaf dhudhun ah hoosteeda darbigu wuxuu helaa sare janjeersan, meelaha saqafku isbeddelo (kaab ama dhinaca) sare ee darbigu wuu foororshaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaq aasaas\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro sagxad ama saqaf-hoose. Aasaaska darbigu wuxuu raacaa wajiga sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeel kasta oo aan waxba ka sare (ama hoosta) ku jirin qayb darbi, qaybtaas waxay ku sii haysaa joogga darbiga naftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhiidhku wuu joogaa: beddel dhudhunta saqafka ama fidinta, ama joogga saqaf-hoosaha, darbiyada lifaaqan ayaa raacaya isla tallaabada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogiisa u gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga soo deyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-ka-beddel-profile\"\u003EWax ka beddel profile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa qaabka darbiga oo laga eegayo dhinaca:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka sare\u003C/strong\u003E: safaf \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac-ka\u003C/strong\u003E (masaafada laga bilaabo darbiga) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog\u003C/strong\u003E (ka sare aasaaska darbiga). Saddex safaf 0 / 3000, 2500 / 4500, 5000 / 3000 waxay samaynayaan geesood saqaf 5 m darbi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka hoose\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag madhan haddii aasaas heer ah, ama geli safaf darbi ah oo aasaas tallaabo leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa safaf, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu mid ka saaraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this profile\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dabaqa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to straight\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka kasta wuxuu socdaa darbiga mar keliya, laga bilaabo bilowga ilaa dhamaadka; khad dib isu soo noqda, ama sare oo ku dhaca aasaaska, waa la diidaa. Haddii sare lifaaqan yahay, midka ka hooseeya ayaa la isticmaalaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"janjeer-darbiga\"\u003EJanjeer darbiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeersan\u003C/strong\u003E (labada dhinacba isku dhinac ayay janjeeraan, dhumucdu way joogtaa) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer labo\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinac kastaa xagal u gaar ah: darbi dhumuc yar ama weyn oo kor u kacaya). Ku qor darajooyinka ka fogaanta toosan; xagal togan wuxuu janjeerayaa dhinaca bidix ee darbiga, laga bilaabo bilowga. Darbigu wuu joogaa meesha laga sawiray aasaaska; darbiyada ku xidhan ma janjeeraan isaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furitaanno-aan-albaab-ama-daaqad-lahayn\"\u003EFuritaanno aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd opening\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu gooyaa god ballacdiisu yahay 900 darbiga dhexdiisa. Safkiisa ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EFuritaannada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESaldhig\u003C/strong\u003E (laga bilaabo heerka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E wuu ka saaraa. Furitaanku wuxuu gudbaa darbiga oo dhan, cabbirrada darbiga ayaa ka reebaa, qorshuhuna wuxuu muujiyaa god meesha uu gaadho sare-goynta qorshaha. Marka bilowga darbiga uu ku dhaqaaqo xariiqdiisa, furitaanku meeshiisa ayuu ku sii haysaa; isbeddel kasta oo ka dhigaya inuu dibadda darbiga ka baxo waa la diidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaal-dhinac-ama-goyn\"\u003EMuuqaal dhinac ama goyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur muuqaalka qalinka mashruuca. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E la daaray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProfile\u003C/strong\u003E: riix darbi wajiga muuqaalka u jeeda. Khadadka sare iyo hoose waxay buluug noqdaan, geesaha yaryar oo dhan iyo dhibic dhexe qayb kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid labajibaar si aad u dhaqaajiso nuqulkaas (labada nuqul dhamaadka keliya ayey sare iyo hoos u dhaqaajiyaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhibic si aad u dhaqaajiso qaybta oo dhan sare ama hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabo jeer riix khadka (ama midig-riix) si aad nuqul ugu darto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point (top)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point (bottom)\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku daraan nuqul bartamaha qaybta ugu dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix labajibaar oo riix Delete (ama midig-riix) si aad nuqulkaas u ka saarto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to straight\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa profile-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka nuqul la doorto, ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac-ka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogga\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca hoose ee qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaq\u003C/strong\u003E: dhinaca dhoofinta ayaa leh liisaska \u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaqid sare\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaqid aasaas\u003C/strong\u003E darbiga la doortay. Ama isticmaal qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach base\u003C/span\u003E: riix darbiga ama darbiyada, kadibna saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha, oo lagu muujiyo sanduuqyo xariiq-xariiq ah. Darbiyada la doortay oo dhan hal tallaabo ayay ku lifaaqaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuritaannada darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E, ku jiid leydi wajiga darbiga. Dib ugu noqo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E, jiid furitaanka si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid mid ka mid ah siddeed geesihiisa si aad u cabbiro, qor \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESaldhig\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca, ama riix Delete si aad u tirtirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E: darbi uu muuqaalku ku eegayo (oo loo arko sida goyn ama muuqaal dhinac ka dhamaadkiisa) ayaa sidoo kale la riixi karaa. Jiid giraangiraha sare si uu u janjeero, ama dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeersan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer labo\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca oo ku qor xagalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada waxay u dhufanayaan 10 mm; wax kasta oo ka yar qor qiime.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha-iyo-3d\"\u003EQorshaha iyo 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Edit:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttach top / base\u003C/span\u003E: dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaqid sare\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELifaaqid aasaas\u003C/strong\u003E safka qalabka. Riix darbiga ama darbiyada (qorshaha ama 3D), kadibna waxa ay ku lifaaqayaan: 3D ahaan riix saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha qudhiisa; qorshaha ahaan riix meel hoosteeda (haddii wax badan jiraan, liis ayaa weydiinaya kan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit profile\u003C/span\u003E: qorshaha, riix darbi si aad u furto wajiga darbiga. 3D ahaan, riix darbi: nuqulada profile-kiisa waxay helaan giraangiro; jiid mid ka mid ah diyaaradda darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlant\u003C/span\u003E: riix darbi (qorshaha ama 3D) oo qor sida uu u janjeerayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall opening\u003C/span\u003E: qorshaha, riix darbi meesha furitaanka ku sii yaal; \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESaldhig\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jiraan safka qalabka. 3D ahaan, riix hal geesood oo wajiga darbiga ku yaal, kadibna geesood ka soo horjeeda. Darbi lagu doortay 3D ahaan, furitaankiisu wuxuu leeyahay giraangiro: geeskuna waa cabbiraan, bartamuhuna wuu dhaqaajiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGiraangiraha 3D waa kuwa muuqaalka 3D laftiisa, sidaas awgeed way sugayaan marka sanduuqa goynta uu giraangiraha muujinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha\"\u003EQorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi janjeersan waxaa lagu sawiraa meesha qorshaha uu goynayo (1200 ka sare heerka, marka muuqaalku aan kale yidhaahdin): qaabkiisa waxaa loo guuriyaa sida uu janjeerayo heerkaas, labo-janjeer waa ballaadhan ama yar meeshaas. Qaabkiisa dhulka waxaa lagu sawiraa xariiqyo khafiif ah oo ka hooseeya goynta. Geesaha darbiga, giraangiraha iyo cabbirrada waxay ku sii jiraan aasaaska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqullo\"\u003ENuqullo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy this level…\u003C/span\u003E iyo Dhaqaajinta leh \u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/strong\u003E waxay qaataan profile-ka darbiga, janjeerkiisa iyo furitaannada darbiga. Darbi lifaaqan sagxad ama saqaf-hoose waxaa lagu lifaaqaa sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha nuqulka heerka cusub; lifaaq saqaf ah lama koobiyeeyo heerkii (saqafyada lama koobiyeeyo). Nuqul ku jira isla heerka wuxuu ku sii haraa isla saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi qaabeysan waxaa loo qoraa jidh xagal-badan (IfcFacetedBrep), oo barnaamijyada kale ay akhrinayaan sidii loo sawiray; dejimahiisa waxay ku jiraan darbiga (CadCraft_Wall Profile, AttachTop, AttachBase, Slant). Furitaanku waa IfcOpeningElement darbiga ku jira oo aan waxba buuxin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProfile leh dhex-u-gudub ama godad ku jira geesaha (isticmaal furitaannada godadka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E3D ahaan: ku darka ama ka saarista nuqullada profile-ka, iyo janjeerka giraangiro (isticmaal wajiga darbiga, muuqaal dhinac ama goyn, ama qor).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E oo leh Copy shaqaynaya ma koobiyeeyo qaabka ama furitaannada darbiga (Dhaqaajinta leh Koobiyee way koobiyeysaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada darbiga janjeersan ma sawirmaan qorshayaasha Dhexdhexaad iyo Fiican (geesaha ayaa la sawiraa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuritaannada aan ahayn xaashiyo afar-geesood ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Beddel qaabka darbi sare iyo hoosba qorshihiisa: sare wuxuu raaci karaa saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf-hoose, wuxuu lahaan karaa khadkiisa muuqaal dhinac, wuxuu janjeeri karaa, wuxuuna lahaan karaa furitaanno aan albaab ama daaqad ku jirin. Qorshaha darbiga, geeskiisa iyo khadka booskiisa way sidii ay ahaayeen. Meelaha aad ka samayn karto Sifooyinka: marka Draw iyo Select la daaray, riix hal darbi aad sawirtay. Sifooyinka wuxuu muujinayaa safafka darbiga, kadibna Qaabka, halkaas oo wax kasta lagu qoro. Muuqaal dhinac ama goyn: qalinka mashruuca (Edit in this view) ayaa furta muuqaalka; halkaas darbi dooro oo jiid geeskiisa. Eeg \"Muuqaal dhinac ama goyn\" hoos. Muuqaalka wajiga darbiga: Walls › Edit profile, kadibna riix darbiga qorshaha. Waxay shaqeysaa darbi kasta, iyo darbi wareegsan (oo lagu muujiyo oo furan). Qorshaha iyo 3D: afarta amar ee Walls (kooxda Edit): Attach top / base, Edit profile, Slant iyo Wall opening. Eeg \"Qorshaha iyo 3D\" hoos. Sida kasta aad dooratid, isbeddelka waa isku mid: hal tallaabo oo ku jirta Isbeddelada, Undo ayaa ka noqdiya. Darbiyada toosan iyo kuwa wareegsan labaduba waxay qaataan dhammaan qalabyada qaabka. Darbi wareegsan dhexdeeda, masaafooyinku waxay socdaan qoskiisa. Lifaaqid sare ama aasaas Lifaaq sare: dooro saqaf, sagxad ama saqaf-hoose. Sare ee darbigu wuxuu raacaa hoosta waxa aad dooratay, toos ka sare geesta kasta ee darbiga. Saqaf dhudhun ah hoosteeda darbigu wuxuu helaa sare janjeersan, meelaha saqafku isbeddelo (kaab ama dhinaca) sare ee darbigu wuu foororshaa. Lifaaq aasaas: dooro sagxad ama saqaf-hoose. Aasaaska darbigu wuxuu raacaa wajiga sare. Meel kasta oo aan waxba ka sare (ama hoosta) ku jirin qayb darbi, qaybtaas waxay ku sii haysaa joogga darbiga naftiisa. Xidhiidhku wuu joogaa: beddel dhudhunta saqafka ama fidinta, ama joogga saqaf-hoosaha, darbiyada lifaaqan ayaa raacaya isla tallaabada. Dooro Joogiisa u gaar ah si aad uga soo deyso. Wax ka beddel profile Edit profile… wuxuu furaa qaabka darbiga oo laga eegayo dhinaca: Khadka sare: safaf Dhinac-ka (masaafada laga bilaabo darbiga) iyo Joog (ka sare aasaaska darbiga). Saddex safaf 0 / 3000, 2500 / 4500, 5000 / 3000 waxay samaynayaan geesood saqaf 5 m darbi ah. Khadka hoose: ka tag madhan haddii aasaas heer ah, ama geli safaf darbi ah oo aasaas tallaabo leh. Add a point wuxuu ku daraa safaf, Ka saar wuxuu mid ka saaraa. Use this profile ayaa dabaqa, Back to straight wuu ka saaraa. Khadka kasta wuxuu socdaa darbiga mar keliya, laga bilaabo bilowga ilaa dhamaadka; khad dib isu soo noqda, ama sare oo ku dhaca aasaaska, waa la diidaa. Haddii sare lifaaqan yahay, midka ka hooseeya ayaa la isticmaalaa. Janjeer darbiga Janjeer: Toosan, Janjeersan (labada dhinacba isku dhinac ayay janjeeraan, dhumucdu way joogtaa) ama Janjeer labo (dhinac kastaa xagal u gaar ah: darbi dhumuc yar ama weyn oo kor u kacaya). Ku qor darajooyinka ka fogaanta toosan; xagal togan wuxuu janjeerayaa dhinaca bidix ee darbiga, laga bilaabo bilowga. Darbigu wuu joogaa meesha laga sawiray aasaaska; darbiyada ku xidhan ma janjeeraan isaga. Furitaanno aan albaab ama daaqad lahayn Add opening wuxuu gooyaa god ballacdiisu yahay 900 darbiga dhexdiisa. Safkiisa ku jira Furitaannada wuxuu dejiyaa Laga bilaabo bilowga, Ballac, Saldhig (laga bilaabo heerka) iyo Joog; Ka saar wuu ka saaraa. Furitaanku wuxuu gudbaa darbiga oo dhan, cabbirrada darbiga ayaa ka reebaa, qorshuhuna wuxuu muujiyaa god meesha uu gaadho sare-goynta qorshaha. Marka bilowga darbiga uu ku dhaqaaqo xariiqdiisa, furitaanku meeshiisa ayuu ku sii haysaa; isbeddel kasta oo ka dhigaya inuu dibadda darbiga ka baxo waa la diidaa. Muuqaal dhinac ama goyn Fur muuqaalka qalinka mashruuca. Marka Select and move la daaray: Profile: riix darbi wajiga muuqaalka u jeeda. Khadadka sare iyo hoose waxay buluug noqdaan, geesaha yaryar oo dhan iyo dhibic dhexe qayb kasta. Jiid labajibaar si aad u dhaqaajiso nuqulkaas (labada nuqul dhamaadka keliya ayey sare iyo hoos u dhaqaajiyaan). Jiid dhibic si aad u dhaqaajiso qaybta oo dhan sare ama hoos. Labo jeer riix khadka (ama midig-riix) si aad nuqul ugu darto; Add a point (top) iyo Add a point (bottom) waxay ku daraan nuqul bartamaha qaybta ugu dheer. Riix labajibaar oo riix Delete (ama midig-riix) si aad nuqulkaas u ka saarto. Back to straight wuxuu ka saaraa profile-ka. Marka nuqul la doorto, ku qor Dhinac-ka iyo Joogga dhinaca hoose ee qalabka. Lifaaq: dhinaca dhoofinta ayaa leh liisaska Lifaaqid sare iyo Lifaaqid aasaas darbiga la doortay. Ama isticmaal qalabka Attach top ama Attach base: riix darbiga ama darbiyada, kadibna saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha, oo lagu muujiyo sanduuqyo xariiq-xariiq ah. Darbiyada la doortay oo dhan hal tallaabo ayay ku lifaaqaan. Furitaannada darbiga: qalabka Wall opening, ku jiid leydi wajiga darbiga. Dib ugu noqo Select and move, jiid furitaanka si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid mid ka mid ah siddeed geesihiisa si aad u cabbiro, qor Laga bilaabo bilowga, Ballac, Saldhig iyo Joog dhinaca, ama riix Delete si aad u tirtirto. Janjeer: darbi uu muuqaalku ku eegayo (oo loo arko sida goyn ama muuqaal dhinac ka dhamaadkiisa) ayaa sidoo kale la riixi karaa. Jiid giraangiraha sare si uu u janjeero, ama dooro Toosan, Janjeersan ama Janjeer labo dhinaca oo ku qor xagalka. Cabbirrada waxay u dhufanayaan 10 mm; wax kasta oo ka yar qor qiime. Qorshaha iyo 3D Fur Walls kooxda Edit: Attach top / base: dooro Lifaaqid sare ama Lifaaqid aasaas safka qalabka. Riix darbiga ama darbiyada (qorshaha ama 3D), kadibna waxa ay ku lifaaqayaan: 3D ahaan riix saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha qudhiisa; qorshaha ahaan riix meel hoosteeda (haddii wax badan jiraan, liis ayaa weydiinaya kan). Edit profile: qorshaha, riix darbi si aad u furto wajiga darbiga. 3D ahaan, riix darbi: nuqulada profile-kiisa waxay helaan giraangiro; jiid mid ka mid ah diyaaradda darbiga. Slant: riix darbi (qorshaha ama 3D) oo qor sida uu u janjeerayo. Wall opening: qorshaha, riix darbi meesha furitaanka ku sii yaal; Ballac, Joog iyo Saldhig waxay ku jiraan safka qalabka. 3D ahaan, riix hal geesood oo wajiga darbiga ku yaal, kadibna geesood ka soo horjeeda. Darbi lagu doortay 3D ahaan, furitaankiisu wuxuu leeyahay giraangiro: geeskuna waa cabbiraan, bartamuhuna wuu dhaqaajiyaa. Giraangiraha 3D waa kuwa muuqaalka 3D laftiisa, sidaas awgeed way sugayaan marka sanduuqa goynta uu giraangiraha muujinayo. Qorshaha Darbi janjeersan waxaa lagu sawiraa meesha qorshaha uu goynayo (1200 ka sare heerka, marka muuqaalku aan kale yidhaahdin): qaabkiisa waxaa loo guuriyaa sida uu janjeerayo heerkaas, labo-janjeer waa ballaadhan ama yar meeshaas. Qaabkiisa dhulka waxaa lagu sawiraa xariiqyo khafiif ah oo ka hooseeya goynta. Geesaha darbiga, giraangiraha iyo cabbirrada waxay ku sii jiraan aasaaska. Nuqullo Copy this level… iyo Dhaqaajinta leh Koobiyee waxay qaataan profile-ka darbiga, janjeerkiisa iyo furitaannada darbiga. Darbi lifaaqan sagxad ama saqaf-hoose waxaa lagu lifaaqaa sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha nuqulka heerka cusub; lifaaq saqaf ah lama koobiyeeyo heerkii (saqafyada lama koobiyeeyo). Nuqul ku jira isla heerka wuxuu ku sii haraa isla saqafka, sagxadda ama saqaf-hoosaha. Faylka Darbi qaabeysan waxaa loo qoraa jidh xagal-badan (IfcFacetedBrep), oo barnaamijyada kale ay akhrinayaan sidii loo sawiray; dejimahiisa waxay ku jiraan darbiga (CadCraft_Wall Profile, AttachTop, AttachBase, Slant). Furitaanku waa IfcOpeningElement darbiga ku jira oo aan waxba buuxin. Weli lama dhisin Profile leh dhex-u-gudub ama godad ku jira geesaha (isticmaal furitaannada godadka). 3D ahaan: ku darka ama ka saarista nuqullada profile-ka, iyo janjeerka giraangiro (isticmaal wajiga darbiga, muuqaal dhinac ama goyn, ama qor). Offset oo leh Copy shaqaynaya ma koobiyeeyo qaabka ama furitaannada darbiga (Dhaqaajinta leh Koobiyee way koobiyeysaa). Lakabyada darbiga janjeersan ma sawirmaan qorshayaasha Dhexdhexaad iyo Fiican (geesaha ayaa la sawiraa). Furitaannada aan ahayn xaashiyo afar-geesood ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"floors-and-roofs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qolalka, sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafyada","summary":"Qolalka waxay muuqdaan marka derbiyadu xidhaan; qol ama dhismaha oo dhan u geli sagxad iyo sooh, derbiyada korkooda na saar saqaf afar-dhinac ama laba-dhinac. Dhammaantood way raacaan marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan.","section":"tasks","order":19,"keywords":["qol","qolal","meel","aag","perimeter","sagxad","shub-sagxad","sagxad hoose","sooh","saqaf","saqaf afar-dhinac","saqaf laba-dhinac","janjeer","dheregga","geesta saqafka","dhabarka saqafka","godka saqafka","6/12"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"qolalka","text":"Qolalka","level":2},{"id":"sagxadaha","text":"Sagxadaha","level":2},{"id":"soohda","text":"Soohda","level":2},{"id":"saqaf","text":"Saqaf","level":2},{"id":"beddelka","text":"Beddelka","level":2},{"id":"sagxad-sooh-ama-saqaf-nooc-leh-lakabyo","text":"Sagxad, sooh ama saqaf nooc leh lakabyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa fiican in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamee qolofka dhismaha. Qolalka waxay ka soo baxaan derbiyada; sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafka mid kasta waxaa loo baahan yahay hal guji. Maadaama ay derbiyada ka soo kobcaan, way raacaan marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qolalka\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeel kasta oo ay derbiyada xidhaan waa qol. Waxay muuqataa marka derbiga ugu dambeeya xidho, oo leh lambar (101, 102 … dabaqa koowaad, 201 … kan xiga) iyo magac (\u003Cstrong\u003EQol 1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQol 2\u003C/strong\u003E …), aagiisana wuxuu ku muuqdaa dhexdiisa qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E uu shidan yahay, guji gudaha qol si aad u doorato. Gudaha \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale \u003Ccode\u003EMaqaasad\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELambarka\u003C/strong\u003E; aagiisa iyo perimeter-kiisa ayaa la muujiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirtir derbi u dhexeeya laba qol, waxay noqdaan mid; derbi qol ku qalloocan, waxay noqonaysaa laba. Qolku wuxuu ilaalinayaa magaciisa iyo lambarkiisa intii derbiyada ku wareegsan dhaqaajinayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQol keligiis lama tirtiri karo: waa meesha ay derbiyadu sameeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAagyada waxaa lagu qiyaasaa gudaha wajiyada derbiyada. Qolalka waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida meelaha IFC leh aagooda sagxadda, perimeter-ka, joogta, dherer-ka iyo mugga, si jadwalladu u akhriyaan (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EKu dar tirooyinka, liis curiyayaasha oo jadwal meelaha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxadaha\"\u003ESagxadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESagxad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQolkan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhismaha oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka\u003C/strong\u003E (sagxad alwaax ah ama shub sagxad) iyo dhumucdiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhex-dhig qol (ama meel kasta gudaha dhismaha). Waxa sagxaddu daboollin doonto ayaa la iftiimiyaa, aagiisana wuu muuqdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji. Sagxadda sare waa heerka dabaqa; waxay u dhacdaa dhumucdeeda. Sagxadda dhismaha oo dhan waxay gaadhaa wajiyada dibadda ee derbiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soohda\"\u003ESoohda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESooh\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQolkan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhismaha oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoog\u003C/strong\u003Ega ka sarreeya sagxadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhex-dhig gudaha oo guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad uga aragto hoosta, iyadoo shabakadeeda iyo iftiinka ku saaran, u beddel qorshaha soohda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EAragtiyada, kala duwanaanta aragtida iyo xaashiyadaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqaf\"\u003ESaqaf\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqa uu derbiyadiisu saqafka qaadayo, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaqaf\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E sida kor oo 12 (\u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E) ama digrii (\u003Ccode\u003E30\u003C/code\u003E), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDheregga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaadyada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003ESaqaf afar-dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinac kasta wuu janjeeraa), \u003Cstrong\u003EGable xagga gaaban\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGable xagga dheer\u003C/strong\u003E (dhismo afar-dhinac leh), ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESaqaf hal-janjeer\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhex-dhig gudaha dhismaha: geesta hoose iyo qoorta sare ayaa ka muuqda qorshaha. Guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaqafku wuxuu saaran yahay derbiyada korkooda, dabaqa ka sarreeya, hoosteedana wuxuu la kulmaa wajiga dibadda ee derbiyada. Dhamaadyada gable-ka waxaa lagu buuxiyaa derbi gable ah oo ballacdiisu la mid yahay derbiga hoose. Dhismaha L-, T- ama U-ah wuxuu helaa saqaf afar-dhinac oo gacmihiisu ku kulmaan godadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddelka\"\u003EBeddelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro sagxad, sooh ama saqaf (aragga 3D, geedka moodelka, ama saqaf ku guji gudaha jidkiisa dabaqa sare) oo ku beddel \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: qaabka sagxadda, dhumucdeeda iyo intee ka sarreeya heerka dabaqa; joogta soohda, dhumucda iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E (setka uu qorshaha soohdu ku sawiro: midna, 600 × 600, 600 × 1200, 2&#039; × 2&#039; ama 2&#039; × 4&#039;); janjeerka saqafka, dheregga, dhamaadyada iyo dhumucda. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxad-sooh-ama-saqaf-nooc-leh-lakabyo\"\u003ESagxad, sooh ama saqaf nooc leh lakabyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESagxad, sooh iyo saqaf waxay heli karaan \u003Cstrong\u003Enooc\u003C/strong\u003E, sida derbigu u heli karo: dhismo magac leh oo lakab kasta leh agabkiisa iyo dhumucdiisa dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarkaad dhigayso.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabka Sagxadda, Soohda, Saqafka iyo Sagxadda sawirka waxay leeyihiin liis \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E safkooda. \u003Cstrong\u003ENooc la&#039;aan\u003C/strong\u003E waxay dhigtaa sida hore, dhumucdeeda gaarka ah. Nooc kastaa wuxuu dhigaa dhumucda ay wadar u tahay lakabyadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDambe.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro sagxadda, soohda ama saqafka oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E sifooyinka. Curiyuhu waa isku mid: meeshiisa, qolkiisa iyo xogtiisa way ilaashanayaan, mana dib loo sawirin. Waxa kaliya ee beddelma waa nooca, dhumucda iyo agabka. Tani waa sida curiye fikradeed loogu beddelo curiye horumarsan: beddel nooca guud oo dhig nooc run ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir nooca…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa tafatirka nooca: lakabyada \u003Cstrong\u003Esare\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa hoose, xudunta, shaqada lakab kasta, iyo tagga LOD ee nooca. Kaydinta wuxuu beddelaa curiyaha nooca oo dhan hal tallaabo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo celinaya. Beddelidda nooca bilowga ah waxay keydisaa nuqul ah nooca aad leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka curiye leeyahay nooc, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhumucdiisa\u003C/strong\u003E waa kan nooca, ma beddeli karto. Dooro nooc kale, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENooc la&#039;aan\u003C/strong\u003E, si aad u beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyada bilowga ah waa hal nooc \u003Cstrong\u003Eguud\u003C/strong\u003E (hal lakab oo agab guud ah, oo lagu calaamadiyay LOD 200) iyo laba nooc oo lakabyo leh (lagu calaamadiyay LOD 300): sagxad joist alwaax ah iyo sagxad shub leh screed; saqaf alwaax ah iyo saqaf shub oo fiiqan; iyo sooh loox gypsum ah iyo sooh alaab la dhex dhigay. Waa qiyamyo bilow ah, ma aha dhismo la tijaabiyay: hubi lakabyada ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada: aagga iyo mugga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa lakab kasta oo nooc kasta oo la isticmaalo; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\"\u003EJadwallada, cabbirrada iyo PDF\u003C/a\u003E. Noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo soohda waxay u gudbaan mashaariicda kale xirmo nooc ama shay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E ah; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-packs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-packs\"\u003EXirmooyinka noocyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaajinta, ku darka ama tirtirka derbiyada waxay dib u sameeyaan qolalka, sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafka ka korreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqaf kasta wuxuu ku habboon yahay qaab kasta. Si aad derbi kastaa u siiso janjeerkiisa, gable-ka, hal-janjeerka ama dhamaadka, kor loo qaado, fascia iyo soffit, ama si aad u sawirto hal dusha saqaf, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/roofs\"\u003ESaqafyada: janjeer derbi kasta, gable-yo, hal-janjeerro iyo dusha saqafka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa sagxad, sooh ama saqaf la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhamee qolofka dhismaha. Qolalka waxay ka soo baxaan derbiyada; sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafka mid kasta waxaa loo baahan yahay hal guji. Maadaama ay derbiyada ka soo kobcaan, way raacaan marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan. Qolalka Meel kasta oo ay derbiyada xidhaan waa qol. Waxay muuqataa marka derbiga ugu dambeeya xidho, oo leh lambar (101, 102 … dabaqa koowaad, 201 … kan xiga) iyo magac (Qol 1, Qol 2 …), aagiisana wuxuu ku muuqdaa dhexdiisa qorshaha. Marka Dooro uu shidan yahay, guji gudaha qol si aad u doorato. Gudaha Sifooyinka beddel Magaca (tusaale Maqaasad) iyo Lambarka; aagiisa iyo perimeter-kiisa ayaa la muujiyaa. Tirtir derbi u dhexeeya laba qol, waxay noqdaan mid; derbi qol ku qalloocan, waxay noqonaysaa laba. Qolku wuxuu ilaalinayaa magaciisa iyo lambarkiisa intii derbiyada ku wareegsan dhaqaajinayaan. Qol keligiis lama tirtiri karo: waa meesha ay derbiyadu sameeyaan. Aagyada waxaa lagu qiyaasaa gudaha wajiyada derbiyada. Qolalka waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida meelaha IFC leh aagooda sagxadda, perimeter-ka, joogta, dherer-ka iyo mugga, si jadwalladu u akhriyaan (eeg Ku dar tirooyinka, liis curiyayaasha oo jadwal meelaha). Sagxadaha Guji Sagxad. Dooro Qolkan ama Dhismaha oo dhan, Qaabka (sagxad alwaax ah ama shub sagxad) iyo dhumucdiisa. Dhex-dhig qol (ama meel kasta gudaha dhismaha). Waxa sagxaddu daboollin doonto ayaa la iftiimiyaa, aagiisana wuu muuqdaa. Guji. Sagxadda sare waa heerka dabaqa; waxay u dhacdaa dhumucdeeda. Sagxadda dhismaha oo dhan waxay gaadhaa wajiyada dibadda ee derbiyada. Soohda Guji Sooh. Dooro Qolkan ama Dhismaha oo dhan, iyo Joogga ka sarreeya sagxadda. Dhex-dhig gudaha oo guji. Si aad uga aragto hoosta, iyadoo shabakadeeda iyo iftiinka ku saaran, u beddel qorshaha soohda: eeg Aragtiyada, kala duwanaanta aragtida iyo xaashiyadaada. Saqaf Dabaqa uu derbiyadiisu saqafka qaadayo, guji Saqaf. Qor Janjeerka sida kor oo 12 (6/12) ama digrii (30), iyo Dheregga. Dooro Dhamaadyada: Saqaf afar-dhinac (dhinac kasta wuu janjeeraa), Gable xagga gaaban ama Gable xagga dheer (dhismo afar-dhinac leh), ama Saqaf hal-janjeer. Dhex-dhig gudaha dhismaha: geesta hoose iyo qoorta sare ayaa ka muuqda qorshaha. Guji. Saqafku wuxuu saaran yahay derbiyada korkooda, dabaqa ka sarreeya, hoosteedana wuxuu la kulmaa wajiga dibadda ee derbiyada. Dhamaadyada gable-ka waxaa lagu buuxiyaa derbi gable ah oo ballacdiisu la mid yahay derbiga hoose. Dhismaha L-, T- ama U-ah wuxuu helaa saqaf afar-dhinac oo gacmihiisu ku kulmaan godadka. Beddelka Dooro sagxad, sooh ama saqaf (aragga 3D, geedka moodelka, ama saqaf ku guji gudaha jidkiisa dabaqa sare) oo ku beddel Sifooyinka: qaabka sagxadda, dhumucdeeda iyo intee ka sarreeya heerka dabaqa; joogta soohda, dhumucda iyo Naqshadda (setka uu qorshaha soohdu ku sawiro: midna, 600 × 600, 600 × 1200, 2' × 2' ama 2' × 4'); janjeerka saqafka, dheregga, dhamaadyada iyo dhumucda. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo. Sagxad, sooh ama saqaf nooc leh lakabyo Sagxad, sooh iyo saqaf waxay heli karaan nooc, sida derbigu u heli karo: dhismo magac leh oo lakab kasta leh agabkiisa iyo dhumucdiisa dhabta ah. Markaad dhigayso. Qalabka Sagxadda, Soohda, Saqafka iyo Sagxadda sawirka waxay leeyihiin liis Nooca safkooda. Nooc la'aan waxay dhigtaa sida hore, dhumucdeeda gaarka ah. Nooc kastaa wuxuu dhigaa dhumucda ay wadar u tahay lakabyadiisa. Dambe. Dooro sagxadda, soohda ama saqafka oo dooro Nooca sifooyinka. Curiyuhu waa isku mid: meeshiisa, qolkiisa iyo xogtiisa way ilaashanayaan, mana dib loo sawirin. Waxa kaliya ee beddelma waa nooca, dhumucda iyo agabka. Tani waa sida curiye fikradeed loogu beddelo curiye horumarsan: beddel nooca guud oo dhig nooc run ah. Tafatir nooca… wuxuu furaa tafatirka nooca: lakabyada sare ilaa hoose, xudunta, shaqada lakab kasta, iyo tagga LOD ee nooca. Kaydinta wuxuu beddelaa curiyaha nooca oo dhan hal tallaabo; Ka noqo ayaa soo celinaya. Beddelidda nooca bilowga ah waxay keydisaa nuqul ah nooca aad leedahay. Marka curiye leeyahay nooc, Dhumucdiisa waa kan nooca, ma beddeli karto. Dooro nooc kale, ama Nooc la'aan, si aad u beddesho. Noocyada bilowga ah waa hal nooc guud (hal lakab oo agab guud ah, oo lagu calaamadiyay LOD 200) iyo laba nooc oo lakabyo leh (lagu calaamadiyay LOD 300): sagxad joist alwaax ah iyo sagxad shub leh screed; saqaf alwaax ah iyo saqaf shub oo fiiqan; iyo sooh loox gypsum ah iyo sooh alaab la dhex dhigay. Waa qiyamyo bilow ah, ma aha dhismo la tijaabiyay: hubi lakabyada ka hor intaadan isku hallayn. Jadwalka Lakabyada: aagga iyo mugga wuxuu liistaa lakab kasta oo nooc kasta oo la isticmaalo; eeg Jadwallada, cabbirrada iyo PDF. Noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo soohda waxay u gudbaan mashaariicda kale xirmo nooc ama shay Maktabad ah; eeg Xirmooyinka noocyada. Waxa fiican in la ogaado Dhaqaajinta, ku darka ama tirtirka derbiyada waxay dib u sameeyaan qolalka, sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafka ka korreeya. Saqaf kasta wuxuu ku habboon yahay qaab kasta. Si aad derbi kastaa u siiso janjeerkiisa, gable-ka, hal-janjeerka ama dhamaadka, kor loo qaado, fascia iyo soffit, ama si aad u sawirto hal dusha saqaf, eeg Saqafyada: janjeer derbi kasta, gable-yo, hal-janjeerro iyo dusha saqafka. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa sagxad, sooh ama saqaf la doortay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"type-packs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xirmooyinka nooca: wadaag noocyada darbiga iyo fayl furan","summary":"Kaydi noocyada darbiga oo leh lakabyadooda, alaabta, calaamadaha iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda, iyo qoysaska, sida hal fayl furan (JSON caadi ah ama IFC), oo ku dar mashruuc kale. Noocyada darbiga ee faylka IFC ee barnaamij kale ayaa sidoo kale la akhrin karaa.","section":"tasks","order":19,"keywords":["xirmada nooca","noocyada","darbi nooc","wadaag","dhoofin","soo gelin","maktabad","furan","json","ifc","IfcWallType","IfcMaterialLayerSet","IfcProjectLibrary","alaabta","lakabyada","template","heer xafiis","qoysaska"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-ka-keen-mashruuc","text":"Noocyada ka keen mashruuc","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-ku-dar-mashruuc","text":"Noocyada ku dar mashruuc","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-sagxadda-saqafka-iyo-saqafka-hoose","text":"Noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose","level":2},{"id":"hal-nooc-oo-ah-shay-maktabad","text":"Hal nooc oo ah shay Maktabad","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyadii darbigaaga ka qaado mashruuc kale, ama siiyo qof ka shaqeeya barnaamij kale. Xirmada nooca waxay haysaa darbi kasta oo nooc ah oo leh lakabyadiisa, dhumucdooda, alaabta, core-ka, godadka, mudnaanta lakabka, heerka horumarka, xogta xisaabinta iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda, iyo qoysaska aad ku darto. Waa fayl furan: qoraal JSON caadi ah oo qof walba akhriyi karo, ama fayl IFC. Waxba kuma xirna shirkad, dal ama akoon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-ka-keen-mashruuc\"\u003ENoocyada ka keen mashruuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EData\u003C/strong\u003E bar-ka moodelka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType packs\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave types from this project\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadi noocyada darbiga ee aad rabto inaad ku darto. Noocyada mashruucu leeyahay waa la calaamadiyay; nooc bilow ah ayaa lagu dari karaa, wuxuuna u galaa nuqul ahaan. Calaamadi qoysaska haddii aad rabto inay ku jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPack name\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a pack (.json)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cctypes.json\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl IFC ah oo keliya noocyada ku jira: nooc darbi kasta sida IfcWallType oo leh kooxdeeda lakabka alaabta, alaabta iyo kala-soocidda, barnaamij BIM kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-ku-dar-mashruuc\"\u003ENoocyada ku dar mashruuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsla daaqadda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a pack or an IFC file…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro xirmo \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ama fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqaddu waxay liistaa waxa faylku ku jiro: nooc darbi kasta oo leh dhumucdiisa, tirada lakabyada iyo koodhadhka, alaabta iyo qoysaska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa dhacaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA type this project already has\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EHay kii mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar kii xirmada nuqul ahaan\u003C/strong\u003E (waxay magac cusub ku heli doontaa oo ku dhamaanaya &quot;(2)&quot;), ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel (kaliya marka darbi aan isticmaalin)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to the project\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa waxa la daray, la nuqul sameeyay, la beddelay ama la hayay. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyada cusub waxay ku jiraan liiska noocyada qalabka darbiga isla markiiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-sagxadda-saqafka-iyo-saqafka-hoose\"\u003ENoocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska noocyada la kaydinayo wuxuu sidoo kale haystaa noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose ee mashruuca iyo bilowgooda (lagu calaamadiyay Floor, Roof, Ceiling). Xirmo wuxuu qaadi karaa afarta nooc oo dhan; nooc kasta wuxuu magacaabaa fasalkiisa IFC (IfcWallType, IfcSlabType, IfcCoveringType). Nooca sagxadda, saqafka ama saqafka hoose ee walxaha isticmaalaa looma beddelo xirmo; beddel tafatiraha nooca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-nooc-oo-ah-shay-maktabad\"\u003EHal nooc oo ah shay Maktabad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi hal nooc oo keliya, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi sida shay Maktabad…\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cctype.json\u003C/code\u003E: shay Maktabad oo nooca Types ah oo haysta nooca keliya (lakabyadiisa, alaabta, LOD iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda). Soo gudbi Maktabadda si aad u wadaagto. \u003Cstrong\u003EFur xirmo ama fayl IFC\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa akhrisa shay noocan oo kale, wuxuuna nooceeda ku daraa mashruuca sida xirmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC ee barnaamij kale waxa laga furi karaa halkan. Nooc darbi kasta oo ku leh lakabyo alaab ah ayaa la akhriyaa: magaca, alaabta lakabyada iyo dhumucdooda, iyo godad kasta waa kuwa faylka laftiisa. Lakabyada core-ka yihiin iyo waxa lakab kasta sameeyo (dhamaystiran, qaab, dhisme, kulaylin) waa la malaynayaa, nooca waxaa lagu calaamadiyay \u003Cstrong\u003E(la malaynayo)\u003C/strong\u003E, oo waa in aad ku hubiso tafatiraha nooca darbiga. Nooc darbi aan lakab lahayn waa la reebay oo magaciisa ayaa la sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlaabta mashruucu horay u leeyahay waa la hayaa sida ay tahay. Alaab cusub oo magaceedu la yimid ayaa magaceeda ku dhamaysa &quot;(xirmo)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENooc darbi oo darbiyadu isticmaalaan looma beddelo xirmo. Ku beddel tafatiraha nooca darbiga, kaasoo darbiyadiisa si sax ah u wareejiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoodh lagu dejiyay darbi kasta ma socdo: waa darbigaas gaarka ah. Koodhka lagu dejiyay nooca ayaa socda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka oo leh goob aan qaabkaasi lahayn, lakab alaabtiisu maqan tahay, ama wax aan qoraal caadi ahayn ahayn ayaa la diidaa, fariintuna waxay sheegaa meesha iyo sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELama dhisin: noocyada dabaqa, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose (nooc kasta dhumucdiisa gaarka ah ayuu leeyahay, sidaas darteed noocyo ma lahan nooca version-kan), noocyada albaabka iyo daaqadda ee aan qoys ahayn, iyo xarriiqyada ama midabyada faylka barnaamij kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Noocyadii darbigaaga ka qaado mashruuc kale, ama siiyo qof ka shaqeeya barnaamij kale. Xirmada nooca waxay haysaa darbi kasta oo nooc ah oo leh lakabyadiisa, dhumucdooda, alaabta, core-ka, godadka, mudnaanta lakabka, heerka horumarka, xogta xisaabinta iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda, iyo qoysaska aad ku darto. Waa fayl furan: qoraal JSON caadi ah oo qof walba akhriyi karo, ama fayl IFC. Waxba kuma xirna shirkad, dal ama akoon. Noocyada ka keen mashruuc Fur Data bar-ka moodelka oo dooro Type packs. Hoosta Save types from this project, calaamadi noocyada darbiga ee aad rabto inaad ku darto. Noocyada mashruucu leeyahay waa la calaamadiyay; nooc bilow ah ayaa lagu dari karaa, wuxuuna u galaa nuqul ahaan. Calaamadi qoysaska haddii aad rabto inay ku jiraan. Ku qor Pack name. Save as a pack (.json) wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl .cctypes.json. Save as IFC (.ifc) wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl IFC ah oo keliya noocyada ku jira: nooc darbi kasta sida IfcWallType oo leh kooxdeeda lakabka alaabta, alaabta iyo kala-soocidda, barnaamij BIM kasta. Noocyada ku dar mashruuc Isla daaqadda, dooro Open a pack or an IFC file… oo dooro xirmo .json ama fayl .ifc. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa waxa faylku ku jiro: nooc darbi kasta oo leh dhumucdiisa, tirada lakabyada iyo koodhadhka, alaabta iyo qoysaska. Dooro waxa dhacaya A type this project already has: Hay kii mashruuca, Ku dar kii xirmada nuqul ahaan (waxay magac cusub ku heli doontaa oo ku dhamaanaya \"(2)\"), ama Beddel (kaliya marka darbi aan isticmaalin). Add to the project. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa waxa la daray, la nuqul sameeyay, la beddelay ama la hayay. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Noocyada cusub waxay ku jiraan liiska noocyada qalabka darbiga isla markiiba. Noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose Liiska noocyada la kaydinayo wuxuu sidoo kale haystaa noocyada sagxadda, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose ee mashruuca iyo bilowgooda (lagu calaamadiyay Floor, Roof, Ceiling). Xirmo wuxuu qaadi karaa afarta nooc oo dhan; nooc kasta wuxuu magacaabaa fasalkiisa IFC (IfcWallType, IfcSlabType, IfcCoveringType). Nooca sagxadda, saqafka ama saqafka hoose ee walxaha isticmaalaa looma beddelo xirmo; beddel tafatiraha nooca. Hal nooc oo ah shay Maktabad Calaamadi hal nooc oo keliya, kadibna dooro Kaydi sida shay Maktabad…. Wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl .cctype.json: shay Maktabad oo nooca Types ah oo haysta nooca keliya (lakabyadiisa, alaabta, LOD iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda). Soo gudbi Maktabadda si aad u wadaagto. Fur xirmo ama fayl IFC ayaa akhrisa shay noocan oo kale, wuxuuna nooceeda ku daraa mashruuca sida xirmo. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Faylka IFC ee barnaamij kale waxa laga furi karaa halkan. Nooc darbi kasta oo ku leh lakabyo alaab ah ayaa la akhriyaa: magaca, alaabta lakabyada iyo dhumucdooda, iyo godad kasta waa kuwa faylka laftiisa. Lakabyada core-ka yihiin iyo waxa lakab kasta sameeyo (dhamaystiran, qaab, dhisme, kulaylin) waa la malaynayaa, nooca waxaa lagu calaamadiyay (la malaynayo), oo waa in aad ku hubiso tafatiraha nooca darbiga. Nooc darbi aan lakab lahayn waa la reebay oo magaciisa ayaa la sheegaa. Alaabta mashruucu horay u leeyahay waa la hayaa sida ay tahay. Alaab cusub oo magaceedu la yimid ayaa magaceeda ku dhamaysa \"(xirmo)\". Nooc darbi oo darbiyadu isticmaalaan looma beddelo xirmo. Ku beddel tafatiraha nooca darbiga, kaasoo darbiyadiisa si sax ah u wareejiya. Koodh lagu dejiyay darbi kasta ma socdo: waa darbigaas gaarka ah. Koodhka lagu dejiyay nooca ayaa socda. Faylka oo leh goob aan qaabkaasi lahayn, lakab alaabtiisu maqan tahay, ama wax aan qoraal caadi ahayn ahayn ayaa la diidaa, fariintuna waxay sheegaa meesha iyo sababta. Lama dhisin: noocyada dabaqa, saqafka iyo saqafka hoose (nooc kasta dhumucdiisa gaarka ah ayuu leeyahay, sidaas darteed noocyo ma lahan nooca version-kan), noocyada albaabka iyo daaqadda ee aan qoys ahayn, iyo xarriiqyada ama midabyada faylka barnaamij kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"library-types-and-kits","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Calaamadaha, noocyada iyo hantida, qaababka mashruucyada iyo Quick Kits","summary":"Maktabadda waxay leedahay saddex nooc oo walax ah (Calaamado, Noocyo, Hanti). Ku dar Nooc mashruucaaga, ka bilow qaab mashruuc la wadaago, ku dar Quick Kit, oo la wadaag kuwaaga adiga ah boggaha soo-rarista maktabadda.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["maktabad","calaamado","noocyo","hanti","nooc","qaab mashruuc","qaab","quick kit","qalab","la wadaag","soo rar","nooc","changelog","LOD","kala-soocidda","liisan","waxyaabo ka timid dhaqanka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"saddexda-nooc-ee-walxa-maktabadda","text":"Saddexda nooc ee walxa maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-nooc-mashruucaaga","text":"Ku dar Nooc mashruucaaga","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-mashruucyada-iyo-quick-kits","text":"Qaababka mashruucyada iyo Quick Kits","level":2},{"id":"la-wadaag-kuwaaga","text":"La wadaag kuwaaga","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-ka-timid-dhaqanka","text":"Waxyaabo ka timid dhaqanka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHel waxa aad u baahan tahay maktabadda iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ay tahay, ku dar Nooc mashruuca aad sawirayso, bilow mashruuc cusub oo qaab la wadaago, oo la wadaag qaababkaaga, noocyadaada iyo qalabkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddexda-nooc-ee-walxa-maktabadda\"\u003ESaddexda nooc ee walxa maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamado\u003C/strong\u003E waa heshiisyada sawirka: 2D oo keliya, lagu sawiray cabbirka sharraxaadda, oo loo kooxeeyay takhaasuska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyo\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sheegaan waxa walaxu ka samaysan yahay: lakabkiisa oo leh dhumucdooda dhabta ah, heerka horumarka (LOD) iyo koodka kala-soocidda. Nooc waxaa lagu daraa mashruuca, ma aha mid la sawiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHanti\u003C/strong\u003E waa shay jireed sida albaabbo, daaqado, alaab, qalab biyo-mareen iyo qalab, oo leh aragta dabaqa iyo jidhka 3D ee cabbirka dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca walxa\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u muujiso Wax kasta, Calaamado, Noocyo ama Hanti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-nooc-mashruucaaga\"\u003EKu dar Nooc mashruucaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca walxa\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyo\u003C/strong\u003E oo fur mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi qaabkiisa dhismaha, LOD iyo kala-soocidda hoosta sawirka, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to this project\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaa lagu daraa sida darbi, dabaq, saqaf ama tuulan oo aad ku sawiri karto. Haddii nooc magacan leh hore u jiro, kan cusub waxaa lagu daraa sida nuqul, kan hore waa sidiisii. Hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-mashruucyada-iyo-quick-kits\"\u003EQaababka mashruucyada iyo Quick Kits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKits\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto waxa dadku wadaageen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab mashruuc\u003C/strong\u003E waa fayl IFC oo leh dabaqyo, gridyo, noocyo iyo dejin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave to my templates\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa New building hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EStart from\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuick Kit\u003C/strong\u003E waa liis walxo maktabadda ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the kit&#039;s items\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liiskaa u muujiyaa kaararka aad dhigi karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalab kasta wuxuu leeyahay nooc iyo diiwaan isbedel, kan ugu cusub ee ugu horeeya. Nooc ku bilaabma 0 waa mid wadahadal ah; 1.0.0 waa kan keliya milkiilaha silsiladda uu ansixiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-wadaag-kuwaaga\"\u003ELa wadaag kuwaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab mashruuc:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as template\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso make a file to share in the Library\u003C/span\u003E, ku dar waxa uu ku jiro iyo nooc. Waxaad heleysaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuick Kit:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKits\u003C/span\u003E gudahiis, dooro Samee Quick Kit mashruucan. Waxay liistaa walxaha maktabadda ee mashruucu isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooc:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType packs\u003C/span\u003E gudahiis, calaamadi hal nooc oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a Library item…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo rar faylka boggaga soo-rarista maktabadda. Waxa uu ku marayaa isla dib-u-eegis sida walxaha kale, adiguna waxaad dooraysaa liisankiisa halkaas. Walax kasta wuxuu sheegaa liisankiisa. Walxaha waxaa looga baahan yahay LOD, IFC class iyo koodka kala-soocidda (koodka, ma aha magac keliya).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-ka-timid-dhaqanka\"\u003EWaxyaabo ka timid dhaqanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoggaga walax kasta oo maktabadda ah, xubnaha la galay waxay ku dari karaan qoraal: la isticmaalay mashruuc dhab ah, la isku dayay mashruuc tusaale ah, ama dhibaato la helay. Sheeg nooca mashruuca erey yar, oo ka reeb magacyada macaamiisha. Qoraalku waa dadweyne, ma aha dib-u-eegis; ma beddelo walxa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba laguma diro app-ka. Faylasha waxaa lagu sameeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, adiguna waad soo rartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalab ka samaysan qaab wuxuu qaadaa qoraalka IFC sida loo kaydiyay. Ka hubi wax gaar ah ka hor inta aadan soo rarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft wuxuu muujiyaa Calaamado iyo Hanti tab-ka Maktabadda; Noocyada iyo qaababka waa kuwa mashruucyada BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hel waxa aad u baahan tahay maktabadda iyada oo loo eegayo waxa ay tahay, ku dar Nooc mashruuca aad sawirayso, bilow mashruuc cusub oo qaab la wadaago, oo la wadaag qaababkaaga, noocyadaada iyo qalabkaaga. Saddexda nooc ee walxa maktabadda Calaamado waa heshiisyada sawirka: 2D oo keliya, lagu sawiray cabbirka sharraxaadda, oo loo kooxeeyay takhaasuska. Noocyo waxay sheegaan waxa walaxu ka samaysan yahay: lakabkiisa oo leh dhumucdooda dhabta ah, heerka horumarka (LOD) iyo koodka kala-soocidda. Nooc waxaa lagu daraa mashruuca, ma aha mid la sawiro. Hanti waa shay jireed sida albaabbo, daaqado, alaab, qalab biyo-mareen iyo qalab, oo leh aragta dabaqa iyo jidhka 3D ee cabbirka dhabta ah. Tab-ka Library dooro Library, kadibna isticmaal Nooca walxa si aad u muujiso Wax kasta, Calaamado, Noocyo ama Hanti. Ku dar Nooc mashruucaaga Hoosta Nooca walxa, dooro Noocyo oo fur mid. Hubi qaabkiisa dhismaha, LOD iyo kala-soocidda hoosta sawirka, kadibna guji Add to this project. Waxaa lagu daraa sida darbi, dabaq, saqaf ama tuulan oo aad ku sawiri karto. Haddii nooc magacan leh hore u jiro, kan cusub waxaa lagu daraa sida nuqul, kan hore waa sidiisii. Hal Undo ayaa ka saaraa. Qaababka mashruucyada iyo Quick Kits Guji Kits si aad u aragto waxa dadku wadaageen. Qaab mashruuc waa fayl IFC oo leh dabaqyo, gridyo, noocyo iyo dejin. Save to my templates wuxuu dhigaa New building hoosta Start from. Quick Kit waa liis walxo maktabadda ah. Show the kit's items wuxuu liiskaa u muujiyaa kaararka aad dhigi karto. Qalab kasta wuxuu leeyahay nooc iyo diiwaan isbedel, kan ugu cusub ee ugu horeeya. Nooc ku bilaabma 0 waa mid wadahadal ah; 1.0.0 waa kan keliya milkiilaha silsiladda uu ansixiyay. La wadaag kuwaaga Qaab mashruuc: Save as template, calaamadi Also make a file to share in the Library, ku dar waxa uu ku jiro iyo nooc. Waxaad heleysaa fayl .json. Quick Kit: Kits gudahiis, dooro Samee Quick Kit mashruucan. Waxay liistaa walxaha maktabadda ee mashruucu isticmaalo. Nooc: Type packs gudahiis, calaamadi hal nooc oo dooro Save as a Library item…. Soo rar faylka boggaga soo-rarista maktabadda. Waxa uu ku marayaa isla dib-u-eegis sida walxaha kale, adiguna waxaad dooraysaa liisankiisa halkaas. Walax kasta wuxuu sheegaa liisankiisa. Walxaha waxaa looga baahan yahay LOD, IFC class iyo koodka kala-soocidda (koodka, ma aha magac keliya). Waxyaabo ka timid dhaqanka Boggaga walax kasta oo maktabadda ah, xubnaha la galay waxay ku dari karaan qoraal: la isticmaalay mashruuc dhab ah, la isku dayay mashruuc tusaale ah, ama dhibaato la helay. Sheeg nooca mashruuca erey yar, oo ka reeb magacyada macaamiisha. Qoraalku waa dadweyne, ma aha dib-u-eegis; ma beddelo walxa. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Waxba laguma diro app-ka. Faylasha waxaa lagu sameeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, adiguna waad soo rartaa. Qalab ka samaysan qaab wuxuu qaadaa qoraalka IFC sida loo kaydiyay. Ka hubi wax gaar ah ka hor inta aadan soo rarin. CadCraft wuxuu muujiyaa Calaamado iyo Hanti tab-ka Maktabadda; Noocyada iyo qaababka waa kuwa mashruucyada BimCraft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plan-schedules-and-pdf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Jadwallada, cabbirrada iyo PDF-ka qorshaha","summary":"Jadwallada albaabbada, daaqadaha, darbiyada iyo qolalka oo isbedela markaad rasmeynayso, cabbirrada qorshaha, iyo qorshaha dabaqa oo lagu kaydiyo PDF cabbir caadi ah.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["jadwal","jadwalka albaabka","jadwalka daaqadda","jadwalka darbiga","jadwalka qolka","tiro","takeoff","bed","csv","xaashi xisaab","cabbir","daabac","pdf","plot","miisaan","xaashi","1/4\"","1:50","sheet"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"jadwallada","text":"Jadwallada","level":2},{"id":"bedka-iyo-mugga-lakab-kasta","text":"Bedka iyo mugga lakab kasta","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-cabbiro-bedka","text":"Sida loo cabbiro bedka","level":2},{"id":"dooro-habka-cabbirka","text":"Dooro habka cabbirka","level":2},{"id":"habka-xafiiskaaga","text":"Habka xafiiskaaga","level":3},{"id":"dhagaxa-blocks-iyo-moorta","text":"Dhagaxa, blocks iyo moorta","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada","text":"Cabbirrada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-qorshaha-sida-pdf","text":"Kaydi qorshaha sida PDF","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArag waxa dhismaha aad rasmeysay ku soo dhammaada intaad rasmeynayso: inta albaab iyo daaqad oo cabbir kasta leh, inta darbi oo nooc kasta leh, iyo inta ballaadhan qol kasta. Cabbirrada qorshaha ku dhig oo kaydi PDF si aad u daabacdo ama u dirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwallada\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E la shido, \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E panelka bidix wuxuu muujiyaa hal miis mar kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabbada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E: mid kasta calaamadiisa (D1, D2 … iyo W1 …, sida aad dhigtid), nooceeda, ballaca, dhererka (iyo sill-ka), dabaqa iyo darbiga uu ku jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada sida nooca\u003C/strong\u003E: nooc kasta oo darbi, tirada darbiyada, dhumucdooda, dherer wadar ah iyo bedka dhinaca ah oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EGross area\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDeductions\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENet area\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo wadar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQolalka\u003C/strong\u003E: lambarka, magaca, dabaqa, bedka iyo perimeter-ka, iyo bedka wadar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/strong\u003E: dabaq kasta oo leh heerkiisa, nooceeda iyo dhumucdiisa, iyo bedkiisa gross, deductions iyo net.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirada\u003C/strong\u003E: lakab kasta oo dhamaystir ah oo darbiyada nooceedu leeyihiin (sida agabka iyo dhinaca darbiga) iyo saqafyada, oo leh tirada wejiyada iyo gross, deductions iyo net.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada darbiga: xogta takeoff\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa mar la geliyay nooc kasta oo darbi (unit, moorta, heer), oo leh tirada darbiyada, dhererkooda iyo bedka net, iyo heerka lagu dhuftay qaddarka la cabbiray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EDarbiyada dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirada qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirada darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirada aagga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETirada dhamaystirka\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa qol kasta daboolaya, oo leh bedka, tirada alaabta tiles oo ay ku jiraan gooynta iyo mugga substrate-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-finishes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-finishes\"\u003EDhamaystirada qolalka iyo jadwallada dhamaystirka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta gaarka ah: jadwal aad kooxeysay, wadartay oo magac ku kaydisay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHabaynta, kaydinta iyo u dhoofinta jadwalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaska waxay isbeddelaan tafatir kasta. Guji safka, ama tiro keliya, si aad u doorato elementiyada uu ka yimid. \u003Cstrong\u003EDeji CSV\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska, si aad ugu furto spreadsheet; \u003Cstrong\u003EDeji Excel\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa hoosteeda. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirada qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESpecification\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/specification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/specification\"\u003EQor specification-ka moodelka\u003C/a\u003E) waxay ka furmaan isla meesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bedka-iyo-mugga-lakab-kasta\"\u003EBedka iyo mugga lakab kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELayers: area and volume\u003C/strong\u003E liiska Jadwallada. Waxay leedahay hal safka lakab kasta oo darbi, dabaq, saqaf iyo saqaf-hoosaad oo nooc kasta oo la isticmaalay: elementiga, nooca iyo LOD-kiisa, lakabka (laga tiriyo dhinaca dibadda darbiga, ama sare dabaqa, saqafka), agabkiisa iyo shaqadiisa, dhumucdiisa, inta elementi, \u003Cstrong\u003Enet area\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Evolume\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBedku waa net area ee elementiga nooca sidaas, oo loo cabbiray sida darbiyada sida nooca, Dabaqyada iyo Dhamaystirada, habka cabbirka mashruuca. Saqafka waa la cabbiraa sida dhinac; cabbirka saqafyada ma leh xeer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMugga waa bedkaas oo ku dhufan dhumucda lakabkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaq, saqaf ama saqaf-hoosaad aan nooc lahayn waa hal safka: hal lakab oo dhumucdiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabka hawo-dhexe ah ayaa lagu liistaa bedkiisa oo laga reebay wadarta mugga. Membrane wuxuu leeyahay bed laakiin mug ma lahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji safka si aad u doorato elementiyadiisa. \u003Cstrong\u003EDeji CSV\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-cabbiro-bedka\"\u003ESida loo cabbiro bedka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBedka kasta waa saddex tiro oo isku dara: gross ka dhimma deductions waa net. Xeerka waxa lagu qoray miis kasta oo sare, waana hal xeer: jadwallada, tirooyinka lagu kaydiyay faylka IFC iyo takeoff-ka loo diro TakeoffCraft oo dhammaantood isticmaalaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbi\u003C/strong\u003E: gross waa hal dhinac oo darbiga ah, dherer ahaan oo dhexe ka dhigan dhererka dhexe ee darbiga oo ku dhufan dhererkiisa (darbiga leh qaab sare ama hoose oo gaar ah, dhulka dhabta ah). Albaab, daaqad iyo furaha kale ee kasta waa la dhimayaa, ballac ku dhufan dhererka, furaha kasta mar keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaq ama saqaf\u003C/strong\u003E: gross waa bedka gudaha xuduuddiisa. Furaha kasta iyo jarista gudaha ayaa mar keliya la dhimayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: lakab kasta oo dhamaystir ah oo nooca darbiga leeyahay wuxuu daboolaa hal wejiga darbiga, oo lagu cabbiro sida darbiga, iyadoo furaha la dhimayo isla sidaas. Dhamaystirku waa lakab darbiga ka mid ah: waxa lagu liistaa hoosta Dhamaystirada wuxuuna aan lagu darin bedka darbiga, sidaas darteed darbi leh albaab marna lagama tiriyo laba jeer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaasi waa \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft default\u003C/strong\u003E: furaha kasta waa la dhimayaa, cabbirkiisa ha ahaado wax kasta; dhererka darbiga waa dhererka dhexe; reveals-ka lama cabbirro. Waa wixii kasta oo mashruuc kasta isticmaalo ilaa aad doorato habka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-habka-cabbirka\"\u003EDooro habka cabbirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare jadwalka, \u003Cstrong\u003EHabka cabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa hababka ku jira BimCraft, \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo rar fayl habka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa kan xafiiskaaga. Doorashada waa la kaydiyaa faylka IFC, hal tallaabo oo undo ah, saddex waxyaalood ayay isla markiiba raacaan: jadwallada, tirooyinka net ee lagu kaydiyay faylka, iyo takeoff-ka loo diro TakeoffCraft. Xeerka sare miis kasta wuxuu markaas ku bilaabmaa habka, isha, taariikhda uu isha la akhriyay iyo erayada \u003Cstrong\u003EUnchecked by a quantity surveyor\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabku waa fayl yar oo xog ah, ma aha code barnaamij. Tirada kasta wuxuu sheegaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Efuraha ugu yar ee la dhimo\u003C/strong\u003E: tusaale ahaan, furaha 0.5 m² ama ka yar wuxuu ku jiraa bedka darbiga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esida loo cabbiro isgoysyada darbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E: dhexe oo ah dhererka bartamaha; ama darbi ku dhammaada darbi kale oo loo cabbiro ilaa wejiga darbigaas; ama darbiga kasta oo ku kulma darbi kale oo loo cabbiro dhinaca dhow;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ehaddii reveals-ka la cabbiro\u003C/strong\u003E dhamaystirka (soo laabashada dhamaystirka furaha gudihiisa), oo bedka ama, marka uu hooseeyo, dherer ahaan. Qoto dheerida reveal-ka waxa loo qaataa nus dhumucda darbiga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ewaxa uu ku yidhi dhisme dhagaxa\u003C/strong\u003E: sida loo cabbiro, iyo wixii qiyaas qalalan ama mooraar uu sheego.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHababka uu BimCraft leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDarbiyada: furaha ugu yar ee la dhimo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhamaystirada darbiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESaqafyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhagaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft default\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ejarista kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema leh qiyaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERICS NRM 2 (Boqortooyada Ingiriiska), 2nd edition 2021\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebedka; boqolleyda lama sheegin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAAQS Standard Method for Africa 2015\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebedka; net la cabbiray, 0% waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIS 1200 (Hindiya), 1976, brickwork\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edefault (eeg hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edefault\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBIA Technical Note 10 (Maraykanka), 2009\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edefault\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edefault\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5% waste unitiyada, 15% moorta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhri xaddaddaan ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan habka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro xisaabiye tirada qaadiyaa oo hubiyay mid kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Mid kasta waxa lagu sameeyay akhrinta ilaha la magacaabay oo tirooyinkiisa waxa lagu duubay qodobka ka yimid. Haddii aad tahay xisaabiye tirada qaadiya oo hubin karta mid, ilaa dhammaadka app-ka waa la jeclaan lahaa inaad nala soo xidhiidho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHalka xeerka aan laga akhrin karin ilaha, habku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003Enot confirmed\u003C/strong\u003E oo wuxuu isticmaalaa CadCraft default. Habka BimCraft ku jira ma leh xeer la xaqiijiyay isgoysyada darbiyada, reveals-ka ama dabaqyada, sidaas darteed waxa loo cabbiraa si default ah habkasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIS 1200 wuxuu dhimaa furaha ku jira plaster-ka saddex heer. Faylka habka weli ma qaadi karo heerar, sidaas darteed dhamaystirada darbiga waxay isticmaalaan default habkaas hoos, xeerkuna wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka Cabbirka Shaqada Dhismaha ee Koonfur Afrika \u003Cstrong\u003Ema\u003C/strong\u003E ku jirto: qoraalkeeda lama akhriyi karin. Habka AAQS ee Afrika wuxuu sheegaa inuu ku saleysan yahay tafatirka 1991 ee nidaamkaas, laakiin waa dukumeen kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBIA Technical Note 10 waa warqad qiyaas warshad, ma aha habka caadiga ah ee cabbirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuraha ah cabbirka ugu yar ee saxda ah wuxuu raacaa erayada habka (&quot;not exceeding&quot;, &quot;less than&quot;). Cabbirrada ku dhow 2 qayb 10 000 ee saxda ah waxay ka mid yihiin saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabka hoostiisa, bedka net ee darbiga iyo bedka net ee dabaqa ama saqafka faylka waxay raacaan habka, magaca habka ayaa lagu qoraa jadwalka. Bedka gross iyo mugga faylka waxay sidii ay u muuqdaan u sii jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraallada habkan\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ku hoos doorashada, waxay sheegaan wixii ilaha kastaa uu furan yahay. \u003Cstrong\u003EFur ilaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u gudbiyaa dukumeentiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"habka-xafiiskaaga\"\u003EHabka xafiiskaaga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka habka waa JSON oo qaabkiisu yahay \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-measurement-method\u003C/code\u003E. Qiime kasta oo ku jira wuxuu magacaabaa qodobka uu ka yimid; qiime aan qodob lahayn waa la diidaa. Faylka waa la hubiyaa marka la soo rarayo, khaladka dhab ah ayaa la magacaabaa, wax aan ka soo baxin faylka aan gudbin ma la isticmaalo. Marka la doorto, faylka waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha mashruuca, sidaas darteed mashruucu wuxuu u furmaa isla sidaas kombuyuutar kale. ID-kiisu waa magac gaar ah oo adiga kuu gaar ah (ma noqon karo ID-ga habka app-ka ku jira).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhagaxa-blocks-iyo-moorta\"\u003EDhagaxa, blocks iyo moorta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada darbiga: xogta takeoff\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa unitiyada iyo moorta nooc kasta oo darbi oo unitigiisu leeyahay dherer iyo dhererka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies#give-a-type-its-takeoff-data\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-hash=\"give-a-type-its-takeoff-data\"\u003EKu sii xogta takeoff nooc\u003C/a\u003E). Kuwanu waa qaababka xisaabta, sidii la xisaabiyay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada bedka hal leaf\u003C/strong\u003E = 1 / ((dhererka unitiga + joint) × (dhererka unitiga + joint)). Dhagax 215 × 65 mm oo leh joint 10 mm: 1 / (225 × 75 mm) = 59.26 m² kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada ballaca leaf-ka dhexdiisa\u003C/strong\u003E = (dhumucda leaf-ka + joint) / (ballaca unitiga + joint), oo la wareejiyay tiro oo dhan, ugu yaraan 1. Leaf 102.5 mm ah oo leh dhagax 102.5 mm waa 1; darbi 215 mm ah oo leh isla dhagaxa waa 2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada\u003C/strong\u003E = unitiyada bedka × unitiyada ballaca × bedka net ee wejiga darbiga, oo lagu daray leaf-yada dhoobada nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada la dalbo\u003C/strong\u003E = unitiyada × (1 + waste % / 100), oo la kor u qaadaa unit oo dhan. Waste-ka waa midka lagu galay nooca; haddii aan la galin, waa midka habka haddii uu sheego; haddii kale 0%.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoorta\u003C/strong\u003E = bedka net × dhumucda leaf-ka, oo laga jaro mugga unitiyada (unitiyada × dherer × dhererka × ballac), kadibna lagu daro boqolleyda dheeraadka ah ee lagu galay nooca ee frogs ama perforations, kadibna lagu daro qiyaaska habka haddii uu sheego. Waxay u baahan tahay ballaca unitiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa la qaatay: leaf kasta oo dhagax ah ee nooc wuxuu ka samaysan yahay unitiga keliya ee nooca; leaf ka weyn hal ballac unitiga waxa loo tiriyaa tiro ballacyo unitiga, mid kastaa sida leaf jiifa; sidaas darteed unitiyada jaraan, cutyada iyo qaabab gaar ah lama tirin kala gooya. Halka aan lakab la calaamadin inuu ka samaysan yahay unitiga, lakabyada dhexe waxa loo qaataa leaf-yada, qoraalka sare shaxda ayaa sidaas sheegaya. \u003Cstrong\u003EAmount\u003C/strong\u003E waa qiimaha iyo waxa uu qiimaha ku saleysan yahay, oo hadda waxa uu noqon karaa unitiga la dalbo, 1000 unit la dalbo ama m³ moorta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha waa \u003Cstrong\u003Etag\u003C/strong\u003E IFC-ga elementiga: beddel mid \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E (Tag) oo jadwalku wuu raacaa. Moodel IFC kasta, la rasmeeyay ama aan la rasmeyn, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EIsku dar tirooyinka, liiska elementiyada iyo jadwalka meelaha\u003C/a\u003E ayaa isku dara sifo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa dherer kasta oo darbi la rasmeeyay dhinaca dibadda (darbi gudaha ah: hal dhinac) iyo, darbiga leh albaab ama daaqad, silsilad ka bilaabanta geeska ilaa furaha kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qarsadaa oo mar kale muujiyaa qaybta moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-qorshaha-sida-pdf\"\u003EKaydi qorshaha sida PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji dabaqa aad rabto oo deji unitiyada panelka \u003Cstrong\u003ELevels\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaabac\u003C/span\u003E qalabka moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa &quot;&lt;file&gt; — &lt;level&gt;.pdf&quot;: qorshaha madow iyo cad, cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee bogga ku dhex mushaaxaysa (1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;, 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; … Letter oo feet iyo inch, 1:50, 1:100 … A4 oo millimitir), darbiyada buuxsan, albaabbada, daaqadaha, magacyada qolalka iyo bedadkooda, cabbirrada, iyo xarig cinwaan oo leh dabaqa, faylka, heerka goynta, taariikhda iyo cabbirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF-ka waxa loo rasmeeyaa xariiqyo iyo qoraal, sidaas darteed wuu cad yahay cabbir kasta, qoraalkeeduna waa la baari karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJadwallada waxay tirinayaan waxa qalabyada rasmeynta samaysay. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha qalab kale laga soo qaatay waxay ka muuqdaan Quantity totals halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad shaqada u qiimaysid, tirooyinka u dir TakeoffCraft: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/takeoff\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/takeoff\"\u003ETirooyinka TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E. Downloadka CSV wuxuu ku sii jiraa spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Arag waxa dhismaha aad rasmeysay ku soo dhammaada intaad rasmeynayso: inta albaab iyo daaqad oo cabbir kasta leh, inta darbi oo nooc kasta leh, iyo inta ballaadhan qol kasta. Cabbirrada qorshaha ku dhig oo kaydi PDF si aad u daabacdo ama u dirto. Jadwallada Marka Sawir la shido, Jadwallada panelka bidix wuxuu muujiyaa hal miis mar kasta: Albaabbada iyo Daaqadaha: mid kasta calaamadiisa (D1, D2 … iyo W1 …, sida aad dhigtid), nooceeda, ballaca, dhererka (iyo sill-ka), dabaqa iyo darbiga uu ku jiro. Darbiyada sida nooca: nooc kasta oo darbi, tirada darbiyada, dhumucdooda, dherer wadar ah iyo bedka dhinaca ah oo ah Gross area, Deductions iyo Net area, iyo wadar. Qolalka: lambarka, magaca, dabaqa, bedka iyo perimeter-ka, iyo bedka wadar ah. Dabaqyada: dabaq kasta oo leh heerkiisa, nooceeda iyo dhumucdiisa, iyo bedkiisa gross, deductions iyo net. Dhamaystirada: lakab kasta oo dhamaystir ah oo darbiyada nooceedu leeyihiin (sida agabka iyo dhinaca darbiga) iyo saqafyada, oo leh tirada wejiyada iyo gross, deductions iyo net. Noocyada darbiga: xogta takeoff: waxa mar la geliyay nooc kasta oo darbi (unit, moorta, heer), oo leh tirada darbiyada, dhererkooda iyo bedka net, iyo heerka lagu dhuftay qaddarka la cabbiray. Eeg Darbiyada dhismaha. Dhamaystirada qolalka, Dhamaystirada darbiga, Dhamaystirada aagga iyo Tirada dhamaystirka: waxa qol kasta daboolaya, oo leh bedka, tirada alaabta tiles oo ay ku jiraan gooynta iyo mugga substrate-ka. Eeg Dhamaystirada qolalka iyo jadwallada dhamaystirka. Habaynta gaarka ah: jadwal aad kooxeysay, wadartay oo magac ku kaydisay. Eeg Habaynta, kaydinta iyo u dhoofinta jadwalka. Miisaska waxay isbeddelaan tafatir kasta. Guji safka, ama tiro keliya, si aad u doorato elementiyada uu ka yimid. Deji CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska, si aad ugu furto spreadsheet; Deji Excel iyo Koobiyee Google Sheets ayaa hoosteeda. Dhamaystirada qolalka iyo Specification (Qor specification-ka moodelka) waxay ka furmaan isla meesha. Bedka iyo mugga lakab kasta Dooro Layers: area and volume liiska Jadwallada. Waxay leedahay hal safka lakab kasta oo darbi, dabaq, saqaf iyo saqaf-hoosaad oo nooc kasta oo la isticmaalay: elementiga, nooca iyo LOD-kiisa, lakabka (laga tiriyo dhinaca dibadda darbiga, ama sare dabaqa, saqafka), agabkiisa iyo shaqadiisa, dhumucdiisa, inta elementi, net area iyo volume. Bedku waa net area ee elementiga nooca sidaas, oo loo cabbiray sida darbiyada sida nooca, Dabaqyada iyo Dhamaystirada, habka cabbirka mashruuca. Saqafka waa la cabbiraa sida dhinac; cabbirka saqafyada ma leh xeer. Mugga waa bedkaas oo ku dhufan dhumucda lakabkiisa. Dabaq, saqaf ama saqaf-hoosaad aan nooc lahayn waa hal safka: hal lakab oo dhumucdiisa. Lakabka hawo-dhexe ah ayaa lagu liistaa bedkiisa oo laga reebay wadarta mugga. Membrane wuxuu leeyahay bed laakiin mug ma lahan. Guji safka si aad u doorato elementiyadiisa. Deji CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska. Sida loo cabbiro bedka Bedka kasta waa saddex tiro oo isku dara: gross ka dhimma deductions waa net. Xeerka waxa lagu qoray miis kasta oo sare, waana hal xeer: jadwallada, tirooyinka lagu kaydiyay faylka IFC iyo takeoff-ka loo diro TakeoffCraft oo dhammaantood isticmaalaan. Darbi: gross waa hal dhinac oo darbiga ah, dherer ahaan oo dhexe ka dhigan dhererka dhexe ee darbiga oo ku dhufan dhererkiisa (darbiga leh qaab sare ama hoose oo gaar ah, dhulka dhabta ah). Albaab, daaqad iyo furaha kale ee kasta waa la dhimayaa, ballac ku dhufan dhererka, furaha kasta mar keliya. Dabaq ama saqaf: gross waa bedka gudaha xuduuddiisa. Furaha kasta iyo jarista gudaha ayaa mar keliya la dhimayaa. Dhamaystirka darbiga: lakab kasta oo dhamaystir ah oo nooca darbiga leeyahay wuxuu daboolaa hal wejiga darbiga, oo lagu cabbiro sida darbiga, iyadoo furaha la dhimayo isla sidaas. Dhamaystirku waa lakab darbiga ka mid ah: waxa lagu liistaa hoosta Dhamaystirada wuxuuna aan lagu darin bedka darbiga, sidaas darteed darbi leh albaab marna lagama tiriyo laba jeer. Taasi waa CadCraft default: furaha kasta waa la dhimayaa, cabbirkiisa ha ahaado wax kasta; dhererka darbiga waa dhererka dhexe; reveals-ka lama cabbirro. Waa wixii kasta oo mashruuc kasta isticmaalo ilaa aad doorato habka kale. Dooro habka cabbirka Sare jadwalka, Habka cabbirka wuxuu liistaa hababka ku jira BimCraft, Soo rar fayl habka wuxuu qaadaa kan xafiiskaaga. Doorashada waa la kaydiyaa faylka IFC, hal tallaabo oo undo ah, saddex waxyaalood ayay isla markiiba raacaan: jadwallada, tirooyinka net ee lagu kaydiyay faylka, iyo takeoff-ka loo diro TakeoffCraft. Xeerka sare miis kasta wuxuu markaas ku bilaabmaa habka, isha, taariikhda uu isha la akhriyay iyo erayada Unchecked by a quantity surveyor. Habku waa fayl yar oo xog ah, ma aha code barnaamij. Tirada kasta wuxuu sheegaa: furaha ugu yar ee la dhimo: tusaale ahaan, furaha 0.5 m² ama ka yar wuxuu ku jiraa bedka darbiga; sida loo cabbiro isgoysyada darbiyada: dhexe oo ah dhererka bartamaha; ama darbi ku dhammaada darbi kale oo loo cabbiro ilaa wejiga darbigaas; ama darbiga kasta oo ku kulma darbi kale oo loo cabbiro dhinaca dhow; haddii reveals-ka la cabbiro dhamaystirka (soo laabashada dhamaystirka furaha gudihiisa), oo bedka ama, marka uu hooseeyo, dherer ahaan. Qoto dheerida reveal-ka waxa loo qaataa nus dhumucda darbiga; waxa uu ku yidhi dhisme dhagaxa: sida loo cabbiro, iyo wixii qiyaas qalalan ama mooraar uu sheego. Hababka uu BimCraft leeyahay: Habka Darbiyada: furaha ugu yar ee la dhimo Dhamaystirada darbiga Saqafyada Dhagaxa CadCraft default furaha kasta furaha kasta jarista kasta ma leh qiyaas RICS NRM 2 (Boqortooyada Ingiriiska), 2nd edition 2021 0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta 1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta 1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta bedka; boqolleyda lama sheegin AAQS Standard Method for Africa 2015 0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta 0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta 0.5 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta bedka; net la cabbiray, 0% waste IS 1200 (Hindiya), 1976, brickwork 0.1 m² ama ka yar ayaa ku jirta default (eeg hoos) default mugga BIA Technical Note 10 (Maraykanka), 2009 furaha kasta default default 5% waste unitiyada, 15% moorta Akhri xaddaddaan ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan habka: Ma jiro xisaabiye tirada qaadiyaa oo hubiyay mid kasta. Mid kasta waxa lagu sameeyay akhrinta ilaha la magacaabay oo tirooyinkiisa waxa lagu duubay qodobka ka yimid. Haddii aad tahay xisaabiye tirada qaadiya oo hubin karta mid, ilaa dhammaadka app-ka waa la jeclaan lahaa inaad nala soo xidhiidho. Halka xeerka aan laga akhrin karin ilaha, habku wuxuu leeyahay not confirmed oo wuxuu isticmaalaa CadCraft default. Habka BimCraft ku jira ma leh xeer la xaqiijiyay isgoysyada darbiyada, reveals-ka ama dabaqyada, sidaas darteed waxa loo cabbiraa si default ah habkasta. IS 1200 wuxuu dhimaa furaha ku jira plaster-ka saddex heer. Faylka habka weli ma qaadi karo heerar, sidaas darteed dhamaystirada darbiga waxay isticmaalaan default habkaas hoos, xeerkuna wuu sheegaa. Qaabka Cabbirka Shaqada Dhismaha ee Koonfur Afrika ma ku jirto: qoraalkeeda lama akhriyi karin. Habka AAQS ee Afrika wuxuu sheegaa inuu ku saleysan yahay tafatirka 1991 ee nidaamkaas, laakiin waa dukumeen kale. BIA Technical Note 10 waa warqad qiyaas warshad, ma aha habka caadiga ah ee cabbirka. Furaha ah cabbirka ugu yar ee saxda ah wuxuu raacaa erayada habka (\"not exceeding\", \"less than\"). Cabbirrada ku dhow 2 qayb 10 000 ee saxda ah waxay ka mid yihiin saxda ah. Habka hoostiisa, bedka net ee darbiga iyo bedka net ee dabaqa ama saqafka faylka waxay raacaan habka, magaca habka ayaa lagu qoraa jadwalka. Bedka gross iyo mugga faylka waxay sidii ay u muuqdaan u sii jiraan. Qoraallada habkan, oo ku hoos doorashada, waxay sheegaan wixii ilaha kastaa uu furan yahay. Fur ilaha wuxuu u gudbiyaa dukumeentiga. Habka xafiiskaaga Faylka habka waa JSON oo qaabkiisu yahay cadcraft-measurement-method. Qiime kasta oo ku jira wuxuu magacaabaa qodobka uu ka yimid; qiime aan qodob lahayn waa la diidaa. Faylka waa la hubiyaa marka la soo rarayo, khaladka dhab ah ayaa la magacaabaa, wax aan ka soo baxin faylka aan gudbin ma la isticmaalo. Marka la doorto, faylka waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha mashruuca, sidaas darteed mashruucu wuxuu u furmaa isla sidaas kombuyuutar kale. ID-kiisu waa magac gaar ah oo adiga kuu gaar ah (ma noqon karo ID-ga habka app-ka ku jira). Dhagaxa, blocks iyo moorta Noocyada darbiga: xogta takeoff wuxuu tiriyaa unitiyada iyo moorta nooc kasta oo darbi oo unitigiisu leeyahay dherer iyo dhererka (eeg Ku sii xogta takeoff nooc). Kuwanu waa qaababka xisaabta, sidii la xisaabiyay: Unitiyada bedka hal leaf = 1 / ((dhererka unitiga + joint) × (dhererka unitiga + joint)). Dhagax 215 × 65 mm oo leh joint 10 mm: 1 / (225 × 75 mm) = 59.26 m² kasta. Unitiyada ballaca leaf-ka dhexdiisa = (dhumucda leaf-ka + joint) / (ballaca unitiga + joint), oo la wareejiyay tiro oo dhan, ugu yaraan 1. Leaf 102.5 mm ah oo leh dhagax 102.5 mm waa 1; darbi 215 mm ah oo leh isla dhagaxa waa 2. Unitiyada = unitiyada bedka × unitiyada ballaca × bedka net ee wejiga darbiga, oo lagu daray leaf-yada dhoobada nooca. Unitiyada la dalbo = unitiyada × (1 + waste % / 100), oo la kor u qaadaa unit oo dhan. Waste-ka waa midka lagu galay nooca; haddii aan la galin, waa midka habka haddii uu sheego; haddii kale 0%. Moorta = bedka net × dhumucda leaf-ka, oo laga jaro mugga unitiyada (unitiyada × dherer × dhererka × ballac), kadibna lagu daro boqolleyda dheeraadka ah ee lagu galay nooca ee frogs ama perforations, kadibna lagu daro qiyaaska habka haddii uu sheego. Waxay u baahan tahay ballaca unitiga. Waxa la qaatay: leaf kasta oo dhagax ah ee nooc wuxuu ka samaysan yahay unitiga keliya ee nooca; leaf ka weyn hal ballac unitiga waxa loo tiriyaa tiro ballacyo unitiga, mid kastaa sida leaf jiifa; sidaas darteed unitiyada jaraan, cutyada iyo qaabab gaar ah lama tirin kala gooya. Halka aan lakab la calaamadin inuu ka samaysan yahay unitiga, lakabyada dhexe waxa loo qaataa leaf-yada, qoraalka sare shaxda ayaa sidaas sheegaya. Amount waa qiimaha iyo waxa uu qiimaha ku saleysan yahay, oo hadda waxa uu noqon karaa unitiga la dalbo, 1000 unit la dalbo ama m³ moorta. Calaamadaha waa tag IFC-ga elementiga: beddel mid Properties (Tag) oo jadwalku wuu raacaa. Moodel IFC kasta, la rasmeeyay ama aan la rasmeyn, Isku dar tirooyinka, liiska elementiyada iyo jadwalka meelaha ayaa isku dara sifo kasta. Cabbirrada Qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa dherer kasta oo darbi la rasmeeyay dhinaca dibadda (darbi gudaha ah: hal dhinac) iyo, darbiga leh albaab ama daaqad, silsilad ka bilaabanta geeska ilaa furaha kasta. Cabbirrada wuxuu qarsadaa oo mar kale muujiyaa qaybta moodelka. Kaydi qorshaha sida PDF Muuji dabaqa aad rabto oo deji unitiyada panelka Levels. Guji Daabac qalabka moodelka. BimCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa \"\u003Cfile\u003E — \u003Clevel\u003E.pdf\": qorshaha madow iyo cad, cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee bogga ku dhex mushaaxaysa (1/4\" = 1'-0\", 1/8\" = 1'-0\" … Letter oo feet iyo inch, 1:50, 1:100 … A4 oo millimitir), darbiyada buuxsan, albaabbada, daaqadaha, magacyada qolalka iyo bedadkooda, cabbirrada, iyo xarig cinwaan oo leh dabaqa, faylka, heerka goynta, taariikhda iyo cabbirka. PDF-ka waxa loo rasmeeyaa xariiqyo iyo qoraal, sidaas darteed wuu cad yahay cabbir kasta, qoraalkeeduna waa la baari karaa. Waxa muhiim ah Jadwallada waxay tirinayaan waxa qalabyada rasmeynta samaysay. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha qalab kale laga soo qaatay waxay ka muuqdaan Quantity totals halkii. Si aad shaqada u qiimaysid, tirooyinka u dir TakeoffCraft: eeg Tirooyinka TakeoffCraft. Downloadka CSV wuxuu ku sii jiraa spreadsheet.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"storeys-and-spaces","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuji oo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo xuduudaha","summary":"Dabaqyada demi si aad u aragto gudaha dhismaha, muuji qolalka iyo meelaha, oo dami ama fur xariiqyada xuduudaha.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["storeys","levels","floors","hide","isolate","rooms","spaces","ifcspace","edges","visibility","section","dabaqyada","heerarka","dabqyo","qari","qolalka","meelaha","xuduudaha","muuqaal","goyn"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-eeg-hal-dabaq","text":"Tillaabooyinka: eeg hal dabaq","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-muuji-qolalka-iyo-meelaha","text":"Tillaabooyinka: muuji qolalka iyo meelaha","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-xuduudaha","text":"Tillaabooyinka: xuduudaha","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha moodel IFC ka eeg adigoo demaya dabaqyada ka sarreeya dabaqa aad doonayso, kadibna muuji qolalka iyo meelaha, oo dami xariiqyada xuduudaha si aad muuqaal nadiifa u hesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-eeg-hal-dabaq\"\u003ETillaabooyinka: eeg hal dabaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EOpen an IFC model and look around in 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStoreys\u003C/span\u003E ee bidix. Dabaqa ugu sarreeya ayaa ugu horreeya, sida goyn la akhrinayo saqafka ka hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar calaamadda saqafka iyo dabaq kasta oo ka sarreeya dabaqa aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu eegto dabaqa hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib ugu calaamadee dabaqyada si aad dib ugu soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDabaq kasta oo aad ka saartay calaamadda ayaa isla markiiba meesha ka baxa, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira. Liiska wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya dabaqyada ku jira wax muuqda. Walxaha aan loo magac-dhigin dabaq ayaa lagu kooxeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro dabaq\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta; walxaha dhulka iyo qalab yar ayaa inta badan halkaas ku dhacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-muuji-qolalka-iyo-meelaha\"\u003ETillaabooyinka: muuji qolalka iyo meelaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E ku jira qalabka sare ee moodelka. Badhanku wuu jiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg moodelka: qolalka iyo meelaha waxay u muuqdaan mugga cadaan ah ee aan ka dhalaalin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meel si aad u akhrido sifooyinkeeda, sida magaceeda, lambarkeeda iyo balaadhkeeda, oo ku taal midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E si aad u qariso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeelaha waxaa la qariyaa markii moodelku furmo, maxaa yeelay haddii kale waxay daboli lahaayeen darbiyada iyo sagxadaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-xuduudaha\"\u003ETillaabooyinka: xuduudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdges\u003C/span\u003E si aad u damiso xariiqyada xuduudaha khafiifka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale riix si aad u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelada aad u waaweyn (ka badan 1.5 milyan xagal saddex-geesood) badhanka ayaa la xannibay oo talo ahaan waxa lagu qoray &quot;Edges are off for very large models&quot;. Tani waxay keydisaa xusuusta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda dabaq ka saartay oo wali qaybo ka mid ah aad aragto.\u003C/strong\u003E Walxaha waxay ku jiraan dabaqa uu u bixiyay barnaamijka soo dhoofinta. Darbi dheer ama jaranjar inta badan wuxuu ku jiraa oo keliya dabaqa saldhigga, sidaas darteed wuu sii jiraa marka dabaqa kor laga qariyo, ama wuu baaba&#039;aa marka dabaqa hoose la qariyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyada oo la qarinayo si aad gudaha u aragto.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqa qaybta ayaa inta badan ka dhakhso badan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane#a-section-box\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\" data-hash=\"a-section-box\"\u003ECut an IFC model with a section plane\u003C/a\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale ka saari kartaa safafka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel tree\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EFind your way with the model tree\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiixida meel ka mid ah darbiga dhinaciisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Riixidu waxay doorataa sathta muuqda ee ugu dhow. Qari dabaqa kor ku xiga, ama u beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagacyada dabaqyada oo u muuqda kuwo cajiib ah.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa magacyada dabaqyada ee faylka ku kaydsan. Haddii ay leeyihiin &quot;Level 1&quot; ama lambar, taas ayaa soo dhoofiyaha qoray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Gudaha moodel IFC ka eeg adigoo demaya dabaqyada ka sarreeya dabaqa aad doonayso, kadibna muuji qolalka iyo meelaha, oo dami xariiqyada xuduudaha si aad muuqaal nadiifa u hesho. Tillaabooyinka: eeg hal dabaq Fur moodel IFC. Eeg Open an IFC model and look around in 3D. Hel liiska Storeys ee bidix. Dabaqa ugu sarreeya ayaa ugu horreeya, sida goyn la akhrinayo saqafka ka hoos. Ka saar calaamadda saqafka iyo dabaq kasta oo ka sarreeya dabaqa aad rabto. Riix Top si aad ugu eegto dabaqa hoose. Dib ugu calaamadee dabaqyada si aad dib ugu soo celiso. Waxa aad arki lahayd Dabaq kasta oo aad ka saartay calaamadda ayaa isla markiiba meesha ka baxa, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira. Liiska wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya dabaqyada ku jira wax muuqda. Walxaha aan loo magac-dhigin dabaq ayaa lagu kooxeeyaa Ma jiro dabaq hoosta; walxaha dhulka iyo qalab yar ayaa inta badan halkaas ku dhacaan. Tillaabooyinka: muuji qolalka iyo meelaha Riix Spaces ku jira qalabka sare ee moodelka. Badhanku wuu jiraa. Eeg moodelka: qolalka iyo meelaha waxay u muuqdaan mugga cadaan ah ee aan ka dhalaalin. Riix meel si aad u akhrido sifooyinkeeda, sida magaceeda, lambarkeeda iyo balaadhkeeda, oo ku taal midig. Mar kale riix Spaces si aad u qariso. Meelaha waxaa la qariyaa markii moodelku furmo, maxaa yeelay haddii kale waxay daboli lahaayeen darbiyada iyo sagxadaha. Tillaabooyinka: xuduudaha Riix Edges si aad u damiso xariiqyada xuduudaha khafiifka ah. Mar kale riix si aad u soo celiso. Moodelada aad u waaweyn (ka badan 1.5 milyan xagal saddex-geesood) badhanka ayaa la xannibay oo talo ahaan waxa lagu qoray \"Edges are off for very large models\". Tani waxay keydisaa xusuusta. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Calaamadda dabaq ka saartay oo wali qaybo ka mid ah aad aragto. Walxaha waxay ku jiraan dabaqa uu u bixiyay barnaamijka soo dhoofinta. Darbi dheer ama jaranjar inta badan wuxuu ku jiraa oo keliya dabaqa saldhigga, sidaas darteed wuu sii jiraa marka dabaqa kor laga qariyo, ama wuu baaba'aa marka dabaqa hoose la qariyo. Dabaqyada oo la qarinayo si aad gudaha u aragto. Sanduuqa qaybta ayaa inta badan ka dhakhso badan: eeg Cut an IFC model with a section plane. Waxaad sidoo kale ka saari kartaa safafka Model tree (eeg Find your way with the model tree). Riixida meel ka mid ah darbiga dhinaciisa. Riixidu waxay doorataa sathta muuqda ee ugu dhow. Qari dabaqa kor ku xiga, ama u beddel Top, kadibna riix. Magacyada dabaqyada oo u muuqda kuwo cajiib ah. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa magacyada dabaqyada ee faylka ku kaydsan. Haddii ay leeyihiin \"Level 1\" ama lambar, taas ayaa soo dhoofiyaha qoray.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"roofs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Saqafyada, xagal darbi kasta, gable-yo, sheedyo iyo dusha saqafka","summary":"Darbi kasta oo saqaf hoostiisa ku jira u dhig pitched, gable end ama midna, isticmaal preset-yada hip, gable iyo sheed, saqafka ku kor qaad plate height, ku dar fascia iyo soffit, oo sawir dusha saqafka kal-kal marka saqafka otomaatiga ahi ku habboon weyn.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["beddel saqaf","wax ka beddel saqaf","saqafka la doortay","dhiman","darbi kasta","gable","gable end","sheed","lean-to","hip","valley","ridge","plate height","heel","fascia","soffit","eave","rake","overhang","dusha saqafka","saqaf barxad","dormer","gable dormer","shed dormer"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-sameyn-doonto","text":"Waxa aad sameyn doonto","level":2},{"id":"saqaf-ku-dheji","text":"Saqaf ku dheji","level":2},{"id":"darbi-mar-mid","text":"Darbi mar mid","level":2},{"id":"saqaf-aad-horay-u-dhigtay-beddel","text":"Saqaf aad horay u dhigtay beddel","level":2},{"id":"plate-height-fascia-iyo-soffit","text":"Plate height, fascia iyo soffit","level":2},{"id":"dusha-saqafka-sawir","text":"Dusha saqafka sawir","level":2},{"id":"dormer-ku-dar","text":"Dormer ku dar","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-kaydiyo","text":"Waxa la kaydiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-sameyn-doonto\"\u003EWaxa aad sameyn doonto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaqafka qaabeey darbiyada hoostiisa. Darbi kasta wuxuu leeyahay dejintiisa, si hal saqaf uu hip ugu sameeyo hore, gable-yo dhamaadka, oo uu ku istaago siman darbi dheer oo dabada ku yaal. Barxad ama dhul saqafka otomaatiga ahi ma samayn karin, dusha saqaf waxaad geesaha ku sawirtaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqaf-ku-dheji\"\u003ESaqaf ku dheji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqa darbiyada saqafka leh, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaqaf\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003EDhiman\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E, ama darajo sida \u003Ccode\u003E30\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhaadhac\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro preset: \u003Cstrong\u003ESaqaf xagaleyn\u003C/strong\u003E (Hip roof), \u003Cstrong\u003EGable dhinacyada gaaban\u003C/strong\u003E (Gables on the short sides), \u003Cstrong\u003EGable dhinacyada dheer\u003C/strong\u003E (Gables on the long sides), ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESheed\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca u dhow cursor-ka waa geesta hoose; dhinacyada kale waa dhamaadka gable).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hoo \u003Cstrong\u003EFascia iyo soffit\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad rabto geesaha sanduuq ah oo leh loox fascia, ama ka saar haddii aad rabto geesaha saqafka oo furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha dhismaha dhex-gali: geesta hoose (eave), ridge, hips iyo valleys waxay muuqdaan qorshaha. Guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab kasta oo ah waa shaqeeya: L, T, U iyo calaamadda plus, geesaha xagal leh iyo godad. Hips, ridges iyo valleys waxay ka helaan meelaha dusha saqafka isku kulmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darbi-mar-mid\"\u003EDarbi mar mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro saqafka (dabaqa ka sarreeya darbiyada, guji gudaha qaabkiisa) oo eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EEach wall\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E hoostiisa. Cursor-ka oo ka taagto safka wuxuu calaamadiyaa darbigaas qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPitched\u003C/strong\u003E: darbigu wuxuu leeyahay dusha saqaf dhiman oo ka dul sii jirta. Ku qor dhimankiisa kor kiisa, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E12/12\u003C/code\u003E dhamaadyada adag ee saqaf \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGable end\u003C/strong\u003E: saqafku wuxuu ku istaagaa dhamaad toosan oo ka dul darbiga, darbigana waa la buuxiyaa ilaa saqafka, saqafkuna wuxuu ka dhaafaa \u003Cstrong\u003EGable overhang\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENone (stops flush)\u003C/strong\u003E: saqafku wuxuu darbigaas ku dhammaadaa gees dheer ama darbi gable ah la&#039;aan, waana darbi dheer oo saqaf ku dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EEnds\u003C/strong\u003E ee sare wuxuu dejiyaa darbi kasta isla mar; \u003Cstrong\u003ESet per wall\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa muuqda marka darbiyadu aanay u mid ahayn preset-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqaf-aad-horay-u-dhigtay-beddel\"\u003ESaqaf aad horay u dhigtay beddel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro saqafka oo \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa dejimaha isla qalabka Roof: \u003Cstrong\u003EDhiman\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhaadhac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGable overhang\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPlate height\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFascia height\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBoxed eaves\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EThickness\u003C/strong\u003E. Beddel kasta wuxuu isla markiiba muujinayaa qorshaha iyo 3D, oo leh hubinta isla qalabka (dhiman oo 80 darajo ama ka weyn waa la diidaa, iyo dejin aan saqaf samayn karin). Ku qor qiime oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama ka bax sanduuqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo. Beddello dhowr ah oo isla sanduuq ah oo midkiis ka dib midka kale (qor \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ccode\u003E7/12\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ccode\u003E8/12\u003C/code\u003E) waxay isku biiraan hal tallaabo, sidaas darteed hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u soo celinaya waxa saqafku ahaa ka hor silsiladda; sanduuq kale beddelkiisu wuxuu bilaabaa tallaabo cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"plate-height-fascia-iyo-soffit\"\u003EPlate height, fascia iyo soffit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlate height\u003C/strong\u003E waa meesha ay diyaarada saqafku ku kulmaan dibadda darbiyada, oo laga cabbiro dabaqa dhulkiisa. Madhan ka tag si saqafku ugu fadhiisto sare darbiyada; qor qiime weyn si aad heel kor loogu qaado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFascia height\u003C/strong\u003E waa loox ku taal geesaha hoose iyo rakes-ka. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E haddii aan lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoxed eaves\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa soffit dabaq ah hoostiisa eave kasta, ka darbiga ilaa dhabarka fascia-ga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha kasta waxay darbiga ku kulmaa plate height, sidaas darteed darbiyada dhimanno kala duwan leh waxay haystaan hal khad plate, geesahoodana heerar kala duwan ayay ku dhammaadaan, sida lagu dhisi lahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-saqafka-sawir\"\u003EDusha saqafka sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqa darbiyada dusha ku taal, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha saqafka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003EDhiman\u003C/strong\u003E iyo, haddii aanu ahayn sare darbiyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EEave height\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha. Dhinaca ugu horreeya ee aad sawirto waa eave; dusha waxay kor u kacaysaa qaabka intiisa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer dhagsii, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysid. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa geesaha la sameeyey.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha saqafku ma raacdo darbiyada. Dooro dabaqa ka sarreeya (guji gudaha qaabkiisa) si aad u beddesho dhiman, eave height ama thickness, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dormer-ku-dar\"\u003EDormer ku dar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji dabaqa saqafku ku yaallo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDormer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka ikhtiyaarka ku dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca dormer\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EGable\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESheed\u003C/strong\u003E) oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga hore\u003C/strong\u003E (dhererka darbiga hore ee saqafka sare ilaa eave-ka dormer), \u003Cstrong\u003EDhiman\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhaadhac\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dusha saqafka meesha ay dhexda dhinaca hore ee dormer-ka tagayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu dhisaa darbiga hore, laba darbi oo cheek ah iyo saqafka dormer-ka, wuxuuna dib ugu kaxeeyaa ilaa uu saqafka la kulmo. Gable dormer wuxuu leeyahay laba dusha oo ku kulma ridge. Sheed dormer wuxuu leeyahay hal dusha, oo ay ka hooseyso saqafka. Saqafka hoostiisa dormer-ka waa la gooyaa. Dormer-ku wuxuu raacaa saqafka markii darbiyadu dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro si aad u beddesho nooca, ballaca, darbiga hore, dhimanka ama dhaadhaca \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu tirtiraa, saqafkuna dib buu u xidhaa. Waa in uu ku habboonaado hal dusha saqaf, oo ka fog hips, valleys iyo ridge, dormer-yadana waxay qaadan karaan oo keliya saqafyada laga sameeyay qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaqaf\u003C/span\u003E, ma aha dusha saqaf gacanta lagu sawiray. Wali lama dhisin: daaqad ku jirta darbiga hore ee dormer-ka, iyo dormer-yada dusha saqafka gacanta lagu sawiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-kaydiyo\"\u003EWaxa la kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaqafyadu waa saqaf IFC ah oo ka kooban slab saqaf dusha kasta, darbiyada gable, hal xubin fascia ah iyo hal daboolka soffit. Saqafku wuxuu leeyahay dherer ridge, hip, valley, eave iyo rake, iyo aagagiisa, si loo qiyaaso. Dusha saqaf waa saqaf IFC ah oo leh hal slab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUndo wuxuu dib u celiyaa beddel saqaf kasta hal tallaabo, oo ay ku jiraan preset-ka oo beddela darbi kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad sameyn doonto Saqafka qaabeey darbiyada hoostiisa. Darbi kasta wuxuu leeyahay dejintiisa, si hal saqaf uu hip ugu sameeyo hore, gable-yo dhamaadka, oo uu ku istaago siman darbi dheer oo dabada ku yaal. Barxad ama dhul saqafka otomaatiga ahi ma samayn karin, dusha saqaf waxaad geesaha ku sawirtaa. Saqaf ku dheji Dabaqa darbiyada saqafka leh, guji Saqaf. Ku qor Dhiman (6/12, ama darajo sida 30) iyo Dhaadhac. Dooro preset: Saqaf xagaleyn (Hip roof), Gable dhinacyada gaaban (Gables on the short sides), Gable dhinacyada dheer (Gables on the long sides), ama Sheed (dhinaca u dhow cursor-ka waa geesta hoose; dhinacyada kale waa dhamaadka gable). Ka hoo Fascia iyo soffit haddii aad rabto geesaha sanduuq ah oo leh loox fascia, ama ka saar haddii aad rabto geesaha saqafka oo furan. Gudaha dhismaha dhex-gali: geesta hoose (eave), ridge, hips iyo valleys waxay muuqdaan qorshaha. Guji. Qaab kasta oo ah waa shaqeeya: L, T, U iyo calaamadda plus, geesaha xagal leh iyo godad. Hips, ridges iyo valleys waxay ka helaan meelaha dusha saqafka isku kulmaan. Darbi mar mid Dooro saqafka (dabaqa ka sarreeya darbiyada, guji gudaha qaabkiisa) oo eeg Each wall ee Properties hoostiisa. Cursor-ka oo ka taagto safka wuxuu calaamadiyaa darbigaas qorshaha. Pitched: darbigu wuxuu leeyahay dusha saqaf dhiman oo ka dul sii jirta. Ku qor dhimankiisa kor kiisa, tusaale 12/12 dhamaadyada adag ee saqaf 6/12. Gable end: saqafku wuxuu ku istaagaa dhamaad toosan oo ka dul darbiga, darbigana waa la buuxiyaa ilaa saqafka, saqafkuna wuxuu ka dhaafaa Gable overhang. None (stops flush): saqafku wuxuu darbigaas ku dhammaadaa gees dheer ama darbi gable ah la'aan, waana darbi dheer oo saqaf ku dhow. Liiska Ends ee sare wuxuu dejiyaa darbi kasta isla mar; Set per wall ayaa muuqda marka darbiyadu aanay u mid ahayn preset-ka. Saqaf aad horay u dhigtay beddel Dooro saqafka oo Properties wuxuu muujinayaa dejimaha isla qalabka Roof: Dhiman, Dhaadhac, Gable overhang, Plate height, Fascia height, Boxed eaves iyo Thickness. Beddel kasta wuxuu isla markiiba muujinayaa qorshaha iyo 3D, oo leh hubinta isla qalabka (dhiman oo 80 darajo ama ka weyn waa la diidaa, iyo dejin aan saqaf samayn karin). Ku qor qiime oo riix Enter, ama ka bax sanduuqa. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo. Beddello dhowr ah oo isla sanduuq ah oo midkiis ka dib midka kale (qor 6/12, kadibna 7/12, kadibna 8/12) waxay isku biiraan hal tallaabo, sidaas darteed hal Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u soo celinaya waxa saqafku ahaa ka hor silsiladda; sanduuq kale beddelkiisu wuxuu bilaabaa tallaabo cusub. Plate height, fascia iyo soffit Plate height waa meesha ay diyaarada saqafku ku kulmaan dibadda darbiyada, oo laga cabbiro dabaqa dhulkiisa. Madhan ka tag si saqafku ugu fadhiisto sare darbiyada; qor qiime weyn si aad heel kor loogu qaado. Fascia height waa loox ku taal geesaha hoose iyo rakes-ka. Qor 0 haddii aan lahayn. Boxed eaves wuxuu dhigaa soffit dabaq ah hoostiisa eave kasta, ka darbiga ilaa dhabarka fascia-ga. Dusha kasta waxay darbiga ku kulmaa plate height, sidaas darteed darbiyada dhimanno kala duwan leh waxay haystaan hal khad plate, geesahoodana heerar kala duwan ayay ku dhammaadaan, sida lagu dhisi lahaa. Dusha saqafka sawir Dabaqa darbiyada dusha ku taal, fur Dhis oo dooro Dusha saqafka. Ku qor Dhiman iyo, haddii aanu ahayn sare darbiyada, Eave height. Guji geesaha. Dhinaca ugu horreeya ee aad sawirto waa eave; dusha waxay kor u kacaysaa qaabka intiisa kale. Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer dhagsii, ama riix Enter si aad u dhammaysid. Esc wuxuu tirtiraa geesaha la sameeyey. Dusha saqafku ma raacdo darbiyada. Dooro dabaqa ka sarreeya (guji gudaha qaabkiisa) si aad u beddesho dhiman, eave height ama thickness, ama riix Delete si aad u tirtirto. Dormer ku dar Muuji dabaqa saqafku ku yaallo. Fur Dhis oo dooro Dormer. Safka ikhtiyaarka ku dooro Nooca dormer (Gable ama Sheed) oo deji Ballac, Darbiga hore (dhererka darbiga hore ee saqafka sare ilaa eave-ka dormer), Dhiman iyo Dhaadhac. Guji dusha saqafka meesha ay dhexda dhinaca hore ee dormer-ka tagayso. BimCraft wuxuu dhisaa darbiga hore, laba darbi oo cheek ah iyo saqafka dormer-ka, wuxuuna dib ugu kaxeeyaa ilaa uu saqafka la kulmo. Gable dormer wuxuu leeyahay laba dusha oo ku kulma ridge. Sheed dormer wuxuu leeyahay hal dusha, oo ay ka hooseyso saqafka. Saqafka hoostiisa dormer-ka waa la gooyaa. Dormer-ku wuxuu raacaa saqafka markii darbiyadu dhaqaaqaan. Dooro si aad u beddesho nooca, ballaca, darbiga hore, dhimanka ama dhaadhaca Properties. Delete wuu tirtiraa, saqafkuna dib buu u xidhaa. Waa in uu ku habboonaado hal dusha saqaf, oo ka fog hips, valleys iyo ridge, dormer-yadana waxay qaadan karaan oo keliya saqafyada laga sameeyay qalabka Saqaf, ma aha dusha saqaf gacanta lagu sawiray. Wali lama dhisin: daaqad ku jirta darbiga hore ee dormer-ka, iyo dormer-yada dusha saqafka gacanta lagu sawiray. Waxa la kaydiyo Saqafyadu waa saqaf IFC ah oo ka kooban slab saqaf dusha kasta, darbiyada gable, hal xubin fascia ah iyo hal daboolka soffit. Saqafku wuxuu leeyahay dherer ridge, hip, valley, eave iyo rake, iyo aagagiisa, si loo qiyaaso. Dusha saqaf waa saqaf IFC ah oo leh hal slab. Undo wuxuu dib u celiyaa beddel saqaf kasta hal tallaabo, oo ay ku jiraan preset-ka oo beddela darbi kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"foundations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Aasaaska hoosta derbiyada","summary":"Ku dheji sagxad dhulka korkiisa, derbiyo gaduud leh sagxad, dhul-hoosaad (crawlspace) ama basamaan dhismaha hoostiisa hal guji; saldhigyada waxaa lagu cabbiraa derbiyada iyo tirada dabaqyada, aasaaskuna wuu raacaa marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["aasaas","saldhig","sagxad dhulka korkiisa","geesta qaro weyn","sagxad midhaysan","derbi gaduud","dhul-hoosaad","crawlspace","crawl space","basamaan","derbiga basamaanka","qabow (frost)","shub","ballaca saldhigga"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"aasaas-geli","text":"Aasaas geli","level":2},{"id":"beddelka","text":"Beddelka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-kaydiyay","text":"Waxa la kaydiyay","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa fiican in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismaha u samee aasaas ku habboon derbiyadiisa. BimCraft wuxuu raacaa dibadda derbiyada, wuxuuna cabbiraa saldhigyada iyadoo adeegsanaya nooca derbiga iyo tirada dabaqyada ee saaran, wuxuuna dib u sameeyaa aasaaska mar kasta oo derbiyadu isbeddelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aasaas-geli\"\u003EAasaas geli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqa uu derbiyadiisu saaran yahay aasaaska (badanaa kan koowaad), fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAasaas\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESagxad dhulka korkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E: sagxad shub 4&quot; ah oo sare uu yahay sagxadda, geesta qaro weyn ee hoosta derbiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDerbiyo gaduud iyo sagxad\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyada aasaaska ilaa sagxadda, saldhigyada korkooda, iyo sagxad gudahooda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhul-hoosaad\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyada aasaaska ee joogsada hoosta qaabka sagxadda, saldhigyada korkooda, aan sagxad lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBasamaan\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyada aasaaska ee buuxa dhererkooda, oo saldhig iyo sagxad basamaan ah leh, hoosta qaabka sagxadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhex-dhig dhismaha gudaha: saldhigyadu waxay muuqdaan dashed oo leh cabbirkooda. Guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji dhismaha horey u leh aasaas wuu doortaa, sidaas awgeed waad beddeli kartaa halkii aad mid labaad ku dari lahayd.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddelka\"\u003EBeddelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro aasaaska (guji gudaha dhismaha oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAasaas\u003C/span\u003E, ama guji qayb kasta oo ka mid ah aragga 3D ama geedka moodelka) oo ku beddel \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: qaabka, ballaca iyo qotada saldhigga, intee hoos u dhacday hoosta saldhigga, dhumucda derbiga, intee ka hoosaysa sagxadda derbiyadu joogsadaan, dhererka basamaanka iyo dhumucda sagxadda. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada lagu calaamadiyay \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka yimaadaan derbiyada: saldhigyo 12&quot;, 15&quot; ama 23&quot; ballac u leh hal, laba ama saddex dabaq oo sagxad ama derbi gaduud ku saaran; 18&quot;, 22&quot; ama 27&quot; dhul-hoosaad ama basamaan kor; iyo 4&quot; ballac dheeraad ah hoosta derbiyada dhagax-dhisme ama shub. Ku qor cabbir si aad naftaada u dejiso; ku qor \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E si aad dib ugu noqoto auto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada otomaatiga ah waa qiyamyo caadi ah oo loogu talagalay guryaha caadiga ah ee qaab khafiif ah, ma aha injineernimo. Naqshadeeye ama injineer ayaa hubiya saldhigyada, qotada iyo derbiyada ee dhulka, qotada qabowga (frost) iyo culeysyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-kaydiyay\"\u003EWaxa la kaydiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAasaas waxaa lagu kaydiyaa sida ururinta curiyaha IFC ee magaciisu yahay &quot;Aasaas&quot; (Foundation), oo ka kooban saldhig (ama geesta qaro weyn ee sagxadda), derbi aasaas iyo sagxad sida nooca u baahan yahay, oo dhammaantood shub ah, mid kasta leh tirooyinkiisa: dherer, ballac, joog, aag iyo mug, oo diyaar u ah shaqada tirinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDerbiyada dhaqaajin, ku dar ama tirtir, aasaaska hoostooda waa dib loo sameeyaa; derbiyada dabaqa korka lagu sawiro saldhigyadu way ballacaysaa dabaq dheeraad ah marka uu jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa aasaas la doortay oo qaybahooda oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulka goobta oo ku jira moodelka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/terrain\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/terrain\"\u003EDhulka goobta, saldhigga dhismaha iyo dhaqaalaha\u003C/a\u003E), derbiyada gaduudka ah iyo saldhigyada dhul-hoosaadka waxay hoos ugu dhacaan tallaabooyin 8&quot; ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaldhigyada derbiyada gudaha weli lama sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhismaha u samee aasaas ku habboon derbiyadiisa. BimCraft wuxuu raacaa dibadda derbiyada, wuxuuna cabbiraa saldhigyada iyadoo adeegsanaya nooca derbiga iyo tirada dabaqyada ee saaran, wuxuuna dib u sameeyaa aasaaska mar kasta oo derbiyadu isbeddelaan. Aasaas geli Dabaqa uu derbiyadiisu saaran yahay aasaaska (badanaa kan koowaad), fur Dhismaha oo dooro Aasaas. Dooro qaabka: Sagxad dhulka korkiisa: sagxad shub 4\" ah oo sare uu yahay sagxadda, geesta qaro weyn ee hoosta derbiyada. Derbiyo gaduud iyo sagxad: derbiyada aasaaska ilaa sagxadda, saldhigyada korkooda, iyo sagxad gudahooda ah. Dhul-hoosaad: derbiyada aasaaska ee joogsada hoosta qaabka sagxadda, saldhigyada korkooda, aan sagxad lahayn. Basamaan: derbiyada aasaaska ee buuxa dhererkooda, oo saldhig iyo sagxad basamaan ah leh, hoosta qaabka sagxadda. Dhex-dhig dhismaha gudaha: saldhigyadu waxay muuqdaan dashed oo leh cabbirkooda. Guji. Guji dhismaha horey u leh aasaas wuu doortaa, sidaas awgeed waad beddeli kartaa halkii aad mid labaad ku dari lahayd. Beddelka Dooro aasaaska (guji gudaha dhismaha oo leh Aasaas, ama guji qayb kasta oo ka mid ah aragga 3D ama geedka moodelka) oo ku beddel Sifooyinka: qaabka, ballaca iyo qotada saldhigga, intee hoos u dhacday hoosta saldhigga, dhumucda derbiga, intee ka hoosaysa sagxadda derbiyadu joogsadaan, dhererka basamaanka iyo dhumucda sagxadda. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo. Cabbirrada lagu calaamadiyay auto waxay ka yimaadaan derbiyada: saldhigyo 12\", 15\" ama 23\" ballac u leh hal, laba ama saddex dabaq oo sagxad ama derbi gaduud ku saaran; 18\", 22\" ama 27\" dhul-hoosaad ama basamaan kor; iyo 4\" ballac dheeraad ah hoosta derbiyada dhagax-dhisme ama shub. Ku qor cabbir si aad naftaada u dejiso; ku qor 0 si aad dib ugu noqoto auto. Cabbirrada otomaatiga ah waa qiyamyo caadi ah oo loogu talagalay guryaha caadiga ah ee qaab khafiif ah, ma aha injineernimo. Naqshadeeye ama injineer ayaa hubiya saldhigyada, qotada iyo derbiyada ee dhulka, qotada qabowga (frost) iyo culeysyada. Waxa la kaydiyay Aasaas waxaa lagu kaydiyaa sida ururinta curiyaha IFC ee magaciisu yahay \"Aasaas\" (Foundation), oo ka kooban saldhig (ama geesta qaro weyn ee sagxadda), derbi aasaas iyo sagxad sida nooca u baahan yahay, oo dhammaantood shub ah, mid kasta leh tirooyinkiisa: dherer, ballac, joog, aag iyo mug, oo diyaar u ah shaqada tirinta. Waxa fiican in la ogaado Derbiyada dhaqaajin, ku dar ama tirtir, aasaaska hoostooda waa dib loo sameeyaa; derbiyada dabaqa korka lagu sawiro saldhigyadu way ballacaysaa dabaq dheeraad ah marka uu jiro. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa aasaas la doortay oo qaybahooda oo dhan. Dhulka goobta oo ku jira moodelka (eeg Dhulka goobta, saldhigga dhismaha iyo dhaqaalaha), derbiyada gaduudka ah iyo saldhigyada dhul-hoosaadka waxay hoos ugu dhacaan tallaabooyin 8\" ah. Saldhigyada derbiyada gudaha weli lama sameeyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"site-building-and-levels","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Goobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarkiisa","summary":"Samee xuduudka goobta, dhig oo rog dhismaha goobta, ku dar heerarka heerarka la siiyay ama kala qaybi dhererka dhismaha, oo sawir heerka aad doorato.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["goobta","qorshaha goobta","khadka dhismaha","go'aanka ka fogaanta","xuquuqda dhulka","xuquuqda marin","xadka hantida","xadka","qaybta dhulka","xuduudka","dhigidda dhismaha","rogidda dhismaha","heerarka","dabaqyada","ku dar heerarka","kala qaybi dhererka","IfcSite","IfcBuilding","IfcBuildingStorey","qaab-dhismeedka meel-dhig"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"sawir-goobta","text":"Sawir goobta","level":2},{"id":"dhig-dhismaha-goobta","text":"Dhig dhismaha goobta","level":2},{"id":"khadadka-dhismaha-iyo-xuquuqda-dhulka","text":"Khadadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda dhulka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-heerarka","text":"Ku dar heerarka","level":2},{"id":"sawir-heer","text":"Sawir heer","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejiso qaybaha moodelka IFC ee hayay wax kale oo dhan: goobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarka dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodel waxaa loo habeeyey sida \u003Cstrong\u003Egoob\u003C/strong\u003E oo hayda \u003Cstrong\u003Edhismo\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo hayda \u003Cstrong\u003Eheerarkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E (dabaqyada); darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo wax kasta oo kale waxay ku jiraan heer. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismo cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa saddexdaas oo dhan. Moodel laga keenay barnaamij kale oo leh dhismo laakiin aan goob lahayn wuxuu helaa goob markii ugu horreysay ee aad sawirto mid: dhismaha waxaa lagu dhigay meeshii uu horay ugu jiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-goobta\"\u003ESawir goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska goobta (qalabku wuxuu u dhejiyaa sida qalabka darbiga). Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer guji ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammayso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa geesi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka wuxuu muujinayaa aagga goobta. Sawir mar kale si aad u beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha heer kasta wuxuu muujiyaa xuduudka goobta sida khadka hantida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-dhismaha-goobta\"\u003EDhig dhismaha goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/span\u003E shidan tahay, ku qor dhismaha \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E goobta ku yaal iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ERog\u003C/strong\u003E dhismaha darajooyin, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha ku dhig gujin\u003C/span\u003E oo guji meesha asalka dhismaha u tagayo. Waxa dhismaha ku jira oo dhan (heerarka, darbiyada, grids, wixii aad sawirtay) wuu guuraa; goobta iyo xuduudkeeda way joogaan. Qorshayaashu waxay sii muujiyaan heer kasta oo ku toosan dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadadka-dhismaha-iyo-xuquuqda-dhulka\"\u003EKhadadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda dhulka (xuquuqda dhulka, xuquuqda marin) waxaa lagu sawiraa goobta sida xaddidaad. \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxay digayaan, weligood ma xidhaan\u003C/strong\u003E: darbi ka sarreeya mid kasta waa la sawiraa sida aad weydiisay, digniin magaca darbiga iyo khadka ama xuquuqda ayaa ka muuqata Dhibaatooyinka. Darbiga dib u celi, digniinta waa tirtirmaa. Digniin waxaa lagu aqbali karaa sabab (dulqaad uu ogolaaday maamulka, tusaale ahaan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka dhismaha ee go&#039;aanka ka fogaanta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGo&#039;aanka ka fogaanta\u003C/span\u003E: qor sida khadku uga fog yahay xadka kasta oo goobta ah. Xuduudaha waxaa lagu lambarkaa qorshaha inta qalabku shidan yahay. Khadku wuxuu ka xisaabtaa masaafooyinkaas, wuxuuna raacaa xuduudka goobta haddii mar kale la sawiro xuduudo badan. Masaafooyinka waa kuwaaga, waxaad ka akhrisaa waraaqda dhulka ama qorshaha kala qaybinta dhulka; BimCraft midkood ma buuxiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhad dhismo oo la sawiray.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E shidan yahay, guji barooyinkiisa oo dhamee double-click ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dhammee barta koowaad si aad u hesho khad xidhan: aagga gudihiisa waa meesha laga dhisi karo, darbi qayb kasta oo ka baxsan wuu digniin ku leeyahay. Khad furan wuxuu digniin ku leeyahay darbi keliya oo gooya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXuquuqda marin.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuquuqda dhulka\u003C/span\u003E: dooro nooca, qor magacooda, tixraacooda diiwaanka iyo ballaadhinteeda, kadibna guji khadka dhexe oo dhamee (xariiq ballaaran), ama xidh barta koowaad (aag). Darbi qayb kasta oo ku jirta wuu digniin ku leeyahay, heer kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta xagasha sax ah ee khad waa taabasho, ma gooyo (tolerance-ka waa 1 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaarka mass-ka hadda ee kasta waxaa la hubiyaa sida darbiyada: mass ka baxsan xuduudka, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda dhulka waxay helaysaa digniin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/massing-options\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/massing-options\"\u003EIkhtiyaaraadka mass-ka oo wada-jir ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mid oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E si aad u beddesho magaceeda, tixraacooda, nooca ama ballaadhinta, u guuri ama tirtir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha heer kasta, xaashiyada iyo PDF-ka qorshaha: khadka dhismaha waa xariiq-jajab, xuquuqda dhulka waa dhibic-dhibic, mid kasta leh calaamadiisa. Faylka IFC mid kasta waa qoraal (IfcAnnotation, nooca BuildingLine ama Servitude) goobta ku yaal, oo xariiqiisu waa qalooc fudud oo barnaamijyada kale akhrin karaan. Hubinta waxay isticmaashaa qaab-dhismeedka darbi kasta ee dhabta ah ee qorshaha, iyada oo xidhmooyinkiisa sida la sawiray ay ku jiraan; darbi qalooc ah waxaa lagu hubiyaa dhumucdiisa gudaha xariiqa dhexe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-heerarka\"\u003EKu dar heerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerarka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heer sare\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heer hoose\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid hoosta ugu hooseeya (basement, dhererka taban). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar heerarka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa dhowr mar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererada kuwan:\u003C/strong\u003E ku qor dhererada kor ka ah heerka ugu hooseeya, kala-saaraya koma (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;, 24&#039;, 36&#039;\u003C/code\u003E). Dhererada oo horey u leh heer waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala qaybi dhererka dhismaha:\u003C/strong\u003E ku qor dhererka dhismaha iyo tirada heerarka. Heerarka aad haysid waxay u guurayaan dhererkooda cusub kor ka bilaabmaan heerka ugu hooseeya, heerarka maqan waa la daraa, kuwa ka sarreeya waxay ku sii jiraan meeshooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada ku dhex-socda heerka ka sarreeya way raacaan, sidaas oo kale tiirarka iyo jidadka kor-u-kaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee heerkan…\u003C/span\u003E (isla panelka) wuxuu ku koobiyeeyaa wixii lagu sawiray heerka aad eegayso heer kale ama heer cusub oo sare, si qorshaha dabaqa dhismaha loo kor u qaado hal tallaabo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawirka darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-heer\"\u003ESawir heer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E kasta wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa heerka lagu doortay liiska heerarka qorshaha (ama lagu doortay panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerarka\u003C/span\u003E): wixii aad sawirto wuxuu ku jiraa heerkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah isbeddel waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC: goobta (IfcSite) oo leh xuduudkeeda iyo aagga, dhismaha (IfcBuilding) oo ku dhigan goobta, iyo heerarka (IfcBuildingStorey) ku jira dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coordinates\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coordinates\"\u003EIsku-xirnaanta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E oo ah asalka mashruuca iyo barta survey-ka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dejiso qaybaha moodelka IFC ee hayay wax kale oo dhan: goobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarka dhismaha. Moodel waxaa loo habeeyey sida goob oo hayda dhismo, kaas oo hayda heerarkiisa (dabaqyada); darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo wax kasta oo kale waxay ku jiraan heer. Faylka › Dhismo cusub wuxuu dejiyaa saddexdaas oo dhan. Moodel laga keenay barnaamij kale oo leh dhismo laakiin aan goob lahayn wuxuu helaa goob markii ugu horreysay ee aad sawirto mid: dhismaha waxaa lagu dhigay meeshii uu horay ugu jiray. Sawir goobta Shid Sawir, kadibna dooro Dhismaha › Goobta. Guji geeska goobta (qalabku wuxuu u dhejiyaa sida qalabka darbiga). Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer guji ama riix Enter si aad u dhammayso. Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa geesi. Safka wuxuu muujinayaa aagga goobta. Sawir mar kale si aad u beddesho. Qorshaha heer kasta wuxuu muujiyaa xuduudka goobta sida khadka hantida. Dhig dhismaha goobta Marka Goobta shidan tahay, ku qor dhismaha X iyo Y goobta ku yaal iyo Rog dhismaha darajooyin, ama guji Dhismaha ku dhig gujin oo guji meesha asalka dhismaha u tagayo. Waxa dhismaha ku jira oo dhan (heerarka, darbiyada, grids, wixii aad sawirtay) wuu guuraa; goobta iyo xuduudkeeda way joogaan. Qorshayaashu waxay sii muujiyaan heer kasta oo ku toosan dhismaha. Khadadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda dhulka Khadadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda dhulka (xuquuqda dhulka, xuquuqda marin) waxaa lagu sawiraa goobta sida xaddidaad. Waxay digayaan, weligood ma xidhaan: darbi ka sarreeya mid kasta waa la sawiraa sida aad weydiisay, digniin magaca darbiga iyo khadka ama xuquuqda ayaa ka muuqata Dhibaatooyinka. Darbiga dib u celi, digniinta waa tirtirmaa. Digniin waxaa lagu aqbali karaa sabab (dulqaad uu ogolaaday maamulka, tusaale ahaan). Khadka dhismaha ee go'aanka ka fogaanta. Dhismaha › Khadka dhismaha, kadibna Go'aanka ka fogaanta: qor sida khadku uga fog yahay xadka kasta oo goobta ah. Xuduudaha waxaa lagu lambarkaa qorshaha inta qalabku shidan yahay. Khadku wuxuu ka xisaabtaa masaafooyinkaas, wuxuuna raacaa xuduudka goobta haddii mar kale la sawiro xuduudo badan. Masaafooyinka waa kuwaaga, waxaad ka akhrisaa waraaqda dhulka ama qorshaha kala qaybinta dhulka; BimCraft midkood ma buuxiyo. Khad dhismo oo la sawiray. Marka Khadka dhismaha shidan yahay, guji barooyinkiisa oo dhamee double-click ama Enter. Dhammee barta koowaad si aad u hesho khad xidhan: aagga gudihiisa waa meesha laga dhisi karo, darbi qayb kasta oo ka baxsan wuu digniin ku leeyahay. Khad furan wuxuu digniin ku leeyahay darbi keliya oo gooya. Xuquuqda marin. Dhismaha › Xuquuqda dhulka: dooro nooca, qor magacooda, tixraacooda diiwaanka iyo ballaadhinteeda, kadibna guji khadka dhexe oo dhamee (xariiq ballaaran), ama xidh barta koowaad (aag). Darbi qayb kasta oo ku jirta wuu digniin ku leeyahay, heer kasta. Barta xagasha sax ah ee khad waa taabasho, ma gooyo (tolerance-ka waa 1 mm). Ikhtiyaarka mass-ka hadda ee kasta waxaa la hubiyaa sida darbiyada: mass ka baxsan xuduudka, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda dhulka waxay helaysaa digniin. Eeg Ikhtiyaaraadka mass-ka oo wada-jir ah. Dooro mid oo Dooro si aad u beddesho magaceeda, tixraacooda, nooca ama ballaadhinta, u guuri ama tirtir. Waa lagu sawiraa qorshaha heer kasta, xaashiyada iyo PDF-ka qorshaha: khadka dhismaha waa xariiq-jajab, xuquuqda dhulka waa dhibic-dhibic, mid kasta leh calaamadiisa. Faylka IFC mid kasta waa qoraal (IfcAnnotation, nooca BuildingLine ama Servitude) goobta ku yaal, oo xariiqiisu waa qalooc fudud oo barnaamijyada kale akhrin karaan. Hubinta waxay isticmaashaa qaab-dhismeedka darbi kasta ee dhabta ah ee qorshaha, iyada oo xidhmooyinkiisa sida la sawiray ay ku jiraan; darbi qalooc ah waxaa lagu hubiyaa dhumucdiisa gudaha xariiqa dhexe. Ku dar heerarka Panelka Heerarka, Ku dar heer sare wuxuu ku daraa mid, Ku dar heer hoose wuxuu ku daraa mid hoosta ugu hooseeya (basement, dhererka taban). Ku dar heerarka… wuxuu ku daraa dhowr mar: Dhererada kuwan: ku qor dhererada kor ka ah heerka ugu hooseeya, kala-saaraya koma (tusaale ahaan 12', 24', 36'). Dhererada oo horey u leh heer waa la dhaafaa. Kala qaybi dhererka dhismaha: ku qor dhererka dhismaha iyo tirada heerarka. Heerarka aad haysid waxay u guurayaan dhererkooda cusub kor ka bilaabmaan heerka ugu hooseeya, heerarka maqan waa la daraa, kuwa ka sarreeya waxay ku sii jiraan meeshooda. Darbiyada ku dhex-socda heerka ka sarreeya way raacaan, sidaas oo kale tiirarka iyo jidadka kor-u-kaca. Koobiyee heerkan… (isla panelka) wuxuu ku koobiyeeyaa wixii lagu sawiray heerka aad eegayso heer kale ama heer cusub oo sare, si qorshaha dabaqa dhismaha loo kor u qaado hal tallaabo. Eeg Sawirka darbiyada. Sawir heer Qalabka Sawir kasta wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa heerka lagu doortay liiska heerarka qorshaha (ama lagu doortay panelka Heerarka): wixii aad sawirto wuxuu ku jiraa heerkaas. Waxa aad arki doontid Mid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah isbeddel waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Faylka IFC: goobta (IfcSite) oo leh xuduudkeeda iyo aagga, dhismaha (IfcBuilding) oo ku dhigan goobta, iyo heerarka (IfcBuildingStorey) ku jira dhismaha. Eeg sidoo kale Isku-xirnaanta BimCraft oo ah asalka mashruuca iyo barta survey-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"schedule-layouts","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Habee, kaydi oo dhoofi jadwal","summary":"Kooxee jadwal, siiso subtotal iyo wadar, ku dar tiir laga akhriyo sifo, ku kaydi sida dejin faylka dhexdiisa, oo u dhoofi sida buug-shaqo (.xlsx), sida qoraal lagu dhejiyo xaashi online, ama sida CSV. Heerka xafiiska wuxuu buuxiyaa wixii jadwalku aanu sheegin.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["habaynta jadwalka","kooxee","subtotal","wadar","madasha","dejin","jadwalka albaabbada dabaq kasta","heerka dabka","ironmongery","xlsx","buug-shaqo","xaashi online","dhaji","csv","dhoofin","jadwal","walxaha","dooro jadwal","heerka xafiiska"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"guji-tiro-si-aad-u-doorato-meesha-ay-ka-timid","text":"Guji tiro si aad u doorato meesha ay ka timid","level":2},{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"heerka-xafiiska","text":"Heerka xafiiska","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJadwal caadi ah ku beddel mid xafiiskaaga soo saaro: lagu kooxeeyay dabaq, nooc ama qol, oo leh subtotal iyo wadar, tiirarka aad u baahan tahay, magaciisa gaarka ah. Kadibna u dir xaashi buug-shaqo. Safka kasta iyo lambar kasta ayaa weli ogaanaya walxaha ay ka yimaadeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E oo fur \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix. Dooro jadwal, tusaale ahaan \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabbada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiskha sare, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxee\u003C/strong\u003E (tiir ka mid ah jadwalka, sida Heer ama Nooc, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro kooxeyn\u003C/strong\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWadarta\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro wadar\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHal wadar\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtotal iyo wadar\u003C/strong\u003E). \u003Cstrong\u003ESida la dejiyay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dooradda ka tagaa dejinta la kaydiyay ama heerka xafiiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad tiir ugu darto oo laga akhriyo walxaha, qor magac sifo ama calaamad hoosta miiska (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EFireRating\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E ama magaca calaamad sida \u003Ccode\u003EIronmongery\u003C/code\u003E) oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar tiir\u003C/strong\u003E. BimCraft marka hore wuxuu akhrinayaa property sets-ka walxaha laftiisa, kadibna kuwa noociisa. Marka aan walax weli qiimo lahayn, waa sheegaysaa; tiirku wuu buuxmaa isaga keligiis markii qiimo la dhigo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor magac (tusaale ahaan &quot;Jadwalka albaabbada dabaq kasta&quot;) oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EKu kaydi sidii dejin\u003C/strong\u003E. Dejintu waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha oo waxay ku biirtaa liiska Jadwallada magaceeda. Waxay raacaa isbeddel kasta oo moodelka ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar dejintan\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa mar kale ka saara. Labaduba waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guji-tiro-si-aad-u-doorato-meesha-ay-ka-timid\"\u003EGuji tiro si aad u doorato meesha ay ka timid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji safka kasta, ama tiro kasta, si aad u doorato walxaha ka dambeeya qorshaha iyo 3D:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esafka waxa uu doortaa walxaha safkaas;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esubtotal ama wadar waxa uu doortaa wixii ay ku darto, madasha kooxda waxa uu doortaa kooxdeeda;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etiro leh walxo u gaar ah ayaa doorta kuwaas: \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jarista\u003C/strong\u003E nooca darbiga waxa uu doortaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, bedka darbiga qol waxa uu doortaa darbiyadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla sidaas ayay ku shaqeysaa dukumeenti laga sameeyay moodelka: horjoogga, guji tiro jadwal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo deji Excel\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa buug-shaqo .xlsx. Dherarka, bedadka, mugyada iyo tirooyinka waa lambar dhab ah oo cutubka tiirku muujiyo (fiit iyo inji waxay sii haraan qoraal). Xaashi labaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EElements\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu liistaa safka kasta GlobalId-yada walxaha ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jadwalka ku dhigaa clipboard-kaaga qoraal ay kala saaraan tab. Google Sheet-ka, guji unugga A1 oo dhejiy. \u003Cstrong\u003EFur Google Sheet cusub\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa \u003Ccode\u003Esheets.new\u003C/code\u003E, ciwaanka Google ee xaashi madhan, akoonkaaga Google gudahiisa. BimCraft ma soo galo Google ma-na diro wax halkaas: dhejinta waa kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska sida uu u habaysan yahay shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerka-xafiiska\"\u003EHeerka xafiiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXafiis wuxuu hal mar sheegi karaa sida jadwalladiisa loo habeeyo. Shid add-on-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/default-policies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/default-policies\"\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/a\u003E) oo dejig, \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › Global › Default Policies › Habaynta jadwalka (heerka xafiiska)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESiyaasadda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxee jadwalada sida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer, Nooc, Qol ama ma jiro kooxeyn, jadwal kasta oo tiir noocaas ah leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta jadwalada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro wadar, hal wadar dhamaadka, ama subtotal hoosta kooxmid kasta iyo wadar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECinwaanka jadwalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E{project}: {schedule}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadasha tiirarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida la qoray, XARAFKA WEYN ama Xarafyo Weyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeerku wuxuu ku dhacaa jadwal kasta, cidna dejisay: jadwallada caadiga ah ee dhinaca, dejinta la kaydiyay, jadwal ay caawiye dejiyay, dhoofinta iyo jadwallada dukumeentiga. Dejin sheegta kooxeyntiisa, wadarteeda ama cinwaankeeda gaarka ah ayaa ilaalinaysa; heerku wuxuu buuxiyaa inta kale. Dhinaca waxa lagu sheegaa qaybaha uu heerka xafiiska dejiyay. Siyaasadaha waxay la socdaan faylka Default Policies oo kuwa kale la wada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejintu waxay magacaabaa jadwalka isha iyo tiirarkeeda; ma haysto tiro. Tirooyinka mar kasta waa laga akhriyaa moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska aan ahayn safka walxaha (isku-dhafka darbiyada iyo astaanta agabka) ma lahan habayn ama dhoofin halkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawiye ayaa dhammaan tan kuu samayn kara: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EOggolow caawiye AI inuu moodelkaaga la shaqeeyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Jadwal caadi ah ku beddel mid xafiiskaaga soo saaro: lagu kooxeeyay dabaq, nooc ama qol, oo leh subtotal iyo wadar, tiirarka aad u baahan tahay, magaciisa gaarka ah. Kadibna u dir xaashi buug-shaqo. Safka kasta iyo lambar kasta ayaa weli ogaanaya walxaha ay ka yimaadeen. Tallaabooyinka Shid Sawir oo fur Jadwallada dhinaca bidix. Dooro jadwal, tusaale ahaan Albaabbada. Miiskha sare, dooro Kooxee (tiir ka mid ah jadwalka, sida Heer ama Nooc, ama Ma jiro kooxeyn) iyo Wadarta (Ma jiro wadar, Hal wadar, ama Subtotal iyo wadar). Sida la dejiyay wuxuu dooradda ka tagaa dejinta la kaydiyay ama heerka xafiiska. Si aad tiir ugu darto oo laga akhriyo walxaha, qor magac sifo ama calaamad hoosta miiska (tusaale ahaan FireRating, Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating ama magaca calaamad sida Ironmongery) oo guji Ku dar tiir. BimCraft marka hore wuxuu akhrinayaa property sets-ka walxaha laftiisa, kadibna kuwa noociisa. Marka aan walax weli qiimo lahayn, waa sheegaysaa; tiirku wuu buuxmaa isaga keligiis markii qiimo la dhigo. Qor magac (tusaale ahaan \"Jadwalka albaabbada dabaq kasta\") oo guji Ku kaydi sidii dejin. Dejintu waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha oo waxay ku biirtaa liiska Jadwallada magaceeda. Waxay raacaa isbeddel kasta oo moodelka ah. Ka saar dejintan ayaa mar kale ka saara. Labaduba waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Guji tiro si aad u doorato meesha ay ka timid Guji safka kasta, ama tiro kasta, si aad u doorato walxaha ka dambeeya qorshaha iyo 3D: safka waxa uu doortaa walxaha safkaas; subtotal ama wadar waxa uu doortaa wixii ay ku darto, madasha kooxda waxa uu doortaa kooxdeeda; tiro leh walxo u gaar ah ayaa doorta kuwaas: Ka jarista nooca darbiga waxa uu doortaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, bedka darbiga qol waxa uu doortaa darbiyadiisa. Isla sidaas ayay ku shaqeysaa dukumeenti laga sameeyay moodelka: horjoogga, guji tiro jadwal. Dhoofin Soo deji Excel wuxuu kaydiyaa buug-shaqo .xlsx. Dherarka, bedadka, mugyada iyo tirooyinka waa lambar dhab ah oo cutubka tiirku muujiyo (fiit iyo inji waxay sii haraan qoraal). Xaashi labaad, Elements, wuxuu liistaa safka kasta GlobalId-yada walxaha ka dambeeya. Koobiyee Google Sheets wuxuu jadwalka ku dhigaa clipboard-kaaga qoraal ay kala saaraan tab. Google Sheet-ka, guji unugga A1 oo dhejiy. Fur Google Sheet cusub wuxuu furaa sheets.new, ciwaanka Google ee xaashi madhan, akoonkaaga Google gudahiisa. BimCraft ma soo galo Google ma-na diro wax halkaas: dhejinta waa kaaga. Soo deji CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska sida uu u habaysan yahay shaashadda. Heerka xafiiska Xafiis wuxuu hal mar sheegi karaa sida jadwalladiisa loo habeeyo. Shid add-on-ka Default Policies (Default Policies) oo dejig, Dejinta › Global › Default Policies › Habaynta jadwalka (heerka xafiiska): Siyaasadda Waxa ay sameyso Kooxee jadwalada sida Heer, Nooc, Qol ama ma jiro kooxeyn, jadwal kasta oo tiir noocaas ah leh Wadarta jadwalada Ma jiro wadar, hal wadar dhamaadka, ama subtotal hoosta kooxmid kasta iyo wadar Cinwaanka jadwalka Qaab, tusaale ahaan {project}: {schedule} Madasha tiirarka Sida la qoray, XARAFKA WEYN ama Xarafyo Weyn Heerku wuxuu ku dhacaa jadwal kasta, cidna dejisay: jadwallada caadiga ah ee dhinaca, dejinta la kaydiyay, jadwal ay caawiye dejiyay, dhoofinta iyo jadwallada dukumeentiga. Dejin sheegta kooxeyntiisa, wadarteeda ama cinwaankeeda gaarka ah ayaa ilaalinaysa; heerku wuxuu buuxiyaa inta kale. Dhinaca waxa lagu sheegaa qaybaha uu heerka xafiiska dejiyay. Siyaasadaha waxay la socdaan faylka Default Policies oo kuwa kale la wada. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Dejintu waxay magacaabaa jadwalka isha iyo tiirarkeeda; ma haysto tiro. Tirooyinka mar kasta waa laga akhriyaa moodelka. Liisaska aan ahayn safka walxaha (isku-dhafka darbiyada iyo astaanta agabka) ma lahan habayn ama dhoofin halkan. Caawiye ayaa dhammaan tan kuu samayn kara: eeg Oggolow caawiye AI inuu moodelkaaga la shaqeeyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"room-finishes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhamaystirka qolalka iyo jadwallada dhamaystirka","summary":"Sheeg waxa dabaqa sagxadda, darbiyada iyo saqafka qol kastaa ku dhamaysan, ku dar meelo sida daboolka dhoobada, oo hel jadwallada dhamaystirka sida qolka, darbiga, gobolka iyo qadarka dhoobada oo ku daraan jarka iyo mugga salka.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["dhamaystir","jadwalka dhamaystirka","dhamaystirka qolalka","dhamaystirka sagxadda","dhamaystirka darbiga","dhamaystirka saqafka","saldhig darbi","dhoobo","dhoobo la jaray","tirada dhoobada","qashin","salka","screed","lawin dhabar","plaster","gobol","daboolka biyaha","dado","meel qoyan","gudaha","qadarka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"jadwallada","text":"Jadwallada","level":2},{"id":"sida-dhamaystirka-loo-cabbiro","text":"Sida dhamaystirka loo cabbiro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU sheeg BimCraft mar keliya waxa qol kastaa lagu dhamaysanayo. Jadwallada dhamaystirka markaas waxay siinayaan bedadka, dhoobada la dalbanayo iyo mugga salka, oo waxay isbeddelaan marka moodelka la beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada dhamaystirka\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar nooca dhamaystirka\u003C/strong\u003E. U sheeg magac, nooc (dhoobo, xaashi, lakab ama gabal) iyo dhumuc. Dhoobo ahaan, u sheeg dherer iyo ballac dhoobada, xidhiidhka iyo ogolaanshaha qashinka boqolkiiba. Haddii wax dhamaystirka hoostiisa ku jiro (screed, lawin dhabar, lakab plaster), magacaabo hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESalka\u003C/strong\u003E oo u sheeg dhumucdiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EQolalka\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro dhamaystirka sagxadda, darbiga iyo saqafka qol kasta. Qor magaca saldhigga darbiga iyo dherkiisa haddii qolku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGobollada\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar gobol\u003C/strong\u003E qayb qol ah oo dhamaystir kale qaadanaysa:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Egobol \u003Cstrong\u003Edarbi\u003C/strong\u003E waa qaybta u dhexaysa laba dherar oo sare sagxadda (daboolka biyaha ee 0 ilaa 1200, dado). Waxa uu ku jiraa darbi kasta oo qolka ka mid ah, ama dooro darbiyada qolkaas moodelka oo guji badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EShid\u003C/strong\u003E si aad ugu xaddido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Egobol \u003Cstrong\u003Esagxad\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Esaqaf\u003C/strong\u003E waa bed aad qortid. Waxa laga jaraa dhamaystirka qolka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Dherarka waxaa lagu qoraa cutubyada mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwallada\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfar gelitaan ayaa ku biiraya liiska Jadwallada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka qolka\u003C/strong\u003E: qol kasta oo sagxadda, darbiga iyo saqafkiisa dhamaystirka, bedadkooda, iyo saldhigga darbiga oo dherkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: dhinac kasta oo darbi oo qolka ka mid ah iyo qaybta ay dhamaystirku daboolo, oo leh dherkeeda, balaca guud, ka jarista, balaca saafi ah iyo, dhoobada ah, dhoobada oo dhan, dhoobada la jaray iyo dhoobada la dalbanayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka gobolka\u003C/strong\u003E: gobol kasta oo dhamaystirkiisa, balaca saafi ah, dhoobada iyo mugga salka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQadarka dhamaystirka\u003C/strong\u003E: hal safka dhamaystir kasta: balaca saafi ah, dhoobada oo dhan iyo kuwa la jaray, dhoobada la dalbanayo, salka iyo mugiisa, iyo mugga dhamaystirka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxee, wadar, kaydi oo u dhoofi sida jadwal kasta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHabayn, kaydi iyo dhoofinta jadwal\u003C/a\u003E. Guji tiro si aad u doorato wixii ka timid: ka jarista darbi wuxuu doortaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-dhamaystirka-loo-cabbiro\"\u003ESida dhamaystirka loo cabbiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E: dhinac kasta oo darbi oo qolka ka mid ah, dherkiisa dhex qolka marka lagu dhufto dherka uu dhamaystirku daboolo, oo ka jaro qaybta albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta oo dherkaas gudaheeda ku jirta. Darbi ka hooseeya qolka waa la dhamaysanayaa ilaa sarkiisa. Habka cabbirka mashruuca ayaa go&#039;aamiya furaha ku yar oo aan la jaraynin (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESagxadaha iyo saqafyada\u003C/strong\u003E: qolka gudihiisa ilaa wajiyada darbiyada, ka jaro jasiirado kasta oo gudaheeda ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaldhigga darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E: dherka darbiyada qolka ka jaro ballaca albaabbadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoobada\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa loo dhigaa sida shabakad ka bilaabanaysa geeska dusha, iyada oo xidhiidh keliya u dhexeeya dhoobada. Dhoobo dusha si buuxda ugu jirta waa dhoobo oo dhan; dhoobo qayb ka mid ah ugu jirta (geeska, ama meel albaab ku wareegsan) waa dhoobo la jaray. Dhoobada la dalbanayo waa oo dhan iyo kuwa la jaray, oo lagu daro ogolaanshaha qashinka, oo lagu wareejiyo sare. Dhoobo kasta oo la jaray waxa loo tiriyaa dhoobo cusub: jarxumaha lama dib u isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMugga salka\u003C/strong\u003E: balaca saafi ah oo lagu dhufto dhumucda salka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro lagu calaamadiyay \u003Cstrong\u003E≈\u003C/strong\u003E waxa lagu xisaabiyaa bedka, halkii laga dhigi lahaa dhoobo dhoobo: dusha gobol qoran laga jaray, ama mid aad u weyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha (property set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Finishes\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca). Qol kasta oo dhamaystir leh waxa kale oo helaa property set-ka caadiga ah ee IFC \u003Ccode\u003EPset_SpaceCoveringRequirements\u003C/code\u003E, si barnaamijyada kale magacyada u akhriyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta dhoobada waxa ka bilaabmaysa geesaha. Habayn dhexda qolka ku taal, qaab (herringbone, brick bond) iyo dib u isticmaalka jarxumaha lama xisaabin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbi wareegan, iyo xadka qolka oo aan darbi ahayn (kala-goynta qolka), waxa lagu diiwaangeliyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EXad kale\u003C/strong\u003E dherkiisa iyo aan albaab lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGelitaanka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka\u003C/strong\u003E ee hore jiray wuxuu liistaa lakabyada dhamaystirka noocyada darbiyada; \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada: bedka iyo mugga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa lakab kasta oo nooc lakabeysan kasta. Dhamaystirka qolalka halkan waa wixii lagu dabaqo qolka dusha ka sare kuwaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawiye ayaa kuu dejin kara dhamaystirka adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ccode\u003Efinishes_set\u003C/code\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EOggolow caawiye AI inuu moodelkaaga la shaqeeyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid U sheeg BimCraft mar keliya waxa qol kastaa lagu dhamaysanayo. Jadwallada dhamaystirka markaas waxay siinayaan bedadka, dhoobada la dalbanayo iyo mugga salka, oo waxay isbeddelaan marka moodelka la beddelo. Tallaabooyinka Shid Sawir, fur Jadwallada dhinaca bidix oo guji Dhamaystirka qolalka. Hoosta Noocyada dhamaystirka, guji Ku dar nooca dhamaystirka. U sheeg magac, nooc (dhoobo, xaashi, lakab ama gabal) iyo dhumuc. Dhoobo ahaan, u sheeg dherer iyo ballac dhoobada, xidhiidhka iyo ogolaanshaha qashinka boqolkiiba. Haddii wax dhamaystirka hoostiisa ku jiro (screed, lawin dhabar, lakab plaster), magacaabo hoosta Salka oo u sheeg dhumucdiisa. Hoosta Qolalka, dooro dhamaystirka sagxadda, darbiga iyo saqafka qol kasta. Qor magaca saldhigga darbiga iyo dherkiisa haddii qolku leeyahay. Hoosta Gobollada, guji Ku dar gobol qayb qol ah oo dhamaystir kale qaadanaysa: gobol darbi waa qaybta u dhexaysa laba dherar oo sare sagxadda (daboolka biyaha ee 0 ilaa 1200, dado). Waxa uu ku jiraa darbi kasta oo qolka ka mid ah, ama dooro darbiyada qolkaas moodelka oo guji badhanka Shid si aad ugu xaddido. gobol sagxad ama saqaf waa bed aad qortid. Waxa laga jaraa dhamaystirka qolka laftiisa. Guji Kaydi. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Dherarka waxaa lagu qoraa cutubyada mashruuca. Jadwallada Afar gelitaan ayaa ku biiraya liiska Jadwallada: Dhamaystirka qolka: qol kasta oo sagxadda, darbiga iyo saqafkiisa dhamaystirka, bedadkooda, iyo saldhigga darbiga oo dherkiisa. Dhamaystirka darbiga: dhinac kasta oo darbi oo qolka ka mid ah iyo qaybta ay dhamaystirku daboolo, oo leh dherkeeda, balaca guud, ka jarista, balaca saafi ah iyo, dhoobada ah, dhoobada oo dhan, dhoobada la jaray iyo dhoobada la dalbanayo. Dhamaystirka gobolka: gobol kasta oo dhamaystirkiisa, balaca saafi ah, dhoobada iyo mugga salka. Qadarka dhamaystirka: hal safka dhamaystir kasta: balaca saafi ah, dhoobada oo dhan iyo kuwa la jaray, dhoobada la dalbanayo, salka iyo mugiisa, iyo mugga dhamaystirka laftiisa. Kooxee, wadar, kaydi oo u dhoofi sida jadwal kasta: eeg Habayn, kaydi iyo dhoofinta jadwal. Guji tiro si aad u doorato wixii ka timid: ka jarista darbi wuxuu doortaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa. Sida dhamaystirka loo cabbiro Darbiyada: dhinac kasta oo darbi oo qolka ka mid ah, dherkiisa dhex qolka marka lagu dhufto dherka uu dhamaystirku daboolo, oo ka jaro qaybta albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta oo dherkaas gudaheeda ku jirta. Darbi ka hooseeya qolka waa la dhamaysanayaa ilaa sarkiisa. Habka cabbirka mashruuca ayaa go'aamiya furaha ku yar oo aan la jaraynin (Jadwallada). Sagxadaha iyo saqafyada: qolka gudihiisa ilaa wajiyada darbiyada, ka jaro jasiirado kasta oo gudaheeda ku jira. Saldhigga darbiga: dherka darbiyada qolka ka jaro ballaca albaabbadiisa. Dhoobada: waxa loo dhigaa sida shabakad ka bilaabanaysa geeska dusha, iyada oo xidhiidh keliya u dhexeeya dhoobada. Dhoobo dusha si buuxda ugu jirta waa dhoobo oo dhan; dhoobo qayb ka mid ah ugu jirta (geeska, ama meel albaab ku wareegsan) waa dhoobo la jaray. Dhoobada la dalbanayo waa oo dhan iyo kuwa la jaray, oo lagu daro ogolaanshaha qashinka, oo lagu wareejiyo sare. Dhoobo kasta oo la jaray waxa loo tiriyaa dhoobo cusub: jarxumaha lama dib u isticmaalo. Mugga salka: balaca saafi ah oo lagu dhufto dhumucda salka. Tiro lagu calaamadiyay ≈ waxa lagu xisaabiyaa bedka, halkii laga dhigi lahaa dhoobo dhoobo: dusha gobol qoran laga jaray, ama mid aad u weyn. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Dhamaystirka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha (property set CadCraft_Finishes ee mashruuca). Qol kasta oo dhamaystir leh waxa kale oo helaa property set-ka caadiga ah ee IFC Pset_SpaceCoveringRequirements, si barnaamijyada kale magacyada u akhriyaan. Habaynta dhoobada waxa ka bilaabmaysa geesaha. Habayn dhexda qolka ku taal, qaab (herringbone, brick bond) iyo dib u isticmaalka jarxumaha lama xisaabin. Darbi wareegan, iyo xadka qolka oo aan darbi ahayn (kala-goynta qolka), waxa lagu diiwaangeliyaa Xad kale dherkiisa iyo aan albaab lahayn. Gelitaanka Dhamaystirka ee hore jiray wuxuu liistaa lakabyada dhamaystirka noocyada darbiyada; Lakabyada: bedka iyo mugga wuxuu liistaa lakab kasta oo nooc lakabeysan kasta. Dhamaystirka qolalka halkan waa wixii lagu dabaqo qolka dusha ka sare kuwaas. Caawiye ayaa kuu dejin kara dhamaystirka adigoo isticmaalaya finishes_set: eeg Oggolow caawiye AI inuu moodelkaaga la shaqeeyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"massing-options","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Doorashooyinka mugga dhismaha ee wada jira","summary":"Ku hay dhowr doorashooyin oo mug dhismaha ah moodel isku mid ah, mid ka dhig doorashada hadda jirta, u hubi khadka dhismaha iyo xuquuqda gudbinta, ka qaad mugga dhismaha ModelCraft, oo doorashada la doortay u horumari darbiyo iyo sagxado.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["mugga dhismaha","mass","doorasho","doorashooyin","set-ka doorashada","qorshe","fikrad","naqshadda fikradda","heer 2","beddelaad","barbardhigga doorashooyinka","doorashada hadda jirta","mugga dhismaha","horumari mugga","xuquuqda gudbinta","khadka dhismaha","dib-u-dhig","modelcraft","civilcraft","aagga sagxadda guud","bannaanka dhismaha","mugga","riix-jiid"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-doorasho","text":"Kaydi doorasho","level":2},{"id":"doorashada-hadda-jirta","text":"Doorashada hadda jirta","level":2},{"id":"mugga-dhismaha-modelcraft","text":"Mugga dhismaha ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"horumari-doorashada-la-doortay","text":"Horumari doorashada la doortay","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-ogaato","text":"Waxa ku habboon inaad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu hay doorashooyinka mugga dhismaha ee fikrad mid ah moodel kali ah halkii faylal kala gaar ah: dhowr mug dhismaha oo wada jira, mid ka mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003Edoorashada hadda jirta\u003C/strong\u003E, kuwa kale waa la kaydiyaa barbardhig ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorasho mugga dhismaha waa mug dhismaha: qaab-dhismaha kor loo qaadayo sare, iyo tiro dabaq. Ma aha darbiyo weli. Waxaad kaydin kartaa intii aad rabto, oo lagu kooxayn karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eset-ka doorashada\u003C/strong\u003E (doorashooyinka hal set-ka ka tirsan waa kala beddelaad).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-doorasho\"\u003EKaydi doorasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarnaamijka qolalka ilaa qaabka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E, qor barnaamijka qolalka iyo bannaanka, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoorashooyinka raadinta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mid ka mid ah doorashooyinka la liistay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoorashooyinka mugga dhismaha ee moodelka\u003C/span\u003E, qor magac \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet-ka doorashada\u003C/span\u003E haddii aad rabto, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHay doorashada la doortay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorashadu waxay ka muuqataa moodelka sida mug dhismaha iyo liiska, iyada oo dabaqyadeeda, bannaanka dhismaha, aagga sagxadda guud iyo mugga. Waxba lama dhisin. Mid kale isla siyaabaha kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorashada koowaad ee set-ka waa doorashada hadda jirta. Tallaabo kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorashada-hadda-jirta\"\u003EDoorashada hadda jirta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid ka mid ah doorashooyin kasta set kasta waa midka hadda jira. Taasi waxay leedahay laba micne:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyadeeda waxay noqdaan aagagga sagxadda dhismaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Doorashada hadda jirta waxay leedahay meel kasta oo dabaq kasta oo qaadda aagga sagxadda guud ee dabaqaas, sidaas darteed wax kasta oo akhriya aagagga dabaqyada wuxuu arkaa doorashada firfircoon oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa la hubiyaa goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii ay ka baxdo xadka goobta, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda gudbinta, digniin magaceeda ku qoran ayaa ka muuqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E. Digniin keliya ayaa: waxba lama diido. Doorashooyinka aan hadda jirin lama hubiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig mid hadda jira\u003C/span\u003E doorasho kale si aad u beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari doorashooyinka aan hadda jirin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa kuwa kale aragga 3D. Taasi browser-kan oo keliya ayaa, faylka lama kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mugga-dhismaha-modelcraft\"\u003EMugga dhismaha ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMugga dhismaha ilaa BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u diraa kooxda ama component kasta sida doorasho mid ah. BimCraft wuxuu furaa faylka isagoo liistaa doorashooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu soo geliso moodel horey u furan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar doorashooyinka mugga faylka ka\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Mugagiisa waxay soo galaan sida doorashooyinka set, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod, iyagoo ku taagan meesha lagu sawiray. Fayl mugga dhismaha oo CivilCraft ah wuxuu u shaqeeyaa isla sidaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorasho lagu calaamadiyay &quot;(shape simplified)&quot; (qaabka la fudaydiyay) ma ahayn bloog toosan oo ModelCraft ku jirtay (way dib u dhigtaa, way dalool tahay ama ma xirna). Mugga halkan waa khadka aasaaska ee lagu kor qaaday sarreeyaha; aagagga dabaqyadeeda iyo mugga waa kuwa laga qiyaasay jidhka adag laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"horumari-doorashada-la-doortay\"\u003EHorumari doorashada la doortay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHorumari\u003C/span\u003E doorasho. Waxay noqotaa heer (lagu daray tirada dabaqyadeeda), darbiyo ku wareegsan khadka aasaaska dabaq kasta, iyo sagxad dabaq kasta, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Doorashadu waxay ka baxdaa liiska; doorashooyinka kale waxay sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Saqaf weli ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa magaca doorashada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa moodelka. Marka la saaro doorashada hadda jirta, doorashada kale ee koowaad ee set-ka ayaa hadda jirta noqonaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorasho kasta oo la kaydiyay oo ah bloog aragga 3D iyo safka liiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(hadda jira)&quot; dhinaca mid ka mid ah doorashooyin kasta set kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigniin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E marka doorashada hadda jirta ay gudbiso xadka goobta, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda gudbinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-ogaato\"\u003EWaxa ku habboon inaad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorasho moodelka IFC waa building element proxy oo leh guddiga sifooyinka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteMass\u003C/code\u003E (set-kiisa doorashada, magaca doorashada iyo haddii ay hadda jirto ayaa ku jira guddigaas). Dabaqyada doorashada hadda jirta waa spaces nooca \u003Ccode\u003EMassingFloor\u003C/code\u003E. Barnaamijyada kale waxay akhriyaan proxy-ga sida element guud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta doorasho weligeed ma kordhiso heerarka; horumarinta ayaa kordhisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawiye ayaa liistada doorashooyinka kaydsan, doorasho kaydin, mid ka dhig hadda jirta, magac beddel, horumari ama ka saar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku hay doorashooyinka mugga dhismaha ee fikrad mid ah moodel kali ah halkii faylal kala gaar ah: dhowr mug dhismaha oo wada jira, mid ka mid ah doorashada hadda jirta, kuwa kale waa la kaydiyaa barbardhig ahaan. Doorasho mugga dhismaha waa mug dhismaha: qaab-dhismaha kor loo qaadayo sare, iyo tiro dabaq. Ma aha darbiyo weli. Waxaad kaydin kartaa intii aad rabto, oo lagu kooxayn karaa set-ka doorashada (doorashooyinka hal set-ka ka tirsan waa kala beddelaad). Kaydi doorasho Fur Barnaamijka qolalka ilaa qaabka dhismaha, qor barnaamijka qolalka iyo bannaanka, kadibna dooro Doorashooyinka raadinta. Dooro mid ka mid ah doorashooyinka la liistay. Hoos Doorashooyinka mugga dhismaha ee moodelka, qor magac Set-ka doorashada haddii aad rabto, kadibna dooro Hay doorashada la doortay. Doorashadu waxay ka muuqataa moodelka sida mug dhismaha iyo liiska, iyada oo dabaqyadeeda, bannaanka dhismaha, aagga sagxadda guud iyo mugga. Waxba lama dhisin. Mid kale isla siyaabaha kaydi. Doorashada koowaad ee set-ka waa doorashada hadda jirta. Tallaabo kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Doorashada hadda jirta Mid ka mid ah doorashooyin kasta set kasta waa midka hadda jira. Taasi waxay leedahay laba micne: Dabaqyadeeda waxay noqdaan aagagga sagxadda dhismaha. Doorashada hadda jirta waxay leedahay meel kasta oo dabaq kasta oo qaadda aagga sagxadda guud ee dabaqaas, sidaas darteed wax kasta oo akhriya aagagga dabaqyada wuxuu arkaa doorashada firfircoon oo keliya. Waa la hubiyaa goobta. Haddii ay ka baxdo xadka goobta, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda gudbinta, digniin magaceeda ku qoran ayaa ka muuqda Dhibaatooyin. Digniin keliya ayaa: waxba lama diido. Doorashooyinka aan hadda jirin lama hubiyo. Calaamee Ka dhig mid hadda jira doorasho kale si aad u beddesho. Qari doorashooyinka aan hadda jirin wuxuu qariyaa kuwa kale aragga 3D. Taasi browser-kan oo keliya ayaa, faylka lama kaydiyo. Mugga dhismaha ModelCraft ModelCraft, Dhoofi › Mugga dhismaha ilaa BimCraft… wuxuu u diraa kooxda ama component kasta sida doorasho mid ah. BimCraft wuxuu furaa faylka isagoo liistaa doorashooyinka. Si aad ugu soo geliso moodel horey u furan, dooro Ku dar doorashooyinka mugga faylka ka oo dooro faylka .ifc. Mugagiisa waxay soo galaan sida doorashooyinka set, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod, iyagoo ku taagan meesha lagu sawiray. Fayl mugga dhismaha oo CivilCraft ah wuxuu u shaqeeyaa isla sidaas. Doorasho lagu calaamadiyay \"(shape simplified)\" (qaabka la fudaydiyay) ma ahayn bloog toosan oo ModelCraft ku jirtay (way dib u dhigtaa, way dalool tahay ama ma xirna). Mugga halkan waa khadka aasaaska ee lagu kor qaaday sarreeyaha; aagagga dabaqyadeeda iyo mugga waa kuwa laga qiyaasay jidhka adag laftiisa. Horumari doorashada la doortay Dooro Horumari doorasho. Waxay noqotaa heer (lagu daray tirada dabaqyadeeda), darbiyo ku wareegsan khadka aasaaska dabaq kasta, iyo sagxad dabaq kasta, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Doorashadu waxay ka baxdaa liiska; doorashooyinka kale waxay sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Saqaf weli ma jiro. Magac cusub wuxuu beddelaa magaca doorashada, Ka saar wuxuu ka saaraa moodelka. Marka la saaro doorashada hadda jirta, doorashada kale ee koowaad ee set-ka ayaa hadda jirta noqonaysa. Waxa aad arki doontid Doorasho kasta oo la kaydiyay oo ah bloog aragga 3D iyo safka liiska. \"(hadda jira)\" dhinaca mid ka mid ah doorashooyin kasta set kasta. Digniin Dhibaatooyin marka doorashada hadda jirta ay gudbiso xadka goobta, khadka dhismaha ama xuquuqda gudbinta. Waxa ku habboon inaad ogaato Doorasho moodelka IFC waa building element proxy oo leh guddiga sifooyinka CadCraft_SiteMass (set-kiisa doorashada, magaca doorashada iyo haddii ay hadda jirto ayaa ku jira guddigaas). Dabaqyada doorashada hadda jirta waa spaces nooca MassingFloor. Barnaamijyada kale waxay akhriyaan proxy-ga sida element guud. Kaydinta doorasho weligeed ma kordhiso heerarka; horumarinta ayaa kordhisa. Caawiye ayaa liistada doorashooyinka kaydsan, doorasho kaydin, mid ka dhig hadda jirta, magac beddel, horumari ama ka saar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"kitchens-and-baths","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Jikooyinka, musqusha iyo alaabta guriga ee kooxda guryaha","summary":"Dhig kabaadhka, miisaska musqusha, qalabka, qalabka biyo-mareenka iyo alaabta guriga ee maktabadda darbiyada hoosteeda, kadibna dhig miisaska shaqada ee kabaadhka hoose ee raacaya.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["jikada","kabaad","kabaad hoose","kabaad sare","kabaad geeska","pantry","kabaadhka biyaha","lazy susan","vanity","miis shaqo","countertop","qalab","firiij","foornada","dishwasher","hood","mashiinka dharka","mashiinka qalliinka","musqusha","biyo-mareen","bathtub","shower","sariir","sofa","miis","guri"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"dhig-kabaadhka-iyo-qalabka","text":"Dhig kabaadhka iyo qalabka","level":2},{"id":"miisaska-shaqada","text":"Miisaska shaqada","level":2},{"id":"albaabbada-iyo-daaqadaha","text":"Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHagaaji jikooyinka, musqusha iyo qolalka kooxda guryaha: kabaadhka, miisaska musqusha, qalabka, qalabka biyo-mareenka iyo alaabta guriga oo ay sameeyeen CadCraft oo xor u ah in la isticmaalo (CC0). Waxay ka yimaadaan maktabadda oo waxay ku habboonaadaan darbiyada; miisaska shaqada ayaa kadib lagu dhigaa hal-guji oo kabaadhka hoose ee raacaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-kabaadhka-iyo-qalabka\"\u003EDhig kabaadhka iyo qalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro qayb: \u003Cstrong\u003EKabaadhka\u003C/strong\u003E (kabaadhka hoose, sare iyo dheer, miisaska musqusha), \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka guriga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-mareenka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta\u003C/strong\u003E. Raadinta \u003Ccode\u003Ebase cabinet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EB24\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EW3030\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Etoilet\u003C/code\u003E ayaa sidoo kale helaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walax oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro heerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhow darbi oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu tiirsato: dhabarka walxa wuxuu ku dhacaa wejiga darbiga. Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u leexiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji si aad u dhigto. Walxa xiga isla markiiba ku dhig; safka kabaadhka waa kabaadho isku xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKabaadhka darbiga, microwave-ka ee dusha foornada, hoodyada foornada iyo biyo-dhaqyada jikada waxay leeyihiin dhererkooda: dhig dhulka sida walxaha kale, oo waxay u dhaxlaan (ama u fadhiistaan) meesha ay ku qummanaan lahaayeen — kabaadhka darbiga 54&quot; sare; biyo-dhaqe miis shaqo 36&quot; ah. Kabaadhka geesaha waxay galaan geeska gudaha, dhabarkooda hal darbi iyo dhinacooda darbiga kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaska-shaqada\"\u003EMiisaska shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerka, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECountertop\u003C/span\u003E. Deji \u003Cstrong\u003EFront overhang\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EThickness\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aanay ahayn 1&quot; iyo 1½&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu tiirsii safka kabaadhka hoose: miiska shaqada ee la samayn doono ayaa muuqda hoostooda kabaadhka oo dhan oo isku xiga, xataa geesaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska shaqada waxaa laga sameeyaa kabaadhka hoostiisa. Markaad kabaad ku darto ama ka saarto, miiska shaqada waxaa lagu muujiyaa qorqorro (dashed) qorshaha ilaa uu ku habboonaado: guji safka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECountertop\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro miiska shaqada oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKu habee kabaadhka\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E. Isbedel kasta oo darbiyada heerkaas ku jira ayaa miisaska shaqada si toos ah u habeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"albaabbada-iyo-daaqadaha\"\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda waxay leeyihiin noocyo guriga ah: \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab kabaad oo laab leh\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabbo Faransiis\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab bahal (darbiga dushiisa)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab galitaan oo sidelites leh\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAwning\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqad sawir\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETransom\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaska shaqada waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida alaab (&quot;Countertop&quot;) oo leh balaadhkooda, dhererka iyo geesta hore, oo diyaar u ah xisaabinta qadarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJarista biyo-dhaqyada miisaska shaqada iyo daboolka darbiga hoose weli lama sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirradu waa cabbirro caadi ah oo magac-la&#039;aan ah, ma aha alaabta shirkad gaar ah; hubi cabbirrada alaabta dhabta ah ka hor inta aadan dalbanayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hagaaji jikooyinka, musqusha iyo qolalka kooxda guryaha: kabaadhka, miisaska musqusha, qalabka, qalabka biyo-mareenka iyo alaabta guriga oo ay sameeyeen CadCraft oo xor u ah in la isticmaalo (CC0). Waxay ka yimaadaan maktabadda oo waxay ku habboonaadaan darbiyada; miisaska shaqada ayaa kadib lagu dhigaa hal-guji oo kabaadhka hoose ee raacaya. Dhig kabaadhka iyo qalabka Fur tab-ka Maktabad oo dooro qayb: Kabaadhka (kabaadhka hoose, sare iyo dheer, miisaska musqusha), Qalabka guriga, Biyo-mareenka, Alaabta. Raadinta base cabinet, B24, W3030 ama toilet ayaa sidoo kale helaysa. Dooro walax oo dooro Dhig. Dooro heerka. Ku dhow darbi oo taabo Tab si aad ugu tiirsato: dhabarka walxa wuxuu ku dhacaa wejiga darbiga. Taabo R si aad u leexiso. Guji si aad u dhigto. Walxa xiga isla markiiba ku dhig; safka kabaadhka waa kabaadho isku xiga. Kabaadhka darbiga, microwave-ka ee dusha foornada, hoodyada foornada iyo biyo-dhaqyada jikada waxay leeyihiin dhererkooda: dhig dhulka sida walxaha kale, oo waxay u dhaxlaan (ama u fadhiistaan) meesha ay ku qummanaan lahaayeen — kabaadhka darbiga 54\" sare; biyo-dhaqe miis shaqo 36\" ah. Kabaadhka geesaha waxay galaan geeska gudaha, dhabarkooda hal darbi iyo dhinacooda darbiga kale. Miisaska shaqada Heerka, fur Build oo dooro Countertop. Deji Front overhang iyo Thickness haddii aanay ahayn 1\" iyo 1½\". Ku tiirsii safka kabaadhka hoose: miiska shaqada ee la samayn doono ayaa muuqda hoostooda kabaadhka oo dhan oo isku xiga, xataa geesaha. Guji. Miiska shaqada waxaa laga sameeyaa kabaadhka hoostiisa. Markaad kabaad ku darto ama ka saarto, miiska shaqada waxaa lagu muujiyaa qorqorro (dashed) qorshaha ilaa uu ku habboonaado: guji safka Countertop, ama dooro miiska shaqada oo dooro Ku habee kabaadhka ee Sifooyinka. Isbedel kasta oo darbiyada heerkaas ku jira ayaa miisaska shaqada si toos ah u habeeya. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha Qalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda waxay leeyihiin noocyo guriga ah: Albaab kabaad oo laab leh, Albaabbo Faransiis, Albaab bahal (darbiga dushiisa), Albaab galitaan oo sidelites leh, Awning, Daaqad sawir iyo Transom (eeg Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha). Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Miisaska shaqada waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida alaab (\"Countertop\") oo leh balaadhkooda, dhererka iyo geesta hore, oo diyaar u ah xisaabinta qadarka. Jarista biyo-dhaqyada miisaska shaqada iyo daboolka darbiga hoose weli lama sameeyo. Cabbirradu waa cabbirro caadi ah oo magac-la'aan ah, ma aha alaabta shirkad gaar ah; hubi cabbirrada alaabta dhabta ah ka hor inta aadan dalbanayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Raadi curiyayaasha sida nooca, magaca ama sifada","summary":"Hel curiye kasta oo buuxinaya hal ama in ka badan oo xeer ah — nooca, magaca, qaabka, dabaqa, agabka ama qiimaha sifo kasta — dhammaantood dooro, oo xeerarka u kaydi sida koox raadin magac leh.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["raadi","raadin","shaandhee","weydiin","xeer","koox raadin","koox doorasho","raadin la kaydiyay","sifo","qiime","nooca","agab","dooro dhammaan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"marka-xigta","text":"Marka xigta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro curiyayaal isku nooc ah ama isku qiime ah tallaabo keliya: albaab kasta, derbi kasta oo ku yaal Heer 2, curiye kasta oo darajada EI60 leh, derbi kasta oo ka qaali ah qadar la dejiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal panelka bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXeerka koowaad, dooro sifo (curiyayaasha kuwooda marka hore, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaq\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna xidhmooyinka sifada moodelka), sida loo barbar dhigayo, iyo qiime. Sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu soo jeedinayaa qiimayaasha moodelku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u yarayso, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xeer\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXeer kasta\u003C/span\u003E si aad u baahato dhammaantood, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMid kasta\u003C/span\u003E mid keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqa qiimaha. Waxa iska hor imanaya ayaa la doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad xeerarka u kaydiso, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida koox raadin\u003C/span\u003E, qor magac, kadibna mar kale guji. Markaad dambe guji magaca kooxda si aad ugu raadiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIska hor imaanta waxaa lagu doortaa aragga 3D iyo geedka moodelka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E oo sheegaya tirada iska hor imaanta nooca. Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u muujiso kuwaas keliya, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u qariso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EErayada way iska hor imaanayaan iyagoo aan u eegin xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar. Tirooyinku way is barbar dhigaan: &quot;ka weyn 1000&quot; waxa loola jeedaa qiimaha, qoraalka ma aha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ewuxuu leeyahay qiime\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ema laha qiime\u003C/span\u003E ma baahan qiime; waxay raadiyaan wixii buuxa ama wixii maqan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoobabka la kaydiyay waxay ku sii jiraan browserkan moodel kasta oo aad furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba lama helin.\u003C/strong\u003E Xeerku waa inuu leeyahay qiime uu iska hor imaan karo: eeg soo jeedinta sanduuqa qiimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifo ma ku jirto liiska.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro curiye moodelkan leh qaab jireed oo leh sifadaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-xigta\"\u003EMarka xigta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EMidabka curiyayaasha sida sifada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo ka dhex arag curiyayaasha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dooro curiyayaal isku nooc ah ama isku qiime ah tallaabo keliya: albaab kasta, derbi kasta oo ku yaal Heer 2, curiye kasta oo darajada EI60 leh, derbi kasta oo ka qaali ah qadar la dejiyay. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC. Fur Raadi oo ku yaal panelka bidix. Xeerka koowaad, dooro sifo (curiyayaasha kuwooda marka hore, sida Nooca iyo Dabaq, kadibna xidhmooyinka sifada moodelka), sida loo barbar dhigayo, iyo qiime. Sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu soo jeedinayaa qiimayaasha moodelku leeyahay. Si aad u yarayso, guji Ku dar xeer. Dooro Xeer kasta si aad u baahato dhammaantood, ama Mid kasta mid keliya. Guji Raadi, ama taabo Enter sanduuqa qiimaha. Waxa iska hor imanaya ayaa la doortaa. Si aad xeerarka u kaydiso, guji Kaydi sida koox raadin, qor magac, kadibna mar kale guji. Markaad dambe guji magaca kooxda si aad ugu raadiso. Waxa aad arki doontid Iska hor imaanta waxaa lagu doortaa aragga 3D iyo geedka moodelka, iyo Sifooyinka oo sheegaya tirada iska hor imaanta nooca. Taabo I si aad u muujiso kuwaas keliya, H si aad u qariso. Erayada way iska hor imaanayaan iyagoo aan u eegin xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar. Tirooyinku way is barbar dhigaan: \"ka weyn 1000\" waxa loola jeedaa qiimaha, qoraalka ma aha. wuxuu leeyahay qiime iyo ma laha qiime ma baahan qiime; waxay raadiyaan wixii buuxa ama wixii maqan. Koobabka la kaydiyay waxay ku sii jiraan browserkan moodel kasta oo aad furto. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Waxba lama helin. Xeerku waa inuu leeyahay qiime uu iska hor imaan karo: eeg soo jeedinta sanduuqa qiimaha. Sifo ma ku jirto liiska. Ma jiro curiye moodelkan leh qaab jireed oo leh sifadaas. Marka xigta Midabka curiyayaasha sida sifada Qari, kala saar oo ka dhex arag curiyayaasha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"stairs-and-railings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Jaranjarro iyo gacan-qabsiyo","summary":"Samee jaranjarro toosan, L, U iyo leexo oo xisaabiya kor-kacyada iyo tallaabooyinka laga bilaabo dhererka u dhexeeya dabaqyada, oo leh gacan-qabsiyo iyo baluster-yo, iyo godka jaranjarka ee dabaqa kor ku yaal; samee gacan-qabsiyo dhinacyada dhulka iyo godka ku wareegsan.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["wareeg","jaranjar wareeg","jaranjar","jaranjarro","jaranjar gooyo","kor-kac","tallaabo","dhexaad","leexo","jaranjar L","jaranjar U","leexasho","gacan-qabsi","ammaan","guardrail","baluster","tiir","newel","post","godka jaranjarka","madhanka sare","deck","balkoon"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-jaranjar","text":"Samee jaranjar","level":2},{"id":"samee-jaranjar-wareeg","text":"Samee jaranjar wareeg","level":2},{"id":"sida-tallaabooyinka-loo-xisaabiyo","text":"Sida tallaabooyinka loo xisaabiyo","level":2},{"id":"beddel-jaranjar","text":"Beddel jaranjar","level":2},{"id":"godka-jaranjarka","text":"Godka jaranjarka","level":2},{"id":"samee-gacan-qabsi","text":"Samee gacan-qabsi","level":2},{"id":"samee-derbi","text":"Samee derbi","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-kaydiyay","text":"Waxa la kaydiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dar jaranjarro dhexdooda heerarka iyo gacan-qabsiyo meelaha dadku u baahan yihiin. Jaranjarku wuxuu xisaabiyaa tallaabooyinkiisa laga bilaabo dhererka u dhexeeya heerarka, wuxuu ilaaliyaa xadka caadiga ah ee guriga, wuxuu dhigaa gacan-qabsiyada dhinacyada furan, wuxuuna jaraa godka jaranjarka dabaqa kor ku yaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-jaranjar\"\u003ESamee jaranjar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerka ay jaranjarku ka bilaabanto, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJaranjar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca — \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EL oo leh dhexaad (landing)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EU oo leh dhexaad\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EL oo leh leexo (winders)\u003C/strong\u003E — halka uu \u003Cstrong\u003Eleexanayo\u003C/strong\u003E (turn), \u003Cstrong\u003Eballacniisa\u003C/strong\u003E (width) iyo meesha ay \u003Cstrong\u003Egacan-qabsiyadiisu\u003C/strong\u003E (handrails) ku yaalliin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha jaranjarku ka bilaabanto: dhexda geesha hore ee tallaabada ugu hooseysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji mouse-ka dhinaca jaranjarku u kacayo; tallaabooyinku way raacaan, iyagoo tusaya tirada kor-kacyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Waxay ku qabsanaysaa darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka 15°; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u hayso isku siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u bilaabaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-jaranjar-wareeg\"\u003ESamee jaranjar wareeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJaranjar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg\u003C/strong\u003E (Spiral) sida nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003ELeexo\u003C/strong\u003E (Turn), oo muujinaya dhinaca ay ku leexanayso marka ay kor u kacayso (bidix waa xagal saacadda ka soo horjeeda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji bartaa tiirkeeda (center post).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji jihada ay tallaabada hoose ee ugu horeysa u tilmaamayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ka bilaabataa ballac 30&quot; (tallaabada, tiirka ka bilaabmaysa ilaa dibadda), oo leh tiir 4½&quot;. Kor-kacyada waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa dhererka u dhexeeya dabaqa iyo heerka kor ku jira, ugu badnaan 9½&quot; si caadi ah. Tallaabooyinku waa 7½&quot; qoto dheer khadka socodka, 12&quot; ka fogaan tiirka. Gacan-qabsigu wuxuu socdaa dibadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E jaranjarka wareegu wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003ECenter post\u003C/strong\u003E, dhexroorkeeda. Goobta \u003Cstrong\u003ETread\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu cabbiraa khadka socodka. Hubinteeda waa qiimayaal caadi ah oo loo calaamadeeyay jaranjarrada wareegga: ballac furan oo 26&quot;, tallaabo ugu yaraan 6¾&quot; khadka socodka, kor-kac ugu badnaan 9½&quot; iyo gacan-qabsiyo 34&quot;–38&quot;. Ma aha injineernimo; mas&#039;uulka dhismaha ayaa go&#039;aamiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-tallaabooyinka-loo-xisaabiyo\"\u003ESida tallaabooyinka loo xisaabiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasaafada u dhexeysa dhulka heerka iyo heerka kor ku jira waxaa loo kala qaybiyaa kor-kac isku mid ah oo aan ka sarreyn 7¾&quot;, tallaabo kasta waxay ahaan doontaa 10&quot; qoto dheer (labadaba waa la beddeli karaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E). Dhexaadku wuxuu tiriyaa hal tallaabo; leexooyinku waa saddex tallaabo oo ku faafsan geeska gudaha. Beddel dhererka heerka, jaranjar kasta oo ku jirta waa dib loo xisaabiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E7¾&quot; kor-kac, 10&quot; tallaabo, 36&quot; ballac, 6&#039;-8&quot; madhan-sare iyo 34&quot;–38&quot; gacan-qabsi waa qiimayaal caadi ah oo loo calaamadeeyay kadib xeerka caadiga ah ee guryaha, ma aha injineernimo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sheegaya kuwa la buuxiyay; mas&#039;uulka dhismaha ayaa go&#039;aamiya waxa khuseeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-jaranjar\"\u003EBeddel jaranjar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro (guji qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D) oo beddel \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: nooca iyo leexashada, ballacka, kor-kaca ugu sarreeya, dhererka tallaabada, gacan-qabsiyada iyo dhererkooda, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJar dabaqa kor ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E ee godka jaranjarka. Kor-kacyada iyo tallaabooyinka ugu dambeeyay ee ay heleen waa la muujiyaa hoostooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godka-jaranjarka\"\u003EGodka jaranjarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii heerka kor ku jira uu leeyahay dhul, jaranjarku wuxuu jaraa meesha tallaabooyinku ay madhan-sare ka yaraan 6&#039;-8&quot;. Jarku wuu raacaa jaranjarka, wuuna baxaa marka jaranjarka la tirtiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-gacan-qabsi\"\u003ESamee gacan-qabsi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGacan-qabsi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EGuardrail\u003C/strong\u003E (36&quot; dheer) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EHandrail\u003C/strong\u003E iyo dhererkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhinaca — dhul, balkoon, ku wareeg godka jaranjarka — oo laba jeer guji ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGacan-qabsiyada waxay helaan tiirar dhamaadyadooda iyo geesaha, iyo baluster-yo leh furuq ka yar 4&quot;. Dooro mid si aad u beddesho nooceeda, dherkeeda ama sida uu u bilaabmo ka sarreeya dabaqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-derbi\"\u003ESamee derbi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFence\u003C/strong\u003E isla qalabka Railing, deji dherkeeda (1800 mm marka hore), guji dhinaca khadka derbiga oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDerbigu wuxuu helaa tiir dhamaadyo kasta iyo geesaha kasta, iyo tiir ugu badnaan 2.4 m u dhexeeya. Derbi panel leh wuxuu leeyahay panel u dhexeeya tiirarka; derbi xadhig leh wuxuu leeyahay laba xadhig. Cabbirkan waa xulasho caadi ah, ma aha shuruud xeer; xeerarka maxalliga ah ayaa xaddidaya dhererka derbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa hal walax moodelka ku jira (IfcRailing oo magacaysan Fence) oo leh kooxda sifooyinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft_Fence\u003C/span\u003E: qaabka, dhererka, tiirarka, panelada, xadhigyada, irdaha, dhererka iyo balaadhinta panelka. Hal tallaabo oo soo celin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHalkan lama sawirin: irdaha (CivilCraft ayaa u diyaariya), xiidooyin (pickets), dhulka (derbigu wuxuu taagan yahay heerka), iyo dooro hal tiir kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-kaydiyay\"\u003EWaxa la kaydiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJaranjarku wuxuu u kaydsan yahay sida jaranjar IFC oo ka kooban jaranjarro (oo leh kor-kac, tallaabo iyo dherer tallaabo), dhexaad, leexo iyo gacan-qabsiyo; godka jaranjarka waa furitaan ku jira dabaqa dhulka kor ku yaal. Gacan-qabsiyadu waa IFC railings oo leh dhererkooda iyo tirada baluster-yada iyo tiirarka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku dar jaranjarro dhexdooda heerarka iyo gacan-qabsiyo meelaha dadku u baahan yihiin. Jaranjarku wuxuu xisaabiyaa tallaabooyinkiisa laga bilaabo dhererka u dhexeeya heerarka, wuxuu ilaaliyaa xadka caadiga ah ee guriga, wuxuu dhigaa gacan-qabsiyada dhinacyada furan, wuxuuna jaraa godka jaranjarka dabaqa kor ku yaal. Samee jaranjar Heerka ay jaranjarku ka bilaabanto, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Jaranjar. Dooro nooca — Toosan, L oo leh dhexaad (landing), U oo leh dhexaad ama L oo leh leexo (winders) — halka uu leexanayo (turn), ballacniisa (width) iyo meesha ay gacan-qabsiyadiisu (handrails) ku yaalliin. Guji meesha jaranjarku ka bilaabanto: dhexda geesha hore ee tallaabada ugu hooseysa. Dhaqaaji mouse-ka dhinaca jaranjarku u kacayo; tallaabooyinku way raacaan, iyagoo tusaya tirada kor-kacyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Waxay ku qabsanaysaa darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka 15°; hay Shift si aad u hayso isku siman. Guji. Esc wuxuu dib u bilaabaa. Samee jaranjar wareeg Fur Dhismaha, dooro Jaranjar, kadibna dooro Wareeg (Spiral) sida nooca. Deji Leexo (Turn), oo muujinaya dhinaca ay ku leexanayso marka ay kor u kacayso (bidix waa xagal saacadda ka soo horjeeda). Guji bartaa tiirkeeda (center post). Guji jihada ay tallaabada hoose ee ugu horeysa u tilmaamayso. Waxay ka bilaabataa ballac 30\" (tallaabada, tiirka ka bilaabmaysa ilaa dibadda), oo leh tiir 4½\". Kor-kacyada waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa dhererka u dhexeeya dabaqa iyo heerka kor ku jira, ugu badnaan 9½\" si caadi ah. Tallaabooyinku waa 7½\" qoto dheer khadka socodka, 12\" ka fogaan tiirka. Gacan-qabsigu wuxuu socdaa dibadda. Qaybta Sifooyinka jaranjarka wareegu wuxuu ku daraa Center post, dhexroorkeeda. Goobta Tread waxaa lagu cabbiraa khadka socodka. Hubinteeda waa qiimayaal caadi ah oo loo calaamadeeyay jaranjarrada wareegga: ballac furan oo 26\", tallaabo ugu yaraan 6¾\" khadka socodka, kor-kac ugu badnaan 9½\" iyo gacan-qabsiyo 34\"–38\". Ma aha injineernimo; mas'uulka dhismaha ayaa go'aamiya. Sida tallaabooyinka loo xisaabiyo Masaafada u dhexeysa dhulka heerka iyo heerka kor ku jira waxaa loo kala qaybiyaa kor-kac isku mid ah oo aan ka sarreyn 7¾\", tallaabo kasta waxay ahaan doontaa 10\" qoto dheer (labadaba waa la beddeli karaa Sifooyinka). Dhexaadku wuxuu tiriyaa hal tallaabo; leexooyinku waa saddex tallaabo oo ku faafsan geeska gudaha. Beddel dhererka heerka, jaranjar kasta oo ku jirta waa dib loo xisaabiyaa. 7¾\" kor-kac, 10\" tallaabo, 36\" ballac, 6'-8\" madhan-sare iyo 34\"–38\" gacan-qabsi waa qiimayaal caadi ah oo loo calaamadeeyay kadib xeerka caadiga ah ee guryaha, ma aha injineernimo. Sifooyinka ayaa sheegaya kuwa la buuxiyay; mas'uulka dhismaha ayaa go'aamiya waxa khuseeya. Beddel jaranjar Dooro (guji qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D) oo beddel Sifooyinka: nooca iyo leexashada, ballacka, kor-kaca ugu sarreeya, dhererka tallaabada, gacan-qabsiyada iyo dhererkooda, iyo Jar dabaqa kor ku jira ee godka jaranjarka. Kor-kacyada iyo tallaabooyinka ugu dambeeyay ee ay heleen waa la muujiyaa hoostooda. Godka jaranjarka Markii heerka kor ku jira uu leeyahay dhul, jaranjarku wuxuu jaraa meesha tallaabooyinku ay madhan-sare ka yaraan 6'-8\". Jarku wuu raacaa jaranjarka, wuuna baxaa marka jaranjarka la tirtiro. Samee gacan-qabsi Fur Dhismaha oo dooro Gacan-qabsi. Dooro Guardrail (36\" dheer) ama Handrail iyo dhererkiisa. Guji dhinaca — dhul, balkoon, ku wareeg godka jaranjarka — oo laba jeer guji ama riix Enter si aad u dhammayso. Gacan-qabsiyada waxay helaan tiirar dhamaadyadooda iyo geesaha, iyo baluster-yo leh furuq ka yar 4\". Dooro mid si aad u beddesho nooceeda, dherkeeda ama sida uu u bilaabmo ka sarreeya dabaqa. Samee derbi Dooro Fence isla qalabka Railing, deji dherkeeda (1800 mm marka hore), guji dhinaca khadka derbiga oo riix Enter. Derbigu wuxuu helaa tiir dhamaadyo kasta iyo geesaha kasta, iyo tiir ugu badnaan 2.4 m u dhexeeya. Derbi panel leh wuxuu leeyahay panel u dhexeeya tiirarka; derbi xadhig leh wuxuu leeyahay laba xadhig. Cabbirkan waa xulasho caadi ah, ma aha shuruud xeer; xeerarka maxalliga ah ayaa xaddidaya dhererka derbiga. Waa hal walax moodelka ku jira (IfcRailing oo magacaysan Fence) oo leh kooxda sifooyinka CadCraft_Fence: qaabka, dhererka, tiirarka, panelada, xadhigyada, irdaha, dhererka iyo balaadhinta panelka. Hal tallaabo oo soo celin ah. Halkan lama sawirin: irdaha (CivilCraft ayaa u diyaariya), xiidooyin (pickets), dhulka (derbigu wuxuu taagan yahay heerka), iyo dooro hal tiir kaliya. Waxa la kaydiyay Jaranjarku wuxuu u kaydsan yahay sida jaranjar IFC oo ka kooban jaranjarro (oo leh kor-kac, tallaabo iyo dherer tallaabo), dhexaad, leexo iyo gacan-qabsiyo; godka jaranjarka waa furitaan ku jira dabaqa dhulka kor ku yaal. Gacan-qabsiyadu waa IFC railings oo leh dhererkooda iyo tirada baluster-yada iyo tiirarka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-tree","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Jid u hel geedka moodelka","summary":"Ka eeg moodeel IFC adigoo ku kala saaraya mashruuca, goobta, dhismaha, dabaqa iyo meesha, iyadoo walxaha loo kala saaray nooca; sanduuqyada calaamadi si aad u muujiso ama u qariso, guji safka si aad u doorato, laba jeer guji si aad u weyneyso.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["geedka moodelka","geed","qaab dhismeed","qaabka meesha","baare","dabaq","heer","meel","qol","koox","nooc","qari","muuji","dooro","weynee"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha","text":"Furayaasha","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOgow sida moodeelku u dhisan yahay oo gaadh walx kasta adigoon ku raadinayn 3D: dhismaha, dabaqyadiisa, meelaha dabaq kasta, iyo walxaha ku jira, oo loo kala saaray nooc (darbiyo, albaabyo, sagxado…).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeedka moodelka\u003C/span\u003E bidix ayuu ilaa dabaqyada ka furmaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji fallaadha ku xigta safka si aad u furto ama u xirto. Dabaq wuxuu marka hore hayaa meelahiisa, kadibna walxahiisa oo loo kala saaray nooc iyo tiradooda. Walax ka kooban qaybo, sida jaranjarada, waxay hayaa qaybaheeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar calaamadda sanduuqa safka si aad wax walba oo ku jira u qarto; calaamadi mar kale si aad u muujiso. Sanduuq leh xariiq wuxuu muujinayaa in qayb keliya oo ka mid ah wixii ku jira la muujinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji magaca safka si aad u doorato waxa uu matalo: hal walax, ama walxaha oo dhan kooxda, dabaqa ama meesha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji ayaa ku daraya doorashada, ama ka saara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ei\u003C/span\u003E ee dabaqa, meesha ama dhismaha si aad u aragto sifooyinkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer guji safka si aad u weyneyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad walax ku doorato muuqaalka 3D, geedku wuxuu ilaa iyada ka furmaa oo calaamad ku saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha qarsan waxaa lagu jarayaa xariiq. Sanduuqyada geedka iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) way wada shaqeeyaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kaligii ka soo saar oo ka arag walxaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha moodeelku aan ku dhigin dabaq ahaan waxay ku jiraan kooxda ugu dambeysa, \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab dhismeedka meeshu kuma jiraan\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoox dheer waxay muujisaa 200 safka mar; guji \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji wax dheeraad ah\u003C/strong\u003E hoosteeda si aad u aragto kuwa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha\"\u003EFurayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad magaca safka xulato: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E way dhaqaaqaan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu furaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu xiraa ama wuu kor u kacaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu calaamadiyaa sanduuqa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu doortaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa dabaq ayaa calaamadsan, laakiin waxba ma muuqdo.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E ee geedka hoosteeda ayaa dabaqyada oo dhan demiya si gooni ah: calaamadi halkaas sidoo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafku waxba ma doorto.\u003C/strong\u003E Safka qaarkood, sida meel madhan, ma laha walxo la sawiri karo; safka xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ETirtir, gooy, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EMuuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ogow sida moodeelku u dhisan yahay oo gaadh walx kasta adigoon ku raadinayn 3D: dhismaha, dabaqyadiisa, meelaha dabaq kasta, iyo walxaha ku jira, oo loo kala saaray nooc (darbiyo, albaabyo, sagxado…). Tallaabooyin Fur moodeel IFC. Geedka moodelka bidix ayuu ilaa dabaqyada ka furmaya. Guji fallaadha ku xigta safka si aad u furto ama u xirto. Dabaq wuxuu marka hore hayaa meelahiisa, kadibna walxahiisa oo loo kala saaray nooc iyo tiradooda. Walax ka kooban qaybo, sida jaranjarada, waxay hayaa qaybaheeda. Ka saar calaamadda sanduuqa safka si aad wax walba oo ku jira u qarto; calaamadi mar kale si aad u muujiso. Sanduuq leh xariiq wuxuu muujinayaa in qayb keliya oo ka mid ah wixii ku jira la muujinayo. Guji magaca safka si aad u doorato waxa uu matalo: hal walax, ama walxaha oo dhan kooxda, dabaqa ama meesha. Ctrl+guji ayaa ku daraya doorashada, ama ka saara. Guji badhanka i ee dabaqa, meesha ama dhismaha si aad u aragto sifooyinkiisa. Laba jeer guji safka si aad u weyneyso. Waxa aad arki doontid Markaad walax ku doorato muuqaalka 3D, geedku wuxuu ilaa iyada ka furmaa oo calaamad ku saaraa. Walxaha qarsan waxaa lagu jarayaa xariiq. Sanduuqyada geedka iyo Muuji (H, I, Shift+H) way wada shaqeeyaan: eeg Qari, kaligii ka soo saar oo ka arag walxaha. Walxaha moodeelku aan ku dhigin dabaq ahaan waxay ku jiraan kooxda ugu dambeysa, Qaab dhismeedka meeshu kuma jiraan. Koox dheer waxay muujisaa 200 safka mar; guji Muuji wax dheeraad ah hoosteeda si aad u aragto kuwa kale. Furayaasha Markaad magaca safka xulato: ↑ iyo ↓ way dhaqaaqaan, → wuu furaa, ← wuu xiraa ama wuu kor u kacaa, Space wuu calaamadiyaa sanduuqa, Enter wuu doortaa. Khaladaad caadi ah Sanduuqa dabaq ayaa calaamadsan, laakiin waxba ma muuqdo. Liiska Dabaqyada ee geedka hoosteeda ayaa dabaqyada oo dhan demiya si gooni ah: calaamadi halkaas sidoo kale. Safku waxba ma doorto. Safka qaarkood, sida meel madhan, ma laha walxo la sawiri karo; safka xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa. Xiga Tirtir, gooy, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha Muuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"specification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qor qeexida shaqada ka moodelka","summary":"Qayb qeexid kasta darbi kasta, albaab, daaqad, sagxad iyo dhamaystir kasta oo la isticmaalo, oo leh xaqiiqooyinkeeda laga akhriyay moodelka iyo qoraalkaaga, oo laga sameeyo PDF ama dokumentiyo Word.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["qeexid","qeexida","sawirada shaqada","marxaladda 5","dokumentiyada dhismaha","qayb","nooca darbiga","nooca albaabka","nooca daaqadda","dhamaystir","sifayn","uniclass","omniclass","masterformat","dokument","pdf","word","docx","jadwallada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"jadwallada-sawirka-shaqada-dokument-ahaan","text":"Jadwallada sawirka shaqada dokument ahaan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHel qeexid raacaysa moodelka: qayb nooc kasta oo dhismaha ku jira, mid kasta oo leh dhismihiisa iyo tirooyinkiisa laga akhriyay moodelka, iyo qoraalka aad u qortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E daaqadda bidix, oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EQeexida\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqu wuxuu liistaa hal qayb nooc darbi kasta, nooc albaab, nooc daaqad, sagxad iyo dhamaystir qol oo la isticmaalo. Hoosta cinwaan kasta waxaa ku yaal \u003Cstrong\u003Exaqiiqooyinkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, oo laga akhriyay moodelka: dhumucda, lakabyada mid mid, heerka horumarka, cabbirrada, tirada iyo qaddarka. Qayb ay xubnaheeda ku jiro koodka sifayn wuxuu muujinayaa koodka cinwaankiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor qoraalka qeexidaada sanduuqa ka hoosaysa qayb. \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro xubnaheeda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa waxa qaybtu ka hadlayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, qoraalkana waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDokumentiyada moodelka\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro qaabka \u003Cstrong\u003EQeexida\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cstrong\u003EHor eeg\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna kaydi PDF, Word ama Markdown. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EDokumentiyada moodelka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwallada-sawirka-shaqada-dokument-ahaan\"\u003EJadwallada sawirka shaqada dokument ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada sawirka shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu daabacaa jadwallada albaabka, daaqadda iyo dhamaystirka si toos ah moodelka, qaabka xafiiskaaga. Qaabkaaga gaarka ah qor \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule doors}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule windows}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule roomfinishes}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule finishtotals}}\u003C/code\u003E, ama magaca habayn la kaydiyay, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule Door schedule by floor}}\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003E{{specification}}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa qeexida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaqiiqooyinku waa kuwa moodelka. Way beddelaan marka moodelka la beddelo; qoraalkaagu ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft ma qoro wax cutub oo heer caadi ah ama qoraal soo saaraha. Qayb aan qoraal lahayn waxay daabacaysaa &quot;Qoraal qeexid weli lama qorin.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraal loo qoray nooc aan mar dambe ku jirin moodelka waa la ilaaliyaa, waxaana lagu liisanayaa &quot;Qoraalka noocyada aan mar dambe moodelka ku jirin&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u beddesho nooc guud oo loogu talagalay qaab-dhismeed gaar ah, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQalabka darbiga\u003C/a\u003E (Beddel nooca).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hel qeexid raacaysa moodelka: qayb nooc kasta oo dhismaha ku jira, mid kasta oo leh dhismihiisa iyo tirooyinkiisa laga akhriyay moodelka, iyo qoraalka aad u qortay. Tallaabooyinka Shid Sawir, fur Jadwallada daaqadda bidix, oo guji Qeexida. Sanduuqu wuxuu liistaa hal qayb nooc darbi kasta, nooc albaab, nooc daaqad, sagxad iyo dhamaystir qol oo la isticmaalo. Hoosta cinwaan kasta waxaa ku yaal xaqiiqooyinkiisa, oo laga akhriyay moodelka: dhumucda, lakabyada mid mid, heerka horumarka, cabbirrada, tirada iyo qaddarka. Qayb ay xubnaheeda ku jiro koodka sifayn wuxuu muujinayaa koodka cinwaankiisa. Qor qoraalka qeexidaada sanduuqa ka hoosaysa qayb. Dooro xubnaheeda wuxuu muujinayaa waxa qaybtu ka hadlayso. Guji Kaydi. Waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, qoraalkana waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka dhismaha. Fur Dokumentiyada moodelka, dooro qaabka Qeexida, guji Hor eeg, kadibna kaydi PDF, Word ama Markdown. Eeg Dokumentiyada moodelka. Jadwallada sawirka shaqada dokument ahaan Qaabka Jadwallada sawirka shaqada wuxuu daabacaa jadwallada albaabka, daaqadda iyo dhamaystirka si toos ah moodelka, qaabka xafiiskaaga. Qaabkaaga gaarka ah qor {{schedule doors}}, {{schedule windows}}, {{schedule roomfinishes}}, {{schedule finishtotals}}, ama magaca habayn la kaydiyay, tusaale ahaan {{schedule Door schedule by floor}}. {{specification}} wuxuu daabacaa qeexida. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Xaqiiqooyinku waa kuwa moodelka. Way beddelaan marka moodelka la beddelo; qoraalkaagu ma beddelo. BimCraft ma qoro wax cutub oo heer caadi ah ama qoraal soo saaraha. Qayb aan qoraal lahayn waxay daabacaysaa \"Qoraal qeexid weli lama qorin.\" Qoraal loo qoray nooc aan mar dambe ku jirin moodelka waa la ilaaliyaa, waxaana lagu liisanayaa \"Qoraalka noocyada aan mar dambe moodelka ku jirin\". Si aad u beddesho nooc guud oo loogu talagalay qaab-dhismeed gaar ah, eeg Qalabka darbiga (Beddel nooca).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"framing","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qaab dhismeedka derbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada","summary":"Soo saar studs, plates, headers, joists, rafters ama trusses moodelka ka, oo la kaydi isaga; mar kale ayaa la sameeyaa marka derbiyada, furyaha, sagxadaha ama saqafku isbeddelaan, jadwalka Alwaaxa waa liiska jarista.","section":"tasks","order":24,"keywords":["TJI","I-joist","miiska fidinta joist","soo rar miis","qaab dhismeed","stud","studs","plate","plate sare","header","king stud","jack stud","trimmer","cripple","sill","blocking","geesta","geesta California","tee","joist","rim joist","band joist","rafter","hip rafter","valley rafter","jack rafter","ridge board","ceiling joist","collar tie","truss","alwaax","liiska jarista","board feet","2x4","2x6","dhexaad","on center"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"qaabee","text":"Qaabee","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-heleysa","text":"Waxa aad heleysa","level":2},{"id":"beddelka","text":"Beddelka","level":2},{"id":"sagxadaha-tji-ee-miis-aad-soo-rarto","text":"Sagxadaha TJI ee miis aad soo rarto","level":2},{"id":"liiska-jarista","text":"Liiska jarista","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-kaydiyay","text":"Waxa la kaydiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismaha qaab-dhismeedka ee aad sawirtay. BimCraft wuxuu u diyaariyaa studs, plates iyo headers derbiyada gudihiisa, joists sagxadaha, rafters (ama trusses) saqafka, wuxuuna cabbiraa adeegsanaya miisaska caadiga ah ee la calaamadeeyay, wuxuuna la kaydiyaa moodelka, mar kasta oo waxa uu qaabeynayo isbeddelo ay dib u sameeyaan. Jadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003EAlwaax\u003C/strong\u003E waa liiska jarista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabee\"\u003EQaabee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaq kasta, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab dhismeed\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003Espacing\u003C/strong\u003E (16&quot; ama 24&quot; on center; 400 ama 600 mm), \u003Cstrong\u003Ecorners\u003C/strong\u003E (saddex-stud ama California), \u003Cstrong\u003ERafters\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETrusses\u003C/strong\u003E saqafka, iyo in derbiyadu helaan safka \u003Cstrong\u003Eblocking\u003C/strong\u003E ee dhexda dhererka. Sagxadaha dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EAlwaax la jaray\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETJI (horumar hore)\u003C/strong\u003E, oo deji jihada joist-ka oo ah automatic, plan X ama plan Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabee derbi kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, ama hal derbi, sagxad ama saqaf (dabaqa uu saqafku saaran yahay) si aad keligeed u qaabeyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDami \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji qaab-dhismeedka\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u qariso qaybaha qaab-dhismeedka oo dhan, sida lakab; \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex ka arag\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qariyaa derbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada qaab-dhismeedka leh si aad qaab-dhismeedka keligiis u aragto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-heleysa\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDerbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E: plate hoose (la gooyay albaabka), plate sare oo laba-lakab ah, studs ku saabsan layout-ka ka bilaabma bilowga derbiga, king iyo jack studs iyo header albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta, cripples ka sareeya headers iyo ka hoosaysa daaqadaha, sill adag hoosta daaqadaha, geesaha meelaha derbiyada isku kulmaan (derbiga dhex-maraa wuxuu qaadaa studs-ka geeska), laba studs taageero ah marka derbi kale tee ku xidho, iyo blocking u dhexeeya studs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESagxadaha\u003C/strong\u003E: joists ee dhinaca gaaban ee sagxadda sida caadiga ah, ama dhinaca plan ee aad dooratay; rim joists agagaaraha geesta, iyo trimmers labanlaabmay iyo headers agagaaraha dhuumaha (stairwell), joists-ka dhexdiisa la gooyay gaaban (tail joists). Habka TJI wuxuu doortaa taxanaha ugu yar iyo qoto ugu yar oo gaadha dherer-jiifka cad ee la cabbiray ee spacing-ka iyo kiiska culeysyada aad dooratay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaqafyada\u003C/strong\u003E: rafters caadi ah oo siman geesta kasta, jack rafters meelaha hip iyo valley ay gooyaan, hip iyo valley rafters, ridge boards, ceiling joists saldhigyada korkooda iyo collar ties; ama trusses fudud oo spacing-ka ku jira, mid kasta hal qayb.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddelka\"\u003EBeddelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qayb kasta oo qaab-dhismeed ah aragga 3D ama geedka moodelka. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa qaab-dhismeedkeeda: beddel spacing-ka, nooca iyo jihada joist-ka sagxadda, corners, blocking ama qaab-dhismeedka saqafka. Derbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha dhaqaajinta, ama sagxadda ama saqafka beddelidda, waxay qaabeeyaan qaab-dhismeedka mar kale iyaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u ilaaliso qayb aad si gaar ah u dhigtay markii qaab-dhismeedka mar kale la sameeyo, dooro qaybta oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaali qaybtan markii qaab-dhismeedka mar kale la sameeyo\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybta la ilaaliyay waxay sii joogtaa meeshii ay ku taal; marka qaab-dhismeedka ku wareegsan isbeddelo, waa la calaamadeeyaa si aad u hubiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxadaha-tji-ee-miis-aad-soo-rarto\"\u003ESagxadaha TJI ee miis aad soo rarto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft ma lahan miisaska fidinta joist-ka ee soo saaraha (kuwaasi waa soo saaraha, waxayna isbeddelaan mar kasta oo daabacaad cusub la sameeyo). Dooro qaab-dhismeedka sagxadda, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EFloor joists\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003ETJI (horumar hore)\u003C/strong\u003E, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo rar miis…\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: fayl qaabka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-tji-table\u003C/code\u003E, JSON ama CSV, oo aad ka samaysay miisaska fidinta ee soo saaraha ee hadda jira. Wuxuu magacaabaa soo saaraha, alaabta iyo daabacaadda, iyo meesha xogta ka timid, wuxuuna liistaa kiis kasta oo culeys (culeyska jiritaanka, culeyska naftiisa, xadka foorarka, dhererka taageerka) iyo dherer-jiifka ugu weyn ee taxan kasta oo qoto kasta oo spacing-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft wuxuu qaataa \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer-jiifka cad\u003C/strong\u003E ee sagxadda, wuxuuna doortaa qotada ugu hoosaysa, oo gudaheeda taxanaha kaas oo dherer-liiskiisa gaadha dherer-jiifkaas spacing-ka iyo kiiska culeysyada aad dooratay, kadibna sagxadda ku qaabeeya. Haddii dhererka ama spacing-ka ka baxsan yihiin miiska, wuu sheegaa oo waxba ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECuleyska, xadka foorarka, dhererka taageerka, miiska iyo qoraalka &quot;Hagid qorshaynta horumar ah; go&#039;aanka dambe wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaska soo saaraha iyo culeysyada mashruuca&quot; waa la daabacaa jadwalka Alwaaxa, waa la qoraa moodelka qaab-dhismeedka, waxaana liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ku jira sida fiiro. Miis la calaamadeeyay tusaale ahaan ayaa sheegta digniin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii add-on-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding regulations\u003C/strong\u003E uu shaqeeyo, xeerka joist-ka sagxadda ayaa akhrisa miis culeys leh; la&#039;aan miis, joists-ka TJI waxaa laga reebaa hubintaas, sida hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska wuxuu ku sii jiraa browserkan ilaa aad nadiifiso ama mid kale soo rarto. Faylku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Ccode\u003Eformat\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-tji-table\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eversion\u003C/code\u003E 1, \u003Ccode\u003Emanufacturer\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eproduct\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eedition\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esource\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunits\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eimperial\u003C/code\u003E: inches, feet, psf; ama \u003Ccode\u003Emetric\u003C/code\u003E: mm, metres, kPa), \u003Ccode\u003Ecases\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eid\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elive\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edead\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edeflection\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebearing\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Erows\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eseries\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edepth\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Espans\u003C/code\u003E: kiis-id kasta, spacing iyo dherer-jiifka ugu weyn, sida \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;16&quot;: &quot;15-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). CSV-ga isla xogtaas waa safafka \u003Ccode\u003E# key = value\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ccode\u003Eseries,depth,case,spacing,span\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aan miis la soo rarin, habaynta TJI waa la diidaa oo waxba ma beddelo: \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo rar miis TJI: miisaska soo saaraha waa kuwooda, ma aha kuwo dhex ku jira.\u003C/strong\u003E Moodel horey loogu qaabeeyay miiska TJI ee dhismaha ah (ka hor isbeddelkan) wuxuu hayaa joist kasta oo uu leeyahay; Sifooyinka iyo Dhibaatooyinku waxay sheegaan in miiska loo baahan yahay, sagxadda waxaa dib loo qaabeyn karaa markaad soo rarto mid. Joists-ka alwaax la jaray ayaa sida hore shaqeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa hagid qaab-dhismeed. Doorashada joist-ka dambe waxay u baahan tahay miisaska soo saaraha, culeysyada mashruuca iyo injineerka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-jarista\"\u003ELiiska jarista\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta Jadwallada dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EAlwaax\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb kasta oo qaab-dhismeed ah, oo lagu kooxeeyay cabbirka iyo dhererka saamiga aad iibsanayso (dherar 2&#039; oo dhammaystiran ilaa 8&#039;; tallaabooyin 600 mm ah marka millimitir la adeegsado, 2400 mm ilaa), tirada qaybaha iyo board feet. \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa soo dejisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada madaxa, joist-ka, rafter-ka iyo joist-ka saqafka waxay ka yimaadaan miisaska caadiga ah ee la calaamadeeyay ee guri caadi ah oo hal ama laba dabaq ah, ma aha injineernimo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa marka dherer ama fur uu ka baxo miiskiisa. Naqshadeeye ama injineer ayaa hubiya dherarka, culeysyada iyo xiriirrada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabaynta TJI waxay isticmaashaa oo kaliya miis aad soo rarto, oo aad ka samaysay miisaska soo saaraha ee hadda jira; BimCraft ma soo dirin midna. Talada ma hubiso taageerka, culeysyada dhibcaha, cantilevers, godadka, madaxyada dhuumaha ama xiriirrada, qaabkana I-shape ee moodelka waa mid sawir ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-kaydiyay\"\u003EWaxa la kaydiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab-dhismeed kasta oo derbi, sagxad ama saqaf ah waa ururinta curiyaha IFC ee &quot;Qaab dhismeed&quot; (Framing), oo ka kooban IFC members (studs, plates, rafters, collar ties, blocking, trusses) iyo beams (headers, joists, rims, ridge boards), mid kasta leh cabbirkiisa, dherkiisa iyo board feet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhismaha qaab-dhismeedka ee aad sawirtay. BimCraft wuxuu u diyaariyaa studs, plates iyo headers derbiyada gudihiisa, joists sagxadaha, rafters (ama trusses) saqafka, wuxuuna cabbiraa adeegsanaya miisaska caadiga ah ee la calaamadeeyay, wuxuuna la kaydiyaa moodelka, mar kasta oo waxa uu qaabeynayo isbeddelo ay dib u sameeyaan. Jadwalka Alwaax waa liiska jarista. Qaabee Dabaq kasta, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Qaab dhismeed. Dooro spacing (16\" ama 24\" on center; 400 ama 600 mm), corners (saddex-stud ama California), Rafters ama Trusses saqafka, iyo in derbiyadu helaan safka blocking ee dhexda dhererka. Sagxadaha dooro Alwaax la jaray ama TJI (horumar hore), oo deji jihada joist-ka oo ah automatic, plan X ama plan Y. Guji Qaabee derbi kasta, ama hal derbi, sagxad ama saqaf (dabaqa uu saqafku saaran yahay) si aad keligeed u qaabeyso. Dami Muuji qaab-dhismeedka si aad u qariso qaybaha qaab-dhismeedka oo dhan, sida lakab; Dhex ka arag wuxuu qariyaa derbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada qaab-dhismeedka leh si aad qaab-dhismeedka keligiis u aragto. Waxa aad heleysa Derbiyada: plate hoose (la gooyay albaabka), plate sare oo laba-lakab ah, studs ku saabsan layout-ka ka bilaabma bilowga derbiga, king iyo jack studs iyo header albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta, cripples ka sareeya headers iyo ka hoosaysa daaqadaha, sill adag hoosta daaqadaha, geesaha meelaha derbiyada isku kulmaan (derbiga dhex-maraa wuxuu qaadaa studs-ka geeska), laba studs taageero ah marka derbi kale tee ku xidho, iyo blocking u dhexeeya studs. Sagxadaha: joists ee dhinaca gaaban ee sagxadda sida caadiga ah, ama dhinaca plan ee aad dooratay; rim joists agagaaraha geesta, iyo trimmers labanlaabmay iyo headers agagaaraha dhuumaha (stairwell), joists-ka dhexdiisa la gooyay gaaban (tail joists). Habka TJI wuxuu doortaa taxanaha ugu yar iyo qoto ugu yar oo gaadha dherer-jiifka cad ee la cabbiray ee spacing-ka iyo kiiska culeysyada aad dooratay. Saqafyada: rafters caadi ah oo siman geesta kasta, jack rafters meelaha hip iyo valley ay gooyaan, hip iyo valley rafters, ridge boards, ceiling joists saldhigyada korkooda iyo collar ties; ama trusses fudud oo spacing-ka ku jira, mid kasta hal qayb. Beddelka Dooro qayb kasta oo qaab-dhismeed ah aragga 3D ama geedka moodelka. Sifooyinka wuxuu muujinayaa qaab-dhismeedkeeda: beddel spacing-ka, nooca iyo jihada joist-ka sagxadda, corners, blocking ama qaab-dhismeedka saqafka. Derbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha dhaqaajinta, ama sagxadda ama saqafka beddelidda, waxay qaabeeyaan qaab-dhismeedka mar kale iyaga. Si aad u ilaaliso qayb aad si gaar ah u dhigtay markii qaab-dhismeedka mar kale la sameeyo, dooro qaybta oo dooro Ilaali qaybtan markii qaab-dhismeedka mar kale la sameeyo. Qaybta la ilaaliyay waxay sii joogtaa meeshii ay ku taal; marka qaab-dhismeedka ku wareegsan isbeddelo, waa la calaamadeeyaa si aad u hubiso. Sagxadaha TJI ee miis aad soo rarto BimCraft ma lahan miisaska fidinta joist-ka ee soo saaraha (kuwaasi waa soo saaraha, waxayna isbeddelaan mar kasta oo daabacaad cusub la sameeyo). Dooro qaab-dhismeedka sagxadda, deji Floor joists oo ah TJI (horumar hore), oo dooro Soo rar miis… ee Sifooyinka: fayl qaabka cadcraft-tji-table, JSON ama CSV, oo aad ka samaysay miisaska fidinta ee soo saaraha ee hadda jira. Wuxuu magacaabaa soo saaraha, alaabta iyo daabacaadda, iyo meesha xogta ka timid, wuxuuna liistaa kiis kasta oo culeys (culeyska jiritaanka, culeyska naftiisa, xadka foorarka, dhererka taageerka) iyo dherer-jiifka ugu weyn ee taxan kasta oo qoto kasta oo spacing-ka. BimCraft wuxuu qaataa dherer-jiifka cad ee sagxadda, wuxuuna doortaa qotada ugu hoosaysa, oo gudaheeda taxanaha kaas oo dherer-liiskiisa gaadha dherer-jiifkaas spacing-ka iyo kiiska culeysyada aad dooratay, kadibna sagxadda ku qaabeeya. Haddii dhererka ama spacing-ka ka baxsan yihiin miiska, wuu sheegaa oo waxba ma beddelo. Culeyska, xadka foorarka, dhererka taageerka, miiska iyo qoraalka \"Hagid qorshaynta horumar ah; go'aanka dambe wuxuu u baahan yahay miisaska soo saaraha iyo culeysyada mashruuca\" waa la daabacaa jadwalka Alwaaxa, waa la qoraa moodelka qaab-dhismeedka, waxaana liiska Dhibaatooyinka ku jira sida fiiro. Miis la calaamadeeyay tusaale ahaan ayaa sheegta digniin. Haddii add-on-ka Building regulations uu shaqeeyo, xeerka joist-ka sagxadda ayaa akhrisa miis culeys leh; la'aan miis, joists-ka TJI waxaa laga reebaa hubintaas, sida hore. Miiska wuxuu ku sii jiraa browserkan ilaa aad nadiifiso ama mid kale soo rarto. Faylku wuxuu leeyahay format (cadcraft-tji-table), version 1, manufacturer, product, edition, source, units (imperial: inches, feet, psf; ama metric: mm, metres, kPa), cases (id, live, dead, deflection, bearing) iyo rows (series, depth, spans: kiis-id kasta, spacing iyo dherer-jiifka ugu weyn, sida \"16\": \"15-6\"). CSV-ga isla xogtaas waa safafka # key = value, kadibna series,depth,case,spacing,span. Haddii aan miis la soo rarin, habaynta TJI waa la diidaa oo waxba ma beddelo: Soo rar miis TJI: miisaska soo saaraha waa kuwooda, ma aha kuwo dhex ku jira. Moodel horey loogu qaabeeyay miiska TJI ee dhismaha ah (ka hor isbeddelkan) wuxuu hayaa joist kasta oo uu leeyahay; Sifooyinka iyo Dhibaatooyinku waxay sheegaan in miiska loo baahan yahay, sagxadda waxaa dib loo qaabeyn karaa markaad soo rarto mid. Joists-ka alwaax la jaray ayaa sida hore shaqeeya. Tani waa hagid qaab-dhismeed. Doorashada joist-ka dambe waxay u baahan tahay miisaska soo saaraha, culeysyada mashruuca iyo injineerka. Liiska jarista Qaybta Jadwallada dooro Alwaax: qayb kasta oo qaab-dhismeed ah, oo lagu kooxeeyay cabbirka iyo dhererka saamiga aad iibsanayso (dherar 2' oo dhammaystiran ilaa 8'; tallaabooyin 600 mm ah marka millimitir la adeegsado, 2400 mm ilaa), tirada qaybaha iyo board feet. CSV ayaa soo dejisa. Cabbirrada madaxa, joist-ka, rafter-ka iyo joist-ka saqafka waxay ka yimaadaan miisaska caadiga ah ee la calaamadeeyay ee guri caadi ah oo hal ama laba dabaq ah, ma aha injineernimo. Sifooyinka wuxuu sheegaa marka dherer ama fur uu ka baxo miiskiisa. Naqshadeeye ama injineer ayaa hubiya dherarka, culeysyada iyo xiriirrada. Habaynta TJI waxay isticmaashaa oo kaliya miis aad soo rarto, oo aad ka samaysay miisaska soo saaraha ee hadda jira; BimCraft ma soo dirin midna. Talada ma hubiso taageerka, culeysyada dhibcaha, cantilevers, godadka, madaxyada dhuumaha ama xiriirrada, qaabkana I-shape ee moodelka waa mid sawir ah. Waxa la kaydiyay Qaab-dhismeed kasta oo derbi, sagxad ama saqaf ah waa ururinta curiyaha IFC ee \"Qaab dhismeed\" (Framing), oo ka kooban IFC members (studs, plates, rafters, collar ties, blocking, trusses) iyo beams (headers, joists, rims, ridge boards), mid kasta leh cabbirkiisa, dherkiisa iyo board feet.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"hide-and-isolate","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qari, kaliya muuji iyo muuqaal daahsan walxaha","summary":"Dooro walxo badan, qari, ama kaliya muuji, ama muuji iyo wax kasta oo kale muuqaal daahsan, kadibna dib u soo celi wax walba.","section":"tasks","order":24,"keywords":["qari","kaliya muuji","muuqaal daahsan","daahsan","ghost","x-ray","muuji dhammaan","dib u muuji","dooro badan","dooro dhowr","ctrl guji","shift guji","muuqaal"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka ka nadiifi ilaa wixii aad eegayso: qari walxaha dhex galaya, kaliya muuji kuwii aad doortay, ama ka dhig kuwa kale shaashadda oo muuqaal daahsan oo khadka fiiqan ah, si aad weli u ogaato meesha aad joogto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EFur moodeel IFC oo ku eeg 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walax si aad u doorato. Si aad mid kale u doorato, ku hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo guji mid kasta. Gujinta walax la doortay sidaas ayaa ka saaraa mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare oo dooro waxa la sameynayo, ama taabo furahiisa:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu qariyaa walaxda la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaliya muuji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu muujiyaa walaxda la doortay oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal daahsan\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu muujiyaa walaxda la doortay sida ay tahay, iyo wax kasta oo kale muuqaal daahsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E isla menu-ga, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad mar kale u muujiso walax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad rabto inaad ka jarto wax kasta oo ku wareegsan walxaha la doortay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay\u003C/span\u003E isla menu-ga, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EKa jar moodeelka IFC qolka goynta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka dhowr walxood la doortay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa tirada iyo liis ahaan nooca. Guji mid keli ah si aad u aragto sifooyinkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha la qariyey lama dooran karo: gujinta ayaa ku dhacda wixii ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha muuqaalka daahsan iyagana lama doorto karo, sidaas darteed waxaad ku guji kartaa dhinac ka dhinac derbiyada ilaa wixii aad kaliya u muujisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadadka geesaha waxay ku qariman yihiin walxahooda, waxayna noqdaan kuwo daahsan oo isla walaxda la mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQarin, kaliya muuji iyo muuqaal daahsan waxay ku sii jiraan intaad wax beddelaysid, ka dhigaysid walxaha maktabadda, ama aad moodeelka ka jarayso qolka goynta. Moodeel kale oo la furo wax walba wuu muujiyaa mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska menu-ga waa jilcaan (greyed out).\u003C/strong\u003E Walax lama doorin. Marka hore guji walax; ku dhaji xulashada si aad u akhrisid sababta aanu u shaqayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya muuji wuxuu muujiyey derbi aan qariyey.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaliya muuji wuxuu muujiyaa wixii aad doortay gabi ahaanba, qarsan iyo muuqdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaq oo dhan ayaa maqan.\u003C/strong\u003E Taasi waa liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E, ma aha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E: mar kale calaamee dabaqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EMuuji oo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EKa jar moodeelka IFC qolka goynta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Muuqaalka ka nadiifi ilaa wixii aad eegayso: qari walxaha dhex galaya, kaliya muuji kuwii aad doortay, ama ka dhig kuwa kale shaashadda oo muuqaal daahsan oo khadka fiiqan ah, si aad weli u ogaato meesha aad joogto. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodeel IFC. Eeg Fur moodeel IFC oo ku eeg 3D. Guji walax si aad u doorato. Si aad mid kale u doorato, ku hay Ctrl ama Shift oo guji mid kasta. Gujinta walax la doortay sidaas ayaa ka saaraa mar kale. Fur Muuji qalabka sare oo dooro waxa la sameynayo, ama taabo furahiisa: Qari (H) wuxuu qariyaa walaxda la doortay. Kaliya muuji (I) wuxuu muujiyaa walaxda la doortay oo keliya. Muuqaal daahsan (T) wuxuu muujiyaa walaxda la doortay sida ay tahay, iyo wax kasta oo kale muuqaal daahsan. Guji Muuji dhammaan isla menu-ga, ama taabo Shift+H, si aad mar kale u muujiso walax kasta. Haddii aad rabto inaad ka jarto wax kasta oo ku wareegsan walxaha la doortay, guji Sanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay isla menu-ga, ama taabo Shift+X. Eeg Ka jar moodeelka IFC qolka goynta. Waxa aad arki lahayd Marka dhowr walxood la doortay, Sifooyinka wuxuu sheegaa tirada iyo liis ahaan nooca. Guji mid keli ah si aad u aragto sifooyinkiisa. Walxaha la qariyey lama dooran karo: gujinta ayaa ku dhacda wixii ka dambeeya. Walxaha muuqaalka daahsan iyagana lama doorto karo, sidaas darteed waxaad ku guji kartaa dhinac ka dhinac derbiyada ilaa wixii aad kaliya u muujisay. Khadadka geesaha waxay ku qariman yihiin walxahooda, waxayna noqdaan kuwo daahsan oo isla walaxda la mid ah. Qarin, kaliya muuji iyo muuqaal daahsan waxay ku sii jiraan intaad wax beddelaysid, ka dhigaysid walxaha maktabadda, ama aad moodeelka ka jarayso qolka goynta. Moodeel kale oo la furo wax walba wuu muujiyaa mar kale. Khaladaad caadi ah Liiska menu-ga waa jilcaan (greyed out). Walax lama doorin. Marka hore guji walax; ku dhaji xulashada si aad u akhrisid sababta aanu u shaqayn. Kaliya muuji wuxuu muujiyey derbi aan qariyey. Kaliya muuji wuxuu muujiyaa wixii aad doortay gabi ahaanba, qarsan iyo muuqdaba. Dabaq oo dhan ayaa maqan. Taasi waa liiska Dabaqyada, ma aha Muuji dhammaan: mar kale calaamee dabaqa. Xiga Muuji oo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geesaha Ka jar moodeelka IFC qolka goynta","lang":"so"},{"slug":"terrain","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhulka goobta, saldhiga dhismaha iyo dhagax-dhigista","summary":"Dhulka u keen moodelka adigoo ka soo qaadanaya dhibcaha sahanka, kontuurrada, sawirka LAS / LAZ, GeoTIFF, lakabka LandXML (kan CivilCraft) ama dhowr dhererka dhibcood; saldhiga dhismaha ee guriga ku jar dhalaalaha iyo jarista / buuxinta; jid, waddo iyo patio ku rid dhulka; u gudbi CivilCraft oo LandXML ah.","section":"tasks","order":25,"keywords":["dhul","goob","sahan","topography","sahan dhul","dhibcaha","PNEZD","kontuur","LAS","LAZ","LiDAR","GeoTIFF","DEM","dhererka","dhererka dhibcaha","heer","heerka dhulka","saldhig","saldhiga dhismaha","jarid","buuxin","shaqada dhulka","iftiin","dhalaal","jidka gaadiga","waddo","patio","dhagax-dhigis","LandXML","CivilCraft"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"dhulka-soo-geli","text":"Dhulka soo geli","level":2},{"id":"saldhiga-dhismaha","text":"Saldhiga dhismaha","level":2},{"id":"jidadka-gaadiga-waddooyinka-iyo-patio","text":"Jidadka gaadiga, waddooyinka iyo patio","level":2},{"id":"aasaaska-wuxuu-u-degaa-heerka","text":"Aasaaska wuxuu u degaa heerka","level":2},{"id":"u-gudbi-civilcraft","text":"U gudbi CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuriga ku dhig goobtiisa. Dhulku wuxuu noqonayaa qayb moodelka ka mid ah: wuxuu ka muuqdaa 3D, wuxuu lagu jaraa qaybaha iyo muuqaalada dhinac, kontuurradana qorshaha ayay ku muuqdaan. Saldhig dhismeed ayaa hoosta guriga lagu jaraa, jidadka gaadiga iyo waddooyinka way raacaan, aasaasna way hoos u degaan isaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhulka-soo-geli\"\u003EDhulka soo geli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETerrain\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidkood:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFur fayl sahan…\u003C/strong\u003E: dhibcaha sahanka (PNEZD, PENZD ama bariga, waqooyiga, dhererka oo keliya; oo ay kala soocayaan koma, tab ama meel bannaan), kontuurrada DXF ama DWG-ga ah (xarriiqyo leh dhererkooda, xarriiqyo 3D ah), sawirka LAS ama LAZ (dhibcaha dhulka la hayo, oo la yareeyay ilaa hal dhibic halkii mitir labajibbaaran), GeoTIFF ama shabakad dhererka ASCII ah, ama lakab \u003Cstrong\u003ELandXML\u003C/strong\u003E oo ay soo saartay sida CivilCraft (dhibcaheeda iyo saddexagaladeeda way la hayaa; haddii faylku lakab badan yeesho, BimCraft wuxuu weydiin doonaa kee ah dhulka; cutubyadiisu faylka ayay ka yimaadaan). Marka hore dooro cutubyada faylka (LandXML waa ay isagu sheegtaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka dhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E (laga bilaabo sagxadda heerkan, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E-1&#039;\u003C/code\u003E waa hal fut ka hooseeya) oo riix dhibcaha qorshaha, beddel dhererka oo riix kuwa kale, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E. Saddex dhibic ayaa ku filan si loo bilaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha sahanka ee ka fog moodelka (state plane, UTM) waxaa loo wareejiyaa guriga, dhererkana waa la dejiyaa si dhulka guriga 8&quot; ka hooseeya sagxadda koowaad. \u003Cstrong\u003EKor u qaad dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sixi karta dhererkaas inta aad doonto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saldhiga-dhismaha\"\u003ESaldhiga dhismaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuilding pad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EXadka\u003C/strong\u003E agagaarka guriga, sida \u003Cstrong\u003Esaldhigu u dhigan yahay hoos sagxadda\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot; hoos sagxadda dhagaxa, wax ka badan hoos dhulka hoose) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhalaalaha\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa dhulka hore (\u003Ccode\u003E2:1\u003C/code\u003E = laba fut oo baxda ah mar kasta hal fut oo kor ama hoos ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhex-gal guriga gudihiisa oo riix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhulka waxaa la siman yahay hoosta guriga iyo xadka ilaa, kadibna wuu janjeeraa ilaa buurta (jarid) iyo hoosta dhinaca hoose (buuxin) ilaa uu ku kulmo dhulka hore. \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E dhulka iyo saldhigga ayaa siinaya mugga jarida iyo buuxinta. Darbiyada haddii aad dhaqaaqdo, saldhigu wuu raacaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidadka-gaadiga-waddooyinka-iyo-patio\"\u003EJidadka gaadiga, waddooyinka iyo patio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaving\u003C/span\u003E, ka dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWaddo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJidka gaadiga\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EPatio\u003C/strong\u003E, oo riix geesaha. Geeska koowaad mar kale riix, laba jeer riix ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammayso. Dhagax-dhigistu wuxuu raacaa heerka dhammaystiran; nooceeda ama dhumucdeeda ku beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aasaaska-wuxuu-u-degaa-heerka\"\u003EAasaaska wuxuu u degaa heerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhulku marka uu moodelka ku jiro, darbiyada aasaaska iyo aasaaska hoosta dhulka ayaa raacaa. Darbi kasta dhinaciisa, aasaaska wuxuu ka hooseeyaa dhulka dibadda ah qotada uu leeyahay, wuxuuna u hoos dhacaa tallaabooyin buuxa oo 8&quot; ah meelaha dhulku hoos u dhacayo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/foundations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/foundations\"\u003EAasaaska hoosta darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-gudbi-civilcraft\"\u003EU gudbi CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELandXML for CivilCraft\u003C/strong\u003E (safka Terrain, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E dhulka) waxay soo dejisaa dhulka jira iyo heerka dhammaystiran sida fayl LandXML. Ku fur CivilCraft si aad u sameyso heerka dhabta ah, biyo-maraha iyo shaqada dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulku wuxuu u baahan yahay moodel IFC4, sida moodel kasta oo cusub oo dhismo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKontuurradu waxay ka muuqdaan qorshaha heerka dhulka, masaafada lagu dejiyay \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E dhulka; mid kasta oo shanaad waa mid culus.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulku waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida curiye IFC ah oo dhulka ah (oo ah dusha xidhan oo saddex-geesood ah, si jarista u jarto); saldhigga iyo dhagax-dhigistuna waa lagu kaydiyaa. Dhulka ka tirtir si aad dib ugu bilowdo — saldhigiisa iyo dhagax-dhigistiisuna way la tirtirmi doonaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Guriga ku dhig goobtiisa. Dhulku wuxuu noqonayaa qayb moodelka ka mid ah: wuxuu ka muuqdaa 3D, wuxuu lagu jaraa qaybaha iyo muuqaalada dhinac, kontuurradana qorshaha ayay ku muuqdaan. Saldhig dhismeed ayaa hoosta guriga lagu jaraa, jidadka gaadiga iyo waddooyinka way raacaan, aasaasna way hoos u degaan isaga. Dhulka soo geli Fur Build oo dooro Terrain. Midkood: Fur fayl sahan…: dhibcaha sahanka (PNEZD, PENZD ama bariga, waqooyiga, dhererka oo keliya; oo ay kala soocayaan koma, tab ama meel bannaan), kontuurrada DXF ama DWG-ga ah (xarriiqyo leh dhererkooda, xarriiqyo 3D ah), sawirka LAS ama LAZ (dhibcaha dhulka la hayo, oo la yareeyay ilaa hal dhibic halkii mitir labajibbaaran), GeoTIFF ama shabakad dhererka ASCII ah, ama lakab LandXML oo ay soo saartay sida CivilCraft (dhibcaheeda iyo saddexagaladeeda way la hayaa; haddii faylku lakab badan yeesho, BimCraft wuxuu weydiin doonaa kee ah dhulka; cutubyadiisu faylka ayay ka yimaadaan). Marka hore dooro cutubyada faylka (LandXML waa ay isagu sheegtaa). Ama ku qor Dhererka dhibcaha (laga bilaabo sagxadda heerkan, sidaas darteed -1' waa hal fut ka hooseeya) oo riix dhibcaha qorshaha, beddel dhererka oo riix kuwa kale, kadibna Samee dhulka. Saddex dhibic ayaa ku filan si loo bilaabo. Dhibcaha sahanka ee ka fog moodelka (state plane, UTM) waxaa loo wareejiyaa guriga, dhererkana waa la dejiyaa si dhulka guriga 8\" ka hooseeya sagxadda koowaad. Kor u qaad dhulka oo ku jira Guryaha ayaa sixi karta dhererkaas inta aad doonto. Saldhiga dhismaha Dooro Building pad. Dejiso Xadka agagaarka guriga, sida saldhigu u dhigan yahay hoos sagxadda (8\" hoos sagxadda dhagaxa, wax ka badan hoos dhulka hoose) iyo Dhalaalaha ilaa dhulka hore (2:1 = laba fut oo baxda ah mar kasta hal fut oo kor ama hoos ah). Dhex-gal guriga gudihiisa oo riix. Dhulka waxaa la siman yahay hoosta guriga iyo xadka ilaa, kadibna wuu janjeeraa ilaa buurta (jarid) iyo hoosta dhinaca hoose (buuxin) ilaa uu ku kulmo dhulka hore. Guryaha dhulka iyo saldhigga ayaa siinaya mugga jarida iyo buuxinta. Darbiyada haddii aad dhaqaaqdo, saldhigu wuu raacaa. Jidadka gaadiga, waddooyinka iyo patio Dooro Paving, ka dooro Waddo, Jidka gaadiga ama Patio, oo riix geesaha. Geeska koowaad mar kale riix, laba jeer riix ama riix Enter si aad u dhammayso. Dhagax-dhigistu wuxuu raacaa heerka dhammaystiran; nooceeda ama dhumucdeeda ku beddel Guryaha. Aasaaska wuxuu u degaa heerka Dhulku marka uu moodelka ku jiro, darbiyada aasaaska iyo aasaaska hoosta dhulka ayaa raacaa. Darbi kasta dhinaciisa, aasaaska wuxuu ka hooseeyaa dhulka dibadda ah qotada uu leeyahay, wuxuuna u hoos dhacaa tallaabooyin buuxa oo 8\" ah meelaha dhulku hoos u dhacayo (eeg Aasaaska hoosta darbiyada). U gudbi CivilCraft LandXML for CivilCraft (safka Terrain, ama Guryaha dhulka) waxay soo dejisaa dhulka jira iyo heerka dhammaystiran sida fayl LandXML. Ku fur CivilCraft si aad u sameyso heerka dhabta ah, biyo-maraha iyo shaqada dhulka. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Dhulku wuxuu u baahan yahay moodel IFC4, sida moodel kasta oo cusub oo dhismo. Kontuurradu waxay ka muuqdaan qorshaha heerka dhulka, masaafada lagu dejiyay Guryaha dhulka; mid kasta oo shanaad waa mid culus. Dhulku waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida curiye IFC ah oo dhulka ah (oo ah dusha xidhan oo saddex-geesood ah, si jarista u jarto); saldhigga iyo dhagax-dhigistuna waa lagu kaydiyaa. Dhulka ka tirtir si aad dib ugu bilowdo — saldhigiisa iyo dhagax-dhigistiisuna way la tirtirmi doonaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"section-plane","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka goy moodelka IFC qorshe goyn","summary":"Ka goy moodelka 3D sare, hore ama dhinac, ama ku hay oo keliya waxa ku jira sanduuqa goynta ama mug sanduuqyo badan oo wejiyo janjeersan leh, si aad dhex u aragto; dhaqaajiso goynta adigoo jiidaya ama qorayo, rog, oo dooro waxa goynta muujiyo.","section":"tasks","order":25,"keywords":["goyn","qorshe goyn","sanduuqa goynta","qabsashada","jiid","margin","sanduuqa dooridda","sanduuqa jarista","goy","jarista","qorshaha goynta","qorshe dhul","muuqaal dhinac","dhex","gudaha","rog","offset","mugga goynta","goyn tallaabo leh","qaab L","janjeer","goyn janjeersan","qorshe dheeri ah"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-goynta","text":"Sanduuqa goynta","level":2},{"id":"mug-sanduuqyo-badan-wejiyo-janjeersan-iyo-qorshayaal-dheeri-ah","text":"Mug sanduuqyo badan, wejiyo janjeersan iyo qorshayaal dheeri ah","level":2},{"id":"dhismo-goobteeda-laga-leexiyay","text":"Dhismo goobteeda laga leexiyay","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka IFC ku goy hal qorshe si aad dhex uga aragto: qorshe sare ah, ama hore ama dhinac, si aad u aragto dhismaha dhexdiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EFur moodel IFC oo ku eeg 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Moodelka waxa lagu goyaa bartiisa dhexe, oo jeex ayaa ka soo muuqda qalabka hoostiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro meesha goynta ka bilaabanayso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E. Hore iyo Dhinac waxay sidoo kale muuqaalka u rogaan si aad u eegto goynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaajiso goynta: jiid jiidiyaha \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-fogaan\u003C/strong\u003E, ama qor masaafada mitir sanduuqa oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa millimitir, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E1200 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog\u003C/span\u003E si aad dhinaca kale ee goynta u hayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walax ku taal goynta si aad u aragto sifooyinkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDemi\u003C/span\u003E, dib u guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad goynta uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-goynta\"\u003ESanduuqa goynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq\u003C/span\u003E qalabka isla, si aad u hayso wixii sanduuq gudihiisa ku jira oo keliya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E mid kasta waxa ku jira laba jiidiye: halka sanduuqu ka bilaabmo iyo halka uu ku dhammaado, mitir laga bilaabo geeska moodelka. Qiimayaasha waxay ku muuqdaan dhinacooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq ku wareeg xubta la doortay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sanduuqa ku habeeyaa walxaha aad doortay oo wuu kuu soo dhowaysiiyaa. Wuxuu 300 mm ka reebaa dhinac kasta; beddel taas \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeel ku wareegsan xulashada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha la doortay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isla shaqada hal tallaabo, xitaa goyn aan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQabsashada\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa ayaa lagu dhaqaajin karaa tilmaame: jiid jajab dhexe wejiga si aad wejigaas u dhaqaaqdo, mid dhexe geesta si aad laba wejigii isku dhaafa u dhaqaaqdo, ama mid geeska si aad saddexdaba u dhaqaaqdo. Jiidiyeyaashu way raacaan. Qorshaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E geeska ayaa sanduuqa qorshe ku dhaqaajiya, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E muuqaal dhinac ku dhaqaajiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodel oo dhan\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa mar kale moodel oo dhan ayuu furaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E waxay dib ugu noqdaan hal qorshe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mug-sanduuqyo-badan-wejiyo-janjeersan-iyo-qorshayaal-dheeri-ah\"\u003EMug sanduuqyo badan, wejiyo janjeersan iyo qorshayaal dheeri ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuq had iyo jeer ma aha qaabka aad u baahan tahay: goyn tallaabo leh, jeex qaab L ah, ama goyn ku dhex jirta darbi aan ku toosnayn shabakadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq\u003C/span\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sanduuq\u003C/span\u003E. Goynta hadda waxa ay haysaa wixii ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Emid kasta\u003C/strong\u003E oo sanduuqyada ka mid ah, sidaas darteed laba sanduuq waxay sameeyaan mug tallaabo leh ama qaab L ah. Liiska ku xiga wuxuu sheegayaa sanduuqa jiidiyeyaashu beddelayaan (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq 1\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq 2\u003C/span\u003E…); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar sanduuqan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa kan la doortay ka saara. Mug wuxuu ka kooban yahay ilaa 8 sanduuq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJanjeeris iyo dhinacyo\u003C/span\u003E si aad sanduuqa la doortay u qaabayso:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E oo qor inta ay ku janjeeraneyso dhinac kasta, darajo ahaan (ilaa 80). Dhinacu wuxuu ku wareegaa bartiisa dhexe; wejiyada kale waxay ku sii jiraan meesha jiidiyeyaashu geeyeen. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosi\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dib ugu celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar dhinac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sanduuqa ku jaraa qorshe kale oo dheeri ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/span\u003E waa jihada dhinaca la jaray u jeedo, darajo ahaan laga bilaabo X ilaa Y; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJanjeer\u003C/span\u003E waa inta ay ku janjeerto sare (0 qorshe toosan, 90 qorshe siman); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-fogaan\u003C/span\u003E waa inta qorshuhu uga fog yahay bartiisa dhexe ee sanduuqa, mitir. × ayaa ka saara. Sanduuq wuxuu qaadi karaa ilaa 6 qorshe oo dheeri ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha mugga ku gooyo jidh adag, dhinacyada la jaray waa la buuxiyaa sidii hore, xitaa halka laba sanduuq tallaabo ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii qaabku baabi&#039;o oo aan wax ka hadhin, janjeeris ama qorshayaashu sanduuqaas gudihiisa waxba kuma reebin; qalabku wuu sheegaa. Dhinac dib ugu janjeeri ama beddel kala-fogaanta qorshe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhismo-goobteeda-laga-leexiyay\"\u003EDhismo goobteeda laga leexiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodello badan ayaa dhismaha ku dhejiya xagal ku aaddan faylka tirooyinka (waqooyiga dhabta ah, kala-dhaliga la wadaago). Marka darbiyadu xagal ku socdaan, goyn cusub waxay ka bilaabataa si toosan dhismaha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E iyo sanduuqu waxay ku socdaan darbiyadiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu toosan dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E qalabka goynta waa shid. Guji si aad u hesho tirooyinka moodelka, oo mar kale si aad dib ugu noqoto (sadarka xaaladdu waa sheegaa inta dhismuhu leexan yahay). Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › BimCraft › Dhismo goobteeda laga leexiyay › Sida loo dhigay goobta\u003C/strong\u003E, goynada iyo muuqaalada waxay ka bilaabanayaan tirooyinka moodelka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta hoosteeda ku jira, si aad u eegto qolalka hoos. Kala-fogaanta waxaa lagu cabbiraa kor laga bilaabo hoosta moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHore\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta dambeeyo, oo laga arko hore; \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta ka sii dhaadheer, oo laga arko dhinaca. Kala-fogaanta waxaa laga cabbiraa hore ama dhinaca moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesta midabka khafiifka ah ayaa muujisa meesha qorshuhu ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha qorshuhu darbi, bal-bal ama jidh kale oo adag ku gooyo, dhinaca la jaray waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab madow, sida goyn la sawiray. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ayaa taas damiya oo shida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaabka muuqaalka ee geeska hoose ee midig ayaa moodelka wareejiya si goynta looga eego dhinac kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGujintu waxa ay doortaa wixii aad arki karto: wax la jaray ma la doorto karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba ma bedelmin.\u003C/strong\u003E Goyntu waxay noqon kartaa ka sarreysa saqafka ama ka baxsan moodelka. Jiidiyaha jiid, ama qor kala-fogaan yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-fogaantu dib ayay u dhacday.\u003C/strong\u003E Masaafo ka baxsan moodelka ayaa loo wareejiyaa dhamaadkiisa, sadarka xaaladdana waa sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaato ayaa muujisa qayb keliya oo mugga ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhibaato (BCF) waxa ay hayaa hal sanduuq oo wejiyadiisa janjeersan iyo qorshayaasha ah: sanduuqa ugu horeeya mugga. Sadarka xaaladda waa sheegaa marka aad dhibaatada samaynayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoyntu waa madhan tahay.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi\u003C/span\u003E qalabka waa demay: guji si aad dhinacyada la jaray ee darbiyada, bal-balka iyo jidhka kale u buuxiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoyn la buuxiyay waxay u muuqataa mid buusbuusan ama qayb ka maqan.\u003C/strong\u003E Buuxinta waxay u baahan tahay jidh xidhan; walax ay qaabkeedu faylka ku jirin xidhan (xaashi keli ah, caleemaha geedka) waa la reebaa oo lama midabeeyo. Walax ka kooban qaybo midabyo kala duwan leh (qaab iyo muraayaddiisa) waa la buuxiyaa marka qaybahooda ay isku xidhmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka goynta xagee yaal?\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa uu ku yaalaa sare muuqaalka 3D ee uu goynayo: qeybta 3D ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E, iyo hoosta jagada sawirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E keliya. Muuqaal gaaban ah wuu sii qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/storeys-and-spaces\"\u003EMuuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geeskabka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EArag sawir DWG ama DXF oo 3D ah\u003C/a\u003E — sawirrada 3D waxay leeyihiin qorshe goyn isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Moodelka IFC ku goy hal qorshe si aad dhex uga aragto: qorshe sare ah, ama hore ama dhinac, si aad u aragto dhismaha dhexdiisa. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC. Eeg Fur moodel IFC oo ku eeg 3D. Guji Goyn qalabka sare, ama riix X. Moodelka waxa lagu goyaa bartiisa dhexe, oo jeex ayaa ka soo muuqda qalabka hoostiisa. Dooro meesha goynta ka bilaabanayso: Sare, Hore ama Dhinac. Hore iyo Dhinac waxay sidoo kale muuqaalka u rogaan si aad u eegto goynta. Dhaqaajiso goynta: jiid jiidiyaha Kala-fogaan, ama qor masaafada mitir sanduuqa oo riix Enter. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa millimitir, tusaale ahaan 1200 mm. Guji Rog si aad dhinaca kale ee goynta u hayso. Guji walax ku taal goynta si aad u aragto sifooyinkeeda. Guji Demi, dib u guji Goyn, ama riix X si aad goynta uga saarto. Sanduuqa goynta Guji Sanduuq qalabka isla, si aad u hayso wixii sanduuq gudihiisa ku jira oo keliya. X, Y iyo Z mid kasta waxa ku jira laba jiidiye: halka sanduuqu ka bilaabmo iyo halka uu ku dhammaado, mitir laga bilaabo geeska moodelka. Qiimayaasha waxay ku muuqdaan dhinacooda. Sanduuq ku wareeg xubta la doortay wuxuu sanduuqa ku habeeyaa walxaha aad doortay oo wuu kuu soo dhowaysiiyaa. Wuxuu 300 mm ka reebaa dhinac kasta; beddel taas Dejinta › BimCraft › Meel ku wareegsan xulashada. Walxaha la doortay, Muuji › Sanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay ama Shift+X isla shaqada hal tallaabo, xitaa goyn aan jirin. Qabsashada sanduuqa ayaa lagu dhaqaajin karaa tilmaame: jiid jajab dhexe wejiga si aad wejigaas u dhaqaaqdo, mid dhexe geesta si aad laba wejigii isku dhaafa u dhaqaaqdo, ama mid geeska si aad saddexdaba u dhaqaaqdo. Jiidiyeyaashu way raacaan. Qorshaha Sare geeska ayaa sanduuqa qorshe ku dhaqaajiya, Hore ama Dhinac muuqaal dhinac ku dhaqaajiya. Moodel oo dhan sanduuqa mar kale moodel oo dhan ayuu furaa. Sare, Hore ama Dhinac waxay dib ugu noqdaan hal qorshe. Mug sanduuqyo badan, wejiyo janjeersan iyo qorshayaal dheeri ah Sanduuq had iyo jeer ma aha qaabka aad u baahan tahay: goyn tallaabo leh, jeex qaab L ah, ama goyn ku dhex jirta darbi aan ku toosnayn shabakadda. Ku Sanduuq, guji Ku dar sanduuq. Goynta hadda waxa ay haysaa wixii ku jira mid kasta oo sanduuqyada ka mid ah, sidaas darteed laba sanduuq waxay sameeyaan mug tallaabo leh ama qaab L ah. Liiska ku xiga wuxuu sheegayaa sanduuqa jiidiyeyaashu beddelayaan (Sanduuq 1, Sanduuq 2…); Ka saar sanduuqan ayaa kan la doortay ka saara. Mug wuxuu ka kooban yahay ilaa 8 sanduuq. Fur Janjeeris iyo dhinacyo si aad sanduuqa la doortay u qaabayso: Dooro Dhinac oo qor inta ay ku janjeeraneyso dhinac kasta, darajo ahaan (ilaa 80). Dhinacu wuxuu ku wareegaa bartiisa dhexe; wejiyada kale waxay ku sii jiraan meesha jiidiyeyaashu geeyeen. Toosi ayaa dib ugu celiya. Ku dar dhinac wuxuu sanduuqa ku jaraa qorshe kale oo dheeri ah. Dhinacyada waa jihada dhinaca la jaray u jeedo, darajo ahaan laga bilaabo X ilaa Y; Janjeer waa inta ay ku janjeerto sare (0 qorshe toosan, 90 qorshe siman); Kala-fogaan waa inta qorshuhu uga fog yahay bartiisa dhexe ee sanduuqa, mitir. × ayaa ka saara. Sanduuq wuxuu qaadi karaa ilaa 6 qorshe oo dheeri ah. Meesha mugga ku gooyo jidh adag, dhinacyada la jaray waa la buuxiyaa sidii hore, xitaa halka laba sanduuq tallaabo ku kulmaan. Haddii qaabku baabi'o oo aan wax ka hadhin, janjeeris ama qorshayaashu sanduuqaas gudihiisa waxba kuma reebin; qalabku wuu sheegaa. Dhinac dib ugu janjeeri ama beddel kala-fogaanta qorshe. Dhismo goobteeda laga leexiyay Moodello badan ayaa dhismaha ku dhejiya xagal ku aaddan faylka tirooyinka (waqooyiga dhabta ah, kala-dhaliga la wadaago). Marka darbiyadu xagal ku socdaan, goyn cusub waxay ka bilaabataa si toosan dhismaha: Hore, Dhinac iyo sanduuqu waxay ku socdaan darbiyadiisa, Ku toosan dhismaha qalabka goynta waa shid. Guji si aad u hesho tirooyinka moodelka, oo mar kale si aad dib ugu noqoto (sadarka xaaladdu waa sheegaa inta dhismuhu leexan yahay). Marka Dejinta › BimCraft › Dhismo goobteeda laga leexiyay › Sida loo dhigay goobta, goynada iyo muuqaalada waxay ka bilaabanayaan tirooyinka moodelka. Eeg Dejinta. Waxa aad arki doontid Sare wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta hoosteeda ku jira, si aad u eegto qolalka hoos. Kala-fogaanta waxaa lagu cabbiraa kor laga bilaabo hoosta moodelka. Hore wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta dambeeyo, oo laga arko hore; Dhinac wuxuu hayaa wixii goynta ka sii dhaadheer, oo laga arko dhinaca. Kala-fogaanta waxaa laga cabbiraa hore ama dhinaca moodelka. Geesta midabka khafiifka ah ayaa muujisa meesha qorshuhu ku yaal. Meesha qorshuhu darbi, bal-bal ama jidh kale oo adag ku gooyo, dhinaca la jaray waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab madow, sida goyn la sawiray. Buuxi qalabka ayaa taas damiya oo shida. Kaabka muuqaalka ee geeska hoose ee midig ayaa moodelka wareejiya si goynta looga eego dhinac kasta. Gujintu waxa ay doortaa wixii aad arki karto: wax la jaray ma la doorto karo. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Waxba ma bedelmin. Goyntu waxay noqon kartaa ka sarreysa saqafka ama ka baxsan moodelka. Jiidiyaha jiid, ama qor kala-fogaan yar. Kala-fogaantu dib ayay u dhacday. Masaafo ka baxsan moodelka ayaa loo wareejiyaa dhamaadkiisa, sadarka xaaladdana waa sheegaa. Dhibaato ayaa muujisa qayb keliya oo mugga ah. Dhibaato (BCF) waxa ay hayaa hal sanduuq oo wejiyadiisa janjeersan iyo qorshayaasha ah: sanduuqa ugu horeeya mugga. Sadarka xaaladda waa sheegaa marka aad dhibaatada samaynayso. Goyntu waa madhan tahay. Buuxi qalabka waa demay: guji si aad dhinacyada la jaray ee darbiyada, bal-balka iyo jidhka kale u buuxiso. Goyn la buuxiyay waxay u muuqataa mid buusbuusan ama qayb ka maqan. Buuxinta waxay u baahan tahay jidh xidhan; walax ay qaabkeedu faylka ku jirin xidhan (xaashi keli ah, caleemaha geedka) waa la reebaa oo lama midabeeyo. Walax ka kooban qaybo midabyo kala duwan leh (qaab iyo muraayaddiisa) waa la buuxiyaa marka qaybahooda ay isku xidhmaan. Qalabka goynta xagee yaal? Waxa uu ku yaalaa sare muuqaalka 3D ee uu goynayo: qeybta 3D ee Kala jar, iyo hoosta jagada sawirka Qorshe keliya. Muuqaal gaaban ah wuu sii qaadaa. Xiga Muuji iyo qari dabaqyada, meelaha iyo geeskabka Arag sawir DWG ama DXF oo 3D ah — sawirrada 3D waxay leeyihiin qorshe goyn isku mid ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"color-by-property","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Midey walxaha iyadoo la eegayo sifo","summary":"Midey walax kasta qiimaha hal sifo, sida nooca, nooca hore, dabaqa, agabka, heerka dab-damiska ama kharashka, akhri sharaxa, guji qiime si aad u muujiso walxaha kaliya, oo kaydi midabada qaab si aad ugu isticmaasho moodelada kale.","section":"tasks","order":26,"keywords":["midab","midey","sharax","muuqaal caqli leh","muuqaal","sifo","nooc","agab","heerka dab-damiska","shaandhayn","kala saar","mawduuc","qiimayaal","qaabka midabka","kaydi midabka","dib u isticmaal","kooxda","json","midab yar"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"beddel-midabada-oo-u-hay-qaab","text":"Beddel midabada oo u hay qaab","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi degdeg ah u arag sida sifo loo kala qaybiyey moodelka: derbiyada dibada iyo kuwa gudaha, agabyada meelaha loo isticmaalo, walxaha aan heerka dab-damiska lahayn. Walax kasta waxay qaadataa midabka qiimihiisa, sharaxuna wuxuu sheegayaa midab kasta waxa uu macno u leeyahay iyo inta walxood ee leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sifo liiska ku jirta. Kuwa hore waxay u dhacaan walax kasta (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooc\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac\u003C/span\u003E…); kuwa kale waxay ka imanayaan set-yada sifooyinka iyo set-yada xaddiga moodelka, hoosta magaca setka. Lambarka ku dhow mid kasta waa inta walxood ee leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri sharaxa: midab, qiimaha iyo inta walxood ee leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qiime si aad u muujiso walxaha kaliya. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo guji si aad qiimo kale ugu darto. Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad wax walba mar kale u muujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDemi\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu noqoto midabka asalka ah ee moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa toddobo qiime ayaa mid kasta midab u gaar ah helaya, kan ugu badan marka hore. Qiimayaal ka badan waxay wadaagaan hal midab cawl, oo lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiimayaal kale\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro leh qiimayaal kala duwan oo badan waxa loo kala qaybiyaa lix xagga oo siman, laga bilaabo midab fudud (hoose) ilaa midab mugdi (sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha aan sifada lahayn waa cawl cad, lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro qiime\u003C/strong\u003E, si walxaha midabka leh u muuqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidabyadu waxay isbedelaan iyadoo loo eegayo Paper iyo Moodeel, waxayna sii joogaan markaad moodelka wax ka beddelayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESifada nooca waxay ku dhacdaa walxaha nooca oo dhan; marka walax ay qiimaha u gaar ah u leedahay isla sifada, qiimaha walaxda laftiisa ayaa ka mudan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-midabada-oo-u-hay-qaab\"\u003EBeddel midabada oo u hay qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji alaabta midabka ee sharaxa si aad midab kale u doorato qiimahaas. Moodelka isla markiiba ayaa dib loo rinjiyeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qaabka midabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa midabada fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ah, oo magaciisu yahay sifada, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EClass colors.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel kale ama kumbiyuutarka saaxiibkaa, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qaabka midabka…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylkaas. Qiime kasta oo qaabka ku jira wuxuu helaa midabkiisa, sidaas darteed heerka dab-damiska ama nidaamka isku midka ahi wuxuu midab isku mid ah ku leeyahay moodel kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiime uusan qaabku lahayn waa cawl, waxaana lagu liistaa &quot;Qiime aan qaabka ku jirin&quot;. Qiimayaasha qaabka ku jira oo moodelkan aan lahayn ayaa sii joogaan liiska iyagoo leh 0, si aad qaabka oo dhan u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabku midabkiisa wuu ku hayaa labada mawduuc. Doorashada sifo liiska ku jirta waxay ka bilaabataa midabyada otomaatiga ah mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Moodelkan ma leh qiimayaal … ah&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaabka waa la kaydiyay sifo aan moodelkan lahayn (magac set kale, tusaale ahaan). Fur qaab loo sameeyay nooca moodelkan, ama dooro sifo liiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifo ma ku jirto liiska.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro walax leh shaqal ku jirta moodelka oo leh sifadaas. Sifooyinka dabaqyada iyo meelaha laftoodu liiska kuma jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax walba midab isku mid ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Walax walba waxay leedahay isla qiimaha, ama ma leh: eeg tirooyinka sharaxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo walxaha ku arag si gaar ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EJidkaaga ka hel geedka moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Si degdeg ah u arag sida sifo loo kala qaybiyey moodelka: derbiyada dibada iyo kuwa gudaha, agabyada meelaha loo isticmaalo, walxaha aan heerka dab-damiska lahayn. Walax kasta waxay qaadataa midabka qiimihiisa, sharaxuna wuxuu sheegayaa midab kasta waxa uu macno u leeyahay iyo inta walxood ee leh. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC. Guji tab-ka Midab ee dhinaca midig. Dooro sifo liiska ku jirta. Kuwa hore waxay u dhacaan walax kasta (Nooca, Nooc, Dabaq, Agab, Magac…); kuwa kale waxay ka imanayaan set-yada sifooyinka iyo set-yada xaddiga moodelka, hoosta magaca setka. Lambarka ku dhow mid kasta waa inta walxood ee leh. Akhri sharaxa: midab, qiimaha iyo inta walxood ee leh. Guji qiime si aad u muujiso walxaha kaliya. Hay Ctrl oo guji si aad qiimo kale ugu darto. Taabo Shift+H si aad wax walba mar kale u muujiso. Guji Demi si aad ugu noqoto midabka asalka ah ee moodelka. Waxa aad arki doontid Ilaa toddobo qiime ayaa mid kasta midab u gaar ah helaya, kan ugu badan marka hore. Qiimayaal ka badan waxay wadaagaan hal midab cawl, oo lagu liistaa qiimayaal kale. Tiro leh qiimayaal kala duwan oo badan waxa loo kala qaybiyaa lix xagga oo siman, laga bilaabo midab fudud (hoose) ilaa midab mugdi (sare). Walxaha aan sifada lahayn waa cawl cad, lagu liistaa Ma jiro qiime, si walxaha midabka leh u muuqdaan. Midabyadu waxay isbedelaan iyadoo loo eegayo Paper iyo Moodeel, waxayna sii joogaan markaad moodelka wax ka beddelayso. Sifada nooca waxay ku dhacdaa walxaha nooca oo dhan; marka walax ay qiimaha u gaar ah u leedahay isla sifada, qiimaha walaxda laftiisa ayaa ka mudan. Beddel midabada oo u hay qaab Guji alaabta midabka ee sharaxa si aad midab kale u doorato qiimahaas. Moodelka isla markiiba ayaa dib loo rinjiyeeyaa. Kaydi qaabka midabka wuxuu soo dejiyaa midabada fayl yar oo .json ah, oo magaciisu yahay sifada, tusaale ahaan Class colors.json. Moodel kale ama kumbiyuutarka saaxiibkaa, guji Fur qaabka midabka… oo dooro faylkaas. Qiime kasta oo qaabka ku jira wuxuu helaa midabkiisa, sidaas darteed heerka dab-damiska ama nidaamka isku midka ahi wuxuu midab isku mid ah ku leeyahay moodel kasta. Qiime uusan qaabku lahayn waa cawl, waxaana lagu liistaa \"Qiime aan qaabka ku jirin\". Qiimayaasha qaabka ku jira oo moodelkan aan lahayn ayaa sii joogaan liiska iyagoo leh 0, si aad qaabka oo dhan u aragto. Qaabku midabkiisa wuu ku hayaa labada mawduuc. Doorashada sifo liiska ku jirta waxay ka bilaabataa midabyada otomaatiga ah mar kale. Khaladaadka caadiga ah \"Moodelkan ma leh qiimayaal … ah\". Qaabka waa la kaydiyay sifo aan moodelkan lahayn (magac set kale, tusaale ahaan). Fur qaab loo sameeyay nooca moodelkan, ama dooro sifo liiska. Sifo ma ku jirto liiska. Ma jiro walax leh shaqal ku jirta moodelka oo leh sifadaas. Sifooyinka dabaqyada iyo meelaha laftoodu liiska kuma jiraan. Wax walba midab isku mid ah. Walax walba waxay leedahay isla qiimaha, ama ma leh: eeg tirooyinka sharaxa. Xiga Qari, kala saar oo walxaha ku arag si gaar ah Jidkaaga ka hel geedka moodelka","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuqaalada dhinacyada, goynta iyo xaashiyada","summary":"Samee xariiqyada goynta qorshaha, kadibna fur Xaashiyada si aad u hesho qaybta daabacaadda diyaar ah oo laga sameeyay moodelka: qorshaha dabaq kasta, afar muuqaal dhinac, goynta dhismaha, jadwallada iyo qaab-dhismeedka darbiyada, oo leh bloogyada cinwaanka iyo miisaanka, hal PDF.","section":"tasks","order":26,"keywords":["xaashiyo","qaybta sawirka","dokumentiyada dhismaha","daabac","pdf","muuqaal dhinac","muuqaalka dhinaca woqooyi","goyn","goynta dhismaha","xariiqa goynta","khadadka qarsoon","bloogga cinwaanka","lambarka xaashiga","miisaan","warqad","11x17","24x36","A3","A1","qaybta ansixinta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-xariiqa-goynta","text":"Samee xariiqa goynta","level":2},{"id":"fur-xaashiyada","text":"Fur xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"qoraallada-caadiga-ah-ee-xeerka","text":"Qoraallada caadiga ah ee xeerka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xaashiyada-ku-jira","text":"Waxa xaashiyada ku jira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee qaybta sawirka moodelka: qorshaha dabaq kasta, dhinacyada woqooyi, bari, koonfur iyo galbeed, goyn dhismo oo loo sameeyay xariiq goyn kasta, jadwalka albaabka, daaqadda, qolka iyo alwaaxa, iyo muuqaal dhinac darbi kasta oo qaab-dhismeed leh. Qaybtu mar kasta mar kale waa la sawiraa moodelka markaad furto, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waxay la mid tahay wixii aad dhistay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-xariiqa-goynta\"\u003ESamee xariiqa goynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaq, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka goynta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha xariiqu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Xariiqa gaaban ee dhexdiisa wuxuu muujiyaa dhinaca goynta eegaysa: bidixda xariiqa, marka laga bilaabo guji koowaad ilaa guji labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqu wuxuu ka muuqdaa qorshaha isagoo leh madaxyadiisa iyo xarafkiisa (A, markaas B, iwm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro xariiqa si aad u beddesho \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: xarafkiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003ERog aragtida\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u eegto dhinac kale, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EEeg ilaa masaafo\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u joojiso aragtida masaafo go&#039;an oo ka dambeysa goynta (0 wuxuu muujiyaa wax walba ee ka dambeeya). Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-xaashiyada\"\u003EFur xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E qaybta moodelka (dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaabac\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyada waxay ku liistaysan yihiin bidix: \u003Cstrong\u003EA-101\u003C/strong\u003E iyo kuwa ka dambeeya qorshayaasha, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-201\u003C/strong\u003E muuqaalka dhinacyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-301\u003C/strong\u003E goynta, \u003Cstrong\u003EA-401\u003C/strong\u003E jadwallada iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ES-101\u003C/strong\u003E qaab-dhismeedka darbiyada. Guji mid si aad u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWarqadda\u003C/strong\u003E: Letter, Tabloid (11 × 17), Arch D (24 × 36), A3 ama A1. Warqaddu waxay magaceeda caadiga ah ku hayn doontaa, cabbirkeeduna wuxuu ku qoran yahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay, tusaale ahaan \u003Cem\u003ELetter · 8.5 × 11 in\u003C/em\u003E ama \u003Cem\u003EA3 · 297 × 420 mm\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo degso garaaca oo dhan PDF ahaan\u003C/span\u003E: hal bog oo xaashi kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraallada-caadiga-ah-ee-xeerka\"\u003EQoraallada caadiga ah ee xeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiga gudihiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraallada caadiga ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad dhigto qoraallo xeer ka soo kala qaybsan (sida qaybta) tiirka midig ee xaashiga. Qoraal kasta wuxuu xifdiyaa xeerka iyo qodobka uu ka yimid, xaashi la daabacay wuxuu sheegaa marka xeerkaas aan la xaqiijin. Qoraallada waa bilow; qofka mas&#039;uulka ka ah sawirka ayaa go&#039;aamiya waxa ay sheegayaan. Waxay u baahan yihiin kordhinta \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerarka dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xaashiyada-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa xaashiyada ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaashu\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinayaan darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, qolalka oo leh aagagooda, cabbirrada iyo xariiqyada goynta, miisaanka weyn ee caadiga ah ee ku habboon: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ama ka yar (1:50 ama ka yar millimitir ahaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada dhinacyada\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa laga sameeyay moodelka 3D oo khadadka qarsoon laga saaray, laba xaashi kasta, dhammaantood isla miisaan, iyo khad dhulka hoostooda. Saqafka, aasaaska iyo dhulku waxay muuqdaan sida loo moodeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoynta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay buuxisaa waxa uu gooyntu marto (darbiyada, dabaqyada, saqafka) oo waxay sawirtaa waxa looga arkay ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada iyo goynta waxay leeyihiin qoraalladooda:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamad heer kasta oo magaceeda iyo dhererkeeda midig ku jira, dhererka u dhexeeya heerarka bidix ku jira, muuqaal dhinac dhexdiisa dhererka dhismaha hoosteeda, iyo calaamad (D1, W1) albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta darbi kuu soo wajahan. Darbiyada qolka gudihiisa eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/interior-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/interior-elevations\"\u003EMuuqaalada gudaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E waa isla miiskii ka muuqday \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/span\u003E ee barta moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-dhismeedka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa dhamaan darbiga qaab-dhismeed leh ee ka muuqda dhinaca dibadda: dhuumaha, saxanka, madaxyada iyo saldhigga daaqadda, si kooxdu u dejiso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/framing\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/framing\"\u003EQaab-dhismeedka darbiyada, dabaqyada iyo saqafyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashi kasta wuxuu leeyahay bloog cinwaan oo leh lambarkiisa, cinwaankiisa, magaca faylka iyo taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashiyada waxay ka imanayaan moodelka: si aad u beddesho sawir, beddel moodelka oo mar kale fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalada iyo goynta waxay muujiyaan khadadka iyo buuxinta oo keliya: cabbirrada, calaamadaha heerarka iyo qoraallada ku saabsan weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee qaybta sawirka moodelka: qorshaha dabaq kasta, dhinacyada woqooyi, bari, koonfur iyo galbeed, goyn dhismo oo loo sameeyay xariiq goyn kasta, jadwalka albaabka, daaqadda, qolka iyo alwaaxa, iyo muuqaal dhinac darbi kasta oo qaab-dhismeed leh. Qaybtu mar kasta mar kale waa la sawiraa moodelka markaad furto, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waxay la mid tahay wixii aad dhistay. Samee xariiqa goynta Dabaq, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Khadka goynta. Guji meesha xariiqu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Xariiqa gaaban ee dhexdiisa wuxuu muujiyaa dhinaca goynta eegaysa: bidixda xariiqa, marka laga bilaabo guji koowaad ilaa guji labaad. Xariiqu wuxuu ka muuqdaa qorshaha isagoo leh madaxyadiisa iyo xarafkiisa (A, markaas B, iwm). Dooro xariiqa si aad u beddesho Sifooyinka: xarafkiisa, Rog aragtida si aad u eegto dhinac kale, iyo Eeg ilaa masaafo si aad u joojiso aragtida masaafo go'an oo ka dambeysa goynta (0 wuxuu muujiyaa wax walba ee ka dambeeya). Taabo Delete si aad u tirtirto. Fur xaashiyada Guji Xaashiyada qaybta moodelka (dhinaca Daabac). Xaashiyada waxay ku liistaysan yihiin bidix: A-101 iyo kuwa ka dambeeya qorshayaasha, A-201 muuqaalka dhinacyada, A-301 goynta, A-401 jadwallada iyo S-101 qaab-dhismeedka darbiyada. Guji mid si aad u aragto. Dooro Warqadda: Letter, Tabloid (11 × 17), Arch D (24 × 36), A3 ama A1. Warqaddu waxay magaceeda caadiga ah ku hayn doontaa, cabbirkeeduna wuxuu ku qoran yahay Cutubyada aad dooratay, tusaale ahaan Letter · 8.5 × 11 in ama A3 · 297 × 420 mm. Guji Soo degso garaaca oo dhan PDF ahaan: hal bog oo xaashi kasta. Qoraallada caadiga ah ee xeerka Xaashiga gudihiisa, Qoraallada caadiga ah wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad dhigto qoraallo xeer ka soo kala qaybsan (sida qaybta) tiirka midig ee xaashiga. Qoraal kasta wuxuu xifdiyaa xeerka iyo qodobka uu ka yimid, xaashi la daabacay wuxuu sheegaa marka xeerkaas aan la xaqiijin. Qoraallada waa bilow; qofka mas'uulka ka ah sawirka ayaa go'aamiya waxa ay sheegayaan. Waxay u baahan yihiin kordhinta Xeerarka dhismaha. Waxa xaashiyada ku jira Qorshayaashu waxay muujinayaan darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, qolalka oo leh aagagooda, cabbirrada iyo xariiqyada goynta, miisaanka weyn ee caadiga ah ee ku habboon: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" ama ka yar (1:50 ama ka yar millimitir ahaan). Muuqaalada dhinacyada waxaa laga sameeyay moodelka 3D oo khadadka qarsoon laga saaray, laba xaashi kasta, dhammaantood isla miisaan, iyo khad dhulka hoostooda. Saqafka, aasaaska iyo dhulku waxay muuqdaan sida loo moodeeyay. Goynta waxay buuxisaa waxa uu gooyntu marto (darbiyada, dabaqyada, saqafka) oo waxay sawirtaa waxa looga arkay ka dambeeya. Muuqaalada iyo goynta waxay leeyihiin qoraalladooda: calaamad heer kasta oo magaceeda iyo dhererkeeda midig ku jira, dhererka u dhexeeya heerarka bidix ku jira, muuqaal dhinac dhexdiisa dhererka dhismaha hoosteeda, iyo calaamad (D1, W1) albaab kasta iyo daaqad kasta darbi kuu soo wajahan. Darbiyada qolka gudihiisa eeg Muuqaalada gudaha. Jadwallada waa isla miiskii ka muuqday Jadwallada ee barta moodelka. Qaab-dhismeedka wuxuu muujinayaa dhamaan darbiga qaab-dhismeed leh ee ka muuqda dhinaca dibadda: dhuumaha, saxanka, madaxyada iyo saldhigga daaqadda, si kooxdu u dejiso. Eeg Qaab-dhismeedka darbiyada, dabaqyada iyo saqafyada. Xaashi kasta wuxuu leeyahay bloog cinwaan oo leh lambarkiisa, cinwaankiisa, magaca faylka iyo taariikhda. Xaashiyada waxay ka imanayaan moodelka: si aad u beddesho sawir, beddel moodelka oo mar kale fur Xaashiyada. Muuqaalada iyo goynta waxay muujiyaan khadadka iyo buuxinta oo keliya: cabbirrada, calaamadaha heerarka iyo qoraallada ku saabsan weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"several-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Eeg moodeelo IFC badan oo wada jir ah","summary":"Ku dar faylal IFC oo dheeraad ah sida naqshadda, qaab-dhismeedka iyo adeegyada, ku arag isku-koorsoonaanta isla iskuxirnaanta, guuri mid, qari mid, oo dooro kan aad tafatirayso.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["isku-dhis","moodelo badan","faylal badan","isku-darin","moodel isku-dhafan","isku-xirnaan","takhasus","qaab-dhismeed","adeegyada","kala-guur","guuri moodel","moodel firfircoon","ku dar moodel"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"fur-moodelada-kooxda","text":"Fur moodelada kooxda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa eeg moodeelada takhasusyada kala duwan meel keliya: moodelka naqshadeeyaha oo leh moodelada qaab-dhismeedka iyo adeegyada. Mid kastaba waa faylkiisa gaarka ah; BimCraft wuxuu kaliya wada muujiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodelka IFC ee koowaad sida caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelo\u003C/span\u003E bidix, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodel…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro hal ama in ka badan oo faylal IFC ah. Mid kasta wuxuu ku muuqdaa liiska iyo aragtida 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee moodel si aad u qariso; calaamee mar kale si aad u muujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii moodel uu yimaado meel khaldan (barta survey-ka oo kale), guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E hoosteeda, qor inta uu u guurayo X, Y iyo Z ee mitirka, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodelka leh dhibicda ayaa ah kan aad tafatirto. Guji dhibcaha moodel kale si aad taas tafatirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji × ku xiga moodel si aad uga saarto muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-moodelada-kooxda\"\u003EFur moodelada kooxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka moodelka furan uu yahay fayl cloud ah oo ku jira mashruuc koox, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur moodeelada kooxda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muuqdaa hoosta liiska. Wuxuu furaa moodelada IFC ee kale ee mashruuca isla markaana dhinaca moodelkan, mid kastaba waxaa lagu guuraa kala-guurka ay mashruucu dejiyay. Moodelada laga qariyay adiga way ka baxaan oo waa la tiriyaa; moodel ay mashruucu leexiyay waa la furaa oo aan la leexin, mana waa la tiriyaa; faylasha aan IFC ahayn (tusaale ahaan DWG) waa la dhaafaa, magacooda loogana sheegaa xariiqa xaaladda. Moodel horey u furan weligiis lama furo mar labaad. Badhanku wuu qarsoon yahay haddii fayluhu ku jirin mashruuc koox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel kasta oo ku jira isku-koorsoonaanta moodelka koowaad, sida faylkiisu u dhigo. Moodelada laga soo dhoofiyay isla mashruuc ayaa isku khadsan, iyada oo aan wax la guurin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad dooratid xubin moodel aadan tafatirin, sifooyinkeeda waxay muuqdaan akhri keliya, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir moodelkaas\u003C/span\u003E si aad u beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeedka moodelka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E, liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E, dhigidda alaabta maktabadda iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E dhammaantood waxay ka shaqeeyaan moodelka aad tafatirayso. Qarinta, kala saarista, daahfurnaanta iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E waxay ka shaqeeyaan moodelada oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa moodelka aad tafatirayso, isagoo leh isbeddelladiisa keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel ayaa fog ama maqan.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylkiisu wuxuu isticmaalaa isku-xirnaan kale. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hesho, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu dhigto meesha saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir ama Koobiyee waa damsan yihiin xubin la doortay.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxay ku jirtaa moodel kale: marka hore u beddel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl laga furay Dooro fayl wuxuu wax walba beddelay.\u003C/strong\u003E Taasi waxay bilaabaysaa muuqaal cusub. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodel…\u003C/span\u003E si aad faylal ugu darto midka aad haysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo daahfur xubnaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EMidabka xubnaha sifo ahaan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka eeg moodeelada takhasusyada kala duwan meel keliya: moodelka naqshadeeyaha oo leh moodelada qaab-dhismeedka iyo adeegyada. Mid kastaba waa faylkiisa gaarka ah; BimCraft wuxuu kaliya wada muujiyaa. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodelka IFC ee koowaad sida caadiga ah. Moodelo bidix, guji Ku dar moodel… oo dooro hal ama in ka badan oo faylal IFC ah. Mid kasta wuxuu ku muuqdaa liiska iyo aragtida 3D. Calaamee moodel si aad u qariso; calaamee mar kale si aad u muujiso. Haddii moodel uu yimaado meel khaldan (barta survey-ka oo kale), guji Guuri hoosteeda, qor inta uu u guurayo X, Y iyo Z ee mitirka, kadibna guji Codso. Moodelka leh dhibicda ayaa ah kan aad tafatirto. Guji dhibcaha moodel kale si aad taas tafatirto. Guji × ku xiga moodel si aad uga saarto muuqaalka. Fur moodelada kooxda Marka moodelka furan uu yahay fayl cloud ah oo ku jira mashruuc koox, Fur moodeelada kooxda wuxuu muuqdaa hoosta liiska. Wuxuu furaa moodelada IFC ee kale ee mashruuca isla markaana dhinaca moodelkan, mid kastaba waxaa lagu guuraa kala-guurka ay mashruucu dejiyay. Moodelada laga qariyay adiga way ka baxaan oo waa la tiriyaa; moodel ay mashruucu leexiyay waa la furaa oo aan la leexin, mana waa la tiriyaa; faylasha aan IFC ahayn (tusaale ahaan DWG) waa la dhaafaa, magacooda loogana sheegaa xariiqa xaaladda. Moodel horey u furan weligiis lama furo mar labaad. Badhanku wuu qarsoon yahay haddii fayluhu ku jirin mashruuc koox. Waxa aad arki doontid Moodel kasta oo ku jira isku-koorsoonaanta moodelka koowaad, sida faylkiisu u dhigo. Moodelada laga soo dhoofiyay isla mashruuc ayaa isku khadsan, iyada oo aan wax la guurin. Markaad dooratid xubin moodel aadan tafatirin, sifooyinkeeda waxay muuqdaan akhri keliya, iyo Tafatir moodelkaas si aad u beddesho. Geedka moodelka, Dabaqyada, Midab, liiska Isbeddellada, dhigidda alaabta maktabadda iyo U kaydi sida IFC dhammaantood waxay ka shaqeeyaan moodelka aad tafatirayso. Qarinta, kala saarista, daahfurnaanta iyo Dooro dhammaan waxay ka shaqeeyaan moodelada oo dhan. U kaydi sida IFC wuxuu soo dejiyaa moodelka aad tafatirayso, isagoo leh isbeddelladiisa keliya. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Moodel ayaa fog ama maqan. Faylkiisu wuxuu isticmaalaa isku-xirnaan kale. Isticmaal Ku habee si aad u hesho, kadibna Guuri si aad ugu dhigto meesha saxda ah. Tirtir ama Koobiyee waa damsan yihiin xubin la doortay. Waxay ku jirtaa moodel kale: marka hore u beddel. Fayl laga furay Dooro fayl wuxuu wax walba beddelay. Taasi waxay bilaabaysaa muuqaal cusub. Isticmaal Ku dar moodel… si aad faylal ugu darto midka aad haysid. Xiga Qari, kala saar oo daahfur xubnaha Midabka xubnaha sifo ahaan","lang":"so"},{"slug":"annotation-sizes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku sawir cabbirka buuxa, qoraalka u cabbir miisaanka","summary":"Dhismaha had iyo jeer waa la sawiraa cabbirka buuxa. Qoraalka, cabbirrada, calaamadaha, magacyada qolalka, goobaha shabakadda iyo calaamadaha waa la cabbiraa warqadda, milimitir sida la daabacay, waxayna ku hayaan cabbirkaas marka miisaanka naqshadda uu ka beddelo 1:100 ilaa 1:50.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["miisaanka qoraalka","annotative","cabbirka qoraalka","dherka qoraalka","dherka warqadda","cabbirka qoraalka cabbirka","cabbirka goobta shabakadda","cabbirka calaamadda","miisaanka naqshadda","1:50","1:100","heerka xafiiska","xarfaha","sawir 1:1","cabbirka buuxa","qoraalka xaashiga"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"sida-ay-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida ay u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"naqshad-leh-miisaan-u-gaar-ah","text":"Naqshad leh miisaan u gaar ah","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-xafiiskaaga","text":"Cabbirrada xafiiskaaga","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-xeerka","text":"Cabbirrada xeerka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"wax-kale-oo-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato","text":"Wax kale oo wanaagsan inaad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig sida uu dherkiisu yahay xarfaha naqshadahaaga warqadda, hal mar dhismaha. Moodelka marna ma miisaamo, qoraalkana marna ma cabbirto miisaan kasta: BimCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa cabbirka iyadoo laga bilaabayo dherka warqadda iyo miisaanka naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-ay-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida ay u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodelku waa cabbir buuxa. Darbi 10 m dherer ah wuxuu yahay 10 000 mm miisaan kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003Epaper height\u003C/strong\u003E: dherka xarfaha weyn ee warqadda la daabacay, milimitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaanka 1:100, qoraal 2.5 mm wuxuu yahay 250 mm moodelka; 1:50 wuxuu yahay 125 mm. Warqadda labaduba waa 2.5 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha qorshaha (kahrabaa, biyo-dhaca) waxay ku sawirmaan milimitir warqadeed oo raacaan isla xeerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur browser-ka mashruuca. Hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada qoraalka…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor dherka milimitir ah noocyada aad rabto inaad dejiso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraallada iyo calaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraalka cabbirka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha iyo magacyada heerka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagacyada qolalka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarfaha goobaha shabakadda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECinwaannada aragtida xaashiyaha\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraalka jadwalka\u003C/span\u003E. Sanduuqa madhan wuxuu hayaa cabbirka BimCraft ee u gaarka ah, oo lagu muujiyay midab cawl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E. Waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaas, xaashi kasta, set-ka naqshadaha, PDF-ka qorshaha, iyo muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goyntu waxay isticmaali doonaan cabbirrada laga bilaabo markaas. Masaafada u dhexaysa khadka cabbirka iyo qoraalkiisa, cabbirka goobta shabakadda iyo dherka safka jadwalka ayaa kor u kaca iyadoo qoraalka la raacayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshad-leh-miisaan-u-gaar-ah\"\u003ENaqshad leh miisaan u gaar ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sii miisaan naqshadda aragtideeda inta u dhexaysa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EMuuqaalada iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E). Markaas:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eshaashadda, magacyada qolalka, calaamadaha, qoraalka cabbirka iyo goobaha shabakadda waxay ku sawirmaan cabbirkooda daabacan marka loo eego moodelka, sidaas darteed waxa aad aragto waa waxa xaashigu tusi doono;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecalaamadaha qorshaha iyo calaamadahoodu waxay u cabbirmaan miisaankaas. Miisaanka oo laga beddelo 1:100 ilaa 1:50 wuxuu ka dhigaa nus cabbirkii hore moodelka, warqadduna waa isku mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad aan miisaan u gaar ah lahayn waxay hayaa qoraalkeeda shaashadda ee go&#039;an, calaamadaheeduna waxa loo cabbiraa 1:50 (1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; feet iyo inch), sidii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-xafiiskaaga\"\u003ECabbirrada xafiiskaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka add-on-ka Default Policies uu shidan yahay, dhig dherarka xafiiska Settings › Global › Default Policies › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada qoraalka warqadda\u003C/span\u003E. Dhismo cusub wuxuu qaadaa markaad gujiso Create. Dhismo aad horey u bilowday, sanduuqa wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal cabbirrada xafiiskayga\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/default-policies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/default-policies\"\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-xeerka\"\u003ECabbirrada xeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPack-ka xeerka ayaa siin kara dherarka qoraalka ee meesha ay u baahan tahay (add-on-ka Building regulations, heshiisyada sawirka). Calaamadee pack-ka Settings › Building regulations, kadibna sanduuqa guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal cabbirrada xeerka\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqyadu way buuxmaan, adna hubi oo kaydi. Cabbir uu pack-ku siiyo points ahaan waa cabbirka font-ka, waana loo beddelaa dherka xarfaha weyn, sidaas darteed hubi. Waxba ma dejmo ilaa aad kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsla dherka qoraalka milimitir ah xaashi 1:100 iyo xaashi 1:50, halka naqshadda laftiisa 1:50 ay laba jeer ka weyn tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirradu waxay la socdaan dhismaha: waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-kale-oo-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato\"\u003EWax kale oo wanaagsan inaad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirrada BimCraft ee u gaarka ah waa kuwii xaashiyadiisu had iyo jeer isticmaali jireen (qiyaastii 1.5 mm xarfaha weyn ee qoraalka cabbirka). Ma ahan heer naqshadeed; dhig kuwa xafiiskaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDherku waa inuu u dhexeeyaa 0.5 ilaa 50 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka sanduuqa cinwaanka iyo sharraxaadda furayaasha ma ku jiraan: waxay hayaan cabbirkooda gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhig sida uu dherkiisu yahay xarfaha naqshadahaaga warqadda, hal mar dhismaha. Moodelka marna ma miisaamo, qoraalkana marna ma cabbirto miisaan kasta: BimCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa cabbirka iyadoo laga bilaabayo dherka warqadda iyo miisaanka naqshadda. Sida ay u shaqeyso Moodelku waa cabbir buuxa. Darbi 10 m dherer ah wuxuu yahay 10 000 mm miisaan kasta. Qoraalku wuxuu leeyahay paper height: dherka xarfaha weyn ee warqadda la daabacay, milimitir. Miisaanka 1:100, qoraal 2.5 mm wuxuu yahay 250 mm moodelka; 1:50 wuxuu yahay 125 mm. Warqadda labaduba waa 2.5 mm. Calaamadaha qorshaha (kahrabaa, biyo-dhaca) waxay ku sawirmaan milimitir warqadeed oo raacaan isla xeerka. Tallaabooyin Fur browser-ka mashruuca. Hoos Xaashiyada guji Cabbirrada qoraalka…. Qor dherka milimitir ah noocyada aad rabto inaad dejiso: Qoraallada iyo calaamadaha, Qoraalka cabbirka, Calaamadaha iyo magacyada heerka, Magacyada qolalka, Xarfaha goobaha shabakadda, Cinwaannada aragtida xaashiyaha iyo Qoraalka jadwalka. Sanduuqa madhan wuxuu hayaa cabbirka BimCraft ee u gaarka ah, oo lagu muujiyay midab cawl. Guji Kaydi. Waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo. Markaas, xaashi kasta, set-ka naqshadaha, PDF-ka qorshaha, iyo muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goyntu waxay isticmaali doonaan cabbirrada laga bilaabo markaas. Masaafada u dhexaysa khadka cabbirka iyo qoraalkiisa, cabbirka goobta shabakadda iyo dherka safka jadwalka ayaa kor u kaca iyadoo qoraalka la raacayo. Naqshad leh miisaan u gaar ah Ku sii miisaan naqshadda aragtideeda inta u dhexaysa (Miisaan; eeg Muuqaalada iyo xaashiyada). Markaas: shaashadda, magacyada qolalka, calaamadaha, qoraalka cabbirka iyo goobaha shabakadda waxay ku sawirmaan cabbirkooda daabacan marka loo eego moodelka, sidaas darteed waxa aad aragto waa waxa xaashigu tusi doono; calaamadaha qorshaha iyo calaamadahoodu waxay u cabbirmaan miisaankaas. Miisaanka oo laga beddelo 1:100 ilaa 1:50 wuxuu ka dhigaa nus cabbirkii hore moodelka, warqadduna waa isku mid. Naqshad aan miisaan u gaar ah lahayn waxay hayaa qoraalkeeda shaashadda ee go'an, calaamadaheeduna waxa loo cabbiraa 1:50 (1/4\" = 1'-0\" feet iyo inch), sidii hore. Cabbirrada xafiiskaaga Marka add-on-ka Default Policies uu shidan yahay, dhig dherarka xafiiska Settings › Global › Default Policies › Cabbirrada qoraalka warqadda. Dhismo cusub wuxuu qaadaa markaad gujiso Create. Dhismo aad horey u bilowday, sanduuqa wuxuu leeyahay Isticmaal cabbirrada xafiiskayga. Eeg Default Policies. Cabbirrada xeerka Pack-ka xeerka ayaa siin kara dherarka qoraalka ee meesha ay u baahan tahay (add-on-ka Building regulations, heshiisyada sawirka). Calaamadee pack-ka Settings › Building regulations, kadibna sanduuqa guji Isticmaal cabbirrada xeerka: sanduuqyadu way buuxmaan, adna hubi oo kaydi. Cabbir uu pack-ku siiyo points ahaan waa cabbirka font-ka, waana loo beddelaa dherka xarfaha weyn, sidaas darteed hubi. Waxba ma dejmo ilaa aad kaydiso. Waxa aad arki lahayd Isla dherka qoraalka milimitir ah xaashi 1:100 iyo xaashi 1:50, halka naqshadda laftiisa 1:50 ay laba jeer ka weyn tahay. Cabbirradu waxay la socdaan dhismaha: waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC-kiisa. Wax kale oo wanaagsan inaad ogaato Cabbirrada BimCraft ee u gaarka ah waa kuwii xaashiyadiisu had iyo jeer isticmaali jireen (qiyaastii 1.5 mm xarfaha weyn ee qoraalka cabbirka). Ma ahan heer naqshadeed; dhig kuwa xafiiskaaga. Dherku waa inuu u dhexeeyaa 0.5 ilaa 50 mm. Qoraalka sanduuqa cinwaanka iyo sharraxaadda furayaasha ma ku jiraan: waxay hayaan cabbirkooda gaarka ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"point-clouds","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuji daruurta barta oo ag moodeelka","summary":"Fur scan laser (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS ama XYZ) muuqaalka 3D keligiis ama moodeel IFC la socda, midabee, gooy xaashi khafiif ah, ka qiyaas barooyinkiisa, oo u dhiib app-ka naqshadaha si uu u raad-raaco khadadka sida la dhisay.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["daruurta barta","scan laser","scan","lidar","las","laz","e57","ply","pcd","ptx","xyz","pts","sida la dhisay","sahan","isku-dhigid","goyn","qiyaas","raad","scan ilaa bim"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"meesha-ay-daruurtu-tagto","text":"Meesha ay daruurtu tagto","level":2},{"id":"raadi-khadadka-sida-la-dhisay","text":"Raadi khadadka sida la dhisay","level":2},{"id":"inta-barood","text":"Inta barood","level":2},{"id":"skaano-badan","text":"Skaano badan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg scan laser ee dhismo oo ku xiga moodeelkeeda: hubi in waxa la dhisay uu waafaqayo naqshadda, ka qiyaas masaafada u dhaxaysa barooyinka scan-ka, oo goo xaashi khafiif ah si aad ugu akhrido darbiyada, albaabada iyo tiirarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur daruurta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuran\u003C/span\u003E fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E, ama ku dhig bogga (eeg mawduuca qaababka daruurta barta si aad u aragto waxa mid kasta keenayo, iyo waxa laga dhoofiyo software-ka scanner-ka). Marka moodeel la furay, daruurtu waxay ku biirtaa moodeelka muuqaalka 3D; furista daruur weligeed ma xirto moodeelka ama isbeddelladiisa aan la kaydin. Moodeel la&#039;aan, daruurtu waa furmaa keligeed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJaraa bar daruurta ayaa soo baxa hoosta qalabka. Waxay sheegaysaa inta barood ee muuqata iyo inta faylku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabka ku salaysan\u003C/span\u003E: midabada faylka (marka scanner-ku kaydiyay), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXoogga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E (fasallada LiDAR sida dhulka, dhirta iyo dhismaha) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHal midab\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa barooyinka weyn ama yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hayso kaliya xaashi khafiif ah oo 1.2 m ka sarreeya barta ugu hoose, oo laga eego sare: darbiyada, furayaasha albaabada iyo tiirarka waxay u akhriyi doonaan sida qorshe dabaq. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E waxay gooyaan xaashiyo toosan oo ah muuqaalka dhinacyada iyo qaybaha. Xaashiga ku dhaqaaq \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAg\u003C/span\u003E hoose, oo beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhumucda\u003C/span\u003E (mitir). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDemi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa daruurta oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare. Taliyuhu wuxuu ku dhegaa barooyinka daruurta (calaamadu waxay leedahay &quot;daruurta barta&quot;), sidaas darteed waxaad ka qiyaasi kartaa darbi ilaa darbi xaashiga goosan, ama moodeel ilaa scan. Geesta ama khadka moodeelka ee u dhow ayaa weli mudan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E, bar daruur wuxuu siinayaa latitude iyo longitude ka nidaamka isku-xirka daruurta, marka faylku magacooda sheego.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa daruurta wakhti yar; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruurta barta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa ama muujiyaa jaraa-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-daruurtu-tagto\"\u003EMeesha ay daruurtu tagto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E jaraha ayaa sheegaya sida daruurtu ula jaanqaadayso moodeelka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E: lambarada daruurta waa lambarada moodeelka (scan la isku dhigay isku-xirka naqshadda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelku wuxuu leeyahay beddelka khariidadda (IfcMapConversion) daruurtuna waxay ku jirtaa isla nidaamka mapped-ka: daruurta waxaa lagu dhigaa isagoo mararka qaarkood la mari karo beddelkaas. Haddii labadaba magacyo kala duwan sheegaan, jaraha ayaa sheegaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E: marka midna daruurta u dhigi waayo meel u dhow moodeelka, dhexdeeda waxay saaraa dhexda moodeelka, barta ugu hoose ee dabaqa moodeelka. Dooro doorasho kale si aad u beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka faylku aanu sheegin cabbirkiisa, BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa mitir, wuxuuna bixiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E jaraha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-khadadka-sida-la-dhisay\"\u003ERaadi khadadka sida la dhisay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rajee CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E si aad daruurta ugu gudbiso app-ka naqshadaha tab cusub. Halkaas waxay ku furmaysaa hoosta sawirka, halkaas oo goyn qorshe iyo ku dhejinta (snap) shayga uu kuu ogolaanayo inaad darbiyada ku sawirto scan-ka dushiisa. Eeg mawduuca CadCraft ee daruurta barta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inta-barood\"\u003EInta barood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScan wuxuu ku hayn karaa boqolaal milyan oo bar. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa bar kasta hal mar, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa qayb isku mid ah oo ka mid ah si uu u sawiro: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E jaraha ayaa dejiya inta (1, 2, 5 ama 10 milyan). Barooyin badan xusuus badan iyo kaarka muuqaalka oo xoog badan ayaa u baahan. Tirinta fasal kasta oo LiDAR waa tiro dhammaan barooyinka faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylalka waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; wax lagama soo dirin. LAS 1.0–1.4 iyo LAZ waa la akhriyaa (LAZ ilaa 1 GB, oo lagu hayo xusuusta intii la akhrinayay); E57 ilaa 6 milyan oo bar iyo 512 MB hadda (skaanada waaweyn: dhoofi LAS ama LAZ); PLY, PCD iyo PTX oo buuxa; daruurta qoraalka ah waa \u003Ccode\u003Ex y z\u003C/code\u003E, oo leh tiirarka midabka (\u003Ccode\u003Er g b\u003C/code\u003E) iyo xoogga marka ay jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skaano-badan\"\u003ESkaano badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkaanada laga qaaday meelo kala duwan waa la dhigi karaa hal qaab, ICP ayaa lagu hagaajin karaa, waana la dhoofin karaa hal LAS ama E57: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003EIsku-dhig skaano badan hal mid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Eeg scan laser ee dhismo oo ku xiga moodeelkeeda: hubi in waxa la dhisay uu waafaqayo naqshadda, ka qiyaas masaafada u dhaxaysa barooyinka scan-ka, oo goo xaashi khafiif ah si aad ugu akhrido darbiyada, albaabada iyo tiirarka. Tallaabooyin Fur daruurta: Furan fayl .las, .laz, .e57, .ply, .pcd, .ptx, .pts ama .xyz, ama ku dhig bogga (eeg mawduuca qaababka daruurta barta si aad u aragto waxa mid kasta keenayo, iyo waxa laga dhoofiyo software-ka scanner-ka). Marka moodeel la furay, daruurtu waxay ku biirtaa moodeelka muuqaalka 3D; furista daruur weligeed ma xirto moodeelka ama isbeddelladiisa aan la kaydin. Moodeel la'aan, daruurtu waa furmaa keligeed. Jaraa bar daruurta ayaa soo baxa hoosta qalabka. Waxay sheegaysaa inta barood ee muuqata iyo inta faylku leeyahay. Dooro Midabka ku salaysan: midabada faylka (marka scanner-ku kaydiyay), Joog, Xoogga, Nooca (fasallada LiDAR sida dhulka, dhirta iyo dhismaha) ama Hal midab. Cabbirka wuxuu ka dhigaa barooyinka weyn ama yar. Riix Qorshe hoosta Goyn si aad u hayso kaliya xaashi khafiif ah oo 1.2 m ka sarreeya barta ugu hoose, oo laga eego sare: darbiyada, furayaasha albaabada iyo tiirarka waxay u akhriyi doonaan sida qorshe dabaq. Hore iyo Dhinac waxay gooyaan xaashiyo toosan oo ah muuqaalka dhinacyada iyo qaybaha. Xaashiga ku dhaqaaq Ag hoose, oo beddel Dhumucda (mitir). Demi wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa daruurta oo dhan. Riix Qiyaas qalabka sare. Taliyuhu wuxuu ku dhegaa barooyinka daruurta (calaamadu waxay leedahay \"daruurta barta\"), sidaas darteed waxaad ka qiyaasi kartaa darbi ilaa darbi xaashiga goosan, ama moodeel ilaa scan. Geesta ama khadka moodeelka ee u dhow ayaa weli mudan. Marka Qiyaas › Booska, bar daruur wuxuu siinayaa latitude iyo longitude ka nidaamka isku-xirka daruurta, marka faylku magacooda sheego. Qari wuxuu qariyaa daruurta wakhti yar; Ka saar wuu ka saaraa. Muuji › Daruurta barta wuxuu qariyaa ama muujiyaa jaraa-ka. Meesha ay daruurtu tagto Dhig jaraha ayaa sheegaya sida daruurtu ula jaanqaadayso moodeelka: Isku-xirka moodeelka: lambarada daruurta waa lambarada moodeelka (scan la isku dhigay isku-xirka naqshadda). Isku-xirka khariidadda: moodeelku wuxuu leeyahay beddelka khariidadda (IfcMapConversion) daruurtuna waxay ku jirtaa isla nidaamka mapped-ka: daruurta waxaa lagu dhigaa isagoo mararka qaarkood la mari karo beddelkaas. Haddii labadaba magacyo kala duwan sheegaan, jaraha ayaa sheegaya. Dhexda moodeelka: marka midna daruurta u dhigi waayo meel u dhow moodeelka, dhexdeeda waxay saaraa dhexda moodeelka, barta ugu hoose ee dabaqa moodeelka. Dooro doorasho kale si aad u beddesho. Marka faylku aanu sheegin cabbirkiisa, BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa mitir, wuxuuna bixiyaa Cutubyada jaraha. Raadi khadadka sida la dhisay Riix Ku rajee CadCraft si aad daruurta ugu gudbiso app-ka naqshadaha tab cusub. Halkaas waxay ku furmaysaa hoosta sawirka, halkaas oo goyn qorshe iyo ku dhejinta (snap) shayga uu kuu ogolaanayo inaad darbiyada ku sawirto scan-ka dushiisa. Eeg mawduuca CadCraft ee daruurta barta. Inta barood Scan wuxuu ku hayn karaa boqolaal milyan oo bar. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa bar kasta hal mar, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa qayb isku mid ah oo ka mid ah si uu u sawiro: Muuji jaraha ayaa dejiya inta (1, 2, 5 ama 10 milyan). Barooyin badan xusuus badan iyo kaarka muuqaalka oo xoog badan ayaa u baahan. Tirinta fasal kasta oo LiDAR waa tiro dhammaan barooyinka faylka. Faylalka waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; wax lagama soo dirin. LAS 1.0–1.4 iyo LAZ waa la akhriyaa (LAZ ilaa 1 GB, oo lagu hayo xusuusta intii la akhrinayay); E57 ilaa 6 milyan oo bar iyo 512 MB hadda (skaanada waaweyn: dhoofi LAS ama LAZ); PLY, PCD iyo PTX oo buuxa; daruurta qoraalka ah waa x y z, oo leh tiirarka midabka (r g b) iyo xoogga marka ay jiraan. Skaano badan Skaanada laga qaaday meelo kala duwan waa la dhigi karaa hal qaab, ICP ayaa lagu hagaajin karaa, waana la dhoofin karaa hal LAS ama E57: eeg Isku-dhig skaano badan hal mid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"electrical-plan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qorshaha korontada","summary":"Ku dhig fiilooyinka, suitshiyada, nalalka, sensorrada, sanduuqyada isku xidhka iyo guddiyada qorshaha isla calaamadaha CadCraft's Electrical add-on, ku xidh suitshiyada nalalka ay shidaan, oo liiska qalabka iyo wareegyada ku jira jadwallada.","section":"tasks","order":27,"keywords":["korontada","qorshaha korontada","fiilo","receptacle","duplex","suitshi","laba-jihood","dimmer","nal","nalka saqafka","nalka dhulka ku dhex jira","downlight","sensor dhaqdhaqaaq","sanduuqa isku xidhka","guddi","guddiga qaybinta","wareeg","culays","watts","amps","cagta suitshiga","jadwalka qalabka","jadwalka guddiga"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-dhig","text":"Qalabka dhig","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidh-suitshiyada-nalalka","text":"Ku xidh suitshiyada nalalka","level":2},{"id":"qolka-uu-qalabku-ku-jiro","text":"Qolka uu qalabku ku jiro","level":2},{"id":"caawiye-ha-dhigo","text":"Caawiye ha dhigo","level":2},{"id":"beddel-oo-liiska","text":"Beddel oo liiska","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha korontada ee guriga ku samee moodeelka: fiilooyinka, suitshiyada iyo guddiyada darbiyada, nalalka iyo sensorrada saqafka. Qalab kasta waa walax korontada oo dhab ah oo ku jirta faylka IFC, leh calaamadiisa, wareegiisa iyo culayskiisa, suitshiyaduna waxay xasustaan nalalka ay shidaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-dhig\"\u003EQalabka dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeer kor, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKorontada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qalabka: fiilooyinka (awood, xog, telefoon, dhegaysi-muuqaal), suitshiyada iyo sensorrada (heerkulka iyo waqtiyaha sidoo kale), nalalka, dareemayaasha iyo digniinta, sanduuqa isku xidhka, guddi ama guddi hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad ogtahay (magac kasta: 1, 2, A-3). Ka tag \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka rakibidda\u003C/strong\u003E banaan si aad u hesho dhererka caadiga ah ee qalabkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix qorshaha. Fiilooyinka, suitshiyada iyo guddiyada waxay u dhacaan wajiga darbiga ugu dhow, oo u jeeda qolka; nalalka, sensorrada iyo sanduuqyada isku xidhka waxay u dhacaan saqafka halka aad riixday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabku waxa la calaamadeeyaa markii la dhigo: \u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E fiilooyinka, \u003Cstrong\u003ES\u003C/strong\u003E suitshiyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EL\u003C/strong\u003E nalalka, \u003Cstrong\u003EM\u003C/strong\u003E sensorrada dhaqdhaqaaqa, \u003Cstrong\u003EJ\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqyada isku xidhka, \u003Cstrong\u003EP\u003C/strong\u003E guddiyada. Qalabka darbiga ku jira wuxuu la socdaa darbiga marka aad darbiga dhaqaajiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa doonaysaa inaad sawir ku baadho? Fur \u003Cstrong\u003ELowska calaamadaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E si aad qalab ugu magacdarto, jeclaato kuwa aad isticmaasho oo hal riix ku dhig: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003ELowska calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidh-suitshiyada-nalalka\"\u003EKu xidh suitshiyada nalalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro suitshi (ama sensor dhaqdhaqaaq) oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh nalalka\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix nal kasta oo uu shido. Riix mar kale nalka xidhan si aad uga furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama riix \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaatay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa khad jajaban oo gobolka ah oo ka bilaabma suitshiga ilaa nal kasta oo uu shido. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E nalka waxay muujinaysaa suitshiyada shida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qolka-uu-qalabku-ku-jiro\"\u003EQolka uu qalabku ku jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab kasta wuxuu og yahay qolka uu ku jiro. Qalab darbiga ku jira wuxuu ku jiraa qolka uu u jeedo; qalab saqafka ku jira wuxuu ku jiraa qolka uu ka hoos yaal. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka\u003C/strong\u003E, jadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka korontada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay tiir \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka\u003C/strong\u003E (lambar iyo magac, sida 101 Musqulka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la cusboonaysiiyaa: haddii aad magaca qolka ama lambarka beddesho, qalabka dhaqaajiso, ama darbiga dhaqaajiso, qolku wuu raacaa isla tallaabada. Qalab ku yaal dusha dibadda dhismaha, ama meel aan qol ahayn, wuxuu sheegaa inuusan qol ku jirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQolka waxa sidoo kale lagu qoraa faylka gudaha sanduuqa sifooyinka qalabka ee \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Location\u003C/code\u003E (Room, RoomNumber, RoomName), si \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMidab sifo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo jadwalka calaamadaha ay u isticmaali karaan, iyo barnaamij kale sidoo kale. Calaamadaha qorshaha iyo elementiyada la xidhay calaamad waxay helaan isla sanduuqa; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/symbol-palette\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/symbol-palette\"\u003ELowska calaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawiye-ha-dhigo\"\u003ECaawiye ha dhigo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad ku xidhay caawiye (\u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta › Caawiyayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E, oo tafatirka oggol), waxaad ku weydiin kartaa qalabka erayo: &quot;dhig fiilo laba-geesood ah 2 m kasta darbiyada qolka fadhiga, 300 mm kor, wareeg 3 dhexdiisa&quot;, ama &quot;ku dar nal saqafka ah oo suitshigiisa albaabka hortiisa&quot;. Caawiyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa shan qalab: \u003Ccode\u003Edevices_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edevice_change\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elights_set\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edevices_delete\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Edevices_list\u003C/code\u003E. Waxay sameeyaan isla qalabka uu qalabka korontada sameeyo, darbiyada isku mid ah, isla calaamadaha, wareegyada, culaysyada iyo dhererrada isku mid ah, wicitaan kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan u dhigmin nooca qalabka korontada uu lahaa ma dhigi karo: nooc aan la aqoon waa la diidaa, caawiyaha ayaana liiska la siiyaa. Fiilo ama suitshi waa inuu ku jiraa 600 mm dusha darbiga, sida riix kasta, haddii kale wicitaanka waa la diidaa oo wax lama dhigo. Dhererka caadiga ah waa millimitir: 300 fiiloyinka, 1100 suitshiyada; qalab saqafka ku jira wuxuu ka dhex hoos yaalaa saqafka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-oo-liiska\"\u003EBeddel oo liiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qalab si aad u beddesho calaamaddiisa, wareegiisa, culaysiisa (watts) iyo dhererka rakibidda. Dooro dhowr si aad hal wareeg ugu dhigto hal mar. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u tirtirto mid; nal la tirtiray waa laga qaadaa suitshiyadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/span\u003E dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka korontada\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah qalab kasta oo leh heerkiisa, wareegiisa, culaysiisa, dhererkiisa iyo nalalka ay suitshi kasta shido, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWareegyada\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah qalabka wareeg kasta, culayska guud iyo amperka. Labaduba waxay ku jiraan sidoo kale xaashida jadwalka ee naqshadda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EMuuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererrada rakibidda iyo culayska waa qiyaasaha qorshaynta (fiilo 16&quot; kor iyo 200 W, suitshi 48&quot;, nal saqaf 60 W), ma aha naqshad: korontada ama injineerka ayaa cabbiraya wareegyada oo hubinaya xeerka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha waa kuwa CadCraft&#039;s Electrical add-on ku sawiro qorshayaasha rakibidda, sidaas darteed qorshaha laga yaba labada barnaamij wuu isku akhriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Qorshaha korontada ee guriga ku samee moodeelka: fiilooyinka, suitshiyada iyo guddiyada darbiyada, nalalka iyo sensorrada saqafka. Qalab kasta waa walax korontada oo dhab ah oo ku jirta faylka IFC, leh calaamadiisa, wareegiisa iyo culayskiisa, suitshiyaduna waxay xasustaan nalalka ay shidaan. Qalabka dhig Heer kor, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Korontada. Dooro qalabka: fiilooyinka (awood, xog, telefoon, dhegaysi-muuqaal), suitshiyada iyo sensorrada (heerkulka iyo waqtiyaha sidoo kale), nalalka, dareemayaasha iyo digniinta, sanduuqa isku xidhka, guddi ama guddi hoose. Ku qor Wareeg haddii aad ogtahay (magac kasta: 1, 2, A-3). Ka tag Dhererka rakibidda banaan si aad u hesho dhererka caadiga ah ee qalabkaas. Riix qorshaha. Fiilooyinka, suitshiyada iyo guddiyada waxay u dhacaan wajiga darbiga ugu dhow, oo u jeeda qolka; nalalka, sensorrada iyo sanduuqyada isku xidhka waxay u dhacaan saqafka halka aad riixday. Qalabku waxa la calaamadeeyaa markii la dhigo: R fiilooyinka, S suitshiyada, L nalalka, M sensorrada dhaqdhaqaaqa, J sanduuqyada isku xidhka, P guddiyada. Qalabka darbiga ku jira wuxuu la socdaa darbiga marka aad darbiga dhaqaajiso. Ma doonaysaa inaad sawir ku baadho? Fur Lowska calaamadaha oo ka Dhismaha si aad qalab ugu magacdarto, jeclaato kuwa aad isticmaasho oo hal riix ku dhig: eeg Lowska calaamadaha. Ku xidh suitshiyada nalalka Dooro suitshi (ama sensor dhaqdhaqaaq) oo riix Ku xidh nalalka ee Sifooyinka. Riix nal kasta oo uu shido. Riix mar kale nalka xidhan si aad uga furto. Riix Enter ama riix Dhammaatay. Qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa khad jajaban oo gobolka ah oo ka bilaabma suitshiga ilaa nal kasta oo uu shido. Sifooyinka nalka waxay muujinaysaa suitshiyada shida. Qolka uu qalabku ku jiro Qalab kasta wuxuu og yahay qolka uu ku jiro. Qalab darbiga ku jira wuxuu ku jiraa qolka uu u jeedo; qalab saqafka ku jira wuxuu ku jiraa qolka uu ka hoos yaal. Sifooyinka waxay muujinaysaa Qolka, jadwalka Qalabka korontada wuxuu leeyahay tiir Qolka (lambar iyo magac, sida 101 Musqulka). Waa la cusboonaysiiyaa: haddii aad magaca qolka ama lambarka beddesho, qalabka dhaqaajiso, ama darbiga dhaqaajiso, qolku wuu raacaa isla tallaabada. Qalab ku yaal dusha dibadda dhismaha, ama meel aan qol ahayn, wuxuu sheegaa inuusan qol ku jirin. Qolka waxa sidoo kale lagu qoraa faylka gudaha sanduuqa sifooyinka qalabka ee CadCraft_Location (Room, RoomNumber, RoomName), si Raadi, Midab sifo iyo jadwalka calaamadaha ay u isticmaali karaan, iyo barnaamij kale sidoo kale. Calaamadaha qorshaha iyo elementiyada la xidhay calaamad waxay helaan isla sanduuqa; eeg Lowska calaamadaha. Caawiye ha dhigo Haddii aad ku xidhay caawiye (Dejinta › Caawiyayaasha, oo tafatirka oggol), waxaad ku weydiin kartaa qalabka erayo: \"dhig fiilo laba-geesood ah 2 m kasta darbiyada qolka fadhiga, 300 mm kor, wareeg 3 dhexdiisa\", ama \"ku dar nal saqafka ah oo suitshigiisa albaabka hortiisa\". Caawiyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa shan qalab: devices_add, device_change, lights_set, devices_delete iyo devices_list. Waxay sameeyaan isla qalabka uu qalabka korontada sameeyo, darbiyada isku mid ah, isla calaamadaha, wareegyada, culaysyada iyo dhererrada isku mid ah, wicitaan kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Qalab aan u dhigmin nooca qalabka korontada uu lahaa ma dhigi karo: nooc aan la aqoon waa la diidaa, caawiyaha ayaana liiska la siiyaa. Fiilo ama suitshi waa inuu ku jiraa 600 mm dusha darbiga, sida riix kasta, haddii kale wicitaanka waa la diidaa oo wax lama dhigo. Dhererka caadiga ah waa millimitir: 300 fiiloyinka, 1100 suitshiyada; qalab saqafka ku jira wuxuu ka dhex hoos yaalaa saqafka. Beddel oo liiska Dooro qalab si aad u beddesho calaamaddiisa, wareegiisa, culaysiisa (watts) iyo dhererka rakibidda. Dooro dhowr si aad hal wareeg ugu dhigto hal mar. Riix Delete si aad u tirtirto mid; nal la tirtiray waa laga qaadaa suitshiyadiisa. In Jadwallada dooro Qalabka korontada oo ah qalab kasta oo leh heerkiisa, wareegiisa, culaysiisa, dhererkiisa iyo nalalka ay suitshi kasta shido, ama Wareegyada oo ah qalabka wareeg kasta, culayska guud iyo amperka. Labaduba waxay ku jiraan sidoo kale xaashida jadwalka ee naqshadda: eeg Muuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo xaashiyada. Dhererrada rakibidda iyo culayska waa qiyaasaha qorshaynta (fiilo 16\" kor iyo 200 W, suitshi 48\", nal saqaf 60 W), ma aha naqshad: korontada ama injineerka ayaa cabbiraya wareegyada oo hubinaya xeerka. Calaamadaha waa kuwa CadCraft's Electrical add-on ku sawiro qorshayaasha rakibidda, sidaas darteed qorshaha laga yaba labada barnaamij wuu isku akhriyaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"register-scans","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isku-dhig skaano badan hal mid","summary":"Ku dhig skaanada laga qaaday meelo kala duwan hal qaab, iyada oo la dooranayo labo bar oo la isku dhigay ama beegsi la qoro, ICP ku hagaaji, mashruuc ahaan kaydi, oo dhoofi daruurta la isku dhigay sida LAS ama E57.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["isku-dhig","isku-dhigid","skaano","daruurta barta","icp","iterative closest point","beegsiyo","labo bar","rigid transform","isku-saf","isku-geddi","e57","las","scan ilaa bim"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhig-skaanada","text":"Ku dhig skaanada","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-icp","text":"Hagaaji ICP","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-iyo-dhoofi","text":"Kaydi iyo dhoofi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkaano dhowr ah oo meel isku mid ah (mid kastaa booska scanner-kiisa) waxay ka bilaabmaan isku-xirkooda. Isku-dhig: siiso mid kasta mid ka mid ah booska si dhammaantood u fadhiistaan hal qaab, kadibna kaydi sida mashruuc oo qor daruurta la isku dhigay sida LAS ama E57 mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhig-skaanada\"\u003EKu dhig skaanada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur wada-hadalka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhig skaanadka…\u003C/span\u003E bogga bilowga, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhig skaanadka…\u003C/span\u003E markii moodeel la furay). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar skaanadka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaataa faylasha LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS ama XYZ, ama ku dhig wada-hadalka. Skaanada leh cabbirro kala duwan waa la diidaa oo waxaa lagu sheegaa qoraal: mid hore u beddel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkaanka la guurinayo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig xagga\u003C/span\u003E. Sawirku wuxuu muujiyaa skaan kasta meesha ay hadda ku taal, midab kasta oo gaar ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E; jiid si aad u guurto, mataanaha ku dhufo si aad u weynaysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabo bar.\u003C/strong\u003E Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro labo\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna bar ku taal skaanka la guurinayo, kadibna isla meeshaas oo ku taal skaan kale (geesta, beegsiga, saldhigga tiirka). Samee ugu yaraan saddex jeer, barooyin aan hal khad ku jirin oo kala fogaada. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig labooyinka\u003C/span\u003E: skaanka waa lagu dhigaa habka least-squares, \u003Cstrong\u003EHadhay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa inta labo kasta weli ay ka dhiman tahay. Labo leh tiro weyn waa dooro xun: ka saar iyada xaaqa calaamadda, kadibna mar kale ku dhig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeegsiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii isku-xidhka saxda ah ee bar la yaqaan (beegsiyo la sahamiyay), riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro, kadibna ku qor beegsiga\u003C/span\u003E, taabo barta skaanka, kadibna ku qor X, Y iyo Z beegsiga safka. Labo iyo beegsiyo la qoray waa la isku dari karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-icp\"\u003EHagaaji ICP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabo ayaa siiya dhigid qiyaas ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu skaanka guurinayaa ilaa dusha uu ku dhego skaanka kale: marka hore \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta ilaa barta\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta ilaa dusha\u003C/strong\u003E. Miiska wuxuu liisanayaa tallaabo kasta oo qalad iyo tirada barooyinka la isku waafajiyay; khadka kor ka sare wuxuu sawiraa qaladka oo hoos u dhacaya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammeeyaa orodka tallaabada socota wuxuuna hayaa waxa uu gaaray. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa orodka oo dhan (ama dhigidda ugu dambaysay); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu skaanka ku celinayaa kuraasta faylkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi ay degdeg ugu noqoto laptop-ka, ICP wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa qayb yaraysan oo barooyinka ah (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood la isticmaalay\u003C/span\u003E, 5,000 ilaa 60,000) wuxuuna iska dhegayaa isbarbar dhigyada ka fog \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada ugu weyn ee isbarbar dhigga\u003C/span\u003E (caadi ahaan 5% cabbirka skaanka, oo yaraanaya marka uu degayo). Wuxuu u baahan yahay dhigid qiyaas ah marka hore: skaano aan ku kala dhow-dhow ka muuqan waxay sheegaan in aan la isbarbar dhigi karin. Dusha siman ama toosan keliya ma hagaajin karto booska iyada, sidaas darteed labo ku dar xaaladdaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-iyo-dhoofi\"\u003EKaydi iyo dhoofi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccscans.json\u003C/code\u003E: magac kasta oo skaan, cabbirkiisa iyo astaamaha 64 KB-ka ugu horreeya, oo leh isbeddelkiisa. Ma hayo barooyin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur mashruuc…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu helaa faylasha skaanka tixraacyadooda (faylashaasi waa in marka hore lagu daraa) wuxuuna dib u celinayaa isbeddel kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoof LAS\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoof E57\u003C/span\u003E waxay qoraan hal fayl oo leh skaan kasta meeshiisa la isku dhigay. Barooyinka asalka ah looma qoro mar kale; isbeddelka waxa lagu dabaqaa marka la dhoofinayo. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa akhri dhammaan barooyinka faylalka\u003C/span\u003E la shido, fayl kasta mar kale ayaa la akhriyaa bar kasta (ilaa 20 milyan skaan kasta); marka la damiyo, kaliya barooyinka muuqda ee muuqaalka ayaa la qoraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji daruurta la isku dhigay\u003C/span\u003E (BimCraft) wuxuu qoraa LAS-ka wuxuuna ku furaa muuqaalka 3D ee moodeelka dhinacdiisa, sida daruur kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba lama soo dirin. Isku-dhigidda waxay ka shaqeysaa cabbirrada faylalka laftooda, waxayna ilaalisaa millimitirada; LAS waxa lagu qoraa miisaan ku habboon (ilaa 0.1 mm), E57 waxa lagu qoraa doubles. Nidaamka isku-xirka wuxuu u gudbaa LAS kaliya marka skaan kasta uu isla koodka EPSG magaca ku sheego. Qoraaga E57 waa kan aanu leenahay; waa la hubiyaa iyadoo faylashiisa lagu akhrinayo akhriskan iyo libE57Format.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Skaano dhowr ah oo meel isku mid ah (mid kastaa booska scanner-kiisa) waxay ka bilaabmaan isku-xirkooda. Isku-dhig: siiso mid kasta mid ka mid ah booska si dhammaantood u fadhiistaan hal qaab, kadibna kaydi sida mashruuc oo qor daruurta la isku dhigay sida LAS ama E57 mid. Ku dhig skaanada Fur wada-hadalka (Isku-dhig skaanadka… bogga bilowga, ama Muuji › Isku-dhig skaanadka… markii moodeel la furay). Ku dar skaanadka… wuxuu qaataa faylasha LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX, PTS ama XYZ, ama ku dhig wada-hadalka. Skaanada leh cabbirro kala duwan waa la diidaa oo waxaa lagu sheegaa qoraal: mid hore u beddel. Dooro Skaanka la guurinayo iyo Ku dhig xagga. Sawirku wuxuu muujiyaa skaan kasta meesha ay hadda ku taal, midab kasta oo gaar ah: Qorshe, Hore ama Dhinac; jiid si aad u guurto, mataanaha ku dhufo si aad u weynaysid. Labo bar. Riix Dooro labo, kadibna bar ku taal skaanka la guurinayo, kadibna isla meeshaas oo ku taal skaan kale (geesta, beegsiga, saldhigga tiirka). Samee ugu yaraan saddex jeer, barooyin aan hal khad ku jirin oo kala fogaada. Riix Ku dhig labooyinka: skaanka waa lagu dhigaa habka least-squares, Hadhay wuxuu muujiyaa inta labo kasta weli ay ka dhiman tahay. Labo leh tiro weyn waa dooro xun: ka saar iyada xaaqa calaamadda, kadibna mar kale ku dhig. Beegsiyo. Haddii isku-xidhka saxda ah ee bar la yaqaan (beegsiyo la sahamiyay), riix Dooro, kadibna ku qor beegsiga, taabo barta skaanka, kadibna ku qor X, Y iyo Z beegsiga safka. Labo iyo beegsiyo la qoray waa la isku dari karaa. Hagaaji ICP Labo ayaa siiya dhigid qiyaas ah. Hagaaji wuxuu skaanka guurinayaa ilaa dusha uu ku dhego skaanka kale: marka hore barta ilaa barta, kadibna barta ilaa dusha. Miiska wuxuu liisanayaa tallaabo kasta oo qalad iyo tirada barooyinka la isku waafajiyay; khadka kor ka sare wuxuu sawiraa qaladka oo hoos u dhacaya. Jooji wuxuu dhammeeyaa orodka tallaabada socota wuxuuna hayaa waxa uu gaaray. Ka noqo wuxuu qaadaa orodka oo dhan (ama dhigidda ugu dambaysay); Dib u deji wuxuu skaanka ku celinayaa kuraasta faylkiisa. Si ay degdeg ugu noqoto laptop-ka, ICP wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa qayb yaraysan oo barooyinka ah (Barood la isticmaalay, 5,000 ilaa 60,000) wuxuuna iska dhegayaa isbarbar dhigyada ka fog Masaafada ugu weyn ee isbarbar dhigga (caadi ahaan 5% cabbirka skaanka, oo yaraanaya marka uu degayo). Wuxuu u baahan yahay dhigid qiyaas ah marka hore: skaano aan ku kala dhow-dhow ka muuqan waxay sheegaan in aan la isbarbar dhigi karin. Dusha siman ama toosan keliya ma hagaajin karto booska iyada, sidaas darteed labo ku dar xaaladdaas. Kaydi iyo dhoofi Kaydi mashruuca wuxuu qoraa fayl yar oo .ccscans.json: magac kasta oo skaan, cabbirkiisa iyo astaamaha 64 KB-ka ugu horreeya, oo leh isbeddelkiisa. Ma hayo barooyin. Fur mashruuc… wuxuu helaa faylasha skaanka tixraacyadooda (faylashaasi waa in marka hore lagu daraa) wuxuuna dib u celinayaa isbeddel kasta. U dhoof LAS iyo U dhoof E57 waxay qoraan hal fayl oo leh skaan kasta meeshiisa la isku dhigay. Barooyinka asalka ah looma qoro mar kale; isbeddelka waxa lagu dabaqaa marka la dhoofinayo. Marka Ka akhri dhammaan barooyinka faylalka la shido, fayl kasta mar kale ayaa la akhriyaa bar kasta (ilaa 20 milyan skaan kasta); marka la damiyo, kaliya barooyinka muuqda ee muuqaalka ayaa la qoraa. Muuji daruurta la isku dhigay (BimCraft) wuxuu qoraa LAS-ka wuxuuna ku furaa muuqaalka 3D ee moodeelka dhinacdiisa, sida daruur kasta. Waxba lama soo dirin. Isku-dhigidda waxay ka shaqeysaa cabbirrada faylalka laftooda, waxayna ilaalisaa millimitirada; LAS waxa lagu qoraa miisaan ku habboon (ilaa 0.1 mm), E57 waxa lagu qoraa doubles. Nidaamka isku-xirka wuxuu u gudbaa LAS kaliya marka skaan kasta uu isla koodka EPSG magaca ku sheego. Qoraaga E57 waa kan aanu leenahay; waa la hubiyaa iyadoo faylashiisa lagu akhrinayo akhriskan iyo libE57Format.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"map-layers","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Khariidad dhulka hoosteeda ku taal moodelka","summary":"Ku dheji khariidadda waddada ama sawirka hawada dhulka hoostiisa moodel IFC oo leh meel khariidad, oo ka timaada tiles khariidad, adeegyada khariidadda ama sawir leh faylkiisa adduunka.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["khariidad","lakabyada khariidadda","aasaaska khariidadda","hawada","dayax-gacmeed","goob","dhul","tiles","xyz","wms","wmts","adeega khariidadda","faylka adduunka","georeference","ifcmapconversion","projected crs","epsg","macnaha goobta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa arag moodelka meeshiisa: khariidadda waddooyinka goobta ama sawirka hawada ee dhulka hoostiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC oo xambaarta meeshiisa khariidadda (beddel khariidad, IfcMapConversion, oo leh nidaam isku-dhafka mashruuc ah). Soo dhoofiyayaasha ayaa qoraa marka isku-dhafka mashruuca (barta sahanka, isku-dhafka la wadaago) la dejiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada khariidadda…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka moodelka, tusaale ahaan EPSG:28356. Moodel aan lahayn beddel khariidad ma lahaan karo lakabyada khariidadda: wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada khariidadda ee internetka ka yimid\u003C/span\u003E. Ilaa markaas waxba lagama codsado server kasta; marka uu furan yahay, server-yada aad ku darto waxay arkaan aagga ku wareegsan moodelka iyo cinwaanka internetkaaga, moodelkaaga ma arkaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar lakab\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dooran karaa tiles (cinwaan leh \u003Ccode\u003E{z}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{x}\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{y}\u003C/code\u003E), adeeg WMS, WMTS ama ArcGIS (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel lakabyada\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro mid), ama sawir leh faylkiisa adduunka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir wada-hadalka. Khariiddu waxay ku jirtaa dhulka, sare hoosta dhibcaha ugu hooseeya moodelka, oo dusha moodelka ka weyn, iyo sidoo kale wareega ku wareegsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhariiddu waa shaashadda kaliya; kuma kaydsanto faylka IFC. Liiska lakabyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan. Isticmaal kaliya adeegyada khariidadda oo shuruudahoodu oggolaanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka arag moodelka meeshiisa: khariidadda waddooyinka goobta ama sawirka hawada ee dhulka hoostiisa. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC oo xambaarta meeshiisa khariidadda (beddel khariidad, IfcMapConversion, oo leh nidaam isku-dhafka mashruuc ah). Soo dhoofiyayaasha ayaa qoraa marka isku-dhafka mashruuca (barta sahanka, isku-dhafka la wadaago) la dejiyo. Dooro Muuji › Lakabyada khariidadda…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka moodelka, tusaale ahaan EPSG:28356. Moodel aan lahayn beddel khariidad ma lahaan karo lakabyada khariidadda: wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa. Shid Lakabyada khariidadda ee internetka ka yimid. Ilaa markaas waxba lagama codsado server kasta; marka uu furan yahay, server-yada aad ku darto waxay arkaan aagga ku wareegsan moodelka iyo cinwaanka internetkaaga, moodelkaaga ma arkaan. Ku dar lakab wuxuu dooran karaa tiles (cinwaan leh {z}, {x} iyo {y}), adeeg WMS, WMTS ama ArcGIS (Hel lakabyada, kadibna dooro mid), ama sawir leh faylkiisa adduunka. Xir wada-hadalka. Khariiddu waxay ku jirtaa dhulka, sare hoosta dhibcaha ugu hooseeya moodelka, oo dusha moodelka ka weyn, iyo sidoo kale wareega ku wareegsan. Khariiddu waa shaashadda kaliya; kuma kaydsanto faylka IFC. Liiska lakabyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan. Isticmaal kaliya adeegyada khariidadda oo shuruudahoodu oggolaanayo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"symbol-palette","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Palettada calaamadaha","summary":"Hel calaamadaha korontada iyo biyo-dhigista magacyada ama sawirrada, xulo kuwa aad isticmaasho, oo ku dhig khariitada hal riix.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["symbol palette","symbols toolbar button","wall follows","symbols","electrical symbols","plumbing symbols","plumbing plan","water closet","toilet","lavatory","sink","bathtub","shower","floor drain","cleanout","hose bib","water heater","valve","gate valve","cold water","hot water","waste","vent","line style","favourites","search","palette","calaamad","korontada","biyo-dhigista","musha","biyo qabow","biyo kulul","qashin","hawo-bixin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"fur-oo-ku-dhig-calaamad","text":"Fur oo ku dhig calaamad","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-set-ka-biyo-dhigista","text":"Waxa ku jira set-ka biyo-dhigista","level":2},{"id":"kuwa-la-doortay-iyo-furayaasha","text":"Kuwa la doortay iyo furayaasha","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidh-qalab-la-dhigay-iyo-calaamad","text":"Xidhiidh qalab la dhigay iyo calaamad","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur hal panel oo liiska calaamadaha korontada iyo calaamadaha khariitada biyo-dhigista ka muujinaya sawirradooda iyo magacyadooda, hel kan aad rabto, oo ku dhig khariitada. Waxba halkan uma baahna internet: calaamadaha waxay ku jiraan barnaamijka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-oo-ku-dhig-calaamad\"\u003EFur oo ku dhig calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESymbol palette\u003C/span\u003E (amarka qoran: SYMBOLS). Isla badhanka ayaa ku jira menu-ga Tools ee Draw bar-ka, iyo sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbols\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda Library ee qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro set: \u003Cstrong\u003EElectrical\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EPlumbing\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EAll sets\u003C/strong\u003E. Ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad liiska u yareyso. Waxaad ku raadin kartaa magac ama kooban (WC, CW, HB).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix calaamad. Khariitadu way diyaar u tahay inay ku dhigto.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad \u003Cstrong\u003Ekorontada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay bilaabaa qalabka Electrical oo qalabkaas la doortay, sidaas darteed wax kasta oo ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/electrical-plan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/electrical-plan\"\u003EThe electrical plan\u003C/a\u003E way khusaysaa: riix khariitada, hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad \u003Cstrong\u003Ebiyo-dhigista\u003C/strong\u003E waxay bilaabaa qalabka calaamadda khariitada. Riix khariitada. Qalab ku taal darbi (musqul, lavatory, bathtub, sink, hose bib) wuxuu u dhowaadaa darbiga ugu dhow, dhabarkiisa darbiga ayuu ku jiraa; qulqulka, valve-yada, biyo-kululeeyaha iyo nooca khadadka meesha aad riixdo ayay tagaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad calaamadda 90 darajo u leexiso (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u leexisaa jihada kale), ama ku qor xagal \u003Cstrong\u003ERotation\u003C/strong\u003E bar-ka ikhtiyaarka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab ama hose bib ku dhacay wejiga darbi wuxuu xasuustaa darbigaas: marka darbigu dhaqaaqo, calaamaddu way raacaysaa (isla wejiga, isla masaafada darbiga dhexdiisa) isla tallaabada tarjumaadda. Haddii aad darbiga tirtirto, calaamaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa meeshii ay ahayd, Problems wuxuu sheegaa &quot;lost its wall&quot;; u guuri ama tirtir. Calaamadaha laga dhigay darbiyada ka fog ma ku xirna wax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad kasta oo aad dhigto waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. Calaamad la dhigay waa faallo khariiteed ku jirta faylka IFC oo leh tag-geeda (WC1, WC2, ...). Dooro si aad u beddesho tag-geeda ama leexashadeeda \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-set-ka-biyo-dhigista\"\u003EWaxa ku jira set-ka biyo-dhigista\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada (water closet, urinal, lavatory, bathtub, shower, kitchen sink, single sink), qulqul dhulka ah, cleanouts dhulka iyo darbiga, hose bib, hydrant darbiga, biyo-kululeeye, valve-yada (gate, globe, ball, check, butterfly, pressure reducing) iyo nooca khadadka oo leh kooban-kooban: biyo qabow (CW), biyo kulul (HW), soo-celinta biyo kulul (HWR), qashin (W), hawo-bixin (V), qulqulka duufaanka (SD) iyo gaas (G). Sawirrada waxay la socdaan khariitada, sidaas darteed ballaaruntooda way ku sii jirtaa warqadda la daabacayo. Nooca khadka waa gaabis gaaban oo lagu muujiyo nooca khariitada; tuubooyinka dhabta ah ku sawir qalabka tuubooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa heshiisyo caadi ah oo khariiteed oo biyo-dhigista, oo lagu sawiray iyaga; lama shahaadeeyo ISO 4067-1 ama ASME Y32.4. Waxaa loo barbar dhigay halbeegyada sawirka dadweynaha iyo buugaagta tababarka (liiska waxaa ku jira sheeko-ilaha set-ka, kaas oo sheegaya meelaha aan ku dhigno iyo meelaha ka duwan), ma aha wax laga soo koobay alaab gaar ah, waana bilaash in la isticmaalo (Apache-2.0). Set-yada sawirka way kala duwan yihiin, sidaas darteed hubi dhaxalka mashruucaaga. Waa calaamado khariiteed, ma aha naqshadda biyo-dhigista: ma cabbiraan tuubooyinka ama ma hubiyaan xeerarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuwa-la-doortay-iyo-furayaasha\"\u003EKuwa la doortay iyo furayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix xiddiga calaamad kasta (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isaga) si aad u ilaaliso sidii kuwa la doortay. Kuwa la doortay ayaa hore u iman doona oo waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. \u003Cstrong\u003EOnly favourites\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa kuwaas oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqa raadinta ayaa kuu geeyaa calaamadaha; furayaasha falka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqaya inta u dhexeysa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu doortaa kan xooga saaran; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu xidhaa palettada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETelefoon ku jira palettada waa xaashi hoosta shaashadda ah; markaad calaamad doorato wuu ka leexdaa si aad khariitada u aragto. Dib u fur menu-ga Build ama badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EPalette\u003C/strong\u003E bar-ka ikhtiyaarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii faylku isticmaalo set calaamadood oo dhismaha hadda aan lahayn, khariitadu waxay muujinaysaa sanduuq meeshii calaamadda ahayd, Problems wuxuu liiskarayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidh-qalab-la-dhigay-iyo-calaamad\"\u003EXidhiidh qalab la dhigay iyo calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELambada iftiinka ee maktabadda waa walax 3D ah, laakiin khariiteynta korontada waxay muujisaa calaamaddeeda. Waa la dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal mar\u003C/strong\u003E oo waa la xidhaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro Build › \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbol link\u003C/strong\u003E (ama qor SYMBOLLINK). Qayb Symbol link ah ayaa furmaysa dhinaca bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walxaha la dhigay khariitada ama 3D. Qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa tirada la doortay iyo waxa ay ku xiran yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESymbol\u003C/strong\u003E (set kasta: Electrical, Plumbing) oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELink\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxuhu wuxuu sii ahaanayaa hal walax, jadwal kastaana wuxuu tirinayaa mar keliya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3D\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu had iyo jeer muujiyaa jidhkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhariiteyn\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa qaabkiisa khariiteed sidii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhariiteyn oo \u003Cstrong\u003EThis view shows linked elements as\u003C/strong\u003E lagu dejiyay \u003Cstrong\u003ETheir symbol (a services layout)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadda meeshiisa. Riix calaamadda waxay doorataa walxaha. Doorashadu waxay ku sii jirtaa muuqaalkaas faylka ku jira (khariitada dabaqa, khariitada saqafka ama callout).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETurn the symbol 90°\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu calaamadda u leexiyaa iyada oo ka soo horjeedda walxaha. \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove the link\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa xidhiidhka; walxuhu wuu sii ahaanayaa. Jadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003ELinked symbols\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liiskarayaa walax kasta oo xiran mar keliya, iyada oo dabaqeeda iyo qolka ay ku taal la socdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELama dhisin: doorashada muuqaalka ee sawirka waa doorashada khariitada dabaqa ee ay muujinayso; qalabka lagu dhigay qalabka Electrical waa calaamado khariita kasta ku jira, sida hore.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Fur hal panel oo liiska calaamadaha korontada iyo calaamadaha khariitada biyo-dhigista ka muujinaya sawirradooda iyo magacyadooda, hel kan aad rabto, oo ku dhig khariitada. Waxba halkan uma baahna internet: calaamadaha waxay ku jiraan barnaamijka. Fur oo ku dhig calaamad Fur moodel oo fur Build › Symbol palette (amarka qoran: SYMBOLS). Isla badhanka ayaa ku jira menu-ga Tools ee Draw bar-ka, iyo sidoo kale Symbols kooxda Library ee qalabka sare. Dooro set: Electrical ama Plumbing, ama All sets. Ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad liiska u yareyso. Waxaad ku raadin kartaa magac ama kooban (WC, CW, HB). Riix calaamad. Khariitadu way diyaar u tahay inay ku dhigto. Calaamad korontada waxay bilaabaa qalabka Electrical oo qalabkaas la doortay, sidaas darteed wax kasta oo ku jira The electrical plan way khusaysaa: riix khariitada, hal tallaabo oo Undo. Calaamad biyo-dhigista waxay bilaabaa qalabka calaamadda khariitada. Riix khariitada. Qalab ku taal darbi (musqul, lavatory, bathtub, sink, hose bib) wuxuu u dhowaadaa darbiga ugu dhow, dhabarkiisa darbiga ayuu ku jiraa; qulqulka, valve-yada, biyo-kululeeyaha iyo nooca khadadka meesha aad riixdo ayay tagaan. Riix R si aad calaamadda 90 darajo u leexiso (Shift+R waxay u leexisaa jihada kale), ama ku qor xagal Rotation bar-ka ikhtiyaarka. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Qalab ama hose bib ku dhacay wejiga darbi wuxuu xasuustaa darbigaas: marka darbigu dhaqaaqo, calaamaddu way raacaysaa (isla wejiga, isla masaafada darbiga dhexdiisa) isla tallaabada tarjumaadda. Haddii aad darbiga tirtirto, calaamaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa meeshii ay ahayd, Problems wuxuu sheegaa \"lost its wall\"; u guuri ama tirtir. Calaamadaha laga dhigay darbiyada ka fog ma ku xirna wax. Calaamad kasta oo aad dhigto waa hal tallaabo oo Undo. Calaamad la dhigay waa faallo khariiteed ku jirta faylka IFC oo leh tag-geeda (WC1, WC2, ...). Dooro si aad u beddesho tag-geeda ama leexashadeeda Sifooyinka, ama riix Delete. Waxa ku jira set-ka biyo-dhigista Qalabyada (water closet, urinal, lavatory, bathtub, shower, kitchen sink, single sink), qulqul dhulka ah, cleanouts dhulka iyo darbiga, hose bib, hydrant darbiga, biyo-kululeeye, valve-yada (gate, globe, ball, check, butterfly, pressure reducing) iyo nooca khadadka oo leh kooban-kooban: biyo qabow (CW), biyo kulul (HW), soo-celinta biyo kulul (HWR), qashin (W), hawo-bixin (V), qulqulka duufaanka (SD) iyo gaas (G). Sawirrada waxay la socdaan khariitada, sidaas darteed ballaaruntooda way ku sii jirtaa warqadda la daabacayo. Nooca khadka waa gaabis gaaban oo lagu muujiyo nooca khariitada; tuubooyinka dhabta ah ku sawir qalabka tuubooyinka. Kuwani waa heshiisyo caadi ah oo khariiteed oo biyo-dhigista, oo lagu sawiray iyaga; lama shahaadeeyo ISO 4067-1 ama ASME Y32.4. Waxaa loo barbar dhigay halbeegyada sawirka dadweynaha iyo buugaagta tababarka (liiska waxaa ku jira sheeko-ilaha set-ka, kaas oo sheegaya meelaha aan ku dhigno iyo meelaha ka duwan), ma aha wax laga soo koobay alaab gaar ah, waana bilaash in la isticmaalo (Apache-2.0). Set-yada sawirka way kala duwan yihiin, sidaas darteed hubi dhaxalka mashruucaaga. Waa calaamado khariiteed, ma aha naqshadda biyo-dhigista: ma cabbiraan tuubooyinka ama ma hubiyaan xeerarka. Kuwa la doortay iyo furayaasha Riix xiddiga calaamad kasta (ama riix F isaga) si aad u ilaaliso sidii kuwa la doortay. Kuwa la doortay ayaa hore u iman doona oo waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. Only favourites wuxuu muujiyaa kuwaas oo keliya. ↓ sanduuqa raadinta ayaa kuu geeyaa calaamadaha; furayaasha falka, Home iyo End ayaa u dhaqaaqaya inta u dhexeysa; Enter wuxuu doortaa kan xooga saaran; Esc wuxuu xidhaa palettada. Telefoon ku jira palettada waa xaashi hoosta shaashadda ah; markaad calaamad doorato wuu ka leexdaa si aad khariitada u aragto. Dib u fur menu-ga Build ama badhanka Palette bar-ka ikhtiyaarka. Haddii faylku isticmaalo set calaamadood oo dhismaha hadda aan lahayn, khariitadu waxay muujinaysaa sanduuq meeshii calaamadda ahayd, Problems wuxuu liiskarayaa. Xidhiidh qalab la dhigay iyo calaamad Lambada iftiinka ee maktabadda waa walax 3D ah, laakiin khariiteynta korontada waxay muujisaa calaamaddeeda. Waa la dhigaa hal mar oo waa la xidhaa: Dooro Build › Symbol link (ama qor SYMBOLLINK). Qayb Symbol link ah ayaa furmaysa dhinaca bidix. Dooro walxaha la dhigay khariitada ama 3D. Qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa tirada la doortay iyo waxa ay ku xiran yihiin. Dooro Symbol (set kasta: Electrical, Plumbing) oo dooro Link. Walxuhu wuxuu sii ahaanayaa hal walax, jadwal kastaana wuxuu tirinayaa mar keliya: 3D wuxuu had iyo jeer muujiyaa jidhkiisa. Khariiteyn wuxuu muujiyaa qaabkiisa khariiteed sidii hore. Khariiteyn oo This view shows linked elements as lagu dejiyay Their symbol (a services layout) wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadda meeshiisa. Riix calaamadda waxay doorataa walxaha. Doorashadu waxay ku sii jirtaa muuqaalkaas faylka ku jira (khariitada dabaqa, khariitada saqafka ama callout). Turn the symbol 90° wuxuu calaamadda u leexiyaa iyada oo ka soo horjeedda walxaha. Remove the link wuxuu ka saaraa xidhiidhka; walxuhu wuu sii ahaanayaa. Jadwalka Linked symbols wuxuu liiskarayaa walax kasta oo xiran mar keliya, iyada oo dabaqeeda iyo qolka ay ku taal la socdaan. Lama dhisin: doorashada muuqaalka ee sawirka waa doorashada khariitada dabaqa ee ay muujinayso; qalabka lagu dhigay qalabka Electrical waa calaamado khariita kasta ku jira, sida hore.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qiyaas masaafooyinka, aagagga bannaanka iyo meelaha 3D","summary":"Qiyaas inta u dhexaysa laba dhibcood oo moodel IFC ah oo lagu xidho geesaha iyo xagalka, akhri farqiga dhinaca X, Y iyo Z, oo qiyaas aagga wejiga siman.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["qiyaas","qiyaasid","masaafo","dherer","cabbir","aagga","aagga wejiga","xidh","geesta","xagal","qiyaasle","xadka","booska","latitude","longitude","lat long","isku-dhafka","georeference","beddelka khariidadda","EPSG","sahan","eastings","northings","WGS 84","datum"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"halka-dhibcu-ku-yaal-dhulka","text":"Halka dhibcu ku yaal dhulka","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi xadhigga, dherer derbi ama cabbirka wejiga si toos ah moodelka, adigoo aan furin barnaamijka dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Bar ayaa furmaa hoosta aragga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafo:\u003C/strong\u003E marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E la doorto, guji dhibcaha koowaad, kadibna kan labaad. Geesta u dhow, dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan; xagalka u dhow, waxay ku xidhmaan geesta. Calaamadda yar ee u dhow mu&#039;arrifka ayaa sheegta waxa ay tahay. Lamaanaha kasta oo guji ah wuxuu samaysaa hal qiyaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga wejiga:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBannaanka wejiga\u003C/span\u003E oo guji wejiga. Wejiga siman oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, aaggiisana wuu muuqdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadadka toosan:\u003C/strong\u003E hoos u hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad dooranayso dhibcaha labaad, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan\u003C/span\u003E barta si aad u hayso. Khadku wuxuu u socdaa hal dhidib oo ugu dhow mu&#039;arrifka (aragga sare, X ama Y ee qorshaha; aragyada kale X, Y ama Z), calaamadda mu&#039;arrifka waxay leedahay &quot;toosan oo ku socda dhidib&quot;. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wali wuxuu bilaabaa/joojiyaa Qiyaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E si aad u tirtirto qiyaasaha, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystay\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) si aad u joojiso qiyaasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhad u dhexeeya laba dhibcood oo dhererkiisa lagu qoray, iyo bar ku jira dhererka iyo intee uu u socdo X, Y iyo Z (dhidibyada moodelka, Z sare u kac), dhammaantoodna waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E laga doortay qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAagga wejiga oo ah mitir laba jibbaaran, wejiga iyo barka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiyaasaha waxay ku sii jiraan markaad wareejiso, jiidato ama weyneyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad qiyaasayso, gujinta ma doortaan elementiyada. Diyaarada ama sanduuqa gooyinta ayaa wali gooya moodelka, waxaadna qiyaasi kartaa waxa ay muujinayso, oo ay ku jiraan wejiyada la gooyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-dhibcu-ku-yaal-dhulka\"\u003EHalka dhibcu ku yaal dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E barta qiyaasta, kadibna guji dhibic moodelka (wuu ku xidhmaa geesaha iyo xagalka sida masaafooyinka). Bar ayaa muujinaya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elatitude iyo longitude\u003C/strong\u003E, degree-yada tobanaqaad iyo degree, daqiiqad iyo ilbiriqsi, WGS 84 marka hore;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eisku-dhafka khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E (eastings iyo northings, oo lagu qoray \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E laga doortay qalabka sare) nidaamka khariidadda ee moodelka, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EEPSG:28356\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edhererka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo datum-ka dhererka ee faylku sheegay, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edatum-ka faylka\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan GDA94).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa xogta oo dhan clipboard-ka hal saf. Beddel nidaamka latitude iyo longitude-ka ku jira hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E: WGS 84 (sida GPS iyo khariidadaha webka), datum-ka faylka, ama mid kale oo caadi ah sida ETRS89 ama NAD83.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waxay u baahan tahay moodel leh meel dhab ah (georeference): mid lagu dhoofiyay isku-dhafka khariidadda (beddel khariidad oo nidaam mashruuc ah oo leh koodka EPSG). Moodel kaliya oo leh latitude iyo longitude goobta ah ayaa heesha qiyaas dhow, oo laga qaaday dhibcaha goobta iyo waqooyiga run-ka, bar-kuna wuu sheegaa. Marka moodelo dhowr ah la furay, dhibic kasta wuxuu isticmaalaa georeference-ka moodelkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareejinta datum-yada (tusaale ahaan GDA94 ilaa WGS 84) waxaa lagu sameeyaa iyada oo aan lahayn faylal grid, sidaas darteed waa saxan tahay dhowr mitir; khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa sida saxda ah. Isku-dhafka khariidadda laftiisa waa saxan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;…has no georeference&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka ma leh beddel khariidad iyo latitude iyo longitude goobta. Dib u dhoofi isagoo nidaamka isku-dhafka la dejiyay (isku-dhafka la wadaago / barta sahanka ee qalabka dhismaha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhafka khariidadda laakiin latitude iyo longitude ma jiraan.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku magaca nidaamka khariidadda ma lahan koodka EPSG, ama koodkiisu ma ku jiro liiska; khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcuhu wuxuu ku dhacaa wejiga, ma aha geesta.\u003C/strong\u003E Xidhiidhku wuxuu eegaa elementiga hoos mu&#039;arrifka. U soo dhow geesta, ama weyneey.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga way ka yar yahay sidii la filayay.\u003C/strong\u003E Furaha waa laga tagay, wejiga foorarsan waa dhowr wejiga: guji kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa joojiyay qiyaasta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kowaad wuxuu tirtiraa masaafada aan dhammaystirnayn; kan labaad wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGooy moodel IFC diyaarad gooyin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo ka arag elementiyada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hubi xadhigga, dherer derbi ama cabbirka wejiga si toos ah moodelka, adigoo aan furin barnaamijka dhismaha. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC. Guji Qiyaas qalabka sare, ama riix M. Bar ayaa furmaa hoosta aragga. Masaafo: marka Masaafo la doorto, guji dhibcaha koowaad, kadibna kan labaad. Geesta u dhow, dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan; xagalka u dhow, waxay ku xidhmaan geesta. Calaamadda yar ee u dhow mu'arrifka ayaa sheegta waxa ay tahay. Lamaanaha kasta oo guji ah wuxuu samaysaa hal qiyaas. Aagga wejiga: dooro Bannaanka wejiga oo guji wejiga. Wejiga siman oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, aaggiisana wuu muuqdaa. Khadadka toosan: hoos u hay Shift markaad dooranayso dhibcaha labaad, ama riix Toosan barta si aad u hayso. Khadku wuxuu u socdaa hal dhidib oo ugu dhow mu'arrifka (aragga sare, X ama Y ee qorshaha; aragyada kale X, Y ama Z), calaamadda mu'arrifka waxay leedahay \"toosan oo ku socda dhidib\". M wali wuxuu bilaabaa/joojiyaa Qiyaas. Guji Nadiifi si aad u tirtirto qiyaasaha, ama Dhammaystay (ama Esc) si aad u joojiso qiyaasta. Waxa aad arki doontid Khad u dhexeeya laba dhibcood oo dhererkiisa lagu qoray, iyo bar ku jira dhererka iyo intee uu u socdo X, Y iyo Z (dhidibyada moodelka, Z sare u kac), dhammaantoodna waxay ku jiraan Cutubyada laga doortay qalabka sare. Aagga wejiga oo ah mitir laba jibbaaran, wejiga iyo barka. Qiyaasaha waxay ku sii jiraan markaad wareejiso, jiidato ama weyneyso. Intaad qiyaasayso, gujinta ma doortaan elementiyada. Diyaarada ama sanduuqa gooyinta ayaa wali gooya moodelka, waxaadna qiyaasi kartaa waxa ay muujinayso, oo ay ku jiraan wejiyada la gooyay. Halka dhibcu ku yaal dhulka Guji Booska barta qiyaasta, kadibna guji dhibic moodelka (wuu ku xidhmaa geesaha iyo xagalka sida masaafooyinka). Bar ayaa muujinaya: latitude iyo longitude, degree-yada tobanaqaad iyo degree, daqiiqad iyo ilbiriqsi, WGS 84 marka hore; isku-dhafka khariidadda (eastings iyo northings, oo lagu qoray Cutubyada laga doortay qalabka sare) nidaamka khariidadda ee moodelka, tusaale ahaan EPSG:28356; dhererka iyo datum-ka dhererka ee faylku sheegay, iyo datum-ka faylka (tusaale ahaan GDA94). Koobiyee wuxuu dhigaa xogta oo dhan clipboard-ka hal saf. Beddel nidaamka latitude iyo longitude-ka ku jira hoos Dejinta › BimCraft › Booska: WGS 84 (sida GPS iyo khariidadaha webka), datum-ka faylka, ama mid kale oo caadi ah sida ETRS89 ama NAD83. Tani waxay u baahan tahay moodel leh meel dhab ah (georeference): mid lagu dhoofiyay isku-dhafka khariidadda (beddel khariidad oo nidaam mashruuc ah oo leh koodka EPSG). Moodel kaliya oo leh latitude iyo longitude goobta ah ayaa heesha qiyaas dhow, oo laga qaaday dhibcaha goobta iyo waqooyiga run-ka, bar-kuna wuu sheegaa. Marka moodelo dhowr ah la furay, dhibic kasta wuxuu isticmaalaa georeference-ka moodelkiisa. Wareejinta datum-yada (tusaale ahaan GDA94 ilaa WGS 84) waxaa lagu sameeyaa iyada oo aan lahayn faylal grid, sidaas darteed waa saxan tahay dhowr mitir; khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa sida saxda ah. Isku-dhafka khariidadda laftiisa waa saxan. Khaladaadka caadiga ah \"…has no georeference\". Faylka ma leh beddel khariidad iyo latitude iyo longitude goobta. Dib u dhoofi isagoo nidaamka isku-dhafka la dejiyay (isku-dhafka la wadaago / barta sahanka ee qalabka dhismaha). Isku-dhafka khariidadda laakiin latitude iyo longitude ma jiraan. Faylku magaca nidaamka khariidadda ma lahan koodka EPSG, ama koodkiisu ma ku jiro liiska; khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa kan. Dhibcuhu wuxuu ku dhacaa wejiga, ma aha geesta. Xidhiidhku wuxuu eegaa elementiga hoos mu'arrifka. U soo dhow geesta, ama weyneey. Aagga way ka yar yahay sidii la filayay. Furaha waa laga tagay, wejiga foorarsan waa dhowr wejiga: guji kasta. Esc ayaa joojiyay qiyaasta. Esc kowaad wuxuu tirtiraa masaafada aan dhammaystirnayn; kan labaad wuu joojiyaa. Xiga Gooy moodel IFC diyaarad gooyin Qari, kala saar oo ka arag elementiyada","lang":"so"},{"slug":"takeoff","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tirooyinka loo gudbiyo TakeoffCraft","summary":"Hal riix ayaa tirooyinka moodelka u dira TakeoffCraft — darbiyada nooca iyo bedka saqafka, xagasha sare, aasaaska, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha, kabadhka, aaladaha korontada, bedka sagxadda iyo liistada goynta alwaaxa — oo lagu calaamadiyay qorshe heer kasta, isku-dhisyada xirmooyinka shaqada oo shayada lagu daray.","section":"tasks","order":28,"keywords":["xisaabinta qadarka","tirinta qadarka","qiyaas kharash","liistada alaabta","biilka alaabta","TakeoffCraft","tirooyinka","bedka darbiga","bedka saqafka","squares","aasaas","kongareet","cubic yards","liistada goynta","alwaax","xirmada shaqada","isku-dhis"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"u-dir","text":"U dir","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-cabbiraa","text":"Waxa la cabbiraa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka u beddel liistada alaabta iyo qiyaasa kharashka TakeoffCraft. BimCraft wuxuu qorshe ka sameeyaa heer kasta oo cabbir caadi ah, wuxuuna calaamadiyaa tiro kasta oo ku jirta, wuxuuna xisaabinta ku dhejiyaa gudaha PDF-ka. TakeoffCraft calaamadaha qudhiisa ayuu cabbiraa, sidaas darteed lambar kasta waa la hubin karaa xaashida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir\"\u003EU dir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka moodelka (oo ku taal dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffCraft wuxuu furmaa tab cusub oo leh qorshayaasha. Markuu weydiiyo, dooro inaad furto xisaabinta uu ka helay PDF-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar qiimahaaga miiska tirooyinka ee TakeoffCraft; isku-dhisyadu horay ayay u liistaan alaabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii TakeoffCraft aan halkan diyaar ahayn, badhanku wuxuu soo dejiyaa PDF-ka. Ku fur TakeoffCraft markaad dib u furto: wuxuu xisaabinta gudaha ka heli doonaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-cabbiraa\"\u003EWaxa la cabbiraa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E nooca iyo dhererka: xarriiqyada dhexe sida waddooyin, iyada oo joogga darbiga shayga ku jira, si TakeoffCraft u siiyo dhererka iyo bedka darbiga. Darbi kasta wuxuu qaadaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft mar keliya ayuu ka jaraa bedka darbiga, isagoo adeegsanaya isla xeerka sida jadwalada BimCraft: labadooda guud, jarista iyo saafiga way isku raacaan. Xogta xisaabinta nooca darbiga (unugga, nuurka, sicirka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada darbiga\u003C/a\u003E) waxay u timaaddaa hal sadar oo qiimaysan oo ku jirta shayga nooca darbigaas. Hab cabbiraad oo ka duwan kan caadiga ah (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf#choose-a-measurement-method\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/plan-schedules-and-pdf\" data-hash=\"choose-a-measurement-method\"\u003EDooro habka cabbiraadda\u003C/a\u003E), xisaabintu waxay qaadaa habka, darbi kasta wuxuu qaadaa waxa isku-xidhku ka jaro wajiga darbiga, TakeoffCraft habkaas ayuu cabbiraa oo magacaa. Nooc darbi oo unugiisu leeyahay dherer iyo joog, wuxuu siiyaa laba qayb oo tirooyin leh: unugyada la dalbanayo iyo mugga nuurka, oo sicir loo siiyo marka sicirka nooca yahay mid unug kasta, kasta 1000 unug, ama m³ nuur kasta. Tiro si sax ah u dhacda lambar oo dhan ayaa TakeoffCraft ku noqon karta mid hal unug ka sareeya, sababtoo ah gudbintu goobaha qorshaha ayay ku wareejisaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaqafyada\u003C/strong\u003E: qorshe kasta oo saqaf ah sida bedka xagal leh, oo leh xagalkiisa (TakeoffCraft wuxuu siinayaa bedka xagal leh), xagasha sare (ridges), xagasha dhinacyada (hips) iyo xagasha hoose (valleys) — xagasha dhinacyada iyo xagasha hoose sida ay u dhacaan — iyo dhinaca hoose ee saqafka iyo dhinaca bannaanka (eaves iyo rakes).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAasaaska\u003C/strong\u003E: aasaaska iyo darbiyada aasaaska sida xarriiqyo dhexdooda ku wareegaya, iyo sagxadaha sida bedad leh oo dhumucdooda la siiyo, si kongareetku mugga ugu soo baxo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu tiriyo nooc, oo ay ku jiraan trim-ka daaqadaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKabadhka hoose\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu cabbiro dherer ee jibbadooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAaladaha korontada\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu tiriyo nooc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBedka sagxadda\u003C/strong\u003E heer kasta, laga soo qaado qolalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiistada goynta alwaaxa\u003C/strong\u003E oo laga soo qaado qaabka dhismaha, lagu tiriyo xaashi u gaar ah (hal dhibic qayb kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmooyinka shaqada oo leh isku-dhis u dhigma — darbiyada dibadda iyo gudaha, sagxadaha, aasaaska, darbiyada aasaaska, shingles-ka, xagasha sare iyo xagasha dhinacyada, xagasha hoose, dhinaca hoose ee saqafka, albaabbada gudaha, trim-ka daaqadaha, kabadhka hoose, bilaha korontada, dhaqdhaqaaqa, nalalka, sanduuqyada isku-xidhka iyo guddiga — shayga wuxuu la yimaadaa alaabtiisa iyo qaacidooyinkiisa. Xirmooyinku ma leeyihin qiimo, mana la dhex-eegin qiyaasayaasha kharashka weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshayaasha waxaa laga sameeyaa moodelka mar kasta oo aad riixdo, sidaas darteed markaad wax beddesho, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Moodelka u beddel liistada alaabta iyo qiyaasa kharashka TakeoffCraft. BimCraft wuxuu qorshe ka sameeyaa heer kasta oo cabbir caadi ah, wuxuuna calaamadiyaa tiro kasta oo ku jirta, wuxuuna xisaabinta ku dhejiyaa gudaha PDF-ka. TakeoffCraft calaamadaha qudhiisa ayuu cabbiraa, sidaas darteed lambar kasta waa la hubin karaa xaashida. U dir Riix Takeoff bar-ka moodelka (oo ku taal dhinaca Sheets). TakeoffCraft wuxuu furmaa tab cusub oo leh qorshayaasha. Markuu weydiiyo, dooro inaad furto xisaabinta uu ka helay PDF-ka. Ku dar qiimahaaga miiska tirooyinka ee TakeoffCraft; isku-dhisyadu horay ayay u liistaan alaabta. Markii TakeoffCraft aan halkan diyaar ahayn, badhanku wuxuu soo dejiyaa PDF-ka. Ku fur TakeoffCraft markaad dib u furto: wuxuu xisaabinta gudaha ka heli doonaa. Waxa la cabbiraa Darbiyada nooca iyo dhererka: xarriiqyada dhexe sida waddooyin, iyada oo joogga darbiga shayga ku jira, si TakeoffCraft u siiyo dhererka iyo bedka darbiga. Darbi kasta wuxuu qaadaa albaabbadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, sidaas darteed TakeoffCraft mar keliya ayuu ka jaraa bedka darbiga, isagoo adeegsanaya isla xeerka sida jadwalada BimCraft: labadooda guud, jarista iyo saafiga way isku raacaan. Xogta xisaabinta nooca darbiga (unugga, nuurka, sicirka; eeg Isku-dhisyada darbiga) waxay u timaaddaa hal sadar oo qiimaysan oo ku jirta shayga nooca darbigaas. Hab cabbiraad oo ka duwan kan caadiga ah (eeg Dooro habka cabbiraadda), xisaabintu waxay qaadaa habka, darbi kasta wuxuu qaadaa waxa isku-xidhku ka jaro wajiga darbiga, TakeoffCraft habkaas ayuu cabbiraa oo magacaa. Nooc darbi oo unugiisu leeyahay dherer iyo joog, wuxuu siiyaa laba qayb oo tirooyin leh: unugyada la dalbanayo iyo mugga nuurka, oo sicir loo siiyo marka sicirka nooca yahay mid unug kasta, kasta 1000 unug, ama m³ nuur kasta. Tiro si sax ah u dhacda lambar oo dhan ayaa TakeoffCraft ku noqon karta mid hal unug ka sareeya, sababtoo ah gudbintu goobaha qorshaha ayay ku wareejisaa. Saqafyada: qorshe kasta oo saqaf ah sida bedka xagal leh, oo leh xagalkiisa (TakeoffCraft wuxuu siinayaa bedka xagal leh), xagasha sare (ridges), xagasha dhinacyada (hips) iyo xagasha hoose (valleys) — xagasha dhinacyada iyo xagasha hoose sida ay u dhacaan — iyo dhinaca hoose ee saqafka iyo dhinaca bannaanka (eaves iyo rakes). Aasaaska: aasaaska iyo darbiyada aasaaska sida xarriiqyo dhexdooda ku wareegaya, iyo sagxadaha sida bedad leh oo dhumucdooda la siiyo, si kongareetku mugga ugu soo baxo. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha oo lagu tiriyo nooc, oo ay ku jiraan trim-ka daaqadaha. Kabadhka hoose oo lagu cabbiro dherer ee jibbadooda. Aaladaha korontada oo lagu tiriyo nooc. Bedka sagxadda heer kasta, laga soo qaado qolalkiisa. Liistada goynta alwaaxa oo laga soo qaado qaabka dhismaha, lagu tiriyo xaashi u gaar ah (hal dhibic qayb kasta). Xirmooyinka shaqada oo leh isku-dhis u dhigma — darbiyada dibadda iyo gudaha, sagxadaha, aasaaska, darbiyada aasaaska, shingles-ka, xagasha sare iyo xagasha dhinacyada, xagasha hoose, dhinaca hoose ee saqafka, albaabbada gudaha, trim-ka daaqadaha, kabadhka hoose, bilaha korontada, dhaqdhaqaaqa, nalalka, sanduuqyada isku-xidhka iyo guddiga — shayga wuxuu la yimaadaa alaabtiisa iyo qaacidooyinkiisa. Xirmooyinku ma leeyihin qiimo, mana la dhex-eegin qiyaasayaasha kharashka weli. Qorshayaasha waxaa laga sameeyaa moodelka mar kasta oo aad riixdo, sidaas darteed markaad wax beddesho, riix Takeoff mar kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"scan-to-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Darbiyada iyo albaabbada laga helo scan telefoon ama laser","summary":"Ka beddel scan qol darbiyo, albaabbo iyo qolal la soo jeediyay oo aad mid mid ogolaato.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["scan","scan telefoon","lidar","daruuraha dhibcaha","darbiyada ka scan","albaabbada ka scan","scan qol","ply","e57","las","obj","soo jeedi"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-sameeyo","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-hubiyaa","text":"Waxa uu hubiyaa","level":2},{"id":"ilaa-la-hubiyo-lama-xaqiijin","text":"Ilaa la hubiyo, lama xaqiijin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-karin","text":"Waxa aan karin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sameeyo\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii scan furan (daruuro dhibcood sida PLY, E57 ama LAS, ama mesh sida OBJ) la furo, BimCraft wuxuu ka gooyaa scan-ka dherka qorshaha, wuxuuna ku rogaa si siman dhismaha, wuxuuna raadiyaa khadadka dheer ee dhuuban ee dhibcaha: kuwaasi waa darbiyo. Meel ballaceedu u dhow yahay albaab, oo u dhexaysa laba jeer oo hal khad ah, waxay noqotaa hal darbi oo albaab ku jira. Darbiyada ku xidha meel waxay sameeyaan qol.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba lama sawirin ilaa aad aqbasho. Darbiyada iyo albaabbada waxay yimaadaan liis soo jeedin ah (waa isbeddelo qaab Suggest ah): kuwa saxa ahi ha la hayo, kuwa kale ha la diido, wixii la hayo oo dhan hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ayaa la sawiraa. Qolalku naftooda ayay soo muuqdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-hubiyaa\"\u003EWaxa uu hubiyaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada aan xidhmin, darbiyada dherkoodu ka gaaban yahay dhumucda darbiga, iyo meel ballac albaab ah oo aan darbi ku wareegsanayn ayaa lagu soo sheegaa Dhibaato, oo leh booska, si aad u eegto scan-ka meeshaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ilaa-la-hubiyo-lama-xaqiijin\"\u003EIlaa la hubiyo, lama xaqiijin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada, albaabbada iyo qolalka aad ka aqbasho scan-ka waxa lagu calaamadiyaa inaan la xaqiijin: sanduuq jajab ah iyo &quot;?&quot; qorshaha ilaa aad u calaamadiso inay la hubiyay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadi walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-karin\"\u003EWaxa aan karin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay helaysaa darbiyada u socda laba jihood oo is-jaanqaadsan. Darbi jiiqsan ama wareegan lama helo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal dabaq mar. Daaqadaha lama helo (daaqad waa meel furan oo keliya marka goyntu tahay hoosta daaqadda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa lagu tijaabiyay scan-yo qol la abuuray iyo meshes, weli ma lagu tijaabin scan-yo telefoon dhab ah. Sida uu uga fiicnaan doono scan dhab ah (kala-dhaca socod dheer, alaab darbiyada ku taabanaysa, muraayad, albaabbo furan) lama yaqaan, oo hagaajinta scan-yada dhabta ah ayaa tallaabada xigta. Hubi soo jeedin kasta scan-ka ka hor intaadan aqbalin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo Markii scan furan (daruuro dhibcood sida PLY, E57 ama LAS, ama mesh sida OBJ) la furo, BimCraft wuxuu ka gooyaa scan-ka dherka qorshaha, wuxuuna ku rogaa si siman dhismaha, wuxuuna raadiyaa khadadka dheer ee dhuuban ee dhibcaha: kuwaasi waa darbiyo. Meel ballaceedu u dhow yahay albaab, oo u dhexaysa laba jeer oo hal khad ah, waxay noqotaa hal darbi oo albaab ku jira. Darbiyada ku xidha meel waxay sameeyaan qol. Waxba lama sawirin ilaa aad aqbasho. Darbiyada iyo albaabbada waxay yimaadaan liis soo jeedin ah (waa isbeddelo qaab Suggest ah): kuwa saxa ahi ha la hayo, kuwa kale ha la diido, wixii la hayo oo dhan hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ayaa la sawiraa. Qolalku naftooda ayay soo muuqdaan. Waxa uu hubiyaa Darbiyada aan xidhmin, darbiyada dherkoodu ka gaaban yahay dhumucda darbiga, iyo meel ballac albaab ah oo aan darbi ku wareegsanayn ayaa lagu soo sheegaa Dhibaato, oo leh booska, si aad u eegto scan-ka meeshaas. Ilaa la hubiyo, lama xaqiijin Darbiyada, albaabbada iyo qolalka aad ka aqbasho scan-ka waxa lagu calaamadiyaa inaan la xaqiijin: sanduuq jajab ah iyo \"?\" qorshaha ilaa aad u calaamadiso inay la hubiyay. Eeg Calaamadi walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta. Waxa aan karin Waxay helaysaa darbiyada u socda laba jihood oo is-jaanqaadsan. Darbi jiiqsan ama wareegan lama helo. Hal dabaq mar. Daaqadaha lama helo (daaqad waa meel furan oo keliya marka goyntu tahay hoosta daaqadda). Waxa lagu tijaabiyay scan-yo qol la abuuray iyo meshes, weli ma lagu tijaabin scan-yo telefoon dhab ah. Sida uu uga fiicnaan doono scan dhab ah (kala-dhaca socod dheer, alaab darbiyada ku taabanaysa, muraayad, albaabbo furan) lama yaqaan, oo hagaajinta scan-yada dhabta ah ayaa tallaabada xigta. Hubi soo jeedin kasta scan-ka ka hor intaadan aqbalin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"issues-bcf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhibaatooyin iyo faylasha BCF","summary":"Kaydi aragta moodeelka sida dhibaato — kamarada, walxaha la doortay, kuwa qarsan, goynta — ka wadaag sida fayl BCF ah qalabyada isku-duubka kale, oo fur faylasha BCF ee kuwa kale si aad u aragto dhibaatooyinkooda.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["bcf","bcfzip","dhibaato","dhibaatooyin","mawduuc","aragti","kamarad","warbixinta isku dhacga","isku-duub","faallo","sawir","fur bcf","kaydi bcf","dhoofin","soo dhoofin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu tilmaan dhibaato moodeelka oo ilaali aragta tusta, kadibna u gudbi fayl BCF, qaabka qalabyada kale ee isku-duubka akhrin iyo qori karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC oo samee aragta: wareeji, dooro walxaha ku lug leh, qari wax jid ku ah, goy qayb ahaan diyaarad goyn ama sanduuq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka midig, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew issue from this view\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor cinwaan, iyo faallo haddii aad rabto; dooro xaalad; qor magacaaga ama iimaylkaaga (haddii aad gashay, magaca akoonkaaga ayaa la buuxiyaa; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings#your-name-on-issues\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"your-name-on-issues\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E). Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECreate issue\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E dhibaato si aragtiisa loo soo celiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi BCF\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u soo dejiso dhibaatooyin oo dhan hal fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.bcf\u003C/code\u003E ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u aragto dhibaatooyin qof kale sameeyay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen BCF…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylkooda \u003Ccode\u003E.bcf\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.bcfzip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibaato kasta liiska ku jirta oo sawir aragteeda, cinwaankeeda, xaaladdeeda, qoraheeda iyo taariikhdeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa kamaradda, walxaha la doortay, waxa la qariyay (ama oo keliya waxa la muujiyay) iyo goynta. Walxaha waxaa lagu helaa GlobalId kasta oo moodeel furan; sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya haddii qaar aysan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDiyaarad goyn ama sanduuq ka timid qalab kale waxaa la muujiyaa marka ay la jaanqaado tiirarka moodeelka; diyaarado janjeeran ama dheeraad ah waxay soo laabtaan sida mugga goynta (ilaa 6 diyaarado). Dhibaato waxay hayaa sanduuqa ugu horeeya mugga leh sanduuqyo badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku waa BCF 2.1 wuxuuna ilaaliyaa aragta kala-kaanka moodeelka, sidaas darteed qalabyada kale kamaradda way ku dhigaan meel isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibaatooyinku waxay ku sii jiraan tab-kan ilaa aad kaydiso. Furidda moodeel kale waxay ilaalisaa liiska; fur moodeelka dhibaatooyinku ku saabsan yihiin ka hor inta aadan muujin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKamarad isbarbar socda (orthogonal) oo ka timid qalab kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa kamaradda perspective-ka ee muraayaddan, dib loo dhigay si isla qaybta moodeelka ay buuxiso aragta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji wuxuu kamaradda u wareejiyay meel aan caadi ahayn.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhibaatada waxaa lagu sameeyay moodeel kale ama kala-kaan kale. Marka hore fur moodeelka saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylku ma furmo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma aha BCF zip, ama waa jabsan; sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo ilaali walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoy moodeelka IFC diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku tilmaan dhibaato moodeelka oo ilaali aragta tusta, kadibna u gudbi fayl BCF, qaabka qalabyada kale ee isku-duubka akhrin iyo qori karaa. Tallaabooyin Fur moodeel IFC oo samee aragta: wareeji, dooro walxaha ku lug leh, qari wax jid ku ah, goy qayb ahaan diyaarad goyn ama sanduuq. Guji Issues tab-ka midig, kadibna New issue from this view. Qor cinwaan, iyo faallo haddii aad rabto; dooro xaalad; qor magacaaga ama iimaylkaaga (haddii aad gashay, magaca akoonkaaga ayaa la buuxiyaa; eeg Dejinta BimCraft). Guji Create issue. Guji Show dhibaato si aragtiisa loo soo celiyo. Guji Kaydi BCF si aad u soo dejiso dhibaatooyin oo dhan hal fayl .bcf ah. Si aad u aragto dhibaatooyin qof kale sameeyay, guji Open BCF… oo dooro faylkooda .bcf ama .bcfzip. Waxa aad arki doontid Dhibaato kasta liiska ku jirta oo sawir aragteeda, cinwaankeeda, xaaladdeeda, qoraheeda iyo taariikhdeeda. Show wuxuu soo celinayaa kamaradda, walxaha la doortay, waxa la qariyay (ama oo keliya waxa la muujiyay) iyo goynta. Walxaha waxaa lagu helaa GlobalId kasta oo moodeel furan; sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya haddii qaar aysan jirin. Diyaarad goyn ama sanduuq ka timid qalab kale waxaa la muujiyaa marka ay la jaanqaado tiirarka moodeelka; diyaarado janjeeran ama dheeraad ah waxay soo laabtaan sida mugga goynta (ilaa 6 diyaarado). Dhibaato waxay hayaa sanduuqa ugu horeeya mugga leh sanduuqyo badan. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Faylku waa BCF 2.1 wuxuuna ilaaliyaa aragta kala-kaanka moodeelka, sidaas darteed qalabyada kale kamaradda way ku dhigaan meel isku mid ah. Dhibaatooyinku waxay ku sii jiraan tab-kan ilaa aad kaydiso. Furidda moodeel kale waxay ilaalisaa liiska; fur moodeelka dhibaatooyinku ku saabsan yihiin ka hor inta aadan muujin. Kamarad isbarbar socda (orthogonal) oo ka timid qalab kale waxaa lagu muujiyaa kamaradda perspective-ka ee muraayaddan, dib loo dhigay si isla qaybta moodeelka ay buuxiso aragta. Khaladaad caadi ah Muuji wuxuu kamaradda u wareejiyay meel aan caadi ahayn. Dhibaatada waxaa lagu sameeyay moodeel kale ama kala-kaan kale. Marka hore fur moodeelka saxda ah. Faylku ma furmo. Ma aha BCF zip, ama waa jabsan; sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya sababta. Xiga Qari, kala saar oo ilaali walxaha Goy moodeelka IFC diyaarad goyn","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-from-a-scan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Moodeel ka samee scan","summary":"Tilmaam kooban oo laga bilaabo scan-ka laser ilaa darbiyada: fur daruurta barta ag dhow dhismo cusub, heer ku isku-habee, darbiyadana qorshaha ku raac.","section":"tasks","order":29,"keywords":["scan","scan laser","daruurta barta","dhismaha jira","sahan dhul","raac","scan ilaa BIM","moodeel scan-ka","goyn","isku-habee","toosan","LAS","LAZ","E57","PLY"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismaha jira ka sawir scan-kiisa laser: darbiyada meesha uu scan-ku ka muuqdo, heerka saxda ah, iyo kuwa isku toosan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhismo aad ku sawirto.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismo cusub\u003C/span\u003E, oo leh heerar sida dhismuhu leeyahay (heerar kale waad ku dari kartaa dambe, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003EGoobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarkiisa\u003C/a\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E wuu shaqeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScan-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruurta barta\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX ama XYZ: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EMuuji daruurta barta dhinaca moodelka\u003C/a\u003E). Daruurta waxay ku muuqataa muuqaalka 3D, qorshuhuna wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egoynteeda\u003C/strong\u003E: dhibcaha la scan-gareeyay 1200 mm (4 fiit) ka sarreeya heerka, oo ah dhibco. Taasi waa joogga darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee ugu fiican ee la akhrin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-habee heerka.\u003C/strong\u003E Fur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan\u003C/span\u003E ee baarka moodelka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESagxaddiisa isku-habee heerkan\u003C/span\u003E: daruurtu waxay kor ama hoos u dhaqaaqaysaa ilaa sagxadda la scan-gareeyay ay ku fadhiiso heerka la muujiyay. Hubi in goynta hadda ay darbiyada ka gooyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToosan dhismaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIska dhig toosan dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu daruurta u leexiyaa si darbiyada goyntiisa ku jira ugu socdaan tiirarka qorshaha, sidaas darbiyada aad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayn ku sawirto ay ku dhex jiraan scan-ka. Waxay ku leexataa bartamaha darbiyada ay helday, sidaas geedaha ama darbiga deriska ah ee ku dhex jira goynta uma rogaan scan-ka meel kale. Marka hore sagxadda isku-habee: markaas goyntu darbiyada ka gooyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada raac.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E oo guji dhibcaha dhinacooda: qalabku wuxuu ku dhegaystaa dhibcaha la scan-gareeyay (calaamadda dhegaysiga waa lakab yar oo afar-geesle ah) iyo sidoo kale darbiyada aad sawirtay. Darbi waxa lagu sawiraa xarriiqda dhexe, sidaas darteed guji dhexda laba safka dhibcaha ee darbi kasta ka soo baxa; ballaca geli marka hore adigoo dooranaya nooca darbiga. Markaas ku dar albaabyada iyo daaqadaha meelaha ay goyntu godadyada muujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka xiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro heerka ka sarreeya liiska heerarka qorshaha: goyntu waxay raacaysaa dhererka goynta heerkaas. Sagxadda mar kale heerkaas isku-habee kaliya haddii sagxadaha scan-ka aysan ahayn meesha heerarkaagu ku yaallaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoyntu way beddelmaysaa markaad heerka beddesho, goyn-qaro badan (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhumucda goynta\u003C/span\u003E) waxay muujisaa dhibco badan meelaha scan-ku khafiifka yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo isku-habaynta\u003C/span\u003E daruurta dib ugu celinaysaa meeshii ay ku taal markii la furay. Isku-habaynta daruurta muuqaalka kaliya ayay ku guurisaa: ma kaydsana faylka IFC, darbiyadii aad sawirtay way ku sii jiraan meeshoodii. Isku-habaynta waxay la socotaa daruurta markaad beddesho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E, ama markaad furto moodeel kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji goynta qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa ama muujinayaa dhibcaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScan-yada waaweyn: qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa ilaa 60,000 oo dhibcood oo goynta ah, muuqaalka 3D-na dhowr milyan oo dhibcood oo daruurta oo dhan ah, labaduba si siman oo scan-ka ka soo kala bixida, sidaas faylka weyn wuu degdegaa. Si aad ugu raacdo qalabka sawirka, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu raac CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ee baarka daruurta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhismaha jira ka sawir scan-kiisa laser: darbiyada meesha uu scan-ku ka muuqdo, heerka saxda ah, iyo kuwa isku toosan. Tallaabooyin Dhismo aad ku sawirto. Faylka › Dhismo cusub, oo leh heerar sida dhismuhu leeyahay (heerar kale waad ku dari kartaa dambe, eeg Goobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarkiisa). Sawir wuu shaqeeyaa. Scan-ka. Muuji › Daruurta barta oo dooro faylka (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, PCD, PTX ama XYZ: eeg Muuji daruurta barta dhinaca moodelka). Daruurta waxay ku muuqataa muuqaalka 3D, qorshuhuna wuxuu muujinayaa goynteeda: dhibcaha la scan-gareeyay 1200 mm (4 fiit) ka sarreeya heerka, oo ah dhibco. Taasi waa joogga darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee ugu fiican ee la akhrin karo. Isku-habee heerka. Fur menu-ga Scan ee baarka moodelka oo guji Sagxaddiisa isku-habee heerkan: daruurtu waxay kor ama hoos u dhaqaaqaysaa ilaa sagxadda la scan-gareeyay ay ku fadhiiso heerka la muujiyay. Hubi in goynta hadda ay darbiyada ka gooyso. Toosan dhismaha. Scan › Iska dhig toosan dhismaha wuxuu daruurta u leexiyaa si darbiyada goyntiisa ku jira ugu socdaan tiirarka qorshaha, sidaas darbiyada aad Shift la hayn ku sawirto ay ku dhex jiraan scan-ka. Waxay ku leexataa bartamaha darbiyada ay helday, sidaas geedaha ama darbiga deriska ah ee ku dhex jira goynta uma rogaan scan-ka meel kale. Marka hore sagxadda isku-habee: markaas goyntu darbiyada ka gooyaa. Darbiyada raac. Dooro Darbi oo guji dhibcaha dhinacooda: qalabku wuxuu ku dhegaystaa dhibcaha la scan-gareeyay (calaamadda dhegaysiga waa lakab yar oo afar-geesle ah) iyo sidoo kale darbiyada aad sawirtay. Darbi waxa lagu sawiraa xarriiqda dhexe, sidaas darteed guji dhexda laba safka dhibcaha ee darbi kasta ka soo baxa; ballaca geli marka hore adigoo dooranaya nooca darbiga. Markaas ku dar albaabyada iyo daaqadaha meelaha ay goyntu godadyada muujiso. Heerka xiga. Dooro heerka ka sarreeya liiska heerarka qorshaha: goyntu waxay raacaysaa dhererka goynta heerkaas. Sagxadda mar kale heerkaas isku-habee kaliya haddii sagxadaha scan-ka aysan ahayn meesha heerarkaagu ku yaallaan. Waxa aad arki doontid Goyntu way beddelmaysaa markaad heerka beddesho, goyn-qaro badan (Scan › Dhumucda goynta) waxay muujisaa dhibco badan meelaha scan-ku khafiifka yahay. Scan › Ka noqo isku-habaynta daruurta dib ugu celinaysaa meeshii ay ku taal markii la furay. Isku-habaynta daruurta muuqaalka kaliya ayay ku guurisaa: ma kaydsana faylka IFC, darbiyadii aad sawirtay way ku sii jiraan meeshoodii. Isku-habaynta waxay la socotaa daruurta markaad beddesho Dhig ama Cutubyada, ama markaad furto moodeel kale. Scan › Muuji goynta qorshaha wuxuu qariyaa ama muujinayaa dhibcaha. Scan-yada waaweyn: qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa ilaa 60,000 oo dhibcood oo goynta ah, muuqaalka 3D-na dhowr milyan oo dhibcood oo daruurta oo dhan ah, labaduba si siman oo scan-ka ka soo kala bixida, sidaas faylka weyn wuu degdegaa. Si aad ugu raacdo qalabka sawirka, isticmaal Ku raac CadCraft ee baarka daruurta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"site-from-civilcraft","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhismayaasha deriska ah iyo dhulka laga qaado CivilCraft","summary":"Qaado dhismayaasha iyo dhulka ay CivilCraft's Cinwaan ilaa goobta ka helay cinwaan ku wareegsan sida talo, oo ku dar kuwa aad calaamayso.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["goobta","cinwaanka","dhulka","deriska","xoogga","civilcraft","ccsite","dhismayaasha","xuduudka goobta","talo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-sameeyaa","text":"Waxa uu sameeyaa","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-isticmaalo","text":"Sida loo isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sameeyaa\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft, Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Cinwaan ilaa goobta wuxuu ka helaa dhismayaasha, dhulka, qorshaha kala qaybinta, aagga daadka iyo ciidda ku wareegsan cinwaan, xog furan. Badhankiisa &quot;U dir BimCraft talo ahaan&quot; (ama &quot;Kaydi goobta fayl ahaan&quot;, kadibna fur \u003Ccode\u003E.ccsite.json\u003C/code\u003E halkan) wuxuu u keenaa BimCraft. Waxba lagu dari maayo ilaa aad sheegto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-isticmaalo\"\u003ESida loo isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow ama fur moodel. Barta cinwaanku waxay ku taal asalka heerka aad ku jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuq wuxuu liistaa dhismo kasta oo deriska ah iyo dhulka oo leh sanduuq calaamad. Ka saar kuwa aanad doonin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhismayaasha aan isha u siin dhererkooda waxay isticmaalaan dhererka lagu qoray sanduuqa sare. Dhismo kaliya oo ay isha u siisay tirada dabaqyadiisa wuxuu u qaataa 3 m dabaq kasta, sanduuqana wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix &quot;Ku dar kuwa la calaameeyay&quot;. Dhismayaashu waxay noqonayaan darbiyo ku wareegsan qaabkooda, sida dherer loo sheegay, hal tallaabo ka noqo. Dhulku wuxuu noqonayaa xuduudka goobta, isagoo tallaabo ka noqo labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKala qaybinta dhulka, aagga daadka iyo ciidda waxaa lagu liisanayaa macluumaad keliya; lama sawiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduudahu waxay ku wanaagsan yihiin sida xogta furan: OpenStreetMap iyo khariidadaha dhulka degmada aad bay ugu kala duwan yihiin meel kasta. Hubi waxa muhiimka ah survey-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBooskuu waa mitir bari iyo waqooyi ka fog barta cinwaanka, oo ku salaysan qiyaas dhul fidsan, saxan dhowr mitir gudaha dhowr kilomitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXogtu waxay leedahay liisanka ilaha ay ka timid (OpenStreetMap waa ODbL); sanduuqu wuxuu muujiyaa khadka aqoonsiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa uu sameeyaa CivilCraft, Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Cinwaan ilaa goobta wuxuu ka helaa dhismayaasha, dhulka, qorshaha kala qaybinta, aagga daadka iyo ciidda ku wareegsan cinwaan, xog furan. Badhankiisa \"U dir BimCraft talo ahaan\" (ama \"Kaydi goobta fayl ahaan\", kadibna fur .ccsite.json halkan) wuxuu u keenaa BimCraft. Waxba lagu dari maayo ilaa aad sheegto. Sida loo isticmaalo Bilow ama fur moodel. Barta cinwaanku waxay ku taal asalka heerka aad ku jirto. Sanduuq wuxuu liistaa dhismo kasta oo deriska ah iyo dhulka oo leh sanduuq calaamad. Ka saar kuwa aanad doonin. Dhismayaasha aan isha u siin dhererkooda waxay isticmaalaan dhererka lagu qoray sanduuqa sare. Dhismo kaliya oo ay isha u siisay tirada dabaqyadiisa wuxuu u qaataa 3 m dabaq kasta, sanduuqana wuu sheegaa. Riix \"Ku dar kuwa la calaameeyay\". Dhismayaashu waxay noqonayaan darbiyo ku wareegsan qaabkooda, sida dherer loo sheegay, hal tallaabo ka noqo. Dhulku wuxuu noqonayaa xuduudka goobta, isagoo tallaabo ka noqo labaad. Kala qaybinta dhulka, aagga daadka iyo ciidda waxaa lagu liisanayaa macluumaad keliya; lama sawiro. Waxa aad ogaataa Xuduudahu waxay ku wanaagsan yihiin sida xogta furan: OpenStreetMap iyo khariidadaha dhulka degmada aad bay ugu kala duwan yihiin meel kasta. Hubi waxa muhiimka ah survey-ka. Booskuu waa mitir bari iyo waqooyi ka fog barta cinwaanka, oo ku salaysan qiyaas dhul fidsan, saxan dhowr mitir gudaha dhowr kilomitir. Xogtu waxay leedahay liisanka ilaha ay ka timid (OpenStreetMap waa ODbL); sanduuqu wuxuu muujiyaa khadka aqoonsiga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"inspect-element","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dooro walax oo akhri sifooyinkeeda","summary":"Guji walax kasta moodeelka 3D ee IFC si aad u iftiimiso oo aad u akhrido magaceeda, nooceeda, tag-keeda, GlobalId, property sets iyo tirooyinkeeda.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["sifooyin","dooro","guji","walax","halbeeg","property sets","pset","tirooyin","globalid","guid","nooc","baadhis"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"gaadhista-walxaha-qarsan","text":"Gaadhista walxaha qarsan","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro walxaha moodeelka IFC oo akhri wixii faylku ku sheegay: astaamaha, property sets, sifooyinka nooca iyo tirooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walax, tusaale albaab. Guji adoon jiidin: jiid ka badan dhowr pixel waxay u rogtaa orbit halkii ay dooran lahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg walaxda: waa la iftiimiyey buluug.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ee midig. Kor ayaa ku qoran nooca walaxda (sida &quot;Door&quot; ama &quot;WallStandardCase&quot;) iyo magaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri block-ka hore: \u003Cstrong\u003EName\u003C/strong\u003E (Magac), \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E (Nooc), \u003Cstrong\u003EObject type\u003C/strong\u003E (Nooca walxda), \u003Cstrong\u003ETag\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDescription\u003C/strong\u003E (Sharaxaad), \u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalId\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELine\u003C/strong\u003E (Safka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos u soo dhaadhac property sets. Saddexda hore waa furan yihiin; guji magaca set kasta oo kale si aad u furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walax kale si aad ugu beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji dhabarka madhan, si aad u nadiifiso xulashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalaxda la iftiimiyey iyo xogteeda midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProperty sets waxay ku kala horreeyaan alifbeetada. Sets-ka ka imanaya \u003Cstrong\u003Enooca\u003C/strong\u003E walaxda waxay magaceeda ku leeyihiin &quot; (type)&quot; iyo qoraalka &quot;Type property: a change here applies to every element of this type.&quot; (Sifo nooca: isbeddel halkan ku dhacaa walax kasta oo nooca ahi.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka (sida dherer, aag iyo mug) waxay ku taal liiska sets-ka, sida kuwa kale. Tirooyinku waa kuwo keli-akhrin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiimayaasha aad beddeli karto waxay u eeg yihiin badhanno. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EBeddel sifooyinka IFC oo keydi nuqul la beddelay\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu tusayaa sida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/properties-panel\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/properties-panel\"\u003EGoobaha panel-ka sifooyinka\u003C/a\u003E ayaa sharxaya goob kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhista-walxaha-qarsan\"\u003EGaadhista walxaha qarsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u gaadho wax dhismaha gudihiisa ku jira, ka saar dabaqyada ka sarreeya liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u gaadho derbi ku jira dhinaca mugga qol, ka damji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walaxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid yar markaad gujinayso.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu taas u qaataa orbit wuuna ma doorto. Gacanta xasilliyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFilashada unugyada dhinaca tirooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Qiimayaashu waxay muuqdaan sida ay faylka ku kaydsan yihiin, oo lagu wareejiyey afar meel-tobnaad, iyada oo aan astaan unug lahayn. Dherer ee dhoofinta metric-ka badanaa waa millimeters ama meters; hubi dejinta dhoofiyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadinta halbeeg magac caadi ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofiyeyaashu magacyada halbeegyada way beddelaan oo waxay u kala soocaan property sets-ka IFC sida \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E. Ka eeg set kasta; halbeegyada gaarka ah badanaa waxay ku jiraan set magaceeda barnaamijka dhoofiya ama shirkadaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFilashada sanduuqa raadinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Guji si aad walax u doorato; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji ayaa dooranaya walxo badan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dooranaya walax kasta oo la muujiyey. Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E ee bidix wuxuu tiraa walxaha nooca kasta oo keliya; ma aha mid la guji karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuji kaadhka faylka mashruuca.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaadhka faylka ma leh walxo la doorto: &quot;Sifooyinka walxaha waxay u baahan yihiin moodeelka 3D. Fur dhoofinta IFC ee faylkan si aad u aragto.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dooro walxaha moodeelka IFC oo akhri wixii faylku ku sheegay: astaamaha, property sets, sifooyinka nooca iyo tirooyinka. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodeel IFC. Guji walax, tusaale albaab. Guji adoon jiidin: jiid ka badan dhowr pixel waxay u rogtaa orbit halkii ay dooran lahayd. Eeg walaxda: waa la iftiimiyey buluug. Eeg panel-ka Sifooyinka ee midig. Kor ayaa ku qoran nooca walaxda (sida \"Door\" ama \"WallStandardCase\") iyo magaceeda. Akhri block-ka hore: Name (Magac), Type (Nooc), Object type (Nooca walxda), Tag, Description (Sharaxaad), GlobalId iyo Line (Safka). Hoos u soo dhaadhac property sets. Saddexda hore waa furan yihiin; guji magaca set kasta oo kale si aad u furto. Guji walax kale si aad ugu beddesho. Taabo Esc, ama guji dhabarka madhan, si aad u nadiifiso xulashada. Waxa aad arki lahayd Walaxda la iftiimiyey iyo xogteeda midig. Property sets waxay ku kala horreeyaan alifbeetada. Sets-ka ka imanaya nooca walaxda waxay magaceeda ku leeyihiin \" (type)\" iyo qoraalka \"Type property: a change here applies to every element of this type.\" (Sifo nooca: isbeddel halkan ku dhacaa walax kasta oo nooca ahi.) Tirooyinka (sida dherer, aag iyo mug) waxay ku taal liiska sets-ka, sida kuwa kale. Tirooyinku waa kuwo keli-akhrin ah. Qiimayaasha aad beddeli karto waxay u eeg yihiin badhanno. Beddel sifooyinka IFC oo keydi nuqul la beddelay wuxuu tusayaa sida. Goobaha panel-ka sifooyinka ayaa sharxaya goob kasta. Gaadhista walxaha qarsan Si aad u gaadho wax dhismaha gudihiisa ku jira, ka saar dabaqyada ka sarreeya liiska Dabaqyada. Si aad u gaadho derbi ku jira dhinaca mugga qol, ka damji Meelaha. Guji walaxda. Khaladaad caadi ah Jiid yar markaad gujinayso. BimCraft wuxuu taas u qaataa orbit wuuna ma doorto. Gacanta xasilliyaan. Filashada unugyada dhinaca tirooyinka. Qiimayaashu waxay muuqdaan sida ay faylka ku kaydsan yihiin, oo lagu wareejiyey afar meel-tobnaad, iyada oo aan astaan unug lahayn. Dherer ee dhoofinta metric-ka badanaa waa millimeters ama meters; hubi dejinta dhoofiyaha. Raadinta halbeeg magac caadi ah. Dhoofiyeyaashu magacyada halbeegyada way beddelaan oo waxay u kala soocaan property sets-ka IFC sida Pset_WallCommon. Ka eeg set kasta; halbeegyada gaarka ah badanaa waxay ku jiraan set magaceeda barnaamijka dhoofiya ama shirkadaada. Filashada sanduuqa raadinta. Guji si aad walax u doorato; Ctrl+guji ama Shift+guji ayaa dooranaya walxo badan, Ctrl+A ayaa dooranaya walax kasta oo la muujiyey. Liiska Walxaha ee bidix wuxuu tiraa walxaha nooca kasta oo keliya; ma aha mid la guji karo. Guji kaadhka faylka mashruuca. Kaadhka faylka ma leh walxo la doorto: \"Sifooyinka walxaha waxay u baahan yihiin moodeelka 3D. Fur dhoofinta IFC ee faylkan si aad u aragto.\"","lang":"so"},{"slug":"clash-check","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka raadi isku-dhacyada","summary":"Hel meelaha laba kooxood oo walxood isku dhacaan, sida tuubooyinka ka gudbaya biimaha, derbiyada oo galaya sagxadaha, hal moodel ama dhowr moodel dhexdooda, oo leh cidla, oo isku-dhac u beddel dhibaato.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["isku-dhac","ogaanshaha isku-dhaca","hubinta isku-dhaca","isku-dhac adag","faragelin","dhacid","isku-xirnaan","isku-dul-marka","cidla","mep","qaab-dhismeed"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHel meelaha laba kooxood oo walxood isku dhacaan, tusaale ahaan wax kasta oo ku jira moodelka adeegyada iyo kuwa qaab-dhismaha, kadibna eeg isku-dhac kasta oo kuwa muhiimka ahna sida dhibaatooyin u hay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC, oo kuwa kale ku dar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodel…\u003C/span\u003E haddii aad isku-dhac ka hubinayso dhowr moodel. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EEeg dhowr moodel IFC oo wada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta isku-dhaca\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca bidix ee panelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo horjeeda\u003C/span\u003E, dooro laba kooxood: walxaha aad doorateen, fasal (moodelada furan oo dhan), kooxda raadinta la kaydiyay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003ERaadi walxaha fasal, magac ama hanti\u003C/a\u003E), ama wax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji inta isku-dul-marka ah ee aad iska indho-tirtid, mitir. 0.01 wuxuu iska indho-tirtaa walxaha kaliya isku dhegaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow\u003C/span\u003E. Hubintu waxay ku socotaa asalka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E way joojisaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji natiijo si aad u aragto: laba walxood waa la doortaa oo la muujiyaa, wax kale oo dhan waa si cad loo arkaa, aragtiina waxay ku dhowaanaysaa iyaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig dhibaato\u003C/span\u003E hoosta natiijo si aad u qorto tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka iyo faylalka BCF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhacyada oo la liistay, magacyada labada walxood (iyo faylalkooda marka moodello badan oo furan yihiin), iyo inta ay ku dul-marayaan, kan ugu qoto-dheer marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha kaliya isku taabta, sida derbi saaran sagxad ama albaab ku jirta godkeeda, isku-dhac ma aha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETani waa hubin isku-dhac adag oo fudud: walxaha dusheeda isku gudbaya. Walx si buuxda ugu jira mid kale (tusaale, tuubo ku qarsoon derbi) weli lama helo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQotodheerku waa intee ka mid ah xadka labada walxood ee isku dul maraan ugu yar: hagid ah, ma aha cabbir sax ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ECabbir masaafooyin, dusha ballaadhka iyo meelaha 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, go&#039;ii iyo arki walxaha si cad\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Hel meelaha laba kooxood oo walxood isku dhacaan, tusaale ahaan wax kasta oo ku jira moodelka adeegyada iyo kuwa qaab-dhismaha, kadibna eeg isku-dhac kasta oo kuwa muhiimka ahna sida dhibaatooyin u hay. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC, oo kuwa kale ku dar Ku dar moodel… haddii aad isku-dhac ka hubinayso dhowr moodel. Eeg Eeg dhowr moodel IFC oo wada. Fur Hubinta isku-dhaca dhinaca bidix ee panelka. Ku Hubi iyo Ka soo horjeeda, dooro laba kooxood: walxaha aad doorateen, fasal (moodelada furan oo dhan), kooxda raadinta la kaydiyay (eeg Raadi walxaha fasal, magac ama hanti), ama wax kasta. Deji inta isku-dul-marka ah ee aad iska indho-tirtid, mitir. 0.01 wuxuu iska indho-tirtaa walxaha kaliya isku dhegaya. Guji Bilow. Hubintu waxay ku socotaa asalka; Jooji way joojisaa. Guji natiijo si aad u aragto: laba walxood waa la doortaa oo la muujiyaa, wax kale oo dhan waa si cad loo arkaa, aragtiina waxay ku dhowaanaysaa iyaga. Guji Ka dhig dhibaato hoosta natiijo si aad u qorto tab-ka Dhibaatooyin. Eeg Dhibaatooyinka iyo faylalka BCF. Waxa aad arki doontaa Isku-dhacyada oo la liistay, magacyada labada walxood (iyo faylalkooda marka moodello badan oo furan yihiin), iyo inta ay ku dul-marayaan, kan ugu qoto-dheer marka hore. Dusha kaliya isku taabta, sida derbi saaran sagxad ama albaab ku jirta godkeeda, isku-dhac ma aha. Wax la xiriira Tani waa hubin isku-dhac adag oo fudud: walxaha dusheeda isku gudbaya. Walx si buuxda ugu jira mid kale (tusaale, tuubo ku qarsoon derbi) weli lama helo. Qotodheerku waa intee ka mid ah xadka labada walxood ee isku dul maraan ugu yar: hagid ah, ma aha cabbir sax ah. Xiga Cabbir masaafooyin, dusha ballaadhka iyo meelaha 3D Qari, go'ii iyo arki walxaha si cad","lang":"so"},{"slug":"floors-by-outline-and-ramps","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sagxadaha qaab kasta, furyaha iyo rambooyinka","summary":"Sagxad ama shub ku sawir sida jidkiisa (balakoon, cantilever, sagxad dhexe), ku jar furyo gudihiisa, oo rambooyin ku sawir sagxadahooda.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["sagxad","shub","jid","balakoon","cantilever","sagxad dhexe","dekis","fur sagxad","god","gaadh","bannaan","rambo","janjeer","rambo la heli karo","rambo kursi-curyaan","1:12","IfcRamp","IfcSlab"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"sagxad-ku-sawir-jidkiisa","text":"Sagxad ku sawir jidkiisa","level":2},{"id":"fur-jar","text":"Fur jar","level":2},{"id":"rambo-ku-sawir","text":"Rambo ku sawir","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee sagxado aan raacin qolalka, sida balakoon ka baxsan derbiyada, oo ku sawir rambooyin u dhexeeya dabaqyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxad-ku-sawir-jidkiisa\"\u003ESagxad ku sawir jidkiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, dooro dabaqa, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESagxad jid ku sawir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka hoosta qalabka, dooro qaabka (shub sagxad ama sagxad alwaax ah), isticmaalkiisa (sagxad ama sagxad dhexe), dhumucdiisa iyo intee ka sarreysa dabaqa (0 = isku heer sagxadda dabaqa; qiimo taban wuxuu dejiyaa hoos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha. Qalabku wuxuu ku dhegaa derbiyada, khadadka gridka iyo isgoyskooda; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u haysato geeso toosan. Dherer kasta oo geesle ah iyo aagga ayaa muuqda intaad socoto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u qaadaa geesta ugu dambeysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer guji, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhamayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-jar\"\u003EFur jar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji sagxadda (aragga 3D, ama jidkeeda qorshaha), kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E oo guji geesaha furka gudaha sagxadda, adiga oo dhammeeynaya sida kor. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E sagxadda waxay liistaa furyaheeda, mid kasta leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E, iyo aagiisa oo aan lahayn furyaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rambo-ku-sawir\"\u003ERambo ku sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERambo\u003C/span\u003E. Ballacdeeda deji, iyo in ay u kacdo \u003Cstrong\u003Edabaqa ka sarreeya\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ekor u kac\u003C/strong\u003E aad qortid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sida loo dejiyo: \u003Cstrong\u003Ejanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E (1:12 bilow; rambadu dheer tahay sida kor-u-kacu u baahan yahay) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer\u003C/strong\u003E (guji labaad wuxuu dejinayaa dheerka, janjeerkuna wuu raacaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji cagta rambada (dhexda geeska hoose), kadibna guji jihada kor. Hordhigu wuxuu muujinayaa dherkeeda, kor-u-kacyadeeda iyo janjeerkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKor-u-kac ka weyn 30 inch (760 mm) waxaa loo kala qaybiyaa kor-u-kacyo, iyadoo u dhexeeya sagxad dhexe oo 5-foot (1525 mm) ah. Kuwani waa qiyamyo qorshaynta caadiga ah, ma aha xeerkaaga: hubi xeerarka meesha aad dhisayso. Rambo ka dheer 1:12 waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESagxad kasta, fur kasta iyo rambo kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dib u qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha, jidka sagxadda la sawiray (furku waa la sawiraa isgoysan), iyo jidka rambada, kor-u-kacyadeeda, sagxadaha dhexe iyo fal kor u tilmaamaya oo janjeerkiisa leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E sagxadda la sawiray (qaabka, isticmaalka, dhumucda, sare, aagga, furyaha) iyo rambada (ballac, sare, kor, janjeer ama dherer); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mid kasta ayuu tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERambo ka dhex dhig dabaqa ka sarreeya ayaa raacda dabaqaas marka joogtiisa beddelanto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC: sagxadda la sawiray waa shub (IfcSlab, sagxad ama sagxad dhexe) oo furyaheeda la jaray (IfcOpeningElement); rambo waa IfcRamp oo ka kooban kor-u-kacyo janjeer leh (IfcRampFlight) iyo sagxadaha dhexe, oo janjeerkeeda iyo ballacheeda leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESagxadaha lagu sawiro habkan waxay ku sii jiraan meeshii aad ku sawirtay. Sagxadaha lagu sameeyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESagxad\u003C/span\u003E waxay raacaan qolalka marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EQolalka, sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee sagxado aan raacin qolalka, sida balakoon ka baxsan derbiyada, oo ku sawir rambooyin u dhexeeya dabaqyada. Sagxad ku sawir jidkiisa Shid Sawir, dooro dabaqa, kadibna Dhismaha › Sagxad jid ku sawir. Safka hoosta qalabka, dooro qaabka (shub sagxad ama sagxad alwaax ah), isticmaalkiisa (sagxad ama sagxad dhexe), dhumucdiisa iyo intee ka sarreysa dabaqa (0 = isku heer sagxadda dabaqa; qiimo taban wuxuu dejiyaa hoos). Guji geesaha. Qalabku wuxuu ku dhegaa derbiyada, khadadka gridka iyo isgoyskooda; hay Shift si aad u haysato geeso toosan. Dherer kasta oo geesle ah iyo aagga ayaa muuqda intaad socoto. Backspace wuxuu dib u qaadaa geesta ugu dambeysa. Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, laba jeer guji, ama taabo Enter si aad u dhamayso. Fur jar Guji sagxadda (aragga 3D, ama jidkeeda qorshaha), kadibna Sifooyinka guji Ku dar fur oo guji geesaha furka gudaha sagxadda, adiga oo dhammeeynaya sida kor. Sifooyinka sagxadda waxay liistaa furyaheeda, mid kasta leh Tirtir, iyo aagiisa oo aan lahayn furyaha. Rambo ku sawir Dooro Dhismaha › Rambo. Ballacdeeda deji, iyo in ay u kacdo dabaqa ka sarreeya ama kor u kac aad qortid. Dooro sida loo dejiyo: janjeer (1:12 bilow; rambadu dheer tahay sida kor-u-kacu u baahan yahay) ama dherer (guji labaad wuxuu dejinayaa dheerka, janjeerkuna wuu raacaa). Guji cagta rambada (dhexda geeska hoose), kadibna guji jihada kor. Hordhigu wuxuu muujinayaa dherkeeda, kor-u-kacyadeeda iyo janjeerkeeda. Kor-u-kac ka weyn 30 inch (760 mm) waxaa loo kala qaybiyaa kor-u-kacyo, iyadoo u dhexeeya sagxad dhexe oo 5-foot (1525 mm) ah. Kuwani waa qiyamyo qorshaynta caadiga ah, ma aha xeerkaaga: hubi xeerarka meesha aad dhisayso. Rambo ka dheer 1:12 waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa Sifooyinkeeda. Waxa aad arki doontid Sagxad kasta, fur kasta iyo rambo kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu dib u qaadaa. Qorshaha, jidka sagxadda la sawiray (furku waa la sawiraa isgoysan), iyo jidka rambada, kor-u-kacyadeeda, sagxadaha dhexe iyo fal kor u tilmaamaya oo janjeerkiisa leh. Sifooyinka sagxadda la sawiray (qaabka, isticmaalka, dhumucda, sare, aagga, furyaha) iyo rambada (ballac, sare, kor, janjeer ama dherer); Delete mid kasta ayuu tirtiraa. Rambo ka dhex dhig dabaqa ka sarreeya ayaa raacda dabaqaas marka joogtiisa beddelanto. Faylka IFC: sagxadda la sawiray waa shub (IfcSlab, sagxad ama sagxad dhexe) oo furyaheeda la jaray (IfcOpeningElement); rambo waa IfcRamp oo ka kooban kor-u-kacyo janjeer leh (IfcRampFlight) iyo sagxadaha dhexe, oo janjeerkeeda iyo ballacheeda leh. Sagxadaha lagu sawiro habkan waxay ku sii jiraan meeshii aad ku sawirtay. Sagxadaha lagu sameeyo Sagxad waxay raacaan qolalka marka derbiyadu dhaqaaqaan: eeg Qolalka, sagxadaha, soohda iyo saqafyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"walk","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku soco moodel","summary":"Ku soco moodel IFC dhererka indhaha adigoo isticmaalaya kiiboodhka, iyada oo jiidista dhulka kuu hayso dhulka oo darbiyadu kaa joojiyaan.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["soco","ku soco","qof-koowaad","duulid","dhaqaaq","dhererka indhaha","jiidista dhulka","ku dhacid","wasd","gudaha","safar"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka u eeg sida qof gudihiisa taagan: ku soco xariiq, gal qol, ka kor tag jaranjar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix dhulka meesha aad rabto inaad taagto. Halkaas waxaad taagan tahay indhahaagana waxay ku yaalliin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEye height\u003C/span\u003E (1.6 m marka hore, waxaana lagu muujiyaa oo lagu qoraa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay: 5&#039;-3&quot; feet iyo inji, 1600 millimitir; tiro kaliya wuxuu ku jiraa cutubkaas, ama qor cutub sida 1.8 m), adigoo eegaya dhinaca uu muuqaalku eegayay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaqaaq \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama furayaasha fallaadha. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u socoto dhakhso. Ku jiid muuqaalka si aad u eegto wareeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E si aad u joojiso. Muuqaalku wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad joogtay, diyaar u ah wareegga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay kugu hayn doontaa dhulka hoosta adiga, waxayna kugu qaadi doontaa tallaabooyinka iyo jaranjarada. Demi si aad u dheceto: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa kor u kacda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa hoos u dhacda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoog darbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaa joojiyaa ka hor darbiyada, albaabyada iyo wax kasta oo jid ku ah, wuxuuna kuu ogolaanayaa inaad ku dhex-jiido. Demi si aad uga soco.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha qarsoon iyo kuwa dhex-arag ahi, iyo wixii goynta ka saarto, ma joojiyaan adiga, lamana taagi karo kuwaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba ma dhacayo markaan riixo W.\u003C/strong\u003E Furayaashu waxay u gudbayaan sanduuqa aad ku qorayso: marka hore riix muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaan ku dhacay masaafo dheer.\u003C/strong\u003E Meeshaas dhul hoose ma jirin (furitaan, ama dhulku waa qarsoon). Demi jiidista dhulka, ama bilow dabaq ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kali-ah iyo dhex-arag walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoy moodel IFC qorshe goyn\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Moodelka u eeg sida qof gudihiisa taagan: ku soco xariiq, gal qol, ka kor tag jaranjar. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC oo riix Walk qalabka sare. Riix dhulka meesha aad rabto inaad taagto. Halkaas waxaad taagan tahay indhahaagana waxay ku yaalliin Eye height (1.6 m marka hore, waxaana lagu muujiyaa oo lagu qoraa Units aad dooratay: 5'-3\" feet iyo inji, 1600 millimitir; tiro kaliya wuxuu ku jiraa cutubkaas, ama qor cutub sida 1.8 m), adigoo eegaya dhinaca uu muuqaalku eegayay. Ku dhaqaaq W A S D ama furayaasha fallaadha. Hay Shift si aad u socoto dhakhso. Ku jiid muuqaalka si aad u eegto wareeg. Riix Esc ama riix Done si aad u joojiso. Muuqaalku wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad joogtay, diyaar u ah wareegga. Waxa aad arki doontid Jiidista dhulka waxay kugu hayn doontaa dhulka hoosta adiga, waxayna kugu qaadi doontaa tallaabooyinka iyo jaranjarada. Demi si aad u dheceto: E ama Page Up ayaa kor u kacda, Q ama Page Down ayaa hoos u dhacda. Joog darbiyada wuxuu kaa joojiyaa ka hor darbiyada, albaabyada iyo wax kasta oo jid ku ah, wuxuuna kuu ogolaanayaa inaad ku dhex-jiido. Demi si aad uga soco. Walxaha qarsoon iyo kuwa dhex-arag ahi, iyo wixii goynta ka saarto, ma joojiyaan adiga, lamana taagi karo kuwaas. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Waxba ma dhacayo markaan riixo W. Furayaashu waxay u gudbayaan sanduuqa aad ku qorayso: marka hore riix muuqaalka. Waxaan ku dhacay masaafo dheer. Meeshaas dhul hoose ma jirin (furitaan, ama dhulku waa qarsoon). Demi jiidista dhulka, ama bilow dabaq ka. Xiga Qari, kali-ah iyo dhex-arag walxaha Goy moodel IFC qorshe goyn","lang":"so"},{"slug":"grids-and-columns","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shabakadaha iyo tiirarka","summary":"Samee khadadka shabakadda oo leh goobooyin lambar iyo xaraf leh, masaafo ahaan ama mid mid, darbiyada iyo tiirarka ku sawir khadadkaas, oo ku arag qorshayaasha, muuqaallada dhinac iyo goynta.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["shabakad","shabakadaha","khadka shabakadda","dhidib","dhidibbada","goob","shabakadda qaab-dhismeed","1 2 3","A B C","tiir","tiirarka","post","qabso","IfcGrid","IfcColumn"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"dhig-shabakad-oo-dhan","text":"Dhig shabakad oo dhan","level":2},{"id":"khad-shabakad-mid-mid-ah-sawir","text":"Khad shabakad mid mid ah sawir","level":2},{"id":"beddel-khad-shabakad","text":"Beddel khad shabakad","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-sawirka-ku-raac-shabakadda","text":"Qalabka sawirka ku raac shabakadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig dhismaha shabakad, kadibna sawir darbiyada oo dhig tiirarka khadadkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-shabakad-oo-dhan\"\u003EDhig shabakad oo dhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad dheji…\u003C/span\u003E. Sheeg tirada \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhadadka lambarka leh\u003C/strong\u003E (1, 2, 3…) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhadadka xarfaha leh\u003C/strong\u003E (A, B, C…) aad rabto, iyo inta ay u dhexeeyaan. Geli hal masaafo, ama dhowr oo ay kala soociyaan commas, si loo helo qaybo aan isku mid ahayn (tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E20&#039;, 24&#039;, 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhaafa xariiqyada ugu dambeeya\u003C/span\u003E waa intee ka dheer khad kasta uga baxdo khadadka nooca kale ee dibadda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareegsan (darajo)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa shabakadda oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji meesha isgoyska ugu horreeya (1 / A) ku yaal. Hordhacu wuxuu raacaa curiyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka lambarka leh waxay ku socdaan qorshaha sare, waana loo kala fogeeyaa dhinaca qorshaha; khadadka xarfaha leh waxay ku socdaan qorshaha dhinac ahaan, waana loo kala fogeeyaa sare. Xarfaha I iyo O waa ka saaraa, sida qorshayaasha, si aan loogu akhrin sida 1 iyo 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khad-shabakad-mid-mid-ah-sawir\"\u003EKhad shabakad mid mid ah sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E la shido, guji meesha khadku ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Wuxuu helaa calaamadda xiga ee khadadka uu ku socdo (ka dib 3 waxay timaadaa 4; ka dib B waxay timaadaa C). Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-khad-shabakad\"\u003EBeddel khad shabakad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E la shido, guji khadka si aad u doorato. Ku qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/span\u003E cusub oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir xariiqan\u003C/span\u003E (ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobooyin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa goobooyinka labada dhinacba, bilowga ama dhammaadka khad kasta, ama meel ma dhigo. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqdiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-sawirka-ku-raac-shabakadda\"\u003EQalabka sawirka ku raac shabakadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E, qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiir\u003C/span\u003E iyo qalabyada kale ee sawirka ayaa ku qabsada khadadka shabakadda iyo meelaha ay isgoyaan (calaamadda qabsashada waa goob yar oo leh xarig gudbaya).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiir\u003C/span\u003E, xulo qaabka (afar-geesle ama wareeg), cabbirka, iyo in tiirku ku socdo \u003Cstrong\u003Edabaqa kor ku xiga\u003C/strong\u003E ama dhererka go&#039;an, kadibna guji. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsgoyska shabakad kasta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa tiir isgoy kasta oo aan hore u lahayn. Guji tiir si aad u beddesho qaabkiisa, cabbirkiisa ama dhererkiisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E ku jira; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka saaraa. Tiirarka ku socda dabaqa kor ku xiga waxay raacaan dabaqaas marka dhererkiisa isbeddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShabakadda qorshaha dabaq kasta, oo leh goob iyo calaamaddeeda labada dhinac khad kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadadka shabakadda ee xaashiyada qoraalka: qorshayaasha, iyo muuqaallada dhinac iyo goynta meelaha khadku si toos ah loo arko, goobadooduna ay kor ku taalla dhismaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EMuuqaallada dhinac, goynta iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC: hal shabakad oo dhismaha (IfcGrid, khadadkeeda lambarka leh hal liis ku jira, khadadka xarfaha leh liis kale), iyo tiirarka sida IfcColumn leh cabbirkooda, dhererkooda iyo tirooyinkooda. Barnaamijyada BIM ee kale labaduba way muujiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShabakad ka timid fayl barnaamij kale waa la muujiyaa, qalabyadana way ku qabsadaan, laakiin khadadkeeda halkan lama beddeli karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhig dhismaha shabakad, kadibna sawir darbiyada oo dhig tiirarka khadadkeeda. Dhig shabakad oo dhan Shido Sawir, kadibna dooro Dhismaha › Shabakad. Guji Shabakad dheji…. Sheeg tirada khadadka lambarka leh (1, 2, 3…) iyo khadadka xarfaha leh (A, B, C…) aad rabto, iyo inta ay u dhexeeyaan. Geli hal masaafo, ama dhowr oo ay kala soociyaan commas, si loo helo qaybo aan isku mid ahayn (tusaale 20', 24', 20'). Ka dhaafa xariiqyada ugu dambeeya waa intee ka dheer khad kasta uga baxdo khadadka nooca kale ee dibadda, Wareegsan (darajo) wuxuu wareejiyaa shabakadda oo dhan. Guji Dhig, kadibna guji meesha isgoyska ugu horreeya (1 / A) ku yaal. Hordhacu wuxuu raacaa curiyaha. Khadadka lambarka leh waxay ku socdaan qorshaha sare, waana loo kala fogeeyaa dhinaca qorshaha; khadadka xarfaha leh waxay ku socdaan qorshaha dhinac ahaan, waana loo kala fogeeyaa sare. Xarfaha I iyo O waa ka saaraa, sida qorshayaasha, si aan loogu akhrin sida 1 iyo 0. Khad shabakad mid mid ah sawir Markii Shabakad la shido, guji meesha khadku ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Wuxuu helaa calaamadda xiga ee khadadka uu ku socdo (ka dib 3 waxay timaadaa 4; ka dib B waxay timaadaa C). Taabo Esc si aad u joojiso. Beddel khad shabakad Markii Shabakad la shido, guji khadka si aad u doorato. Ku qor Calaamad cusub oo taabo Enter, ama guji Tirtir xariiqan (ama taabo Delete). Goobooyin wuxuu dhigaa goobooyinka labada dhinacba, bilowga ama dhammaadka khad kasta, ama meel ma dhigo. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqdiya. Qalabka sawirka ku raac shabakadda Qalabka Darbi, qalabka Tiir iyo qalabyada kale ee sawirka ayaa ku qabsada khadadka shabakadda iyo meelaha ay isgoyaan (calaamadda qabsashada waa goob yar oo leh xarig gudbaya). Tiirarka: dooro Dhismaha › Tiir, xulo qaabka (afar-geesle ama wareeg), cabbirka, iyo in tiirku ku socdo dabaqa kor ku xiga ama dhererka go'an, kadibna guji. Isgoyska shabakad kasta wuxuu dhigaa tiir isgoy kasta oo aan hore u lahayn. Guji tiir si aad u beddesho qaabkiisa, cabbirkiisa ama dhererkiisa Sifooyinka ku jira; Delete ayaa ka saaraa. Tiirarka ku socda dabaqa kor ku xiga waxay raacaan dabaqaas marka dhererkiisa isbeddelo. Waxa aad arki lahayd Shabakadda qorshaha dabaq kasta, oo leh goob iyo calaamaddeeda labada dhinac khad kasta. Khadadka shabakadda ee xaashiyada qoraalka: qorshayaasha, iyo muuqaallada dhinac iyo goynta meelaha khadku si toos ah loo arko, goobadooduna ay kor ku taalla dhismaha. Eeg Muuqaallada dhinac, goynta iyo xaashiyada. Faylka IFC: hal shabakad oo dhismaha (IfcGrid, khadadkeeda lambarka leh hal liis ku jira, khadadka xarfaha leh liis kale), iyo tiirarka sida IfcColumn leh cabbirkooda, dhererkooda iyo tirooyinkooda. Barnaamijyada BIM ee kale labaduba way muujiyaan. Shabakad ka timid fayl barnaamij kale waa la muujiyaa, qalabyadana way ku qabsadaan, laakiin khadadkeeda halkan lama beddeli karo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"clash-fixes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xalli isku-dhacyada hagaajinta kala-takhasus kasta","summary":"Natiijooyinka isku-dhaca, Soo jeedi hagaajin wuxuu liistaa isku-dhac kasta waxa kala-takhasus kasta ka samayn karo, sida tuubo hoos loo wareejiyo biimaha, tuubo dhinac loo riddo, tiir la dhaqaajiyo, ama god biimaha ku jira. Mid walba waxa lagu tijaabiyaa nuqul moodelka ah oo leh is-dhaafsigiisa, si aad aqbasho ama diido. Hagaajinada la aqbalay waxay ku dhigmaan hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["isku-dhac","hagaajinta isku-dhaca","xalli isku-dhacyada","xalli isku-dhacyada","isku-xirnaan","soo jeedi hagaajin","dib u wareejin","wareejin","dhinac-u-rid","tuubada hawada","tuubo","saxan","biim","tiir","god","muruq","is-dhaafsi","kala-takhasus","qaab-dhismeed","mikaanig","biyo-dhigga","korontada","naqshadeynta","caawiye"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kala-takhasus-kasta-samayn-karo","text":"Waxa kala-takhasus kasta samayn karo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhacyada liistada ku beddel go&#039;aano. Kala-takhasus kasta (qaab-dhismeed, mikaanig, biyo-dhigga, korontada, naqshadeynta) wuxuu soo jeedinayaa hagaajin walxaha kaliya u gaar ah, hagaajin kasta waxa lagu hubiyaa nuqul moodel ah, adna waad doortaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore samee hubinta isku-dhaca. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EKa raadi isku-dhacyada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaab-dhismaha ka soo horjeeda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta natiijooyinka, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo jeedi hagaajin\u003C/span\u003E. Panelka \u003Cstrong\u003EHagaajinta la soo jeediyay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka furmaa moodelka dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhac kasta waxaad aragtaa soo jeedinta kala-takhasus kasta, kan ugu wanaagsan marka hore. Sadar kasta wuxuu sheegaa waxa uu sameeyo iyo is-dhaafsigiisa: haddii uu isku-dhaca xallinayo, inta isku-dhac cusub uu abuurayo, xeerarka uu jebinayo, inta jidka uu kordhinayo ama inta uu u dhaqaajinayo, inta fittings-ka, iyo dhibcaha kharashka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E si aad walxaha 3D ugu aragto. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAqbal\u003C/span\u003E hagaajinta aad rabto (mid isku-dhac kasta), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa waxa hagaajinadaada la aqbalay wada sameeyaan: inta isku-dhac la xalliyay, inta hadhay, iyo haddii wax cusub isku dhacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaq hagaajinta la aqbalay (hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah)\u003C/span\u003E. Hubinta isku-dhaca mar kale ayaa socota. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammaantood mar mid ah dib u celinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kala-takhasus-kasta-samayn-karo\"\u003EWaxa kala-takhasus kasta samayn karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMikaanigga\u003C/strong\u003E (tuubooyinka hawada, kulaynta iyo qabowga): wareejinta hoos ama dul ee cagta isku dhacda, kor u qaadista ama hoos u dhigista jidka oo dhan, u wareejinta dhinac, iyo tuubada hawada ee taxan u dhig mid ballac weyn oo isla cabbirka dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-dhigga\u003C/strong\u003E (biyaha, dhulka-biyaha, gaaska, dabka): isla dhaqdhaqaaqyada, marka laga reebo dhulka-biyaha dhaadhaca oo aan waligiis wareejin lahayn; waxa keliya oo dhan loo dhaqaajin karaa, iyada oo ilaalinaysa dhaadheeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKorontada\u003C/strong\u003E (saxanka kaabbleyaasha iyo tuubada): isla dhaqdhaqaaqyada; saxanku waa inuu ilaaliyo 150 mm banaanka sare si kaabbleyaasha loo dhigo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-dhismeedka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhaqaaji tiirka (ilaa 300 mm), ama god ku jira bayga biimaha ama sagxadda jidka u gudbaya. Hagaajin kasta oo qaab-dhismeed waxa ansixiya injineerka qaab-dhismeedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadeynta\u003C/strong\u003E: muruq ku jira derbiga jidka u gudbaya, ama dhaqaajinta derbi loo yaqaan inuusan culays qaadin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaajinada jebiya xeer waa la calaamadiyay: ka dhow 25 mm oo kala-dhexaad ah wax kale, ka hoosaysa 2,100 mm oo dhererka madaxa, god bayga biimaha oo ka weyn 40% qotodheer biimaha ama ku dhow darafyadiisa, biim span-kiisa u beddelan doonta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaajinada BimCraft ku samayn karo waxa lagu dabaqaa moodelka: jidadka aad ku sawirtay qalabka Pipe iyo Duct, iyo tiirarka aad sawirtay. Kuwa kale waxay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003ETalo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E: aqbalidda waxay ku dartaa dhibaato tab-ka Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaajinadu waxay ka yimaadaan xeerar dhisan oo ku jira app-ka; AI lama isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad caawiye ku xidho (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EOgolow caawiye AI inuu la shaqeeyo moodelkaaga\u003C/a\u003E), wuxuu akhrin karaa isku-dhacyada oo wuxuu ku dari karaa soo jeedinadiisa kala-takhasus keliya panelka furan. Waxa lagu hubiyaa si isku mid ah, waxa lagu calaamadiyaa magaca caawiyaha, oo waxba ma beddelmayo ilaa aad aqbasho oo dabaqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka waxa lagu hubiyaa sanduuqyo ku wareegsan walx kasta iyo jid kasta, sidaas darteed jid u janjeera wuxuu muujin karaa isku-dhac uusan hubinta isku-dhaca ogaan. Dabaqitaan kadib mar kale hubinta isku-dhaca samee: waa kan ugu dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXadka (inta jidku u dhaqaaji karo, intee sare buu u kor kici karaa, iyo masaafada) waa qiimaha caadiga ah ee lagu qoray panelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka iyo faylalka BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003ESawir jidadka tuubada iyo tuubada hawada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Isku-dhacyada liistada ku beddel go'aano. Kala-takhasus kasta (qaab-dhismeed, mikaanig, biyo-dhigga, korontada, naqshadeynta) wuxuu soo jeedinayaa hagaajin walxaha kaliya u gaar ah, hagaajin kasta waxa lagu hubiyaa nuqul moodel ah, adna waad doortaa. Tallaabooyin Marka hore samee hubinta isku-dhaca. Eeg Ka raadi isku-dhacyada iyo Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaab-dhismaha ka soo horjeeda. Hoosta natiijooyinka, guji Soo jeedi hagaajin. Panelka Hagaajinta la soo jeediyay wuxuu ka furmaa moodelka dhinac. Isku-dhac kasta waxaad aragtaa soo jeedinta kala-takhasus kasta, kan ugu wanaagsan marka hore. Sadar kasta wuxuu sheegaa waxa uu sameeyo iyo is-dhaafsigiisa: haddii uu isku-dhaca xallinayo, inta isku-dhac cusub uu abuurayo, xeerarka uu jebinayo, inta jidka uu kordhinayo ama inta uu u dhaqaajinayo, inta fittings-ka, iyo dhibcaha kharashka. Guji Muuji si aad walxaha 3D ugu aragto. Guji Aqbal hagaajinta aad rabto (mid isku-dhac kasta), ama Diid. Sadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa waxa hagaajinadaada la aqbalay wada sameeyaan: inta isku-dhac la xalliyay, inta hadhay, iyo haddii wax cusub isku dhacaan. Guji Dabaq hagaajinta la aqbalay (hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah). Hubinta isku-dhaca mar kale ayaa socota. Ka noqo wuxuu dhammaantood mar mid ah dib u celinayaa. Waxa kala-takhasus kasta samayn karo Mikaanigga (tuubooyinka hawada, kulaynta iyo qabowga): wareejinta hoos ama dul ee cagta isku dhacda, kor u qaadista ama hoos u dhigista jidka oo dhan, u wareejinta dhinac, iyo tuubada hawada ee taxan u dhig mid ballac weyn oo isla cabbirka dusha. Biyo-dhigga (biyaha, dhulka-biyaha, gaaska, dabka): isla dhaqdhaqaaqyada, marka laga reebo dhulka-biyaha dhaadhaca oo aan waligiis wareejin lahayn; waxa keliya oo dhan loo dhaqaajin karaa, iyada oo ilaalinaysa dhaadheeda. Korontada (saxanka kaabbleyaasha iyo tuubada): isla dhaqdhaqaaqyada; saxanku waa inuu ilaaliyo 150 mm banaanka sare si kaabbleyaasha loo dhigo. Qaab-dhismeedka: dhaqaaji tiirka (ilaa 300 mm), ama god ku jira bayga biimaha ama sagxadda jidka u gudbaya. Hagaajin kasta oo qaab-dhismeed waxa ansixiya injineerka qaab-dhismeedka. Naqshadeynta: muruq ku jira derbiga jidka u gudbaya, ama dhaqaajinta derbi loo yaqaan inuusan culays qaadin. Waxa aad arki doontaa Hagaajinada jebiya xeer waa la calaamadiyay: ka dhow 25 mm oo kala-dhexaad ah wax kale, ka hoosaysa 2,100 mm oo dhererka madaxa, god bayga biimaha oo ka weyn 40% qotodheer biimaha ama ku dhow darafyadiisa, biim span-kiisa u beddelan doonta. Hagaajinada BimCraft ku samayn karo waxa lagu dabaqaa moodelka: jidadka aad ku sawirtay qalabka Pipe iyo Duct, iyo tiirarka aad sawirtay. Kuwa kale waxay leeyihiin Talo keliya: aqbalidda waxay ku dartaa dhibaato tab-ka Dhibaatooyinka. Wax la xiriira Hagaajinadu waxay ka yimaadaan xeerar dhisan oo ku jira app-ka; AI lama isticmaalo. Haddii aad caawiye ku xidho (eeg Ogolow caawiye AI inuu la shaqeeyo moodelkaaga), wuxuu akhrin karaa isku-dhacyada oo wuxuu ku dari karaa soo jeedinadiisa kala-takhasus keliya panelka furan. Waxa lagu hubiyaa si isku mid ah, waxa lagu calaamadiyaa magaca caawiyaha, oo waxba ma beddelmayo ilaa aad aqbasho oo dabaqdo. Nuqulka waxa lagu hubiyaa sanduuqyo ku wareegsan walx kasta iyo jid kasta, sidaas darteed jid u janjeera wuxuu muujin karaa isku-dhac uusan hubinta isku-dhaca ogaan. Dabaqitaan kadib mar kale hubinta isku-dhaca samee: waa kan ugu dambeeya. Xadka (inta jidku u dhaqaaji karo, intee sare buu u kor kici karaa, iyo masaafada) waa qiimaha caadiga ah ee lagu qoray panelka. Xiga Dhibaatooyinka iyo faylalka BCF Sawir jidadka tuubada iyo tuubada hawada","lang":"so"},{"slug":"walls-from-a-drawing","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Darbiyada naqshad la raad-raacay","summary":"Qorshe DWG ama DXF ah u beddel darbiyo, albaabyo iyo daaqado heer ahaan, oo naqshadda ku hay qorshaha sida tixraac hoose.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","raad","la raad-raacay","qorshe soo dhoof","beddel","cad to bim","2d to 3d","darbiyo khadadka ka","lakabyo","bloogyo","albaabyo bloogyada ka","hoosta","naqshad tixraac","background","xref","app naqshadeed"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshe aad (ama qof kale) ku sawirtay app-ka naqshadeynta u isticmaal bilow moodelka: khadadka darbiga ee qorshaha waxay noqdaan darbiyo, bloogyada albaabka iyo daaqadda waxay noqdaan albaabyo iyo daaqado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro heerka uu naqshaddu muujinayo liiska heerarka qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro DWG ama DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala-sarka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECutubyada naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka yimaadaan naqshadda; dooro kuwa kale haddii ay khaldan yihiin (qorshe la sawiray feet oo loo akhriyay inji wuu ka yar yahay 12 jeer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada darbiyada leh\u003C/strong\u003E: calaamadee lakabyada khadadka darbiga ku yaal. Lakabyada magacyadoodu leeyihiin &quot;wall&quot; waa la calaamadeeyaa adiga aan lagu waydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadadku waa\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003Elabada wajiga darbi kasta\u003C/strong\u003E (habka caadiga ah ee qorshayaasha loo sawiro: labo khad oo isbarbar ah oo ka fog ilaa 600 mm wuxuu noqdaa hal darbi oo dhumucdiisu u dhigma farqiga), \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhadadka dhexe ee darbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal wajih\u003C/strong\u003E oo darbiga dhinaceeda bidix ama midig. Khadadka dhexe ama hal wajih, nooca darbigu wuxuu dejiyaa dhumucda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogga darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E, sida qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBloogyada\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro nooc albaab ama daaqad bloog kasta oo albaab ama daaqad ah, ama ka tag. Bloogyada magacyadoodu leeyihiin &quot;door&quot; ama &quot;window&quot; waa loo doortaa. Mid kastaa waxaa lagu dhigaa darbiga uu saaran yahay, sida bloogga oo kale ee darbiga dhererkiisa; albaab wuxuu u furmaa dhinaca uu jiifku ku sawiran yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha ay tagayso\u003C/strong\u003E: sida kala-xiriirka naqshadda, ama meesha geeska hoose ee bidix ay tahay bilowga qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda ku hay qorshaha heerkan\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag calaamadda si aad u aragto naqshadda sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta waxa aad sameyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadka hoosta doorashooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi, albaab iyo daaqadood ee ay samayn doonto. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake them\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha heerka, oo isku xidhan meelaha ay kulmaan, qolalkooda oo la xidhay; oo dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo, markaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqodi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa naqshadaha heerka ku jira, mid kastaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E; mid ka saarista ma saaro darbiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC naqshadda la kaydiyey waa faahfaahin heerka ku jira (khadadkiisa), sidaas awgeed barnaamijyada BIM ee kale ayaa tusaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF ama skaan ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EDarbiyada qorshayaasha\u003C/a\u003E. Qaansooyinka waa la dhaafaa (BimCraft wuxuu sawiraa darbiyo toosan), khadadka gudaha bloogyada sidoo kale. Khadadka aan lammaane lahayn &quot;labada wajiga&quot; waa la tiriyaa kala-sarka oo waa la dhaafaa: khadadkaas darbiyada ku sawir qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, ama u nadiifi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim / extend\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/trim-extend-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/trim-extend-walls\"\u003EJar, kordhi iyo isku xidh darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad ku raad-raacday skaan app-ka naqshadeynta? Skaanka halkan ka fur oo darbiyada la hubi: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-from-a-scan\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-from-a-scan\"\u003EMoodel skaan ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Qorshe aad (ama qof kale) ku sawirtay app-ka naqshadeynta u isticmaal bilow moodelka: khadadka darbiga ee qorshaha waxay noqdaan darbiyo, bloogyada albaabka iyo daaqadda waxay noqdaan albaabyo iyo daaqado. Tallaabooyinka Daar Draw oo dooro heerka uu naqshaddu muujinayo liiska heerarka qorshaha. Dooro Build › From a drawing…, kadibna Choose a drawing… oo dooro DWG ama DXF. Kala-sarka: Cutubyada naqshadda waxay ka yimaadaan naqshadda; dooro kuwa kale haddii ay khaldan yihiin (qorshe la sawiray feet oo loo akhriyay inji wuu ka yar yahay 12 jeer). Lakabyada darbiyada leh: calaamadee lakabyada khadadka darbiga ku yaal. Lakabyada magacyadoodu leeyihiin \"wall\" waa la calaamadeeyaa adiga aan lagu waydiin. Khadadku waa: labada wajiga darbi kasta (habka caadiga ah ee qorshayaasha loo sawiro: labo khad oo isbarbar ah oo ka fog ilaa 600 mm wuxuu noqdaa hal darbi oo dhumucdiisu u dhigma farqiga), khadadka dhexe ee darbiyada, ama hal wajih oo darbiga dhinaceeda bidix ama midig. Khadadka dhexe ama hal wajih, nooca darbigu wuxuu dejiyaa dhumucda. Nooca darbiga iyo Joogga darbiga, sida qalabka Wall. Bloogyada: dooro nooc albaab ama daaqad bloog kasta oo albaab ama daaqad ah, ama ka tag. Bloogyada magacyadoodu leeyihiin \"door\" ama \"window\" waa loo doortaa. Mid kastaa waxaa lagu dhigaa darbiga uu saaran yahay, sida bloogga oo kale ee darbiga dhererkiisa; albaab wuxuu u furmaa dhinaca uu jiifku ku sawiran yahay. Meesha ay tagayso: sida kala-xiriirka naqshadda, ama meesha geeska hoose ee bidix ay tahay bilowga qorshaha. Naqshadda ku hay qorshaha heerkan: ka tag calaamadda si aad u aragto naqshadda sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta waxa aad sameyso. Khadka hoosta doorashooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi, albaab iyo daaqadood ee ay samayn doonto. Riix Make them. Waxa aad arki doontid Darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha heerka, oo isku xidhan meelaha ay kulmaan, qolalkooda oo la xidhay; oo dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo, markaa Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqodi karo. Naqshadda sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshaha. Build › From a drawing… wuxuu liistaa naqshadaha heerka ku jira, mid kastaa Remove; mid ka saarista ma saaro darbiyada. Faylka IFC naqshadda la kaydiyey waa faahfaahin heerka ku jira (khadadkiisa), sidaas awgeed barnaamijyada BIM ee kale ayaa tusaa. PDF ama skaan ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya: eeg Darbiyada qorshayaasha. Qaansooyinka waa la dhaafaa (BimCraft wuxuu sawiraa darbiyo toosan), khadadka gudaha bloogyada sidoo kale. Khadadka aan lammaane lahayn \"labada wajiga\" waa la tiriyaa kala-sarka oo waa la dhaafaa: khadadkaas darbiyada ku sawir qalabka Wall, ama u nadiifi Modify › Trim / extend (eeg Jar, kordhi iyo isku xidh darbiyada). Waxaad ku raad-raacday skaan app-ka naqshadeynta? Skaanka halkan ka fur oo darbiyada la hubi: eeg Moodel skaan ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-checks","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah","summary":"Hel walxaha uu ka maqan yahay sifo aad u baahan tahay, GlobalId-yada loo isticmaalay laba jeer, walxaha aan dabaq ku jirin iyo nuqullada isku dul saaran.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["hubi","hubinta moodelka","xaqiijin","tayo","sifo maqan","loo baahan yahay","nuqul","laba jeer","globalid","guid","dabaq","isku dul saaran","isku daboolan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa fiican in la yaqaan","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg moodelka ka hor intaadan u gudbin qof kale: dhibaatooyinka jajaban jadwallada, tirooyinka iyo barnaamijyada kale ee dadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E bidix panelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka loo baahan yahay\u003C/span\u003E xeer ayaa horey u jira (nooc kasta, Magac). Beddel nooceeda (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooc kasta\u003C/span\u003E) iyo sifadeeda, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sifo\u003C/span\u003E si aad xeer kale u dartid; x-ku wuxuu tirtiraa mid. Walax way fashilantaa xeerka marka sifadu maqan tahay ama madhan tahay. Xeerarku waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan moodel kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji natiijo si aad u doorato walxahaas oo u ballaariso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifo loo baahan yahay oo maqan\u003C/strong\u003E: xeer kasta oo leh walxaha aan qiime u lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalId laba jeer la isticmaalay\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha wadaagaya hal GlobalId. Software kale wuxuu u tixgeliyaa hal walax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaq ma leh\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha qaab aan dabaq kasta ku jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqullo isku dul saaran\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha isla nooca iyo isla noocda ah ee isla meel ku yaal, kuwaas oo tirooyinka laba jeer tiriya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijo kasta waa badhan: guji si aad u doorato walxahaas oo u ballaariso. Kaliya 50 kooxood oo ugu horreeya ayaa la liisteeyaa. Isla natiijooyinkaas ayaa sidoo kale ka muuqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubintu waxay eegtaa moodelka firfircoon marka dhowr moodel la furan yihiin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EEeg dhowr moodel IFC isku mar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKadib tafatir, mar kale hubi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E, dherer, ballac iyo mug ku jira erayada dhibaatada waxay raacaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E laga doortay qalabka (albaab &quot;800 mm&quot; wuxuu ku akhrinayaa 2&#039;-7 1/2&quot; feet iyo inch); beddel cutubka waxayna panelku mar kale ku qori doonaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHubi moodelka: qolalka, calaamadaha, LOD, isku dhacyada iyo isku xirka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003ERaadi walxaha nooca, magaca ama sifada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ETirtir, jar, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Eeg moodelka ka hor intaadan u gudbin qof kale: dhibaatooyinka jajaban jadwallada, tirooyinka iyo barnaamijyada kale ee dadka. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC. Fur Hubinta moodelka bidix panelka. Hoosta Sifooyinka loo baahan yahay xeer ayaa horey u jira (nooc kasta, Magac). Beddel nooceeda (ama Nooc kasta) iyo sifadeeda, ama guji Ku dar sifo si aad xeer kale u dartid; x-ku wuxuu tirtiraa mid. Walax way fashilantaa xeerka marka sifadu maqan tahay ama madhan tahay. Xeerarku waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan moodel kasta. Guji Hubi. Guji natiijo si aad u doorato walxahaas oo u ballaariso. Waxa aad arki doontid Sifo loo baahan yahay oo maqan: xeer kasta oo leh walxaha aan qiime u lahayn. GlobalId laba jeer la isticmaalay: walxaha wadaagaya hal GlobalId. Software kale wuxuu u tixgeliyaa hal walax. Dabaq ma leh: walxaha qaab aan dabaq kasta ku jirin. Nuqullo isku dul saaran: walxaha isla nooca iyo isla noocda ah ee isla meel ku yaal, kuwaas oo tirooyinka laba jeer tiriya. Natiijo kasta waa badhan: guji si aad u doorato walxahaas oo u ballaariso. Kaliya 50 kooxood oo ugu horreeya ayaa la liisteeyaa. Isla natiijooyinkaas ayaa sidoo kale ka muuqda Dhibaatooyin. Waxa fiican in la yaqaan Hubintu waxay eegtaa moodelka firfircoon marka dhowr moodel la furan yihiin. Eeg Eeg dhowr moodel IFC isku mar. Kadib tafatir, mar kale hubi. Panelka Dhibaatooyin, dherer, ballac iyo mug ku jira erayada dhibaatada waxay raacaan Cutubyada laga doortay qalabka (albaab \"800 mm\" wuxuu ku akhrinayaa 2'-7 1/2\" feet iyo inch); beddel cutubka waxayna panelku mar kale ku qori doonaan. Xiga Hubi moodelka: qolalka, calaamadaha, LOD, isku dhacyada iyo isku xirka Raadi walxaha nooca, magaca ama sifada Tirtir, jar, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Samee sawir moodelka","summary":"Samee sawir maalinta ah oo ka mid ah muuqaalka 3D: samada, qorrax meeshii latitude-ka goobtu ka dhigayso, hooska jilicsan, daaqadaha muraayadda; WebGPU-ga, path traced kaarka garaafyada oo leh samooyin, kamarad, isku-darka iftiinka, grading, hoos iyo safka rendarka.","section":"tasks","order":32,"keywords":["render","preset","presets","scene preset","gudaha","dibadda","muuqaalka goynta","habeen","hal riix","rendering","path tracing","path traced","ray tracing","global illumination","reflections","refraction","tayo sare","sawir","photo","photoreal","realistic","picture","image","png","still","sky","sun","daylight","shadows","soft shadows","ambient occlusion","glass","windows","metal","materials","exposure","brightness","overcast","dusk","studio","presentation","visualization","webgpu","denoise","physical sky","hdri","ies","depth of field","panorama","white balance","light mixing","render elements","exr","16-bit png","fog","caustics","render queue"],"headings":[{"id":"sawirka-muuqaalka","text":"Sawirka muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"scene-presets-sawir-fiican-hal-guji","text":"Scene presets: sawir fiican hal guji","level":2},{"id":"waxa-sawirka-ku-muuqda","text":"Waxa sawirka ku muuqda","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"nalalka","text":"Nalalka","level":2},{"id":"muraayadda-iyo-agabyada-kale","text":"Muraayadda iyo agabyada kale","level":2},{"id":"tayo-sare","text":"Tayo sare","level":2},{"id":"samooyinka-hawada-iyo-profile-yada-iftiinka-kaarka-garaafyada","text":"Samooyinka hawada iyo profile-yada iftiinka kaarka garaafyada","level":2},{"id":"kameradda","text":"Kameradda","level":2},{"id":"sawirka-dhammaystir","text":"Sawirka dhammaystir","level":2},{"id":"sawirka-kaydi","text":"Sawirka kaydi","level":2},{"id":"isku-dar-iftiinka-rendar-ka-dib","text":"Isku-dar iftiinka rendar ka dib","level":2},{"id":"hoos-qiiq-dhawaaq-iyo-caustics","text":"Hoos, qiiq, dhawaaq iyo caustics","level":2},{"id":"safka-rendarka","text":"Safka rendarka","level":2},{"id":"intee-bay-qaadataa","text":"Intee bay qaadataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka ku jira wuxuu sameeyaa sawir muuqaalka 3D ah oo u eg maalinta: samada, qorrax meeshii latitude-ka goobtu ka dhigayso, hooska jilicsan, iftiin ka yimaada samada oo dhan oo xoogsada geeska, iyo midab u eg muraayad ama bir. Moodelka iyo faylka lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-muuqaalka\"\u003ESawirka muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaaji muuqaalka 3D sida aad rabto sawirka: wareeji iyo zoom, qari dabaqyada ama walxaha aadan rabin inay muuqdaan, oo dooro \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003Egoyn\u003C/a\u003E haddii sawirku u baahan yahay goyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScene\u003C/span\u003E haddii kan la riixay uusan ahayn kan aad rabto (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\"\u003EScene presets\u003C/a\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E wada-hadalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirku wuu buuxmaa intuu sameynayo oo wuu nadiifaa tallaabo kasta marka ay dhammaato. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu joojiyaa hore, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa sawirka ilaa hadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E si aad PNG ugu soo dejiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as\u003C/span\u003E qaab kale (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003ESawirka kaydi\u003C/a\u003E). Waxa loo magac-daraa sida faylka moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe view&#039;s size\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hubiso kameradda, kadibna samee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBest\u003C/span\u003E cabbir weyn oo sawirka dhammaadka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scene-presets-sawir-fiican-hal-guji\"\u003EScene presets: sawir fiican hal guji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta sare ee wada-hadalka waxaa ku jira afar badhan oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScene\u003C/span\u003E. Mid kasta wuxuu dejiyaa samada, iftiinka, dhulka, khadadka geesaha, tayada iyo qorrax hal guji oo keliya, sidaas darteed ma jirto wax lagu baro sawirka ugu horreeya. Guji mid, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EScene\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu dejiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loo isticmaalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExterior\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamada oo cad, qorraxda moodelka, dhulka oo furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterior\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamada daruur (iftiin siman, midhaha qorraxda ma jiraan), nus istobbis oo iftiin badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal ka yimaada qol\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection view\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio cad, dhul ma jiro, khadadka geesaha ee rendarka degdega ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel ay goyn gooyso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorraxdu way dhacday (habeen dhexe xilliga jiilaalka nuska dunida ee goobta), iftiin nus istobbis oo badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENalalka oo moodelka iftiimiya. Nal la&#039;aan sawirku waa mugdi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick for this view\u003C/span\u003E wuu kuu doortaa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection view\u003C/span\u003E marka goyn la shido, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterior\u003C/span\u003E marka kamaraddu moodelka gudihiisa ku jirto, haddii kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExterior\u003C/span\u003E. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto wada-hadalka, si toos ah ayuu kaas ku bilaabmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta oo dhan ayaa hoosta ku jirta waana la beddeli karaa. Markaad mid beddesho, scene-ka la dejiyey ma riixna, sariirta hoose waxay sheegaysaa in dejintu tahay tiinkaaga. Mar kale guji scene-ka si qiimayaasha u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScene ma taabto injinka, habka, cabbirka, agabka, kameradda ama nalalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScene-yadu waxay siiyaan qiimayaal isku mid ah ModelCraft iyo BimCraft. Sida sawirka dhammaadka u muuqdo waxay ku xirantahay moodelkaaga iyo kaarka garaafyadaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-sawirka-ku-muuqda\"\u003EWaxa sawirka ku muuqda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa muuqaalka 3D ku muuqda oo adag: walxaha qarsan iyo kuwa hufan ayaa laga reebay; dabaqyada qarsan iyo moodelada qarsan ayaa laga reebay; qolalku waxay muuqdaan kaliya marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E shidan tahay. Goyn ama sanduuq goyn ayaa sawirka goynaya sida muuqaalka uu goynayo. Walxuhu midabkooda u muuqdaan: midabka ku salaysan sifada (tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E) lama isticmaalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka muuqaalka, laba jeer cabbirka muuqaalka, Full HD, 4K ama labajibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMode\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E (hoos) oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETime limit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImisa marxaladood (ama tayo sare, samples) ayaa celcelis la qaadaa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E 16, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E 64, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBest\u003C/span\u003E 256. Marxaladaha badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo xuduudaha jilicsan, laakiin way qaadataan wakhti badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESky\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear sky\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOvercast\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusk\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhite studio\u003C/span\u003E (background cad oo fudud)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESun\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21-ka June, saacadda 15:00, latitude-ka faylku siiyo goobtiisa (IfcSite), oo loo rogay waqooyiga dhabta ah ee moodelka. Calaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse another date and time for this picture\u003C/span\u003E waqti kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrightness\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiin badan ama madow badan, istobbis (stops) ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGround under the model\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhul ku yaal meesha ugu hoose ee moodelka, kaas oo qaata hooska oo ku dhammaada xadka dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw edges\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha walxaha ayuu khad khafiif ah ku sawiraa sawirka dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii qorraxdu hoos uga dhacdo xadka dhulka waqtiga la doortay, waa habeen: samada way madowdaa oo nalalka moodelka ayaa iftiimiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nalalka\"\u003ENalalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamaan qalabka iftiinka ee moodelka waa nal sawirka gudihiisa: qalabka ku jira faylka IFC (IfcLightFixture, ama element loo calaamadiyay qalab iftiin), oo ay ku jiraan kuwa aad ka soo dhigtay maktabadda. Mid kasta wuxuu iftiin ka siiyaa hoos ka dhow qalabka. Marka faylku siiyo wattage-ka qalabka, iftiinkiisu wuxuu ka raacaa; haddii kale waa 800 lumens, cadaan diirran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDialog-ka wuxuu nalalka hoos ku liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELamps\u003C/span\u003E: ka saar mid si aad u demiso, ama ku qor iftiinkiisa lumens. Isbeddelladan waxay ku kaydsamaan IFC-ga (property set-ka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Light\u003C/code\u003E ee qalabka, halkaas oo aad ku beddeli karto Properties), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka faylku aan waxba sheegin meesha goobtu tahay, qorraxda waxaa lagu dhigaa 40° waqooyi, wadahadalkuna wuu sheegaa. Waqtigu waa saacadda goobta, oo lagu xisaabinayo longitude-kiisa, sidaas darteed hal saac ayaa khaldan karta meelaha saacadaha kala duwan lagu dejiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejimahan waxay ku kaydsamaan browser-kan sawirka xiga. Ma kaydsana faylka IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muraayadda-iyo-agabyada-kale\"\u003EMuraayadda iyo agabyada kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterials\u003C/span\u003E, midab kasta oo shaashadda ku jira wuxuu leeyahay muuqaal: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatte\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESatin\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlossy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMetal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolished metal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlass\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrosted glass\u003C/span\u003E. Midabyada faylka IFC ka dhigaya kuwo muuqda (tusaale, daaqadaha muraayadda) waxay ka bilaabmaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlass\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E, muraayadda iyo biraha waxay muujiyaan samada, ma aha qaybta kale ee moodelka, iftiinkuna ma gudbo muraayadda. Habka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E ee hoose labadaba wuu sameeyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tayo-sare\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMode\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E sawir raacaa iftiinka sida kamaraddu u aragto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiftiinku wuxuu ka dhabbaqaa dusha u dhexeeya, sidaas darteed qol iftiin ka yimaada daaqad ama nal ayaa wareegga oo dhan lagu iftiimiyaa, midabkuna wuu u gudbaa jaarrada;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emuraayaddu waa muraayad run ah: iftiinku wuu foorsadaa, oo wuxuu muujiyaa qaybta kale ee moodelka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebiraha iyo dusha dhalaalaysa waxay muujiyaan qaybta kale ee moodelka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epanelada iftiinka waxay u iftiimaan sida panel, hooska jilicsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa aad uga gaabisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E: marxaladda kasta waxay mar kale raacaa iftiinka pixel kasta. Sawirku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa dhibco-dhibco oo wuu cadaadaa markii samples-ku isku kordhaan, sidaas darteed bilow cabbir yar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E) oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETime limit\u003C/span\u003E: markii ay dhammaato, sawirka hadda jira ayaa la ilaaliyaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sidoo kale ilaaliya. Marxaladda koowaad waxay sugaysaa intii browser-ku diyaarinayo path tracer-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, path tracer-ku waa kan CadCraft u gaar ah oo kaarka garaafyada ku shaqeeya; khadka hoose ee sawirka ayaa sheegta. Markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E ama xadka waqtiga la dhammeeyo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EResume\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sii wadaa isla sawirkaas ilaa uu helo samples-kiisa oo dhan; beddelka dejin ama riixida mar kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale. Haddii WebGPU aan jirin, sawirka path traced waxaa lagu sameeyaa WebGL (khadku wuu sheegaa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EResume\u003C/span\u003E ma muuqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox iyo inta badan Chrome ee Linux weli ma lahan WebGPU, sidaas darteed tayo sare halkaas WebGL ayuu isticmaalaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabkan geesaha lama sawiro, tusaha ayaa muujiya midabka iyo roughness-ka, laakiin ma muujiyo bumps; goynta waxaa lagu sameeyaa moodelka ka hor inta sawirku bilaabmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDenoise (clears the grain left after the samples)\u003C/span\u003E waa shidan tahay default: markii sawirku dhammaado ama la joojiyo, dhibcaha hadhay waxaa nadiifiya shabakad neural ah oo loo sameeyay (Intel Open Image Denoise, shabakaddii la daabacay, oo lagu shaqeeyo kombiyuutarkaaga: kaarka garaafyada, haddii kale processor-ka). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe picture before denoising\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa sida loo rendaray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samooyinka-hawada-iyo-profile-yada-iftiinka-kaarka-garaafyada\"\u003ESamooyinka hawada iyo profile-yada iftiinka kaarka garaafyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebGPU-ga, tayo sare waxay leedahay laba samo oo dheeraad ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysical sky\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu iftiinka maalinta ka xisaabiyaa dhererka qorraxda: buluug qoto dheer madaxa kor, bar cad horizon-ka, iyo qorrax u kululeysa oo yaraysa markay hoos u dhacdo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHaze\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhex maraa maalin aad u cad (2) ilaa mid hoos u ceeryaan (10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESky picture (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nalalka moodelka ku iftiimiyaa sawir panorama oo goob dhab ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a picture…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaataa fayl equirectangular \u003Ccode\u003E.hdr\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodelka ku wareejiyaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka sawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan ama madow badan. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay qorraxdiisa, sidaas darteed qorraxda moodelka lama daro. Waxay ku kaydsantahay oo keliya inta bogga furan; markii dib loo furo, mar kale dooro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENal kasta oo ku jira liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELamps\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadan karaa profile iftiin oo soo saaraha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProfiilka IES…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa fayl IES (LM-63), nalkana iftiinkiisu wuxuu u tuurayaa sida qalabkaas u sameeyo (downlight dhuuban, wall washer). Nal kasta oo magacaas leh ayaa isticmaala, nalkuna wuxuu hayaa iftiinkiisa. Guji magaca profile-ka si aad u joojiso isticmaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadaha muraayad cad ayaa caawiya in iftiinka samada uu galo qolka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E iyo WebGL path tracer-ku waxay muujiyaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysical sky\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESky picture (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E sidii samo cad, waxayna iska indha tiraan profile-yada iftiinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kameradda\"\u003EKameradda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECamera\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawirka u diyaariyaa sida sawir sawir ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExposure\u003C/span\u003E: ku hay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJiifka iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta kameradda\u003C/span\u003E oo deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurka (f-stop)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXawaaraha shutter-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EISO\u003C/span\u003E sida kamarad: EV ee ku xiga waa exposure value-ka caadiga ah. f/16 ee 1/100 s iyo ISO 100 waxay la mid tahay maalin qorrax leh; goob mugdi ah waxay rabtaa aperture ballaaran, shutter gaabis ah ama ISO sare. Tani qaab kasta way shaqeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto-dheerta muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa wax ka dhow ama ka fog \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada diiradda (m)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku dhigaa sida lens-ka f-stop-kaas ah; (ka tag madhan si aad ugu diiradayso waxa dhexe ee muuqaalka ku jira). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabka furka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu iftiinka aan diirada lahayn siinayaa qaab wareeg ama qaab fiino leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal laba-barood ah (khadadka toosan ayaa toosan ku sii jira)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kameradda sinaysiiyaa oo sawirka wareejiyaa, sida lens-ka tilt-shift ee naqshadaha, si darbiyadu u foororin markaad madaxa kor u qaaddo ama hoos u eegto dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dheelitirka cadaanka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa midabka iftiinka ee cad u muuqda: hoose (tusaale 3000 K) nalalka diirran, sare hooska iyo maalmaha daruuraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMashruuca\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E360° panorama\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa sawir 2:1 ah oo ah wax kasta oo kamarad ku wareegsan, oo loogu talagalay muuqaal-akhristayaasha panorama; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanorama stereo 360°\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku dhejiyaa panorama bidix iyo midig oo loogu talagalay madax-dhegta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuubka khariidadda (6 wejiyo)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa lix muuqaal labajibbaaran oo grid 3 × 2 ah. Ballaadhka waxa uu ka yimaadaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuca, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka, muuqaal laba-barood ah iyo isku-dheelitirka cadaanka waxay u baahan yihiin path tracer-ka kaarka garaafyada (WebGPU), sidaas darteed waxay muuqdaan kaliya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-dhammaystir\"\u003ESawirka dhammaystir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawirka tayo sare u qiimeeyaa sida sawir, oo dejin kasta sawirka dhammaadka ah isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan mar kale rendarin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELook (view transform)\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E (sida hore), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E (jilicsan, midabka wuu ilaaliyaa iftiin aad u sarreeya), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E (qalooc film oo jilicsan) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStandard\u003C/span\u003E (fudud, iftiinka aad u sarreeya wuxuu noqdaa cad).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContrast\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHighlight compression\u003C/span\u003E (dib u soo celinaya faahfaahinta qaybaha aad u iftiinka badan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBloom\u003C/span\u003E (wehel jilicsan oo ku wareegsan nalalka iftiinka badan), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlare\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlare streaks\u003C/span\u003E (xariiqyada xiddigta ee barta ugu iftiinka badan) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVignette\u003C/span\u003E (geesaha madow).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColour table (.cube)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku dabaqaa grade midab oo ka yimid fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColour table strength\u003C/span\u003E; sida sawirka samada, waxay ku kaydsantahay oo keliya inta bogga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-kaydi\"\u003ESawirka kaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa faylka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJPEG\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebP\u003C/span\u003E wadaagid ahaan (JPEG iyo WebP kaliya meesha browser-ku qori karo), iyo ka dib rendar tayo sare oo kaarka garaafyada ku jira, sidoo kale:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG, 16 bits\u003C/span\u003E: sawirka grade-ka leh oo leh tallaabooyin khafiif ah oo midabka ah, loogu talagalay daabacaadda ama wax-ka-beddelka dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEXR, every layer (32-bit float)\u003C/span\u003E: sawirka sida la rendaray (iftiin khadka ah, grade la&#039;aan) oo leh render element kasta iyo koox iftiin kasta sidii layer gaar ah, loogu talagalay barnaamijyada compositing-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender file (.ccrender, to grade again later)\u003C/span\u003E: wax kasta oo wadahadalku u baahan yahay si dib loo isku dhejiyo oo loo grade-ayo sawirka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a render file…\u003C/span\u003E wuu soo celiyaa, isku-darkiisa iyo gradekiisa, iyada oo aan dib loo rendarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dar-iftiinka-rendar-ka-dib\"\u003EIsku-dar iftiinka rendar ka dib\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight mixing (change each light&#039;s colour and brightness after the render)\u003C/span\u003E ka hor intaadan riixin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Sawirka markii uu dhammaado (ama la joojiyo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku qas sawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa iftiinkiisa kooxo ahaan: samada, qorraxda, iyo nalalka magacooda (nal kasta oo magac isku mid leh waa hal koox). Koox kasta dami, midab sii, ama ka dhig mid iftiin badan ama madow badan, sawirkuna isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan dib loo rendarin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi isku-darka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa isku-darka magac hoose si mar dambe dib loo doorto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida la rendaray\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa sawirkii la sameeyay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sawirka la isku daray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender elements (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaybaha sawirka sidoo kale ilaaliyaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa muuqaalka mid ka mid ah: midabka dusha (albedo), normals, depth, diffuse, specular iyo iftiinka gudbaya (mid toosan iyo mid dadban midkiiba), wixii iftiin ka soo baxa iyo samada, iyo midab kasta oo walax kasta ama agab kasta si loo sameeyo masks.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabadaba layers dheeraad ah ayay kaarka garaafyada ku hayaan. Cabbirrada waaweyn kaarka garaafyadu waxa laga yaabaa inaysan lahayn meel; wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa, cabbir yar ayaa shaqeysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hoos-qiiq-dhawaaq-iyo-caustics\"\u003EHoos, qiiq, dhawaaq iyo caustics\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos, qiiq iyo dhawaaq\u003C/span\u003E waxayna shaqeeyaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E kaarka garaafyada; injinada kale ayaa ka reebaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos iyo uumi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa hawada ilaa dhererka mid oo ah uumi ay qorraxda, samada iyo nalalku iftiimiyaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow far you can see, in meters\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa qaro-dhumuc ahaan (qiyaastii 100 m waa uumi khafiif ah, 20 m waa hoos qaro weyn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFog height above the ground, in meters\u003C/span\u003E waa meesha ay ku dhammaanayso, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight shafts\u003C/span\u003E waa intee ka iftiimaa uumida xagga iftiinka. Iftiinka qorraxda wuxuu ka baxaa sare hoosta, sidaas darteed meelaha qorraxdu ka soo gasho daaqad ama u dhexeyso dhismayaasha waxaad u aragtaa sida xariiqyo iftiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmoke or cloud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa hal mugga qiiq ama daruur oo lagu iftiimiyo sida hooska. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiirka qiiqa\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka mugga (.ccvol)\u003C/span\u003E, oo ah qaabka grid-ka u gaarka ah CadCraft. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala duwanaansho\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan daruur ama tiir la sameeyey; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka dhinaca ugu dheer, mitir ahaan (0 = cabbirka moodelka)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji X (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji Y (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji Z (m)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa meesha dhigaya (wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhexda moodelka); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhumucda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid qaro weyn; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin hore\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan xagga iftiinka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E wuu midabeeyaa. Faylka mugga waxaa lagu kaydiyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan, sida sawirka samada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop early where the picture is clean (adaptive sampling)\u003C/span\u003E ma siiyo samples dheeraad ah pixel-ada oo degay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhawaaqa la aqbalo\u003C/span\u003E waa intee dhawaaq ayaa hadhaa markii pixel-ku joogsado. Khadka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu sheegaa intee sample ah pixel kasta helay celcelis ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaustics (light bent by glass or bounced by mirrors)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raacaa iftiinka nalalka iyo qorraxda, sidaas darteed dhibcaha iftiinka ee hoos ka muuqda kubbad muraayad ama iftiinka muraayadda ee derbiga ayaa u soo baxa nadiif halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen dhibco-dhibco. Waa la damiyaa intii hoos, qiiq, isku-dar iftiin ama render elements ay shidan yihiin, waana loogu talagalay sawirrada, ma aha sawirrada 360°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-rendarka\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender queue\u003C/span\u003E wada-hadalka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sawirkan safka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa dejinta sawirka iyo muuqaalkiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow safka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu rendarayaa waxa sugaya, mid mid, kombiyuutarkan. Xidhista bogga waxay ilaalisaa safka; fur isla moodelka si aad u sii socoto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa mid dhammaaday; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi kuwii dhammaaday\u003C/span\u003E ayaa liiska nadiifiya. Safku wuxuu rendarayaa tayo sare, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intee-bay-qaadataa\"\u003EIntee bay qaadataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirka kombiyuutarkaaga, kaarka garaafyadiisa ayuu sameeyaa; wax lama soo shubo. Waqtigu wuxuu kordhaa marka marxaladaha iyo pixel-ada la kordhiyo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgu fiican\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay 16 jeer marxaladaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E, sawir 4K wuxuu leeyahay qiyaastii afar jeer pixel-ada Full HD. Moodelada waaweyn marxalad kasta way qaadataan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Render toolbar-ka ku jira wuxuu sameeyaa sawir muuqaalka 3D ah oo u eg maalinta: samada, qorrax meeshii latitude-ka goobtu ka dhigayso, hooska jilicsan, iftiin ka yimaada samada oo dhan oo xoogsada geeska, iyo midab u eg muraayad ama bir. Moodelka iyo faylka lama beddelo. Sawirka muuqaalka Hagaaji muuqaalka 3D sida aad rabto sawirka: wareeji iyo zoom, qari dabaqyada ama walxaha aadan rabin inay muuqdaan, oo dooro goyn haddii sawirku u baahan yahay goyn. Guji Render toolbar-ka. Dooro Scene haddii kan la riixay uusan ahayn kan aad rabto (eeg Scene presets), dooro Size, kadibna guji Render wada-hadalka. Sawirku wuu buuxmaa intuu sameynayo oo wuu nadiifaa tallaabo kasta marka ay dhammaato. Stop (ama Esc) wuu joojiyaa hore, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa sawirka ilaa hadda. Guji Save si aad PNG ugu soo dejiso, ama Save as qaab kale (eeg Sawirka kaydi). Waxa loo magac-daraa sida faylka moodelka. Bilow Draft oo ku jira The view's size si aad u hubiso kameradda, kadibna samee Good ama Best cabbir weyn oo sawirka dhammaadka ah. Scene presets: sawir fiican hal guji Qaybta sare ee wada-hadalka waxaa ku jira afar badhan oo Scene. Mid kasta wuxuu dejiyaa samada, iftiinka, dhulka, khadadka geesaha, tayada iyo qorrax hal guji oo keliya, sidaas darteed ma jirto wax lagu baro sawirka ugu horreeya. Guji mid, kadibna Render. Scene Waxa uu dejiyo Waxa loo isticmaalo Exterior Samada oo cad, qorraxda moodelka, dhulka oo furan Dhismaha dibadda Interior Samada daruur (iftiin siman, midhaha qorraxda ma jiraan), nus istobbis oo iftiin badan Muuqaal ka yimaada qol Section view Studio cad, dhul ma jiro, khadadka geesaha ee rendarka degdega ah Moodel ay goyn gooyso Night Qorraxdu way dhacday (habeen dhexe xilliga jiilaalka nuska dunida ee goobta), iftiin nus istobbis oo badan Nalalka oo moodelka iftiimiya. Nal la'aan sawirku waa mugdi Pick for this view wuu kuu doortaa: Section view marka goyn la shido, Interior marka kamaraddu moodelka gudihiisa ku jirto, haddii kale Exterior. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto wada-hadalka, si toos ah ayuu kaas ku bilaabmaa. Dejinta oo dhan ayaa hoosta ku jirta waana la beddeli karaa. Markaad mid beddesho, scene-ka la dejiyey ma riixna, sariirta hoose waxay sheegaysaa in dejintu tahay tiinkaaga. Mar kale guji scene-ka si qiimayaasha u soo celiso. Scene ma taabto injinka, habka, cabbirka, agabka, kameradda ama nalalka. Scene-yadu waxay siiyaan qiimayaal isku mid ah ModelCraft iyo BimCraft. Sida sawirka dhammaadka u muuqdo waxay ku xirantahay moodelkaaga iyo kaarka garaafyadaada. Waxa sawirka ku muuqda Waxa muuqaalka 3D ku muuqda oo adag: walxaha qarsan iyo kuwa hufan ayaa laga reebay; dabaqyada qarsan iyo moodelada qarsan ayaa laga reebay; qolalku waxay muuqdaan kaliya marka Spaces shidan tahay. Goyn ama sanduuq goyn ayaa sawirka goynaya sida muuqaalka uu goynayo. Walxuhu midabkooda u muuqdaan: midabka ku salaysan sifada (tab-ka Color) lama isticmaalo. Dejinta Dejin Waxa uu sameeyo Size Cabbirka muuqaalka, laba jeer cabbirka muuqaalka, Full HD, 4K ama labajibbaaran Mode Degdeg, ama Tayo sare (path traced) (hoos) oo leh Time limit Quality Imisa marxaladood (ama tayo sare, samples) ayaa celcelis la qaadaa: Draft 16, Good 64, Best 256. Marxaladaha badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo xuduudaha jilicsan, laakiin way qaadataan wakhti badan Sky Clear sky, Overcast, Dusk ama White studio (background cad oo fudud) Sun 21-ka June, saacadda 15:00, latitude-ka faylku siiyo goobtiisa (IfcSite), oo loo rogay waqooyiga dhabta ah ee moodelka. Calaamadi Use another date and time for this picture waqti kale Brightness Iftiin badan ama madow badan, istobbis (stops) ahaan Ground under the model Dhul ku yaal meesha ugu hoose ee moodelka, kaas oo qaata hooska oo ku dhammaada xadka dhulka Draw edges Geesaha walxaha ayuu khad khafiif ah ku sawiraa sawirka dushiisa Markii qorraxdu hoos uga dhacdo xadka dhulka waqtiga la doortay, waa habeen: samada way madowdaa oo nalalka moodelka ayaa iftiimiya. Nalalka Dhamaan qalabka iftiinka ee moodelka waa nal sawirka gudihiisa: qalabka ku jira faylka IFC (IfcLightFixture, ama element loo calaamadiyay qalab iftiin), oo ay ku jiraan kuwa aad ka soo dhigtay maktabadda. Mid kasta wuxuu iftiin ka siiyaa hoos ka dhow qalabka. Marka faylku siiyo wattage-ka qalabka, iftiinkiisu wuxuu ka raacaa; haddii kale waa 800 lumens, cadaan diirran. Dialog-ka wuxuu nalalka hoos ku liistaa Lamps: ka saar mid si aad u demiso, ama ku qor iftiinkiisa lumens. Isbeddelladan waxay ku kaydsamaan IFC-ga (property set-ka CadCraft_Light ee qalabka, halkaas oo aad ku beddeli karto Properties), Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Marka faylku aan waxba sheegin meesha goobtu tahay, qorraxda waxaa lagu dhigaa 40° waqooyi, wadahadalkuna wuu sheegaa. Waqtigu waa saacadda goobta, oo lagu xisaabinayo longitude-kiisa, sidaas darteed hal saac ayaa khaldan karta meelaha saacadaha kala duwan lagu dejiyo. Dejimahan waxay ku kaydsamaan browser-kan sawirka xiga. Ma kaydsana faylka IFC. Muraayadda iyo agabyada kale Hoos Materials, midab kasta oo shaashadda ku jira wuxuu leeyahay muuqaal: Matte, Satin, Glossy, Metal, Polished metal, Glass ama Frosted glass. Midabyada faylka IFC ka dhigaya kuwo muuqda (tusaale, daaqadaha muraayadda) waxay ka bilaabmaan Glass. Habka Degdeg, muraayadda iyo biraha waxay muujiyaan samada, ma aha qaybta kale ee moodelka, iftiinkuna ma gudbo muraayadda. Habka Tayo sare (path traced) ee hoose labadaba wuu sameeyaa. Tayo sare Dooro Mode › Tayo sare (path traced) sawir raacaa iftiinka sida kamaraddu u aragto: iftiinku wuxuu ka dhabbaqaa dusha u dhexeeya, sidaas darteed qol iftiin ka yimaada daaqad ama nal ayaa wareegga oo dhan lagu iftiimiyaa, midabkuna wuu u gudbaa jaarrada; muraayaddu waa muraayad run ah: iftiinku wuu foorsadaa, oo wuxuu muujiyaa qaybta kale ee moodelka; biraha iyo dusha dhalaalaysa waxay muujiyaan qaybta kale ee moodelka; panelada iftiinka waxay u iftiimaan sida panel, hooska jilicsan. Waa aad uga gaabisa Degdeg: marxaladda kasta waxay mar kale raacaa iftiinka pixel kasta. Sawirku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa dhibco-dhibco oo wuu cadaadaa markii samples-ku isku kordhaan, sidaas darteed bilow cabbir yar (Cabbirka muuqaalka, Draft) oo dooro Time limit: markii ay dhammaato, sawirka hadda jira ayaa la ilaaliyaa. Stop ayaa sidoo kale ilaaliya. Marxaladda koowaad waxay sugaysaa intii browser-ku diyaarinayo path tracer-ka. Haddii browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, path tracer-ku waa kan CadCraft u gaar ah oo kaarka garaafyada ku shaqeeya; khadka hoose ee sawirka ayaa sheegta. Markii Stop ama xadka waqtiga la dhammeeyo, Resume wuxuu sii wadaa isla sawirkaas ilaa uu helo samples-kiisa oo dhan; beddelka dejin ama riixida mar kale Render wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale. Haddii WebGPU aan jirin, sawirka path traced waxaa lagu sameeyaa WebGL (khadku wuu sheegaa), Resume ma muuqdo. Firefox iyo inta badan Chrome ee Linux weli ma lahan WebGPU, sidaas darteed tayo sare halkaas WebGL ayuu isticmaalaa. Habkan geesaha lama sawiro, tusaha ayaa muujiya midabka iyo roughness-ka, laakiin ma muujiyo bumps; goynta waxaa lagu sameeyaa moodelka ka hor inta sawirku bilaabmo. Denoise (clears the grain left after the samples) waa shidan tahay default: markii sawirku dhammaado ama la joojiyo, dhibcaha hadhay waxaa nadiifiya shabakad neural ah oo loo sameeyay (Intel Open Image Denoise, shabakaddii la daabacay, oo lagu shaqeeyo kombiyuutarkaaga: kaarka garaafyada, haddii kale processor-ka). Muuji › The picture before denoising wuxuu muujiyaa sida loo rendaray. Samooyinka hawada iyo profile-yada iftiinka kaarka garaafyada WebGPU-ga, tayo sare waxay leedahay laba samo oo dheeraad ah: Physical sky wuxuu iftiinka maalinta ka xisaabiyaa dhererka qorraxda: buluug qoto dheer madaxa kor, bar cad horizon-ka, iyo qorrax u kululeysa oo yaraysa markay hoos u dhacdo. Haze wuxuu ka dhex maraa maalin aad u cad (2) ilaa mid hoos u ceeryaan (10). Sky picture (HDRI) wuxuu nalalka moodelka ku iftiimiyaa sawir panorama oo goob dhab ah. Choose a picture… wuxuu qaataa fayl equirectangular .hdr ama .exr; Wareeji wuxuu moodelka ku wareejiyaa, Iftiinka sawirka wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan ama madow badan. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay qorraxdiisa, sidaas darteed qorraxda moodelka lama daro. Waxay ku kaydsantahay oo keliya inta bogga furan; markii dib loo furo, mar kale dooro. Nal kasta oo ku jira liiska Lamps wuxuu qaadan karaa profile iftiin oo soo saaraha: Profiilka IES… wuxuu akhriyaa fayl IES (LM-63), nalkana iftiinkiisu wuxuu u tuurayaa sida qalabkaas u sameeyo (downlight dhuuban, wall washer). Nal kasta oo magacaas leh ayaa isticmaala, nalkuna wuxuu hayaa iftiinkiisa. Guji magaca profile-ka si aad u joojiso isticmaalka. Daaqadaha muraayad cad ayaa caawiya in iftiinka samada uu galo qolka. Habka Degdeg iyo WebGL path tracer-ku waxay muujiyaan Physical sky iyo Sky picture (HDRI) sidii samo cad, waxayna iska indha tiraan profile-yada iftiinka. Kameradda Camera wuxuu sawirka u diyaariyaa sida sawir sawir ah: Exposure: ku hay Jiifka iftiinka, ama dooro Dejinta kameradda oo deji Furka (f-stop), Xawaaraha shutter-ka iyo ISO sida kamarad: EV ee ku xiga waa exposure value-ka caadiga ah. f/16 ee 1/100 s iyo ISO 100 waxay la mid tahay maalin qorrax leh; goob mugdi ah waxay rabtaa aperture ballaaran, shutter gaabis ah ama ISO sare. Tani qaab kasta way shaqeeyaa. Qoto-dheerta muuqaalka wuxuu dhigaa wax ka dhow ama ka fog Masaafada diiradda (m) oo ku dhigaa sida lens-ka f-stop-kaas ah; (ka tag madhan si aad ugu diiradayso waxa dhexe ee muuqaalka ku jira). Qaabka furka wuxuu iftiinka aan diirada lahayn siinayaa qaab wareeg ama qaab fiino leh. Muuqaal laba-barood ah (khadadka toosan ayaa toosan ku sii jira) wuxuu kameradda sinaysiiyaa oo sawirka wareejiyaa, sida lens-ka tilt-shift ee naqshadaha, si darbiyadu u foororin markaad madaxa kor u qaaddo ama hoos u eegto dhismaha. Isku-dheelitirka cadaanka wuxuu go'aaminayaa midabka iftiinka ee cad u muuqda: hoose (tusaale 3000 K) nalalka diirran, sare hooska iyo maalmaha daruuraha. Mashruuca: 360° panorama wuxuu sameeyaa sawir 2:1 ah oo ah wax kasta oo kamarad ku wareegsan, oo loogu talagalay muuqaal-akhristayaasha panorama; Panorama stereo 360° wuxuu isku dhejiyaa panorama bidix iyo midig oo loogu talagalay madax-dhegta; Kuubka khariidadda (6 wejiyo) wuxuu sameeyaa lix muuqaal labajibbaaran oo grid 3 × 2 ah. Ballaadhka waxa uu ka yimaadaa Size. Mashruuca, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka, muuqaal laba-barood ah iyo isku-dheelitirka cadaanka waxay u baahan yihiin path tracer-ka kaarka garaafyada (WebGPU), sidaas darteed waxay muuqdaan kaliya Tayo sare (path traced). Sawirka dhammaystir Sawir wuxuu sawirka tayo sare u qiimeeyaa sida sawir, oo dejin kasta sawirka dhammaadka ah isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan mar kale rendarin: Look (view transform): ACES filmic (sida hore), AgX (jilicsan, midabka wuu ilaaliyaa iftiin aad u sarreeya), Filmic (qalooc film oo jilicsan) ama Standard (fudud, iftiinka aad u sarreeya wuxuu noqdaa cad). Contrast iyo Highlight compression (dib u soo celinaya faahfaahinta qaybaha aad u iftiinka badan). Bloom (wehel jilicsan oo ku wareegsan nalalka iftiinka badan), Glare oo leh Glare streaks (xariiqyada xiddigta ee barta ugu iftiinka badan) iyo Vignette (geesaha madow). Colour table (.cube)… wuxuu ku dabaqaa grade midab oo ka yimid fayl .cube, oo leh Colour table strength; sida sawirka samada, waxay ku kaydsantahay oo keliya inta bogga furan. Sawirka kaydi Save as oo ku xiga Save wuxuu doortaa faylka: PNG, JPEG ama WebP wadaagid ahaan (JPEG iyo WebP kaliya meesha browser-ku qori karo), iyo ka dib rendar tayo sare oo kaarka garaafyada ku jira, sidoo kale: PNG, 16 bits: sawirka grade-ka leh oo leh tallaabooyin khafiif ah oo midabka ah, loogu talagalay daabacaadda ama wax-ka-beddelka dambe. EXR, every layer (32-bit float): sawirka sida la rendaray (iftiin khadka ah, grade la'aan) oo leh render element kasta iyo koox iftiin kasta sidii layer gaar ah, loogu talagalay barnaamijyada compositing-ka. Render file (.ccrender, to grade again later): wax kasta oo wadahadalku u baahan yahay si dib loo isku dhejiyo oo loo grade-ayo sawirka. Open a render file… wuu soo celiyaa, isku-darkiisa iyo gradekiisa, iyada oo aan dib loo rendarin. Isku-dar iftiinka rendar ka dib Shid Light mixing (change each light's colour and brightness after the render) ka hor intaadan riixin Render. Sawirka markii uu dhammaado (ama la joojiyo), Isku qas sawirka wuxuu liistaa iftiinkiisa kooxo ahaan: samada, qorraxda, iyo nalalka magacooda (nal kasta oo magac isku mid leh waa hal koox). Koox kasta dami, midab sii, ama ka dhig mid iftiin badan ama madow badan, sawirkuna isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan dib loo rendarin. Kaydi isku-darka wuxuu ilaaliyaa isku-darka magac hoose si mar dambe dib loo doorto; Sida la rendaray wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa sawirkii la sameeyay. Save wuxuu kaydiyaa sawirka la isku daray. Render elements (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs) wuxuu qaybaha sawirka sidoo kale ilaaliyaa. Muuji wuxuu beddelaa muuqaalka mid ka mid ah: midabka dusha (albedo), normals, depth, diffuse, specular iyo iftiinka gudbaya (mid toosan iyo mid dadban midkiiba), wixii iftiin ka soo baxa iyo samada, iyo midab kasta oo walax kasta ama agab kasta si loo sameeyo masks. Labadaba layers dheeraad ah ayay kaarka garaafyada ku hayaan. Cabbirrada waaweyn kaarka garaafyadu waxa laga yaabaa inaysan lahayn meel; wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa, cabbir yar ayaa shaqeysa. Hoos, qiiq, dhawaaq iyo caustics Kuwan waxay ku jiraan Hoos, qiiq iyo dhawaaq waxayna shaqeeyaan Tayo sare (path traced) kaarka garaafyada; injinada kale ayaa ka reebaya. Hoos iyo uumi wuxuu buuxiyaa hawada ilaa dhererka mid oo ah uumi ay qorraxda, samada iyo nalalku iftiimiyaan. How far you can see, in meters wuxuu dejiyaa qaro-dhumuc ahaan (qiyaastii 100 m waa uumi khafiif ah, 20 m waa hoos qaro weyn), Fog height above the ground, in meters waa meesha ay ku dhammaanayso, Light shafts waa intee ka iftiimaa uumida xagga iftiinka. Iftiinka qorraxda wuxuu ka baxaa sare hoosta, sidaas darteed meelaha qorraxdu ka soo gasho daaqad ama u dhexeyso dhismayaasha waxaad u aragtaa sida xariiqyo iftiin. Smoke or cloud wuxuu ku daraa hal mugga qiiq ama daruur oo lagu iftiimiyo sida hooska. Nooca waa Daruur, Tiirka qiiqa ama Faylka mugga (.ccvol), oo ah qaabka grid-ka u gaarka ah CadCraft. Faahfaahin iyo Kala duwanaansho waxay beddelaan daruur ama tiir la sameeyey; Cabbirka dhinaca ugu dheer, mitir ahaan (0 = cabbirka moodelka), Dhaqaaji X (m), Dhaqaaji Y (m), Dhaqaaji Z (m) iyo Wareeji ayaa meesha dhigaya (wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhexda moodelka); Dhumucda wuxuu ka dhigaa mid qaro weyn; Iftiin hore wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan xagga iftiinka; Midab wuu midabeeyaa. Faylka mugga waxaa lagu kaydiyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan, sida sawirka samada. Stop early where the picture is clean (adaptive sampling) ma siiyo samples dheeraad ah pixel-ada oo degay. Dhawaaqa la aqbalo waa intee dhawaaq ayaa hadhaa markii pixel-ku joogsado. Khadka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu sheegaa intee sample ah pixel kasta helay celcelis ahaan. Caustics (light bent by glass or bounced by mirrors) wuxuu raacaa iftiinka nalalka iyo qorraxda, sidaas darteed dhibcaha iftiinka ee hoos ka muuqda kubbad muraayad ama iftiinka muraayadda ee derbiga ayaa u soo baxa nadiif halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen dhibco-dhibco. Waa la damiyaa intii hoos, qiiq, isku-dar iftiin ama render elements ay shidan yihiin, waana loogu talagalay sawirrada, ma aha sawirrada 360°. Safka rendarka Render queue wada-hadalka: Ku dar sawirkan safka wuxuu ilaaliyaa dejinta sawirka iyo muuqaalkiisa, Bilow safka wuxuu rendarayaa waxa sugaya, mid mid, kombiyuutarkan. Xidhista bogga waxay ilaalisaa safka; fur isla moodelka si aad u sii socoto. Save wuxuu soo dejiyaa mid dhammaaday; Ka saar iyo Nadiifi kuwii dhammaaday ayaa liiska nadiifiya. Safku wuxuu rendarayaa tayo sare, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU. Intee bay qaadataa Sawirka kombiyuutarkaaga, kaarka garaafyadiisa ayuu sameeyaa; wax lama soo shubo. Waqtigu wuxuu kordhaa marka marxaladaha iyo pixel-ada la kordhiyo: Ugu fiican wuxuu leeyahay 16 jeer marxaladaha Qabyo, sawir 4K wuxuu leeyahay qiyaastii afar jeer pixel-ada Full HD. Moodelada waaweyn marxalad kasta way qaadataan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"walls-from-plans","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Darbiyada qorshayaasha (PDF ama skaan)","summary":"Bogagga PDF, ama naqshad skaan la sameeyay, u beddel darbiyo, albaabyo iyo daaqado, heer kasta bog kasta, oo bogga hoosta qorshe kasta lagu hayo.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["pdf","qorshayaasha","qorshayaal","skaan","naqshad skaan la sameeyay","tiff","raad","darbiyo PDF-ka ka","darbiyo skaanka ka","heerarka","bogagga","miisaan","albaabyo","daaqado","furitaan","sill","hoosta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sida-uu-bogga-u-akhriyo","text":"Sida uu bogga u akhriyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilow moodel qorshayaasha aad ku haysid warqad: PDF (oo khadad ah, ama skaan ku jira PDF) ama skaan (PNG, JPEG, TIFF oo hal bog ama tiro bog leh). Bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha hal heer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro PDF-ka ama skaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBogagga iyo heerarka.\u003C/strong\u003E Bog kasta waxaa lagu liisteeyaa waxa uu yahay (\u003Cstrong\u003Ekhad shaqo\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Esawir (la raad-raacay)\u003C/strong\u003E) iyo heerka uu tagayo: mid ka mid ah heerarka aad leedahay, \u003Cstrong\u003Eheer cusub oo ka sarreeya kuwa kale\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eka saar bogan\u003C/strong\u003E. Bogagga waxaa lagu isku geeyaa heerarkaaga adigoo tallaabo tallaabo ah; mid kasta beddel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka.\u003C/strong\u003E PDF ahaan, sheeg sida loo sawiray (\u003Cstrong\u003E1 : 100\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E1 : 50\u003C/strong\u003E…). Waxa kale, ama markaad ogayn, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003Emasaafo aan ogahay\u003C/strong\u003E: riix labada dhamaad ee cabbir ama xariiq miisaan ku yaal muuqaalka, kadibna qor masaafada dhabta ah. Dhammaan bogagga hal miisaan ayey isticmaalaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003Enooca darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edhererka heer cusub\u003C/strong\u003E. Ka tag \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda bog kasta ku hay qorshaha heerkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E calaamadeysan si aad u aragto bog kasta sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadka hoosta doorashooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi, albaab iyo daaqadood ee ay samayn doonto, iyo heerarka ay ku jiraan. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake them\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-uu-bogga-u-akhriyo\"\u003ESida uu bogga u akhriyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka yimaadaan labo khad oo isbarbar ah oo ka fog ilaa 600 mm (labada wajiga darbi); darbigu wuxuu u dhumucan yahay sida farqigu yahay. Hatching iyo xarfaha waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabyada iyo daaqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Jid darbi (500 ilaa 2600 mm) oo ay ku jirto jiifka albaabka oo taabanaya waa albaab, oo lagu xidhay hal dhamaad jidka, oo u furma dhinaca jiifku ku sawiran yahay. Jid ama darbi ay ku jiraan khadad sill waa daaqad. Jid aan midna lahayn waa albaab ilaa 1300 mm, ka sarreeyana daaqad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkaanka\u003C/strong\u003E waa la toosiyaa marka hore haddii si qalloocan loo skaneeyay (wada-hadalku wuu sheegayaa), waa madow iyo cadaan, waa la nadiifiyaa, waana la raad-raacaa; \u003Cstrong\u003Ebogga PDF ee sawir ah\u003C/strong\u003E waa la sawiraa marka hore, kadibna waa la sameeyaa sidii kale. Raadka waxa uu helaa dhexda mid kasta oo xariiqda ah, wuxuuna ku habboonayn xariiqyo toosan iyo qaansoo; ma isticmaalo shabakad, ma isticmaalo moodel tababaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQolalka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay raacaan iyaga oo laftooda ah xariiqyada xidhan ee darbiyada samaysa. Marka PDF-ku leeyahay qoraal, qolku magaciisa wuxuu ka qaataa qoraalka gudihiisa (kan ugu weyn; cabbir, miisaan ama lambarka xaashiga magac ma aha). Skaanku ma leeyo qoraal, sidaas awgeed qolalkiisu waxay haysaa magacyada barnaamijku siiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax kasta oo bogga laga akhriyay waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa aan la hubin\u003C/strong\u003E: darbi kasta, albaab, daaqad iyo qol waxay leeyihiin sanduuq dhibcaysan iyo &quot;?&quot; qorshaha, ilaa aad hubiso. Dooro waxa aad hubisay oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as checked\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qolalka heer kasta, iyo heerarka cusub haddii ay jiraan, oo dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa wax kasta ka noqodi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBog kasta sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshaha heerkiisa, oo lagu liisteeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa waxa khadadku siiyeen, oo ku habboon daqiqnaanta bogga. Skaanku wuxuu lumin karaa darbi cidhiidh ah, wuxuu isku xidhi karaa labo darbi oo aad u dhow, wuxuuna ka heli karaa darbi wasakh ku jira. Jid ay muujinayso qorshuhu ma aha wax albaab ah. Heer kasta ka hubi bogga ka hor inta aadan isku halleyn, kana saxi waxa khaldan adigoo isticmaalaya qalabyada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Bilow moodel qorshayaasha aad ku haysid warqad: PDF (oo khadad ah, ama skaan ku jira PDF) ama skaan (PNG, JPEG, TIFF oo hal bog ama tiro bog leh). Bog kasta wuxuu noqdaa darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha hal heer. Tallaabooyinka Daar Draw. Dooro Build › From a drawing…, kadibna Choose a drawing… oo dooro PDF-ka ama skaanka. Bogagga iyo heerarka. Bog kasta waxaa lagu liisteeyaa waxa uu yahay (khad shaqo, ama sawir (la raad-raacay)) iyo heerka uu tagayo: mid ka mid ah heerarka aad leedahay, heer cusub oo ka sarreeya kuwa kale, ama ka saar bogan. Bogagga waxaa lagu isku geeyaa heerarkaaga adigoo tallaabo tallaabo ah; mid kasta beddel. Miisaanka. PDF ahaan, sheeg sida loo sawiray (1 : 100, 1 : 50…). Waxa kale, ama markaad ogayn, dooro masaafo aan ogahay: riix labada dhamaad ee cabbir ama xariiq miisaan ku yaal muuqaalka, kadibna qor masaafada dhabta ah. Dhammaan bogagga hal miisaan ayey isticmaalaan. Dooro nooca darbiga iyo dhererka heer cusub. Ka tag Naqshadda bog kasta ku hay qorshaha heerkiisa calaamadeysan si aad u aragto bog kasta sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshihiisa. Khadka hoosta doorashooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta darbi, albaab iyo daaqadood ee ay samayn doonto, iyo heerarka ay ku jiraan. Riix Make them. Sida uu bogga u akhriyo Darbiyada waxay ka yimaadaan labo khad oo isbarbar ah oo ka fog ilaa 600 mm (labada wajiga darbi); darbigu wuxuu u dhumucan yahay sida farqigu yahay. Hatching iyo xarfaha waa la dhaafaa. Albaabyada iyo daaqadaha. Jid darbi (500 ilaa 2600 mm) oo ay ku jirto jiifka albaabka oo taabanaya waa albaab, oo lagu xidhay hal dhamaad jidka, oo u furma dhinaca jiifku ku sawiran yahay. Jid ama darbi ay ku jiraan khadad sill waa daaqad. Jid aan midna lahayn waa albaab ilaa 1300 mm, ka sarreeyana daaqad. Skaanka waa la toosiyaa marka hore haddii si qalloocan loo skaneeyay (wada-hadalku wuu sheegayaa), waa madow iyo cadaan, waa la nadiifiyaa, waana la raad-raacaa; bogga PDF ee sawir ah waa la sawiraa marka hore, kadibna waa la sameeyaa sidii kale. Raadka waxa uu helaa dhexda mid kasta oo xariiqda ah, wuxuuna ku habboonayn xariiqyo toosan iyo qaansoo; ma isticmaalo shabakad, ma isticmaalo moodel tababaran. Qolalka waxay raacaan iyaga oo laftooda ah xariiqyada xidhan ee darbiyada samaysa. Marka PDF-ku leeyahay qoraal, qolku magaciisa wuxuu ka qaataa qoraalka gudihiisa (kan ugu weyn; cabbir, miisaan ama lambarka xaashiga magac ma aha). Skaanku ma leeyo qoraal, sidaas awgeed qolalkiisu waxay haysaa magacyada barnaamijku siiyay. Wax kasta oo bogga laga akhriyay waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa aan la hubin: darbi kasta, albaab, daaqad iyo qol waxay leeyihiin sanduuq dhibcaysan iyo \"?\" qorshaha, ilaa aad hubiso. Dooro waxa aad hubisay oo isticmaal Tools › Mark as checked. Eeg Calaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay. Waxa aad arki doontid Darbiyada, albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qolalka heer kasta, iyo heerarka cusub haddii ay jiraan, oo dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa wax kasta ka noqodi karo. Bog kasta sida khadad khafiif ah hoosta qorshaha heerkiisa, oo lagu liisteeyay Build › From a drawing… oo leh Remove. Tani waa waxa khadadku siiyeen, oo ku habboon daqiqnaanta bogga. Skaanku wuxuu lumin karaa darbi cidhiidh ah, wuxuu isku xidhi karaa labo darbi oo aad u dhow, wuxuuna ka heli karaa darbi wasakh ku jira. Jid ay muujinayso qorshuhu ma aha wax albaab ah. Heer kasta ka hubi bogga ka hor inta aadan isku halleyn, kana saxi waxa khaldan adigoo isticmaalaya qalabyada Wall, Door iyo Window.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"vr-review","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dib-u-eeg moodelka madasha VR","summary":"Ku soco moodelka IFC cabbirka buuxa madasha VR: ku dhaqaaq, wareeg, qiyaas, goyso, geli dhibaatooyin sawir leh, eeg sida moodel miis-sare ah, oo la kulan kuwa kale ee kalfadhiga toosan.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["vr","virtual reality","madas","webxr","xr","dareen-gelin","quest","oculus","vive","index","pico","ku soco","soco dhexdeeda","teleport","dib-u-eegis naqshadeed","isku-duubid","dib-u-eegis","qiyaas","goyn","dhibaato","dhibaatooyin","bcf","miis-sare","moodel miisaan","joogitaan","avatars","toos ah","wada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay","text":"Waxa aad u baahan tahay","level":2},{"id":"bilow","text":"Bilow","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhaqaaq","text":"Ku dhaqaaq","level":2},{"id":"qiyaas","text":"Qiyaas","level":2},{"id":"goy-oo-fur","text":"Goy oo fur","level":2},{"id":"geli-dhibaato","text":"Geli dhibaato","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sida-moodel-miis-sare","text":"Eeg sida moodel miis-sare","level":2},{"id":"kuwa-kale-toos-ah","text":"Kuwa kale, toos ah","level":2},{"id":"ka-bax","text":"Ka bax","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare ayaa kugu geliya moodelka adigoo wata madasha VR, cabbirka buuxa. Waxaad taagan tahay meesha kamarada muuqaalka 3D ku taal, dhulka hoosteeda, adigoo u jeedda isla dhinaca. Madasku wuxuu tusayaa waxa muuqaalka 3D tusayo: dabaqyada, walxaha iyo moodelada qarsoon ayey qarsoon yihiin, agabka la rinjiyeeyay ayaa la socda. Waxba lama soo rarin: browser-ku wuxuu ku sawiraa kombiyuutarkan (ama browser-ka madasha laftiisa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay\"\u003EWaxa aad u baahan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadas uu browser-ku maamuli karo (WebXR): browser-ka madasha madax-bannaan, ama Chrome ama Edge oo ku yaal kombiyuutar leh madas ku xidhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel IFC oo furan, bog ammaan leh (https), sida ku jirto goobtan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka madas la&#039;aan yahay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E wuu ifka ka baxaa oo wuxuu sheegaa sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow\"\u003EBilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka 3D ka dhig meesha aad ka bilaabanayso: qol gudihiisa, ama dibadda oo dhismaha eegaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVR\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadasha xidh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska wuxuu ku yaal dhabarka gacantaada bidix. Ku tilmaan adigoo isticmaalaya kontoroolka midig, oo riix badhanka si aad batan u doorato. (Haddii gacan keliya la isticmaalo, liiska wuxuu ka dhex siibanayaa meesha aad ka bilowday.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhaqaaq\"\u003EKu dhaqaaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoodid:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E ku jira, ku tilmaan dhul oo riix badhanka; halkaas ayaad degi. Ama riix joystick-ka hore si aad bartamayso, oo sii deyso si aad u boodo. Waxaad degi kartaa dhul, sagxad iyo dabaq oo keliya (dusha u jeedda sare), weligaa darbi ma degi kartid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg:\u003C/strong\u003E riix joystick-ka bidix ama midig: mar kasta 30° ayaad wareegaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoco:\u003C/strong\u003E goobta dhaqdhaqaaqa, si fudud soco.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix badhanka labo nuqul. Masaafada ayaa u dhexaysa, mitir. Nuqul u dhow geesood ayaa geesoodka u xidhma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goy-oo-fur\"\u003EGoy oo fur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E oo riix badhanka dusha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edarbi dushiisa (ama wax aan dhul ahayn): wax kasta oo u dhexeeya adiga iyo dushaas ayaa la goynayaa, si aad gudaha ugu aragto. Tani ugu fiican waa marka dibadda laga eegayo, ama qol dhan ka dhaadheer;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhul dushiisa, sare ka: qorshe-goyn 1.2 m dhulkaas kor ah, si darbiyadu u muujiyaan qaybtooda hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E goynta iyo qiyaasaha ayuu ka saaraa. Haddii \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003Eqorshaha goynta\u003C/a\u003E moodelka goyo marka aad bilowdo, madasku wuxuu kula bilaabmaa isaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-dhibaato\"\u003EGeli dhibaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssue\u003C/span\u003E oo riix badhanka meesha dhibaatadu ku taal. Calaamad lambar leh ayaa tusta, dhibaatadana waxay gashaa tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E sida mawduuc BCF ah, iyada oo ay ku jiraan sawirka waxa aad aragtay iyo kamarada meesha aad taagnayd, marka la kala xiriiro moodelka. Kaydi iyaga oo wata \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003Edhibaatooyinkaaga\u003C/a\u003E kale faylka BCF; qalabyada isku-duubista kale ayaa ku furaya isla muuqaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaallo ku dar dhibaato marka aad ka baxdo VR, tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E: qorista madasha weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sida-moodel-miis-sare\"\u003EEeg sida moodel miis-sare\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETable top\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodelka yareeyaa si uu ugu habboonaado miis hortaada ku taal; ku soco wareeg, ama ku wareeji joystick-ka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull size\u003C/span\u003E waxay kugu celinaysaa meeshii aad ku jirteen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kuwa-kale-toos-ah\"\u003EKuwa kale, toos ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/work-live\"\u003EKalfadhi toos ah\u003C/a\u003E gudihiisa, kuwa ku jira VR waxay arkaan kuwa kale oo ah madax iyo labo gacmood midabkooda, magacooda, iyo dhibic meesha mid kastaa tilmaamayo. Wax kasta oo qof kastaa wax ka beddelo ayaa madasha kuu gaadhaya wakhti gaaban. Dadka miiska ku jira weli madasha kuma muuqdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-bax\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave VR\u003C/span\u003E (ama ka qaado madasha oo halkaas ku dhamee). Muuqaalka 3D ee shaashadda wuxuu u guuraa meeshii madaxaagu ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa lagu tijaabiyay emulator madas, weli ma aha madas kasta. Moodel weyn ayaa madasha ka dhigi karta mid taahaba: marka hore dabaqyada ama moodelada aan u baahnayn qari (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003Eqari, kali-ah iyo dhex-arag\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"VR ee qalabka sare ayaa kugu geliya moodelka adigoo wata madasha VR, cabbirka buuxa. Waxaad taagan tahay meesha kamarada muuqaalka 3D ku taal, dhulka hoosteeda, adigoo u jeedda isla dhinaca. Madasku wuxuu tusayaa waxa muuqaalka 3D tusayo: dabaqyada, walxaha iyo moodelada qarsoon ayey qarsoon yihiin, agabka la rinjiyeeyay ayaa la socda. Waxba lama soo rarin: browser-ku wuxuu ku sawiraa kombiyuutarkan (ama browser-ka madasha laftiisa). Waxa aad u baahan tahay Madas uu browser-ku maamuli karo (WebXR): browser-ka madasha madax-bannaan, ama Chrome ama Edge oo ku yaal kombiyuutar leh madas ku xidhan. Moodel IFC oo furan, bog ammaan leh (https), sida ku jirto goobtan. Marka madas la'aan yahay, VR wuu ifka ka baxaa oo wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Bilow Muuqaalka 3D ka dhig meesha aad ka bilaabanayso: qol gudihiisa, ama dibadda oo dhismaha eegaya. Riix VR qalabka sare. Madasha xidh. Liiska wuxuu ku yaal dhabarka gacantaada bidix. Ku tilmaan adigoo isticmaalaya kontoroolka midig, oo riix badhanka si aad batan u doorato. (Haddii gacan keliya la isticmaalo, liiska wuxuu ka dhex siibanayaa meesha aad ka bilowday.) Ku dhaqaaq Boodid: Move ku jira, ku tilmaan dhul oo riix badhanka; halkaas ayaad degi. Ama riix joystick-ka hore si aad bartamayso, oo sii deyso si aad u boodo. Waxaad degi kartaa dhul, sagxad iyo dabaq oo keliya (dusha u jeedda sare), weligaa darbi ma degi kartid. Wareeg: riix joystick-ka bidix ama midig: mar kasta 30° ayaad wareegaysaa. Soco: goobta dhaqdhaqaaqa, si fudud soco. Qiyaas Dooro Measure, kadibna riix badhanka labo nuqul. Masaafada ayaa u dhexaysa, mitir. Nuqul u dhow geesood ayaa geesoodka u xidhma. Goy oo fur Dooro Section oo riix badhanka dusha: darbi dushiisa (ama wax aan dhul ahayn): wax kasta oo u dhexeeya adiga iyo dushaas ayaa la goynayaa, si aad gudaha ugu aragto. Tani ugu fiican waa marka dibadda laga eegayo, ama qol dhan ka dhaadheer; dhul dushiisa, sare ka: qorshe-goyn 1.2 m dhulkaas kor ah, si darbiyadu u muujiyaan qaybtooda hoose. Clear goynta iyo qiyaasaha ayuu ka saaraa. Haddii qorshaha goynta moodelka goyo marka aad bilowdo, madasku wuxuu kula bilaabmaa isaga. Geli dhibaato Dooro Issue oo riix badhanka meesha dhibaatadu ku taal. Calaamad lambar leh ayaa tusta, dhibaatadana waxay gashaa tab-ka Issues sida mawduuc BCF ah, iyada oo ay ku jiraan sawirka waxa aad aragtay iyo kamarada meesha aad taagnayd, marka la kala xiriiro moodelka. Kaydi iyaga oo wata dhibaatooyinkaaga kale faylka BCF; qalabyada isku-duubista kale ayaa ku furaya isla muuqaal. Faallo ku dar dhibaato marka aad ka baxdo VR, tab-ka Issues: qorista madasha weli lama dhisin. Eeg sida moodel miis-sare Table top wuxuu moodelka yareeyaa si uu ugu habboonaado miis hortaada ku taal; ku soco wareeg, ama ku wareeji joystick-ka. Full size waxay kugu celinaysaa meeshii aad ku jirteen. Kuwa kale, toos ah Kalfadhi toos ah gudihiisa, kuwa ku jira VR waxay arkaan kuwa kale oo ah madax iyo labo gacmood midabkooda, magacooda, iyo dhibic meesha mid kastaa tilmaamayo. Wax kasta oo qof kastaa wax ka beddelo ayaa madasha kuu gaadhaya wakhti gaaban. Dadka miiska ku jira weli madasha kuma muuqdaan. Ka bax Dooro Leave VR (ama ka qaado madasha oo halkaas ku dhamee). Muuqaalka 3D ee shaashadda wuxuu u guuraa meeshii madaxaagu ahaa. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay emulator madas, weli ma aha madas kasta. Moodel weyn ayaa madasha ka dhigi karta mid taahaba: marka hore dabaqyada ama moodelada aan u baahnayn qari (qari, kali-ah iyo dhex-arag).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-engines","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dooro barnaamijka sawirka soo saara","summary":"Doorashada Injinka ee wada-hadalka Render, injinadayada, barnaamijyada kale ee CadCraft Studio, iyo waxa webku sameeyo halkeeda.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["render","injin","rendar","injinka rendarka","plug-in","studio","barnaamij dibadda","lagu sameeyay","safka","kordhinka injinka"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-doorashadu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida doorashadu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-injin-kasta-siiyo","text":"Waxa injin kasta siiyo","level":2},{"id":"safka-rendarka","text":"Safka rendarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu leeyahay doorashada \u003Cstrong\u003EEngine\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka sarreysa Mode. Laba injinadayada had iyo jeer way jiraan oo meel kasta way shaqeeyaan; kordhinnadu waxay ku dari karaan kuwo kale, CadCraft Studio-na liiska wuxuu sidoo kale ka kooban yahay barnaamijyada qaada muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInjin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGudaha ku dhex jira: Degdeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir degdeg ah: iftiinka maalinta, hooska jilicsan, muuqaalka muraayadda iyo biraha, ilbiriqsiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka iyo Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGudaha ku dhex jira: Path tracer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka oo ka dhabbaqa dusha u dhexeeya, kaarka garaafyada ama processor-ka, safka rendarka iyo kombiyuutarada kale ee shabakadaada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka iyo Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInjinka kordhinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu sawirka sameeyaa oo soo celiyaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\"\u003ESawirka barnaamij kale ku sameey\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka (injin lagu qoray JavaScript) ama Studio (injin barnaamij socodsiiya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamij qaada muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio wuxuu muuqaalka geliyaa folder-kiisa oo wuu la socdaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka oo ku furaa barnaamij; wax dib uma soo noqdo: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EMuuqaalka ku fur barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebka wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-doorashadu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida doorashadu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad dooratid Degdeg ama Path tracer, Mode wuu la beddelaa, iyo si ka soo rogta. Wax kale oo ku saabsan wada-hadalka ma beddelmaan dadka aan waligood injin kale isticmaalin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjin aan diyaar ahayn ayuu liiska ku sii jiraa sababta (ma la helin, wuxuu u baahan yahay nooc cusub); ma dooran kartid. Browser-ka injin kaliya Studio ku shaqeeya wuxuu muujiyaa &quot;kaydiya fayl&quot;. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E markaas wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka iyo dejintiisa fayl aad u qaadato barnaamijkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashada waa la kaydiyaa fayl-ka dejinta rendarka, injinka aad ugu dambeyntii dooratay waa injinka bilowga ah ee fayloyda aan doorasho gaar ah lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka soo sawiray iyo nooca, wada-hadalka iyo safka rendarka. Ballamada \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERender\u003C/a\u003E waxay daboolaan \u003Cstrong\u003Einjinadayada\u003C/strong\u003E oo keliya: barnaamij kale iftiinka, midabka iyo tijaabinta wuu ku sameeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed laba sawir oo muuqaal isku mid ah kamarad, qorrax, nalal iyo exposure ayaa is-eg, laakiin dhibco-dhibco ma aha isku mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-injin-kasta-siiyo\"\u003EWaxa injin kasta siiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka barnaamij kale wuxuu u gudbaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmo\u003C/strong\u003E: moodelka sidii fayl USD (isla faylka ay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003ESave as USD\u003C/a\u003E qorto), iyo fayl dejin oo leh waxyaala USD importer aan la aamini karin: qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka, nalalka oo furan iyo awoodooda iyo profile-yadooda iftiinka, qorrax, samada, exposure-ka iyo kameradda sida wadahadalku u rabo. Waxba meel loo soo shubo ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-rendarka\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir barnaamij kale wuxuu sugi karaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Esafka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E sida kuwa aan leenahay; shaqadiisu wuxuu xusaa injinka ay u tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Render waxa uu leeyahay doorashada Engine oo ka sarreysa Mode. Laba injinadayada had iyo jeer way jiraan oo meel kasta way shaqeeyaan; kordhinnadu waxay ku dari karaan kuwo kale, CadCraft Studio-na liiska wuxuu sidoo kale ka kooban yahay barnaamijyada qaada muuqaalka. Injin Waxa uu sameeyo Meesha Gudaha ku dhex jira: Degdeg Sawir degdeg ah: iftiinka maalinta, hooska jilicsan, muuqaalka muraayadda iyo biraha, ilbiriqsiyo Browser-ka iyo Studio Gudaha ku dhex jira: Path tracer Iftiinka oo ka dhabbaqa dusha u dhexeeya, kaarka garaafyada ama processor-ka, safka rendarka iyo kombiyuutarada kale ee shabakadaada Browser-ka iyo Studio Injinka kordhinka Wuu sawirka sameeyaa oo soo celiyaa: eeg Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sameey Browser-ka (injin lagu qoray JavaScript) ama Studio (injin barnaamij socodsiiya) Barnaamij qaada muuqaalka Studio wuxuu muuqaalka geliyaa folder-kiisa oo wuu la socdaa Studio Ku fur … Wuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka oo ku furaa barnaamij; wax dib uma soo noqdo: eeg Muuqaalka ku fur barnaamij kale Webka wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka Sida doorashadu u shaqeyso Markaad dooratid Degdeg ama Path tracer, Mode wuu la beddelaa, iyo si ka soo rogta. Wax kale oo ku saabsan wada-hadalka ma beddelmaan dadka aan waligood injin kale isticmaalin. Injin aan diyaar ahayn ayuu liiska ku sii jiraa sababta (ma la helin, wuxuu u baahan yahay nooc cusub); ma dooran kartid. Browser-ka injin kaliya Studio ku shaqeeya wuxuu muujiyaa \"kaydiya fayl\". Render markaas wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka iyo dejintiisa fayl aad u qaadato barnaamijkaas. Doorashada waa la kaydiyaa fayl-ka dejinta rendarka, injinka aad ugu dambeyntii dooratay waa injinka bilowga ah ee fayloyda aan doorasho gaar ah lahayn. Sawirka barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka soo sawiray iyo nooca, wada-hadalka iyo safka rendarka. Ballamada Render waxay daboolaan injinadayada oo keliya: barnaamij kale iftiinka, midabka iyo tijaabinta wuu ku sameeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed laba sawir oo muuqaal isku mid ah kamarad, qorrax, nalal iyo exposure ayaa is-eg, laakiin dhibco-dhibco ma aha isku mid. Waxa injin kasta siiyo Muuqaalka barnaamij kale wuxuu u gudbaa xirmo: moodelka sidii fayl USD (isla faylka ay Save as USD qorto), iyo fayl dejin oo leh waxyaala USD importer aan la aamini karin: qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka, nalalka oo furan iyo awoodooda iyo profile-yadooda iftiinka, qorrax, samada, exposure-ka iyo kameradda sida wadahadalku u rabo. Waxba meel loo soo shubo ma jiro. Safka rendarka Sawir barnaamij kale wuxuu sugi karaa safka rendarka sida kuwa aan leenahay; shaqadiisu wuxuu xusaa injinka ay u tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"trim-extend-walls","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Jar, kordhi iyo isku xidh darbiyada","summary":"Jar ama kordhi darbiyada darbi kale, oo isku xidh laba darbi meesha ay isku kulmaan, mid kasta oo ka mid ah hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["jar","kordhi","geeska","isku xidh","kulan","nadiifi","dhamaadka darbiga","geeska darbiga","gooyo dib","dheeheen","gaabin","wax ka beddel","TR"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyadii aad sawirtay nadiifi: jar darbi ka dhaafa darbi kale, dheeheen darbi ka gaabinaya, ama xidh geesi furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro heerka liiska heerarka ee qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJar ama kordhi ilaa darbi:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim / extend\u003C/span\u003E. Riix darbiga aad jarayso ama kordhinayso ilaa xadka (geeska), kadibna riix darbi kasta oo aad beddelayso. Darbi ka dhaafa xadka waa la jaraa ilaa halkaas, qaybta aad riixday ayaa ku sii jirta; darbi ka gaaban waa la kordhiyaa ilaa uu xadka ku kulmo. Xadka waa uu dooran yahay, sidaas darteed waad riixi kartaa darbiyo dhowr mar mid kadib mid. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u doorato xad kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku xidh laba darbi geesta:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorner\u003C/span\u003E, riix darbiga koowaad, kadibna kan labaad. Labadooda waxay gaaraan barta ay isku kulmaan, BimCraft-na geeska wuu nadiifiyaa. Marka darbi kale uu gudbo darbiga kale, qaybta aad riixday ayaa ku sii jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad dib ugu bilowdo, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad darbiga ku tusayso, qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa meesha uu ku tagi doono, horay ayuu ugu xidhan yahay darbiyada uu la kulmo, iyo dhererka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQolalka, sagxadaha, saqafyada iyo waxa raacaya darbiyada waa la dib u sameeyaa, sida ka dib isbeddel kasta oo darbiyada ku yimaada. Qolka geeska lagu xidhay wuxuu ka muuqdaa lambarkiisa iyo bedkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlbaab ama daaqad ku jirta qaybta la jaray waa la tirtiraa iyaga oo wata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada waxaa lagu rarayaa xarriiqa dhexe, sidaas darteed waa la jaraa oo la kordhiyaa isaga dhexdiisa: darbi wuxuu la kulmaa xarriiqa dhexe ee darbiga kale, isku xidhkana waa la nadiifiyaa T ama L.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft wuu sheegaa sababta marka aanu samayn karin: labada darbi waa isbarbar, xarriiqa darbigu waxay ka gudbaysaa darbiga kale dhinac, albaab ama daaqad ayaa jid ku ah (ku dhaqaajin ama tirtir marka hore), ama waxba ma harayo darbiga (ka yar 1 mm). Darbi ka gaabnaan 50 mm ayaa la sameeyaa, anigoo digniin ku qoran Dhibaatooyinka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/drawing-advice\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/drawing-advice\"\u003ETalooyinka naqshadeynta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya darbiyada BimCraft ku sawiran ayaa la jari karaa ama la kordhin karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDarbiyada sawir\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Darbiyadii aad sawirtay nadiifi: jar darbi ka dhaafa darbi kale, dheeheen darbi ka gaabinaya, ama xidh geesi furan. Tallaabooyinka Hay Draw oo dooro heerka liiska heerarka ee qorshaha. Jar ama kordhi ilaa darbi: dooro Modify › Trim / extend. Riix darbiga aad jarayso ama kordhinayso ilaa xadka (geeska), kadibna riix darbi kasta oo aad beddelayso. Darbi ka dhaafa xadka waa la jaraa ilaa halkaas, qaybta aad riixday ayaa ku sii jirta; darbi ka gaaban waa la kordhiyaa ilaa uu xadka ku kulmo. Xadka waa uu dooran yahay, sidaas darteed waad riixi kartaa darbiyo dhowr mar mid kadib mid. Riix Esc si aad u doorato xad kale. Isku xidh laba darbi geesta: dooro Modify › Corner, riix darbiga koowaad, kadibna kan labaad. Labadooda waxay gaaraan barta ay isku kulmaan, BimCraft-na geeska wuu nadiifiyaa. Marka darbi kale uu gudbo darbiga kale, qaybta aad riixday ayaa ku sii jirta. Riix Esc si aad dib ugu bilowdo, ama V si aad ugu noqoto Select. Waxa aad arki doontid Intaad darbiga ku tusayso, qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa meesha uu ku tagi doono, horay ayuu ugu xidhan yahay darbiyada uu la kulmo, iyo dhererka cusub. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Qolalka, sagxadaha, saqafyada iyo waxa raacaya darbiyada waa la dib u sameeyaa, sida ka dib isbeddel kasta oo darbiyada ku yimaada. Qolka geeska lagu xidhay wuxuu ka muuqdaa lambarkiisa iyo bedkiisa. Albaab ama daaqad ku jirta qaybta la jaray waa la tirtiraa iyaga oo wata. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Darbiyada waxaa lagu rarayaa xarriiqa dhexe, sidaas darteed waa la jaraa oo la kordhiyaa isaga dhexdiisa: darbi wuxuu la kulmaa xarriiqa dhexe ee darbiga kale, isku xidhkana waa la nadiifiyaa T ama L. BimCraft wuu sheegaa sababta marka aanu samayn karin: labada darbi waa isbarbar, xarriiqa darbigu waxay ka gudbaysaa darbiga kale dhinac, albaab ama daaqad ayaa jid ku ah (ku dhaqaajin ama tirtir marka hore), ama waxba ma harayo darbiga (ka yar 1 mm). Darbi ka gaabnaan 50 mm ayaa la sameeyaa, anigoo digniin ku qoran Dhibaatooyinka: eeg Talooyinka naqshadeynta. Kaliya darbiyada BimCraft ku sawiran ayaa la jari karaa ama la kordhin karaa. Eeg sidoo kale Darbiyada sawir iyo Beddel darbi, albaab ama daaqad.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-against-ids","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka hubi moodel IDS-ka macmiilka","summary":"Soo rar faylka .ids ee la siiyay oo ka arag walxaha kasta oo aan u hoggaansamin Dhibaatooyinka, ka hor inta aanad IFC-ga gudbin.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["ids","qeexidda gudbinta macluumaadka","buildingsmart","shuruudaha","gudbinta","hubinta","validation","qa","eir","bep","hanti","kala saarista","agabka","iibsashada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIDS (Information Delivery Specification, oo ah heerka buildingSMART) waa liistada waxa IFC ku jiri karo: fasallada, hantida iyo qiimayaashooda, kala saarista, agabka, iyo meelaha walxuhu ku sugan yihiin. Macmiilayaasha iyo iibsashada dadweynaha mar walba mashruuca ayay la socod siiyaan. BimCraft wuxuu moodelka IFC ee furan ka hubiyaa isagoo ka eegaya, wuxuuna liistaa walxaha kasta oo ka gaabiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa hubi IDS-ka\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca bidix ee panel-ka, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa hubi IDS…\u003C/span\u003E liiska menu-ga nidaamka menu-gaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERar fayl .ids…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka. Waxba lama soo gudbiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri natiijada: qeexid kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudbay\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFashil\u003C/span\u003E iyo inta walxood ay khusayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur Dhibaatooyinka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift M\"\u003E⌃⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo guji fashil si aad walxa u doorato oo aad ugu soo dhowaato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigniin keliya mid walxa kasta iyo shuruud kasta oo ay ka gaabiyo, oo leh magaca qeexidda, waxa IDS-ku codsanayo, iyo waxa walxu leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShuruud loo baahan yahay oo aan wax moodelka ku jirin ku habboonaan waa digniin gaar ah oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarbixinta hubinta (ee Dhibaatooyinka) waxay ku bilaabmaysaa IDS-ka: cinwaankeeda, nooca, qoraha, iyo qeexid kasta tirada khusaysa, tirada la gudbay iyo tirada fashilay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIFC-gu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya tixraac IDS-ka (magaciisa, cinwaankiisa, nooca iyo hash-kiisa), ma aha IDS-ka laftiisa: IDS-ka macmiil waa xog qarsoon ah oo laga yaabo, IFC-gana dad kale ayaa loo diraa. IDS-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-kan moodelka ag jira, sidaas darteed markaad IFC-ga la kaydiyay mar kale halkan furto, mar kale ayaa la hubiyaa. Soo rarista ama illoobidda IDS-ka waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKombiyuutar ama browser kale ayaa lagu furay, Dhibaatooyinka waxa ka muuqda fiiro ah in IDS-ka aan la helin: mar kale rar si aad dib u hubiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad IDS-ka IFC-ga ula dirto, daar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHay IDS-ka gudaha IFC-ga\u003C/span\u003E Dejinta, tab-ka BimCraft, ka hor inta aanad soo raran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatir kasta, ka noqo iyo samee mar kale waxa dib loo hubiyaa wakhti yar kadib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiimayaasha waxa loo barbardhigaa siyaabta IDS: qoraalka sidiisa oo kale (xarfaha weyn iyo yar way muhiim yihiin), lambarada unitiyada SI oo leh cidla yar (dherer ahaan mitir, sidaas darteed moodel millimitir ah marka hore la beddelaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQeexid loo qoray nooc IFC kale (tusaale IFC2X3 marka moodelku yahay IFC4) weli waa la hubiyaa; natiijadu way sheegaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii faylka IDS uu qalad leeyahay oo IDS audit uu calaamadiyo, wada-hadalku wuu liistaa; qeexidaha ay ku jiraan waa fashilayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFashil waad aqbali kartaa sabab la xusay, sida dhibaato kasta. Waa sii jiraysaa intii qiimayaasha walxa isku mid yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka IDS-ka waxa loo akhriyaa inay yihiin qiimaha oo dhan. \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E bilowga iyo \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E dhamaadka waxa sidoo kale loo qaataa inay yihiin &quot;qiimaha oo dhan&quot;, sida faylasha IDS badanaa ula jeedaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EKa hubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/change-a-wall-or-door\"\u003EBeddel derbi ama albaab\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa IDS (Information Delivery Specification, oo ah heerka buildingSMART) waa liistada waxa IFC ku jiri karo: fasallada, hantida iyo qiimayaashooda, kala saarista, agabka, iyo meelaha walxuhu ku sugan yihiin. Macmiilayaasha iyo iibsashada dadweynaha mar walba mashruuca ayay la socod siiyaan. BimCraft wuxuu moodelka IFC ee furan ka hubiyaa isagoo ka eegaya, wuxuuna liistaa walxaha kasta oo ka gaabiya. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC. Fur Ka hubi IDS-ka dhinaca bidix ee panel-ka, hoosta Hubinta moodelka, ama dooro Ka hubi IDS… liiska menu-ga nidaamka menu-gaaga. Guji Rar fayl .ids… oo dooro faylka. Waxba lama soo gudbiyo. Akhri natiijada: qeexid kasta oo leh Gudbay ama Fashil iyo inta walxood ay khusayso. Fur Dhibaatooyinka (Ctrl+Shift+M) oo guji fashil si aad walxa u doorato oo aad ugu soo dhowaato. Waxa aad arki doontaa Digniin keliya mid walxa kasta iyo shuruud kasta oo ay ka gaabiyo, oo leh magaca qeexidda, waxa IDS-ku codsanayo, iyo waxa walxu leeyahay. Shuruud loo baahan yahay oo aan wax moodelka ku jirin ku habboonaan waa digniin gaar ah oo keliya. Warbixinta hubinta (ee Dhibaatooyinka) waxay ku bilaabmaysaa IDS-ka: cinwaankeeda, nooca, qoraha, iyo qeexid kasta tirada khusaysa, tirada la gudbay iyo tirada fashilay. Wax la xiriira IFC-gu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya tixraac IDS-ka (magaciisa, cinwaankiisa, nooca iyo hash-kiisa), ma aha IDS-ka laftiisa: IDS-ka macmiil waa xog qarsoon ah oo laga yaabo, IFC-gana dad kale ayaa loo diraa. IDS-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-kan moodelka ag jira, sidaas darteed markaad IFC-ga la kaydiyay mar kale halkan furto, mar kale ayaa la hubiyaa. Soo rarista ama illoobidda IDS-ka waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartaa. Kombiyuutar ama browser kale ayaa lagu furay, Dhibaatooyinka waxa ka muuqda fiiro ah in IDS-ka aan la helin: mar kale rar si aad dib u hubiso. Si aad IDS-ka IFC-ga ula dirto, daar Hay IDS-ka gudaha IFC-ga Dejinta, tab-ka BimCraft, ka hor inta aanad soo raran. Tafatir kasta, ka noqo iyo samee mar kale waxa dib loo hubiyaa wakhti yar kadib. Qiimayaasha waxa loo barbardhigaa siyaabta IDS: qoraalka sidiisa oo kale (xarfaha weyn iyo yar way muhiim yihiin), lambarada unitiyada SI oo leh cidla yar (dherer ahaan mitir, sidaas darteed moodel millimitir ah marka hore la beddelaa). Qeexid loo qoray nooc IFC kale (tusaale IFC2X3 marka moodelku yahay IFC4) weli waa la hubiyaa; natiijadu way sheegaysaa. Haddii faylka IDS uu qalad leeyahay oo IDS audit uu calaamadiyo, wada-hadalku wuu liistaa; qeexidaha ay ku jiraan waa fashilayaan. Fashil waad aqbali kartaa sabab la xusay, sida dhibaato kasta. Waa sii jiraysaa intii qiimayaasha walxa isku mid yihiin. Qaababka IDS-ka waxa loo akhriyaa inay yihiin qiimaha oo dhan. ^ bilowga iyo $ dhamaadka waxa sidoo kale loo qaataa inay yihiin \"qiimaha oo dhan\", sida faylasha IDS badanaa ula jeedaan. Xiga Ka hubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah Beddel derbi ama albaab","lang":"so"},{"slug":"quantity-totals","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku dar qadarka, liis walxaha, oo jadwal meelaha","summary":"Tiri walxaha oo ku dar dherarkooda, aagagooda, mugagooda ama lambar kasta oo sifo ah, oo kooxee sida sifo kasta; ama liis safaf kasta oo walax; ama jadwal meelaha iyo aagagooda iyo mugagooda. Mid kasta waxa lagu soo dejiyaa CSV.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["qadar","qadarka","qiyaas","wadar","isku geey","jadwal","bill of quantities","boq","qto","csv","kooxee sida","tiri","dherer","aag","mug","meelaha","qolalka","jadwalka qolalka","jadwalka aagga","liiska walxaha"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"hal-safka-walax-kasta-ama-jadwal-meelaha","text":"Hal safka walax kasta, ama jadwal meelaha","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2},{"id":"infrastructure-ifc-4-3","text":"Infrastructure (IFC 4.3)","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHel wadarta moodeelka: dherarka darbiyada dabaq kasta, tirada albaabada nooc kasta, mugga dhagaxa agab kasta, kharashka aag kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E panelka bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiro\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalax kasta\u003C/span\u003E ama kuwa la doortay oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooxee sida\u003C/span\u003E, dooro sifo, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar koox\u003C/span\u003E si aad u kala qaybiso ilaa saddex, tusaale sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaq\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku geey\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadee tirooyinka si aad u wadato. Qaybaha tirooyinka moodeelka ayaa bilowga la calaamadeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E si aad u furto miiska spreadsheet-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka kasta oo kooxeed oo leh inta walxood ee ku jirta iyo wadar kasta, iyo safka wadarta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha aan qiime lahayn waa la tiriyaa laakiin wax ku daraan ma sameeyaan. Markaasi dhacdo, CSV-ga wuxuu ku daraa tiir &quot;la reebay&quot; xagga wadarta si aad u aragto inta ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinku waxay ku jiraan unugyada faylka sida uu kaydiyay, inta badan millimitir dherarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-safka-walax-kasta-ama-jadwal-meelaha\"\u003EHal safka walax kasta, ama jadwal meelaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal safka walax kasta\u003C/strong\u003E: walax kasta safkeeda gaarka ah, oo leh sifooyinka hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiirarka\u003C/span\u003E iyo tirooyinka hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku geey\u003C/span\u003E. CSV-ga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa GlobalId walax kasta. Riix qiimaha ugu horreeya safka si aad walaxaas u doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeelaha\u003C/strong\u003E: qol kasta oo leh lambarkiisa, magaciisa, dabaqiisa, aagiisa iyo mugiisa, iyo wadarahooda. Aagagga iyo mugagga waxay ka imanayaan qiimayaasha meesha sida faylku sheegay. Haddii faylku aanu lahayn, waxa lagu qiyaasaa qaabka meesha m² iyo m³ waxaana lagu muujiyaa xarfo jiiran (italic); CSV-ga wuxuu sheegaa kuwee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003ERaadi walxaha nooca, magaca ama sifada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EMidabee walxaha sifo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"infrastructure-ifc-4-3\"\u003EInfrastructure (IFC 4.3)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EInfrastructure (IFC 4.3)\u003C/strong\u003E liiska aragtida si aad u aragto waddooyinka, jidadka tareenada, buundooyinka iyo shaqooyinka badda, oo lagu wada geeyo nooca iyo qaabka, iyada oo dherer, aag iyo mug uu faylku sheegay. Qadar uu faylku aanu sheegin waa la reebaa, weligeedna lama xisaabiyo. \u003Cstrong\u003EU dir qadarka infrastructure TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E oo TakeoffCraft u furta sida qadarka nooca loo qoray.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hel wadarta moodeelka: dherarka darbiyada dabaq kasta, tirada albaabada nooc kasta, mugga dhagaxa agab kasta, kharashka aag kasta. Tallaabooyin Fur moodeel IFC. Fur Wadarta qadarka panelka bidix. Hoosta Tiro, dooro Walax kasta ama kuwa la doortay oo keliya. Hoosta Kooxee sida, dooro sifo, sida Nooca. Riix Ku dar koox si aad u kala qaybiso ilaa saddex, tusaale sida Dabaq. Hoosta Isku geey, calaamadee tirooyinka si aad u wadato. Qaybaha tirooyinka moodeelka ayaa bilowga la calaamadeeyay. Riix Soo deji CSV si aad u furto miiska spreadsheet-ka. Waxa aad arkaysaa Safka kasta oo kooxeed oo leh inta walxood ee ku jirta iyo wadar kasta, iyo safka wadarta. Walxaha aan qiime lahayn waa la tiriyaa laakiin wax ku daraan ma sameeyaan. Markaasi dhacdo, CSV-ga wuxuu ku daraa tiir \"la reebay\" xagga wadarta si aad u aragto inta ay tahay. Tirooyinku waxay ku jiraan unugyada faylka sida uu kaydiyay, inta badan millimitir dherarka. Hal safka walax kasta, ama jadwal meelaha Beddel Muuji: Hal safka walax kasta: walax kasta safkeeda gaarka ah, oo leh sifooyinka hoosta Tiirarka iyo tirooyinka hoosta Isku geey. CSV-ga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa GlobalId walax kasta. Riix qiimaha ugu horreeya safka si aad walaxaas u doorato. Meelaha: qol kasta oo leh lambarkiisa, magaciisa, dabaqiisa, aagiisa iyo mugiisa, iyo wadarahooda. Aagagga iyo mugagga waxay ka imanayaan qiimayaasha meesha sida faylku sheegay. Haddii faylku aanu lahayn, waxa lagu qiyaasaa qaabka meesha m² iyo m³ waxaana lagu muujiyaa xarfo jiiran (italic); CSV-ga wuxuu sheegaa kuwee. Xiga Raadi walxaha nooca, magaca ama sifada Midabee walxaha sifo Infrastructure (IFC 4.3) Dooro Infrastructure (IFC 4.3) liiska aragtida si aad u aragto waddooyinka, jidadka tareenada, buundooyinka iyo shaqooyinka badda, oo lagu wada geeyo nooca iyo qaabka, iyada oo dherer, aag iyo mug uu faylku sheegay. Qadar uu faylku aanu sheegin waa la reebaa, weligeedna lama xisaabiyo. U dir qadarka infrastructure TakeoffCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl .quantities.json oo TakeoffCraft u furta sida qadarka nooca loo qoray.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"live-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuqaalka tooska ah","summary":"Panel ku dhow moodelka oo muujinaya isagoo ah muuqaal wakhtiga dhabta ah, oo leh qorraxda, hooska iyo iftiinka dib u celinta; ku soco gudihiisa oo dejin waqtiga maalinta iyo bilaha.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["muuqaalka tooska ah","wakhtiga dhabta ah","real-time","sawir wakhtiga dhabta ah","socod","socod gudihiis","qof-koowaad","bandhig","macmiil","shaashad labaad","daaqad labaad","monitor","waqtiga maalinta","qorraxda","xilli","bil","hooska","hadhaaga","iftiinka dib u celinta","iftiinka caalami","webgpu","webgl"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"xakamaynta","text":"Xakamaynta","level":2},{"id":"soco-gudihiisa","text":"Soco gudihiisa","level":2},{"id":"iftiinka-dib-u-celinta","text":"Iftiinka dib u celinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu muujiyaa moodelka qaabka wakhtiga dhabta ah: cirka iyo qorraxda marka loo eego meesha goobtaada iyo taariikhda, hooska qorraxda, midabada iyo alaabta aad u dhiibtay walxaha, nalalka, iyo iftiinka laga celiyo darbiyada iyo sagxadaha. Wuxuu raacaa waxa aad samaynayso: u leexi aragga 3D wuuna u leexdaa, bedel moodelka wuxuu tusaa isbeddelka ilbiriqsi kadib. Waxba lama soo rarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu sawiraa isla muuqaalka, midabada, nalalka iyo qorraxda sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ESawir samee\u003C/a\u003E; sawir dhammaystiran u isticmaal taas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah\u003C/span\u003E qalabka. Panel-ku wuxuu ku furmaa dusha app-ka, dhinaca midig hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid cinwaankiisa si aad u dhaqaajiso; jiid geeskiisa si aad u weyneyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah daaqad cusub\u003C/span\u003E (badhanka ku xiga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaaqad cusub\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka wuxuu u wareejiyaa daaqad u gaar ah, shaashad labaad. Haddii browser-kaagu xayirayo daaqadaha pop-up, wuxuu ku furmaa sida panel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuu xirayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xakamaynta\"\u003EXakamaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXakamaynta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkuu daaran yahay: muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu eegaa meesha aragga 3D eegayo. Socodka wuu damiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoco\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu soco moodelka (hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECufka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkaad socoto: istaag sagxadaha oo kor u kac jaranjarooyinka. Damaysan: duul\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqtiga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaacadda maalinta. Qorraxdu way dhaqaaqdaa markaad jiidato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBil\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBisha, si aad u aragto qorraxda jiilaalka iyo xagaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKombiyuutarkan\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooseeya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa waxa muujinaya aragga (WebGPU ama WebGL 2), tayada iyo iftiinka dib u celinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soco-gudihiisa\"\u003ESoco gudihiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeexi aragga 3D meesha aad rabto inaad taagnaato oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoco\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad taagnaataa sagxadda ka hoosaysa barta indhaha aragga, dhererkaagana waa 1.6 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji muuqaalka tooska ah, kadibna isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama furayaasha falka. Hoos u hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u orodo. Jiid si aad u eegto wareeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabo ilaa 40 cm waa la kor u kacaa (jaranjarooyinka); wax ka sareeya waa darbi. Darbiyada ayaa ku joojiya, waxaadna ku sii dhaartaa dhinacyadooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECufka\u003C/span\u003E damiyo waad duushaa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa kor u kacda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa hoos u dhacda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiinka-dib-u-celinta\"\u003EIftiinka dib u celinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIftiinka ka soo noqda darbi qorraxda ku jirta oo ku dhaca sagxadda, iyo dhinaca mugdiga ah ee qolka, waxaa lagu xisaabinayaa dadaal duwan oo ku dhex jira dhammaan core-yada processor-ka. Inta uu shaqeynayo, sadarka hoose wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka dib u celinta: 40 %\u003C/span\u003E; markuu diyaar yahay, muuqaalku wuu qaataa. Isbeddel kasta kadib wuu dib u bilaabaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa qiyaas muuqaalka tooska ah, ma aha sawir la sameeyay: faahfaahinta yar ee u dhexaysa dhibcaha waxay helaan iftiinka dib u celinta dhibcaha ku dhow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Halka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa; meelaha kale wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGL 2 wuuna la mid yahay. Haddii labaduba ka maqan yihiin, panel-ku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu muujiyaa moodelka qaabka wakhtiga dhabta ah: cirka iyo qorraxda marka loo eego meesha goobtaada iyo taariikhda, hooska qorraxda, midabada iyo alaabta aad u dhiibtay walxaha, nalalka, iyo iftiinka laga celiyo darbiyada iyo sagxadaha. Wuxuu raacaa waxa aad samaynayso: u leexi aragga 3D wuuna u leexdaa, bedel moodelka wuxuu tusaa isbeddelka ilbiriqsi kadib. Waxba lama soo rarin. Wuxuu sawiraa isla muuqaalka, midabada, nalalka iyo qorraxda sida Sawir samee; sawir dhammaystiran u isticmaal taas. Fur Fur moodel oo dooro Muuqaalka tooska ah qalabka. Panel-ku wuxuu ku furmaa dusha app-ka, dhinaca midig hoose. Jiid cinwaankiisa si aad u dhaqaajiso; jiid geeskiisa si aad u weyneyso. Muuqaalka tooska ah daaqad cusub (badhanka ku xiga) ama Daaqad cusub ee panel-ka wuxuu u wareejiyaa daaqad u gaar ah, shaashad labaad. Haddii browser-kaagu xayirayo daaqadaha pop-up, wuxuu ku furmaa sida panel. Xir wuu xirayaa. Xakamaynta Xakamaynta Waxa uu sameeyo Raac muuqaalka Markuu daaran yahay: muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu eegaa meesha aragga 3D eegayo. Socodka wuu damiyaa Soco Ku soco moodelka (hoos) Cufka Markaad socoto: istaag sagxadaha oo kor u kac jaranjarooyinka. Damaysan: duul Waqtiga Saacadda maalinta. Qorraxdu way dhaqaaqdaa markaad jiidato Bil Bisha, si aad u aragto qorraxda jiilaalka iyo xagaaga Tayada Kombiyuutarkan, ama Hooseeya, Dhexdhexaad ama Sare Sadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa waxa muujinaya aragga (WebGPU ama WebGL 2), tayada iyo iftiinka dib u celinta. Soco gudihiisa Leexi aragga 3D meesha aad rabto inaad taagnaato oo dooro Soco. Waxaad taagnaataa sagxadda ka hoosaysa barta indhaha aragga, dhererkaagana waa 1.6 m. Guji muuqaalka tooska ah, kadibna isticmaal W A S D ama furayaasha falka. Hoos u hay Shift si aad u orodo. Jiid si aad u eegto wareeg. Tallaabo ilaa 40 cm waa la kor u kacaa (jaranjarooyinka); wax ka sareeya waa darbi. Darbiyada ayaa ku joojiya, waxaadna ku sii dhaartaa dhinacyadooda. Markii Cufka damiyo waad duushaa: E ayaa kor u kacda, Q ayaa hoos u dhacda. Esc wuxuu joojiyaa socodka. Iftiinka dib u celinta Iftiinka ka soo noqda darbi qorraxda ku jirta oo ku dhaca sagxadda, iyo dhinaca mugdiga ah ee qolka, waxaa lagu xisaabinayaa dadaal duwan oo ku dhex jira dhammaan core-yada processor-ka. Inta uu shaqeynayo, sadarka hoose wuxuu leeyahay Iftiinka dib u celinta: 40 %; markuu diyaar yahay, muuqaalku wuu qaataa. Isbeddel kasta kadib wuu dib u bilaabaa. Tani waa qiyaas muuqaalka tooska ah, ma aha sawir la sameeyay: faahfaahinta yar ee u dhexaysa dhibcaha waxay helaan iftiinka dib u celinta dhibcaha ku dhow. Browser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Halka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa; meelaha kale wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGL 2 wuuna la mid yahay. Haddii labaduba ka maqan yihiin, panel-ku wuu sheegaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"paint-materials","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Rinji agabka darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada","summary":"Ku sii agab sida dubeed, siding, shingles, alwaax, dhagax, tayil ama kongareeto unsuriyada, dhammaantood ama hal dhinac, oo lagu kaydiyo IFC-ga oo lagu muujiyo sawirrada rendered.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["rinji","agab","agabyo","dhammeystir","dhammeystiro","tekstuur","dubeed","siding","shingles","saqaf","alwaax","dhagax","tayil","kongareeto","istukoo","dhul","muraayad","bir","dhinaca darbiga","gudaha","dibedda","dhammeystirka sagxadda","qol","nooca dusha"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-rinji-unsuriyada","text":"Ku rinji unsuriyada","level":2},{"id":"ku-rinji-hal-dhinac","text":"Ku rinji hal dhinac","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-agab","text":"Ka saar agab","level":2},{"id":"faylka-dhexdiisa","text":"Faylka dhexdiisa","level":2},{"id":"tekstuurrada-aragtida-3d","text":"Tekstuurrada aragtida 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu furaa maktabadda agabka oo ku korraysa aragtida 3D: dubeed iyo block, siding, saqaf, alwaax, dhagax, tayil, kongareeto, istukoo, dhul, dhalaalo iyo bir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-rinji-unsuriyada\"\u003EKu rinji unsuriyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix agab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix unsuriyada aragtida 3D. Riix kasta wuxuu rinjiyaa unsurka aad riixday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad tiro badan wada u rinjiso, marka hore dooro (riix, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003Eraadin\u003C/a\u003E), kadibna riix agabka: unsur kasta oo la doortay wuxuu qaadanayaa tallaabo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnsurku wuxuu isla markiiba muujinayaa midabka agabka aragtida 3D. Teksjarkiisa wuxuu ka muuqdaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003Esawirka rendered\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammaynaya rinjiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-rinji-hal-dhinac\"\u003EKu rinji hal dhinac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the side clicked\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix dhinaca aad rabto: dibedda darbi siding ku jira iyo gudaha isla darbiga dhammeystir kale ku jira, ama korka sagxad alwaax oo hoosta lagu daayo sidii ay ahayd. Qaybta kale ee unsurka ayaa ilaalinaysa agabkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca waxaa laga helaa jihooyinka unsurka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuu isla dhinaca ku sii jiraa marka aad wareejiso ama aad u rogto unsurka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad sagxadaha qol qol ugu rinjiso, qol kasta siiso sagxaddiisa gaarka ah (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloor\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EQolkan\u003C/strong\u003E, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EQolalka, sagxadaha, saqaf-hoosaha iyo saqafyada\u003C/a\u003E), kadibna rinji korka sagxad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-agab\"\u003EKa saar agab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENo material\u003C/span\u003E (xariijimo midabka leh), kadibna riix unsurka. Agab kasta oo ku jira, dhinacyadiisa oo dhan, ayaa baxa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-dhexdiisa\"\u003EFaylka dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERinjigu wuxuu beddelaa IFC (tallaabo kasta mid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya) wuuna ku sii jiraa IFC caadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eunsur kasta oo la rinjiyay wuxuu helaa hab-sifada \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Render\u003C/code\u003E oo magacaabaysa agabkiisa, iyo hal sifo dhinac kasta oo la rinjiyay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejirkiisa wuxuu helaa qaab dusha ah oo leh midabka agabka, si barnaamijyada BIM kale ay midabka u muujiyaan. Qaabka IFC4 wuxuu sidoo kale magacaabaa tekstuurka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka BimCraft uu darbi aad rinjiyeysay dib u qaabeeyo (tusaale ahaan aad dhamaadkiisa u wareejiso), darbigu wuxuu ilaalinayaa agabkiisa iyo midabkiisa: BimCraft-ka, sawirrada iyo barnaamijyada kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETekstuurrada waxaa sameeya BimCraft laftiisa: waxay shaqeeyaan adigoon internet lahayn, waana bilaash in lagu isticmaalo wax kasta (CC0). Tekstuurradaada sawirka gaarka ah weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tekstuurrada-aragtida-3d\"\u003ETekstuurrada aragtida 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi dubeed ah oo la rinjiyay wuxuu muujinayaa dubeedkiisa, sagxad alwaax ahna lawaaxyadiisa, cabbirkooda dhabta ah, rinjiga markuu saaran yahay. Ka saar calaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji tekstuurrada aragtida 3D\u003C/strong\u003E paletka Rinji si aad midabyo caadi ah u aragto (moodeel aad u weyn ayaa iskiis u damiya oo sheegta). Midabka sifada wuxuu had iyo jeer muujinayaa midabkiisa. Tekstuurrada barnaamijku ayaa sameeya, sidaas darteed waxba lama soo dejinayo; render-yada iyo faylka glTF labaduba way qaadaan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Paint qalabka sare wuxuu furaa maktabadda agabka oo ku korraysa aragtida 3D: dubeed iyo block, siding, saqaf, alwaax, dhagax, tayil, kongareeto, istukoo, dhul, dhalaalo iyo bir. Ku rinji unsuriyada Riix Paint. Riix agab. Riix unsuriyada aragtida 3D. Riix kasta wuxuu rinjiyaa unsurka aad riixday. Si aad tiro badan wada u rinjiso, marka hore dooro (riix, Ctrl+riix, ama raadin), kadibna riix agabka: unsur kasta oo la doortay wuxuu qaadanayaa tallaabo keliya. Unsurku wuxuu isla markiiba muujinayaa midabka agabka aragtida 3D. Teksjarkiisa wuxuu ka muuqdaa sawirka rendered. Esc ama Close ayaa dhammaynaya rinjiga. Ku rinji hal dhinac Dooro Only the side clicked, kadibna riix dhinaca aad rabto: dibedda darbi siding ku jira iyo gudaha isla darbiga dhammeystir kale ku jira, ama korka sagxad alwaax oo hoosta lagu daayo sidii ay ahayd. Qaybta kale ee unsurka ayaa ilaalinaysa agabkeeda. Dhinaca waxaa laga helaa jihooyinka unsurka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuu isla dhinaca ku sii jiraa marka aad wareejiso ama aad u rogto unsurka. Si aad sagxadaha qol qol ugu rinjiso, qol kasta siiso sagxaddiisa gaarka ah (Draw › Floor › Qolkan, eeg Qolalka, sagxadaha, saqaf-hoosaha iyo saqafyada), kadibna rinji korka sagxad kasta. Ka saar agab Riix No material (xariijimo midabka leh), kadibna riix unsurka. Agab kasta oo ku jira, dhinacyadiisa oo dhan, ayaa baxa. Faylka dhexdiisa Rinjigu wuxuu beddelaa IFC (tallaabo kasta mid, Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya) wuuna ku sii jiraa IFC caadi: unsur kasta oo la rinjiyay wuxuu helaa hab-sifada CadCraft_Render oo magacaabaysa agabkiisa, iyo hal sifo dhinac kasta oo la rinjiyay; jirkiisa wuxuu helaa qaab dusha ah oo leh midabka agabka, si barnaamijyada BIM kale ay midabka u muujiyaan. Qaabka IFC4 wuxuu sidoo kale magacaabaa tekstuurka. Marka BimCraft uu darbi aad rinjiyeysay dib u qaabeeyo (tusaale ahaan aad dhamaadkiisa u wareejiso), darbigu wuxuu ilaalinayaa agabkiisa iyo midabkiisa: BimCraft-ka, sawirrada iyo barnaamijyada kale. Tekstuurrada waxaa sameeya BimCraft laftiisa: waxay shaqeeyaan adigoon internet lahayn, waana bilaash in lagu isticmaalo wax kasta (CC0). Tekstuurradaada sawirka gaarka ah weli lama dhisin. Tekstuurrada aragtida 3D Darbi dubeed ah oo la rinjiyay wuxuu muujinayaa dubeedkiisa, sagxad alwaax ahna lawaaxyadiisa, cabbirkooda dhabta ah, rinjiga markuu saaran yahay. Ka saar calaamadda Muuji tekstuurrada aragtida 3D paletka Rinji si aad midabyo caadi ah u aragto (moodeel aad u weyn ayaa iskiis u damiya oo sheegta). Midabka sifada wuxuu had iyo jeer muujinayaa midabkiisa. Tekstuurrada barnaamijku ayaa sameeya, sidaas darteed waxba lama soo dejinayo; render-yada iyo faylka glTF labaduba way qaadaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"drawing-advice","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Talo naqshadeed: cabbirro aan caadi ahayn waa la sameeyaa, iyo digniin","summary":"BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa waxa aad codsatay. Cabbir ka baxsan caadiga ah wuxuu noqdaa digniin ku jirta Dhibaatooyin; ma joojiso sawirka ama kaydinta.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["talo","digniin","dhibaatooyin","la diido","ma sawirto","aad u yar","aad u cidhiidhi","ugu yar","xad","ballaca jaranjarka","joogga tallaabada","tiir","jid kor u kacaya","cabbirka albaabka","khadka shabakada","joogga heerka","dormer","jaranjarka wareega","dhulka aasaaska","darbi gaaban","xannibaad ma jiro"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waa-talo","text":"Waa talo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wali-la-diido","text":"Waxa wali la diido","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir ama beddel cabbir aan caadi ahayn, oo arag meesha BimCraft kuu sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir ama beddel walxa sida aad rabto: tusaale ahaan jaranjar 400 mm ballac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa sida aad codsatay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka sare. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ETalo naqshadeed\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa ku jira digniin magaca walxa sheegta, cabbirka aad bixisay, iyo kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix digniinta si aad u doorato walxa. Beddel cabbirka haddii ay tahay khalad, ama ka tag: digniinta waa la aqbali karaa, sabab la&#039;aan ama sabab leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-talo\"\u003EWaa talo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay ahaan jireen kuwo la diidi jiray. Hadda waa la sameeyaa, mid walba digniin leh:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJaranjarro\u003C/strong\u003E: ballac ka yar 500 mm ama ka weyn 5 m; sare-jogyada ka baxsan 100 ilaa 300 mm; sagxadaha jaranjarka ka baxsan 150 ilaa 600 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJaranjarro wareega\u003C/strong\u003E: post ka baxsan 40 ilaa 400 mm; sagxado ka yar 100 mm qoto dheer marka laga eego khadka socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar 50 mm dhererka ama ka yar 300 mm joogga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidadka kor u kacaya (ramps)\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar 300 mm ballac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabo iyo daaqado\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar 100 mm ballac ama joog.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadadka shabakada\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar 100 mm dherer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E: darbi ka hadhay ka yar 50 mm dherer, tusaale ahaan kadib jar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar 1 m ama ka weyn 100 m joog (dhis cusub, heerar kala qaybsan, joogga heer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDormer-yada\u003C/strong\u003E: ballac ka baxsan 600 mm ilaa 12 m, darbiga hore ka baxsan 300 mm ilaa 4 m, dhex-dhaaf ka weyn 1 m, darbiyada ka baxsan 50 ilaa 400 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka aasaaska\u003C/strong\u003E: jiidadka dhinacyada ka baxsan 1:1 ilaa 10:1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wali-la-diido\"\u003EWaxa wali la diido\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaliya waxa aan la dhisi karin ama la heli karin, mid walba fariin sheegta sababta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbir ka yar 10 mm (darbi ka yar 1 mm): ma jiro wax la dhisi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDormer aan ka ballaaran laba jibbaarka dhumucda darbigiisa: labada darbi ee dhinacyada way kulmi lahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhul aasaas oo jiidadka dhinacyadu ka adkaado 0.1:1 (taasi waa darbi xannibaad) ama ka jiifo 100:1 (sawirku wuu sii socon lahaa aan dhammaad lahayn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax aan ku habboonayn meesha aad ku dhigtay, qaab isgoysa, ama walax aan weli moodel ku jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETalada waxa laga shaqeeyaa moodelka, sidaas darteed mar kale way ku jirtaa marka aad faylka dib u furto, waxayna baxaysaa marka cabbirka la saxo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubinta moodelka, xeerarka qorshaha iyo hubinta IDS sidoo kale kaliya waxay liistaan wixii ay helaan. Waxba ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E ma joojiyo sawirka ama kaydinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah waa dhaqanka guud, ma aha xeer dhismo. Xeer, ku dar add-on-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerarka dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro meeshaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\"\u003EJaranjarrada iyo gacan-qabsiga\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Sawir ama beddel cabbir aan caadi ahayn, oo arag meesha BimCraft kuu sheegayo. Tallaabooyin Sawir ama beddel walxa sida aad rabto: tusaale ahaan jaranjar 400 mm ballac. BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa sida aad codsatay. Fur Dhibaatooyin bar-ka sare. Hoosta Talo naqshadeed waxaa ku jira digniin magaca walxa sheegta, cabbirka aad bixisay, iyo kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah. Riix digniinta si aad u doorato walxa. Beddel cabbirka haddii ay tahay khalad, ama ka tag: digniinta waa la aqbali karaa, sabab la'aan ama sabab leh. Waa talo Kuwan waxay ahaan jireen kuwo la diidi jiray. Hadda waa la sameeyaa, mid walba digniin leh: Jaranjarro: ballac ka yar 500 mm ama ka weyn 5 m; sare-jogyada ka baxsan 100 ilaa 300 mm; sagxadaha jaranjarka ka baxsan 150 ilaa 600 mm. Jaranjarro wareega: post ka baxsan 40 ilaa 400 mm; sagxado ka yar 100 mm qoto dheer marka laga eego khadka socodka. Tiirarka: ka yar 50 mm dhererka ama ka yar 300 mm joogga. Jidadka kor u kacaya (ramps): ka yar 300 mm ballac. Albaabo iyo daaqado: ka yar 100 mm ballac ama joog. Khadadka shabakada: ka yar 100 mm dherer. Darbiyada: darbi ka hadhay ka yar 50 mm dherer, tusaale ahaan kadib jar. Heerarka: ka yar 1 m ama ka weyn 100 m joog (dhis cusub, heerar kala qaybsan, joogga heer). Dormer-yada: ballac ka baxsan 600 mm ilaa 12 m, darbiga hore ka baxsan 300 mm ilaa 4 m, dhex-dhaaf ka weyn 1 m, darbiyada ka baxsan 50 ilaa 400 mm. Dhulka aasaaska: jiidadka dhinacyada ka baxsan 1:1 ilaa 10:1. Waxa wali la diido Kaliya waxa aan la dhisi karin ama la heli karin, mid walba fariin sheegta sababta: Cabbir ka yar 10 mm (darbi ka yar 1 mm): ma jiro wax la dhisi karo. Dormer aan ka ballaaran laba jibbaarka dhumucda darbigiisa: labada darbi ee dhinacyada way kulmi lahaayeen. Dhul aasaas oo jiidadka dhinacyadu ka adkaado 0.1:1 (taasi waa darbi xannibaad) ama ka jiifo 100:1 (sawirku wuu sii socon lahaa aan dhammaad lahayn). Wax aan ku habboonayn meesha aad ku dhigtay, qaab isgoysa, ama walax aan weli moodel ku jirin. Waxa muhiim ah Talada waxa laga shaqeeyaa moodelka, sidaas darteed mar kale way ku jirtaa marka aad faylka dib u furto, waxayna baxaysaa marka cabbirka la saxo. Hubinta moodelka, xeerarka qorshaha iyo hubinta IDS sidoo kale kaliya waxay liistaan wixii ay helaan. Waxba ku jira Dhibaatooyin ma joojiyo sawirka ama kaydinta. Kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah waa dhaqanka guud, ma aha xeer dhismo. Xeer, ku dar add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha oo dooro meeshaada. Xiga Hubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah Jaranjarrada iyo gacan-qabsiga","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tags-and-schedules","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Calaamadi walxaha oo jadwal ku samee calaamadda","summary":"Qeex calaamadahaaga (magac, nooc, qiimayaasha la oggol yahay, fasalada), calaamadi walxo badan mar keliya, oo samee jadwallo tiirarkoodu, shaandhaysiyadoodu iyo kooxahoodu akhriyaan calaamadaha. Calaamadaha waxay ku kaydsan yihiin IFC.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["tags","tag","tagging","custom properties","parameters","shared parameters","property set","pset","schedule","filter","group by","finish","fire rating","bulk edit","csv","calaamad","calaamadaha","sifooyin","jadwal","shaandheyn","kooxee","dhamaystir","heer dab","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka","text":"Tillaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"noocyada","text":"Noocyada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad waa sifo aad leedahay, sida \u003Cem\u003EFinish\u003C/em\u003E ama \u003Cem\u003EFire rating\u003C/em\u003E. Mar keliya ayaad qeexaysaa mashruuca, waxaana lagu dejiyaa walxo badan oo isku mar ah, BimCraft jadwal walba ayuu akhrin karaa: jadwalka calaamadaha halkan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, Find, Color by property iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/documents-from-the-model\"\u003EDocuments from the model\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka\"\u003ETillaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC, ama bilow dhismo cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca bidix, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETags\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tag\u003C/span\u003E. Siiso magac, dooro nooca, haddii aad rabto liiska qiimayaasha la oggol yahay (kala soo reeb commas) iyo fasalada ay u tahay (\u003Ccode\u003EIfcDoor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EIfcWall\u003C/code\u003E …). Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the tag\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walxaha moodelka (Find way kaa caawinaysaa: dooro albaabada oo dhan mar keliya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag the selection\u003C/span\u003E, dooro ama ku qor qiime calaamad kasta oo aad rabto inaad dejiso, kuwa kale ka tag ahaan siday yihiin, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply to … selected elements\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag schedule\u003C/span\u003E, calaamee tiirarka, ku dar shaandheyn, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroup by\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload CSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabo ku jirta liiska isbeddelka oo loogu talagalay qeexid kasta oo la kaydiyay iyo calaamad kasta oo la dhigay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha fasal aan calaamaddu u ahayn waa laga reebay calaamadda, sadarka xaaladdu waxay sheegaysaa tirada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJadwalka calaamadaha wuxuu liiskarayaa hal safka walax kasta, oo lagu kooxeeyay goobta aad dooratay; riix unugga ugu horreeya safka si aad walxaas u doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liiskarayaa calaamadaha hoosta \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Tags\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed halkaas waxaad ku wada tiri kartaa balaadhka ama tirooyinka calaamad kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada\"\u003ENoocyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyadu waa isku liiska sida parameters-ka qoyska: Length (millimeters), Angle (degrees), Number, Whole number, Yes / No, Pen (1–16), Text, Material iyo Fill. Qiime aan ku habboonayn nooceeda, ama aan ahayn mid ka mid ah qiimayaasha la oggol yahay, waa la diidaa oo fariin ayaa la siiyaa, wax kalena ma beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta waa IFC caadi ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale qiimayaasha way akhrin karaan: qeexidda waxay ku jirtaa property set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_TagDefs\u003C/code\u003E mashruuca, qiimayaasha waxay ku jiraan property set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Tags\u003C/code\u003E walx kasta (hal sifo oo calaamad kasta). Dhererka waxaa lagu qoraa unugga dhererka faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EIfcWall\u003C/code\u003E ee fasalada calaamadda waxay sidoo kale ku daraysaa darbiyada standard-case iyo kuwa elemented.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac-bedelka calaamad wuxuu magacaa qiimayaasheeda walx kasta isla tallaabo kaas. Calaamad tirtirida waxay tirtirtaa oo keliya qeexiddeeda: qiimayaasha hore loo dejiyay waxay ku sii jiraan walxaha sifooyin caadi ah. Marka hore nadiifi (dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E) si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha habka CadCraft drafting app (block attributes) weli lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Calaamad waa sifo aad leedahay, sida Finish ama Fire rating. Mar keliya ayaad qeexaysaa mashruuca, waxaana lagu dejiyaa walxo badan oo isku mar ah, BimCraft jadwal walba ayuu akhrin karaa: jadwalka calaamadaha halkan, Quantities, Find, Color by property iyo Documents from the model. Tillaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC, ama bilow dhismo cusub. Dhinaca bidix, hoosta Quantities, fur Tags. Riix Add a tag. Siiso magac, dooro nooca, haddii aad rabto liiska qiimayaasha la oggol yahay (kala soo reeb commas) iyo fasalada ay u tahay (IfcDoor, IfcWall …). Riix Add the tag. Dooro walxaha moodelka (Find way kaa caawinaysaa: dooro albaabada oo dhan mar keliya). Hoosta Tag the selection, dooro ama ku qor qiime calaamad kasta oo aad rabto inaad dejiso, kuwa kale ka tag ahaan siday yihiin, kadibna riix Apply to … selected elements. Hoosta Tag schedule, calaamee tiirarka, ku dar shaandheyn, dooro Group by, kadibna riix Download CSV. Waxa aad arki lahayd Tallaabo ku jirta liiska isbeddelka oo loogu talagalay qeexid kasta oo la kaydiyay iyo calaamad kasta oo la dhigay; Undo ayaa soo celinaya. Walxaha fasal aan calaamaddu u ahayn waa laga reebay calaamadda, sadarka xaaladdu waxay sheegaysaa tirada. Jadwalka calaamadaha wuxuu liiskarayaa hal safka walax kasta, oo lagu kooxeeyay goobta aad dooratay; riix unugga ugu horreeya safka si aad walxaas u doorato. Quantities wuxuu liiskarayaa calaamadaha hoosta CadCraft_Tags, sidaas darteed halkaas waxaad ku wada tiri kartaa balaadhka ama tirooyinka calaamad kasta. Noocyada Noocyadu waa isku liiska sida parameters-ka qoyska: Length (millimeters), Angle (degrees), Number, Whole number, Yes / No, Pen (1–16), Text, Material iyo Fill. Qiime aan ku habboonayn nooceeda, ama aan ahayn mid ka mid ah qiimayaasha la oggol yahay, waa la diidaa oo fariin ayaa la siiyaa, wax kalena ma beddelmaan. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Wax kasta waa IFC caadi ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale qiimayaasha way akhrin karaan: qeexidda waxay ku jirtaa property set CadCraft_TagDefs mashruuca, qiimayaasha waxay ku jiraan property set CadCraft_Tags walx kasta (hal sifo oo calaamad kasta). Dhererka waxaa lagu qoraa unugga dhererka faylka. IfcWall ee fasalada calaamadda waxay sidoo kale ku daraysaa darbiyada standard-case iyo kuwa elemented. Magac-bedelka calaamad wuxuu magacaa qiimayaasheeda walx kasta isla tallaabo kaas. Calaamad tirtirida waxay tirtirtaa oo keliya qeexiddeeda: qiimayaasha hore loo dejiyay waxay ku sii jiraan walxaha sifooyin caadi ah. Marka hore nadiifi (dooro Clear) si aad uga saarto. Calaamadaha habka CadCraft drafting app (block attributes) weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-for-rendering","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dir moodelka barnaamijka rendarka","summary":"Keydi waxa muuqaalka 3D muujinayo sida moodel glTF (.glb) oo leh agabkiisa, teksaarkiisa iyo nalalkiisa, loogu talagalay barnaamijyada rendarka iyo muujinta ee akhrisa glTF.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["glb","gltf","gl transmission format","dhoof","rendar","rendering","muuqaal","waqtiga dhabta ah","archviz","agabka","teksaarka","nalalka","hanti","hanti gaar ah"],"headings":[{"id":"keydi","text":"Keydi","level":2},{"id":"waxa-faylku-qaadaa","text":"Waxa faylku qaadaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-ka-tago","text":"Waxa uu ka tago","level":2},{"id":"enscape-iyo-rendarrada-plug-in","text":"Enscape iyo rendarrada plug-in","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEe soo bandhigga\u003C/span\u003E safka toolbar-ka wuxuu keydiyaa waxa muuqaalka 3D muujinayo hal fayl \u003Cstrong\u003E.glb\u003C/strong\u003E (glTF 2.0, qaabka furan ee Khronos Group). Barnaamijyada rendarka ee akhrisa glTF waxay ku furaan agabkiisa iyo nalalkiisa; Twinmotion wuxuu liistaa glTF iyo GLB marka faylasha geometry-ga uu soo dhoofiyo, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa nalalkooda (dokumentiga Epic, &quot;Importing geometry in Twinmotion&quot;): isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEe soo bandhigga\u003C/span\u003E oo halkaas soo dhoof .glb. Waxba lama soo dirin: faylku kombiyuutarkan ayuu ka sameeyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keydi\"\u003EKeydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodelka IFC oo deji muuqaalka 3D: qari dabaqyada, elementiyada ama moodeelada xiriira ee aadan rabin, oo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/paint-materials\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/paint-materials\"\u003Erinji agabka\u003C/a\u003E aad rabto inaad aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEe soo bandhigga\u003C/span\u003E (ama qor \u003Ccode\u003EGLB\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuxuu soo degayaa magaca &quot;&lt;model name&gt;.glb&quot;. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa tirada saddex-geesoodka, agabka iyo nalalka uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-faylku-qaadaa\"\u003EWaxa faylku qaadaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeometry\u003C/strong\u003E ee elementi kasta oo muuqaalka 3D muujinayo, meetarro ku qoran, Y oo kor u socda (dhidibada glTF ee u gaarka ah). Hal shay dabaq kasta iyo agab kasta, oo magacyada ah &quot;Level 1 — Brick, red&quot;, si aad agabka barnaamijka rendarka ugu doorato oo aad ugu beddesho midka u gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka:\u003C/strong\u003E midab kasta oo leh muuqaalka aad u dooratay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERendar\u003C/a\u003E (matte, satin, glossy, metal, glass…), iyo agab kasta oo maktabad ah oo la rinjiyey leh midabkiisa, roughness iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eteksaarkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E (sawirkiisa wuxuu ku jiraa faylka, cabbir u dhigan cabbirkiisa dhabta ah: laba-dhagax waa cabbirka laba-dhagax). Muraayadda way ka muuqataa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENalalka:\u003C/strong\u003E dhammaan nalalka iftiinka ee lagu daray Rendar › Lamps oo shidan, sida nalka dhibcaha ama nalka xagal, oo leh iftiinkooda (lumen oo loo beddelay candela), midabkooda iyo xagasha ifka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha goobta:\u003C/strong\u003E latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka goobta ayaa lagu qoray faylka tixraac ahaan. Barnaamijyada rendarku waxay leeyihiin qorraxdooda; ku qor goobta gudaheeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-ka-tago\"\u003EWaxa uu ka tago\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGooyada qaybta (elementiyada oo dhan ayaa galaya) iyo elementiyada muuqda si dhalaalaya (waa la ka tagayaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElementi-elementi objects (hal shay dabaq kasta iyo agab kasta bedelkiisa), IFC properties, bump maps, muuqaallada la keydiyay iyo socodyada la duubay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEdges iyo background.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enscape-iyo-rendarrada-plug-in\"\u003EEnscape iyo rendarrada plug-in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnscape wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa barnaamij naqshadeed kale oo ma leh fayl lagu furi karo mashruuc oo dhan. Laba siyaabood:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodelka \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E (File › Save) barnaamijka uu Enscape ku shaqeeyo; intooda badan waxay akhriyaan IFC. Midabyada way yimaadaan; agabka maktabada waxay yimaadaan sida midabkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo geli \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb yar\u003C/strong\u003E (alaab guri, qalab) sida hanti gaar ah: marka hore kala soo saar, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnscape ee (.gltf)\u003C/span\u003E. Maktabada hantida gaarka ah ee Enscape waxay liistaa faylal .gltf, .obj iyo .fbx, ma aha .glb, sidaas darteed badhankan wuxuu keydiyaa isla muuqaalka sida \u003Cstrong\u003E.gltf\u003C/strong\u003E oo keligiis ah (xogta binary iyo sawirrada faylka ayey ku jiraan; ma jiro wax kale oo lagu wada koobiyeeyo). Enscape wuxuu talinayaa hanti yar (ka yar qiyaastii 20,000 saddex-geesood).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio-ga isla faylka glTF (iyo faylka USD) waxa laga keydin karaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E › Engine › \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka glTF\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka USD\u003C/strong\u003E, ama si toos ah loogu furi karaa barnaamij kombiyuutarkan ku jira: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EFur muuqaalka barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E. Plug-in ama xidhiidh toos ah oo Enscape ama Twinmotion ah lama dhisin. Qaababka FBX iyo Datasmith looma qoro sifo la daabacay, sidaas darteed BimCraft ma qoro; glTF waa jidka furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Ee soo bandhigga safka toolbar-ka wuxuu keydiyaa waxa muuqaalka 3D muujinayo hal fayl .glb (glTF 2.0, qaabka furan ee Khronos Group). Barnaamijyada rendarka ee akhrisa glTF waxay ku furaan agabkiisa iyo nalalkiisa; Twinmotion wuxuu liistaa glTF iyo GLB marka faylasha geometry-ga uu soo dhoofiyo, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa nalalkooda (dokumentiga Epic, \"Importing geometry in Twinmotion\"): isticmaal Ee soo bandhigga oo halkaas soo dhoof .glb. Waxba lama soo dirin: faylku kombiyuutarkan ayuu ka sameeyaa. Keydi Fur moodelka IFC oo deji muuqaalka 3D: qari dabaqyada, elementiyada ama moodeelada xiriira ee aadan rabin, oo rinji agabka aad rabto inaad aragto. Guji Ee soo bandhigga (ama qor GLB). Faylku wuxuu soo degayaa magaca \"\u003Cmodel name\u003E.glb\". Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa tirada saddex-geesoodka, agabka iyo nalalka uu hayo. Waxa faylku qaadaa Geometry ee elementi kasta oo muuqaalka 3D muujinayo, meetarro ku qoran, Y oo kor u socda (dhidibada glTF ee u gaarka ah). Hal shay dabaq kasta iyo agab kasta, oo magacyada ah \"Level 1 — Brick, red\", si aad agabka barnaamijka rendarka ugu doorato oo aad ugu beddesho midka u gaarka ah. Agabka: midab kasta oo leh muuqaalka aad u dooratay Rendar (matte, satin, glossy, metal, glass…), iyo agab kasta oo maktabad ah oo la rinjiyey leh midabkiisa, roughness iyo teksaarkiisa (sawirkiisa wuxuu ku jiraa faylka, cabbir u dhigan cabbirkiisa dhabta ah: laba-dhagax waa cabbirka laba-dhagax). Muraayadda way ka muuqataa. Nalalka: dhammaan nalalka iftiinka ee lagu daray Rendar › Lamps oo shidan, sida nalka dhibcaha ama nalka xagal, oo leh iftiinkooda (lumen oo loo beddelay candela), midabkooda iyo xagasha ifka. Meesha goobta: latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka goobta ayaa lagu qoray faylka tixraac ahaan. Barnaamijyada rendarku waxay leeyihiin qorraxdooda; ku qor goobta gudaheeda. Waxa uu ka tago Gooyada qaybta (elementiyada oo dhan ayaa galaya) iyo elementiyada muuqda si dhalaalaya (waa la ka tagayaa). Elementi-elementi objects (hal shay dabaq kasta iyo agab kasta bedelkiisa), IFC properties, bump maps, muuqaallada la keydiyay iyo socodyada la duubay. Edges iyo background. Enscape iyo rendarrada plug-in Enscape wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa barnaamij naqshadeed kale oo ma leh fayl lagu furi karo mashruuc oo dhan. Laba siyaabood: Fur moodelka IFC (File › Save) barnaamijka uu Enscape ku shaqeeyo; intooda badan waxay akhriyaan IFC. Midabyada way yimaadaan; agabka maktabada waxay yimaadaan sida midabkooda. Soo geli qayb yar (alaab guri, qalab) sida hanti gaar ah: marka hore kala soo saar, kadibna guji Enscape ee (.gltf). Maktabada hantida gaarka ah ee Enscape waxay liistaa faylal .gltf, .obj iyo .fbx, ma aha .glb, sidaas darteed badhankan wuxuu keydiyaa isla muuqaalka sida .gltf oo keligiis ah (xogta binary iyo sawirrada faylka ayey ku jiraan; ma jiro wax kale oo lagu wada koobiyeeyo). Enscape wuxuu talinayaa hanti yar (ka yar qiyaastii 20,000 saddex-geesood). CadCraft Studio-ga isla faylka glTF (iyo faylka USD) waxa laga keydin karaa Rendar › Engine › Faylka glTF / Faylka USD, ama si toos ah loogu furi karaa barnaamij kombiyuutarkan ku jira: eeg Fur muuqaalka barnaamij kale. Plug-in ama xidhiidh toos ah oo Enscape ama Twinmotion ah lama dhisin. Qaababka FBX iyo Datasmith looma qoro sifo la daabacay, sidaas darteed BimCraft ma qoro; glTF waa jidka furan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"compare-versions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isbarbardhig laba nooc oo moodel ah","summary":"Fur laba nooc oo isla IFC moodel ah oo eeg walxaha lagu daray, la tirtiray iyo kuwa la beddelay, oo lagu isbarbardhigay GlobalId-yadooda, iyo CSV ee isbeddel kasta.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["isbarbardhig","diff","farqi","noocyo","dib u eegis","isbeddel","la beddelay","lagu daray","la tirtiray","la dhaqaajiyay","globalid","guid","waxa isbeddelay"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArag waxa isbeddelay inta u dhexaysa moodelkii aad haysay iyo kii laguu diray: walxaha cusub, kuwa la waayay, kuwa la dhaqaajiyay ama qiimayaal sifo cusub helay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur nooca cusub, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodel…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro kii hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EEeg dhowr moodel IFC isku mar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelo\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig noocyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca hore\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca cusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji walax liiska ku jirta si aad u doorato oo aad u aragto sifooyinkeeda. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hesho isbeddel kasta, sifo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu noqoto muuqaalka caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha \u003Cstrong\u003Elagu daray\u003C/strong\u003E waa buluug, nooca cusub ka yimid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha \u003Cstrong\u003Ela tirtiray\u003C/strong\u003E waa casaan, nooca hore ka yimid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha \u003Cstrong\u003Ela beddelay\u003C/strong\u003E waa jaalle ochre; nooca cusub ka yimid, mid kasta oo leh waxa isbeddelay: sifooyin, dhaqdhaqaaq oo ay fogaatay, ama qaab cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta oo isku mid ah waa muuqaal dhaadhac ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha waxaa lagu isku dhigaa GlobalId-yadooda. Barnaamij bixiya GlobalId cusub mar kasta oo dhoofiyo ayaa ka dhigaya walax kasta mid la tirtiray oo mar kale la daray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeelaha waxaa lagu barbardhigaa halka moodelada ku yaallaan muuqaalka. Haddii mid ka mid ah nooca si ula kac ah loo dhaqaajiyay, marka hore u hagaaji adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jirta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGlobalId la isticmaalay laba jeer moodel gudihiisa waa laga reebay isbarbardhigga. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHubi moodel dhibaatooyin caadi ah\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu helaa kuwaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EArrimaha iyo faylasha BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/quantity-totals\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/quantity-totals\"\u003EKu dar tirooyinka iyada oo lagu salaynayo sifada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Arag waxa isbeddelay inta u dhexaysa moodelkii aad haysay iyo kii laguu diray: walxaha cusub, kuwa la waayay, kuwa la dhaqaajiyay ama qiimayaal sifo cusub helay. Tallaabooyinka Fur nooca cusub, kadibna guji Ku dar moodel… oo dooro kii hore. Eeg Eeg dhowr moodel IFC isku mar. Ku Moodelo, fur Isbarbardhig noocyada. Dooro Nooca hore iyo Nooca cusub. Guji Isbarbardhig. Guji walax liiska ku jirta si aad u doorato oo aad u aragto sifooyinkeeda. Guji Soo deji CSV si aad u hesho isbeddel kasta, sifo kasta. Guji Nadiifi si aad ugu noqoto muuqaalka caadiga ah. Waxa aad arki doontid Walxaha lagu daray waa buluug, nooca cusub ka yimid. Walxaha la tirtiray waa casaan, nooca hore ka yimid. Walxaha la beddelay waa jaalle ochre; nooca cusub ka yimid, mid kasta oo leh waxa isbeddelay: sifooyin, dhaqdhaqaaq oo ay fogaatay, ama qaab cusub. Wax kasta oo isku mid ah waa muuqaal dhaadhac ah. Waxa muhiim ah Walxaha waxaa lagu isku dhigaa GlobalId-yadooda. Barnaamij bixiya GlobalId cusub mar kasta oo dhoofiyo ayaa ka dhigaya walax kasta mid la tirtiray oo mar kale la daray. Meelaha waxaa lagu barbardhigaa halka moodelada ku yaallaan muuqaalka. Haddii mid ka mid ah nooca si ula kac ah loo dhaqaajiyay, marka hore u hagaaji adigoo isticmaalaya Guuri oo ku jirta Moodelo. GlobalId la isticmaalay laba jeer moodel gudihiisa waa laga reebay isbarbardhigga. Hubi moodel dhibaatooyin caadi ah wuxuu helaa kuwaas. Xiga Arrimaha iyo faylasha BCF Ku dar tirooyinka iyada oo lagu salaynayo sifada","lang":"so"},{"slug":"views-and-walkthroughs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Kaydi muuqaalada iyo socodyada","summary":"Kaydi muuqaalada kaamerada ee moodeelka magacyada, ku noqo iyaga, ciyaar midba midka kale ka dib, oo duub socod dhismaha dhexdiisa si aad dib u ciyaarto.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["muuqaalada","muuqaalada la kaydiyay","kaamera","kaamerada","aragtida","goob","goobaha","bandhig","socod","socodka","sii socod","duub","ciyaar","waddo","animation"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-muuqaal","text":"Kaydi muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"ciyaar-muuqaalada","text":"Ciyaar muuqaalada","level":2},{"id":"duub-socod","text":"Duub socod","level":2},{"id":"qor-socodka-fiidiyo","text":"Qor socodka fiidiyo","level":2},{"id":"sheeg-socodka","text":"Sheeg socodka","level":2},{"id":"faylka-dhexdiisa","text":"Faylka dhexdiisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu hayaa kaamerada muuqaalka 3D ee faylka moodeelka, si adiga iyo cid kasta oo aad u dirto ay toos ugu noqon karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-muuqaal\"\u003EKaydi muuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDiyaari muuqaalka 3D: wareeji, weynee, qari waxa aanad rabin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E, ku qor magac (ama ku hay kan la soo jeediyay) oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave view\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagac horey liiska ku jira wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa muuqaalkaas. Guji magaca muuqaal si aad ugu noqoto; kaamerada si nabad ah ayey halkaas u gudubtaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFallaadhaha ayaa beddela tartanka, qalinka magaca wuu beddelaa, bakhsiga wuu tirtiraa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu ka noqdaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ciyaar-muuqaalada\"\u003ECiyaar muuqaalada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay the views\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka gudbaa muuqaal kasta ilaa kan xiga liiska tartankiisa, isagoo joogsadaa wakhti yar mid kasta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E way dhammeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"duub-socod\"\u003EDuub socod\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walk\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walk\"\u003ESocod\u003C/a\u003E oo bilow inaad ku socoto dhismaha gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecord a walk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu soco \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo ku eeg wareegga mouse-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop recording\u003C/span\u003E. Socodka waa la kaydiyaa &quot;Socod 1&quot;, oo dhererkiisa la sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji socod si aad dib ugu ciyaarto sida aad ku socotay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qor-socodka-fiidiyo\"\u003EQor socodka fiidiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji sawirka filimka ee socodka ku xiga. Wada-hadalka fiidiyaha wuxuu sawirayaa frame kasta oo socodka ah, isagoo isticmaalaya dejinta Render ee aad ugu dambeyn dooratay, iyo cabbirka, rate-ka frame-ka iyo tayada aad halkan doorato. Waxaad u kaydin kartaa fiidiyo WebM ama MP4 ah, ama ZIP oo leh sawir kasta frame kasta. Frame-yada waxay qaadan doonaan wakhti sida sawirrada qaadanayaan, sidaas darteed ku bilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuick\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheeg-socodka\"\u003ESheeg socodka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji calaamadda xabbad-hadalka ee socodka ku xiga. Qor hal sadar kasta oo la yiraahdo, oo sadar kasta ku bilow wakhtiga ay bilaabmayso (\u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0:12\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1:02.5\u003C/code\u003E); sadar aan wakhti lahayn waxay raacaysaa sadarka kor ka hor, wakhtiga ay qaadato in la dhaho. Dooro luqadda, luqadda macmiilka haddii uu yahay kan daawanaya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreview\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa erayada codka kombiyuutarkan oo wuxuu muujiyaa sida qoraal-hoosaad; sidaas ayay dhacdaa mar kasta oo socodku ciyaaro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave with the walk\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegta ku kaydiyaa IFC-da socodka la socda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaaliyaha xiriirka kuu leh wuxuu sheegta qori karaa adiga: waxaad ku weydiisaa inuu eego socodka iyo muuqaalada la kaydiyay, kadibna wuxuu dejiyaa sadarrada luqadda aad magacowdo, hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFiidiyaha la sawiray ma leh cod gaar ah, sababtoo ah browser-ku ma duubi karo codkiisa. Kaydi qoraal-hoosaadka (\u003Ccode\u003E.srt\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.vtt\u003C/code\u003E) oo ku dar fiidiyaha player-ka fiidiyaha ama tafatirka. Codadka aad dooran karto waxay ku xidhan yihiin kombiyuutarka; luqad aan cod lagu rakibin weli waxay helaysaa qoraal-hoosaadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-dhexdiisa\"\u003EFaylka dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalada iyo socodyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa IFC sida habayn sifooyinka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Views\u003C/code\u003E mashruuca: IFC caadi ah oo barnaamijyada kale iska daba-dhigaan. Waxay ku jiraan isku-xidhka moodeelka koowaad, sidaas darteed way ku habboonaadaan marka moodeelka dib loo akhriyo ama moodeel kale la daro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad sawir uga sawirto muuqaal kaydsan, tag muuqaalka, kadibna guji \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERendar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Views qalabka sare wuxuu hayaa kaamerada muuqaalka 3D ee faylka moodeelka, si adiga iyo cid kasta oo aad u dirto ay toos ugu noqon karaan. Kaydi muuqaal Diyaari muuqaalka 3D: wareeji, weynee, qari waxa aanad rabin. Guji Views, ku qor magac (ama ku hay kan la soo jeediyay) oo guji Save view ama riix Enter. Magac horey liiska ku jira wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa muuqaalkaas. Guji magaca muuqaal si aad ugu noqoto; kaamerada si nabad ah ayey halkaas u gudubtaa. Fallaadhaha ayaa beddela tartanka, qalinka magaca wuu beddelaa, bakhsiga wuu tirtiraa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z wuu ka noqdaa. Ciyaar muuqaalada Play the views wuxuu ka gudbaa muuqaal kasta ilaa kan xiga liiska tartankiisa, isagoo joogsadaa wakhti yar mid kasta. Esc ama Stop way dhammeeyaan. Duub socod Shid Socod oo bilow inaad ku socoto dhismaha gudihiisa. Ku Views, guji Record a walk. Ku soco W A S D oo ku eeg wareegga mouse-ka. Guji Stop recording. Socodka waa la kaydiyaa \"Socod 1\", oo dhererkiisa la sheegayo. Guji socod si aad dib ugu ciyaarto sida aad ku socotay. Esc wuu joojiyaa. Qor socodka fiidiyo Guji sawirka filimka ee socodka ku xiga. Wada-hadalka fiidiyaha wuxuu sawirayaa frame kasta oo socodka ah, isagoo isticmaalaya dejinta Render ee aad ugu dambeyn dooratay, iyo cabbirka, rate-ka frame-ka iyo tayada aad halkan doorato. Waxaad u kaydin kartaa fiidiyo WebM ama MP4 ah, ama ZIP oo leh sawir kasta frame kasta. Frame-yada waxay qaadan doonaan wakhti sida sawirrada qaadanayaan, sidaas darteed ku bilow Quick. Sheeg socodka Guji calaamadda xabbad-hadalka ee socodka ku xiga. Qor hal sadar kasta oo la yiraahdo, oo sadar kasta ku bilow wakhtiga ay bilaabmayso (12, 0:12 ama 1:02.5); sadar aan wakhti lahayn waxay raacaysaa sadarka kor ka hor, wakhtiga ay qaadato in la dhaho. Dooro luqadda, luqadda macmiilka haddii uu yahay kan daawanaya. Preview wuxuu ciyaaraa erayada codka kombiyuutarkan oo wuxuu muujiyaa sida qoraal-hoosaad; sidaas ayay dhacdaa mar kasta oo socodku ciyaaro. Save with the walk wuxuu sheegta ku kaydiyaa IFC-da socodka la socda. Kaaliyaha xiriirka kuu leh wuxuu sheegta qori karaa adiga: waxaad ku weydiisaa inuu eego socodka iyo muuqaalada la kaydiyay, kadibna wuxuu dejiyaa sadarrada luqadda aad magacowdo, hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah. Fiidiyaha la sawiray ma leh cod gaar ah, sababtoo ah browser-ku ma duubi karo codkiisa. Kaydi qoraal-hoosaadka (.srt ama .vtt) oo ku dar fiidiyaha player-ka fiidiyaha ama tafatirka. Codadka aad dooran karto waxay ku xidhan yihiin kombiyuutarka; luqad aan cod lagu rakibin weli waxay helaysaa qoraal-hoosaadka. Faylka dhexdiisa Muuqaalada iyo socodyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa IFC sida habayn sifooyinka CadCraft_Views mashruuca: IFC caadi ah oo barnaamijyada kale iska daba-dhigaan. Waxay ku jiraan isku-xidhka moodeelka koowaad, sidaas darteed way ku habboonaadaan marka moodeelka dib loo akhriyo ama moodeel kale la daro. Si aad sawir uga sawirto muuqaal kaydsan, tag muuqaalka, kadibna guji Rendar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"linked-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Moodeelo kale isku xidh si loo isku waafajiyo","summary":"Ku muuji moodel IFC kale oo u taal dhinacaaga adiga oo tixraac ku sameynaya (weligiisna lama isku milmin), ku dheji isku-dhafka la wadaago, isku-dhafka khariidadda ama laba dhibcood, ku deg marka aad sawirayso, kuna dib u soo rar marka faylkiisa isbedelo.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["isku xidh","moodel isku xidhan","tixraac","xref","isku waafajin","federation","qaab dhismaha","MEP","la-talin","isku-dhafka la wadaago","sahan","isku-dhafka khariidadda","dib u soo rar","ka soo saar","dokumentiga tixraaca","IfcDocumentReference"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"isku-xidh-moodel","text":"Isku xidh moodel","level":2},{"id":"ku-shaqee-isaga","text":"Ku shaqee isaga","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sawir iyada la-taliyaha moodelkiisa (qaab-dhismaha, adeegyada, dhismaha jira) adiga oo aan wax ku koobiyeynin faylkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelka isku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu muujiyaa aragga 3D, waana la gooyaa khariidaddaada, laakiin weligiis lama bedelo, faylkaagana kuma kaydsana. Moodelkaagu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya xidhiidhka: magaca faylka iyo meesha uu ku yaallo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-xidh-moodel\"\u003EIsku xidh moodel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelo isku xidhan\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka bidix, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xidh moodeel…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka IFC. Isla markiiba wuu muuqdaa, safkiisana wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EWaa la muujiyay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro meesha uu ku yaallo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha dhigista\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhafka la wadaago\u003C/strong\u003E (si bilow ah): isku-dhafkiisu waa kaaga, sida marka labada moodel laga bilaabay isla meel bilow ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhafka khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E: isku-dhafka khariidadda labada faylba ayaa u sii toosiya (labaduba waa inay leeyihiin beddel khariidad; BimCraft wuu sheegaa marka mid uu ka maqan yahay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba dhibcood…\u003C/strong\u003E: guji dhibic moodelka isku xidhan, kadibna meesha uu ku yaallo moodelkaaga; kadibna laba dhibcood oo kale. Xidhiidhka ayaa la wareejiyaa oo la leexiyaa (dhidibka toosan) si uu ugu habboono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta oo xidhiidh ama meel-dhigis ah waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu ka noqdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-shaqee-isaga\"\u003EKu shaqee isaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhariidaddu waxay muujinaysaa moodelka isku xidhan oo la gooyay heerka gooynta ee dabaqa khadad khafiif ah, qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E iyo qalabyada kale ee sawirka ayaa ku xidha geesaha iyo xagalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaybihiisa aragga 3D si aad u akhrido sifooyinkooda. Moodel isku xidhan ma aha kan aad tafatirto, sidaas darteed badhanka raadiyaha ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelo\u003C/span\u003E waa damaysan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylku wuu isbeddelay?\u003C/strong\u003E Marka browser-ku uu daawan karo faylka (fayl la furay doorasho faylka ama gudaha Studio), BimCraft wuxuu dib u soo raraa xidhiidhka isagoo kaligiis ah dhowr ilbiriqsi kadib markii faylka dib loo kaydiyo, wuuna sheegaa. Haddii kale guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u soo rar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo saar\u003C/span\u003E wuu qariyaa oo xorayn xusuusta; xidhiidhku wuxuu ku sii jiraa moodelkaaga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo rar…\u003C/span\u003E wuu mar kale muujiyaa (waxaad dooratay faylka: browser-ku ma furi karo fayl magaceeda kaligeed).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda × waxay ka saartaa xidhiidhka moodelkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylkaaga IFC: IfcDocumentReference mid kasta oo xidhiidh ah (magaca faylka), oo la xidhiidhay mashruuca, iyo meesha uu ku yaallo guddiga sifooyinka mashruuca ee CadCraft_Links. Marka aad dib u furto moodelkaaga, xidhiidhadiisa waxay liistaan \u003Cstrong\u003ELama soo rarin\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa aad soo rarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubinta isku-dhacyada, Barbardhig iyo Raadi waxay isticmaali karaan xidhiidh la soo raray sida moodel furan oo kasta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/several-models\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/several-models\"\u003EDhowr moodelo IFC wada eeg\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku sawir iyada la-taliyaha moodelkiisa (qaab-dhismaha, adeegyada, dhismaha jira) adiga oo aan wax ku koobiyeynin faylkaaga. Moodelka isku xidhan waxaa lagu muujiyaa aragga 3D, waana la gooyaa khariidaddaada, laakiin weligiis lama bedelo, faylkaagana kuma kaydsana. Moodelkaagu wuxuu kaydiyaa oo keliya xidhiidhka: magaca faylka iyo meesha uu ku yaallo. Isku xidh moodel Qaybta Moodeelo isku xidhan ee panel-ka bidix, guji Isku xidh moodeel… oo dooro faylka IFC. Isla markiiba wuu muuqdaa, safkiisana wuxuu leeyahay Waa la muujiyay. Dooro meesha uu ku yaallo Meesha dhigista: Isku-dhafka la wadaago (si bilow ah): isku-dhafkiisu waa kaaga, sida marka labada moodel laga bilaabay isla meel bilow ah. Isku-dhafka khariidadda: isku-dhafka khariidadda labada faylba ayaa u sii toosiya (labaduba waa inay leeyihiin beddel khariidad; BimCraft wuu sheegaa marka mid uu ka maqan yahay). Laba dhibcood…: guji dhibic moodelka isku xidhan, kadibna meesha uu ku yaallo moodelkaaga; kadibna laba dhibcood oo kale. Xidhiidhka ayaa la wareejiyaa oo la leexiyaa (dhidibka toosan) si uu ugu habboono. Isbeddel kasta oo xidhiidh ama meel-dhigis ah waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu ka noqdaa. Ku shaqee isaga Khariidaddu waxay muujinaysaa moodelka isku xidhan oo la gooyay heerka gooynta ee dabaqa khadad khafiif ah, qalabka Darbi iyo qalabyada kale ee sawirka ayaa ku xidha geesaha iyo xagalka. Dooro qaybihiisa aragga 3D si aad u akhrido sifooyinkooda. Moodel isku xidhan ma aha kan aad tafatirto, sidaas darteed badhanka raadiyaha ee Moodelo waa damaysan. Faylku wuu isbeddelay? Marka browser-ku uu daawan karo faylka (fayl la furay doorasho faylka ama gudaha Studio), BimCraft wuxuu dib u soo raraa xidhiidhka isagoo kaligiis ah dhowr ilbiriqsi kadib markii faylka dib loo kaydiyo, wuuna sheegaa. Haddii kale guji Dib u soo rar. Ka soo saar wuu qariyaa oo xorayn xusuusta; xidhiidhku wuxuu ku sii jiraa moodelkaaga. Soo rar… wuu mar kale muujiyaa (waxaad dooratay faylka: browser-ku ma furi karo fayl magaceeda kaligeed). Calaamadda × waxay ka saartaa xidhiidhka moodelkaaga. Waxa aad arki doontid Faylkaaga IFC: IfcDocumentReference mid kasta oo xidhiidh ah (magaca faylka), oo la xidhiidhay mashruuca, iyo meesha uu ku yaallo guddiga sifooyinka mashruuca ee CadCraft_Links. Marka aad dib u furto moodelkaaga, xidhiidhadiisa waxay liistaan Lama soo rarin ilaa aad soo rarto. Hubinta isku-dhacyada, Barbardhig iyo Raadi waxay isticmaali karaan xidhiidh la soo raray sida moodel furan oo kasta: eeg Dhowr moodelo IFC wada eeg.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"views-and-sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuqaalada, heerarka muuqaalka iyo xaashiyadaada","summary":"Hel qorshe kasta, qaab-dhis, goyn, muuqaal 3D, jadwal iyo xaashi mashruuca browser-ka, deji sida qorshe kasta loo gooyo iyo waxa uu muujiyo, samee muuqaalo weyn, khadadka iyo xarriijinta hal muuqaal, ku hay dejinta qaababka muuqaalka, oo habee xaashiyo aad leedahay.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["callout","muuqaal weyn","muuqaal faahfaahin","qorshe weyn","naqshadaynta","khadadka naqshadaynta","hatch","aagga xarriijinta","buuxinta","reflected ceiling plan","rcp","qorshaha saqafka hoose","shabakadda saqafka","nalalka","project browser","muuqaalada","heerka muuqaalka","jarid","aagga jaridka","miisaanka muuqaalka","underlay","muuji heer kale","qorshaha gooyga","gobolka gooyga","top","bottom","qoto dheer","muuqaalka","qaybaha","qarinta muuqaalka","qaabka muuqaalka","qaababka","xaashi","xaashiyada","title block","viewport","miisaan","habee xaashiyada","layout","pdf","dejinta qorshaha","browser"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"mashruuca-browser","text":"Mashruuca browser","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-heerka-muuqaalka-qorshe","text":"Dejinta heerka muuqaalka qorshe","level":2},{"id":"jarid-qorshe-miisaan-siiso-muuji-heer-kale-hoosteeda","text":"Jarid qorshe, miisaan siiso, muuji heer kale hoosteeda","level":2},{"id":"qorshaha-saqafka-hoose-ee-heer","text":"Qorshaha saqafka hoose ee heer","level":2},{"id":"samee-muuqaal-weyn","text":"Samee muuqaal weyn","level":2},{"id":"samee-khadadka-iyo-xarriijinta-hal-muuqaal","text":"Samee khadadka iyo xarriijinta hal muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"ku-hay-dejinta-qaabka-muuqaalka","text":"Ku hay dejinta qaabka muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"xaashi-u-habee","text":"Xaashi u habee","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu shaqee sida mashaariicda BIM loo abaabulo: muuqaal kasta liis keli ah, qorshe kasta oo laga gooyo meesha aad rabto, isla dejin qorshayaal badan qaab-dhis ah, iyo xaashiyo aad naftaada habayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mashruuca-browser\"\u003EMashruuca browser\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShiid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E. Dhinaca bidix waxa ku yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E hoos moodeelada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa uu liistaa:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E: heer kasta. Guji mid si aad u aragto qorshihiisa. Badhanka sliderka ee dhinaciisa wuxuu dejiyaa heerka muuqaalka (hoos). Qorshe raacaya qaab wuxuu muujiyaa magaca qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha saqafka hoose\u003C/strong\u003E: qorshaha saqafka hoose ee heer kasta (hoos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada weyn\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaal weyn kasta oo muuqaalka uu ku sawiran yahay, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew callout\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EMaqan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa muuqaalada weyn ee muuqaalkoodu tagay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGooyada\u003C/strong\u003E: afarta dhinac iyo khad goyn kasta. Guji mid si aad u furto kooxda naqshadaha ay ku sawirmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaalada aad ku kaydisay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E: guji mid si aad u muujiso qorshaha hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E: xaashiyada aad samaysay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing set…\u003C/span\u003E oo ah kooxda naqshadaha oo dhan ee moodeelka laga sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew template\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku xidhka\u003C/strong\u003E (moodeelada isku xidhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-heerka-muuqaalka-qorshe\"\u003EDejinta heerka muuqaalka qorshe\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji badhanka sliderka ee dhinaca heer kasta oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji dhererka, kor u kacsan heerkaas:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECut at\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha qorshuhu ka gooyo darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha (1200 mm, qiyaas ahaan 4 ft, haddii aanad beddelin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa ka sarreeya gooyga iyo ka hooseeya sare-ga waa la sawiraa jajab (kabeed sare, bariiga). Ka tag madhan si aad u heshid dhererka heerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDepth below the bottom\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa ka hooseeya gooyga waa la sawiraa khadad khafiif ah ilaa hoosta, iyo ka hooseeya ilaa masaafadaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cstrong\u003EShown in this plan\u003C/strong\u003E, ka saar waxa qorshahan uusan muujin: qalabka guriga, qolalka, tiirarka iwm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad walxo keli ah uga saarto: dooro qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D, fur wada-hadalka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide the selected here\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow them all\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse these settings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha waa dib loo gooyaa isla markiiba, xaashiyadaada iyo kooxda naqshadaha way raacaan. Gooynta daruurta dhibcood waxay raacaysaa dhererka gooyga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarid-qorshe-miisaan-siiso-muuji-heer-kale-hoosteeda\"\u003EJarid qorshe, miisaan siiso, muuji heer kale hoosteeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdaba wada-hadal isku mid ah (badhanka sliderka ee heer kasta):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan\u003C/strong\u003E: miisaanka qorshuhu ku daabacmo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E sadarka qorshaha) oo uu ku yimaado xaashi. \u003Cstrong\u003EFit\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu doortaa miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrop region\u003C/strong\u003E: guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw on the plan…\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji hal geeska iyo geeska ka soo horjeeda qorshaha (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa). Qorshaha ka baxsan gobolka waa la xijaabaa shaashadda, adigu weli waad ka shaqayn kartaa; markaad daabacayso, xaashiyada iyo kooxda naqshadaha, qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya waxa gudaha ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa jaridka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku habeeyaa jaridka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnderlay\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro heer kale. Darbiyadooda, walxaha la gooyay, albaabadooda iyo daaqadahooda waa la sawiraa khafiif hoosta qorshahan, si wax loogu hagaajiyo heerka hoose ama sare. Halkan lama dooran karo, waxayna daabacmaan midab cawl ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka muuqaalka wuxuu qaadaa miisaanka dhererka iyo qaybaha. Gobolka jaridka iyo underlay-ga waxay ku xidhan yihiin hal qorshe keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha-saqafka-hoose-ee-heer\"\u003EQorshaha saqafka hoose ee heer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeer kasta waxa uu leeyahay qorshe saqaf hoose oo ku yaal dhinaca qorshaha dabaqa: qorshe lagu arko hoose, si loo habeeyo saqafyada iyo waxa ka dhex dhacaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji heerka hoose \u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha saqafka hoose\u003C/strong\u003E browser-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECeiling plan\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca heerka sadarka qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada waxa lagu gooyaa 2300 mm (qiyaas ahaan 7&#039;-6&quot;). Waxa ka sarreeya gooyga oo ka hoosaysa sare-ga heerka waa la sawiraa: saqafyada, shabakadooda iyo calaamadda dhererka (\u003Ccode\u003ECLG 2438\u003C/code\u003E), nalalka, bawlaha. Albaabada, daaqadaha iyo waxa ka hooseeya gooyga waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad saqaf u samayso, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECeiling\u003C/span\u003E sida qorshaha dabaqa, kadibna dooro oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EPattern\u003C/strong\u003E Properties-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EQolalka, dabaqyada, saqafyada iyo saqafyada sare\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad naal uga dhex deysid, ku dheji walaxda maktabadda intii qorshaha saqafka la muujinayo: waxay tagaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAt the ceiling\u003C/strong\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo qalabka guriga maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka sliderka ee qorshaha saqafka wuxuu dejiyaa gooyga iyo sarreeda, miisaanka, qaybaha, gobolka jaridka iyo underlay-ga, sida qorshaha dabaqa. Qorshayaasha saqafka ma qaataan qaabka muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la sawiraa si la mid ah qorshaha dabaqa (qorshe la rogay, ma aha sawir muraayad). Saqaf ka hooseeya gooyga looma sawiro: hoosaysii gooyga qorshaha saqafka heerkaas. Qorshayaasha saqafka waxay u tagaan xaashiyadaada sida qorshayaasha kale; kooxda naqshadaha iskood uma ku darto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-muuqaal-weyn\"\u003ESamee muuqaal weyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaal weyn wuxuu muujiyaa qayb qorshe ah oo weyn, miisaankiisa, sida muuqaal gaar ah: musqul, jaranjaro, geeska darbi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji qorshaha, qorshaha saqafka ama muuqaalka weyn ee uu ka tirsan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECallout\u003C/span\u003E sadarka qorshaha (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew callout\u003C/span\u003E browser-ka), kadibna guji hal geeska aagga iyo geeska ka soo horjeeda. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka weyn waxa la sameeyaa 1:20 (1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; feet iyo inji). Afar-geesheeda iyo calaamad wareegsan waa la sawiraa qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji calaamadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, ama muuqaalka weyn browser-ka, si aad u furto: qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya aagga, miisaanka muuqaalka weyn. Sadarku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECallout:\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaciisa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUp\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa muuqaalka uu ku sawiran yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka sliderka ee dhinaca (browser-ka ama sadarka) wuxuu magaca beddelaa, miisaankiisa beddelaa, afar-geeshiisa mar kale sawiraa ama tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaal weyn wuxuu muujiyaa waxa muuqaalkiisa muujiyo: isla gooyga, isla qaybaha, saqafyada qorshaha saqafka. Muuqaal weyn oo ku jira muuqaal weyn wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sidaas. Dhig muuqaal weyn xaashi sida qorshe; calaamaddiisa markaas waxay sheegaysaa meesha uu ku yaal (\u003Ccode\u003E1 / A-501\u003C/code\u003E: muuqaalka koowaad ee xaashiga A-501). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E muuqaal weyn wuxuu daabacaa aagga kaliya miisaankiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtirida muuqaal weyn waxay sidoo kale tirtirtaa muuqaalada weyn ee ku jira, iyo khadadka iyo xarriijinta lagu sawiray (waa laguu weydiiyaa marka hore). Haddii heerka muuqaal weyn lagu sawiray la tirtiro, muuqaalka weyn wuxuu ku sii jiraa \u003Cstrong\u003EMaqan\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa aad tirtirto, xaashiyada uu ku yaal ayaa sheegaya inuu maqan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-khadadka-iyo-xarriijinta-hal-muuqaal\"\u003ESamee khadadka iyo xarriijinta hal muuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadaynta waa shaqo 2D oo u gaar ah hal muuqaal: qoraal khadadka, dhul ama kontreet xarriijin ah, aag buuxsan. Had iyo jeer ma joogto muuqaalka 3D, mana joogto qorshe kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji qorshaha dabaqa, qorshaha saqafka ama muuqaalka weyn ee aad ku sawirayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E sadarka qorshaha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E: guji meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Khadka xiga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meesha kii ugu dambeeyay ku dhammaaday; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib u bilaabaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolyline\u003C/span\u003E: guji dhibcahooda; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer dhufo wuu dhammeeyaa, guji dhibcaha koowaad wuu xiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E: laba geesood oo iska soo horjeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHatch region\u003C/span\u003E: dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EPattern\u003C/strong\u003E (Solid, Diagonal, Cross-hatch, Concrete, Insulation, Earth) iyo miisaankiisa sadarka, kadibna guji geeskiisa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, laba jeer dhufo ama guji geeska koowaad wuu xiraa. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFill a room\u003C/span\u003E la calaamadeeyo, hal guji qol gudaheeda wuxuu xarriijiyaa khadkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibcaha waxay ku dhejiyaan sida darbiyada; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu khadka ka dhigaa mid toosan, waxaadna dherer ku qori kartaa sida darbiyada. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celiyaa dhibcaha ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhad ama xarriijin dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E qorshaha ku jira. Properties wuxuu beddelaa pattern-ka iyo miisaanka xarriijinta, waxayna leedahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove…\u003C/span\u003E (guji dhibcaha laga guurayo, kadibna meesha u gudubta). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu tirtiraa. Khad kasta, xarriijin iyo beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka iyo xarriijinta waa la daabacaa qorshaha, waxayna u gudbaan xaashiyadaada, waxayna ku jiraan kooxda naqshadaha. Ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003EAnnotations\u003C/strong\u003E heerka muuqaalka si aad uga reebto muuqaalkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-hay-dejinta-qaabka-muuqaalka\"\u003EKu hay dejinta qaabka muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew template\u003C/span\u003E browser-ka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a template…\u003C/span\u003E heerka muuqaalka qorshe (qorshaha markaas wuu isticmaalaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, deji dhererka iyo qaybaha, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the template\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerka muuqaalka qorshe kasta, dooro qaabka. Qorshuhu wuxuu qaataa dhererka iyo qaybaha; beddel qaabka si aad u beddesho qorshe kasta oo isticmaala. Waxa aad mid mid ka qarisay wuxuu ku sii qarsan yahay qorshihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qaabka browser-ka si aad u beddesho, magac u beddesho ama tirtirto. Tirtirida mid waxay ka tagtaa qorshayaasha dejintooda gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashi-u-habee\"\u003EXaashi u habee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E. Ku qor lambarkeeda iyo cinwaankeeda oo dooro warqadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca qorshe, qorshe saqaf, muuqaal weyn, dhinac, gooyo ama jadwal. Waxay ku dhacaysaa xagga dhexe ee xaashiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid meesha ay tagayso. Markaad doorato, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EScale\u003C/strong\u003E, ama ka tag miisaanka qorshaha (haddii uu leeyo), amaba miisaanka ku habboon saddex meelood meel xaashiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake off the sheet\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the sheet\u003C/span\u003E. Waa la liistaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E; guji si aad u beddesho mar dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload as PDF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa xaashigaas hal bog oo PDF ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshayaasha la gooyay dhererkaaga, waxa ka sarreeya gooyga oo jajab ah, iyo waxa aad tirtirtay oo laga reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshe jaran oo shaashadda ka baxsan gobolkiisa lagu xijaabiyay, warqadda ku gooyan gobolkaas, miisaanka aad siisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshe saqaf leh shabakadaha saqafyada iyo calaamadaha dhererka, iyo nalalka saqafka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalo weyn oo leh afar-geeshooda iyo calaamaddooda qorshaha, mid walba miisaankiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadadka iyo xarriijinta kaliya muuqaalka aad ku sawirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyadaadu mar kasta oo aad furto dib baa moodeelka laga sawiraa, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer way la mid yihiin. Muuqaal kasta oo heerkiisa ama khadkiisa gooyga la tirtiray waa la sheegaa, ma la sawiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta halkan waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu ka noqdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaas oo dhan waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC sida habayn sifooyin barnaamijyada kale ka tagaan: heerka muuqaalka iyo qorshaha saqafka ee heer kasta, qaababka, muuqaalada weyn iyo xaashiyadaada mashruuca. Khadadka iyo xarriijinta waa annotations IFC ah heerkooda, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan sida curves 2D ah iyo aagga xarriijinta (sawirkooda pattern kasta), laakiin ma arkaan muuqaalka ay u tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijyada BIM kale waxay gooyga u yiraahdaan view range ama cut plane, qaababka view templates ama view settings, khadadka naqshadaynta detail lines, xarriijinta hatch regions ama filled regions. Fikradaha waa isku mid; dejinta muuqaalka ma gudbi karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku shaqee sida mashaariicda BIM loo abaabulo: muuqaal kasta liis keli ah, qorshe kasta oo laga gooyo meesha aad rabto, isla dejin qorshayaal badan qaab-dhis ah, iyo xaashiyo aad naftaada habayso. Mashruuca browser Shiid Draw. Dhinaca bidix waxa ku yaal Project browser hoos moodeelada. Waxa uu liistaa: Qorshayaasha dabaqa: heer kasta. Guji mid si aad u aragto qorshihiisa. Badhanka sliderka ee dhinaciisa wuxuu dejiyaa heerka muuqaalka (hoos). Qorshe raacaya qaab wuxuu muujiyaa magaca qaabka. Qorshayaasha saqafka hoose: qorshaha saqafka hoose ee heer kasta (hoos). Muuqaalada weyn: muuqaal weyn kasta oo muuqaalka uu ku sawiran yahay, iyo New callout. Maqan wuxuu liistaa muuqaalada weyn ee muuqaalkoodu tagay. Dhinacyada iyo Gooyada: afarta dhinac iyo khad goyn kasta. Guji mid si aad u furto kooxda naqshadaha ay ku sawirmaan. Muuqaalada 3D: muuqaalada aad ku kaydisay Views. Jadwallada: guji mid si aad u muujiso qorshaha hoosteeda. Xaashiyada: xaashiyada aad samaysay, New sheet, iyo Drawing set… oo ah kooxda naqshadaha oo dhan ee moodeelka laga sameeyay. Qaababka muuqaalka, oo leh New template, iyo Isku xidhka (moodeelada isku xidhan). Dejinta heerka muuqaalka qorshe Guji badhanka sliderka ee dhinaca heer kasta oo ku jira Qorshayaasha dabaqa. Deji dhererka, kor u kacsan heerkaas: Cut at: meesha qorshuhu ka gooyo darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha (1200 mm, qiyaas ahaan 4 ft, haddii aanad beddelin). Top: waxa ka sarreeya gooyga iyo ka hooseeya sare-ga waa la sawiraa jajab (kabeed sare, bariiga). Ka tag madhan si aad u heshid dhererka heerka. Bottom iyo Depth below the bottom: waxa ka hooseeya gooyga waa la sawiraa khadad khafiif ah ilaa hoosta, iyo ka hooseeya ilaa masaafadaas. Hoos Shown in this plan, ka saar waxa qorshahan uusan muujin: qalabka guriga, qolalka, tiirarka iwm. Si aad walxo keli ah uga saarto: dooro qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D, fur wada-hadalka oo guji Hide the selected here. Show them all wuxuu soo celinayaa. Guji Use these settings. Qorshaha waa dib loo gooyaa isla markiiba, xaashiyadaada iyo kooxda naqshadaha way raacaan. Gooynta daruurta dhibcood waxay raacaysaa dhererka gooyga. Jarid qorshe, miisaan siiso, muuji heer kale hoosteeda Saddexdaba wada-hadal isku mid ah (badhanka sliderka ee heer kasta): Miisaan: miisaanka qorshuhu ku daabacmo (Print sadarka qorshaha) oo uu ku yimaado xaashi. Fit wuxuu doortaa miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon. Crop region: guji Draw on the plan…, kadibna guji hal geeska iyo geeska ka soo horjeeda qorshaha (Esc wuu joojiyaa). Qorshaha ka baxsan gobolka waa la xijaabaa shaashadda, adigu weli waad ka shaqayn kartaa; markaad daabacayso, xaashiyada iyo kooxda naqshadaha, qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya waxa gudaha ku jira. Clear wuu ka saaraa jaridka. Fit wuxuu ku habeeyaa jaridka. Underlay: dooro heer kale. Darbiyadooda, walxaha la gooyay, albaabadooda iyo daaqadahooda waa la sawiraa khafiif hoosta qorshahan, si wax loogu hagaajiyo heerka hoose ama sare. Halkan lama dooran karo, waxayna daabacmaan midab cawl ah. Qaabka muuqaalka wuxuu qaadaa miisaanka dhererka iyo qaybaha. Gobolka jaridka iyo underlay-ga waxay ku xidhan yihiin hal qorshe keliya. Qorshaha saqafka hoose ee heer Heer kasta waxa uu leeyahay qorshe saqaf hoose oo ku yaal dhinaca qorshaha dabaqa: qorshe lagu arko hoose, si loo habeeyo saqafyada iyo waxa ka dhex dhacaya. Guji heerka hoose Qorshayaasha saqafka hoose browser-ka, ama dooro Ceiling plan dhinaca heerka sadarka qorshaha. Darbiyada waxa lagu gooyaa 2300 mm (qiyaas ahaan 7'-6\"). Waxa ka sarreeya gooyga oo ka hoosaysa sare-ga heerka waa la sawiraa: saqafyada, shabakadooda iyo calaamadda dhererka (CLG 2438), nalalka, bawlaha. Albaabada, daaqadaha iyo waxa ka hooseeya gooyga waa la dhaafaa. Si aad saqaf u samayso, isticmaal Ceiling sida qorshaha dabaqa, kadibna dooro oo dooro Pattern Properties-ka. Eeg Qolalka, dabaqyada, saqafyada iyo saqafyada sare. Si aad naal uga dhex deysid, ku dheji walaxda maktabadda intii qorshaha saqafka la muujinayo: waxay tagaysaa At the ceiling. Eeg Dhig qalabka iyo qalabka guriga maktabadda. Badhanka sliderka ee qorshaha saqafka wuxuu dejiyaa gooyga iyo sarreeda, miisaanka, qaybaha, gobolka jaridka iyo underlay-ga, sida qorshaha dabaqa. Qorshayaasha saqafka ma qaataan qaabka muuqaalka. Waa la sawiraa si la mid ah qorshaha dabaqa (qorshe la rogay, ma aha sawir muraayad). Saqaf ka hooseeya gooyga looma sawiro: hoosaysii gooyga qorshaha saqafka heerkaas. Qorshayaasha saqafka waxay u tagaan xaashiyadaada sida qorshayaasha kale; kooxda naqshadaha iskood uma ku darto. Samee muuqaal weyn Muuqaal weyn wuxuu muujiyaa qayb qorshe ah oo weyn, miisaankiisa, sida muuqaal gaar ah: musqul, jaranjaro, geeska darbi. Muuji qorshaha, qorshaha saqafka ama muuqaalka weyn ee uu ka tirsan yahay. Dooro Annotate › Callout sadarka qorshaha (ama New callout browser-ka), kadibna guji hal geeska aagga iyo geeska ka soo horjeeda. Esc wuu joojiyaa. Muuqaalka weyn waxa la sameeyaa 1:20 (1/2\" = 1'-0\" feet iyo inji). Afar-geesheeda iyo calaamad wareegsan waa la sawiraa qorshaha. Guji calaamadda Select, ama muuqaalka weyn browser-ka, si aad u furto: qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa kaliya aagga, miisaanka muuqaalka weyn. Sadarku wuxuu leeyahay Callout: iyo magaciisa; Up wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa muuqaalka uu ku sawiran yahay. Badhanka sliderka ee dhinaca (browser-ka ama sadarka) wuxuu magaca beddelaa, miisaankiisa beddelaa, afar-geeshiisa mar kale sawiraa ama tirtiraa. Muuqaal weyn wuxuu muujiyaa waxa muuqaalkiisa muujiyo: isla gooyga, isla qaybaha, saqafyada qorshaha saqafka. Muuqaal weyn oo ku jira muuqaal weyn wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sidaas. Dhig muuqaal weyn xaashi sida qorshe; calaamaddiisa markaas waxay sheegaysaa meesha uu ku yaal (1 / A-501: muuqaalka koowaad ee xaashiga A-501). Print muuqaal weyn wuxuu daabacaa aagga kaliya miisaankiisa. Tirtirida muuqaal weyn waxay sidoo kale tirtirtaa muuqaalada weyn ee ku jira, iyo khadadka iyo xarriijinta lagu sawiray (waa laguu weydiiyaa marka hore). Haddii heerka muuqaal weyn lagu sawiray la tirtiro, muuqaalka weyn wuxuu ku sii jiraa Maqan ilaa aad tirtirto, xaashiyada uu ku yaal ayaa sheegaya inuu maqan yahay. Samee khadadka iyo xarriijinta hal muuqaal Naqshadaynta waa shaqo 2D oo u gaar ah hal muuqaal: qoraal khadadka, dhul ama kontreet xarriijin ah, aag buuxsan. Had iyo jeer ma joogto muuqaalka 3D, mana joogto qorshe kale. Muuji qorshaha dabaqa, qorshaha saqafka ama muuqaalka weyn ee aad ku sawirayso. Ka dooro Annotate sadarka qorshaha: Line: guji meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado. Khadka xiga wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meesha kii ugu dambeeyay ku dhammaaday; Enter wuxuu dib u bilaabaa. Polyline: guji dhibcahooda; Enter ama laba jeer dhufo wuu dhammeeyaa, guji dhibcaha koowaad wuu xiraa. Rectangle: laba geesood oo iska soo horjeeda. Hatch region: dooro Pattern (Solid, Diagonal, Cross-hatch, Concrete, Insulation, Earth) iyo miisaankiisa sadarka, kadibna guji geeskiisa; Enter, laba jeer dhufo ama guji geeska koowaad wuu xiraa. Marka Fill a room la calaamadeeyo, hal guji qol gudaheeda wuxuu xarriijiyaa khadkeeda. Dhibcaha waxay ku dhejiyaan sida darbiyada; Shift wuxuu khadka ka dhigaa mid toosan, waxaadna dherer ku qori kartaa sida darbiyada. Backspace wuxuu soo celiyaa dhibcaha ugu dambeeyay. Khad ama xarriijin dooro Select qorshaha ku jira. Properties wuxuu beddelaa pattern-ka iyo miisaanka xarriijinta, waxayna leedahay Move… (guji dhibcaha laga guurayo, kadibna meesha u gudubta). Delete wuu tirtiraa. Khad kasta, xarriijin iyo beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo. Khadadka iyo xarriijinta waa la daabacaa qorshaha, waxayna u gudbaan xaashiyadaada, waxayna ku jiraan kooxda naqshadaha. Ka saar Annotations heerka muuqaalka si aad uga reebto muuqaalkaas. Ku hay dejinta qaabka muuqaalka Guji New template browser-ka, ama Save as a template… heerka muuqaalka qorshe (qorshaha markaas wuu isticmaalaa). Ku sii magac, deji dhererka iyo qaybaha, kadibna guji Save the template. Heerka muuqaalka qorshe kasta, dooro qaabka. Qorshuhu wuxuu qaataa dhererka iyo qaybaha; beddel qaabka si aad u beddesho qorshe kasta oo isticmaala. Waxa aad mid mid ka qarisay wuxuu ku sii qarsan yahay qorshihiisa. Guji qaabka browser-ka si aad u beddesho, magac u beddesho ama tirtirto. Tirtirida mid waxay ka tagtaa qorshayaasha dejintooda gaarka ah. Xaashi u habee Guji New sheet. Ku qor lambarkeeda iyo cinwaankeeda oo dooro warqadda. Guji Add dhinaca qorshe, qorshe saqaf, muuqaal weyn, dhinac, gooyo ama jadwal. Waxay ku dhacaysaa xagga dhexe ee xaashiga. Jiid meesha ay tagayso. Markaad doorato, dooro Scale, ama ka tag miisaanka qorshaha (haddii uu leeyo), amaba miisaanka ku habboon saddex meelood meel xaashiga. Take off the sheet wuu ka saaraa. Guji Save the sheet. Waa la liistaa hoosta Xaashiyada; guji si aad u beddesho mar dambe. Download as PDF wuxuu kaydiyaa xaashigaas hal bog oo PDF ah. Waxa aad arkaysaa Qorshayaasha la gooyay dhererkaaga, waxa ka sarreeya gooyga oo jajab ah, iyo waxa aad tirtirtay oo laga reebay. Qorshe jaran oo shaashadda ka baxsan gobolkiisa lagu xijaabiyay, warqadda ku gooyan gobolkaas, miisaanka aad siisay. Qorshe saqaf leh shabakadaha saqafyada iyo calaamadaha dhererka, iyo nalalka saqafka. Muuqaalo weyn oo leh afar-geeshooda iyo calaamaddooda qorshaha, mid walba miisaankiisa. Khadadka iyo xarriijinta kaliya muuqaalka aad ku sawirtay. Xaashiyadaadu mar kasta oo aad furto dib baa moodeelka laga sawiraa, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer way la mid yihiin. Muuqaal kasta oo heerkiisa ama khadkiisa gooyga la tirtiray waa la sheegaa, ma la sawiro. Isbeddel kasta halkan waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu ka noqdaa. Waxaas oo dhan waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka IFC sida habayn sifooyin barnaamijyada kale ka tagaan: heerka muuqaalka iyo qorshaha saqafka ee heer kasta, qaababka, muuqaalada weyn iyo xaashiyadaada mashruuca. Khadadka iyo xarriijinta waa annotations IFC ah heerkooda, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan sida curves 2D ah iyo aagga xarriijinta (sawirkooda pattern kasta), laakiin ma arkaan muuqaalka ay u tahay. Barnaamijyada BIM kale waxay gooyga u yiraahdaan view range ama cut plane, qaababka view templates ama view settings, khadadka naqshadaynta detail lines, xarriijinta hatch regions ama filled regions. Fikradaha waa isku mid; dejinta muuqaalka ma gudbi karto.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rooms-and-separators","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qolalka iyo kala-goynta qolalka","summary":"Dooro qol si aad u magacowdo oo lambar siiso, oo akhri bedkiisa, wareegiisa iyo mugiisa. Sawir kala-goynta qolka halka laba qol isku kulmaan iyada oo aan darbi u dhexeyn.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["qol","qolalka","kala-goynta qolka","xariiqda kala-goynta","meel","IfcSpace","magac","lambar","bed","wareeg","mug","qorshe furan","qol kala qaybi","jikada iyo qolka fadhiga","aan la xidhin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"halka-qalabka-ku-yaal","text":"Halka qalabka ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kala-goynta-sameyso","text":"Waxa kala-goynta sameyso","level":2},{"id":"haddii-qol-uusan-ku-jirin-meesha-aad-gujisay","text":"Haddii qol uusan ku jirin meesha aad gujisay","level":2},{"id":"ifc-ga-dhexdiisa","text":"IFC-ga dhexdiisa","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagacow qolalka ay darbiyadu sameeyaan, oo qol furan u kala qaybi laba iyada oo aan darbi u dhexayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-qalabka-ku-yaal\"\u003EHalka qalabka ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EQol &amp; Bed\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-goynta qolka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta classic: jagada Sawir › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENooc kasta oo menu ah: amarrada waxaa lagu magacaabay Room iyo Room Separator; palette-ka amarrada ayaa ka heli kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir darbiyada. Wareeg kasta oo darbi xidhan oo qol horay u ah: BimCraft ayaa sameeya, lambar siiya oo bedkiisa siiya markaad sawirayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol\u003C/span\u003E. Ku dhaqaaq qorshaha: qolka ay tilmaamuhu ku taal ayaa iftiimaya, oo bedkiisa, wareegiisa iyo mugiisa ayaa muuqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi dhakhso ah qolalka ugu magacow, marka hore safka qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELambarka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji qolka. Lambarku wuxuu kordhaa hal mar qolka xiga (101, 102; A-09, A-10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma guji qol keliya: waa la doortay, Sifooyinka waxa ku jira magaciisa, lambarkiisa, bedkiisa, wareegiisa, mugiisa iyo calaamaddiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad qol furan u kala qaybiso, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-goynta qolka\u003C/span\u003E oo guji laba dhibcood: darbi ilaa darbi, ama darbi ilaa kala-goyn kale. Sii guji si aad silsilad u samayso; Enter, Esc ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhamaystira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kala-goynta-sameyso\"\u003EWaxa kala-goynta sameyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQolalka waxay xadiyaa sida darbi aan dhumuc lahayn. Bedadka labada qol wada-geeyaan oo siman qolkii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQolka dhexda qolkii hore ku haya wuxuu hayaa magacii iyo lambarkii. Kan kale waa cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala-goyn ku dhammaata meel furan, oo aan wax ku taabanin hal dhamaadkeed, ma kala qaybiso. Ku fidi, markaas ayuu kala qaybin doonaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta kala-goynta ku jirta darbi waa la iska indhatiraa, sidaas darteed waxaad ku qabsan kartaa xariiqyada dhexe ee darbiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kala-goyn oo riix Delete si aad u tirtirto: labada qol mar kale qol ayay noqdaan. Ka noqo ayaa dib u celiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-qol-uusan-ku-jirin-meesha-aad-gujisay\"\u003EHaddii qol uusan ku jirin meesha aad gujisay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa: darbiyadu halkaas ma xidhna. Xidh godka, ama sawir kala-goyn meeshaas kor ku marta. Waxba lama diido; waxa kaliya ee ka maqan waa qol xidhan oo weli jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-ga-dhexdiisa\"\u003EIFC-ga dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQol waa IfcSpace oo leh lambarkiisa (Name), magaciisa (LongName) iyo Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities: NetFloorArea, NetPerimeter, Height, NetVolume. Mugga waa bedka oo lagu dhufto dherka ilaa heerka ka sarreeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKala-goynta qolka waa IfcVirtualElement, taas oo ah shaxanka IFC u leedahay xad aan la dhisin. Waxa uu leeyahay xariiq oo jidh ma lahan, sidaas darteed barnaamij kale darbi ma akhristo oo waxba uma tiriyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala-goynno wareegan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQol raacaya saqaf janjeersan: mugga had iyo jeer waa bed oo lagu dhufto dherka heerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhiidhka xadka meesha (IfcRelSpaceBoundary) lama qoro, darbiyada iyo kala-goynta labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\"\u003ECalaamadaynta qolka iyo bedka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/areas-and-area-boundaries\"\u003EBedadka iyo xadadka bedadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Magacow qolalka ay darbiyadu sameeyaan, oo qol furan u kala qaybi laba iyada oo aan darbi u dhexayn. Halka qalabka ku yaal Habaynta ribbon-ka: Naqshadda dhismaha › Qol & Bed › Qol iyo Kala-goynta qolka. Habaynta classic: jagada Sawir › menu-ga Qolalka. Nooc kasta oo menu ah: amarrada waxaa lagu magacaabay Room iyo Room Separator; palette-ka amarrada ayaa ka heli kara. Tallaabooyinka Sawir darbiyada. Wareeg kasta oo darbi xidhan oo qol horay u ah: BimCraft ayaa sameeya, lambar siiya oo bedkiisa siiya markaad sawirayso. Dooro Qol. Ku dhaqaaq qorshaha: qolka ay tilmaamuhu ku taal ayaa iftiimaya, oo bedkiisa, wareegiisa iyo mugiisa ayaa muuqda. Si dhakhso ah qolalka ugu magacow, marka hore safka qor Magac iyo Lambarka, kadibna guji qolka. Lambarku wuxuu kordhaa hal mar qolka xiga (101, 102; A-09, A-10). Ama guji qol keliya: waa la doortay, Sifooyinka waxa ku jira magaciisa, lambarkiisa, bedkiisa, wareegiisa, mugiisa iyo calaamaddiisa. Si aad qol furan u kala qaybiso, dooro Kala-goynta qolka oo guji laba dhibcood: darbi ilaa darbi, ama darbi ilaa kala-goyn kale. Sii guji si aad silsilad u samayso; Enter, Esc ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhamaystira. Waxa kala-goynta sameyso Qolalka waxay xadiyaa sida darbi aan dhumuc lahayn. Bedadka labada qol wada-geeyaan oo siman qolkii hore. Qolka dhexda qolkii hore ku haya wuxuu hayaa magacii iyo lambarkii. Kan kale waa cusub. Kala-goyn ku dhammaata meel furan, oo aan wax ku taabanin hal dhamaadkeed, ma kala qaybiso. Ku fidi, markaas ayuu kala qaybin doonaa. Qaybta kala-goynta ku jirta darbi waa la iska indhatiraa, sidaas darteed waxaad ku qabsan kartaa xariiqyada dhexe ee darbiyada. Dooro kala-goyn oo riix Delete si aad u tirtirto: labada qol mar kale qol ayay noqdaan. Ka noqo ayaa dib u celiya. Haddii qol uusan ku jirin meesha aad gujisay Sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa: darbiyadu halkaas ma xidhna. Xidh godka, ama sawir kala-goyn meeshaas kor ku marta. Waxba lama diido; waxa kaliya ee ka maqan waa qol xidhan oo weli jira. IFC-ga dhexdiisa Qol waa IfcSpace oo leh lambarkiisa (Name), magaciisa (LongName) iyo Qto_SpaceBaseQuantities: NetFloorArea, NetPerimeter, Height, NetVolume. Mugga waa bedka oo lagu dhufto dherka ilaa heerka ka sarreeya. Kala-goynta qolka waa IfcVirtualElement, taas oo ah shaxanka IFC u leedahay xad aan la dhisin. Waxa uu leeyahay xariiq oo jidh ma lahan, sidaas darteed barnaamij kale darbi ma akhristo oo waxba uma tiriyo. Weli lama dhisin Kala-goynno wareegan. Qol raacaya saqaf janjeersan: mugga had iyo jeer waa bed oo lagu dhufto dherka heerka. Xidhiidhka xadka meesha (IfcRelSpaceBoundary) lama qoro, darbiyada iyo kala-goynta labadaba. Eeg sidoo kale Calaamadaynta qolka iyo bedka, Bedadka iyo xadadka bedadka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-other-program","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sameey","summary":"Path tracer-kayaga wuxuu sawirka Render sameeyaa; barnaamij kale wuxuu sawirka sameyn karaa kaliya kordhin injin rendar ah oo ku jira CadCraft Studio. Waxa la qaado iyo sababta barnaamijyada qaarkood aan waligood loo soo jeedin.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["render","injin","barnaamij kale","injinka kordhinka","studio","background","safka","usd","gltf","lagu sameeyay","blender","gpl"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-ka-soo-sameey-injinka-kordhinka","text":"Sawir ka soo sameey injinka kordhinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-qaadayo","text":"Waxa la qaadayo","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-cadcraft-weligood-ma-socodsiiyo","text":"Barnaamijyada CadCraft weligood ma socodsiiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESawirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E waxaa sameeya \u003Cstrong\u003Einjinadayada\u003C/strong\u003E: Degdeg iyo Path tracer, browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Barnaamij kale wuxuu sawir sameyn karaa kaliya marka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003Ekordhin injin rendar\u003C/a\u003E keeno: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EKu dar injin rendar oo kordhin ah\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad muuqaalka u gudbiso barnaamij kale oo aad halkaas ku sii shaqeyso, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EMuuqaalka ku fur barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EDir muuqaalka injinka ciyaarta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-ka-soo-sameey-injinka-kordhinka\"\u003ESawir ka soo sameey injinka kordhinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid kordhinka Dejinta › Kordhinada. Injinkiisu wuxuu ka muuqan doonaa liiska Injinka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro. Dejintiisa gaarka ah waxay ka muuqan doonaan hoosta liiska Injinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Studio, markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa dialog gaar ah. Horumarka ayaa muuqda intuu sawirka sameynayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E ayaa joojinaya. Sawirka ayaa soo muuqda oo calaamad ku leh injinka sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjin lagu qoray JavaScript browser-ka ayaa sidoo kale ku shaqeeya. Injin barnaamij kombiyuutarkan ku socodsiiya wuxuu shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu u muuqdaa sida fayl la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-qaadayo\"\u003EWaxa la qaadayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInjinku wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmo\u003C/strong\u003E: moodelka sidii fayl USD (iyo fayl glTF marka uu weydiiyo), iyo fayl dejin oo leh qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka, qorrax iyo samada, nal kasta oo furan oo leh awoodeeda iyo profile-kiisa iftiinka, kameradda iyo exposure-ka. Barnaamij kastaa iftiinka, midabka iyo tijaabinta wuu ku sameeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed sawirrada waa isku mid kamarad, qorrax, nalal iyo exposure, laakiin dhibco-dhibco ma aha isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-cadcraft-weligood-ma-socodsiiyo\"\u003EBarnaamijyada CadCraft weligood ma socodsiiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft weligood ma bilaabo barnaamij ku shaqeeya shatiga GNU GPL, weligeedna ma liisto mid ka mid ah injin ama bartilmaameed Ku fur. Blender waa mid ka mid ah, sidaas darteed ma ku jirto liiska Injinka. Fayl USD ama glTF oo laga kaydiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E wali waa la furi karaa barnaamijkaas sida barnaamij kasta oo akhrin kara faylashaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirrada panorama, kameradaha stereo iyo sawirka samada (midabka samada ayaa la isticmaalaa halkeeda) ma gudbaan barnaamij kale. Wax barnaamij kale ku sameeyo ma soo noqdo moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Sawirka Render waxaa sameeya injinadayada: Degdeg iyo Path tracer, browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Barnaamij kale wuxuu sawir sameyn karaa kaliya marka kordhin injin rendar keeno: eeg Ku dar injin rendar oo kordhin ah. Si aad muuqaalka u gudbiso barnaamij kale oo aad halkaas ku sii shaqeyso, isticmaal Muuqaalka ku fur barnaamij kale ama Dir muuqaalka injinka ciyaarta. Sawir ka soo sameey injinka kordhinka Shid kordhinka Dejinta › Kordhinada. Injinkiisu wuxuu ka muuqan doonaa liiska Injinka ee Render. Dooro. Dejintiisa gaarka ah waxay ka muuqan doonaan hoosta liiska Injinka. Guji Render. Studio, markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa dialog gaar ah. Horumarka ayaa muuqda intuu sawirka sameynayo; Stop ayaa joojinaya. Sawirka ayaa soo muuqda oo calaamad ku leh injinka sameeyay. Injin lagu qoray JavaScript browser-ka ayaa sidoo kale ku shaqeeya. Injin barnaamij kombiyuutarkan ku socodsiiya wuxuu shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu u muuqdaa sida fayl la kaydiyo. Waxa la qaadayo Injinku wuxuu helaa xirmo: moodelka sidii fayl USD (iyo fayl glTF marka uu weydiiyo), iyo fayl dejin oo leh qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka, qorrax iyo samada, nal kasta oo furan oo leh awoodeeda iyo profile-kiisa iftiinka, kameradda iyo exposure-ka. Barnaamij kastaa iftiinka, midabka iyo tijaabinta wuu ku sameeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed sawirrada waa isku mid kamarad, qorrax, nalal iyo exposure, laakiin dhibco-dhibco ma aha isku mid. Barnaamijyada CadCraft weligood ma socodsiiyo CadCraft weligood ma bilaabo barnaamij ku shaqeeya shatiga GNU GPL, weligeedna ma liisto mid ka mid ah injin ama bartilmaameed Ku fur. Blender waa mid ka mid ah, sidaas darteed ma ku jirto liiska Injinka. Fayl USD ama glTF oo laga kaydiyay Render wali waa la furi karaa barnaamijkaas sida barnaamij kasta oo akhrin kara faylashaas. Sawirrada panorama, kameradaha stereo iyo sawirka samada (midabka samada ayaa la isticmaalaa halkeeda) ma gudbaan barnaamij kale. Wax barnaamij kale ku sameeyo ma soo noqdo moodelka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rollover-and-tooltips","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tooltip laba marxaladood, iyo macluumaad markii laga eego qorshaha","summary":"Ku tilmaam qalab si aad magaciisa iyo gaabintiisa isla markiiba u aragto, iyo waxa uu sameeyo wax yar kadib. Ku jiid cursor-ka darbi, albaab, daaqad, qol ama cabbir si aad u akhrido adigoo aan dooran.","section":"tasks","order":34,"keywords":["tooltip","hint","gaabin","furaha","amarka qoran","sharax","tilmaam","rollover","tilmaam ku dhig","nooca darbiga","heer","ballac","toosan","skew","ma aha laba-xagal","curved","albaab","daaqad","qol","aagga","cabbir","adigoo aan dooran"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-sameyn-doonto","text":"Waxa aad sameyn doonto","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-tooltip-ka-qalabka-muujiyo","text":"Waxa tooltip-ka qalabka muujiyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-tilmaamuhu-muujiyo","text":"Waxa tilmaamuhu muujiyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-sameyn-doonto\"\u003EWaxa aad sameyn doonto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaro gaabinta qalab adigoo tilmaamaya, oo akhri waxa ku jira qorshaha adigoo aan dooran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETilmaam qalab, tusaale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbi\u003C/span\u003E Draw bar-ka. Wax yar ka dib tooltip ayaa muujinaya magaciisa iyo gaabintiisa (\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECursor-ka ku hay halkaas. Wax yar kadib hal khad oo hoostiisa ka muuqda ayaa sheegaya waxa qalabku sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qorshe, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E qalabka oo shidan. Ku jiid cursor-ka darbi. Tooltip-ka cursor-ka ku xiga wuxuu muujinayaa nooca, heerka, dherer iyo ballaca, iyo in ay toosan tahay ama skew tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudub albaab, daaqad, qol ama cabbir si aad mid kaas u akhrido halkii. Waxba lama doorto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-tooltip-ka-qalabka-muujiyo\"\u003EWaxa tooltip-ka qalabka muujiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarxalad 1\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca amarka habka menu-ga aad isticmaasho, iyo furayaashiisa habkaas. Haddii command line uu shaashadda ku jiro, wuxuu sidoo kale muujiyaa ereyga la qori karo haddii amarku furayn lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarxalad 2\u003C/strong\u003E: hal khad sharaxaad. Waa qoraalka badanka amarka, sidaas darteed meel kasta oo amarku ka muuqdo (Draw bar-ka, ribbon, habka menu-ga, safafka qalabka ee layout-ka) isku mid bay yiraahdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalab damaan ah ayaa halkeeda muujiya sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-tilmaamuhu-muujiyo\"\u003EWaxa tilmaamuhu muujiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarbi\u003C/strong\u003E: nooca, heerka, dherer iyo ballac, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESkew\u003C/strong\u003E (oo leh xagasha) ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECurved\u003C/strong\u003E. Toosan macnaheedu waa xagal qumman jihada ugu weyn ee darbiyada ay ku xirmaan: dhismaha xaashida ayaa weli toosan. Darbi keligeed waa toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaab ama daaqad\u003C/strong\u003E: nooca, ballac iyo dherer, dhererka sill-ka daaqadda, iyo darbiga ay ku jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQol\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca iyo lambarka, heerka, iyo aagga sida xaashidu u calaamadiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererkiisa, haddii ay tahay darbiga oo dhan ama qaybta u dhexeysa furmaha, dhinaca laga cabbiro, iyo darbiga ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETilmaamaha waxay shaqeeyaan qalabka Dooro. Markii qalab Draw uu shaqeynayo, qalabku wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa dhammaadaa markaad ka guurto shayga, badhanka mouse-ka riixdo, wheel-ka bahalo, ama fure riixdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETooltips-ku waligood kama muuqdaan touch-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad sameyn doonto Baro gaabinta qalab adigoo tilmaamaya, oo akhri waxa ku jira qorshaha adigoo aan dooran. Tallaabooyinka Tilmaam qalab, tusaale Darbi Draw bar-ka. Wax yar ka dib tooltip ayaa muujinaya magaciisa iyo gaabintiisa (Darbi, W). Cursor-ka ku hay halkaas. Wax yar kadib hal khad oo hoostiisa ka muuqda ayaa sheegaya waxa qalabku sameeyo. Fur qorshe, oo Dooro qalabka oo shidan. Ku jiid cursor-ka darbi. Tooltip-ka cursor-ka ku xiga wuxuu muujinayaa nooca, heerka, dherer iyo ballaca, iyo in ay toosan tahay ama skew tahay. Gudub albaab, daaqad, qol ama cabbir si aad mid kaas u akhrido halkii. Waxba lama doorto. Waxa tooltip-ka qalabka muujiyo Marxalad 1: magaca amarka habka menu-ga aad isticmaasho, iyo furayaashiisa habkaas. Haddii command line uu shaashadda ku jiro, wuxuu sidoo kale muujiyaa ereyga la qori karo haddii amarku furayn lahayn. Marxalad 2: hal khad sharaxaad. Waa qoraalka badanka amarka, sidaas darteed meel kasta oo amarku ka muuqdo (Draw bar-ka, ribbon, habka menu-ga, safafka qalabka ee layout-ka) isku mid bay yiraahdaan. Qalab damaan ah ayaa halkeeda muujiya sababta. Waxa tilmaamuhu muujiyo Darbi: nooca, heerka, dherer iyo ballac, iyo Toosan, Skew (oo leh xagasha) ama Curved. Toosan macnaheedu waa xagal qumman jihada ugu weyn ee darbiyada ay ku xirmaan: dhismaha xaashida ayaa weli toosan. Darbi keligeed waa toosan. Albaab ama daaqad: nooca, ballac iyo dherer, dhererka sill-ka daaqadda, iyo darbiga ay ku jirto. Qol: magaca iyo lambarka, heerka, iyo aagga sida xaashidu u calaamadiyo. Cabbir: dhererkiisa, haddii ay tahay darbiga oo dhan ama qaybta u dhexeysa furmaha, dhinaca laga cabbiro, iyo darbiga ay leedahay. Waxa aad ogaataa Tilmaamaha waxay shaqeeyaan qalabka Dooro. Markii qalab Draw uu shaqeynayo, qalabku wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadihiisa. Waa dhammaadaa markaad ka guurto shayga, badhanka mouse-ka riixdo, wheel-ka bahalo, ama fure riixdo. Tooltips-ku waligood kama muuqdaan touch-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"areas-and-area-boundaries","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Bedadka iyo xuduudaha bedka","summary":"Ku cabbir bedka guud ee dhismaha ama bedka kirada leh gudaha khadadka xuduudka aad sawirto ama ka qaadato darbiyada, oo liiska bedadka ku jira jadwal.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["bed","bedad","xuduudka bedka","habka bedka","bedka guud ee dhismaha","GFA","kiro","qorshaha bedadka","jadwalka bedadka","dooro darbiyada","aan la xidhin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-qalabka-ku-yaal","text":"Meelaha qalabka ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-raacaya-waxa-kale","text":"Waxa raacaya waxa kale","level":2},{"id":"haddii-xuduudaha-aan-xirmin","text":"Haddii xuduudaha aan xirmin","level":2},{"id":"jadwalka","text":"Jadwalka","level":2},{"id":"gudaha-ifc","text":"Gudaha IFC","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir xuduudaha habka bedka, ku dhig bedadka gudahooda, oo akhri wadarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-qalabka-ku-yaal\"\u003EMeelaha qalabka ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENidaamka ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka &amp; Bedka\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBedka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudka bedka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENidaamka classic: Sawirka bar › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudka bedka\u003C/span\u003E. Safka dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E: Dhismaha guud ama Kiro. Habka kasta wuxuu leeyahay xuduudadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sida khadadka loo sameeyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu samee\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir\u003C/strong\u003E: guji barta mid mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro darbiyada: khadka dhexe\u003C/strong\u003E: guji darbi, khadkeeda dhexe ayaa noqda xuduud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro darbiyada: wajiga la riixay\u003C/strong\u003E: guji darbi dhinaca aad rabto; wajigaas ayaa noqda xuduudka. Bedka dhismaha guud, guji dibadda darbiyada dibadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBedka\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro habka isku mid, qor magac, lambar ama nooc haddii aad rabto, oo guji gudaha xuduudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBedka isla markiiba waa la cabbiraa. Dooro si aad magaca, lambarka ama nooca ugu beddesho \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-raacaya-waxa-kale\"\u003EWaxa raacaya waxa kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduud laga sameeyay darbi la doortay wuu raacaa darbigaas: darbiga oo guuri, bedka mar kale ayaa la cabbiraa isla tallaabada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduud aad sawirtay wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad sawirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWajiyada darbiyada ee isku xidha geeska halkaas ayay isku xidhaan, sidaas darteed afar darbi la doortay ayaa bed xidha iyada oo aan wax furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduudka bedka wuxuu muuqdaa qorshaha intii qolka ama qalabka bedka ayaa gacanta kaaga ku jira, sidaas darteed qorshaha intiisa kale ma buuqsanayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-xuduudaha-aan-xirmin\"\u003EHaddii xuduudaha aan xirmin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBedka weli waa la dhigaa. Wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EAan la xidhin\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna cabbiraa wax aan lahayn ilaa xuduudaha ay ku xirmaan. Tani waa talo: wax lama diido.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalka\"\u003EJadwalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka bidix › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EBedadka\u003C/strong\u003E: habka, lambarka, magaca, nooca, heerka, bedka iyo masaafada wareegga, oo wadar leh. Guji safka si aad bedka u doorato. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa isla shaxda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gudaha-ifc\"\u003EGudaha IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBedku waa IfcSpace aan jidh lahayn: PredefinedType GFA habka dhismaha guud, USERDEFINED oo ObjectType Rentable habka kirada. Wuxuu leeyahay GrossFloorArea iyo GrossPerimeter, mana laha bed net, sidaas darteed looma qaldo qol. Xuduudku waa IfcVirtualElement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabab aad naftaada leedahay (kaliya Dhismaha guud iyo Kiro).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidabka buuxinta sida nooca bedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXeerarka dhigaya xuduudka adiga, sida &quot;ilaa khadka muraayadda&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EQolalka iyo kala-goynta qolalka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/room-and-area-tags\"\u003ECalaamadda qolka iyo bedka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Sawir xuduudaha habka bedka, ku dhig bedadka gudahooda, oo akhri wadarta. Meelaha qalabka ku yaal Nidaamka ribbon: Naqshadda dhismaha › Qolka & Bedka › Bedka iyo Xuduudka bedka. Nidaamka classic: Sawirka bar › menu-ga Qolalka. Tallaabooyin Dooro Xuduudka bedka. Safka dooro Habka: Dhismaha guud ama Kiro. Habka kasta wuxuu leeyahay xuduudadiisa. Dooro sida khadadka loo sameeyo Ku samee: Sawir: guji barta mid mid ah. Dooro darbiyada: khadka dhexe: guji darbi, khadkeeda dhexe ayaa noqda xuduud. Dooro darbiyada: wajiga la riixay: guji darbi dhinaca aad rabto; wajigaas ayaa noqda xuduudka. Bedka dhismaha guud, guji dibadda darbiyada dibadda. Dooro Bedka. Dooro habka isku mid, qor magac, lambar ama nooc haddii aad rabto, oo guji gudaha xuduudaha. Bedka isla markiiba waa la cabbiraa. Dooro si aad magaca, lambarka ama nooca ugu beddesho Sifooyinka. Waxa raacaya waxa kale Xuduud laga sameeyay darbi la doortay wuu raacaa darbigaas: darbiga oo guuri, bedka mar kale ayaa la cabbiraa isla tallaabada. Xuduud aad sawirtay wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad sawirtay. Wajiyada darbiyada ee isku xidha geeska halkaas ayay isku xidhaan, sidaas darteed afar darbi la doortay ayaa bed xidha iyada oo aan wax furan. Xuduudka bedka wuxuu muuqdaa qorshaha intii qolka ama qalabka bedka ayaa gacanta kaaga ku jira, sidaas darteed qorshaha intiisa kale ma buuqsanayn. Haddii xuduudaha aan xirmin Bedka weli waa la dhigaa. Wuxuu leeyahay Aan la xidhin wuxuuna cabbiraa wax aan lahayn ilaa xuduudaha ay ku xirmaan. Tani waa talo: wax lama diido. Jadwalka Panel-ka bidix › Jadwallada › Bedadka: habka, lambarka, magaca, nooca, heerka, bedka iyo masaafada wareegga, oo wadar leh. Guji safka si aad bedka u doorato. Soo deji CSV wuxuu siinayaa isla shaxda. Gudaha IFC Bedku waa IfcSpace aan jidh lahayn: PredefinedType GFA habka dhismaha guud, USERDEFINED oo ObjectType Rentable habka kirada. Wuxuu leeyahay GrossFloorArea iyo GrossPerimeter, mana laha bed net, sidaas darteed looma qaldo qol. Xuduudku waa IfcVirtualElement. Weli lama dhisin Habab aad naftaada leedahay (kaliya Dhismaha guud iyo Kiro). Midabka buuxinta sida nooca bedka. Xeerarka dhigaya xuduudka adiga, sida \"ilaa khadka muraayadda\". Eeg sidoo kale Qolalka iyo kala-goynta qolalka, Calaamadda qolka iyo bedka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"place-an-elevation","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhig dhererka oo fur muuqaalkiisa","summary":"Dhig calaamadda dhererka qorshaha dabaqa, u jiheey sida ay u muuqato, ka dib ka hel sawirkiisa baaraha mashruuca, ka tafatir oo dhig xaashi. Tallaabooyinka hababka ribbon iyo habka classic.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["dhererka","muuqaalka dhererka","calaamadda dhererka","tag-ka dhererka","dhig dhererka","dhererka cusub","samee dhererka","dhererka dibadda","muuqaal dhinac","muuqaal hore","muuqaal laga eego barta","halka uu dhererkaygu yahay","fur dhererka","dhererka xaashi ku jira","jiho dhererka","magaca dhererka beddel","dhererka woqooyi","muuqaalada isku-dhig","muuqaal kala jar","qorshe iyo 3D dhinac-dhinac"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"meesha-qalabka-yaal","text":"Meesha qalabka yaal","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"fur-sawirka","text":"Fur sawirka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muuqaashu-muujinayo","text":"Waxa muuqaashu muujinayo","level":2},{"id":"beddel","text":"Beddel","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2},{"id":"gudaha-ifc","text":"Gudaha IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee dhererkaaga gaarka ah: sawir dhismaha laga arko meel aad doorato, isagoo u eegaya sida aad doorato. Waxay qaadataa laba riix oo ku yaal qorshaha dabaqa. Sawirka markaa waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa dhererrada kale ee dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfarta dhinac horeba way jiraan. Dhismo kasta wuxuu leeyahay dhererrada Woqooyi, Bari, Koonfur iyo Galbeed ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaaraha mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E hoostiisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevations\u003C/span\u003E iyada oo aan wax dhig la&#039;aan. Mid aad u dhigto markaad rabto muuqaal meel kale ka ah: xagal ka soo horjeeda bar jeexjeex ah, gudaha barxadda, ama hal darbi qol gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-qalabka-yaal\"\u003EMeesha qalabka yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHababka ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabka classic: shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabka menu kasta: amarka waxaa loo yaqaan Elevation; palette-ka amarrada wuu helaa, command line-nana wuxuu qaataa ELEVATION.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E. Dhererka waxaa lagu dhigaa qorshaha dabaqa, sidaas darteed haddii aad ku jirtay muuqaalka 3D, BimCraft wuxuu tusayaa qorshaha dabaqii aad ku jirtay. Mu&#039;eeshu wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ERiix meesha uu dhererku taagan yahay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha laga qaadayo muuqaalka. Dhererka dibadda, riix dibadda dhismaha, meel yar oo ka fog darbiga aad rabto inaad aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMu&#039;eeshu hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ERiix sida ay u muuqato\u003C/strong\u003E. U soco dhismaha: fallaadho ayaa tusaya jihada, khadka gaaban ee ku jira riixkaaga kowaad waa geeska uu muuqaashu ka eegayo. Riix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobo leh lambar iyo mu&#039;eeshi ayaa ka muuqda qorshaha. Taasi waa calaamadda dhererka. Kii koowaad waa 1, kii xiga 2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix Esc si aad u dhammaysato, ama sii wad oo dhig mid kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad dhigidu waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqonaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-sawirka\"\u003EFur sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha ayaa hortaada ku sii jira riixa labaad ka dib. Sawirka waxaa ku yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaaraha mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevations\u003C/span\u003E. Kaaga waxaa lagu liisay afarta dhinac ka dib sidii \u003Cstrong\u003EElevation 1\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix badhanka qalinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa tafatir muuqaalkan\u003C/span\u003E safkiisa si aad sawirka u aragto oo aad ugu shaqeyso: dhaqaaji darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha iyo heerarka, ku dar qoraallo iyo cabbirro. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003EKa tafatir dhererada iyo goynta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix safka laftiisa si aad u furto kooxda sawirka, ama ku dar muuqaalka xaashi aad leedahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EMuuqaalada iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka classic, baaraha mashruuca wuxuu ku yaal panel-ka bidix intii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E uu shidan yahay. Hababka ribbon, waa tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject Browser\u003C/span\u003E hoosta Sifooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muuqaashu-muujinayo\"\u003EWaxa muuqaashu muujinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta oo ku jira hor calaamadda, ilaa dhismuhu gaaro. Wax ka dambeeya ma muuqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerarka, magacyadooda iyo dherarkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii calaamaddu ku taagan tahay gudaha dhismaha, wax kasta oo ay taagan tahay ayaa halkaas laga jaraa, sida goyn uu u jaro. Dhererka dibadda oo nadiif ah, taag dibadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda qorshaha ku dooro (riix goobadeeda adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E). Sifooyinka waxaa ku jira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabel\u003C/span\u003E: lambarkeeda ama magac aad naftaada u doorato, ilaa 8 xaraf.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip the view\u003C/span\u003E: u eeg jihada kale meel isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELook as far as\u003C/span\u003E: intee ka fog calaamadda hore ayuu muuqaashu gaari doonaa. 0 wax walba wuu muujinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix Delete si aad u tirtirto calaamadda iyo sawirkeeda. Ka noqo ayaa labadaba soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D isku wakhti ugu aragto inta aad shaqeynayso, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETile Views\u003C/span\u003E hababka ribbon, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit\u003C/span\u003E habka classic. Riix tab-ka muuqaalka si aad ugu noqoto hal muuqaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda weli ma jiidi karto ama ma wareejin karto qorshaha. Tirtir oo dib u dhig, ama isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip the view\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska muuqaalada aad xaashi ku dari karto, dhererka aad leedahay waxaa lagu liisay qaybaha kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha albaabka iyo daaqadaha waxaa lagu sawirayaa afarta dhinac ee dhererka, ma aha midka aad dhigtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gudaha-ifc\"\u003EGudaha IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamaddu waxaa faylka lagu kaydiyaa sida IfcAnnotation oo magaciisu yahay &quot;Elevation 1&quot; nooca objectka &quot;Elevation marker&quot;, dabaqa lagu dhigay. Barnaamij kale wuxuu u muujinayaa sida qoraal sharaxaad; sawirka laftiisa BimCraft ayaa ka sameeya moodeelka mar kasta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee dhererkaaga gaarka ah: sawir dhismaha laga arko meel aad doorato, isagoo u eegaya sida aad doorato. Waxay qaadataa laba riix oo ku yaal qorshaha dabaqa. Sawirka markaa waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa dhererrada kale ee dhismaha. Afarta dhinac horeba way jiraan. Dhismo kasta wuxuu leeyahay dhererrada Woqooyi, Bari, Koonfur iyo Galbeed ee Baaraha mashruuca hoostiisa Elevations iyada oo aan wax dhig la'aan. Mid aad u dhigto markaad rabto muuqaal meel kale ka ah: xagal ka soo horjeeda bar jeexjeex ah, gudaha barxadda, ama hal darbi qol gudihiisa. Meesha qalabka yaal Hababka ribbon: View › Samee › Elevation. Habka classic: shid Draw, kadibna Build › Elevation. Habka menu kasta: amarka waxaa loo yaqaan Elevation; palette-ka amarrada wuu helaa, command line-nana wuxuu qaataa ELEVATION. Tallaabooyinka Dooro Elevation. Dhererka waxaa lagu dhigaa qorshaha dabaqa, sidaas darteed haddii aad ku jirtay muuqaalka 3D, BimCraft wuxuu tusayaa qorshaha dabaqii aad ku jirtay. Mu'eeshu wuxuu leeyahay Riix meesha uu dhererku taagan yahay. Riix meesha laga qaadayo muuqaalka. Dhererka dibadda, riix dibadda dhismaha, meel yar oo ka fog darbiga aad rabto inaad aragto. Mu'eeshu hadda wuxuu leeyahay Riix sida ay u muuqato. U soco dhismaha: fallaadho ayaa tusaya jihada, khadka gaaban ee ku jira riixkaaga kowaad waa geeska uu muuqaashu ka eegayo. Riix. Goobo leh lambar iyo mu'eeshi ayaa ka muuqda qorshaha. Taasi waa calaamadda dhererka. Kii koowaad waa 1, kii xiga 2. Riix Esc si aad u dhammaysato, ama sii wad oo dhig mid kale. Calaamad dhigidu waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqonaysa. Fur sawirka Qorshaha ayaa hortaada ku sii jira riixa labaad ka dib. Sawirka waxaa ku yaal Baaraha mashruuca: Fur Elevations. Kaaga waxaa lagu liisay afarta dhinac ka dib sidii Elevation 1. Riix badhanka qalinka Ka tafatir muuqaalkan safkiisa si aad sawirka u aragto oo aad ugu shaqeyso: dhaqaaji darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha iyo heerarka, ku dar qoraallo iyo cabbirro. Eeg Ka tafatir dhererada iyo goynta. Riix safka laftiisa si aad u furto kooxda sawirka, ama ku dar muuqaalka xaashi aad leedahay. Eeg Muuqaalada iyo xaashiyada. Habka classic, baaraha mashruuca wuxuu ku yaal panel-ka bidix intii Draw uu shidan yahay. Hababka ribbon, waa tab-ka Project Browser hoosta Sifooyinka. Waxa muuqaashu muujinayo Wax kasta oo ku jira hor calaamadda, ilaa dhismuhu gaaro. Wax ka dambeeya ma muuqdo. Heerarka, magacyadooda iyo dherarkooda. Haddii calaamaddu ku taagan tahay gudaha dhismaha, wax kasta oo ay taagan tahay ayaa halkaas laga jaraa, sida goyn uu u jaro. Dhererka dibadda oo nadiif ah, taag dibadda. Beddel Calaamadda qorshaha ku dooro (riix goobadeeda adigoo isticmaalaya Select). Sifooyinka waxaa ku jira: Label: lambarkeeda ama magac aad naftaada u doorato, ilaa 8 xaraf. Flip the view: u eeg jihada kale meel isku mid ah. Look as far as: intee ka fog calaamadda hore ayuu muuqaashu gaari doonaa. 0 wax walba wuu muujinayaa. Riix Delete si aad u tirtirto calaamadda iyo sawirkeeda. Ka noqo ayaa labadaba soo celinaysa. Si aad qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D isku wakhti ugu aragto inta aad shaqeynayso, isticmaal View › Daaqadaha › Tile Views hababka ribbon, ama Split habka classic. Riix tab-ka muuqaalka si aad ugu noqoto hal muuqaal. Xaddidaadyo Calaamadda weli ma jiidi karto ama ma wareejin karto qorshaha. Tirtir oo dib u dhig, ama isticmaal Flip the view. Liiska muuqaalada aad xaashi ku dari karto, dhererka aad leedahay waxaa lagu liisay qaybaha kale. Calaamadaha albaabka iyo daaqadaha waxaa lagu sawirayaa afarta dhinac ee dhererka, ma aha midka aad dhigtay. Gudaha IFC Calaamaddu waxaa faylka lagu kaydiyaa sida IfcAnnotation oo magaciisu yahay \"Elevation 1\" nooca objectka \"Elevation marker\", dabaqa lagu dhigay. Barnaamij kale wuxuu u muujinayaa sida qoraal sharaxaad; sawirka laftiisa BimCraft ayaa ka sameeya moodeelka mar kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"documents-from-the-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid","summary":"Qor qoraal ama sharaxaad mar hal mar sida qaab, oo leh goobo tirooyinka, guryaha iyo calaamadaha, kadibna ka buuxi IFC-ka furan sida PDF ama dukumentiga Word.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["dukumentiga","dukumentiyo","specification","sharaxaad","qaab","markdown","warbixin","word","docx","pdf","tirooyin","jadwal","trade","jadwalka albaabada","dhamaystirro","documentcad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"goobaha","text":"Goobaha","level":2},{"id":"jadwallada-iyo-sharaxaadda-gudaha-dukumentiga","text":"Jadwallada iyo sharaxaadda gudaha dukumentiga","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabku waa qoraal Markdown leh goobo laba xidhmo xidhan. BimCraft wuxuu ka buuxiyaa goobaha moodelka furan (tirooyinka, tirooyinka sida nooca, guryaha, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/tags-and-schedules\"\u003Ecalaamadaha\u003C/a\u003E aad leedahay) wuxuuna kaydiyaa natiijada sida PDF, dukumentiga Word (.docx) ama Markdown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca bidix, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaab: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlbaabada iyo agabka\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiyada, dahaarka iyo dhamaystirka\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad qaab (.md)…\u003C/span\u003E kaaga gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qaabku akhristo calaamado moodelku wali aanu qeexin, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar calaamadaha qaabkan\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna calaamadi walxaha hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel qoraalka sida aad rabto oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dukumentiga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E (marka hore dooro A4 ama Letter) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWord (.docx)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDukumentiga la buuxiyay ee badhamada hoose, oo leh miisaskiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiis digniino marka goob aan la akhrin karin (calaamad aan la qeexin, guri aan moodelku lahayn, bloog aan la xidhin); goobtaas waxa loo daabacaa sida \u003Ccode\u003E[?…]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBogagga PDF oo leh cinwaanka dukumentiga iyo &quot;Bogga 1 oo ka mid ah 3&quot; hoosta bog kasta; miisaska dheer waxay sii socdaan safka madaxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobaha\"\u003EGoobaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoob\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu bixiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{project}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{project description}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{file}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{date}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emagaca mashruuca iyo sharaxaaddiisa, magaca faylka, maanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{count IfcDoor}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einta albaab\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{sum IfcWall NetSideArea}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewadar, oo leh unugeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{calc [sum IfcWall NetSideArea] * 1.1 round 1 unit m²}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exisaab (\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E iyo qaasaska) oo ku saleysan ereyada qaansada: \u003Ccode\u003E[sum …]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E[count …]\u003C/code\u003E, iyo gudaha each \u003Ccode\u003E[qty Width]\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Eround n\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa meelaha tobanka, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ku daraa unug. Wax aan la akhrin karin, ama qaybin eber, wuxuu daabacaa \u003Ccode\u003E[?…]\u003C/code\u003E oo digniin ayuu siiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{qty IfcWall NetSideArea by Type}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emiis: safka kasta nooc kasta oo tiro iyo wadar, iyo safka wadarta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{table IfcDoor cols Mark, Type, Width, tag:Fire rating}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emiis, safka kasta walax kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{tag Finish}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewareeg gudihiisa, qiimaha walxaha; meel kale dhammaan qiimayaasha la isticmaalay (Oak, Paint)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{tags}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqeexinta calaamadaha miis ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{#each IfcDoor}} … {{else}} … {{/each}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoraalka mar walax kasta; qaybta ka dambeysa \u003Ccode\u003E{{else}}\u003C/code\u003E marka aanay jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{#group IfcWall by Type}} … {{/group}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoraalka mar nooc kasta, oo leh \u003Ccode\u003E{{value}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{count}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{sum Length}}\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{{#each}}\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah gudaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha \u003Ccode\u003E{{#each}}\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E{{name}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{type}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{storey}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{class}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{material}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{mark}}\u003C/code\u003E (the IFC Tag), \u003Ccode\u003E{{guid}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{n}}\u003C/code\u003E (1, 2, 3 …), \u003Ccode\u003E{{prop Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{qty Width}}\u003C/code\u003E (kan walxa kasta, oo leh unuggiisa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFasal wuxuu noqon karaa dhowr (\u003Ccode\u003EIfcDoor|IfcWindow\u003C/code\u003E) ama dhammaan walxaha (\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E). Ku kooba mid kasta \u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E{{#each IfcDoor where Fire rating &gt;= 60}}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{{count IfcWall where Wall finish hasnot}}\u003C/code\u003E. Baaritaannada waa \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E!=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E~\u003C/code\u003E (ka kooban), \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehas\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ehasnot\u003C/code\u003E; isku xidh dhowr oo \u003Ccode\u003Eand\u003C/code\u003E; qiime leh meel-bannaan geli &quot;xigmado&quot; gudaha. \u003Ccode\u003Esort Name\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu kala soocaa wareeg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwallada-iyo-sharaxaadda-gudaha-dukumentiga\"\u003EJadwallada iyo sharaxaadda gudaha dukumentiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{schedule doors}}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa jadwal moodel ah miis ahaan, qaabka xafiiskaaga: \u003Ccode\u003Edoors\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewindows\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewalls\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erooms\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloors\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eroomfinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewallfinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ezonefinishes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efinishtotals\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elayers\u003C/code\u003E, ama magaca habayn kaydsan oo ku jira Jadwalada. \u003Ccode\u003E{{specification}}\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa sharaxaadda mashruuca. Qaababka \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwalka shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESharaxaad\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa isticmaala. Horudhaca, guji tiro jadwal oo aad u doorato walxaha uu ka yimid. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/schedule-layouts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/schedule-layouts\"\u003EHabee, kaydi oo dhoofi jadwalka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/specification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/specification\"\u003EQor sharaxaadda moodelka ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoob wuxuu magacaabaa mid dhex-dhisan (Name, Type, Storey, Class, Material, Mark), calaamad (\u003Ccode\u003Etag:Fire rating\u003C/code\u003E, ama magaciisa), guri (\u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E) ama magaca guri keliya (\u003Ccode\u003ENetSideArea\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E): magaca keliya wuxuu akhrinayaa xogta walax kasta, marka hore xogta tirada, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E albaab ahaan waa ballaca albaabka, ma aha qaybta darbiga. Gudaha \u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E, magaca keliya wuxuu akhrinayaa xogta ay leedahay inta badan walxaha la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinku waa waxa xogta tirada faylku sheegayo (BimCraft wuu qoraa wixii uu sameeyo); unugyadu waxay ka yimaadaan dejinta unugyada faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEreyada goobaha (\u003Ccode\u003Ecount\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esum\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eqty\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eby\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecols\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewhere\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeach\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egroup\u003C/code\u003E …) waxay ku sii jiraan Ingiriisi luuqad kasta. Qaababka tusaalaha waa Ingiriisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka moodelka ma noqdo qaab: magac leh \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E|\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacmaa sidiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaab aad beddeshay ku hay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu hay browser-kan\u003C/span\u003E (browser-kan kaliya ayaa haysta) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji qaabka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka PDF wuxuu isticmaalaa farta PDF-ka caadiga ah: xaraf ka baxsan qoraalka Yurub ee galbeedka wuxuu daabacmaa &quot;?&quot;, oo xaaladdu waxay tirinaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka qaababka ah waxay ku nool yihiin Maktabadda (nooca Qaabka dukumentiga). Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadda…\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro mid, qoraalkiisa iyo calaamadaha uu akhrinayo ayaa soo galaya; wax ka beddel sida aad rabto. Qaabkaaga u daabac Maktabadda waa isla soo-dejinta sida shay kasta. Weli lama dhisin: xisaabaad ka badan tirooyinka iyo wadarta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Qaabku waa qoraal Markdown leh goobo laba xidhmo xidhan. BimCraft wuxuu ka buuxiyaa goobaha moodelka furan (tirooyinka, tirooyinka sida nooca, guryaha, calaamadaha aad leedahay) wuxuuna kaydiyaa natiijada sida PDF, dukumentiga Word (.docx) ama Markdown. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC. Dhinaca bidix, hoosta Tirooyinka, fur Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid. Dooro qaab: Albaabada iyo agabka ama Darbiyada, dahaarka iyo dhamaystirka, ama Soo qaad qaab (.md)… kaaga gaarka ah. Haddii qaabku akhristo calaamado moodelku wali aanu qeexin, guji Ku dar calaamadaha qaabkan, kadibna calaamadi walxaha hoosta Calaamadaha. Beddel qoraalka sida aad rabto oo guji Muuji dukumentiga. Guji PDF (marka hore dooro A4 ama Letter) ama Word (.docx). Waxa aad arki doontaa Dukumentiga la buuxiyay ee badhamada hoose, oo leh miisaskiisa. Liis digniino marka goob aan la akhrin karin (calaamad aan la qeexin, guri aan moodelku lahayn, bloog aan la xidhin); goobtaas waxa loo daabacaa sida [?…]. Bogagga PDF oo leh cinwaanka dukumentiga iyo \"Bogga 1 oo ka mid ah 3\" hoosta bog kasta; miisaska dheer waxay sii socdaan safka madaxa. Goobaha Goob Waxa uu bixiyaa {{project}}, {{project description}}, {{file}}, {{date}} magaca mashruuca iyo sharaxaaddiisa, magaca faylka, maanta {{count IfcDoor}} inta albaab {{sum IfcWall NetSideArea}} wadar, oo leh unugeeda {{calc [sum IfcWall NetSideArea] * 1.1 round 1 unit m²}} xisaab (+ - * / iyo qaasaska) oo ku saleysan ereyada qaansada: [sum …], [count …], iyo gudaha each [qty Width]. round n wuxuu dejiyaa meelaha tobanka, unit wuxuu ku daraa unug. Wax aan la akhrin karin, ama qaybin eber, wuxuu daabacaa [?…] oo digniin ayuu siiyaa {{qty IfcWall NetSideArea by Type}} miis: safka kasta nooc kasta oo tiro iyo wadar, iyo safka wadarta {{table IfcDoor cols Mark, Type, Width, tag:Fire rating}} miis, safka kasta walax kasta {{tag Finish}} wareeg gudihiisa, qiimaha walxaha; meel kale dhammaan qiimayaasha la isticmaalay (Oak, Paint) {{tags}} qeexinta calaamadaha miis ahaan {{#each IfcDoor}} … {{else}} … {{/each}} qoraalka mar walax kasta; qaybta ka dambeysa {{else}} marka aanay jirin {{#group IfcWall by Type}} … {{/group}} qoraalka mar nooc kasta, oo leh {{value}}, {{count}}, {{sum Length}} iyo {{#each}} caadi ah gudaha Gudaha {{#each}}: {{name}}, {{type}}, {{storey}}, {{class}}, {{material}}, {{mark}} (the IFC Tag), {{guid}}, {{n}} (1, 2, 3 …), {{prop Pset_DoorCommon.FireRating}}, {{qty Width}} (kan walxa kasta, oo leh unuggiisa). Fasal wuxuu noqon karaa dhowr (IfcDoor|IfcWindow) ama dhammaan walxaha (*). Ku kooba mid kasta where: {{#each IfcDoor where Fire rating \u003E= 60}}, {{count IfcWall where Wall finish hasnot}}. Baaritaannada waa =, !=, ~ (ka kooban), \u003E, \u003C, \u003E=, \u003C=, has iyo hasnot; isku xidh dhowr oo and; qiime leh meel-bannaan geli \"xigmado\" gudaha. sort Name wuxuu kala soocaa wareeg. Jadwallada iyo sharaxaadda gudaha dukumentiga {{schedule doors}} wuxuu daabacaa jadwal moodel ah miis ahaan, qaabka xafiiskaaga: doors, windows, walls, rooms, floors, roomfinishes, wallfinishes, zonefinishes, finishtotals, layers, ama magaca habayn kaydsan oo ku jira Jadwalada. {{specification}} wuxuu daabacaa sharaxaadda mashruuca. Qaababka Jadwalka shaqada iyo Sharaxaad ayaa isticmaala. Horudhaca, guji tiro jadwal oo aad u doorato walxaha uu ka yimid. Eeg Habee, kaydi oo dhoofi jadwalka iyo Qor sharaxaadda moodelka ka. Waxa muhiim ah Goob wuxuu magacaabaa mid dhex-dhisan (Name, Type, Storey, Class, Material, Mark), calaamad (tag:Fire rating, ama magaciisa), guri (Pset_WallCommon.FireRating) ama magaca guri keliya (NetSideArea, Width): magaca keliya wuxuu akhrinayaa xogta walax kasta, marka hore xogta tirada, sidaas darteed Width albaab ahaan waa ballaca albaabka, ma aha qaybta darbiga. Gudaha where, magaca keliya wuxuu akhrinayaa xogta ay leedahay inta badan walxaha la doortay. Tirooyinku waa waxa xogta tirada faylku sheegayo (BimCraft wuu qoraa wixii uu sameeyo); unugyadu waxay ka yimaadaan dejinta unugyada faylka. Ereyada goobaha (count, sum, qty, by, cols, where, each, group …) waxay ku sii jiraan Ingiriisi luuqad kasta. Qaababka tusaalaha waa Ingiriisi. Qoraalka moodelka ma noqdo qaab: magac leh * ama | wuxuu daabacmaa sidiisa. Qaab aad beddeshay ku hay Ku hay browser-kan (browser-kan kaliya ayaa haysta) ama Soo deji qaabka. Qoraalka PDF wuxuu isticmaalaa farta PDF-ka caadiga ah: xaraf ka baxsan qoraalka Yurub ee galbeedka wuxuu daabacmaa \"?\", oo xaaladdu waxay tirinaysaa. Qaababka qaababka ah waxay ku nool yihiin Maktabadda (nooca Qaabka dukumentiga). Dukumentiyada moodelka ka yimid, dooro Maktabadda…, dooro mid, qoraalkiisa iyo calaamadaha uu akhrinayo ayaa soo galaya; wax ka beddel sida aad rabto. Qaabkaaga u daabac Maktabadda waa isla soo-dejinta sida shay kasta. Weli lama dhisin: xisaabaad ka badan tirooyinka iyo wadarta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-in-another-app","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur faylka app kale","summary":"Ku gudbi sawirka ama moodeelka aad furtay app kale oo ku jira kooxda, tab cusub — sawirka app-ka naqshadaynta, moodeelka app-ka faahfaahinta — adigoon wax soo rarin.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["gudbin","u gudbi","ku fur","ku wax ka beddel","app kale","tab cusub","u dir","faahfaahin","naqshadayn","cadcraft","detailcraft"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sii wad shaqada faylka app-ka loo sameeyay shaqada xigta, adigoo aan kaydin oo mar kale aan furin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawir DWG ama DXF si aad uga wax ka beddesho app-ka naqshadaynta, ama moodeel IFC si aad uga faahfaahiso app-ka faahfaahinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal aragtida 2D ee sawirka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in DetailCraft\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal qalabka sare ee moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApp-ka kale wuxuu ku furmaa tab cusub, faylka oo horeba loo furay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka tab cusub. BimCraft ayaa sidoo kale furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeel leh isbeddello aan la kaydin ayaa lagu gudbiyaa isbeddelladaas ku jira. Nuqulkaaga aad lahayd ma kaydinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirku wuxuu u gudbaa isagoo aan sawirrada lagu xidhay lagu gudbin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuxuu u dhex maraa labada tab gudaha browser-kaaga. Wax lagu soo rarin maayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka wuxuu soo muuqdaa kaliya marka app-ka kale uu furan yahay meesha aad joogto oo uu qaadi karo faylka sidan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii wax aan furmin, browser-ku wuxuu xannibay tab cusub: u oggolow pop-ups goobtan oo riix mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EEeg sawir DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/files\"\u003EFaylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku sii wad shaqada faylka app-ka loo sameeyay shaqada xigta, adigoo aan kaydin oo mar kale aan furin. Tallaabooyinka Fur sawir DWG ama DXF si aad uga wax ka beddesho app-ka naqshadaynta, ama moodeel IFC si aad uga faahfaahiso app-ka faahfaahinta. Riix Edit in CadCraft oo ku yaal aragtida 2D ee sawirka, ama Open in DetailCraft oo ku yaal qalabka sare ee moodeelka. App-ka kale wuxuu ku furmaa tab cusub, faylka oo horeba loo furay. Waxa aad arki doontid Faylka tab cusub. BimCraft ayaa sidoo kale furan. Moodeel leh isbeddello aan la kaydin ayaa lagu gudbiyaa isbeddelladaas ku jira. Nuqulkaaga aad lahayd ma kaydinayso. Sawirku wuxuu u gudbaa isagoo aan sawirrada lagu xidhay lagu gudbin. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Faylku wuxuu u dhex maraa labada tab gudaha browser-kaaga. Wax lagu soo rarin maayo. Badhanka wuxuu soo muuqdaa kaliya marka app-ka kale uu furan yahay meesha aad joogto oo uu qaadi karo faylka sidan. Haddii wax aan furmin, browser-ku wuxuu xannibay tab cusub: u oggolow pop-ups goobtan oo riix mar kale. Xiga Eeg sawir DWG ama DXF Faylasha BimCraft furo oo kaydiyo","lang":"so"},{"slug":"working-style","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Habka shaqada, muuqaalada la laabay, qalinnada warqadda, Warbixin ahaan iyo qaababka","summary":"Dooro sida BimCraft u dhaqmo habka aad u shaqeyso, laabi muuqaal kasta oo nuqul gaar ah ama xidhiidh ah, ku hay qalinnada faylka oo ku daabac sida la muujiyay ama miiska qalinka, u warbixi walax sida fasal IFC kale, oo ka bilow mashruucyada qaabkaaga.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["habka shaqada","laabi muuqaal","muuqaal la laabay","laabid","koobi muuqaal","muuqaal xidhiidh","muuqaal gaar ah","qalinnada","qalinka khadka","ku daabac sida la muujiyay","miiska qalinka","plot style","ctb","monochrome","grayscale","warbixin ahaan","fasalka ifc","dib u kala saar","nooca hore","moodel guud","dhulka sida waddo","derbiga sida panel","saqafka sida jid","qaab","qaabka","qaabka mashruuca","qaabka cusub","kaydi sida qaabka","heerka xafiiska"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"dooro-habka-shaqada","text":"Dooro habka shaqada","level":2},{"id":"laabi-muuqaal","text":"Laabi muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"qalinnada-muuqaalka-ku-hay-oo-la-daabacay-sida-la-muujiyay","text":"Qalinnada muuqaalka ku hay, oo la daabacay sida la muujiyay","level":2},{"id":"walax-u-warbixi-fasal-kale","text":"Walax u warbixi fasal kale","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-mashruuc-sida-qaab-oo-ka-bilow","text":"Kaydi mashruuc sida qaab, oo ka bilow","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji sida BimCraft u shaqeyso habka aad u shaqeyso, laabi muuqaalada, ku daabac sida aad filayso, tiri walaxda sida ay tahay in ay tahay oo ka bilow mashruuc kasta qaabka xafiiskaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-habka-shaqada\"\u003EDooro habka shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Hel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorking style\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mid:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach view its own\u003C/span\u003E (doorashada ugu horreysa): muuqaal la laabay wuxuu koobiyeeyaa faallooyinkiisa oo waxay sii ahaanayaan kuwa muuqaalkaas; xaashiyada waxa loo daabacaa sida shaashaddu muujinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShared annotations and pen tables\u003C/span\u003E: muuqaalada la laabay waxay wadaagaan faallooyinka; daabacaaddu waxay marta miiska qalinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos doorashada waxaa ah afarta wax ee ay deysa. Beddel mid kasta keligiis; markaas habku wuxuu akhrin doonaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECustom\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka shaqada waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, sida qaabeynta shaqada. Qaabku wuxuu habkan u qaadaa moodelada cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"laabi-muuqaal\"\u003ELaabi muuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBaaraha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E, qorshaha dabaqa kasta, qorshaha saqafka, callout, wejiga iyo goynta waxa uu leeyahay badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E (laba xaashi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaci nuqulka oo dooro sida uu u dhaqmayo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOwn copy\u003C/span\u003E: naqshadeynteeda, cabbiraadyadeeda, jaristooda, walxaha qarsan iyo qalinnadeeda waa la koobiyeeyaa oo waxay sii ahaanayaan kuwa gaarka ah. Tafatirka mid kasta ma beddelo kan kale, sidaas darteed muuqaal ku yaal xaashi la soo diyaariyay wuu sidiisii ku sii jiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinked\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu muujinayaa isla muuqaalka oo leh hal set oo faallooyin iyo dejin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka waxa lagu liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicated views\u003C/span\u003E. Riix si aad u furto; baarka ka sare qorshaha wuxuu sheegayaa inuu yahay nuqul, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUp\u003C/span\u003E oo kuu celinaya muuqaalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka shiidaha wuxuu furaa dejinteeda: magaca, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView range\u003C/span\u003E (nuqul gaar ah wuxuu leeyahay kiisa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake own copy\u003C/span\u003E oo loogu talagalay mid xidhan, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobiyada wejiga iyo goynta waxay saaraan xaashiyadaaga sida muuqaalada ay ka yimaadeen. Laabidda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho, nuqullada waxay ku kaydsan yihiin IFC-ga dhinaca callouts-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalinnada-muuqaalka-ku-hay-oo-la-daabacay-sida-la-muujiyay\"\u003EQalinnada muuqaalka ku hay, oo la daabacay sida la muujiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPens\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor\u003C/span\u003E hadda wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta: derbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha, dabaqyada, saqafyada, tiirarka, tallaabooyinka, qalabka guriga iyo kuwa kale, iyo naqshadeynta iyo cabbiraadyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalinka ku hayaa IFC-ga muuqaalka la muujiyo: qorshe, qorshaha saqafka, callout ama muuqaal la laabay. Qalinnada la sameeyay ka hor nooca 0.9 waxa lagu hayay browser-ka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep these in the file\u003C/span\u003E ayaa u guuraya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyada iyo PDF-ka waxay sawiraan qalin kasta sida shaashaddu u muujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu daabacdo miiska qalinka, dhig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E safka Pens \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThrough a pen table\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro miis (midab, midab-madow, madow-cad) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit pen table…\u003C/span\u003E: midab kasta wuxuu helaa midabka, ballaca khadka iyo shaandheynta uu ku daabacan doono. Miiska waa faylka plot style-ka CadCraft, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadan karaa miis laga sameeyay app-ka CadCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid soo celinayaa. Moodelku wuxuu hayaa doorashadiisa; haddii aan wax la dhigin, habka shaqada ayaa go&#039;aaminaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"walax-u-warbixi-fasal-kale\"\u003EWalax u warbixi fasal kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb laga sameeyay dhul sida waddo, derbi loo isticmaalay sida panel, saqaf loo qaabeeyay sida jid kor u kacaysa: ku hay qalabka aad ku sawirtay oo u warbixi sida ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walaxda oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport as\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u hesho fasal ku habboon qaabka, dooro, iyo nooca hore ee u diyaarsan. Fasal gaar ah oo kaaga ah, dooro USERDEFINED oo bixi magac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mar kale u warbixiyaa sida la sawiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli waxaad ku tafatirtaa qalabka lagu sawiray. IFC-ga la kaydiyay wuxuu u qoraa sida fasalka la warbixiyay, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale, xisaabinta qadarka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, Raadi, Midabee sida, hubinta moodelka iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProblems\u003C/span\u003E waxay u tiriyaan sida fasalkaas. Jadwallada waxay ka saaraan derbi loo warbixiyay sida panel jadwalka derbiyada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElements by reported class\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa mid kasta. Waxay shaqeysaa faylalka IFC4 iyo IFC2X3; liiska wuxuu bixiyaa kaliya fasalada nooca IFC ee faylka. Albaabada, daaqadaha, tallaabooyinka, qolalka iyo heerarka waxay haystaan fasalkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-mashruuc-sida-qaab-oo-ka-bilow\"\u003EKaydi mashruuc sida qaab, oo ka bilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMashruuc furan, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as template\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacee. Calaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso download the template file\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu wadaagto sida faylka IFC; iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart new models from it\u003C/span\u003E si aad uga dhigto caadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabku wuxuu hayaa heerarka, qaababka muuqaalka iyo dejinta muuqaalka, muuqaalada la laabay iyo callouts-ka, naqshadeynta, qalinnada iyo miiska qalinka, calaamadaha, qoysaska iyo noocyada, xaashiyada, cabbirrada xaashiyada, title blocks-ka iyo habka shaqada. Derbiyada, dabaqyada, albaabada iyo walxaha kale ee moodelka waa laga reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew building\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart from\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA template file…\u003C/span\u003E mid laguu soo diray. Mashruuca cusub wuxuu helaa magaciisa iyo aqoonsigiisa mashruuca; wax kale sida qaabka ayey yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan. Qaababka kooxda ee la wadaago CadCraft Studio weli lama dhisin: halkii, u dir faylka qaabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Deji sida BimCraft u shaqeyso habka aad u shaqeyso, laabi muuqaalada, ku daabac sida aad filayso, tiri walaxda sida ay tahay in ay tahay oo ka bilow mashruuc kasta qaabka xafiiskaaga. Dooro habka shaqada Fur Settings iyo tab-ka BimCraft. Hel Working style. Dooro mid: Each view its own (doorashada ugu horreysa): muuqaal la laabay wuxuu koobiyeeyaa faallooyinkiisa oo waxay sii ahaanayaan kuwa muuqaalkaas; xaashiyada waxa loo daabacaa sida shaashaddu muujinayso. Shared annotations and pen tables: muuqaalada la laabay waxay wadaagaan faallooyinka; daabacaaddu waxay marta miiska qalinka. Hoos doorashada waxaa ah afarta wax ee ay deysa. Beddel mid kasta keligiis; markaas habku wuxuu akhrin doonaa Custom. Habka shaqada waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, sida qaabeynta shaqada. Qaabku wuxuu habkan u qaadaa moodelada cusub. Laabi muuqaal Baaraha Project browser, qorshaha dabaqa kasta, qorshaha saqafka, callout, wejiga iyo goynta waxa uu leeyahay badhanka Duplicate (laba xaashi). Magaci nuqulka oo dooro sida uu u dhaqmayo: Own copy: naqshadeynteeda, cabbiraadyadeeda, jaristooda, walxaha qarsan iyo qalinnadeeda waa la koobiyeeyaa oo waxay sii ahaanayaan kuwa gaarka ah. Tafatirka mid kasta ma beddelo kan kale, sidaas darteed muuqaal ku yaal xaashi la soo diyaariyay wuu sidiisii ku sii jiraa. Linked: wuxuu muujinayaa isla muuqaalka oo leh hal set oo faallooyin iyo dejin ah. Nuqulka waxa lagu liistaa Duplicated views. Riix si aad u furto; baarka ka sare qorshaha wuxuu sheegayaa inuu yahay nuqul, oo leh Up oo kuu celinaya muuqaalkiisa. Badhanka shiidaha wuxuu furaa dejinteeda: magaca, View range (nuqul gaar ah wuxuu leeyahay kiisa), Make own copy oo loogu talagalay mid xidhan, iyo Delete. Koobiyada wejiga iyo goynta waxay saaraan xaashiyadaaga sida muuqaalada ay ka yimaadeen. Laabidda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho, nuqullada waxay ku kaydsan yihiin IFC-ga dhinaca callouts-ka. Qalinnada muuqaalka ku hay, oo la daabacay sida la muujiyay Shid Draw oo dooro Pens. For hadda wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta: derbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha, dabaqyada, saqafyada, tiirarka, tallaabooyinka, qalabka guriga iyo kuwa kale, iyo naqshadeynta iyo cabbiraadyada. Apply wuxuu qalinka ku hayaa IFC-ga muuqaalka la muujiyo: qorshe, qorshaha saqafka, callout ama muuqaal la laabay. Qalinnada la sameeyay ka hor nooca 0.9 waxa lagu hayay browser-ka; Keep these in the file ayaa u guuraya. Xaashiyada iyo PDF-ka waxay sawiraan qalin kasta sida shaashaddu u muujiso. Si aad ugu daabacdo miiska qalinka, dhig Print safka Pens Through a pen table, kadibna dooro miis (midab, midab-madow, madow-cad) ama Edit pen table…: midab kasta wuxuu helaa midabka, ballaca khadka iyo shaandheynta uu ku daabacan doono. Miiska waa faylka plot style-ka CadCraft, sidaas darteed Import… wuxuu qaadan karaa miis laga sameeyay app-ka CadCraft, Export wuxuu mid soo celinayaa. Moodelku wuxuu hayaa doorashadiisa; haddii aan wax la dhigin, habka shaqada ayaa go'aaminaya. Walax u warbixi fasal kale Qayb laga sameeyay dhul sida waddo, derbi loo isticmaalay sida panel, saqaf loo qaabeeyay sida jid kor u kacaysa: ku hay qalabka aad ku sawirtay oo u warbixi sida ay tahay. Dooro walaxda oo fur Properties. Fur Report as. Qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u hesho fasal ku habboon qaabka, dooro, iyo nooca hore ee u diyaarsan. Fasal gaar ah oo kaaga ah, dooro USERDEFINED oo bixi magac. Apply (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho). Clear wuxuu mar kale u warbixiyaa sida la sawiray. Weli waxaad ku tafatirtaa qalabka lagu sawiray. IFC-ga la kaydiyay wuxuu u qoraa sida fasalka la warbixiyay, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale, xisaabinta qadarka ee Quantities, Raadi, Midabee sida, hubinta moodelka iyo Problems waxay u tiriyaan sida fasalkaas. Jadwallada waxay ka saaraan derbi loo warbixiyay sida panel jadwalka derbiyada, Elements by reported class wuxuu liistaa mid kasta. Waxay shaqeysaa faylalka IFC4 iyo IFC2X3; liiska wuxuu bixiyaa kaliya fasalada nooca IFC ee faylka. Albaabada, daaqadaha, tallaabooyinka, qolalka iyo heerarka waxay haystaan fasalkooda. Kaydi mashruuc sida qaab, oo ka bilow Mashruuc furan, riix Save as template oo ku xiga Save. Magacee. Calaamadi Also download the template file si aad ugu wadaagto sida faylka IFC; iyo Start new models from it si aad uga dhigto caadi. Qaabku wuxuu hayaa heerarka, qaababka muuqaalka iyo dejinta muuqaalka, muuqaalada la laabay iyo callouts-ka, naqshadeynta, qalinnada iyo miiska qalinka, calaamadaha, qoysaska iyo noocyada, xaashiyada, cabbirrada xaashiyada, title blocks-ka iyo habka shaqada. Derbiyada, dabaqyada, albaabada iyo walxaha kale ee moodelka waa laga reebay. Riix New building oo dooro hoos Start from, ama dooro A template file… mid laguu soo diray. Mashruuca cusub wuxuu helaa magaciisa iyo aqoonsigiisa mashruuca; wax kale sida qaabka ayey yihiin. Qaababka waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan. Qaababka kooxda ee la wadaago CadCraft Studio weli lama dhisin: halkii, u dir faylka qaabka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-open-in","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuqaalka ku fur barnaamij kale","summary":"Kaydi muuqaalka fayl USD ama glTF barnaamij kasta oo akhrisa, ama ka fur Studio barnaamij ku jira kombiyuutarkan.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["ku fur","usd","gltf","glb","dhoofin","barnaamijka rendarka","archviz","studio","usdview","dir","gudbin","xirmo","folder-ka unreal"],"headings":[{"id":"fayl-loo-furo-barnaamij-kasta","text":"Fayl loo furo barnaamij kasta","level":2},{"id":"studio-ku-fur-barnaamij","text":"Studio: ku fur barnaamij","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKu fur …\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira liiska Injinka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E si aad muuqaalka u gudbiso barnaamij kale. Waxba ma soo noqdo moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayl-loo-furo-barnaamij-kasta\"\u003EFayl loo furo barnaamij kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUSD file\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muuqaalka kaydiyaa sidii \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E marka moodelku sawiro leeyahay): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003Eisla fayl sida Save as USD\u003C/a\u003E, oo leh agabka, nalalka iyo kameradaha. Wuu ilaaliyaa instancing-ka iyo qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka. Inta badan rendarrada, injinada ciyaarta iyo muuqaal-akhristayaasha waxay akhriyaan USD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF file (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl glTF 2.0 oo fudud, oo leh agabka, texture-yada iyo nalalka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\"\u003EDir moodelka barnaamijka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E waxa uu ku jiro iyo waxa uu ka reebayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnreal project folder (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa folder-ka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EDir muuqaalka injinka ciyaarta\u003C/a\u003E qoro, mashruuc kasta oo kombiyuutar kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdaas oo dhammaantood waxay shaqeeyaan browser-ka iyo Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"studio-ku-fur-barnaamij\"\u003EStudio: ku fur barnaamij\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio wuxuu liistaa barnaamijyada uu ka helo kombiyuutarkan ee furi kara muuqaalka: usdview haddii uu ku jiro search path-kaaga, iyo barnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaarka ah nooca faylka. Dooro mid, dooro USD ama glTF meesha ay labaduba akhriyaan, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Studio wuxuu xirmada ku qoraa folder cusub oo ku jira Documents (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft hand-off\u003C/code\u003E; wax lama dhex-qorayo, dir kasta folder gaar ah ayuu helaa), wuxuuna barnaamijka ku bilaabaa, kadibna wuxuu sheegaa meesha faylasha ku yaallaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBarnaamij\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkhriska ugu fiican\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eusdview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka kombiyuutarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarku u haysto nooca faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio wuxuu bilaabaa kaliya barnaamijyada liiska go&#039;an; ma socodsiiyo wax bogga magacooda ku weydiiyo. Weligiisna ma bilaabo barnaamij ku shaqeeya shatiga GNU GPL (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program#programs-cadcraft-never-runs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-hash=\"programs-cadcraft-never-runs\"\u003ESawirka barnaamij kale ku sameey\u003C/a\u003E). Barnaamij kasta oo akhrin kara USD ama glTF wuxuu furaa faylka ka \u003Cstrong\u003EFayl loo furo barnaamij kasta\u003C/strong\u003E kor ku xusan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwinmotion, Enscape iyo barnaamijyada muuqaalka kale ma ku jiraan liiska. CadCraft ma hubin iyaga, sidaas darteed ma sheegi karo wax ku saabsan iyaga. Fayl glTF ama USD oo halkan ka yimid waa jidka lagu galo; eeg qoraallada ku saabsan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering#enscape-and-other-plug-in-renderers\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-hash=\"enscape-and-other-plug-in-renderers\"\u003Einjinada rendarka ee plug-in\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Dooro Ku fur … oo ku jira liiska Injinka ee Render si aad muuqaalka u gudbiso barnaamij kale. Waxba ma soo noqdo moodelka. Fayl loo furo barnaamij kasta USD file wuxuu muuqaalka kaydiyaa sidii .usdc (ama .usdz marka moodelku sawiro leeyahay): isla fayl sida Save as USD, oo leh agabka, nalalka iyo kameradaha. Wuu ilaaliyaa instancing-ka iyo qiimaha saxda ah ee agabka. Inta badan rendarrada, injinada ciyaarta iyo muuqaal-akhristayaasha waxay akhriyaan USD. glTF file (.glb) wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl glTF 2.0 oo fudud, oo leh agabka, texture-yada iyo nalalka; eeg Dir moodelka barnaamijka rendarka waxa uu ku jiro iyo waxa uu ka reebayo. Unreal project folder (.zip) wuxuu kaydiyaa folder-ka Dir muuqaalka injinka ciyaarta qoro, mashruuc kasta oo kombiyuutar kasta. Saddexdaas oo dhammaantood waxay shaqeeyaan browser-ka iyo Studio. Studio: ku fur barnaamij Studio wuxuu liistaa barnaamijyada uu ka helo kombiyuutarkan ee furi kara muuqaalka: usdview haddii uu ku jiro search path-kaaga, iyo barnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaarka ah nooca faylka. Dooro mid, dooro USD ama glTF meesha ay labaduba akhriyaan, kadibna guji Render. Studio wuxuu xirmada ku qoraa folder cusub oo ku jira Documents (CadCraft hand-off; wax lama dhex-qorayo, dir kasta folder gaar ah ayuu helaa), wuxuuna barnaamijka ku bilaabaa, kadibna wuxuu sheegaa meesha faylasha ku yaallaan. Barnaamij Akhriska ugu fiican usdview USD Barnaamijka kombiyuutarka Waxa kombiyuutarku u haysto nooca faylka Studio wuxuu bilaabaa kaliya barnaamijyada liiska go'an; ma socodsiiyo wax bogga magacooda ku weydiiyo. Weligiisna ma bilaabo barnaamij ku shaqeeya shatiga GNU GPL (eeg Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sameey). Barnaamij kasta oo akhrin kara USD ama glTF wuxuu furaa faylka ka Fayl loo furo barnaamij kasta kor ku xusan. Twinmotion, Enscape iyo barnaamijyada muuqaalka kale ma ku jiraan liiska. CadCraft ma hubin iyaga, sidaas darteed ma sheegi karo wax ku saabsan iyaga. Fayl glTF ama USD oo halkan ka yimid waa jidka lagu galo; eeg qoraallada ku saabsan injinada rendarka ee plug-in.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"interior-elevations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Muuqaallada gudaha","summary":"Samee hal xaashi oo muujinaya afarta darbi ee qol gudihiisa, oo leh cabbirro iyo calaamado, kadibna kaydi PDF.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["muuqaal gudaha","qol","darbi","kabaad","jikada","muuqaal","xaashi","PDF","cabbir","calaamad","meel","A-501"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-xaashida","text":"Samee xaashida","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xaashidu-muujinayso","text":"Waxa xaashidu muujinayso","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyadaada","text":"Xaashiyadaada","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qol oo hel hal xaashi oo muujinaya afarta darbi ee qolka sida aad ku arki lahayd markaad gudaha taagan tahay. Waxa loo sameeyay jikooyinka, musqusha iyo qol kasta oo aad u baahan tahay inaad aragto kabaadhka, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha darbi kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-xaashida\"\u003ESamee xaashida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qolka. Qorshaha oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E uu furan yahay, guji gudaha qolka. Aragtida 3D ama geedka moodeelka, dooro meesha (IfcSpace).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa sifooyinka \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterior elevations…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqaddu waxay furmaysaa xaashida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload PDF\u003C/span\u003E si aad u kaydiso. Faylka magiciisu waa &quot;&lt;file&gt; — Interior elevations — &lt;room&gt;.pdf&quot; wuuna ahaa PDF vektor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E markaad dhammeysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xaashidu-muujinayso\"\u003EWaxa xaashidu muujinayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashidu waxay leedahay afar aragtiyood, labo labo, hal miisaan oo keliya: miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon. Waa \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga Waqooyi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga Bari\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga Koonfur\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga Galbeed\u003C/strong\u003E. Sanduuqa cinwaanka wuxuu leeyahay lambarka xaashida A-501, cinwaanka &quot;Interior elevations — &quot; oo leh lambarka iyo magaca qolka, mashruuca iyo taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAragti kasta waxaa la gooyaa bartamaha qolka oo waxay eegaysaa darbiga dhinacaas. Darbiyada dhinacyada, iyo wax kasta oo lagu gooyay iyaga sida daaqad, waxay u muuqdaan sidii poché cawl ah oo aragta ku wareegsan. Aragtidu waxay joogsataa wax yar ka dib wejiga darbiga, si wax ka dambeeya darbiga aanu u muuqan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAragti kasta waxay leedahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eballaca qolka hoosteeda, wejiga gudaha ilaa wejiga gudaha;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhererka qolka dhinacdeeda, dhulka ilaa heerka ka sarreeya;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecalaamad afar-geesle ah albaab kasta, iyo calaamad lix-geesle ah daaqad kasta darbigaas, oo leh calaamaddeeda (D1, W1 iwm.);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecalaamad goobo ah oo leh lambarka walxa maktabadda ah ee lagu dhigay hortiisa darbigaas: kabaadh, qalab iyo qalabka kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAragtiyada waxaa laga sameeyaa moodeelka mar kasta oo aad furto daaqadda, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waa isku mid. Kabaad dhaqdhaqaaji, kadibna mar kale fur daaqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyadaada\"\u003EXaashiyadaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAragti kasta oo darbi kasta oo qol kasta waa sidoo kale aragti aad ku dari karto xaashi aad samayso: sanduuqa mashruuca, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EInterior elevations\u003C/strong\u003E ku dar &quot;101 Kitchen — North wall&quot; iyo kuwa kale. Waxay yimaadaa cabbirradii iyo calaamadihii isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaallada gudaha ee dukumentiyada la soo saaray (oo ka imanaya \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E qolka ama xaashiyadaada), qolalka aan ku badnayn afar-geesle (aragtidu waxay u muuqataa labo-geesle dhinac kasta oo sanduuqa qolka ah), qoridda, qoraallada ama cabbirrada aad naftaadu ku darto, iyo dooridda darbiyada la muujinayo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dooro qol oo hel hal xaashi oo muujinaya afarta darbi ee qolka sida aad ku arki lahayd markaad gudaha taagan tahay. Waxa loo sameeyay jikooyinka, musqusha iyo qol kasta oo aad u baahan tahay inaad aragto kabaadhka, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha darbi kasta. Samee xaashida Dooro qolka. Qorshaha oo Draw uu furan yahay, guji gudaha qolka. Aragtida 3D ama geedka moodeelka, dooro meesha (IfcSpace). Ka sifooyinka Sifooyinka, guji Interior elevations…. Daaqaddu waxay furmaysaa xaashida. Guji Download PDF si aad u kaydiso. Faylka magiciisu waa \"\u003Cfile\u003E — Interior elevations — \u003Croom\u003E.pdf\" wuuna ahaa PDF vektor. Guji Close markaad dhammeysid. Waxa xaashidu muujinayso Xaashidu waxay leedahay afar aragtiyood, labo labo, hal miisaan oo keliya: miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon. Waa Darbiga Waqooyi, Darbiga Bari, Darbiga Koonfur iyo Darbiga Galbeed. Sanduuqa cinwaanka wuxuu leeyahay lambarka xaashida A-501, cinwaanka \"Interior elevations — \" oo leh lambarka iyo magaca qolka, mashruuca iyo taariikhda. Aragti kasta waxaa la gooyaa bartamaha qolka oo waxay eegaysaa darbiga dhinacaas. Darbiyada dhinacyada, iyo wax kasta oo lagu gooyay iyaga sida daaqad, waxay u muuqdaan sidii poché cawl ah oo aragta ku wareegsan. Aragtidu waxay joogsataa wax yar ka dib wejiga darbiga, si wax ka dambeeya darbiga aanu u muuqan. Aragti kasta waxay leedahay: ballaca qolka hoosteeda, wejiga gudaha ilaa wejiga gudaha; dhererka qolka dhinacdeeda, dhulka ilaa heerka ka sarreeya; calaamad afar-geesle ah albaab kasta, iyo calaamad lix-geesle ah daaqad kasta darbigaas, oo leh calaamaddeeda (D1, W1 iwm.); calaamad goobo ah oo leh lambarka walxa maktabadda ah ee lagu dhigay hortiisa darbigaas: kabaadh, qalab iyo qalabka kale. Aragtiyada waxaa laga sameeyaa moodeelka mar kasta oo aad furto daaqadda, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waa isku mid. Kabaad dhaqdhaqaaji, kadibna mar kale fur daaqadda. Xaashiyadaada Aragti kasta oo darbi kasta oo qol kasta waa sidoo kale aragti aad ku dari karto xaashi aad samayso: sanduuqa mashruuca, guji New sheet, kadibna hoosta Interior elevations ku dar \"101 Kitchen — North wall\" iyo kuwa kale. Waxay yimaadaa cabbirradii iyo calaamadihii isku mid. Weli lama dhisin Muuqaallada gudaha ee dukumentiyada la soo saaray (oo ka imanaya Sifooyinka qolka ama xaashiyadaada), qolalka aan ku badnayn afar-geesle (aragtidu waxay u muuqataa labo-geesle dhinac kasta oo sanduuqa qolka ah), qoridda, qoraallada ama cabbirrada aad naftaadu ku darto, iyo dooridda darbiyada la muujinayo. Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"command-line","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sadka amarka ee xaaladda","summary":"Layout leh sadka amarka, ku qor meel kasta waxyaalaha, xarfuhu waxay galaan xariiqda hoose. Waxay liistaa wixii is waafaqa, waxay xasuusataa taariikhda, oo waligeed ma daboolo sawirka.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["sadka amarka","ku qor meel kasta","amar la qoray","xarriiqda xaaladda","taariikhda","enter","space","WALL","DOOR","layout Duncan","layout Rhino","gaabin","furayaasha","raadinta amarka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-qori-karto","text":"Waxa aad qori karto","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada ku socodsii adigoo ku qorayo magacyadooda, adigoo aan marka hore sanduuq guji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro layout leh sadka amarka: fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDuncan\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003ERhino\u003C/strong\u003E). Xariiqdu waxay ku jirtaa xarriiqda xaaladda ee hoose ee daaqadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad mouse-ka meel kasta ku jirto oo aan sanduuq shaqeynayn, ku qor \u003Ccode\u003Ewall\u003C/code\u003E. Xarfuhu way muuqdaan xariiqda amarka, liis ka sarreeyana wuxuu muujinayaa amarada is waafaqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qalabka Wall wuu bilaabmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xariiqda amarka (ama mar kale taabo fure). Haddii xariiqdu madhan tahay, liistu waxay muujinaysaa amarada aad hore u qortay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dhex mara; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa midka la muujiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-qori-karto\"\u003EWaxa aad qori karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac amar oo habka menu-ga la isticmaalo, meesha habkaas leeyahay (\u003Ccode\u003EWALL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR\u003C/code\u003E habka Drafting).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuraha amarka, sida eray: \u003Ccode\u003EW\u003C/code\u003E ka dib \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Wall, \u003Ccode\u003ED\u003C/code\u003E waa Door.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca amarka, oo leh ama aan lahayn meelaha: \u003Ccode\u003Esplit wall\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewallrectangle\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilowga eray ama magac, marka amar keliya sidaas u bilowdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kale kasta wuxuu furaa raadinta amarka oo leh waxa aad qortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu afuraa xariiqda oo furayaasha wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELayoutyadan, xaraf keligiis ma bilaabo qalab: wuxuu ku sugaa xariiqda ilaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Furayaasha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, furayaasha function, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay sii shaqeeyaan sida hore. Layoutyada kale wax ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInta qalab Draw uu socdo, lambarrada waxay ku sii jiraan qalabka (dherer la qoray).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorista sanduuq, wada-hadal ama Settings waxay sii jirtaa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaariikhda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa kumbiyuutarkan, 50 amar barnaamij kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Qalabyada ku socodsii adigoo ku qorayo magacyadooda, adigoo aan marka hore sanduuq guji. Tallaabooyinka Dooro layout leh sadka amarka: fur Dejinta, dooro Caalami, kadibna Qaabeynta, oo dooro Duncan (ama Rhino). Xariiqdu waxay ku jirtaa xarriiqda xaaladda ee hoose ee daaqadda. Markaad mouse-ka meel kasta ku jirto oo aan sanduuq shaqeynayn, ku qor wall. Xarfuhu way muuqdaan xariiqda amarka, liis ka sarreeyana wuxuu muujinayaa amarada is waafaqa. Taabo Enter. Qalabka Wall wuu bilaabmaa. Guji xariiqda amarka (ama mar kale taabo fure). Haddii xariiqdu madhan tahay, liistu waxay muujinaysaa amarada aad hore u qortay. ↑ iyo ↓ ayaa dhex mara; Enter wuxuu socodsiiyaa midka la muujiyay. Waxa aad qori karto Magac amar oo habka menu-ga la isticmaalo, meesha habkaas leeyahay (WALL, WA, DOOR habka Drafting). Furaha amarka, sida eray: W ka dib Enter ama Space waa Wall, D waa Door. Magaca amarka, oo leh ama aan lahayn meelaha: split wall, wallrectangle. Bilowga eray ama magac, marka amar keliya sidaas u bilowdo. Wax kale kasta wuxuu furaa raadinta amarka oo leh waxa aad qortay. Waxa muhiim ah Esc wuxuu afuraa xariiqda oo furayaasha wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa sawirka. Layoutyadan, xaraf keligiis ma bilaabo qalab: wuxuu ku sugaa xariiqda ilaa Enter ama Space. Furayaasha Ctrl, furayaasha function, Delete iyo Esc waxay sii shaqeeyaan sida hore. Layoutyada kale wax ma beddelo. Inta qalab Draw uu socdo, lambarrada waxay ku sii jiraan qalabka (dherer la qoray). Qorista sanduuq, wada-hadal ama Settings waxay sii jirtaa halkaas. Taariikhda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa kumbiyuutarkan, 50 amar barnaamij kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"room-and-area-tags","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Calaamadaynta qolka iyo bedka","summary":"Dhig calaamad leh lambarka, magaca iyo bedka qol ama bed. Calaamaddu waxay raacaysaa meeshaas, cabbirkeeduna waxa lagu go'aamiyaa dherka ku qoran warqadda.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["calaamad","calaamadda qolka","calaamadda bedka","calaamadi qolka","calaamadi bedka","calaamadi dhammaan","sumad","dherka qoraalka","dherka warqadda","tilmaam"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"halka-qalabka-ku-yaal","text":"Halka qalabka ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-calaamaddu-sameyso","text":"Waxa calaamaddu sameyso","level":2},{"id":"ifc-ga-dhexdiisa","text":"IFC-ga dhexdiisa","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi qolalka iyo bedadka mid mid ama oo dhammaantood wada, oo calaamadda dhig meel ay si fiican u akhriyi karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-qalabka-ku-yaal\"\u003EHalka qalabka ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EQol &amp; Bed\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi qolka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi bedka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta classic: jagada Sawir › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQol ama bed la doortay: Sifooyinka › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar calaamad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi qolka\u003C/span\u003E oo guji qol, meesha calaamaddu ku taal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi kuwii aan calaamad lahayn oo dhan\u003C/span\u003E safka: qol kasta oo heerkan ku jira oo aan calaamad lahayn ayaa helaysa mid, bartiisa dhexe. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad calaamad u guurisid, dooro adigoo isticmaalaya Dooro oo jiid. Sifooyinka waxa ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib ugu celi dhexda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi bedka\u003C/span\u003E waxay u shaqaysaa sidaas oo kale bedadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-calaamaddu-sameyso\"\u003EWaxa calaamaddu sameyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay sheegaysaa lambarka, magaca iyo bedka, cutubyada muuqda ee aad dooratay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay raacaysaa qolkeeda: magaca qolka beddel, darbi ruq, erayada calaamadda iyo meeshaduba isla tallaabo ku beddelmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarqadda ayaa cabbirkeeda go&#039;aamisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherka qoraalka warqadda\u003C/span\u003E waa millimitir (bilowga 2.5). Iskeelka muuqaalka 1:50, calaamad 2.5 mm waa 125 mm dherer ku jirta moodelka; 1:100 waa 250 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQol leh calaamad wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadda halkii sumadda caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii qolkeeda ama bedkeeda la tirtiro, calaamaddu way la tagaysaa. Ka noqo labadaba way soo celisaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-ga-dhexdiisa\"\u003EIFC-ga dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad waa IfcAnnotation (ObjectType ROOMTAG ama AREATAG) oo qoraalkeeda loo qoray qoraal toos ah (text literal), iyo GlobalId ee wixii ay magacaabto. Qoraalka faylka wuxuu bedka siinayaa mitir laba jibbaaran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka calaamadda gaarka ah, iyo xariiqda hoggaaminta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha albaabbada, daaqadaha iyo darbiyada waa qalab gooni ah (eeg qaababka calaamadda ee xaashiyada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EQolalka iyo kala-goynta qolalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Calaamadi qolalka iyo bedadka mid mid ama oo dhammaantood wada, oo calaamadda dhig meel ay si fiican u akhriyi karto. Halka qalabka ku yaal Habaynta ribbon-ka: Naqshadda dhismaha › Qol & Bed › Calaamadi qolka iyo Calaamadi bedka. Habaynta classic: jagada Sawir › menu-ga Qolalka. Qol ama bed la doortay: Sifooyinka › Ku dar calaamad. Tallaabooyinka Dooro Calaamadi qolka oo guji qol, meesha calaamaddu ku taal. Ama riix Calaamadi kuwii aan calaamad lahayn oo dhan safka: qol kasta oo heerkan ku jira oo aan calaamad lahayn ayaa helaysa mid, bartiisa dhexe. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Si aad calaamad u guurisid, dooro adigoo isticmaalaya Dooro oo jiid. Sifooyinka waxa ku jira Dib ugu celi dhexda. Calaamadi bedka waxay u shaqaysaa sidaas oo kale bedadka. Waxa calaamaddu sameyso Waxay sheegaysaa lambarka, magaca iyo bedka, cutubyada muuqda ee aad dooratay. Waxay raacaysaa qolkeeda: magaca qolka beddel, darbi ruq, erayada calaamadda iyo meeshaduba isla tallaabo ku beddelmaan. Warqadda ayaa cabbirkeeda go'aamisa: Dherka qoraalka warqadda waa millimitir (bilowga 2.5). Iskeelka muuqaalka 1:50, calaamad 2.5 mm waa 125 mm dherer ku jirta moodelka; 1:100 waa 250 mm. Qol leh calaamad wuxuu muujiyaa calaamadda halkii sumadda caadiga ah. Markii qolkeeda ama bedkeeda la tirtiro, calaamaddu way la tagaysaa. Ka noqo labadaba way soo celisaa. IFC-ga dhexdiisa Calaamad waa IfcAnnotation (ObjectType ROOMTAG ama AREATAG) oo qoraalkeeda loo qoray qoraal toos ah (text literal), iyo GlobalId ee wixii ay magacaabto. Qoraalka faylka wuxuu bedka siinayaa mitir laba jibbaaran. Weli lama dhisin Qaababka calaamadda gaarka ah, iyo xariiqda hoggaaminta. Calaamadaha albaabbada, daaqadaha iyo darbiyada waa qalab gooni ah (eeg qaababka calaamadda ee xaashiyada). Eeg sidoo kale Qolalka iyo kala-goynta qolalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"4d-schedule","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ciyaar jadwalka dhismaha moodelka","summary":"Fur liiska hawlaha oo ah CSV, ku xidh hawl kasta walxaha sifo ahaan, kadibna u gudub taariikhaha si aad u aragto waxa la dhisay, waxa socda iyo waxa weli aan bilaabmin.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["4d","jadwal","taxanaha dhismaha","timeline","marxaladeynta","barnaamij","gantt","hawlo","taariikhaha","simulation","horumar","la dhisay","csv","marxalad","phase","xirmada shaqada","wbs","koox"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"liiska-hawlaha","text":"Liiska hawlaha","level":2},{"id":"marxaladaha-iyo-xirmooyinka-shaqada","text":"Marxaladaha iyo xirmooyinka shaqada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"xiriiriyaasha-jaantuska-gantt-iyo-ms-project","text":"Xiriiriyaasha, jaantuska Gantt iyo MS Project","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaawo dhismaha oo kor u kacaya: hawl kasta oo jadwalkaaga ku jira oo ku xidhan walxaha uu dhisayo, oo maalin-maalin lagu muujiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka 4D\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji tusaale\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hesho liis hawlaha oo leh hal toddobaad dabaq kasta, oo ku beddel miis-xisaab. Ama qor kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur liiska hawlaha…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro CSV-ga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhanka taariikhda, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-hawlaha\"\u003ELiiska hawlaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV oo leh safka madaxa iyo tiirarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETask\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EStart\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFinish\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EField\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E. Kala-soocidda waxay noqon kartaa koma ama semicolon labaduba way shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETask\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFinish\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EValue\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabaqa 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-02\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-13\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaqaf\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-16\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-20\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcRoof\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaqaf\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-16\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-20\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPset_WallCommon.IsExternal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor taariikhaha qaabka YYYY-MM-DD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafku wuxuu hawlka ku xidhaa walxaha oo dhan ee \u003Cstrong\u003EField\u003C/strong\u003E-kooda \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E-kooda la mid yahay. Field waa sifo sida Storey, Class, Name, Type, Material, Tag ama GlobalId, ama sifo kasta oo lagu qoro set-kiisa iyo magaciisa, sida \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon.FireRating\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu celi hawl safyo badan oo taariikh isku mid ah, si aad walxo dheeraad ah ugu xidhto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marxaladaha-iyo-xirmooyinka-shaqada\"\u003EMarxaladaha iyo xirmooyinka shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dar tiir \u003Cstrong\u003EStage\u003C/strong\u003E, tiir \u003Cstrong\u003EPackage\u003C/strong\u003E, ama labadaba, si aad hawlaha ugu soo ururiso marxaladaha iyo xirmooyinka shaqada. Phase iyo WBS waxay sidoo kale shaqeeyaan sida magacyada tiirarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETask\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFinish\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EValue\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStage\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPackage\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESagxadda dabaqa 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-02\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-04\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcSlab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab-dhismeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrame\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyada dabaqa 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-05\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-13\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab-dhismeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrame\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlbaabbada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-11-30\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2026-12-04\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcDoor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamaystirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoinery\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHawl wuxuu ku jiraa hal marxalad iyo hal xirmo. Haddii safka dambe ee isla hawlaha uu magac kale magacaabo, safkaas waa la liistaa lambarka safkiisa oo waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac xirmo isku mid ah laba marxalad gudahood waa laba xirmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka liiska leeyahay kooxo, liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka soo muuqda taariikhda kor. Dooro marxalad ama xirmo, oo waxay u ciyaartaa sidii hal mid:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiidka iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow\u003C/span\u003E waxay socdaan laga bilaabo bilowga ugu horreeya ee kooxda ilaa dhammaadka ugu dambeeya,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekaliya hawlaha kooxda ayaa la liistaa oo la sawiraa, wax kasta oo ka baxsan kooxda waa muuqaal cadaan ah,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhadka hoos ee liiska wuxuu sheegayaa imisa hawl oo kooxda ka mid ah ayaa la dhammeeyay, la socda, iyo kuwa soo socda taariikhdaas,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro walxaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa walxaha kooxda oo dhan, si loo isticmaalo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E ama jadwal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan hawlaha\u003C/strong\u003E si aad jadwalka oo dhan dib ugu aragto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuilt\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha hawlahooda oo dhan la dhammeeyay, midabkooda u gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIn progress\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha ay hawl socota maalintaas ku jirto, midab ochre ah. Hawl waxa la socdaa laga bilaabo taariikhda bilowga ilaa taariikhda dhammaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENot started\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaal cadaan ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha aan hawl ku jirin way sii joogaan sidooda. Liiska wuxuu muujinayaa imisa walxood ayaa hawl kasta helay. Safyada aan la akhriyi karin, ama aan wax helin, waxaa lagu liistaa lambarkooda safka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiriiriyaasha-jaantuska-gantt-iyo-ms-project\"\u003EXiriiriyaasha, jaantuska Gantt iyo MS Project\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur fayl Microsoft Project XML (\u003Ccode\u003E.xml\u003C/code\u003E) ama CSV oo leh tiir \u003Ccode\u003EPredecessors\u003C/code\u003E. Xiriiriyayaashu waxay noqon karaan finish to start, start to start, finish to finish ama start to finish, mid kastaba leh lead ama lag maalmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos liiska hawlaha, jaantuska Gantt wuxuu hawl kasta ku sawiraa bar, falaadhna xiriiriyayaasha u dhexeeya. Hawlaha ku jira jidka muhiimka ah (critical path) waa casaan. Xiriiriye wareeg ah ama predecessor aan jirin ayaa lagu liistaa panel-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida MS Project XML\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi CSV oo leh xidhiidhada\u003C/span\u003E waxay jadwalka dib u qoraan iyadoo xiriiriyayaashiisa ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003ERaadi walxaha fasal, magac ama sifo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/color-by-property\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/color-by-property\"\u003EMidee walxaha iyada oo sifo lagu saleeyay\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Daawo dhismaha oo kor u kacaya: hawl kasta oo jadwalkaaga ku jira oo ku xidhan walxaha uu dhisayo, oo maalin-maalin lagu muujiyo. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC oo fur Jadwalka 4D panel-ka bidix. Guji Soo deji tusaale si aad u hesho liis hawlaha oo leh hal toddobaad dabaq kasta, oo ku beddel miis-xisaab. Ama qor kaaga. Guji Fur liiska hawlaha… oo dooro CSV-ga. Jiid dhanka taariikhda, ama guji Bilow. Liiska hawlaha CSV oo leh safka madaxa iyo tiirarka Task, Start, Finish, Field iyo Value. Kala-soocidda waxay noqon kartaa koma ama semicolon labaduba way shaqeeyaan. Task Start Finish Field Value Dabaqa 1 2026-11-02 2026-11-13 Storey Level 1 Saqaf 2026-11-16 2026-11-20 Class IfcRoof Saqaf 2026-11-16 2026-11-20 Pset_WallCommon.IsExternal Yes Qor taariikhaha qaabka YYYY-MM-DD. Safku wuxuu hawlka ku xidhaa walxaha oo dhan ee Field-kooda Value-kooda la mid yahay. Field waa sifo sida Storey, Class, Name, Type, Material, Tag ama GlobalId, ama sifo kasta oo lagu qoro set-kiisa iyo magaciisa, sida Pset_WallCommon.FireRating. Ku celi hawl safyo badan oo taariikh isku mid ah, si aad walxo dheeraad ah ugu xidhto. Marxaladaha iyo xirmooyinka shaqada Ku dar tiir Stage, tiir Package, ama labadaba, si aad hawlaha ugu soo ururiso marxaladaha iyo xirmooyinka shaqada. Phase iyo WBS waxay sidoo kale shaqeeyaan sida magacyada tiirarka. Task Start Finish Field Value Stage Package Sagxadda dabaqa 1 2026-11-02 2026-11-04 Class IfcSlab Qaab-dhismeed Frame Darbiyada dabaqa 1 2026-11-05 2026-11-13 Storey Level 1 Qaab-dhismeed Frame Albaabbada 2026-11-30 2026-12-04 Class IfcDoor Dhamaystirka Joinery Hawl wuxuu ku jiraa hal marxalad iyo hal xirmo. Haddii safka dambe ee isla hawlaha uu magac kale magacaabo, safkaas waa la liistaa lambarka safkiisa oo waa la dhaafaa. Magac xirmo isku mid ah laba marxalad gudahood waa laba xirmo. Marka liiska leeyahay kooxo, liiska Muuji ayaa ka soo muuqda taariikhda kor. Dooro marxalad ama xirmo, oo waxay u ciyaartaa sidii hal mid: jiidka iyo Bilow waxay socdaan laga bilaabo bilowga ugu horreeya ee kooxda ilaa dhammaadka ugu dambeeya, kaliya hawlaha kooxda ayaa la liistaa oo la sawiraa, wax kasta oo ka baxsan kooxda waa muuqaal cadaan ah, khadka hoos ee liiska wuxuu sheegayaa imisa hawl oo kooxda ka mid ah ayaa la dhammeeyay, la socda, iyo kuwa soo socda taariikhdaas, Dooro walxaha wuxuu doortaa walxaha kooxda oo dhan, si loo isticmaalo Muuji, Goyn ama jadwal. Dooro Dhammaan hawlaha si aad jadwalka oo dhan dib ugu aragto. Waxa aad arki lahayd Built: walxaha hawlahooda oo dhan la dhammeeyay, midabkooda u gaar ah. In progress: walxaha ay hawl socota maalintaas ku jirto, midab ochre ah. Hawl waxa la socdaa laga bilaabo taariikhda bilowga ilaa taariikhda dhammaadka. Not started: muuqaal cadaan ah. Walxaha aan hawl ku jirin way sii joogaan sidooda. Liiska wuxuu muujinayaa imisa walxood ayaa hawl kasta helay. Safyada aan la akhriyi karin, ama aan wax helin, waxaa lagu liistaa lambarkooda safka. Xiriiriyaasha, jaantuska Gantt iyo MS Project Fur fayl Microsoft Project XML (.xml) ama CSV oo leh tiir Predecessors. Xiriiriyayaashu waxay noqon karaan finish to start, start to start, finish to finish ama start to finish, mid kastaba leh lead ama lag maalmo. Hoos liiska hawlaha, jaantuska Gantt wuxuu hawl kasta ku sawiraa bar, falaadhna xiriiriyayaasha u dhexeeya. Hawlaha ku jira jidka muhiimka ah (critical path) waa casaan. Xiriiriye wareeg ah ama predecessor aan jirin ayaa lagu liistaa panel-ka. Kaydi sida MS Project XML iyo Kaydi CSV oo leh xidhiidhada waxay jadwalka dib u qoraan iyadoo xiriiriyayaashiisa ku jira. Xiga Raadi walxaha fasal, magac ama sifo Midee walxaha iyada oo sifo lagu saleeyay","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-unreal","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dir muuqaalka injinka ciyaarta","summary":"Studio wuxuu muuqaalka ku qori karaa mashruuc Unreal Engine wuxuuna ku ilaaliyaa isku-waafaqsan dir kasta; tafatirkaaga wuxuu ku jiraa layer aan CadCraft weligeed ku qorin. Plug-inka furaya weli lama sii deyn.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["unreal","unreal engine","injinka ciyaarta","xidhiidh","dir","usd stage","mashruuc","toos ah","cine camera","movie render queue"],"headings":[{"id":"dir-muuqaalka","text":"Dir muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"tafatirkaaga-way-ammaan-tahay","text":"Tafatirkaaga way ammaan tahay","level":2},{"id":"studio-la-aantood","text":"Studio la'aantood","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio-da liiska Injinka wuxuu hayn karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E mashruuca Unreal Engine. Hal jihood oo keliya: CadCraft-ka ilaa Unreal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dir-muuqaalka\"\u003EDir muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro galka Unreal ee liiska Injinka. Markii ugu horreysay, Studio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad dooratid folder-ka mashruucaaga (kan leh faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.uproject\u003C/code\u003E); wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend\u003C/span\u003E. Studio wuxuu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft/&lt;file name&gt;/\u003C/code\u003E mashruuca gudihiisa: muuqaalka sidii fayl USD, fayl dejinta, profile-yada iftiinka, iyo laba fayl layer oo yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel moodelka, kaydi oo dir mar kale. Waxa kaliya ee la beddelo waa muuqaalka iyo fayl dejinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatirkaaga-way-ammaan-tahay\"\u003ETafatirkaaga way ammaan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStage-ka uu Unreal furo waa root layer yar oo la sameeyay hal mar, iyo laba layer oo hoostiisa ku jira: \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaaga\u003C/strong\u003E korka ku jira (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.user.usda\u003C/code\u003E, madhan markii hore, CadCraft weligeed ma dib u qorto) iyo muuqaalka CadCraft ee hoose. Tafatirka aad ku kaydiso layer-kaaga wuu sii joogaa markii muuqaalka mar kale la diro. Nalalka iyo actors-ka kale ee aad ku dhejiso heerka Unreal waa ka baxsan stage-ka, sidaas darteed iyaguna lama taaban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"studio-la-aantood\"\u003EStudio la&#039;aantood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-ka, ama kombiyuutar aan Studio uu Unreal ka helin, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EUnreal project folder (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E liiska Injinka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu kaydiyaa isla folder-ka sidii zip: fur mashruucaaga folder-ka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft\u003C/code\u003E gudihiisa. Ku hay \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar faylasha stage-ka\u003C/strong\u003E shidan markii ugu horreysay; ka demi kaydinta soo socota, si zip-ku kaliya muuqaalka iyo fayl dejinta ugu jiraan, layer-kaagana aan waligiis la beddelin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug-inka Unreal ee furaya stage-ka, codsada iftiinka, nalalka, kameradaha iyo exposure-ka, raacaya dir kasta, iyo kamarad kasta oo rendarka ah, \u003Cstrong\u003Eweli lama sii deynin\u003C/strong\u003E oo weli lama socodsiin Unreal. Ilaa markaas, Send wuxuu faylasha geliyaa mashruuca, qalabka USD ee Unreal ayaa furi kara. Windows ayaa ah nidaamka ugu horreeya; macOS ayaa raaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"CadCraft Studio-da liiska Injinka wuxuu hayn karaa xidhiidh mashruuca Unreal Engine. Hal jihood oo keliya: CadCraft-ka ilaa Unreal. Dir muuqaalka Dooro galka Unreal ee liiska Injinka. Markii ugu horreysay, Studio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad dooratid folder-ka mashruucaaga (kan leh faylka .uproject); wuu xasuustaa. Guji Send. Studio wuxuu qoraa CadCraft/\u003Cfile name\u003E/ mashruuca gudihiisa: muuqaalka sidii fayl USD, fayl dejinta, profile-yada iftiinka, iyo laba fayl layer oo yar. Beddel moodelka, kaydi oo dir mar kale. Waxa kaliya ee la beddelo waa muuqaalka iyo fayl dejinta. Tafatirkaaga way ammaan tahay Stage-ka uu Unreal furo waa root layer yar oo la sameeyay hal mar, iyo laba layer oo hoostiisa ku jira: kaaga korka ku jira (\u003Cname\u003E.user.usda, madhan markii hore, CadCraft weligeed ma dib u qorto) iyo muuqaalka CadCraft ee hoose. Tafatirka aad ku kaydiso layer-kaaga wuu sii joogaa markii muuqaalka mar kale la diro. Nalalka iyo actors-ka kale ee aad ku dhejiso heerka Unreal waa ka baxsan stage-ka, sidaas darteed iyaguna lama taaban. Studio la'aantood Browser-ka, ama kombiyuutar aan Studio uu Unreal ka helin, dooro Unreal project folder (.zip) liiska Injinka oo guji Render. Wuxuu kaydiyaa isla folder-ka sidii zip: fur mashruucaaga folder-ka CadCraft gudihiisa. Ku hay Ku dar faylasha stage-ka shidan markii ugu horreysay; ka demi kaydinta soo socota, si zip-ku kaliya muuqaalka iyo fayl dejinta ugu jiraan, layer-kaagana aan waligiis la beddelin. Plug-inka Unreal ee furaya stage-ka, codsada iftiinka, nalalka, kameradaha iyo exposure-ka, raacaya dir kasta, iyo kamarad kasta oo rendarka ah, weli lama sii deynin oo weli lama socodsiin Unreal. Ilaa markaas, Send wuxuu faylasha geliyaa mashruuca, qalabka USD ee Unreal ayaa furi kara. Windows ayaa ah nidaamka ugu horreeya; macOS ayaa raaca.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"edit-in-elevations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tafatir muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynta, cabbirrada xaashiyada, shaxda cinwaanka iyo magac beddelka","summary":"Dhaqaaji darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha iyo heerarka, oo sawir darbiyo, furitaanno, heerar, cabbirro iyo qoraal toos muuqaalka dhinaca ama goynta; ilaali cabbirrada xaashiyadaada iyo shaxda cinwaanka xog ahaan, oo magac beddel qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha baaraha mashruuca.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["heer cusub muuqaalka dhinaca","cabbir muuqaalka dhinaca","tafatir muuqaalka dhinaca","tafatir goynta","muuqaalka dhinaca","muuqaalka goynta","dhaqaaji darbi muuqaalka dhinaca","saldhigga daaqadda","joogga heerka","jiid heer","sawir darbi goynta","qoraal muuqaalka dhinaca","sharaxaad","cabbirka xaashiga","cabbir xaashi gaar ah","cabbirka warqadda","shaxda cinwaanka","template shaxda cinwaanka","qaabka xaashiga","xuduudka","goobaha","macmiilka","ay sawirtay","dib u eegista","magac beddel qoys","magac beddel nooc","magac beddel walax","baaraha mashruuca"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tafatir-muuqaal-dhinac-ama-goyn","text":"Tafatir muuqaal dhinac ama goyn","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-xaashiyada-iyo-shaxda-cinwaanka","text":"Cabbirrada xaashiyada iyo shaxda cinwaanka","level":2},{"id":"magac-beddel-qoysaska-cabbirrada-iyo-walxaha","text":"Magac beddel qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel dhismaha markii aad ka aragto dhinaca, dejinta xaashiyada shirkaddaada u isticmaasho, oo magacyada qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha u dhig magacyada aad rabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatir-muuqaal-dhinac-ama-goyn\"\u003ETafatir muuqaal dhinac ama goyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E. Baaraha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevations\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESections\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix badhanka qalinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in this view\u003C/span\u003E safka. Muuqaalku wuxuu furmaa sida xaashiyadu u sawiraan, iyo waxa aad beddeli karto oo kor saaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid darbi wajiga muuqaalka u jeeda oo dhinaca ku dheeraad;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid albaab ama daaqad dhinaca darbigooda, daaqadna sare ama hoos si aad u beddesho saldhigga daaqadda;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid khadka heer si aad u beddesho joogga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid qoraal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E: riix darbiga meesha ay tagayso (daaqad joogta aad riixdo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E (goynta): riix meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado diyaarada goynta; waxa lagu sawiraa heerka ka hooseeya riixdaada koowaad, ilaa heerka xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENote\u003C/span\u003E: riix oo qor. Qoraalada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxaana lagu sawiraa xaashi kasta oo muujinaya muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel\u003C/span\u003E: riix joogga heerka cusub. Waa dherer u dhiganta masaafada ilaa heerka ka sarreeya (3000 mm sare-ka); jiid khadkiisa si aad u beddesho. Heer labaad oo 50 mm ka dhow heer kale waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E: riix meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo meesha ay ku dhammaanto. Riixyadu waxay ku qabtaan geesaha darbiga, albaabka, daaqadda iyo heerka, cabbirkuna wuxuu noqonayaa toos ama toosan, jihada aad u dhaqaajiso. Waa la kaydiyaa oo lagu sawiraa, dherkeeda ku jirta, xaashi kasta oo muujinaya muuqaalka. Riix oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E ku dooro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E ama furaha Delete wuxuu tirtiraa darbiga, albaabka, daaqadda, cabbirka ama qoraalka la doortay. Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqonayaa isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay intii panelku furan yahay. Esc wuxuu ku laabanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect and move\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa isla isbeddelka qorshuhu sameeyo, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: qorshaha, muuqaalka 3D iyo xaashiyadu waa raacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-xaashiyada-iyo-shaxda-cinwaanka\"\u003ECabbirrada xaashiyada iyo shaxda cinwaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur xaashi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew sheet\u003C/span\u003E, ama mid aad leedahay oo ka hooseeya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E). Dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E waxaa ku yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETitle block\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormats…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa cabbir kasta oo caadi ah (Letter ilaa Arch E, A4 ilaa A0) iyo kuwaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETitle block\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStrip (bottom)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColumn (right)\u003C/span\u003E oo leh goobaha caadiga ah, ama kuwaaga. Goobaha tan aad dooratay waxay muuqdaan hoosta magaca xaashiga: qor macmiilka, qofka sawiray, dib u eegista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormats…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu sameeyaa kuwaaga: cabbir xaashi (magac, ballac, joog, xuduud) iyo shaxda cinwaanka (meesha ay tagayso, ballacheeda, goobaheeda mid kasta sadar kasta; ku dhamee goob oo leh * si ay weyn u noqoto).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa iyaga sida fayl maktabad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ku daraa moodel kale. Waxay ku jiraan moodelka, sidaas darteed template-ku wuu qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magac-beddel-qoysaska-cabbirrada-iyo-walxaha\"\u003EMagac beddel qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBaaraha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject browser\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFamilies\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalinka ku xiga qoys wuxuu magac beddelaa; nooc kasta oo cabbir ayaa magaca cusub qaadanaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qoysaska cabbirradooda si aad u magac beddesho cabbir, ama walax laga dhigay qoys (ilaa 40 cabbir kasta ayaa la liistaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagac beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Beddel dhismaha markii aad ka aragto dhinaca, dejinta xaashiyada shirkaddaada u isticmaasho, oo magacyada qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha u dhig magacyada aad rabto. Tafatir muuqaal dhinac ama goyn Shid Draw. Baaraha Project browser, fur Elevations ama Sections. Riix badhanka qalinka Edit in this view safka. Muuqaalku wuxuu furmaa sida xaashiyadu u sawiraan, iyo waxa aad beddeli karto oo kor saaran. Adigoo isticmaalaya Select and move: jiid darbi wajiga muuqaalka u jeeda oo dhinaca ku dheeraad; jiid albaab ama daaqad dhinaca darbigooda, daaqadna sare ama hoos si aad u beddesho saldhigga daaqadda; jiid khadka heer si aad u beddesho joogga; jiid qoraal. Door iyo Window: riix darbiga meesha ay tagayso (daaqad joogta aad riixdo). Wall (goynta): riix meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo meesha uu ku dhammaado diyaarada goynta; waxa lagu sawiraa heerka ka hooseeya riixdaada koowaad, ilaa heerka xiga. Note: riix oo qor. Qoraalada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxaana lagu sawiraa xaashi kasta oo muujinaya muuqaalka. Level: riix joogga heerka cusub. Waa dherer u dhiganta masaafada ilaa heerka ka sarreeya (3000 mm sare-ka); jiid khadkiisa si aad u beddesho. Heer labaad oo 50 mm ka dhow heer kale waa la diidaa. Dimension: riix meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo meesha ay ku dhammaanto. Riixyadu waxay ku qabtaan geesaha darbiga, albaabka, daaqadda iyo heerka, cabbirkuna wuxuu noqonayaa toos ama toosan, jihada aad u dhaqaajiso. Waa la kaydiyaa oo lagu sawiraa, dherkeeda ku jirta, xaashi kasta oo muujinaya muuqaalka. Riix oo Select and move ku dooro. Delete ama furaha Delete wuxuu tirtiraa darbiga, albaabka, daaqadda, cabbirka ama qoraalka la doortay. Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqonayaa isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay intii panelku furan yahay. Esc wuxuu ku laabanayaa Select and move. Isbeddel kasta waa isla isbeddelka qorshuhu sameeyo, hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: qorshaha, muuqaalka 3D iyo xaashiyadu waa raacaan. Cabbirrada xaashiyada iyo shaxda cinwaanka Fur xaashi (New sheet, ama mid aad leedahay oo ka hooseeya Sheets). Dhinaca Paper waxaa ku yaal Title block iyo Formats…. Paper wuxuu liistaa cabbir kasta oo caadi ah (Letter ilaa Arch E, A4 ilaa A0) iyo kuwaaga. Title block: Strip (bottom), Column (right) oo leh goobaha caadiga ah, ama kuwaaga. Goobaha tan aad dooratay waxay muuqdaan hoosta magaca xaashiga: qor macmiilka, qofka sawiray, dib u eegista. Formats… wuxuu kuu sameeyaa kuwaaga: cabbir xaashi (magac, ballac, joog, xuduud) iyo shaxda cinwaanka (meesha ay tagayso, ballacheeda, goobaheeda mid kasta sadar kasta; ku dhamee goob oo leh * si ay weyn u noqoto). Export wuxuu kaydiyaa iyaga sida fayl maktabad, Import… wuxuu mid ku daraa moodel kale. Waxay ku jiraan moodelka, sidaas darteed template-ku wuu qaadaa. Magac beddel qoysaska, cabbirrada iyo walxaha Baaraha Project browser, fur Families. Qalinka ku xiga qoys wuxuu magac beddelaa; nooc kasta oo cabbir ayaa magaca cusub qaadanaya. Fur qoysaska cabbirradooda si aad u magac beddesho cabbir, ama walax laga dhigay qoys (ilaa 40 cabbir kasta ayaa la liistaa). Magac beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pipes-and-ducts","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada","summary":"Ku rasm xariiqyada tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qorshaha iyadoo la adeegsanayo xariiqyada bartamaha; elbow-yada, tee-yada, reducer-yada iyo transition-yada waa la sameeyaa adiga oo aan wax samayn; xariiqyadu waxay ku jiraan nidaamyo dekedo isku xidhan oo faylka IFC ku jira, waxayna muuqdaan qorshayaasha, jadwallada iyo takeoff-ka.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["tuubo","tuubooyin","biyo-xidhka","tuubada hawada","hvac","mep","mechanical","elbow","tee","reducer","transition","fitting","fittings","faalfo","faalfooyin","gate valve","ball valve","globe valve","check valve","riser","caarnimo","biyo-saar","sanitary","roobka","hawo-bixin","biyo qabow","biyo kulul","biyo qabow oo qaboojin","kulaynta","gaas","ilaalinta dabka","hawo soo galin","hawo dibadda","hawo bixin","nidaam","nidaamyada","dekedo","dekedaha","connector","connectors","qalab","qalabyada","plumbing fixture","basin","sink","toilet","water closet","lavatory","kitchen sink","shower","laundry tub","fixture units","uhc","dfu","size the drains","drain sizing","building drain","branch","ramal","coletor","airflow","cfm","friction","equal friction","sizing","schedule","takeoff","nbr","nbr 5648","nbr 5688","nbr 8160","pvc soldável","esgoto","dn"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"ku-rasm-tuubo","text":"Ku rasm tuubo","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-heerka-biyo-saarka-mashruuca","text":"Dejinta heerka biyo-saarka mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"ku-rasm-tuubada-hawada","text":"Ku rasm tuubada hawada","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-biyo-xidhka","text":"Qalabka biyo-xidhka","level":2},{"id":"connector-ka-qalabka","text":"Connector-ka qalabka","level":2},{"id":"faalfooyinka-oo-loo-sameeyay","text":"Faalfooyinka, oo loo sameeyay","level":2},{"id":"riser-yada","text":"Riser-yada","level":2},{"id":"biyo-saarka-iyo-hoos-u-dhacooda","text":"Biyo-saarka iyo hoos u dhacooda","level":2},{"id":"biyo-saarrada-cabbir-ahaan-unit-yada-qalabka","text":"Biyo-saarrada cabbir ahaan unit-yada qalabka","level":2},{"id":"faalfooyin","text":"Faalfooyin","level":2},{"id":"beddel-xariiq","text":"Beddel xariiq","level":2},{"id":"qorshayaasha","text":"Qorshayaasha","level":2},{"id":"jadwallada-iyo-takeoff-ka","text":"Jadwallada iyo takeoff-ka","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha ku rasm sida darbiyada loo rasmeeyo: guji geesaha xariiqda bartamaha ee dhererka aad dejisay. BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa fittings-ka, qayb kasta wuxuu geliyaa nidaamkiisa oo wuu isku xidhaa, si barnaamijyada kale ay xariiqda u akhrin karaan hal nidaam oo isku xidhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-rasm-tuubo\"\u003EKu rasm tuubo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabka dooro \u003Cstrong\u003Enidaamka\u003C/strong\u003E (biyo qabow, biyo kulul, biyo-saar caafimaad, gaas…). Waxay dejisaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eagabka\u003C/strong\u003E caadiga ah: naxaas biyaha, PVC biyo-saarka iyo hawo-bixinta, birta kulaynta, qaboojinta biyaha, gaaska iyo ilaalinta dabka. Beddel \u003Cstrong\u003Eagabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eclass\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Esize\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad u baahan tahay. Cabbirrada iyo darbiyada waxay ka yimaadaan heerarka dadweynaha: tuubada birta ASME B36.10M, tuubada naxaasta ASTM B88, PVC ASTM D1785 iyo PEX ASTM F876. Mashaariicda Brazil waxay isticmaali karaan \u003Cstrong\u003EPVC water pipe (NBR 5648)\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ah PVC lagu xidho dhanka biyaha qabow, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EPVC drain pipe (NBR 5688)\u003C/strong\u003E, série normal ama reforçada, biyo-saarka iyo hawo-bixinta; cabbirradooda waxa lagu magacaabaa DN (DN 25, DN 100). Marka aad mid ka mid ah ka dooratid, doorashada nidaam kale waxay ku haysaa tuubooyinka Brazil (PVC drain pipe biyo-saarka sanitary-ka ka dib PVC water pipe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererka bartamaha xariiqda tuubada ka sarreeya heerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha tuubadu ka bilaabanto, kadibna geesaha kasta. Dhibcaha u dambeeya, guji laba jeer ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qaadaa geeska u dambeeya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tuurayaa xariiqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubadu waxay u dhegtaa darbiyada siday u dhegaan iyo xariiqyada kale: bilow tuubada dhamaadkeeda si aad uga sii socoto, ama dhammee xariiqda khadka tuubo si aad uga laanto. Xariiq cusub wuxuu qaataa dhererka tuubada uu ku dhegto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiq la bilaabo ama la dhammeeyo dekeda qalab ayaa qaadata cabbirkiisa iyo nidaamkiisa oo wuu ku xidhnaadaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EQalabka MEP ee dekedaha leh\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EKu xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-heerka-biyo-saarka-mashruuca\"\u003EDejinta heerka biyo-saarka mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska koowaad ee qalabka tuubada waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eheerka biyo-saarka\u003C/strong\u003E ee moodeelka: \u003Cstrong\u003EUS (IPC, inches)\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBrazil (ABNT, DN)\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la kaydiyaa moodeelka, sidaas darteed qof kasta oo furta faylka wuxuu bilaabaa xariiqyada isla siday u bilaabmaan. Hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EUS\u003C/strong\u003E, xariiq cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa naxaas (biyo) ama PVC Schedule 40 (biyo-saar), inch-ka ku jira, iyo hoos u dhac International Plumbing Code. Hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EBrazil\u003C/strong\u003E, biyo qabow wuxuu ku bilaabmaa PVC soldável DN 25, biyo-saarka sanitary iyo roobka iyo hawo-bixinta waxay ku bilaabmaan PVC esgoto DN 100 oo leh hoos u dhaca NBR 8160, biyo kululna naxaas. Waxay khusayso sidoo kale xariiq laga bilaabo connector-ka qalabka ama dekeda soo saaraha. Tuubooyin hore loo rasmeeyay waxay hayaan agabkooda iyo miisaskooda; liiska agabka wuu furan yahay, sidaas darteed waad rasmi kartaa hal xariiq Brazil ah moodeel US ah, adigoo ula kac. Fayl aan doorasho lahayn wuxuu u dhaqmaa sidii hore: xariiq cusub wuxuu raacaa agabka la isticmaalayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-rasm-tuubada-hawada\"\u003EKu rasm tuubada hawada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro nidaamka (supply, return, exhaust ama hawo dibadda) iyo qaabka: wareega, afar-geesle ama flat oval.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor ballaca iyo dhererka (ballaca tuubada wareegga waa dhexroorkeeda), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E dhererka bartamaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u cabbirto hawada, ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EAirflow\u003C/strong\u003E iyo heerka \u003Cstrong\u003EFriction\u003C/strong\u003E kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbiri\u003C/span\u003E. Tuubada waxa lagu cabbiraa isku-friction ahaan, habka cutubka tuubada naqshadeynta ee ASHRAE Handbook, waxaana lagu kor u qaadaa cabbir la kaydiyay, si friction-ku u noqdo mid ka yar ama la mid ah heerka aad qortay. Haddii heer aan la qorin, waxay isticmaashaa 0.08 in. of water per 100 ft (0.8 Pa/m). Tuubada afar-geesle waxay hayaa dhererka aad qortay oo waxay heshaa ballac; BimCraft wuu sheegaa marka dhinacyadeedu ka badan yihiin 4 ilaa 1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha sida tuubada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-biyo-xidhka\"\u003EQalabka biyo-xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig qoyska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa shan qalab oo aad ka bilaabato, mid kasta oo leh biyo-saar iyo connector biyo qabow: \u003Cstrong\u003EWater closet\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELavatory\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKitchen sink\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EShower tray\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELaundry tub\u003C/strong\u003E. Hortooda waxay kuu muuqdaan markaad dhigayso, dambeenkooduna darbiga ayuu ku dhegaa. Biyo-saarradoodu waxay ku yaalaan cabbirka ugu yar ee biyo-saarka qalabka ee NBR 8160 (DN 100 water closet-ka, DN 50 kitchen sink-ka, DN 40 kuwa kale); biyuhu waa DN 20. Beddel cabbirkooda, ama tafatir sida qoys kasta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoys wuxuu sheegaa qalabka uu yahay hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalab biyo-xidhka\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidhiyayaal\u003C/span\u003E ee tafatiraha qoyska. Biyo-saarkiisa markaas waxa lagu tiriyaa unit-yada qalabka: 6 UHC water closet-ka, 1 lavatory-ga, 3 kitchen sink ama laundry tub, 2 shower (NBR 8160), ama drainage fixture units ee IPC Table 709.1.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"connector-ka-qalabka\"\u003EConnector-ka qalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxaha la dhigay qoys leh connectors (biyo-saarka iyo tabka basin-ka, neck-ka air terminal-ka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003EEdit a family\u003C/a\u003E) waxay muujiyaan connectors-kooda bilaashka ah sida dhibco markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/span\u003E furan yahay, mouse-kuna wuu ku dhegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa bilow connector\u003C/strong\u003E: xariiqdu wuxuu qaataa nidaamkiisa iyo cabbirkiisa (tuubada agabka qalabka ee ku dhow ama ka weyn cabbirka connector-ka; tuubada hawada wareeg ah dhexroorkeeda). Marka connector-ku hoos ama sare u eego, sida biyo-saarka hoos basin-ka, xariiqdu marka hore toos ayuu hoos ama sare ugu kacaa heerka \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna wuxuu sii socdaa guji-gujiyadaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dhammee connector\u003C/strong\u003E: xariiqdu hoos ama sare ayuu u socdaa oo halkaas ayuu ku dhammaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqda waxa lagu xidhaa walxaha faylka IFC, si barnaamijyada kale u arkaan qalabka oo qayb ka ah nidaamkiisa. Walax la dhigo dambe oo connector ku yaal dhamaadka xariiqda ayaa sidoo kale lagu xidhaa. Xariiq laga guuro connector wuxuu ka baxaa xidhiidhkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faalfooyinka-oo-loo-sameeyay\"\u003EFaalfooyinka, oo loo sameeyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq wareegaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElbow. Tuubada birta long radius ee ASME B16.9 (1.5 × cabbirka), tuubooyin kale hal dibadda dhexroor, tuubada hawada wareeg 1.5 dhexroor, tuubada afar-geesle hal ballac (ama hal dhererka marka wareegu sare u kaco ama hoos u dhaco)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq ku dhammaado khadka xariiq kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETee; xariiqda kale halkaas ayaa la kala jaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariiq oo dhamaad-ka-dhamaadka ku kulma cabbir kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReducer (tuubooyinka) ama transition (tuubada hawada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariiq oo cabbir isku mid ah dhamaad-ka-dhamaadka ku kulma xagal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElbow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad beddesho, dhaqdho ama tirtirto xariiq, fitting kasta oo heerkaas ku jira waa dib loo sameeyaa. Haddii lug gaaban yahay fittings-ka dhamaadkiisa, BimCraft wuu sheegaa oo ma beddelo wax: dhig geeska meel ka fogaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFittings-ka iyo faalfooyinka waa guud: waxa laga qaatay cabbirka tuubada ama tuubada hawada, ma aha katalogga soo saaraha. Fittings-ka socket, press iyo grooved, jidhka faalfaha iyo qalabka waxay leeyihiin cabbirro soo saaraha; ka hubi bixiyahaaga ka hor intaadan dalbin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riser-yada\"\u003ERiser-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aad rasmeynayso, qor heer cusub oo \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E ah oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: xariiqdu si toos ah ayuu u kacaa ama u dhacaa geeska u dambeeya, elbow ayaa ku yaal labada dhamaad. Riser wuxuu kor u gali karaa dabaqa ka sarreeya. Heer kasta wuxuu muujiyaa qaybaha xariiqa ee aragtidiisa ay gaarto, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003EUP\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDN\u003C/strong\u003E riser-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"biyo-saarka-iyo-hoos-u-dhacooda\"\u003EBiyo-saarka iyo hoos u dhacooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiyo-saarka sanitary iyo roobka waxay ku bilaabmaan hoos u dhaca ugu yar ee International Plumbing Code u oggol yahay cabbirkooda: 1/4 in. in ft ilaa 2-1/2 in., 1/8 in. in ft 3 ilaa 6 in., 1/16 in. in ft 8 in. ka sarreeya. Biyo-saarka PVC Brazil wuxuu ku bilaabmaa hoos u dhaca NBR 8160: 2 % ilaa DN 75, 1 % DN 100 ka bilaabmaa. Hoos u dhac kale ku qor qalabka ama Properties: \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot;/ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 %\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E. Xariiqdu wuxuu ka hoos dhacaa barta koowaad, sidaas darteed biyo-saarka ku rasm jihada ay socdaan. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa hoos u dhaca iyo fallaadh. Properties wuxuu digayaa marka biyo-saar uu ka siman yahay heerka ugu yar ee xeerka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"biyo-saarrada-cabbir-ahaan-unit-yada-qalabka\"\u003EBiyo-saarrada cabbir ahaan unit-yada qalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro biyo-saar sanitary: \u003Cstrong\u003EFixture units\u003C/strong\u003E ee Properties wuxuu sheegaa inta uu qaadayo iyo cabbirka ugu yar ee u baahan. Qalab biyo-xidh kasta oo connector-kiisa biyo-saarku xariiqda ku yaal ayaa la tiriyaa, iyo biyo-saar kasta oo ku shubma ayaa la tiriyaa: ku rasm biyo-saarrada jihada ay socdaan, mid kasta oo ku dhammaada biyo-saarka uu ku shubmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBiyo-saarrada PVC Brazil waxay tiriyaan \u003Cstrong\u003EUHC\u003C/strong\u003E waxayna raacaan NBR 8160; kuwa kale waxay tiriyaan \u003Cstrong\u003EDFU\u003C/strong\u003E waxayna raacaan International Plumbing Code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrain\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EBranch\u003C/strong\u003E waxa loo cabbiraa miiska code-ka ee laamaha qalabka; \u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding drain\u003C/strong\u003E miiskiisa hoos u dhaca, sidaas darteed \u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E way muhiim tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBiyo-saar kama yaraan karo biyo-saarrada qalabka uu u adeego (water closet wuxuu u baahan yahay DN 100, ama 3 in.), iyo kama yaraan karo biyo-saar ku shubma. Hoos NBR 8160, building drain waa DN 100 ugu yaraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbiri biyo-saarrada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa biyo-saar sanitary kasta oo moodeelka ah oo yar cabbirkiisa unit-yada qalabka, hal tallaabo oo aad Undo ku celin karto. Biyo-saar ka weyn intii loo baahnaa waa la uga tago sidiisa. Marka biyo-saar uu qaadayo wax ka badan intii cabbirka ugu weyn ee tuubadiisa uu hoos u dhacayaa ku qaadi karo, BimCraft wuu sheegaa: sii hoos u dhac jabsan ama tuubo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaskani waa kuwa biyo-saarrada siman. Tiirarka, hawo-bixinta iyo biyo-saarka roobka halkan lama cabbiro: hubi iyaga iyo naqshadda oo dhan xeerka mashruuca u dhaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faalfooyin\"\u003EFaalfooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaalfo\u003C/span\u003E iyo nooca: gate, ball, globe ama check.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tuubo meesha ay tagayso. Tuubada waa la jarayaa agteeda, faalfadana labada dhinac ayaa lagu xidhaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties of the run wuxuu liistaa faalfooyinkiisa, mid kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyo faalfo oo dheeraad ah, shaandhe, damperro tuubada hawada, qaababkaaga tuubada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-specs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-specs\"\u003EQaababka tuubada, faalfooyinka, damperrada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-xariiq\"\u003EBeddel xariiq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qayb kasta oo xariiq, qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. Properties:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESystem\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EClass\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E (tuubooyin), ama \u003Cstrong\u003EShape\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWidth\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHeight\u003C/strong\u003E (tuubada hawada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeight above the level\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu guuraa xariiqda oo dhan kor ama hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInsulation\u003C/strong\u003E: dhumucdeeda, waa la kaydiyaa hubinta masaafada iyo liiska furayaasha (wax lagu rasmeeyo ma jiro): eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubada birta: \u003Cstrong\u003ECut into spools\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003ESpool-yada tuubada birta iyo xaashiyada spool-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E (tuubooyin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbiri\u003C/span\u003E: biyaha, cabbirka ugu yar ee biyaha ku hayo 8 ft/s (2.4 m/s), ama 5 ft/s (1.5 m/s) biyo kulul; 3 m/s tuubada PVC Brazil ee (NBR 5626). Tuubada hawada, xawaaraha iyo heerka friction ee tuubada sida loo rasmeeyay. Biyo-saarrada sanitary waxa lagu cabbiraa unit-yada qalabka: eeg \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbiri biyo-saarrada unit-yada qalabka\u003C/strong\u003E hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa xariiqda oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshayaasha\"\u003EQorshayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubooyin ka yar 150 mm (qiyaastii 6 in.) waxa lagu rasmeeyaa hal khad bartamaha, tuubooyinka ka weyn iyo tuubada hawada oo dhan labo khad ballacooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENidaam kasta midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay; PDF-ka qorshaha wuxuu ku daabacaa madow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiq kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa cabbirkiisa iyo nidaamkiisa (tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E2&quot; CW\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E16×10 SA\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala duwanaanta aragtida qorshaha ayaa go&#039;aamisa xariiqyada uu muujiyo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu muuqda qorshahan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saari karaa \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyin\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EAragtiyada, kala duwanaanta aragtida iyo xaashiyadaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwallada-iyo-takeoff-ka\"\u003EJadwallada iyo takeoff-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwallada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyin\u003C/strong\u003E (nidaamka, agabka iyo cabbirka, dhererkooda), \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/strong\u003E (nidaamka, qaabka iyo cabbirka, dherer iyo dusha dibadda) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFittings iyo faalfooyin\u003C/strong\u003E (noocyada iyo cabbirka, tirinta). Guji safka si aad u doorato waxa uu liistaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuu soo dejiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabinta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xariiqyada u qaadaa TakeoffCraft: tuubo iyo tuubada hawada sida cabbir xariiq ku rasmeysan qorshaha (biyo-saarka hoos u dhaca loo cabbiraa dhaca hoos u dhacooda), fittings-ka iyo faalfooyinka oo la tiriyay meelaha ay yaallaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/takeoff\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/takeoff\"\u003EQadarka moodeelka u dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/a\u003E. Riser-yada xaashigaas ayaa laga reebay, sababtoo ah qorshuhu ma cabbiri karo; jadwalka Tuubooyin wuxuu leeyahay dhererkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiq kasta waa assembly oo hayaa qaybahiisa: qaybaha tuubada iyo tuubada hawada, fittings iyo faalfooyin, mid kasta oo leh nooceeda, agabkiisa, midabka nidaamkiisa iyo dekedahiisa. Dekedaha taabanaya waa la isku xidhay, qayb kasta waxay ka tirsan tahay nidaamka qaybinta (faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan isku mid ah flow segments, fittings iyo controllers nidaam ku jira). Barnaamijyada kale ee akhrinaya nidaamyada IFC waxay arkaan hal xariiq oo isku xidhan nidaam kasta. Qeexidda xariiqda ayaa lagu kaydiyaa, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuu dib u sameeyaa si isku mid ah marka aad beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dhismaha ku rasm sida darbiyada loo rasmeeyo: guji geesaha xariiqda bartamaha ee dhererka aad dejisay. BimCraft wuxuu sameeyaa fittings-ka, qayb kasta wuxuu geliyaa nidaamkiisa oo wuu isku xidhaa, si barnaamijyada kale ay xariiqda u akhrin karaan hal nidaam oo isku xidhan. Ku rasm tuubo Shid Sawir, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Tuubo. Qalabka dooro nidaamka (biyo qabow, biyo kulul, biyo-saar caafimaad, gaas…). Waxay dejisaa agabka caadiga ah: naxaas biyaha, PVC biyo-saarka iyo hawo-bixinta, birta kulaynta, qaboojinta biyaha, gaaska iyo ilaalinta dabka. Beddel agabka, class iyo size haddii aad u baahan tahay. Cabbirrada iyo darbiyada waxay ka yimaadaan heerarka dadweynaha: tuubada birta ASME B36.10M, tuubada naxaasta ASTM B88, PVC ASTM D1785 iyo PEX ASTM F876. Mashaariicda Brazil waxay isticmaali karaan PVC water pipe (NBR 5648), oo ah PVC lagu xidho dhanka biyaha qabow, iyo PVC drain pipe (NBR 5688), série normal ama reforçada, biyo-saarka iyo hawo-bixinta; cabbirradooda waxa lagu magacaabaa DN (DN 25, DN 100). Marka aad mid ka mid ah ka dooratid, doorashada nidaam kale waxay ku haysaa tuubooyinka Brazil (PVC drain pipe biyo-saarka sanitary-ka ka dib PVC water pipe). Deji At: dhererka bartamaha xariiqda tuubada ka sarreeya heerka. Guji meesha tuubadu ka bilaabanto, kadibna geesaha kasta. Dhibcaha u dambeeya, guji laba jeer ama riix Enter. Backspace wuxuu qaadaa geeska u dambeeya; Esc wuxuu tuurayaa xariiqda. Tuubadu waxay u dhegtaa darbiyada siday u dhegaan iyo xariiqyada kale: bilow tuubada dhamaadkeeda si aad uga sii socoto, ama dhammee xariiqda khadka tuubo si aad uga laanto. Xariiq cusub wuxuu qaataa dhererka tuubada uu ku dhegto. Xariiq la bilaabo ama la dhammeeyo dekeda qalab ayaa qaadata cabbirkiisa iyo nidaamkiisa oo wuu ku xidhnaadaa: eeg Qalabka MEP ee dekedaha leh iyo Ku xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka. Dejinta heerka biyo-saarka mashruuca Liiska koowaad ee qalabka tuubada waa heerka biyo-saarka ee moodeelka: US (IPC, inches) ama Brazil (ABNT, DN). Waa la kaydiyaa moodeelka, sidaas darteed qof kasta oo furta faylka wuxuu bilaabaa xariiqyada isla siday u bilaabmaan. Hoos US, xariiq cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa naxaas (biyo) ama PVC Schedule 40 (biyo-saar), inch-ka ku jira, iyo hoos u dhac International Plumbing Code. Hoos Brazil, biyo qabow wuxuu ku bilaabmaa PVC soldável DN 25, biyo-saarka sanitary iyo roobka iyo hawo-bixinta waxay ku bilaabmaan PVC esgoto DN 100 oo leh hoos u dhaca NBR 8160, biyo kululna naxaas. Waxay khusayso sidoo kale xariiq laga bilaabo connector-ka qalabka ama dekeda soo saaraha. Tuubooyin hore loo rasmeeyay waxay hayaan agabkooda iyo miisaskooda; liiska agabka wuu furan yahay, sidaas darteed waad rasmi kartaa hal xariiq Brazil ah moodeel US ah, adigoo ula kac. Fayl aan doorasho lahayn wuxuu u dhaqmaa sidii hore: xariiq cusub wuxuu raacaa agabka la isticmaalayo. Ku rasm tuubada hawada Dooro Tuubada hawada. Dooro nidaamka (supply, return, exhaust ama hawo dibadda) iyo qaabka: wareega, afar-geesle ama flat oval. Ku qor ballaca iyo dhererka (ballaca tuubada wareegga waa dhexroorkeeda), iyo At dhererka bartamaha. Si aad u cabbirto hawada, ku qor Airflow iyo heerka Friction kadibna guji Cabbiri. Tuubada waxa lagu cabbiraa isku-friction ahaan, habka cutubka tuubada naqshadeynta ee ASHRAE Handbook, waxaana lagu kor u qaadaa cabbir la kaydiyay, si friction-ku u noqdo mid ka yar ama la mid ah heerka aad qortay. Haddii heer aan la qorin, waxay isticmaashaa 0.08 in. of water per 100 ft (0.8 Pa/m). Tuubada afar-geesle waxay hayaa dhererka aad qortay oo waxay heshaa ballac; BimCraft wuu sheegaa marka dhinacyadeedu ka badan yihiin 4 ilaa 1. Guji geesaha sida tuubada. Qalabka biyo-xidhka Dhismaha › Dhig qoyska wuxuu bixiyaa shan qalab oo aad ka bilaabato, mid kasta oo leh biyo-saar iyo connector biyo qabow: Water closet, Lavatory, Kitchen sink, Shower tray iyo Laundry tub. Hortooda waxay kuu muuqdaan markaad dhigayso, dambeenkooduna darbiga ayuu ku dhegaa. Biyo-saarradoodu waxay ku yaalaan cabbirka ugu yar ee biyo-saarka qalabka ee NBR 8160 (DN 100 water closet-ka, DN 50 kitchen sink-ka, DN 40 kuwa kale); biyuhu waa DN 20. Beddel cabbirkooda, ama tafatir sida qoys kasta: eeg Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda. Qoys wuxuu sheegaa qalabka uu yahay hoos Qalab biyo-xidhka tab-ka Xidhiidhiyayaal ee tafatiraha qoyska. Biyo-saarkiisa markaas waxa lagu tiriyaa unit-yada qalabka: 6 UHC water closet-ka, 1 lavatory-ga, 3 kitchen sink ama laundry tub, 2 shower (NBR 8160), ama drainage fixture units ee IPC Table 709.1. Connector-ka qalabka Walxaha la dhigay qoys leh connectors (biyo-saarka iyo tabka basin-ka, neck-ka air terminal-ka: eeg Edit a family) waxay muujiyaan connectors-kooda bilaashka ah sida dhibco markii Tuubo ama Tuubada hawada furan yahay, mouse-kuna wuu ku dhegaa. Ka bilow connector: xariiqdu wuxuu qaataa nidaamkiisa iyo cabbirkiisa (tuubada agabka qalabka ee ku dhow ama ka weyn cabbirka connector-ka; tuubada hawada wareeg ah dhexroorkeeda). Marka connector-ku hoos ama sare u eego, sida biyo-saarka hoos basin-ka, xariiqdu marka hore toos ayuu hoos ama sare ugu kacaa heerka At, kadibna wuxuu sii socdaa guji-gujiyadaada. Ku dhammee connector: xariiqdu hoos ama sare ayuu u socdaa oo halkaas ayuu ku dhammaadaa. Xariiqda waxa lagu xidhaa walxaha faylka IFC, si barnaamijyada kale u arkaan qalabka oo qayb ka ah nidaamkiisa. Walax la dhigo dambe oo connector ku yaal dhamaadka xariiqda ayaa sidoo kale lagu xidhaa. Xariiq laga guuro connector wuxuu ka baxaa xidhiidhkaas. Faalfooyinka, oo loo sameeyay Meesha Waxa BimCraft sameeyo Xariiq wareegaa Elbow. Tuubada birta long radius ee ASME B16.9 (1.5 × cabbirka), tuubooyin kale hal dibadda dhexroor, tuubada hawada wareeg 1.5 dhexroor, tuubada afar-geesle hal ballac (ama hal dhererka marka wareegu sare u kaco ama hoos u dhaco) Xariiq ku dhammaado khadka xariiq kale Tee; xariiqda kale halkaas ayaa la kala jaraa Laba xariiq oo dhamaad-ka-dhamaadka ku kulma cabbir kala duwan Reducer (tuubooyinka) ama transition (tuubada hawada) Laba xariiq oo cabbir isku mid ah dhamaad-ka-dhamaadka ku kulma xagal Elbow Marka aad beddesho, dhaqdho ama tirtirto xariiq, fitting kasta oo heerkaas ku jira waa dib loo sameeyaa. Haddii lug gaaban yahay fittings-ka dhamaadkiisa, BimCraft wuu sheegaa oo ma beddelo wax: dhig geeska meel ka fogaysa. Fittings-ka iyo faalfooyinka waa guud: waxa laga qaatay cabbirka tuubada ama tuubada hawada, ma aha katalogga soo saaraha. Fittings-ka socket, press iyo grooved, jidhka faalfaha iyo qalabka waxay leeyihiin cabbirro soo saaraha; ka hubi bixiyahaaga ka hor intaadan dalbin. Riser-yada Intii aad rasmeynayso, qor heer cusub oo At ah oo riix Enter: xariiqdu si toos ah ayuu u kacaa ama u dhacaa geeska u dambeeya, elbow ayaa ku yaal labada dhamaad. Riser wuxuu kor u gali karaa dabaqa ka sarreeya. Heer kasta wuxuu muujiyaa qaybaha xariiqa ee aragtidiisa ay gaarto, oo leh UP ama DN riser-ka. Biyo-saarka iyo hoos u dhacooda Biyo-saarka sanitary iyo roobka waxay ku bilaabmaan hoos u dhaca ugu yar ee International Plumbing Code u oggol yahay cabbirkooda: 1/4 in. in ft ilaa 2-1/2 in., 1/8 in. in ft 3 ilaa 6 in., 1/16 in. in ft 8 in. ka sarreeya. Biyo-saarka PVC Brazil wuxuu ku bilaabmaa hoos u dhaca NBR 8160: 2 % ilaa DN 75, 1 % DN 100 ka bilaabmaa. Hoos u dhac kale ku qor qalabka ama Properties: 1/4\"/ft, 2 % ama 1:50. Xariiqdu wuxuu ka hoos dhacaa barta koowaad, sidaas darteed biyo-saarka ku rasm jihada ay socdaan. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujiyaa hoos u dhaca iyo fallaadh. Properties wuxuu digayaa marka biyo-saar uu ka siman yahay heerka ugu yar ee xeerka. Biyo-saarrada cabbir ahaan unit-yada qalabka Dooro biyo-saar sanitary: Fixture units ee Properties wuxuu sheegaa inta uu qaadayo iyo cabbirka ugu yar ee u baahan. Qalab biyo-xidh kasta oo connector-kiisa biyo-saarku xariiqda ku yaal ayaa la tiriyaa, iyo biyo-saar kasta oo ku shubma ayaa la tiriyaa: ku rasm biyo-saarrada jihada ay socdaan, mid kasta oo ku dhammaada biyo-saarka uu ku shubmo. Biyo-saarrada PVC Brazil waxay tiriyaan UHC waxayna raacaan NBR 8160; kuwa kale waxay tiriyaan DFU waxayna raacaan International Plumbing Code. Drain: Branch waxa loo cabbiraa miiska code-ka ee laamaha qalabka; Building drain miiskiisa hoos u dhaca, sidaas darteed Slope way muhiim tahay. Biyo-saar kama yaraan karo biyo-saarrada qalabka uu u adeego (water closet wuxuu u baahan yahay DN 100, ama 3 in.), iyo kama yaraan karo biyo-saar ku shubma. Hoos NBR 8160, building drain waa DN 100 ugu yaraan. Cabbiri biyo-saarrada wuxuu sameeyaa biyo-saar sanitary kasta oo moodeelka ah oo yar cabbirkiisa unit-yada qalabka, hal tallaabo oo aad Undo ku celin karto. Biyo-saar ka weyn intii loo baahnaa waa la uga tago sidiisa. Marka biyo-saar uu qaadayo wax ka badan intii cabbirka ugu weyn ee tuubadiisa uu hoos u dhacayaa ku qaadi karo, BimCraft wuu sheegaa: sii hoos u dhac jabsan ama tuubo kale. Miisaskani waa kuwa biyo-saarrada siman. Tiirarka, hawo-bixinta iyo biyo-saarka roobka halkan lama cabbiro: hubi iyaga iyo naqshadda oo dhan xeerka mashruuca u dhaca. Faalfooyin Dooro Faalfo iyo nooca: gate, ball, globe ama check. Guji tuubo meesha ay tagayso. Tuubada waa la jarayaa agteeda, faalfadana labada dhinac ayaa lagu xidhaa. Properties of the run wuxuu liistaa faalfooyinkiisa, mid kasta oo leh Ka saar. Noocyo faalfo oo dheeraad ah, shaandhe, damperro tuubada hawada, qaababkaaga tuubada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha: eeg Qaababka tuubada, faalfooyinka, damperrada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha. Beddel xariiq Dooro qayb kasta oo xariiq, qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. Properties: System, Material, Class iyo Size (tuubooyin), ama Shape, Width, Height (tuubada hawada). Height above the level wuxuu guuraa xariiqda oo dhan kor ama hoos. Insulation: dhumucdeeda, waa la kaydiyaa hubinta masaafada iyo liiska furayaasha (wax lagu rasmeeyo ma jiro): eeg Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka dhismaha. Tuubada birta: Cut into spools: eeg Spool-yada tuubada birta iyo xaashiyada spool-ka. Slope (tuubooyin). Flow oo leh Cabbiri: biyaha, cabbirka ugu yar ee biyaha ku hayo 8 ft/s (2.4 m/s), ama 5 ft/s (1.5 m/s) biyo kulul; 3 m/s tuubada PVC Brazil ee (NBR 5626). Tuubada hawada, xawaaraha iyo heerka friction ee tuubada sida loo rasmeeyay. Biyo-saarrada sanitary waxa lagu cabbiraa unit-yada qalabka: eeg Cabbiri biyo-saarrada unit-yada qalabka hoos. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa xariiqda oo dhan. Qorshayaasha Tuubooyin ka yar 150 mm (qiyaastii 6 in.) waxa lagu rasmeeyaa hal khad bartamaha, tuubooyinka ka weyn iyo tuubada hawada oo dhan labo khad ballacooda. Nidaam kasta midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay; PDF-ka qorshaha wuxuu ku daabacaa madow. Xariiq kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa cabbirkiisa iyo nidaamkiisa (tusaale 2\" CW ama 16×10 SA). Kala duwanaanta aragtida qorshaha ayaa go'aamisa xariiqyada uu muujiyo, Ku muuqda qorshahan wuxuu ka saari karaa Tuubooyin ama Tuubada hawada: eeg Aragtiyada, kala duwanaanta aragtida iyo xaashiyadaada. Jadwallada iyo takeoff-ka Panelka Jadwallada wuxuu ku daraa Tuubooyin (nidaamka, agabka iyo cabbirka, dhererkooda), Tuubada hawada (nidaamka, qaabka iyo cabbirka, dherer iyo dusha dibadda) iyo Fittings iyo faalfooyin (noocyada iyo cabbirka, tirinta). Guji safka si aad u doorato waxa uu liistaa; Soo deji CSV wuu soo dejiyaa. Xisaabinta qadarka wuxuu xariiqyada u qaadaa TakeoffCraft: tuubo iyo tuubada hawada sida cabbir xariiq ku rasmeysan qorshaha (biyo-saarka hoos u dhaca loo cabbiraa dhaca hoos u dhacooda), fittings-ka iyo faalfooyinka oo la tiriyay meelaha ay yaallaan: eeg Qadarka moodeelka u dir TakeoffCraft. Riser-yada xaashigaas ayaa laga reebay, sababtoo ah qorshuhu ma cabbiri karo; jadwalka Tuubooyin wuxuu leeyahay dhererkooda. Faylka IFC Xariiq kasta waa assembly oo hayaa qaybahiisa: qaybaha tuubada iyo tuubada hawada, fittings iyo faalfooyin, mid kasta oo leh nooceeda, agabkiisa, midabka nidaamkiisa iyo dekedahiisa. Dekedaha taabanaya waa la isku xidhay, qayb kasta waxay ka tirsan tahay nidaamka qaybinta (faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan isku mid ah flow segments, fittings iyo controllers nidaam ku jira). Barnaamijyada kale ee akhrinaya nidaamyada IFC waxay arkaan hal xariiq oo isku xidhan nidaam kasta. Qeexidda xariiqda ayaa lagu kaydiyaa, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuu dib u sameeyaa si isku mid ah marka aad beddesho.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"units-on-import","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Unugyada markii la soo dhoofiyo: faylku wuu sheegaa unugyadiisa, ama waa la idin weydiiyaa marka hore","summary":"Marka fayl aad soo dhoofiso uu sheego unugyadiisa, BimCraft wuu isticmaalaa oo wuu sheegaa. Marka uusan sheegin, BimCraft wuu weydiiyaa ka hor inta uusan wax dhigin, jawaabtaadana wuu xasuustaa faylkaas.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["unugyada","soo dhoofin","fur","OBJ","STL","DWG","DXF","IFC","daruuro dhibcood","shay maktabad","millimitir","mitir","inji","fut","miisaan","cabbir qaldan","aad u weyn","aad u yar","1000 jeer","weydii","la xasuusto"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-sheega-unugyadooda","text":"Faylasha sheega unugyadooda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi fayl oo hubi in uu ku yimaado cabbirka saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur ama ku dar faylka sida caadiga ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFiles\u003C/span\u003E ee Maktabadda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint clouds\u003C/span\u003E, ama Dhis › Ka dhis naqshad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii faylku sheego unugyadiisa, wax lagu weydiiyo ma jiraan. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa unugyada uu faylku sheegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aanu sheegin, wada-hadal ayaa weydiinaya \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E faylka. Dooro hal unug oo faylka ku jira waa maxay, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse these units\u003C/span\u003E. Wax lagu dhigo ma jiraan ilaa aad jawaabtaada siiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wax soo dhoofin mana sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-sheega-unugyadooda\"\u003EFaylasha sheega unugyadooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu sheegaa unugga dhererka, &quot;Furmay&quot; ayaa sheegta haddii ay tahay. IFC aan wax sheegin ayaa lagu weydiiyaa ka hor inta aan furmin; jawaabtaadu waxa lagu qoraa moodeelka, sidaas darteed faylku wuu sheegaa markaad kaydiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/strong\u003E: unugyada geliska naqshadda (insertion units). Naqshad aan lahayn ayaa lagu weydiiyaa (faylasha Maktabadda, Dhis › Ka dhis naqshad, dhulka laga helay khadadka kontuurka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiisaska dhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E dhulka: ma sheegaan unugyo. Waa lagu weydiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaruuro dhibcood\u003C/strong\u003E: LAS iyo LAZ oo leh nidaam isku xidhka, E57, PTX iyo PLY waxay sheegaan kuwooda. Kuwa kale waa lagu weydiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ iyo STL\u003C/strong\u003E: marna ma sheegaan unugyo. Waa lagu weydiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF iyo GLB\u003C/strong\u003E: mitir, sida xeerka qaabkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirada\u003C/strong\u003E: ma lahaan cabbir gaar ah. Sawirka waa la habeeyaa muuqaalka, cabbirkiisana waxaad dejisaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan laba dhibcood\u003C/strong\u003E. Cabbirka aad siiso ayaa loo xasuustaa faylkaas: marka mar kale la geliyo, wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirkaas, sadarka xaaladdana wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-on-ka daruuro dhibcood\u003C/strong\u003E: wuu weydiiyaa marka aad dhisayso daruuro faylkeeda aan unug sheegin, wuxuuna lambarrada daruurta ku calaamadiyaa unugga uu sido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJawaabta waa la xasuustaa faylkaas (magaciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo taariikhdiisa) kombiyuutarkan, dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft. Marka isla faylka mar kale la geliyo ma weydiisanayso, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa in unugyada la xasuustay la isticmaalay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi mar kale loo weydiiyo: amarka palette-ka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cstrong\u003EWeydii mar kale unugyada faylasha la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska unugyada oo hore u jiray soo dhoofin (Unugyada Maktabadda, Unugyada barta daruurta, Unugyada naqshadda ee Ka dhis naqshad) ayaa wali unugyada ka dib beddela. Liiska unugyada ee qalabka dhulka hadda waa meesha su&#039;aashu ka bilaabanto keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Soo dhoofi fayl oo hubi in uu ku yimaado cabbirka saxda ah. Tallaabooyin Fur ama ku dar faylka sida caadiga ah: Open, Files ee Maktabadda, Point clouds, ama Dhis › Ka dhis naqshad. Haddii faylku sheego unugyadiisa, wax lagu weydiiyo ma jiraan. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa unugyada uu faylku sheegay. Haddii aanu sheegin, wada-hadal ayaa weydiinaya Unugyada faylka. Dooro hal unug oo faylka ku jira waa maxay, kadibna guji Use these units. Wax lagu dhigo ma jiraan ilaa aad jawaabtaada siiso. Cancel (ama Esc) wax soo dhoofin mana sameeyo. Faylasha sheega unugyadooda IFC: wuxuu sheegaa unugga dhererka, \"Furmay\" ayaa sheegta haddii ay tahay. IFC aan wax sheegin ayaa lagu weydiiyaa ka hor inta aan furmin; jawaabtaadu waxa lagu qoraa moodeelka, sidaas darteed faylku wuu sheegaa markaad kaydiso. DWG iyo DXF: unugyada geliska naqshadda (insertion units). Naqshad aan lahayn ayaa lagu weydiiyaa (faylasha Maktabadda, Dhis › Ka dhis naqshad, dhulka laga helay khadadka kontuurka). Liisaska dhibcaha dhulka: ma sheegaan unugyo. Waa lagu weydiiyaa. Daruuro dhibcood: LAS iyo LAZ oo leh nidaam isku xidhka, E57, PTX iyo PLY waxay sheegaan kuwooda. Kuwa kale waa lagu weydiiyaa. OBJ iyo STL: marna ma sheegaan unugyo. Waa lagu weydiiyaa. glTF iyo GLB: mitir, sida xeerka qaabkooda. Sawirada: ma lahaan cabbir gaar ah. Sawirka waa la habeeyaa muuqaalka, cabbirkiisana waxaad dejisaa Miisaan laba dhibcood. Cabbirka aad siiso ayaa loo xasuustaa faylkaas: marka mar kale la geliyo, wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirkaas, sadarka xaaladdana wuu sheegaa. Add-on-ka daruuro dhibcood: wuu weydiiyaa marka aad dhisayso daruuro faylkeeda aan unug sheegin, wuxuuna lambarrada daruurta ku calaamadiyaa unugga uu sido. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Jawaabta waa la xasuustaa faylkaas (magaciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo taariikhdiisa) kombiyuutarkan, dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft. Marka isla faylka mar kale la geliyo ma weydiisanayso, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa in unugyada la xasuustay la isticmaalay. Si mar kale loo weydiiyo: amarka palette-ka (Ctrl+K) › Weydii mar kale unugyada faylasha la soo dhoofiyay. Liiska unugyada oo hore u jiray soo dhoofin (Unugyada Maktabadda, Unugyada barta daruurta, Unugyada naqshadda ee Ka dhis naqshad) ayaa wali unugyada ka dib beddela. Liiska unugyada ee qalabka dhulka hadda waa meesha su'aashu ka bilaabanto keliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"mep-calculations","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Cabbir tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada, hubi buuxinta kaabalka iyo iftiinka","summary":"Hubi cabbirrada tuubooyinka biyaha bixinta iyo tuubada hawada oo leh hoos u dhaca cadaadiska, u wareeji kaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka oo arag buuxinta, oo xisaabi iftiinka qolalka laga bilaabo faylasha IES ama EULUMDAT. Qiyamka caadiga ah waa la calaamadiyey; ku qor qiyamka xeerka jira.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["cabbirka","cabbirka tuubada","cabbirka tuubada hawada","hoos u dhaca cadaadiska","unugyada qalabka","baahida","hunter","hazen-williams","xawaaraha","xoog-shaqo","isla xoog","cadaadiska dabalaha","damper","jidka muhiimka ah","tiirka kaabalka","tuubada kaabalka","buuxinta","jadwalka kaabalka","ies","ldt","eulumdat","fotometri","iftiinka","lux","isla-qaybsanaan","xisaabta iftiinka","awoodda iftiinka","mep","xisaabinta","dhibaatooyin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tuubooyinka","text":"Tuubooyinka","level":2},{"id":"tuubada-hawada","text":"Tuubada hawada","level":2},{"id":"kaabalka-iyo-tuubooyinka-kaabalka","text":"Kaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka","level":2},{"id":"iftiinka","text":"Iftiinka","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-dabka","text":"Hubinta dabka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxaad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiish tuubooyinka, tuubada hawada, tiirarka kaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka sida caadiga ah, kadibna fur panelka \u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/strong\u003E. Tab kasta wuxuu akhrisaa moodeelka, muujinaa miis, wuxuuna liistaa waxa khaldan ee ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E panelka ⚠. Marka cabbir ay ka dhigayso dhibaato, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dabbaq cabbirrada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu beddelaa socodyada hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa caawimo qorista. Qiyam kasta waa la calaamadiyey shaashadda, ma jiro miis xeer ah: ku qor tirooyinka xeerka aad ku shaqaynayso, natiijadana eeg injineerka mas&#039;uul ka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubooyinka\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003Enidaamka\u003C/strong\u003E furaha (biyo qabow waa \u003Ccode\u003Ecw\u003C/code\u003E, biyo kulul \u003Ccode\u003Ehw\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji xawaaraha ugu sarreeya, iyo haddii aad rabto in cadaadiska la hubiyo, cadaadiska isha iyo cadaadiska ugu yar ee qalab kasta u baahan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubo kasta waxay qaadaa baahida unugyada qalabka ee hoosteeda ku jira. Baahidu waxay ka timaadaa khad unugyada qalabka iyo socodka, sida Hunter sheegay. \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka dhismaha waa tusaale, ma aha miis xeer\u003C/strong\u003E; Dhibaatooyinka ayaa sheegaya taas ilaa aad khadkaaga ku qorto. Iska caabbinta waa Hazen–Williams, kuwa fittings-ka waa tirooyin lumitaan, kor u kaca waxaa lagu qiyaasaa 9.8 kPa mitir kasta. Unugyada qalab kasta waxay ka yimaadaan noocooda, ama tirada aad dejisay qalabka caawiyaha \u003Ccode\u003Eloads_set\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubada-hawada\"\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji nidaamka, heerka xoogga (equal friction) ama xawaare, iyo khasaaraha kooyil, shaandhe ama dhawaqa-yare. Terminal-ka waxay qaadaan socodka hawada ee \u003Ccode\u003Eloads_set\u003C/code\u003E ee diffuser-ka. Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa xawaaraha iyo xoogga qayb kasta, \u003Cstrong\u003Ecadaadiska dabalaha\u003C/strong\u003E jidka muhiimka ah, iyo cadaadiska uu damper-ka terminal kasta u baahan yahay. Khasaaraha fittings-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa tirooyin caadi ah oo la wareejiyey, ma aha xog-ururin fittings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaabalka-iyo-tuubooyinka-kaabalka\"\u003EKaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sawir qalabka Duct sida caadiga; nidaamyada \u003Cstrong\u003ECable tray\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EConduit\u003C/strong\u003E waxay u kaydsan yihiin sida kaabal-qaadayaal, si barnaamijyada kale ay ugu akhristaan sida tiraay iyo tuubo kaabalka. Tab-ka Cables-ka, ku dheji liiska kaabalka (tag, dhexroorka dibadda mm, tirada, from, to). \u003Ccode\u003Efrom\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eto\u003C/code\u003E waa tag-ga qalab ama nuqul \u003Ccode\u003Ex,y,z\u003C/code\u003E oo millimitir ah. Kaabalku wuxuu raacaa jidka ugu gaaban ee joogtada ah ee tiraayda iyo tuubooyinka; socod kasta wuxuu muujinayaa buuxinteeda marka loo eego xadka aad qortay, jadwalkuna wuxuu u kaydsan yahay CSV, dherer ku jira boqolkiiba dheeri ah iyo dhamaadyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiinka\"\u003EIftiinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESiiso luminaire kasta faylkiisa IES (LM-63) ama EULUMDAT adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka caawiyaha \u003Ccode\u003Ephotometry_set\u003C/code\u003E. Qor bartilmaameedyada, masaafada gridka iyo dhererka workplane-ka. Natiijadu waa iftiin \u003Cstrong\u003Etoos ah\u003C/strong\u003E keliya: ma jiro iftiin dib-u-celin iyo ma jiro hooska, sidaas darteed waa xadka hoose ee qolka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-dabka\"\u003EHubinta dabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKordhinta \u003Cstrong\u003EFire sprinklers\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay tab u gaar ah; eeg caawintiisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa Kiish tuubooyinka, tuubada hawada, tiirarka kaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka sida caadiga ah, kadibna fur panelka Xisaabinta. Tab kasta wuxuu akhrisaa moodeelka, muujinaa miis, wuxuuna liistaa waxa khaldan ee ah Dhibaatooyin panelka ⚠. Marka cabbir ay ka dhigayso dhibaato, Ku dabbaq cabbirrada wuxuu beddelaa socodyada hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Kuwani waa caawimo qorista. Qiyam kasta waa la calaamadiyey shaashadda, ma jiro miis xeer ah: ku qor tirooyinka xeerka aad ku shaqaynayso, natiijadana eeg injineerka mas'uul ka ah. Tuubooyinka Dooro nidaamka furaha (biyo qabow waa cw, biyo kulul hw). Deji xawaaraha ugu sarreeya, iyo haddii aad rabto in cadaadiska la hubiyo, cadaadiska isha iyo cadaadiska ugu yar ee qalab kasta u baahan yahay. Guji Hubi. Tuubo kasta waxay qaadaa baahida unugyada qalabka ee hoosteeda ku jira. Baahidu waxay ka timaadaa khad unugyada qalabka iyo socodka, sida Hunter sheegay. Khadka dhismaha waa tusaale, ma aha miis xeer; Dhibaatooyinka ayaa sheegaya taas ilaa aad khadkaaga ku qorto. Iska caabbinta waa Hazen–Williams, kuwa fittings-ka waa tirooyin lumitaan, kor u kaca waxaa lagu qiyaasaa 9.8 kPa mitir kasta. Unugyada qalab kasta waxay ka yimaadaan noocooda, ama tirada aad dejisay qalabka caawiyaha loads_set. Tuubada hawada Deji nidaamka, heerka xoogga (equal friction) ama xawaare, iyo khasaaraha kooyil, shaandhe ama dhawaqa-yare. Terminal-ka waxay qaadaan socodka hawada ee loads_set ee diffuser-ka. Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa xawaaraha iyo xoogga qayb kasta, cadaadiska dabalaha jidka muhiimka ah, iyo cadaadiska uu damper-ka terminal kasta u baahan yahay. Khasaaraha fittings-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa tirooyin caadi ah oo la wareejiyey, ma aha xog-ururin fittings. Kaabalka iyo tuubooyinka kaabalka Ku sawir qalabka Duct sida caadiga; nidaamyada Cable tray iyo Conduit waxay u kaydsan yihiin sida kaabal-qaadayaal, si barnaamijyada kale ay ugu akhristaan sida tiraay iyo tuubo kaabalka. Tab-ka Cables-ka, ku dheji liiska kaabalka (tag, dhexroorka dibadda mm, tirada, from, to). from iyo to waa tag-ga qalab ama nuqul x,y,z oo millimitir ah. Kaabalku wuxuu raacaa jidka ugu gaaban ee joogtada ah ee tiraayda iyo tuubooyinka; socod kasta wuxuu muujinayaa buuxinteeda marka loo eego xadka aad qortay, jadwalkuna wuxuu u kaydsan yahay CSV, dherer ku jira boqolkiiba dheeri ah iyo dhamaadyada. Iftiinka Siiso luminaire kasta faylkiisa IES (LM-63) ama EULUMDAT adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka caawiyaha photometry_set. Qor bartilmaameedyada, masaafada gridka iyo dhererka workplane-ka. Natiijadu waa iftiin toos ah keliya: ma jiro iftiin dib-u-celin iyo ma jiro hooska, sidaas darteed waa xadka hoose ee qolka. Hubinta dabka Kordhinta Fire sprinklers wuxuu leeyahay tab u gaar ah; eeg caawintiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"shafts-and-vertical-openings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Godka iyo furitaannada toosan ee dabaqyada","summary":"God waa hal qaab-dhismeed oo gooya dabaq kasta, saqaf kasta iyo saqaf-sare kasta oo u dhexeeya laba heer. Furitaan toosan wuxuu gooyaa mid ka mid ah. Furitaanka darbiga wuxuu gooyaa darbi.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["god","god qaadista","god elevator","furitaanka jaranjarada","furitaanka dabaqa","furitaanka saqafka","furitaanka saqaf-sare","dalool dabaqa","furitaanka darbiga","IfcOpeningElement","ka jarista","aagga saafiga ah"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"meesha-qalabka-ku-yaal","text":"Meesha qalabka ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"god","text":"God","level":2},{"id":"furitaan-toosan","text":"Furitaan toosan","level":2},{"id":"furitaanka-darbiga","text":"Furitaanka darbiga","level":2},{"id":"tirooyinka","text":"Tirooyinka","level":2},{"id":"haddii-waxba-la-gooyin","text":"Haddii waxba la gooyin","level":2},{"id":"ifc-da-dhexdiisa","text":"IFC-da dhexdiisa","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa jar god qaadista dhismaha hal sawir, ka jar dalool dabaq keliya, oo akhri waxa laga saaray aagagga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-qalabka-ku-yaal\"\u003EMeesha qalabka ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka ribbon: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFuritaan\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGodka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaanka toosan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaanka darbiga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka classic: barta Sawir › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/span\u003E (God, Furitaan toosan) iyo › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/span\u003E (furitaanka darbiga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"god\"\u003EGod\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qorshaha dabaqa heerka uu godku ka bilaabmo. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGodka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerka aasaaska\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerka sare\u003C/span\u003E, iyo kor-u-kaca haddii ay ka bilaabmayso ama ku dhammaanayso sare ama hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska qaab-dhismeedka. Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, ama laba jeer guji, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaq kasta, saqaf kasta iyo saqaf-sare kasta oo u dhexeeya laba dhererka ayaa la gooyaa. Xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod waa hal shay. Pick its outline on any level it passes: Dooro qaab-dhismeedkiisa heer kasta oo uu maro: Sifooyinka wuxuu leeyahay magaciisa, heerarkiisa iyo kor-u-kacyadiisa, waxa uu gooyo iyo aagga laga jaray. Beddelkiisa oo dhan furitaannadu way raacaan. Tirtirkiisa oo dhan furitaannadu way baxaan. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuu sii gooyaa: dabaq la sameeyo mar dambe oo u dhexeeya heerarkiisa waa la gooyaa iyada oo aan la weydiin, dabaq aad tirtirto waa la sii daayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDabaqa godku ku taagan yahay lama gooyo (sare-kiisu waa aasaaska). Aasaaska ku sii kor-u-kac taban si aad ugu gooyso sidoo kale. Sare-ka ku sii kor-u-kac togan si aad uga gudubto saqafka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furitaan-toosan\"\u003EFuritaan toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaanka toosan\u003C/span\u003E. Safka dooro waxa la gooyo: dabaqa, saqafka ama saqaf-sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska qaab-dhismeedka oo dhamee sida kor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqa, saqafka ama saqaf-sare ee heerkan hoosta qaab-dhismeedka ayaa la gooyaa. Waa xubin keliya: tirtir dabaqa, furitaankiisuna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furitaanka-darbiga\"\u003EFuritaanka darbiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaanka darbiga\u003C/span\u003E waa qalabka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EQaabeynta darbiga\u003C/a\u003E: guji darbi ku yaal qorshaha, ama laba geesood oo wejigiisa ku yaal 3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirooyinka\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka loo eego xeerka cabbirka dabaqyada, aagga saafiga ah ee xubin waa aagga guud ka dhimista wixii laga gooyay. God ama furitaan toosan waa ka jarista dabaq kasta iyo saqaf kasta oo uu gooyo; jadwallada Sagxadaha iyo Dhamaystirka iyo tirooyinka IFC waxay muujiyaan isla tirooyinkaas. Saqaf-sare waxa laga jaro waa aagga dusha saqafka: aagga qorshaha oo loo qaybiyay cosine-ka xagalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab-dhismeed dhex-dhaafa geeska wuxuu ka jaraa oo keliya qaybta ku taal xubinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-waxba-la-gooyin\"\u003EHaddii waxba la gooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod aan wax ku xayiran lahayn wali waa la sameeyaa, waana sheegaa: wuxuu gooyaa wixii lagu dhisi doono markii dambe. Furitaan toosan wuxuu u baahan yahay wax hoosta ah; haddii aanu wax ku jirin, xariiqa xaaladda ayaa sheegta, waxna lama sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-da-dhexdiisa\"\u003EIFC-da dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGooy kasta waa IfcOpeningElement oo leh IfcRelVoidsElement ilaa xubinta uu gooyo, si barnaamij IFC kasta u muujiyo daloolka. Saqaf-sare wajiga wajiga ah ayaa la gooyaa. God laftiisu waa IfcGroup oo ka kooban furitaannadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaab-dhismeedyada qalooca ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada godka: sawir iyadoo la isticmaalayo qalabka Darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddelka qaab-dhismeedka iyada oo la jiidayo geesaha (beddel sifooyinka, ama tirtir oo mar kale sawir).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESifooyinka dabaq la sawiray waxay muujiyaan aagga laga jarayo furitaannadiisa oo keliya; jadwallada iyo tirooyinka IFC waxay ku daraan kuwa godka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rooms-and-separators\"\u003EQolalka iyo kala-saareyaasha qolalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka jar god qaadista dhismaha hal sawir, ka jar dalool dabaq keliya, oo akhri waxa laga saaray aagagga. Meesha qalabka ku yaal Qaababka ribbon: Naqshadda dhismaha › Furitaan › Godka, Furitaanka toosan iyo Furitaanka darbiga. Qaabka classic: barta Sawir › menu-ga Qolalka (God, Furitaan toosan) iyo › menu-ga Darbiyada (furitaanka darbiga). God Fur qorshaha dabaqa heerka uu godku ka bilaabmo. Dooro Godka. Safka dooro Heerka aasaaska iyo Heerka sare, iyo kor-u-kaca haddii ay ka bilaabmayso ama ku dhammaanayso sare ama hoose. Guji geeska qaab-dhismeedka. Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, ama laba jeer guji, ama riix Enter si aad u dhammayso. Dabaq kasta, saqaf kasta iyo saqaf-sare kasta oo u dhexeeya laba dhererka ayaa la gooyaa. Xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay tahay. God waa hal shay. Pick its outline on any level it passes: Dooro qaab-dhismeedkiisa heer kasta oo uu maro: Sifooyinka wuxuu leeyahay magaciisa, heerarkiisa iyo kor-u-kacyadiisa, waxa uu gooyo iyo aagga laga jaray. Beddelkiisa oo dhan furitaannadu way raacaan. Tirtirkiisa oo dhan furitaannadu way baxaan. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Wuu sii gooyaa: dabaq la sameeyo mar dambe oo u dhexeeya heerarkiisa waa la gooyaa iyada oo aan la weydiin, dabaq aad tirtirto waa la sii daayaa. Dabaqa godku ku taagan yahay lama gooyo (sare-kiisu waa aasaaska). Aasaaska ku sii kor-u-kac taban si aad ugu gooyso sidoo kale. Sare-ka ku sii kor-u-kac togan si aad uga gudubto saqafka. Furitaan toosan Dooro Furitaanka toosan. Safka dooro waxa la gooyo: dabaqa, saqafka ama saqaf-sare. Guji geeska qaab-dhismeedka oo dhamee sida kor. Dabaqa, saqafka ama saqaf-sare ee heerkan hoosta qaab-dhismeedka ayaa la gooyaa. Waa xubin keliya: tirtir dabaqa, furitaankiisuna wuu baxaa. Furitaanka darbiga Furitaanka darbiga waa qalabka Qaabeynta darbiga: guji darbi ku yaal qorshaha, ama laba geesood oo wejigiisa ku yaal 3D. Tirooyinka Marka loo eego xeerka cabbirka dabaqyada, aagga saafiga ah ee xubin waa aagga guud ka dhimista wixii laga gooyay. God ama furitaan toosan waa ka jarista dabaq kasta iyo saqaf kasta oo uu gooyo; jadwallada Sagxadaha iyo Dhamaystirka iyo tirooyinka IFC waxay muujiyaan isla tirooyinkaas. Saqaf-sare waxa laga jaro waa aagga dusha saqafka: aagga qorshaha oo loo qaybiyay cosine-ka xagalka. Qaab-dhismeed dhex-dhaafa geeska wuxuu ka jaraa oo keliya qaybta ku taal xubinta. Haddii waxba la gooyin God aan wax ku xayiran lahayn wali waa la sameeyaa, waana sheegaa: wuxuu gooyaa wixii lagu dhisi doono markii dambe. Furitaan toosan wuxuu u baahan yahay wax hoosta ah; haddii aanu wax ku jirin, xariiqa xaaladda ayaa sheegta, waxna lama sameeyo. IFC-da dhexdiisa Gooy kasta waa IfcOpeningElement oo leh IfcRelVoidsElement ilaa xubinta uu gooyo, si barnaamij IFC kasta u muujiyo daloolka. Saqaf-sare wajiga wajiga ah ayaa la gooyaa. God laftiisu waa IfcGroup oo ka kooban furitaannadiisa. Weli lama dhisin Qaab-dhismeedyada qalooca ah. Darbiyada godka: sawir iyadoo la isticmaalayo qalabka Darbiga. Beddelka qaab-dhismeedka iyada oo la jiidayo geesaha (beddel sifooyinka, ama tirtir oo mar kale sawir). Sifooyinka dabaq la sawiray waxay muujiyaan aagga laga jarayo furitaannadiisa oo keliya; jadwallada iyo tirooyinka IFC waxay ku daraan kuwa godka. Eeg sidoo kale Qolalka iyo kala-saareyaasha qolalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"mep-equipment","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qalabka MEP oo leh dekado","summary":"Dhig qalabka hawo-maamule guud, dabbaalada, mishiinnada, dhuxul-kululeeyaasha, kulul-biyoodka, cutubyada terminal-ka, diffuser-yada, grille-yada iyo taangiyada, oo cabbirkoodu yahay qiimaha aad qortid, mid kastaana leh xidhiidhyada tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee kale ay ku xirtaan.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["mep","qalabka","hawo-maamule","ahu","dabbaal","dabbaal dhexe","mishiin","dhuxul-kululeeye","kulul-biyood","cutubka terminal-ka","vav","diffuser","grille","register","taangi","dekad","dekadaha","xidhiidh","afka","cabbirka afka","hvac","plumbing","mechanical","ifc","ifcpump","ifcairterminal","ifcunitaryequipment"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"dhig-qalab","text":"Dhig qalab","level":2},{"id":"beddel-ama-ka-saar","text":"Beddel ama ka saar","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxaad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig qalabka dhammaadka tuubooyinkaaga iyo tuubada hawada. Qalab kasta waa qaab guud oo cabbirkiisa lagu go&#039;aaminayo qiyamka aad qortay, xidhiidhyadiisana waa \u003Cstrong\u003Edekado\u003C/strong\u003E: halka tuubo ama tuubo hawo ku xirmaan, nidaamka, jihada socodka, iyo cabbirka. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee laga bilaabo dekad waxay qaadaan cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda oo waxay ku xirnaanayaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EKu xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa caawin naqshadeed iyo isku-duubni, injineer ayaa cabbirka sameeya. Qalabku ma aha alaab soo saare gaar ah: ma jiro awood, miisaan, ama cabbirro xidhiidh oo soo saare. Soo geli moodeel soo saare ah oo ka yimid barnaamijkaaga MEP sida IFC marka aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-qalab\"\u003EDhig qalab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBar-ka, dooro nooca oo qor cabbirkiisa. Nooc kasta wuxuu weydiiyaa midiisa:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad qortaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDekadihiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHawo-maamule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer, ballac, joog; furitaanka soo-bixinta iyo soo-celinta; cabbirka tuubada dabbaalka iyo nidaamkeeda; cabbirka biyo-dhigga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etuubo hawo soo-bixin ka baxda, tuubo hawo soo-celin gasha, dabbaalka gal iyo ka bax, biyo-dhigga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabbaal dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhexroor, dherer, nidaam\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etuubo hawo gal iyo ka bax\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMishiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecabbirka tuubada, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egal iyo ka bax\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuxul-kululeeye\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer, ballac, joog, cabbirka tuubada, cabbirka gaasta, dhexroorka qoorta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esoo-bixinta kululaynta ka baxda iyo soo-celinta gasha, gaasta gal, qoorta ka bax\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKulul-biyood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhexroor, joog, cabbirka tuubada, gaas ama koronto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebiyo qabow gal, biyo kulul ka bax (iyo gaas gal iyo qoor marka uu gaas gubo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECutubka terminal-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer, ballac, joog; furitaanka wareega ee dhexroorka; furitaanka hawada gal iyo ka bax\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehawada gal iyo ka bax\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiffuser\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewejiga, qoorta, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoorteeda (hawo gal)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGrille\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eballaca iyo dhererka wejiga, ballaca iyo dhererka qoorta, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoorteeda (hawo ka bax oo loo wareego tuubada soo celinta ama ka bixinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaangi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhexroor, joog, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egal sare, ka bax hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadiator\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer, joog, qoto, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esocod gal dhamaadka sare ee hal dhinac, soo-celin ka bax dhamaadka hoose ee dhinaca kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuxul-kululeeye / convector\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer, joog, qoto, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esocod gal hal dhamaad, soo-celin ka bax dhamaadka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoyska soo saaraha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoyska (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-specs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-specs\"\u003ECabbirrada tuubada, valve-yada, damper-yada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edekadaha uu qoyskiisu siiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E, dhererka saldhigiisa ee ka sarreeya heerka. Dhererka diffuser-ka ama grille-ka waa wejigiisa: qor dhererka saqafka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003ETag\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad rabto (\u003Ccode\u003EAHU-1\u003C/code\u003E); qalabka nooca isku mid ah ee xiga wuxuu helayaa lambarka xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha ku dhaqaaji muraayadda: aasaaska iyo dekadihiisu way kula socdaan. Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 90° ugu rogto. Guji meesha uu tagayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada tuubada waa cabbirrada tuubada birta ah (ASME B36.10M). Tuubo laga bilaabo mishiin agab kale ah waxay qaadaa isla cabbirka magaca ah agabkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-ama-ka-saar\"\u003EBeddel ama ka saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qalabka qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa cabbir kasta aad qortay, tag-kiisa, X, Y, dhererka iyo wareegga, iyo dekad kasta: cabbirkeeda, nidaamkeeda, jihada socodka, iyo in wax lagu xidhay ama maya. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E; socodyada ku xiran dekadihiisa waa wada guuraan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu tirtiraa; socodyada ku xiran ayaa sii joogi doona, Hubinta xidhiidhka ayaa liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooc kasta waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida fasalkiisa IFC: IfcUnitaryEquipment (hawo-maamule), IfcFan (dabbaal dhexe), IfcPump (mishiin), IfcBoiler (dhuxul-kululeeye; kulul-biyoodu waa IfcBoiler oo nooca biyo ah oo leh object type &quot;Water heater&quot;), IfcAirTerminalBox (cutubka terminal-ka), IfcAirTerminal (diffuser, grille) iyo IfcTank, oo nooc la wadaago qalab kasta oo nooca isku mid ah iyo cabbirro. Faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan IfcEnergyConversionDevice, IfcFlowMovingDevice, IfcFlowController, IfcFlowTerminal iyo IfcFlowStorageDevice oo leh noocyada u habboon. Dekad kasta waa IfcDistributionPort oo lagu dhigay meesha xidhiidhku joogo, wejigiisu dibadda u jeedo, leh jihada socodka iyo nidaamka; barnaamijyada kale waxay akhrin karaan socodka ku xirnaan doona dekadda. Qalabku wuxuu ku biiraa nidaamka dekad kasta, wuxuuna qaadaa xirmooyinka sifooyinka ee alaab maktabadeed kasta oo la dhigay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa Dhig qalabka dhammaadka tuubooyinkaaga iyo tuubada hawada. Qalab kasta waa qaab guud oo cabbirkiisa lagu go'aaminayo qiyamka aad qortay, xidhiidhyadiisana waa dekado: halka tuubo ama tuubo hawo ku xirmaan, nidaamka, jihada socodka, iyo cabbirka. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee laga bilaabo dekad waxay qaadaan cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda oo waxay ku xirnaanayaan: eeg Ku xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka. Tani waa caawin naqshadeed iyo isku-duubni, injineer ayaa cabbirka sameeya. Qalabku ma aha alaab soo saare gaar ah: ma jiro awood, miisaan, ama cabbirro xidhiidh oo soo saare. Soo geli moodeel soo saare ah oo ka yimid barnaamijkaaga MEP sida IFC marka aad u baahan tahay. Dhig qalab Shid Sawir, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Qalabka. Bar-ka, dooro nooca oo qor cabbirkiisa. Nooc kasta wuxuu weydiiyaa midiisa: Nooca Waxaad qortaa Dekadihiisa Hawo-maamule dherer, ballac, joog; furitaanka soo-bixinta iyo soo-celinta; cabbirka tuubada dabbaalka iyo nidaamkeeda; cabbirka biyo-dhigga tuubo hawo soo-bixin ka baxda, tuubo hawo soo-celin gasha, dabbaalka gal iyo ka bax, biyo-dhigga Dabbaal dhexe dhexroor, dherer, nidaam tuubo hawo gal iyo ka bax Mishiin cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka gal iyo ka bax Dhuxul-kululeeye dherer, ballac, joog, cabbirka tuubada, cabbirka gaasta, dhexroorka qoorta soo-bixinta kululaynta ka baxda iyo soo-celinta gasha, gaasta gal, qoorta ka bax Kulul-biyood dhexroor, joog, cabbirka tuubada, gaas ama koronto biyo qabow gal, biyo kulul ka bax (iyo gaas gal iyo qoor marka uu gaas gubo) Cutubka terminal-ka dherer, ballac, joog; furitaanka wareega ee dhexroorka; furitaanka hawada gal iyo ka bax hawada gal iyo ka bax Diffuser wejiga, qoorta, nidaamka qoorteeda (hawo gal) Grille ballaca iyo dhererka wejiga, ballaca iyo dhererka qoorta, nidaamka qoorteeda (hawo ka bax oo loo wareego tuubada soo celinta ama ka bixinta) Taangi dhexroor, joog, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka gal sare, ka bax hoose Radiator dherer, joog, qoto, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka socod gal dhamaadka sare ee hal dhinac, soo-celin ka bax dhamaadka hoose ee dhinaca kale Dhuxul-kululeeye / convector dherer, joog, qoto, cabbirka tuubada, nidaamka socod gal hal dhamaad, soo-celin ka bax dhamaadka kale Qoyska soo saaraha qoyska (eeg Cabbirrada tuubada, valve-yada, damper-yada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha) dekadaha uu qoyskiisu siiyay Deji At, dhererka saldhigiisa ee ka sarreeya heerka. Dhererka diffuser-ka ama grille-ka waa wejigiisa: qor dhererka saqafka. Qor Tag haddii aad rabto (AHU-1); qalabka nooca isku mid ah ee xiga wuxuu helayaa lambarka xiga. Qorshaha ku dhaqaaji muraayadda: aasaaska iyo dekadihiisu way kula socdaan. Taabo R si aad 90° ugu rogto. Guji meesha uu tagayo. Cabbirrada tuubada waa cabbirrada tuubada birta ah (ASME B36.10M). Tuubo laga bilaabo mishiin agab kale ah waxay qaadaa isla cabbirka magaca ah agabkeeda. Beddel ama ka saar Dooro qalabka qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. Sifooyinka wuxuu muujinayaa cabbir kasta aad qortay, tag-kiisa, X, Y, dhererka iyo wareegga, iyo dekad kasta: cabbirkeeda, nidaamkeeda, jihada socodka, iyo in wax lagu xidhay ama maya. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo; socodyada ku xiran dekadihiisa waa wada guuraan. Delete wuu tirtiraa; socodyada ku xiran ayaa sii joogi doona, Hubinta xidhiidhka ayaa liistaa. Faylka IFC Nooc kasta waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida fasalkiisa IFC: IfcUnitaryEquipment (hawo-maamule), IfcFan (dabbaal dhexe), IfcPump (mishiin), IfcBoiler (dhuxul-kululeeye; kulul-biyoodu waa IfcBoiler oo nooca biyo ah oo leh object type \"Water heater\"), IfcAirTerminalBox (cutubka terminal-ka), IfcAirTerminal (diffuser, grille) iyo IfcTank, oo nooc la wadaago qalab kasta oo nooca isku mid ah iyo cabbirro. Faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan IfcEnergyConversionDevice, IfcFlowMovingDevice, IfcFlowController, IfcFlowTerminal iyo IfcFlowStorageDevice oo leh noocyada u habboon. Dekad kasta waa IfcDistributionPort oo lagu dhigay meesha xidhiidhku joogo, wejigiisu dibadda u jeedo, leh jihada socodka iyo nidaamka; barnaamijyada kale waxay akhrin karaan socodka ku xirnaan doona dekadda. Qalabku wuxuu ku biiraa nidaamka dekad kasta, wuxuuna qaadaa xirmooyinka sifooyinka ee alaab maktabadeed kasta oo la dhigay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"families","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda","summary":"Albaabbada, daaqadaha iyo alaabta waxay ku imaanayaan qoysas. Cabbir kasta oo qoys ah waa hal nooc oo ku jira faylka IFC, sidaas darteed liiska noocyada BimCraft wuu gaabanaadaa, barnaamijyada kale oo akhrinaya noocyada fudud.","section":"tasks","order":37,"keywords":["qoys","qoysaska","nooc","noocyada","cabbir","cabbirrada","nooca albaabka","nooca daaqadda","alaab","miis","rafka","kabbaad","cabbir cusub","laabi","dhig qoyska","faylka qoyska","ccfamily","maktabadda IFC","maktabadda mashruuca","koox","muuqaal","IfcDoorType","IfcWindowType","IfcGroup"],"headings":[{"id":"waa-maxay-qoys","text":"Waa maxay qoys","level":2},{"id":"halka-lagu-helo","text":"Halka lagu helo","level":2},{"id":"albaabbada-iyo-daaqadaha","text":"Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha","level":2},{"id":"cabbir-cusub-oo-qoyskan-ka-timid","text":"Cabbir cusub oo qoyskan ka timid","level":2},{"id":"dhig-alaabta","text":"Dhig alaabta","level":2},{"id":"cabbirro-shaxan-ka","text":"Cabbirro shaxan ka","level":2},{"id":"qiyam-qalab-kasta","text":"Qiyam qalab kasta","level":2},{"id":"heerka-faahfaahinta","text":"Heerka faahfaahinta","level":2},{"id":"laabo-qoys","text":"Laabo qoys","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-qoysaska","text":"Faylasha qoysaska","level":2},{"id":"qoysaska-maktabadda","text":"Qoysaska Maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-barnaamijyada-kale","text":"Noocyada barnaamijyada kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-maxay-qoys\"\u003EWaa maxay qoys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoys waa nooc waxyaabo ah oo lagu sameeyo dhowr cabbir: albaab hal dhinac u furma oo 32, 36 iyo 42 inji ballac leh, ama miis dheer iyo gaaban. BimCraft qoyska mar hal mar ayaad ku aragtaa, cabbirradiisa hoosteeda, halkii liis dheer oo noocyo ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIFC ma lahan qoysas. Faylka gudihiisa cabbir kasta waa nooc caadi ah (nooca albaabka, nooca daaqadda, nooca alaabta…), qoyskuna waa koox liistaysa cabbirradeeda. Barnaamijyada BIM ee kale noocyada iyo kooxda way akhrinayaan sida ay yihiin; BimCraft qoyska ayuu ka soo akhriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-lagu-helo\"\u003EHalka lagu helo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EQoysaska\u003C/strong\u003E ee baaraha mashruuca waxay liisanaysaa qoysaska moodeelkan, inta cabbir kasta leedahay iyo inta la dhigay. Hoostooda waa \u003Cstrong\u003EQoysaska bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E: albaabbada iyo daaqadaha qalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda, iyo miis, cabbirka rafka alaabta, iyo kabbaad aasaas ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isla liistaas ku muujiyaa daaqad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix qoys si aad u furto: cabbirradiisa, qiyamka cabbir kasta, iyo inta elementi kasta isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"albaabbada-iyo-daaqadaha\"\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda waxay liistaan qoysaska nooca, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003Eliiska cabbirrada\u003C/strong\u003E dhinacooda. Dooro cabbir, ama ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EH\u003C/strong\u003E: ballac iyo dherer aan cabbir lahayn wuxuu noqonayaa cabbir cusub oo qoysku marka albaabka la dhigo. Albaabbada cabbir isku mid ah waxay wadaagaan hal nooc.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlbaab ama daaqad la doortay, \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ayay muujinaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQoyska\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro cabbir kale liiska, ama ku qor ballac ama dherer cusub. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qoyska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa qoyska ay leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDerbiga kasta albaabkiisa iyo daaqadiisa waxay raacaan dhumucda darbigiisa, sida hore qoysaska. Nooca cabbirku wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa albaabka ee lagu sawiro darbi 140 mm ah, barnaamijyada noocyada akhrinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir-cusub-oo-qoyskan-ka-timid\"\u003ECabbir cusub oo qoyskan ka timid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qoyska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir cusub oo qoyskan ka timid\u003C/strong\u003E, ku qor qiyamkiisa (Ballac, Dherer iyo cabbirrada kale ee qoysku leeyahay) iyo, haddii aad rabto, magac. Haddii aan magac lahayn, waxaa loo magacaabaa qiyamkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee cabbir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba cabbir qiyam isku mid ah ma lahaan karaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMagac beddel\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu beddelaa magaca cabbirka; \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka qaadaa cabbir qof isticmaalin; \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu doortaa elementiyada cabbirkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-alaabta\"\u003EDhig alaabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig qoyska\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda qoys.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda, dooro qoyska iyo cabbirkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix qorshaha si aad ugu dhigto dabaqa. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u rogto 90° ka hor inta aadan riixin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa joojiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab la dhigay \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinaysaa cabbirkiisa, meesha uu yaal iyo inta la rogay; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka tirtira. Qalab kasta oo cabbir isku mid ah wuxuu wadaagaa qaabka cabbirkaas, sidaas darteed beddelka qoyska wuxuu beddelaa dhammaantood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirro-shaxan-ka\"\u003ECabbirro shaxan ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirro shaxan ka…\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda qoyska wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl CSV (koma, semicolon ama tab). Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka: magaca ama calaamada cabbirka, iyo haddii la doono \u003Ccode\u003EName\u003C/code\u003E. Dherarka waa millimitir mar aan la qorin unug (\u003Ccode\u003E1.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E36 in\u003C/code\u003E). Tiirarka Haa / Maya waxay qaataan yes, no, true, false, 1 ama 0, cabbir aan tiir lahayn wuxuu hayaa caddaynta caadiga ah. Safka kasta wuxuu noqdaa cabbir, oo waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto; cabbir horey u jirtay waa la dhaafaa. Hal safka aan la akhrin, ama qoyska aanu sawirin karin, miiska oo dhan waa la diidaa oo magaca safkiisa ayuu sheegaa. Ugu badnaan 200 safka iyo 1 MB. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi cabbirrada shaxan ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa isla miiska dib u soo saaraya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyam-qalab-kasta\"\u003EQiyam qalab kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EParameter ku calaamadsan \u003Cstrong\u003EQalab kasta\u003C/strong\u003E tafatiraha (Haa / Maya oo ku daraya transom, calaamad, agab) ma aha qayb cabbir; laba albaab oo cabbir isku mid ah way kala duwan karaan. Dooro elementiga, \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa muujinaysa parameters-kan; beddel mid ka mid ah, elementigaas waa la sawiraa mar kale qaab u gaar ah (alaabta iyo qalabka waxay helaan qaab gaar ah, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha waa la dib u sameeyaa darbiyadooda). Dhammaantood dib ugu celi caadiga ah, wuxuu dib ugu noqonayaa qaabka cabbirkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerka-faahfaahinta\"\u003EHeerka faahfaahinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka faahfaahinta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa, qoys kasta oo moodeelka ku jira, waxa lagu kaydiyo solids-ka lagana muujiyo calaamadaha qorshaha: \u003Cstrong\u003EFine\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa wax kasta, \u003Cstrong\u003EMedium\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECoarse\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka reebaan qaybaha tafatiraha ku calaamadeeyay inay kuwo ka yar yihiin (faylal yar, muuqaal dhakhso leh). \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomatic\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa wax kasta, muuqaalka xaashidana wuxuu doortaa iyada oo ku salaysan miisaankeeda: 1:50 iyo wixii ka weyn fine, 1:100 medium, 1:200 iyo wixii ka yar coarse. Hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"laabo-qoys\"\u003ELaabo qoys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa aha inaad wax aan waxba lahayn ka bilowdo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoys parameters-kiisa, solids-kiisa iyo cabbirradiisa magac cusub hoostiisa. Beddel nuqulka tafatiraha; asalkuna wuu sidiisii ku sii jiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-qoysaska\"\u003EFaylasha qoysaska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi faylka qoyska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E.ccfamily.json\u003C/code\u003E: parameters-ka qoyska, solids-ka iyo cabbirrada. Ku fur moodeel kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur fayl qoys…\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Qoysaska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoyska ku kaydiyaa fayl IFC yar: noocyada cabbirradiisa iyo kooxdiisa, oo lagu sheegay maktabadda mashruuca IFC. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u furaan sida tiro noocyo; BimCraft wuxuu u furaa sida qoys mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka qoys ee halkan lagu furay waxaa loo akhriyaa sida xog, waana la hubiyaa ka hor inta aan waxba la qorin. Qoys furihiisu horey u jiro moodeelka waxa uu u yimaadaa sida qoys gaar ah. Qoys haysta qoysas kale (eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EQoysaska gudaha ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E ee tafatiraha) waa keenaa iyaga: faylku wuxuu liistaa, moodeelka waxa uu hayaa kuwa horey u haystay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoysaska-maktabadda\"\u003EQoysaska Maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska…\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabadda…\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto qoysaska la wadaagay Maktabadda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar mashruucan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u akhrinayaa sida faylka qoys: BimCraft wuxuu hubiyaa goob kasta ka hor inta uusan samayn wax, qoysku wuxuu imanayaa sida qoys gaar ah, wuxuuna furmaa tafatiraha. Ku darista waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Si aad kaaga wadaagto, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi dhammaan maktabad ahaan\u003C/span\u003E oo u dir faylka Maktabadda (shaqaalaha Maktabadda waxay daabacaan faylka qoys amar ku saabsan; qoys kasta waa shay gaar ah oo cabbirradiisa leh). Haddii Maktabadda la gaari karin, liistu way sheegaysaa oo wax ma beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-barnaamijyada-kale\"\u003ENoocyada barnaamijyada kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyada ay sameeyeen barnaamijyada kale ayaa sidoo kale ku muuqda kooxda Qoysaska, iyaga oo lagu kooxeeyay male-awaal: qaybta magacyada elementigooda ka hor colon-ka koowaad, ama noocyada magacyadooda ku kala duwan oo keliya tirooyinkooda. Daaqadda qoyska waxay sheegtaa male-awaalka la isticmaalay. Waa la liistaa oo elementigooda waa la dooran karaa, laakiin halkan lama tafatiro: ma lahan qaacidada qoyska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha bilowga ah waxaa loo sawiraa sidii ay ahaayeen ka hor qoysaska. Faylasha la sameeyay ka hor qoysaska wax la&#039;aan ayay furmaan: albaabbadooda iyo daaqadahooda waxay muuqdaan qoyskooda hoostiisa iyo cabbirrada la isticmaalayo, waxayna u guuraan cabbir gaar ah markii ugu horreysay ee la beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003ETafatirka qoyska\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waa maxay qoys Qoys waa nooc waxyaabo ah oo lagu sameeyo dhowr cabbir: albaab hal dhinac u furma oo 32, 36 iyo 42 inji ballac leh, ama miis dheer iyo gaaban. BimCraft qoyska mar hal mar ayaad ku aragtaa, cabbirradiisa hoosteeda, halkii liis dheer oo noocyo ah. IFC ma lahan qoysas. Faylka gudihiisa cabbir kasta waa nooc caadi ah (nooca albaabka, nooca daaqadda, nooca alaabta…), qoyskuna waa koox liistaysa cabbirradeeda. Barnaamijyada BIM ee kale noocyada iyo kooxda way akhrinayaan sida ay yihiin; BimCraft qoyska ayuu ka soo akhriyaa. Halka lagu helo Qaybta Qoysaska ee baaraha mashruuca waxay liisanaysaa qoysaska moodeelkan, inta cabbir kasta leedahay iyo inta la dhigay. Hoostooda waa Qoysaska bilowga: albaabbada iyo daaqadaha qalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda, iyo miis, cabbirka rafka alaabta, iyo kabbaad aasaas ah. Dhismaha › Qoysaska… wuxuu isla liistaas ku muujiyaa daaqad. Riix qoys si aad u furto: cabbirradiisa, qiyamka cabbir kasta, iyo inta elementi kasta isticmaasho. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha Qalabyada Albaabka iyo Daaqadda waxay liistaan qoysaska nooca, kadibna liiska cabbirrada dhinacooda. Dooro cabbir, ama ku qor W iyo H: ballac iyo dherer aan cabbir lahayn wuxuu noqonayaa cabbir cusub oo qoysku marka albaabka la dhigo. Albaabbada cabbir isku mid ah waxay wadaagaan hal nooc. Albaab ama daaqad la doortay, Sifooyinka ayay muujinaysaa Qoyska iyo Cabbirka. Dooro cabbir kale liiska, ama ku qor ballac ama dherer cusub. Fur qoyska wuxuu furaa qoyska ay leedahay. Derbiga kasta albaabkiisa iyo daaqadiisa waxay raacaan dhumucda darbigiisa, sida hore qoysaska. Nooca cabbirku wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa albaabka ee lagu sawiro darbi 140 mm ah, barnaamijyada noocyada akhrinaya. Cabbir cusub oo qoyskan ka timid Fur qoyska. Hoosta Cabbir cusub oo qoyskan ka timid, ku qor qiyamkiisa (Ballac, Dherer iyo cabbirrada kale ee qoysku leeyahay) iyo, haddii aad rabto, magac. Haddii aan magac lahayn, waxaa loo magacaabaa qiyamkiisa. Riix Samee cabbir. Laba cabbir qiyam isku mid ah ma lahaan karaan. Magac beddel wuxuu beddelaa magaca cabbirka; Ka saar wuxuu ka qaadaa cabbir qof isticmaalin; Dooro wuxuu doortaa elementiyada cabbirkaas. Dhig alaabta Dhismaha › Dhig qoyska, ama Dhig daaqadda qoys. Xariiqda, dooro qoyska iyo cabbirkiisa. Riix qorshaha si aad ugu dhigto dabaqa. Riix R si aad u rogto 90° ka hor inta aadan riixin. Esc ayaa joojiya. Qalab la dhigay Sifooyinka waxay muujinaysaa cabbirkiisa, meesha uu yaal iyo inta la rogay; Delete ayaa ka tirtira. Qalab kasta oo cabbir isku mid ah wuxuu wadaagaa qaabka cabbirkaas, sidaas darteed beddelka qoyska wuxuu beddelaa dhammaantood. Cabbirro shaxan ka Cabbirro shaxan ka… daaqadda qoyska wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl CSV (koma, semicolon ama tab). Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka: magaca ama calaamada cabbirka, iyo haddii la doono Name. Dherarka waa millimitir mar aan la qorin unug (1.2 m, 36 in). Tiirarka Haa / Maya waxay qaataan yes, no, true, false, 1 ama 0, cabbir aan tiir lahayn wuxuu hayaa caddaynta caadiga ah. Safka kasta wuxuu noqdaa cabbir, oo waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto; cabbir horey u jirtay waa la dhaafaa. Hal safka aan la akhrin, ama qoyska aanu sawirin karin, miiska oo dhan waa la diidaa oo magaca safkiisa ayuu sheegaa. Ugu badnaan 200 safka iyo 1 MB. Kaydi cabbirrada shaxan ahaan wuxuu qoraa isla miiska dib u soo saaraya. Qiyam qalab kasta Parameter ku calaamadsan Qalab kasta tafatiraha (Haa / Maya oo ku daraya transom, calaamad, agab) ma aha qayb cabbir; laba albaab oo cabbir isku mid ah way kala duwan karaan. Dooro elementiga, Sifooyinka ayaa muujinaysa parameters-kan; beddel mid ka mid ah, elementigaas waa la sawiraa mar kale qaab u gaar ah (alaabta iyo qalabka waxay helaan qaab gaar ah, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha waa la dib u sameeyaa darbiyadooda). Dhammaantood dib ugu celi caadiga ah, wuxuu dib ugu noqonayaa qaabka cabbirkiisa. Heerka faahfaahinta Dhismaha › Qoysaska… › Heerka faahfaahinta wuxuu qoraa, qoys kasta oo moodeelka ku jira, waxa lagu kaydiyo solids-ka lagana muujiyo calaamadaha qorshaha: Fine wuxuu hayaa wax kasta, Medium iyo Coarse waxay ka reebaan qaybaha tafatiraha ku calaamadeeyay inay kuwo ka yar yihiin (faylal yar, muuqaal dhakhso leh). Automatic wuxuu kaydiyaa wax kasta, muuqaalka xaashidana wuxuu doortaa iyada oo ku salaysan miisaankeeda: 1:50 iyo wixii ka weyn fine, 1:100 medium, 1:200 iyo wixii ka yar coarse. Hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Laabo qoys Ma aha inaad wax aan waxba lahayn ka bilowdo. Laabi wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoys parameters-kiisa, solids-kiisa iyo cabbirradiisa magac cusub hoostiisa. Beddel nuqulka tafatiraha; asalkuna wuu sidiisii ku sii jiraa. Faylasha qoysaska Kaydi faylka qoyska wuxuu kaydiyaa .ccfamily.json: parameters-ka qoyska, solids-ka iyo cabbirrada. Ku fur moodeel kale Fur fayl qoys… kooxda Qoysaska. U kaydi sida IFC wuxuu qoyska ku kaydiyaa fayl IFC yar: noocyada cabbirradiisa iyo kooxdiisa, oo lagu sheegay maktabadda mashruuca IFC. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u furaan sida tiro noocyo; BimCraft wuxuu u furaa sida qoys mar kale. Faylka qoys ee halkan lagu furay waxaa loo akhriyaa sida xog, waana la hubiyaa ka hor inta aan waxba la qorin. Qoys furihiisu horey u jiro moodeelka waxa uu u yimaadaa sida qoys gaar ah. Qoys haysta qoysas kale (eeg Qoysaska gudaha ku jira ee tafatiraha) waa keenaa iyaga: faylku wuxuu liistaa, moodeelka waxa uu hayaa kuwa horey u haystay. Qoysaska Maktabadda Fur Qoysaska… oo riix Maktabadda… si aad u aragto qoysaska la wadaagay Maktabadda. Ku dar mashruucan wuxuu u akhrinayaa sida faylka qoys: BimCraft wuxuu hubiyaa goob kasta ka hor inta uusan samayn wax, qoysku wuxuu imanayaa sida qoys gaar ah, wuxuuna furmaa tafatiraha. Ku darista waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Si aad kaaga wadaagto, isticmaal Kaydi dhammaan maktabad ahaan oo u dir faylka Maktabadda (shaqaalaha Maktabadda waxay daabacaan faylka qoys amar ku saabsan; qoys kasta waa shay gaar ah oo cabbirradiisa leh). Haddii Maktabadda la gaari karin, liistu way sheegaysaa oo wax ma beddelmaan. Noocyada barnaamijyada kale Noocyada ay sameeyeen barnaamijyada kale ayaa sidoo kale ku muuqda kooxda Qoysaska, iyaga oo lagu kooxeeyay male-awaal: qaybta magacyada elementigooda ka hor colon-ka koowaad, ama noocyada magacyadooda ku kala duwan oo keliya tirooyinkooda. Daaqadda qoyska waxay sheegtaa male-awaalka la isticmaalay. Waa la liistaa oo elementigooda waa la dooran karaa, laakiin halkan lama tafatiro: ma lahan qaacidada qoyska. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha bilowga ah waxaa loo sawiraa sidii ay ahaayeen ka hor qoysaska. Faylasha la sameeyay ka hor qoysaska wax la'aan ayay furmaan: albaabbadooda iyo daaqadahooda waxay muuqdaan qoyskooda hoostiisa iyo cabbirrada la isticmaalayo, waxayna u guuraan cabbir gaar ah markii ugu horreysay ee la beddelo. See also Tafatirka qoyska and Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-with-energyplus","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka hubi kulaynta iyo qabowga EnergyPlus-ka","summary":"Qor moodelka fayl EnergyPlus ah, ama ku socodsii EnergyPlus nooca 26.2.0 browser-ka, oo isku barbardhig culayska naqshadeynta iyo caawiyaha degdega ah ee kulaynta iyo qabowga. Fikrad labaad oo naqshadeynta hore, ma aha xisaabinta waafaqsanaanta.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["energyplus","simulation tamarta","maalinta naqshadeynta","culaynta kulaynta","culaynta qabowga","faylka cimilada","epw","idf","cufnaanta kulaynta","tamarta sannadlaha","simulate"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"diyaari-engine-ka","text":"Diyaari engine-ka","level":2},{"id":"maalmo-naqshadeyn-ama-sannad","text":"Maalmo naqshadeyn ama sannad","level":2},{"id":"cufnaanta-kulaynta","text":"Cufnaanta kulaynta","level":2},{"id":"akhrinta-isbarbardhigga","text":"Akhrinta isbarbardhigga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka \u003Cstrong\u003EKa hubi EnergyPlus-ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu moodelka furan u qoraa fayl gelin EnergyPlus ah (IDF): hal goob qol kasta, derbiyada, dhulalka, saqafyada iyo daaqadaha oo leh U-values-kooda, isbeddelka hawada, iyo kulaynta iyo qabowga ee ku habboon. Mar walba waad \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaydin kartaa faylkaas\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku socodsiin kartaa EnergyPlus-kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad sidoo kale engine-ka diyaariso, panelku wuxuu isla markiiba simulate samayn karaa, oo wuxuu liistaa kulaynta iyo qabowga naqshadeynta ee EnergyPlus-ka, ku dhinac-dhinac caawiyaha degdega ah, qol kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa caawiye naqshadeyn. Heerarka tamarta, shahaadooyinka iyo ogolaanshaha waxay u baahan yihiin qalab la ansixiyay iyo xogta cimilada ay codsato, natiijadana waxay u baahan tahay dib-u-eegis ka timid qofka u jawaabaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"diyaari-engine-ka\"\u003EDiyaari engine-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft ma sido EnergyPlus. Waa dhismo WebAssembly oo weyn (qiyaastii 6 MB oo la cadaadiyay, iyo fayl xog 4.6 MB), sidaas darteed adigu ayaad martigelisaa oo ciwaanka ku qortaa panelka. Bogga wuxuu soo rarayaa kaliya markaad riixdo badhanka simulate, weligiis bilowga ma yeelan. Ciwaanku waa inuu noqdaa https, jid ku yaal goobtan, ama localhost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maalmo-naqshadeyn-ama-sannad\"\u003EMaalmo naqshadeyn ama sannad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee maalmaha naqshadeynta\u003C/strong\u003E ma u baahna fayl cimilo. Waxay socodsiisaa maalin qabow oo jiilaal ah oo aan qorrax lahayn iyo maalin kulul oo cad oo xagaag ah, heerkulka lagu qoray gelinta kulaynta iyo qabowga ee tab-ka Daylight, wuxuuna sheegaa culaynta qol kasta watt-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee sannad\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay fayl cimilo oo EPW ah oo aad dooratid. Wuxuu ku daraa dadka, nalalka iyo qalabka isla gelinta (had iyo jeer shidan, sababtoo ah jadwal lama abuurin), wuxuuna sheegaa tamarta kulaynta iyo qabowga qol kasta kWh-ga. Faylalka cimilada waxay leeyihiin liisanskooda, sidaas darteed isticmaal midka aad isticmaali karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cufnaanta-kulaynta\"\u003ECufnaanta kulaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EDerbiyada rakaabyo la yaqaan u sii cufnaanta kulaynta\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyada, saqafyada iyo dhulalka rakaabkoodu la yaqaan waxa loo qoraa rakaab rakaab ah, iyadoo cufnaanta iyo kulaynta gaarka ah laga qaadayo miis gaaban oo qiyaasaha caadiga ah ku salaysan magaca agabka. Rakaabyada waxa lagu qaadaa dibada marka hore, siday faylku u liistay. Walxaha aan rakaab lahayn waxay ku sii jiraan U-value-kooda, iyada oo aan cufnaan lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhrinta-isbarbardhigga\"\u003EAkhrinta isbarbardhigga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada hab su&#039;aalo kala duwan ayay ka jawaabaan. Caawiyaha degdega ah wuxuu hayaa walx kasta; faylka EnergyPlus-ku wuxuu celceliyaa U-values-ka qol kasta sida nooca dusha. Farqiga ka badan 15 % ee kulaynta naqshadeynta qol kasta waxa lagu liistaa qoraal ku jira panelka ⚠, oo leh labada tirooyin. Qabowga farqigu wuu ka weyn yahay naqshadeyn ahaan: caawiyaha degdega ah wuxuu xisaabiyaa kor-u-kaca qorraxda maalin keliya, EnergyPlus-kuna wuxuu cabbiraa maalinta naqshadeyntiisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Panelka Ka hubi EnergyPlus-ka wuxuu moodelka furan u qoraa fayl gelin EnergyPlus ah (IDF): hal goob qol kasta, derbiyada, dhulalka, saqafyada iyo daaqadaha oo leh U-values-kooda, isbeddelka hawada, iyo kulaynta iyo qabowga ee ku habboon. Mar walba waad kaydin kartaa faylkaas oo ku socodsiin kartaa EnergyPlus-kaaga. Haddii aad sidoo kale engine-ka diyaariso, panelku wuxuu isla markiiba simulate samayn karaa, oo wuxuu liistaa kulaynta iyo qabowga naqshadeynta ee EnergyPlus-ka, ku dhinac-dhinac caawiyaha degdega ah, qol kasta. Tani waa caawiye naqshadeyn. Heerarka tamarta, shahaadooyinka iyo ogolaanshaha waxay u baahan yihiin qalab la ansixiyay iyo xogta cimilada ay codsato, natiijadana waxay u baahan tahay dib-u-eegis ka timid qofka u jawaabaya. Diyaari engine-ka BimCraft ma sido EnergyPlus. Waa dhismo WebAssembly oo weyn (qiyaastii 6 MB oo la cadaadiyay, iyo fayl xog 4.6 MB), sidaas darteed adigu ayaad martigelisaa oo ciwaanka ku qortaa panelka. Bogga wuxuu soo rarayaa kaliya markaad riixdo badhanka simulate, weligiis bilowga ma yeelan. Ciwaanku waa inuu noqdaa https, jid ku yaal goobtan, ama localhost. Maalmo naqshadeyn ama sannad Samee maalmaha naqshadeynta ma u baahna fayl cimilo. Waxay socodsiisaa maalin qabow oo jiilaal ah oo aan qorrax lahayn iyo maalin kulul oo cad oo xagaag ah, heerkulka lagu qoray gelinta kulaynta iyo qabowga ee tab-ka Daylight, wuxuuna sheegaa culaynta qol kasta watt-ka. Samee sannad wuxuu u baahan yahay fayl cimilo oo EPW ah oo aad dooratid. Wuxuu ku daraa dadka, nalalka iyo qalabka isla gelinta (had iyo jeer shidan, sababtoo ah jadwal lama abuurin), wuxuuna sheegaa tamarta kulaynta iyo qabowga qol kasta kWh-ga. Faylalka cimilada waxay leeyihiin liisanskooda, sidaas darteed isticmaal midka aad isticmaali karto. Cufnaanta kulaynta Calaamadi Derbiyada rakaabyo la yaqaan u sii cufnaanta kulaynta: derbiyada, saqafyada iyo dhulalka rakaabkoodu la yaqaan waxa loo qoraa rakaab rakaab ah, iyadoo cufnaanta iyo kulaynta gaarka ah laga qaadayo miis gaaban oo qiyaasaha caadiga ah ku salaysan magaca agabka. Rakaabyada waxa lagu qaadaa dibada marka hore, siday faylku u liistay. Walxaha aan rakaab lahayn waxay ku sii jiraan U-value-kooda, iyada oo aan cufnaan lahayn. Akhrinta isbarbardhigga Labada hab su'aalo kala duwan ayay ka jawaabaan. Caawiyaha degdega ah wuxuu hayaa walx kasta; faylka EnergyPlus-ku wuxuu celceliyaa U-values-ka qol kasta sida nooca dusha. Farqiga ka badan 15 % ee kulaynta naqshadeynta qol kasta waxa lagu liistaa qoraal ku jira panelka ⚠, oo leh labada tirooyin. Qabowga farqigu wuu ka weyn yahay naqshadeyn ahaan: caawiyaha degdega ah wuxuu xisaabiyaa kor-u-kaca qorraxda maalin keliya, EnergyPlus-kuna wuxuu cabbiraa maalinta naqshadeyntiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-groups","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Kooxaha moodeelka","summary":"Ka samee walxaha la doortay koox magac leh, dib u dhig koobiga meel kale, oo mid bedel si nuqulada kale oo dhammuba isugu beddelmaan.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["koox","koox moodeel","kooxayn","ka saar kooxda","nuqul","ku celi","bay","dib u dhig","wax ka beddel kooxda","IfcGroup"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"meesha-uu-qalabku-ku-yaal","text":"Meesha uu qalabku ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-kale-oo-aad-samayn-kartid","text":"Waxyaabo kale oo aad samayn kartid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-koox-ku-jiri-kara","text":"Waxa koox ku jiri kara","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee koox qaybta caadiga ah ee bay, dhig dhowr jeer, oo mid bedel si nuqul kasta oo kale isu beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-uu-qalabku-ku-yaal\"\u003EMeesha uu qalabku ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabeynta ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeel\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox moodeel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabeynta classic-ka: baarka Sawir › menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQolalka\u003C/span\u003E › Koox moodeel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdigoo isticmaalaya Dooro, dooro walxaha: guji mid, Ctrl+guji ama Shift+guji kuwa kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox moodeel\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay isla markiiba noqdaan koox. Marka hore qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagaca kooxda\u003C/span\u003E safka si aad u magacowdo, ama ka dib qor mid si aad u beddesho magaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig mid kale\u003C/span\u003E oo guji meesha nuqulku taagan doono: geeskiisa hoose ee bidix ayaa u tagta gujintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBedel nuqul kasta: guuri darbi dhamaadkiisa, cabbir albaab mar kale, tirtir tiir. Nuqul kasta oo kale oo kooxda ka mid ah isla tallaabada ayaa isu beddelma, oo mar keliya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammaantood soo celisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox moodeel\u003C/span\u003E hadda shaqaynayso, gujinta walax kasta waxay doorataa kooxda oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-kale-oo-aad-samayn-kartid\"\u003EWaxyaabo kale oo aad samayn kartid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar kuwii la doortay\u003C/span\u003E: ku dar walxo dheeraad ah kooxda aad ugu dambeyn dooratay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar kooxda\u003C/span\u003E: nuqulkan wuxuu noqonayaa walxo caadi ah mar kale. Nuqulada kale waxay sii joogi doonaan koox.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqul oo dhan ku guuri \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E: waa isla kooxda meel cusub; kuwa kale ma guuraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirtir walxaha nuqul, nuqulkaasna wuu baxayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-koox-ku-jiri-kara\"\u003EWaxa koox ku jiri kara\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada iyo albaabyadooda iyo daaqadahooda, tiirarka iyo sagxadaha la sawiray waa la dib u dhigi karaa oo waa la isku mid ahaan karaa. Koox waxay sidoo kale hayn kartaa walxo kale, laakiin markaas lama dib u dhigi karo weli; safku wuxuu sababta sheegayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulada waa la guuraa oo kaliya; looma leexin ama looma sameeyo muraayad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoox waa IfcGroup oo leh IfcRelAssignsToGroup oo u gaar ah xubnahooda, kuwaas oo sii ahaanaya darbi, tiir iyo sagxad caadi ah. Nuqul kasta oo koox kale wuxuu qaadaa isla aqoonsiga qeexidda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqul leexinta ama muraayad-geeynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJaranjarooyin, saqafyo, sagxadaha qolalka iyo walxaha maktabadda ee koox dib loo dhigo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProfiilka darbiga, janjeerka iyo furitaanada darbiga looma qaado nuqulada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKooxo ku jira kooxo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/move-align-distribute\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/move-align-distribute\"\u003EGuuri, isu-dhig iyo kala fidi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee koox qaybta caadiga ah ee bay, dhig dhowr jeer, oo mid bedel si nuqul kasta oo kale isu beddelmaan. Meesha uu qalabku ku yaal Qaabeynta ribbon-ka: Naqshadda dhismaha › Moodeel › Koox moodeel. Qaabeynta classic-ka: baarka Sawir › menu-ga Qolalka › Koox moodeel. Tallaabooyin Adigoo isticmaalaya Dooro, dooro walxaha: guji mid, Ctrl+guji ama Shift+guji kuwa kale. Dooro Koox moodeel. Waxay isla markiiba noqdaan koox. Marka hore qor Magaca kooxda safka si aad u magacowdo, ama ka dib qor mid si aad u beddesho magaca. Riix Dhig mid kale oo guji meesha nuqulku taagan doono: geeskiisa hoose ee bidix ayaa u tagta gujintaas. Bedel nuqul kasta: guuri darbi dhamaadkiisa, cabbir albaab mar kale, tirtir tiir. Nuqul kasta oo kale oo kooxda ka mid ah isla tallaabada ayaa isu beddelma, oo mar keliya Ka noqo ayaa dhammaantood soo celisa. Inta Koox moodeel hadda shaqaynayso, gujinta walax kasta waxay doorataa kooxda oo dhan. Waxyaabo kale oo aad samayn kartid Ku dar kuwii la doortay: ku dar walxo dheeraad ah kooxda aad ugu dambeyn dooratay. Ka saar kooxda: nuqulkan wuxuu noqonayaa walxo caadi ah mar kale. Nuqulada kale waxay sii joogi doonaan koox. Nuqul oo dhan ku guuri Guuri: waa isla kooxda meel cusub; kuwa kale ma guuraan. Tirtir walxaha nuqul, nuqulkaasna wuu baxayaa. Waxa koox ku jiri kara Darbiyada iyo albaabyadooda iyo daaqadahooda, tiirarka iyo sagxadaha la sawiray waa la dib u dhigi karaa oo waa la isku mid ahaan karaa. Koox waxay sidoo kale hayn kartaa walxo kale, laakiin markaas lama dib u dhigi karo weli; safku wuxuu sababta sheegayaa. Nuqulada waa la guuraa oo kaliya; looma leexin ama looma sameeyo muraayad. Faylka IFC Koox waa IfcGroup oo leh IfcRelAssignsToGroup oo u gaar ah xubnahooda, kuwaas oo sii ahaanaya darbi, tiir iyo sagxad caadi ah. Nuqul kasta oo koox kale wuxuu qaadaa isla aqoonsiga qeexidda. Weli lama dhisin Nuqul leexinta ama muraayad-geeynta. Jaranjarooyin, saqafyo, sagxadaha qolalka iyo walxaha maktabadda ee koox dib loo dhigo. Profiilka darbiga, janjeerka iyo furitaanada darbiga looma qaado nuqulada. Kooxo ku jira kooxo. Eeg sidoo kale Guuri, isu-dhig iyo kala fidi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"mep-connections","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka","summary":"Bilow ama dhamee tuubo ama tuubada hawada dekad (port) si ay u qaadato cabbirka dekadda iyo nidaamkeeda oo ay ugu xirnaato, kadibna hubi xidhiidhka — dekadaha furan, cabbir iyo nidaam aan waafaqsanayn, iyo socodyo aan isha lahayn.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["mep","ku xidh","xidhiidh","xidhiidhyada","dekad","dekadaha","dekad furan","cabbir aan isku mid ahayn","nidaam aan isku mid ahayn","isha","hubi xidhiidhka","ku xiran","raac","qalabka dhaqdhaqaaqa","ifcrelconnectsports","isku-duubni"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"ka-bilow-dekad","text":"Ka bilow dekad","level":2},{"id":"hubi-xidhiidhka","text":"Hubi xidhiidhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxaad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu xidh socodyada qalabka si moodeelku u noqdo hal nidaam isku xidhan: dhoofinta mishiinka ilaa tuubada ka baxda, iyo luuqa diffuser-ka ilaa tuubada laanta. Kadibna ka dhig BimCraft inuu liisto waxa aan isku xidhnayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-bilow-dekad\"\u003EKa bilow dekad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada hawada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji markaad ku dhowdahay dekad qalab (goobaha yaryar; dekad furan waxaa lagu muujiyaa midabka digniinta). Mu&#039;ashirku wuu ku xidhmaa wuxuuna sheegaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edekad saaran\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji: socodku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dekadda dhererkeeda oo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaadaa cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E (tuubadu sidoo kale qaadaa agabka caadiga ah ee nidaamka). Status line-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa qaaday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii sawirka sida caadiga ah. Socod ku dhammaada dekad kale ayaa dhamaadkaas sidoo kale xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamaadka socodka dekad saaran wuxuu \u003Cstrong\u003Eku xirnaan\u003C/strong\u003E yahay: dhaqaaji ama wareeji qalabka (Sifooyinka), dhamaadka socodka ayaa raacaa; wax ka beddel socodka, dhamaadkaas wuxuu sii joogaa dekadda. Geeska kale ee socodka waxay sii joogsadaan meesha ay joogaan, sidaas darteed dhaqdhaqaaq weyn kadib, cagta koowaad ayaa laga yaari karaa dekadda xagal ah: dhaqaaji geeska xiga sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-xidhiidhka\"\u003EHubi xidhiidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi xidhiidhka\u003C/span\u003E. Liiska hoosta bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXariiq\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheeda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA port is not connected\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalab ayaa leh xidhiidh aan wax lagu sawirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing on its end\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod ayaa ku dhammaada hawada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoined ports of different sizes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod cabbir kale ah ayaa ku kulma dekad ama socod kale oo aan reducer lahayn (cabbirka magaca tuubada, qaabka iyo dhinacyada tuubada hawada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoined ports of different systems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETusaale ahaan tuubada soo celinta oo ku xidhan diffuser-ka soo bixinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA pipe joined to a duct\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xidhiidh oo nooc kala duwan ah ayaa isku kulma\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENo equipment in its network supplies it\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidna ma leh qalab soo bixinaya, dhowr ha ahaadeen socodyada ay ku xirnaan. Biyo-dhaqidda, biyaha roobka iyo hawo-qaadka looma weydiinayo: biyahoodu waxay ka yimaadaan qalabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFixed to a port of equipment that is not in the model any more\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka waa la tirtiray; mar kale sawir dhamaadka ama tirtir socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhaladaadku waa kuwa marka hore yimaadda. Guji xariiq si aad u doorato waxa uu magacaabo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa liiska. Hubintu waxay akhrisaa moodeelka sida la sawiray: waxay hubisaa xidhiidhyada iyo cabbirrada, ma hubiso socodka, cadaadiska ama isku-dheelitirka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa Ku xidh socodyada qalabka si moodeelku u noqdo hal nidaam isku xidhan: dhoofinta mishiinka ilaa tuubada ka baxda, iyo luuqa diffuser-ka ilaa tuubada laanta. Kadibna ka dhig BimCraft inuu liisto waxa aan isku xidhnayn. Ka bilow dekad Dooro Tuubo ama Tuubada hawada. Dhaqaaji markaad ku dhowdahay dekad qalab (goobaha yaryar; dekad furan waxaa lagu muujiyaa midabka digniinta). Mu'ashirku wuu ku xidhmaa wuxuuna sheegaa dekad saaran. Guji: socodku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dekadda dhererkeeda oo qaadaa cabbirkeeda iyo nidaamkeeda (tuubadu sidoo kale qaadaa agabka caadiga ah ee nidaamka). Status line-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa qaaday. Sii sawirka sida caadiga ah. Socod ku dhammaada dekad kale ayaa dhamaadkaas sidoo kale xidha. Dhamaadka socodka dekad saaran wuxuu ku xirnaan yahay: dhaqaaji ama wareeji qalabka (Sifooyinka), dhamaadka socodka ayaa raacaa; wax ka beddel socodka, dhamaadkaas wuxuu sii joogaa dekadda. Geeska kale ee socodka waxay sii joogsadaan meesha ay joogaan, sidaas darteed dhaqdhaqaaq weyn kadib, cagta koowaad ayaa laga yaari karaa dekadda xagal ah: dhaqaaji geeska xiga sidoo kale. Hubi xidhiidhka Fur Dhismaha oo guji Hubi xidhiidhka. Liiska hoosta bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa: Xariiq Macnaheeda A port is not connected Qalab ayaa leh xidhiidh aan wax lagu sawirin Nothing on its end Socod ayaa ku dhammaada hawada Joined ports of different sizes Socod cabbir kale ah ayaa ku kulma dekad ama socod kale oo aan reducer lahayn (cabbirka magaca tuubada, qaabka iyo dhinacyada tuubada hawada) Joined ports of different systems Tusaale ahaan tuubada soo celinta oo ku xidhan diffuser-ka soo bixinta A pipe joined to a duct Laba xidhiidh oo nooc kala duwan ah ayaa isku kulma No equipment in its network supplies it Midna ma leh qalab soo bixinaya, dhowr ha ahaadeen socodyada ay ku xirnaan. Biyo-dhaqidda, biyaha roobka iyo hawo-qaadka looma weydiinayo: biyahoodu waxay ka yimaadaan qalabka Fixed to a port of equipment that is not in the model any more Qalabka waa la tirtiray; mar kale sawir dhamaadka ama tirtir socodka Khaladaadku waa kuwa marka hore yimaadda. Guji xariiq si aad u doorato waxa uu magacaabo. Xir wuxuu qariyaa liiska. Hubintu waxay akhrisaa moodeelka sida la sawiray: waxay hubisaa xidhiidhyada iyo cabbirrada, ma hubiso socodka, cadaadiska ama isku-dheelitirka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"family-editor","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tafatir qoys","summary":"Beddel parameters, qaacidooyin iyo solids qoys, muuji qaybaha parameter Haa / Maya, goo oo isku xidh solids, siiso xidhiidhiyayaal biyaha iyo tuubooyinka hawada, oo arag natiijada loo sawiray IFC ee kaydin doonta.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["tafatiraha qoysaska","tafatir qoys","parameter","parameters","qaacido","qaacidooyin","muuqaal","haa maya","solid","solids","sanduuq","extrusion","extrude","revolve","sweep","profile","arc","boolean","booleans","cut","join","difference","union","handle","handles","work plane","sketch","qoys cusub","xidhiidhiye","xidhiidhiyayaal","port","ports","xidhiidhiyaha tuubada","xidhiidhiyaha tuubada hawada","biyo-dhigga","biyo-gelinta"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-tafatiraha","text":"Fur tafatiraha","level":2},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"solids","text":"Solids","level":2},{"id":"sawir-profile","text":"Sawir profile","level":3},{"id":"booleans","text":"Booleans","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-qorshaha","text":"Calaamadda qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"qoysaska-gudaha-ku-jira","text":"Qoysaska gudaha ku jira","level":2},{"id":"dhibcaha-taabta","text":"Dhibcaha taabta","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidhiyayaal","text":"Xidhiidhiyayaal","level":2},{"id":"preview-iyo-gacmahooda","text":"Preview iyo gacmahooda","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta","text":"Kaydinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-tafatiraha\"\u003EFur tafatiraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur qoys (baaraha mashruuca \u003Cstrong\u003EQoysaska\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska…\u003C/span\u003E) oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qoyska\u003C/span\u003E. Si aad wax aan waxba lahayn ka bilowdo, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoys cusub\u003C/span\u003E: siiso magac, sheeg waa maxay (albaab, daaqad, alaab, qalab ama wax kale) iyo, albaab ama daaqad ahaan, dooro bilowga qaabkiisa iyo gacantiisa. Tafatiraha wuxuu furmaa qoys leh dhowr parameter iyo hal solid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETafatirka bilowga ah wuxuu isbeddelladaada ku kaydiyaa moodeelkan oo keliya. Moodeelada kale waxay haystaan bilowga sida uu yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba ma beddelmo moodeelka ilaa aad riixdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qoyska\u003C/span\u003E. Tafatiraha wuxuu leeyahay ka noqo iyo mar kale oo gudaha ah (badhamada fallaadha ee magaca ku xigta, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); kaydinta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta ka noqoshada moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"parameters\"\u003EParameters\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbiraha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa parameters-ka qoyska: magac, nooc iyo default. Noocyadu waa: \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E (millimitir), \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E (darajo), \u003Cstrong\u003ETiro\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETiro oo buuxa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHaa / Maya\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQalin\u003C/strong\u003E (1–16), iyo saddex oo qaata erayo halkii tirooyin: \u003Cstrong\u003EQoraal\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAgab\u003C/strong\u003E (mid ka mid ah agabka mashruuca) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBuuxin\u003C/strong\u003E (buuxinta qorshaha). Erayada lama isticmaalo qaacidooyinka; waxay midabeeyaan solid (\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E), buuxiyaan qayb calaamad, ama ku soo baxaan sida \u003Ccode\u003E{Name}\u003C/code\u003E qoraalka calaamadda. Sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQalab kasta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa parameter ay qalab kasta oo la dhigay iyada isu dejiso halkii cabbirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaacido\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa parameter inuu raaco kuwa kale, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003EWidth / 30\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Eif(Width &gt; 1200, 2, 1)\u003C/code\u003E. Dherarka qaacidooyinka waa millimitir, ama qor unug: \u003Ccode\u003E3&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6in\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E50cm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac beddelka parameter waxa uu beddelaa magaciisa qaacido kasta iyo goob kasta oo isticmaasha. Parameter weli la isticmaalayo ma la saari karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E solid wuxuu qaataa midabka agabka mashruuca (ama parameter Agab), \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqda marka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qariyaa heerarka faahfaahinta ka liita, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu celi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa nuqullo: tiro (tiro ama parameter tiro oo buuxa, 1 ilaa 200) iyo tallaabada u dhexeysa x, y iyo z. Solid la celiyay waa safka alwaaxyada, go&#039;yada ama godadka; haddii lagu jaro, nuqullada waxay wada jaraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoys albaab ama daaqad ah wuxuu sidoo kale helaa laba magac darbigiisa: \u003Ccode\u003EWallThickness\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EFace\u003C/code\u003E (1 ama −1, dhinaca uu albaabku ku rogmado).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"solids\"\u003ESolids\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa solids. Ku dar sanduuq, extrusion, revolve ama sweep:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESolid\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad dejiso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elaba geeskiisa: x0 ilaa x1, y0 ilaa y1, z0 ilaa z1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrusion\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eprofile ku yaal work plane (plan, front ama side), meesha diyaarka uu yaal, iyo qoto dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eprofile, tiir oo diyaarka ku taal, iyo xagal ilaa 360°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESweep\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ejid oo dhibcood ah iyo radius (ul ama jaranjaro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro kasta waxay noqon kartaa tiro la qoray ama qaacido parameters. Solid kasta wuxuu leeyahay midab iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqda marka\u003C/strong\u003E: ka daa banaan si ay had iyo jeer u muuqato, ama magac Haa / Maya parameter (ama qor isbarbardhig sida \u003Ccode\u003EShelves &gt;= 3\u003C/code\u003E) si ay markaa keliya u muuqato. Taasi waa parameter muuqaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sawir-profile\"\u003ESawir profile\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProfile-ka extrusion ama revolve waxa lagu sawiraa work plane-kiisa hoosta preview-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix warqadda si aad dhibic ugu darto kan la doortay ka dib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhibic si aad u dhaqaajiso. Dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan grid-ka; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhigto si xor ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix labajaran yar oo ku yaal qayb si aad dhibic halkaas ugu darto. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix qaybtaas waxay ka dhigaysaa arc (riix mar kale si aad u doorato dhinaca kale, kadibna toos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix dhibic si aad u tirtirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha godan parameters ayaa dejiya: ku beddel miiska, ha jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"booleans\"\u003EBooleans\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoolean\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka jaraa solid-ka labaad solid-ka koowaad, ama wuu isku xidhaa. Natiijada Boolean waa la jari karaa ama mar kale la isku xidhi karaa. Solid la isticmaalay Boolean waxaa lagu sawiraa qayb ka mid ah oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka solid-ka labaad uu qariyo parameter Haa / Maya, kan koowaad waa la hayaa sidiisa; marka kan koowaad qarinayo, natiijadu waa la qariyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-qorshaha\"\u003ECalaamadda qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadda qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa waxa qorshuhu muujiyo qoyskan halkii goynta solids-kiisa: xariiqyo, rectangles, goobo, xagal, poligon iyo qoraal, oo ku salaysan axes-ka qoyska. Qayb kasta waxay leedahay \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalin\u003C/strong\u003E (1–16, qaacido ama parameter Qalin), \u003Cstrong\u003Ebuuxin\u003C/strong\u003E (ma jiro, adag, diagonal, isku-jarran, konkreet, insulation, dhulka, ama parameter Buuxin), \u003Cstrong\u003Emuuqda marka\u003C/strong\u003E qaacido, \u003Cstrong\u003Egobolka jarista\u003C/strong\u003E millimitir kor ka sare saldhigga (qayb si buuxda loo sawiro goynta qorshaha ay ku jirto, si fiican hoos uga hoosaysa, si dashed ka sarreysa: kabbaad kor ka goynta wuxuu muujinayaa dashed), heerka faahfaahinta, iyo ku celinta. Qoraalku wuxuu magacaabi karaa parameters sida \u003Ccode\u003E{Name}\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa: Goynta solids-ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa qorshaha oo jarayo solids-ka halka calaamaddu ku sii jirto qoyska. Barnaamijyada kale waxay calaamadda akhrinayaan sida footprint-ka qoyska (xariiqyo iyo qaabab; qoraalku wuxuu ku sii jiraa BimCraft oo keliya).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoysaska-gudaha-ku-jira\"\u003EQoysaska gudaha ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska gudaha ku jira\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoys kale gudaha ku dhigayaa: lug miis ku jirta, gacan albaab ku jirta. Dooro qoyska, kadibna meesha uu ku yaal (x, y, z), inta uu rogmo (rubuc-wareeg oo keliya: 0, 90, 180, 270), goorta uu muuqdo, iyo qiyamka uu helo, mid kasta safka: \u003Ccode\u003EHeight = Height - 40\u003C/code\u003E. Markii qoyska gudaha la kaydiyo, qoyskan waa la sawiraa mar kale; qoys ay haysato qoys kale looma tirtiri karo; qoys isagu naftiisa ma hayn karo, xataa iyada oo marineysa qoys kale, isku-dhididda waxay ku joogsataa afar heer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibcaha-taabta\"\u003EDhibcaha taabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibic taabta waa dhibic ama geesha aad jiidto si aad u beddesho parameter. Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibcaha taabta\u003C/span\u003E ku dar mid, dooro jihada uu ku jiido iyo parameter-ka tirada uu beddelo, oo ku qor booskiisa isla qaacidooyinka solids-ka. Preview-ka, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha taabta\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta handles si aad u jiido. Elementi la dhigay qorshaha (dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E) dhibcaha x iyo y waxay u muuqdaan sida gacanta; jiid mid, elementigu wuxuu qaataa cabbirka dhibicdaas dhigaysa, iyada oo marinaya qaacidooyinka ku dhex jira; hal Undo ayaa celinaysa. Dhibic taabta ma beddeli karto parameter la wada maamulo, Haa / Maya ama erey.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D isla dhibcahaas waxay u muuqdaan sida gacmo ku dhex jira elementiga la doortay, dhibcaha kor-hoos (axis z) ayaa halkaas muuqda, taasoo qorshuhu aan sawiri karin. Dooro elementiga, jiid gacan dhinaceeda axis-ka, oo sii dheji: elementigu wuxuu qaataa cabbirka dhibicdaas dhigaysa, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Gacmaha waa la qariyaa marka sanduuqa qaybta uu shidan yahay, sababta oo ah wuxuu isticmaalaa isla gacmaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidhiyayaal\"\u003EXidhiidhiyayaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoysaska lagu dhigay dhulka (alaabta, qalabka iyo kuwa kale) waxay leeyihiin tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidhiyayaal\u003C/span\u003E: dhibcaha tuubada ama tuubada hawada ay ku biirayaan elementiga, sida wadiga iyo godka ee biyo-qabowga iyo biyo-dhigga. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xidhiidhiye\u003C/span\u003E oo dejiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E: tuubo ama tuubada hawada, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E (biyo qabow, biyo-dhigga sanitary, hawo gelinta…).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ex\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ey\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ez\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha uu yaal, axes-ka qoyska. Sida tirooyinka solid, mid kasta waxay noqon kartaa tiro ama qaacido parameters, si xidhiidhiyuhu u dhaqaaqo marka cabbirku beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJihada baxa\u003C/strong\u003E: jihada tuubada ama tuubada hawada uga baxda, dhinac ka mid ah axes-ka qoyska (dhiigga hoosta wadiga waa \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E: cabbirka magaca tuubada (DN) ama dhexroorka tuubada hawada ee wareega ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocod\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EGal\u003C/strong\u003E xidhiidhiyaha la quudiyo (tusaale wadiga), \u003Cstrong\u003EBax\u003C/strong\u003E kan biyaha wax dhiiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPreview-ka wuxuu xidhiidhiye kasta u sawiraa wareeg oo fallaad ku jirta jihada baxa. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha ma lahan xidhiidhiyayaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab biyo-dhigga ah, dooro waa kee hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka biyo-dhigga\u003C/strong\u003E (musqulka, lavatory, saxanka jikada, shower, tuubada dharka). Qalabyada bilowga ah horay ayay u sheegaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab kasta oo qoysaska laga dhigo wuxuu helaa xidhiidhiyayaashiisa sida portal-ka IFC, waxaana dib loo sameeyaa marka cabbirka uu beddelo ama qoyska la kaydiyo. Barnaamijyada akhrinaya nidaamyada IFC waxay arkaan meesha tuubada ama tuubada hawada ay ku haboon tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"preview-iyo-gacmahooda\"\u003EPreview iyo gacmahooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPreview-ka waa qoyska oo loo qoray sida IFC, isla koodka uu moodeelka ku kaydiyo, oo dib loo sawiray. Waxa aad aragto waa waxa barnaamijyada kale helaan. Hoosteeda, \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka la muujiyo\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa qiyamka parameters-ka preview-ku isticmaalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGacmaha\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhibcaha preview-ka: \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa gacmo Ballac, Qoto dheer iyo Dherer; \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid-ka la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa mid dhinac kasta oo solid-ka la doortay. Jiid gacan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edusha ay parameter dejiso, cabbirka la muujiyo wuu beddelmaa (qaacidooyinka qoyska way ilaaliyaan);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edusha ay tiro la qoray dejiso, tirada ayaa beddelmaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta\"\u003EKaydinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qoyska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hubiyaa qoyska, kadibna wuu dib u sawiraa cabbir kasta oo qoyska ah wuuna dib u sameeyaa elementi kasta, hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Haddii cabbir aan lagu sawiri karin isbeddelkaas (tusaale solid-ka uu ballac eber ahaan ku yaali doono cabbirkaas), wax lama kaydiyo, tafatiraha wuxuu sheegaa cabbirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii qof kale uu kaydiyey qoyskii isla markaa tafatirkaaga furnaa (Live TeamWork ama daaqad kale), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qoyska\u003C/span\u003E wuu diidaa oo wuu sheegaa, halkii uu ku beddeli lahaa isbeddelkiisa kan aad. Xir tafatiraha, mar kale fur qoyska si aad isbeddelkooda u aragto, oo mar kale samee kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeometry-ga waxa loo kaydiyaa sida solids-ka IFC: extrusions, revolves, diskiyada sweep-ka, iyo natiijooyinka Boolean. Waxba laguma beddelo liis xagal saddex-geesood ah, sidaas darteed faylashu way yaraadaan, barnaamijyada kale waxay akhrin karaan qaababka sida qaabab. Profiles-ka leh arc waxay kaydiyaan arc-yada IFC4 ku jira; IFC2X3 ma lahan arc-yo profile-ka ku jira, halkaasna arc-yada waxaa loo kaydiyaa qaybo toos ah oo gaaban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur tafatiraha Fur qoys (baaraha mashruuca Qoysaska, ama Dhismaha › Qoysaska…) oo riix Wax ka beddel qoyska. Si aad wax aan waxba lahayn ka bilowdo, riix Qoys cusub: siiso magac, sheeg waa maxay (albaab, daaqad, alaab, qalab ama wax kale) iyo, albaab ama daaqad ahaan, dooro bilowga qaabkiisa iyo gacantiisa. Tafatiraha wuxuu furmaa qoys leh dhowr parameter iyo hal solid. Tafatirka bilowga ah wuxuu isbeddelladaada ku kaydiyaa moodeelkan oo keliya. Moodeelada kale waxay haystaan bilowga sida uu yahay. Waxba ma beddelmo moodeelka ilaa aad riixdo Kaydi qoyska. Tafatiraha wuxuu leeyahay ka noqo iyo mar kale oo gudaha ah (badhamada fallaadha ee magaca ku xigta, ama Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y); kaydinta waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta ka noqoshada moodeelka. Parameters Tab-ka Cabbiraha wuxuu liistaa parameters-ka qoyska: magac, nooc iyo default. Noocyadu waa: Dherer (millimitir), Xagal (darajo), Tiro, Tiro oo buuxa, Haa / Maya, Qalin (1–16), iyo saddex oo qaata erayo halkii tirooyin: Qoraal, Agab (mid ka mid ah agabka mashruuca) iyo Buuxin (buuxinta qorshaha). Erayada lama isticmaalo qaacidooyinka; waxay midabeeyaan solid (Agabkiisa), buuxiyaan qayb calaamad, ama ku soo baxaan sida {Name} qoraalka calaamadda. Sanduuqa Qalab kasta wuxuu ka dhigaa parameter ay qalab kasta oo la dhigay iyada isu dejiso halkii cabbirka. Qaacido wuxuu ka dhigaa parameter inuu raaco kuwa kale, tusaale Width / 30 ama if(Width \u003E 1200, 2, 1). Dherarka qaacidooyinka waa millimitir, ama qor unug: 3', 6in, 50cm. Magac beddelka parameter waxa uu beddelaa magaciisa qaacido kasta iyo goob kasta oo isticmaasha. Parameter weli la isticmaalayo ma la saari karo. Agabka solid wuxuu qaataa midabka agabka mashruuca (ama parameter Agab), Muuqda marka wuxuu qariyaa heerarka faahfaahinta ka liita, Ku celi wuxuu sameeyaa nuqullo: tiro (tiro ama parameter tiro oo buuxa, 1 ilaa 200) iyo tallaabada u dhexeysa x, y iyo z. Solid la celiyay waa safka alwaaxyada, go'yada ama godadka; haddii lagu jaro, nuqullada waxay wada jaraan. Qoys albaab ama daaqad ah wuxuu sidoo kale helaa laba magac darbigiisa: WallThickness iyo Face (1 ama −1, dhinaca uu albaabku ku rogmado). Solids Tab-ka Jirarka wuxuu liistaa solids. Ku dar sanduuq, extrusion, revolve ama sweep: Solid Waxa aad dejiso Box laba geeskiisa: x0 ilaa x1, y0 ilaa y1, z0 ilaa z1 Extrusion profile ku yaal work plane (plan, front ama side), meesha diyaarka uu yaal, iyo qoto dheer Revolve profile, tiir oo diyaarka ku taal, iyo xagal ilaa 360° Sweep jid oo dhibcood ah iyo radius (ul ama jaranjaro) Tiro kasta waxay noqon kartaa tiro la qoray ama qaacido parameters. Solid kasta wuxuu leeyahay midab iyo Muuqda marka: ka daa banaan si ay had iyo jeer u muuqato, ama magac Haa / Maya parameter (ama qor isbarbardhig sida Shelves \u003E= 3) si ay markaa keliya u muuqato. Taasi waa parameter muuqaal. Sawir profile Profile-ka extrusion ama revolve waxa lagu sawiraa work plane-kiisa hoosta preview-ka: Riix warqadda si aad dhibic ugu darto kan la doortay ka dib. Jiid dhibic si aad u dhaqaajiso. Dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan grid-ka; hay Shift si aad u dhigto si xor ah. Riix labajaran yar oo ku yaal qayb si aad dhibic halkaas ugu darto. Shift+riix qaybtaas waxay ka dhigaysaa arc (riix mar kale si aad u doorato dhinaca kale, kadibna toos). Laba jeer riix dhibic si aad u tirtirto. Dhibcaha godan parameters ayaa dejiya: ku beddel miiska, ha jiidin. Booleans Tab-ka Boolean wuxuu ka jaraa solid-ka labaad solid-ka koowaad, ama wuu isku xidhaa. Natiijada Boolean waa la jari karaa ama mar kale la isku xidhi karaa. Solid la isticmaalay Boolean waxaa lagu sawiraa qayb ka mid ah oo keliya. Marka solid-ka labaad uu qariyo parameter Haa / Maya, kan koowaad waa la hayaa sidiisa; marka kan koowaad qarinayo, natiijadu waa la qariyaa. Calaamadda qorshaha Tab-ka Calaamadda qorshaha wuxuu sawiraa waxa qorshuhu muujiyo qoyskan halkii goynta solids-kiisa: xariiqyo, rectangles, goobo, xagal, poligon iyo qoraal, oo ku salaysan axes-ka qoyska. Qayb kasta waxay leedahay qalin (1–16, qaacido ama parameter Qalin), buuxin (ma jiro, adag, diagonal, isku-jarran, konkreet, insulation, dhulka, ama parameter Buuxin), muuqda marka qaacido, gobolka jarista millimitir kor ka sare saldhigga (qayb si buuxda loo sawiro goynta qorshaha ay ku jirto, si fiican hoos uga hoosaysa, si dashed ka sarreysa: kabbaad kor ka goynta wuxuu muujinayaa dashed), heerka faahfaahinta, iyo ku celinta. Qoraalku wuxuu magacaabi karaa parameters sida {Name}. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa: Goynta solids-ka wuxuu hayaa qorshaha oo jarayo solids-ka halka calaamaddu ku sii jirto qoyska. Barnaamijyada kale waxay calaamadda akhrinayaan sida footprint-ka qoyska (xariiqyo iyo qaabab; qoraalku wuxuu ku sii jiraa BimCraft oo keliya). Qoysaska gudaha ku jira Tab-ka Qoysaska gudaha ku jira wuxuu qoys kale gudaha ku dhigayaa: lug miis ku jirta, gacan albaab ku jirta. Dooro qoyska, kadibna meesha uu ku yaal (x, y, z), inta uu rogmo (rubuc-wareeg oo keliya: 0, 90, 180, 270), goorta uu muuqdo, iyo qiyamka uu helo, mid kasta safka: Height = Height - 40. Markii qoyska gudaha la kaydiyo, qoyskan waa la sawiraa mar kale; qoys ay haysato qoys kale looma tirtiri karo; qoys isagu naftiisa ma hayn karo, xataa iyada oo marineysa qoys kale, isku-dhididda waxay ku joogsataa afar heer. Dhibcaha taabta Dhibic taabta waa dhibic ama geesha aad jiidto si aad u beddesho parameter. Tab-ka Dhibcaha taabta ku dar mid, dooro jihada uu ku jiido iyo parameter-ka tirada uu beddelo, oo ku qor booskiisa isla qaacidooyinka solids-ka. Preview-ka, dooro Dhibcaha taabta hoosta handles si aad u jiido. Elementi la dhigay qorshaha (dooro Dooro) dhibcaha x iyo y waxay u muuqdaan sida gacanta; jiid mid, elementigu wuxuu qaataa cabbirka dhibicdaas dhigaysa, iyada oo marinaya qaacidooyinka ku dhex jira; hal Undo ayaa celinaysa. Dhibic taabta ma beddeli karto parameter la wada maamulo, Haa / Maya ama erey. Muuqaalka 3D isla dhibcahaas waxay u muuqdaan sida gacmo ku dhex jira elementiga la doortay, dhibcaha kor-hoos (axis z) ayaa halkaas muuqda, taasoo qorshuhu aan sawiri karin. Dooro elementiga, jiid gacan dhinaceeda axis-ka, oo sii dheji: elementigu wuxuu qaataa cabbirka dhibicdaas dhigaysa, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Gacmaha waa la qariyaa marka sanduuqa qaybta uu shidan yahay, sababta oo ah wuxuu isticmaalaa isla gacmaha. Xidhiidhiyayaal Qoysaska lagu dhigay dhulka (alaabta, qalabka iyo kuwa kale) waxay leeyihiin tab-ka Xidhiidhiyayaal: dhibcaha tuubada ama tuubada hawada ay ku biirayaan elementiga, sida wadiga iyo godka ee biyo-qabowga iyo biyo-dhigga. Riix Ku dar xidhiidhiye oo dejiso: Nooca: tuubo ama tuubada hawada, iyo Nidaamkeeda (biyo qabow, biyo-dhigga sanitary, hawo gelinta…). x, y iyo z: meesha uu yaal, axes-ka qoyska. Sida tirooyinka solid, mid kasta waxay noqon kartaa tiro ama qaacido parameters, si xidhiidhiyuhu u dhaqaaqo marka cabbirku beddelo. Jihada baxa: jihada tuubada ama tuubada hawada uga baxda, dhinac ka mid ah axes-ka qoyska (dhiigga hoosta wadiga waa Hoos). Cabbirka (mm): cabbirka magaca tuubada (DN) ama dhexroorka tuubada hawada ee wareega ah. Socod: Gal xidhiidhiyaha la quudiyo (tusaale wadiga), Bax kan biyaha wax dhiiga. Preview-ka wuxuu xidhiidhiye kasta u sawiraa wareeg oo fallaad ku jirta jihada baxa. Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha ma lahan xidhiidhiyayaal. Qalab biyo-dhigga ah, dooro waa kee hoos Qalabka biyo-dhigga (musqulka, lavatory, saxanka jikada, shower, tuubada dharka). Qalabyada bilowga ah horay ayay u sheegaan. Qalab kasta oo qoysaska laga dhigo wuxuu helaa xidhiidhiyayaashiisa sida portal-ka IFC, waxaana dib loo sameeyaa marka cabbirka uu beddelo ama qoyska la kaydiyo. Barnaamijyada akhrinaya nidaamyada IFC waxay arkaan meesha tuubada ama tuubada hawada ay ku haboon tahay. Preview iyo gacmahooda Preview-ka waa qoyska oo loo qoray sida IFC, isla koodka uu moodeelka ku kaydiyo, oo dib loo sawiray. Waxa aad aragto waa waxa barnaamijyada kale helaan. Hoosteeda, Cabbirka la muujiyo wuxuu dejiyaa qiyamka parameters-ka preview-ku isticmaalo. Gacmaha waa dhibcaha preview-ka: Cabbirka wuxuu muujiyaa gacmo Ballac, Qoto dheer iyo Dherer; Solid-ka la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa mid dhinac kasta oo solid-ka la doortay. Jiid gacan: dusha ay parameter dejiso, cabbirka la muujiyo wuu beddelmaa (qaacidooyinka qoyska way ilaaliyaan); dusha ay tiro la qoray dejiso, tirada ayaa beddelmaysa. Kaydinta Kaydi qoyska wuxuu hubiyaa qoyska, kadibna wuu dib u sawiraa cabbir kasta oo qoyska ah wuuna dib u sameeyaa elementi kasta, hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Haddii cabbir aan lagu sawiri karin isbeddelkaas (tusaale solid-ka uu ballac eber ahaan ku yaali doono cabbirkaas), wax lama kaydiyo, tafatiraha wuxuu sheegaa cabbirka. Haddii qof kale uu kaydiyey qoyskii isla markaa tafatirkaaga furnaa (Live TeamWork ama daaqad kale), Kaydi qoyska wuu diidaa oo wuu sheegaa, halkii uu ku beddeli lahaa isbeddelkiisa kan aad. Xir tafatiraha, mar kale fur qoyska si aad isbeddelkooda u aragto, oo mar kale samee kaaga. Geometry-ga waxa loo kaydiyaa sida solids-ka IFC: extrusions, revolves, diskiyada sweep-ka, iyo natiijooyinka Boolean. Waxba laguma beddelo liis xagal saddex-geesood ah, sidaas darteed faylashu way yaraadaan, barnaamijyada kale waxay akhrin karaan qaababka sida qaabab. Profiles-ka leh arc waxay kaydiyaan arc-yada IFC4 ku jira; IFC2X3 ma lahan arc-yo profile-ka ku jira, halkaasna arc-yada waxaa loo kaydiyaa qaybo toos ah oo gaaban. See also Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"split-vrf-fan-coils","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Unitiyada split, VRF iyo fan coil","summary":"Dhig unitiyada gudaha ee darbi, kaasad iyo tuubo-duct, unitiyada dibada ee single-split iyo VRF, isku-xidhka refnet iyo fan coil 2-pipe ama 4-pipe, mid walba oo leh xidhiidhkiisa refrigerant, biyo, condensate iyo duct, oo sawir line set-yada u dhexeeya oo cabirkooda ka qaad miis aad beddeli karto.","section":"tasks","order":38,"keywords":["split","mini split","minisplit","multi split","vrf","vrv","variable refrigerant flow","heat pump","indoor unit","outdoor unit","condensing unit","wall mounted","high wall","cassette","ducted","concealed","fan coil","fcu","2-pipe","4-pipe","refnet","branch joint","y joint","line set","lineset","refrigerant","liquid line","gas line","suction line","acr","copper","condensate","hvac","ifcunitaryequipment","splitsystem","ifcpipefitting"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"dhig-unit","text":"Dhig unit","level":2},{"id":"sawir-line-set","text":"Sawir line set","level":2},{"id":"beddel-miiska-line-set-ka","text":"Beddel miiska line set-ka","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig unitiyada nidaamka split, multi-split ama VRF iyo fan coil-kiisa moodelka, kadibna ku xidh line set-yada: khad dareere iyo khad gaas oo naxaas ACR ah, oo lagu xiro dekedaha unitiyada. Unitiyadu waxay u shaqeeyaan sida qaybaha kale ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EMEP equipment with ports\u003C/a\u003E: isla bar-ka, Sifooyinka, dekedaha iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003Econnections\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa qalab qoraal-diyaarin iyo isku-duubid. Unitiyadu waa qaabab guud ah oo cabbirkooda ku salaysan qiimayaasha aad qortid, ma aha alaabta wax soo saare gaar ah. Cabbirrada tuubooyinkooda waxay ka yimaadaan miis ah \u003Cstrong\u003Etusaale caadi ah\u003C/strong\u003E oo loogu talagalay qalabka R410A iyo R32, ma aha wax soo saare gaar ah: buugga rakibidda ee soo saaraha unitiga ayaa go&#039;aaya cabbirrada dhabta ah, iyo xariiqyada dheer ama farqiga sare ee dhererka ayaa beddelaya. Beddel miiska, ama ku qor cabbirrada, si ay ula mid noqdaan unitiyada aad isticmaasho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-unit\"\u003EDhig unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca oo dejiso qiimayaashiisa:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad dejisaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDekedaheeda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga gudaha ee split, darbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, dherer, qoto, joog, cabbirka condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erefrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate (dhinaca midig, ee darbiga u dhow)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga gudaha ee split, kaasad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, panel, jidh, joog, cabbirka condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erefrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate (hal dhinac, ee sare u dhow)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga gudaha ee split, duct\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, dherer, ballac, joog, furitaanka bixinta iyo soo celinta, cabbirka condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Educt bixin ka baxda, duct soo celin ku gala, refrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga dibada ee split\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, ballac, qoto, joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erefrigerant dareere iyo gaas (dhinaca midig)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga dibada ee VRF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, ballac, qoto, joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erefrigerant dareere iyo gaas (hore, hoose)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xidhka refnet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhadka dareeraha ama gaasta, culeyska laan kasta, tuubada laba dhamaadka kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egalka, laanta A, laanta B\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnitiga fan coil\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2-pipe ama 4-pipe, dherer, ballac, joog, furitaanka bixinta iyo soo celinta, tuubada coil-ka iyo nidaamka, tuubada kulaylka, cabbirka condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Educt bixin ka baxda, duct soo celin ku gala, coil gal iyo bax, kulayl gal iyo bax (4-pipe), biyo-dhigista condensate\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EAt\u003C/strong\u003E: joogga saldhigga unitiga ka sarreeya heerka. Saldhigga unitiga darbiga waa dhinaca hoose (inta badan 2100 mm); kan kaasadda waa wejigeeda ee saqafka; kan refnet-ka waa joogga xariiqda dhexe ee tuubadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha uu tagayo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu leexiyaa 90°).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAwoodda\u003C/strong\u003E waa awoodda qaboojinta magaca ah ee unitiga, kW, oo Btu/h ayaa ku yaal dhinacaas. Haddii \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka dareeraha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka gaasta\u003C/strong\u003E lagu tago \u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska\u003C/strong\u003E, xidhiidhyada unitiga waxay qaadanayaan cabbirrada miiska awoodda hadda; dooro cabbir tuubo si aad u isticmaasho kan unitigaaga. Galka refnet-ka waxaa lagu cabbiraa laanta labadaba wadajir, laan kasta waxaa lagu cabbiraa culaysheeda ay leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDekedaha refrigerant-ka waxay shaqeeyaan labada jiho (pompe kulayl wuxuu shaqeeyaa jihada kasta). Biyo-dhigista condensate waa cabbir tuubo oo siddeed la mid ah biyo-dhigista kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-line-set\"\u003ESawir line set\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro laba qaybood (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix kan labaad): unit dibada iyo unit gudaha (single split), ama unit dibada iyo refnet, refnet iyo unit gudaha, ama laba refnet (VRF).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine set\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu sawiraa socodka dareeraha iyo gaasta u dhexeeya dekedahooda xor ah, laga bilaabo dekad kasta ilaa heer wadaag ah, oo naxaas ACR ah ku jira (coil la qalajiyey ilaa 1-5/8 in, tuubo la jiidey ka weyn), oo waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. Refnet-ku wuxuu qaataa khadkiisa keliya: galka wuxuu ka galaa dhinaca dibada, laanta ka baxaa oo u socota unitiyada gudaha. Socod kasta waxay qaadataa cabbirka dhamaadkiisa hoose (unitiga gudaha, ama galka refnet-ka); meesha dhamaadka kale ee dekeddiisa ay tahay cabbir kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck connections\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo bandhigta, halkaas ayaa reducer-ku ku qasban yahay. Labo unit gudaha waxay u baahan yihiin refnet u dhexeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocodyada markii dambe u guuri sida tuubo kasta; dhamaadkooda waxay sii joogaan dekedaha. Socodyada u dhexeeya dabaqyada waxaa lagu sawiraa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipe\u003C/span\u003E: tuubo laga bilaabo dekedda refrigerant-ka waxay qaadataa nidaamkeeda, naxaaska ACR iyo cabbirkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-miiska-line-set-ka\"\u003EBeddel miiska line set-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine set sizes\u003C/span\u003E. Safka kasta wuxuu sheegaa: ilaa awoodan (kW), tuubadan dareeraha iyo tuubadan gaasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDareere\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGaas\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.8 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ6.35 (1/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5.6 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ6.35 (1/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ12.7 (1/2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ15.88 (5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E22.4 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E33 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ9.52 (3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ22.22 (7/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E47 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ12.7 (1/2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ28.58 (1-1/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E71 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ15.88 (5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ28.58 (1-1/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E104 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ34.92 (1-3/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E180 kW\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ19.05 (3/4&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EØ41.28 (1-5/8&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qiimayaasha bilowga ah, ee caadiga ah. Beddel safka, ku dar ama ka saar safafka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E: miiska waxaa lagu hayaa moodelka, sidaas darteed qof kasta oo ku shaqeeya faylka wuxuu isticmaalaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo celisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the typical values\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celiyaa miiska bilowga ah. Tuubooyinka hore loo dhigay waxay sii hayn dekedahooda ilaa aad beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnitiyada gudaha iyo dibada ee nidaamyada split iyo VRF waa IfcUnitaryEquipment oo nooca SPLITSYSTEM, nooca objectka ayaa sheegaya kan ah (&quot;Split indoor unit, wall-mounted&quot;, &quot;Split indoor unit, ceiling cassette&quot;, &quot;Split indoor unit, ducted&quot;, &quot;Split outdoor unit&quot;, &quot;VRF outdoor unit&quot;). Fan coil waa IfcUnitaryEquipment oo nooca AIRHANDLER ah, nooca objectka &quot;Fan coil unit&quot;: IFC4 ma leh nooc fan coil ah, fan, coil iyo filter ee qol keliya waxay ku habboon yihiin AIRHANDLER. Isku-xidhka refnet waa IfcPipeFitting oo nooca JUNCTION ah (&quot;Refnet joint&quot;). Faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan IfcEnergyConversionDevice iyo IfcFlowFitting oo nooacyada u dhigma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDekedaha iyo socodyada refrigerant-ka waxay ku jiraan nidaamyada REFRIGERATION (mid khadyada dareeraha, mid khadyada gaasta), condensate-na nidaamka DRAINAGE. Socodyada ACR waxaa lagu magacaabaa dhexroorka dibadda. Miiska line set-ka waa property set CadCraft_HvacLineSets ee mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EMEP equipment with ports\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EConnect pipes and ducts to equipment\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003EPipes and ducts\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Dhig unitiyada nidaamka split, multi-split ama VRF iyo fan coil-kiisa moodelka, kadibna ku xidh line set-yada: khad dareere iyo khad gaas oo naxaas ACR ah, oo lagu xiro dekedaha unitiyada. Unitiyadu waxay u shaqeeyaan sida qaybaha kale ee MEP equipment with ports: isla bar-ka, Sifooyinka, dekedaha iyo connections. Tani waa qalab qoraal-diyaarin iyo isku-duubid. Unitiyadu waa qaabab guud ah oo cabbirkooda ku salaysan qiimayaasha aad qortid, ma aha alaabta wax soo saare gaar ah. Cabbirrada tuubooyinkooda waxay ka yimaadaan miis ah tusaale caadi ah oo loogu talagalay qalabka R410A iyo R32, ma aha wax soo saare gaar ah: buugga rakibidda ee soo saaraha unitiga ayaa go'aaya cabbirrada dhabta ah, iyo xariiqyada dheer ama farqiga sare ee dhererka ayaa beddelaya. Beddel miiska, ama ku qor cabbirrada, si ay ula mid noqdaan unitiyada aad isticmaasho. Dhig unit Shid Draw, fur Build oo dooro Equipment. Dooro nooca oo dejiso qiimayaashiisa: Nooca Waxaad dejisaa Dekedaheeda Unitiga gudaha ee split, darbi awoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, dherer, qoto, joog, cabbirka condensate refrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate (dhinaca midig, ee darbiga u dhow) Unitiga gudaha ee split, kaasad awoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, panel, jidh, joog, cabbirka condensate refrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate (hal dhinac, ee sare u dhow) Unitiga gudaha ee split, duct awoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, dherer, ballac, joog, furitaanka bixinta iyo soo celinta, cabbirka condensate duct bixin ka baxda, duct soo celin ku gala, refrigerant dareere iyo gaas, biyo-dhigista condensate Unitiga dibada ee split awoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, ballac, qoto, joog refrigerant dareere iyo gaas (dhinaca midig) Unitiga dibada ee VRF awoodda, khadka dareeraha iyo gaasta, ballac, qoto, joog refrigerant dareere iyo gaas (hore, hoose) Isku-xidhka refnet khadka dareeraha ama gaasta, culeyska laan kasta, tuubada laba dhamaadka kasta galka, laanta A, laanta B Unitiga fan coil 2-pipe ama 4-pipe, dherer, ballac, joog, furitaanka bixinta iyo soo celinta, tuubada coil-ka iyo nidaamka, tuubada kulaylka, cabbirka condensate duct bixin ka baxda, duct soo celin ku gala, coil gal iyo bax, kulayl gal iyo bax (4-pipe), biyo-dhigista condensate Deji At: joogga saldhigga unitiga ka sarreeya heerka. Saldhigga unitiga darbiga waa dhinaca hoose (inta badan 2100 mm); kan kaasadda waa wejigeeda ee saqafka; kan refnet-ka waa joogga xariiqda dhexe ee tuubadiisa. Riix meesha uu tagayo (R wuxuu leexiyaa 90°). Awoodda waa awoodda qaboojinta magaca ah ee unitiga, kW, oo Btu/h ayaa ku yaal dhinacaas. Haddii Khadka dareeraha iyo Khadka gaasta lagu tago Miiska, xidhiidhyada unitiga waxay qaadanayaan cabbirrada miiska awoodda hadda; dooro cabbir tuubo si aad u isticmaasho kan unitigaaga. Galka refnet-ka waxaa lagu cabbiraa laanta labadaba wadajir, laan kasta waxaa lagu cabbiraa culaysheeda ay leedahay. Dekedaha refrigerant-ka waxay shaqeeyaan labada jiho (pompe kulayl wuxuu shaqeeyaa jihada kasta). Biyo-dhigista condensate waa cabbir tuubo oo siddeed la mid ah biyo-dhigista kale. Sawir line set Dooro laba qaybood (Shift+riix kan labaad): unit dibada iyo unit gudaha (single split), ama unit dibada iyo refnet, refnet iyo unit gudaha, ama laba refnet (VRF). Fur Build oo dooro Line set. BimCraft wuxuu sawiraa socodka dareeraha iyo gaasta u dhexeeya dekedahooda xor ah, laga bilaabo dekad kasta ilaa heer wadaag ah, oo naxaas ACR ah ku jira (coil la qalajiyey ilaa 1-5/8 in, tuubo la jiidey ka weyn), oo waa hal tallaabo oo Undo. Refnet-ku wuxuu qaataa khadkiisa keliya: galka wuxuu ka galaa dhinaca dibada, laanta ka baxaa oo u socota unitiyada gudaha. Socod kasta waxay qaadataa cabbirka dhamaadkiisa hoose (unitiga gudaha, ama galka refnet-ka); meesha dhamaadka kale ee dekeddiisa ay tahay cabbir kale, Check connections ayaa soo bandhigta, halkaas ayaa reducer-ku ku qasban yahay. Labo unit gudaha waxay u baahan yihiin refnet u dhexeeya. Socodyada markii dambe u guuri sida tuubo kasta; dhamaadkooda waxay sii joogaan dekedaha. Socodyada u dhexeeya dabaqyada waxaa lagu sawiraa Pipe: tuubo laga bilaabo dekedda refrigerant-ka waxay qaadataa nidaamkeeda, naxaaska ACR iyo cabbirkeeda. Beddel miiska line set-ka Fur Build oo dooro Line set sizes. Safka kasta wuxuu sheegaa: ilaa awoodan (kW), tuubadan dareeraha iyo tuubadan gaasta. Ilaa Dareere Gaas 2.8 kW Ø6.35 (1/4\") Ø9.52 (3/8\") 5.6 kW Ø6.35 (1/4\") Ø12.7 (1/2\") 16 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø15.88 (5/8\") 22.4 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø19.05 (3/4\") 33 kW Ø9.52 (3/8\") Ø22.22 (7/8\") 47 kW Ø12.7 (1/2\") Ø28.58 (1-1/8\") 71 kW Ø15.88 (5/8\") Ø28.58 (1-1/8\") 104 kW Ø19.05 (3/4\") Ø34.92 (1-3/8\") 180 kW Ø19.05 (3/4\") Ø41.28 (1-5/8\") Kuwani waa qiimayaasha bilowga ah, ee caadiga ah. Beddel safka, ku dar ama ka saar safafka oo dooro Save: miiska waxaa lagu hayaa moodelka, sidaas darteed qof kasta oo ku shaqeeya faylka wuxuu isticmaalaa, Undo ayaa soo celisa. Use the typical values wuxuu soo celiyaa miiska bilowga ah. Tuubooyinka hore loo dhigay waxay sii hayn dekedahooda ilaa aad beddesho. Faylka IFC Unitiyada gudaha iyo dibada ee nidaamyada split iyo VRF waa IfcUnitaryEquipment oo nooca SPLITSYSTEM, nooca objectka ayaa sheegaya kan ah (\"Split indoor unit, wall-mounted\", \"Split indoor unit, ceiling cassette\", \"Split indoor unit, ducted\", \"Split outdoor unit\", \"VRF outdoor unit\"). Fan coil waa IfcUnitaryEquipment oo nooca AIRHANDLER ah, nooca objectka \"Fan coil unit\": IFC4 ma leh nooc fan coil ah, fan, coil iyo filter ee qol keliya waxay ku habboon yihiin AIRHANDLER. Isku-xidhka refnet waa IfcPipeFitting oo nooca JUNCTION ah (\"Refnet joint\"). Faylalka IFC2X3 waxay helaan IfcEnergyConversionDevice iyo IfcFlowFitting oo nooacyada u dhigma. Dekedaha iyo socodyada refrigerant-ka waxay ku jiraan nidaamyada REFRIGERATION (mid khadyada dareeraha, mid khadyada gaasta), condensate-na nidaamka DRAINAGE. Socodyada ACR waxaa lagu magacaabaa dhexroorka dibadda. Miiska line set-ka waa property set CadCraft_HvacLineSets ee mashruuca. Eeg sidoo kale: MEP equipment with ports, Connect pipes and ducts to equipment iyo Pipes and ducts.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"mep-against-structure","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaab-dhismeedka ka dhan ah","summary":"Ku socodsii isku-dhacyada diyaar ah ee tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee darbiyada, sabka, biimaha iyo tiirarka, hel socodyada ka dhow qaab-dhismeedka intuu ka fogaan lahaa dahaarkooda iyo meel bannaan, oo liis qaybaha ay u baahan yihiin furitaannada darbiyada iyo sabka ah sida CSV iyo BCF.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["mep","isku-dhac","hubinta isku-dhaca","isku-duubni","qaab-dhismeedka","darbiyada","sabka","biimaha","tiirarka","masaafada","isku-dhac jilicsan","dahaar","meel bannaan","furitaan","furitaannada","gelinta","xudunta","shaqada dhisaha","bcf","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhacyada-adag","text":"Isku-dhacyada adag","level":2},{"id":"masaafooyinka","text":"Masaafooyinka","level":2},{"id":"furitaanno-loo-baahan-yahay","text":"Furitaanno loo baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxaad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi in adeegyada ku habboon dhismaha: waxa galaya qaab-dhismeedka, waxa u dhow yaal, iyo halka darbiyada iyo sabka u baahan yihiin god. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta isku-dhaca\u003C/span\u003E panelka bidix; qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee qaab-dhismeedka ka dhan ah\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jirtaa hubinta caadiga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhacyada-adag\"\u003EIsku-dhacyada adag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada liis ee set-ka ah hadda waxay sidoo kale bixiyaan \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESabka iyo saqafyada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBiimaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-dhismeedka\u003C/strong\u003E (dhammaantood), oo leh tirada elementi kasta ku jirta. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada × qaab-dhismeedka\u003C/span\u003E si aad u doorato kan ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya oo aad u socodsiiso hubinta; ama dooro labada kasta adigu, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHubi isku-dhacyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masaafooyinka\"\u003EMasaafooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah adeegyada waxay u baahan yihiin meel ku wareegsan: dahaarkooda, iyo meel shaqeynta ama kolli (sleeve) u baahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii tuubo ama tuubada hawada ee socodka \u003Cstrong\u003Edahaarka\u003C/strong\u003E (thickness) Sifooyinka (wax lagama sawirin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha bannaan ee ku wareegsan tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada\u003C/strong\u003E (mm) Hubinta isku-dhaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi masaafooyinka\u003C/span\u003E: qeyb kasta oo ka dhow darbi, sab, biim ama tiir marka loo eego dahaarkiisa iyo meesha bannaan ayaa la liistaa masaafada uu leeyahay iyo masaafada uu rabo. Guji xariiq si aad u aragto labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQeyb darbi ama sab ku gudba waa furitaan, ma aha masaafo, sidaas darteed halkaas ayaa lagu liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furitaanno-loo-baahan-yahay\"\u003EFuritaanno loo baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaanno loo baahan yahay\u003C/span\u003E. Meesha dhexe ee xariiqa socodka ee darbi ama sab ku gudubtaa, BimCraft wuxuu liistaa furitaanka ay u baahan tahay: wareeg tuubada wareegga ah, haddii kale afar geesood, oo weyn sida cabbirka dibadda ee socodka oo ku daraysan laba jeer dahaarka iyo laba jeer meesha bannaan, oo dhexda ku taal meesha xariiqu gudbayo. Guji xariiq si aad u aragto socodka iyo darbiga ama sabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaannada CSV ahaan\u003C/span\u003E: hal xariiq furitaan kasta, oo leh socodka, cabbirkiisa iyo dahaarkiisa, cabbirka furitaanka, elementiga uu gudbayo iyo GlobalId-kiisa, dabaqa, X, Y iyo Z ee dhexda, iyo sida uu socodku u gudbo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuritaannada BCF arrimo ahaan\u003C/span\u003E: hal arrin furitaan kasta, oo leh kamarad u eegaya iyo socodka iyo elementiga la doortay, loogu talagalay barnaamijka injineerka qaab-dhismeedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba lama gooyo: furitaannadu waa liis loo sameeyay dadka cabbirkooda go&#039;aaminaya. Meesha bannaan waa mid adigu qortaa; ma jiro xeer sheegaya inta furitaanku weyn tahay. Biimaha iyo tiirarku waa isku-dhac, ma aha furitaan: haddii tuubo laga gudbi karo midkood waa go&#039;aanka injineerka qaab-dhismeedka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxaad samaynaysaa Hubi in adeegyada ku habboon dhismaha: waxa galaya qaab-dhismeedka, waxa u dhow yaal, iyo halka darbiyada iyo sabka u baahan yihiin god. Fur Hubinta isku-dhaca panelka bidix; qaybta Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee qaab-dhismeedka ka dhan ah waxay ku jirtaa hubinta caadiga ah. Isku-dhacyada adag Labada liis ee set-ka ah hadda waxay sidoo kale bixiyaan Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada, Darbiyada, Sabka iyo saqafyada, Biimaha, Tiirarka iyo Qaab-dhismeedka (dhammaantood), oo leh tirada elementi kasta ku jirta. Guji Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada × qaab-dhismeedka si aad u doorato kan ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya oo aad u socodsiiso hubinta; ama dooro labada kasta adigu, kadibna guji Bilow. Eeg Hubi isku-dhacyada. Masaafooyinka Qaar ka mid ah adeegyada waxay u baahan yihiin meel ku wareegsan: dahaarkooda, iyo meel shaqeynta ama kolli (sleeve) u baahan. Ku sii tuubo ama tuubada hawada ee socodka dahaarka (thickness) Sifooyinka (wax lagama sawirin). Ku qor Meesha bannaan ee ku wareegsan tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada (mm) Hubinta isku-dhaca. Guji Hubi masaafooyinka: qeyb kasta oo ka dhow darbi, sab, biim ama tiir marka loo eego dahaarkiisa iyo meesha bannaan ayaa la liistaa masaafada uu leeyahay iyo masaafada uu rabo. Guji xariiq si aad u aragto labadaba. Qeyb darbi ama sab ku gudba waa furitaan, ma aha masaafo, sidaas darteed halkaas ayaa lagu liistaa. Furitaanno loo baahan yahay Guji Furitaanno loo baahan yahay. Meesha dhexe ee xariiqa socodka ee darbi ama sab ku gudubtaa, BimCraft wuxuu liistaa furitaanka ay u baahan tahay: wareeg tuubada wareegga ah, haddii kale afar geesood, oo weyn sida cabbirka dibadda ee socodka oo ku daraysan laba jeer dahaarka iyo laba jeer meesha bannaan, oo dhexda ku taal meesha xariiqu gudbayo. Guji xariiq si aad u aragto socodka iyo darbiga ama sabka. Furitaannada CSV ahaan: hal xariiq furitaan kasta, oo leh socodka, cabbirkiisa iyo dahaarkiisa, cabbirka furitaanka, elementiga uu gudbayo iyo GlobalId-kiisa, dabaqa, X, Y iyo Z ee dhexda, iyo sida uu socodku u gudbo. Furitaannada BCF arrimo ahaan: hal arrin furitaan kasta, oo leh kamarad u eegaya iyo socodka iyo elementiga la doortay, loogu talagalay barnaamijka injineerka qaab-dhismeedka. Waxba lama gooyo: furitaannadu waa liis loo sameeyay dadka cabbirkooda go'aaminaya. Meesha bannaan waa mid adigu qortaa; ma jiro xeer sheegaya inta furitaanku weyn tahay. Biimaha iyo tiirarku waa isku-dhac, ma aha furitaan: haddii tuubo laga gudbi karo midkood waa go'aanka injineerka qaab-dhismeedka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"embodied-carbon-and-5d-cost","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Karbonka ku jira iyo kharashka jadwalka","summary":"Ku dar karbonka ku jira moodeelka oo ka yimid miis caamil ah oo furan oo la tafatiri karo, kuna kala firi qiimayaasha jadwalka 4D kharash iyo khad dhaqaale. Labaduba waxay ka bilaabmaan qiyamka aad ku qortay ama soo dhoofisay.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["karbon ku jira","karbon","co2","kgco2e","hawo-sii-deynta","miiska caamilka","epd","5d","kharash","dhaqaale","khadka dhaqaalaha","khadka S","kharashka jadwalka","qiimayaasha","qiimaha xisaabinta qadarka"],"headings":[{"id":"karbonka-ku-jira","text":"Karbonka ku jira","level":2},{"id":"kharashka-jadwalka-4d","text":"Kharashka jadwalka 4D","level":2},{"id":"lacagta","text":"Lacagta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"karbonka-ku-jira\"\u003EKarbonka ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EKarbonka\u003C/strong\u003E. Qadarka qalab kasta (mugga, bedka ama dhererka) waxaa lagu dhufanayaa caamil ka mid ah miiska, sida moodulka nolosha: marxaladda wax-soo-saarka waa loo baahan yahay; gaadiidka iyo qashinka waa ikhtiyaari. Wadarta waxaa la helaa agabka, fasalka iyo dabaqa, iyo mitir laba jibbaaran oo dabaq kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska caamilku waa kaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Safafka uu BimCraft ku imaanayo waa qiyamo caadi ah oo bilow ah, oo qadarkoodu sax maahan. Ma ka soo baxayo kayd xog, waxaana lagu calaamadeeyay inaysan la hubin, waana in lagu beddelo isha aad isticmaasho (EPD, kaydka qaranka, ama tirooyinka shirkadaada). Wax ka beddel safafka qaybta, ama soo dhoofi oo dhoofi miiska CSV ama JSON. Safafka aad ku darto waxay ka dhex dhigaan safka bilowga ah ee isla aqoonsiga. Miiska waxaa lagu kaydiyaa moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka aan lagu helin ama aan qadar lahayn waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha inay eber ahaan u tirtirmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kharashka-jadwalka-4d\"\u003EKharashka jadwalka 4D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EKharashka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal jadwalka 4D. Qiimayaal geli (ku qor, soo dhoofi CSV ama JSON, ama keen khadadka TakeoffCraft), ku dhig qiime kasta agabka moodeelka ereyo furaha ah, wuxuuna qiimeeyaa qalabka shaqo kasta. Kharashka shaqo kasta waxaa loo kala firdhiyaa maalmaha bilowga ilaa dhammaadka (siman, ama culays hore ama dambe), qaybtuna waxay sawirtaa khadka dhaqaalaha ee wadarta ah maalin, toddobaad ama bil, iyo kharashka marxaladda iyo xirmada, iyo waxa loo qorsheeyay marka laga barbar dhigo waxa la dhisay taariikh kasta. Soo saar CSV. Waxba lama qiimeeyo ilaa aad qiimayaal siiso: ma jiraan kuwa la soo diro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lacagta\"\u003ELacagta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska qiimaha wuxuu sheegi karaa lacagta qiimayaashu ku jiraan (saddex xaraf, sida USD ama EUR). Qaybta 5D waxaa ku jira sanduuq uu geliyo, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka iyo qiimayaasha, JSON soo dhoofintuna way qaadaan. Miis hore loo sameeyay, ama meesha aad banaanka ka tagtay, ma leh lacag: kharashkiisa waxaa lagu muujiyaa USD, oo ah caadiga barnaamijka, qaybta iyo wadarta socota ayaa sidaas sheegta. Lacag lama beddelo midba midka kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Karbonka ku jira Fur qaybta Karbonka. Qadarka qalab kasta (mugga, bedka ama dhererka) waxaa lagu dhufanayaa caamil ka mid ah miiska, sida moodulka nolosha: marxaladda wax-soo-saarka waa loo baahan yahay; gaadiidka iyo qashinka waa ikhtiyaari. Wadarta waxaa la helaa agabka, fasalka iyo dabaqa, iyo mitir laba jibbaaran oo dabaq kasta. Miiska caamilku waa kaaga. Safafka uu BimCraft ku imaanayo waa qiyamo caadi ah oo bilow ah, oo qadarkoodu sax maahan. Ma ka soo baxayo kayd xog, waxaana lagu calaamadeeyay inaysan la hubin, waana in lagu beddelo isha aad isticmaasho (EPD, kaydka qaranka, ama tirooyinka shirkadaada). Wax ka beddel safafka qaybta, ama soo dhoofi oo dhoofi miiska CSV ama JSON. Safafka aad ku darto waxay ka dhex dhigaan safka bilowga ah ee isla aqoonsiga. Miiska waxaa lagu kaydiyaa moodeelka. Qalabka aan lagu helin ama aan qadar lahayn waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa Dhibaatooyin, ma aha inay eber ahaan u tirtirmaan. Kharashka jadwalka 4D Fur qaybta Kharashka oo ku taal jadwalka 4D. Qiimayaal geli (ku qor, soo dhoofi CSV ama JSON, ama keen khadadka TakeoffCraft), ku dhig qiime kasta agabka moodeelka ereyo furaha ah, wuxuuna qiimeeyaa qalabka shaqo kasta. Kharashka shaqo kasta waxaa loo kala firdhiyaa maalmaha bilowga ilaa dhammaadka (siman, ama culays hore ama dambe), qaybtuna waxay sawirtaa khadka dhaqaalaha ee wadarta ah maalin, toddobaad ama bil, iyo kharashka marxaladda iyo xirmada, iyo waxa loo qorsheeyay marka laga barbar dhigo waxa la dhisay taariikh kasta. Soo saar CSV. Waxba lama qiimeeyo ilaa aad qiimayaal siiso: ma jiraan kuwa la soo diro. Lacagta Miiska qiimaha wuxuu sheegi karaa lacagta qiimayaashu ku jiraan (saddex xaraf, sida USD ama EUR). Qaybta 5D waxaa ku jira sanduuq uu geliyo, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka iyo qiimayaasha, JSON soo dhoofintuna way qaadaan. Miis hore loo sameeyay, ama meesha aad banaanka ka tagtay, ma leh lacag: kharashkiisa waxaa lagu muujiyaa USD, oo ah caadiga barnaamijka, qaybta iyo wadarta socota ayaa sidaas sheegta. Lacag lama beddelo midba midka kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pipe-specs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qaababka tuubada, faalfooyinka, damperrada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha","summary":"Samee qaababkaaga tuubada (miisaska cabbirka oo leh agabka, xidhka iyo caarnimada), oo lagu kaydiyo faylka moodeelka; dhig faalfooyin, shaandhe iyo damperro xariiqyada; oo keenso faalfo ama qalab soo saare oo qoys ah oo leh dekedo xidhiidh.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["qaabka tuubada","qaababka tuubada","qaabka xariiqa","fasalka tuubada","tuubo gaar ah","miisaska cabbirka","tuubo","tuubo nadiif ah","bir alaab","jadwal","dibadda dhexroorka","qaro darbiga","dhexroorka gudaha","caarnimo","cadaadis qiimo","csv","json","soo geli","u dhoof","miis","xaashi","bpe","din","en 10357","en 10255","faalfo","faalfooyin","faalfo kala goysa","faalfo dheelitir","faalfo xakameyn","shaandhe","damper","damper mugga","damper dabka","oem","soo saare","qoys","qoysas","dekedo","xidhiidh","step","obj","gltf","ifc","radiyaatar","konvektor","kulaykeeye panel","qaybiye hawada","faafiye","dhegle"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-qaabka-tuubada","text":"Samee qaabka tuubada","level":2},{"id":"dib-ugu-isticmaal-qaab-moodeel-kale","text":"Dib ugu isticmaal qaab moodeel kale","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-bilowga","text":"Qaababka bilowga","level":2},{"id":"xariiq-ku-rasm-qaab","text":"Xariiq ku rasm qaab","level":2},{"id":"faalfooyin-shaandhe-iyo-damperro","text":"Faalfooyin, shaandhe iyo damperro","level":2},{"id":"moodeel-soo-saare-sida-qoys","text":"Moodeel soo saare sida qoys","level":2},{"id":"radiyaatarrada-iyo-konvektorrada","text":"Radiyaatarrada iyo konvektorrada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubo ku rasm qaabkaaga gaarka ah halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd miisaska dhismaha ee birta, naxaasta iyo plastikada, dul dhig faalfooyin iyo damperro xariiqyada, oo dhig moodeel soo saare oo leh dekedo ay tuubooyinku ku xidhmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab qabyo iyo isku-duubis. Qaabka tuubada wuxuu hayaa tirooyinka aad ku qortay ama aad soo gelisay: hubi miis kasta si waafaqsan heerkaaga mashruuca. Faalfooyinka, shaandheyada iyo damperrada ku dhex jira waa qaabab fudud oo lagu cabbiray xariiqda, ma aha dhererka soo saaraha ama heerka faalfaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-qaabka-tuubada\"\u003ESamee qaabka tuubada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka tuubada\u003C/span\u003E. Isla badhanka ayaa ku yaal qalabka Tuubo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, ama ka bilow fayl, koobiyeyn ama qaab bilow oo hoos ku qoran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor magaciisa, heerka ama tixraaca uu raaco, agabka iyo nooca dhammaadka ama isku xidhka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor hal safka cabbir kasta: magaca cabbirka, dibadda dhexroorka iyo darbiga, millimitir ku. Ku qor dhexroorka gudaha halkii darbiga haddii aad haysato taas: kan kale waa la buuxiyaa. DN, cadaadis qiimo iyo miisaanka waa ikhtiyaari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaari: caarnimada millimitir ku (xisaabta hoos u dhigista cadaadiska ayaa isticmaasha), dhumucda dhufashada ee xariiqyada cusub ka bilaabmaan, dhexroorka qallooca oo ah qayb ka mid ah dibadda dhexroorka, in qaabku leeyahay tee iyo reducer, iyo midab u gaar ah 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi adeegyada xariiqyadooda cusub ee ka bilaabmi doona qaabkan, tusaale ahaan biyo qabow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu kaydi moodelka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka moodeelka. Qof kasta oo furta faylka ayaa leh, Undo wuu ka soo celiyaa isbedelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab, ama mid ka mid ah cabbirradiisa, looma tirtiri karo intii xariiq lagu rasmeeyay. Isbedelka tirooyinka cabbir kasta ayaa dib u rasmeeya xariiqyada cabbirkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-ugu-isticmaal-qaab-moodeel-kale\"\u003EDib ugu isticmaal qaab moodeel kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoof .json\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la doortay fayl yar; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoof dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dhammaan qaababka moodeelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli fayl\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dib u akhrisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoof .csv\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska cabbirka xaashi xisaab. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli fayl\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale akhrisaa \u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaji safafka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaataa miis laga koobiyeeyay xaashi xisaab. Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka: \u003Ccode\u003ESize\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EOD\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EWall\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003EID\u003C/code\u003E), iyo ikhtiyaari \u003Ccode\u003EDN\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPressure\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EWeight\u003C/code\u003E. Hal safka cabbir kasta. Tirooyinku waa millimitir, inkastoo aad dooratid inch ama unugga oo qora unugiisa (\u003Ccode\u003E0.065 in\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-bilowga\"\u003EQaababka bilowga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar qaab bilow\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodeelkaaga ku darayaa mid ka mid ah kuwan, nuqul aad tafatiri karto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBilow\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EASME BPE tube\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1/4&quot; ilaa 6&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10357 series A tube (DIN 11850 row 2)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN10 ilaa DN200\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10255 steel tube, medium series\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN15 ilaa DN150\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEN 10255 steel tube, heavy series\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDN15 ilaa DN125\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaskan waa dibadda dhexroorka iyo darbiyada ay laba ama in ka badan bogagga bixiyeyaasha ee la daabacay ku daabacaan heerka, oo ay isku raacaan. Heerarka laftooda looma soo qaadin. Cabbirrada uu hal bog keliya siiyay waa laga reebay. Bilow kasta wuxuu muujiyaa bogagga ilaha ah, wuxuuna ku calaamadaysan yahay &quot;hubi heerkaaga mashruuca&quot;. Caarnimo, cadaadis qiimo ama miisaan lama siin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiq-ku-rasm-qaab\"\u003EXariiq ku rasm qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E. Xariiq ku bilaabma adeeg aad ku calaamaysay qaab, wuxuu ku bilaabmaa qaabkaas. Xariiq kasta oo kale, dooro qaabka liiska agabka: qaababka waxa lagu liistaa agabka dhismaha ka dib sida &quot;Qaab: magac&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska cabbirku hadda wuxuu haysaa cabbirrada qaabkaas oo keliya. Dooro mid oo xariiqda rasm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad xariiq ugu wareejiso qaab markii dambe, dooro oo beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E ee Properties. Cabbirkeedu wuxuu noqonayaa cabbirka qaabka ugu dhow ee dibadda dhexroorka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka IFC tuubadu waxay leedahay magaca qaabka, heerka, agabka, xidhka iyo cabbirrada (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_PipeSpec\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EPset_PipeSegmentTypeCommon\u003C/code\u003E, tuubada iyo nooceeda).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXisaabaha cabbirka iyo hoos u dhigista cadaadiska waxay akhriyaan dhexroorka gudaha ee qaabka. Marka qaabku caarnimo leeyahay, xoogga xariiqda waxa lagu xisaabiyaa Darcy-Weisbach; haddii kale, caadiga xisaabta ayaa la isticmaalaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faalfooyin-shaandhe-iyo-damperro\"\u003EFaalfooyin, shaandhe iyo damperro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaalfo\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro nooca bar-ka: gate, ball, butterfly, globe, check, balancing ama control valve, ama shaandhe, xariiqyada; damper mugga ama damper dabka, tuubada hawada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xariiqda meesha ay tagayso. Xariiqda waa la jarayaa agteeda, labada dhinac ayay isku xidhan yihiin. Waxay qaadaa cabbirka xariiqda oo waxay la socotaa xariiqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties of the run wuxuu liistaa mid kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E; xariiqda mar kale ayaa isku xidhma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXisaabta hoos u dhigista cadaadiska waxay tirinta khasaaraha fitting-ka faalfaha gate, ball, globe iyo check kaliya. Noocyada kale, damperrada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha khasaare ma darayaan halkaas: u oggolow kaaga hubinta. Waxa lagu tiriyaa jadwalka \u003Cstrong\u003EFittings iyo faalfooyin\u003C/strong\u003E iyo takeoff-ka, waxaana lagu qoraa IFC sida faalfo, shaandhe (strainer) iyo damperro leh laba dekedo oo isku xidhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodeel-soo-saare-sida-qoys\"\u003EMoodeel soo saare sida qoys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoysaska\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli moodeel\u003C/span\u003E. Waxa la akhriyaa IFC, STEP, OBJ, STL, glTF iyo faylalka shayga Maktabadda. Faylalka OBJ iyo STL, marka hore deji unitiyada faylka iyo axis-ka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa dekedaha, ku qor magaca, soo saaraha iyo lambarka moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro in ay tahay \u003Cstrong\u003Exariiq saaran\u003C/strong\u003E (faalfo, shaandhe ama damper) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo sida loo qoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiso dekedaheeda. Mid kasta wuxuu leeyahay magac, tuubo ama tuubada hawada, adeegga, cabbirka millimitir (dibadda dhexroorka tuubada), cabbirka magaca sida qaabkaaga u magacaabo, nooca dhammaadka, booska iyo jihada uu u jeedo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWajiga dushiisa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dekedda dhigaa bartamaha dhinac kasta oo sanduuqa moodeelka ah. Muuqaalka sare ee yar wuxuu muujiyaa dekedaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qoyska moodeelka gudihiisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoys xariiq saaran wuxuu u baahan yahay laba dekedood oo isu jeeda ka fogaysa oo ku yaal hal khad. Dooro liiska qalabka Faalfo oo guji xariiq: waa lagu dhigi doonaa dhererkiisa, tuubooyinkuna dekedahiisa ayay ku xidhmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoys lama fidiyo. Haddii dekedihiisu aanay ahayn cabbirka xariiqda, waa lagu sheegi doonaa markaad dhigayso, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi xidhiidhka\u003C/span\u003E ayaa liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoyska qalabka waxa lagu dhigaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E, nooca \u003Cstrong\u003Eqoyska soo saaraha\u003C/strong\u003E. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dekedahiisa ayay ku xidhmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dejiso shay Maktabad ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoyska dekedahiisa ku kaydiyaa fayl aad u gudbin karto Maktabadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"radiyaatarrada-iyo-konvektorrada\"\u003ERadiyaatarrada iyo konvektorrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ERadiyaatar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKonvektor / kulaykeeye panel\u003C/strong\u003E: jidh guud oo leh xidhiidh socod iyo soo celin biyo kulaynta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EQalabka MEP ee dekedaha leh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Tuubo ku rasm qaabkaaga gaarka ah halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd miisaska dhismaha ee birta, naxaasta iyo plastikada, dul dhig faalfooyin iyo damperro xariiqyada, oo dhig moodeel soo saare oo leh dekedo ay tuubooyinku ku xidhmaan. Qalab qabyo iyo isku-duubis. Qaabka tuubada wuxuu hayaa tirooyinka aad ku qortay ama aad soo gelisay: hubi miis kasta si waafaqsan heerkaaga mashruuca. Faalfooyinka, shaandheyada iyo damperrada ku dhex jira waa qaabab fudud oo lagu cabbiray xariiqda, ma aha dhererka soo saaraha ama heerka faalfaha. Samee qaabka tuubada Shid Sawir, fur Dhismaha oo dooro Qaababka tuubada. Isla badhanka ayaa ku yaal qalabka Tuubo. Dooro Cusub, ama ka bilow fayl, koobiyeyn ama qaab bilow oo hoos ku qoran. Ku qor magaciisa, heerka ama tixraaca uu raaco, agabka iyo nooca dhammaadka ama isku xidhka. Ku qor hal safka cabbir kasta: magaca cabbirka, dibadda dhexroorka iyo darbiga, millimitir ku. Ku qor dhexroorka gudaha halkii darbiga haddii aad haysato taas: kan kale waa la buuxiyaa. DN, cadaadis qiimo iyo miisaanka waa ikhtiyaari. Ikhtiyaari: caarnimada millimitir ku (xisaabta hoos u dhigista cadaadiska ayaa isticmaasha), dhumucda dhufashada ee xariiqyada cusub ka bilaabmaan, dhexroorka qallooca oo ah qayb ka mid ah dibadda dhexroorka, in qaabku leeyahay tee iyo reducer, iyo midab u gaar ah 3D. Calaamadi adeegyada xariiqyadooda cusub ee ka bilaabmi doona qaabkan, tusaale ahaan biyo qabow. Dooro Ku kaydi moodelka. Qaababka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka moodeelka. Qof kasta oo furta faylka ayaa leh, Undo wuu ka soo celiyaa isbedelka. Qaab, ama mid ka mid ah cabbirradiisa, looma tirtiri karo intii xariiq lagu rasmeeyay. Isbedelka tirooyinka cabbir kasta ayaa dib u rasmeeya xariiqyada cabbirkaas. Dib ugu isticmaal qaab moodeel kale U dhoof .json wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la doortay fayl yar; U dhoof dhammaan wuxuu kaydiyaa dhammaan qaababka moodeelka. Soo geli fayl ayaa dib u akhrisa. U dhoof .csv wuxuu kaydiyaa miiska cabbirka xaashi xisaab. Soo geli fayl wuxuu sidoo kale akhrisaa .csv. Ku dhaji safafka wuxuu qaataa miis laga koobiyeeyay xaashi xisaab. Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa tiirarka: Size, OD iyo Wall (ama ID), iyo ikhtiyaari DN, Pressure, Weight. Hal safka cabbir kasta. Tirooyinku waa millimitir, inkastoo aad dooratid inch ama unugga oo qora unugiisa (0.065 in). Qaababka bilowga Ku dar qaab bilow wuxuu moodeelkaaga ku darayaa mid ka mid ah kuwan, nuqul aad tafatiri karto: Bilow Cabbirrada ASME BPE tube 1/4\" ilaa 6\" EN 10357 series A tube (DIN 11850 row 2) DN10 ilaa DN200 EN 10255 steel tube, medium series DN15 ilaa DN150 EN 10255 steel tube, heavy series DN15 ilaa DN125 Miisaskan waa dibadda dhexroorka iyo darbiyada ay laba ama in ka badan bogagga bixiyeyaasha ee la daabacay ku daabacaan heerka, oo ay isku raacaan. Heerarka laftooda looma soo qaadin. Cabbirrada uu hal bog keliya siiyay waa laga reebay. Bilow kasta wuxuu muujiyaa bogagga ilaha ah, wuxuuna ku calaamadaysan yahay \"hubi heerkaaga mashruuca\". Caarnimo, cadaadis qiimo ama miisaan lama siin. Xariiq ku rasm qaab Dooro Tuubo. Xariiq ku bilaabma adeeg aad ku calaamaysay qaab, wuxuu ku bilaabmaa qaabkaas. Xariiq kasta oo kale, dooro qaabka liiska agabka: qaababka waxa lagu liistaa agabka dhismaha ka dib sida \"Qaab: magac\". Liiska cabbirku hadda wuxuu haysaa cabbirrada qaabkaas oo keliya. Dooro mid oo xariiqda rasm. Si aad xariiq ugu wareejiso qaab markii dambe, dooro oo beddel Material ee Properties. Cabbirkeedu wuxuu noqonayaa cabbirka qaabka ugu dhow ee dibadda dhexroorka. Faylka IFC tuubadu waxay leedahay magaca qaabka, heerka, agabka, xidhka iyo cabbirrada (CadCraft_PipeSpec iyo Pset_PipeSegmentTypeCommon, tuubada iyo nooceeda). Xisaabaha cabbirka iyo hoos u dhigista cadaadiska waxay akhriyaan dhexroorka gudaha ee qaabka. Marka qaabku caarnimo leeyahay, xoogga xariiqda waxa lagu xisaabiyaa Darcy-Weisbach; haddii kale, caadiga xisaabta ayaa la isticmaalaa. Faalfooyin, shaandhe iyo damperro Dooro Faalfo oo dooro nooca bar-ka: gate, ball, butterfly, globe, check, balancing ama control valve, ama shaandhe, xariiqyada; damper mugga ama damper dabka, tuubada hawada. Guji xariiqda meesha ay tagayso. Xariiqda waa la jarayaa agteeda, labada dhinac ayay isku xidhan yihiin. Waxay qaadaa cabbirka xariiqda oo waxay la socotaa xariiqda. Properties of the run wuxuu liistaa mid kasta oo leh Ka saar; xariiqda mar kale ayaa isku xidhma. Xisaabta hoos u dhigista cadaadiska waxay tirinta khasaaraha fitting-ka faalfaha gate, ball, globe iyo check kaliya. Noocyada kale, damperrada iyo qoysaska soo saaraha khasaare ma darayaan halkaas: u oggolow kaaga hubinta. Waxa lagu tiriyaa jadwalka Fittings iyo faalfooyin iyo takeoff-ka, waxaana lagu qoraa IFC sida faalfo, shaandhe (strainer) iyo damperro leh laba dekedo oo isku xidhan. Moodeel soo saare sida qoys Fur Dhismaha oo dooro Qoysaska, kadibna Soo geli moodeel. Waxa la akhriyaa IFC, STEP, OBJ, STL, glTF iyo faylalka shayga Maktabadda. Faylalka OBJ iyo STL, marka hore deji unitiyada faylka iyo axis-ka sare. Sanduuqa dekedaha, ku qor magaca, soo saaraha iyo lambarka moodeelka. Dooro in ay tahay xariiq saaran (faalfo, shaandhe ama damper) ama Qalabka, iyo sida loo qoro. Siiso dekedaheeda. Mid kasta wuxuu leeyahay magac, tuubo ama tuubada hawada, adeegga, cabbirka millimitir (dibadda dhexroorka tuubada), cabbirka magaca sida qaabkaaga u magacaabo, nooca dhammaadka, booska iyo jihada uu u jeedo. Wajiga dushiisa wuxuu dekedda dhigaa bartamaha dhinac kasta oo sanduuqa moodeelka ah. Muuqaalka sare ee yar wuxuu muujiyaa dekedaha. Dooro Kaydi qoyska moodeelka gudihiisa. Qoys xariiq saaran wuxuu u baahan yahay laba dekedood oo isu jeeda ka fogaysa oo ku yaal hal khad. Dooro liiska qalabka Faalfo oo guji xariiq: waa lagu dhigi doonaa dhererkiisa, tuubooyinkuna dekedahiisa ayay ku xidhmaan. Qoys lama fidiyo. Haddii dekedihiisu aanay ahayn cabbirka xariiqda, waa lagu sheegi doonaa markaad dhigayso, Hubi xidhiidhka ayaa liistaa. Qoyska qalabka waxa lagu dhigaa Qalabka, nooca qoyska soo saaraha. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada dekedahiisa ayay ku xidhmaan. Soo dejiso shay Maktabad ahaan wuxuu qoyska dekedahiisa ku kaydiyaa fayl aad u gudbin karto Maktabadda. Radiyaatarrada iyo konvektorrada Qalabka wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay Radiyaatar iyo Konvektor / kulaykeeye panel: jidh guud oo leh xidhiidh socod iyo soo celin biyo kulaynta. Eeg Qalabka MEP ee dekedaha leh.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"edit-ifc-properties","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beddel sifooyinka IFC oo kaydi nuqul la tafatiray","summary":"Beddel magaca walxa, tag-ka, sharaxaadda ama qiimaha sifada, ka noqo, oo soo dejiso fayl IFC cusub iyada oo faylka asalka uu sidiisa yahay.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["tafatir","beddel","sifooyinka","cabbiraha","tag","magac","magac beddel","calaamad","kaydi sida","soo dejin","ka noqo","koobiyee","ifc","qor"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-beddeli-karto","text":"Waxa aad beddeli karto","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-qiimaha","text":"Noocyada qiimaha","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo","text":"Ka noqo","level":2},{"id":"sababta-tafatirkaagu-u-beddelo-hal-walax-oo-keliya","text":"Sababta tafatirkaagu u beddelo hal walax oo keliya","level":2},{"id":"digniinno-ka-hor-inta-aadan-lumin-shaqada","text":"Digniinno ka hor inta aadan lumin shaqada","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaxo xogta moodel IFC: magac beddel walxa, hagaaji tag-ka, beddel qiimaha sifada. Kadibna kaydi fayl IFC cusub oo isbeddellada ku jira. Faylka aad furtay waligiis lama taabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-beddeli-karto\"\u003EWaxa aad beddeli karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoob\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETafatir ah\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, Nooca walxa, Tag, Sharaxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimayaasha sifada keligood (qoraal, lambarro, Haa/Maya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka nooca (goobaha ku calaamadsan &quot;(type)&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, isbeddelkuna wuxuu khuseeyaa walxaha nooca oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca, GlobalId, Khadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyinka (dherer, meel, mug, tiro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiisaska, liiska doorashada iyo qiimayaasha dhowr qaybood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoomatari, meel, ku darid ama tirtirid walxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC oo riix walxa aad rabto inaad beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, riix qiimaha aad rabto inaad beddesho. Wuxuu noqdaa sanduuq qoraal. Qiime madhan wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cem\u003Eempty\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor qiimaha cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix meel kale si aad u hayso. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg qiimaha: hadda waa xarfo culus oo jeex buluug ah ayaa dhinacaa, taas oo calaamad u ah qiime la tafatiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E bidix: isbeddelka waxa lagu liistaa sida \u003Cem\u003Ewalxa\u003C/em\u003E: \u003Cem\u003Egoobta\u003C/em\u003E, qiimihii hore ilaa qiimaha cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu celi qiimayaasha kale ama walxaha kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E (waxay muujinaysaa inta isbeddel ee sugaysa, tusaale &quot;Save as IFC (3)&quot;), ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hel &quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagaca asalka\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc&quot; galkaaga soo dejinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadarka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Saved \u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E (edited).ifc with \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E changes (… bytes). Your original file is unchanged.&quot; Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E wuu madhnaanayaa, diyaar u ah wareegga xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-qiimaha\"\u003ENoocyada qiimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraal\u003C/strong\u003E: wax kasta oo aad qorto waa la ilaalinayaa sidaas oo kale. Nadiifinta Magaca, Nooca walxa, Tag ama Sharaxaad waxay ka saaraysaa qiimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELambarro\u003C/strong\u003E: qor lambar fudud, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E2.4\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1200\u003C/code\u003E, unugyada faylka. Ma jiro calaamad unug. Wax kale wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;Use a number.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELambarro oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E (tiro, lambar oo buuxa): &quot;Use a whole number.&quot; haddii aad qorto meel tobanle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHaa/Maya\u003C/strong\u003E: qiimuhu wuxuu noqdaa liis doorasho oo leh Haa iyo Maya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiime kasta wuxuu hayaa nooca IFC, sidaas darteed lambarku wuu sii ahaanayaa lambar, barnaamijyada kalena si sax ah ayay u akhrin doonaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E adigoo aan ku qorin goob.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu celi si aad uga noqoto isbeddello dheeraad ah. Ka noqo kasta wuxuu saaraa isbeddelka ugu cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta ka dib ma noqon kartid: ka dib kaydinta liiska wuu bilaabmaa mar kale. Faylka la kaydiyay wuxuu hayaa wax walba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sababta-tafatirkaagu-u-beddelo-hal-walax-oo-keliya\"\u003ESababta tafatirkaagu u beddelo hal walax oo keliya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada soo dhoofiya waxay kaydiyaan meel adiga oo wadaagaya xog. Hal goobo sifo ah ayaa laga yaabaa in ay wadaagaan labaatan albaab, hal qiime (&quot;Fire rating: 60 min&quot;) ayaa laga yaabaa in lagu liisto sagaal iyo sagaashan goobood. Haddii BimCraft uu si toos ah u beddelo qiimaha la wadaago, walx kasta oo wadaaga wuu isbeddelayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidaas darteed BimCraft wuu koobiyeeyaa ka hor inta uusan qorin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii goobta sifada aad tafatirayso ay la wadaago walxo kale, walxaaga wuxuu helaa nuqul gaar ah goobtaas, oo nuqulka keliya ayaa isbeddela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qiimuhu la wadaago goobo kale, goobtaada wuxuu helaa nuqul gaar ah qiimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxaha deriska ahi waxay sii hayaan xogtooda hore. Tan waxa loo yaqaan \u003Cem\u003Ecopy-on-write\u003C/em\u003E. Waxay ku daraysaa dhowr qoraal oo yar faylka, kuwaas oo barnaamijyada IFC oo dhan si caadi ah u akhriyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka nooca waa ka reeban tahay ujeed ahaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Goobta ku calaamadsan &quot;(type)&quot; waxay ka mid tahay nooca walxa, IFC-nina walxaha nooca kasta waxay ka akhriyaan halkaas. Beddelku wuxuu beddelaa nooca, sidaas darteed walxaha nooca oo dhan waxay muujinayaan qiimaha cusub. Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa tafatirkan &quot;(type)&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EBeddel sifada nooca walxaha nooca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"digniinno-ka-hor-inta-aadan-lumin-shaqada\"\u003EDigniinno ka hor inta aadan lumin shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur fayl kale markaad leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, waxay weydiisaa &quot;You have \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E unsaved changes to \u003Cem\u003Efile\u003C/em\u003E. Discard them?&quot; Riix Cancel si aad u sii shaqeyso, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib u soo rogida tab-ka isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorista unugyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E2400 mm\u003C/code\u003E waa la diidaa. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E2400\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddelka sifada nooca markaad ula jeeddo hal walax.\u003C/strong\u003E Raadi calaamadda &quot;(type)&quot; ka hor inta aadan qorin. Haddii aad rabto in hal walax ay kala duwanaato, beddel sifada halkaas ama Tag-ka ama Magaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filashada in faylka asalka uu isbeddelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaydinta had iyo jeer waxay soo dejisaa fayl cusub. Adigu u beddel faylka asalka haddii aad rabto, oo ku hay nuqul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isbeddel la&#039;aan.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa kaliya marka wax la kaydiyo; haddii kale browser-kaaga &quot;Save page&quot; ayaa furmi karta. Xir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta laba jeer oo rajaynaya laba fayl oo yar.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaydin kasta wuxuu ku jiraa tafatir kasta tan iyo markii aad furtay moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filashada in tafatirku uu ku noqdo fayl mashruuc.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu qoraa IFC kaliya. Keen IFC-ga la tafatiray barnaamijkaaga sida aad u keento IFC kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Saxo xogta moodel IFC: magac beddel walxa, hagaaji tag-ka, beddel qiimaha sifada. Kadibna kaydi fayl IFC cusub oo isbeddellada ku jira. Faylka aad furtay waligiis lama taabto. Waxa aad beddeli karto Goob Tafatir ah Magaca, Nooca walxa, Tag, Sharaxaad Haa Qiimayaasha sifada keligood (qoraal, lambarro, Haa/Maya) Haa Sifooyinka nooca (goobaha ku calaamadsan \"(type)\") Haa, isbeddelkuna wuxuu khuseeyaa walxaha nooca oo dhan Nooca, GlobalId, Khadka Maya Tirooyinka (dherer, meel, mug, tiro) Maya Liisaska, liiska doorashada iyo qiimayaasha dhowr qaybood Maya Joomatari, meel, ku darid ama tirtirid walxaha Maya Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC oo riix walxa aad rabto inaad beddesho. Panelka Properties, riix qiimaha aad rabto inaad beddesho. Wuxuu noqdaa sanduuq qoraal. Qiime madhan wuxuu muujinayaa empty. Qor qiimaha cusub. Riix Enter, ama riix meel kale si aad u hayso. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Eeg qiimaha: hadda waa xarfo culus oo jeex buluug ah ayaa dhinacaa, taas oo calaamad u ah qiime la tafatiray. Eeg qaybta Changes bidix: isbeddelka waxa lagu liistaa sida walxa: goobta, qiimihii hore ilaa qiimaha cusub. Ku celi qiimayaasha kale ama walxaha kale. Riix Save as IFC (waxay muujinaysaa inta isbeddel ee sugaysa, tusaale \"Save as IFC (3)\"), ama riix Ctrl+S. Ka hel \"magaca asalka (edited).ifc\" galkaaga soo dejinta. Waxa aad arki lahayd Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Saved name (edited).ifc with n changes (… bytes). Your original file is unchanged.\" Liiska Changes wuu madhnaanayaa, diyaar u ah wareegga xiga. Noocyada qiimaha Qoraal: wax kasta oo aad qorto waa la ilaalinayaa sidaas oo kale. Nadiifinta Magaca, Nooca walxa, Tag ama Sharaxaad waxay ka saaraysaa qiimaha. Lambarro: qor lambar fudud, tusaale 2.4 ama 1200, unugyada faylka. Ma jiro calaamad unug. Wax kale wuxuu muujinayaa \"Use a number.\" Lambarro oo dhan (tiro, lambar oo buuxa): \"Use a whole number.\" haddii aad qorto meel tobanle. Haa/Maya: qiimuhu wuxuu noqdaa liis doorasho oo leh Haa iyo Maya. Qiime kasta wuxuu hayaa nooca IFC, sidaas darteed lambarku wuu sii ahaanayaa lambar, barnaamijyada kalena si sax ah ayay u akhrin doonaan. Ka noqo Riix Undo qaybta Changes, ama riix Ctrl+Z adigoo aan ku qorin goob. Ku celi si aad uga noqoto isbeddello dheeraad ah. Ka noqo kasta wuxuu saaraa isbeddelka ugu cusub. Kaydinta ka dib ma noqon kartid: ka dib kaydinta liiska wuu bilaabmaa mar kale. Faylka la kaydiyay wuxuu hayaa wax walba. Sababta tafatirkaagu u beddelo hal walax oo keliya Qalabyada soo dhoofiya waxay kaydiyaan meel adiga oo wadaagaya xog. Hal goobo sifo ah ayaa laga yaabaa in ay wadaagaan labaatan albaab, hal qiime (\"Fire rating: 60 min\") ayaa laga yaabaa in lagu liisto sagaal iyo sagaashan goobood. Haddii BimCraft uu si toos ah u beddelo qiimaha la wadaago, walx kasta oo wadaaga wuu isbeddelayaa. Sidaas darteed BimCraft wuu koobiyeeyaa ka hor inta uusan qorin: Haddii goobta sifada aad tafatirayso ay la wadaago walxo kale, walxaaga wuxuu helaa nuqul gaar ah goobtaas, oo nuqulka keliya ayaa isbeddela. Haddii qiimuhu la wadaago goobo kale, goobtaada wuxuu helaa nuqul gaar ah qiimaha. Walxaha deriska ahi waxay sii hayaan xogtooda hore. Tan waxa loo yaqaan copy-on-write. Waxay ku daraysaa dhowr qoraal oo yar faylka, kuwaas oo barnaamijyada IFC oo dhan si caadi ah u akhriyaan. Sifooyinka nooca waa ka reeban tahay ujeed ahaan. Goobta ku calaamadsan \"(type)\" waxay ka mid tahay nooca walxa, IFC-nina walxaha nooca kasta waxay ka akhriyaan halkaas. Beddelku wuxuu beddelaa nooca, sidaas darteed walxaha nooca oo dhan waxay muujinayaan qiimaha cusub. Liiska Changes wuxuu calaamadiyaa tafatirkan \"(type)\". Eeg Beddel sifada nooca walxaha nooca oo dhan. Digniinno ka hor inta aadan lumin shaqada Fur fayl kale markaad leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, waxay weydiisaa \"You have n unsaved changes to file. Discard them?\" Riix Cancel si aad u sii shaqeyso, kadibna kaydi. Xidhida ama dib u soo rogida tab-ka isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo. Khaladaad caadi ah Qorista unugyada. 2400 mm waa la diidaa. Qor 2400. Beddelka sifada nooca markaad ula jeeddo hal walax. Raadi calaamadda \"(type)\" ka hor inta aadan qorin. Haddii aad rabto in hal walax ay kala duwanaato, beddel sifada halkaas ama Tag-ka ama Magaca. Ku filashada in faylka asalka uu isbeddelo. Kaydinta had iyo jeer waxay soo dejisaa fayl cusub. Adigu u beddel faylka asalka haddii aad rabto, oo ku hay nuqul. Riix Ctrl+S isbeddel la'aan. BimCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa kaliya marka wax la kaydiyo; haddii kale browser-kaaga \"Save page\" ayaa furmi karta. Xir. Kaydinta laba jeer oo rajaynaya laba fayl oo yar. Kaydin kasta wuxuu ku jiraa tafatir kasta tan iyo markii aad furtay moodelka. Ku filashada in tafatirku uu ku noqdo fayl mashruuc. BimCraft wuxuu qoraa IFC kaliya. Keen IFC-ga la tafatiray barnaamijkaaga sida aad u keento IFC kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solar-pv","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Safafka qorraxda PV, hiifka iyo wax soo saarka","summary":"Ku rakib safafka qorraxda saqafyada ama dhulka, u hiifi moodelka, qiyaas tamarta sanadlaha ah, cabbir xadhkaha iyo samee xogta sawirka hal-khadka. Dhammaan geliyada waa la muujiyaa, moodelka bilowgii iyo khasaaraha waa guud.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["qorrax","pv","photovoltaic","safka","moodel","saqaf","hiifka","wax soo saarka","kwh","kwp","cabbirka xadhkaha","inverter","hal-khad","janjeerada","xagalka","masaafada safka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"hiifka-wax-soo-saarka-iyo-xadhkaha","text":"Hiifka, wax soo saarka iyo xadhkaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ESolar PV\u003C/strong\u003E daaqadda. Dooro wejiga saqafka (janjeerada iyo jihada waxaa laga akhrinayaa moodelka) ama hoos ugu dhig safka dhulka oo leh janjeer iyo jiho; moodelka waxaa lagu rakibaa gudaha iyada oo la dhowrayo masaafooyinka, waana la tiriyaa, taasoo bixisa awoodda DC ee kWp ahaan. Safka lagu dhigo wuxuu moodelka ku qoran yahay sida xubnaha qorraxda, hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hiifka-wax-soo-saarka-iyo-xadhkaha\"\u003EHiifka, wax soo saarka iyo xadhkaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHiifku\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu soo saaraa shucaac ilaa moodel kasta oo u socda qorraxda maalmaha caadiga ah ee bil kasta, isagoo gaaraya geometry-ga moodelka laftiisa, sidaas darteed dhismayaasha deriska ah, parapet-ka iyo safafka hortiisa way tiriyaan. Kaliya shucaaca toosan ayaa la yareeyaa, safka hiif qayb ah wuu lumiyaa awood isagoo u dhigma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax soo saarku\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa kWh bil iyo sanad, kWh kWp kasta, iyo cabbirka waxqabadka. Qorraxda waxay ka timaadaa wadarta bisha ee adiga aad qortid haddii aad qortid, dusha toosan. Haddii aanad qorin, daaqaddu waxay isticmaashaa xad sare oo cirka cad ah, waxayna sheegtaa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo qaad cimilada NASA POWER\u003C/strong\u003E badhankiisa ku yaal tab-ka Wax soo saarka: wuxuu u diraa keliya latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta, hal mar, wuxuuna jawaabta ku hayaa kombuyuutarkan. PVGIS ma oggolaanayo bog-web inuu akhriyo jawaabtiisa, sidaas darteed tab-ku wuxuu siiyaa xidho furaya xogta bisha ee PVGIS ee goobta daaqad cusub; ku dheji waxa uu muujiyo sanduuqa, bisha laba iyo tobanka ayaa buuxsamaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadhkaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hubiyaa moodelada xadhig kasta marka loo eego daaqada voltage-ka inverter-ka maalinta ugu qabowga badan iyo ugu kulul, iyo xadhkaha isbarbar ah marka loo eego korontada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal-khad\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa xogta sawirka (safka, combiner-ka, disconnect-ka, inverter-ka, panel-ka, utility) oo leh cabbirka waayarka iyo fuse-ka laga qaadayo factors-ka aad qortid. Waa xog iyo SVG; kordhinta korontada ee CadCraft ayaa u dhigi karta sida calaamado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka, inverter-ka, khasaarahaha iyo factors-ka waayarka ee ku yimid BimCraft waa tusaaleyaal guud, waxaana lagu calaamadiyaa natiijo kasta. Ku qor xogta soo saaraha iyo qiimayaasha code-ka aad naqshadaysid, oo naqshadda ka eeg qofka mas&#039;uulka ka ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Fur Solar PV daaqadda. Dooro wejiga saqafka (janjeerada iyo jihada waxaa laga akhrinayaa moodelka) ama hoos ugu dhig safka dhulka oo leh janjeer iyo jiho; moodelka waxaa lagu rakibaa gudaha iyada oo la dhowrayo masaafooyinka, waana la tiriyaa, taasoo bixisa awoodda DC ee kWp ahaan. Safka lagu dhigo wuxuu moodelka ku qoran yahay sida xubnaha qorraxda, hal tallaabo ka noqo. Hiifka, wax soo saarka iyo xadhkaha Hiifku wuxuu soo saaraa shucaac ilaa moodel kasta oo u socda qorraxda maalmaha caadiga ah ee bil kasta, isagoo gaaraya geometry-ga moodelka laftiisa, sidaas darteed dhismayaasha deriska ah, parapet-ka iyo safafka hortiisa way tiriyaan. Kaliya shucaaca toosan ayaa la yareeyaa, safka hiif qayb ah wuu lumiyaa awood isagoo u dhigma. Wax soo saarku wuxuu bixiyaa kWh bil iyo sanad, kWh kWp kasta, iyo cabbirka waxqabadka. Qorraxda waxay ka timaadaa wadarta bisha ee adiga aad qortid haddii aad qortid, dusha toosan. Haddii aanad qorin, daaqaddu waxay isticmaashaa xad sare oo cirka cad ah, waxayna sheegtaa. Soo qaad cimilada NASA POWER badhankiisa ku yaal tab-ka Wax soo saarka: wuxuu u diraa keliya latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta, hal mar, wuxuuna jawaabta ku hayaa kombuyuutarkan. PVGIS ma oggolaanayo bog-web inuu akhriyo jawaabtiisa, sidaas darteed tab-ku wuxuu siiyaa xidho furaya xogta bisha ee PVGIS ee goobta daaqad cusub; ku dheji waxa uu muujiyo sanduuqa, bisha laba iyo tobanka ayaa buuxsamaya. Xadhkaha wuxuu hubiyaa moodelada xadhig kasta marka loo eego daaqada voltage-ka inverter-ka maalinta ugu qabowga badan iyo ugu kulul, iyo xadhkaha isbarbar ah marka loo eego korontada. Hal-khad wuxuu sameeyaa xogta sawirka (safka, combiner-ka, disconnect-ka, inverter-ka, panel-ka, utility) oo leh cabbirka waayarka iyo fuse-ka laga qaadayo factors-ka aad qortid. Waa xog iyo SVG; kordhinta korontada ee CadCraft ayaa u dhigi karta sida calaamado. Moodelka, inverter-ka, khasaarahaha iyo factors-ka waayarka ee ku yimid BimCraft waa tusaaleyaal guud, waxaana lagu calaamadiyaa natiijo kasta. Ku qor xogta soo saaraha iyo qiimayaasha code-ka aad naqshadaysid, oo naqshadda ka eeg qofka mas'uulka ka ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pipe-spools","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Spool-yada tuubada birta iyo xaashiyada spool-ka","summary":"Jar xariiq tuubo birta oo butt-weld ah spool-yo aan ka dheerayn dherer aad dooratay, iyo alxanka goobta ee aad dhigto; lambarka sii, oo soo deji xaashi spool kasta (muuqaal 3D, dherer jarista, fittings, alxanka, liiska alaabta) PDF iyo CSV; tuubada hawada waxay helaan liis jarista qaybaha toosan.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["spool","spool-yo","xaashiga spool","isometric","soo saarid","prefabrication","field weld","shop weld","butt weld","dherer jarista","liiska jarista","liiska alaabta","bom","tuubo birta","schedule 40","lambarka khadka","liiska jarista tuubada hawada","qaybaha tuubada hawada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"xariiq-u-jar-spool-yo","text":"Xariiq u jar spool-yo","level":2},{"id":"dhig-alxanka-goobta","text":"Dhig alxanka goobta","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada-spool-ka","text":"Xaashiyada spool-ka","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2},{"id":"tuubada-hawada-liis-jarista","text":"Tuubada hawada: liis jarista","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiq tuubo birta u rari qaybaha dukaanka ay alxanka ku sameeyaan iyo kuwa fitter-ku ku rakibo: spool-yo aan ka dheerayn dherer aad dooratid, oo lagu kala jaro meelaha alxanka goobta ee aad dhigto, mid kasta oo leh xaashi u gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaliya \u003Cstrong\u003Etuubada birta ee butt-weld\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa loo jaraa spool-yo (cabbirrada tuubada ASME B36.10M, elbow-yada long radius ee ASME B16.9). Naxaasta, PVC iyo PEX xidhkoodu ma aha butt weld, sidaas darteed xariiqyadoodu ma lahan spool-yo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiq-u-jar-spool-yo\"\u003EXariiq u jar spool-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xariiq tuubo birta. Properties, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ECut into spools\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELongest spool\u003C/strong\u003E: dherer dhexe ee khadka ugu badan oo hal spool uu lahaan karo (6 m, qiyaastii 20 ft, marka hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELine number\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb ka mid ah lambarka spool kasta. Xariiq spool ah oo cusub wuxuu helaa lambarka xor ah ee ugu xiga nidaamkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpool-yada waxa loo lambareeyaa xariiqa iyo barta ugu horreysa: \u003Ccode\u003ECHW-12-S01\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECHW-12-S02\u003C/code\u003E … (nidaamka, lambarka khadka, spool-ka). Spool wuxuu kor u kacaa qayb-qayb; qaybta u horseedda inuu dheeraado ayaa bilaabaysa mid cusub, xariiq toosan oo ka dheer spool ayaa lagu jaraa meesha spool-ku buuxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-alxanka-goobta\"\u003EDhig alxanka goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaxaad goobta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tuubo spool ah meesha alxanka goobta uu tagayo. Gudaha xariiq toosan tuubada halkaas ayaa la jarayaa; gudaha fitting ama faalfo, alxanku wuxuu u guuraa isku xidhka ugu dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties wuxuu liistaa alxanka goobta xariiqda, mid kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada-spool-ka\"\u003EXaashiyada spool-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties of a spooled run:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada spool-ka (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E: hal bog spool kasta. Bidix, spool-ka muuqaal isometric 30°: qaybaha toosan ee lambaraysan, alxanka dukaanka oo ah dhibco, alxanka goobta oo lagu calaamadeeyay FW, iyo waqooyiga qorshaha. Midig, lambarka spool-ka, cabbirka, schedule-ka iyo dhererka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer jarista\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Efittings\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ealxanka\u003C/strong\u003E (alxan dukaan oo ku yaal isku xidh kasta gudaha spool-ka, alxan goobta meesha ay ku dhacdo spool-ka xiga) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eliiska alaabta\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh miisaanka tuubada (ASME B36.10M plain-end weight).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska spool-ka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E: isla waxa, block kasta oo spool ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer jarista waa end to end sida loo rasmeeyay: wax root gap ama alxan oo laga jaro ma jiro. Elbow-yada waxay ku yaalaan B16.9 long radius; tee, reducer iyo faalfaha waa guud, waxaana lagu cabbiraa tuubada, ma aha B16.9 ama soo saare, xaashiguna way sheegaa. Miisaanka fittings-ka lama siin. Qalab qabyo iyo isku-duubis, oo ay cabbirtay injineer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta oo xariiq spool ah waxay leedahay \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft_Spool\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh SpoolId-keeda, xariiqda, lambarka spool-ka xariiqda gudaheeda, iyo meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo ku dhammaado xariiqda. Xariiqdu waxay hayaa xeerarkeeda (spool-ka ugu dheer, alxanka goobta, lambarka khadka) setkeeda, si spool-yadu isku mid ahaadaan marka faylka mar kale la furo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubada-hawada-liis-jarista\"\u003ETuubada hawada: liis jarista\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska jarista tuubada hawada\u003C/span\u003E: CSV ah qaybaha toosan ee tuubada hawada sida nidaamka, qaabka iyo cabbirka, xariiq toosan kasta oo loo jaraa qaybo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EPiece length\u003C/strong\u003E ee qalabka Tuubada hawada (1500 mm, qiyaastii 5 ft, marka hore) iyo wixii hadhay. Dherer keliya: ma jiraan seams, gauges ama connectors.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Xariiq tuubo birta u rari qaybaha dukaanka ay alxanka ku sameeyaan iyo kuwa fitter-ku ku rakibo: spool-yo aan ka dheerayn dherer aad dooratid, oo lagu kala jaro meelaha alxanka goobta ee aad dhigto, mid kasta oo leh xaashi u gaar ah. Kaliya tuubada birta ee butt-weld ayaa loo jaraa spool-yo (cabbirrada tuubada ASME B36.10M, elbow-yada long radius ee ASME B16.9). Naxaasta, PVC iyo PEX xidhkoodu ma aha butt weld, sidaas darteed xariiqyadoodu ma lahan spool-yo. Xariiq u jar spool-yo Dooro xariiq tuubo birta. Properties, calaamadi Cut into spools. Longest spool: dherer dhexe ee khadka ugu badan oo hal spool uu lahaan karo (6 m, qiyaastii 20 ft, marka hore). Line number: qayb ka mid ah lambarka spool kasta. Xariiq spool ah oo cusub wuxuu helaa lambarka xor ah ee ugu xiga nidaamkiisa. Spool-yada waxa loo lambareeyaa xariiqa iyo barta ugu horreysa: CHW-12-S01, CHW-12-S02 … (nidaamka, lambarka khadka, spool-ka). Spool wuxuu kor u kacaa qayb-qayb; qaybta u horseedda inuu dheeraado ayaa bilaabaysa mid cusub, xariiq toosan oo ka dheer spool ayaa lagu jaraa meesha spool-ku buuxo. Dhig alxanka goobta Fur Dhismaha oo dooro Laxaad goobta. Guji tuubo spool ah meesha alxanka goobta uu tagayo. Gudaha xariiq toosan tuubada halkaas ayaa la jarayaa; gudaha fitting ama faalfo, alxanku wuxuu u guuraa isku xidhka ugu dhow. Properties wuxuu liistaa alxanka goobta xariiqda, mid kasta oo leh Ka saar. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Xaashiyada spool-ka Properties of a spooled run: Xaashiyada spool-ka (PDF): hal bog spool kasta. Bidix, spool-ka muuqaal isometric 30°: qaybaha toosan ee lambaraysan, alxanka dukaanka oo ah dhibco, alxanka goobta oo lagu calaamadeeyay FW, iyo waqooyiga qorshaha. Midig, lambarka spool-ka, cabbirka, schedule-ka iyo dhererka, kadibna dherer jarista, fittings, alxanka (alxan dukaan oo ku yaal isku xidh kasta gudaha spool-ka, alxan goobta meesha ay ku dhacdo spool-ka xiga) iyo liiska alaabta oo leh miisaanka tuubada (ASME B36.10M plain-end weight). Liiska spool-ka (CSV): isla waxa, block kasta oo spool ah. Dherer jarista waa end to end sida loo rasmeeyay: wax root gap ama alxan oo laga jaro ma jiro. Elbow-yada waxay ku yaalaan B16.9 long radius; tee, reducer iyo faalfaha waa guud, waxaana lagu cabbiraa tuubada, ma aha B16.9 ama soo saare, xaashiguna way sheegaa. Miisaanka fittings-ka lama siin. Qalab qabyo iyo isku-duubis, oo ay cabbirtay injineer. Faylka IFC Qayb kasta oo xariiq spool ah waxay leedahay CadCraft_Spool oo leh SpoolId-keeda, xariiqda, lambarka spool-ka xariiqda gudaheeda, iyo meesha uu ka bilaabmo iyo ku dhammaado xariiqda. Xariiqdu waxay hayaa xeerarkeeda (spool-ka ugu dheer, alxanka goobta, lambarka khadka) setkeeda, si spool-yadu isku mid ahaadaan marka faylka mar kale la furo. Tuubada hawada: liis jarista Fur Dhismaha oo guji Liiska jarista tuubada hawada: CSV ah qaybaha toosan ee tuubada hawada sida nidaamka, qaabka iyo cabbirka, xariiq toosan kasta oo loo jaraa qaybo ah Piece length ee qalabka Tuubada hawada (1500 mm, qiyaastii 5 ft, marka hore) iyo wixii hadhay. Dherer keliya: ma jiraan seams, gauges ama connectors.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure-on-the-plan","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qiyaas qorshaha","summary":"Guji laba dhibcood qorshaha heer si aad u akhrido masaafada iyo farqiga X iyo Y, ku xidh guji dheeraad ah wadarta socota, oo ma kaydiso wax moodelka gudihiisa.","section":"tasks","order":44,"keywords":["qiyaas","qorshe","masaafo","cabbir","qiyaasle","wadar socota","silsilad","dx","dy","toosan","snap","geesaha darbiyada","khadadka gridka","tiirarka","hubi dherer"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"qoraal","text":"Qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi dherer qorshaha heer, sida ballaca qol ama masaafada u dhexaysa laba khad oo grid ah, iyada oo aan wax lagu darin moodelka. Si aad 3D ugu qiyaasto, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas masaafooyinka, aagagga bannaanka iyo meelaha 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji qorshaha heerka aad rabto: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E qorshaha kaliya, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E. Markaad qorshaha kaliya muujisid waxaad riixi kartaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhibcaha koowaad. Dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan darbiyada, khadadka gridka iyo tiirarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhibcaha labaad. Khad cabbir ayaa muujinaya masaafada, khadka xaaladda wuxuu siinayaa masaafada iyo farqiga X iyo Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u sii socoto, guji dhibic saddexaad. Qayb kasta waa la qiyaasaa, wadarta waa la daraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos u hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad gujinayso si aad u haysato qaybta toosan ee ka horreysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u nadiifiso qiyaasta, ama dooro qalab kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraal\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba moodelka kuma qoro, cabbirkuna wuu baxaa marka aad nadiifiso. Cabbirrada joogta ah, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EDerbiyada iyo cabbirrada tixraaca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka aragga 3D uu shaashadda ku yaal, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sii haya 3D Qiyaas. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Guuri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMasaafadu waxay isticmaashaa unugga bandhigga ee aad doorashay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hubi dherer qorshaha heer, sida ballaca qol ama masaafada u dhexaysa laba khad oo grid ah, iyada oo aan wax lagu darin moodelka. Si aad 3D ugu qiyaasto, eeg Qiyaas masaafooyinka, aagagga bannaanka iyo meelaha 3D. Tallaabooyinka Muuji qorshaha heerka aad rabto: Qorshe qorshaha kaliya, ama Kala jar. Qaybta Sawir, guji Qiyaas. Markaad qorshaha kaliya muujisid waxaad riixi kartaa M halkii. Guji dhibcaha koowaad. Dhibcuhu waxay ku xidhmaan darbiyada, khadadka gridka iyo tiirarka. Guji dhibcaha labaad. Khad cabbir ayaa muujinaya masaafada, khadka xaaladda wuxuu siinayaa masaafada iyo farqiga X iyo Y. Si aad u sii socoto, guji dhibic saddexaad. Qayb kasta waa la qiyaasaa, wadarta waa la daraa. Hoos u hay Shift inta aad gujinayso si aad u haysato qaybta toosan ee ka horreysa. Riix Esc si aad u nadiifiso qiyaasta, ama dooro qalab kale. Qoraal Waxba moodelka kuma qoro, cabbirkuna wuu baxaa marka aad nadiifiso. Cabbirrada joogta ah, eeg Derbiyada iyo cabbirrada tixraaca. Marka aragga 3D uu shaashadda ku yaal, M wuxuu sii haya 3D Qiyaas. Shift+M waa Guuri. Masaafadu waxay isticmaashaa unugga bandhigga ee aad doorashay Dejinta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"grid-dimensions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Cabbir shabakadda","summary":"Muuji masaafada u dhexaysa khadadka shabakadda deriska ah iyo cabbirka guud ee shabakadda qorshaha dabaq kasta, oo lagu kaydiyo IFC-ga oo raacda shabakadda marka khadadku isbeddelaan.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["shabakad","cabbirka shabakadda","cabbir","masaafo","qaybaha","cabbirka guud","goobooyin","shabakadda tiirarka","qorshe","xaashi"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"xusuusin","text":"Xusuusin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhig masaafada u dhexaysa khadadka shabakadda iyo cabbirka guud ee shabakadda qorshayaasha, gadaasha goobooyinka, si xaashiyada laga sameeyo ay cabbirrada qaadaan. Waxaad u baahan tahay shabakad marka hore: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grids-and-columns\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grids-and-columns\"\u003EShabakadaha iyo tiirarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuji qorshaha dabaq oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E si aad qalabka shabakadda u shido. Safka doorashooyinka shabakadda ayaa muuqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E. Masaafada u dhexaysa khadadka lambarka leh ee deriska ah iyo khadadka xarfaha leh ee deriska ah, iyo cabbirka guud labada jihood, ayaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro dabaq kale: cabbirrada isla markaana waxay muuqdaan qorshihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaq khad, magacee mid, ama ku dar mid cusub. Cabbirrada way raacaan shabakadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar calaamadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E si aad uga qariso mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xusuusin\"\u003EXusuusin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqdiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejintu waxay lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ga shabakadda ay weheliso, qorshayaasha xaashiyada lagu dhigo waxay qaadaan cabbirrada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii moodeelka aanu lahayn shabakad aad beddeli karto (shabakad ka timid fayl barnaamij kale, oo halkan laga beddeli karin), sadarka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Ma jiro shabakad la beddeli karo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku dhig masaafada u dhexaysa khadadka shabakadda iyo cabbirka guud ee shabakadda qorshayaasha, gadaasha goobooyinka, si xaashiyada laga sameeyo ay cabbirrada qaadaan. Waxaad u baahan tahay shabakad marka hore: eeg Shabakadaha iyo tiirarka. Tallaabooyinka Muuji qorshaha dabaq oo guji Shabakad si aad qalabka shabakadda u shido. Safka doorashooyinka shabakadda ayaa muuqda. Calaamee Cabbirrada. Masaafada u dhexaysa khadadka lambarka leh ee deriska ah iyo khadadka xarfaha leh ee deriska ah, iyo cabbirka guud labada jihood, ayaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha. Dooro dabaq kale: cabbirrada isla markaana waxay muuqdaan qorshihiisa. Dhaqaaq khad, magacee mid, ama ku dar mid cusub. Cabbirrada way raacaan shabakadda. Ka saar calaamadda Cabbirrada si aad uga qariso mar kale. Xusuusin Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqdiya. Dejintu waxay lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ga shabakadda ay weheliso, qorshayaasha xaashiyada lagu dhigo waxay qaadaan cabbirrada. Haddii moodeelka aanu lahayn shabakad aad beddeli karto (shabakad ka timid fayl barnaamij kale, oo halkan laga beddeli karin), sadarka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Ma jiro shabakad la beddeli karo.\"","lang":"so"},{"slug":"assets-and-maintenance","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku hay xogta hantida iyo diiwaanka dayactirka moodelka","summary":"Isticmaal moodelka IFC ee la wareejiyay si aad dhismaha u shaqeyso: soo saaraha, moodelka, lambarka taxanaha, damaanadda iyo nolosha adeegga qalabka iyo qalabka guriga, iyo diiwaan shaqada dayactirka la sameeyay, oo dhan lagu qoro IFC.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["wareejin","shahaadada dhammaystirka","shahaadada isticmaalka","as-built","xirmada wareejinta","hanti","diiwaanka hantida","maareynta guryaha","fm","hawlgal","dayactir","adeeg","damaanad","lambarka taxanaha","barcode","soo saaraha","moodel","nolosha adeegga","cobie","mataanaha dhijitaalka","dib u dhacay","waqtigu gaaray","shaqo-amar"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-la-liisto","text":"Waxa la liisto","level":2},{"id":"xogta-hantida","text":"Xogta hantida","level":2},{"id":"dukumentiyada","text":"Dukumentiyada","level":2},{"id":"diiwaanka-dayactirka","text":"Diiwaanka dayactirka","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-hayo-ifc-ga","text":"Sida loo hayo IFC-ga","level":2},{"id":"akhriska-sensorrada","text":"Akhriska sensorrada","level":2},{"id":"akhrisyada-toosa-ah","text":"Akhrisyada toosa ah","level":2},{"id":"faylka-cobie","text":"Faylka COBie","level":2},{"id":"dukumentiyada-wareejinta","text":"Dukumentiyada wareejinta","level":2},{"id":"csv","text":"CSV","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHantida\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka midig ayaa furaha moodelka IFC u beddela diiwaan qalabka dhismaha. Wax kasta waxaa lagu qoraa IFC laftiisa, set-yada sifada iyo hawlaha IFC ee u gaarka ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijka xiga ee furaya faylka ayaa akhrinaya. Waxba lama soo rarin, server looma baahna: kaydi IFC-ga si aad u hayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-liisto\"\u003EWaxa la liisto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabka iyo qalabka guriga: alaabta guriga, qalabka musqusha, qalabka iftiinka, qalabka guriga, terminal-ada hawada, valve-yada, pump-yada, fan-yada, boiler-yada, tank-yada, outlet-yada, switchboard-yada, lift-yada iyo walxo kale oo sidaas ah, iyo alaabta maktabadda leh xogta qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxo kale oo aad \u003Cstrong\u003Eraacdo\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro moodelka (albaab, darbi, pump oo loo sameeyay shay caadi ah) oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac wixii la doortay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta oo horay u leh xogta hantida ama hawl dayactir, oo halkan ama barnaamij kale lagu qoray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa dib u dhacay ayaa marka hore yimaadda, kadibna waxa waqtigu gaarayo 30 maalmood gudahood. Shaandee magaca, tag-ka, soo saaraha, moodelka ama lambarka taxanaha, dabaqa, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaliya kuwa dib u dhacay ama 30 maalmood gudahood\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xogta-hantida\"\u003EXogta hantida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji hanti liiska ku jirta (ama dooro moodelka) si aad u furto xogtiisa: soo saaraha, moodelka, tixraaca moodelka, lambarka taxanaha, barcode, maalinta la rakibay, lambarka damaanadda iyo bilowga iyo dhammaadkeeda, iyo nolosha adeegga sannado ahaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xogta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa hal tallaabo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda). Sanduuq madhan ka dhig si aad qiimahaas uga saarto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dukumentiyada\"\u003EDukumentiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXogta hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa buugaagta, damaanadaha, sawirrada, shahaadooyinka iyo naqshadaha la xidhiidha hantida. Dooro nooca, bixi cinwaan (ama ka tag madhan: magaca faylka ayaa la isticmaalaa), oo qor meesha uu ku yaal:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecinwaan web\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://…\u003C/code\u003E): wuxuu helayaa Open link, kaas oo furaya tab cusub;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eama \u003Cstrong\u003Emagaca fayl ama jid\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003EManuals/AHU-1.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC:\\FM\\pump.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, network share): ku hay faylasha agtiisa IFC-ga, isla folder-ka ama mid ka hooseeya, si magacyadu u shaqeeyaan marka folder-ka la wareejiyo. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa magaca; faylka ka fur folder-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha laftooda lama soo rarin ama lama koobiyeeyo IFC-ga: waxaa la qoraa oo keliya xidhiidhka. Cinwaan web oo password ku jira, iyo xidhiidh kasta oo aan ahayn cinwaan web ama fayl (sida \u003Ccode\u003Ejavascript:\u003C/code\u003E), waa la diidaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dukumentiga ka saaraa hantida (hal tallaabo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDukumentiyada barnaamij kale ku dhigay walxa ayaa sidoo kale la liistaa. Dukumentiyada ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Enooca\u003C/strong\u003E walxa waxay muujinayaan walxaha isku nooca ah oo dhan, waxayna sheegaan taas; isbedelkooda ka samee meesha nooca laga sameeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha IFC dukumenti kasta waa IFC document reference oo walxa ku xiran, nooceeda oo lagu hayo xidhiidhkaas, IFC4 iyo IFC2X3 labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"diiwaanka-dayactirka\"\u003EDiiwaanka dayactirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos dukumentiyada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiiwaan geli shaqada la sameeyay\u003C/span\u003E: maalinta la sameeyay, shaqada, cidda sameysay, goorta xigta ee la gaarayo iyo qoraalo. Qoraal kasta waa hal tallaabo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan mar dambe. Taariikhda xigta ee qoraalka ugu dambeeya ayaa go&#039;aamisa in hantidu dib u dhacday ama si dhaqso ah u socota.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-hayo-ifc-ga\"\u003ESida loo hayo IFC-ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo saaraha iyo moodelka gudaha \u003Ccode\u003EPset_ManufacturerTypeInformation\u003C/code\u003E, lambarka taxanaha, barcode-ka iyo maalinta la rakibay gudaha \u003Ccode\u003EPset_ManufacturerOccurrence\u003C/code\u003E, damaanadda gudaha \u003Ccode\u003EPset_Warranty\u003C/code\u003E, nolosha adeegga gudaha \u003Ccode\u003EPset_ServiceLife\u003C/code\u003E, walxa laftiisa. Marka nooca walxa horay u leeyahay soo saare ama moodel, wuu muuqdaa ilaa aad qortid kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraal kasta oo dayactir waa IFC \u003Cstrong\u003Etask\u003C/strong\u003E nooca dayactirka ah, walxa ku xiran, taariikhaheeda (IFC4 sidoo kale waqtiga hawsha), iyo set-ka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Maintenance\u003C/code\u003E oo leh maalinta, cidda sameysay iyo maalinta xigta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiimayaasha walxaha kale wadaagaan waa la koobiyeeyaa marka hore: beddelka hal hanti ma beddelo kuwa deriska ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha IFC2X3 ee duugga ah taariikhaha waxaa lagu qoraa qoraal (YYYY-MM-DD); nooca ayaa u baahan diiwaan taariikh gaar ah oo halkaas, taas oo BimCraft aanu qorin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhriska-sensorrada\"\u003EAkhriska sensorrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimaha sensorrada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur akhrisyada (CSV)…\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo gashid akhrisyo laga soo dhoofiyay nidaamka maamulka dhismaha, data logger ama miis-xisaab:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirka koowaad waa waqtiga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23 14:05\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23T14:05:00Z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2026-10-23T14:05+02:00\u003C/code\u003E ama ilbiriqsiyo Unix. Waqti aan aag lahayn waxaa la akhriyaa aagga waqtiga kombiyuutarkaaga. Taariikhaha maalinta-ugu-horreeya sida \u003Ccode\u003E23/10/2026\u003C/code\u003E lama akhriyo (waa is-qabsanayaan); dhoofi taariikhaha ISO.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiir kasta oo kale waa hal sensor\u003C/strong\u003E, oo madaxiisa lagu qoray \u003Cstrong\u003Etag\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ename\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalId\u003C/strong\u003E hantidiisa. Madax aan hanti u dhigmin, ama in ka badan hal hanti u dhigma, waa la liistaa oo laga reebaa. Commas, semicolons ama tabs ayaa kala soocaya tiirarka; marka semicolons ama tabs la isticmaalo, koma tobanle (\u003Ccode\u003E21,5\u003C/code\u003E) waa la akhriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaqtiyada ama qiimayaasha aan la akhriyi karin (eray, ama unug uu ku qoran yahay unug cabbir) waa la tiriyaa oo laga reebaa, weligood looma male-yeelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhriska ugu dambeeya wuxuu muuqdaa tiirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkhriska\u003C/span\u003E ee liiska iyo bloke \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESensor\u003C/span\u003E ee hantida, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Echart\u003C/strong\u003E ee akhrisyada oo dhan (telefoonka chart-yada waa la sugaa ilaa aad gujiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji jadwalka\u003C/span\u003E). Deji \u003Cstrong\u003Exadka hoose iyo xadka sare\u003C/strong\u003E iyo cutub hantida, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi xadadka\u003C/span\u003E: akhris ka baxsan xaddadaas wuxuu calaamadeeyaa hantida. Calaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu muuji moodelka\u003C/span\u003E si aad hanti kasta midabka ugu sawirto akhriskeeda — buluug marka ka hooseyso xadka hoose, cagaar gudaha xadadka, casaan marka ka sarreyso xadka sare, iyo, hantida aan xad lahayn, miisaan buluug oo keliya oo ka bilaabmaya akhriska ugu hooseeya ilaa ugu sarreeya — iyo akhriskeeda sida calaamad (ilaa 60 calaamadood, kuwa calaamadaysan marka hore).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhrisyada waxay ku sii jiraan tab-kan browser-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: lama kaydiyo IFC-ga, mana loo diro meel kale; xiliga xiga CSV-ga mar kale fur. \u003Cstrong\u003EXadadka waa la kaydiyaa IFC-ga\u003C/strong\u003E (set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Sensor\u003C/code\u003E oo walxa ku jira: Low, High, Unit), sidaas darteed qofka xiga ee furaya faylka wuxuu arkaa calaamadaha isku mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhrisyada-toosa-ah\"\u003EAkhrisyada toosa ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXogta toosa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa qiimayaasha markay dhacaan, \u003Cstrong\u003Esi toos ah browser-kan ilaa nidaamkaaga\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxba ma marayo server-keenna, waxna lama kaydiyo meel kale marka laga reebo tab-ka browser-kaaga. Waxba ma xidhmayo marka faylku furmo: kaliya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/span\u003E ayaa taas sameeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMQTT over WebSockets\u003C/strong\u003E: cinwaanka dhegaystaha WebSocket ee broker-kaaga (\u003Ccode\u003Ewss://broker.example.com:8884/mqtt\u003C/code\u003E), iyo mawduuc ama in ka badan oo leh \u003Ccode\u003E{tag}\u003C/code\u003E halka tag-ka hantida laga dhigo, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003Esite/{tag}/temperature\u003C/code\u003E (BimCraft wuxuu ku diiwaangeliyaa \u003Ccode\u003Esite/+/temperature\u003C/code\u003E wuxuuna akhriyaa tag-ka mawduuca fariin kasta). Mawduucyada aan \u003Ccode\u003E{tag}\u003C/code\u003E lahayn waxay magacaabaan sensor-ka laftiisa. Fariintu waa lambar caadi ah (\u003Ccode\u003E21.5\u003C/code\u003E) ama JSON sida \u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;value&quot;: 21.5, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-10-23T14:05:00Z&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E (deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta qiimaha ee JSON-ka\u003C/span\u003E haddii tiirkaagu magac kale yeelanayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeydii cinwaan (HTTP)\u003C/strong\u003E: cinwaan web oo nidaamka maamulka dhismahaaga ama script yar oo aad leedahay ku jawaabo, oo la weydiiyo ilaa tiro ilbiriqsi ah (ugu yaraan 5). Waxay ku jawaabi kartaa JSON oo tag lagu furay (\u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;AHU-1&quot;: 21.5}\u003C/code\u003E), liis JSON ah (\u003Ccode\u003E[{&quot;tag&quot;: &quot;AHU-1&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 21.5}]\u003C/code\u003E), ama CSV oo akhrisyo ah sida kor. Haddii aanu jawaabin, BimCraft wuxuu sugaa laba jibbaar wakhtigaas ka hor inta uusan mar kale weydiin, ilaa shan daqiiqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhris kasta wuxuu u gaaraa hantida magaceeda, tag-keeda, ama GlobalId-keeda uu sheegay, sida tiir CSV oo kale; magacyada aan hanti u dhigmin waa la liistaa. Akhrisyadu waxay ku biiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimaha sensorrada\u003C/span\u003E: liiska, chart-yada, xadadka iyo midabka moodelka waxay u shaqeeyaan sidii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPassword-kaaga ama token-kaaga\u003C/strong\u003E waa la qoraa xidhiidh kasta: waa la siiyaa xidhiidhka, sanduuqana waa la madhiyaa; marna lama kaydiyo browser-kan ama IFC-ga. Token-ku wuxuu u socdaa header \u003Ccode\u003EAuthorization: Bearer\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah, cookies lama diro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu hay dejimahan IFC-da\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa cinwaanka, mawduucyada, goobta qiimaha iyo sida uu u weydiiyo moodelka (set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Feed\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca; password goob uma leh), sidaas darteed qofka xiga ee furaya faylka wuxuu qoraa login-kiisa oo keliya wuxuuna gujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/span\u003E. Ha dhigin password ama furaha cinwaanka laftiisa: cinwaan leh magac isticmaale iyo password ku jira waa la diidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa broker-kaaga ama cinwaankaagu u baahan yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Bogga browser-ku wuxuu kaliya la hadli karaa server oggolaanaya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBogga waa amni (https), sidaas darteed browser-ku wuxuu ku xidhmaa kaliya cinwaanada \u003Ccode\u003Ewss://\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://\u003C/code\u003E — marka laga reebo kombiyuutarkaaga (\u003Ccode\u003Elocalhost\u003C/code\u003E), halkaas oo \u003Ccode\u003Ews://\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://\u003C/code\u003E ay ku shaqeeyaan tijaabada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECinwaanka HTTP waa inuu ogolaadaa codsiyada bogagga (CORS: header-ka \u003Ccode\u003EAccess-Control-Allow-Origin\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ccode\u003EAuthorization\u003C/code\u003E ka mid ah headers-ka la ogolaaday haddii aad token isticmaashid).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBroker-yada badankood (Mosquitto, EMQX, HiveMQ iyo kuwa kale) waxay bixiyaan dhegaystaha WebSocket; inta badan waa la damiyaa ilaa la shido. BimCraft wuxuu hadlaa MQTT 3.1.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDigniin ma jirto\u003C/strong\u003E marka BimCraft la xiro: xadadku waxay calaamadeeyaan hantida inta moodelku furan yahay oo feed xidhiidh la xidhan yahay. Dhismo la ilaaliyo saacadaha oo dhan wuxuu u baahan yahay server, BimCraft ma socodsiiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-cobie\"\u003EFaylka COBie\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECOBie\u003C/strong\u003E waa miiska wareejinta ee milkiilayaasha iyo kooxaha hantida inta badan weydiista (oo ay soo saartay National BIM Standard ee Mareykanka; BS 1192-4 ee Ingriiska). Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska COBie\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida COBie (.xlsx)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa xaashiyada COBie 2.4 — Contact, Facility, Floor, Space, Type, Component, System, Job, Document iyo Attribute — moodelka iyo xogta hantida: dhismaha, dabaqyadiisa iyo qolalkiisa (bedadka quantities-ka moodelka), hanti kasta oo component ah leh lambarka taxanaha, maalinta la rakibay, bilowga damaanadda, tag-ka iyo barcode-ka, nooca oo leh soo saaraha, moodelka, nolosha adeegga iyo dhererka damaanadda, nidaamyada ay ka tirsan tahay, diiwaanka dayactirka sida jobs iyo dukumentiyada xidhiidhka. Component kasta wuxuu xambaarayaa IFC GlobalId ee walxa. Qor cinwaanka emailkaaga tiirka &quot;created by&quot; ee COBie, ama ka tag madhan (markaas wuxuu leeyahay n/a). Qiimayaasha moodelku ma lahan waxay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003En/a\u003C/strong\u003E; tiirarka qaybta waxay xambaaraan fasalka IFC, ma aha koodka OmniClass.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkhri miiska COBie…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u akhriyaa mid laga soo bilaabay BimCraft ama barnaamij kale, oo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewuxuu liistaa isbedel kasta marka hore\u003C/strong\u003E: hantida, qiimaha, ka-maxay ilaa-maxay, iyo dukumentiyo cusub. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa dhammaantood hal tallaabo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda). Safyada waa la isku xidhaa GlobalId, kadibna magaca component-ka. Safyada aan wax moodelka ku xidhnayn waa la liistaa, lama darin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska waa la tixgeliyaa mid aan la isku halayn karin: formulas lama akhriyo lamana fulin (kaliya qiimihii ugu dambeeyay ee unugga laga kaydiyay), qiime ku dhammeeya damaanadda ka hor bilowga iyo xidhiidh dukumenti oo aan ahayn cinwaan web ama magac fayl waa la dhaafaa oo la tiriyaa, buugaag aad u waaweyn waa la diidaa. Jobs-ka COBie waa shaqada qorsheysan ee nooca, waa la qoraa laakiin lama akhriyo mar kale. Miiska BimCraft qoro, qoraal ay miiska ka qaadan karto formula (oo bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) waa lagu calaamadiyaa inuu yahay qoraal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuugga shaqada waxaa lagu hubiyay tijaabooyinkeenna iyada oo la barbardhigayo akhristaha miiska madaxbannaan; ma uu marin COBie validator. Haddii kooxda la wareejinayo mid isticmaasho, noo sheeg waxa uu sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dukumentiyada-wareejinta\"\u003EDukumentiyada wareejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaraaqaha loo geeyo milkiilaha dhismaha dhammaystiran waxay khuseeyaan mashruuca, ma aha hal hanti. Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHantida\u003C/span\u003E fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyada wareejinta\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar dukumenti\u003C/span\u003E, dooro nooca (shahaadada dhammaystirka, shahaadada isticmaalka, damaanad, buug-gacmeed, sawirrada as-built, kale), oo qor cinwaankiisa, taariikhda la soo saaray, cidda soo saartay iyo lambarka tixraaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESheeg meesha uu ku yaal: cinwaan web, magaca fayl ee agtiisa IFC-ga lagu hayo, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka ku lifaaq\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska ku dar\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan liiska; mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis xirmada wareejinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa hal zip: bog hordhac ah oo liistaa dukumenti kasta, isla liiska sida miiska, buugga COBie (dukumentiyada ku jira xaashiga Document, safyo ku saabsan Facility), moodelka, iyo faylasha kasta ee lifaaqan. Shahaadada dhammaystirka ama isticmaalka oo weli liiska ku jirin waa la magacaabaa bogga hordhaca; xirmada si kastaba ha ahaatee ayaa la dhisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka xirmada gudihiisa waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emoodelka as-built\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu sheegayaa walxaha la cabbiray goobta. Isaga la socda, folder-ka \u003Ccode\u003Eas-built\u003C/code\u003E: bayaanka, liis walxo kasta oo leh xaaladda xaqiijinta, set-ka naqshadaha sida hadda yihiin hal PDF (naqshadaha as-built), iyo diiwaanka isbedelka naqshadaha markii moodelku soo saaray set-yo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC dukumenti kasta waa IfcDocumentInformation oo mashruuca ku xiran (IfcRelAssociatesDocument), oo leh cinwaankiisa, tixraaca, taariikhda, soo saaraha iyo meeshiisa, si barnaamijyada kale u liistaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl lifaaqan waxaa lagu diiwaangeliyaa magaca, cabbirka iyo SHA-256. Si aad faylka laftiisa mashruuca ula hayso, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi mashruuca xirmo ahaan\u003C/span\u003E (.ccbundle wuxuu hayaa moodelka iyo faylasha lifaaqan; furiddiisa ayaa soo celinaysa, mid kastaba waa la hubinayaa diiwaankiisa). Kaydinta caadiga ah ayaa idin weydiisa midkee rabtaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIFC caadi ah wuxuu hayaa diiwaanka, faylka ma hayo: furidda ka dib, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka mar kale ku lifaaq\u003C/span\u003E. Faylka isku mid ah waa la aqoonsadaa; faylka kale ayaa diiwaanka beddela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"csv\"\u003ECSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa hanti kasta oo leh xogteeda, qoraal kasta oo dayactir iyo dukumenti kasta, safka kasta hal hal, oo loogu talagalay miis-xisaab ama barnaamij kale oo dayactirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAan la dhisin: adeeg la martiqaaday oo kaydiya akhrisyada oo digniinaha u diri kara marka BimCraft la xiro, iyo akhriska jobs-ka COBie oo dib loo akhriyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Tab-ka Hantida ee panel-ka midig ayaa furaha moodelka IFC u beddela diiwaan qalabka dhismaha. Wax kasta waxaa lagu qoraa IFC laftiisa, set-yada sifada iyo hawlaha IFC ee u gaarka ah, sidaas darteed barnaamijka xiga ee furaya faylka ayaa akhrinaya. Waxba lama soo rarin, server looma baahna: kaydi IFC-ga si aad u hayso. Waxa la liisto Qalabka iyo qalabka guriga: alaabta guriga, qalabka musqusha, qalabka iftiinka, qalabka guriga, terminal-ada hawada, valve-yada, pump-yada, fan-yada, boiler-yada, tank-yada, outlet-yada, switchboard-yada, lift-yada iyo walxo kale oo sidaas ah, iyo alaabta maktabadda leh xogta qalabka. Walxo kale oo aad raacdo: dooro moodelka (albaab, darbi, pump oo loo sameeyay shay caadi ah) oo guji Raac wixii la doortay. Wax kasta oo horay u leh xogta hantida ama hawl dayactir, oo halkan ama barnaamij kale lagu qoray. Waxa dib u dhacay ayaa marka hore yimaadda, kadibna waxa waqtigu gaarayo 30 maalmood gudahood. Shaandee magaca, tag-ka, soo saaraha, moodelka ama lambarka taxanaha, dabaqa, ama dooro Kaliya kuwa dib u dhacay ama 30 maalmood gudahood. Xogta hantida Guji hanti liiska ku jirta (ama dooro moodelka) si aad u furto xogtiisa: soo saaraha, moodelka, tixraaca moodelka, lambarka taxanaha, barcode, maalinta la rakibay, lambarka damaanadda iyo bilowga iyo dhammaadkeeda, iyo nolosha adeegga sannado ahaan. Kaydi xogta wuxuu qoraa hal tallaabo (Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda). Sanduuq madhan ka dhig si aad qiimahaas uga saarto. Dukumentiyada Xogta hoosteeda, Dukumentiyo wuxuu liistaa buugaagta, damaanadaha, sawirrada, shahaadooyinka iyo naqshadaha la xidhiidha hantida. Dooro nooca, bixi cinwaan (ama ka tag madhan: magaca faylka ayaa la isticmaalaa), oo qor meesha uu ku yaal: cinwaan web (https://…): wuxuu helayaa Open link, kaas oo furaya tab cusub; ama magaca fayl ama jid (Manuals/AHU-1.pdf, C:\\FM\\pump.pdf, network share): ku hay faylasha agtiisa IFC-ga, isla folder-ka ama mid ka hooseeya, si magacyadu u shaqeeyaan marka folder-ka la wareejiyo. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa magaca; faylka ka fur folder-ka. Faylasha laftooda lama soo rarin ama lama koobiyeeyo IFC-ga: waxaa la qoraa oo keliya xidhiidhka. Cinwaan web oo password ku jira, iyo xidhiidh kasta oo aan ahayn cinwaan web ama fayl (sida javascript:), waa la diidaa. Ka saar wuxuu dukumentiga ka saaraa hantida (hal tallaabo; Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda). Dukumentiyada barnaamij kale ku dhigay walxa ayaa sidoo kale la liistaa. Dukumentiyada ku jira nooca walxa waxay muujinayaan walxaha isku nooca ah oo dhan, waxayna sheegaan taas; isbedelkooda ka samee meesha nooca laga sameeyay. Gudaha IFC dukumenti kasta waa IFC document reference oo walxa ku xiran, nooceeda oo lagu hayo xidhiidhkaas, IFC4 iyo IFC2X3 labadaba. Diiwaanka dayactirka Hoos dukumentiyada, Diiwaan geli shaqada la sameeyay: maalinta la sameeyay, shaqada, cidda sameysay, goorta xigta ee la gaarayo iyo qoraalo. Qoraal kasta waa hal tallaabo; Wax ka beddel iyo Tirtir waxay beddelaan mar dambe. Taariikhda xigta ee qoraalka ugu dambeeya ayaa go'aamisa in hantidu dib u dhacday ama si dhaqso ah u socota. Sida loo hayo IFC-ga Soo saaraha iyo moodelka gudaha Pset_ManufacturerTypeInformation, lambarka taxanaha, barcode-ka iyo maalinta la rakibay gudaha Pset_ManufacturerOccurrence, damaanadda gudaha Pset_Warranty, nolosha adeegga gudaha Pset_ServiceLife, walxa laftiisa. Marka nooca walxa horay u leeyahay soo saare ama moodel, wuu muuqdaa ilaa aad qortid kaaga. Qoraal kasta oo dayactir waa IFC task nooca dayactirka ah, walxa ku xiran, taariikhaheeda (IFC4 sidoo kale waqtiga hawsha), iyo set-ka CadCraft_Maintenance oo leh maalinta, cidda sameysay iyo maalinta xigta. Qiimayaasha walxaha kale wadaagaan waa la koobiyeeyaa marka hore: beddelka hal hanti ma beddelo kuwa deriska ah. Faylasha IFC2X3 ee duugga ah taariikhaha waxaa lagu qoraa qoraal (YYYY-MM-DD); nooca ayaa u baahan diiwaan taariikh gaar ah oo halkaas, taas oo BimCraft aanu qorin. Akhriska sensorrada Fur Qiimaha sensorrada iyo Fur akhrisyada (CSV)… si aad u soo gashid akhrisyo laga soo dhoofiyay nidaamka maamulka dhismaha, data logger ama miis-xisaab: Tiirka koowaad waa waqtiga: 2026-10-23 14:05, 2026-10-23T14:05:00Z, 2026-10-23T14:05+02:00 ama ilbiriqsiyo Unix. Waqti aan aag lahayn waxaa la akhriyaa aagga waqtiga kombiyuutarkaaga. Taariikhaha maalinta-ugu-horreeya sida 23/10/2026 lama akhriyo (waa is-qabsanayaan); dhoofi taariikhaha ISO. Tiir kasta oo kale waa hal sensor, oo madaxiisa lagu qoray tag, name ama GlobalId hantidiisa. Madax aan hanti u dhigmin, ama in ka badan hal hanti u dhigma, waa la liistaa oo laga reebaa. Commas, semicolons ama tabs ayaa kala soocaya tiirarka; marka semicolons ama tabs la isticmaalo, koma tobanle (21,5) waa la akhriyaa. Waqtiyada ama qiimayaasha aan la akhriyi karin (eray, ama unug uu ku qoran yahay unug cabbir) waa la tiriyaa oo laga reebaa, weligood looma male-yeelo. Akhriska ugu dambeeya wuxuu muuqdaa tiirka Akhriska ee liiska iyo bloke Sensor ee hantida, oo leh chart ee akhrisyada oo dhan (telefoonka chart-yada waa la sugaa ilaa aad gujiso Muuji jadwalka). Deji xadka hoose iyo xadka sare iyo cutub hantida, kadibna Kaydi xadadka: akhris ka baxsan xaddadaas wuxuu calaamadeeyaa hantida. Calaamadee Ku muuji moodelka si aad hanti kasta midabka ugu sawirto akhriskeeda — buluug marka ka hooseyso xadka hoose, cagaar gudaha xadadka, casaan marka ka sarreyso xadka sare, iyo, hantida aan xad lahayn, miisaan buluug oo keliya oo ka bilaabmaya akhriska ugu hooseeya ilaa ugu sarreeya — iyo akhriskeeda sida calaamad (ilaa 60 calaamadood, kuwa calaamadaysan marka hore). Akhrisyada waxay ku sii jiraan tab-kan browser-ka: lama kaydiyo IFC-ga, mana loo diro meel kale; xiliga xiga CSV-ga mar kale fur. Xadadka waa la kaydiyaa IFC-ga (set CadCraft_Sensor oo walxa ku jira: Low, High, Unit), sidaas darteed qofka xiga ee furaya faylka wuxuu arkaa calaamadaha isku mid ah. Akhrisyada toosa ah Xogta toosa wuxuu akhriyaa qiimayaasha markay dhacaan, si toos ah browser-kan ilaa nidaamkaaga. Waxba ma marayo server-keenna, waxna lama kaydiyo meel kale marka laga reebo tab-ka browser-kaaga. Waxba ma xidhmayo marka faylku furmo: kaliya Xidhiidh ayaa taas sameeya. MQTT over WebSockets: cinwaanka dhegaystaha WebSocket ee broker-kaaga (wss://broker.example.com:8884/mqtt), iyo mawduuc ama in ka badan oo leh {tag} halka tag-ka hantida laga dhigo, tusaale site/{tag}/temperature (BimCraft wuxuu ku diiwaangeliyaa site/+/temperature wuxuuna akhriyaa tag-ka mawduuca fariin kasta). Mawduucyada aan {tag} lahayn waxay magacaabaan sensor-ka laftiisa. Fariintu waa lambar caadi ah (21.5) ama JSON sida {\"value\": 21.5, \"time\": \"2026-10-23T14:05:00Z\"} (deji Goobta qiimaha ee JSON-ka haddii tiirkaagu magac kale yeelanayo). Weydii cinwaan (HTTP): cinwaan web oo nidaamka maamulka dhismahaaga ama script yar oo aad leedahay ku jawaabo, oo la weydiiyo ilaa tiro ilbiriqsi ah (ugu yaraan 5). Waxay ku jawaabi kartaa JSON oo tag lagu furay ({\"AHU-1\": 21.5}), liis JSON ah ([{\"tag\": \"AHU-1\", \"value\": 21.5}]), ama CSV oo akhrisyo ah sida kor. Haddii aanu jawaabin, BimCraft wuxuu sugaa laba jibbaar wakhtigaas ka hor inta uusan mar kale weydiin, ilaa shan daqiiqo. Akhris kasta wuxuu u gaaraa hantida magaceeda, tag-keeda, ama GlobalId-keeda uu sheegay, sida tiir CSV oo kale; magacyada aan hanti u dhigmin waa la liistaa. Akhrisyadu waxay ku biiraan Qiimaha sensorrada: liiska, chart-yada, xadadka iyo midabka moodelka waxay u shaqeeyaan sidii hore. Password-kaaga ama token-kaaga waa la qoraa xidhiidh kasta: waa la siiyaa xidhiidhka, sanduuqana waa la madhiyaa; marna lama kaydiyo browser-kan ama IFC-ga. Token-ku wuxuu u socdaa header Authorization: Bearer caadi ah, cookies lama diro. Ku hay dejimahan IFC-da wuxuu qoraa cinwaanka, mawduucyada, goobta qiimaha iyo sida uu u weydiiyo moodelka (set CadCraft_Feed ee mashruuca; password goob uma leh), sidaas darteed qofka xiga ee furaya faylka wuxuu qoraa login-kiisa oo keliya wuxuuna gujiyaa Xidhiidh. Ha dhigin password ama furaha cinwaanka laftiisa: cinwaan leh magac isticmaale iyo password ku jira waa la diidaa. Waxa broker-kaaga ama cinwaankaagu u baahan yahay. Bogga browser-ku wuxuu kaliya la hadli karaa server oggolaanaya: Bogga waa amni (https), sidaas darteed browser-ku wuxuu ku xidhmaa kaliya cinwaanada wss:// iyo https:// — marka laga reebo kombiyuutarkaaga (localhost), halkaas oo ws:// iyo http:// ay ku shaqeeyaan tijaabada. Cinwaanka HTTP waa inuu ogolaadaa codsiyada bogagga (CORS: header-ka Access-Control-Allow-Origin, iyo Authorization ka mid ah headers-ka la ogolaaday haddii aad token isticmaashid). Broker-yada badankood (Mosquitto, EMQX, HiveMQ iyo kuwa kale) waxay bixiyaan dhegaystaha WebSocket; inta badan waa la damiyaa ilaa la shido. BimCraft wuxuu hadlaa MQTT 3.1.1. Digniin ma jirto marka BimCraft la xiro: xadadku waxay calaamadeeyaan hantida inta moodelku furan yahay oo feed xidhiidh la xidhan yahay. Dhismo la ilaaliyo saacadaha oo dhan wuxuu u baahan yahay server, BimCraft ma socodsiiyo. Faylka COBie COBie waa miiska wareejinta ee milkiilayaasha iyo kooxaha hantida inta badan weydiista (oo ay soo saartay National BIM Standard ee Mareykanka; BS 1192-4 ee Ingriiska). Fur Miiska COBie tab-ka: U kaydi sida COBie (.xlsx) wuxuu qoraa xaashiyada COBie 2.4 — Contact, Facility, Floor, Space, Type, Component, System, Job, Document iyo Attribute — moodelka iyo xogta hantida: dhismaha, dabaqyadiisa iyo qolalkiisa (bedadka quantities-ka moodelka), hanti kasta oo component ah leh lambarka taxanaha, maalinta la rakibay, bilowga damaanadda, tag-ka iyo barcode-ka, nooca oo leh soo saaraha, moodelka, nolosha adeegga iyo dhererka damaanadda, nidaamyada ay ka tirsan tahay, diiwaanka dayactirka sida jobs iyo dukumentiyada xidhiidhka. Component kasta wuxuu xambaarayaa IFC GlobalId ee walxa. Qor cinwaanka emailkaaga tiirka \"created by\" ee COBie, ama ka tag madhan (markaas wuxuu leeyahay n/a). Qiimayaasha moodelku ma lahan waxay leeyihiin n/a; tiirarka qaybta waxay xambaaraan fasalka IFC, ma aha koodka OmniClass. Akhri miiska COBie… wuxuu dib u akhriyaa mid laga soo bilaabay BimCraft ama barnaamij kale, oo wuxuu liistaa isbedel kasta marka hore: hantida, qiimaha, ka-maxay ilaa-maxay, iyo dukumentiyo cusub. Codso wuxuu qoraa dhammaantood hal tallaabo (Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda). Safyada waa la isku xidhaa GlobalId, kadibna magaca component-ka. Safyada aan wax moodelka ku xidhnayn waa la liistaa, lama darin. Miiska waa la tixgeliyaa mid aan la isku halayn karin: formulas lama akhriyo lamana fulin (kaliya qiimihii ugu dambeeyay ee unugga laga kaydiyay), qiime ku dhammeeya damaanadda ka hor bilowga iyo xidhiidh dukumenti oo aan ahayn cinwaan web ama magac fayl waa la dhaafaa oo la tiriyaa, buugaag aad u waaweyn waa la diidaa. Jobs-ka COBie waa shaqada qorsheysan ee nooca, waa la qoraa laakiin lama akhriyo mar kale. Miiska BimCraft qoro, qoraal ay miiska ka qaadan karto formula (oo bilaabma =, +, - ama @) waa lagu calaamadiyaa inuu yahay qoraal. Buugga shaqada waxaa lagu hubiyay tijaabooyinkeenna iyada oo la barbardhigayo akhristaha miiska madaxbannaan; ma uu marin COBie validator. Haddii kooxda la wareejinayo mid isticmaasho, noo sheeg waxa uu sheegayo. Dukumentiyada wareejinta Waraaqaha loo geeyo milkiilaha dhismaha dhammaystiran waxay khuseeyaan mashruuca, ma aha hal hanti. Tab-ka Hantida fur Dukumentiyada wareejinta: Ku dar dukumenti, dooro nooca (shahaadada dhammaystirka, shahaadada isticmaalka, damaanad, buug-gacmeed, sawirrada as-built, kale), oo qor cinwaankiisa, taariikhda la soo saaray, cidda soo saartay iyo lambarka tixraaca. Sheeg meesha uu ku yaal: cinwaan web, magaca fayl ee agtiisa IFC-ga lagu hayo, ama Faylka ku lifaaq. Liiska ku dar. Wax ka beddel iyo Ka saar waxay beddelaan liiska; mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo. Dhis xirmada wareejinta wuxuu soo dejiyaa hal zip: bog hordhac ah oo liistaa dukumenti kasta, isla liiska sida miiska, buugga COBie (dukumentiyada ku jira xaashiga Document, safyo ku saabsan Facility), moodelka, iyo faylasha kasta ee lifaaqan. Shahaadada dhammaystirka ama isticmaalka oo weli liiska ku jirin waa la magacaabaa bogga hordhaca; xirmada si kastaba ha ahaatee ayaa la dhisaa. Moodelka xirmada gudihiisa waa moodelka as-built: wuxuu sheegayaa walxaha la cabbiray goobta. Isaga la socda, folder-ka as-built: bayaanka, liis walxo kasta oo leh xaaladda xaqiijinta, set-ka naqshadaha sida hadda yihiin hal PDF (naqshadaha as-built), iyo diiwaanka isbedelka naqshadaha markii moodelku soo saaray set-yo. Eeg Calaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta. Faylka IFC dukumenti kasta waa IfcDocumentInformation oo mashruuca ku xiran (IfcRelAssociatesDocument), oo leh cinwaankiisa, tixraaca, taariikhda, soo saaraha iyo meeshiisa, si barnaamijyada kale u liistaan. Fayl lifaaqan waxaa lagu diiwaangeliyaa magaca, cabbirka iyo SHA-256. Si aad faylka laftiisa mashruuca ula hayso, isticmaal Kaydi mashruuca xirmo ahaan (.ccbundle wuxuu hayaa moodelka iyo faylasha lifaaqan; furiddiisa ayaa soo celinaysa, mid kastaba waa la hubinayaa diiwaankiisa). Kaydinta caadiga ah ayaa idin weydiisa midkee rabtaan. IFC caadi ah wuxuu hayaa diiwaanka, faylka ma hayo: furidda ka dib, isticmaal Faylka mar kale ku lifaaq. Faylka isku mid ah waa la aqoonsadaa; faylka kale ayaa diiwaanka beddela. CSV CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa hanti kasta oo leh xogteeda, qoraal kasta oo dayactir iyo dukumenti kasta, safka kasta hal hal, oo loogu talagalay miis-xisaab ama barnaamij kale oo dayactirka. Aan la dhisin: adeeg la martiqaaday oo kaydiya akhrisyada oo digniinaha u diri kara marka BimCraft la xiro, iyo akhriska jobs-ka COBie oo dib loo akhriyo. Eeg Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"daylight-factor","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qiyaas iftiinka maalinta qol kasta","summary":"Celceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta qol kasta oo ka timid daaqadihiisa, dusha gudaha iyo cirka ay arkayaan daaqad kasta, iyada oo xagalka cirka lagu cabbiray moodelka. Qiyaas hore oo naqshadeed, ma aha simulation ama hubin xeer.","section":"tasks","order":48,"keywords":["iftiinka maalinta","factor-ka iftiinka maalinta","celceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta","adf","qaybta cirka toosan","vsc","kulaylka qorraxda","qorraxda","g-value","shabakad","split flux","qaybta cirka","dib-u-ibsasho gudaha","iftiin dabiici ah","daaqad","isbiir","xagalka cirka","hortaag","dedaal","balkoon","overhang","ibsasho","gudbin","naqshadeynta hore","falanqayn","qolal","spaces"],"headings":[{"id":"xisaabi","text":"Xisaabi","level":2},{"id":"qaacidada","text":"Qaacidada","level":2},{"id":"sida-xagalka-cirka-loo-cabbiro","text":"Sida xagalka cirka loo cabbiro","level":2},{"id":"qaybta-cirka-toosan-ee-daaqad-kasta","text":"Qaybta cirka toosan ee daaqad kasta","level":2},{"id":"qorraxda-daaqadaha-taariikh-gaar-ah","text":"Qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah","level":2},{"id":"factor-ka-iftiinka-maalinta-shabakad-ku-jirta","text":"Factor-ka iftiinka maalinta shabakad ku jirta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-ka-tagaa","text":"Waxa uu ka tagaa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka maalinta\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka midig wuxuu xisaabiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecelceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta\u003C/strong\u003E qol kasta: inta ka mid ah iftiinka cirka daruufka leh ee dibadda ayaa gaarta qolka, celceliska ahaan, boqolkiiba. Wuxuu akhrinayaa qolalka (spaces) iyo daaqadaha moodelka IFC ee furan. Wax ma beddelayo moodelka, wax lagama soo dirayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku jira tab-kan oo dhan waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab naqshadeed, ma aha xisaab u hoggaansan\u003C/strong\u003E: qiyaasro naqshadeed hore oo habab la daabacay, \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha simulation\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha hubin ka dhan ah xeer dhismo ama heer\u003C/strong\u003E. BS EN 17037, LEED, BREEAM iyo xeerarka tamarta waxay weydiiyaan simulation iftiinka maalinta oo leh cimilada meesha; u isticmaal barnaamij simulation iftiinka maalinta kuwaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabi\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC oo leh qolal (spaces) iyo daaqado. Moodelada halkan lagu sawiray waxay leeyihiin qol gudaha silsilad kasta oo derbi xidhan ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka maalinta\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa factor-kiisa iftiinka maalinta iyo heer: ka hooseeya 2 %, 2–5 %, 5 % ama ka badan. Guji qol si aad u aragto dusheeda iyo daaqad kasta aagga iyo xagalka cirka; qolka iyo daaqadihiisa waxaa lagu doortaa moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel gelin, tirooyinka way raacaan isla markiiba; marka moodelka la beddelo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale xisaabi\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qol kasta tirooyinkiisa iyo gelinta la isticmaalay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaacidada\"\u003EQaacidada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECelceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta (%) = T × Ag × θ × M ÷ (A × (1 − R²)), lagu daro daaqadaha qolka oo dhan (qaacidada Littlefair, oo ay isticmaalaan BRE 209, BS 8206-2 iyo CIBSE LG10):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ET\u003C/strong\u003E, gudbinta iftiinka isbiirta (0.7 ilaa bilow: isticmaal tirada soo saaraha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAg\u003C/strong\u003E, aagga dhalaalka: aagga daaqad kasta (ballaca guud × dhererka, ama cabbirkeeda moodelka) × \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta dhalaalka\u003C/strong\u003E (0.75 ilaa bilow: inta kale waa qaab).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eθ\u003C/strong\u003E, xagalka cirka ee daaqaddu aragto, digrii (hoos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EM\u003C/strong\u003E, factor-ka dayactirka ee wasakhda isbiirta (1 ilaa bilow).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, dusha gudaha qolka oo dhan: dhulka, darbiyada, saqafka iyo daaqadaha, oo laga qaadayo qaabka qolka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E, ibsashada celceliska ah, oo miisaan aagga ku leh: dhulka 0.2, darbiyada 0.5, saqafka 0.7 ilaa bilow; isbiirta waxay tirinaysaa 0.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xagalka-cirka-loo-cabbiro\"\u003ESida xagalka cirka loo cabbiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqad kasta BimCraft wuxuu jarayaa moodelka hal dhuumo oo toosan oo xagal qumman daaqadda, laga bilaabo dusha dibadda ee isbiirta, wuxuuna ka eegaa xadka dhulka oo toos u kor: wax kasta oo jarka la kulmiyo hore ka daaqadda (dhismo ka soo horjeeda, balkoon ama overhang sare, saqafka hoose) ayaa qayb ka qaada 90° ee. θ waa wixii haray. Daaqadda laftiisa iyo darbiga ay ku jirto way ka maqan yihiin. Wuxuu sidan ku sameeyaa shan meelood oo ballaca daaqadda ah oo dhexdhexaad ayuu qaadaa, sidaas darteed tiir yar oo hore ka dhexe ah wuxuu qaadaa qaybtiisa, ma aha cirka oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismo 8.5 m ka sarreeya bartamaha daaqadda oo 9.9 m ka fog wuxuu xijaabaa 40.65° (xagalka tangent-kiisu yahay 8.5 ÷ 9.9), taas oo ka tagta θ = 49.35°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybta-cirka-toosan-ee-daaqad-kasta\"\u003EQaybta cirka toosan ee daaqad kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale cabbiraa, daaqad kasta, waxa ay ka arkayso cirka oo dhan: isla jarka toosan, oo la wareejiyay jihada kasta ee hore ee daaqadda (kasta 2°, hal dhinac ilaa dhinaca kale), si dhismo dhinac ka jira, fin ama dhuxul qoto dheer ay qaybtiisa qaadaan. Kadibna BimCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta cirka toosan (VSC)\u003C/strong\u003E: intee ka mid ah iftiinka cirka daruufka leh ayaa gaarta isbiirta, iyada oo loo qaado sida uu saqaf furan oo siman ku helo. Daaqad aan wax hor ku jirin waxay heleysaa \u003Cstrong\u003E39.6 %\u003C/strong\u003E, taas oo ah ugu badan ee daaqad toosan heli karto; dhismo dheer oo 25° ka sarreeya daaqadda wuxuu ka tagaa qiyaastii \u003Cstrong\u003E27 %\u003C/strong\u003E, taas oo ah qiyaas ay hagistu UK (BRE 209) u isticmaasho sida xeerka dhabta. Daaqad kasta oo qolka ku jirta faahfaahinteeda waxay muujinaysaa VSC-kiisa iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Exagalka hortaagga\u003C/strong\u003E (sida ugu sarreeya wax u kacaya toos hore ee daaqadda).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECirku waa cirka daruufka CIE ee caadiga ah, kaas oo toos u kor uu ka iftiin badan yahay xadka dhulka saddex jeer, jarkuna waa sax: wax tusaale lagama qaato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorraxda-daaqadaha-taariikh-gaar-ah\"\u003EQorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro taariikh. BimCraft wuxuu raacaa qorraxda maalintaas rubuc saac kasta, wuxuuna isku geeyaa daaqad kasta kulaylka ay qorraxdu keento isbiirta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqorraxda toosan\u003C/strong\u003E, marka ay hore uga jirto daaqadda oo wax moodelka ka hortaagin (isla jarka sax ah, oo loo jeediyay qorraxda: balkoon hooseeya qorraxda xagaaga sare duhurka ayaa hoosaysa, qorraxda jiilaalka hoose ayaa soo gashaa);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eiftiinka cirka\u003C/strong\u003E ee isbiirta, oo ka dhimma wixii daaqaddu aragto;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiftiinka \u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka laga soo jeediyo\u003C/strong\u003E (ibsashadiisa: 0.2 ilaa bilow);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eoo dhammaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eg-value\u003C/strong\u003E-ka isbiirta (qaybta tamarta qorraxda ee u oggolaatay: 0.6 ilaa bilow; isticmaal tirada soo saaraha) iyo qaybta dhalaalkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa wadarta maalinta ee kWh-ka iyo kulaylkiisa ugu sarreeya watt-ka iyo waqtigiisa; faahfaahinta qolka waxay maalinta u sawirtaa shaxan. Cirku waa cir cad sida moodelka Hottel (Duffie &amp; Beckman, \u003Cem\u003ESolar Engineering of Thermal Processes\u003C/em\u003E), oo leh tirooyinka xagaaga ama jiilaalka ee meesha iyo xilliga, iyo dhererka goobta; booska qorraxda waa NOAA. Latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta waxay ka yimaadaan goobta IFC-ka, waqooyiga waxay ka yimaadaan waqooyiga dhabta ah ee moodelka; haddii moodelka aanu goob lahayn, qor latitude iyo longitude. Waqtiyadu waa waqtiga caadiga ah (ma jiro waqtiga xagaaga) aagga waqtiga aad qortay, ama midka longitude-ku soo jeedinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa uu ka tagaa: daruufka (waa maalin cad), isbiirta oo iftiin yar ka soo gasha xagal hoose, qaabka oo hooseeya isbiirta, siiraha, daaqada, iyo waxa derbiyada iyo saqafku qaadaan. Qiyaasta qaboojinta ee tab isla markaas wuxuu isticmaalaa kulaylka ugu sarreeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"factor-ka-iftiinka-maalinta-shabakad-ku-jirta\"\u003EFactor-ka iftiinka maalinta shabakad ku jirta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFactor-ka iftiinka maalinta shabakadda\u003C/span\u003E oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabi shabakadda\u003C/span\u003E: BimCraft wuxuu saaraa shabakad dhulka qol kasta oo ah sarreeyaha shaqada (0.85 m ilaa bilow), nus mitir oo ka gudaha darbiyada, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa factor-ka iftiinka maalinta barta kasta \u003Cstrong\u003Ehabka BRE split-flux\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta cirka\u003C/strong\u003E: cirka daruufka ah ee barta ka arka daaqad kasta furitaankeeda, ka dhimma qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta dib-u-ibsatay ee dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E: wixii barta ka arka dhismooyinka dibadda daaqadda dhexdeeda, oo iftiinkoodu yahay tobanaad cirka ka dambeeya (beddel iftiinka hortaagga haddii ay aad uga iftiin badan yihiin ama aad uga mugdi badan yihiin);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta dib-u-ibsatay ee gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E: iftiinka ku wareegaya qolka, oo ka yimid dusha qolka iyo ibsashadooda, aagga daaqadaha iyo intee ka baxsan darbiyada (qaacidada BRE, oo gudbinta iftiinka isbiirta lagu beddelay isbiirta cadda ee ay ku saleysnayd).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa celceliskiisa, barta ugu hooseysa, iyo intee ka mid ah oo heleysa 2 % ama ka badan; faahfaahinta qolka waxay sawirtaa qorshihiisa iyo barta kasta oo midab ku leh factor-kiisa iftiinka maalinta, daaqadahana casaan. Si ay kombiyuutar kasta ugu dhaqso badnaato, qol kasta waxa uu helaa ugu badnaan \u003Cstrong\u003E400 barood\u003C/strong\u003E: qol weyn ku jira masaafadu way kordhaysaa (qor masaafo si aad u doorato).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-ka-tagaa\"\u003EWaxa uu ka tagaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha saqafka (dhalaalka siman ama dhaadhacan) waa la liistaa laakiin lagama tirinayo: qaacidooyinka halkan waxay u yihiin daaqadaha darbiyada ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha aan qol gadaashooda ku jirin (hol aan space lahayn, tusaale ahaan) waa la liistaa gooni ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiiqnimada daaqadda (furitaanka waxa laga qaadaa dusha dibadda), indho-adkaynta, saacadaha qorraxda, iyo iftiinka maalinta ee cimilada ku saleysan. BS EN 17037, LEED ama BREEAM u isticmaal barnaamij simulation iftiinka maalinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerarka waxay ka yimaadaan hagis Ingiriis oo hore (BS 8206-2), oo lagu muujiyo hagis, marna ma aha gudbid ama fashil.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Tab-ka Iftiinka maalinta ee panel-ka midig wuxuu xisaabiyaa celceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta qol kasta: inta ka mid ah iftiinka cirka daruufka leh ee dibadda ayaa gaarta qolka, celceliska ahaan, boqolkiiba. Wuxuu akhrinayaa qolalka (spaces) iyo daaqadaha moodelka IFC ee furan. Wax ma beddelayo moodelka, wax lagama soo dirayo. Waxa ku jira tab-kan oo dhan waa qalab naqshadeed, ma aha xisaab u hoggaansan: qiyaasro naqshadeed hore oo habab la daabacay, ma aha simulation iyo ma aha hubin ka dhan ah xeer dhismo ama heer. BS EN 17037, LEED, BREEAM iyo xeerarka tamarta waxay weydiiyaan simulation iftiinka maalinta oo leh cimilada meesha; u isticmaal barnaamij simulation iftiinka maalinta kuwaas. Xisaabi Fur moodel IFC oo leh qolal (spaces) iyo daaqado. Moodelada halkan lagu sawiray waxay leeyihiin qol gudaha silsilad kasta oo derbi xidhan ah. Fur tab-ka Iftiinka maalinta oo guji Xisaabi. Qol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa factor-kiisa iftiinka maalinta iyo heer: ka hooseeya 2 %, 2–5 %, 5 % ama ka badan. Guji qol si aad u aragto dusheeda iyo daaqad kasta aagga iyo xagalka cirka; qolka iyo daaqadihiisa waxaa lagu doortaa moodelka. Beddel gelin, tirooyinka way raacaan isla markiiba; marka moodelka la beddelo, Mar kale xisaabi. CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa qol kasta tirooyinkiisa iyo gelinta la isticmaalay. Qaacidada Celceliska factor-ka iftiinka maalinta (%) = T × Ag × θ × M ÷ (A × (1 − R²)), lagu daro daaqadaha qolka oo dhan (qaacidada Littlefair, oo ay isticmaalaan BRE 209, BS 8206-2 iyo CIBSE LG10): T, gudbinta iftiinka isbiirta (0.7 ilaa bilow: isticmaal tirada soo saaraha). Ag, aagga dhalaalka: aagga daaqad kasta (ballaca guud × dhererka, ama cabbirkeeda moodelka) × qaybta dhalaalka (0.75 ilaa bilow: inta kale waa qaab). θ, xagalka cirka ee daaqaddu aragto, digrii (hoos). M, factor-ka dayactirka ee wasakhda isbiirta (1 ilaa bilow). A, dusha gudaha qolka oo dhan: dhulka, darbiyada, saqafka iyo daaqadaha, oo laga qaadayo qaabka qolka laftiisa. R, ibsashada celceliska ah, oo miisaan aagga ku leh: dhulka 0.2, darbiyada 0.5, saqafka 0.7 ilaa bilow; isbiirta waxay tirinaysaa 0.1. Sida xagalka cirka loo cabbiro Daaqad kasta BimCraft wuxuu jarayaa moodelka hal dhuumo oo toosan oo xagal qumman daaqadda, laga bilaabo dusha dibadda ee isbiirta, wuxuuna ka eegaa xadka dhulka oo toos u kor: wax kasta oo jarka la kulmiyo hore ka daaqadda (dhismo ka soo horjeeda, balkoon ama overhang sare, saqafka hoose) ayaa qayb ka qaada 90° ee. θ waa wixii haray. Daaqadda laftiisa iyo darbiga ay ku jirto way ka maqan yihiin. Wuxuu sidan ku sameeyaa shan meelood oo ballaca daaqadda ah oo dhexdhexaad ayuu qaadaa, sidaas darteed tiir yar oo hore ka dhexe ah wuxuu qaadaa qaybtiisa, ma aha cirka oo dhan. Dhismo 8.5 m ka sarreeya bartamaha daaqadda oo 9.9 m ka fog wuxuu xijaabaa 40.65° (xagalka tangent-kiisu yahay 8.5 ÷ 9.9), taas oo ka tagta θ = 49.35°. Qaybta cirka toosan ee daaqad kasta Xisaabi wuxuu sidoo kale cabbiraa, daaqad kasta, waxa ay ka arkayso cirka oo dhan: isla jarka toosan, oo la wareejiyay jihada kasta ee hore ee daaqadda (kasta 2°, hal dhinac ilaa dhinaca kale), si dhismo dhinac ka jira, fin ama dhuxul qoto dheer ay qaybtiisa qaadaan. Kadibna BimCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa qaybta cirka toosan (VSC): intee ka mid ah iftiinka cirka daruufka leh ayaa gaarta isbiirta, iyada oo loo qaado sida uu saqaf furan oo siman ku helo. Daaqad aan wax hor ku jirin waxay heleysaa 39.6 %, taas oo ah ugu badan ee daaqad toosan heli karto; dhismo dheer oo 25° ka sarreeya daaqadda wuxuu ka tagaa qiyaastii 27 %, taas oo ah qiyaas ay hagistu UK (BRE 209) u isticmaasho sida xeerka dhabta. Daaqad kasta oo qolka ku jirta faahfaahinteeda waxay muujinaysaa VSC-kiisa iyo xagalka hortaagga (sida ugu sarreeya wax u kacaya toos hore ee daaqadda). Cirku waa cirka daruufka CIE ee caadiga ah, kaas oo toos u kor uu ka iftiin badan yahay xadka dhulka saddex jeer, jarkuna waa sax: wax tusaale lagama qaato. Qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah Fur Qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah oo dooro taariikh. BimCraft wuxuu raacaa qorraxda maalintaas rubuc saac kasta, wuxuuna isku geeyaa daaqad kasta kulaylka ay qorraxdu keento isbiirta: qorraxda toosan, marka ay hore uga jirto daaqadda oo wax moodelka ka hortaagin (isla jarka sax ah, oo loo jeediyay qorraxda: balkoon hooseeya qorraxda xagaaga sare duhurka ayaa hoosaysa, qorraxda jiilaalka hoose ayaa soo gashaa); iftiinka cirka ee isbiirta, oo ka dhimma wixii daaqaddu aragto; iftiinka dhulka laga soo jeediyo (ibsashadiisa: 0.2 ilaa bilow); oo dhammaan g-value-ka isbiirta (qaybta tamarta qorraxda ee u oggolaatay: 0.6 ilaa bilow; isticmaal tirada soo saaraha) iyo qaybta dhalaalkeeda. Qol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa wadarta maalinta ee kWh-ka iyo kulaylkiisa ugu sarreeya watt-ka iyo waqtigiisa; faahfaahinta qolka waxay maalinta u sawirtaa shaxan. Cirku waa cir cad sida moodelka Hottel (Duffie & Beckman, Solar Engineering of Thermal Processes), oo leh tirooyinka xagaaga ama jiilaalka ee meesha iyo xilliga, iyo dhererka goobta; booska qorraxda waa NOAA. Latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta waxay ka yimaadaan goobta IFC-ka, waqooyiga waxay ka yimaadaan waqooyiga dhabta ah ee moodelka; haddii moodelka aanu goob lahayn, qor latitude iyo longitude. Waqtiyadu waa waqtiga caadiga ah (ma jiro waqtiga xagaaga) aagga waqtiga aad qortay, ama midka longitude-ku soo jeedinayo. Waxa uu ka tagaa: daruufka (waa maalin cad), isbiirta oo iftiin yar ka soo gasha xagal hoose, qaabka oo hooseeya isbiirta, siiraha, daaqada, iyo waxa derbiyada iyo saqafku qaadaan. Qiyaasta qaboojinta ee tab isla markaas wuxuu isticmaalaa kulaylka ugu sarreeya. Factor-ka iftiinka maalinta shabakad ku jirta Fur Factor-ka iftiinka maalinta shabakadda oo Xisaabi shabakadda: BimCraft wuxuu saaraa shabakad dhulka qol kasta oo ah sarreeyaha shaqada (0.85 m ilaa bilow), nus mitir oo ka gudaha darbiyada, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa factor-ka iftiinka maalinta barta kasta habka BRE split-flux: qaybta cirka: cirka daruufka ah ee barta ka arka daaqad kasta furitaankeeda, ka dhimma qaabka. qaybta dib-u-ibsatay ee dibadda: wixii barta ka arka dhismooyinka dibadda daaqadda dhexdeeda, oo iftiinkoodu yahay tobanaad cirka ka dambeeya (beddel iftiinka hortaagga haddii ay aad uga iftiin badan yihiin ama aad uga mugdi badan yihiin); qaybta dib-u-ibsatay ee gudaha: iftiinka ku wareegaya qolka, oo ka yimid dusha qolka iyo ibsashadooda, aagga daaqadaha iyo intee ka baxsan darbiyada (qaacidada BRE, oo gudbinta iftiinka isbiirta lagu beddelay isbiirta cadda ee ay ku saleysnayd). Qol kasta wuxuu muujinayaa celceliskiisa, barta ugu hooseysa, iyo intee ka mid ah oo heleysa 2 % ama ka badan; faahfaahinta qolka waxay sawirtaa qorshihiisa iyo barta kasta oo midab ku leh factor-kiisa iftiinka maalinta, daaqadahana casaan. Si ay kombiyuutar kasta ugu dhaqso badnaato, qol kasta waxa uu helaa ugu badnaan 400 barood: qol weyn ku jira masaafadu way kordhaysaa (qor masaafo si aad u doorato). Waxa uu ka tagaa Daaqadaha saqafka (dhalaalka siman ama dhaadhacan) waa la liistaa laakiin lagama tirinayo: qaacidooyinka halkan waxay u yihiin daaqadaha darbiyada ku jira. Daaqadaha aan qol gadaashooda ku jirin (hol aan space lahayn, tusaale ahaan) waa la liistaa gooni ahaan. Fiiqnimada daaqadda (furitaanka waxa laga qaadaa dusha dibadda), indho-adkaynta, saacadaha qorraxda, iyo iftiinka maalinta ee cimilada ku saleysan. BS EN 17037, LEED ama BREEAM u isticmaal barnaamij simulation iftiinka maalinta. Heerarka waxay ka yimaadaan hagis Ingiriis oo hore (BS 8206-2), oo lagu muujiyo hagis, marna ma aha gudbid ama fashil.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"heating-and-cooling-loads","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qiyaas culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta","summary":"Luminta kulaylka qol kasta, kulaylkeeda sannadka oo dhan iyada oo loo marayo degree-days, iyo kor-jeedka qaboojintooda, oo laga bilaabo wixii xuddunaysa moodeelka iyo U-value kasta oo walax kasta, iyo dhammaan geliyeyaashaba oo la muujiyey. Qalab naqshadeed, ma aha xisaab u hogaansan qawaaniin.","section":"tasks","order":49,"keywords":["tamar","kulaylka","qaboojinta","luminta kulaylka","culeyska kulaylka","u-value","gudbinta kulaylka","degree-days","hdd","hawo-marinta","isbedelka hawada","dhalaalaha gudaha","kulaylka qorraxda","lambda","awoodda gudbinta","dahaarka kulaylka","naqshadda hore","falanqayn","qolal","meelaha"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-xuddunaysa-qol-kasta","text":"Waxa xuddunaysa qol kasta","level":2},{"id":"u-values","text":"U-values","level":2},{"id":"kulaylka","text":"Kulaylka","level":2},{"id":"qaboojinta","text":"Qaboojinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ka-reebma","text":"Waxa ka reebma","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka maalinta\u003C/span\u003E, kadib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/span\u003E, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuleyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar culeyska\u003C/span\u003E. Qol kasta wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eluminta kulaylka\u003C/strong\u003E maalinta qabow ee naqshadda, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekulaylkiisa sannadka oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekor-jeedka qaboojintiisa\u003C/strong\u003E maalin kulul. Waxba lama soo dirayo; waxba moodeelka kama beddelo, mooyaane haddii aad U-value ku qortid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab naqshadeed, ma aha xisaab u hogaansan qawaaniin\u003C/strong\u003E: qiyaas xaaladda joogta ah oo dhammaan geliyeyaashu shaashadda ku muuqdaan. Ma aha habka \u003Cstrong\u003EISO 52016-1\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha simulation, ma aha shahaado tamar; ma cabbirto boyleerada, pompyada kulaylka ama chillers-ka. Natiijooyinka hubi, qalabka cabbirtiisa injineer la jaan qaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xuddunaysa-qol-kasta\"\u003EWaxa xuddunaysa qol kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu ka helaa moodeelka laftiisa, sidaas darteed IFC kasta oo barnaamij kasta leeyahay waa shaqeyneysaa (ma u baahna xuduudaha goobta ee barnaamijyada qaarkood dhoofiyaan). Wax kasta oo ka mid ah dusha qolka kasta wuxuu si toos ah u eegaa dibadda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ederbiga ugu horreeya, daaqadda, albaabka, dhulka, saqafka, dahaarka, derbiga aaladda (curtain wall) ama biimka ay kulanto \u003Cstrong\u003Exuduudayaa\u003C/strong\u003E qaybtaas;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisla markaana wixii ka dambeeya walaxda, mid ka mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003Eqol kale\u003C/strong\u003E (loo tiriyaa inuu ku dhow yahay, heerkul isku mid ah: ma jiro luminta), \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaxba\u003C/strong\u003E (dibadda), ama, hoos dhulka dabaqa ugu hooseeya, \u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ealbaab furan oo u furma qol kale waxaa loo tiriyaa inuu ku dhow yahay; qayb aan waxba kulmin (1.5 m dhinac ama hoos, 8 m kor) waa la liisanayaa qolka hoostiisa oo waa laga reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadaha iyo albaabada cabbirkooda waxay ka qaadanaan IFC (ballac guud × dhererka) derbiga ay ku jiraan. Guji qol miiska ku jira si aad u aragto walax kasta oo xuddunaysa, oo leh aagga, U-value-kiisa iyo meesha uu ka yimid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-values\"\u003EU-values\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalax kasta oo BimCraft isticmaalo, waxay raacdaa tan siday u kala horreysaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EU-value-ka IFC-ga laftiisa\u003C/strong\u003E — \u003Ccode\u003EThermalTransmittance\u003C/code\u003E ee ku jira common property set-ka walaxda (tusaale \u003Ccode\u003EPset_WallCommon\u003C/code\u003E) ama nooceeda. Naqshadaha badankood way qori karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDahaarrada agabkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E — 1 ÷ (iska caabbinta dusha gudaha + qaybo dahaar kasta oo dhumuc ÷ kulaylka gudbiya λ + iska caabbinta dusha dibadda), iyadoo la isticmaalayo iska caabbinta dusha ee caadiga ah (0.13 iyo 0.04 m²K/W derbiyada; 0.10 kor u ah, 0.17 hoos u ah gudaha). Kulaylka gudbiya ee bilowga caadiga ah (wool-ka macdanta 0.035, dhagaxa 0.77, konkreet 1.4…); hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKulaylinta agabka\u003C/span\u003E ku qor kan soo saaraha, U-value kasta oo ka yimaada dahaaradaas wuu raacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiime caadi ah\u003C/strong\u003E (derbiyada 0.3, saqafyada 0.2, dhulka 0.25, daaqadaha 1.4, albaabada 1.6 W/m²K), oo sidaas loo calaamadiyey — ku qor kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU-value aad ku qorto faahfaahinta qol waxaa lagu qoraa common property set-ka walaxda sida \u003Ccode\u003EThermalTransmittance\u003C/code\u003E (hal tallaabo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqdiya). Haddii walxo badan wadaagaan set-kaas (tusaale hal nooc oo derbi), dhammaantood way isbeddelaan, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulaylka\"\u003EKulaylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuminta kulaylka\u003C/strong\u003E = Σ U × A × (gudaha − dibadda) dhammaan wixii dibadda u furan + Σ U × A × (gudaha − dhulka) dhulka ku taal + 0.335 × isbeddelka hawada saacadiiba × mugga qolka × (gudaha − dibadda). 0.335 Wh halkii m³ halkii kelvin waa cufnaanta hawada (1.2 kg/m³) iyo kulaylka ay kaydiso (1005 J/kgK).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKulaylka sannadka\u003C/strong\u003E = (luminta qolka halkii darajo oo dibadda loo gudbiyo, oo ku dhex marta dhismaha iyo hawada, + luminta dhulkiisa oo loo qiyaasay isla farqiga) × \u003Cstrong\u003Edegree-days\u003C/strong\u003E × 24 ÷ 1000, oo ah kWh. Ku qor degree-days meesha, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkhri degree-days CSV…\u003C/span\u003E (hal safka maalin ama bil kasta; tirada ugu dambeysa ee safka kasta waa la isku daraa). Isticmaal degree-days ilaa heerkulka saldhigga ee isha aad isticmaasho: saldhigaas horay buu u qabtay kulaylka bilaashka ah ee dadka, iftiinka iyo qorraxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaboojinta\"\u003EQaboojinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKor-jeedka qaboojinta\u003C/strong\u003E = kulaylka dhismaha iyo hawada heerkulka naqshadda xagaaga + dadka (dhul halkii qof × kulayl halkii qof) + iftiinka iyo qalabka halkii m² dhul + \u003Cstrong\u003Eqorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E: kor-jeedka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E qolkaas. Marka hore qorraxda ka shaqee maalin kulul; ilaa markaas qorraxdu waxay tiraysaa 0 qaybtuna way sheegtaa. Kor-jeedka qayb kasta waa la isku daraa xitaa haddii ay saacado kala duwan ku dhacaan, taasoo wax yar ka sii badisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ka-reebma\"\u003EWaxa ka reebma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabka ISO 52016-1 ee bil iyo saacad (heer ku qoran oo lacag la bixiyo), kulaylka ku kaydsan miisaanka dhismaha, xidhiidhka kulaylka (thermal bridges), sida nidaamyada kulaylka iyo qaboojinta u shaqeeyaan, iyo faylasha cimilada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQolalka isku xiga waxaa loo qaatay heerkul isku mid ah; meelaha aan kulaylka lahayn ma la moodelayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\"\u003EQiyaas iftiinka qol kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Iftiinka maalinta, kadib Xisaabi, fur Culeyska kulaylka iyo qaboojinta oo guji Soo saar culeyska. Qol kasta wuxuu helaa luminta kulaylka maalinta qabow ee naqshadda, kulaylkiisa sannadka oo dhan iyo kor-jeedka qaboojintiisa maalin kulul. Waxba lama soo dirayo; waxba moodeelka kama beddelo, mooyaane haddii aad U-value ku qortid. Tani waa qalab naqshadeed, ma aha xisaab u hogaansan qawaaniin: qiyaas xaaladda joogta ah oo dhammaan geliyeyaashu shaashadda ku muuqdaan. Ma aha habka ISO 52016-1, ma aha simulation, ma aha shahaado tamar; ma cabbirto boyleerada, pompyada kulaylka ama chillers-ka. Natiijooyinka hubi, qalabka cabbirtiisa injineer la jaan qaado. Waxa xuddunaysa qol kasta BimCraft wuxuu ka helaa moodeelka laftiisa, sidaas darteed IFC kasta oo barnaamij kasta leeyahay waa shaqeyneysaa (ma u baahna xuduudaha goobta ee barnaamijyada qaarkood dhoofiyaan). Wax kasta oo ka mid ah dusha qolka kasta wuxuu si toos ah u eegaa dibadda: derbiga ugu horreeya, daaqadda, albaabka, dhulka, saqafka, dahaarka, derbiga aaladda (curtain wall) ama biimka ay kulanto xuduudayaa qaybtaas; isla markaana wixii ka dambeeya walaxda, mid ka mid ah qol kale (loo tiriyaa inuu ku dhow yahay, heerkul isku mid ah: ma jiro luminta), waxba (dibadda), ama, hoos dhulka dabaqa ugu hooseeya, dhulka; albaab furan oo u furma qol kale waxaa loo tiriyaa inuu ku dhow yahay; qayb aan waxba kulmin (1.5 m dhinac ama hoos, 8 m kor) waa la liisanayaa qolka hoostiisa oo waa laga reebay. Daaqadaha iyo albaabada cabbirkooda waxay ka qaadanaan IFC (ballac guud × dhererka) derbiga ay ku jiraan. Guji qol miiska ku jira si aad u aragto walax kasta oo xuddunaysa, oo leh aagga, U-value-kiisa iyo meesha uu ka yimid. U-values Walax kasta oo BimCraft isticmaalo, waxay raacdaa tan siday u kala horreysaa: U-value-ka IFC-ga laftiisa — ThermalTransmittance ee ku jira common property set-ka walaxda (tusaale Pset_WallCommon) ama nooceeda. Naqshadaha badankood way qori karaan. Dahaarrada agabkeeda — 1 ÷ (iska caabbinta dusha gudaha + qaybo dahaar kasta oo dhumuc ÷ kulaylka gudbiya λ + iska caabbinta dusha dibadda), iyadoo la isticmaalayo iska caabbinta dusha ee caadiga ah (0.13 iyo 0.04 m²K/W derbiyada; 0.10 kor u ah, 0.17 hoos u ah gudaha). Kulaylka gudbiya ee bilowga caadiga ah (wool-ka macdanta 0.035, dhagaxa 0.77, konkreet 1.4…); hoos Kulaylinta agabka ku qor kan soo saaraha, U-value kasta oo ka yimaada dahaaradaas wuu raacaa. Qiime caadi ah (derbiyada 0.3, saqafyada 0.2, dhulka 0.25, daaqadaha 1.4, albaabada 1.6 W/m²K), oo sidaas loo calaamadiyey — ku qor kaaga. U-value aad ku qorto faahfaahinta qol waxaa lagu qoraa common property set-ka walaxda sida ThermalTransmittance (hal tallaabo; Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqdiya). Haddii walxo badan wadaagaan set-kaas (tusaale hal nooc oo derbi), dhammaantood way isbeddelaan, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay. Kulaylka Luminta kulaylka = Σ U × A × (gudaha − dibadda) dhammaan wixii dibadda u furan + Σ U × A × (gudaha − dhulka) dhulka ku taal + 0.335 × isbeddelka hawada saacadiiba × mugga qolka × (gudaha − dibadda). 0.335 Wh halkii m³ halkii kelvin waa cufnaanta hawada (1.2 kg/m³) iyo kulaylka ay kaydiso (1005 J/kgK). Kulaylka sannadka = (luminta qolka halkii darajo oo dibadda loo gudbiyo, oo ku dhex marta dhismaha iyo hawada, + luminta dhulkiisa oo loo qiyaasay isla farqiga) × degree-days × 24 ÷ 1000, oo ah kWh. Ku qor degree-days meesha, ama Akhri degree-days CSV… (hal safka maalin ama bil kasta; tirada ugu dambeysa ee safka kasta waa la isku daraa). Isticmaal degree-days ilaa heerkulka saldhigga ee isha aad isticmaasho: saldhigaas horay buu u qabtay kulaylka bilaashka ah ee dadka, iftiinka iyo qorraxda. Qaboojinta Kor-jeedka qaboojinta = kulaylka dhismaha iyo hawada heerkulka naqshadda xagaaga + dadka (dhul halkii qof × kulayl halkii qof) + iftiinka iyo qalabka halkii m² dhul + qorraxda: kor-jeedka Qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah qolkaas. Marka hore qorraxda ka shaqee maalin kulul; ilaa markaas qorraxdu waxay tiraysaa 0 qaybtuna way sheegtaa. Kor-jeedka qayb kasta waa la isku daraa xitaa haddii ay saacado kala duwan ku dhacaan, taasoo wax yar ka sii badisa. Waxa ka reebma Habka ISO 52016-1 ee bil iyo saacad (heer ku qoran oo lacag la bixiyo), kulaylka ku kaydsan miisaanka dhismaha, xidhiidhka kulaylka (thermal bridges), sida nidaamyada kulaylka iyo qaboojinta u shaqeeyaan, iyo faylasha cimilada. Qolalka isku xiga waxaa loo qaatay heerkul isku mid ah; meelaha aan kulaylka lahayn ma la moodelayo. Eeg sidoo kale Qiyaas iftiinka qol kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"type-vs-instance","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beddel sifada nooca ee dhammaan walxaha nooca isku mid ah","summary":"Kala soo hel sifooyinka nooca iyo sifooyinka kiiska, beddel qiime nooca si walxaha oo dhammu u raacaan, oo hubi in tafatirka hal walax uu yahay mid isaga u gaar ah.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["nooc","kiis","sifooyinka nooca","nooca qoyska","la wadaago","nuqul marka la beddelo","dhammaan walxaha","tafatir badan","soo saaraha","moodeelka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"nooc-mise-kiis","text":"Nooc mise kiis?","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-beddel-nooca","text":"Tallaabooyin: beddel nooca","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-beddel-hal-walax-oo-keliya","text":"Tallaabooyin: beddel hal walax oo keliya","level":2},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo saaraha albaab nooc ah ku dhig si albaab kasta oo nooca ahaan uu u muujiyo, ka dibna hal albaab u sii darajo dab gaar ah, adigoo aan taabanin kuwa kale. Tani waxay muujinaysaa farqiga u dhexeeya sifooyinka nooca iyo sifooyinka kiiska ee BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nooc-mise-kiis\"\u003ENooc mise kiis?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKiis\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u taallaa hal walax keliya: calaamadeeda, tirada, qolkeeda, darajo dabkeeda gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooc\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u taallaa nooca ay walxo badan wadaagaan: soo saaraha, moodeelka, ballaca nooca albaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E gudihiisa, habaynta ka timid nooca waxay leedahay &quot; (type)&quot; ka dib magacooda, iyo sadar ah &quot;Sifada nooca: beddelka halkan wuxuu ku dhacaa dhammaan walxaha noocan ah.&quot; Habayn kasta oo kale waxay u taallaa walaxda laftiisa. \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta koowaad waxa uu muujiyaa magaca nooca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-beddel-nooca\"\u003ETallaabooyin: beddel nooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC ah oo guji albaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa fiiri \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta koowaad ee panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, tusaale ahaan &quot;Single-Flush 900 x 2100&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU gudub habayn magaceeda ku dhamaata &quot;(type)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qiimaha aad rabto inaad beddesho, tusaale ahaan \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saaraha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor qiimaha cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E: qoraalka wuxuu ku dhamaadaa &quot;(type)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji albaab kale oo isla nooc ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi isla qiimaha: wuxuu kaloo muujinayaa qiimaha cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-beddel-hal-walax-oo-keliya\"\u003ETallaabooyin: beddel hal walax oo keliya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji hal albaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur habayn aan &quot;(type)&quot; ku jirin magaceeda, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EPset_DoorCommon\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qiime, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EFireRating\u003C/strong\u003E, ku qor qiimo cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji albaabka ku xiga, oo isla nooc ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi isla qiimaha: wuxuu weli muujinayaa qiimihii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXitaa haddii soo saaraha uu habaynta sifooyinkaas la wadaago labada albaab, BimCraft wuxuu albaabka koowaad siiyay nuqul u gaar ah ka hor inta uusan beddelin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties#why-your-edit-changes-only-one-element\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-hash=\"why-your-edit-changes-only-one-element\"\u003ESababta tafatirkaagu uu beddelo hal walax oo keliya\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur nuqulka la kaydiyay BimCraft-ka, ama IFC viewer kasta, si aad u hubiso labada beddel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeel kasta ma lahan nooc.\u003C/strong\u003E Soo saarayaal qaarkood ma qoraan walxo nooc ah, ama wax walba kiiska ku qoraan. Markaas ma jiraan habayn &quot;(type)&quot; ah, walxaha mid kasta waa in si gaar ah loo beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsla qiimaha wuxuu ku jiraa habayn nooc iyo habayn kiis.\u003C/strong\u003E Soo saarayaal qaarkood waxay ku qoraan cabbir labadaba. Barnaamijyo kale mid kasta ayay akhrin karaan; labadaba beddel haddii aad rabto inay isku waafaqaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFilashada inaad doorato &quot;dhammaan albaabada nooca ah&quot; oo aad wada tafatirto.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhismahan ma jiro doorasho badan. Sifada nooca waa habka ugu fudud ee lagu beddelo walxo badan mar keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Soo saaraha albaab nooc ah ku dhig si albaab kasta oo nooca ahaan uu u muujiyo, ka dibna hal albaab u sii darajo dab gaar ah, adigoo aan taabanin kuwa kale. Tani waxay muujinaysaa farqiga u dhexeeya sifooyinka nooca iyo sifooyinka kiiska ee BimCraft. Nooc mise kiis? Kiis wuxuu u taallaa hal walax keliya: calaamadeeda, tirada, qolkeeda, darajo dabkeeda gaarka ah. Nooc wuxuu u taallaa nooca ay walxo badan wadaagaan: soo saaraha, moodeelka, ballaca nooca albaabka. Panel-ka Properties gudihiisa, habaynta ka timid nooca waxay leedahay \" (type)\" ka dib magacooda, iyo sadar ah \"Sifada nooca: beddelka halkan wuxuu ku dhacaa dhammaan walxaha noocan ah.\" Habayn kasta oo kale waxay u taallaa walaxda laftiisa. Nooca qaybta koowaad waxa uu muujiyaa magaca nooca. Tallaabooyin: beddel nooca Fur moodeel IFC ah oo guji albaab. Ka fiiri Nooca qaybta koowaad ee panel-ka Properties, tusaale ahaan \"Single-Flush 900 x 2100\". U gudub habayn magaceeda ku dhamaata \"(type)\". Guji qiimaha aad rabto inaad beddesho, tusaale ahaan Soo saaraha. Ku qor qiimaha cusub oo riix Enter. Eeg liiska Changes: qoraalka wuxuu ku dhamaadaa \"(type)\". Guji albaab kale oo isla nooc ah. Hubi isla qiimaha: wuxuu kaloo muujinayaa qiimaha cusub. Tallaabooyin: beddel hal walax oo keliya Guji hal albaab. Fur habayn aan \"(type)\" ku jirin magaceeda, tusaale ahaan Pset_DoorCommon. Guji qiime, sida FireRating, ku qor qiimo cusub oo riix Enter. Guji albaabka ku xiga, oo isla nooc ah. Hubi isla qiimaha: wuxuu weli muujinayaa qiimihii hore. Xitaa haddii soo saaraha uu habaynta sifooyinkaas la wadaago labada albaab, BimCraft wuxuu albaabka koowaad siiyay nuqul u gaar ah ka hor inta uusan beddelin. Eeg Sababta tafatirkaagu uu beddelo hal walax oo keliya. Kaydi Guji Save as IFC ama riix Ctrl+S. Fur nuqulka la kaydiyay BimCraft-ka, ama IFC viewer kasta, si aad u hubiso labada beddel. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Moodeel kasta ma lahan nooc. Soo saarayaal qaarkood ma qoraan walxo nooc ah, ama wax walba kiiska ku qoraan. Markaas ma jiraan habayn \"(type)\" ah, walxaha mid kasta waa in si gaar ah loo beddelo. Isla qiimaha wuxuu ku jiraa habayn nooc iyo habayn kiis. Soo saarayaal qaarkood waxay ku qoraan cabbir labadaba. Barnaamijyo kale mid kasta ayay akhrin karaan; labadaba beddel haddii aad rabto inay isku waafaqaan. Filashada inaad doorato \"dhammaan albaabada nooca ah\" oo aad wada tafatirto. Dhismahan ma jiro doorasho badan. Sifada nooca waa habka ugu fudud ee lagu beddelo walxo badan mar keliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"piping-pcf","scope":"bimcraft","title":"U dir tuubada cadaadiska ama isometric-ka, oo dib u akhri (PCF)","summary":"Qor xariiqyada tuubada moodeelka sida faylka PCF ee qaybaha tuubada, ama akhri fayl PCF ah oo ka yimid barnaamij cadaadiska tuubada ama isometric, oo rasm tuubadiisa sida xariiqyo.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["pcf","faylka qaybaha tuubada","cadaadiska tuubada","isometric","isometrics","u dhoof","soo geli","tuubo","dhir","tuubo birta","wareejinta mashruuca","barnaamijyo kale"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"u-dhoof","text":"U dhoof","level":2},{"id":"soo-geli","text":"Soo geli","level":2},{"id":"hubi-waxa-soo-gaaray","text":"Hubi waxa soo gaaray","level":2},{"id":"tuubo-ku-jirta-faylka-ifc","text":"Tuubo ku jirta faylka IFC","level":2},{"id":"soo-gelinta-waxa-la-reebay","text":"Soo gelinta, waxa la reebay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPCF waa fayl qoraal fudud oo barnaamijyada cadaadiska tuubada iyo isometric-ka akhriyaan oo qoraan. Wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta oo tuubo ah oo leh dhamaadkeeda iyo boorkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dhoof\"\u003EU dhoof\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qalabka Tuubo. Safka ikhtiyaarka wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EExport PCF\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji. Xariiq tuubo kasta oo moodeelka ku jirta waa la qoraa: tuubo toosan, elbow-yo (wareeg 90 darajo, haddii kale bend), tee oo leh barta laantooda, reducer-yo iyo faalfo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuxuu isticmaalaa millimitir. Boorku waa dhexroorka magaca ah ee millimitir. Barta bartamaha elbow-ka waa geeskeeda, halkaas oo labada dhinac ay ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPCF waxa loo qoraa tuubada birta butt-weld. Xariiq agab kale ahna waa la qoraa, isticmaalaya furayaasha qaybaha birta, waxaana lagu xusaa panelka Problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli\"\u003ESoo geli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qalabka Tuubo oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EImport PCF…\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna dooro faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubo toosan ilaa elbow-yada, bends, faalfo iyo flanges waxay noqonayaan hal xariiq dabaqa hadda. Isbedelka cabbirka wuxuu bilaabaa xariiq cusub. Laanta tee-da waxay noqonaysaa xariiq u gaar ah oo ka bilaabanta bartamaha tee-da.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeeluhu wuxuu dhigaa fittings-kiisa. Reducer-yada iyo tee-yada lama koobiyeeyo: waxay muuqdaan meelaha xariiqyada cabbir kala duwan ama laan ay ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererka faylka waxa loo akhriyaa sida dhererka kor ka dhigan dabaqa hadda. Culeysyada, xakamaynta iyo falanqaynta cadaadiska laftooda ma jiraan faylka PCF, mana soo gelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-waxa-soo-gaaray\"\u003EHubi waxa soo gaaray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhererka tuubada oo wadar ah ee tuubo kasta waa inay ku dhigmaa ilaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka Problems wuxuu liistaa, mid kasta hal mar: elbow oo barta bartamaheeda aanay ahayn masaafo isku mid ah labada dhamaad, tuubo aan dherer lahayn, iyo bore aan ahayn cabbir caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubo-ku-jirta-faylka-ifc\"\u003ETuubo ku jirta faylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka faylka IFC la furo, \u003Cstrong\u003EExport PCF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale qorayaa qaybaha tuubada, fittings-ka iyo faalfooyinkiisa, xariiqyada aad rasmeysay ku xigta. Qayb kasta wuxuu dhamaadkiisa ka helaa dekedahiisa, ama dhamaadka jidhkiisa. Fitting aan dekedo lahayn waa laga reebay, panelka Problems wuu sheegaa. Waad u dhoofi kartaa IFC keliya haddii moodeelku aanu lahayn xariiq la rasmeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-gelinta-waxa-la-reebay\"\u003ESoo gelinta, waxa la reebay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka la soo geliyo, taageerooyinka, olets, flanges, gaskets iyo caps ee faylka lama rasmeeyo. Panelka Problems wuxuu sheegaa tirada mid kasta oo la reebay, si wax aan la ogeysiin uga baxin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid PCF waa fayl qoraal fudud oo barnaamijyada cadaadiska tuubada iyo isometric-ka akhriyaan oo qoraan. Wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta oo tuubo ah oo leh dhamaadkeeda iyo boorkeeda. U dhoof Dooro qalabka Tuubo. Safka ikhtiyaarka wuxuu muujiyaa Export PCF. Guji. Xariiq tuubo kasta oo moodeelka ku jirta waa la qoraa: tuubo toosan, elbow-yo (wareeg 90 darajo, haddii kale bend), tee oo leh barta laantooda, reducer-yo iyo faalfo. Faylku wuxuu isticmaalaa millimitir. Boorku waa dhexroorka magaca ah ee millimitir. Barta bartamaha elbow-ka waa geeskeeda, halkaas oo labada dhinac ay ku kulmaan. PCF waxa loo qoraa tuubada birta butt-weld. Xariiq agab kale ahna waa la qoraa, isticmaalaya furayaasha qaybaha birta, waxaana lagu xusaa panelka Problems. Soo geli Dooro qalabka Tuubo oo guji Import PCF…, kadibna dooro faylka. Tuubo toosan ilaa elbow-yada, bends, faalfo iyo flanges waxay noqonayaan hal xariiq dabaqa hadda. Isbedelka cabbirka wuxuu bilaabaa xariiq cusub. Laanta tee-da waxay noqonaysaa xariiq u gaar ah oo ka bilaabanta bartamaha tee-da. Moodeeluhu wuxuu dhigaa fittings-kiisa. Reducer-yada iyo tee-yada lama koobiyeeyo: waxay muuqdaan meelaha xariiqyada cabbir kala duwan ama laan ay ku kulmaan. Dhererka faylka waxa loo akhriyaa sida dhererka kor ka dhigan dabaqa hadda. Culeysyada, xakamaynta iyo falanqaynta cadaadiska laftooda ma jiraan faylka PCF, mana soo gelaan. Hubi waxa soo gaaray Dhererka tuubada oo wadar ah ee tuubo kasta waa inay ku dhigmaa ilaha. Panelka Problems wuxuu liistaa, mid kasta hal mar: elbow oo barta bartamaheeda aanay ahayn masaafo isku mid ah labada dhamaad, tuubo aan dherer lahayn, iyo bore aan ahayn cabbir caadi ah. Tuubo ku jirta faylka IFC Marka faylka IFC la furo, Export PCF wuxuu sidoo kale qorayaa qaybaha tuubada, fittings-ka iyo faalfooyinkiisa, xariiqyada aad rasmeysay ku xigta. Qayb kasta wuxuu dhamaadkiisa ka helaa dekedahiisa, ama dhamaadka jidhkiisa. Fitting aan dekedo lahayn waa laga reebay, panelka Problems wuu sheegaa. Waad u dhoofi kartaa IFC keliya haddii moodeelku aanu lahayn xariiq la rasmeeyay. Soo gelinta, waxa la reebay Marka la soo geliyo, taageerooyinka, olets, flanges, gaskets iyo caps ee faylka lama rasmeeyo. Panelka Problems wuxuu sheegaa tirada mid kasta oo la reebay, si wax aan la ogeysiin uga baxin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"read-rvt-file","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Akhri faylka mashruuca ama qoyska","summary":"Fur fayl `.rvt`, `.rfa`, `.rte` ama `.rft` oo akhri siideynteeda, shaqada wadaagga, macluumaadka mashruuca, sifooyinka qoyska, xidhiidhada iyo sawirka hore, iyada oo aan barnaamijkii sameeyay la furin.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["rvt","rfa","rte","rft","faylka mashruuca","qoys","siideyn","nooca","dhismaha","wadaag","dhexe","macluumaadka mashruuca","sawir hore","sawirka yar","xidhiidhada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"sababta-aanu-3d-u-jirin","text":"Sababta aanu 3D u jirin","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOgow waxa ku jira fayl mashruuc ama qoys iyada oo aan Revit lagu furin: nooca keydiyay, haddii uu shaqo wadaag leeyahay, macluumaadka mashruuca, iyo waxa uu ku xidhan yahay. Waa waxtar marka fayl laga helo qof kale oo aad u baahan tahay inaad ogaato nooca loo furo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro fayl\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug wax yar. Jaraha xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Akhrinta faylka…&quot; kadibna &quot;Furay \u003Cem\u003Emagaca faylka\u003C/em\u003E&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiiri sare kaarka: sawirka hore ee faylka lagu keydiyay, nooca faylka iyo siideynta uu lagu keydiyay, iyo magaca mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos u dhaadhac si aad u akhrido qaybaha kaarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarka dhexe, oo leh qaybahan marka faylku hayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaybta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu kuu sheegayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca faylka, cabbirka, nooca (mashruuc, qaab mashruuc, qoys ama qaab qoys), siideynta iyo dhismaha lagu keydiyay, shaqada wadaagga, jidka moodeelka dhexe, meesha ugu dambeysay ee laga keydiyay, cidda keydisay, luqadda iyo GUID-ka dokumentka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject information\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaha mashruuca, sida magaca, lambarka, macmiilka, cinwaanka iyo xaaladda. Goobaha weli ku jira qiimayaashii caadiga ahaa ee mashruuca cusub waa laga reebay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFamily, Family: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoys ahaan: magaciisa, qaybtiisa, siideynta, cusboonaysiinta ugu dambeysay iyo sifooyinkiisa, koox koox\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked and referenced files\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel kasta oo xidhan, xidhiidh CAD, sawir iyo miiska qoraalka (keynote) ee faylku tilmaamo, iyo jidkiisa keydsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidoo kale, panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E ee bidix ayaa soo celinaya xaqiiqooyinka muhiimka ah oo wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E: inta faylka BimCraft uu si dhab ah u akhriyay, badanaa qiyaastii 40 KB oo ka mid ah fayl dhowr megabyte ah. Dhinaca midig, panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa in sifooyinka walxaha ay u baahan yihiin moodeelka 3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sababta-aanu-3d-u-jirin\"\u003ESababta aanu 3D u jirin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeelka 3D iyo walxaha gudaha faylka mashruuca waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaab aan la qoraal ahayn. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaybaha faylka ee la qoray ama si fudud loo akhriyi karo: macluumaadka faylka, macluumaadka mashruuca, xogta qoyska, liiska xidhiidhada iyo sawirka hore. Ma qiyaaso qaybaha kale. Si aad u aragto moodeelka 3D oo aad u akhrido sifooyinka walxaha, dhoofi IFC barnaamijka uu faylka sameeyay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EFaylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC kor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIn la filayo 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg kor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhadu waxay muujiyaan jidka keydsan oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Fayl keligiis la furo ma hubin karo in xidhiidhadaasi jiraan. Taasi waxay ku hagaajiyaa furista galka uu ku nool yahay: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E. BimCraft wuxuu xidhiidh kasta ku calaamadeeyaa &quot;la helay&quot; ama &quot;lama helin&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Faylkan waa dhammaystirnayn ah…&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka waa la jaray intii la koobiyeynayay, la soo raraayay ama la isku dhigay. Faylka kaydka cloud-ka ee weli &quot;online only&quot; ah ayaa sidaas sameeya. BimCraft weli wuu furaa wuxuuna muujiyaa oo keliya waxa la soo kiciyay: fariin jaalle ah oo sare kaarka ku taal, qayb magaceedu yahay \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga soo kiciyay faylkan\u003C/strong\u003E oo liistaa qaybaha baytkii kasta uu faylka ku jiro, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka kuma jirto\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta kale. Waxba lama buuxin qaybta maqan, sidaas darteed siideynta, sawirka hore ama macluumaadka mashruuca way maqnaan karaan marka ay ka dambeysay jarka. Haddii xitaa liiska waxyaabaha faylka la jaray, waxba ma furmi karo. Nuqulka asalka ah mar kale koobiyee oo dib u fur si aad u hesho faylka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Ma jiro sawir hore faylkan&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaar ka mid ah faylasha waxa lagu keydiyaa iyada oo aan lahayn. Taasi waa caadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul furista khalad ahaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Fayl magac ahaan sida \u003Ccode\u003ETower.0004.rvt\u003C/code\u003E waa nuqul lambar leh. Galka furistiisa ayaa ku kooxeeya moodeelkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ogow waxa ku jira fayl mashruuc ama qoys iyada oo aan Revit lagu furin: nooca keydiyay, haddii uu shaqo wadaag leeyahay, macluumaadka mashruuca, iyo waxa uu ku xidhan yahay. Waa waxtar marka fayl laga helo qof kale oo aad u baahan tahay inaad ogaato nooca loo furo. Tallaabooyin Riix Dooro fayl. Dooro fayl .rvt, .rfa, .rte ama .rft. Sug wax yar. Jaraha xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Akhrinta faylka…\" kadibna \"Furay magaca faylka\". Fiiri sare kaarka: sawirka hore ee faylka lagu keydiyay, nooca faylka iyo siideynta uu lagu keydiyay, iyo magaca mashruuca. Hoos u dhaadhac si aad u akhrido qaybaha kaarka. Waxa aad arkaysaa Kaarka dhexe, oo leh qaybahan marka faylku hayo: Qaybta Waxa uu kuu sheegayaa File Magaca faylka, cabbirka, nooca (mashruuc, qaab mashruuc, qoys ama qaab qoys), siideynta iyo dhismaha lagu keydiyay, shaqada wadaagga, jidka moodeelka dhexe, meesha ugu dambeysay ee laga keydiyay, cidda keydisay, luqadda iyo GUID-ka dokumentka Project information Goobaha mashruuca, sida magaca, lambarka, macmiilka, cinwaanka iyo xaaladda. Goobaha weli ku jira qiimayaashii caadiga ahaa ee mashruuca cusub waa laga reebay. Family, Family: … Qoys ahaan: magaciisa, qaybtiisa, siideynta, cusboonaysiinta ugu dambeysay iyo sifooyinkiisa, koox koox Linked and referenced files Moodel kasta oo xidhan, xidhiidh CAD, sawir iyo miiska qoraalka (keynote) ee faylku tilmaamo, iyo jidkiisa keydsan Sidoo kale, panelka File ee bidix ayaa soo celinaya xaqiiqooyinka muhiimka ah oo wuxuu ku daraa Read: inta faylka BimCraft uu si dhab ah u akhriyay, badanaa qiyaastii 40 KB oo ka mid ah fayl dhowr megabyte ah. Dhinaca midig, panelka Properties wuxuu sheegayaa in sifooyinka walxaha ay u baahan yihiin moodeelka 3D. Sababta aanu 3D u jirin Moodeelka 3D iyo walxaha gudaha faylka mashruuca waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaab aan la qoraal ahayn. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaybaha faylka ee la qoray ama si fudud loo akhriyi karo: macluumaadka faylka, macluumaadka mashruuca, xogta qoyska, liiska xidhiidhada iyo sawirka hore. Ma qiyaaso qaybaha kale. Si aad u aragto moodeelka 3D oo aad u akhrido sifooyinka walxaha, dhoofi IFC barnaamijka uu faylka sameeyay. Eeg Faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC kor. Khaladaadka caadiga ah In la filayo 3D. Eeg kor. Xidhiidhadu waxay muujiyaan jidka keydsan oo keliya. Fayl keligiis la furo ma hubin karo in xidhiidhadaasi jiraan. Taasi waxay ku hagaajiyaa furista galka uu ku nool yahay: Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan. BimCraft wuxuu xidhiidh kasta ku calaamadeeyaa \"la helay\" ama \"lama helin\". \"Faylkan waa dhammaystirnayn ah…\" Faylka waa la jaray intii la koobiyeynayay, la soo raraayay ama la isku dhigay. Faylka kaydka cloud-ka ee weli \"online only\" ah ayaa sidaas sameeya. BimCraft weli wuu furaa wuxuuna muujiyaa oo keliya waxa la soo kiciyay: fariin jaalle ah oo sare kaarka ku taal, qayb magaceedu yahay Laga soo kiciyay faylkan oo liistaa qaybaha baytkii kasta uu faylka ku jiro, iyo Faylka kuma jirto qaybta kale. Waxba lama buuxin qaybta maqan, sidaas darteed siideynta, sawirka hore ama macluumaadka mashruuca way maqnaan karaan marka ay ka dambeysay jarka. Haddii xitaa liiska waxyaabaha faylka la jaray, waxba ma furmi karo. Nuqulka asalka ah mar kale koobiyee oo dib u fur si aad u hesho faylka oo dhan. \"Ma jiro sawir hore faylkan\". Qaar ka mid ah faylasha waxa lagu keydiyaa iyada oo aan lahayn. Taasi waa caadi. Nuqul furista khalad ahaan. Fayl magac ahaan sida Tower.0004.rvt waa nuqul lambar leh. Galka furistiisa ayaa ku kooxeeya moodeelkooda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"people-in-the-building","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dadka dhismaha ku socodsii","summary":"Ka bixid degdeg ah ama imaanshaha maalinta caadiga ah ee qolalkaaga, albaabyadaaga iyo jiidaha, iyadoo isku-socodka laga helo meelaha dhismuhu yaraado, safarka ugu dheer ee ilaa ka bixid qol kasta, iyo natiijooyinka sida Dhibaatooyin. Qalab naqshadayn dadka ah oo go'aannada loogu talo galay, ma aha shahaado amniga dabka.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["dad","ka bixid","ka baxid","dhoof","masaafada safarka","isku-soco","ballac albaab","jid","jiid","imaansho","xannibaad","dhibaatooyin","waa maxaa haddii","qolal","albaab xidhan"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-socodsii","text":"Ku socodsii","level":2},{"id":"waa-maxaa-haddii","text":"Waa maxaa haddii","level":2},{"id":"sida-ay-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida ay u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"dadka-qol-kasta","text":"Dadka qol kasta","level":2},{"id":"isku-socodka-albaabada","text":"Isku-socodka albaabada","level":2},{"id":"jiidaha-iyo-fadhiyada","text":"Jiidaha iyo fadhiyada","level":2},{"id":"aragtida-3d","text":"Aragtida 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeople in the building\u003C/span\u003E qaybta bidix wuxuu dadka ku socodsiiyaa qolalka, albaabyada iyo jiidaha moodelka IFC ee furan. Waxba ma beddelmo moodelka oo waxba lama soo rarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab naqshadayn, ma aha shahaado amniga dabka\u003C/strong\u003E. Ma garanayso dab, qiiq, cabsi, kala duwanaanshaha dhaqdhaqaaqa ama waxa xeerku kugu doono. Xuduudaha waa adiga: safarka ugu dheer ee ilaa ka bixid iyo waqtiga la heli karo waa tirooyin aad qortid; midna lama malaynayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-socodsii\"\u003EKu socodsii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel leh qolal xidhan iyo albaabo. Albaab leh qol hal dhinac ah waa ka bixid; albaab u dhexeeya laba qol wuu isku xidhaa; jid wuxuu isku xidhaa qolalka dhamaadkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKa bixid\u003C/strong\u003E (dadka oo dhan ayaa u socda ka bixid), \u003Cstrong\u003EImaansho\u003C/strong\u003E (dadka oo dhan ayaa soo galaya oo u socda qol) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIsdhaafsiga\u003C/strong\u003E (dadka qolalka ka baxaya halka dad la mid ah ay soo galayaan), iyo meesha dhulka qof kasta. Qolalka loo magacaabay sida koridor, jid, lobby ama musqul ma hayaan qof.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad heli doontaa waqtiga dadka ugu dambeeya ee ka baxay (iyo markii badhkood iyo sagaal meel ka tobanka), isku-socodka albaab kasta iyo jid kasta, qolka leh safarka ugu dheer, iyo qorshe ciyaara orodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-maxaa-haddii\"\u003EWaa maxaa haddii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShut\u003C/span\u003E albaab ku jira miiska oo mar kale orod. Dadka waxay helayaan jid kale, ama qolalka aan waddo ka bixin lagu liisan doonaa sida khaladaad. Albaab laba jeer ballac weyn wuxuu qolal si ka dhakhso badan u faaruqiyaa; miiskuna wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha isku-socodka ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-ay-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida ay u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQol kasta waa shabakad, sidaas darteed dadku waxay ku wareegaan geeska, ma aha inay ku maraan darbiga. Xawaaruhu wuu hoos u dhacaa qolku markuu buuxo (S = 1.4 (1 − 0.266 D) m/s, D waa dad in m² kasta). Albaab wuxuu u oggolaadaa 1.3 qof sekan kasta mitir ballac kasta, oo laga jaray 150 mm dhinac kasta; jid wuxuu u oggolaadaa 1.0 iyo socod aad u gaabsan. Dadka waxay sugaan isku-soco ku dhufan oo qofkii hore u yimid ayuu hore u gudbaa. Lambarka orodka wuxuu ku celiyaa isla orodkii si sax ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiyaha ayaa wuxuu orodi karaa wax isku mid ah: weydii ka bixid, ama safarka ugu dheer ee ilaa ka bixid qol kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dadka-qol-kasta\"\u003EDadka qol kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeople in each room\u003C/span\u003E si aad lambar u qortid qol kasta. Sanduuqa madhan wuxuu isticmaalaa tirada meesha dhulka (oo lagu muujiyo midab cawl); 0 wuxuu faaruqiyaa qol. Tirooyinkaaga waxaa loo isticmaalaa orodka, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-socodka-albaabada\"\u003EIsku-socodka albaabada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu \u003Cstrong\u003EKa bixid\u003C/strong\u003E, dadka u baxaya iyo dadka soo galaya waxay ku kulmaan albaabyada isku mid. Markii albaab uu qof jihada kale ka soo socda dhow ku raaco qofkii ugu dambeeyay, wuxuu hayaa qayb ka mid ah heerkiisa (0.8 halkan; qiyaas, maxaa yeelay qiyamaha la daabacay way kala duwan yihiin), miiskuna wuxuu tiriyaa isbedelada jihada. Albaab isbeddelo badan ayaa ku liistay Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiidaha-iyo-fadhiyada\"\u003EJiidaha iyo fadhiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFadhi kasta oo jid ah wuxuu kharash u yahay socodsiiyaha hal ilbiriq oo lagu rogo (qiyaas). Jid toos ah ma leh; jid L ama U wuxuu leeyahay mid. Heerka jidku wuxuu wali ka imanayaa ballaca qeybtiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aragtida-3d\"\u003EAragtida 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the people in the 3D view\u003C/span\u003E waxaa muuqda dadka sida sawirro moodelka ku jira, midabkooda oo ku salaysan waxay sameynayaan, oo waxay dhaqaaqaan markaad ciyaarto orodka. Wax moodelka lagu darin maayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"People in the building qaybta bidix wuxuu dadka ku socodsiiyaa qolalka, albaabyada iyo jiidaha moodelka IFC ee furan. Waxba ma beddelmo moodelka oo waxba lama soo rarin. Tani waa qalab naqshadayn, ma aha shahaado amniga dabka. Ma garanayso dab, qiiq, cabsi, kala duwanaanshaha dhaqdhaqaaqa ama waxa xeerku kugu doono. Xuduudaha waa adiga: safarka ugu dheer ee ilaa ka bixid iyo waqtiga la heli karo waa tirooyin aad qortid; midna lama malaynayo. Ku socodsii Fur moodel leh qolal xidhan iyo albaabo. Albaab leh qol hal dhinac ah waa ka bixid; albaab u dhexeeya laba qol wuu isku xidhaa; jid wuxuu isku xidhaa qolalka dhamaadkiisa. Dooro Ka bixid (dadka oo dhan ayaa u socda ka bixid), Imaansho (dadka oo dhan ayaa soo galaya oo u socda qol) ama Isdhaafsiga (dadka qolalka ka baxaya halka dad la mid ah ay soo galayaan), iyo meesha dhulka qof kasta. Qolalka loo magacaabay sida koridor, jid, lobby ama musqul ma hayaan qof. Riix Run. Waxaad heli doontaa waqtiga dadka ugu dambeeya ee ka baxay (iyo markii badhkood iyo sagaal meel ka tobanka), isku-socodka albaab kasta iyo jid kasta, qolka leh safarka ugu dheer, iyo qorshe ciyaara orodka. Waa maxaa haddii Calaamadi Shut albaab ku jira miiska oo mar kale orod. Dadka waxay helayaan jid kale, ama qolalka aan waddo ka bixin lagu liisan doonaa sida khaladaad. Albaab laba jeer ballac weyn wuxuu qolal si ka dhakhso badan u faaruqiyaa; miiskuna wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha isku-socodka ku jira. Sida ay u shaqeyso Qol kasta waa shabakad, sidaas darteed dadku waxay ku wareegaan geeska, ma aha inay ku maraan darbiga. Xawaaruhu wuu hoos u dhacaa qolku markuu buuxo (S = 1.4 (1 − 0.266 D) m/s, D waa dad in m² kasta). Albaab wuxuu u oggolaadaa 1.3 qof sekan kasta mitir ballac kasta, oo laga jaray 150 mm dhinac kasta; jid wuxuu u oggolaadaa 1.0 iyo socod aad u gaabsan. Dadka waxay sugaan isku-soco ku dhufan oo qofkii hore u yimid ayuu hore u gudbaa. Lambarka orodka wuxuu ku celiyaa isla orodkii si sax ah. Caawiyaha ayaa wuxuu orodi karaa wax isku mid ah: weydii ka bixid, ama safarka ugu dheer ee ilaa ka bixid qol kasta. Dadka qol kasta Fur People in each room si aad lambar u qortid qol kasta. Sanduuqa madhan wuxuu isticmaalaa tirada meesha dhulka (oo lagu muujiyo midab cawl); 0 wuxuu faaruqiyaa qol. Tirooyinkaaga waxaa loo isticmaalaa orodka, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan. Isku-socodka albaabada Ku Ka bixid, dadka u baxaya iyo dadka soo galaya waxay ku kulmaan albaabyada isku mid. Markii albaab uu qof jihada kale ka soo socda dhow ku raaco qofkii ugu dambeeyay, wuxuu hayaa qayb ka mid ah heerkiisa (0.8 halkan; qiyaas, maxaa yeelay qiyamaha la daabacay way kala duwan yihiin), miiskuna wuxuu tiriyaa isbedelada jihada. Albaab isbeddelo badan ayaa ku liistay Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro. Jiidaha iyo fadhiyada Fadhi kasta oo jid ah wuxuu kharash u yahay socodsiiyaha hal ilbiriq oo lagu rogo (qiyaas). Jid toos ah ma leh; jid L ama U wuxuu leeyahay mid. Heerka jidku wuxuu wali ka imanayaa ballaca qeybtiisa. Aragtida 3D Calaamadi Show the people in the 3D view waxaa muuqda dadka sida sawirro moodelka ku jira, midabkooda oo ku salaysan waxay sameynayaan, oo waxay dhaqaaqaan markaad ciyaarto orodka. Wax moodelka lagu darin maayo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"frame-analysis","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Falanqee qaab-dhismeedka","summary":"Xoogagga, falcelinta iyo foorarka biimaha, tiirarka iyo xidhayaasha moodelka ee hoos culeysyada iyo isku-darka aad dejisay, oo lagu kaydiyay IFC. Caawiye falanqayn, ma aha hubin xeer.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["falanqayn","cutubyada","feet iyo inches","cutubka muuqda","falanqaynta qaab-dhismeedka","hubinta naqshadda","isticmaalka","la rogay","la alxamay","AISC 360","EN 1993-1-1","falanqaynta qaab-dhismeedka","moodeelka falanqaynta","habka adkaynta","culeysyo","xaaladda culeysyada","isku-darka","culeyska joogtada","culeyska kala duwan","culeyska naftiisa","falcelin","xoogga bend (bending moment)","xoogga jeexa (shear)","xoogga toosan (axial force)","foorarka","qaabka foorarka","taageerayaasha","pinned","fixed","sii-deyn","warbixin","pdf","csv","craftscript","frame3d","biimaha","tiirarka","xubnaha"],"headings":[{"id":"socodsii","text":"Socodsii","level":2},{"id":"sida-moodelka-falanqaynta-loo-sameeyo","text":"Sida moodelka falanqaynta loo sameeyo","level":2},{"id":"kiisaska-isku-darka-calaamadaha-iyo-warbixinta","text":"Kiisaska, isku-darka, calaamadaha iyo warbixinta","level":2},{"id":"cutubyada","text":"Cutubyada","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-naqshadda","text":"Hubinta naqshadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E ee tabka midig wuxuu helaa xoogagga biimaha, tiirarka iyo xidhayaasha moodelka furan, falcelinta cagaha tiirarka, iyo intee ka foorarta xubnaha, culeysyada aad siisay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecaawiye falanqayn, ma aha hubin xeer\u003C/strong\u003E. Falanqaynta ma aha xeer naqshad: ma cabbirto xubnaha, ma hubiso awoodooda, ma dooranayso culeys-isku-dhufka. Injineer ayaa hubiya moodelka falanqaynta, culeysyadiisa iyo taageerayaasha, wuxuuna go&#039;aamiyaa macnaha tirooyinka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda\u003C/span\u003E ee hoosta ayaa hubisa biimaha birta la rogay ee AISC 360 ama EN 1993-1-1, caawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodsii\"\u003ESocodsii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC iyo tabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro hal ama in ka badan oo biim, tiir ama xidhay aragga, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaaladda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuleys\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJihada\u003C/span\u003E, qor qiimaha oo taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar culeys\u003C/span\u003E: kN/m culeys ku faafsan xubin, kN culeys barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodso falanqaynta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska wuxuu liistaa xoogga toosan ee ugu weyn ee xubin kasta, jeexyada, foorarka, wareejinta iyo qotada; guji magaca xubin si aad aragga uga doorato. Hoostiisa waxaa ah falcelinta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelka dushiisa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa qaabka foorarka, ama hal falcelin oo sawir ah dhinac kasta xubin. Natiijooyinku way ka duwanaan karaan marka moodelku isbeddelo: dib u socodsii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECuleys kasta iyo dejin kasta waa hal isbeddel liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo celinaya, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ku hayaa faylka (guryaha \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Analysis\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca), si markii dambe moodelka halkan la furo culeysyadiisu weli jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-moodelka-falanqaynta-loo-sameeyo\"\u003ESida moodelka falanqaynta loo sameeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKasta oo IfcBeam, IfcColumn iyo IfcMember oo qaabkeedu yahay hal soo-bixid toosan, wuxuu noqdaa xubin ku taal xarriiqda dhexe ee qaybtiisa. Sifooyinkeeda qaybtu waxay ka yimaadaan profile-ka: I, U, L iyo T, afar-geesood iyo tuubooyin, goobo iyo tuubooyin wareegsan, ama qaab xidhan oo kasta (markaas joogta qallafsanaanta waa qiyas, oo warbixinta lagu sheegaa). Wax kasta oo kale waa laga reebaa oo waa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel gudahiisa, biimaha waxay joogsadaan wajiga tiir kasta oo ay ka hoos yihiin dabaqa. Dhamaad kasta oo xubin waxaa loo qaadaa xarriiqdiisa oo gaadha xarriiqda xubinta uu ku xidhan yahay, marka xarriiqdaasi u dhow tahay (qiyaastii cabbirka qaybaha), xubintaasna halkaas ayaa laga gooyaa. Warbixinta waxay sheegtaa inta dhamaad la dhaqaajiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECagaha tiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E wax hoos ka gaadha ma jiraan waa taageerayaal: go&#039;an (bilowga) ama pinned (la hayo oo laga hortago wareegga, laakiin xor u ah inuu wareego).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaadyada biimaha\u003C/strong\u003E waa adag ama pinned sida xeerka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhamaadyada biimka aan xidhiidh lahayn\u003C/span\u003E u dhigayo; \u003Cstrong\u003Exidhayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E (IfcMember) labada dhinac waa pinned. Dooro hal xubin si aad u siiso dhamaadyadeeda, ama cagta tiirka, xeer u gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlaabta magaca ayay ku salaysan tahay: kongareeto (E = 30 GPa), alwaax (E = 11 GPa), kale waa biro (E = 200 GPa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii qaabku dhaqaaqi karo isagoo aan wax foorarin — mekanism — socodsiintu way joogsataa oo waxay sheegtaa meesha iyo jihada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kiisaska-isku-darka-calaamadaha-iyo-warbixinta\"\u003EKiisaska, isku-darka, calaamadaha iyo warbixinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFalanqaynta waxay bilaabataa \u003Cstrong\u003EDead\u003C/strong\u003E (miisaanka naftiisa), \u003Cstrong\u003ELive\u003C/strong\u003E (culeyska jiritaanka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDead + live\u003C/strong\u003E; ku dar kiisas iyo isku-dar, iyadoo adeegsanaysa factor-yada uu xeerka naqshaddaadu codsado. N &gt; 0 waa tansiyon; My &gt; 0 wuxuu xubinta dhinaceeda hoose ee -z ku keenaa tansiyon (biimka oo culeyska dhulka hoosta u foorarta wuxuu leeyahay My &gt; 0).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixin (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixin (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E waxay hayaan malo-aadinta, qaybaha, kiisaska, falcelinta iyo wadarta, xoogagga xubnaha, foorarka iyo dahaarka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi CraftScript\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa qaabka qaab-dhismeedka PartCraft Script workspace, halkaas oo shaqada maktabada \u003Ccode\u003Eframe3d\u003C/code\u003E ay ku xallisay koodka la akhrin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka waa habka adkaynta tooska ah (direct stiffness), rogmo oo heer-koowaad ah ilaa aad ka dhigto \u003Cstrong\u003ESecond order (P-Delta)\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu hubiyay kiisaska buugaagta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESecond order (P-Delta).\u003C/strong\u003E Ka calaamadee \u003Cem\u003ESecond order (P-Delta)\u003C/em\u003E dhinaca Run: isku-dar kasta waa la xalliyaa mar kale iyadoo xoogagga toosan ee xubinta ay saameeyaan qaabka foorarka (xubin kasta waxaa loo gooyaa 4 qaybood, si foorarka xubinta u dhex-dhexaad ah iyo dhamaadkeeda uu u tirmo), ilaa xoogagga toosan ay degaan. Xariiqda natiijada waxay sheegtaa tirada marxaladaha iyo inta ay dhaqaajinta kordhay; foorarka, hubinta naqshadda iyo warbixintu waxay isticmaalaan natiijooyinkan. Ka sarreeya culeyska xadka caabbinta ee qaabka, socodsiintu way joogsataa oo waa sheegtaa. Waa caabbin ku socota oo wareeg yar leh, flexural keliya, aan lahayn yaraynta adkaynta ama culeysyada male-awaan (ma aha habka AISC direct analysis keligiis); sagxadaha, derbiyada iyo sagxadaha adag waxay ku sii jiraan first order.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadaadiska sagxadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Sagxadaha shubka ah (falanqaynta waxay u akhrisaa sagxad sida lakabyo markii alaabtu tahay shub), qaybta Culeysyada waxay leedahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadaadiska sagxad kasta\u003C/span\u003E: qor kN/m², dooro kiiska kore oo taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sagxadaha\u003C/span\u003E. Waa la faafiyaa sagxad kasta oo falanqaynta heshay, hoos loo riixo, waxaana lagu liistaa xiriir \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa hal cadaadis oo dhammaan sagxadaha u jira, ma aha mid sagxad kasta; ma aha culeys xeer: qor qiimaha injineerkaagu siiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhawaaqyada dabiiciga ah (qaybaha xadidan).\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha limitada: dhawaaqyada dabiiciga ah\u003C/span\u003E ee hoosta natiijooyinka waxay helaa qaababka ugu hooseeya ee isla moodelka iyadoo adeegsanaysa injinka qaybaha xadidan: biimaha oo leh sii-deynta dhamaadkooda, sagxadaha iyo derbiyada oo ah qolof afar-barood, sagxadaha adag, taageerayaasha. Dooro inta qaab (3, 6, 10 ama 20) iyo qaybta sagxadda (qolofka afar-barood ee sagxadaha dhumuc ama khafiif, ama kan sagxadda khafiifka ah) oo taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel dhawaaqyada\u003C/span\u003E. Miiska wuxuu siiyaa qaab kasta dhawaaqa Hz-ka, muddada ilbiriqsiyada, iyo miisaanka wax-ka-qabashada ee X, Y, Z oo qayb ka ah miisaanka dhaqaajin kara. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu muuji moodelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa qaab kasta sida qaabka foorarka loo sawiro. Miisaanku waa densiti-ga alaabta marka lagu dhuftay mugga: culeysyadu ma kordhiyaan miisaanka, alaabta aan densiti lahayn ma leh. Warbixinta (PDF, CSV) waxay qaadaysaa miiska. Waa rogmo iyo dhaqdhaqaaq yar oo keliya, ma jiro culeys dhulgariir ama dabayl oo laga sameeyey xeer halkan. Ma aha hubin xeer; injineerkaagu wuu dib u eegaa natiijooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJawaabta xooggii, taariikhda waqtiga iyo riixitaanka (pushover).\u003C/strong\u003E Saddex qaybood oo kale ayaa hoos ugu jira dhawaaqyada, iyadoo adeegsanaya isla moodelka qaybaha xadidan. Miisaanka dhammaantood waa densiti-ga alaabta iyo culeysyada hoos-u-riixa ee kiisaska aad calaamadeysay, mid kasta oo lagu dhufo factor aad qortay (tusaale, Dead 1 iyo Live qayb aad u tirinayso miisaan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJawaabta xooggii\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa qaab kasta spectrum aad siisay (miis muddo iyo xawaare, ama qaabka ASCE 7 ee SDS, SD1 iyo TL; badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal qiyamyada Dhulgariirka\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka nuqulaya qiyamyadaas qaybta Dhulgariirka), wuxuuna isku geliyaa qaababka CQC, SRSS, xeerka toban boqolkiiba ama wadarta buuxda, kadibna wuxuu isku geliyaa jihooyinka X, Y, Z (100 % + 30 % ama SRSS). Wuxuu siiyaa cadaadiska saldhigga, dhaqaajinta dabaqyada, xoogagga dhamaadka xubinta, iyo miis qaabab oo digta marka qaababka la isticmaalay ay ka yar yihiin 90 % miisaanka. Natiijooyinka waad ku cabbiri kartaa factor ama ilaa cadaadis saldhig oo aad qortay; qaybtu marna kuma xisaabiso cadaadiskaas. Natiijooyinku ma leeyihiin calaamad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaariikhda waqtiga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa xawaaraha dhulka isagoo adeegsanaya isku-darka qaababka (sax u ah khadadka toosan ee duubista) ama isku-dhufka toosan (Newmark average acceleration oo leh Rayleigh damping). Gelinta waa sine ama pulse la sameeyay (had iyo jeer lagu calaamadiyaa synthetic), duubis aad ku dhejiso, ama fayl qoraal ah oo aad furto (waqti iyo xawaare, hal xawaare saf kasta oo leh step, ama fayl qaabka PEER oo leh madax DT=; g ama m/s²). Waxay siisaa dhaqaajinta saqafka iyo cadaadiska saldhigga marka waqtiga, dhaqaajinta dabaq kasta, iyo dahaarka xoogagga dhamaadka xubinta. Moodelada duubis aad u dheer leh waxay ilaaliyaan kaliya kalfadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiixitaanka (pushover)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu saqafka dhinac ahaan ugu riixaa tillaabo yaryar (qaab la mid ah qaabka koowaad, ama isku mid ah), iyadoo qalfiyo plastik ah ay ku jiraan dhamaadka xubinta leh qaabka I. Qalfi wuxuu ku soo degaa xagga plastikada ah, kaas oo hoos u dhacaa markii xoogga toosan kordho (lagu xisaabiyo qaabka la sawiray, fillet-yada lama tixgeliyo); hardening waa ikhtiyaari, P-delta waa ikhtiyaari, isku-darka culeyska dhulka ayaa lagu dabaqi karaa marka hore. Waxay siisaa xariiqda awoodda (cadaadiska saldhigga iyo dhaqaajinta saqafka), qalfiga ugu horreeya, iyo xaaladda iyo wareegga plastikada ah ee qalfi kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodsii taariikhda waqtiga ee khadka jajabka ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa qalfiyada isla duubista qaybta Taariikhda waqtiga moodelada yaryar. Qalfiyo waxay samaysmaan dhamaadka xubinta oo keliya (dhig nood halka qalfi u baahan yahay gudaha bannaanka); xubin labada dhinac sii-deysan ma helayso; dhalaalka iyo buckling-ka xidhayaasha lama moodelo; sagxadaha iyo derbiyada waxay ku sii jiraan rogmo; ma jiro shuruudo aqbalaad. Ma aha hubin xeer; injineerkaagu wuu dib u eegaa natiijooyinka. Dejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa moodelka, warbixintuna waxay qaadaysaa miisaska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli lama dhisin: buckling, saxitaanka miisaanka maqan ee spectrum-ka, cabbirka duubista, shuruudaha aqbalaadda qalfiyada, culeysyada aagga ka duwan cadaadiska sagxad kasta oo keliya, dhaqaajinta xubinta, xidhayaasha tensiyonka-keliya, derbiyada iyo sagxadaha qaabka ku jira, iyo hubinta naqshadda ee biimaha dhalaalay iyo qaybaha aan I-shape birta la rogay ahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cutubyada\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer kasta wuxuu raacaa cutubka aad dooratay qalabka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E), sida qaybta kale ee BimCraft: booska culeysyada aad qortay oo aad aragto (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa yimid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAg\u003C/span\u003E), barta culeysyada barta iyo jawaabaha, dhererka dabaqyada ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhulgariirka\u003C/span\u003E, iyo tiirarka foorarka iyo dhaqaajinta (feet iyo inches waxay muujiyaan dherarka yar ee inch tobanka). Beddel cutubka wakhti kasta; tabku wuu dib u rinjiyaa. Xoogagga waxay ku sii jiraan kN iyo kN·m, warbixinta (PDF, CSV) iyo faylka CraftScript waxay ku sii jiraan millimitir oo cutubka lagu qoray. Cabbirrada qaybaha, dhexroorka beddelaha iyo daboolka ee qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShub\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku sii jiraan millimitir sida loo magacaabay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-naqshadda\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda\u003C/span\u003E (oo la mid ah DetailCraft) waxay qaadataa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECode-ka naqshadda\u003C/span\u003E, ASCE 7 + AISC 360 ama EN 1990 + EN 1993-1-1, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarajada birta\u003C/span\u003E. Sii nooc kiis kasta (dead, live, wind …) ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee isku-darka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa isku-darka culeysyada xeerka kiisaskaaga; falanqaynta markaas ayaa u socodsiisa sida isku-dar kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi xubnaha\u003C/span\u003E ka dib waxay hubisaa I-shape birta la rogay kasta oo leh hubinta DetailCraft (tensiyon, cadaadis oo leh buckling, foorarka oo leh lateral-torsional buckling, jeexa, foorarka oo leh xoogga toosan, qotada; qodobada waxay ku jiraan warbixinta) oo waxay muujinaysaa inta awoodda ay isticmaasho, midabka moodelka. Waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecaawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXubnaha la hubiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii profile-ka IFC aanu sheegin in I-shape birta la rogay ama la alxamay yahay, BimCraft waxay u tiriyaa la rogay kaliya marka magaca profile-kiisa (haddii kale magaca nooca curiyaha) yahay cabbir ka mid ah miisaska AISC W ama S, ama miisaska EN 10365 IPE, HEA ama HEB (\u003Ccode\u003EW12x26\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EIPE 300\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EHEA200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EHE 200 A\u003C/code\u003E) \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyo\u003C/strong\u003E dhererka, ballaca, derbiga iyo flange-ka faylka ay ku dhex jiraan 1% cabbirkaas. Dhammaan I-shape kale (plate girder, cabbir magac kale ku jira, ama cabbir la wax ka beddelay) waxaa loo qaadaa la alxamay, waana laga soo celiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan la hubin\u003C/strong\u003E; sidaas oo kale tuubooyinka, angles, channels iyo qaybaha kale, qaybaha dherer-qaarka ah iyo torsion. Xubnahaas hubi injineer.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Falanqayn ee tabka midig wuxuu helaa xoogagga biimaha, tiirarka iyo xidhayaasha moodelka furan, falcelinta cagaha tiirarka, iyo intee ka foorarta xubnaha, culeysyada aad siisay. Waa caawiye falanqayn, ma aha hubin xeer. Falanqaynta ma aha xeer naqshad: ma cabbirto xubnaha, ma hubiso awoodooda, ma dooranayso culeys-isku-dhufka. Injineer ayaa hubiya moodelka falanqaynta, culeysyadiisa iyo taageerayaasha, wuxuuna go'aamiyaa macnaha tirooyinka. Hubinta naqshadda ee hoosta ayaa hubisa biimaha birta la rogay ee AISC 360 ama EN 1993-1-1, caawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego: eeg Hubinta naqshadda. Socodsii Fur moodel IFC iyo tabka Falanqayn. Dooro hal ama in ka badan oo biim, tiir ama xidhay aragga, dooro Xaaladda, Culeys iyo Jihada, qor qiimaha oo taabo Ku dar culeys: kN/m culeys ku faafsan xubin, kN culeys barta. Taabo Socodso falanqaynta. Miiska wuxuu liistaa xoogga toosan ee ugu weyn ee xubin kasta, jeexyada, foorarka, wareejinta iyo qotada; guji magaca xubin si aad aragga uga doorato. Hoostiisa waxaa ah falcelinta. Moodelka dushiisa wuxuu sawiraa qaabka foorarka, ama hal falcelin oo sawir ah dhinac kasta xubin. Natiijooyinku way ka duwanaan karaan marka moodelku isbeddelo: dib u socodsii. Culeys kasta iyo dejin kasta waa hal isbeddel liiska Isbeddellada: Ka noqo ayaa soo celinaya, U kaydi sida IFC ayaa ku hayaa faylka (guryaha CadCraft_Analysis ee mashruuca), si markii dambe moodelka halkan la furo culeysyadiisu weli jiraan. Sida moodelka falanqaynta loo sameeyo Kasta oo IfcBeam, IfcColumn iyo IfcMember oo qaabkeedu yahay hal soo-bixid toosan, wuxuu noqdaa xubin ku taal xarriiqda dhexe ee qaybtiisa. Sifooyinkeeda qaybtu waxay ka yimaadaan profile-ka: I, U, L iyo T, afar-geesood iyo tuubooyin, goobo iyo tuubooyin wareegsan, ama qaab xidhan oo kasta (markaas joogta qallafsanaanta waa qiyas, oo warbixinta lagu sheegaa). Wax kasta oo kale waa laga reebaa oo waa la tiriyaa. Moodel gudahiisa, biimaha waxay joogsadaan wajiga tiir kasta oo ay ka hoos yihiin dabaqa. Dhamaad kasta oo xubin waxaa loo qaadaa xarriiqdiisa oo gaadha xarriiqda xubinta uu ku xidhan yahay, marka xarriiqdaasi u dhow tahay (qiyaastii cabbirka qaybaha), xubintaasna halkaas ayaa laga gooyaa. Warbixinta waxay sheegtaa inta dhamaad la dhaqaajiyay. Cagaha tiirarka wax hoos ka gaadha ma jiraan waa taageerayaal: go'an (bilowga) ama pinned (la hayo oo laga hortago wareegga, laakiin xor u ah inuu wareego). Dhamaadyada biimaha waa adag ama pinned sida xeerka Dhamaadyada biimka aan xidhiidh lahayn u dhigayo; xidhayaasha (IfcMember) labada dhinac waa pinned. Dooro hal xubin si aad u siiso dhamaadyadeeda, ama cagta tiirka, xeer u gaar ah. Alaabta magaca ayay ku salaysan tahay: kongareeto (E = 30 GPa), alwaax (E = 11 GPa), kale waa biro (E = 200 GPa). Haddii qaabku dhaqaaqi karo isagoo aan wax foorarin — mekanism — socodsiintu way joogsataa oo waxay sheegtaa meesha iyo jihada. Kiisaska, isku-darka, calaamadaha iyo warbixinta Falanqaynta waxay bilaabataa Dead (miisaanka naftiisa), Live (culeyska jiritaanka) iyo Dead + live; ku dar kiisas iyo isku-dar, iyadoo adeegsanaysa factor-yada uu xeerka naqshaddaadu codsado. N \u003E 0 waa tansiyon; My \u003E 0 wuxuu xubinta dhinaceeda hoose ee -z ku keenaa tansiyon (biimka oo culeyska dhulka hoosta u foorarta wuxuu leeyahay My \u003E 0). Warbixin (PDF) iyo Warbixin (CSV) waxay hayaan malo-aadinta, qaybaha, kiisaska, falcelinta iyo wadarta, xoogagga xubnaha, foorarka iyo dahaarka. U dhoofi CraftScript wuxuu qoraa qaabka qaab-dhismeedka PartCraft Script workspace, halkaas oo shaqada maktabada frame3d ay ku xallisay koodka la akhrin karo. Habka waa habka adkaynta tooska ah (direct stiffness), rogmo oo heer-koowaad ah ilaa aad ka dhigto Second order (P-Delta) oo lagu hubiyay kiisaska buugaagta. Second order (P-Delta). Ka calaamadee Second order (P-Delta) dhinaca Run: isku-dar kasta waa la xalliyaa mar kale iyadoo xoogagga toosan ee xubinta ay saameeyaan qaabka foorarka (xubin kasta waxaa loo gooyaa 4 qaybood, si foorarka xubinta u dhex-dhexaad ah iyo dhamaadkeeda uu u tirmo), ilaa xoogagga toosan ay degaan. Xariiqda natiijada waxay sheegtaa tirada marxaladaha iyo inta ay dhaqaajinta kordhay; foorarka, hubinta naqshadda iyo warbixintu waxay isticmaalaan natiijooyinkan. Ka sarreeya culeyska xadka caabbinta ee qaabka, socodsiintu way joogsataa oo waa sheegtaa. Waa caabbin ku socota oo wareeg yar leh, flexural keliya, aan lahayn yaraynta adkaynta ama culeysyada male-awaan (ma aha habka AISC direct analysis keligiis); sagxadaha, derbiyada iyo sagxadaha adag waxay ku sii jiraan first order. Cadaadiska sagxadaha. Sagxadaha shubka ah (falanqaynta waxay u akhrisaa sagxad sida lakabyo markii alaabtu tahay shub), qaybta Culeysyada waxay leedahay Cadaadiska sagxad kasta: qor kN/m², dooro kiiska kore oo taabo Ku dar sagxadaha. Waa la faafiyaa sagxad kasta oo falanqaynta heshay, hoos loo riixo, waxaana lagu liistaa xiriir Ka saar. Waa hal cadaadis oo dhammaan sagxadaha u jira, ma aha mid sagxad kasta; ma aha culeys xeer: qor qiimaha injineerkaagu siiyo. Dhawaaqyada dabiiciga ah (qaybaha xadidan). Qaybta Qaybaha limitada: dhawaaqyada dabiiciga ah ee hoosta natiijooyinka waxay helaa qaababka ugu hooseeya ee isla moodelka iyadoo adeegsanaysa injinka qaybaha xadidan: biimaha oo leh sii-deynta dhamaadkooda, sagxadaha iyo derbiyada oo ah qolof afar-barood, sagxadaha adag, taageerayaasha. Dooro inta qaab (3, 6, 10 ama 20) iyo qaybta sagxadda (qolofka afar-barood ee sagxadaha dhumuc ama khafiif, ama kan sagxadda khafiifka ah) oo taabo Hel dhawaaqyada. Miiska wuxuu siiyaa qaab kasta dhawaaqa Hz-ka, muddada ilbiriqsiyada, iyo miisaanka wax-ka-qabashada ee X, Y, Z oo qayb ka ah miisaanka dhaqaajin kara. Ku muuji moodelka wuxuu sawiraa qaab kasta sida qaabka foorarka loo sawiro. Miisaanku waa densiti-ga alaabta marka lagu dhuftay mugga: culeysyadu ma kordhiyaan miisaanka, alaabta aan densiti lahayn ma leh. Warbixinta (PDF, CSV) waxay qaadaysaa miiska. Waa rogmo iyo dhaqdhaqaaq yar oo keliya, ma jiro culeys dhulgariir ama dabayl oo laga sameeyey xeer halkan. Ma aha hubin xeer; injineerkaagu wuu dib u eegaa natiijooyinka. Jawaabta xooggii, taariikhda waqtiga iyo riixitaanka (pushover). Saddex qaybood oo kale ayaa hoos ugu jira dhawaaqyada, iyadoo adeegsanaya isla moodelka qaybaha xadidan. Miisaanka dhammaantood waa densiti-ga alaabta iyo culeysyada hoos-u-riixa ee kiisaska aad calaamadeysay, mid kasta oo lagu dhufo factor aad qortay (tusaale, Dead 1 iyo Live qayb aad u tirinayso miisaan). Jawaabta xooggii wuxuu akhrinayaa qaab kasta spectrum aad siisay (miis muddo iyo xawaare, ama qaabka ASCE 7 ee SDS, SD1 iyo TL; badhanka Isticmaal qiyamyada Dhulgariirka ayaa ka nuqulaya qiyamyadaas qaybta Dhulgariirka), wuxuuna isku geliyaa qaababka CQC, SRSS, xeerka toban boqolkiiba ama wadarta buuxda, kadibna wuxuu isku geliyaa jihooyinka X, Y, Z (100 % + 30 % ama SRSS). Wuxuu siiyaa cadaadiska saldhigga, dhaqaajinta dabaqyada, xoogagga dhamaadka xubinta, iyo miis qaabab oo digta marka qaababka la isticmaalay ay ka yar yihiin 90 % miisaanka. Natiijooyinka waad ku cabbiri kartaa factor ama ilaa cadaadis saldhig oo aad qortay; qaybtu marna kuma xisaabiso cadaadiskaas. Natiijooyinku ma leeyihiin calaamad. Taariikhda waqtiga wuxuu socodsiiyaa xawaaraha dhulka isagoo adeegsanaya isku-darka qaababka (sax u ah khadadka toosan ee duubista) ama isku-dhufka toosan (Newmark average acceleration oo leh Rayleigh damping). Gelinta waa sine ama pulse la sameeyay (had iyo jeer lagu calaamadiyaa synthetic), duubis aad ku dhejiso, ama fayl qoraal ah oo aad furto (waqti iyo xawaare, hal xawaare saf kasta oo leh step, ama fayl qaabka PEER oo leh madax DT=; g ama m/s²). Waxay siisaa dhaqaajinta saqafka iyo cadaadiska saldhigga marka waqtiga, dhaqaajinta dabaq kasta, iyo dahaarka xoogagga dhamaadka xubinta. Moodelada duubis aad u dheer leh waxay ilaaliyaan kaliya kalfadka. Riixitaanka (pushover) wuxuu saqafka dhinac ahaan ugu riixaa tillaabo yaryar (qaab la mid ah qaabka koowaad, ama isku mid ah), iyadoo qalfiyo plastik ah ay ku jiraan dhamaadka xubinta leh qaabka I. Qalfi wuxuu ku soo degaa xagga plastikada ah, kaas oo hoos u dhacaa markii xoogga toosan kordho (lagu xisaabiyo qaabka la sawiray, fillet-yada lama tixgeliyo); hardening waa ikhtiyaari, P-delta waa ikhtiyaari, isku-darka culeyska dhulka ayaa lagu dabaqi karaa marka hore. Waxay siisaa xariiqda awoodda (cadaadiska saldhigga iyo dhaqaajinta saqafka), qalfiga ugu horreeya, iyo xaaladda iyo wareegga plastikada ah ee qalfi kasta. Socodsii taariikhda waqtiga ee khadka jajabka ah wuxuu socodsiiyaa qalfiyada isla duubista qaybta Taariikhda waqtiga moodelada yaryar. Qalfiyo waxay samaysmaan dhamaadka xubinta oo keliya (dhig nood halka qalfi u baahan yahay gudaha bannaanka); xubin labada dhinac sii-deysan ma helayso; dhalaalka iyo buckling-ka xidhayaasha lama moodelo; sagxadaha iyo derbiyada waxay ku sii jiraan rogmo; ma jiro shuruudo aqbalaad. Ma aha hubin xeer; injineerkaagu wuu dib u eegaa natiijooyinka. Dejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa moodelka, warbixintuna waxay qaadaysaa miisaska. Weli lama dhisin: buckling, saxitaanka miisaanka maqan ee spectrum-ka, cabbirka duubista, shuruudaha aqbalaadda qalfiyada, culeysyada aagga ka duwan cadaadiska sagxad kasta oo keliya, dhaqaajinta xubinta, xidhayaasha tensiyonka-keliya, derbiyada iyo sagxadaha qaabka ku jira, iyo hubinta naqshadda ee biimaha dhalaalay iyo qaybaha aan I-shape birta la rogay ahayn. Eeg Weli lama dhisin. Cutubyada Dherer kasta wuxuu raacaa cutubka aad dooratay qalabka (Cutubyada), sida qaybta kale ee BimCraft: booska culeysyada aad qortay oo aad aragto (Ka yimid, Meesha, Ag), barta culeysyada barta iyo jawaabaha, dhererka dabaqyada ee Dhulgariirka, iyo tiirarka foorarka iyo dhaqaajinta (feet iyo inches waxay muujiyaan dherarka yar ee inch tobanka). Beddel cutubka wakhti kasta; tabku wuu dib u rinjiyaa. Xoogagga waxay ku sii jiraan kN iyo kN·m, warbixinta (PDF, CSV) iyo faylka CraftScript waxay ku sii jiraan millimitir oo cutubka lagu qoray. Cabbirrada qaybaha, dhexroorka beddelaha iyo daboolka ee qaybta Shub waxay ku sii jiraan millimitir sida loo magacaabay. Hubinta naqshadda Qaybta Hubinta naqshadda (oo la mid ah DetailCraft) waxay qaadataa Code-ka naqshadda, ASCE 7 + AISC 360 ama EN 1990 + EN 1993-1-1, iyo Darajada birta. Sii nooc kiis kasta (dead, live, wind …) ka dibna Samee isku-darka wuxuu qoraa isku-darka culeysyada xeerka kiisaskaaga; falanqaynta markaas ayaa u socodsiisa sida isku-dar kasta. Hubi xubnaha ka dib waxay hubisaa I-shape birta la rogay kasta oo leh hubinta DetailCraft (tensiyon, cadaadis oo leh buckling, foorarka oo leh lateral-torsional buckling, jeexa, foorarka oo leh xoogga toosan, qotada; qodobada waxay ku jiraan warbixinta) oo waxay muujinaysaa inta awoodda ay isticmaasho, midabka moodelka. Waa caawiye ilaa injineer uu dib u eego. Xubnaha la hubiyo. Haddii profile-ka IFC aanu sheegin in I-shape birta la rogay ama la alxamay yahay, BimCraft waxay u tiriyaa la rogay kaliya marka magaca profile-kiisa (haddii kale magaca nooca curiyaha) yahay cabbir ka mid ah miisaska AISC W ama S, ama miisaska EN 10365 IPE, HEA ama HEB (W12x26, IPE 300, HEA200, HE 200 A) iyo dhererka, ballaca, derbiga iyo flange-ka faylka ay ku dhex jiraan 1% cabbirkaas. Dhammaan I-shape kale (plate girder, cabbir magac kale ku jira, ama cabbir la wax ka beddelay) waxaa loo qaadaa la alxamay, waana laga soo celiyaa aan la hubin; sidaas oo kale tuubooyinka, angles, channels iyo qaybaha kale, qaybaha dherer-qaarka ah iyo torsion. Xubnahaas hubi injineer.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"assistants","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka dhig caawiye AI inuu moodelkaaga kula shaqeeyo","summary":"Ka shid caawiyayaasha Settings si caawiye kombiyuutarkaaga ku jira u helo walxaha, akhriyo sifooyinkooda, ka saar muuqaalka, oo ku sawir darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, dabaqyo, heerar iyo grids, iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio. Waa la damiyaa ilaa aad shido.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ai","caawiye","mcp","script","automation","studio","raadi walxaha","ka saar","sifooyinka","ogolaansho","ka jaree","dhaqdhaqaaq","sawir darbiyo","ku dar albaabo","ku dar daaqado","heerar","grids","dabaqyo","ka noqo","kaydi","command line","cli","headless","isticmaal caawiyayaasha AI"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-caawiyuhu-samayn-karo-bimcraft","text":"Waxa caawiyuhu samayn karo BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2},{"id":"intaad-caawiye-ku-xirnaan","text":"Intaad caawiye ku xirnaan","level":2},{"id":"adigoo-aan-daaqad-lahayn-script-yada-iyo-command-line-ka","text":"Adigoo aan daaqad lahayn: script-yada iyo command line-ka","level":2},{"id":"dami","text":"Dami","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo ogolaado caawiye AI (caawiye kasta oo hadla MCP) inuu eego moodelka IFC ee aad furan tahay oo uu ku sawiro, waxa uu samayn karo iyo waxa uusan samayn karin, iyo sida loo joojiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-caawiyuhu-samayn-karo-bimcraft\"\u003EWaxa caawiyuhu samayn karo BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu weydiisto\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhacaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu u baahan yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaadi walxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu helaa liis walxo oo fasal, dabaq, magac ama qiimaha sifada ku saabsan, sida \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E samayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri sifooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu helaa hal walax oo sifooyinkeeda, nooceeda, set-yada sifada iyo cabbirrada, sida \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E muujiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESharax moodelka, liis darbiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu helaa heerarka, darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, qolalka, sagxadaha, grids iyo tiirarka, iyo dhamaadka darbi kasta, nooceeda iyo dherkeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa soo saar, ku dar kaliya, qari ama muuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka 3D wuu isbedelaa sida aad u isticmaashay menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, dabaqyo, heerar ama grid lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelka wuu isbedelaa sida aad u isticmaashay qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E: darbiyada isku xidhan, qolalka, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada raacaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel magac ama qiimaha sifada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, sharaxaadda, nooca shayga ama tag-ka hal walax, ama qiimaha sifo kaliya. Qiimaha uu la wadaago walxo kale waa la koobiyeeyaa marka hore; qiimaha nooca walxa wuxuu isbedelaa kaliya marka caawiyuhu sheego, sababtoo ah walxaha nooca oo dhan way raacaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel, tirtir, darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha way guurayaan ama way tirtirmaan iyo waxa ay martiqaadaan; darbiyada lagu sawiray qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E waxay isbedelaan geeskooda ama nooceedaba, albaabada iyo daaqadaha meeshooda, cabbirkooda ama nooceedaba, qolalkana iyo isku xidhka way raacaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig, habee oo akhri jadwal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Jadwal albaabbo dabaq kasta, oo leh heer dab-kicinta iyo hardware-ka albaabka&quot;: caawiyuhu wuxuu magacaabaa jadwalka, tiirarkiisa (sifo ama tag wuxuu noqdaa tiir) iyo kooxeynta; BimCraft wuu buuxiyaa oo wuu habeeyaa ka moodelka, wixii caawiyuhu sheegin ayaa laga qaadaa heerka xafiiska. Dejintu waxay ku biirtaa liiskaaga \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwallada\u003C/strong\u003E. Safka kasta oo uu dib u helo wuxuu magacaabaa walxaheeda, si uu u dooran karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri si aad u akhrido; Beddel aragtida oo sawir si aad u kaydiso dejinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar jadwal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSV, Excel, ama qoraal tab kala soocaya oo lagu dhejin karo Google Sheets (waxba Google looma diro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri oo dejiya dhamaystirka qolalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada dhamaystirka, dhamaystirka dabaq, darbi iyo saqaf kasta ee qol kasta, aagagga; bedadka, tirada alaabta iyo mugga substrate-ka ayaa markaas ka imanaya jadwallada dhamaystirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri; Beddel aragtida oo sawir si aad dejiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro walxaha, ka noqo tallaabooyinkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha waxa lagu doortaa aragtida; tallaabadiisa ugu dambeysay waa la qaadaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl IFC cusub oo leh isbedel kasta, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E u sameyso (asalka lama beddelo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar USD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelada furan ee OpenUSD ah (.usda, .usdc ama .usdz), sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka u qoro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir rendar, samee queue-ka rendarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir ee aragtida 3D, sida dialog-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E u sameeyo oo leh dejinta Render-kaaga haddii aanu wax kale waydiin, ama sawirro tayo sare ah oo lagu daro queue-ka dialog-ka, oo mid kasta kadib kan kale lagu rendero (queue-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU). Waxba moodelka kama beddelo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ESawir rendar\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbedel kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyo waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedelada\u003C/strong\u003E, oo magacaabmaysa &quot;Assistant: …&quot; (tusaale &quot;Assistant: ku dar 4 darbi&quot;), sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqonayaa ficilkiisa oo dhan, waxaadna arki kartaa tallaabada qofka ay tahay. Daaqadda gudaheeda ma furi karo faylal: adiga ayaa furta moodelka; wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kan furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiyayaasha waxay BimCraft gaaraan iyadoo loo marayo CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga; browser-ka caadiga ahi ma leh jid gelid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoos \u003Cstrong\u003ECaawiyayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E waa la calaamadeeyay adiga. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel aragtida oo sawir\u003C/strong\u003E haddii caawiyuhu ka dooran karo, qarin karo walxaha, iyo sawiri karo, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi\u003C/strong\u003E haddii uu moodelka u kaydin karo fayl cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu xidh caawiyaha Studio (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo dejinta lagu dhejiyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intaad-caawiye-ku-xirnaan\"\u003EIntaad caawiye ku xirnaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraal sare oo ku yaal panel-ka midig wuxuu sheegayaa caawiyaha ku xiran iyo waxa uu samayn karo. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jaree\u003C/span\u003E si aad fadhigiisa isla markiiba u dhammaysid; wuxuu dib u xidhmayaa si uu u sii socdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ku yaal hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ECaawiyayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E ee Settings, wuxuu liistaa wicitaan kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyay, kan ugu dambeeya marka hore, iyo in uu shaqeeyay ama ayan shaqeyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu weydii erayo fudud, tusaale &quot;ka saar darbiyada dibadda ee Dabaqa 1&quot;, &quot;albaabbo noocee ah ayaa aan lahayn heer dab-kicinta?&quot; ama &quot;sawir qol 6 x 4 m ah oo Dabaqa 1 ku yaal, oo leh albaab darbiga koonfureed&quot;. Caawiyuhu wuxuu helaa walxaha oo muujiyaa aragtidaada, ama wuu sawiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adigoo-aan-daaqad-lahayn-script-yada-iyo-command-line-ka\"\u003EAdigoo aan daaqad lahayn: script-yada iyo command line-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka sawirka ee isku mid ah ayaa ku shaqeeya faylasha IFC ee folders-ka aad magacaabto, iyadoo aan daaqad furan: MCP server-ka CadCraft iyo command line-ku waxay bilaabi karaan dhismo cusub ama furi karaan fayl IFC, sharax, ku dar darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, dabaqyo, heerar iyo grids, ka noqo, oo kaydi sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E cusub. Adiga ayaa go&#039;aamiya folders-ka uu isticmaali karo iyo inuu wax beddeli karo ama kaydin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dami\"\u003EDami\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa saar calaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Caawiye kasta isla markiiba waa la jaraa, dejintuna waa la kaydiyaa xilliga xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ECuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E: tusaalooyin shaqo, mid kastaba leh qalabka uu wicitaano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003ERaadi walxaha fasal, magac ama sifo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kaliya u dhig, ama muuqaal cadaan u dhig walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida loo ogolaado caawiye AI (caawiye kasta oo hadla MCP) inuu eego moodelka IFC ee aad furan tahay oo uu ku sawiro, waxa uu samayn karo iyo waxa uusan samayn karin, iyo sida loo joojiyo. Waxa caawiyuhu samayn karo BimCraft Waxa uu weydiisto Waxa dhacaa Wuxuu u baahan yahay Raadi walxaha Wuxuu helaa liis walxo oo fasal, dabaq, magac ama qiimaha sifada ku saabsan, sida Raadi samayso Akhri Akhri sifooyinka Wuxuu helaa hal walax oo sifooyinkeeda, nooceeda, set-yada sifada iyo cabbirrada, sida Sifooyinka muujiyo Akhri Sharax moodelka, liis darbiyada Wuxuu helaa heerarka, darbiyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, qolalka, sagxadaha, grids iyo tiirarka, iyo dhamaadka darbi kasta, nooceeda iyo dherkeeda Akhri Ka soo saar, ku dar kaliya, qari ama muuji Muuqaalka 3D wuu isbedelaa sida aad u isticmaashay menu-ga Muuji Beddel aragtida oo sawir Sawir darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, dabaqyo, heerar ama grid lines Moodelka wuu isbedelaa sida aad u isticmaashay qalabka Sawir: darbiyada isku xidhan, qolalka, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada raacaan Beddel aragtida oo sawir Beddel magac ama qiimaha sifada Magaca, sharaxaadda, nooca shayga ama tag-ka hal walax, ama qiimaha sifo kaliya. Qiimaha uu la wadaago walxo kale waa la koobiyeeyaa marka hore; qiimaha nooca walxa wuxuu isbedelaa kaliya marka caawiyuhu sheego, sababtoo ah walxaha nooca oo dhan way raacaan Beddel aragtida oo sawir Beddel, tirtir, darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha beddel Walxaha way guurayaan ama way tirtirmaan iyo waxa ay martiqaadaan; darbiyada lagu sawiray qalabka Sawir waxay isbedelaan geeskooda ama nooceedaba, albaabada iyo daaqadaha meeshooda, cabbirkooda ama nooceedaba, qolalkana iyo isku xidhka way raacaan Beddel aragtida oo sawir Dhig, habee oo akhri jadwal \"Jadwal albaabbo dabaq kasta, oo leh heer dab-kicinta iyo hardware-ka albaabka\": caawiyuhu wuxuu magacaabaa jadwalka, tiirarkiisa (sifo ama tag wuxuu noqdaa tiir) iyo kooxeynta; BimCraft wuu buuxiyaa oo wuu habeeyaa ka moodelka, wixii caawiyuhu sheegin ayaa laga qaadaa heerka xafiiska. Dejintu waxay ku biirtaa liiskaaga Jadwallada. Safka kasta oo uu dib u helo wuxuu magacaabaa walxaheeda, si uu u dooran karo Akhri si aad u akhrido; Beddel aragtida oo sawir si aad u kaydiso dejinta Soo saar jadwal CSV, Excel, ama qoraal tab kala soocaya oo lagu dhejin karo Google Sheets (waxba Google looma diro) Soo saar Akhri oo dejiya dhamaystirka qolalka Noocyada dhamaystirka, dhamaystirka dabaq, darbi iyo saqaf kasta ee qol kasta, aagagga; bedadka, tirada alaabta iyo mugga substrate-ka ayaa markaas ka imanaya jadwallada dhamaystirka Akhri; Beddel aragtida oo sawir si aad dejiso Dooro walxaha, ka noqo tallaabooyinkiisa Walxaha waxa lagu doortaa aragtida; tallaabadiisa ugu dambeysay waa la qaadaa Beddel aragtida oo sawir Kaydi Fayl IFC cusub oo leh isbedel kasta, sida U kaydi sida IFC u sameyso (asalka lama beddelo) Kaydi Soo saar USD Moodelada furan ee OpenUSD ah (.usda, .usdc ama .usdz), sida USD ee toolbar-ka u qoro Soo saar Sawir rendar, samee queue-ka rendarka Sawir ee aragtida 3D, sida dialog-ka Rendar u sameeyo oo leh dejinta Render-kaaga haddii aanu wax kale waydiin, ama sawirro tayo sare ah oo lagu daro queue-ka dialog-ka, oo mid kasta kadib kan kale lagu rendero (queue-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU). Waxba moodelka kama beddelo (Sawir rendar) Soo saar Isbedel kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyo waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta Isbedelada, oo magacaabmaysa \"Assistant: …\" (tusaale \"Assistant: ku dar 4 darbi\"), sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqonayaa ficilkiisa oo dhan, waxaadna arki kartaa tallaabada qofka ay tahay. Daaqadda gudaheeda ma furi karo faylal: adiga ayaa furta moodelka; wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kan furan. Shid Caawiyayaasha waxay BimCraft gaaraan iyadoo loo marayo CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga; browser-ka caadiga ahi ma leh jid gelid. Fur Dejinta oo dooro tab-ka BimCraft. Hoos Caawiyayaasha, calaamadee Ogolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan BimCraft. Akhri waa la calaamadeeyay adiga. Calaamadee Beddel aragtida oo sawir haddii caawiyuhu ka dooran karo, qarin karo walxaha, iyo sawiri karo, iyo Kaydi haddii uu moodelka u kaydin karo fayl cusub. Ku xidh caawiyaha Studio (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo dejinta lagu dhejiyo). Intaad caawiye ku xirnaan Qoraal sare oo ku yaal panel-ka midig wuxuu sheegayaa caawiyaha ku xiran iyo waxa uu samayn karo. Guji Ka jaree si aad fadhigiisa isla markiiba u dhammaysid; wuxuu dib u xidhmayaa si uu u sii socdo. Dhaqdhaqaaq, oo ku yaal hoos Caawiyayaasha ee Settings, wuxuu liistaa wicitaan kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyay, kan ugu dambeeya marka hore, iyo in uu shaqeeyay ama ayan shaqeyn. Ku weydii erayo fudud, tusaale \"ka saar darbiyada dibadda ee Dabaqa 1\", \"albaabbo noocee ah ayaa aan lahayn heer dab-kicinta?\" ama \"sawir qol 6 x 4 m ah oo Dabaqa 1 ku yaal, oo leh albaab darbiga koonfureed\". Caawiyuhu wuxuu helaa walxaha oo muujiyaa aragtidaada, ama wuu sawiraa. Adigoo aan daaqad lahayn: script-yada iyo command line-ka Qalabka sawirka ee isku mid ah ayaa ku shaqeeya faylasha IFC ee folders-ka aad magacaabto, iyadoo aan daaqad furan: MCP server-ka CadCraft iyo command line-ku waxay bilaabi karaan dhismo cusub ama furi karaan fayl IFC, sharax, ku dar darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, dabaqyo, heerar iyo grids, ka noqo, oo kaydi sida fayl .ifc cusub. Adiga ayaa go'aamiya folders-ka uu isticmaali karo iyo inuu wax beddeli karo ama kaydin karo. Dami Ka saar calaamadda Ogolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan BimCraft. Caawiye kasta isla markiiba waa la jaraa, dejintuna waa la kaydiyaa xilliga xiga. Eeg sidoo kale Cuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI: tusaalooyin shaqo, mid kastaba leh qalabka uu wicitaano. Raadi walxaha fasal, magac ama sifo Qari, kaliya u dhig, ama muuqaal cadaan u dhig walxaha Dejinta BimCraft","lang":"so"},{"slug":"field-points","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhibcaha lagu dhigayo, iyo hubinta sida la dhisay","summary":"Lambar u sii dhibcaha uu kooxda dhigayso moodeelka — dhexaadka tiirarka, dhammaadka darbiyada, boolalka dhegta, sleeves, iyo qalab kasta oo aad doorato — qor ku dhex dhigaya total station, kadibna akhri dhibcaha kooxda ay cabbirtay oo arag wixii ka baxay.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["dhibcaha lagu dhigayo","dhigid","total station","sahan","faylka dhibcaha","csv","txt","pnezd","penzd","xyz","northing","easting","elevation","sida la dhisay","hubin","dulqaad","farqi","boolalka dhegta","dhexaadka tiirarka","dhammaadka darbiyada","sleeves","isku-xirka sahanka","beddelka khariidadda"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-dhibcaha","text":"Samee dhibcaha","level":2},{"id":"hubi-dhibcaha-sida-la-dhisay","text":"Hubi dhibcaha sida la dhisay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibcaha\u003C/span\u003E ee midig wuxuu sameeyaa dhibcaha kooxda ku dhigtaa goobta moodeelka furan, wuxuuna hubiyaa dhibcaha ay cabbiraan kadib.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-dhibcaha\"\u003ESamee dhibcaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC iyo tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibcaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee waxa la dhigayo: \u003Cstrong\u003Edhexaadka tiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E (saldhigga khadka dhexe ee tiir kasta), \u003Cstrong\u003Edhammaadka darbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E (labada dhammaad ee khadka dhexe ee darbi kasta, saldhigga), \u003Cstrong\u003Eboolalka dhegta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esleeves\u003C/strong\u003E (elementiyada magacooda ama nooceeda ku qoran sleeve), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eelementiyada la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E (mid kasta barta dhigidda — dooro marka hore aragga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro lambarka koowaad iyo horjoog, isku-xirka, cabbirrada, tiirarka iyo faylka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeel\u003C/strong\u003E: isku-xirka faylka. \u003Cstrong\u003EGridka sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E: gridka khariidadda ee georeference-ka moodeelka (waxa lagu muujiyaa IFC-ga kaliya haddii uu leeyahay map conversion), mitir ama unug aad doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirarka \u003Cstrong\u003EPNEZD\u003C/strong\u003E (dhibic, northing, easting, elevation, sharaxaad), \u003Cstrong\u003EPENZD\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EXYZ\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E (koma) ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETXT\u003C/strong\u003E (tab).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee dhibcaha\u003C/span\u003E: liiska wuu tusayaa, aragtuna waxay calaamaynaysaa cadaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji dhibcaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcuhu waxay yimaadaan amar go&#039;an — nooca, kadibna safafka qorshaha — sidaas darteed marka dib loo sameeyo isla moodeelka waxay siiyaan isla tirooyinka. Faylku waa kan CivilCraft uu furo, iyo kan EXPORTPOINTS CadCraft uu qoro: hal dhibic hal xariiq kasta, saddex meelood oo jajab, sharaxaad ku jirta xigmado marka ay ku jirto koma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-dhibcaha-sida-la-dhisay\"\u003EHubi dhibcaha sida la dhisay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka kooxdu soo diro waxa ay cabbirtay, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003Edulqaad\u003C/strong\u003E millimitir ahaan iyo sida dhibcaha loo isku xidhayo — \u003Cstrong\u003Elambarka dhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E (ku hayay lambarradaada) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Etoogashada ugu dhow\u003C/strong\u003E — oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkhri dhibcaha sida la dhisay…\u003C/span\u003E. Akhri faylka isla unugyada iyo isku-xirka aad ku qortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibic kasta oo naqshad ah waxay noqonaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha\u003C/strong\u003E dulqaadka, \u003Cstrong\u003Edibada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan la cabbirin\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo toogasho aan la weydiin waa \u003Cstrong\u003Edheeraad\u003C/strong\u003E. Miiska wuxuu bixiyaa farqiyada unugga aad doorato jaranjaroda, cagaha waxa lagu muujiyaa inji dhibcaan ah (sida la dhisay ka hor naqshadda: bari, woqooyi, dhererka, iyo masaafada qorshaha); aragtu wuxuu calaamaynayaa dhibic kasta cagaar ama cas, iyo xariiq ilaa toogashada, iyo cawl haddii aan la cabbirin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixin (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa isbarbardhigga oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba halkan moodeelka ma beddelo. Weli lama dhisin: dhigida xagga cidhifyada dhulka, isgoyska gridka ama furayaasha aan loo samayn, iyo u dirista dhibcaha qalab toos ah — isticmaal faylka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tab-ka Dhibcaha ee midig wuxuu sameeyaa dhibcaha kooxda ku dhigtaa goobta moodeelka furan, wuxuuna hubiyaa dhibcaha ay cabbiraan kadib. Samee dhibcaha Fur moodeel IFC iyo tab-ka Dhibcaha. Calaamee waxa la dhigayo: dhexaadka tiirarka (saldhigga khadka dhexe ee tiir kasta), dhammaadka darbiyada (labada dhammaad ee khadka dhexe ee darbi kasta, saldhigga), boolalka dhegta, sleeves (elementiyada magacooda ama nooceeda ku qoran sleeve), iyo elementiyada la doortay (mid kasta barta dhigidda — dooro marka hore aragga). Dooro lambarka koowaad iyo horjoog, isku-xirka, cabbirrada, tiirarka iyo faylka: Moodeel: isku-xirka faylka. Gridka sahanka: gridka khariidadda ee georeference-ka moodeelka (waxa lagu muujiyaa IFC-ga kaliya haddii uu leeyahay map conversion), mitir ama unug aad doorato. Tiirarka PNEZD (dhibic, northing, easting, elevation, sharaxaad), PENZD ama XYZ; CSV (koma) ama TXT (tab). Riix Samee dhibcaha: liiska wuu tusayaa, aragtuna waxay calaamaynaysaa cadaan. Soo deji dhibcaha wuxuu qoraa faylka. Dhibcuhu waxay yimaadaan amar go'an — nooca, kadibna safafka qorshaha — sidaas darteed marka dib loo sameeyo isla moodeelka waxay siiyaan isla tirooyinka. Faylku waa kan CivilCraft uu furo, iyo kan EXPORTPOINTS CadCraft uu qoro: hal dhibic hal xariiq kasta, saddex meelood oo jajab, sharaxaad ku jirta xigmado marka ay ku jirto koma. Hubi dhibcaha sida la dhisay Marka kooxdu soo diro waxa ay cabbirtay, dooro dulqaad millimitir ahaan iyo sida dhibcaha loo isku xidhayo — lambarka dhibcaha (ku hayay lambarradaada) ama toogashada ugu dhow — oo riix Akhri dhibcaha sida la dhisay…. Akhri faylka isla unugyada iyo isku-xirka aad ku qortay. Dhibic kasta oo naqshad ah waxay noqonaysaa gudaha dulqaadka, dibada, aan la cabbirin, iyo toogasho aan la weydiin waa dheeraad. Miiska wuxuu bixiyaa farqiyada unugga aad doorato jaranjaroda, cagaha waxa lagu muujiyaa inji dhibcaan ah (sida la dhisay ka hor naqshadda: bari, woqooyi, dhererka, iyo masaafada qorshaha); aragtu wuxuu calaamaynayaa dhibic kasta cagaar ama cas, iyo xariiq ilaa toogashada, iyo cawl haddii aan la cabbirin. Warbixin (CSV) wuxuu qoraa isbarbardhigga oo dhan. Waxba halkan moodeelka ma beddelo. Weli lama dhisin: dhigida xagga cidhifyada dhulka, isgoyska gridka ama furayaasha aan loo samayn, iyo u dirista dhibcaha qalab toos ah — isticmaal faylka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"room-acoustics","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi wakhtiga dib u celinta dhawaaqa qolkaaga oo dhegayso","summary":"Wakhtiga dib u celinta dhawaaqa ee qol kasta, bandhig kasta oo octave ah (Sabine iyo Eyring), iyadoo laga adeegsanayo cabbirkiisa iyo dhamaystirkiisa, bartilmaameed aad doorato, iyo cod, miyir-tiri ama muusik lagu ciyaaro iyadoo lagu mareynayo jawaabta saamaynta ee qolka la xisaabiyay.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["dhawaaq","dib u celin","waqtiga dib u celinta","rt60","sabine","eyring","nuugid","aloosh","dhawaaq","dhegayso","jawaabta saamaynta","hadal","fasal","xafiis","dabaal","dhalooyinka saqafka","buuq"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-dhamaystirka","text":"Dooro dhamaystirka","level":2},{"id":"akhri-jadwalka","text":"Akhri jadwalka","level":2},{"id":"dhegayso","text":"Dhegayso","level":2},{"id":"dadka-iyo-alaabta","text":"Dadka iyo alaabta","level":2},{"id":"isha-iyo-dhegeystaha","text":"Isha iyo dhegeystaha","level":2},{"id":"nuugista-aan-siman-iyo-qaababka-qolka","text":"Nuugista aan siman iyo qaababka qolka","level":2},{"id":"cutubyada","text":"Cutubyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhawaaqa qolka\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca bidix ayaa xisaabisa inta uu dhawaaqu ku sii socdo qol kasta. Waxay akhrisaa balaca dhulka qol kasta, dhererka, darbiyada, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha laga bilaabo moodelka IFC ee furan. Waxba kama bedelato moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-dhamaystirka\"\u003EDooro dhamaystirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha moodelku sheegayo waxa dusha ku jira, qolku wuu akhriyaa: lakabka gudaha ee nooc kasta oo darbi (gypsum, plaster, brick, concrete iyo block waa la yaqaan), nooca dhulka (alwaax ama shub) iyo in saqafku dhoobo leeyahay. Calaamadda ku xigta doorasho kasta waxay sheegaysaa in ay ka timid moodelka, caadi ahaan, ama doorashadaada. Dooro dhamaystir kale si aad u beddesho. Wax uu moodelku aan sheegin waxa uu ku sii jiraa caadiga. Xoogsadyada waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiyaasaha caadiga ah ee la daabacay\u003C/strong\u003E; beddel marka aad haysato xogta tijaabada alaabta. Ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003Ebartilmaameed\u003C/strong\u003E (dib u celinta dhexe ee ugu dheer ee aad rabto) qol kasta oo ka sarreysa waa digniin, iyo nuugista loo baahan yahay si loo hoosaysiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-jadwalka\"\u003EAkhri jadwalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u celinta waxaa la siiyaa 125 Hz ilaa 4 kHz. Sabine waxay ku habboon tahay qolal nool, Eyring qolal dhimma; khadka lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cem\u003ELagu isticmaalo\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu qaataa Eyring marka nuugista celceliska ah uu ka badan yahay 0.2. Nuugista hawada waa la ku daray (waxay gaabiyaa bandhigyada sare qolal waaweyn). Waa moodel tiro-ahaan: wuxuu male-awaal ahaan u qaadanayaa in codku si siman u faafo, sidaas darteed qolal dheer ama fidsan iyo qolal aad u yar waa hagid qiyaas ah, alaabta, dadka iyo albaabbada furan lama tiriyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhegayso\"\u003EDhegayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu ciyaar qolkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa hadal (halkan lagu sameeyay), miyir-tiri, jiri-jiriyo ama \u003Cstrong\u003Efaylkaaga codka gaarka ah\u003C/strong\u003E (wuxuu kaaga jiraa kombuyuutarkaaga) oo mareynaya jawaabta saamaynta loo xisaabiyay qolka: dhawaaqa toosan, dhawaaqa ugu horreeya ee sanduuq sidaas u weyn, iyo dabeel dhimma oo ku dhammaata wakhtiga dib u celinta qolka bandhig kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu ciyaar si qallalan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa isla dhawaaqa isla heerka iyada oo aan qolka lahayn. Waxaad kaydin kartaa jawaabta saamaynta ama dhawaaqa qolka sida faylal WAV. Waxay u dhawaaqaysaa qol cabbirkiisa iyo dhamaystirkiisa leh, ma aha qol dhab ah oo gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dadka-iyo-alaabta\"\u003EDadka iyo alaabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQor tirada \u003Cstrong\u003Edadka qolkan ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E si aad nuugistooda ku darto. Alaabta moodelku haysto (sofas, beds, chairs, tables, wardrobes, oo lagu helo magaca) nuugistooda ayay ku darta. Tirooyinku waa qiyaasyo qorshe oo qiyaas ah, la wareejiyay; ku beddel cabbirro qol muhiim ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isha-iyo-dhegeystaha\"\u003EIsha iyo dhegeystaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsha iyo dhegeystaha\u003C/span\u003E, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig isha\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig dhegeystaha\u003C/span\u003E oo guji qorshaha qolka. Dhawaaqa aad ciyaarto waxaa loo maqlaa meeshaas: dhawaaqa toosan wuxuu imanayaa ka dib masaafada, qaybta dib u celinta ahna heerkeeda masaafadaas. Labadaba ka saar si aad ugu noqoto sanduuqa masaafada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuugista-aan-siman-iyo-qaababka-qolka\"\u003ENuugista aan siman iyo qaababka qolka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuugista aan siman (qol sanduuq ah)\u003C/span\u003E, qor qolka sida sanduuq oo dooro dhamaystirka dhulka, saqafka iyo darbiyada. Jadwalka waxa lagu daraa Fitzroy iyo Arau-Puchades Sabine iyo Eyring: waxay labadaba u qaadaan saddex lammaane oo is-soo-horjeeda si gooni ah, sidaas darteed qol leh kaarpet iyo saqaf adag laguma akhrin mid aad u gaaban. Marka lammaanuhu aad u kala duwan yihiin, qor ayaa sheegaysa midka la aamini karo. Hoosta jadwalka, \u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka qolka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa mawjadaha taagan ee ugu hooseeya sanduuqa iyo bandhigga uu qolku ku yeesho qaababka kala gaar ah halkii uu dhawaaq isku mid ah ku lahaan lahaa. Kuwani waa saadaalyo qol sanduuq ah, qalab naqshadeed, ma aha cabbir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cutubyada\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBedadka qolka, dherarka, mugyada iyo masaafooyinka waxaa lagu muujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay (cagta laba jibbaaran iyo saddex jibbaaran, inji, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir). Xisaabta laftiisa waxay ku sii jirtaa SI; kaliya muujintu waa beddelanaysaa. Waqtiyada (ilbidhiqsi), bandhigyada iyo heerarka waa isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Dhawaaqa qolka ee dhinaca bidix ayaa xisaabisa inta uu dhawaaqu ku sii socdo qol kasta. Waxay akhrisaa balaca dhulka qol kasta, dhererka, darbiyada, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha laga bilaabo moodelka IFC ee furan. Waxba kama bedelato moodelka. Dooro dhamaystirka Meesha moodelku sheegayo waxa dusha ku jira, qolku wuu akhriyaa: lakabka gudaha ee nooc kasta oo darbi (gypsum, plaster, brick, concrete iyo block waa la yaqaan), nooca dhulka (alwaax ama shub) iyo in saqafku dhoobo leeyahay. Calaamadda ku xigta doorasho kasta waxay sheegaysaa in ay ka timid moodelka, caadi ahaan, ama doorashadaada. Dooro dhamaystir kale si aad u beddesho. Wax uu moodelku aan sheegin waxa uu ku sii jiraa caadiga. Xoogsadyada waa qiyaasaha caadiga ah ee la daabacay; beddel marka aad haysato xogta tijaabada alaabta. Ku qor bartilmaameed (dib u celinta dhexe ee ugu dheer ee aad rabto) qol kasta oo ka sarreysa waa digniin, iyo nuugista loo baahan yahay si loo hoosaysiyo. Akhri jadwalka Dib u celinta waxaa la siiyaa 125 Hz ilaa 4 kHz. Sabine waxay ku habboon tahay qolal nool, Eyring qolal dhimma; khadka lagu calaamadeeyay Lagu isticmaalo wuxuu qaataa Eyring marka nuugista celceliska ah uu ka badan yahay 0.2. Nuugista hawada waa la ku daray (waxay gaabiyaa bandhigyada sare qolal waaweyn). Waa moodel tiro-ahaan: wuxuu male-awaal ahaan u qaadanayaa in codku si siman u faafo, sidaas darteed qolal dheer ama fidsan iyo qolal aad u yar waa hagid qiyaas ah, alaabta, dadka iyo albaabbada furan lama tiriyo. Dhegayso Ku ciyaar qolkan wuxuu ciyaaraa hadal (halkan lagu sameeyay), miyir-tiri, jiri-jiriyo ama faylkaaga codka gaarka ah (wuxuu kaaga jiraa kombuyuutarkaaga) oo mareynaya jawaabta saamaynta loo xisaabiyay qolka: dhawaaqa toosan, dhawaaqa ugu horreeya ee sanduuq sidaas u weyn, iyo dabeel dhimma oo ku dhammaata wakhtiga dib u celinta qolka bandhig kasta. Ku ciyaar si qallalan wuxuu ciyaaraa isla dhawaaqa isla heerka iyada oo aan qolka lahayn. Waxaad kaydin kartaa jawaabta saamaynta ama dhawaaqa qolka sida faylal WAV. Waxay u dhawaaqaysaa qol cabbirkiisa iyo dhamaystirkiisa leh, ma aha qol dhab ah oo gaar ah. Dadka iyo alaabta Qor tirada dadka qolkan ku jira si aad nuugistooda ku darto. Alaabta moodelku haysto (sofas, beds, chairs, tables, wardrobes, oo lagu helo magaca) nuugistooda ayay ku darta. Tirooyinku waa qiyaasyo qorshe oo qiyaas ah, la wareejiyay; ku beddel cabbirro qol muhiim ah. Isha iyo dhegeystaha Hoosta Isha iyo dhegeystaha, riix Dhig isha ama Dhig dhegeystaha oo guji qorshaha qolka. Dhawaaqa aad ciyaarto waxaa loo maqlaa meeshaas: dhawaaqa toosan wuxuu imanayaa ka dib masaafada, qaybta dib u celinta ahna heerkeeda masaafadaas. Labadaba ka saar si aad ugu noqoto sanduuqa masaafada. Nuugista aan siman iyo qaababka qolka Hoosta Nuugista aan siman (qol sanduuq ah), qor qolka sida sanduuq oo dooro dhamaystirka dhulka, saqafka iyo darbiyada. Jadwalka waxa lagu daraa Fitzroy iyo Arau-Puchades Sabine iyo Eyring: waxay labadaba u qaadaan saddex lammaane oo is-soo-horjeeda si gooni ah, sidaas darteed qol leh kaarpet iyo saqaf adag laguma akhrin mid aad u gaaban. Marka lammaanuhu aad u kala duwan yihiin, qor ayaa sheegaysa midka la aamini karo. Hoosta jadwalka, Qaababka qolka wuxuu liistaa mawjadaha taagan ee ugu hooseeya sanduuqa iyo bandhigga uu qolku ku yeesho qaababka kala gaar ah halkii uu dhawaaq isku mid ah ku lahaan lahaa. Kuwani waa saadaalyo qol sanduuq ah, qalab naqshadeed, ma aha cabbir. Cutubyada Bedadka qolka, dherarka, mugyada iyo masaafooyinka waxaa lagu muujiyaa Cutubyada aad dooratay (cagta laba jibbaaran iyo saddex jibbaaran, inji, millimitir, sentimitir ama mitir). Xisaabta laftiisa waxay ku sii jirtaa SI; kaliya muujintu waa beddelanaysaa. Waqtiyada (ilbidhiqsi), bandhigyada iyo heerarka waa isku mid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"concrete-and-seismic","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi xubnaha kontaadada oo samee culeysyada jilicsanaanta","summary":"Dejiso birta beamada kontaadada iyo tiirarka moodelka furan, hubi sida ACI 318-19, samee xoogagga dhinaca ee ASCE 7-22 ee dabaqyada adag, oo eeg kala-gedgedka dabaqa. Caawin injineer oo hubiya.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["kontaado","kontaado birta ku xoogaysan","reinforced concrete","ACI 318","ACI 318-19","birta","beam","tiir","shear","ties","dhulgariir","jilicsanaan","ELF","xoog dhinac","ASCE 7-22","drift","kala-gedgedka dabaqa","dabaqyada","diaphragm adag","miisaanka dabaqa","utilisation","qaab-dhismeed","injineer","falanqayn"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-bimcraft-akhrinayo","text":"Waxa BimCraft akhrinayo","level":2},{"id":"birmo-isku-dhafka-hubin","text":"Birmo, isku-dhafka, hubin","level":2},{"id":"dabaqyada-iyo-culeysyada-jilicsanaanta","text":"Dabaqyada iyo culeysyada jilicsanaanta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXubnaha kontaadada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuleysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/span\u003E ee tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E waxay hubiyaan beamada kontaadada ee birta ku xoogaysan iyo tiirarka IFC-ka furan, waxayna sameeyaan xoogagga dhinaca ee dhulgariirka ee dabaqyada qaab-dhismeedkiisa. Waa qaybaha isku mid ah ee DetailCraft, waxaa la socodsiiyaa kadib falanqaynta tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ka oo ay weheliyaan dejinta falanqaynta kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijooyinku \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaxay u yihiin hubinta injineer\u003C/strong\u003E: caawin ilaa uu mid dib u eegay. Hubinta kontaadada waxay isticmaashaa xoogag kowaad-darajo (tiir ku jira qaab aan dhaqaajin loo naqshadeeyay cabbirka dhidibka ballaadhan), iyada oo aan lagu dhex-dhigin dhaqdhaqaaq, aan la naqshadeyn torsion, aan faahfaahin jilicsanaan (ACI cutubka 18) iyo aan faahfaahin tie. Culeysyada dhulgariirka waxay ka tagaan isku-dhafka dheeraadka ah, xoogga dhulgariirka toosan, kor u kaca torsion iyo saamaynta P-delta. \u003Cstrong\u003ECuleysyada dabaysha lama dhisin\u003C/strong\u003E: cutubyada dabaysha ee heerka ma ku jiraan bogagga tixraaca mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-bimcraft-akhrinayo\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft akhrinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFalanqaynta waxay akhrisaa beamada, tiirarka iyo braces-ka moodelka oo leh profile-yadooda (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\"\u003EFalanqee qaab-dhismeedka\u003C/a\u003E). Qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXubnaha kontaadada\u003C/span\u003E waxay liistaa qaybo kasta oo ay isticmaalaan. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu deji kontaado…\u003C/span\u003E qayb kontaado ah: BimCraft wuxuu afar-xagal ka qaadaa agga iyo adkaynta profile-ka (ballaca b iyo dhererka h oo markaas aad beddeli kartid), sidaas darteed qayb aan u dhowayn afar-xagal (birta la rogay) wuxuu siinayaa cabbir aad wax ka beddeshid, ama waa la daayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb loo dejiyay kontaado, iyo walax kasta oo magaceeda agabkeedu yahay kontaado, waxaa lagu falanqeeyaa sida kontaado: E = 4700 √f′c, 2400 kg/m³, iyo caadi ahaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybo ciirsan\u003C/strong\u003E (tiirarka 0.70 Ig, beamada 0.35 Ig; ACI 318-19 Table 6.6.3.1.1(a)). Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha buuxa\u003C/span\u003E si aad u damiso. Dejinta kale la&#039;aan, moodelka waxaa loo falanqeeyaa sida hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"birmo-isku-dhafka-hubin\"\u003EBirmo, isku-dhafka, hubin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBixi daboolka, birta sare, hoose iyo dhinac (ama kaarka tiirka), iyo ties-ka qayb kasta, deji f′c, fy, fyt, K iyo sway ama non-sway. Bixi noocyada culeyska, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee isku-darka\u003C/span\u003E (ASCE 7 §5.3.1) kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi kontaadada\u003C/span\u003E: xubin kasta waxay heshaa utilisation, oo midab lagu siiyay moodelka. Xubnaha ka sarreeya awoodda, iyo kala-gedgedka dabaqa ka sarreeya xadka, waxaa lagu liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E iyo qodobkooda; guji mid si aad walaxda u doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabaqyada-iyo-culeysyada-jilicsanaanta\"\u003EDabaqyada iyo culeysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuleysyada jilicsanaanta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel dabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu helaa heerarka ay bar laba ama ka badan ku kulmaan; mid kasta wuxuu noqdaa diaphragm adag. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaado miisaanka kiisaska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrisaa miisaanka jilicsanaanta dabaq kasta oo kiisaska aad siiso factor. Buuxi SDS, SD1, S1, R, Ie, Cd, TL, nidaamka iyo heerka khatarta, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee kiisaska jilicsanaanta\u003C/span\u003E (ASCE 7-22 12.8: period, base shear, qaybinta dabaqyada kor, 5 % accidental torsion). Xoogagga dabaqyada iyo hubinta kala-gedgedka (12.12) ayaa muuqda kadib socodsiin. Isla period-ka iyo adkaynta dabaqa ayaa quudiya dhulgariirka ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hazard-playback\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hazard-playback\"\u003ECiyaar daad, dabayl ama dhulgariir\u003C/a\u003E marka aad dooratid qaabka falanqaynta isha ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESagxadaha iyo darbiyada kontaadada waxay noqdaan saxan falanqaynta, qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirta sagxadda\u003C/span\u003E waxay xisaabisaa birta ay u baahan yihiin mitir kasta. Faahfaahinta hubin kasta waxaa ku jira mawduuca isla magacaas ee DetailCraft.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybaha Xubnaha kontaadada iyo Culeysyada jilicsanaanta ee tab-ka Falanqayn waxay hubiyaan beamada kontaadada ee birta ku xoogaysan iyo tiirarka IFC-ka furan, waxayna sameeyaan xoogagga dhinaca ee dhulgariirka ee dabaqyada qaab-dhismeedkiisa. Waa qaybaha isku mid ah ee DetailCraft, waxaa la socodsiiyaa kadib falanqaynta tab-ka Falanqayn, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa IFC-ka oo ay weheliyaan dejinta falanqaynta kale. Natiijooyinku waxay u yihiin hubinta injineer: caawin ilaa uu mid dib u eegay. Hubinta kontaadada waxay isticmaashaa xoogag kowaad-darajo (tiir ku jira qaab aan dhaqaajin loo naqshadeeyay cabbirka dhidibka ballaadhan), iyada oo aan lagu dhex-dhigin dhaqdhaqaaq, aan la naqshadeyn torsion, aan faahfaahin jilicsanaan (ACI cutubka 18) iyo aan faahfaahin tie. Culeysyada dhulgariirka waxay ka tagaan isku-dhafka dheeraadka ah, xoogga dhulgariirka toosan, kor u kaca torsion iyo saamaynta P-delta. Culeysyada dabaysha lama dhisin: cutubyada dabaysha ee heerka ma ku jiraan bogagga tixraaca mashruuca. Waxa BimCraft akhrinayo Falanqaynta waxay akhrisaa beamada, tiirarka iyo braces-ka moodelka oo leh profile-yadooda (eeg Falanqee qaab-dhismeedka). Qaybta Xubnaha kontaadada waxay liistaa qaybo kasta oo ay isticmaalaan. Riix Ku deji kontaado… qayb kontaado ah: BimCraft wuxuu afar-xagal ka qaadaa agga iyo adkaynta profile-ka (ballaca b iyo dhererka h oo markaas aad beddeli kartid), sidaas darteed qayb aan u dhowayn afar-xagal (birta la rogay) wuxuu siinayaa cabbir aad wax ka beddeshid, ama waa la daayaa. Qayb loo dejiyay kontaado, iyo walax kasta oo magaceeda agabkeedu yahay kontaado, waxaa lagu falanqeeyaa sida kontaado: E = 4700 √f′c, 2400 kg/m³, iyo caadi ahaan qaybo ciirsan (tiirarka 0.70 Ig, beamada 0.35 Ig; ACI 318-19 Table 6.6.3.1.1(a)). Dooro Qaybaha buuxa si aad u damiso. Dejinta kale la'aan, moodelka waxaa loo falanqeeyaa sida hore. Birmo, isku-dhafka, hubin Bixi daboolka, birta sare, hoose iyo dhinac (ama kaarka tiirka), iyo ties-ka qayb kasta, deji f′c, fy, fyt, K iyo sway ama non-sway. Bixi noocyada culeyska, riix Samee isku-darka (ASCE 7 §5.3.1) kadibna Hubi kontaadada: xubin kasta waxay heshaa utilisation, oo midab lagu siiyay moodelka. Xubnaha ka sarreeya awoodda, iyo kala-gedgedka dabaqa ka sarreeya xadka, waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka iyo qodobkooda; guji mid si aad walaxda u doorato. Dabaqyada iyo culeysyada jilicsanaanta Qaybta Culeysyada jilicsanaanta, Hel dabaqyada wuxuu helaa heerarka ay bar laba ama ka badan ku kulmaan; mid kasta wuxuu noqdaa diaphragm adag. Qaado miisaanka kiisaska wuxuu akhrisaa miisaanka jilicsanaanta dabaq kasta oo kiisaska aad siiso factor. Buuxi SDS, SD1, S1, R, Ie, Cd, TL, nidaamka iyo heerka khatarta, kadibna Samee kiisaska jilicsanaanta (ASCE 7-22 12.8: period, base shear, qaybinta dabaqyada kor, 5 % accidental torsion). Xoogagga dabaqyada iyo hubinta kala-gedgedka (12.12) ayaa muuqda kadib socodsiin. Isla period-ka iyo adkaynta dabaqa ayaa quudiya dhulgariirka ku jira Ciyaar daad, dabayl ama dhulgariir marka aad dooratid qaabka falanqaynta isha ah. Sagxadaha iyo darbiyada kontaadada waxay noqdaan saxan falanqaynta, qaybta Birta sagxadda waxay xisaabisaa birta ay u baahan yihiin mitir kasta. Faahfaahinta hubin kasta waxaa ku jira mawduuca isla magacaas ee DetailCraft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"hazard-playback","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ciyaari daadka, dabaysha ama dhulgariirka dhismaha","summary":"Biyaha oo kor u kacaya qolalka, cadaadiska dabaysha dabaq kasta, ama dhulgariir dabaqyada gariraya, oo lagu ciyaaro qorshe ama muuqaal dhinac oo leh jiid-wakhti. Moodeelo fudud oo liiska male-awaalkooda ku qoran; ma aha hubin koodh ama naqshad qaab-dhismeed.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["khatar","daad","dabayl","dhulgariir","seismic","drift","sway","base shear","heerka biyaha","cimilada","sanaryo","heerka badda","ciyaarin","dabaq","xilli"],"headings":[{"id":"daad","text":"Daad","level":2},{"id":"dabayl","text":"Dabayl","level":2},{"id":"dhulgariir","text":"Dhulgariir","level":2},{"id":"adkaysiga-dabaqa-oo-ka-yimid-qaabka-falanqaynta","text":"Adkaysiga dabaqa oo ka yimid Qaabka falanqaynta","level":2},{"id":"unugyada","text":"Unugyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaarinta khatarta\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka bidix ayaa khatar ciyaaraysa moodeelka IFC ee furan. Waxba ma beddelmo moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emoodeelo fudud si loo arko khatarta uu qorshahan ku sameeyo\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha daraasad daadka, hubin koodhka dabaysha, ama naqshad qaab-dhismeed. Natiijo kasta wuxuu liistaa male-awaalkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daad\"\u003EDaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDheji heerka biyaha ugu sarreeya ee ka sarreeya dabaqa ugu hoose, iyo daqiiqadaha ay ku kacayaan, ku hayaan, ku hoosaadaan. Biyuhu qol ayaan u galaan albaab furan oo sill-kiisa ay gudbeen, qolalka ay albaabbo ka hooseeya biyaha ugu xidhan yihiin qolalka biyaha ku jira waxay joogaan heer isku mid ah (quasi-static). Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa goorta qol kasta marka hore qoyaanoobo iyo sida uu u qoto dheer yahay; qorshaha ayaa ciyaaraya. Ku qor inta ugu badan ee biyo qol qaadan karo, qolalka ka badan wuxuu ahaadaan digniin. \u003Cstrong\u003EMustaqbalka cimilada:\u003C/strong\u003E soo geli faylkaaga sanaryo (JSON ama CSV oo leh sannad, kor u kaca heerka badda iyo tiro daad) oo dooro sannad. Ama shid kordhinta Mustaqbalka cimilada oo dooro sanaryo iyo sannad: daadku wuu laba jeer socdaa, mid hadda iyo mid mustaqbal oo isku dhinac ah (eeg &quot;Mustaqbalka cimilada: daadka, kulaylka iyo dabka-dhulka 2050 iyo 2080&quot;). Noocyada Khatarta dabka-dhulka iyo Faylka kulaylka cimilada ee mustaqbalka waxay ku jiraan isla liiskaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabayl\"\u003EDabayl\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadaadiska wuxuu raacaa ½ρV², xawaarahana wuxuu kor u kacaa sida ay u sarreeyaan. Xoogga dabaq kasta waa cadaadiskaas oo ay dhufatay qaddarka dhufashada (gust factor), labada isku-xidhka cadaadis, ballaca iyo dhererka dabaqa. Waxaad heleysaa shear, moment-ka rarista iyo sway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhulgariir\"\u003EDhulgariir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismo shear ah: culeys dabaq kasta (aagga dhulka × kilogram halkii m², oo adna dejiso), isku-adkaysi isku mid ah dabaq kasta oo la habeeyey xilliga koowaad ee aad siiso (tobnaad ilbiriqsi halkii dabaq haddii aad bannaysid, oo wuu sheegaa), qaylo-dhimis, iyo dhaqdhaqaaq dhul oo la sameeyey (garaac ama dhawaaq la shaandheeyey) ee xawaaraha ugu sarreeya ee aad doorato. Natiijadu waa drift dabaq kasta, xawaaraha dabaqyada iyo base shear; muuqaalka dhinaca wuxuu ciyaaraa sway, oo la sawiray mid ka weyn sidii uu yahay. Ka qor drift ratio aad oggolaato, dabaqyada ka badan waa digniin. Waa elastic: waxba ma gooyo ama ma jaajuuqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adkaysiga-dabaqa-oo-ka-yimid-qaabka-falanqaynta\"\u003EAdkaysiga dabaqa oo ka yimid Qaabka falanqaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhulgariir ama dabayl dhaqdhaqaq ah, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka falanqaynta\u003C/strong\u003E halkii aad ku qori lahayd xilliga, si isku-adkaysiga loo helo. Dabaq kasta waa la riixaa dhinac dhinac, qaabka (xubnaha, tiirarka, xidhashada, dabaqyada) waa la xalliyaa, kadibna isku-adkaysiga dabaqyada oo dhan oo wada shaqeeya ayaa socodka wadaa. Culeyska waa kan xubnaha iyo culeyska dabaqa ee aad ku dhejiso dhulka dabaq kasta. Xilliga koowaad ee dhabta ah ayaa la muujiyaa. Waa elastic: waxba ma jaajuuqdo, torsion-kana ma la moodelayo. Dabaysha, xoogagga dabaqyada weli waa kuwii la male-awaaleeyey ee kor ku xusan (qaab power-law, qaddarka dhufashada, iyo isku-dhufka cadaadiska go&#039;an, ma aha koodhka dabaysha); sway-ga keliya ayaa ka timaada qaabka, iyada oo la xalliyo matriksa isku-adkaysiga oo dhan ee qaabka ka dhan ah xoogagaas. Moodeelku wuxuu u baahan yahay IFC oo leh qaab ay Tab-ka Falanqaynta akhrin karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unugyada\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoto dheerka biyaha, sway iyo drift dabaq-dabaq, masaafooyinka iyo aagagga waxay muuqdaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay. Xoogagga (kN), waqtiyada iyo xawaaraha dhaqdhaqaaqa waxay haystaan unugyadooda; qiimaha aad ku qortay sanduuq ku calaamadsan meters wuu ku sii jiraa meters. Isla waxaa loo kala dhan yahay natiijooyinka kala-baxa, iftiinka, kulaylka iyo qaboojinta iyo alaabaynta: dhererka, aagga iyo mugga waxay raacaan doorashadaada; cadaadiska, socodka, heerkulka, tamarta iyo awoodda waligood lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Ciyaarinta khatarta ee panel-ka bidix ayaa khatar ciyaaraysa moodeelka IFC ee furan. Waxba ma beddelmo moodeelka. Kuwani waa moodeelo fudud si loo arko khatarta uu qorshahan ku sameeyo, ma aha daraasad daadka, hubin koodhka dabaysha, ama naqshad qaab-dhismeed. Natiijo kasta wuxuu liistaa male-awaalkiisa. Daad Dheji heerka biyaha ugu sarreeya ee ka sarreeya dabaqa ugu hoose, iyo daqiiqadaha ay ku kacayaan, ku hayaan, ku hoosaadaan. Biyuhu qol ayaan u galaan albaab furan oo sill-kiisa ay gudbeen, qolalka ay albaabbo ka hooseeya biyaha ugu xidhan yihiin qolalka biyaha ku jira waxay joogaan heer isku mid ah (quasi-static). Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa goorta qol kasta marka hore qoyaanoobo iyo sida uu u qoto dheer yahay; qorshaha ayaa ciyaaraya. Ku qor inta ugu badan ee biyo qol qaadan karo, qolalka ka badan wuxuu ahaadaan digniin. Mustaqbalka cimilada: soo geli faylkaaga sanaryo (JSON ama CSV oo leh sannad, kor u kaca heerka badda iyo tiro daad) oo dooro sannad. Ama shid kordhinta Mustaqbalka cimilada oo dooro sanaryo iyo sannad: daadku wuu laba jeer socdaa, mid hadda iyo mid mustaqbal oo isku dhinac ah (eeg \"Mustaqbalka cimilada: daadka, kulaylka iyo dabka-dhulka 2050 iyo 2080\"). Noocyada Khatarta dabka-dhulka iyo Faylka kulaylka cimilada ee mustaqbalka waxay ku jiraan isla liiskaas. Dabayl Cadaadiska wuxuu raacaa ½ρV², xawaarahana wuxuu kor u kacaa sida ay u sarreeyaan. Xoogga dabaq kasta waa cadaadiskaas oo ay dhufatay qaddarka dhufashada (gust factor), labada isku-xidhka cadaadis, ballaca iyo dhererka dabaqa. Waxaad heleysaa shear, moment-ka rarista iyo sway. Dhulgariir Dhismo shear ah: culeys dabaq kasta (aagga dhulka × kilogram halkii m², oo adna dejiso), isku-adkaysi isku mid ah dabaq kasta oo la habeeyey xilliga koowaad ee aad siiso (tobnaad ilbiriqsi halkii dabaq haddii aad bannaysid, oo wuu sheegaa), qaylo-dhimis, iyo dhaqdhaqaaq dhul oo la sameeyey (garaac ama dhawaaq la shaandheeyey) ee xawaaraha ugu sarreeya ee aad doorato. Natiijadu waa drift dabaq kasta, xawaaraha dabaqyada iyo base shear; muuqaalka dhinaca wuxuu ciyaaraa sway, oo la sawiray mid ka weyn sidii uu yahay. Ka qor drift ratio aad oggolaato, dabaqyada ka badan waa digniin. Waa elastic: waxba ma gooyo ama ma jaajuuqo. Adkaysiga dabaqa oo ka yimid Qaabka falanqaynta Dhulgariir ama dabayl dhaqdhaqaq ah, dooro Qaabka falanqaynta halkii aad ku qori lahayd xilliga, si isku-adkaysiga loo helo. Dabaq kasta waa la riixaa dhinac dhinac, qaabka (xubnaha, tiirarka, xidhashada, dabaqyada) waa la xalliyaa, kadibna isku-adkaysiga dabaqyada oo dhan oo wada shaqeeya ayaa socodka wadaa. Culeyska waa kan xubnaha iyo culeyska dabaqa ee aad ku dhejiso dhulka dabaq kasta. Xilliga koowaad ee dhabta ah ayaa la muujiyaa. Waa elastic: waxba ma jaajuuqdo, torsion-kana ma la moodelayo. Dabaysha, xoogagga dabaqyada weli waa kuwii la male-awaaleeyey ee kor ku xusan (qaab power-law, qaddarka dhufashada, iyo isku-dhufka cadaadiska go'an, ma aha koodhka dabaysha); sway-ga keliya ayaa ka timaada qaabka, iyada oo la xalliyo matriksa isku-adkaysiga oo dhan ee qaabka ka dhan ah xoogagaas. Moodeelku wuxuu u baahan yahay IFC oo leh qaab ay Tab-ka Falanqaynta akhrin karto. Unugyada Qoto dheerka biyaha, sway iyo drift dabaq-dabaq, masaafooyinka iyo aagagga waxay muuqdaan Cutubyada aad dooratay. Xoogagga (kN), waqtiyada iyo xawaaraha dhaqdhaqaaqa waxay haystaan unugyadooda; qiimaha aad ku qortay sanduuq ku calaamadsan meters wuu ku sii jiraa meters. Isla waxaa loo kala dhan yahay natiijooyinka kala-baxa, iftiinka, kulaylka iyo qaboojinta iyo alaabaynta: dhererka, aagga iyo mugga waxay raacaan doorashadaada; cadaadiska, socodka, heerkulka, tamarta iyo awoodda waligood lama beddelo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"georeference-any-projection","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Geo-tixgelinta projection kasta","summary":"U sheeg BimCraft nidaamka khariidadda ee isku xirka moodelka, liiska EPSG oo dhan, aagga UTM kasta, ama projection aad naftaadu qeexdo, oo isticmaal Booska, lakabyada khariidadda iyo daruuraha dhibcaha.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["projection","nidaamka isku xirka","crs","epsg","utm","aagga utm","projection gaar ah","proj4","proj string","prj","wkt","geo-tixgelin","geo-tixgelinta","beddelka khariidadda","ifcprojectedcrs","dhigistayda","latitude","longitude","easting","northing","lambert","gauss-kruger","state plane","gridka qaranka"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-nidaamka-moodelka","text":"Dooro nidaamka moodelka","level":2},{"id":"dhigistayda","text":"Dhigistayda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-isticmaala","text":"Waxa isticmaala","level":2},{"id":"moodel-aan-weli-khariidadda-ku-jirin","text":"Moodel aan weli khariidadda ku jirin","level":2},{"id":"moodel-horey-khariidadda-ugu-jira","text":"Moodel horey khariidadda ugu jira","level":2},{"id":"daruuro-dhibcaha-iyo-dhulka-nidaam-kale","text":"Daruuro dhibcaha iyo dhulka nidaam kale","level":2},{"id":"marka-wax-qiyaas-yihiin","text":"Marka wax qiyaas yihiin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQorshooyin qaarkood waxaa lagu sawiraa nidaam khariidad oo aan ku jirin liiska gaaban: aag UTM, gridka qaranka, ama projection qof qoray sida qeexid qoraal. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENidaamka isku xirka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad sheegto nidaamka moodelku isticmaalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-nidaamka-moodelka\"\u003EDooro nidaamka moodelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodelka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENidaamka isku xirka…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa raadinta. Mid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah ayaa shaqeeya:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elambar EPSG: \u003Ccode\u003E32633\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EEPSG:2277\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eaagga UTM: \u003Ccode\u003EUTM 33N\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EUTM 20 S\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ENAD83 UTM 15N\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EETRS89 UTM 32N\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eerayo ka mid ah magaca: \u003Ccode\u003Elambert 93\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emga zone 56\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etexas central\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqeexid projection: \u003Ccode\u003E+proj=tmerc +lat_0=0 +lon_0=9 +k=0.9996 +x_0=500000 +y_0=0 +ellps=WGS84 +units=m\u003C/code\u003E, oo lagu dari karo magac hore (\u003Ccode\u003EMy grid = +proj=…\u003C/code\u003E);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqoraalka fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E, ama isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo rar fayl .prj…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro natiijo, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal nidaamkan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorashadu waxay ku kaydsantaa moodelka (property set oo magiciisu yahay \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_CRS\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca), sidaas awgeed way dib u furmaysaa moodelka. Kaydi moodelka si aad u ilaaliso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku laabanayaa waxa faylku sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii qeexidkaaga uu siiyo isku xirka isku mid ah ee nidaam EPSG liistaan ah, BimCraft waa sheegaa oo wuxuu isticmaalaa koodkaas; marka nidaamyo liis ah oo badan ay isku mid yihiin xisaabta, waxay magacaabaan kuwa kale sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhigistayda\"\u003EDhigistayda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQeexid aad ku dhejiso ama fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E aad soo rarto waa la ilaalin karaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu hay Dhigistayda\u003C/span\u003E. Liiskaasi wuxuu ku jiraa qalabkan (browserkan) waxaana lagu soo bandhigaa mar xigta markaad furto doorashada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-isticmaala\"\u003EWaxa isticmaala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa barta la doortay latitude iyo longitude iyada oo loo marayo nidaamka moodelka. Waqti hore wuxuu joogsan jiray markii faylku magacaabo nidaamka khariidadda oo aan lahayn koodka EPSG; hadda, marka doorasho la kaydiyay, wuxuu siiyaa jawaabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta moodelka waxay isticmaalaan isla nidaamka. Daruur dhibco ama fayl dhul oo nidaam kale ku jira ayaa lagu soo bandhigaa kan moodelka (eeg hoos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro nidaam kale…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa waxa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale sheegayo: latitude iyo longitude nidaam geographic kasta oo liistaan ah, ama easting iyo northing nidaam projected kasta, oo ka sokow kan moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodel-aan-weli-khariidadda-ku-jirin\"\u003EMoodel aan weli khariidadda ku jirin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii faylku aanu lahayn beddel khariidad, doorashada nidaamka waxay furtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig moodeelkan khariidadda\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad ka furi kartaa sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga khariidadda…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii bilowga moodelka sida easting iyo northing nidaamka, ama qor latitude iyo longitude oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu beddel eastings iyo northings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii jiifka ilaa waqooyiga gridka (degrees, saacadda ka soo horjeedda; 0 wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in Y axis-ka moodelka uu u jeedo waqooyiga gridka) iyo dhererka bilowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaanku wuxuu bilaabmaa farqiga unit-ka ee moodelka iyo khariidadda (0.001 moodel millimitir ah oo ku yaal grid metir ah). Beddel kaliya haddii aad u baahan tahay factor isku dhafan oo dhulka ilaa gridka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig khariidadda\u003C/span\u003E. Hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo wuxuu qoraa IfcProjectedCRS iyo IfcMapConversion (IFC4). Moodelka laftiisu ma dhaqaaqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka IFC2X3 labadaba qaybood ma leh. BimCraft wuxuu qoraa tirooyinka isla sida caadigu oggolaado: property sets-ka buildingSMART \u003Ccode\u003EePSet_MapConversion\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EePSet_ProjectedCRS\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca, latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta, iyo waqooyiga run. Wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa taas. Kaydi moodelka si aad u ilaaliso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodel-horey-khariidadda-ugu-jira\"\u003EMoodel horey khariidadda ugu jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka faylku horey isu geliyo khariidadda oo aad dooratid nidaam kale, BimCraft wuu weydiiyaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaliya beddel waxa Location soo sheegta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaalinayaa geo-tixgelinta faylka oo isticmaalaa doorashadaada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E, lakabyada khariidadda iyo daruuraha dhibcaha (markaas tirooyinka moodelka waxaa loo akhriyaa inay ku jiraan nidaamka cusub).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri moodelka nidaamkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u qoraa geo-tixgelinta: bilowga wuxuu gudbaa projection-ka (eastings, northings, dhererka, jiifka iyo miisaanka) iyo IfcProjectedCRS (magaca, datum, projection, zone, unit) waa dib loo qoraa, sidaas IFC-ga la kaydiyay wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka cusub. Meesha dhulka ma beddelanayso: bilowgu wuxuu hayaa latitude iyo longitude-kiisii. Waxyaabaha moodelka gudihiisa ma beddelmaan; geo-tixgelinta kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa bilowga hore iyo kan cusub ka hor intaadan dooran. Dhaqaajinta tagista iyo soo noqoshada bilowga waxay soo celinaysaa dhex millimitir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daruuro-dhibcaha-iyo-dhulka-nidaam-kale\"\u003EDaruuro dhibcaha iyo dhulka nidaam kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaruur ama fayl sahan wuxuu leeyahay nidaamkiisa (LAS, LAZ, E57, GeoTIFF) ama midna. Markay ka duwan tahay kan moodelka, BimCraft wuxuu bixiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMashaariic dib u qorso nidaamka moodelka\u003C/span\u003E. Dhibcaha waa la dhaqaajiyaa qaybo (worker ku jira markay yihiin badan, si bogga u sii shaqeeyo), faylka kombiyuutarkaaga lama taabanayo, sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyay. Dib u fur faylka si aad ugu noqoto nidaamkiisii. Daruur horey u furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u qor moodelka…\u003C/span\u003E ee baarka daruurta ayaa samaysa isla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii faylku aanu magacaabin nidaam, BimCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylkan nidaam ayuu ku jiraa?\u003C/span\u003E: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro nidaamka…\u003C/span\u003E oo jawaabta waa la xasuustaa faylkaas qalabkan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu sii hay nidaamka faylka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka tagaa dhibcaha sidooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-wax-qiyaas-yihiin\"\u003EMarka wax qiyaas yihiin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibaatooyinka waa la liistaa wada-hadalka iyo qaybta Dhibaatooyinka, weligood si aan la ogeysiin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeel ka baxsan aagga ay nidaamku u sameysan yahay: tirooyinku way shaqeeyaan, laakiin fogaansho ayaa kordha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareejinta datum-ka oo u baahan fayl gridka (NADCON, NTv2 iyo kuwa la mid ah) lama heli karo. Nidaamyada datum kale waxaa loo dhaqaajiyaa iyadoo la adeegsanayo wareejinta aan gridka lahayn ee liiska EPSG uu sheego, natiijadana waa qiyaas ilaa saxnaanta la sheegay, oo fariintu meter ku sheegaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibcaha aan la mari karin waa la reebaa oo la tiriyaa; faylka ka weyn xadka cabbirka waa la diidaa, xadka oo la sheegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku xirka khariidadda wuxuu u baahan yahay beddel khariidadda. Fayl aan lahayn waxaa lagu dhigaa khariidadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga khariidadda…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhaqaajinta u dhexeysa datum-yada iyada oo aan fayl grid-ka lahayn ayaa wanaagsan dhowr mitir; natiijada Booska waxay sheegtaa inta ay fogtahay marka katalogku ogyahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qorshooyin qaarkood waxaa lagu sawiraa nidaam khariidad oo aan ku jirin liiska gaaban: aag UTM, gridka qaranka, ama projection qof qoray sida qeexid qoraal. Qiyaas › Nidaamka isku xirka… wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad sheegto nidaamka moodelku isticmaalo. Dooro nidaamka moodelka Fur moodelka, dooro Qiyaas, kadibna Nidaamka isku xirka…. Ku qor sanduuqa raadinta. Mid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah ayaa shaqeeya: lambar EPSG: 32633 ama EPSG:2277; aagga UTM: UTM 33N, UTM 20 S, NAD83 UTM 15N, ETRS89 UTM 32N; erayo ka mid ah magaca: lambert 93, mga zone 56, texas central; qeexid projection: +proj=tmerc +lat_0=0 +lon_0=9 +k=0.9996 +x_0=500000 +y_0=0 +ellps=WGS84 +units=m, oo lagu dari karo magac hore (My grid = +proj=…); qoraalka fayl .prj, ama isticmaal Soo rar fayl .prj…. Dooro natiijo, kadibna Isticmaal nidaamkan. Doorashadu waxay ku kaydsantaa moodelka (property set oo magiciisu yahay CadCraft_CRS ee mashruuca), sidaas awgeed way dib u furmaysaa moodelka. Kaydi moodelka si aad u ilaaliso. Ka saar moodeelka wuxuu ku laabanayaa waxa faylku sheegayo. Haddii qeexidkaaga uu siiyo isku xirka isku mid ah ee nidaam EPSG liistaan ah, BimCraft waa sheegaa oo wuxuu isticmaalaa koodkaas; marka nidaamyo liis ah oo badan ay isku mid yihiin xisaabta, waxay magacaabaan kuwa kale sidoo kale. Dhigistayda Qeexid aad ku dhejiso ama fayl .prj aad soo rarto waa la ilaalin karaa Ku hay Dhigistayda. Liiskaasi wuxuu ku jiraa qalabkan (browserkan) waxaana lagu soo bandhigaa mar xigta markaad furto doorashada. Waxa isticmaala Qiyaas › Booska wuxuu beddelaa barta la doortay latitude iyo longitude iyada oo loo marayo nidaamka moodelka. Waqti hore wuxuu joogsan jiray markii faylku magacaabo nidaamka khariidadda oo aan lahayn koodka EPSG; hadda, marka doorasho la kaydiyay, wuxuu siiyaa jawaabta. Lakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta moodelka waxay isticmaalaan isla nidaamka. Daruur dhibco ama fayl dhul oo nidaam kale ku jira ayaa lagu soo bandhigaa kan moodelka (eeg hoos). Dejinta › BimCraft › Booska › Dooro nidaam kale… wuxuu dejiyaa waxa Booska sidoo kale sheegayo: latitude iyo longitude nidaam geographic kasta oo liistaan ah, ama easting iyo northing nidaam projected kasta, oo ka sokow kan moodelka. Moodel aan weli khariidadda ku jirin Haddii faylku aanu lahayn beddel khariidad, doorashada nidaamka waxay furtaa Dhig moodeelkan khariidadda. Waxaad ka furi kartaa sidoo kale Qiyaas › Bilowga khariidadda…. Ku sii bilowga moodelka sida easting iyo northing nidaamka, ama qor latitude iyo longitude oo dooro Ku beddel eastings iyo northings. Ku sii jiifka ilaa waqooyiga gridka (degrees, saacadda ka soo horjeedda; 0 wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in Y axis-ka moodelka uu u jeedo waqooyiga gridka) iyo dhererka bilowga. Miisaanku wuxuu bilaabmaa farqiga unit-ka ee moodelka iyo khariidadda (0.001 moodel millimitir ah oo ku yaal grid metir ah). Beddel kaliya haddii aad u baahan tahay factor isku dhafan oo dhulka ilaa gridka. Dooro Dhig khariidadda. Hal tallaabo oo lagu soo noqdo wuxuu qoraa IfcProjectedCRS iyo IfcMapConversion (IFC4). Moodelka laftiisu ma dhaqaaqo. Faylka IFC2X3 labadaba qaybood ma leh. BimCraft wuxuu qoraa tirooyinka isla sida caadigu oggolaado: property sets-ka buildingSMART ePSet_MapConversion iyo ePSet_ProjectedCRS ee mashruuca, latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta, iyo waqooyiga run. Wada-hadalku wuu sheegaa taas. Kaydi moodelka si aad u ilaaliso. Moodel horey khariidadda ugu jira Marka faylku horey isu geliyo khariidadda oo aad dooratid nidaam kale, BimCraft wuu weydiiyaa: Kaliya beddel waxa Location soo sheegta wuxuu ilaalinayaa geo-tixgelinta faylka oo isticmaalaa doorashadaada Booska, lakabyada khariidadda iyo daruuraha dhibcaha (markaas tirooyinka moodelka waxaa loo akhriyaa inay ku jiraan nidaamka cusub). Guuri moodelka nidaamkan wuxuu dib u qoraa geo-tixgelinta: bilowga wuxuu gudbaa projection-ka (eastings, northings, dhererka, jiifka iyo miisaanka) iyo IfcProjectedCRS (magaca, datum, projection, zone, unit) waa dib loo qoraa, sidaas IFC-ga la kaydiyay wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka cusub. Meesha dhulka ma beddelanayso: bilowgu wuxuu hayaa latitude iyo longitude-kiisii. Waxyaabaha moodelka gudihiisa ma beddelmaan; geo-tixgelinta kaliya. Wada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa bilowga hore iyo kan cusub ka hor intaadan dooran. Dhaqaajinta tagista iyo soo noqoshada bilowga waxay soo celinaysaa dhex millimitir. Daruuro dhibcaha iyo dhulka nidaam kale Daruur ama fayl sahan wuxuu leeyahay nidaamkiisa (LAS, LAZ, E57, GeoTIFF) ama midna. Markay ka duwan tahay kan moodelka, BimCraft wuxuu bixiyaa Mashaariic dib u qorso nidaamka moodelka. Dhibcaha waa la dhaqaajiyaa qaybo (worker ku jira markay yihiin badan, si bogga u sii shaqeeyo), faylka kombiyuutarkaaga lama taabanayo, sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyay. Dib u fur faylka si aad ugu noqoto nidaamkiisii. Daruur horey u furan, Dib u qor moodelka… ee baarka daruurta ayaa samaysa isla. Haddii faylku aanu magacaabin nidaam, BimCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa Faylkan nidaam ayuu ku jiraa?: dooro Dooro nidaamka… oo jawaabta waa la xasuustaa faylkaas qalabkan. Ku sii hay nidaamka faylka wuxuu ka tagaa dhibcaha sidooda. Marka wax qiyaas yihiin Dhibaatooyinka waa la liistaa wada-hadalka iyo qaybta Dhibaatooyinka, weligood si aan la ogeysiin: Meel ka baxsan aagga ay nidaamku u sameysan yahay: tirooyinku way shaqeeyaan, laakiin fogaansho ayaa kordha. Wareejinta datum-ka oo u baahan fayl gridka (NADCON, NTv2 iyo kuwa la mid ah) lama heli karo. Nidaamyada datum kale waxaa loo dhaqaajiyaa iyadoo la adeegsanayo wareejinta aan gridka lahayn ee liiska EPSG uu sheego, natiijadana waa qiyaas ilaa saxnaanta la sheegay, oo fariintu meter ku sheegaysa. Dhibcaha aan la mari karin waa la reebaa oo la tiriyaa; faylka ka weyn xadka cabbirka waa la diidaa, xadka oo la sheegay. Isku xirka khariidadda wuxuu u baahan yahay beddel khariidadda. Fayl aan lahayn waxaa lagu dhigaa khariidadda Bilowga khariidadda…. Dhaqaajinta u dhexeysa datum-yada iyada oo aan fayl grid-ka lahayn ayaa wanaagsan dhowr mitir; natiijada Booska waxay sheegtaa inta ay fogtahay marka katalogku ogyahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"climate-futures","scope":"bimcraft","title":"\"Mustaqbalka cimilada: 2050 iyo 2080 daadad, kulayl iyo dab-baadi\"","summary":"Dib u socodsii daadadka, sannadka tamarta iyo hubinta dab-baadiga iyadoo cimilada mustaqbalka la adeegsanayo (qaababka SSP2-4.5 iyo SSP5-8.5, sannadaha 2050 iyo 2080) xirmo xog cimilo, oo lagu soo bandhigo isku dhinac hadda iyo mustaqbal.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["cimilada","isbeddelka cimilada","mustaqbal","2050","2080","ssp","cmip6","qaab","heerka badda","daad","kulayl","faylka cimilada","epw","morph","energyplus","dab-baadi","dab","cimilada dabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-mustaqbal","text":"Dooro mustaqbal","level":2},{"id":"daad-hadda-iyo-mustaqbal-isku-dhinac","text":"Daad, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac","level":2},{"id":"kulayl-faylka-cimilada-mustaqbalka","text":"Kulayl: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka","level":2},{"id":"sannad-tamarta-hadda-iyo-mustaqbal-isku-dhinac","text":"Sannad tamarta, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac","level":2},{"id":"dab-baadiga-screening-keliya","text":"Dab-baadiga (screening keliya)","level":2},{"id":"xogta-ka-timid-halkay","text":"Xogta ka timid halkay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXogta cimilada waxa ka timid \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmo xog\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha app-ka. Ku shid add-on-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMustaqbalka cimilada\u003C/span\u003E Dejinta › Add-ons, ama rar faylka xirmo aad leedahay block-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMustaqbal cimilo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmada ku timid add-on-ka waa \u003Cstrong\u003Etijaabo\u003C/strong\u003E: saddex meelood (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), hal qaab cimilo, iyo shan sannadood in kasta oo 20 sannadood ah. Waxa loogu talagalay isku dayidda qalabka, \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha naqshadeyn\u003C/strong\u003E. Panelku waxa uu taas ku sheegaa xarfo qaro ah markii la isticmaalayo. Xirmo buuxa (qaabab badan, sannadaha oo dhan, meelo badan) waxa lagu dhisaa \u003Ccode\u003Etools/climate/build-pack.mjs\u003C/code\u003E iyadoo laga soo qaadayo xogta NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-mustaqbal\"\u003EDooro mustaqbal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca bidix ee panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaarinta khatarta\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EScenario\u003C/strong\u003E (SSP2-4.5, dhexdhexaadka, ama SSP5-8.5, qiiqa sare) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EYear\u003C/strong\u003E (2050 waxa ay la macno tahay 2041-2060, 2080 waxa ay la macno tahay 2071-2090; labaduba waxay ka hor yimaadaan 1995-2014). \u003Cstrong\u003EPlace\u003C/strong\u003E waa meesha xirmada ugu dhow goobta moodelka (IfcSite latitude iyo longitude), ama midka aad dooratay. Meel kasta oo ka fog, isbeddelka celceliska adduunka ee xirmada ayaa la isticmaalaa oo panelku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daad-hadda-iyo-mustaqbal-isku-dhinac\"\u003EDaad, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScenario la doortay, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EFlood type\u003C/strong\u003E: xeebta (wuxuu ku daraa kor u kaca heerka badda), webi ama roob culus (wuxuu ka dhigaa mid qoto dheer badan isbeddelka roobka maalinta ugu qoyan), ama labadaba. Riix Run: daadku wuu ciyaaraa sida hore, miis ayaa muujinaya daadka hadda iyo kan mustaqbalka isku dhinac (heerka biyaha, qolalka qoyaanka, biyaha ugu qoto-dheer). Male-ahaan qaybaha hoose ayaa lagu liistaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eheerka xeebta wuxuu kor u kacaa kor u kaca badda oo dhan; wamuuj iyo mawjadaha lama beddelo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esocodka webiga wuxuu si la mid ah ugu kacaa roobka maalinta ugu qoyan, qotodheerkana wuxuu raacaa socodka ilaa xoogga 0.6 (sinaajiga Manning ee kanaal ballaaran);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elabada qaybood si fudud ayaa loo daraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulayl-faylka-cimilada-mustaqbalka\"\u003EKulayl: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro nooca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKulayl: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka\u003C/span\u003E, dooro fayl cimilo \u003Ccode\u003E.epw\u003C/code\u003E oo hadda ah, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee faylka cimilada mustaqbalka\u003C/span\u003E. Faylka waxa \u003Cstrong\u003Ela morph-gareeyaa\u003C/strong\u003E bil bil iyadoo la adeegsanayo habka isbeddelka iyo kordhinta ee la daabacay (Belcher, Hacker and Powell 2005): celceliska bisha wuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka xirmada, galabta kulul wuxuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka heerka ugu kulul maalinta, habeenada qabowna wuxuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka heerka ugu hooseeya maalinta. Qoyaanka xigta wuxuu raacaa isbeddelka xirmada, dew point-na waa dib loo xisaabiyaa. Cadaadiska iyo dabaysha way sidii ay ahaayeen. Miiska wuxuu isbarbardhigaa celceliska iyo heerkulka ugu kulul, heerkulka naqshadeynta qabowga 0.4 % iyo kulaylka 99.6 %, saacadaha 30 °C iyo 35 °C, iyo degree-days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi faylka cimilada mustaqbalka\u003C/span\u003E wuu kaydiyaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal hubinta tamarta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa hubinta EnergyPlus (tab-ka Energy). Faylka mustaqbalka waa isla sannadka cimilada caadiga ah, oo kulul: ma ku daro mowjado kulul oo cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sannad-tamarta-hadda-iyo-mustaqbal-isku-dhinac\"\u003ESannad tamarta, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubinta EnergyPlus ee tab-ka Energy (add-on u gaar ah oo leh engine-kaaga), dooro fayl cimilo oo hadda ah, kadibna scenario iyo sannad block-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMustaqbal cimilo\u003C/span\u003E, oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee sannad: hadda iyo mustaqbal\u003C/span\u003E: sannadku wuxuu ku socdaa faylka hadda iyo mustaqbalkiisa oo morph-gareeyay, kulaylka iyo qabowga qol kasta ayaa isku dhinac lagu liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dab-baadiga-screening-keliya\"\u003EDab-baadiga (screening keliya)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro nooca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDab-baadiga (screening keliya)\u003C/span\u003E: beerta ugu dhow, jiifka ka kor u kaca ilaa dhismaha, iyo masaafada ilaa beertaas. Natiijadu waa qaybta ka bilaabanta aad u hooseeya ilaa aad u sarreeya, hadda iyo mustaqbal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScreening keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Tani waa miisaankeenna nidaamka kaliya si loo ogaado in goob u baahan tahay qiimayn dab-baadi oo sax ah, ma aha qiimo qawaaniin ama bushfire attack level. Waxay isku dhufataa miisaan u eg beerta, factor jiifka (dabku wuxuu ku dhufanayaa xawaaraha ilaa laba jeer 10 darajo kasta oo kor u kacaysa, oo lagu tiriyo ilaa 20 darajo), factor masaafada (10 m oo loo qaybiyay masaafada, ugu badnaan 1) iyo isbeddelka xirmada ee fire-weather index-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xogta-ka-timid-halkay\"\u003EXogta ka timid halkay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerkulka, qoyaanka, qorraxda, roobka, cimilada dabka:\u003C/strong\u003E NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6, natiijada modelka CMIP6 ee maalin kasta la yareeyay. Natiijada modelka kasta waxa ku jira CC BY 4.0. Isbeddelka cimilada dabka waa Canadian Fire Weather Index oo maalin kasta laga xisaabiyey cimilada modelka (qoyaanka maalinta halkii qoyaanka duhurka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKor u kaca heerka badda:\u003C/strong\u003E celceliska adduunka ee IPCC AR6 (ma aha meel gaar ah; dhulka kor u kaca ama hoos u dhacaya kuma jiro), ilaa xirmo ay leedahay xog meel gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXirmadu waxay magacaabaysaa isha, liisanka iyo taariikhda; panelku wuu muujiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Xogta cimilada waxa ka timid xirmo xog, ma aha app-ka. Ku shid add-on-ka Mustaqbalka cimilada Dejinta › Add-ons, ama rar faylka xirmo aad leedahay block-ka Mustaqbal cimilo. Xirmada ku timid add-on-ka waa tijaabo: saddex meelood (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), hal qaab cimilo, iyo shan sannadood in kasta oo 20 sannadood ah. Waxa loogu talagalay isku dayidda qalabka, ma aha naqshadeyn. Panelku waxa uu taas ku sheegaa xarfo qaro ah markii la isticmaalayo. Xirmo buuxa (qaabab badan, sannadaha oo dhan, meelo badan) waxa lagu dhisaa tools/climate/build-pack.mjs iyadoo laga soo qaadayo xogta NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6. Dooro mustaqbal Dhinaca bidix ee panelka Ciyaarinta khatarta, dooro Scenario (SSP2-4.5, dhexdhexaadka, ama SSP5-8.5, qiiqa sare) iyo Year (2050 waxa ay la macno tahay 2041-2060, 2080 waxa ay la macno tahay 2071-2090; labaduba waxay ka hor yimaadaan 1995-2014). Place waa meesha xirmada ugu dhow goobta moodelka (IfcSite latitude iyo longitude), ama midka aad dooratay. Meel kasta oo ka fog, isbeddelka celceliska adduunka ee xirmada ayaa la isticmaalaa oo panelku wuu sheegaa. Daad, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac Scenario la doortay, deji Flood type: xeebta (wuxuu ku daraa kor u kaca heerka badda), webi ama roob culus (wuxuu ka dhigaa mid qoto dheer badan isbeddelka roobka maalinta ugu qoyan), ama labadaba. Riix Run: daadku wuu ciyaaraa sida hore, miis ayaa muujinaya daadka hadda iyo kan mustaqbalka isku dhinac (heerka biyaha, qolalka qoyaanka, biyaha ugu qoto-dheer). Male-ahaan qaybaha hoose ayaa lagu liistaa: heerka xeebta wuxuu kor u kacaa kor u kaca badda oo dhan; wamuuj iyo mawjadaha lama beddelo; socodka webiga wuxuu si la mid ah ugu kacaa roobka maalinta ugu qoyan, qotodheerkana wuxuu raacaa socodka ilaa xoogga 0.6 (sinaajiga Manning ee kanaal ballaaran); labada qaybood si fudud ayaa loo daraa. Kulayl: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka Dooro nooca Kulayl: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka, dooro fayl cimilo .epw oo hadda ah, kadibna riix Samee faylka cimilada mustaqbalka. Faylka waxa la morph-gareeyaa bil bil iyadoo la adeegsanayo habka isbeddelka iyo kordhinta ee la daabacay (Belcher, Hacker and Powell 2005): celceliska bisha wuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka xirmada, galabta kulul wuxuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka heerka ugu kulul maalinta, habeenada qabowna wuxuu kululaanayaa isbeddelka heerka ugu hooseeya maalinta. Qoyaanka xigta wuxuu raacaa isbeddelka xirmada, dew point-na waa dib loo xisaabiyaa. Cadaadiska iyo dabaysha way sidii ay ahaayeen. Miiska wuxuu isbarbardhigaa celceliska iyo heerkulka ugu kulul, heerkulka naqshadeynta qabowga 0.4 % iyo kulaylka 99.6 %, saacadaha 30 °C iyo 35 °C, iyo degree-days. Kaydi faylka cimilada mustaqbalka wuu kaydiyaa; Isticmaal hubinta tamarta wuxuu siinayaa hubinta EnergyPlus (tab-ka Energy). Faylka mustaqbalka waa isla sannadka cimilada caadiga ah, oo kulul: ma ku daro mowjado kulul oo cusub. Sannad tamarta, hadda iyo mustaqbal isku dhinac Hubinta EnergyPlus ee tab-ka Energy (add-on u gaar ah oo leh engine-kaaga), dooro fayl cimilo oo hadda ah, kadibna scenario iyo sannad block-ka Mustaqbal cimilo, oo riix Samee sannad: hadda iyo mustaqbal: sannadku wuxuu ku socdaa faylka hadda iyo mustaqbalkiisa oo morph-gareeyay, kulaylka iyo qabowga qol kasta ayaa isku dhinac lagu liistaa. Dab-baadiga (screening keliya) Dooro nooca Dab-baadiga (screening keliya): beerta ugu dhow, jiifka ka kor u kaca ilaa dhismaha, iyo masaafada ilaa beertaas. Natiijadu waa qaybta ka bilaabanta aad u hooseeya ilaa aad u sarreeya, hadda iyo mustaqbal. Screening keliya. Tani waa miisaankeenna nidaamka kaliya si loo ogaado in goob u baahan tahay qiimayn dab-baadi oo sax ah, ma aha qiimo qawaaniin ama bushfire attack level. Waxay isku dhufataa miisaan u eg beerta, factor jiifka (dabku wuxuu ku dhufanayaa xawaaraha ilaa laba jeer 10 darajo kasta oo kor u kacaysa, oo lagu tiriyo ilaa 20 darajo), factor masaafada (10 m oo loo qaybiyay masaafada, ugu badnaan 1) iyo isbeddelka xirmada ee fire-weather index-ka. Xogta ka timid halkay Heerkulka, qoyaanka, qorraxda, roobka, cimilada dabka: NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6, natiijada modelka CMIP6 ee maalin kasta la yareeyay. Natiijada modelka kasta waxa ku jira CC BY 4.0. Isbeddelka cimilada dabka waa Canadian Fire Weather Index oo maalin kasta laga xisaabiyey cimilada modelka (qoyaanka maalinta halkii qoyaanka duhurka). Kor u kaca heerka badda: celceliska adduunka ee IPCC AR6 (ma aha meel gaar ah; dhulka kor u kaca ama hoos u dhacaya kuma jiro), ilaa xirmo ay leedahay xog meel gaar ah. Xirmadu waxay magacaabaysaa isha, liisanka iyo taariikhda; panelku wuu muujiyaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"life-cycle-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Arag waxa daahsanaya muddo konton sano gudahood","summary":"Daaqadaha, albaabbada, dhamaystirrada iyo saqafka uu moodelku hayo, nolosha adeegga ee kasta, sannadaha la beddelo, iyo kharashka sannad kasta iyo qiimihiisa hadda marka aad qiimo unug kasta gelisid.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["nolosha dhismaha","nolosha adeegga","beddel","dayactir","kharash","qiimaha hadda","dhimis","kor u kac qiimaha","50 sano","daaqadaha","midabka","saqaf","dhamaystirrada","nolosha oo dhan"],"headings":[{"id":"akhri","text":"Akhri","level":2},{"id":"tuubooyinka-tuubooyinka-hawada-xadhkaha-korontada-iyo-qalabka","text":"Tuubooyinka, tuubooyinka hawada, xadhkaha korontada iyo qalabka","level":2},{"id":"kaarboonka-beddel-kasta","text":"Kaarboonka beddel kasta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida nolosha\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca bidix waxay liisteysaa waxa moodelku hayo ee daahsanaya iyo goorta la beddelo muddada daraasadda (50 sano marka hore). Waxba ma bedelo moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri\"\u003EAkhri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta waxay muujinaysaa tirada (laga qaaday moodelka: aagga daaqadda, albaabbada dibadda iyo gudaha, dhamaystirka darbiga dibadda, midabka gudaha, dhamaystirka sagxadda iyo saqafka, bannaanka saqafka, jaranjarooyinka), \u003Cstrong\u003Enolosha sannadaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekharashka unug kasta\u003C/strong\u003E. Qayb waa la beddelaa marka nolosheeda dhammaato, iyo mar kasta oo ay laba jeer nolosheeda gaadho, inta ay ka horreyso dhammaadka daraasadda. Sidaas darteed daaqad nolosheedu tahay 30 sano oo daraasadu tahay 50 sano waa la beddelaa hal mar, sannadka 30aad. Nolosha adeegga waa qiyaas qorshe oo caadi ah: beddel kuwa alaabtaada iyo cimilada ku habboon. Kharash lama qaado; qor mid si aad u aragto lacagta sannad kasta, wadarta iyo qiimaheeda hadda. Ku dar heerka dhimista iyo heerka kor u kaca qiimaha haddii aad rabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi jadwalka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa qaybaha iyo sannadaha. Biibiyaha, tuubooyinka hawada, xadhkaha korontada iyo qalabka ayaa sidoo kale lagu liistaa (eeg hoose).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubooyinka-tuubooyinka-hawada-xadhkaha-korontada-iyo-qalabka\"\u003ETuubooyinka, tuubooyinka hawada, xadhkaha korontada iyo qalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubooyinka hawada\u003C/strong\u003E waa mitirada socod kasta oo la sawiray. \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka\u003C/strong\u003E (bambooyinka, dabbaallada, faalfaha, terminaalada, rakibaadka, godadka korontada, suiishyada, guddiyada korontada iyo waxyaabaha kale ee tab-ka Assets raadiyo) waxaa lagu tiriyaa nooca, nooc kasta oo leh nolosha qorshe. Shay kasta oo \u003Cem\u003Enolosha adeegga\u003C/em\u003E ay tab-ka Assets ku dejisay waa safka u gaar ah oo leh nolosheeda, haddii taariikh rakibidda ay leedna waxay ka bilaabataa da&#039;deeda: bambo da&#039;diisu tahay 16 sano, nolosheeduna tahay 10 sano, ayaa hadda la beddelayaa, kadibna 10 sano kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadhkaha korontada\u003C/strong\u003E waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiyaas\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafada qorshaha ee laga soo bilaabo guddiga ilaa qalabka wareeg kasta, iyada oo laga bilaabayo kan ugu dhow, oo lagu dhuftay 1.25 si loo helo jidka. Moodelku ma sawiro kable, sidaas darteed hubi isaga oo lagu barbardhigayo xisaabinta qadarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENolosha waa qiyaasaha qorshaha ee la dib u eego, ma aha il.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaarboonka-beddel-kasta\"\u003EKaarboonka beddel kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar kaarboonka ku jira beddel kasta\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqad, albaab, jaranjaro, saqaf, tuubo ama qalab cusub waxaa lagu tiriyaa kaarboonka ay leeyihiin elementiyada moodelka ee nooca isku mid ah (xaddidaha tab-ka Carbon, unug kasta). Qayb aan lahayn element ama xaddid, sida midabka, dhamaystirrada iyo xadhkaha korontada, waxay muujinaysaa jeexjeex, waana la liistaa. Dhammaadka nolosha qaybta hore iyo shuqulka beddelkeeda lama tirin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Aragtida nolosha ee dhinaca bidix waxay liisteysaa waxa moodelku hayo ee daahsanaya iyo goorta la beddelo muddada daraasadda (50 sano marka hore). Waxba ma bedelo moodelka. Akhri Qayb kasta waxay muujinaysaa tirada (laga qaaday moodelka: aagga daaqadda, albaabbada dibadda iyo gudaha, dhamaystirka darbiga dibadda, midabka gudaha, dhamaystirka sagxadda iyo saqafka, bannaanka saqafka, jaranjarooyinka), nolosha sannadaha iyo kharashka unug kasta. Qayb waa la beddelaa marka nolosheeda dhammaato, iyo mar kasta oo ay laba jeer nolosheeda gaadho, inta ay ka horreyso dhammaadka daraasadda. Sidaas darteed daaqad nolosheedu tahay 30 sano oo daraasadu tahay 50 sano waa la beddelaa hal mar, sannadka 30aad. Nolosha adeegga waa qiyaas qorshe oo caadi ah: beddel kuwa alaabtaada iyo cimilada ku habboon. Kharash lama qaado; qor mid si aad u aragto lacagta sannad kasta, wadarta iyo qiimaheeda hadda. Ku dar heerka dhimista iyo heerka kor u kaca qiimaha haddii aad rabto. Kaydi jadwalka (CSV) wuxuu qoraa qaybaha iyo sannadaha. Biibiyaha, tuubooyinka hawada, xadhkaha korontada iyo qalabka ayaa sidoo kale lagu liistaa (eeg hoose). Tuubooyinka, tuubooyinka hawada, xadhkaha korontada iyo qalabka Tuubooyinka iyo tuubooyinka hawada waa mitirada socod kasta oo la sawiray. Qalabka (bambooyinka, dabbaallada, faalfaha, terminaalada, rakibaadka, godadka korontada, suiishyada, guddiyada korontada iyo waxyaabaha kale ee tab-ka Assets raadiyo) waxaa lagu tiriyaa nooca, nooc kasta oo leh nolosha qorshe. Shay kasta oo nolosha adeegga ay tab-ka Assets ku dejisay waa safka u gaar ah oo leh nolosheeda, haddii taariikh rakibidda ay leedna waxay ka bilaabataa da'deeda: bambo da'diisu tahay 16 sano, nolosheeduna tahay 10 sano, ayaa hadda la beddelayaa, kadibna 10 sano kasta. Xadhkaha korontada waa qiyaas: masaafada qorshaha ee laga soo bilaabo guddiga ilaa qalabka wareeg kasta, iyada oo laga bilaabayo kan ugu dhow, oo lagu dhuftay 1.25 si loo helo jidka. Moodelku ma sawiro kable, sidaas darteed hubi isaga oo lagu barbardhigayo xisaabinta qadarkaaga. Nolosha waa qiyaasaha qorshaha ee la dib u eego, ma aha il. Kaarboonka beddel kasta Calaamee Ku dar kaarboonka ku jira beddel kasta. Daaqad, albaab, jaranjaro, saqaf, tuubo ama qalab cusub waxaa lagu tiriyaa kaarboonka ay leeyihiin elementiyada moodelka ee nooca isku mid ah (xaddidaha tab-ka Carbon, unug kasta). Qayb aan lahayn element ama xaddid, sida midabka, dhamaystirrada iyo xadhkaha korontada, waxay muujinaysaa jeexjeex, waana la liistaa. Dhammaadka nolosha qaybta hore iyo shuqulka beddelkeeda lama tirin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"compare-scan-with-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isbarbardhig scan-ka moodelka iyo jadwalka 4D","summary":"Xukun ku bixi walax kasta oo moodelka ah marka la barbardhigo daruuro dhibcood oo furan (la dhisay, qayb ahaan, la waayay, aan la gaarin), eeg boqolkiiba la dhisay, midabka moodelka iyada oo loo eegayo, iyo marka jadwal 4D la soo rogo, liis walxaha ka dambeeya ama ka horreeya maalinta 4D.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["scan","daruuro dhibcood","horumar","boqolkiiba dhammaystiran","la dhisay","la waayay","dambeeya jadwalka","horreeya jadwalka","4D","horumarka goobta","kala duwanaansho","as-built","scanka laser","drone","isbarbardhig"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-sameeyo","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo","level":2},{"id":"jadwalka-4d","text":"Jadwalka 4D","level":2},{"id":"miiraha-iyo-moodelka","text":"Miiraha iyo moodelka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur IFC, fur daruuro dhibcood oo ku dhinac ah (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EDaruuraha dhibcaha\u003C/a\u003E) oo dhig moodelka. Qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig scan-ka moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E waxay ka muuqataa panelka midig inta daruurta la furan tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sameeyo\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig\u003C/span\u003E. Walax kasta oo moodelka ah waxaa lagu xukumaa dusheeda, sababtoo ah taasi waa waxa scanku arka. Sanduuqa walax kasta lixda dhinac waxaa loo jarayaa unugyo ku dhow 20 cm; unug waa la tiriyaa marka dhibic scan ah ay ku jirto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDulqaadka\u003C/span\u003E aad dooratay (50 mm bilowga) ee dhinaca. Dhinaca weyn ee ugu fiican ayaa la tirinayaa, sidaas darteed darbi laga scanay hal dhinac kama ciqaabto dhinaca kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa dhisay\u003C/strong\u003E: ugu yaraan 40% dusha ayaa la arkay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb ahaan\u003C/strong\u003E: 10% ilaa 40%.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa waayay\u003C/strong\u003E: ka yar, laakiin scanku wuu gaaraa walaxda (dhibcaha ku dhow 1.5 m).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAan la gaarin\u003C/strong\u003E: scanku waligiis halkaas ma tagin, marka wax lagama odhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxaha la dhisay iyo kuwa qayb ahaan la dhisay, wuxuu kaloo siiyaa celceliska fogaanta dhibcaha scanka ee ka soo horjeeda dusha moodelka, wuxuuna sheegaa haddii walaxdu meeshii ay ku dhacdo ku jirto (dulqaadka gudihiisa), dhow (saddex jeer dulqaadka gudihiisa) ama fog (ka sii fog). Waxay arkaa oo keliya fogaanta ilaa shan jeer dulqaadka; walax meeshii ay ku dhacday ka sii fog, waxay u muuqataa mid la waayay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo koobidda waxay siinaysaa boqolkiiba la dhisay ee walxaha uu scanku gaaro, iyadoo lagu tiriyo tiro iyo mugga. Walxaha qayb ahaan la dhisay waa la tirinayaa si gaar ah, lamana isku daro walxaha la dhisay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalka-4d\"\u003EJadwalka 4D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka jadwal 4D la soo rogo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/4d-schedule\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/4d-schedule\"\u003EJadwalka 4D\u003C/a\u003E), natiijadu waxay sidoo kale isticmaashaa maalinta aad dejisay slider-ka 4D: walxaha u baahan maalintaas oo scanku aan u muujin inay la dhisay waa \u003Cstrong\u003Edambeeya jadwalka\u003C/strong\u003E; walxaha weli aan la gaarin oo la dhisay waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehoreeya\u003C/strong\u003E. Walxaha dambeeya waxaa lagu liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, miiraha waxaa lagu shaandhayn karaa iyaga. Jadwal la&#039;aan wax lagama odhan dambeeya ama horeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miiraha-iyo-moodelka\"\u003EMiiraha iyo moodelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji safka si aad walaxda u doorato. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidey moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu walxaha ku rinjiyeeyaa cagaar (la dhisay), jaalle (qayb ahaan), casaan (la waayay) ama cawl (aan la gaarin); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabkiisa\u003C/span\u003E wuu soo celiyaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa miiraha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadeeyaa walxaha la arkay oo la dhisay dulqaadka gudihiisa sida la xaqiijiyay goobta (LOD 500, habka scan), hal tallaabo oo aad dib u celin kartid. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waxay barbardhigtaa sanduuqa walax kasta dhibcaha scanka oo dulqaad ku jira. Ma aha \u003Cstrong\u003Esahan, xisaabinta qadarka ama salka lacag bixinta\u003C/strong\u003E. Walax qarsan oo ka dhinac scan la sameeyay (derbi ka gadaal dahaarka, sagxad shub hoosta dhamaadka sagxadda) wuxuu la wadaagaa dusha, wuxuuna u muuqan karaa la dhisay; walax qaloocan ama jiid ah sanduuqeedu wuu ka weyn yahay jirkeedu, wuxuuna u muuqan karaa qayb ahaan ama la waayay. Eeg liiska ka hor inta aadan wax ka qaadin. Faallooyinka ansixinta iyo warbixinnada horumarka ma ku jiraan tan: waxay sii joogaan tiirarka aad ku haysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiye ayaa samayn kara isbarbardhigga isla \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbarbardhig scan-ka moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E qalabka; ma beddelo wax moodelka ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur IFC, fur daruuro dhibcood oo ku dhinac ah (eeg Daruuraha dhibcaha) oo dhig moodelka. Qaybta Isbarbardhig scan-ka moodeelka waxay ka muuqataa panelka midig inta daruurta la furan tahay. Waxa uu sameeyo Riix Isbarbardhig. Walax kasta oo moodelka ah waxaa lagu xukumaa dusheeda, sababtoo ah taasi waa waxa scanku arka. Sanduuqa walax kasta lixda dhinac waxaa loo jarayaa unugyo ku dhow 20 cm; unug waa la tiriyaa marka dhibic scan ah ay ku jirto Dulqaadka aad dooratay (50 mm bilowga) ee dhinaca. Dhinaca weyn ee ugu fiican ayaa la tirinayaa, sidaas darteed darbi laga scanay hal dhinac kama ciqaabto dhinaca kale. La dhisay: ugu yaraan 40% dusha ayaa la arkay. Qayb ahaan: 10% ilaa 40%. La waayay: ka yar, laakiin scanku wuu gaaraa walaxda (dhibcaha ku dhow 1.5 m). Aan la gaarin: scanku waligiis halkaas ma tagin, marka wax lagama odhan. Walxaha la dhisay iyo kuwa qayb ahaan la dhisay, wuxuu kaloo siiyaa celceliska fogaanta dhibcaha scanka ee ka soo horjeeda dusha moodelka, wuxuuna sheegaa haddii walaxdu meeshii ay ku dhacdo ku jirto (dulqaadka gudihiisa), dhow (saddex jeer dulqaadka gudihiisa) ama fog (ka sii fog). Waxay arkaa oo keliya fogaanta ilaa shan jeer dulqaadka; walax meeshii ay ku dhacday ka sii fog, waxay u muuqataa mid la waayay. Soo koobidda waxay siinaysaa boqolkiiba la dhisay ee walxaha uu scanku gaaro, iyadoo lagu tiriyo tiro iyo mugga. Walxaha qayb ahaan la dhisay waa la tirinayaa si gaar ah, lamana isku daro walxaha la dhisay. Jadwalka 4D Marka jadwal 4D la soo rogo (eeg Jadwalka 4D), natiijadu waxay sidoo kale isticmaashaa maalinta aad dejisay slider-ka 4D: walxaha u baahan maalintaas oo scanku aan u muujin inay la dhisay waa dambeeya jadwalka; walxaha weli aan la gaarin oo la dhisay waa horeeya. Walxaha dambeeya waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka, miiraha waxaa lagu shaandhayn karaa iyaga. Jadwal la'aan wax lagama odhan dambeeya ama horeeya. Miiraha iyo moodelka Guji safka si aad walaxda u doorato. Midey moodeelka wuxuu walxaha ku rinjiyeeyaa cagaar (la dhisay), jaalle (qayb ahaan), casaan (la waayay) ama cawl (aan la gaarin); Midabkiisa wuu soo celiyaa. Kaydi CSV wuxuu qoraa miiraha. Calaamadee walxaha la xaqiijiyay goobta wuxuu calaamadeeyaa walxaha la arkay oo la dhisay dulqaadka gudihiisa sida la xaqiijiyay goobta (LOD 500, habka scan), hal tallaabo oo aad dib u celin kartid. Eeg Calaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta. Tani waxay barbardhigtaa sanduuqa walax kasta dhibcaha scanka oo dulqaad ku jira. Ma aha sahan, xisaabinta qadarka ama salka lacag bixinta. Walax qarsan oo ka dhinac scan la sameeyay (derbi ka gadaal dahaarka, sagxad shub hoosta dhamaadka sagxadda) wuxuu la wadaagaa dusha, wuxuuna u muuqan karaa la dhisay; walax qaloocan ama jiid ah sanduuqeedu wuu ka weyn yahay jirkeedu, wuxuuna u muuqan karaa qayb ahaan ama la waayay. Eeg liiska ka hor inta aadan wax ka qaadin. Faallooyinka ansixinta iyo warbixinnada horumarka ma ku jiraan tan: waxay sii joogaan tiirarka aad ku haysid. Caawiye ayaa samayn kara isbarbardhigga isla Isbarbardhig scan-ka moodeelka qalabka; ma beddelo wax moodelka ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rvt-to-ifc","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Faylka mashruuca oo BimCraft ku gal IFC-ga","summary":"Dejinta dhoofinta IFC ee si fiican ugu furmaysa BimCraft (nooca, property sets, base quantities, qolalka, moodelada xidhan, kala-dhaliga), sida loo furo natiijada, iyo waxa dhoofintu hayso.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["dhoofin","dhoofinta ifc","rvt to ifc","beddel","3d","joomatari","ifc2x3","ifc4","Coordination View","Reference View","Design Transfer View","property sets","base quantities","qolalka","meelaha","faylal xidhan","kala-dhaliga la wadaago","barta sahanka","barta saldhigga mashruuca","dejin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-ugu-wanaagsan-ee-halkan-furmaysa","text":"Dejinta ugu wanaagsan ee halkan furmaysa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-dhoofintu-hayso-iyo-waxa-aan-hayn","text":"Waxa dhoofintu hayso iyo waxa aan hayn","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka mashruuca u beddel fayl IFC oo aad ku wareegi karto, ku eegi karto, ku hubin karto oo ku tafatiri karto BimCraft. BimCraft wali ma akhrin moodelka 3D ee gudaha fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed dhoofintu waxay ku dhacdaa barnaamijka sameeyay (Revit); BimCraft waxa uu furaa natiijada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMashruuca ku fur barnaamijka sameeyay. Kaarka BimCraft wuxuu magacaabaa nooca lagu kaydiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur muuqaal 3D ah oo muujinaya waxa aad rabto inaad dhoofiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka &gt; Dhoofin &gt; IFC\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa dhoofinta dooro dejin (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel dejinta…\u003C/strong\u003E) oo leh dejinta hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro gal iyo magac fayl, oo dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft gudahiisa, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro fayl\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka cusub ee \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Moodelada xidhan ee loo dhoofiyay faylal gaar ah waxay isla muuqaal ugu furmaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodeel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-ugu-wanaagsan-ee-halkan-furmaysa\"\u003EDejinta ugu wanaagsan ee halkan furmaysa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta dhoofiyaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDooro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Reference View\u003C/strong\u003E eegista, hubinta iyo qadarka ka qaadista; \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0\u003C/strong\u003E marka kuwa kale u baahan yihiin IFC2X3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabaduba si buuxda ayay furmaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Design Transfer View\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sidoo kale furmaysa, oo leh qaababka saxda ah ee ka badan, laakiin faylku waa weyn yahay oo gaabis badan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E (caadi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft ma furo \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarxalad / walxaha la arki karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarxaladda aad ula jeedo, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi kaliya walxaha ku muuqda muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E marka aad u dejinayso muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa ka reebaya waxa aad ula jeedday inaad qariso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProperty sets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi property sets-ka Revit\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi property sets-ka guud ee IFC\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay noqdaan property sets-ka BimCraft muujiyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, kuwaas oo ay isticmaalaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBase quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi base quantities\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E iyo jadwalada ayaa isticmaalaan (dherer, bed, mug) halkii ay male-awaal ku saari lahaayeen.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolalka iyo bedadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi qolalka muuqaalada 3D\u003C/strong\u003E (ama doorashada Rooms / Spaces)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolalku waxay yimaadaan sida meelo: guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalka xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi faylalka xidhan sida IFC gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhiid kasta wuxuu noqdaa fayl gaar ah; ku fur wada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar moodeel\u003C/span\u003E oo waa isku toosaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaldhigga kala-dhaliga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-dhaliga la wadaago\u003C/strong\u003E (ama barta sahanka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku markaas wuxuu sidaa booskiisa khariidadda (IfcMapConversion), si Cabbir › Meel, lakabyada khariidada dhulka iyo daruuraha dhibcaha ee lagu meeleeyay kala-dhaliga khariidadda ay shaqeeyaan. Barta saldhigga mashruuca moodelka ku hayso asalka agtiisa laakiin booskiisa khariidadda ma lahan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala-jar darbiyada iyo tiirarka heerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShid, markaad qadarka dabaq kasta ka qaadayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta dabaq kasta waa walxaheeda gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka 3D, oo dabaqyadiisa laga qaado heerarka mashruuca iyo macluumaadka mashruuca ee sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga dhoofiyay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu magacaabaa dhoofiyaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-dhoofintu-hayso-iyo-waxa-aan-hayn\"\u003EWaxa dhoofintu hayso iyo waxa aan hayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa hayo\u003C/strong\u003E: joomatriga, dabaqyada, noocyada walxaha, magacyada, nooca, inta badan cabbirrada (property sets ahaan), base quantities marka la waydiiyo, qolalka oo meelo ah, iyo booska khariidadda ee kala-dhaliga la wadaago.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama hayo\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaalada, xaashiyada, faallooyinka, qoysaska sida qoysas la tafatiri karo, shaqo-kooxaha iyo ikhtiyaarrada naqshadda. Fayl IFC waa sawirka walxaha moodelka, ma aha mashruuca. Xaashiyada, dhoofi DWG oo ku fur muuqaalka 2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada ka maqan BimCraft.\u003C/strong\u003E Shid doorashooyinka property set-ka ee kor ku qoran oo mar kale dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQolalka ka maqan.\u003C/strong\u003E Shid doorashada qolalka, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta sida \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro IFC caadi ah, ama ka fur \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBooska khariidadda ma jiro.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofi kala-dhaliga la wadaago; hubi in barta sahanka mashruuca la dejiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax-ka-beddelka oo laga sugayo inay dib u socdaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax-ka-beddelka aad ku kaydiso BimCraft waxay galaan fayl IFC cusub, ma aha faylka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Faylka mashruuca u beddel fayl IFC oo aad ku wareegi karto, ku eegi karto, ku hubin karto oo ku tafatiri karto BimCraft. BimCraft wali ma akhrin moodelka 3D ee gudaha fayl .rvt, sidaas darteed dhoofintu waxay ku dhacdaa barnaamijka sameeyay (Revit); BimCraft waxa uu furaa natiijada. Tallaabooyinka Mashruuca ku fur barnaamijka sameeyay. Kaarka BimCraft wuxuu magacaabaa nooca lagu kaydiyay. Fur muuqaal 3D ah oo muujinaya waxa aad rabto inaad dhoofiso. Dooro Faylka \u003E Dhoofin \u003E IFC. Sanduuqa dhoofinta dooro dejin (ama Beddel dejinta…) oo leh dejinta hoose. Dooro gal iyo magac fayl, oo dhoofi. BimCraft gudahiisa, guji Dooro fayl oo dooro faylka cusub ee .ifc. Moodelada xidhan ee loo dhoofiyay faylal gaar ah waxay isla muuqaal ugu furmaan Ku dar moodeel. Dejinta ugu wanaagsan ee halkan furmaysa Dejinta dhoofiyaha Dooro Sababta Nooca IFC IFC4 Reference View eegista, hubinta iyo qadarka ka qaadista; IFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0 marka kuwa kale u baahan yihiin IFC2X3 Labaduba si buuxda ayay furmaan. IFC4 Design Transfer View ayaa sidoo kale furmaysa, oo leh qaababka saxda ah ee ka badan, laakiin faylku waa weyn yahay oo gaabis badan. Nooca faylka IFC (caadi) BimCraft ma furo .ifczip ama .ifcxml. Marxalad / walxaha la arki karo Marxaladda aad ula jeedo, iyo Dhoofi kaliya walxaha ku muuqda muuqaalka marka aad u dejinayso muuqaalka 3D Waxa ka reebaya waxa aad ula jeedday inaad qariso. Property sets Dhoofi property sets-ka Revit iyo Dhoofi property sets-ka guud ee IFC Waxay noqdaan property sets-ka BimCraft muujiyo Sifooyinka, kuwaas oo ay isticmaalaan Raadi, Midab iyo Hubinta moodelka. Base quantities Dhoofi base quantities Wadarta qadarka iyo jadwalada ayaa isticmaalaan (dherer, bed, mug) halkii ay male-awaal ku saari lahaayeen. Qolalka iyo bedadka Dhoofi qolalka muuqaalada 3D (ama doorashada Rooms / Spaces) Qolalku waxay yimaadaan sida meelo: guji Meelaha si aad u aragto. Faylalka xidhan Dhoofi faylalka xidhan sida IFC gaar ah Xidhiid kasta wuxuu noqdaa fayl gaar ah; ku fur wada Ku dar moodeel oo waa isku toosaan. Saldhigga kala-dhaliga Kala-dhaliga la wadaago (ama barta sahanka) Faylku markaas wuxuu sidaa booskiisa khariidadda (IfcMapConversion), si Cabbir › Meel, lakabyada khariidada dhulka iyo daruuraha dhibcaha ee lagu meeleeyay kala-dhaliga khariidadda ay shaqeeyaan. Barta saldhigga mashruuca moodelka ku hayso asalka agtiisa laakiin booskiisa khariidadda ma lahan. Kala-jar darbiyada iyo tiirarka heerka Shid, markaad qadarka dabaq kasta ka qaadayso Qaybta dabaq kasta waa walxaheeda gaarka ah. Waxa aad arki doontid Moodelka 3D, oo dabaqyadiisa laga qaado heerarka mashruuca iyo macluumaadka mashruuca ee sanduuqa Faylka. Laga dhoofiyay wuxuu magacaabaa dhoofiyaha. Waxa dhoofintu hayso iyo waxa aan hayn La hayo: joomatriga, dabaqyada, noocyada walxaha, magacyada, nooca, inta badan cabbirrada (property sets ahaan), base quantities marka la waydiiyo, qolalka oo meelo ah, iyo booska khariidadda ee kala-dhaliga la wadaago. Lama hayo: muuqaalada, xaashiyada, faallooyinka, qoysaska sida qoysas la tafatiri karo, shaqo-kooxaha iyo ikhtiyaarrada naqshadda. Fayl IFC waa sawirka walxaha moodelka, ma aha mashruuca. Xaashiyada, dhoofi DWG oo ku fur muuqaalka 2D. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Cabbirrada ka maqan BimCraft. Shid doorashooyinka property set-ka ee kor ku qoran oo mar kale dhoofi. Qolalka ka maqan. Shid doorashada qolalka, kadibna guji Meelaha. Kaydinta sida .ifczip. Dooro IFC caadi ah, ama ka fur .ifczip. Booska khariidadda ma jiro. Dhoofi kala-dhaliga la wadaago; hubi in barta sahanka mashruuca la dejiyay. Wax-ka-beddelka oo laga sugayo inay dib u socdaan. Wax-ka-beddelka aad ku kaydiso BimCraft waxay galaan fayl IFC cusub, ma aha faylka mashruuca.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"develop-a-mass","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Culeys dhismo ka samee daraasad goobeed","summary":"Qaado culeys dhismo oo laga daraaseeyay aragtida goobta ee CivilCraft, ka dhig dabaqyo, derbiyo iyo dhulal, iyada oo kaydinaysa booska goobta ee khariidadda.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["culeys","culeys dhismo","massing","daraasad goobeed","samee","CivilCraft","gacan u gudbin","dabaqyo","derbiyo","dhulal","footprint","georeference","IFC"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-culeys","text":"Samee culeys","level":2},{"id":"booska-goobta","text":"Booska goobta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAragtida goobta ee CivilCraft ayaa sawiri karta culeysyo dhismo oo ku taal dhul, iyo xuduudaha aad gelisay, iyo iftiinka. \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo leh culeysyada; \u003Cstrong\u003ECuleysyada IFC ahaan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl aad halkan ku furto si caadi ah. Labadaba mid kasta wuxuu yimaadaa sida goob, dhismo oo dabaq kasta u leeyahay dabaq, iyo hal bloog (culeysku qudhiisa) oo qaadaya tirooyinkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-culeys\"\u003ESamee culeys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro culeys ku jira muuqaalka 3D. Guryaha waxay muujinayaan isticmaalkiisa, dabaqyada iyo dhererka dabaqa, footprint-ka, aagga guud ee dabaqa, sida uu ugu jiro dhaadhaca, iyo dhulkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee culeyskan\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal tallaabo ka noqo, dhismo kasta dabaq kasta waxa uu helaa derbiyo ku wareegsan footprint-ka (footprint-ku waa dusha dibadda ee derbiyada; derbi kasta wuxuu kor u kacaa dabaqa kore, dabaqa sare waa hal dabaq dherer) iyo sagxad hoos ka dhigan dhismaha oo dhan. Bloogga waa la beddelaa, dhismuhuna wuxuu hayaa tirooyinka daraasadda ee dhaqanka xogta \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteMass\u003C/code\u003E, oo calaamad lagu sameeyay. Ma jiro saqaf: saqafku wuxuu ku xidhan yahay naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"booska-goobta\"\u003EBooska goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka CivilCraft waxaa lagu qoraa unugga dherer ee mashruuca, oo haddii mashruucii CivilCraft uu nidaam isku xidhka lahaa, waxaa lagu qaadaa sida isbeddelka khariidadda ee mashruuca. Samaynta culeysku ma beddelo taas, sidaas darteed dhismuhu wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha uu khariiddu sheegayso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aragtida goobta ee CivilCraft ayaa sawiri karta culeysyo dhismo oo ku taal dhul, iyo xuduudaha aad gelisay, iyo iftiinka. Samee BimCraft wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo leh culeysyada; Culeysyada IFC ahaan wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl aad halkan ku furto si caadi ah. Labadaba mid kasta wuxuu yimaadaa sida goob, dhismo oo dabaq kasta u leeyahay dabaq, iyo hal bloog (culeysku qudhiisa) oo qaadaya tirooyinkiisa. Samee culeys Dooro culeys ku jira muuqaalka 3D. Guryaha waxay muujinayaan isticmaalkiisa, dabaqyada iyo dhererka dabaqa, footprint-ka, aagga guud ee dabaqa, sida uu ugu jiro dhaadhaca, iyo dhulkiisa. Guji Samee culeyskan. Hal tallaabo ka noqo, dhismo kasta dabaq kasta waxa uu helaa derbiyo ku wareegsan footprint-ka (footprint-ku waa dusha dibadda ee derbiyada; derbi kasta wuxuu kor u kacaa dabaqa kore, dabaqa sare waa hal dabaq dherer) iyo sagxad hoos ka dhigan dhismaha oo dhan. Bloogga waa la beddelaa, dhismuhuna wuxuu hayaa tirooyinka daraasadda ee dhaqanka xogta CadCraft_SiteMass, oo calaamad lagu sameeyay. Ma jiro saqaf: saqafku wuxuu ku xidhan yahay naqshadda. Booska goobta Faylka CivilCraft waxaa lagu qoraa unugga dherer ee mashruuca, oo haddii mashruucii CivilCraft uu nidaam isku xidhka lahaa, waxaa lagu qaadaa sida isbeddelka khariidadda ee mashruuca. Samaynta culeysku ma beddelo taas, sidaas darteed dhismuhu wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha uu khariiddu sheegayso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pln-project-files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur faylasha mashruuca .pln iyo .pla","summary":"Waxa BimCraft ku sameeyo faylasha .pln, .pla, .tpl iyo .bpn maanta, iyo sida IFC iyo DWG looga dhoofiyo si moodeelka iyo naqshadaha halkan ugu furmaan.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["pln","pla","tpl","bpn","faylka mashruuca","kaydka","qaabka","nuqulka badbaadada","ifc export","dwg export","turjumaan","aagag","qaabeynta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-maanta-furma","text":"Waxa maanta furma","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-ifc-moodeelka","text":"Dhoofi IFC (moodeelka)","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-dwg-naqshadaha","text":"Dhoofi DWG (naqshadaha)","level":2},{"id":"xalinta-dhibaatada","text":"Xalinta dhibaatada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHel mashruuc la kaydiyay sida \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E (mashruuc), \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E (kayd oo leh maktabadiisa), \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E (qaab) ama \u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E (nuqul badbaado) ku geli BimCraft. Kuwani waa faylasha Archicad ee laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-maanta-furma\"\u003EWaxa maanta furma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha mashruuca laftoodu weli ma furmaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaabkooda lama daabacin, BimCraft weli ma akhrin. Markaad furto mid, BimCraft way sheegaa oo halkan ku tilmaamaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xarfaha ugu horreeya ee faylka.\u003C/strong\u003E Mashruucyada Archicad ee nooca 17 ka dambeeya waxay ku bilaabmaan isla calaamad gaaban, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu si hubaan ah u sheegi karaa in faylku yahay mashruuc Archicad. Fayl magac Archicad leh oo aan sidaas ku bilaabmin waxa loo malaynayaa in magaciisa la beddelay, uu dhaawacmay, ama uu ka yimid nooc hore. Calaamaddu ma kala saarto mashruuc, kayd iyo qaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta IFC si buuxda ayay u furmaan\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelka 3D, dabaqyada, aagagga sida meelaha, xogta walxaha, qaybaha sifooyinka iyo kala-saarista, iyo dhammaan qalabka BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta DWG way furmaan\u003C/strong\u003E muuqaalka 2D, iyada oo leh lakabyadeeda iyo qaabeyntooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E. Si aad u tafatirto, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu tafatir CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma keen mashruuca oo dhan hal zip ah, iyada oo leh muuqaalkeeda, qaabeyntooda iyo kooxaha sifooyinka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EFur bakaylka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-ifc-moodeelka\"\u003EDhoofi IFC (moodeelka)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur mashruuca Archicad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka &gt; U kaydi sida\u003C/strong\u003E, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E nooca faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro turjumaan IFC (Archicad wuxuu ugu yeeraa dejin dhoofin IFC oo isku mid ah). Mid \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC4 Reference View\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ku habboon BimCraft. IFC4X3 sidoo kale way furmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa la dhoofinayo: mashruuca oo dhan, ama kaliya walxaha ku muuqda dabaqyada aad eegayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydi, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro fayl\u003C/span\u003E BimCraft oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi dejinta turjumaanka ka hor dhoofinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagagga\u003C/strong\u003E: dhoofi, si qolalku ugu yimaaddaan sida meelo. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E BimCraft si aad u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka iyo kala-saarista\u003C/strong\u003E: dhoofi, si ay ugu muuqdaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E oo loo isticmaali karo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadarta qadarka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E. BimCraft wuxuu furaa oo keliya \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-dwg-naqshadaha\"\u003EDhoofi DWG (naqshadaha)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qorshaha, qaybta ama qaabeynta aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka &gt; U kaydi sida\u003C/strong\u003E, oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E nooca faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro turjumaan DXF-DWG, oo kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyaha oo dhan, kaydi qaabeynta Buugga Qaabeynta, ama daabac DWG ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E BimCraft. Naqshadaha ay dhoofintu xidhiidhisay way ku furmaan marka ay isla galka ku jiraan; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003ENaqshadaha iyo sawirrada xidhiidhka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xalinta-dhibaatada\"\u003EXalinta dhibaatada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… waa mashruuc Archicad: xarfihiisa ugu horreeya ayaa sidaas sheegaya.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofi IFC ama DWG sida kor ku qoran, oo fur faylkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… magac Archicad leh ayuu, laakiin sidaas uma bilaabmo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg meesha uu ka yimid: wuxuu noqon karaa nooc kale oo fayl magac cusub ku jira (isku day inaad ku furto kordhinta dhabta ah), nuqul aan dhammaan, ama mashruuc ka hor nooca 17. Haddii ay suurtogal tahay, ku fur Archicad, kadibna dhoofi IFC ama DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeelka wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan qolal lahayn.\u003C/strong\u003E Aagagga lama dhoofin. Dooro dejinta turjumaanka IFC oo mar kale dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaasha lama gooyo.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu sidaas ku sheegaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama muujin\u003C/strong\u003E panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E. Mar kale dhoofi; haddii ay sii jirto, fur moodeelka barnaamijka uu sameeyay oo hubi furayaasha halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka DWG wuu kala duwan yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofintu waxa laga yaabaa inay haysato xafladaha BimCraft ma haysto; BimCraft qoraalka wuxuu ku sawiraa xarfo fudud (sans-serif).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EFaylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC kor\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft ka akhriyo qaab kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hel mashruuc la kaydiyay sida .pln (mashruuc), .pla (kayd oo leh maktabadiisa), .tpl (qaab) ama .bpn (nuqul badbaado) ku geli BimCraft. Kuwani waa faylasha Archicad ee laftiisa. Waxa maanta furma Faylasha mashruuca laftoodu weli ma furmaan. Qaabkooda lama daabacin, BimCraft weli ma akhrin. Markaad furto mid, BimCraft way sheegaa oo halkan ku tilmaamaa. BimCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xarfaha ugu horreeya ee faylka. Mashruucyada Archicad ee nooca 17 ka dambeeya waxay ku bilaabmaan isla calaamad gaaban, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu si hubaan ah u sheegi karaa in faylku yahay mashruuc Archicad. Fayl magac Archicad leh oo aan sidaas ku bilaabmin waxa loo malaynayaa in magaciisa la beddelay, uu dhaawacmay, ama uu ka yimid nooc hore. Calaamaddu ma kala saarto mashruuc, kayd iyo qaab. Dhoofinta IFC si buuxda ayay u furmaan: moodeelka 3D, dabaqyada, aagagga sida meelaha, xogta walxaha, qaybaha sifooyinka iyo kala-saarista, iyo dhammaan qalabka BimCraft. Dhoofinta DWG way furmaan muuqaalka 2D, iyada oo leh lakabyadeeda iyo qaabeyntooda, iyo 3D. Si aad u tafatirto, isticmaal Ku tafatir CadCraft. Ama keen mashruuca oo dhan hal zip ah, iyada oo leh muuqaalkeeda, qaabeyntooda iyo kooxaha sifooyinka: eeg Fur bakaylka mashruuca. Dhoofi IFC (moodeelka) Fur mashruuca Archicad. Dooro Faylka \u003E U kaydi sida, oo dooro IFC nooca faylka. Dooro turjumaan IFC (Archicad wuxuu ugu yeeraa dejin dhoofin IFC oo isku mid ah). Mid IFC4 Reference View ama IFC2X3 Coordination View 2.0 ayaa ku habboon BimCraft. IFC4X3 sidoo kale way furmaa. Dooro waxa la dhoofinayo: mashruuca oo dhan, ama kaliya walxaha ku muuqda dabaqyada aad eegayso. Kaydi, kadibna riix Dooro fayl BimCraft oo dooro faylka .ifc. Hubi dejinta turjumaanka ka hor dhoofinta: Aagagga: dhoofi, si qolalku ugu yimaaddaan sida meelo. Riix Meelaha BimCraft si aad u aragto. Sifooyinka iyo kala-saarista: dhoofi, si ay ugu muuqdaan Sifooyinka oo loo isticmaali karo Raadi, Midab iyo Wadarta qadarka. .ifc caadi ah, ma aha .ifczip ama .ifcxml. BimCraft wuxuu furaa oo keliya .ifc caadi ah. Dhoofi DWG (naqshadaha) Fur qorshaha, qaybta ama qaabeynta aad rabto. Dooro Faylka \u003E U kaydi sida, oo dooro DWG nooca faylka. Dooro turjumaan DXF-DWG, oo kaydi. Xaashiyaha oo dhan, kaydi qaabeynta Buugga Qaabeynta, ama daabac DWG ahaan. Fur .dwg BimCraft. Naqshadaha ay dhoofintu xidhiidhisay way ku furmaan marka ay isla galka ku jiraan; eeg Naqshadaha iyo sawirrada xidhiidhka. Xalinta dhibaatada \"… waa mashruuc Archicad: xarfihiisa ugu horreeya ayaa sidaas sheegaya.\" Dhoofi IFC ama DWG sida kor ku qoran, oo fur faylkaas. \"… magac Archicad leh ayuu, laakiin sidaas uma bilaabmo.\" Eeg meesha uu ka yimid: wuxuu noqon karaa nooc kale oo fayl magac cusub ku jira (isku day inaad ku furto kordhinta dhabta ah), nuqul aan dhammaan, ama mashruuc ka hor nooca 17. Haddii ay suurtogal tahay, ku fur Archicad, kadibna dhoofi IFC ama DWG. Moodeelka wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan qolal lahayn. Aagagga lama dhoofin. Dooro dejinta turjumaanka IFC oo mar kale dhoofi. Furayaasha lama gooyo. BimCraft wuxuu sidaas ku sheegaa hoosta Weli lama muujin panelka Faylka. Mar kale dhoofi; haddii ay sii jirto, fur moodeelka barnaamijka uu sameeyay oo hubi furayaasha halkaas. Qoraalka DWG wuu kala duwan yahay. Dhoofintu waxa laga yaabaa inay haysato xafladaha BimCraft ma haysto; BimCraft qoraalka wuxuu ku sawiraa xarfo fudud (sans-serif). Eeg sidoo kale Faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC kor iyo Waxa BimCraft ka akhriyo qaab kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-project-bundle","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur bundle-ka mashruuca","summary":"Bundle-ka mashruuca waa zip keliya oo leh moodeel, aragtidiisa, habaynteeda iyo kooxaha sifooyinka. Furo, tus aragti oo leh dabaqeeda iyo lakabyadeeda, fur habayn, oo eeg sifooyinka kooxaha mashruuca.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["bundle","bundle-ka mashruuca","ccbundle","zip","aragtiyo","khariidadda aragtiyada","habayn","buugga habaynta","isku-dhafka lakabyada","kooxaha sifooyinka","heerarka","pln","qaab"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-bundle","text":"Samee bundle","level":2},{"id":"fur-bundle","text":"Fur bundle","level":2},{"id":"muuji-aragti","text":"Muuji aragti","level":2},{"id":"fur-habayn","text":"Fur habayn","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sifooyinka-kooxaha-mashruuca","text":"Eeg sifooyinka kooxaha mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-iyo-qoraallada","text":"Heerarka iyo qoraallada","level":2},{"id":"xallinta-dhibaatooyinka","text":"Xallinta dhibaatooyinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003Ebundle-ka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E) oo ku shaqee mashruuca sida loo habeeyay: aragtidiisa, habaynteeda iyo kooxaha sifooyinka, moodeelka korkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBundle-ku wuxuu hayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emoodeelka sida IFC,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehabaynta sida PDF iyo DWG,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eliis wax IFC ka tagaa: aragtiyada (mid kasta dabaqiisa, isku-dhafka lakabyadiisa iyo miisaankiisa), habaynta iyo sawirrada lagu dhigay, qeexitaanka sifooyinka kooxahooda, sifeynta, iyo heerarka sida lakabyada, set-yada qalinka, noocyada khadka, buuxinta, dusha iyo isku-darka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBundle-yada waxaa qoraya script open-source ah oo ku shaqeeya Archicad-ka, oo liisaska ka waydiiya Archicad laftiisa. BimCraft ma akhristo faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E si toos ah; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EFur faylasha mashruuca .pln iyo .pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-bundle\"\u003ESamee bundle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScript-ku waa horumarin tijaabo ah: lama isticmaalin nooc kasta oo Archicad ah weli. Ka hel \u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle\u003C/a\u003E. Waxaad u baahan tahay Archicad 24 ama ka dambeeya iyo Python 3.8 ama ka dambeeya; wax kale oo la rakibo ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu kaydi \u003Ccode\u003Earchicad_bundle.py\u003C/code\u003E gal, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EC:\\cc-bundle\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArchicad-ka, fur mashruuca oo samee set daabacaad oo magaciisu yahay saxda \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft bundle\u003C/strong\u003E: aragtida 3D sida IFC, habayn kasta sida PDF, habayn kasta mar kale sida DWG, lagu daabaco faylal diskka ku jira gal fidsan oo keli ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMashruuca oo furan, orod \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --probe --out .\u003C/code\u003E hal mar. Wuxuu akhrisaa oo keliya, wuxuuna qorayaa \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOrod \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --out . --translator &quot;IFC4 Reference View&quot;\u003C/code\u003E (ku isticmaal turjumaanka IFC aad dooratay). Archicad wuu daabacaa setka, script-ku wuxuu qorayaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;project&gt;.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii daabacaadda script-ka fashilanto, daabac setka gacanta oo orod \u003Ccode\u003Epython archicad_bundle.py --out . --no-publish --files &lt;folder&gt;\\*.ifc &lt;folder&gt;\\*.pdf &lt;folder&gt;\\*.dwg\u003C/code\u003E. README-ga kaydka wuxuu leeyahay dhammaan xulashooyinka. Haddii wax soo gala ma soo dhaafaan, ka fur dhibaato halkaas oo ku lifaaqdo \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-bundle\"\u003EFur bundle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku tuur \u003Ccode\u003E.ccbundle.zip\u003C/code\u003E BimCraft. Gal aad ku furtay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E gudihiisa, bundle-yada waxaa lagu liisanayaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBundle-yada mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E; riix magaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeelka wuxuu u furmaa sida IFC kasta, qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EBundle-ka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ka soo muuqata bidix, hoosta xaqiiqooyinka faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax lagu soo rarin maayo: bundle-ka waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, mid mid, sidaas darteed moodel weyn lama koobiyeeyo laba jeer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-aragti\"\u003EMuuji aragti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EAragtiyada\u003C/strong\u003E, aragtiyada waxaa lagu kooxeeyay galalka ay mashruucu lahaa. Riix magaca aragti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshe dabaq\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa dabaqiisa oo keliya, laga eego sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhafka lakabyadeeda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qariyaa unsuriyada lakabyada ay isku-dhafkaasi qariyo. Xariga xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa inta unsur ee qarisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaankeeda\u003C/strong\u003E waa la muujiyaa magaca ku xiga iyo xariga xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAragta 3D\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa dabaq kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad mar kale wax walba u muujiso, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E oo calaamadi dabaq kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu lakabyada ka helaa diiwaanka lakabyada ee faylka IFC. Haddii IFC-ga aan lagu dhoofin, isku-dhafka lakabyadu waxba ma qariyo, xariga xaaladduna wuxuu sheegaa 0 unsur la qariyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-habayn\"\u003EFur habayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EHabaynta\u003C/strong\u003E, habayn kasta wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, magaceeda, cabbirka warqadda iyo aragtida lagu dhigay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa PDF-ka habaynta ee bundle-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa sawirka habaynta ee aragta 2D. Riix aragti kasta si aad ugu soo noqoto moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu fur …\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu faylka habaynta u gudbiyaa app-ka shaqeeya, tab cusub: PDF wuxuu u gudbaa MarkupCraft, DWG wuxuu u gudbaa CadCraft. Wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya marka app-kaas uu furan yahay meel ku xigta BimCraft. Faylka waxaa laga akhriyaa bundle-ka markii tabka la soo rarayo, wax lagu soo rarin maayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabayn aan labadaba lahayn wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka bundle-ka kuma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sifooyinka-kooxaha-mashruuca\"\u003EEeg sifooyinka kooxaha mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro unsur. \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha sifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa sifooyinkiisa hoosta kooxaha uu mashruucu qeexay, oo lagu isku xidhay hab-sifada iyo magaca uu qeexidda siiyo IFC, ama haddii kale magaciisa. Kuwa kale waxay ku sii jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sida caadiga ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EQeexitaanka sifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liisanayaa qeexitaan kasta oo leh kooxdiisa, noociisa iyo magaca IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-iyo-qoraallada\"\u003EHeerarka iyo qoraallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa lakabyada, isku-dhafka lakabyada, set-yada qalinka, noocyada khadka, buuxinta, dusha, isku-darka iyo alaabta ku jirta bundle-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraallada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liisanayaa waxa script-ku ka heli waayay nooca Archicad-kaas, goob kasta oo BimCraft akhrin waayay, iyo fayl kasta oo bundle-ku magacaabo laakiin aanu haynin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xallinta-dhibaatooyinka\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… waa zip laakiin ma aha bundle mashruuc.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Zip-ka ma leh \u003Ccode\u003Emanifest.json\u003C/code\u003E. Fur zip-ka oo fur \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… waa bundle mashruuc oo ka cusub kan BimCraft akhrin karo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Cusbooneysii BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… ma hayo moodeelka uu manifest-ku magacaabo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Zip-ka waa la gooyay ama waa la wax ka beddelay. Samee bundle-ka mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAragti wuxuu muujinayaa dabaq kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Dabaqiisa ma ku jiro IFC-ga moodeelka (xariga xaaladdu wuu sheegaa). Hubi in dhoofinta IFC ay dabaqaas ku jirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/two-bim-programs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/two-bim-programs\"\u003EShaqaynta laba barnaamij BIM dhexdooda\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/file-formats\"\u003EBimCraft wuxuu ka akhriyo qaab kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Fur bundle-ka mashruuca (.ccbundle.zip) oo ku shaqee mashruuca sida loo habeeyay: aragtidiisa, habaynteeda iyo kooxaha sifooyinka, moodeelka korkiisa. Bundle-ku wuxuu hayaa: moodeelka sida IFC, habaynta sida PDF iyo DWG, liis wax IFC ka tagaa: aragtiyada (mid kasta dabaqiisa, isku-dhafka lakabyadiisa iyo miisaankiisa), habaynta iyo sawirrada lagu dhigay, qeexitaanka sifooyinka kooxahooda, sifeynta, iyo heerarka sida lakabyada, set-yada qalinka, noocyada khadka, buuxinta, dusha iyo isku-darka. Bundle-yada waxaa qoraya script open-source ah oo ku shaqeeya Archicad-ka, oo liisaska ka waydiiya Archicad laftiisa. BimCraft ma akhristo faylasha .pln ama .tpl si toos ah; eeg Fur faylasha mashruuca .pln iyo .pla. Samee bundle Script-ku waa horumarin tijaabo ah: lama isticmaalin nooc kasta oo Archicad ah weli. Ka hel github.com/getcadcraft/bim-project-bundle. Waxaad u baahan tahay Archicad 24 ama ka dambeeya iyo Python 3.8 ama ka dambeeya; wax kale oo la rakibo ma jiro. Ku kaydi archicad_bundle.py gal, tusaale ahaan C:\\cc-bundle. Archicad-ka, fur mashruuca oo samee set daabacaad oo magaciisu yahay saxda CadCraft bundle: aragtida 3D sida IFC, habayn kasta sida PDF, habayn kasta mar kale sida DWG, lagu daabaco faylal diskka ku jira gal fidsan oo keli ah. Mashruuca oo furan, orod python archicad_bundle.py --probe --out . hal mar. Wuxuu akhrisaa oo keliya, wuxuuna qorayaa probe.json. Orod python archicad_bundle.py --out . --translator \"IFC4 Reference View\" (ku isticmaal turjumaanka IFC aad dooratay). Archicad wuu daabacaa setka, script-ku wuxuu qorayaa \u003Cproject\u003E.ccbundle.zip. Haddii daabacaadda script-ka fashilanto, daabac setka gacanta oo orod python archicad_bundle.py --out . --no-publish --files \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.ifc \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.pdf \u003Cfolder\u003E\\*.dwg. README-ga kaydka wuxuu leeyahay dhammaan xulashooyinka. Haddii wax soo gala ma soo dhaafaan, ka fur dhibaato halkaas oo ku lifaaqdo probe.json. Fur bundle Riix Choose a file, ama ku tuur .ccbundle.zip BimCraft. Gal aad ku furtay Open a folder gudihiisa, bundle-yada waxaa lagu liisanayaa hoosta Bundle-yada mashruuca; riix magaciisa. Moodeelka wuxuu u furmaa sida IFC kasta, qaybta Bundle-ka mashruuca ayaa ka soo muuqata bidix, hoosta xaqiiqooyinka faylka. Wax lagu soo rarin maayo: bundle-ka waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, mid mid, sidaas darteed moodel weyn lama koobiyeeyo laba jeer. Muuji aragti Hoosta Aragtiyada, aragtiyada waxaa lagu kooxeeyay galalka ay mashruucu lahaa. Riix magaca aragti: Qorshe dabaq wuxuu muujinayaa dabaqiisa oo keliya, laga eego sare. Isku-dhafka lakabyadeeda wuxuu qariyaa unsuriyada lakabyada ay isku-dhafkaasi qariyo. Xariga xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa inta unsur ee qarisay. Miisaankeeda waa la muujiyaa magaca ku xiga iyo xariga xaaladda. Aragta 3D wuxuu muujinayaa dabaq kasta. Si aad mar kale wax walba u muujiso, isticmaal Show all gudaha Show oo calaamadi dabaq kasta. BimCraft wuxuu lakabyada ka helaa diiwaanka lakabyada ee faylka IFC. Haddii IFC-ga aan lagu dhoofin, isku-dhafka lakabyadu waxba ma qariyo, xariga xaaladduna wuxuu sheegaa 0 unsur la qariyay. Fur habayn Hoosta Habaynta, habayn kasta wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, magaceeda, cabbirka warqadda iyo aragtida lagu dhigay. PDF wuxuu kaydiyaa PDF-ka habaynta ee bundle-ka. DWG wuxuu furaa sawirka habaynta ee aragta 2D. Riix aragti kasta si aad ugu soo noqoto moodeelka. Ku fur … wuxuu faylka habaynta u gudbiyaa app-ka shaqeeya, tab cusub: PDF wuxuu u gudbaa MarkupCraft, DWG wuxuu u gudbaa CadCraft. Wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya marka app-kaas uu furan yahay meel ku xigta BimCraft. Faylka waxaa laga akhriyaa bundle-ka markii tabka la soo rarayo, wax lagu soo rarin maayo. Habayn aan labadaba lahayn wuxuu leeyahay Faylka bundle-ka kuma jiro. Eeg sifooyinka kooxaha mashruuca Dooro unsur. Kooxaha sifooyinka wuxuu muujinayaa sifooyinkiisa hoosta kooxaha uu mashruucu qeexay, oo lagu isku xidhay hab-sifada iyo magaca uu qeexidda siiyo IFC, ama haddii kale magaciisa. Kuwa kale waxay ku sii jiraan Properties sida caadiga ah. Qeexitaanka sifooyinka wuxuu liisanayaa qeexitaan kasta oo leh kooxdiisa, noociisa iyo magaca IFC. Heerarka iyo qoraallada Heerarka wuxuu tiriyaa lakabyada, isku-dhafka lakabyada, set-yada qalinka, noocyada khadka, buuxinta, dusha, isku-darka iyo alaabta ku jirta bundle-ka. Qoraallada wuxuu liisanayaa waxa script-ku ka heli waayay nooca Archicad-kaas, goob kasta oo BimCraft akhrin waayay, iyo fayl kasta oo bundle-ku magacaabo laakiin aanu haynin. Xallinta dhibaatooyinka \"… waa zip laakiin ma aha bundle mashruuc.\" Zip-ka ma leh manifest.json. Fur zip-ka oo fur .ifc ku jirta. \"… waa bundle mashruuc oo ka cusub kan BimCraft akhrin karo.\" Cusbooneysii BimCraft. \"… ma hayo moodeelka uu manifest-ku magacaabo.\" Zip-ka waa la gooyay ama waa la wax ka beddelay. Samee bundle-ka mar kale. Aragti wuxuu muujinayaa dabaq kasta. Dabaqiisa ma ku jiro IFC-ga moodeelka (xariga xaaladdu wuu sheegaa). Hubi in dhoofinta IFC ay dabaqaas ku jirtay. Eeg sidoo kale Shaqaynta laba barnaamij BIM dhexdooda iyo BimCraft wuxuu ka akhriyo qaab kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"merge-models","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isku dar wax-ka-beddelka laba qof oo moodel hal ah","summary":"Ka dhig git, Fossil ama Mercurial inay isku daraan laba nuqul oo wax laga beddelay isla IFC moodel ah shay shay, si laba qof ay isla dhismo ugu shaqeeyaan oo ay shuqulkooda isku xidhaan.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["isku dar","git","fossil","mercurial","maamulka nooca","isku-dhac","saddex-geesood","cadaymaha cadaan","gitattributes","ifc","globalid","koox","laba nuqul","laamo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"xeerarka","text":"Xeerarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaba qof ayaa qaadaa isla dhismaha nuqul: mid wuxuu sameeyaa bari, mid kalena galbeed; kadibna nuqulladu waa inay noqdaan mid. Haddii ay taabteen shay kala duwan, barnaamij ayaa sameyn kara halkii qof.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi, albaab, heer, qol iyo koox sifooyin ah oo kasta oo fayl IFC ah waxay leedahay GlobalId aan weligeed beddelmin. Isku-darku wuxuu raadiyaa shayga id-kaas, ma aha lambarka uu faylku siiyo (\u003Ccode\u003E#123\u003C/code\u003E), sababtoo ah lambaradu way beddelmaan marka barnaamij keydiyo. Qaybaha ku xiran shay oo aan lahayn id gaar ah (goobaha, qaabka, unugyada) waxay isbarbar dhigmaan waxa ay ku jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba nuqulba waa inay isku mid ahaadaan nooca IFC (2x3, 4 ama 4.3). Isku-darku wuxuu ilaaliyaa faylkaaga sida uu yahay, dalabkiisa iyo lambarradiisa, oo wuxuu ku daraa waxa cusub, sidaas darteed git diff-ka isku-darka wuxuu muujinayaa waxa isku-darku beddelay oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGit wuxuu u baahan yahay laba xariiq hal mar mid kasta repository:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E# .gitattributes\n*.ifc merge=cadcraft\n\n# hal mar, kombiyuutar kasta\ngit config merge.cadcraft.driver &quot;node /path/to/tools/cli/merge.mjs %O %A %B&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGit la&#039;aan, orod \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft merge &lt;base&gt; &lt;ours&gt; &lt;theirs&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. Fossil iyo Mercurial waxay qaataan saddexdaas fayl isla dejinta qalabka isku-darka ee ka tirsan. Waxba lama soo dirin; dhammaantood waxay ku shaqeeyaan kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xeerarka\"\u003EXeerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESifo laga beddelay hal dhinac oo keliya ayaa la qaataa. Isla beddelka labada dhinac waa la qaataa hal mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESifo labo siyaabood loo beddelay (heer isku magac loo beddelay labo siyaabood) waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eisku-dhac\u003C/strong\u003E: dhinacaaga ayaa sii joogaa, warbixintuna waxay liisataa labadaba. Fur natiijada oo ka saxo gacanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiis waxyaabo (darbiyada heer, sifooyinka set) waxay isku daraan sida set: waxa labada dhinac ku daray waa la hayaa, waxa labada dhinac ka saaray waa la saaraa. Laba qof oo mid kastaa darbi ku daray heer isku mid ah isku-dhac ma leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay lagu daray dhinac kasta waa la hayaa, qaabkeeda iyo sifooyinkeeda. Laga saaray hal dhinac oo kan kale aan la taabanin: waa la saaraa. Laga saaray hal dhinac oo kan kale la beddelay: waa la saaraa, warbixinna waa lagu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaqtiga iyo magaca qofka ee faylka, iyo taariikhda milkiilaha shay kasta, way sii joogaan kuwaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeometry waa la isku daraa oo dhan: qaabka darbi wuxuu ka imanayaa mid ka mid ah dhinacyada, weligeed looma isku qasin dhibcaha. Faylalka IFC ee la dhegeeyey iyo IFCX looma isku daro. Kadib isku-dar, fur natiijada BimCraft oo eeg panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E ka hor intaadan keydin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Laba qof ayaa qaadaa isla dhismaha nuqul: mid wuxuu sameeyaa bari, mid kalena galbeed; kadibna nuqulladu waa inay noqdaan mid. Haddii ay taabteen shay kala duwan, barnaamij ayaa sameyn kara halkii qof. Waxa shaqeeya Darbi, albaab, heer, qol iyo koox sifooyin ah oo kasta oo fayl IFC ah waxay leedahay GlobalId aan weligeed beddelmin. Isku-darku wuxuu raadiyaa shayga id-kaas, ma aha lambarka uu faylku siiyo (#123), sababtoo ah lambaradu way beddelmaan marka barnaamij keydiyo. Qaybaha ku xiran shay oo aan lahayn id gaar ah (goobaha, qaabka, unugyada) waxay isbarbar dhigmaan waxa ay ku jiraan. Laba nuqulba waa inay isku mid ahaadaan nooca IFC (2x3, 4 ama 4.3). Isku-darku wuxuu ilaaliyaa faylkaaga sida uu yahay, dalabkiisa iyo lambarradiisa, oo wuxuu ku daraa waxa cusub, sidaas darteed git diff-ka isku-darka wuxuu muujinayaa waxa isku-darku beddelay oo keliya. Dejinta Git wuxuu u baahan yahay laba xariiq hal mar mid kasta repository: # .gitattributes *.ifc merge=cadcraft # hal mar, kombiyuutar kasta git config merge.cadcraft.driver \"node /path/to/tools/cli/merge.mjs %O %A %B\" Git la'aan, orod cadcraft merge \u003Cbase\u003E \u003Cours\u003E \u003Ctheirs\u003E. Fossil iyo Mercurial waxay qaataan saddexdaas fayl isla dejinta qalabka isku-darka ee ka tirsan. Waxba lama soo dirin; dhammaantood waxay ku shaqeeyaan kombiyuutarkaaga. Xeerarka Sifo laga beddelay hal dhinac oo keliya ayaa la qaataa. Isla beddelka labada dhinac waa la qaataa hal mar. Sifo labo siyaabood loo beddelay (heer isku magac loo beddelay labo siyaabood) waa isku-dhac: dhinacaaga ayaa sii joogaa, warbixintuna waxay liisataa labadaba. Fur natiijada oo ka saxo gacanta. Liis waxyaabo (darbiyada heer, sifooyinka set) waxay isku daraan sida set: waxa labada dhinac ku daray waa la hayaa, waxa labada dhinac ka saaray waa la saaraa. Laba qof oo mid kastaa darbi ku daray heer isku mid ah isku-dhac ma leh. Shay lagu daray dhinac kasta waa la hayaa, qaabkeeda iyo sifooyinkeeda. Laga saaray hal dhinac oo kan kale aan la taabanin: waa la saaraa. Laga saaray hal dhinac oo kan kale la beddelay: waa la saaraa, warbixinna waa lagu sheegaa. Waqtiga iyo magaca qofka ee faylka, iyo taariikhda milkiilaha shay kasta, way sii joogaan kuwaaga. Geometry waa la isku daraa oo dhan: qaabka darbi wuxuu ka imanayaa mid ka mid ah dhinacyada, weligeed looma isku qasin dhibcaha. Faylalka IFC ee la dhegeeyey iyo IFCX looma isku daro. Kadib isku-dar, fur natiijada BimCraft oo eeg panelka Dhibaatooyin ka hor intaadan keydin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"permit-package","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xirmada ogolaanshaha iyo dukumentiyada taageera ee maamulka","summary":"Ururi hubinta xeerka, faallooyinka dib-u-eegista ee la malaynayo, moodelka iyo liiska maamulka ee dukumentiyada taageera hal zip, oo dukumenti kasta lagu xidhay xaashi ama liis ku qanciya.","section":"tasks","order":78,"keywords":["habka ansixinta","qaabka gudbinta","sawirada loo baahan yahay","cabbirka xaashiga","qaabka faylka","nuqullada","xirmada xeerka","ogolaansho","xirmada ogolaanshaha","gudbinta qorshaha dhismaha","ansixinta qorshaha","gudbinta sharciga","dukumentiyada taageera","liis hubin","maamul","degmada","golaha","codsiga qorshaha","faallooyinka dib-u-eegista","xeerarka dhismaha ee qaranka","dukumentiyo maqan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sida-dukumenti-loo-xidhaa","text":"Sida dukumenti loo xidhaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee hal zip oo loogu talagalay gudbinta sharciga (marka liiska maamulku ka yimaado xirmada xeerka, waxaa ku jira habka ansixinta iyo qaabka gudbinta): daboolka, faallooyinka uu dib-u-eegaha u badan yahay inuu sameeyo (laga qoray hubinta, ma aha wax la male-ayo), warbixinta xeerka markii add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha uu shaqeynayo, moodelka, iyo liiska dukumentiyada taageera ee maamulkaaga ogolaanshaha uu codsado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa hagid laga sameeyay moodelka. Xirfadlaha diiwaan-gashan iyo maamulku waxay go&#039;aaminayaan waxa loo baahan yahay iyo waxa la aqbalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel furan ku jirto, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPermit package\u003C/span\u003E bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor magaca mashruuca, cinwaanka iyo codsadaha, oo liis xaashiyadaada iyo foomamkaaga, mid kasta safka kala gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupporting documents\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuthority&#039;s list\u003C/span\u003E. Liisasku waxay ka yimaadaan xirmooyinka xeerka: ku dar add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha oo calaamadi xirmada meeshaada Dejinta › Xeerarka dhismaha (xirmo waxay hayn kartaa xeerarka, habka ansixinta, qaabka gudbinta, heshiisyada sawirka iyo qoraallada caadiga ah). Liiska guud wuu shaqeeyaa iyada oo aan taas la samayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri liiska. Dukumenti kasta waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinked\u003C/span\u003E (xaashiga iyo sababta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupplied by you\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoes not apply\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMissing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaraaq aad adigu keentid (foom, dhalaalo dhulka, rasiid lacag) dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESupplied by me\u003C/span\u003E. Shay calaamadsan &quot;haddii ay khusayso&quot; oo aan khusayn, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoes not apply here\u003C/span\u003E. Si aad dukumenti xaashi ugu xidho adigu, dooro xaashiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApproval process\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubmission format\u003C/span\u003E hoosta liiska si aad u akhrido tallaabooyinka iyo waxa la gudbinayo (cabbirka xaashiyada, qaababka faylka, nuqullada). Qiimo ama muddo waxa ay soo muuqdaan kaliya marka isha xirmadu ay sheegto, iyadoo bogga iyo taariikhda la akhriyay ay sidoo kale muuqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild the permit package (zip)\u003C/span\u003E. Tallaabooyinka iyo qaabka ayaa sidoo kale ku jira daboolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-dukumenti-loo-xidhaa\"\u003ESida dukumenti loo xidhaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDukumenti waxaa lagu xidhaa xaashi leh nooca saxda ah ee muuqaalka (qorshe dabaq, muuqaal dhinac, goyn), ama xaashi leh jaantuska saxda ah (jaantuska albaabka, haddii uu jiro), ama xaashi cinwaankiisu sheegayo (xaashi uu cinwaankiisu yahay &quot;Qorshe goobta&quot;). Markii moodelka ay ku jiraan safafka laakiin ma jiro xaashi jaantuska hayo, ama goobta la sawiray laakiin ma jiro xaashi cinwaankiisu yahay qorshe goobta, shayga wuu maqnaan yahay wuxuuna sheegaa sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska maamul kasta looma xaqiijin xirfadle deegaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Mid kasta waxaa laga akhriyay ilaha uu tilmaamay, taariikhda uu muujinayo, waxaana lagu qoray erayadeenna. Shuruudaha way beddelmaan: hubi liiska maamulka ee hadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa set-ku weli ku maqan yahay, ama xaashi aan cabbirka, jihada ama miisaanka ah ee xirmadu codsato, wuxuu ka muuqdaa liiska Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro. Fiiroyinku waa talo: ma joojiyaan xirmada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDukumentiyada maqan ma joojiyaan xirmada. Waa la liistaa daboolka iyo \u003Ccode\u003E04-supporting-documents.csv\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisasku waa xog, ma aha code, gudaha xirmooyinka xeerka: Koonfur Afrika (Xeerarka Dhismaha ee Qaranka, xeerka A2), Cape Town (oo lagu daray gobolka Koonfur Afrika ee maktabadda), England (shuruudaha macluumaadka qaranka), Portland ee Oregon, xirmo tijaabo ah oo la sameeyay, iyo liis guud oo aan ahayn mid maamul kasta. Qof kasta wuu qori karaa xirmo meeshiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashooyinkaaga waxay ku kaydsan yihiin moodelka, sidaas darteed way jiraan markaad mar kale furto, tallaabo kasta waa tallaabo aad dib u celin kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/site-building-and-levels\"\u003EGoobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarkiisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Samee hal zip oo loogu talagalay gudbinta sharciga (marka liiska maamulku ka yimaado xirmada xeerka, waxaa ku jira habka ansixinta iyo qaabka gudbinta): daboolka, faallooyinka uu dib-u-eegaha u badan yahay inuu sameeyo (laga qoray hubinta, ma aha wax la male-ayo), warbixinta xeerka markii add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha uu shaqeynayo, moodelka, iyo liiska dukumentiyada taageera ee maamulkaaga ogolaanshaha uu codsado. Tani waa hagid laga sameeyay moodelka. Xirfadlaha diiwaan-gashan iyo maamulku waxay go'aaminayaan waxa loo baahan yahay iyo waxa la aqbalo. Tallaabooyinka Moodel furan ku jirto, fur Permit package bidix. Qor magaca mashruuca, cinwaanka iyo codsadaha, oo liis xaashiyadaada iyo foomamkaaga, mid kasta safka kala gaar ah. Hoosta Supporting documents, dooro Authority's list. Liisasku waxay ka yimaadaan xirmooyinka xeerka: ku dar add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha oo calaamadi xirmada meeshaada Dejinta › Xeerarka dhismaha (xirmo waxay hayn kartaa xeerarka, habka ansixinta, qaabka gudbinta, heshiisyada sawirka iyo qoraallada caadiga ah). Liiska guud wuu shaqeeyaa iyada oo aan taas la samayn. Akhri liiska. Dukumenti kasta waa Linked (xaashiga iyo sababta), Supplied by you, Does not apply ama Missing. Waraaq aad adigu keentid (foom, dhalaalo dhulka, rasiid lacag) dooro Supplied by me. Shay calaamadsan \"haddii ay khusayso\" oo aan khusayn, dooro Does not apply here. Si aad dukumenti xaashi ugu xidho adigu, dooro xaashiga. Fur Approval process iyo Submission format hoosta liiska si aad u akhrido tallaabooyinka iyo waxa la gudbinayo (cabbirka xaashiyada, qaababka faylka, nuqullada). Qiimo ama muddo waxa ay soo muuqdaan kaliya marka isha xirmadu ay sheegto, iyadoo bogga iyo taariikhda la akhriyay ay sidoo kale muuqdaan. Riix Build the permit package (zip). Tallaabooyinka iyo qaabka ayaa sidoo kale ku jira daboolka. Sida dukumenti loo xidhaa Dukumenti waxaa lagu xidhaa xaashi leh nooca saxda ah ee muuqaalka (qorshe dabaq, muuqaal dhinac, goyn), ama xaashi leh jaantuska saxda ah (jaantuska albaabka, haddii uu jiro), ama xaashi cinwaankiisu sheegayo (xaashi uu cinwaankiisu yahay \"Qorshe goobta\"). Markii moodelka ay ku jiraan safafka laakiin ma jiro xaashi jaantuska hayo, ama goobta la sawiray laakiin ma jiro xaashi cinwaankiisu yahay qorshe goobta, shayga wuu maqnaan yahay wuxuuna sheegaa sababta. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Liiska maamul kasta looma xaqiijin xirfadle deegaan. Mid kasta waxaa laga akhriyay ilaha uu tilmaamay, taariikhda uu muujinayo, waxaana lagu qoray erayadeenna. Shuruudaha way beddelmaan: hubi liiska maamulka ee hadda. Waxa set-ku weli ku maqan yahay, ama xaashi aan cabbirka, jihada ama miisaanka ah ee xirmadu codsato, wuxuu ka muuqdaa liiska Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro. Fiiroyinku waa talo: ma joojiyaan xirmada. Dukumentiyada maqan ma joojiyaan xirmada. Waa la liistaa daboolka iyo 04-supporting-documents.csv. Liisasku waa xog, ma aha code, gudaha xirmooyinka xeerka: Koonfur Afrika (Xeerarka Dhismaha ee Qaranka, xeerka A2), Cape Town (oo lagu daray gobolka Koonfur Afrika ee maktabadda), England (shuruudaha macluumaadka qaranka), Portland ee Oregon, xirmo tijaabo ah oo la sameeyay, iyo liis guud oo aan ahayn mid maamul kasta. Qof kasta wuu qori karaa xirmo meeshiisa. Doorashooyinkaaga waxay ku kaydsan yihiin moodelka, sidaas darteed way jiraan markaad mar kale furto, tallaabo kasta waa tallaabo aad dib u celin kartaa. Eeg sidoo kale Xaashiyada iyo Goobta, dhismaha ku yaal iyo heerarkiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhibaatooyin, dib-u-eegisyo iyo diiwaanka isbedelka","summary":"Diiwaan geli xaashi kasta oo aad siiso, eeg waxa isbedelay tan iyo markaas xaashi kasta iyo walax kasta, oo ilaali tilmaamaha goobta, sawirrada wax soo saarka iyo moodeelada lagu xiro dhibaatada ay ku jiraan.","section":"tasks","order":79,"keywords":["dhibaato","xaashi la siiyay","xaashi la gudbiyay","gudbin","dib-u-eegis","waxa isbedelay","tan iyo","diiwaanka isbedelka","diiwaanka xaashiyada","warqadda gudbinta","tilmaamaha goobta","sawirka wax soo saarka","moodeel la xidhiidha","tender","dhismaha","sawir"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiiwaan geli dhibaato: xaashiyada la siiyay, taariikhda, ujeedada, mid kasta dib-u-eegistiisa. Kadib weydii waxa isbedelay tan iyo dhibaatadaas. Ilaali tilmaamaha goobta iyo sawirrada wax soo saarka ee la xiriira dhibaatada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBidixda ka fur \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-eegisyo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaan geli dhibaato\u003C/strong\u003E. Dib-u-eegista waa la soo jeedinayaa (A, kadibna B; lambar sida P1 wuu kordhaa). Dooro waxa loo siinayo, kuwa loogu gaynayo, taariikhda iyo xaashiyada. Marka heerka mashruucaaga la dejiyo, ujeedadu waa raacaysaa. Marka xirmada ogolaanshaha leedahay liis dukumentiyo taageero ah, xaashiyada ku xiran liistaas waa lagu calaamadiyaa adiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag \u003Cstrong\u003ESidoo kale kaydi nuqul moodeelka sida la siiyay\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u ilaaliso moodeelka sida uu u baxay. Nuqulka waa la soo dejiyaa; magiciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo SHA-256 waxaa lagu kaydiyaa dhibaatada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaan geli dhibaatadan\u003C/strong\u003E. Xaashi isbedelay tan iyo markii ugu dambaysay la siiyay wuxuu helayaa dib-u-eegis cusub. Xaashi aan isbedelin wuxuu sii haysanayaa dib-u-eegistiisa. Sanduuqa cinwaanka xaashi kasta wuxuu muujinayaa dib-u-eegistiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u aragto waxa isbedelay, guji \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedelada tan iyo\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal dhinaca dhibaato. Xaashi kasta wuxuu akhrinayaa Isku mid ama La beddelay, iyo walxaha lagu daray, la beddelay iyo la saaray. Guji tirada si aad u doorato walxaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar diiwaan\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u ku darto jadwal goobeed, sawir wax soo saar, xirmada calaamadinta, moodeel la xidhiidha ama qoraal. Dooro dhibaatada ay ka tahay. Fayl aad dooratid waxaa lagu diiwaan geliyaa magiciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo SHA-256; faylku wuxuu sii joogaa meeshiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaanka isbedelka xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa hal safka xaashi kasta iyo hal tiir dhibaato kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo deji diiwaanka isbedelka (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa iyada oo ay ku jiraan dhibaatooyinka iyo diiwaannada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi taariikhda dhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E. MarkupCraft, TakeoffCraft iyo DetailCraft way akhriyaan oo isticmaalaan \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri taariikhda dhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaariikhda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka IFC (property set \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Issues\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruuca). Barnaamijyada kale ma aqoonsadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashi waxaa loo tiriyaa inuu isbedelay marka dejintiisa gaarka ah isbeddelo, ama walax uu muujiyo oo isbeddelo: qorshe wuxuu muujiyaa dabaqiisa, muuqaal ama goyn wuxuu muujiyaa moodeelka oo dhan, jadwal albaabbada ama daaqadaha wuxuu muujiyaa albaabbadiisa ama daaqadihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalax waxaa loo tiriyaa inay isbedeshay marka hanti, meel, cabbir ama qaab isbeddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u aragto hantida saxda ah ee isbedeshay, fur nuqulka la siiyay ee moodeelka oo isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbarbardhig nooca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibaato la saaro waxay ilaalinaysaa diiwaankeeda, laakiin dhibaatada ma tirtirayso. Tallaabo kasta waa hal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeel ka badan 60,000 walxood ma hayo diiwaan walax kasta oo dhibaatada la xiriira. Xaashiyada weli way is barbardhigaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyada lama kaydiyo PDF iyo dhibaatada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaasha dib-u-eegista lama sawirin xaashiyada BimCraft. Ku diiwaan geli dabaasha MarkupCraft dhibaatada ku xiran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Diiwaan geli dhibaato: xaashiyada la siiyay, taariikhda, ujeedada, mid kasta dib-u-eegistiisa. Kadib weydii waxa isbedelay tan iyo dhibaatadaas. Ilaali tilmaamaha goobta iyo sawirrada wax soo saarka ee la xiriira dhibaatada. Tallaabooyin Bidixda ka fur Dhibaatooyin, kadibna Dib-u-eegisyo. Dooro Diiwaan geli dhibaato. Dib-u-eegista waa la soo jeedinayaa (A, kadibna B; lambar sida P1 wuu kordhaa). Dooro waxa loo siinayo, kuwa loogu gaynayo, taariikhda iyo xaashiyada. Marka heerka mashruucaaga la dejiyo, ujeedadu waa raacaysaa. Marka xirmada ogolaanshaha leedahay liis dukumentiyo taageero ah, xaashiyada ku xiran liistaas waa lagu calaamadiyaa adiga. Ka tag Sidoo kale kaydi nuqul moodeelka sida la siiyay si aad u ilaaliso moodeelka sida uu u baxay. Nuqulka waa la soo dejiyaa; magiciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo SHA-256 waxaa lagu kaydiyaa dhibaatada. Guji Diiwaan geli dhibaatadan. Xaashi isbedelay tan iyo markii ugu dambaysay la siiyay wuxuu helayaa dib-u-eegis cusub. Xaashi aan isbedelin wuxuu sii haysanayaa dib-u-eegistiisa. Sanduuqa cinwaanka xaashi kasta wuxuu muujinayaa dib-u-eegistiisa. Si aad u aragto waxa isbedelay, guji Isbedelada tan iyo oo ku taal dhinaca dhibaato. Xaashi kasta wuxuu akhrinayaa Isku mid ama La beddelay, iyo walxaha lagu daray, la beddelay iyo la saaray. Guji tirada si aad u doorato walxaha. Guji Ku dar diiwaan si aad u ku darto jadwal goobeed, sawir wax soo saar, xirmada calaamadinta, moodeel la xidhiidha ama qoraal. Dooro dhibaatada ay ka tahay. Fayl aad dooratid waxaa lagu diiwaan geliyaa magiciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo SHA-256; faylku wuxuu sii joogaa meeshiisa. Diiwaanka isbedelka xaashiyada wuxuu muujinayaa hal safka xaashi kasta iyo hal tiir dhibaato kasta. Soo deji diiwaanka isbedelka (CSV) wuxuu kaydiyaa iyada oo ay ku jiraan dhibaatooyinka iyo diiwaannada. Kaydi taariikhda dhibaatooyinka wuxuu qoraa fayl .issues.json. MarkupCraft, TakeoffCraft iyo DetailCraft way akhriyaan oo isticmaalaan Akhri taariikhda dhibaatooyinka. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Taariikhda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka IFC (property set CadCraft_Issues ee mashruuca). Barnaamijyada kale ma aqoonsadaan. Xaashi waxaa loo tiriyaa inuu isbedelay marka dejintiisa gaarka ah isbeddelo, ama walax uu muujiyo oo isbeddelo: qorshe wuxuu muujiyaa dabaqiisa, muuqaal ama goyn wuxuu muujiyaa moodeelka oo dhan, jadwal albaabbada ama daaqadaha wuxuu muujiyaa albaabbadiisa ama daaqadihiisa. Walax waxaa loo tiriyaa inay isbedeshay marka hanti, meel, cabbir ama qaab isbeddelo. Si aad u aragto hantida saxda ah ee isbedeshay, fur nuqulka la siiyay ee moodeelka oo isticmaal Isbarbardhig nooca. Dhibaato la saaro waxay ilaalinaysaa diiwaankeeda, laakiin dhibaatada ma tirtirayso. Tallaabo kasta waa hal Undo. Moodeel ka badan 60,000 walxood ma hayo diiwaan walax kasta oo dhibaatada la xiriira. Xaashiyada weli way is barbardhigaan. Weli lama dhisin Xaashiyada lama kaydiyo PDF iyo dhibaatada. Dabaasha dib-u-eegista lama sawirin xaashiyada BimCraft. Ku diiwaan geli dabaasha MarkupCraft dhibaatada ku xiran.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"local-requirements","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shuruudaha deegaanka sida xirmooyinka xeerarka","summary":"Xirmada xeerarka waxay ka kooban karta wax ka badan xeerar: habka ansixinta, qaabka gudbinta, sawirrada la keenayo, habka sawirrada iyo qoraallada caadiga ah ee meel.","section":"tasks","order":79,"keywords":["xirmada xeerarka","habka ansixinta","qaabka gudbinta","habka sawirrada","qoraallada caadiga ah","qoraallada guud","ballaca qoraalka","miisaanka khadka","xagga waqooyi","shuruudaha deegaanka","degmada","dalka","qaabka xirmada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xirmadu-ku-hayn-karto","text":"Waxa xirmadu ku hayn karto","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-ogaato","text":"Waxa ku habboon inaad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOgow waxa goobtaadu weydiisanayso, oo ka dhig BimCraft inuu isticmaalo: tallaabooyinka lagu helo ogolaansho, waxa la keenayo iyo qaabkiisa, sida sawirrada u eg yihiin, iyo qoraallada caadiga ah ee lagu dhejiyo. Hal xirmo ayaa ku hayaa, dhinaca xeerarka dhismaha, waxaadna mar dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmo waa hage. Ogolaanshaha iyo xirfadle diiwaan-gashan ayaa go&#039;aaneeya waxa loo baahan yahay. Xirmo kasta wuxuu sheegaa sida loo isku halayn karo: \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan la hubin\u003C/strong\u003E (aan qof xaqiijin), \u003Cstrong\u003Eqabyo\u003C/strong\u003E (laga qoray bogagga la daabacay, aan weli xirfadle dib u eegin) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ela eegay\u003C/strong\u003E. Xirmo tusaale ah oo la sameeyay wuxuu meel kasta ku leeyahay MADE-UP.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar kordhinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXeerarka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXeerarka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee xirmada goobtaada. Fur: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa kale ku jira\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxa ay sidoo kale ku jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarqadda ansixinta, dooro liistadeeda: tallaabooyinka, qaabka iyo sawirrada la keenayo ayaa soo muuqda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/permit-package\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/permit-package\"\u003EXirmada ansixinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashi gudihiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraallada caadiga ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa qoraallada xirmada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada qoraalka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal cabbirrada xeerka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaataa dherarka qoraalka ee xirmada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/annotation-sizes\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/annotation-sizes\"\u003ESawir cabbirka buuxa, qoraal miisaan ku samee\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xirmadu-ku-hayn-karto\"\u003EWaxa xirmadu ku hayn karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka ansixinta:\u003C/strong\u003E tallaabooyinka isku xigxigga ah, yaa qabta mid kasta, waxa la keenayo, dukumentiyada. Lacag ama muddo kaliya ayaa soo muuqda marka ay la socoto bogga laga akhriyay iyo taariikhda la akhriyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka gudbinta:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirrada xaashiyada, jihada, qaababka faylka, nuqullada, magacyada faylka, goobaha qoraalka ee xaashiga, iyo sawirrada (miisaanka lala socdo) iyo warqadaha ay gudbinta u baahan tahay. Shay maqan waa qoraal ku jira Dhibaatooyin, weligeedna ma joojiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka sawirrada:\u003C/strong\u003E dherarka qoraalka warqadda, miisaanka khadadka, miis qalin, iyo calaamado sida barta waqooyi ama miisaan-khadka. Qaar ayaa lagu hubiyaa sida xeerar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraallada caadiga ah:\u003C/strong\u003E qoraallo sida takhasuska loo kala saaray, erayadooda xirmada, mid kasta oo leh cutubkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-ogaato\"\u003EWaxa ku habboon inaad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXirmada magaalada waxay ku dhisan tahay xirmada dalkeeda: tallaabooyinkeeda, sawirradeeda iyo qoraalladeeda ayaa mudan, kuwa dalka way joogaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta oo aan laga akhrin bog rasmi ah waxaa xirmada lagu calaamadiyaa tusaale ama aan la hubin, iyo meesha lagu muujiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXirmo u qor deegaankaaga oo ku dar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo rar faylka xeerarka\u003C/span\u003E; had iyo jeer wuxuu muuqan doonaa inuu kaaga yahay, weligeedna lama muujin doono inuu la eegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ogow waxa goobtaadu weydiisanayso, oo ka dhig BimCraft inuu isticmaalo: tallaabooyinka lagu helo ogolaansho, waxa la keenayo iyo qaabkiisa, sida sawirrada u eg yihiin, iyo qoraallada caadiga ah ee lagu dhejiyo. Hal xirmo ayaa ku hayaa, dhinaca xeerarka dhismaha, waxaadna mar dooratid. Xirmo waa hage. Ogolaanshaha iyo xirfadle diiwaan-gashan ayaa go'aaneeya waxa loo baahan yahay. Xirmo kasta wuxuu sheegaa sida loo isku halayn karo: aan la hubin (aan qof xaqiijin), qabyo (laga qoray bogagga la daabacay, aan weli xirfadle dib u eegin) ama la eegay. Xirmo tusaale ah oo la sameeyay wuxuu meel kasta ku leeyahay MADE-UP. Tallaabooyinka Ku dar kordhinta Xeerarka dhismaha oo fur Dejinta › Xeerarka dhismaha. Calaamee xirmada goobtaada. Fur: Waxa kale ku jira wuxuu liistaa waxa ay sidoo kale ku jirto. Warqadda ansixinta, dooro liistadeeda: tallaabooyinka, qaabka iyo sawirrada la keenayo ayaa soo muuqda. Eeg Xirmada ansixinta. Xaashi gudihiisa, Qoraallada caadiga ah wuxuu dhigaa qoraallada xirmada. Eeg Xaashiyada. Gudaha Cabbirrada qoraalka, Isticmaal cabbirrada xeerka wuxuu qaataa dherarka qoraalka ee xirmada. Eeg Sawir cabbirka buuxa, qoraal miisaan ku samee. Waxa xirmadu ku hayn karto Habka ansixinta: tallaabooyinka isku xigxigga ah, yaa qabta mid kasta, waxa la keenayo, dukumentiyada. Lacag ama muddo kaliya ayaa soo muuqda marka ay la socoto bogga laga akhriyay iyo taariikhda la akhriyay. Qaabka gudbinta: cabbirrada xaashiyada, jihada, qaababka faylka, nuqullada, magacyada faylka, goobaha qoraalka ee xaashiga, iyo sawirrada (miisaanka lala socdo) iyo warqadaha ay gudbinta u baahan tahay. Shay maqan waa qoraal ku jira Dhibaatooyin, weligeedna ma joojiyo. Habka sawirrada: dherarka qoraalka warqadda, miisaanka khadadka, miis qalin, iyo calaamado sida barta waqooyi ama miisaan-khadka. Qaar ayaa lagu hubiyaa sida xeerar. Qoraallada caadiga ah: qoraallo sida takhasuska loo kala saaray, erayadooda xirmada, mid kasta oo leh cutubkiisa. Waxa ku habboon inaad ogaato Xirmada magaalada waxay ku dhisan tahay xirmada dalkeeda: tallaabooyinkeeda, sawirradeeda iyo qoraalladeeda ayaa mudan, kuwa dalka way joogaan. Wax kasta oo aan laga akhrin bog rasmi ah waxaa xirmada lagu calaamadiyaa tusaale ama aan la hubin, iyo meesha lagu muujiyo. Xirmo u qor deegaankaaga oo ku dar Soo rar faylka xeerarka; had iyo jeer wuxuu muuqan doonaa inuu kaaga yahay, weligeedna lama muujin doono inuu la eegay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-project-folder","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan","summary":"Ku tilmaam BimCraft galka mashruuca si uu u arko moodel kasta, nuqullada keydka iyo xidhiidhadooda hal mar, oo sanduuqa Start here uu soo jeediyo faylka aad u badan tahay inaad furto.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["gal","galka mashruuca","galka","darawalka shabakada","server","halkan ka bilow","faylka kee","nuqullada keydka","xidhiidhyada","xrefs","galalka dhawaan la furay","jiid gal"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-sanduuqa-start-here","text":"Isticmaal sanduuqa Start here","level":2},{"id":"fur-faylasha-warbixinta","text":"Fur faylasha warbixinta","level":2},{"id":"mar-dambe-ku-fur-galka","text":"Mar dambe ku fur galka","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan, sida kii laguu siiyay shaqo, oo ka saar BimCraft: maxay yihiin moodelada, kuwee nuqullo keydka ah, maxay isku xidhan yihiin, faylasha khasaaray, iyo faylka aad u badan tahay inaad furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaliya dhowr kilobytes oo ay qaadato kaarta moodel kasta ayaa la akhriyaa, sidaas darteed galka ku yaal darawal shabakad ama gal cloud-ka la isku waafajiyey waa fiican yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003ESelect\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EUpload\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen\u003C/strong\u003E, iyadoo ku xidhan nidaamkaaga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EView files\u003C/strong\u003E markii browser-ku weydiiyo &quot;Let site view files?&quot;. Tani waxay kaliya u oggolaanaysaa tabka inuu akhriyo galka; wax lagu soo rarin maayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta xariga xaaladdu tiriyo: &quot;Galka la liisanayo: … fayl&quot;, kadibna &quot;Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo xaqiiji. Firefox ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weydiiyo inaad xaqiijiso in boggu akhrin karo faylasha galka; way kombiyuutarkaaga ku sii jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta xariga xaaladdu yidhaahdo &quot;Galka la akhrinayo: … fayl&quot;, kadibna &quot;Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EUpload\u003C/strong\u003E. Erayga kor ku xusan ha ka dhigin: waxba kama bixi Mac-kaaga, faylasha waxaa loo gudbiyaa tabka oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta xariga xaaladdu yidhaahdo &quot;Galka la akhrinayo: … fayl&quot;, kadibna &quot;Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003Ejiidi galka\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaareeyaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E ilaa bogga. Galka la jiiday wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan ruqsad weydiin lagu sameynin browser kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWarbixinta galka ayaa buuxisa dhexda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca galka, tirinta moodelada, sawirrada CAD, moodelada IFC iyo faylasha, iyo wadarta cabbirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOgaysiisyo casaan ama casaan-yar haddii faylasha qaarkood aan dhammaystirnayn ama faylal isku xidhan qaarkood ka maqan yihiin galka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart here\u003C/span\u003E: faylka BimCraft soo jeediyo inaad furto, iyo sababaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelada\u003C/strong\u003E: hal safka moodel kasta, nuqullada keydkiisa oo hoos ku kooxaysan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha la xidhay iyo kuwa tixraacan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelada IFC\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada CAD\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac la dhigay\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii galku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBidix, qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFolder\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo koobaysa; \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Midna&quot; marka nuqul kasta uu caafimaad qabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-sanduuqa-start-here\"\u003EIsticmaal sanduuqa Start here\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqu wuxuu magac u bixiyaa hal fayl oo wuxuu sababta sheegaa, tusaale ahaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Shaqada ugu dambeysay ee la kaydiyay galkan (Mar 3, 2025).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003EConsultant.rvt\u003C/em\u003E waxa lagu xidhay moodelada kale, sidaas darteed waa asal, ma aha faylka laga wax beddelayo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003ETower.rvt\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu u egyahay doorashada ugu fiican, laakiin waa khasaaray; nuqulkiisii ugu dambeeyay waa …&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Tani waa moodel dhexe: Revit-ka, ku fur adigoo isticmaalaya &quot;Create New Local&quot; oo ka shaqee nuqulka maxalliga ah.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri sababaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen its card\u003C/span\u003E si aad u akhrido kaartida faylkaas, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow it in the list\u003C/span\u003E si aad safkiisa u hesho \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi qofka ugu dambeeyay ee shaqeeyay mashruuca ka hor intaadan isku halleyn. Sanduuqu wuu sidaas sheegaa: waa hagaajin ku salaysan magacyada, taariikhaha iyo xidhiidhyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylasha-warbixinta\"\u003EFur faylasha warbixinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix magaca moodel si aad u furto kaartidiisa. Kaartidu wuxuu hubiyaa xidhiidh kasta galka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca galka sare ee kaartida (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the folder\u003C/span\u003E bidix) si aad ugu noqoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix faylka IFC kasta hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelada IFC\u003C/strong\u003E si aad 3D ugu furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix DWG ama DXF kasta hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada CAD\u003C/strong\u003E si aad 2D ugu furto. Sawirrada xidhan iyo sawirrada waxaa galka laga heli doonaa si toos ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mar-dambe-ku-fur-galka\"\u003EMar dambe ku fur galka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGalalka aad ku furtay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E ama aad jiidday waxaa bidix hoosta ku liisan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecent folders\u003C/span\u003E. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReopen\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca galka si aad mar kale u furto adigoon dooran. Markii browser-ka dib loo bilaabo, Chrome ama Edge mar kale ayay weydiin doonaan; dooro &quot;Allow on every visit&quot; si ay weydiinta u joojiyaan. Liistaasi waxay ku kaydsantahay browser-kan oo keliya, mana loo diro meel kale. Riix × si aad galka u illowdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-kani ma xasuusan karo galalka intii u dhexeysay booqashooyinka. Dooro galka mar kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E, ama jiid gudaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalka oo aad weyn doortay.\u003C/strong\u003E Ka badan 20,000 fayl: &quot;Galkan wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan 20,000 fayl. Dooro gal yar, sida mashruuc keliya.&quot; Dooro galka mashruuca, ma aha darawalka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDoorashada waalidka mashruucyo badan.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart here\u003C/span\u003E markaas wuxuu dooranayaa dhex mashruucyada. Dooro hal mashruuc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalalka Revit ee u gaarka ah oo loo arko inay la dhiibteen.\u003C/strong\u003E Galalka \u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E waa kuwo nadaafad ah oo ku liisan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac la dhigay\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha kuwo la akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel laga rajeeyo inuu 3D ka furmo kaartidiisa.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka mashruucu waa kaarti keliya. Fur dhoofinta IFC-giisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaleefannada iyo tablet-yada.\u003C/strong\u003E Browser-yo badan oo moobaylka ah ma dooran karaan galalka. Isticmaal kombiyuutar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-folder-health\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-folder-health\"\u003EHubi galka nuqullada khaldan, xidhiidhyada maqan iyo hadhaaga\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/folder-roles\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/folder-roles\"\u003EWarbixinta galka: doorarka, xaaladaha iyo xidhiidhyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan, sida kii laguu siiyay shaqo, oo ka saar BimCraft: maxay yihiin moodelada, kuwee nuqullo keydka ah, maxay isku xidhan yihiin, faylasha khasaaray, iyo faylka aad u badan tahay inaad furto. Kaliya dhowr kilobytes oo ay qaadato kaarta moodel kasta ayaa la akhriyaa, sidaas darteed galka ku yaal darawal shabakad ama gal cloud-ka la isku waafajiyey waa fiican yahay. Tallaabooyinka Riix Open a folder bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan). Dooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo riix Select (ama Upload ama Open, iyadoo ku xidhan nidaamkaaga). Riix View files markii browser-ku weydiiyo \"Let site view files?\". Tani waxay kaliya u oggolaanaysaa tabka inuu akhriyo galka; wax lagu soo rarin maayo. Sug inta xariga xaaladdu tiriyo: \"Galka la liisanayo: … fayl\", kadibna \"Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …\". Riix Open a folder bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan). Dooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo xaqiiji. Firefox ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weydiiyo inaad xaqiijiso in boggu akhrin karo faylasha galka; way kombiyuutarkaaga ku sii jiraan. Sug inta xariga xaaladdu yidhaahdo \"Galka la akhrinayo: … fayl\", kadibna \"Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …\". Riix Open a folder bidix (ama dhexda shaashadda madhan). Dooro galka mashruuca daaqadda furta oo riix Upload. Erayga kor ku xusan ha ka dhigin: waxba kama bixi Mac-kaaga, faylasha waxaa loo gudbiyaa tabka oo keliya. Sug inta xariga xaaladdu yidhaahdo \"Galka la akhrinayo: … fayl\", kadibna \"Faylasha Revit la hubinayo: … ka mid ah …\". Waxaad sidoo kale jiidi galka Finder / File Explorer / maareeyaha faylalkaaga ilaa bogga. Galka la jiiday wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan ruqsad weydiin lagu sameynin browser kasta. Waxa aad arki doontid Warbixinta galka ayaa buuxisa dhexda: Magaca galka, tirinta moodelada, sawirrada CAD, moodelada IFC iyo faylasha, iyo wadarta cabbirka. Ogaysiisyo casaan ama casaan-yar haddii faylasha qaarkood aan dhammaystirnayn ama faylal isku xidhan qaarkood ka maqan yihiin galka. Sanduuqa Start here: faylka BimCraft soo jeediyo inaad furto, iyo sababaha. Moodelada: hal safka moodel kasta, nuqullada keydkiisa oo hoos ku kooxaysan. Faylasha la xidhay iyo kuwa tixraacan, Moodelada IFC, Sawirrada CAD iyo Dhinac la dhigay, haddii galku leeyahay. Bidix, qaybta Folder ayaa soo koobaysa; Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu leeyahay \"Midna\" marka nuqul kasta uu caafimaad qabo. Isticmaal sanduuqa Start here Sanduuqu wuxuu magac u bixiyaa hal fayl oo wuxuu sababta sheegaa, tusaale ahaan: \"Shaqada ugu dambeysay ee la kaydiyay galkan (Mar 3, 2025).\" \"Consultant.rvt waxa lagu xidhay moodelada kale, sidaas darteed waa asal, ma aha faylka laga wax beddelayo.\" \"Tower.rvt wuxuu u egyahay doorashada ugu fiican, laakiin waa khasaaray; nuqulkiisii ugu dambeeyay waa …\" \"Tani waa moodel dhexe: Revit-ka, ku fur adigoo isticmaalaya \"Create New Local\" oo ka shaqee nuqulka maxalliga ah.\" Akhri sababaha. Riix Open its card si aad u akhrido kaartida faylkaas, ama Show it in the list si aad safkiisa u hesho Moodelada. Hubi qofka ugu dambeeyay ee shaqeeyay mashruuca ka hor intaadan isku halleyn. Sanduuqu wuu sidaas sheegaa: waa hagaajin ku salaysan magacyada, taariikhaha iyo xidhiidhyada. Fur faylasha warbixinta Riix magaca moodel si aad u furto kaartidiisa. Kaartidu wuxuu hubiyaa xidhiidh kasta galka. Riix Back to iyo magaca galka sare ee kaartida (ama Back to the folder bidix) si aad ugu noqoto. Riix faylka IFC kasta hoos Moodelada IFC si aad 3D ugu furto. Riix DWG ama DXF kasta hoos Sawirrada CAD si aad 2D ugu furto. Sawirrada xidhan iyo sawirrada waxaa galka laga heli doonaa si toos ah. Mar dambe ku fur galka Galalka aad ku furtay Open a folder ama aad jiidday waxaa bidix hoosta ku liisan Recent folders. Riix Reopen iyo magaca galka si aad mar kale u furto adigoon dooran. Markii browser-ka dib loo bilaabo, Chrome ama Edge mar kale ayay weydiin doonaan; dooro \"Allow on every visit\" si ay weydiinta u joojiyaan. Liistaasi waxay ku kaydsantahay browser-kan oo keliya, mana loo diro meel kale. Riix × si aad galka u illowdo. Browser-kani ma xasuusan karo galalka intii u dhexeysay booqashooyinka. Dooro galka mar kale Open a folder, ama jiid gudaha. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Galka oo aad weyn doortay. Ka badan 20,000 fayl: \"Galkan wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan 20,000 fayl. Dooro gal yar, sida mashruuc keliya.\" Dooro galka mashruuca, ma aha darawalka oo dhan. Doorashada waalidka mashruucyo badan. Sanduuqa Start here markaas wuxuu dooranayaa dhex mashruucyada. Dooro hal mashruuc. Galalka Revit ee u gaarka ah oo loo arko inay la dhiibteen. Galalka *_backup, *_log iyo Revit_temp waa kuwo nadaafad ah oo ku liisan Dhinac la dhigay, ma aha kuwo la akhriyo. Moodel laga rajeeyo inuu 3D ka furmo kaartidiisa. Faylka mashruucu waa kaarti keliya. Fur dhoofinta IFC-giisa. Taleefannada iyo tablet-yada. Browser-yo badan oo moobaylka ah ma dooran karaan galalka. Isticmaal kombiyuutar. Eeg Hubi galka nuqullada khaldan, xidhiidhyada maqan iyo hadhaaga iyo Warbixinta galka: doorarka, xaaladaha iyo xidhiidhyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"project-stages","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Marxaladaha mashruuca, laga bilaabo baaqa ilaa tilmaamaha goobta","summary":"Ka bilow baaqa leh cabbirrada bartilmaameedka oo arag waa la gaadhay ama waa ka yar intaad naqshadeyso, ka barbardhig ikhtiyaarada fikradda baaqa, ku xidh shuruudaha iyo faahfaahinta noocyadooda, eeg naqshadaha warshadda oo diiwaan geli tilmaamaha goobta ee walxaha.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["baaqa","jadwalka qolalka","bartilmaameed","waa la gaadhay","ka yar","qolalka","doorashooyin","ikhtiyaarada qaabka dhismaha","qaabka dhismaha","miisaaniyad","shuruud","specification","spec","faahfaahin","faahfaahinta dhismaha","nooc","naqshadda warshadda","eegis","ansixi","dib-u-habayn","tilmaamaha goobta","sabab","goobta","marxalad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarxaladaha mashruuca oo dhan ku shaqee hal panel: qor baaqa macmiilka qolal leh cabbirro bartilmaameed, ka barbardhig ikhtiyaarada fikradda baaqa, ku hay shuruudaha iyo faahfaahinta dhismaha noocyadii ay ku jiraan, eeg naqshadaha warshadda markay ka soo noqdaan shaqaalaha, oo diiwaan geli tilmaamaha goobta ee walxaha ay beddelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka bidix ka fur \u003Cstrong\u003EMarxalada mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EBaaqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dheji qolalka, mid kasta khad keliya: \u003Ccode\u003ELiving; 1; 30\u003C/code\u003E waxa uu macnaynayaa hal qol oo 30 m². Tirada waa laga reebi karaa. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E. Buuxi macmiilka, goobta, miisaaniyadda, dulqaadka iyo barnaamijka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi baaqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshad darbiyada. Qol kasta oo darbiyadu sameeyaan oo leh magaca qolka baaqa (lambarka ka dambeeya, sida &quot;Qolka hurdada 2&quot;, waa la iska indho tiray) waa la tiriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EJadwalka qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWaa la gaadhay\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa yar\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa badan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELama naqshadin\u003C/strong\u003E, oo farqiga m² ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad mashruuc cusub ugu bilowdo habkan, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow mashruuc cusub baaqa ka\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay furtaa moodeel cusub, oo laga abuuro mid ka mid ah qaababka aad kaydisay haddii aad dooratid, waxayna baaqa geliyaa tallaabada koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDoorashooyinta baaqa ka soo horjeeda\u003C/strong\u003E. Dhammaan doorashooyinta qaabka dhismaha ee moodeelka ku jira waxa lagu rasmeeyaa hal miisaan, iyada oo ay ku jiraan balaadhinta guud, waxa baaqu codsanayo, iyo inta qol ee baaqa ka mid ah ee ku habboon. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu rari baaqa halkan\u003C/strong\u003E qolalka waxa uu geliyaa dabaqyada doorashada, kan ugu hooseeya marka hore, waxana uu sheegayaa waxa aan ku habboonayn. Qiimuhu waxa uu ka imanayaa oo keliya miiska qiimaha mashruuca; haddii safka la jaadka ahi aanu jirin, waxa uu tidhi &quot;Qiime ma jiro&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada, shuruudaha iyo faahfaahinta\u003C/strong\u003E. Nooc kasta oo darbi, albaab, daaqad iyo sagxad ah wuxuu muujinayaa haddii uu leeyahay qoraal shuruudo, faahfaahinta la xidhay, iyo meesha shuruudaha, jadwalada iyo xaashiyaha is khilaafayaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh faahfaahin\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa fayl DetailCraft ama CadCraft, cinwaan, ama xaashi ka mid ah moodeelkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha warshadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro walxaha uu naqshadda warshadda daboolayo ee moodeelka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EHel\u003C/strong\u003E. Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EAnsixi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESida lagu xusay\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u habee\u003C/strong\u003E iyada oo magaca hubiyaha iyo qoraalkiisa ku jira. \u003Cstrong\u003EDib loo gudbiyay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa dib-u-eegista xigta ee isla diiwaanka, wuxuuna hayaa taariikhda eegista. Xaaladda waxaa sidoo kale lagu qoraa walax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ETilmaamaha goobta\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro walxaha, ku qor sababta iyo waxa ay qiimaha iyo waqtiga ka beddeli doonto, erayadaada, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EDiiwaan geli\u003C/strong\u003E. Markii dhibaato la diiwaan geliyo, \u003Cstrong\u003ESharax isbeddelada tan ka dib dhibaatada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa walxaha la beddelay ee tilmaamuhu daboolo iyo kuwa la beddelay iyada oo aan waxba lagu diiwaan gelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabo kasta waa hal \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxba lama diido: baaqa aan la gaadhin, nooc aan la waafaqin qoraalkiisa, ama naqshad dib u dhacday waa digniin ama qoraal ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQolalka baaqa waa meelo aan darbi lahayn. Waxay leeyihiin bartilmaameed, ma aha bal naqshadda la gaadhay, sidaas darteed jadwalada qolalka iyo COBie ma tiriyaan iyagu sidii qolal la naqshadeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabeynta keliya waxay qolalka ku rarta dabaqyada iyada oo loo eegayo balaadhinta. Ma naqshadayso darbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka shuruudaha waxa lagu qoraa \u003Cstrong\u003EDukumentiyada\u003C/strong\u003E moodeelka. Halkan waxa lagu barbardhigaa oo keliya cabbirrada moodeelka laftiisa: ma qoro dhibcaha heerka oo adiga kuu qoran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadaha warshadda iyo tilmaamaha goobta waa diiwaano taariikh isku mid ah oo ay ku jiraan panelka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka iyo dib-u-eegista\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed labada panel ayaa tusaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaaladda naqshadda warshadda waa sifada walax kasta (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_ShopDrawing\u003C/code\u003E), tilmaamaha goobtana waa \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteInstruction\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMidabka sifada\u003C/strong\u003E way isticmaali karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha goobta lagu xaqiijiyay (Marxaladda 7) waxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXaqiijin\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Marxaladaha mashruuca oo dhan ku shaqee hal panel: qor baaqa macmiilka qolal leh cabbirro bartilmaameed, ka barbardhig ikhtiyaarada fikradda baaqa, ku hay shuruudaha iyo faahfaahinta dhismaha noocyadii ay ku jiraan, eeg naqshadaha warshadda markay ka soo noqdaan shaqaalaha, oo diiwaan geli tilmaamaha goobta ee walxaha ay beddelaan. Tallaabooyinka Panelka bidix ka fur Marxalada mashruuca, kadibna Baaqa. Ku dheji qolalka, mid kasta khad keliya: Living; 1; 30 waxa uu macnaynayaa hal qol oo 30 m². Tirada waa laga reebi karaa. Dooro Ku dar qolalka. Buuxi macmiilka, goobta, miisaaniyadda, dulqaadka iyo barnaamijka, kadibna Kaydi baaqa. Naqshad darbiyada. Qol kasta oo darbiyadu sameeyaan oo leh magaca qolka baaqa (lambarka ka dambeeya, sida \"Qolka hurdada 2\", waa la iska indho tiray) waa la tiriyaa. Jadwalka qolalka wuxuu sheegayaa Waa la gaadhay, Ka yar, Ka badan ama Lama naqshadin, oo farqiga m² ku jira. Si aad mashruuc cusub ugu bilowdo habkan, dooro Bilow mashruuc cusub baaqa ka. Waxay furtaa moodeel cusub, oo laga abuuro mid ka mid ah qaababka aad kaydisay haddii aad dooratid, waxayna baaqa geliyaa tallaabada koowaad. Fur Doorashooyinta baaqa ka soo horjeeda. Dhammaan doorashooyinta qaabka dhismaha ee moodeelka ku jira waxa lagu rasmeeyaa hal miisaan, iyada oo ay ku jiraan balaadhinta guud, waxa baaqu codsanayo, iyo inta qol ee baaqa ka mid ah ee ku habboon. Ku rari baaqa halkan qolalka waxa uu geliyaa dabaqyada doorashada, kan ugu hooseeya marka hore, waxana uu sheegayaa waxa aan ku habboonayn. Qiimuhu waxa uu ka imanayaa oo keliya miiska qiimaha mashruuca; haddii safka la jaadka ahi aanu jirin, waxa uu tidhi \"Qiime ma jiro\". Fur Noocyada, shuruudaha iyo faahfaahinta. Nooc kasta oo darbi, albaab, daaqad iyo sagxad ah wuxuu muujinayaa haddii uu leeyahay qoraal shuruudo, faahfaahinta la xidhay, iyo meesha shuruudaha, jadwalada iyo xaashiyaha is khilaafayaan. Ku xidh faahfaahin wuxuu ku daraa fayl DetailCraft ama CadCraft, cinwaan, ama xaashi ka mid ah moodeelkan. Fur Naqshadaha warshadda. Dooro walxaha uu naqshadda warshadda daboolayo ee moodeelka, kadibna Hel. Isticmaal Ansixi, Sida lagu xusay ama Dib u habee iyada oo magaca hubiyaha iyo qoraalkiisa ku jira. Dib loo gudbiyay wuxuu sameeyaa dib-u-eegista xigta ee isla diiwaanka, wuxuuna hayaa taariikhda eegista. Xaaladda waxaa sidoo kale lagu qoraa walax kasta. Fur Tilmaamaha goobta. Dooro walxaha, ku qor sababta iyo waxa ay qiimaha iyo waqtiga ka beddeli doonto, erayadaada, kadibna Diiwaan geli. Markii dhibaato la diiwaan geliyo, Sharax isbeddelada tan ka dib dhibaatada wuxuu sheegayaa walxaha la beddelay ee tilmaamuhu daboolo iyo kuwa la beddelay iyada oo aan waxba lagu diiwaan gelin. Good to know Tallaabo kasta waa hal Ka noqo. Waxba lama diido: baaqa aan la gaadhin, nooc aan la waafaqin qoraalkiisa, ama naqshad dib u dhacday waa digniin ama qoraal ku jira Dhibaatooyinka. Qolalka baaqa waa meelo aan darbi lahayn. Waxay leeyihiin bartilmaameed, ma aha bal naqshadda la gaadhay, sidaas darteed jadwalada qolalka iyo COBie ma tiriyaan iyagu sidii qolal la naqshadeeyay. Qaabeynta keliya waxay qolalka ku rarta dabaqyada iyada oo loo eegayo balaadhinta. Ma naqshadayso darbi. Qoraalka shuruudaha waxa lagu qoraa Dukumentiyada moodeelka. Halkan waxa lagu barbardhigaa oo keliya cabbirrada moodeelka laftiisa: ma qoro dhibcaha heerka oo adiga kuu qoran. Naqshadaha warshadda iyo tilmaamaha goobta waa diiwaano taariikh isku mid ah oo ay ku jiraan panelka Dhibaatooyinka iyo dib-u-eegista, sidaas darteed labada panel ayaa tusaya. Xaaladda naqshadda warshadda waa sifada walax kasta (CadCraft_ShopDrawing), tilmaamaha goobtana waa CadCraft_SiteInstruction, sidaas darteed Raadi iyo Midabka sifada way isticmaali karaan. Calaamadaha goobta lagu xaqiijiyay (Marxaladda 7) waxay ku jiraan Guryaha, hoosta Xaqiijin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"client-pack-and-stage-report","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xirmooyinka macmiilka, warbixinta marxaladda iyo barbardhigga ikhtiyaarrada","summary":"Samee xirmo macmiil ama warbixin marxaladeed moodelka, oo ikhtiyaarrada qaabka la kaydiyay lagu barbardhigo aagga iyo kharashka, aagga dabaqyada, sawirrada oo leh dib-u-eegistooda iyo taariikhda soo-saarista. Tiro kasta waxa ku xiran walxaha ay ka dambeeyaan.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["xirmada macmiilka","soo bandhig","warbixinta marxaladda","warbixin","barbardhigga ikhtiyaarka","ikhtiyaarro","barbardhig ikhtiyaar","aagga iyo kharashka","kharash ikhtiyaar kasta","qiimo la'aan","qaabka","aagga dabaqa","liiska sawirrada","taariikhda soo-saarista","tirooyin","tirooyin isku xidhan"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"goobaha","text":"Goobaha","level":2},{"id":"sida-ikhtiyaarada-loo-qiimeeyo","text":"Sida ikhtiyaarada loo qiimeeyo","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee xirmo macmiil ama warbixin marxaladeed moodelka sida uu hadda yahay, oo barbardhig ikhtiyaarrada qaabka la kaydiyay dhinac-dhinac aagga iyo kharashka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca bidix ee panelka fur \u003Cstrong\u003EXirmada macmiilka iyo warbixinta marxaladda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFur gudaha Documents\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku xiga Xirmada macmiilka ama Warbixinta marxaladda. Dukumentigu wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa Documents moodelka, halkaas oo aad qoraalkiisa ka beddeli karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreview-ka, guji tirada si aad u doorato walxaha ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhis xirmada\u003C/strong\u003E. Hal zip ayaa la kaydiyaa: dukumentigu oo PDF ah, sawir ka mid ah aragtida 3D, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efigures.csv\u003C/code\u003E, kaasoo liisteeya tiro kasta oo leh GlobalIds-ka walxaha ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobaha\"\u003EGoobaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad isticmaali kartaa kuwan dukumenti kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoob\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu daabacaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{stage}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarxaladda mashruuca ee faahfaahinta sawirka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{options}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhtiyaarrada qaabka la kaydiyay, dhinac-dhinac: dabaqyada, dhererka, aagga saldhigga, aagga dabaqa guud, xuubka dhismaha iyo kharashka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{areas}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga dabaq kasta, oo laga helay qolalka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{sheets}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada, dib-u-eegista ay hadda ku taagan tahay, iyo waqtigii la soo saaray ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{issues}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda soo-saarista iyo buuga isbeddelka sawirrada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{{changes}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa isbeddelay tan iyo soo-saarkii ugu dambeeyay, xaashi xaashi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-ikhtiyaarada-loo-qiimeeyo\"\u003ESida ikhtiyaarada loo qiimeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKharashka waxa laga helaa keliya miiska qiimaha mashruucaaga (Energy/Cost, 5D cost). Wax lagu qiyaaso lagama samaynayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka qiimaha wuxuu qiimeeyaa ikhtiyaar keliya haddii fasalladiisa magacaabaan \u003Ccode\u003EIfcBuildingElementProxy\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAagga dabaqa waxa qiimeeya safka erayadiisa magacaabaan isticmaalka ikhtiyaarka, sida office. Haddii aanu jirin, safka erayadiisa ku jira aagga dabaqa guud ama mass-ka dhismaha ayaa la isticmaalaa. Safka m² wuxuu isticmaalaa aagga guud. Safka m³ wuxuu isticmaalaa mugga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuubka (perimeter iyo dherer) waxa qiimeeya safka erayga envelope ama facade.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaar aan safka ku habboon lahayn wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQiimo ma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E. Wadarta waxa la muujiyaa keliya marka qayb kasta oo la weydiiyay qiimo leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaar ku hay \u003Cstrong\u003EKu hay ikhtiyaar\u003C/strong\u003E (Keep as an option) liiska qorshaha qolalka ee massing. Eeg ikhtiyaarrada massing-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF ma dooran karto walxo. Ka baxsan BimCraft, \u003Ccode\u003Efigures.csv\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sidaas u qaadaa xiriirka tiro kasta ilaa walxaha ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiyada iyo aragtida la sawiray ma la dhigo dukumentiga gudihiisa. Xirmadu waxay haysaa sawir 3D oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Samee xirmo macmiil ama warbixin marxaladeed moodelka sida uu hadda yahay, oo barbardhig ikhtiyaarrada qaabka la kaydiyay dhinac-dhinac aagga iyo kharashka. Tallaabooyin Dhinaca bidix ee panelka fur Xirmada macmiilka iyo warbixinta marxaladda. Dooro Fur gudaha Documents oo ku xiga Xirmada macmiilka ama Warbixinta marxaladda. Dukumentigu wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa Documents moodelka, halkaas oo aad qoraalkiisa ka beddeli karto. Preview-ka, guji tirada si aad u doorato walxaha ka dambeeya. Dooro Dhis xirmada. Hal zip ayaa la kaydiyaa: dukumentigu oo PDF ah, sawir ka mid ah aragtida 3D, iyo figures.csv, kaasoo liisteeya tiro kasta oo leh GlobalIds-ka walxaha ay leedahay. Goobaha Waxaad isticmaali kartaa kuwan dukumenti kasta: Goob Waxa uu daabacaa {{stage}} Marxaladda mashruuca ee faahfaahinta sawirka. {{options}} Ikhtiyaarrada qaabka la kaydiyay, dhinac-dhinac: dabaqyada, dhererka, aagga saldhigga, aagga dabaqa guud, xuubka dhismaha iyo kharashka. {{areas}} Aagga dabaq kasta, oo laga helay qolalka. {{sheets}} Xaashiyada, dib-u-eegista ay hadda ku taagan tahay, iyo waqtigii la soo saaray ugu dambeeyay. {{issues}} Taariikhda soo-saarista iyo buuga isbeddelka sawirrada. {{changes}} Waxa isbeddelay tan iyo soo-saarkii ugu dambeeyay, xaashi xaashi. Sida ikhtiyaarada loo qiimeeyo Kharashka waxa laga helaa keliya miiska qiimaha mashruucaaga (Energy/Cost, 5D cost). Wax lagu qiyaaso lagama samaynayo. Safka qiimaha wuxuu qiimeeyaa ikhtiyaar keliya haddii fasalladiisa magacaabaan IfcBuildingElementProxy. Aagga dabaqa waxa qiimeeya safka erayadiisa magacaabaan isticmaalka ikhtiyaarka, sida office. Haddii aanu jirin, safka erayadiisa ku jira aagga dabaqa guud ama mass-ka dhismaha ayaa la isticmaalaa. Safka m² wuxuu isticmaalaa aagga guud. Safka m³ wuxuu isticmaalaa mugga. Xuubka (perimeter iyo dherer) waxa qiimeeya safka erayga envelope ama facade. Ikhtiyaar aan safka ku habboon lahayn wuxuu muujinayaa Qiimo ma jiro. Wadarta waxa la muujiyaa keliya marka qayb kasta oo la weydiiyay qiimo leedahay. Wax la xiriira Ikhtiyaar ku hay Ku hay ikhtiyaar (Keep as an option) liiska qorshaha qolalka ee massing. Eeg ikhtiyaarrada massing-ka. PDF ma dooran karto walxo. Ka baxsan BimCraft, figures.csv wuxuu sidaas u qaadaa xiriirka tiro kasta ilaa walxaha ay leedahay. Weli lama dhisin Xaashiyada iyo aragtida la sawiray ma la dhigo dukumentiga gudihiisa. Xirmadu waxay haysaa sawir 3D oo keliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"level-of-development","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Heerka horumarka (LOD) iyo hubinta marxaladaha","summary":"Sii shay kasta heer horumar, ka eeg meesha uu ka yimid, hubi moodelka marka loo eego heerka ay marxaladdu codsato, oo hagaaji calaamadaha maqan iyo qolalka aan magac lahayn. Hubin kasta waa talo; waxba ma xannibayo.","section":"tasks","order":81,"keywords":["lod","heerka horumarka","lod 100","lod 200","lod 300","lod 350","lod 400","lod 500","marxalad","miiska marxaladaha","hubinta moodelka","calaamadaha maqan","qolalka aan magac lahayn","guud hore","ifc class","kala-soocid"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESii heer horumar shay kasta, kadibna hubi moodelka oo dhan marka loo eego waxa ay marxaladda mashruucu codsato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro shay (ama dhowr) oo fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. Hel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel of development\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa dooro heer liiska ka mid ah. Heer kasta waxa loo magacaabaa waxa uu ka dhigan yahay, mid kasta wuxuu ka kooban yahay kuwa hoose. Hal tallaabo ka noqo ayaa daboolaya dooritaan oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri meesha heerku ka yimid: shaygan, nooceeda, ama calaamad xaqiijisa goobta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad moodelka u hubiso, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E bidix, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELOD milestones\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro marxaladda iyo miiska (miiska bilowga, ama faylkaaga CSV ama JSON ah oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck the model\u003C/span\u003E. Wadarta iyo mid kasta oo safka miiska ah ayaa muujinaya waxa gaaray heerkiisa iyo waxa aan gaarin; natijooyinka waxa kale oo ay ka muuqdaan liiska Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMissing tags and unnamed rooms\u003C/span\u003E, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind them\u003C/span\u003E, wax ka beddel soo-jeedinta haddii aad rabto, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerka aad shayga u dooratay, oo ay ku xiga IFC class-kiisa iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWadarta iyo safafka marxaladda. Miiska weligiis ma beddelo macnaha heerka: miisaanku waa mid go&#039;an, miiskuna wuxuu kaliya sheegayaa heerka ay marxaladdu u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Guud hore&quot;: talo ah in shayada loo hayo guud ahaan marxaladda hore. Waa talo oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba halkan ma xannibayo. Moodel ka hooseeya heerka ay marxaladdu codsato waa la liisanayaa, ma diidmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaddexda qayb ee heer kasta (joogitaanka, macluumaadka, dukumeentiga) mid kasta ayaa la dejin karaa; calaamad ayaa muujinaysa in la gaaray, in ay hoosaysay, ama in aan la sheegin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Sii heer horumar shay kasta, kadibna hubi moodelka oo dhan marka loo eego waxa ay marxaladda mashruucu codsato. Tallaabooyinka Dooro shay (ama dhowr) oo fur Properties. Hel Level of development. Ka dooro heer liiska ka mid ah. Heer kasta waxa loo magacaabaa waxa uu ka dhigan yahay, mid kasta wuxuu ka kooban yahay kuwa hoose. Hal tallaabo ka noqo ayaa daboolaya dooritaan oo dhan. Akhri meesha heerku ka yimid: shaygan, nooceeda, ama calaamad xaqiijisa goobta. Si aad moodelka u hubiso, fur Model checks bidix, kadibna LOD milestones. Dooro marxaladda iyo miiska (miiska bilowga, ama faylkaaga CSV ama JSON ah oo leh Load). Riix Check the model. Wadarta iyo mid kasta oo safka miiska ah ayaa muujinaya waxa gaaray heerkiisa iyo waxa aan gaarin; natijooyinka waxa kale oo ay ka muuqdaan liiska Dhibaatooyinka. Hoosta Missing tags and unnamed rooms, riix Find them, wax ka beddel soo-jeedinta haddii aad rabto, kadibna riix Apply. Waxa aad arki doontid Heerka aad shayga u dooratay, oo ay ku xiga IFC class-kiisa iyo koodhadhka kala-soocidda. Wadarta iyo safafka marxaladda. Miiska weligiis ma beddelo macnaha heerka: miisaanku waa mid go'an, miiskuna wuxuu kaliya sheegayaa heerka ay marxaladdu u baahan tahay. \"Guud hore\": talo ah in shayada loo hayo guud ahaan marxaladda hore. Waa talo oo keliya. Waxa muhiim ah Waxba halkan ma xannibayo. Moodel ka hooseeya heerka ay marxaladdu codsato waa la liisanayaa, ma diidmo. Saddexda qayb ee heer kasta (joogitaanka, macluumaadka, dukumeentiga) mid kasta ayaa la dejin karaa; calaamad ayaa muujinaysa in la gaaray, in ay hoosaysay, ama in aan la sheegin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"wall-finishes","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhamaystirka darbiyada, habaynta shaxanka iyo salka hoose","summary":"Dhamaystir dhinacyada darbiyada, ka bilow habaynta shaxanka meel bilow ah, deji lakabyada salka hoose ee ka dambeeya, oo akhri tirooyinka jadwallada dhamaystirka darbiyada.","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["dhamaystirka darbiga","dhamaystirro","shaxan","habaynta shaxanka","darbiga biyaha","darbiga musqulka","biyo-diid","salka hoose","kolley","xadhig","qashin","dahaad","jadwal","tiro"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamaystir dhinacyada darbiyada (rang, looxyo, shaxan) oo ogow inta dhamaystir ee dhismuhu u baahan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalls\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall finishes…\u003C/span\u003E. Panel ayaa ka furmaa sawirka korkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro darbi. Tabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E dooro dhinaca bidix ama midig, kadibna ku dar dhamaystir: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull height\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplash-back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShower wall\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy corners\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka shaxanka, dooro meesha habaynta ka bilaabanto (geesta, dhexda, geesta furaha ama barta), jihada shaxanka iyo qaab toosan ama qaab dhisme. Tirada shaxanka oo dhan iyo kuwa la gooyay ayaa isla markiiba muuqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish types\u003C/span\u003E samee ama beddel nooc: magac, nooc, cabbirka shaxanka iyo xadhigga, qashinka, iyo dhismaha laga bilaabo darbiga dibadiisa (salka, biyo-diid, kolley, dhamaystirka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubstrates\u003C/span\u003E beddel lakabyada salka hoose gaar ahaan oo ogow darbiga intuu dhamaystirka dhammaystiran ku cabbiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E akhri dhamaystirrada darbiyada sida gobolka, dhamaystirka iyo qolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirrada qorshaha lagu sawiray iyo sida dahaadhka moodelka; dhaqdhaqaaqa ama dib-u-qorista darbiga ayaa dhamaystirradiisa la socod siiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka waa iyada oo laga jaray furayaasha. Tirooyinka shaxanka ee calaamadda ≈ leh waa qiyaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelku talo bixiyaa oo ma xidho wax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirrada darbiyada waxay sidoo kale ku muuqdaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E sida Dhamaystirrada darbiyada sida gobolka, dhamaystirka iyo qolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhamaystir dhinacyada darbiyada (rang, looxyo, shaxan) oo ogow inta dhamaystir ee dhismuhu u baahan yahay. Tallaabooyinka Fur Draw › Walls › Wall finishes…. Panel ayaa ka furmaa sawirka korkiisa. Dooro darbi. Tabka Face dooro dhinaca bidix ama midig, kadibna ku dar dhamaystir: Full height, Splash-back, Shower wall ama By corners. Dhamaystirka shaxanka, dooro meesha habaynta ka bilaabanto (geesta, dhexda, geesta furaha ama barta), jihada shaxanka iyo qaab toosan ama qaab dhisme. Tirada shaxanka oo dhan iyo kuwa la gooyay ayaa isla markiiba muuqda. Tabka Finish types samee ama beddel nooc: magac, nooc, cabbirka shaxanka iyo xadhigga, qashinka, iyo dhismaha laga bilaabo darbiga dibadiisa (salka, biyo-diid, kolley, dhamaystirka). Tabka Substrates beddel lakabyada salka hoose gaar ahaan oo ogow darbiga intuu dhamaystirka dhammaystiran ku cabbiro. Tabka Schedules akhri dhamaystirrada darbiyada sida gobolka, dhamaystirka iyo qolka. Waxa aad arki doontid Dhamaystirrada qorshaha lagu sawiray iyo sida dahaadhka moodelka; dhaqdhaqaaqa ama dib-u-qorista darbiga ayaa dhamaystirradiisa la socod siiya. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Tirooyinka waa iyada oo laga jaray furayaasha. Tirooyinka shaxanka ee calaamadda ≈ leh waa qiyaas. Waxa muhiim ah Panelku talo bixiyaa oo ma xidho wax. Dhamaystirrada darbiyada waxay sidoo kale ku muuqdaan Schedules sida Dhamaystirrada darbiyada sida gobolka, dhamaystirka iyo qolka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"part-link","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dir walax PartCraft oo soo celi","summary":"Dooro taageero, bracket, gacan-qabsi ama qalab, naqshadee qayb PartCraft oo ku dhex jirta dhismaha, kadibna aqbal qaabka cusub ee moodelka ku celi.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["partcraft","qayb","dir","xidhiidh","walax","taageero","bracket","gacan-qabsi","derbi","qalab","naqshad","wareeg","aqbal","isbeddel","xidhiidhka qaybaha"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa fiican in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadee hal walax oo dhismaha ka mid ah qayb: u dir PartCraft, ku beddel halkaas (jar, ku dar, qodi, cabbirka ku beddel), kadibna soo celi qaabka cusub moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro hal walax moodelka ku jira: walax guud, qalab, tiir, biim, gacan-qabsi ama alaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidhka qaybaha\u003C/span\u003E bartanka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDir PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E. PartCraft wuxuu furayaa tab cusub oo walaxda ku jirta qayb ahaan. Walxaha ku jira 3 m dhexdooda waxay ku muuqdaan midab grey xagaaga, si aad halkaas ugu naqshadayso. Halkaas lama beddeli karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel qaybta PartCraft. Ku PartCraft dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu soo celi BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Waad ku kaydin kartaa marar badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib BimCraft: badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidhka qaybaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa tiro, kaarka wuxuu walaxda ku liisteeyaa sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaa la beddelay PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuuna sheegayaa isbeddelka cabbirka iyo mugga erayo ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E si aad u eegto, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAqbal\u003C/span\u003E si aad walaxda u siiso qaabka cusub, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIi ilaali\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ilaaliso sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAqbalidda waa hal tallaabo oo soo celin ah. Walaxdu waxay ilaalisaa meeshaas, GlobalId-ga, nooca, agabka iyo sifooyinka. Kaliya jidhkeeda ayaa la beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalaxdu waxay heleysaa kooxda sifooyinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft_PartLink\u003C/span\u003E oo leh xidhiidhka, xaaladeeda iyo nuqulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDir mar kale\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u furaa isla walaxda PartCraft, isla xidhiidhka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDerbiyada, dabaqyada, saqafyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, jaranjarrada, rambaha iyo meelaha waxaa naqshadeeya qalabka dhismaha oo qaab laga sameeyay muuqaal-xad, waxayna dib u dhisaan kadib isbeddel kasta. Jidh ka yimid app kale ayaa dul qori doona, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa oo sababta ayaa la sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka dib ayaa ku imanaya sida mesh (IFC tessellation), ma aha astaamaha qaybta. Taariikhda qaybta waxay ku sii jirtaa PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii walaxda ay ku beddeshay moodelka kadib markii aad dirtay, kaarka wuxuu sheegaa ka hor intaadan aqbalin: aqbalidda waxay beddeshaa isbeddelladaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba lama soo rarin. Labada app waa bogagga hal websaydh, waxayna walaxda isu gudbiyaan browser-kan. Labaduba waa in ay ku furan yihiin isla browser-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalaxda waa in ay PartCraft ku xirmaa jidh buuxa (solid). Walax oo qaabkeedu leeyahay furooyin waaweyn waa la diidaa halkaas, iyadoo tirada cidhifyada furan lagu sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad aqbasho, ka dhig moodelka ku hayaa walaxda mid firfircoon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Naqshadee hal walax oo dhismaha ka mid ah qayb: u dir PartCraft, ku beddel halkaas (jar, ku dar, qodi, cabbirka ku beddel), kadibna soo celi qaabka cusub moodelka. Tallaabooyinka Dooro hal walax moodelka ku jira: walax guud, qalab, tiir, biim, gacan-qabsi ama alaab. Dooro Xidhiidhka qaybaha bartanka, kadibna Dir PartCraft. PartCraft wuxuu furayaa tab cusub oo walaxda ku jirta qayb ahaan. Walxaha ku jira 3 m dhexdooda waxay ku muuqdaan midab grey xagaaga, si aad halkaas ugu naqshadayso. Halkaas lama beddeli karo. Beddel qaybta PartCraft. Ku PartCraft dooro Faylka › Dhoofi › Ku soo celi BimCraft. Waad ku kaydin kartaa marar badan. Dib BimCraft: badhanka Xidhiidhka qaybaha wuxuu muujinayaa tiro, kaarka wuxuu walaxda ku liisteeyaa sida Waa la beddelay PartCraft wuxuuna sheegayaa isbeddelka cabbirka iyo mugga erayo ahaan. Dooro Muuji si aad u eegto, kadibna Aqbal si aad walaxda u siiso qaabka cusub, ama Ii ilaali si aad u ilaaliso sida ay ahayd. Waxa aad arki doontid Aqbalidda waa hal tallaabo oo soo celin ah. Walaxdu waxay ilaalisaa meeshaas, GlobalId-ga, nooca, agabka iyo sifooyinka. Kaliya jidhkeeda ayaa la beddelaa. Walaxdu waxay heleysaa kooxda sifooyinka CadCraft_PartLink oo leh xidhiidhka, xaaladeeda iyo nuqulka. Dir mar kale wuxuu dib u furaa isla walaxda PartCraft, isla xidhiidhka. Waxa fiican in la yaqaan Derbiyada, dabaqyada, saqafyada, albaabada, daaqadaha, jaranjarrada, rambaha iyo meelaha waxaa naqshadeeya qalabka dhismaha oo qaab laga sameeyay muuqaal-xad, waxayna dib u dhisaan kadib isbeddel kasta. Jidh ka yimid app kale ayaa dul qori doona, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa oo sababta ayaa la sheegaa. Qaabka dib ayaa ku imanaya sida mesh (IFC tessellation), ma aha astaamaha qaybta. Taariikhda qaybta waxay ku sii jirtaa PartCraft. Haddii walaxda ay ku beddeshay moodelka kadib markii aad dirtay, kaarka wuxuu sheegaa ka hor intaadan aqbalin: aqbalidda waxay beddeshaa isbeddelladaas. Waxba lama soo rarin. Labada app waa bogagga hal websaydh, waxayna walaxda isu gudbiyaan browser-kan. Labaduba waa in ay ku furan yihiin isla browser-ka. Walaxda waa in ay PartCraft ku xirmaa jidh buuxa (solid). Walax oo qaabkeedu leeyahay furooyin waaweyn waa la diidaa halkaas, iyadoo tirada cidhifyada furan lagu sheegayo. Si aad aqbasho, ka dhig moodelka ku hayaa walaxda mid firfircoon.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-folder-health","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka hubi galka koobiyada burburay, xiriirrada maqan iyo wixii hadhay","summary":"Isticmaal warbixinta galka si aad u hesho faylalka moodelka ee go'ay, aad u doorato koobiga dambe ee buuxa, aad u aragto xiriirrada maqan, oo aad ogaato faylalka qufulka iyo kuwa meel-ku-meel.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["hubinta caafimaadka","burburay","khaldan","aan dhammaystirnayn","go'ay","backup","xiriirro maqan","xref maqan","audit","wixii hadhay","faylalka qufulka","dwl","bak","gudbin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-koobiyada-burburay","text":"Tallaabooyin: koobiyada burburay","level":2},{"id":"waxa-hubinta-caafimaadka-samaysa","text":"Waxa hubinta caafimaadka samaysa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-xiriirrada-maqan","text":"Tallaabooyin: xiriirrada maqan","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-wixii-hadhay","text":"Tallaabooyin: wixii hadhay","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hubi galka mashruuca ka hor inta aadan gudbin ama shaqo ku bilaabin: moodel kasta ma buuxa, koobiga wanaagsan ee u dambeeyay kee, oo dhammaan faylalka isku xidhan ma jiraan?\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-koobiyada-burburay\"\u003ETallaabooyin: koobiyada burburay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur galka mashruuca. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur galka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri qoraallada hoosta magaca galka. &quot;2 files are incomplete or unreadable. See the models below.&quot; macnaheedu waa wax eegid ayaa jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu jira \u003Cstrong\u003EModels\u003C/strong\u003E, eeg tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EStatus\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EComplete\u003C/strong\u003E waa wanaagsan. &quot;1 incomplete&quot; oo midab ambar ah macnaheedu waa hal koobi oo xun, laakiin mid kale oo wanaagsan ayaa jira. \u003Cstrong\u003EIncomplete\u003C/strong\u003E oo casaan ah macnaheedu waa koobi wanaagsan lama helin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EAll … copies\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta moodel leh dhibaato. Waxa uu liisteeyaa faylka ugu weyn iyo koobi kasta oo lambar leh, kan ugu cusub marka hore, oo leh cabbirka, taariikhda iyo xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri qoraalka ka sarreeya liiska, tusaale ahaan &quot;Tower.rvt is incomplete (183.2 MB, should be at least 214.0 MB). The card shows the newest complete copy, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025).&quot; Tusaale: Tower.rvt waa go&#039;ay (183.2 MB, waa inuu ahaadaa ugu yaraan 214.0 MB). Kaarka wuxuu muujinayaa koobiga ugu cusub ee buuxa, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji koobiga aad rabto inaad furto. Koobiyada buuxa oo keliya ayaa la guji karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-hubinta-caafimaadka-samaysa\"\u003EWaxa hubinta caafimaadka samaysa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobi kasta oo moodel kasta waxa lagu hubiyaa degdeg madaxa, 512 bytes kasta, si galka ay ka buuxaan moodelo waaweyn ay ilbiriqsiyo ku dhammaato. Fayl kaas oo index-kiisa uu ka dhex tago dhamaadkiisa waxaa loo arkaa inuu go&#039;ay markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo gudbinayay ama la isku waafaqsiinayay. Fayl ku jira diska cloud-ka oo weli yahay &quot;online only&quot; wuxuu ku egyahay sidaas oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarka moodel kasta waxa laga akhriyaa faylka ugu weyn markii uu wanaagsan yahay, markii uusan wanaagsanayn waxa laga akhriyaa koobiga lambarka leh ee ugu cusub ee wanaagsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-xiriirrada-maqan\"\u003ETallaabooyin: xiriirrada maqan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadso qoraalka &quot;\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E linked files are not in this folder.&quot; hoosta magaca galka. Macnaheedu: \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E faylal isku xidhan galkan ma ku jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU dhaadh \u003Cstrong\u003ELinked and referenced files\u003C/strong\u003E. Xiriirrada maqan ayaa marka hore la liisteeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EWhere\u003C/strong\u003E xiriir kasta:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalkan ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa la helay jidka moodelku kaydiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagac isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E: fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa galka dhex ku jira meel kale. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl maktabad\u003C/strong\u003E: miis koodka keynote ama isku-dhis. Kuwan waxa la socda barnaamijka kombiyuutar kasta, sidaas darteed looma filayo inay galka ku jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalkan kuma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E: meel kasta oo galka dhex ah lama helin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri \u003Cstrong\u003EUsed by\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto moodelada xiriira fayl kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu xiriir kasta marka hore ka raadiyaa jidkiisa isku xidhan, kadibna dhamaadka jidka la kaydiyay (sida \u003Ccode\u003E\\\\server\\jobs\\Tower\\Cad\\X-Refs\\site.dwg\u003C/code\u003E waxa la helaa \u003Ccode\u003EX-Refs/site.dwg\u003C/code\u003E markaad galka \u003Ccode\u003ECad\u003C/code\u003E dooratay), kadibna magaca faylka meel kasta oo galka dhex ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-wixii-hadhay\"\u003ETallaabooyin: wixii hadhay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU dhaadh \u003Cstrong\u003ESet aside\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku yaal dhammaadka warbixinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri saddex saf oo laga yaabo inay soo muuqdaan:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGalalka nadaafadda (\u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E): lama akhrin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWixii qufulka, log-ga iyo backup-ka ka hadhay: faylal sida \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E. Waxay ka tagaan barnaamijyo buu jabay ama furnaa markii galka la koobiyeynayay. Badanaa waa amaan in la tirtiro marka qof faylalkaas furayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylal kale: wax kasta oo BimCraft aan akhrin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka ugu weyn ee burburay tirtirida ka hor inta aan koobi wanaagsan la kaydin.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka hore koobiga ugu dambeeya ee buuxa koobi, kadibna ka dhig faylka burburay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESi indha la&#039;aan ugu kalsoonaanta &quot;Magac isku mid ah&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Laba sawir oo kala duwan ayaa magac isku mid ah yeelan kara. Haddii shaki jiro, labaduba fur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIn aad u malaynayso faylka maktabadda ee maqan inay dhibaato tahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Miisaska koodka keynote iyo isku-dhiska waxay la nool yihiin barnaamijka kombiyuutar kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirada faylalka way kala duwan tahay browser-ada.\u003C/strong\u003E Firefox iyo Safari, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur gal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu gacanta siiyaa fayl kasta, oo ay ku jiraan kuwa galalka nadaafadda ku jira, sidaas darteed tirada (iyo xadka 20,000 ee faylalka) waxay ku jiraan. Galka la jiido wuu ka reebaa, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Warbixintu waa isku mid marka kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa Ka hubi galka mashruuca ka hor inta aadan gudbin ama shaqo ku bilaabin: moodel kasta ma buuxa, koobiga wanaagsan ee u dambeeyay kee, oo dhammaan faylalka isku xidhan ma jiraan? Tallaabooyin: koobiyada burburay Fur galka mashruuca. Eeg Fur galka mashruuca oo dhan. Akhri qoraallada hoosta magaca galka. \"2 files are incomplete or unreadable. See the models below.\" macnaheedu waa wax eegid ayaa jira. Ku jira Models, eeg tiirka Status. Complete waa wanaagsan. \"1 incomplete\" oo midab ambar ah macnaheedu waa hal koobi oo xun, laakiin mid kale oo wanaagsan ayaa jira. Incomplete oo casaan ah macnaheedu waa koobi wanaagsan lama helin. Fur All … copies hoosta moodel leh dhibaato. Waxa uu liisteeyaa faylka ugu weyn iyo koobi kasta oo lambar leh, kan ugu cusub marka hore, oo leh cabbirka, taariikhda iyo xaaladda. Akhri qoraalka ka sarreeya liiska, tusaale ahaan \"Tower.rvt is incomplete (183.2 MB, should be at least 214.0 MB). The card shows the newest complete copy, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025).\" Tusaale: Tower.rvt waa go'ay (183.2 MB, waa inuu ahaadaa ugu yaraan 214.0 MB). Kaarka wuxuu muujinayaa koobiga ugu cusub ee buuxa, Tower.0012.rvt (Mar 3, 2025). Guji koobiga aad rabto inaad furto. Koobiyada buuxa oo keliya ayaa la guji karaa. Waxa hubinta caafimaadka samaysa Koobi kasta oo moodel kasta waxa lagu hubiyaa degdeg madaxa, 512 bytes kasta, si galka ay ka buuxaan moodelo waaweyn ay ilbiriqsiyo ku dhammaato. Fayl kaas oo index-kiisa uu ka dhex tago dhamaadkiisa waxaa loo arkaa inuu go'ay markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo gudbinayay ama la isku waafaqsiinayay. Fayl ku jira diska cloud-ka oo weli yahay \"online only\" wuxuu ku egyahay sidaas oo kale. Kaarka moodel kasta waxa laga akhriyaa faylka ugu weyn markii uu wanaagsan yahay, markii uusan wanaagsanayn waxa laga akhriyaa koobiga lambarka leh ee ugu cusub ee wanaagsan. Tallaabooyin: xiriirrada maqan Raadso qoraalka \"n linked files are not in this folder.\" hoosta magaca galka. Macnaheedu: n faylal isku xidhan galkan ma ku jiraan. U dhaadh Linked and referenced files. Xiriirrada maqan ayaa marka hore la liisteeyaa. Akhri tiirka Where xiriir kasta: Galkan ku jira: waxa la helay jidka moodelku kaydiyay. Magac isku mid ah: fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa galka dhex ku jira meel kale. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxan. Fayl maktabad: miis koodka keynote ama isku-dhis. Kuwan waxa la socda barnaamijka kombiyuutar kasta, sidaas darteed looma filayo inay galka ku jiraan. Galkan kuma jiro: meel kasta oo galka dhex ah lama helin. Akhri Used by si aad u aragto moodelada xiriira fayl kasta. BimCraft wuxuu xiriir kasta marka hore ka raadiyaa jidkiisa isku xidhan, kadibna dhamaadka jidka la kaydiyay (sida \\\\server\\jobs\\Tower\\Cad\\X-Refs\\site.dwg waxa la helaa X-Refs/site.dwg markaad galka Cad dooratay), kadibna magaca faylka meel kasta oo galka dhex ku jira. Tallaabooyin: wixii hadhay U dhaadh Set aside oo ku yaal dhammaadka warbixinta. Akhri saddex saf oo laga yaabo inay soo muuqdaan: Galalka nadaafadda (*_backup, *_log, Revit_temp): lama akhrin. Wixii qufulka, log-ga iyo backup-ka ka hadhay: faylal sida .dwl, .dwl2, .bak, .err, .log, .tmp, .sv$. Waxay ka tagaan barnaamijyo buu jabay ama furnaa markii galka la koobiyeynayay. Badanaa waa amaan in la tirtiro marka qof faylalkaas furayn. Faylal kale: wax kasta oo BimCraft aan akhrin. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Faylka ugu weyn ee burburay tirtirida ka hor inta aan koobi wanaagsan la kaydin. Marka hore koobiga ugu dambeeya ee buuxa koobi, kadibna ka dhig faylka burburay. Si indha la'aan ugu kalsoonaanta \"Magac isku mid ah\". Laba sawir oo kala duwan ayaa magac isku mid ah yeelan kara. Haddii shaki jiro, labaduba fur. In aad u malaynayso faylka maktabadda ee maqan inay dhibaato tahay. Miisaska koodka keynote iyo isku-dhiska waxay la nool yihiin barnaamijka kombiyuutar kasta. Tirada faylalka way kala duwan tahay browser-ada. Firefox iyo Safari, Fur gal wuxuu gacanta siiyaa fayl kasta, oo ay ku jiraan kuwa galalka nadaafadda ku jira, sidaas darteed tirada (iyo xadka 20,000 ee faylalka) waxay ku jiraan. Galka la jiido wuu ka reebaa, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Warbixintu waa isku mid marka kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"view-dwg","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Daawo naqshad DWG ama DXF","summary":"Fur DWG ama DXF, u dhaqaaq meesha moodeelka iyo xaashiyada, akhri isku-xidhka, oo arag waxa wali aan la sawirin.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["bloogyada firfircoon","xaaladaha muuqaalka","dwg","dxf","cad","naqshad","2d","muuqaal","daawo","dhaqaajin","weynee","meesha moodeelka","meesha warqadda","layout","isku-xidhka","fur dwg"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaajinta","text":"Dhaqaajinta","level":2},{"id":"bloogyada-firfircoon","text":"Bloogyada firfircoon","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-sawirin","text":"Wali lama sawirin","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur naqshad CAD ah, arag 3D ama 2D, u dhaqaaq, u gudub meesha moodeelka iyo xaashiyadeeda, oo akhri koorarinaadka. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF; ma tafatiro, ma kaydiyo. Si aad wax u beddesho, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E naqshaddu waxay ku furmaysaa codsaha naqshadaynta CadCraft tab cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose a file\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku rid naqshadda bogga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta sadarka xaaladdu uu leeyahay &quot;Reading the drawing…&quot;. Naqshadaha waaweyn dhowr ilbiriqsi bay qaadan. Kadibna wuxuu sheegayaa inta akhrintu qaadatay, &quot;rendering…&quot; inta sawirka hore la sawirayo, iyo inta ay qaadatay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshaddu waxay ku furmaysaa 3D, habka ugu degdegga badan ee lagu muujiyo naqshad weyn (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003ENaqshad DWG ama DXF ah 3D ku arag\u003C/a\u003E). Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto muuqaalka 2D ee fidsan. Si naqshadaha mar walba 2D ugu furmaan, deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha waxay ku furmaan\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel (2D)\u003C/span\u003E. Naqshad aan waxba lahayn meesha moodeelka, ama browser aan 3D muujin karin, waxay ku furmaysaa 2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg tabs-ka ku sarreeya naqshadda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E marka hore, kadibna mid xaashi kasta, sida naqshaddu u leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tab-ka xaashi si aad u aragto xaashigaas: warqadda, moodeelka oo ku muuqda viewport-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E si aad dib ugu noqoto meesha moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaqaaq naqshadda oo akhri koorarinaadka X iyo Y ee geeska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda, oo ku habaysan daaqadda. Midabku wuxuu raacaa naqshadda; khadadka cad (midab 7) waxay ku sawirmaan midabka qoraalka mawduuca, midabyada khafiifka ahna waa la madoobeeyaa mawduuca iftiinka si ay u akhrisan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E ee bidix: faylka, cabbirka, qaabka (tusaale &quot;AutoCAD 2018 (AC1032)&quot;), unugyada, tirada entity-yada iyo lakabyada, tirada xaashiyada, iyo naqshadaha iyo qalabka isku xidhan haddii ay jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E ee bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig: sida loo dhaqaajiyo, naqshadaha iyo sawirada isku xidhan, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaajinta\"\u003EDhaqaajinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaajiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid adiga oo riixaya badhanka mouse-ka kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeyneyso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu jiid giraanta; dhibcaha ku hoos jira indhicirku wuu joogaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer dhufo, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka, laba farood oo lagu jiido \u003Cstrong\u003Eweyneeyaan\u003C/strong\u003E, ma dhaqaajinayaan. Pinch-kuna wuu weyneeyaa. Si aad u dhaqaajiso, riix oo jiid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal farood ku jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso. Pinch zoom wali looma dhisin naqshadaha: taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto xaashiga oo dhan, oo mouse ama trackpad ku weynee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bloogyada-firfircoon\"\u003EBloogyada firfircoon\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBloog firfircoon waxa loo sawiraa sida naqshaddu muujiso: bloog kasta oo la dhigay xaaladda muuqaalka ee naqshaddu ku kaydisay (&quot;Plan&quot; ama &quot;Front&quot;, &quot;Single bowl&quot; ama &quot;Double bowl&quot;). Midig, \u003Cstrong\u003EBloogyada firfircoon\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa mid kasta oo meesha moodeelka lagu dhigay: inta la dhigay, xaaladaha ay muujinayaan, iyo xaaladaha kale ee bloogga oo dhan. Gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, guji bloog la dhigay si aad u aragto \u003Cstrong\u003EBloogga firfircoon\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EXaaladda la muujiyay\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXaaladaha kale\u003C/strong\u003E ee Properties. BimCraft ma beddelo xaaladaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-sawirin\"\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyo walxood qaarkood dhismahan lama sawirin. Waxa lagu tiriyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E midig (&quot;Qaybahan naqshadda waa la dhaafayaa hadda, lama male-awaajiyo.&quot;), si aad u ogaato wax maqan. Khadadka, polylines, arcs, circles, ellipses, splines, hatches iyo buuxinta adag, qoraalka iyo qoraalka saf badan, bloogyada leh sifooyin, dimensions, leaders iyo multileaders, miisaska, sawirada iyo viewports waa la sawiraa. 3D faces, polyface meshes iyo polygon meshes waxa loo sawiraa sida gidaarradooda oo laga arko sare; u beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E si aad uga aragto sida dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDXF binary ma furmo: BimCraft wuu sheegaa. Dib ugu kaydi sida DXF ASCII ah, ama sida DWG, barnaamijka uu ka sameeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshaddu waa wax madhan oo eg.\u003C/strong\u003E Lakabyo qaarkood waxay naqshaddu laftiisa ku xidhan yihiin ama way xidhan yihiin; waxay ku bilaabmaan iyagoo aan lagu shiidin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll on\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii sadarka uu leeyahay &quot;\u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E waa naqshad madhan: ma hayso khad, qoraal ama bloog&quot;, ma jiro wax ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashi wuxuu muujiyaa qaab madhan.\u003C/strong\u003E Xaashigu wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay naqshadaha isku xidhan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003EHel naqshadaha iyo sawirada isku xidhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalku wuu wax yar ka duwan yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu qoraalka ku sawiraa font sans-serif oo cidhiidhi ah, ma aha fonts-ka naqshadda, sidaas darteed qoraalku wuxuu ku noqon karaa wax yar oo ballaaran ama cidhiidhi marka loo eego barnaamijka uu sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Ename\u003C/em\u003E lama akhri karo. Waa laga yaabaa inuu burbursan yahay, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay qaab aan akhriyuhu weli maamulin.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Qawska dhamaadka wuxuu magacaabayaa koodka qaabka faylka. Ka keydi barnaamijka uu ka sameeyay sida DWG hore ama DXF, kadibna mar kale isku day.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa la filayaa in la cabbiro, la naqshadeeyo ama la tafatiro.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu naqshadaha kaliya muujiyaa. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit in CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E si aad faylka isku u furto codsaha naqshadaynta CadCraft, kaas oo tafatira oo kaydiya nuqul DWG ama DXF ah. Faylkaaga asalka ah lama beddelo, naqshadaha isku xidhan waxay ku sii jiraan BimCraft. Badhanku wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya meesha CadCraft laga furi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EDaawo naqshad DWG ama DXF ah 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\"\u003EKa shaqee lakabyada iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/print-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/print-view\"\u003EHubi naqshadda muuqaalka daabacaadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Fur naqshad CAD ah, arag 3D ama 2D, u dhaqaaq, u gudub meesha moodeelka iyo xaashiyadeeda, oo akhri koorarinaadka. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa naqshadaha DWG iyo DXF; ma tafatiro, ma kaydiyo. Si aad wax u beddesho, guji Edit in CadCraft naqshaddu waxay ku furmaysaa codsaha naqshadaynta CadCraft tab cusub. Tallaabooyin Guji Choose a file, ama ku rid naqshadda bogga. Dooro fayl .dwg ama .dxf. Sug inta sadarka xaaladdu uu leeyahay \"Reading the drawing…\". Naqshadaha waaweyn dhowr ilbiriqsi bay qaadan. Kadibna wuxuu sheegayaa inta akhrintu qaadatay, \"rendering…\" inta sawirka hore la sawirayo, iyo inta ay qaadatay. Naqshaddu waxay ku furmaysaa 3D, habka ugu degdegga badan ee lagu muujiyo naqshad weyn (eeg Naqshad DWG ama DXF ah 3D ku arag). Guji Model si aad u aragto muuqaalka 2D ee fidsan. Si naqshadaha mar walba 2D ugu furmaan, deji Settings › BimCraft › Naqshadaha waxay ku furmaan ilaa Model (2D). Naqshad aan waxba lahayn meesha moodeelka, ama browser aan 3D muujin karin, waxay ku furmaysaa 2D. Eeg tabs-ka ku sarreeya naqshadda: Model marka hore, kadibna mid xaashi kasta, sida naqshaddu u leedahay. Guji tab-ka xaashi si aad u aragto xaashigaas: warqadda, moodeelka oo ku muuqda viewport-yadiisa. Guji Model si aad dib ugu noqoto meesha moodeelka. Ku dhaqaaq naqshadda oo akhri koorarinaadka X iyo Y ee geeska. Waxa aad arkaysaa Naqshadda, oo ku habaysan daaqadda. Midabku wuxuu raacaa naqshadda; khadadka cad (midab 7) waxay ku sawirmaan midabka qoraalka mawduuca, midabyada khafiifka ahna waa la madoobeeyaa mawduuca iftiinka si ay u akhrisan yihiin. Panel-ka Drawing ee bidix: faylka, cabbirka, qaabka (tusaale \"AutoCAD 2018 (AC1032)\"), unugyada, tirada entity-yada iyo lakabyada, tirada xaashiyada, iyo naqshadaha iyo qalabka isku xidhan haddii ay jiraan. Liiska Layers ee bidix. Midig: sida loo dhaqaajiyo, naqshadaha iyo sawirada isku xidhan, iyo Wali lama sawirin. Dhaqaajinta Si aad Samee tan Dhaqaajiso Jiid adiga oo riixaya badhanka mouse-ka kasta Weyneyso Ku jiid giraanta; dhibcaha ku hoos jira indhicirku wuu joogaa Ku habayso Laba jeer dhufo, riix F, ama guji Fit Trackpad-ka, laba farood oo lagu jiido weyneeyaan, ma dhaqaajinayaan. Pinch-kuna wuu weyneeyaa. Si aad u dhaqaajiso, riix oo jiid. Hal farood ku jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso. Pinch zoom wali looma dhisin naqshadaha: taabo Fit si aad u aragto xaashiga oo dhan, oo mouse ama trackpad ku weynee. Bloogyada firfircoon Bloog firfircoon waxa loo sawiraa sida naqshaddu muujiso: bloog kasta oo la dhigay xaaladda muuqaalka ee naqshaddu ku kaydisay (\"Plan\" ama \"Front\", \"Single bowl\" ama \"Double bowl\"). Midig, Bloogyada firfircoon wuxuu liistaa mid kasta oo meesha moodeelka lagu dhigay: inta la dhigay, xaaladaha ay muujinayaan, iyo xaaladaha kale ee bloogga oo dhan. Gudaha 3D, guji bloog la dhigay si aad u aragto Bloogga firfircoon, Xaaladda la muujiyay iyo Xaaladaha kale ee Properties. BimCraft ma beddelo xaaladaha. Wali lama sawirin Noocyo walxood qaarkood dhismahan lama sawirin. Waxa lagu tiriyaa Wali lama sawirin midig (\"Qaybahan naqshadda waa la dhaafayaa hadda, lama male-awaajiyo.\"), si aad u ogaato wax maqan. Khadadka, polylines, arcs, circles, ellipses, splines, hatches iyo buuxinta adag, qoraalka iyo qoraalka saf badan, bloogyada leh sifooyin, dimensions, leaders iyo multileaders, miisaska, sawirada iyo viewports waa la sawiraa. 3D faces, polyface meshes iyo polygon meshes waxa loo sawiraa sida gidaarradooda oo laga arko sare; u beddel 3D si aad uga aragto sida dusha. DXF binary ma furmo: BimCraft wuu sheegaa. Dib ugu kaydi sida DXF ASCII ah, ama sida DWG, barnaamijka uu ka sameeyay. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Naqshaddu waa wax madhan oo eg. Lakabyo qaarkood waxay naqshaddu laftiisa ku xidhan yihiin ama way xidhan yihiin; waxay ku bilaabmaan iyagoo aan lagu shiidin Layers. Guji All on. Haddii sadarka uu leeyahay \"name waa naqshad madhan: ma hayso khad, qoraal ama bloog\", ma jiro wax ku jira. Xaashi wuxuu muujiyaa qaab madhan. Xaashigu wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay naqshadaha isku xidhan. Eeg Hel naqshadaha iyo sawirada isku xidhan. Qoraalku wuu wax yar ka duwan yahay. BimCraft wuxuu qoraalka ku sawiraa font sans-serif oo cidhiidhi ah, ma aha fonts-ka naqshadda, sidaas darteed qoraalku wuxuu ku noqon karaa wax yar oo ballaaran ama cidhiidhi marka loo eego barnaamijka uu sameeyay. \"name lama akhri karo. Waa laga yaabaa inuu burbursan yahay, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay qaab aan akhriyuhu weli maamulin.\" Qawska dhamaadka wuxuu magacaabayaa koodka qaabka faylka. Ka keydi barnaamijka uu ka sameeyay sida DWG hore ama DXF, kadibna mar kale isku day. Waa la filayaa in la cabbiro, la naqshadeeyo ama la tafatiro. BimCraft wuxuu naqshadaha kaliya muujiyaa. Guji Edit in CadCraft si aad faylka isku u furto codsaha naqshadaynta CadCraft, kaas oo tafatira oo kaydiya nuqul DWG ama DXF ah. Faylkaaga asalka ah lama beddelo, naqshadaha isku xidhan waxay ku sii jiraan BimCraft. Badhanku wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya meesha CadCraft laga furi karo. Xiga Daawo naqshad DWG ama DXF ah 3D Ka shaqee lakabyada iyo xaashiyada Hubi naqshadda muuqaalka daabacaadda","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dwg-in-3d","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Eeg sawir DWG ama DXF 3D ah","summary":"Beddel meesha moodelka sawirka 3D si aad u aragto sare-jogyada, qaddarka, wajiyada 3D, shabakadaha iyo blocks-ka, u wareeg, dhig walax si aad u aragto hantideeda, iyo wixii aan weli la sawirin.","section":"tasks","order":105,"keywords":["3d","dwg","dxf","sawir","meesha moodelka","wareeg","goyn","jar","dooro","sifooyinka","sifo","handle","sare-jog","qaddar","extrusion","3dface","polyface","mesh","3d polyline","blocks","muuqaal","perspektiif","toosan","extents","acis","solids"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"goo-oo-leh-diyaarad-goyn","text":"Goo oo leh diyaarad goyn","level":2},{"id":"eeg-hantida-walxa","text":"Eeg hantida walxa","level":2},{"id":"ku-wareegidda","text":"Ku wareegidda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-lagu-sawiraa-3d","text":"Waxa lagu sawiraa 3D","level":2},{"id":"kaliya-muuqaalka-2d","text":"Kaliya muuqaalka 2D","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-sawirin","text":"Wali lama sawirin","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg meesha moodelka sawirka ee 3D. Khadadka iyo polylines-ka waxay ku jiraan sare-jogyadooda dhabta ah; walxaha leh qaddar waxay istaagaan sida darbiyo; wajiyada 3D, shabakadaha iyo blocks-ka 3D ah waxay u muuqdaan dusha aad ku wareegi karto. Warqadaha waxay sii ahaanayaan 2D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur DWG ama DXF. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/view-dwg\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/view-dwg\"\u003EEeg sawir DWG ama DXF\u003C/a\u003E. Waxa uu ku furmaa 3D marka aan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada waxay ku furmaan\u003C/strong\u003E ay tidhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel (2D)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaga bilaabo 2D, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E safka sare ee sawirka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug wax yar markii ugu horeysay: xaaladda waxay tidhi &quot;Sawirka 3D ayaa la dhisayaa…&quot;, kadibna inta khad iyo wajiyo ah ee muujinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg, guuri oo weyneey (eeg miiska hoose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix muuqaal ku jira safka labaad: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERight\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E si aad u beddesho muuqaal perspective iyo muuqaal toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad dib ugu aragto sawirka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E mar kale, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E ama tab xaashi si aad ugu noqoto 2D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha moodelka 3D, Z kor, midabada sawirka laftiisa. Wajiyada way ka khafiifsan yihiin ka xuduudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada aad demiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka baxa muuqaalka 3D sidoo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig: tirada khadadka iyo wajiyada, cabbirka sawirka X, Y iyo Z, \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka 2D keliya\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goo-oo-leh-diyaarad-goyn\"\u003EGoo oo leh diyaarad goyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection\u003C/span\u003E safka 3D, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Safka hoose wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida moodelada IFC (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoo moodel IFC oo leh diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E): goo ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide\u003C/span\u003E, jiid ama qor offset-ka — halkan unugyada sawirka laftiisa — oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlip\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hayso dhinaca kale. Wixii diyaarada goyntu ka gooyo lama dooran karo. Dib 2D u noqoshadu goynta way ka qaadaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-hantida-walxa\"\u003EEeg hantida walxa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix walax muuqaalka 3D ku jirta. Waxay noqotaa midabka la doortay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E waxay muujinaysaa waxa faylku ka sheegayo: noocdeeda, lakabkeeda, midabkeeda, nooca khadka iyo handle-keeda, kadibna xogtiisa, sida bilowga, dhamaadka iyo dherer khadka, xudunta iyo radius-ka wareegga, geeskooda wajiga 3D, ama block reference-ka block-keeda, barta galinta, miisaanka, jihada iyo qiimayaasha sifooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBlock reference-ka wuxuu dooranaa oo dhan, blocks-ka ku dhex jira sidoo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix dhowr pixel ka fog khad, wuxuu doortaa khadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo riix si aad u doorato walxo dheeraad ah, ama si aad mid uga saarto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu markaas tiriyaa siday noocyadoodu yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix meel bannaan, wuxuu tirtiraa doorashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha lakabyada aad demisay lama doori karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-wareegidda\"\u003EKu wareegidda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batanka dhexe, ama batanka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batanka midig, ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeyneey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaq furaha; wuxuu weynaynayaa meesha hoos ee mouse-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArag oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa eeg dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix dhinac, geesta ama xagga ka mid ah cube-ka muuqaalka ee geeska midig ee hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubka muuqaalka waxaa lagu beddeli karaa calaamad tiir, ama waa la qarin karaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E dhexdeeda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac;input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac, Mouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka, ku ruux laba farood si aad u wareegto, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo ruux si aad u guurto, oo ku isku-cabbir (pinch) si aad u weyneyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal farood jiid si aad u wareegto. Laba farood isku-cabbir si aad u weyneyso, oo wada dhaqaaqi si aad u guurto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-lagu-sawiraa-3d\"\u003EWaxa lagu sawiraa 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESawirka dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka, polylines-ka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESare-jogyadooda dhabta ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolylines, goobo, qaansooyin, ellipses\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaarada ay ku jiraan, sare-jogga, leexday marka sawirku leexiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhumucda khadadka, polylines, goobo iyo qaansooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyo qaddarkaas; goobadu waa xirran sare iyo hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWajiyada 3D, meshes-ka polyface, polygon meshes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha iftiimiyay leh geesaha muuqda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBlocks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeel laga dhigay, la leexiyay, la cabbiray 3D, blocks-ka ku dhex jira sidoo kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHatches\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGees-jeexyadooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka 2D ee fudud\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaaban, meesha laga sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaliya-muuqaalka-2d\"\u003EKaliya muuqaalka 2D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalka, qoraalka saf badan iyo sifooyinka muuqda ee blocks-ka waxa lagu sawiraa 3D, diyaarada ku jirta iyo sare-jogga laftiisa, guji ayaa doortaa. Polylines-ka ballaadhka leh waxay muujinayaan ballacooda sida qaybo fidsan. Multileaders, sawirrada iyo hatch patterns waxa lagu tiriyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya muuqaalka 2D\u003C/strong\u003E: ka eeg tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E ama xaashiyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-sawirin\"\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESolids iyo dusha loo kaydiyay sida ACIS bodies (3D solids, bodies, regions iyo surfaces) iyo subdivision meshes waxa lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E iyo tirada ay yihiin. Waa la dhaafaa, lama male-awaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax kasta waa taban yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawirku waa 2D: khadadkiisu ma leh sare-jog. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hubiso; sawir taban wuxuu u muuqdaa khad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel adag ma muujinayo wax.\u003C/strong\u003E Solids-ka barnaamij moodel adag lagu sameeyay waa ACIS bodies, oo lagu liistay \u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E. Ka soo dhoofi moodelka sida IFC ama sida 3D faces barnaamijka uu sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirku waa tiro yar oo dhex ku taal.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax aad ka fog meesha moodelka, sida koobi hore oo qorshe, ayaa ballaarinaya dhammaadka. Ku weynee mouse-ka meesha aad rabto inaad aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-layers-sheets\"\u003EShaqee lakabyada iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoo moodel IFC oo leh diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Eeg meesha moodelka sawirka ee 3D. Khadadka iyo polylines-ka waxay ku jiraan sare-jogyadooda dhabta ah; walxaha leh qaddar waxay istaagaan sida darbiyo; wajiyada 3D, shabakadaha iyo blocks-ka 3D ah waxay u muuqdaan dusha aad ku wareegi karto. Warqadaha waxay sii ahaanayaan 2D. Tallaabooyin Fur DWG ama DXF. Eeg Eeg sawir DWG ama DXF. Waxa uu ku furmaa 3D marka aan Dejinta › BimCraft › Sawirrada waxay ku furmaan ay tidhi Moodeel (2D). Laga bilaabo 2D, riix 3D safka sare ee sawirka, ama riix 3. Sug wax yar markii ugu horeysay: xaaladda waxay tidhi \"Sawirka 3D ayaa la dhisayaa…\", kadibna inta khad iyo wajiyo ah ee muujinayso. Wareeg, guuri oo weyneey (eeg miiska hoose). Riix muuqaal ku jira safka labaad: Iso, Top, Bottom, Front, Back, Left ama Right. Riix Perspective si aad u beddesho muuqaal perspective iyo muuqaal toosan. Riix Extents ama riix F si aad dib ugu aragto sawirka oo dhan. Riix 3D mar kale, riix 3, ama riix Model ama tab xaashi si aad ugu noqoto 2D. Waxa aad arki lahayd Meesha moodelka 3D, Z kor, midabada sawirka laftiisa. Wajiyada way ka khafiifsan yihiin ka xuduudaha. Lakabyada aad demiso Layers ayaa ka baxa muuqaalka 3D sidoo kale. Midig: tirada khadadka iyo wajiyada, cabbirka sawirka X, Y iyo Z, Muuqaalka 2D keliya iyo Wali lama sawirin. Goo oo leh diyaarad goyn Riix Section safka 3D, ama riix X. Safka hoose wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida moodelada IFC (eeg Goo moodel IFC oo leh diyaarad goyn): goo ka Top, Front ama Side, jiid ama qor offset-ka — halkan unugyada sawirka laftiisa — oo Flip si aad u hayso dhinaca kale. Wixii diyaarada goyntu ka gooyo lama dooran karo. Dib 2D u noqoshadu goynta way ka qaadaysaa. Eeg hantida walxa Riix walax muuqaalka 3D ku jirta. Waxay noqotaa midabka la doortay, Properties waxay muujinaysaa waxa faylku ka sheegayo: noocdeeda, lakabkeeda, midabkeeda, nooca khadka iyo handle-keeda, kadibna xogtiisa, sida bilowga, dhamaadka iyo dherer khadka, xudunta iyo radius-ka wareegga, geeskooda wajiga 3D, ama block reference-ka block-keeda, barta galinta, miisaanka, jihada iyo qiimayaasha sifooyinka. Block reference-ka wuxuu dooranaa oo dhan, blocks-ka ku dhex jira sidoo kale. Riix dhowr pixel ka fog khad, wuxuu doortaa khadka. Hay Ctrl oo riix si aad u doorato walxo dheeraad ah, ama si aad mid uga saarto; Properties wuxuu markaas tiriyaa siday noocyadoodu yihiin. Esc, ama riix meel bannaan, wuxuu tirtiraa doorashada. Walxaha lakabyada aad demisay lama doori karo. Ku wareegidda Si aad u Samee tan Wareeg Jiid batanka dhexe, ama batanka bidix Guuri Jiid batanka midig, ama hay Shift oo jiid Weyneey Ku dhaq furaha; wuxuu weynaynayaa meesha hoos ee mouse-ka Arag oo dhan Extents ama F Ka eeg dhinac Riix dhinac, geesta ama xagga ka mid ah cube-ka muuqaalka ee geeska midig ee hoose Kubka muuqaalka waxaa lagu beddeli karaa calaamad tiir, ama waa la qarin karaa, Settings dhexdeeda. Eeg Dejinta BimCraft. Trackpad-ka, ku ruux laba farood si aad u wareegto, hay Shift oo ruux si aad u guurto, oo ku isku-cabbir (pinch) si aad u weyneyso. Hal farood jiid si aad u wareegto. Laba farood isku-cabbir si aad u weyneyso, oo wada dhaqaaqi si aad u guurto. Waxa lagu sawiraa 3D Sawirka dhexdiisa 3D Khadadka, polylines-ka 3D Sare-jogyadooda dhabta ah Polylines, goobo, qaansooyin, ellipses Diyaarada ay ku jiraan, sare-jogga, leexday marka sawirku leexiyo Dhumucda khadadka, polylines, goobo iyo qaansooyin Darbiyo qaddarkaas; goobadu waa xirran sare iyo hoose Wajiyada 3D, meshes-ka polyface, polygon meshes Dusha iftiimiyay leh geesaha muuqda Blocks Meel laga dhigay, la leexiyay, la cabbiray 3D, blocks-ka ku dhex jira sidoo kale Hatches Gees-jeexyadooda Khadka 2D ee fudud Taaban, meesha laga sawiray Kaliya muuqaalka 2D Qoraalka, qoraalka saf badan iyo sifooyinka muuqda ee blocks-ka waxa lagu sawiraa 3D, diyaarada ku jirta iyo sare-jogga laftiisa, guji ayaa doortaa. Polylines-ka ballaadhka leh waxay muujinayaan ballacooda sida qaybo fidsan. Multileaders, sawirrada iyo hatch patterns waxa lagu tiriyaa Kaliya muuqaalka 2D: ka eeg tab-ka Model ama xaashiyada. Wali lama sawirin Solids iyo dusha loo kaydiyay sida ACIS bodies (3D solids, bodies, regions iyo surfaces) iyo subdivision meshes waxa lagu liistaa Wali lama sawirin iyo tirada ay yihiin. Waa la dhaafaa, lama male-awaado. Khaladaad caadi ah Wax kasta waa taban yahay. Sawirku waa 2D: khadadkiisu ma leh sare-jog. Riix Front si aad u hubiso; sawir taban wuxuu u muuqdaa khad. Moodel adag ma muujinayo wax. Solids-ka barnaamij moodel adag lagu sameeyay waa ACIS bodies, oo lagu liistay Wali lama sawirin. Ka soo dhoofi moodelka sida IFC ama sida 3D faces barnaamijka uu sameeyay. Sawirku waa tiro yar oo dhex ku taal. Wax aad ka fog meesha moodelka, sida koobi hore oo qorshe, ayaa ballaarinaya dhammaadka. Ku weynee mouse-ka meesha aad rabto inaad aragto. Xiga Shaqee lakabyada iyo xaashiyada Goo moodel IFC oo leh diyaarad goyn","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dwg-layers-sheets","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shaqee lakabyada iyo xaashiyada","summary":"Shid oo dami lakabyada sawirka, ku beddel meesha moodelka iyo xaashiyada, oo fahmo sida xaashiyadu u muujiyaan moodelka iyada oo loo marayo viewports-keeda.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["lakabyada","shid demi","qaboojin","dhalaali","xaashiyo","layouts","paper space","tabs","viewports","layer manager","la"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-lakabyada","text":"Tallaabooyin: lakabyada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin-xaashiyada","text":"Tallaabooyin: xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"sida-xaashiyadu-halkan-u-shaqeeyaan","text":"Sida xaashiyadu halkan u shaqeeyaan","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENadiifi muuqaalka sawir mashquul badan adigoo demiya lakabyo, kadibna eeg xaashiyada sawirka mid mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-lakabyada\"\u003ETallaabooyin: lakabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawir DWG ama DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E bidix. Lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad, midab, iyo magac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar calaamadda lakab si aad u qariso wax kasta oo ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll off\u003C/span\u003E si aad u qariso lakabyada oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi lakabyada kaliya aad rabto inaad aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll on\u003C/span\u003E si aad mar kale wax kasta u muujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELakabyadu way ka baxaan oo mar kale way soo muuqdaan isla mar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E iyo xaashi kasta. Lakabyada demay ama qaboojiyey sawirka laftiisa ayaa ka bilaabma iyada oo aan calaamad lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin-xaashiyada\"\u003ETallaabooyin: xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg safka tabs-ka sare sawirka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna xaashi kasta magaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix tab xaashi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg xaashiga: warqaddu waxay saaran tahay miis madow, viewport kasta wuxuu muujinayaa qaybtiisa moodelka miisaankiisa iyo xagalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu weynee viewport si aad u akhrido faahfaahin. Waxaad weynaynaysaa xaashiga, ma aha viewport-ka, sidaas xaashiga oo dhan wuu wada dhaqaaqaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E ama laba jeer-riix si aad dib ugu aragto xaashiga oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xaashiyadu-halkan-u-shaqeeyaan\"\u003ESida xaashiyadu halkan u shaqeeyaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashi (layout, ama paper space) waxa uu hayaa block cinwaan iyo viewports oo eegaya meesha moodelka. BimCraft wuxuu sawiraa viewport kasta isagoo xuduudkiisa ku xidhaa, miisaankiisa iyo leexashadiisa, wuxuuna qariyaa lakabyada qabowgooda ku jira viewport-ka. Viewport-ka ugu horreeya ee xaashi kasta waa xaashiga laftiisa, lamana sawiro laba jeer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filashada in beddelka lakabyada la kaydiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Dejinta lakabyada waxay saameynaysaa muuqaalka keliya, ilaa aad fur fayl kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filashada xakameynta lakab viewport kasta.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa lakabka meel kasta. Lakabyada uu sawirku ku qaboojiyey viewport gaar ah way ku sii qaboon yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadinta lakab ama gobolada lakabyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Wali lama dhisin. Liiska waa sida uu sawirku ku jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filashada in la shaqeeyo gudaha viewport.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro wax la shaqeeyo: BimCraft waxa uu kaliya muujinayaa xaashiga. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E si toos ah u eegto meesha moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Nadiifi muuqaalka sawir mashquul badan adigoo demiya lakabyo, kadibna eeg xaashiyada sawirka mid mid. Tallaabooyin: lakabyada Fur sawir DWG ama DXF. Hel liiska Layers bidix. Lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad, midab, iyo magac. Ka saar calaamadda lakab si aad u qariso wax kasta oo ku jira. Riix All off si aad u qariso lakabyada oo dhan. Calaamadi lakabyada kaliya aad rabto inaad aragto. Riix All on si aad mar kale wax kasta u muujiso. Waxa aad arki lahayd Lakabyadu way ka baxaan oo mar kale way soo muuqdaan isla mar, Model iyo xaashi kasta. Lakabyada demay ama qaboojiyey sawirka laftiisa ayaa ka bilaabma iyada oo aan calaamad lahayn. Tallaabooyin: xaashiyada Eeg safka tabs-ka sare sawirka: Model, kadibna xaashi kasta magaceeda. Riix tab xaashi. Eeg xaashiga: warqaddu waxay saaran tahay miis madow, viewport kasta wuxuu muujinayaa qaybtiisa moodelka miisaankiisa iyo xagalkiisa. Ku weynee viewport si aad u akhrido faahfaahin. Waxaad weynaynaysaa xaashiga, ma aha viewport-ka, sidaas xaashiga oo dhan wuu wada dhaqaaqaa. Riix Fit ama laba jeer-riix si aad dib ugu aragto xaashiga oo dhan. Sida xaashiyadu halkan u shaqeeyaan Xaashi (layout, ama paper space) waxa uu hayaa block cinwaan iyo viewports oo eegaya meesha moodelka. BimCraft wuxuu sawiraa viewport kasta isagoo xuduudkiisa ku xidhaa, miisaankiisa iyo leexashadiisa, wuxuuna qariyaa lakabyada qabowgooda ku jira viewport-ka. Viewport-ka ugu horreeya ee xaashi kasta waa xaashiga laftiisa, lamana sawiro laba jeer. Khaladaad caadi ah Ku filashada in beddelka lakabyada la kaydiyo. Dejinta lakabyada waxay saameynaysaa muuqaalka keliya, ilaa aad fur fayl kale. Ku filashada xakameynta lakab viewport kasta. Liiska Layers wuxuu beddelaa lakabka meel kasta. Lakabyada uu sawirku ku qaboojiyey viewport gaar ah way ku sii qaboon yihiin. Raadinta lakab ama gobolada lakabyada. Wali lama dhisin. Liiska waa sida uu sawirku ku jiro. Ku filashada in la shaqeeyo gudaha viewport. Ma jiro wax la shaqeeyo: BimCraft waxa uu kaliya muujinayaa xaashiga. Isticmaal Model si toos ah u eegto meesha moodelka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"documents-walkthrough","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dukumentiyada iyo noocyada (kaydka)","summary":"Tallaabo-tallaabo ah oo ku saabsan hal shaqo oo dhab ah: fal foolderka mashruuca ee moodelada IFC maamulka, qaad moodel, beddel, soo celi oo leh fiiro, u dir dib-u-eegis, ansixi oo sii daay, eeg taariikhda iyo waxa isticmaala, waxa qof labaad arkayo intii aad haysatay faylka, iyo sida ay ula shaqeyso foolderada daruurta.","section":"tasks","order":119,"keywords":["kaydka","dukumentiyo","tallaabo-tallaabo","tuto","qaad","soo celi","nooc","sii daayo","ansixi","qufulka","taariikhda","moodel","foolder daruuro","foolder mashruuc","laba qof","foolder la wadaago"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"1-samee-foolderka-mashruuca","text":"1. Samee foolderka mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"2-fal-faylka-hoosta-xakamaynta","text":"2. Fal faylka hoosta xakamaynta","level":2},{"id":"3-soo-qaad-beddel-soo-celi","text":"3. Soo qaad, beddel, soo celi","level":2},{"id":"4-dib-u-eegis-iyo-sii-daynta","text":"4. Dib-u-eegis iyo sii daynta","level":2},{"id":"5-nooc-cusub","text":"5. Nooc cusub","level":2},{"id":"6-eeg-waxa-dhacay","text":"6. Eeg waxa dhacay","level":2},{"id":"moodelada-tilmaama-dukumentiyo-kale","text":"Moodelada tilmaama dukumentiyo kale","level":2},{"id":"7-waxa-ben-arkayo-intii-aad-haysato-faylka","text":"7. Waxa Ben arkayo intii aad haysato faylka","level":2},{"id":"8-foolderada-daruuro","text":"8. Foolderada daruuro","level":2},{"id":"isku-day","text":"Isku day","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad tahay Ana, oo ka shaqeynaysa Riverside Clinic oo la shaqeynaysa Ben. Moodelada IFC ee mashruuca waxay ku nool yihiin hal foolder oo labaduba aad gaadhi karaan (darbi wadaag ah, foolder isku xidhan, ama foolder daruuro). Dhamaadka, hal fayl ayaa ka soo baxay nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay ilaa nooca \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E oo la sii daayay, ka dibna wuxuu noqday \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxaad aragtay yaa sameeyay maxay, waxaadna aragtay waxa Ben arkayo markaad haysato faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba waxaa lagu kaydiyaa foolder qarsoon oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault\u003C/code\u003E ah oo ku xiga faylashaada: server ma jiro, wax lagama soo dejiyo (foolderka daruuro waa kaliya ka baxsan, eeg tallaabada ugu dambeysa). Badhanka iyo xeerka kasta hal meel, eeg mawduuca \u003Cem\u003EDukumentiyada: soo qaadista, noocyada iyo sii daynta\u003C/em\u003E meesha app-kaaga uu leeyahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-samee-foolderka-mashruuca\"\u003E1. Samee foolderka mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyo\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur gal\u003C/span\u003E shaashadda bilowga, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyo…\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003EFayl\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro galka mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro foolderka ay ku jiraan moodelada IFC ee mashruuca. (Foolderada mashruuca waxay ku shaqeeyaan Studio iyo browser-yada ay foolder furi karaan, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Browser kale, panel-ku wuu sheegaa.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbeddel\u003C/span\u003E ku xiga \u003Cstrong\u003EAdigu:\u003C/strong\u003E, oo qor magacaaga, \u003Ccode\u003EAna\u003C/code\u003E (haddii la weydiiyo, magaca kombiyuutarkan sidoo kale). Panel-ku hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cem\u003EAdigu: Ana ee\u003C/em\u003E iyo kombiyuutarkaaga. Magacaagu wuxuu ku xiga wax kasta oo aad samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydka ku bilow galkan\u003C/span\u003E oo qor magaca mashruuca, \u003Ccode\u003ERiverside clinic\u003C/code\u003E. Panel-ku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cem\u003EKaydka waa la bilaabay Riverside clinic.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-fal-faylka-hoosta-xakamaynta\"\u003E2. Fal faylka hoosta xakamaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EFayllada aan kaydka ku jirin\u003C/strong\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E ku xiga \u003Ccode\u003Emodels/House.ifc\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa uu ka soo muuqanayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFayllada kaydka ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E nooca \u003Cstrong\u003EA.1\u003C/strong\u003E, xaaladda \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqo socda\u003C/strong\u003E. A.1 waa nuqulkiisa ugu horreeya; kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta oo nooc ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-soo-qaad-beddel-soo-celi\"\u003E3. Soo qaad, beddel, soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuran\u003C/span\u003E ku xiga \u003Ccode\u003Emodels/House.ifc\u003C/code\u003E. Moodelka ayaa BimCraft ku furmaya oo panel-ku wuu xirmaa si aad u aragto. Mar kale fur panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDukumentiyo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale fur panel-ka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad\u003C/span\u003E. Safka hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaad soo qaadatay\u003C/strong\u003E. Fayl quful ah ayaa lagu sameeyay \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/locks\u003C/code\u003E; qofna ma soo qaadan karo faylkan ilaa aad soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel moodelka: rog derbi, ku dar albaab. Kaydinta waa la diidaa haddii moodelku aanu ahayn kan aad soo qaadatay, waxaana sababta la sheegayaa; Kaydi sida nuqul ayaa had iyo jeer shaqeeya, nuqulkaagana wuu kaydiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur panel-ka, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo celi\u003C/span\u003E oo qor waxa beddelay (\u003Ccode\u003EAlbaabka waa la rogay\u003C/code\u003E). Panel-ku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cem\u003Esoo celiyay A.2 ahaan\u003C/em\u003E. Faylka foolderka mashruuca hadda waa moodelka aad furtay, qufulkana waa la furay. Soo celinta isbeddel la&#039;aan waxay ilaalisaa nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad go&#039;aankaaga beddesho, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu faylka dib u celiyaa iyada oo aan nooc cusub lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-dib-u-eegis-iyo-sii-daynta\"\u003E4. Dib-u-eegis iyo sii daynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir dib-u-eegis\u003C/span\u003E. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-eegis\u003C/strong\u003E, faylkuna wuxuu noqdaa mid kaliya la akhrin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hor ansixinta, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E oo liiska qofka ansixin kara (mid mid ahaan safka kasta), tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EBen\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ECarla\u003C/code\u003E, oo calaamadi xeerka ah in ansixiyaha uu noqdo qof aan qoraaga ahayn. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi dejinta\u003C/span\u003E. Hadda kaydku wuu diidaa qof kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBen (ama Carla) guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnsixi\u003C/span\u003E oo qor magaca ansixiyaha. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELa sii daayay\u003C/strong\u003E, nooca noqdana waa \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh \u003Cem\u003Eansixiyay\u003C/em\u003E iyo magaca. Faylka la sii daayay wuu kaliya-akhri yahay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u celi\u003C/span\u003E wuu ku celin lahaa Shaqo socda, sabab la sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca ansixiyaha waa magaca lagu qoro panel-ka; waa diiwaan ah oo ah cidda saxeexday, ma aha caddayn aqoonsi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-nooc-cusub\"\u003E5. Nooc cusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka la sii daayay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooc cusub\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad haysaa xarfaha xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo celi\u003C/span\u003E. Nooca waa \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, shaqo socda. Sii daayo sidii hore wuxuu noqonayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E ka hor soo celinta koowaad wuxuu ka tagaa \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha noocyada waxay socdaan A, B … Z, AA, AB. Haddii heerkaaga uu ka tago xarfaha qaarkood, dejinta mashruuca \u003Cem\u003EIsticmaal habka ASME Y14.35\u003C/em\u003E waxay ka tagtaa I, O, Q, S, X iyo Z noocyada xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"6-eeg-waxa-dhacay\"\u003E6. Eeg waxa dhacay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji magaca faylka si aad u furto faahfaahintiisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaariikhda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: dhacdo kasta, kii ugu dambeeyay marka hore, oo leh cidda, kombiyuutarka iyo waqtiga: \u003Cem\u003ESoo celiyay A.2\u003C/em\u003E oo ay samaysay Ana, \u003Cem\u003ELa sii daayay\u003C/em\u003E oo ay samaysay Ben, iwm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENoocyada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: miiska noocyada: nooc kasta oo la kaydiyay, oo leh taariikhdiisa, cidda soo celisay, qoraalka, iyo cidda ansixisay. Kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/revs\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: dukumentiyada moodelka IFC uu tilmaamo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxaa isticmaala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: liis ahaan moodel kasta oo kaydka ku jira oo tilmaamaya faylkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodelada-tilmaama-dukumentiyo-kale\"\u003EMoodelada tilmaama dukumentiyo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodel IFC oo tilmaama dukumentiyo kale oo foolderka ku jira (sawiro, jadwalo) wuxuu muujiyaa iyaga hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/strong\u003E, mid kasta oo ka mid ahna wuxuu muujinayaa moodelka hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa isticmaala\u003C/strong\u003E. Soo celi dukumentiga oo waad arki kartaa moodelada tilmaamaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"7-waxa-ben-arkayo-intii-aad-haysato-faylka\"\u003E7. Waxa Ben arkayo intii aad haysato faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda mar kale soo qaad faylka, oo ka codso Ben inuu furo isla foolderka mashruuca kombiyuutarkiisa oo furo panel-ka. Safka faylka wuxuu arkayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo qaadday Ana\u003C/strong\u003E kombiyuutarkaaga \u003Cstrong\u003Etan iyo\u003C/strong\u003E waqtiga, oo ma jiro badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii uu isku dayo, kaydku wuu diidaa: qufulku waa fayl nidaamku aanu labo jeer samayn, sidaas darteed laba qof ma heli karaan faylka isla markaasna, xataa Studio-ga marka foolderku uu diskka ku jiro. (Browser-ka foolderku wuxuu oggolaadaa isku day oo kaliya, panel-ku wuu sheegayaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EFoolder\u003C/strong\u003E.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii Ana ka maqan tahay oo Ben uu u baahan yahay faylka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJebi soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E ayaa xorayn. Waa inuu qoro sabab; waxay gashaa diiwaanka oo leh cidda soo qaadatay. Markii mashruucu liis maamulayaal leeyahay, iyaga kaliya ayaa samayn kara. Soo qaadid ka weyn xadka dhaqsiyaha (14 maalmood caadi ahaan) waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa \u003Cem\u003Emuddo dheer\u003C/em\u003E. Jebinta ka dib, soo celinta dambe ee Ana waa la diidaa, si aad labaduba aadan isu qorin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"8-foolderada-daruuro\"\u003E8. Foolderada daruuro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFoolder daruuro waa foolder mashruuc oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka daruuraha kooxda, si kooxdu uusan u baahnayn darbi wadaag ah. Studio-ga, marka aad ku xisaabsan tahay akoonkaaga CadCraft, panel-ku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur gal kaydsan daruuro\u003C/span\u003E ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro galka mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro oo dooro foolderka, oo lagu liisto sida workspace / foolder. Milkiilaha workspace-ka ayaa marka hore sameeya foolderka, kaydka daruuraha kooxdana waa inuu shaqeeyaa. Wax kasta oo kor ku qoran ayaa isku siman, server-ka ayaa sameeya qufulka, kaas oo adag dadka dhexdooda. Haddii aadan ku xisaabsanayn, panel-ku wuxuu kugu leeyahay gal. Tab browser caadi ah badhanka daruuraha lama siiyo; isticmaal Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-day\"\u003EIsku day\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee sideed tallaabo ee kor ku qoran nuqul fayl dhab ah. Tallaabooyinka laba qof u baahan tahay qof kale, ama laba daaqad oo laba magac leh. Haddii aad ku tijaabiso foolder la wadaago oo dhab ah, bogga tijaabinta bulshada wuxuu liistaa hubin taas oo weydiisa sida oo kale, natiijooyinkana wuu aqbalaa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Waxaad tahay Ana, oo ka shaqeynaysa Riverside Clinic oo la shaqeynaysa Ben. Moodelada IFC ee mashruuca waxay ku nool yihiin hal foolder oo labaduba aad gaadhi karaan (darbi wadaag ah, foolder isku xidhan, ama foolder daruuro). Dhamaadka, hal fayl ayaa ka soo baxay nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay ilaa nooca A oo la sii daayay, ka dibna wuxuu noqday B.1. Waxaad aragtay yaa sameeyay maxay, waxaadna aragtay waxa Ben arkayo markaad haysato faylka. Wax walba waxaa lagu kaydiyaa foolder qarsoon oo .ccvault ah oo ku xiga faylashaada: server ma jiro, wax lagama soo dejiyo (foolderka daruuro waa kaliya ka baxsan, eeg tallaabada ugu dambeysa). Badhanka iyo xeerka kasta hal meel, eeg mawduuca Dukumentiyada: soo qaadista, noocyada iyo sii daynta meesha app-kaaga uu leeyahay. 1. Samee foolderka mashruuca Dooro Dukumentiyo oo ku xiga Fur gal shaashadda bilowga, ama Dukumentiyo… menu-ga Fayl. Guji Dooro galka mashruuca oo dooro foolderka ay ku jiraan moodelada IFC ee mashruuca. (Foolderada mashruuca waxay ku shaqeeyaan Studio iyo browser-yada ay foolder furi karaan, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Browser kale, panel-ku wuu sheegaa.) Guji Isbeddel ku xiga Adigu:, oo qor magacaaga, Ana (haddii la weydiiyo, magaca kombiyuutarkan sidoo kale). Panel-ku hadda wuxuu leeyahay Adigu: Ana ee iyo kombiyuutarkaaga. Magacaagu wuxuu ku xiga wax kasta oo aad samayso. Guji Kaydka ku bilow galkan oo qor magaca mashruuca, Riverside clinic. Panel-ku wuxuu leeyahay Kaydka waa la bilaabay Riverside clinic. 2. Fal faylka hoosta xakamaynta Fur Fayllada aan kaydka ku jirin oo guji Ku dar ku xiga models/House.ifc. Waxa uu ka soo muuqanayaa Fayllada kaydka ku jira nooca A.1, xaaladda Shaqo socda. A.1 waa nuqulkiisa ugu horreeya; kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta oo nooc ah. 3. Soo qaad, beddel, soo celi Guji Furan ku xiga models/House.ifc. Moodelka ayaa BimCraft ku furmaya oo panel-ku wuu xirmaa si aad u aragto. Mar kale fur panel-ka Dukumentiyo. Mar kale fur panel-ka oo guji Soo qaad. Safka hadda wuxuu leeyahay Waxaad soo qaadatay. Fayl quful ah ayaa lagu sameeyay .ccvault/locks; qofna ma soo qaadan karo faylkan ilaa aad soo celiso. Beddel moodelka: rog derbi, ku dar albaab. Kaydinta waa la diidaa haddii moodelku aanu ahayn kan aad soo qaadatay, waxaana sababta la sheegayaa; Kaydi sida nuqul ayaa had iyo jeer shaqeeya, nuqulkaagana wuu kaydiyaa. Fur panel-ka, guji Soo celi oo qor waxa beddelay (Albaabka waa la rogay). Panel-ku wuxuu leeyahay soo celiyay A.2 ahaan. Faylka foolderka mashruuca hadda waa moodelka aad furtay, qufulkana waa la furay. Soo celinta isbeddel la'aan waxay ilaalisaa nooca. Haddii aad go'aankaaga beddesho, Ka noqo soo qaadista wuxuu faylka dib u celiyaa iyada oo aan nooc cusub lahayn. 4. Dib-u-eegis iyo sii daynta Guji U dir dib-u-eegis. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa Dib-u-eegis, faylkuna wuxuu noqdaa mid kaliya la akhrin karo. Ka hor ansixinta, guji Dejinta mashruuca oo liiska qofka ansixin kara (mid mid ahaan safka kasta), tusaale ahaan Ben iyo Carla, oo calaamadi xeerka ah in ansixiyaha uu noqdo qof aan qoraaga ahayn. Guji Kaydi dejinta. Hadda kaydku wuu diidaa qof kale. Ben (ama Carla) guji Ansixi oo qor magaca ansixiyaha. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa La sii daayay, nooca noqdana waa A, oo leh ansixiyay iyo magaca. Faylka la sii daayay wuu kaliya-akhri yahay. Dib u celi wuu ku celin lahaa Shaqo socda, sabab la sheegayo. Magaca ansixiyaha waa magaca lagu qoro panel-ka; waa diiwaan ah oo ah cidda saxeexday, ma aha caddayn aqoonsi. 5. Nooc cusub Faylka la sii daayay, guji Nooc cusub. Waxaad haysaa xarfaha xiga. Beddel, kadibna Soo celi. Nooca waa B.1, shaqo socda. Sii daayo sidii hore wuxuu noqonayaa B. Ka noqo soo qaadista ka hor soo celinta koowaad wuxuu ka tagaa A. Xarfaha noocyada waxay socdaan A, B … Z, AA, AB. Haddii heerkaaga uu ka tago xarfaha qaarkood, dejinta mashruuca Isticmaal habka ASME Y14.35 waxay ka tagtaa I, O, Q, S, X iyo Z noocyada xiga. 6. Eeg waxa dhacay Guji magaca faylka si aad u furto faahfaahintiisa: Taariikhda: dhacdo kasta, kii ugu dambeeyay marka hore, oo leh cidda, kombiyuutarka iyo waqtiga: Soo celiyay A.2 oo ay samaysay Ana, La sii daayay oo ay samaysay Ben, iwm. Noocyada: miiska noocyada: nooc kasta oo la kaydiyay, oo leh taariikhdiisa, cidda soo celisay, qoraalka, iyo cidda ansixisay. Kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta .ccvault/revs. Isticmaalka: dukumentiyada moodelka IFC uu tilmaamo. Waxaa isticmaala: liis ahaan moodel kasta oo kaydka ku jira oo tilmaamaya faylkan. Moodelada tilmaama dukumentiyo kale Moodel IFC oo tilmaama dukumentiyo kale oo foolderka ku jira (sawiro, jadwalo) wuxuu muujiyaa iyaga hoosta Isticmaalka, mid kasta oo ka mid ahna wuxuu muujinayaa moodelka hoosta Waxaa isticmaala. Soo celi dukumentiga oo waad arki kartaa moodelada tilmaamaya. 7. Waxa Ben arkayo intii aad haysato faylka Hadda mar kale soo qaad faylka, oo ka codso Ben inuu furo isla foolderka mashruuca kombiyuutarkiisa oo furo panel-ka. Safka faylka wuxuu arkayaa Soo qaadday Ana kombiyuutarkaaga tan iyo waqtiga, oo ma jiro badhanka Soo qaad. Haddii uu isku dayo, kaydku wuu diidaa: qufulku waa fayl nidaamku aanu labo jeer samayn, sidaas darteed laba qof ma heli karaan faylka isla markaasna, xataa Studio-ga marka foolderku uu diskka ku jiro. (Browser-ka foolderku wuxuu oggolaadaa isku day oo kaliya, panel-ku wuu sheegayaa hoosta Foolder.) Haddii Ana ka maqan tahay oo Ben uu u baahan yahay faylka, Jebi soo qaadista ayaa xorayn. Waa inuu qoro sabab; waxay gashaa diiwaanka oo leh cidda soo qaadatay. Markii mashruucu liis maamulayaal leeyahay, iyaga kaliya ayaa samayn kara. Soo qaadid ka weyn xadka dhaqsiyaha (14 maalmood caadi ahaan) waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa muddo dheer. Jebinta ka dib, soo celinta dambe ee Ana waa la diidaa, si aad labaduba aadan isu qorin. 8. Foolderada daruuro Foolder daruuro waa foolder mashruuc oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka daruuraha kooxda, si kooxdu uusan u baahnayn darbi wadaag ah. Studio-ga, marka aad ku xisaabsan tahay akoonkaaga CadCraft, panel-ku wuxuu muujinayaa Fur gal kaydsan daruuro ku xiga Dooro galka mashruuca. Dooro oo dooro foolderka, oo lagu liisto sida workspace / foolder. Milkiilaha workspace-ka ayaa marka hore sameeya foolderka, kaydka daruuraha kooxdana waa inuu shaqeeyaa. Wax kasta oo kor ku qoran ayaa isku siman, server-ka ayaa sameeya qufulka, kaas oo adag dadka dhexdooda. Haddii aadan ku xisaabsanayn, panel-ku wuxuu kugu leeyahay gal. Tab browser caadi ah badhanka daruuraha lama siiyo; isticmaal Studio. Isku day Samee sideed tallaabo ee kor ku qoran nuqul fayl dhab ah. Tallaabooyinka laba qof u baahan tahay qof kale, ama laba daaqad oo laba magac leh. Haddii aad ku tijaabiso foolder la wadaago oo dhab ah, bogga tijaabinta bulshada wuxuu liistaa hubin taas oo weydiisa sida oo kale, natiijooyinkana wuu aqbalaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dwg-linked-files","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hel naqshado isku xidhan iyo sawirro","summary":"Muuji naqshadaha isku xidhan ee sawirka (xrefs) iyo sawirrada block cinwaanka, adigoo furaya galkooda ama adigoo gacanta ku daraya faylasha.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["xref","tixraac dibadda","naqshad isku xidhan","ku xir","overlay","sawir","muuqaal","logo","shaxda cinwaanka","xref maqan","etransmit","maareeyaha tixraaca"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"habka-fudud-fur-galka","text":"Habka fudud: fur galka","level":2},{"id":"habka-kale-ku-dar-faylasha-gacanta","text":"Habka kale: ku dar faylasha gacanta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadaha oo dhameystir: muuji naqshadaha ay ku xidhan yihiin (tixraacyada dibadda, ama xrefs) iyo sawirrada ay isticmaalaan, sida logo ku jira shaxda cinwaanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habka-fudud-fur-galka\"\u003EHabka fudud: fur galka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen a folder\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro galka ku haya sawirka iyo xiriirradiisa, tusaale ahaan galka \u003Ccode\u003ECad\u003C/code\u003E oo dhan ee mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarbixinta galka, u dhaadhac \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha CAD\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E midig, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha isku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu u raadiyaa naqshad kasta oo isku xidhan magacyadeeda (&quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagac\u003C/em\u003E.dwg&quot;), marka hore isla galka sawirka ku jira, kadibna meel kasta galka aad furtay. Sawirrada waxa loo raadiyaa isla siyaabo, iyo sidoo kale magac la mid ah: eTransmit ama Revit export inta badan waxay ku daraan magaca mashruuca hore, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003Elogo.png\u003C/code\u003E waxa la helaa sida \u003Ccode\u003ETower-logo-5425051.png\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habka-kale-ku-dar-faylasha-gacanta\"\u003EHabka kale: ku dar faylasha gacanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawirka keligiis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha isku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd linked drawings…\u003C/span\u003E. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada\u003C/strong\u003E, badhanka waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd pictures…\u003C/span\u003E; labadaba waxay furaan isla doorashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E ee isku xidhan iyo faylasha sawirka. Waad dooran kartaa dhowr mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta BimCraft uu sawirka mar kale ku furayo iyaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad kasta oo isku xidhan iyo sawir kasta waxaa lagu liistaa calaamad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheedu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShown\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa helay oo la sawiray. Jidka hoosteeda wuxuu sheegayaa meesha ka timid, ama &quot;ku daray adiga&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShown, similar name\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir la helay magac la mid ah. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENot found\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro galka ama faylasha aad ku darteen. Sawir maqan wuxuu u muuqdaa qaab bannaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETIFF cannot be shown in a browser\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirku waa fayl TIFF, oo browser-yadu ma sawiraan. U kaydi PNG magac isku mid ah oo ku dar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECould not be read\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka waa la helay laakiin lama furi karin sida sawir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E bidix wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E ka mid ah \u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E la soo rarey&quot; naqshadaha isku xidhan. Lakabyada naqshadaha isku xidhan waxay ku muuqdaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E sida &quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagaca xiriirka\u003C/em\u003E|\u003Cem\u003Elakabka\u003C/em\u003E&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurista sawirka keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Sawirkan wuxuu muujinayaa waxa ku jira keliya ilaa naqshadaha isku xidhan lagu daro. Furista galka mashruuca oo dhan ayaa iska helaya.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurista gal aad u yar.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii xiriirradu ku jiraan galka walaalka ah, fur galka waalid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirro magac laga beddelay.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu isku qabsadaa naqshadaha isku xidhan magacyadooda. Xiriir diskka laga beddelay lama helo; ku dar gacanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirro xiriirro ah.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu soo rarayaa naqshadaha sawirka furan ay xidhan yihiin. Naqshadaha ku xidhan kuwaas dhexdooda lama raadiyo, sidaas darteed badanaa ma muuqdaan dhismahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Naqshadaha oo dhameystir: muuji naqshadaha ay ku xidhan yihiin (tixraacyada dibadda, ama xrefs) iyo sawirrada ay isticmaalaan, sida logo ku jira shaxda cinwaanka. Habka fudud: fur galka Riix Open a folder oo dooro galka ku haya sawirka iyo xiriirradiisa, tusaale ahaan galka Cad oo dhan ee mashruuca. Warbixinta galka, u dhaadhac Naqshadaha CAD hoosta. Riix sawirka. Eeg panelka Properties midig, hoosta Naqshadaha isku xidhan iyo Sawirrada. BimCraft wuxuu u raadiyaa naqshad kasta oo isku xidhan magacyadeeda (\"magac.dwg\"), marka hore isla galka sawirka ku jira, kadibna meel kasta galka aad furtay. Sawirrada waxa loo raadiyaa isla siyaabo, iyo sidoo kale magac la mid ah: eTransmit ama Revit export inta badan waxay ku daraan magaca mashruuca hore, sidaas darteed logo.png waxa la helaa sida Tower-logo-5425051.png. Habka kale: ku dar faylasha gacanta Fur sawirka keligiis. Midig, hoosta Naqshadaha isku xidhan, riix Add linked drawings…. Hoosta Sawirrada, badhanka waa Add pictures…; labadaba waxay furaan isla doorashada. Dooro faylasha .dwg ee isku xidhan iyo faylasha sawirka. Waad dooran kartaa dhowr mar. Sug inta BimCraft uu sawirka mar kale ku furayo iyaga. Waxa aad arki lahayd Naqshad kasta oo isku xidhan iyo sawir kasta waxaa lagu liistaa calaamad: Calaamad Macnaheedu Shown La helay oo la sawiray. Jidka hoosteeda wuxuu sheegayaa meesha ka timid, ama \"ku daray adiga\". Shown, similar name Sawir la helay magac la mid ah. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxan. Not found Ma jiro galka ama faylasha aad ku darteen. Sawir maqan wuxuu u muuqdaa qaab bannaan. TIFF cannot be shown in a browser Sawirku waa fayl TIFF, oo browser-yadu ma sawiraan. U kaydi PNG magac isku mid ah oo ku dar. Could not be read Faylka waa la helay laakiin lama furi karin sida sawir. Panelka Drawing bidix wuxuu muujinayaa \"n ka mid ah m la soo rarey\" naqshadaha isku xidhan. Lakabyada naqshadaha isku xidhan waxay ku muuqdaan Layers sida \"magaca xiriirka|lakabka\". Khaladaad caadi ah Furista sawirka keliya. \"Sawirkan wuxuu muujinayaa waxa ku jira keliya ilaa naqshadaha isku xidhan lagu daro. Furista galka mashruuca oo dhan ayaa iska helaya.\" Furista gal aad u yar. Haddii xiriirradu ku jiraan galka walaalka ah, fur galka waalid. Xiriirro magac laga beddelay. BimCraft wuxuu isku qabsadaa naqshadaha isku xidhan magacyadooda. Xiriir diskka laga beddelay lama helo; ku dar gacanta. Xiriirro xiriirro ah. BimCraft wuxuu soo rarayaa naqshadaha sawirka furan ay xidhan yihiin. Naqshadaha ku xidhan kuwaas dhexdooda lama raadiyo, sidaas darteed badanaa ma muuqdaan dhismahan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-view","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi naqshad aragtida daabacaadda","summary":"U beddel DWG ama DXF aragtida daabacaadda si aad u aragto oo madow ku qoran cad, iyada oo cabbirrada xarriiqyada la muujiyo oo aan lakabyada aan waligood daabicmin la muujin.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["daabac","qorshe","horudhac","horudhaca qorshaha","cabbirrada xarriiqa","lineweight","madow iyo cad","defpoints","ma daabacmo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sida xaashi u muuqan doonto warqadda ka hor intaadan ka daabicin barnaamijka uu sameeyay: madow ku qoran cad, cabbirrada xarriiqyada oo dhab ah, iyo lakabyada loo dejiyay inaysan daabicin ka tagaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur naqshad DWG ama DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix tab xaashi ah oo kor ku yaal naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E dhamaadka tabyada, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhowow faahfaahin si aad u barbardhigto xarriiqyada culus iyo kuwa fudud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad dib ugu noqoto midabada caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarqad cad oo ku taal miis cawl, xarriiq kasta iyo qoraal kasta madow, mawduuc kasta oo ha ahaadee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirrada xarriiqyada: xaashiga, cabbir kasta waxaa lagu sawiraa ballaca dhabta ah ee warqadda, sidaas darteed xarriiq 0.5 mm waa laba jeer ka ballaaran tahay xarriiq 0.25 mm kasta oo fogaan. Xarriiq looma sawiro mid ka khafiifsan cabbirkeeda shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada loo dejiyay inaysan daabicin, iyo lakabka DEFPOINTS, ayaa qarsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E wuu ku sii hayaa riixan. Aragtida daabacaadda way sii shaqaynaysaa marka aad u beddesho xaashiyaha ama furto naqshad kale, ilaa aad damiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E, aragtida daabacaadda waxay isticmaashaa cabbirrada shaashadda oo keliya (xarriiqyo khafiif ah hal pixel, kuwa culusna wax yar oo ballaaran), sababtoo ah booska moodeelku ma lahan cabbir warqad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIn la filayo in la daabici doono.\u003C/strong\u003E Aragtida daabacaadda waa horudhac. Daabicidda iyo dhoofinta PDF weli BimCraft kuma jiraan; ka daabac barnaamijka naqshadda sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIn la filayo qaababka daabacaadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Miisaska qalinka iyo midabada qaababka daabacaadda lama akhriyo. Wax walba waa madow fudud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiixida P intaad qorayso.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxba ma sameeyaan intaad ku qorayso goob, ama marka jadwalka qalabka uu muuqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Eeg sida xaashi u muuqan doonto warqadda ka hor intaadan ka daabicin barnaamijka uu sameeyay: madow ku qoran cad, cabbirrada xarriiqyada oo dhab ah, iyo lakabyada loo dejiyay inaysan daabicin ka tagaan. Tallaabooyin Fur naqshad DWG ama DXF. Riix tab xaashi ah oo kor ku yaal naqshadda. Riix Aragtida daabacaadda dhamaadka tabyada, ama taabo P. Ku dhowow faahfaahin si aad u barbardhigto xarriiqyada culus iyo kuwa fudud. Mar kale riix Aragtida daabacaadda, ama taabo P, si aad dib ugu noqoto midabada caadiga ah. Waxa aad arkaysaa Warqad cad oo ku taal miis cawl, xarriiq kasta iyo qoraal kasta madow, mawduuc kasta oo ha ahaadee. Cabbirrada xarriiqyada: xaashiga, cabbir kasta waxaa lagu sawiraa ballaca dhabta ah ee warqadda, sidaas darteed xarriiq 0.5 mm waa laba jeer ka ballaaran tahay xarriiq 0.25 mm kasta oo fogaan. Xarriiq looma sawiro mid ka khafiifsan cabbirkeeda shaashadda. Lakabyada loo dejiyay inaysan daabicin, iyo lakabka DEFPOINTS, ayaa qarsan. Badhanka Aragtida daabacaadda wuu ku sii hayaa riixan. Aragtida daabacaadda way sii shaqaynaysaa marka aad u beddesho xaashiyaha ama furto naqshad kale, ilaa aad damiso. Gudaha Moodeel, aragtida daabacaadda waxay isticmaashaa cabbirrada shaashadda oo keliya (xarriiqyo khafiif ah hal pixel, kuwa culusna wax yar oo ballaaran), sababtoo ah booska moodeelku ma lahan cabbir warqad. Khaladaadka caadiga ah In la filayo in la daabici doono. Aragtida daabacaadda waa horudhac. Daabicidda iyo dhoofinta PDF weli BimCraft kuma jiraan; ka daabac barnaamijka naqshadda sameeyay. In la filayo qaababka daabacaadda. Miisaska qalinka iyo midabada qaababka daabacaadda lama akhriyo. Wax walba waa madow fudud. Riixida P intaad qorayso. F iyo P waxba ma sameeyaan intaad ku qorayso goob, ama marka jadwalka qalabka uu muuqdo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"equipment-schedule","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Samee jadwal qalab oo soo dhoofi CSV","summary":"U beddel calaamadaha alaabta ee sawirka cunto-bixinta jadwal qalab, sifee, u gudub alaabta kasta xaashideeda, oo soo deji CSV.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["qalab","jadwal","cunto-bixin","jikada","calaamadaha alaabta","kcl","sifooyinka","bom","liiska agabka","csv","miiska xisaabta","soo dhoofin","soo saarida xogta"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"sida-jadwalka-loo-dhiso","text":"Sida jadwalka loo dhiso","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhri liiska qalabka ka yimid sawirka jikada ama cunto-bixinta, hubi, ka hel alaabta kasta qorshaha, oo soo deji faylka miiska xisaabta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waxay shaqeysaa sawiro ay calaamadaha qalabkoodu xogtooda ku sidaan sifooyinka bloogga, sida maktabadaha naqshadaynta jikada ee KCL: calaamad kasta waxay haysaa lambarka alaabta (\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E), tirada, qaybta, soo saaraha, moodelka, xogta korontada iyo biyo-dhigga, iyo tixgelinno. Sawiro kale ma lahan tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawirka, si wanaagsan faylka mashruucu ka, si sawirrada xiriirka ahna ay u soo soo baxaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E ee kor ku yaal sawirka. Calaamaddiisu waxay tusaysaa inta alaab ku jirta xaashiyada, tusaale &quot;Qalabka (88)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri jadwalka: \u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETirada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saaraha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKorontada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-dhigga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHalka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa la liistaayo menu-ka kor ku yaal miiska: \u003Cstrong\u003EXaashi kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, hal xaashi, \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro xaashi\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EWax kasta oo calaamad lagu sameeyay sawirka\u003C/strong\u003E. Doorasho kasta waxay tusaysaa tirada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa shaandheynta (&quot;Shaandhee: qaybta, soo saaraha, moodelka…&quot;) si aad liiska u yareyso, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003Eqaboojiye\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E208\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix magaca xaashida ee tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EHalka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiiri sawirka: BimCraft wuxuu u beddelaa xaashidaas, wuxuuna ku weyneeyaa alaabta oo wareeg ku hareeraynayaa. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay &quot;Alaabta \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E, \u003Cem\u003Eqayb\u003C/em\u003E waa la wareegay \u003Cem\u003Exaashida\u003C/em\u003E.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu noqoto jadwalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl magiciisu yahay &quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagaca sawirka\u003C/em\u003E equipment.csv&quot; (magaca xaashida qaad qaansada haddii aad liistay hal xaashi) ku jira galkaaga soo dejinta. Wuxuu ku furmaa Excel, Numbers, LibreOffice ama Google Sheets.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda xaaladda: &quot;Waa la soo dejiyay \u003Cem\u003Emagaca faylka\u003C/em\u003E (\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E alaab).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV-ga waxa ku jira tiirarkan: Item, Qty, Category, Manufacturer, Model, Electrical, Plumbing, Remarks, Electrical remarks, Plumbing remarks, Sheets, Placed (inta calaamad). Waxay soo dejisaa safafka saxda ah ee miiska tusaya, kadib menu-ka iyo shaandhaynta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-jadwalka-loo-dhiso\"\u003ESida jadwalka loo dhiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaa laga akhriyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecalaamadaha laftooda\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha miiska jadwalka ee lagu sawiray xaashida. Fiiro ku qoran sare miiska wuxuu sheegaa inta calaamad la akhriyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal safka waa hal lambar alaabta oo leh hal xog. Tiradeedu waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ewadarta\u003C/strong\u003E calaamadaha, sida jadwal la daabacay u tiriyo: shelf la calaamadeeyay &quot;5&quot; meel, &quot;3&quot; meel kale waa 8, oo lagu muujiyaa &quot;5 + 3&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHalka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku taxaan xaashiyada tusaya alaabta kasta, oo lagu go&#039;aamiyay waxa muujinaya viewports-ka xaashi kasta, kaasoo daabacan. &quot;Moodeel keliya&quot; macnaheedu waa ma jiro xaashi tusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELambar la isticmaalay laba jeer\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu calaamadeeyaa hal lambar alaabta oo ku jira laba qalab oo kala duwan. Safka waxaa ku yaal calaamad casaan-jaalle ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha aan xaashi tusin waxaa lagu kala saaraa \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro xaashi\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay badanaa ka hadhay qorshayaasha hore ama shuqullada kale, weligood lama isku qasin \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKorontada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay tusaysaa amperka, kW, HP, volts, phase, xidhiidhka iyo plug sida calaamadeeyay. \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-dhigga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tusaa cabbirrada xidhiidhka: CW biyo qabow, HW biyo kulul, DD biyo-dhigga toosan, ID biyo-dhigga aan toosnayn, iyo gas. Goobaha kale ee calaamadda weli lama muujin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawirku ma leh calaamado \u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E, ama qalabkiisa waa la sawiray oo aan xog lahayn. Ma jiro wax la akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinku way ka duwan yihiin jadwalka la daabacay.\u003C/strong\u003E Jadwal la daabacay wuxuu liisan karaa lambarro dheeraad ah, ama magacyo gaaban oo ka duwan calaamadaha. Calaamadaha ku aaddan waxa la dhigay; farqiga la hubi naqshadeeyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda CSV-ga oo calaamado aan caadi ahayn muujinaysa.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku waa UTF-8. Ku fur amarka soo dhoofinta ee miiska xisaabta oo dooro UTF-8 haddii barnaamijku weydiisto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnug wuxuu ku bilaabmaa apostrophe.\u003C/strong\u003E Qiyamka ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E waxay helaan \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E hor ah si miisaska aanay u fulin sida qaacidooyin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ma samaynayaan wax.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxay shaqeeyaan sawirka, ma aha jadwalka. Marka hore riix tab-ka xaashiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Akhri liiska qalabka ka yimid sawirka jikada ama cunto-bixinta, hubi, ka hel alaabta kasta qorshaha, oo soo deji faylka miiska xisaabta. Tani waxay shaqeysaa sawiro ay calaamadaha qalabkoodu xogtooda ku sidaan sifooyinka bloogga, sida maktabadaha naqshadaynta jikada ee KCL: calaamad kasta waxay haysaa lambarka alaabta (KCL-ITEM), tirada, qaybta, soo saaraha, moodelka, xogta korontada iyo biyo-dhigga, iyo tixgelinno. Sawiro kale ma lahan tab Qalabka. Tallaabooyin Fur sawirka, si wanaagsan faylka mashruucu ka, si sawirrada xiriirka ahna ay u soo soo baxaan. Riix tab-ka Qalabka ee kor ku yaal sawirka. Calaamaddiisu waxay tusaysaa inta alaab ku jirta xaashiyada, tusaale \"Qalabka (88)\". Akhri jadwalka: Alaabta, Tirada, Qalabka, Soo saaraha, Moodelka, Korontada, Biyo-dhigga iyo Halka. Dooro waxa la liistaayo menu-ka kor ku yaal miiska: Xaashi kasta, hal xaashi, Ma jiro xaashi, ama Wax kasta oo calaamad lagu sameeyay sawirka. Doorasho kasta waxay tusaysaa tirada. Ku qor sanduuqa shaandheynta (\"Shaandhee: qaybta, soo saaraha, moodelka…\") si aad liiska u yareyso, tusaale qaboojiye ama 208. Riix magaca xaashida ee tiirka Halka. Fiiri sawirka: BimCraft wuxuu u beddelaa xaashidaas, wuxuuna ku weyneeyaa alaabta oo wareeg ku hareeraynayaa. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay \"Alaabta n, qayb waa la wareegay xaashida.\" Riix Qalabka si aad ugu noqoto jadwalka. Riix Soo deji CSV. Waxa aad arki doontaa Fayl magiciisu yahay \"magaca sawirka equipment.csv\" (magaca xaashida qaad qaansada haddii aad liistay hal xaashi) ku jira galkaaga soo dejinta. Wuxuu ku furmaa Excel, Numbers, LibreOffice ama Google Sheets. Xariiqda xaaladda: \"Waa la soo dejiyay magaca faylka (n alaab).\" CSV-ga waxa ku jira tiirarkan: Item, Qty, Category, Manufacturer, Model, Electrical, Plumbing, Remarks, Electrical remarks, Plumbing remarks, Sheets, Placed (inta calaamad). Waxay soo dejisaa safafka saxda ah ee miiska tusaya, kadib menu-ka iyo shaandhaynta. Sida jadwalka loo dhiso Waxaa laga akhriyaa calaamadaha laftooda, ma aha miiska jadwalka ee lagu sawiray xaashida. Fiiro ku qoran sare miiska wuxuu sheegaa inta calaamad la akhriyay. Hal safka waa hal lambar alaabta oo leh hal xog. Tiradeedu waa wadarta calaamadaha, sida jadwal la daabacay u tiriyo: shelf la calaamadeeyay \"5\" meel, \"3\" meel kale waa 8, oo lagu muujiyaa \"5 + 3\". Halka waxay ku taxaan xaashiyada tusaya alaabta kasta, oo lagu go'aamiyay waxa muujinaya viewports-ka xaashi kasta, kaasoo daabacan. \"Moodeel keliya\" macnaheedu waa ma jiro xaashi tusta. Lambar la isticmaalay laba jeer wuxuu calaamadeeyaa hal lambar alaabta oo ku jira laba qalab oo kala duwan. Safka waxaa ku yaal calaamad casaan-jaalle ah. Calaamadaha aan xaashi tusin waxaa lagu kala saaraa Ma jiro xaashi. Waxay badanaa ka hadhay qorshayaasha hore ama shuqullada kale, weligood lama isku qasin Dhammaan xaashiyada. Korontada waxay tusaysaa amperka, kW, HP, volts, phase, xidhiidhka iyo plug sida calaamadeeyay. Biyo-dhigga wuxuu tusaa cabbirrada xidhiidhka: CW biyo qabow, HW biyo kulul, DD biyo-dhigga toosan, ID biyo-dhigga aan toosnayn, iyo gas. Goobaha kale ee calaamadda weli lama muujin. Khaladaad caadi ah Ma jiro tab Qalabka. Sawirku ma leh calaamado KCL-ITEM, ama qalabkiisa waa la sawiray oo aan xog lahayn. Ma jiro wax la akhriyo. Tirooyinku way ka duwan yihiin jadwalka la daabacay. Jadwal la daabacay wuxuu liisan karaa lambarro dheeraad ah, ama magacyo gaaban oo ka duwan calaamadaha. Calaamadaha ku aaddan waxa la dhigay; farqiga la hubi naqshadeeyaha. Furidda CSV-ga oo calaamado aan caadi ahayn muujinaysa. Faylku waa UTF-8. Ku fur amarka soo dhoofinta ee miiska xisaabta oo dooro UTF-8 haddii barnaamijku weydiisto. Unug wuxuu ku bilaabmaa apostrophe. Qiyamka ku bilaabma =, +, - ama @ waxay helaan ' hor ah si miisaska aanay u fulin sida qaacidooyin. F iyo P ma samaynayaan wax. Waxay shaqeeyaan sawirka, ma aha jadwalka. Marka hore riix tab-ka xaashiga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"bimcraft","title":"U dhoofi moodeelka USD","summary":"Qor IFC-yada furan sida USD si loogu isticmaalo rendarka, isku dhigista goobta iyo barnaamijyada 3D kale, iyadoo walax kasta ay ku jirto IFC class, GlobalId iyo sifooyinkeeda.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usda","usdc","usdz","openusd","dhoofin","ifc","globalid","sifooyinka","dabaqyada","takhasusyada","isku dhigista goobta","archviz","rendarka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-faylka","text":"Waxa ku jira faylka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu qoraa waxa furan oo dhan (dhammaan moodeelada, kuwa federated ah ee meesha ku dhigtay) hal fayl USD ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EText (.usda)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBinary (.usdc)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPackage (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuu soo degayaa. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta walxood gashay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-faylka\"\u003EWaxa ku jira faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMoodeelka IFC\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka USD\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobta, dhismaha, dabaqyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxo ku jira midkood midka kale, dabaqyada sida ay u kala horreeyaan sarreynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalax kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal prim oo hoos taagan dabaqeeda iyo takhasuskeeda (Architecture, Structure, MEP, Furnishing, Site, Spaces, Other), oo geometry-geeda ahaan mesh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClass, GlobalId, magac, nooc, calaamad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyin la magacaabay \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:class\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:globalId\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc:name\u003C/code\u003E iyo kuwa kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabaynta sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifo kasta; dherer, bed iyo mug waxay ku jiraan mitir, mitir laba jibbaaran iyo mitir saddex jibbaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabka (oo leh hufnaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpaces\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la hayaa, lagu calaamadeeyay hagayaal si rendarradu u dhaafaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeometry-gu wuxuu ku yaal isku-xidhka IFC faylka. Qaabaynta waxa raacaysa habka qoran ee CadCraft ee USD ee dhismayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"USD qalabka sare wuxuu qoraa waxa furan oo dhan (dhammaan moodeelada, kuwa federated ah ee meesha ku dhigtay) hal fayl USD ah. Dhoofin Dooro USD qalabka sare. Dooro Text (.usda), Binary (.usdc) ama Package (.usdz). Faylku wuu soo degayaa. Sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta walxood gashay. Waxa ku jira faylka Moodeelka IFC Faylka USD Goobta, dhismaha, dabaqyada Kooxo ku jira midkood midka kale, dabaqyada sida ay u kala horreeyaan sarreynta Walax kasta Hal prim oo hoos taagan dabaqeeda iyo takhasuskeeda (Architecture, Structure, MEP, Furnishing, Site, Spaces, Other), oo geometry-geeda ahaan mesh Class, GlobalId, magac, nooc, calaamad Sifooyin la magacaabay ifc:class, ifc:globalId, ifc:name iyo kuwa kale Habaynta sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka Sifo kasta; dherer, bed iyo mug waxay ku jiraan mitir, mitir laba jibbaaran iyo mitir saddex jibbaaran Midabada Agabka (oo leh hufnaan) Spaces Waa la hayaa, lagu calaamadeeyay hagayaal si rendarradu u dhaafaan Geometry-gu wuxuu ku yaal isku-xidhka IFC faylka. Qaabaynta waxa raacaysa habka qoran ee CadCraft ee USD ee dhismayaasha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"collada","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhoofi moodelka sida Collada ama Google Earth","summary":"Qor moodelada IFC ee furan fayl Collada (.dae) oo loogu talagalay Blender iyo barnaamijyada 3D kale, ama xirmo Google Earth (.kmz) oo lagu dhigay meesha uu ku yaal khariidadda.","section":"tasks","order":141,"keywords":["collada","dae","kmz","kml","google earth","blender","dhoofin","geolocation","georeference","latitude","longitude","goob","barnaamijyada 3d"],"headings":[{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-faylka","text":"Waxa ku jira faylka","level":2},{"id":"goobta-ka-timaadda","text":"Goobta ka timaadda","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-kale","text":"Barnaamijyada kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi Collada (.dae, .kmz)…\u003C/span\u003E ee liiska Fayl ee hababka menu iyo ribbon) wuxuu qoraa waxa furan oo ah Collada 1.4.1: moodel kasta oo la muujinayo, iyo moodelada isku xidhan meelaha aad dhigtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada file (.dae), for Blender and other 3D programs\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoogle Earth package (.kmz): the model placed where it is on the map\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa kaliya marka moodelku leeyahay goob.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro doorashooyinka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E. Faylka ayaa la soo dejiyaa, saftarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa inta walxood ee gashay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay samayso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrite the location into the file\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku daraa latitude, longitude, dhererka iyo jihada bilowga faylka .dae\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOn the ground: the model’s level 0 sits on the terrain\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe model’s own height above sea level\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInclude rooms and spaces\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeelaha waa la geliyaa mana aha (caadi ahaan waa la ka reebaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInclude hidden elements\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha aad qarisay ayaa sidoo kale la qoraa (caadi ahaan waxa la qoraa oo keliya waxa aad aragto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-faylka\"\u003EWaxa ku jira faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMoodelka dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka Collada dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha, dabaqyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENodes ku jira midba kan kale, dabaqyada sida ay u kala horreeyaan kor-u-kac; walxaha aan dabaq lahayn ee ku jira &quot;Unplaced&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalax kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal node oo leh mesh u gaar ah, lagu magacaabay sida moodelka (magaciisa, haddii kale nooceeda iyo tag-keeda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca, GlobalId, nooca hore loo qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENode-ka extra data-diisa (profile IFC), magaca saxda ah (profile ModelCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabyo, oo leh hufnaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirrada iyo dhidibbada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMitir, Z sare. Heerka 0 ee moodelka hore wuxuu ku yaalaa dhererka 0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelku wuxuu ku sii jiraa meel u dhow bilowga dhulka, si barnaamijyada ku shaqeeya saxnaan hoose ay u muujiyaan iyada oo aan gariirin. ModelCraft wuxuu qoraa faylashiisa Collada isla qoraaga, wuxuuna furaa faylashan iyada oo magacyada walxahooda la hayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobta-ka-timaadda\"\u003EGoobta ka timaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka hore ayaa siiya goobta, si la mid ah sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E u xisaabiso latitude iyo longitude-ka dhibic:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel khariidad (IFC4 IfcMapConversion, ama property sets IFC2X3) iyada oo loo marayo nidaamka isku-xirka moodelka. Nidaamka aad moodelka u dooratay ayaa ka mudan kan faylku magacaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii kale, latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta (qiyaas: waa wanaagsan tahay marka goobta oo dhan la eegayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJihada waa la cabbiraa, ma aha mid la male-awaaleeyo: waxay tixgelinaysaa jiifka khariidadda, waqooyiga run ah iyo isu-soo-dhowaanta meridianka khariidadda. Si aad moodel goob u siiso, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga khariidadda…\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-kale\"\u003EBarnaamijyada kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoogle Earth\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa .kmz: moodelku wuxuu u muuqdaa goobtiisa, oo loo rogay waqooyiga. .dae fudud ma leh meel uu Google Earth ka akhrin karo goob; isticmaal .kmz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlender\u003C/strong\u003E (4.x iyo ka hor): File, Import, Collada (.dae). Walax kasta waxay u timaadaa sida shay gaar ah oo leh agabkeeda. Goobta waxaa lagu kaydiyay extra data-da faylka, taas oo Blender aan akhrin. Blender 5.0 wuu iska tirtiray importer-kiisii Collada ee dhismaha ku jiray; halkaas isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E ama dhoofinta glTF, ama fur .dae ee Blender 4.5 oo kaydi .blend.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETijaabooyinkeennu waxay hubiyaan fayl kasta iyadoo la barbardhigayo qaabka Collada 1.4.1, waxayna dib u akhriyaan akhristaha Collada ee madaxbannaan. Ma aanay furin Blender ama Google Earth.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Collada ee qalabka (ama Dhoofi Collada (.dae, .kmz)… ee liiska Fayl ee hababka menu iyo ribbon) wuxuu qoraa waxa furan oo ah Collada 1.4.1: moodel kasta oo la muujinayo, iyo moodelada isku xidhan meelaha aad dhigtay. Dhoofin Dooro Collada. Dooro qaabka: Collada file (.dae), for Blender and other 3D programs. Google Earth package (.kmz): the model placed where it is on the map. Waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa kaliya marka moodelku leeyahay goob. Dooro doorashooyinka, kadibna Dhoofi. Faylka ayaa la soo dejiyaa, saftarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa inta walxood ee gashay. Doorasho Waxa ay samayso Write the location into the file Wuxuu ku daraa latitude, longitude, dhererka iyo jihada bilowga faylka .dae Height On the ground: the model’s level 0 sits on the terrain, ama The model’s own height above sea level Include rooms and spaces Meelaha waa la geliyaa mana aha (caadi ahaan waa la ka reebaa) Include hidden elements Walxaha aad qarisay ayaa sidoo kale la qoraa (caadi ahaan waxa la qoraa oo keliya waxa aad aragto) Waxa ku jira faylka Moodelka dhexdiisa Faylka Collada dhexdiisa Dhismaha, dabaqyada Nodes ku jira midba kan kale, dabaqyada sida ay u kala horreeyaan kor-u-kac; walxaha aan dabaq lahayn ee ku jira \"Unplaced\" Walax kasta Hal node oo leh mesh u gaar ah, lagu magacaabay sida moodelka (magaciisa, haddii kale nooceeda iyo tag-keeda) Nooca, GlobalId, nooca hore loo qeexay Node-ka extra data-diisa (profile IFC), magaca saxda ah (profile ModelCraft) Midabka Agabyo, oo leh hufnaan Cabbirrada iyo dhidibbada Mitir, Z sare. Heerka 0 ee moodelka hore wuxuu ku yaalaa dhererka 0 Moodelku wuxuu ku sii jiraa meel u dhow bilowga dhulka, si barnaamijyada ku shaqeeya saxnaan hoose ay u muujiyaan iyada oo aan gariirin. ModelCraft wuxuu qoraa faylashiisa Collada isla qoraaga, wuxuuna furaa faylashan iyada oo magacyada walxahooda la hayo. Goobta ka timaadda Moodelka hore ayaa siiya goobta, si la mid ah sida Qiyaas u xisaabiso latitude iyo longitude-ka dhibic: Beddel khariidad (IFC4 IfcMapConversion, ama property sets IFC2X3) iyada oo loo marayo nidaamka isku-xirka moodelka. Nidaamka aad moodelka u dooratay ayaa ka mudan kan faylku magacaabo. Haddii kale, latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta (qiyaas: waa wanaagsan tahay marka goobta oo dhan la eegayo). Jihada waa la cabbiraa, ma aha mid la male-awaaleeyo: waxay tixgelinaysaa jiifka khariidadda, waqooyiga run ah iyo isu-soo-dhowaanta meridianka khariidadda. Si aad moodel goob u siiso, isticmaal Bilowga khariidadda… oo ku jira Qiyaas. Barnaamijyada kale Google Earth wuxuu akhrinayaa .kmz: moodelku wuxuu u muuqdaa goobtiisa, oo loo rogay waqooyiga. .dae fudud ma leh meel uu Google Earth ka akhrin karo goob; isticmaal .kmz. Blender (4.x iyo ka hor): File, Import, Collada (.dae). Walax kasta waxay u timaadaa sida shay gaar ah oo leh agabkeeda. Goobta waxaa lagu kaydiyay extra data-da faylka, taas oo Blender aan akhrin. Blender 5.0 wuu iska tirtiray importer-kiisii Collada ee dhismaha ku jiray; halkaas isticmaal USD ama dhoofinta glTF, ama fur .dae ee Blender 4.5 oo kaydi .blend. Tijaabooyinkeennu waxay hubiyaan fayl kasta iyadoo la barbardhigayo qaabka Collada 1.4.1, waxayna dib u akhriyaan akhristaha Collada ee madaxbannaan. Ma aanay furin Blender ama Google Earth.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"ifc5-alpha-ifcx","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Fur oo dhoofi faylasha IFC5 alpha (IFCX)","summary":"Ikhtiyaar tijaabo ah oo ku saabsan qaabka faylka IFC5 alpha (.ifcx): fur fayl oo leh lakabyadiisa, arag waxa akhrintu aysan hubin karin, oo dhoofi moodeelada furan. Qaabku weli waa isbeddelayaa, marka hore akhri.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["ifc5","ifcx","alpha","buildingsmart","json","lakab","schema","tijaabo","tirooyin","qto","dhoofin","soo gelin"],"headings":[{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2},{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"warbixinta","text":"Warbixinta","level":3},{"id":"waxa-noqda-waxa","text":"Waxa noqda waxa","level":2},{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"xadka","text":"Xadka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIFC5 alpha (faylka dhamaadkiisu yahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E.ifcx\u003C/span\u003E) waa qaabka faylka buildingSMART weli naqshadaysa. Ma aha mid dhammaystiran: faylasha, iyo sida aannu u akhrinno, way isbedeli karaan. Taasi waa sababta tani u tahay ikhtiyaar tijaabo iyo sababta akhrintu marka hore timaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha (IFCX)\u003C/span\u003E ee tab-ka BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha (IFCX) - qaabku weli way isbeddelaysaa; akhri marka hore\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la damiyaa caadi ahaan. Intuu damiga yahay, fayl .ifcx waa la diidaa jumlad tilmaamaysa halkan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)…\u003C/span\u003E iyo badhanka dhoofinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha\u003C/span\u003E ayaa muuqda marka uu shidan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl .ifcx adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur fayl ama gal\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu beddelaa moodeelka furan, kadib su&#039;aasha caadiga ah ee wax-beddelka), ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro dhowr fayl oo wada: faylka, lakabyadiisa, iyo faylasha schema-ta uu soo dhoofiyo. Haddii moodeel horay loo furay, faylka \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaxaa lagu daraa dhinacisa\u003C/strong\u003E; calaamadda x ee liiska moodeelka ayaa ka saaraa mar kale, taas oo ah ka noqod.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka IFCX wuxuu liistaa nodes (jid, carruurtiisa, waxa dhaxla, sifooyinkiisa). Fayloodo badan ayaa sharxi kara isla node-ka: fayl dambe (lakab) ayaa ka sarreeya sifooyinka fayl hore, carruur null ahna waa ka saartaa carruur. BimCraft wuu isku daraa, kadibna natiijada wuxuu u muujiyaa moodeel yar oo IFC4 ah: mashruuc, goob, dhismo, dabaqyo iyo walxo leh magacyo, fasallo, sifooyin, tirooyin, midabo iyo meshes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba internet-ka laga soo qaadan. Faylasha schema-ta uu faylku soo dhoofiyo (tusaale \u003Ccode\u003Eifc@v5a.ifcx\u003C/code\u003E) waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya haddii aad faylka la dooratay; haddii kale warbixintu wuu sheegaa, sifooyinkana waa la akhriyaa iyada oo aan nooca la hubin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"warbixinta\"\u003EWarbixinta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuritaanka ka dib, warbixinta ayaa liisteysa waxa akhrintu heshay: xog aan waafaqsanayn schema-tiisa, faylasha schema-ta aan la siin, sifooyin aan macno IFC ku lahayn halkan. Sifooyinka aan mapping lahayn waa la \u003Cstrong\u003Ehayaa\u003C/strong\u003E moodeelka, looma tuuro, waxaana dib loo qoraa marka la dhoofiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-noqda-waxa\"\u003EWaxa noqda waxa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka IFCX\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENode leh fasal IFC (mashruuc, goob, dhismo, dabaq, derbi …)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxda IFC4 ee ku habboon; fasal aan akhrintan garanayn wuxuu noqdaa building element proxy\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca node-ku leeyahay hoosta waalidkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca walxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyin leh nooc tiro (Length, Area, Volume, Mass …)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal set oo tiro IFC4 ah oo lagu magacaabay \u003Ccode\u003EQto_IFCX\u003C/code\u003E (tirooyinka IFC4 waxay ku sii jiraan IFC4 \u003Ccode\u003EQto_*\u003C/code\u003E sets)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka kale ee hantida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal property set oo lagu magacaabay \u003Ccode\u003EPset_IFCX\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka mesh iyo transform\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddexagallada walxda iyo meeleynta; meshes aan muuqan lama sawirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabka, opacity-ga, agabka, kala-soocidda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurface style, agabka iyo kala-soocidda walxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnugyada waxa loo qaataa inay yihiin mitir, Z oo kor u jeeda: alfa wuxuu sheegayaa in unugyada dambe la qori doono.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC5 alpha\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, akhri qoraalka, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi .ifcx\u003C/span\u003E. Faylku wuxuu leeyahay madasheen (header) keena (qoraaga CadCraft, nooca ifcx_alpha) waana uu isagu sheegaa inuu yahay qaabka alfa. Moodel kasta waxa lagu qoraa isku-xidhka faylkiisa (coordinates) oo mitir ah, oo leh magacyo, fasallo, property sets, tirooyin (sifooyin leh nooceeda), midabo iyo saddexagallo. Lakabyada iyo dhaxalka waa la qoraa oo la fidiyey. Faylka hubi barnaamijka aad u dirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka\"\u003EXadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJoogitada qalloocan (curves, surfaces) lama akhrin: waxaa la akhriyaa oo keliya mesh-yada saddexagallada ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlbaabada iyo daaqadaha ku dhex jira derbi waxay ku yaalaan dabaqa; derbigii ay ka yimaadeen lama xidhin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacyada set-yada tirooyinka IFC4 \u003Ccode\u003EQto_*\u003C/code\u003E waxa loo haynayaa sida kooxo sifo gaar ah (\u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft::qto::…\u003C/code\u003E); qaabka alfa ee caadiga ah wuxuu leeyahay magacyo tiro oo yar oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabku wuu isbedeli karaa annaga oo aan ogaanin; faylka maanta la sameeyey berri ma akhriyi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"IFC5 alpha (faylka dhamaadkiisu yahay .ifcx) waa qaabka faylka buildingSMART weli naqshadaysa. Ma aha mid dhammaystiran: faylasha, iyo sida aannu u akhrinno, way isbedeli karaan. Taasi waa sababta tani u tahay ikhtiyaar tijaabo iyo sababta akhrintu marka hore timaado. Shid Dooro Dejinta, kadibna qaybta IFC5 alpha (IFCX) ee tab-ka BimCraft. Calaamee IFC5 alpha (IFCX) - qaabku weli way isbeddelaysaa; akhri marka hore. Waa la damiyaa caadi ahaan. Intuu damiga yahay, fayl .ifcx waa la diidaa jumlad tilmaamaysa halkan. Fur IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)… iyo badhanka dhoofinta IFC5 alpha ayaa muuqda marka uu shidan yahay. Fur Dooro fayl .ifcx adigoo isticmaalaya Fur fayl ama gal (wuxuu beddelaa moodeelka furan, kadib su'aasha caadiga ah ee wax-beddelka), ama dooro Fur IFC5 alpha (.ifcx)… oo dooro dhowr fayl oo wada: faylka, lakabyadiisa, iyo faylasha schema-ta uu soo dhoofiyo. Haddii moodeel horay loo furay, faylka waxaa lagu daraa dhinacisa; calaamadda x ee liiska moodeelka ayaa ka saaraa mar kale, taas oo ah ka noqod. Faylka IFCX wuxuu liistaa nodes (jid, carruurtiisa, waxa dhaxla, sifooyinkiisa). Fayloodo badan ayaa sharxi kara isla node-ka: fayl dambe (lakab) ayaa ka sarreeya sifooyinka fayl hore, carruur null ahna waa ka saartaa carruur. BimCraft wuu isku daraa, kadibna natiijada wuxuu u muujiyaa moodeel yar oo IFC4 ah: mashruuc, goob, dhismo, dabaqyo iyo walxo leh magacyo, fasallo, sifooyin, tirooyin, midabo iyo meshes. Waxba internet-ka laga soo qaadan. Faylasha schema-ta uu faylku soo dhoofiyo (tusaale ifc@v5a.ifcx) waxaa loo isticmaalaa oo keliya haddii aad faylka la dooratay; haddii kale warbixintu wuu sheegaa, sifooyinkana waa la akhriyaa iyada oo aan nooca la hubin. Warbixinta Furitaanka ka dib, warbixinta ayaa liisteysa waxa akhrintu heshay: xog aan waafaqsanayn schema-tiisa, faylasha schema-ta aan la siin, sifooyin aan macno IFC ku lahayn halkan. Sifooyinka aan mapping lahayn waa la hayaa moodeelka, looma tuuro, waxaana dib loo qoraa marka la dhoofiyo. Waxa noqda waxa Faylka IFCX BimCraft Node leh fasal IFC (mashruuc, goob, dhismo, dabaq, derbi …) Walxda IFC4 ee ku habboon; fasal aan akhrintan garanayn wuxuu noqdaa building element proxy Magaca node-ku leeyahay hoosta waalidkiisa Magaca walxda Sifooyin leh nooc tiro (Length, Area, Volume, Mass …) Hal set oo tiro IFC4 ah oo lagu magacaabay Qto_IFCX (tirooyinka IFC4 waxay ku sii jiraan IFC4 Qto_* sets) Sifooyinka kale ee hantida Hal property set oo lagu magacaabay Pset_IFCX Sifooyinka mesh iyo transform Saddexagallada walxda iyo meeleynta; meshes aan muuqan lama sawirin Midabka, opacity-ga, agabka, kala-soocidda Surface style, agabka iyo kala-soocidda walxda Unugyada waxa loo qaataa inay yihiin mitir, Z oo kor u jeeda: alfa wuxuu sheegayaa in unugyada dambe la qori doono. Dhoofin Guji IFC5 alpha qalabka sare, akhri qoraalka, kadibna guji Dhoofi .ifcx. Faylku wuxuu leeyahay madasheen (header) keena (qoraaga CadCraft, nooca ifcx_alpha) waana uu isagu sheegaa inuu yahay qaabka alfa. Moodel kasta waxa lagu qoraa isku-xidhka faylkiisa (coordinates) oo mitir ah, oo leh magacyo, fasallo, property sets, tirooyin (sifooyin leh nooceeda), midabo iyo saddexagallo. Lakabyada iyo dhaxalka waa la qoraa oo la fidiyey. Faylka hubi barnaamijka aad u dirto. Xadka Joogitada qalloocan (curves, surfaces) lama akhrin: waxaa la akhriyaa oo keliya mesh-yada saddexagallada ah. Albaabada iyo daaqadaha ku dhex jira derbi waxay ku yaalaan dabaqa; derbigii ay ka yimaadeen lama xidhin. Magacyada set-yada tirooyinka IFC4 Qto_* waxa loo haynayaa sida kooxo sifo gaar ah (cadcraft::qto::…); qaabka alfa ee caadiga ah wuxuu leeyahay magacyo tiro oo yar oo keliya. Qaabku wuu isbedeli karaa annaga oo aan ogaanin; faylka maanta la sameeyey berri ma akhriyi karo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"place-from-library","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhig qalab iyo alaab laga soo qaatay maktabadda","summary":"Hel shay Maktabadda, fayl ama qorshaha furan, dhig dabaq moodeelka IFC ah oo leh muuqaal ghost ah, leexi, ku dhufo darbiga, oo kaydi.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["guuri","leexi","jiid","drag","maktabad","librarycraft","dhig","geli","qalab","alaab","bloog","qoys","shay","katalog","nuxur","kcl","csv","gltf","obj","rfa","dwg","nooca ifc"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"qorshaha-ama-moodeelka","text":"Qorshaha ama moodeelka","level":2},{"id":"guuri-ama-leexi-shay-la-dhigay","text":"Guuri ama leexi shay la dhigay","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"shayada-luqaddaada","text":"Shayada luqaddaada","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay maktabad ah geli moodeel IFC: sink, miis shaqo, kursi. BimCraft wuxuu u qoraa sida element IFC oo sax ah oo nooc leh, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta oo shayga isku mid ah wuxuu wadaagaa hal set oo geometry ah, xogtiisa, lambarka shayga iyo liisanka ayaa sidoo kale socda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeel IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E ee ku dhow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E midig, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E qalabka kor ku yaal moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro il:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuilt-in symbols\u003C/strong\u003E: astaamaha qorshaha tuubada ee guud oo ku jira BimCraft oo leh Apache-2.0, oo offline ku shaqeeya. Hubi cabbirradooda ka hor dhismaha. Astaamaha korontada qorshaha iyo qalabka koronto ee IFC, isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EDhismaha › Koronto\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary\u003C/strong\u003E: maktabadda CadCraft ee bogan. Shayada dadweynaha ma u baahna gelitaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThis file\u003C/strong\u003E: bloogyada fayl DWG ama DXF ah ee furan. Bloog dynamic oo leh xaaladaha muuqaalka waa la siiyaa mar kasta oo xaalad ah, magac ahaan &quot;Sink: Double bowl&quot;, mid kasta oo keliya tirada xaalada ayaa la rasmeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayloota…\u003C/strong\u003E: fayl DWG, DXF, IFC, glTF/GLB, OBJ, RFA ama CSV ah oo kombuyuutarkaaga ku jira. Waxa lagu akhriyaa tabkan; waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOther feeds\u003C/strong\u003E: maktabad kale oo isticmaalaysa isla qaabka feed-ka. Ku dar cinwaankeeda hal mar; waa la kaydiyaa browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadi ama dooro qaybta, kadibna guji kaarka. Kaarku wuxuu muujiyaa muuqaal qorshaha, magaca, soo saaraha iyo moodelka, liisanka iyo nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E (aragtida Plan) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E (aragtida 3D). Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E ay muuqdaan qorshaha iyo 3D labaduba, badhanku waa badhan kala qaybsan: ficilka ugu weyn waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E, fallaadhda midigta ah waxay furaysaa liis leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E. Ama jiid kaarka, ama sawirka faahfaahinta shayga, qorshaha ama 3D: shayga waxa lagu dhigaa meesha aad ka sii dayso. Qalin ama farta, riix oo hay kaarka wakhti yar, kadibna jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro dabaqa qalabka dhigista. Aragtida 3D, dabaqyada ka sarreeya waa la qariyaa intaad dhigayso, muuqaalkuna wuxuu u leexdaa sare; qorshaha, dabaqaas ayuu horeba u muujinayaa. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E qorshaha keliya wuxuu keenaa aragtida 3D oo ku dhinac taal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaq sare moodelka: sanduuq aan iftiin lahayn ayaa tusaya meesha shayga aado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u leexiso 90°. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiga ku dhufo\u003C/span\u003E) si aad dambeeda ugu dhejiso darbiga ugu dhow, u soo jeedisa qolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji si aad u dhigto. Ama ku qor booska \u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E1200, 3400\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIftiin ama wax kale oo laga xidho sare: deji \u003Cstrong\u003EMount\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EAt the ceiling\u003C/strong\u003E. Sare shayga wuxuu ku dhacaa hoosta saqafka meesha (ama heerka dabaqa meelaha aan saqaf lahayn). Haddii qorshe saqaf ah uu furan yahay aragtida qorshaha, \u003Cstrong\u003EMount\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAt the ceiling\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa jawaab hal su&#039;aal: \u003Cstrong\u003Elambarka shayga\u003C/strong\u003E (lambarka xor ee xiga ayaa la buuxiyaa), tirada iyo qoraalka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhig wax dheeraad ah, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo deystid nuqulka la tafatiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha-ama-moodeelka\"\u003EQorshaha ama moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka dhigista ee Maktabadda wuxuu raacaa aragtida aad ku jirto, wuuna beddelaa markaad beddesho aragtida (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorshe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala jar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E badhamada, furayaasha, ama marka fayl la furo). Qorshe wuxuu muujiyaa hal badhan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E; 3D wuxuu muujiyaa hal badhan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E; Kala jar wuxuu muujiyaa badhanka kala qaybsan, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E ficilka ugu weyn iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E liiskiisa. Labada habba isla qalabka dhigista ayay isticmaalaan oo isla element IFC ayay qoraan: mouse-ku wuxuu shaqeeyaa aragtida qorshaha mid ahaan, aragtida 3D mid kale. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waqti kasta si aad u joojiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiidista kaarka ma leh fure u gaar ah: badhanka kala qaybsan ama badhanka caadiga ah ayaa sameeya isla shayga furayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-ama-leexi-shay-la-dhigay\"\u003EGuuri ama leexi shay la dhigay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E dhexdiisa, dooro shayga qorshaha. Calaamad yar oo afar-geesle ah ayaa muujinaysa barta gelinta, iyo calaamad goobaan ah oo ku xigta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid shayga, ama calaamadda afar-geesle, si aad u guurto. Wuxuu la dhaqmaa sida qalabka Darbiga (geesaha iyo dhinacyada darbiyada); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid toosan dhinaca uu ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid calaamadda goobaanka si aad u leexiso 15° tallaabo kasta. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tallaabo 1° ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u leexiso 90°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProperties (sidoo kale aragtida 3D), ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ERotation (°)\u003C/strong\u003E, ama guji \u003Cstrong\u003ETurn 90°\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuuri kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah, wuxuuna u socdaa Live TeamWork. Shayga wuxuu sii hayaa lambarkiisa, xogta maktabadda iyo dhererka uu kor ka yaal dabaqa. Weli lama dhisin: jiidista aragtida 3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShayga moodeelka ku jira, la doortay, oo leh guddiga sifooyinkiisa midig: sanduuq \u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary item\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh liisanka iyo sheegista, iyo set-yada \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Placement\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Equipment\u003C/code\u003E iyo, shayada laga soo qaatay qorshayaasha calaamadaysan, \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SourceAttributes\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;La dhigay: \u003Cem\u003Eitem\u003C/em\u003E (shay \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E)&quot; liiska isbeddelka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStatus line: &quot;La dhigay \u003Cem\u003Eitem\u003C/em\u003E sida shay \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaar ka mid ah shayada waxay leeyihiin dhowr cabbir ama ikhtiyaar: kaarku wuxuu leeyahay doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003EVariant\u003C/strong\u003E, shayga aad dooratid ayaa la dhigaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EDhig oo beddel shay maktabad leh variants\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay aan 3D body lahayn (astaamo 2D ah) waa lagu dhigaa sanduuq ku meel mariyaha ah; markii la weydiiyo waa inaad siiso dhererkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax la mid ah: dooro shay la dhigay oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo ku soo celi shayada maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u bilowdo dhig kasta oo wall snap ah, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EStart with wall snap on\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EBimCraft settings\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDherer kasta waa la beddelaa unitiyada moodeelka, ha ahaadaan wax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEntourage\u003C/strong\u003E (geedo, dhir, dad, gaadiid) ayaa sidoo kale maktabadda ku jira: raadi &quot;tree&quot;, &quot;person&quot; ama &quot;car&quot;. Kuwanu waxa rasmeeya CadCraft (CC0) oo midabkooda ayay ilaaliyaan marka la dhigo (jidh bunni, caleemo cagaar, daaqadaha gaadiidka oo muuqda), BimCraft iyo barnaamijyada BIM kale. Waxay ku muuqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003Esawirada la rendered-gareeyay\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka IFC2X3 jidhka waxa loo qoraa sida solid aad u fiiqan; IFC4 sida triangulated face set. Labadoodaba waxay ku furmaan qalabka IFC kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka (DWG ama DXF) halkan lama kaydin karo, sidaas darteed shayada waxa lagu dhigaa moodeelada IFC oo keliya. Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EThis file\u003C/strong\u003E sawirka si aad u aragto bloogyadiisa waxa ay noqon lahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shayada-luqaddaada\"\u003EShayada luqaddaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay wuxuu leeyahay magac, sharraxaad iyo nooc luqado kale. Marka ay ku jiraan luqadda BimCraft loo dejiyay (Settings › General › Language), bogga shayga wuxuu tusaa kuwaas, magaca uu soo saaraha siiyay ayaa hoosta yaal, \u003Cstrong\u003EPlace\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna moodelka ku qoraa magaca luqadaada, si liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E u muujiyo sidaas. Shayga waa isla shay: hubinta cusboonaysiinta iyo beddelka waxa lagu ogaadaa shayga laftiisa, weligeed magaciisa ma aha. Shayada aan tarjumaadda lahayn waxay hayaan erayadooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanka dhigista ma jiro.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma furna moodeel IFC. Marka hore fur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGhost-ku ma raacayo mouse-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Mouse-ku wuxuu ka baxay aagga moodelka, ama diyaarada dabaqa ma muuqato. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiga ku dhufo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay ma jiro darbiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Dabaqa IFC-ga ma leh darbiyo (qaar soo saarid darbiyada dabaq kale ayay dhigaan). Dooro dabaqaas, ama ku qor X iyo Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShayada faylka cabbirkoodu khaldan yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku ma leh unitiyo ama wuxuu sheegaa kuwo khaldan. Ku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayloota…\u003C/span\u003E dooro unitiyada oo mar kale akhri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay isku mid ah labo jeer dhigida waxay wadaagaan hal nooc IFC, sidaas darteed moodeel leh afartan kursi ayaa kursiga hal mar kaydiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Shay maktabad ah geli moodeel IFC: sink, miis shaqo, kursi. BimCraft wuxuu u qoraa sida element IFC oo sax ah oo nooc leh, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta oo shayga isku mid ah wuxuu wadaagaa hal set oo geometry ah, xogtiisa, lambarka shayga iyo liisanka ayaa sidoo kale socda. Tallaabooyin Fur moodeel IFC. Guji tab-ka Maktabad ee ku dhow Sifooyinka midig, ama Maktabad qalabka kor ku yaal moodeelka. Dooro il: Built-in symbols: astaamaha qorshaha tuubada ee guud oo ku jira BimCraft oo leh Apache-2.0, oo offline ku shaqeeya. Hubi cabbirradooda ka hor dhismaha. Astaamaha korontada qorshaha iyo qalabka koronto ee IFC, isticmaal Dhismaha › Koronto. Library: maktabadda CadCraft ee bogan. Shayada dadweynaha ma u baahna gelitaan. This file: bloogyada fayl DWG ama DXF ah ee furan. Bloog dynamic oo leh xaaladaha muuqaalka waa la siiyaa mar kasta oo xaalad ah, magac ahaan \"Sink: Double bowl\", mid kasta oo keliya tirada xaalada ayaa la rasmeeyay. Fayloota…: fayl DWG, DXF, IFC, glTF/GLB, OBJ, RFA ama CSV ah oo kombuyuutarkaaga ku jira. Waxa lagu akhriyaa tabkan; waxba lama soo rarayo. Other feeds: maktabad kale oo isticmaalaysa isla qaabka feed-ka. Ku dar cinwaankeeda hal mar; waa la kaydiyaa browser-kan. Raadi ama dooro qaybta, kadibna guji kaarka. Kaarku wuxuu muujiyaa muuqaal qorshaha, magaca, soo saaraha iyo moodelka, liisanka iyo nooca. Guji Ku dhig qorshaha (aragtida Plan) ama Ku dhig moodeelka (aragtida 3D). Marka Kala jar ay muuqdaan qorshaha iyo 3D labaduba, badhanku waa badhan kala qaybsan: ficilka ugu weyn waa Ku dhig qorshaha, fallaadhda midigta ah waxay furaysaa liis leh Ku dhig moodeelka. Ama jiid kaarka, ama sawirka faahfaahinta shayga, qorshaha ama 3D: shayga waxa lagu dhigaa meesha aad ka sii dayso. Qalin ama farta, riix oo hay kaarka wakhti yar, kadibna jiid. Dooro dabaqa qalabka dhigista. Aragtida 3D, dabaqyada ka sarreeya waa la qariyaa intaad dhigayso, muuqaalkuna wuxuu u leexdaa sare; qorshaha, dabaqaas ayuu horeba u muujinayaa. Dooro Ku dhig moodeelka qorshaha keliya wuxuu keenaa aragtida 3D oo ku dhinac taal. Ku dhaq sare moodelka: sanduuq aan iftiin lahayn ayaa tusaya meesha shayga aado. Riix R si aad u leexiso 90°. Riix Tab (ama Darbiga ku dhufo) si aad dambeeda ugu dhejiso darbiga ugu dhow, u soo jeedisa qolka. Guji si aad u dhigto. Ama ku qor booska X, Y (mm), tusaale 1200, 3400, kadibna riix Enter. Iftiin ama wax kale oo laga xidho sare: deji Mount oo ah At the ceiling. Sare shayga wuxuu ku dhacaa hoosta saqafka meesha (ama heerka dabaqa meelaha aan saqaf lahayn). Haddii qorshe saqaf ah uu furan yahay aragtida qorshaha, Mount wuxuu bilaabaa At the ceiling. Ka jawaab hal su'aal: lambarka shayga (lambarka xor ee xiga ayaa la buuxiyaa), tirada iyo qoraalka. Riix Enter. Dhig wax dheeraad ah, ama riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Guji U kaydi sida IFC si aad u soo deystid nuqulka la tafatiray. Qorshaha ama moodeelka Badhanka dhigista ee Maktabadda wuxuu raacaa aragtida aad ku jirto, wuuna beddelaa markaad beddesho aragtida (Qorshe, Kala jar iyo 3D badhamada, furayaasha, ama marka fayl la furo). Qorshe wuxuu muujiyaa hal badhan, Ku dhig qorshaha; 3D wuxuu muujiyaa hal badhan, Ku dhig moodeelka; Kala jar wuxuu muujiyaa badhanka kala qaybsan, oo leh Ku dhig qorshaha ficilka ugu weyn iyo Ku dhig moodeelka liiskiisa. Labada habba isla qalabka dhigista ayay isticmaalaan oo isla element IFC ayay qoraan: mouse-ku wuxuu shaqeeyaa aragtida qorshaha mid ahaan, aragtida 3D mid kale. Riix Esc waqti kasta si aad u joojiso. Jiidista kaarka ma leh fure u gaar ah: badhanka kala qaybsan ama badhanka caadiga ah ayaa sameeya isla shayga furayaasha. Guuri ama leexi shay la dhigay Dhismaha Sawir dhexdiisa, dooro shayga qorshaha. Calaamad yar oo afar-geesle ah ayaa muujinaysa barta gelinta, iyo calaamad goobaan ah oo ku xigta. Jiid shayga, ama calaamadda afar-geesle, si aad u guurto. Wuxuu la dhaqmaa sida qalabka Darbiga (geesaha iyo dhinacyada darbiyada); Shift wuxuu ka dhigaa mid toosan dhinaca uu ahaa. Jiid calaamadda goobaanka si aad u leexiso 15° tallaabo kasta. Hay Shift tallaabo 1° ah. Riix R si aad u leexiso 90°. Properties (sidoo kale aragtida 3D), ku qor X, Y iyo Rotation (°), ama guji Turn 90°. Guuri kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah, wuxuuna u socdaa Live TeamWork. Shayga wuxuu sii hayaa lambarkiisa, xogta maktabadda iyo dhererka uu kor ka yaal dabaqa. Weli lama dhisin: jiidista aragtida 3D. Waxa aad arki lahayd Shayga moodeelka ku jira, la doortay, oo leh guddiga sifooyinkiisa midig: sanduuq Library item oo leh liisanka iyo sheegista, iyo set-yada CadCraft_Placement, CadCraft_LibraryItem, CadCraft_Equipment iyo, shayada laga soo qaatay qorshayaasha calaamadaysan, CadCraft_SourceAttributes. \"La dhigay: item (shay n)\" liiska isbeddelka. Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda. Status line: \"La dhigay item sida shay n.\" Waxa muhiim ah Qaar ka mid ah shayada waxay leeyihiin dhowr cabbir ama ikhtiyaar: kaarku wuxuu leeyahay doorasho Variant, shayga aad dooratid ayaa la dhigaa. Eeg Dhig oo beddel shay maktabad leh variants. Shay aan 3D body lahayn (astaamo 2D ah) waa lagu dhigaa sanduuq ku meel mariyaha ah; markii la weydiiyo waa inaad siiso dhererkiisa. Wax la mid ah: dooro shay la dhigay oo isticmaal Koobiyee iyo Dhaji, ama Ctrl+D. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo ku soo celi shayada maktabadda. Si aad u bilowdo dhig kasta oo wall snap ah, deji Start with wall snap on ee BimCraft settings. Dherer kasta waa la beddelaa unitiyada moodeelka, ha ahaadaan wax kasta. Entourage (geedo, dhir, dad, gaadiid) ayaa sidoo kale maktabadda ku jira: raadi \"tree\", \"person\" ama \"car\". Kuwanu waxa rasmeeya CadCraft (CC0) oo midabkooda ayay ilaaliyaan marka la dhigo (jidh bunni, caleemo cagaar, daaqadaha gaadiidka oo muuqda), BimCraft iyo barnaamijyada BIM kale. Waxay ku muuqdaan sawirada la rendered-gareeyay. Faylka IFC2X3 jidhka waxa loo qoraa sida solid aad u fiiqan; IFC4 sida triangulated face set. Labadoodaba waxay ku furmaan qalabka IFC kale. Sawirka (DWG ama DXF) halkan lama kaydin karo, sidaas darteed shayada waxa lagu dhigaa moodeelada IFC oo keliya. Isticmaal This file sawirka si aad u aragto bloogyadiisa waxa ay noqon lahayd. Shayada luqaddaada Shay wuxuu leeyahay magac, sharraxaad iyo nooc luqado kale. Marka ay ku jiraan luqadda BimCraft loo dejiyay (Settings › General › Language), bogga shayga wuxuu tusaa kuwaas, magaca uu soo saaraha siiyay ayaa hoosta yaal, Place wuxuuna moodelka ku qoraa magaca luqadaada, si liiska Qalabka u muujiyo sidaas. Shayga waa isla shay: hubinta cusboonaysiinta iyo beddelka waxa lagu ogaadaa shayga laftiisa, weligeed magaciisa ma aha. Shayada aan tarjumaadda lahayn waxay hayaan erayadooda. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Badhanka dhigista ma jiro. Ma furna moodeel IFC. Marka hore fur. Ghost-ku ma raacayo mouse-ka. Mouse-ku wuxuu ka baxay aagga moodelka, ama diyaarada dabaqa ma muuqato. Guji Sare. Darbiga ku dhufo wuxuu leeyahay ma jiro darbiyo. Dabaqa IFC-ga ma leh darbiyo (qaar soo saarid darbiyada dabaq kale ayay dhigaan). Dooro dabaqaas, ama ku qor X iyo Y. Shayada faylka cabbirkoodu khaldan yahay. Faylku ma leh unitiyo ama wuxuu sheegaa kuwo khaldan. Ku Fayloota… dooro unitiyada oo mar kale akhri. Shay isku mid ah labo jeer dhigida waxay wadaagaan hal nooc IFC, sidaas darteed moodeel leh afartan kursi ayaa kursiga hal mar kaydiya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"swap-and-update-library-items","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Beddel shay la dhigay, oo cusboonaysii shayada maktabadda","summary":"Beddel hal shay oo maktabad ah oo la dhigay oo mid kale ku beddel iyadoo haysa meeshiisa iyo lambarkiisa shayga, oo hubi Maktabadda nooca cusub ee wax kasta oo ku jira moodelka.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["swap","replace","substitute","update","newer version","check for updates","library","withdrawn","license change","item number","beddel","bedel","cusboonaysii","nooca cusub","maktabad","lambarka shayga"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"beddel-hal-shay","text":"Beddel hal shay","level":2},{"id":"hubi-cusboonaysiinta","text":"Hubi cusboonaysiinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel fikirkaaga ku saabsan shay adigoo aan mar kale u guurin, oo hay shayada maktabadda ee moodelka cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-hal-shay\"\u003EBeddel hal shay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix shay maktabad ah oo la dhigay ee moodelka ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sifooyinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary item\u003C/strong\u003E. Taabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E ayaa furmaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel shayga cusub oo riix kaarkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap … to this\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxaha waxay haysaa meeshiisa, leexashadiisa, dabaqiisa, lambarkiisa shayga, tirada iyo qoraalladiisa. Nooceeda, qaabkeeda iyo xogta shayga ayaa u beddelma shayga cusub. Walxaha la dhigay isla siyaabo ah waxay wadaagaan nooc isku mid ah, sida markaad dhigayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay leh kala duwanaansho (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/library-variants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/library-variants\"\u003EPlace and swap a library item that has variants\u003C/a\u003E) waxay soo bandhigaa kala duwanaanshaheeda kale korka taabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E markaad beddelayso: hal riix oo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka shayga cusub uu yahay nooc kale oo shay, tusaale ahaan miiska meesha lagu beddelayo dhaqan, fasalka IFC ee walxaha ayaa u beddelma si u habboon (halkan wuxuu ka beddelmayaa furniture element ilaa sanitary terminal), si barnaamijyada kale ay u qorsheeyaan sax ah. Waxay sii ahaanaysaa isla walxaha, isla GlobalId-ga, sidaas darteed xidhiidhyada ku xiran waxay sii shaqeeyaan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa fasalkii hore ee shayga hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-cusboonaysiinta\"\u003EHubi cusboonaysiinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdates\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa shayga maktabadda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri liiska: shay kasta oo maktabad ah ee moodelka ku jira, nooca uu moodelka ku leeyahay, nooca ugu dambeeya iyo xaalad: \u003Cstrong\u003EUp to date\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENewer version\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWithdrawn\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENot found\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu sidoo kale sheegayaa waxa isbeddelay (qaabka, xogta, liisanka ama hagaajinta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate\u003C/span\u003E safka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate all\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Updated \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E placements. Places, item numbers, quantities and notes are kept.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafafka &quot;Updated: \u003Cem\u003Eitem\u003C/em\u003E&quot; ee liiska isbeddelka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa mid kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya shayada ka imanaya Maktabadda ayaa la hubin karaa. Shayada faylalka ka imanaya ma leh aqoonsiga maktabadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka liisanku isbeddelo, nuqulka aad hore u dhigtay wuxuu sii haynayaa liisankii uu ku yimid ilaa aad cusboonaysiiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay \u003Cstrong\u003EWithdrawn\u003C/strong\u003E looma soo jeediyo dhigitaanno cusub. Mid laga soo qaaday sababo xuquuqda kopiga ah ma soo dejisan karo; ku beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala duwanaanshaha la dhigay wuxuu sii ahaanayaa kaas haddii nooca cusub ee shayga uu weli leeyahay; haddii kale wuxuu qaadanayaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee shayga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubinta waxay diraa kaliya aqoonsiyada shayga iyo noocyada, marna ma diro moodelkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Beddel fikirkaaga ku saabsan shay adigoo aan mar kale u guurin, oo hay shayada maktabadda ee moodelka cusub. Beddel hal shay Riix shay maktabad ah oo la dhigay ee moodelka ku jira. Ku sifooyinka Properties, riix Swap item… sanduuqa Library item. Taabka Library ayaa furmaya. Hel shayga cusub oo riix kaarkiisa. Riix Swap … to this. Walxaha waxay haysaa meeshiisa, leexashadiisa, dabaqiisa, lambarkiisa shayga, tirada iyo qoraalladiisa. Nooceeda, qaabkeeda iyo xogta shayga ayaa u beddelma shayga cusub. Walxaha la dhigay isla siyaabo ah waxay wadaagaan nooc isku mid ah, sida markaad dhigayso. Shay leh kala duwanaansho (eeg Place and swap a library item that has variants) waxay soo bandhigaa kala duwanaanshaheeda kale korka taabka Library markaad beddelayso: hal riix oo kasta. Marka shayga cusub uu yahay nooc kale oo shay, tusaale ahaan miiska meesha lagu beddelayo dhaqan, fasalka IFC ee walxaha ayaa u beddelma si u habboon (halkan wuxuu ka beddelmayaa furniture element ilaa sanitary terminal), si barnaamijyada kale ay u qorsheeyaan sax ah. Waxay sii ahaanaysaa isla walxaha, isla GlobalId-ga, sidaas darteed xidhiidhyada ku xiran waxay sii shaqeeyaan. Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa fasalkii hore ee shayga hore. Hubi cusboonaysiinta Riix Updates qalabka sare (ama Check for updates sanduuqa shayga maktabadda). Akhri liiska: shay kasta oo maktabad ah ee moodelka ku jira, nooca uu moodelka ku leeyahay, nooca ugu dambeeya iyo xaalad: Up to date, Newer version, Withdrawn ama Not found. Wuxuu sidoo kale sheegayaa waxa isbeddelay (qaabka, xogta, liisanka ama hagaajinta). Riix Update safka, ama Update all. Waxa aad arki lahayd \"Updated n placements. Places, item numbers, quantities and notes are kept.\" Safafka \"Updated: item\" ee liiska isbeddelka. Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa mid kasta. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Kaliya shayada ka imanaya Maktabadda ayaa la hubin karaa. Shayada faylalka ka imanaya ma leh aqoonsiga maktabadda. Marka liisanku isbeddelo, nuqulka aad hore u dhigtay wuxuu sii haynayaa liisankii uu ku yimid ilaa aad cusboonaysiiso. Shay Withdrawn looma soo jeediyo dhigitaanno cusub. Mid laga soo qaaday sababo xuquuqda kopiga ah ma soo dejisan karo; ku beddel Swap item…. Kala duwanaanshaha la dhigay wuxuu sii ahaanayaa kaas haddii nooca cusub ee shayga uu weli leeyahay; haddii kale wuxuu qaadanayaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee shayga. Hubinta waxay diraa kaliya aqoonsiyada shayga iyo noocyada, marna ma diro moodelkaaga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"add-ons-in-your-file","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Kordhinta ay faylkaagu isticmaalo","summary":"Qoraalada BimCraft ee faylka IFC oo sheegaya kordhinta ku qortay, wuxuuna kugu soo bandhigaa kuwa aad ka maqan tahay markaad furayso.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["kordhin","addon","faylkan wuxuu isticmaalaa","kordhin maqan","trusscraft","maktabad","diiwaan","cadcraft_addons"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-ay-samaynaysa","text":"Waxa ay samaynaysa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ay-samaynaysa\"\u003EWaxa ay samaynaysa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii kordhin uu qoro moodelka (tusaale, buundo ama xariiq tuubooyin), BimCraft wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kordhinta iyo nooca ay leedahay mashruuca IFC, oo ku jira set-ka sifada ee magaciisu yahay CadCraft_AddOns. Diiwaanka waxa lagu qoraa isla tallaabada tafatirka ee kordhinta, sidaas darteed markaad ka noqoto isbedelka, diiwaanka ayaa sidoo kale la qaadayaa. Barnaamijyada kale set-ka sifada way iska indho tiraan; wixii kordhinta sawirtay ayaa faylka ku sii jira labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur fayl IFC oo kordhin uu ka caawiyay in la sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii kordhin uu isticmaalay aanu shid ahayn, qoraal ka sare moodelka ayaa sheegaya kuwa, oo leh badhan lagu ku darayo maktabadda akoonkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar iyaga, ama xir qoraalka. Moodelka ayaa furmaya labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraal ma muuqdo.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma seegin akoonkaaga tabkan, ama faylku ma hayo diiwaan (waxaa la sameeyay ka hor diiwaannada, ama barnaamij kale ayuu sameeyay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska isbedelada wuxuu leeyahay &quot;undefined&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Waa la saxay: hadda sumadaha waxay muujinayaan magaca kordhinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EKu dhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa ay samaynaysa Markii kordhin uu qoro moodelka (tusaale, buundo ama xariiq tuubooyin), BimCraft wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kordhinta iyo nooca ay leedahay mashruuca IFC, oo ku jira set-ka sifada ee magaciisu yahay CadCraft_AddOns. Diiwaanka waxa lagu qoraa isla tallaabada tafatirka ee kordhinta, sidaas darteed markaad ka noqoto isbedelka, diiwaanka ayaa sidoo kale la qaadayaa. Barnaamijyada kale set-ka sifada way iska indho tiraan; wixii kordhinta sawirtay ayaa faylka ku sii jira labadaba. Tallaabooyin Fur fayl IFC oo kordhin uu ka caawiyay in la sameeyo. Haddii kordhin uu isticmaalay aanu shid ahayn, qoraal ka sare moodelka ayaa sheegaya kuwa, oo leh badhan lagu ku darayo maktabadda akoonkaaga. Ku dar iyaga, ama xir qoraalka. Moodelka ayaa furmaya labadaba. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Qoraal ma muuqdo. Ma seegin akoonkaaga tabkan, ama faylku ma hayo diiwaan (waxaa la sameeyay ka hor diiwaannada, ama barnaamij kale ayuu sameeyay). Liiska isbedelada wuxuu leeyahay \"undefined\". Waa la saxay: hadda sumadaha waxay muujinayaan magaca kordhinta. Xiga Ku dhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plant-list","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhig dhirta Maktabadda","summary":"Dooro dhir ka soo qaad ilaha Plants ee Maktabadda, oo leh astaamaheeda qorshaha iyo cabbirkeeda marka uu gaaro, oo ku dhig moodeelka.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["dhirta","geedaha","dhirta yar","beerta","noocyada","liiska dhirta","maktabad","cc0","astaamo","cabbirka marka uu gaaro"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd","text":"Waxa aad arki lahayd","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhir geli moodeelka dhismaha. Ilaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhirta\u003C/span\u003E ee Maktabadda wuxuu liistaa qiyaastii 400 dhir oo ay qortay CadCraft (CC0), mid kasta oo leh astaamaha qorshaha iyo cabbirka uu marka uu gaaro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E midig oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhirta\u003C/span\u003E sida ilaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadi ama dooro dhir, kadibna dhig sida aad shay maktabad kasta u dhigto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-lahayd\"\u003EWaxa aad arki lahayd\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska wuxuu ka imanayaa Maktabadda markaad online tahay, sidaas darteed dhirta lagu daray halkaas ayay soo muuqan doonaan. Offline, ama haddii Maktabada aan la gaari karin, BimCraft wuxuu muujinayaa liiska dhirta uu la socdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhir kasta wuxuu hayaa magaciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo liisankiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalab iyo alaab laga soo qaatay maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhir geli moodeelka dhismaha. Ilaha Dhirta ee Maktabadda wuxuu liistaa qiyaastii 400 dhir oo ay qortay CadCraft (CC0), mid kasta oo leh astaamaha qorshaha iyo cabbirka uu marka uu gaaro. Tallaabooyin Fur Maktabad midig oo dooro Dhirta sida ilaha. Raadi ama dooro dhir, kadibna dhig sida aad shay maktabad kasta u dhigto. Waxa aad arki lahayd Liiska wuxuu ka imanayaa Maktabadda markaad online tahay, sidaas darteed dhirta lagu daray halkaas ayay soo muuqan doonaan. Offline, ama haddii Maktabada aan la gaari karin, BimCraft wuxuu muujinayaa liiska dhirta uu la socdo. Dhir kasta wuxuu hayaa magaciisa, cabbirkiisa iyo liisankiisa. Xiga Dhig qalab iyo alaab laga soo qaatay maktabadda","lang":"so"},{"slug":"library-credits","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Liiska tixraacyada maktabadda iyo soo gal maktabadda","summary":"Arag walxaha maktabadda ee moodeel kasta lagu isticmaalay, oo leh liisankooda iyo tixraacooda, nuqul ka samee tixraacyada ama soo deji jadwalka, oo soo gal si aad u aragto walxaha kooxdaada.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["tixraac","tixraacyo","liisanka","cc by","cc0","copyright","maktabadda kooxda","soo gal","ku xidh","token","jadwalka qalabka","CSV"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tixraacyada-maktabadda","text":"Tixraacyada maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"jadwalka-qalabka-ee-moodeelka","text":"Jadwalka qalabka ee moodeelka","level":2},{"id":"soo-gal-maktabadda","text":"Soo gal maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sii tixraac meesha liisanku codsado, oo gaar ahaan u gaar ah walxaha maktabadda kooxdaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tixraacyada-maktabadda\"\u003ETixraacyada maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECredits\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri liiska: walax kasta oo la isticmaalay, nooceeda, liisankeeda, tixraaceeda iyo lambarrada walxaha ee loo dhigay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy credits\u003C/span\u003E si aad u koobiyeysid tixraacyada, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV with the schedule\u003C/span\u003E oo ah spreadsheet ah dhigida kasta iyo tixraaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiisanka iyo tixraaca waxaa sidoo kale lagu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E markaad doorato walax la dhigay, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa IFC (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E), sidaas darteed waxay la socdaan faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalka-qalabka-ee-moodeelka\"\u003EJadwalka qalabka ee moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka. Jadwalka waxaa laga dhisay walxaha maktabadda ee la dhigay: lambarka walxa, tirada, magaca, soo-saaraha, moodelka, xogta korontada iyo biyo-mareenka, oo kooxaysan dabaqa. Waxaa la soo dejiyaa CSV la mid ah kan jadwalka sawirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-gal-maktabadda\"\u003ESoo gal maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in to the library\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa mogaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo gal haddii la weydiiyo, kadibna guji \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect\u003C/strong\u003E. Daaqadu waxay BimCraft siinaysaa furaha maktabada, waadna xidhi kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Waa lagu soo galay maktabada&quot; oo ku taal sare liiska Maktabada. Walxaha kooxdaada waxay ku muuqanayaan dhinaca walxaha dadweynaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha aad dhigto waxaa la diiwaan geliyaa inay la isticmaaleen, si maktabadu u sheegi karto markay isbedelaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuraha waxaa lagu hayaa tab-kan oo keliya, wuuna dhammaadaa markaad xirto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForget sign-in\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBogga amniga akoonkaaga wuxuu liiskaa furaha sida &quot;BimCraft library (browser)&quot;; halkaas ka laabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba oo ku saabsan moodeelkaaga lama diro: kaliya waxaa la diraa walxaha maktabadda aad dhigtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ku sii tixraac meesha liisanku codsado, oo gaar ahaan u gaar ah walxaha maktabadda kooxdaada. Tixraacyada maktabadda Fur moodeelka. Guji Credits toolbar-ka. Akhri liiska: walax kasta oo la isticmaalay, nooceeda, liisankeeda, tixraaceeda iyo lambarrada walxaha ee loo dhigay. Guji Copy credits si aad u koobiyeysid tixraacyada, ama CSV with the schedule oo ah spreadsheet ah dhigida kasta iyo tixraaceeda. Liisanka iyo tixraaca waxaa sidoo kale lagu muujiyaa Sifooyinka markaad doorato walax la dhigay, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa IFC (CadCraft_LibraryItem), sidaas darteed waxay la socdaan faylka. Jadwalka qalabka ee moodeelka Guji Equipment toolbar-ka. Jadwalka waxaa laga dhisay walxaha maktabadda ee la dhigay: lambarka walxa, tirada, magaca, soo-saaraha, moodelka, xogta korontada iyo biyo-mareenka, oo kooxaysan dabaqa. Waxaa la soo dejiyaa CSV la mid ah kan jadwalka sawirka. Soo gal maktabadda Tab-ka Library, dooro Maktabad. Guji Sign in to the library. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa mogaca. Soo gal haddii la weydiiyo, kadibna guji Connect. Daaqadu waxay BimCraft siinaysaa furaha maktabada, waadna xidhi kartaa. Waxa aad arki doontid \"Waa lagu soo galay maktabada\" oo ku taal sare liiska Maktabada. Walxaha kooxdaada waxay ku muuqanayaan dhinaca walxaha dadweynaha. Walxaha aad dhigto waxaa la diiwaan geliyaa inay la isticmaaleen, si maktabadu u sheegi karto markay isbedelaan. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Furaha waxaa lagu hayaa tab-kan oo keliya, wuuna dhammaadaa markaad xirto. Forget sign-in wuxuu ka saaraa hore. Bogga amniga akoonkaaga wuxuu liiskaa furaha sida \"BimCraft library (browser)\"; halkaas ka laabo. Waxba oo ku saabsan moodeelkaaga lama diro: kaliya waxaa la diraa walxaha maktabadda aad dhigtay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"library-variants","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dhig oo beddel walxa maktabadda leh kala duwanaansho","summary":"Qaar ka mid ah walxaha maktabadda waxay yimaadaan cabbirro ama ikhtiyaarro badan. Dooro kala duwanaanshaha ka hor inta aanad dhigin, arag kala duwanaanshaha walax la dhigay, beddelo mid kale hal-guji, oo ilaali markii walxa la cusbooneysiiyo.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["kala duwanaansho","cabbirro","ikhtiyaarro","qaabeyn","maktabad","librarycraft","dhig","beddel","qaabeeye","qoys","nooc","cusbooneysii","ports"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"dooro-kala-duwanaanshaha-oo-dhig","text":"Dooro kala duwanaanshaha oo dhig","level":2},{"id":"arag-kala-duwanaanshaha-walax-la-dhigay","text":"Arag kala duwanaanshaha walax la dhigay","level":2},{"id":"beddel-kala-duwanaansho-kale","text":"Beddel kala duwanaansho kale","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-dhaji-iyo-cusbooneysiin","text":"Koobiyee, dhaji iyo cusbooneysiin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig walxa maktabadda ee cabbirka ama ikhtiyaarka aad u baahan tahay, oo ka beddel markaad isbedesho adigoon mar kale dhigin. Walax leh kala duwanaansho waa hal walax maktabadda ah (hal magac, hal liisan, hal nooc) oo leh miis kala duwanaanshaha ay ku jiraan: tusaale ahaan saxan dhejin oo ah Yar, Dhexe iyo Weyn, ama isla saxanka aan godo lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-kala-duwanaanshaha-oo-dhig\"\u003EDooro kala duwanaanshaha oo dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E oo guji kaarka walxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta magaca, doorashada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E waxay liistaa kala duwanaansho kasta oo cabbirkeeda leh. Walxa caadiga ah ayaa marka hore la doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mid. Qorshaha, cabbirka iyo safka jidhka 3D waxay raacaan doorashadaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace in plan\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace in model\u003C/span\u003E aragta 3D) oo dhig sida walax kasta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalaxda la dhigay waxaa loo magacaabaa walxa iyo kala duwanaanshaha, tusaale ahaan \u003Cem\u003ESaxanka dhejinta — Large\u003C/em\u003E, si liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEquipment\u003C/span\u003E iyo geedku u kala saaraan. Kala duwanaansho kasta waa nooc IFC gaar ah: dhigida isla kala duwanaansho labo jeer waxay wadaagtaa hal nooc, kala duwanaansho kale nooc u gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arag-kala-duwanaanshaha-walax-la-dhigay\"\u003EArag kala duwanaanshaha walax la dhigay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro walxa la dhigay. Sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWalxa maktabadda\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay sadar \u003Cstrong\u003EKala duwanaansho\u003C/strong\u003E. IFC wuxuu ku kaydiyaa \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_LibraryItem\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003EVariant\u003C/code\u003E (aqoonsiga kala duwanaanshaha), \u003Ccode\u003EVariantName\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EVariantValues\u003C/code\u003E (qiyamka ikhtiyaarka, qoraal ahaan), si barnaamijyada kale ay u akhriyi karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-kala-duwanaansho-kale\"\u003EBeddel kala duwanaansho kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro walxa la dhigay oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwap item…\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWalxa maktabadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E ayaa furmaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESare, \u003Cstrong\u003EKala duwanaanshaha kale ee\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cem\u003Ewalxa\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu liistaa kala duwanaansho kasta oo cabbirkeeda leh. Midka la dhigay waa la calaamadiyay oo looma dooran karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji Beddel u … kala duwanaanshaha aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalaxdu waxay haysaa meeshaa, jihadeeda, dabaqa, lambarka walxa, tirada iyo qoraalada; nooceeda, qaabkeeda iyo xogteeda ayaa isbedelaya kala duwanaanshaha kale. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa tii hore. Waxaad weli dooran kartaa walxa kale liiska hoose sida hore: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/swap-and-update-library-items\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/swap-and-update-library-items\"\u003EBeddel walxa la dhigay, oo cusbooneysii walxaha maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-dhaji-iyo-cusbooneysiin\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo cusbooneysiin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka kala duwanaansho la dhigay waa isla kala duwanaanshaha: moodeelkan, iyo moodeel kale oo furan tab-ka browser-ka isla, nuqul ahaan (Koobiyee iyo Dhaji).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECusbooneysiinta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ilaalisaa kala duwanaanshaha: haddii nooca cusub ee walxa uu wali leeyahay, dhigidu waxay noqonaysaa kala duwanaanshahaas nooca cusub. Haddii nooca cusub aanu weli lahayn, dhigidu waxay qaadaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee walxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaano\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha qaarkood oo keliya ayaa kala duwanaansho leh. Kaararku ma sheegin; waxaad aragtaa doorashada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVariant\u003C/span\u003E markaad furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalax wuxuu liisan karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eports\u003C/strong\u003E (dhibcaha xidhiidhka ee tuubooyinka iyo duct-yada) kala duwanaansho kasta. Tab-ka Maktabadda wuxuu muujiyaa inta uu leeyahay. Weli ma gelinayaan IFC markaad walxa ka dhigto tab-ka Maktabadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala duwanaansho aan lahayn jidh 3D waxa lagu dhigaa sanduuq beddel ah, sida calaamad 2D kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirrada doorashada waa millimeters, sida maktabadu u qorto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhig walxa maktabadda ee cabbirka ama ikhtiyaarka aad u baahan tahay, oo ka beddel markaad isbedesho adigoon mar kale dhigin. Walax leh kala duwanaansho waa hal walax maktabadda ah (hal magac, hal liisan, hal nooc) oo leh miis kala duwanaanshaha ay ku jiraan: tusaale ahaan saxan dhejin oo ah Yar, Dhexe iyo Weyn, ama isla saxanka aan godo lahayn. Dooro kala duwanaanshaha oo dhig Fur tab-ka Library oo guji kaarka walxa. Hoosta magaca, doorashada Variant waxay liistaa kala duwanaansho kasta oo cabbirkeeda leh. Walxa caadiga ah ayaa marka hore la doortaa. Dooro mid. Qorshaha, cabbirka iyo safka jidhka 3D waxay raacaan doorashadaada. Guji Place in plan (ama Place in model aragta 3D) oo dhig sida walax kasta: eeg Dhig qalabka iyo alaabta maktabadda. Walaxda la dhigay waxaa loo magacaabaa walxa iyo kala duwanaanshaha, tusaale ahaan Saxanka dhejinta — Large, si liiska Equipment iyo geedku u kala saaraan. Kala duwanaansho kasta waa nooc IFC gaar ah: dhigida isla kala duwanaansho labo jeer waxay wadaagtaa hal nooc, kala duwanaansho kale nooc u gaar ah. Arag kala duwanaanshaha walax la dhigay Dooro walxa la dhigay. Sanduuqa Walxa maktabadda ee Sifooyinka wuxuu leeyahay sadar Kala duwanaansho. IFC wuxuu ku kaydiyaa CadCraft_LibraryItem: Variant (aqoonsiga kala duwanaanshaha), VariantName iyo VariantValues (qiyamka ikhtiyaarka, qoraal ahaan), si barnaamijyada kale ay u akhriyi karaan. Beddel kala duwanaansho kale Dooro walxa la dhigay oo guji Swap item… sanduuqa Walxa maktabadda. Tab-ka Library ayaa furmaya. Sare, Kala duwanaanshaha kale ee walxa wuxuu liistaa kala duwanaansho kasta oo cabbirkeeda leh. Midka la dhigay waa la calaamadiyay oo looma dooran karo. Guji Beddel u … kala duwanaanshaha aad rabto. Walaxdu waxay haysaa meeshaa, jihadeeda, dabaqa, lambarka walxa, tirada iyo qoraalada; nooceeda, qaabkeeda iyo xogteeda ayaa isbedelaya kala duwanaanshaha kale. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa tii hore. Waxaad weli dooran kartaa walxa kale liiska hoose sida hore: eeg Beddel walxa la dhigay, oo cusbooneysii walxaha maktabadda. Koobiyee, dhaji iyo cusbooneysiin Nuqulka kala duwanaansho la dhigay waa isla kala duwanaanshaha: moodeelkan, iyo moodeel kale oo furan tab-ka browser-ka isla, nuqul ahaan (Koobiyee iyo Dhaji). Cusbooneysiinta waxay ilaalisaa kala duwanaanshaha: haddii nooca cusub ee walxa uu wali leeyahay, dhigidu waxay noqonaysaa kala duwanaanshahaas nooca cusub. Haddii nooca cusub aanu weli lahayn, dhigidu waxay qaadaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee walxa. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaano Walxaha qaarkood oo keliya ayaa kala duwanaansho leh. Kaararku ma sheegin; waxaad aragtaa doorashada Variant markaad furto. Walax wuxuu liisan karaa ports (dhibcaha xidhiidhka ee tuubooyinka iyo duct-yada) kala duwanaansho kasta. Tab-ka Maktabadda wuxuu muujiyaa inta uu leeyahay. Weli ma gelinayaan IFC markaad walxa ka dhigto tab-ka Maktabadda. Kala duwanaansho aan lahayn jidh 3D waxa lagu dhigaa sanduuq beddel ah, sida calaamad 2D kasta. Cabbirrada doorashada waa millimeters, sida maktabadu u qorto.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"undo-across-apps","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka noqo barnaamijyada oo dhan gudaha CadCraft Studio","summary":"Gudaha Studio, BimCraft wuxuu u sheegaa Studio tallaabo kasta oo dhammaysay, si Studio u ka noqon karo tallaabadaadii ugu dambaysay daaqadda aad ugu shaqaysay ugu dambayntii.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["ka noqo","studio","barnaamijyada oo dhan","ka noqo mashruuca","taariikh","joornaal","daaqad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-sameeyo","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sameeyo\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha CadCraft Studio, daaqad kasta oo barnaamij ah wuxuu Studio u sheegaa marka tallaabo la dhammeeyo (geed la sawiro, ama walxo la aqbalo oo laga helay scan). Studio tallaabooyinka ayuu ku kaydiyaa siduu u dhacay, wuxuuna ka codsan karaa daaqadda samaysay tallaabada ugu dambeysa inay ka noqoto, isagoo isticmaalaya ka noqoshada daaqadaas. Ctrl+Z gudaha BimCraft wuxuu sii ahaanayaa kan BimCraft, waxaana Studio loo sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio wuxuu codsadaa daaqad inay ka noqoto kaliya marka liistayada ka noqoshadeeda ay tahay sidii tallaabadu ka tagtay. Ka dib Save (taas oo bilaabta liis isbeddel cusub), ama ka dib markaad beddesho moodeelka aad tafatirayso, BimCraft wuxuu jawaabaa in liiska uu guuray, Studio wuu daaqaddaas ka gudbaa. Waxba lagama qasbo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaameynta hal barnaamij barnaamij kale ka noqoshadeeda lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa baxsan Studio waxba ma isbeddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu-ga Studio ee codsada ka noqoshada wuxuu la socdaa dhismaha Studio; ilaa markaas tallaabooyinka waa la sheegaa, laakiin ma jiro menu-ga isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/work-live\"\u003ESi toos ah ula shaqee kuwa kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo Gudaha CadCraft Studio, daaqad kasta oo barnaamij ah wuxuu Studio u sheegaa marka tallaabo la dhammeeyo (geed la sawiro, ama walxo la aqbalo oo laga helay scan). Studio tallaabooyinka ayuu ku kaydiyaa siduu u dhacay, wuxuuna ka codsan karaa daaqadda samaysay tallaabada ugu dambeysa inay ka noqoto, isagoo isticmaalaya ka noqoshada daaqadaas. Ctrl+Z gudaha BimCraft wuxuu sii ahaanayaa kan BimCraft, waxaana Studio loo sheegaa. Waxa aad ogaataa Studio wuxuu codsadaa daaqad inay ka noqoto kaliya marka liistayada ka noqoshadeeda ay tahay sidii tallaabadu ka tagtay. Ka dib Save (taas oo bilaabta liis isbeddel cusub), ama ka dib markaad beddesho moodeelka aad tafatirayso, BimCraft wuxuu jawaabaa in liiska uu guuray, Studio wuu daaqaddaas ka gudbaa. Waxba lagama qasbo. Saameynta hal barnaamij barnaamij kale ka noqoshadeeda lama dhisin. Ka baxsan Studio waxba ma isbeddelo. Menu-ga Studio ee codsada ka noqoshada wuxuu la socdaa dhismaha Studio; ilaa markaas tallaabooyinka waa la sheegaa, laakiin ma jiro menu-ga isticmaalaya. Xiga Si toos ah ula shaqee kuwa kale","lang":"so"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Koobiyee, dhaji iyo laabi shayada maktabadda","summary":"Koobiyee shay maktabad ah oo la dhigay oo ku dhaji meesha aad riixdo, meel ku dhow asalka, ama moodel kale; koobiyee guryaha walxaha kale qoraal ahaan; ka noqo iyo samee mar kale.","section":"tasks","order":155,"keywords":["koobiyee","dhaji","laabi","clipboard","ku dhaji meeshii","jar","tirtir","dooro dhammaan","ka noqo","samee mar kale","menu tafatir","wax badan","shay maktabad","dhigis","ku celi","array"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhaji-meeshii","text":"Ku dhaji meeshii","level":2},{"id":"laabi","text":"Laabi","level":2},{"id":"moodel-kale-ama-tab-kale","text":"Moodel kale ama tab kale","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad arki doontaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-caadi-ah","text":"Khaladaad caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xidhiidha","text":"Wax la xidhiidha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee nuqullo dheeraad ah oo shay aad horay dhigtay: miis shaqo labaad, safka musqulaha. Mawduucani wuxuu ka hadlayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eshayada maktabadda la dhigay\u003C/strong\u003E, walxaha BimCraft ku qoray moodelka; mid ka mid ah waxaa lagu dhaji karaa moodel kasta, xataa tab kale. Darbiyada, albaabada iyo walxaha kale ee dhismaha waxaa lagu koobiyeeyaa, lagu jaraa, lagu dhajiyaa oo lagu tirtiraa si la mid ah moodelkooda gudihiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ETirtir, jar, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada waxay ku yaalaan qalabka sare ee moodelka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, oo ah menu leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHa dooran midna\u003C/span\u003E. Amarka aan hadda shaqayn karin waa la madoobeeyay; ku dhowaado si aad u akhrido sababta, ama guji oo sadarka xaaladda ayaa kuu sheegaya sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC ah oo ku jira shay maktabad, ama marka hore dhig mid. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EKa dhig qalab iyo alaab maktabadda ka mid ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji shayga muuqaalka 3D. Guryahiisa waxay muujinayaan sanduuq \u003Cstrong\u003EShay maktabad\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qaybta dhigista ayaa furmaysa, sanduuq muuqaal ahaan qarsoon ayaa raacaya go&#039;aaga, wuxuuna u jeedaa sida asalka oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 90° ugu rogto, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si dhabarkeeda loogu xidho darbi, ama ku qor X iyo Y qaybta dhigista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha nuqulku tagayo. Guji kasta nuqul kale ayaa dhigta; riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo deegsato nuqulka la wax ka beddelay ee moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhaji-meeshii\"\u003EKu dhaji meeshii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay ku dhajiyaan iyada oo aan guji lahayn, isla X iyo Y, iyo isla jihada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodel isku mid ah, isla dabaq\u003C/strong\u003E: laba shay meel isku mid ah ku jira ma aha wax faa&#039;iido leh, sidaas darteed nuqulku wuxuu u dhow yahay asalka, hal ballaca shayga iyo 100 mm oo ku socda ballaca shayga. Mar kale ku dhaji nuqulka cusub si aad safka u samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaq kale ama moodel kale\u003C/strong\u003E: X, Y iyo rogidda oo isku mid ah. BimCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa dabaqa leh magaca isku mid ah; haddii aanu jirin, kan ugu dhow dhererka. Qaybta xaaladda ayaa sheegta kan la isticmaalay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"laabi\"\u003ELaabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay koobiyeeyaan shayga la doortay oo isla markiiba bilaabaan dhajinta: hal tallaabo halkii laba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodel-kale-ama-tab-kale\"\u003EMoodel kale ama tab kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aad koobiyeysay waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, sidaas darteed waxaad furi kartaa moodel IFC kale, ama BimCraft tab kale, oo halkaas ku dhajin kartaa. Moodelka kale wuxuu u baahan yahay shayga maktabadda laftiisa: BimCraft wuu haystaa marka shayga la dhigay, la beddelay ama la cusboonaysiiyay tabkan. Shay la dhigay fadhigii hore ayaa dib loo dhajin karaa moodelkiisa kaliya; moodel kale, dhig isagoo ka doorta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka moodelka, la doortay, oo leh isla shayga maktabadda, liisanka, xogta qalabka, tirada iyo qoraalka asalka, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Elambarka shayga ee xorta ah ee xiga\u003C/strong\u003E. Ku beddel lambarka Guryaha, hoosta \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Placement\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Waa la dhigay: \u003Cem\u003Eshay\u003C/em\u003E (shay \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E)&quot; liiska isbeddelada. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celiya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale ayaa dib u dhigaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqullada waxay wadaagaan nooca asalka, sidaas darteed dhammaantood waxay isticmaalaan hal qaab-dhismeed, sida marka isla shay labo jeer la dhigo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waxay daboolaan isbeddel kasta: qiimayaasha la tafatiray, dhigista, dhajinta, beddelka iyo cusboonaysiinta. Samee mar kale wuxuu dib u dhigaa dhigista meeshii isla. Isbeddel cusub ayaa tirtiraya wixii dib loo samayn karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka 2D ee naqshadda ma jiro wax la doorto, sidaas darteed ma jiro wax la koobiyeeyo. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu beddel CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E si aad u beddesho naqshadda, marka ay muuqato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-caadi-ah\"\u003EKhaladaad caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay walxaha waxay ka yimaadeen moodel kale.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa ugu dambeeyay ee aad koobiyeysay wuxuu ahaa dhismo ama dhowr walxood: kuwaasi waxay ku dhajmaan moodelkooda kaliya. Dooro hal shay maktabad oo la dhigay oo koobiyee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay nuqulka wuxuu ka yimid moodel aan shayga maktabadda lahayn.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhig shayga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabad\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka hal mar tabkan, kadibna koobiyee oo dhaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoraalka bogga halkii.\u003C/strong\u003E Qoraal ayaa bogga lagu doortay. Marka hore guji moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xidhiidha\"\u003EWax la xidhiidha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard#edit\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"edit\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Samee nuqullo dheeraad ah oo shay aad horay dhigtay: miis shaqo labaad, safka musqulaha. Mawduucani wuxuu ka hadlayaa shayada maktabadda la dhigay, walxaha BimCraft ku qoray moodelka; mid ka mid ah waxaa lagu dhaji karaa moodel kasta, xataa tab kale. Darbiyada, albaabada iyo walxaha kale ee dhismaha waxaa lagu koobiyeeyaa, lagu jaraa, lagu dhajiyaa oo lagu tirtiraa si la mid ah moodelkooda gudihiisa: eeg Tirtir, jar, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha. Amarrada waxay ku yaalaan qalabka sare ee moodelka: Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee, Dhaji iyo Wax badan, oo ah menu leh Jar, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Ku dhaji meeshii, Laabi, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan iyo Ha dooran midna. Amarka aan hadda shaqayn karin waa la madoobeeyay; ku dhowaado si aad u akhrido sababta, ama guji oo sadarka xaaladda ayaa kuu sheegaya sababta. Tallaabooyin Fur moodel IFC ah oo ku jira shay maktabad, ama marka hore dhig mid. Eeg Ka dhig qalab iyo alaab maktabadda ka mid ah. Guji shayga muuqaalka 3D. Guryahiisa waxay muujinayaan sanduuq Shay maktabad. Guji Koobiyee ama riix Ctrl+C. Guji Dhaji ama riix Ctrl+V. Qaybta dhigista ayaa furmaysa, sanduuq muuqaal ahaan qarsoon ayaa raacaya go'aaga, wuxuuna u jeedaa sida asalka oo kale. Riix R si aad 90° ugu rogto, Tab si dhabarkeeda loogu xidho darbi, ama ku qor X iyo Y qaybta dhigista. Guji meesha nuqulku tagayo. Guji kasta nuqul kale ayaa dhigta; riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Guji U kaydi sida IFC si aad u soo deegsato nuqulka la wax ka beddelay ee moodelka. Ku dhaji meeshii Wax badan, Ku dhaji meeshii ama Ctrl+Shift+V waxay ku dhajiyaan iyada oo aan guji lahayn, isla X iyo Y, iyo isla jihada: Moodel isku mid ah, isla dabaq: laba shay meel isku mid ah ku jira ma aha wax faa'iido leh, sidaas darteed nuqulku wuxuu u dhow yahay asalka, hal ballaca shayga iyo 100 mm oo ku socda ballaca shayga. Mar kale ku dhaji nuqulka cusub si aad safka u samayso. Dabaq kale ama moodel kale: X, Y iyo rogidda oo isku mid ah. BimCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa dabaqa leh magaca isku mid ah; haddii aanu jirin, kan ugu dhow dhererka. Qaybta xaaladda ayaa sheegta kan la isticmaalay. Laabi Wax badan, Laabi ama Ctrl+D waxay koobiyeeyaan shayga la doortay oo isla markiiba bilaabaan dhajinta: hal tallaabo halkii laba. Moodel kale ama tab kale Waxa aad koobiyeysay waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, sidaas darteed waxaad furi kartaa moodel IFC kale, ama BimCraft tab kale, oo halkaas ku dhajin kartaa. Moodelka kale wuxuu u baahan yahay shayga maktabadda laftiisa: BimCraft wuu haystaa marka shayga la dhigay, la beddelay ama la cusboonaysiiyay tabkan. Shay la dhigay fadhigii hore ayaa dib loo dhajin karaa moodelkiisa kaliya; moodel kale, dhig isagoo ka doorta Maktabad tab-ka. Waxa aad arki doontaa Nuqulka moodelka, la doortay, oo leh isla shayga maktabadda, liisanka, xogta qalabka, tirada iyo qoraalka asalka, iyo lambarka shayga ee xorta ah ee xiga. Ku beddel lambarka Guryaha, hoosta CadCraft_Placement. \"Waa la dhigay: shay (shay n)\" liiska isbeddelada. Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celiya; Ctrl+Y mar kale ayaa dib u dhigaysa. Waxa muhiim ah Nuqullada waxay wadaagaan nooca asalka, sidaas darteed dhammaantood waxay isticmaalaan hal qaab-dhismeed, sida marka isla shay labo jeer la dhigo. Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waxay daboolaan isbeddel kasta: qiimayaasha la tafatiray, dhigista, dhajinta, beddelka iyo cusboonaysiinta. Samee mar kale wuxuu dib u dhigaa dhigista meeshii isla. Isbeddel cusub ayaa tirtiraya wixii dib loo samayn karo. Muuqaalka 2D ee naqshadda ma jiro wax la doorto, sidaas darteed ma jiro wax la koobiyeeyo. Isticmaal Ku beddel CadCraft si aad u beddesho naqshadda, marka ay muuqato. Khaladaad caadi ah Dhaji wuxuu leeyahay walxaha waxay ka yimaadeen moodel kale. Waxa ugu dambeeyay ee aad koobiyeysay wuxuu ahaa dhismo ama dhowr walxood: kuwaasi waxay ku dhajmaan moodelkooda kaliya. Dooro hal shay maktabad oo la dhigay oo koobiyee. Dhaji wuxuu leeyahay nuqulka wuxuu ka yimid moodel aan shayga maktabadda lahayn. Dhig shayga Maktabad tab-ka hal mar tabkan, kadibna koobiyee oo dhaji. Ctrl+C wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoraalka bogga halkii. Qoraal ayaa bogga lagu doortay. Marka hore guji moodelka. Wax la xidhiidha Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka Dejinta BimCraft","lang":"so"},{"slug":"edit-elements","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Tirtir, jar, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha","summary":"Dooro darbiyada, albaabada, alaabta ama wax kale oo ku jira moodel IFC; tirtir, jar, ama koobiyee oo dhaji meesha aad gujiso, meeshii ay ku jirtay, ama dabaq kale.","section":"tasks","order":156,"keywords":["tirtir","ka saar","tirtir","jar","koobiyee","dhaji","nuqul","guuri","dooro dhammaan","dooro dhammaan walxaha","walxaha dhismaha","darbi","albaab","daaqad","jaranjar","furitaan","ka noqo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-socda-walax","text":"Waxa la socda walax","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa fiican in la yaqaan","level":2},{"id":"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah","text":"Khaladaadka caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"la-xiriira","text":"La xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa beddel waxa ku jira moodel IFC: ka saar walxaha aadan u baahnayn, koobiyee darbi ama alaab meel kale, ama guuri walxaha adiga oo jaray oo dhajinaya. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartid, kaydintuna waxay qori doontaa fayl cusub, sidaas darteed asalkaagu wuu sii ahaanayaa sida uu ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodel IFC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-ifc-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-ifc-model\"\u003EFur moodel IFC oo eeg 3D-ta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad beddelayso: guji walax, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo guji si aad wax badan u doorato, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u doorato dhammaan walxaha la muujiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKadib:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJar:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E. Walxaha way baxaan, waana ku dhajin kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u dhajiso, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E. Sanduuq hufan oo cabbirka waxa aad koobiyeysay ayaa raacaya suulka ku yaal dabaqa lagu doortay bartanka meel-dhigista. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u leexiso 90°, kadibna guji meesha ay tagayso. Guji kasta wuxuu dhigayaa nuqul kale; riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax badan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E): haddii aad jartay, walxaha way dib ugu noqonayaan meeshii ay ahaayeen si sax ah; haddii aad koobiyeysay, nuqulku wuxuu ag dhowaan dhigmayaa asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo dejiso moodelka la wax ka beddelay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-socda-walax\"\u003EWaxa la socda walax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha:\u003C/strong\u003E jaranjarku wuxuu qaadaa jaranjarradiisa, darbiga daboolka wuxuu qaadaa panelladiisa, wax kasta oo qaybo ka dhisan yahay wuxuu qaadaa dhammaantood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuritaannada:\u003C/strong\u003E darbiga wuxuu qaadaa furitaannada lagu jaray. Albaab ama daaqad la tirtiro waxa kale oo ay qaadaa furitaankii ay buuxinayeen, si darbigu u xirmo, sida barnaamijyada dhismaha ee kale. Darbi BimCraft lagu sawiray la tirtiro waxa kale oo ay tirtirtaa albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, darbiyadii ka haray ayaa dib loo isku xidhaa. Darbi laga tirtiro fayl meel kale laga sameeyay wuxuu albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa ku reebayaa meeshooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXogta:\u003C/strong\u003E nuqulku wuxuu leeyahay isla nooca, agabka, kooxaha sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka sida asalka, iyo GlobalId cusub. Haddii qiimaha nuqulka markii dambe la beddelo, asalka ma saamaynayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha maktabadda\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ilaaliyaan xogtooda maktabadda; nuqul wuxuu helaa lambarka xubinta ee xorta ah ee ugu horreeya, walax la jaray oo dib loo dhajiyay ayaa ilaalisa lambarkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Tirtay: …&quot; ama &quot;Dhajiyay: …&quot; liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeyay; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu mar kale dhigayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka la tirtiro, saf-xaalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta qayb iyo furitaan ah ee sidoo kale tirtirmay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha la dhajiyay waa la doortaa, sidaas darteed waad ku dhajin kartaa meesha mar kale si aad u samayso safka, ama waad tirtiri kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqullada waxay isticmaalaan isla juqraafigii asalka (IFC wuxuu u ogolaanayaa walxaha inay wadaagaan), sidaas darteed faylku aad uma kordhayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWalxaha dhismaha waxay ku dhajiyaan moodelkii laga koobiyeeyay, isla tab-ka. Si aad walxaha maktabadda la meel dhigay u isticmaasho moodel kale, koobiyee hal shay mar: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul walxaha maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDabaqyada, meelaha, dhismayaasha iyo goobta lama tirtiri karo ama lama koobiyeyn karo. Dooro walxaha ku jira halkaas. Qolka BimCraft lagu sawiray wuxuu ka soo baxaa darbiyada ku wareegsan: tirtir darbi si aad laba qol isugu xidhto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha lagu sawiray qalabka darbiga, albaabka iyo daaqadda BimCraft ee u gaarka ah weli lama koobiyeyn karo, lama jari karo, lamana nuqul samayn karo; saf-xaalku wuu sheegayaa. Dib ayaad u sawiri. Tirtirku wuu shaqeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoobiyeeyntu waxa kale oo ay magacyada iyo sifooyinka waxa aad koobiyeysay ku dhejisaa clipboard-kaaga qoraal ahaan, si aad ugu dhajiso miiska xisaabta ama emayl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaadka-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKhaladaadka caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E waa la xidhay.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax lagama doorannin, ama dabaqyo ama meelo kaliya ayaa la doortay. Ku dhowow si aad u akhrido sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhajintu waxay leedahay walxaha waxay ka yimaadeen moodel kale.\u003C/strong\u003E Moodel kale ayaad furtay kadib markii aad koobiyeysay. Mar kale fur moodelkii hore oo halkaas ku koobiyee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqulka la dhajiyay wuxuu ku yaal dabaq kale.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaq\u003C/span\u003E ee bartanka meel-dhigista ayaa go&#039;aaminaya meesha uu tagayo; dabaqa dooro ka hor intaadan gujin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-xiriira\"\u003ELa xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo ka arag walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard#edit\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"edit\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo maawiska\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka beddel waxa ku jira moodel IFC: ka saar walxaha aadan u baahnayn, koobiyee darbi ama alaab meel kale, ama guuri walxaha adiga oo jaray oo dhajinaya. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartid, kaydintuna waxay qori doontaa fayl cusub, sidaas darteed asalkaagu wuu sii ahaanayaa sida uu ahaa. Tallaabooyinka Fur moodel IFC. Eeg Fur moodel IFC oo eeg 3D-ta. Dooro waxa aad beddelayso: guji walax, hay Ctrl ama Shift oo guji si aad wax badan u doorato, ama riix Ctrl+A (Wax badan, Dooro dhammaan) si aad u doorato dhammaan walxaha la muujiyay. Kadib: Tirtir: riix Delete, ama Wax badan, Tirtir. Koobiyee: riix Ctrl+C ama guji Koobiyee. Jar: riix Ctrl+X, ama Wax badan, Jar. Walxaha way baxaan, waana ku dhajin kartaa. Si aad u dhajiso, riix Ctrl+V ama guji Dhaji. Sanduuq hufan oo cabbirka waxa aad koobiyeysay ayaa raacaya suulka ku yaal dabaqa lagu doortay bartanka meel-dhigista. Riix R si aad u leexiso 90°, kadibna guji meesha ay tagayso. Guji kasta wuxuu dhigayaa nuqul kale; riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Ama riix Ctrl+Shift+V (Wax badan, Ku dhaji meeshii): haddii aad jartay, walxaha way dib ugu noqonayaan meeshii ay ahaayeen si sax ah; haddii aad koobiyeysay, nuqulku wuxuu ag dhowaan dhigmayaa asalka. Guji Kaydi sida IFC si aad u soo dejiso moodelka la wax ka beddelay. Waxa la socda walax Qaybaha: jaranjarku wuxuu qaadaa jaranjarradiisa, darbiga daboolka wuxuu qaadaa panelladiisa, wax kasta oo qaybo ka dhisan yahay wuxuu qaadaa dhammaantood. Furitaannada: darbiga wuxuu qaadaa furitaannada lagu jaray. Albaab ama daaqad la tirtiro waxa kale oo ay qaadaa furitaankii ay buuxinayeen, si darbigu u xirmo, sida barnaamijyada dhismaha ee kale. Darbi BimCraft lagu sawiray la tirtiro waxa kale oo ay tirtirtaa albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa, darbiyadii ka haray ayaa dib loo isku xidhaa. Darbi laga tirtiro fayl meel kale laga sameeyay wuxuu albaabadiisa iyo daaqadihiisa ku reebayaa meeshooda. Xogta: nuqulku wuxuu leeyahay isla nooca, agabka, kooxaha sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka sida asalka, iyo GlobalId cusub. Haddii qiimaha nuqulka markii dambe la beddelo, asalka ma saamaynayo. Walxaha maktabadda waxay ilaaliyaan xogtooda maktabadda; nuqul wuxuu helaa lambarka xubinta ee xorta ah ee ugu horreeya, walax la jaray oo dib loo dhajiyay ayaa ilaalisa lambarkeeda. Waxa aad arki doontid \"Tirtay: …\" ama \"Dhajiyay: …\" liiska Isbeddellada. Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeyay; Ctrl+Y wuxuu mar kale dhigayaa. Marka la tirtiro, saf-xaalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta qayb iyo furitaan ah ee sidoo kale tirtirmay. Walxaha la dhajiyay waa la doortaa, sidaas darteed waad ku dhajin kartaa meesha mar kale si aad u samayso safka, ama waad tirtiri kartaa. Waxa fiican in la yaqaan Nuqullada waxay isticmaalaan isla juqraafigii asalka (IFC wuxuu u ogolaanayaa walxaha inay wadaagaan), sidaas darteed faylku aad uma kordhayo. Walxaha dhismaha waxay ku dhajiyaan moodelkii laga koobiyeeyay, isla tab-ka. Si aad walxaha maktabadda la meel dhigay u isticmaasho moodel kale, koobiyee hal shay mar: eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul walxaha maktabadda. Dabaqyada, meelaha, dhismayaasha iyo goobta lama tirtiri karo ama lama koobiyeyn karo. Dooro walxaha ku jira halkaas. Qolka BimCraft lagu sawiray wuxuu ka soo baxaa darbiyada ku wareegsan: tirtir darbi si aad laba qol isugu xidhto. Darbiyada, albaabada iyo daaqadaha lagu sawiray qalabka darbiga, albaabka iyo daaqadda BimCraft ee u gaarka ah weli lama koobiyeyn karo, lama jari karo, lamana nuqul samayn karo; saf-xaalku wuu sheegayaa. Dib ayaad u sawiri. Tirtirku wuu shaqeeyaa. Koobiyeeyntu waxa kale oo ay magacyada iyo sifooyinka waxa aad koobiyeysay ku dhejisaa clipboard-kaaga qoraal ahaan, si aad ugu dhajiso miiska xisaabta ama emayl. Khaladaadka caadiga ah Tirtir waa la xidhay. Wax lagama doorannin, ama dabaqyo ama meelo kaliya ayaa la doortay. Ku dhowow si aad u akhrido sababta. Dhajintu waxay leedahay walxaha waxay ka yimaadeen moodel kale. Moodel kale ayaad furtay kadib markii aad koobiyeysay. Mar kale fur moodelkii hore oo halkaas ku koobiyee. Nuqulka la dhajiyay wuxuu ku yaal dabaq kale. Dabaq ee bartanka meel-dhigista ayaa go'aaminaya meesha uu tagayo; dabaqa dooro ka hor intaadan gujin. La xiriira Qari, kala saar oo ka arag walxaha Furayaasha iyo maawiska","lang":"so"},{"slug":"move-align-distribute","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Guuri, koobiyee, isu-dhig iyo kala fidi walxaha dhismaha","summary":"Guuri darbiyada, dabaqyada, tiirarka iyo walxaha maktabadda la dhigay adigoo isticmaalaya barta salka iyo barta labaad ama masaafo la qoray, nuqul ka samee sida aad u socoto, oo isu-dhig ama si siman u kala fidi, qorshaha ama adigoo ka doorto 3D.","section":"tasks","order":157,"keywords":["guuri","koobiyee","isu-dhig","kala fidi","kala-fogeyn","masaafo","barta salka","kala-guurid","darbiyada","tiirarka","dabaqyada","MOVE","ALIGN","DISTRIBUTE","Shift+M"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"magacyada-iyo-furayaasha","text":"Magacyada iyo furayaasha","level":2},{"id":"guuri","text":"Guuri","level":2},{"id":"isu-dhig","text":"Isu-dhig","level":2},{"id":"kala-fidi","text":"Kala fidi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi, tiir, sagxad ama walax maktabad ah oo la dhigay u wareeji meel cusub, nuqul ka samee, ama dhowr isu-dhig, adigoon dib u sawirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magacyada-iyo-furayaasha\"\u003EMagacyada iyo furayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada waxa loo yaqaanaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsu-dhig\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala fidi\u003C/span\u003E, waxaana ku qori kartaa \u003Ccode\u003EMOVE\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EALIGN\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EDISTRIBUTE\u003C/code\u003E safka amarka, sida barnaamijka sawirka CadCraft. Hal farqi ayaa jira: BimCraft \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Qiyaas, sidaas darteed Guuri wuxuu leeyahay furaha u gaarka ah, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qalabyada waxay ku yaalaan menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa la guurinayo, qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. Darbiyada, sagxadaha, tiirarka iyo walxaha maktabadda la dhigay oo dhan waxaa lagu dooran karaa hal doorasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift M\"\u003E⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta salka, kadibna barta labaad. Ama, barta salka ka dib, qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: waxay u socotaa jihada uu tilmaamayo fallaadhu ka barta salka. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa \u003Ccode\u003Edx,dy\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E@dx,dy\u003C/code\u003E), ama \u003Ccode\u003Edherer&lt;xagal\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u shido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E: guurid kasta markaas nuqul ayay samaysaa oo diyaar ayay u tahay kan xiga. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada barood waxaa sidoo kale lagu gujin karaa muuqaalka 3D: marka Guuri uu shaqeeyo, fallaadhu waxay isku dhacaa dhererka dabaqa, sidaas guji halkaas waa barta qorshaha. Hoos u hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad gujinayso si aad walax kale u doorato. Isticmaal qorshe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E sida aad doonto: barooradu had iyo jeer dabaqaas ku yaalaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiga waxa la socda albaabyadiisa iyo daaqadahiisa. Sagxadda la sawiray waxay qaadaa godadkeeda. Qolalka, sagxadaha iyo saqaf hoosaha ee raacaya darbiyada waa la cusbooneysiiyaa. Darbiyada ku xidhnaa darbiga la guuray waxay sii joogaan meeshooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuurid kasta waa hal isbeddel: hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda, waxayna gaadhaa qof walba oo ku jira kulan Live TeamWork ah. Walax maktabad oo la dhigay looma koobiyeyn habkan; isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isu-dhig\"\u003EIsu-dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro laba walax ama ka badan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsu-dhig\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dhinac (bidix, dhexe, midig, sare, bartamaha ama hoose) iyo waxa lagu isu-dhigayo: kooxda la doortay, walxihii ugu horreeyay ee la doortay, kii ugu dambeeyay ee la doortay, ama barta aad gujiso. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsu-dhig\u003C/span\u003E baarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-fidi\"\u003EKala fidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro saddex walax ama ka badan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala fidi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna jihada (dhinaca ama hoos) iyo masaafada: godado isku mid ah ama bartamo isku mid ah. Labada ka mid ah dhammaadka ayaa sii joogi doona meeshooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbiyada ay Isu-dhig ama Kala fidi guuraan waxay ilaalinayaan isku xidhkooda, sida Guuri: darbi ku xidhan darbiga la guuray ayaa dhamaadkeeda ku dhex socda khadkeeda si ay xidhan sii ahaato; qaybaha ku dhacaya ayaa la socda; labada darbi ee xidhan oo labaduba la guuray ayaa geeskooda ku sii hayaa meesha ay khadadkoodu cusub ku kulmaan. Qolalku waa sii xidhan yihiin. Waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Darbi, tiir, sagxad ama walax maktabad ah oo la dhigay u wareeji meel cusub, nuqul ka samee, ama dhowr isu-dhig, adigoon dib u sawirin. Magacyada iyo furayaasha Amarrada waxa loo yaqaanaa Guuri, Isu-dhig iyo Kala fidi, waxaana ku qori kartaa MOVE, ALIGN iyo DISTRIBUTE safka amarka, sida barnaamijka sawirka CadCraft. Hal farqi ayaa jira: BimCraft M waa Qiyaas, sidaas darteed Guuri wuxuu leeyahay furaha u gaarka ah, Shift+M. Qalabyada waxay ku yaalaan menu-ga Dhismaha. Guuri Dooro waxa la guurinayo, qorshaha ama muuqaalka 3D. Darbiyada, sagxadaha, tiirarka iyo walxaha maktabadda la dhigay oo dhan waxaa lagu dooran karaa hal doorasho. Riix Shift+M ama dooro Guuri. Guji barta salka, kadibna barta labaad. Ama, barta salka ka dib, qor masaafo oo riix Enter: waxay u socotaa jihada uu tilmaamayo fallaadhu ka barta salka. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa dx,dy (ama @dx,dy), ama dherer\u003Cxagal. Riix C si aad u shido Koobiyee: guurid kasta markaas nuqul ayay samaysaa oo diyaar ayay u tahay kan xiga. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Labada barood waxaa sidoo kale lagu gujin karaa muuqaalka 3D: marka Guuri uu shaqeeyo, fallaadhu waxay isku dhacaa dhererka dabaqa, sidaas guji halkaas waa barta qorshaha. Hoos u hay Shift inta aad gujinayso si aad walax kale u doorato. Isticmaal qorshe, Sare, Hore ama Dhinac sida aad doonto: barooradu had iyo jeer dabaqaas ku yaalaan. Darbiga waxa la socda albaabyadiisa iyo daaqadahiisa. Sagxadda la sawiray waxay qaadaa godadkeeda. Qolalka, sagxadaha iyo saqaf hoosaha ee raacaya darbiyada waa la cusbooneysiiyaa. Darbiyada ku xidhnaa darbiga la guuray waxay sii joogaan meeshooda. Guurid kasta waa hal isbeddel: hal Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda, waxayna gaadhaa qof walba oo ku jira kulan Live TeamWork ah. Walax maktabad oo la dhigay looma koobiyeyn habkan; isticmaal Wax ka beddel › Koobiyee iyo Dhaji. Isu-dhig Dooro laba walax ama ka badan, dooro Isu-dhig, kadibna dhinac (bidix, dhexe, midig, sare, bartamaha ama hoose) iyo waxa lagu isu-dhigayo: kooxda la doortay, walxihii ugu horreeyay ee la doortay, kii ugu dambeeyay ee la doortay, ama barta aad gujiso. Riix Isu-dhig baarka. Kala fidi Dooro saddex walax ama ka badan, dooro Kala fidi, kadibna jihada (dhinaca ama hoos) iyo masaafada: godado isku mid ah ama bartamo isku mid ah. Labada ka mid ah dhammaadka ayaa sii joogi doona meeshooda. Darbiyada ay Isu-dhig ama Kala fidi guuraan waxay ilaalinayaan isku xidhkooda, sida Guuri: darbi ku xidhan darbiga la guuray ayaa dhamaadkeeda ku dhex socda khadkeeda si ay xidhan sii ahaato; qaybaha ku dhacaya ayaa la socda; labada darbi ee xidhan oo labaduba la guuray ayaa geeskooda ku sii hayaa meesha ay khadadkoodu cusub ku kulmaan. Qolalku waa sii xidhan yihiin. Waa hal tallaabo oo ku jirta Isbeddelada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"trace-pens-stairs-obj","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Raad heer, qalmaha muuqaal kasta, samee jaad sawir, fur OBJ","summary":"Muuji heer kale oo jiiran hoosta qorshaha oo isku jiheeyey, siiso darbiyada, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha qalin u gaar ah hal muuqaal, samee xarriiqa socodka si aad u hesho jaad, oo fur shabakadda Wavefront OBJ.","section":"tasks","order":158,"keywords":["raadka","ghost","underlay","qalin","cabbirka xariiqda","nooca xariiqda","override","jaad","sawir","bar","OBJ","mesh","soo geli","Wavefront"],"headings":[{"id":"raad-heer","text":"Raad heer","level":2},{"id":"qalmaha-muuqaal-kasta","text":"Qalmaha muuqaal kasta","level":2},{"id":"jaad-sawir-ka-samee","text":"Jaad sawir ka samee","level":2},{"id":"fur-obj","text":"Fur OBJ","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"raad-heer\"\u003ERaad heer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrace\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna muuqaal liiska ka mid ah: qorshaha heer kale, qorshaha tirtirka heer ama dhinac-muuqaal (oo la jarey si uu u yimaado). Darbiyadiisa, tiirarkiisa iyo sagxadihiisa ayaa jiiran hoosta qorshaha aad sawirayso. Dhaqdhaqaaqiisa, riix barta saldhigga ah ee tixraaca kadibna meesha ay tahay inay tagto, ama ku qor X, Y iyo xagal (wuxuu ku leexdaa xudunteeda). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dib u geynaya, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka saaraa. Waa tixraac oo keliya: ma la dooran karo, looma daabacdo, IFC-na kuma kaydka. BimCraft wuxuu u xasuustaa heer kasta browser-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalmaha-muuqaal-kasta\"\u003EQalmaha muuqaal kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPens\u003C/span\u003E. Sheeg waxa qalinku u yahay: dhammaan darbiyada, dhammaan albaabbada, dhammaan daaqadaha, nooca walxaha la doortay, ama walxaha la doortay. Dooro cabbir, xariiqa (buuxa, jiidan, dhibcaha) iyo midab, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E. Isbeddelku waa qorshaha heerkan keliya. Doorashada walxaha ayaa ka mudan nooca, nooca ayaa ka mudan qaybta oo dhan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin browser-kan. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EMidabka qalinka 3D\u003C/strong\u003E si aad qalinada midabka leh ugu rinjiyayso moodelka muuqaalka 3D; (cabbirka ama jiidanku waa kan xariiqda, sidaas darteed midabka kaliya ayaa halkaas ka muuqda); ka saar si aad dib ugu noqoto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalinada ku daabacaa PDF-ka qorshaha: cabbirku shaashadda ayuu ka qiyaasaa (qalinka darbiga caadiga ah ee 1.75 pikseel waa 0.5 mm), jiidanku wuxuu sii ahaadaa jiidan, midabka waxaa la daabacaa qiimaha midabka ee mawduuca warqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jaad-sawir-ka-samee\"\u003EJaad sawir ka samee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch stair\u003C/span\u003E oo riix geesaha xarriiqa socodka, tallaabada hoose ee ugu horreysa. Hal xarriiq waa jaad toosan, laba xarriiq oo isku kulma xagal qumman waa L, saddex xarriiq (kor, dhinac, dib) waa U. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u sawirto nasasho: riix geesaha kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dhinaceeda gaaban ayaa ballacda jaadka dejisa. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhigto jaadka. Tallaabo kasta waxaa loo xisaabiyaa dherer xarriiqaaga iyo tirada kor u kacaysa ee dhererka loo baahan yahay. Kadib waa jaad caadi ah: ku beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, qaybta jaadka iyo gacan-qabsiyada way raacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee qoys\u003C/strong\u003E safka qalabka (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ka hor \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad u dhigto jaadka qoys ahaan (jaad toosan, L ama U). Waxay u timaaddaa sida hal walax, waxayna ku furmaa tafatiraha qoyska iyada oo leh ballacdeeda, tallaabada, dhererka wadarta ah, tallaabooyinka kasta oo socod ah iyo furaha U sida cabbirro; sidaas darteed waad ku dari kartaa cabbirro, astaan qorshe ama hotspots. Tallaabooyinka iyo dhererka kor u kac waxay ka raacaan. Ma leh gacan-qabsiyo ama qolka jaadka: kuwaas waxay u gaar yihiin jaad caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-obj\"\u003EFur OBJ\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E sida fayl kasta. OBJ ma leh unugyo, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa mitirro iyo Y oo sare, sida barnaamijyo badan u qoraan. Shay kasta ama koox kasta waxay noqonaysaa hal walax shabakad ah oo hal heer ku jirta, kadibna waad eegi kartaa, cabbiri kartaa, jarin kartaa, dhigi kartaa moodel ku jira oo kaydin kartaa sida IFC. Xarriiqyada, qallooyinka iyo dusha waa la reebay, status line-ka ayaa sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta oo toos ahaan u ah prism (shabakad xidhan oo leh laba dhamaad oo isku mid ah oo is barbar ah, iyo dhinacyo fidsan oo ku xagal qumman: bedad, tiir, bloog darbi, dhagax leh godad) waxaa lagu kaydiyaa IFC sida solid-ka IFC ee laga soo saaray, oo leh qaabkiisa iyo qotada, halkii liis saddex-geesood. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u akhrinayaan sida solid dhab ah, waxay ahaataa yar, qotadiisa iyo qaabkiisa waa la wax ka beddeli karaa dambe. Status line-ka wuxuu sheegayaa inta shay halkaas loo kaydiyay. Wax aan toos u ahayn prism (qaab taper leh, shabakad oo hal geesood la dhaqaajiyay, ama shabakad leh god) wuxuu ku sii ahaanayaa saddex-geesood. Faylka STEP wuxuu si la mid ah loo akhriyaa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Raad heer Ka dooro Trace menu-ga Build, kadibna muuqaal liiska ka mid ah: qorshaha heer kale, qorshaha tirtirka heer ama dhinac-muuqaal (oo la jarey si uu u yimaado). Darbiyadiisa, tiirarkiisa iyo sagxadihiisa ayaa jiiran hoosta qorshaha aad sawirayso. Dhaqdhaqaaqiisa, riix barta saldhigga ah ee tixraaca kadibna meesha ay tahay inay tagto, ama ku qor X, Y iyo xagal (wuxuu ku leexdaa xudunteeda). Reset ayaa dib u geynaya, Hide ayaa ka saaraa. Waa tixraac oo keliya: ma la dooran karo, looma daabacdo, IFC-na kuma kaydka. BimCraft wuxuu u xasuustaa heer kasta browser-kan. Qalmaha muuqaal kasta Dooro Pens. Sheeg waxa qalinku u yahay: dhammaan darbiyada, dhammaan albaabbada, dhammaan daaqadaha, nooca walxaha la doortay, ama walxaha la doortay. Dooro cabbir, xariiqa (buuxa, jiidan, dhibcaha) iyo midab, kadibna Apply. Isbeddelku waa qorshaha heerkan keliya. Doorashada walxaha ayaa ka mudan nooca, nooca ayaa ka mudan qaybta oo dhan. Clear all wuu ka saaraa. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin browser-kan. Calaamadi Midabka qalinka 3D si aad qalinada midabka leh ugu rinjiyayso moodelka muuqaalka 3D; (cabbirka ama jiidanku waa kan xariiqda, sidaas darteed midabka kaliya ayaa halkaas ka muuqda); ka saar si aad dib ugu noqoto. Print wuxuu qalinada ku daabacaa PDF-ka qorshaha: cabbirku shaashadda ayuu ka qiyaasaa (qalinka darbiga caadiga ah ee 1.75 pikseel waa 0.5 mm), jiidanku wuxuu sii ahaadaa jiidan, midabka waxaa la daabacaa qiimaha midabka ee mawduuca warqadda. Jaad sawir ka samee Dooro Sketch stair oo riix geesaha xarriiqa socodka, tallaabada hoose ee ugu horreysa. Hal xarriiq waa jaad toosan, laba xarriiq oo isku kulma xagal qumman waa L, saddex xarriiq (kor, dhinac, dib) waa U. Riix L si aad u sawirto nasasho: riix geesaha kadibna riix Enter, dhinaceeda gaaban ayaa ballacda jaadka dejisa. Riix Enter si aad u dhigto jaadka. Tallaabo kasta waxaa loo xisaabiyaa dherer xarriiqaaga iyo tirada kor u kacaysa ee dhererka loo baahan yahay. Kadib waa jaad caadi ah: ku beddel Guryaha, qaybta jaadka iyo gacan-qabsiyada way raacaan. Calaamadi Samee qoys safka qalabka (ama riix F) ka hor Enter, si aad u dhigto jaadka qoys ahaan (jaad toosan, L ama U). Waxay u timaaddaa sida hal walax, waxayna ku furmaa tafatiraha qoyska iyada oo leh ballacdeeda, tallaabada, dhererka wadarta ah, tallaabooyinka kasta oo socod ah iyo furaha U sida cabbirro; sidaas darteed waad ku dari kartaa cabbirro, astaan qorshe ama hotspots. Tallaabooyinka iyo dhererka kor u kac waxay ka raacaan. Ma leh gacan-qabsiyo ama qolka jaadka: kuwaas waxay u gaar yihiin jaad caadi ah. Fur OBJ Fur fayl .obj sida fayl kasta. OBJ ma leh unugyo, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa mitirro iyo Y oo sare, sida barnaamijyo badan u qoraan. Shay kasta ama koox kasta waxay noqonaysaa hal walax shabakad ah oo hal heer ku jirta, kadibna waad eegi kartaa, cabbiri kartaa, jarin kartaa, dhigi kartaa moodel ku jira oo kaydin kartaa sida IFC. Xarriiqyada, qallooyinka iyo dusha waa la reebay, status line-ka ayaa sheegaa. Shay kasta oo toos ahaan u ah prism (shabakad xidhan oo leh laba dhamaad oo isku mid ah oo is barbar ah, iyo dhinacyo fidsan oo ku xagal qumman: bedad, tiir, bloog darbi, dhagax leh godad) waxaa lagu kaydiyaa IFC sida solid-ka IFC ee laga soo saaray, oo leh qaabkiisa iyo qotada, halkii liis saddex-geesood. Barnaamijyada kale waxay u akhrinayaan sida solid dhab ah, waxay ahaataa yar, qotadiisa iyo qaabkiisa waa la wax ka beddeli karaa dambe. Status line-ka wuxuu sheegayaa inta shay halkaas loo kaydiyay. Wax aan toos u ahayn prism (qaab taper leh, shabakad oo hal geesood la dhaqaajiyay, ama shabakad leh god) wuxuu ku sii ahaanayaa saddex-geesood. Faylka STEP wuxuu si la mid ah loo akhriyaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pictures-as-backgrounds","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sawir ku dhig hoosta qorshaha","summary":"Ku dhig sawir PNG, JPEG ama WebP (scan qorshe, sawir-gacmeed, sawirka goobta, sawir hawada laga qaaday) hoosta qorshaha dabaqa ama diyaarad toosan, cabbirka ku qiyaas laba dhibcood, u rog, u wareeji, ifi iyo quful, eeg 3D iyo PDF-ka qorshaha, oo ku hay bundle-ka oo la socda moodelka.","section":"tasks","order":159,"keywords":["sawir","sawirka","asal","PNG","JPEG","WebP","scan","sawir-gacmeed","sawirka hawada","qorshe goobta","miisaan","iftiin","quful","hoos","raad"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dhig-sawir","text":"Ku dhig sawir","level":2},{"id":"samee-miisaanka","text":"Samee miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhejiso-meel-la-koobiyeeyay","text":"Ku dhejiso meel la koobiyeeyay","level":2},{"id":"guuri-u-rog-ifi-quful","text":"Guuri, u rog, ifi, quful","level":2},{"id":"sawiro-badan-dabaqyo-badan","text":"Sawiro badan, dabaqyo badan","level":2},{"id":"sawirada-aragtida-3d","text":"Sawirada aragtida 3D","level":2},{"id":"sawir-diyaarad-toosan","text":"Sawir diyaarad toosan","level":2},{"id":"daabacaadda","text":"Daabacaadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-lagu-hayaa-moodelka-hareeraha","text":"Waxa lagu hayaa moodelka hareeraha","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada-qaybta-iyo-muuqaalka","text":"Xaashiyada qaybta iyo muuqaalka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhig-sawir\"\u003EKu dhig sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E, tag dabaqa, oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPicture\u003C/span\u003E menyuga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E. Kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro fayl PNG, JPEG ama WebP. Browser-kaaga ayaa akhrisa, mana loo soo rarin. Waxay ka muuqataa qorshaha hoosteeda, waxaana lagu habeeyay aragtida, qalabka sare wuxuu leeyahay in aan wali miisaan lagu saarin. Wax kasta oo aad sawirtid waxay ku sii jiraan korkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-miisaanka\"\u003ESamee miisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, riix laba dhibcood sawirka oo masaafadooda dhabta ah aad og tahay (labada dhamaadka darbi ee qorshe scan ah, ama cabbir lagu daabacay sawir-gacmeed), kadibna qor masaafada oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sawirku wuu weynaanayaa ama yaraanayaa dhibcii ugu horeeyay ee aad riixday. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa joojiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhejiso-meel-la-koobiyeeyay\"\u003EKu dhejiso meel la koobiyeeyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkupCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy area\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qayb ka mid ah xaashi PDF sida sawir. Dib BimCraft, markii qorshe dabaq muuqda, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control V\"\u003E⌃V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E gudaha menyuga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E): meeshu waxay ku dhacaa qorshaha sida sawir, dhexda u dhigan meesha mouse-ku joogo (ama dhexda aragtida). Markii xaashigu uu miisaan naqshadeed lahaa, wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirkiisa dhabta ah, sidaas darteed darbi ku jira wuxuu u dhaadhacaa sida darbiyadaada. Haddii kale wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirka warqadda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E wuu bilaabanayaa, si aad laba dhibcood u riixdo oo masaafadooda u qortid. Meel koobiyeysan oo ah overlay wuxuu ka bilaabanayaa iftiinka ay ku koobiyeysay. Waa hal tallaabo dib-u-celin, waxaana la kaydiyaa sida sawir kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa wixii aad ugu dambayntii koobiyeysay: meel la koobiyeeyay ama wax aad BimCraft ku koobiyeysay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control V\"\u003E⌃V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale dhajiyaa sawir PNG, JPEG ama WebP kasta oo ku jira clipboard-kaaga, oo loo dhigo sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E oo aan wali miisaan lagu saarin. Meel la koobiyeeyay waxaa la xasuustaa lix saac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-u-rog-ifi-quful\"\u003EGuuri, u rog, ifi, quful\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa dhibic salka ah oo ku yaal sawirka, kadibna meesha ay tagayso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa xagal darajooyin ah, dhexda sawirka ku wareegsan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpacity\u003C/span\u003E wuu ifiyaa si khadadkaagu u muuqdaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka ilaaliyaa inuu guuro intaad sawirinayso; sawir quful ah wuxuu weli ogolaanayaa inaad beddesho iftiinkiisa oo aad qariso. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo dib-u-celin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawiro-badan-dabaqyo-badan\"\u003ESawiro badan, dabaqyo badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir wuxuu leeyahay dabaqa la dhigay, wuxuuna muuqdaa qorshaha dabaqaas iyo qorshaha saqafkiisa. Riix sawir si aad uga shaqeysid, ama dooro liiska. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E wuu damiyaa oo ma tirtiro; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu ka saaraa moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada-aragtida-3d\"\u003ESawirada aragtida 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir kasta waxaa sidoo kale lagu arkaa aragtida 3D sida diyaarad fidsan: sawirka qorshaha wuxuu ku dhacaa dabaqiisa, sawirka diyaarad toosan wuxuu istaagaa khadka qaybta ee korkiisa. Waxaa lagu rinjiyaa korka moodelka adigoon qarinin, moodelkuna wuxuu qariyaa qaybta sawirka ee ku dhuuman. Sawirada isku daboolan waxay u kala soocan masaafada. Iftiinka, Qari, Quful iyo Ka saar isku shaqeeyaan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow in 3D\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu damiyaa diyaaradaha oo dhan aragtida 3D keliya. Dabaq kasta wuxuu hayaa ugu badnaan 8 sawir, si aragtidu u dhaqso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-diyaarad-toosan\"\u003ESawir diyaarad toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace on\u003C/span\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA vertical plane (section line)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInsert picture…\u003C/span\u003E. Riix labada dhamaad ee khad qorshaha (dhamaadka wejiga darbi ayaa iskiis u isku dhejiya), ama dooro khad qayb oo magac leh oo dabaqa ka mid ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver a section line\u003C/span\u003E wax riix ah looma baahna. Sawirku wuxuu istaagaa dabaqa khadkaas korkiisa, isagoo ballac u dhigan khadka. Ku dhig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWidth\u003C/span\u003E, meeshiisa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the line\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight above level\u003C/span\u003E adigoo qoraya; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa diyaaradiisa gudaheeda. Sawirka toosan ma lagu daabacayo qorshaha hoosteeda; qorshuhu wuxuu tusayaa khadkiisa intaad ku shaqaynayso. BimCraft ma lahan daaqad qayb 2D ah oo isdhexgal leh: qaybaha iyo muuqaalada waxaa lagu sawiraa xaashiyada, sawirrada xaashiyadaas weli kuma daabacmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daabacaadda\"\u003EDaabacaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint view\u003C/span\u003E qorshe kasta wuxuu qorayaa sawirrada dabaqa PDF hoosta sawirka, miisaankooda, rogiddooda iyo ifkooda, oo xaashiga lagu jaray; sawir qarsan ayaa ka baxa. JPEG wuxuu u galaa sida uu yahay; sawirada kale waa la yareeyaa ilaa 200 dpi xaashiga hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-lagu-hayaa-moodelka-hareeraha\"\u003EWaxa lagu hayaa moodelka hareeraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaytiyada sawirka laguma qorin qoraalka IFC. Moodelku wuxuu sawir kasta ku tixraacaa magac (IfcDocumentReference sida \u003Ccode\u003Epictures/&lt;id&gt;.png\u003C/code\u003E), baytiyadana waxay ku safraan bundle-ka mashruuca. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as bundle…\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro): waxaad heshaa hal fayl .ccbundle oo leh moodelka iyo sawirradiisa; IFC-gu wuu yar yahay, tafatirkuna wuu dhaqso. Fur .ccbundle sawirradii way soo noqonayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal .ifc oo sade ma haysan karto sawir iyada oo aan weyn noqonin. Markaad kaydiso mid, BimCraft wuxuu sheegaa inta sawir ee ka baxsan lagu kaydiyay oo wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa bundle, ama IFC sade oo ku dhex jira sawirada ilaa 512 KB oo uu ka tago kuwa kale. .ifc sade oo aan bundle-kiisa lagu furin ayaa sawirkaas u muuqda sida maqan, Dhibaatooyinkuna way liistaan; fur .ccbundle-kii lagu kaydiyay. Faylasha nooca koowaad ku kaydiyay, sawirka gudaha IFC-ga, weli way furmaan, kaydinta bundle-na sawirradaas way ka soo saartaa. Sawir waxaa la hayaa sidii uu yahay ilaa 6 MB; ka weyn waa la yareeyaa marka hore, waana laguu sheegaa. Barnaamijyada kale moodelka way furaan, sawirrada way iska indha-tirtaan. Sawir aadan wali miisaan u saarin waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada-qaybta-iyo-muuqaalka\"\u003EXaashiyada qaybta iyo muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir diyaarad toosan (dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVertical\u003C/span\u003E panelka sawirka oo riix labada dhamaad khad, ama dhig khad qayb magac leh korkiisa) waxaa lagu daabacaa xaashiyada aragtiyada ee u eg. Qayb wuxuu muujinayaa sawir kasta oo istaagay khadka goynta, ama kii khad qaybta magaciisa lagu dhigay. Muuqaal dhinac wuxuu muujinayaa sawir kasta oo diyaaradiisu u jeedo. Sawirka waxaa lagu sawiraa hoosta khadadka aragtida, miisaanka aragtida, waxaana lagu jaray aragtida, iftiinkiisana waa uu hayaa. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets…\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto; PDF-ka xaashiga wuxuu u qaadaa sida sawir. Haddii laga eego dhabarka, sawirku waa ka soo rogmaa, sida 3D. Sawirada qarsan waa laga reebay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ku dhig sawir Ku shid Draw, tag dabaqa, oo dooro Picture menyuga Build. Kadibna Insert picture… oo dooro fayl PNG, JPEG ama WebP. Browser-kaaga ayaa akhrisa, mana loo soo rarin. Waxay ka muuqataa qorshaha hoosteeda, waxaana lagu habeeyay aragtida, qalabka sare wuxuu leeyahay in aan wali miisaan lagu saarin. Wax kasta oo aad sawirtid waxay ku sii jiraan korkiisa. Samee miisaanka Dooro Scale, riix laba dhibcood sawirka oo masaafadooda dhabta ah aad og tahay (labada dhamaadka darbi ee qorshe scan ah, ama cabbir lagu daabacay sawir-gacmeed), kadibna qor masaafada oo riix Enter. Sawirku wuu weynaanayaa ama yaraanayaa dhibcii ugu horeeyay ee aad riixday. Esc ayaa joojiya. Ku dhejiso meel la koobiyeeyay MarkupCraft, Copy area wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qayb ka mid ah xaashi PDF sida sawir. Dib BimCraft, markii qorshe dabaq muuqda, riix Ctrl+V (ama Paste gudaha menyuga Edit): meeshu waxay ku dhacaa qorshaha sida sawir, dhexda u dhigan meesha mouse-ku joogo (ama dhexda aragtida). Markii xaashigu uu miisaan naqshadeed lahaa, wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirkiisa dhabta ah, sidaas darteed darbi ku jira wuxuu u dhaadhacaa sida darbiyadaada. Haddii kale wuxuu ku imanayaa cabbirka warqadda, Scale wuu bilaabanayaa, si aad laba dhibcood u riixdo oo masaafadooda u qortid. Meel koobiyeysan oo ah overlay wuxuu ka bilaabanayaa iftiinka ay ku koobiyeysay. Waa hal tallaabo dib-u-celin, waxaana la kaydiyaa sida sawir kasta. Paste wuxuu qaadaa wixii aad ugu dambayntii koobiyeysay: meel la koobiyeeyay ama wax aad BimCraft ku koobiyeysay. Ctrl+V wuxuu sidoo kale dhajiyaa sawir PNG, JPEG ama WebP kasta oo ku jira clipboard-kaaga, oo loo dhigo sida Insert picture… oo aan wali miisaan lagu saarin. Meel la koobiyeeyay waxaa la xasuustaa lix saac. Guuri, u rog, ifi, quful Move wuxuu qaadaa dhibic salka ah oo ku yaal sawirka, kadibna meesha ay tagayso. Turn wuxuu qaadaa xagal darajooyin ah, dhexda sawirka ku wareegsan. Opacity wuu ifiyaa si khadadkaagu u muuqdaan. Lock wuxuu ka ilaaliyaa inuu guuro intaad sawirinayso; sawir quful ah wuxuu weli ogolaanayaa inaad beddesho iftiinkiisa oo aad qariso. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo dib-u-celin. Sawiro badan, dabaqyo badan Sawir wuxuu leeyahay dabaqa la dhigay, wuxuuna muuqdaa qorshaha dabaqaas iyo qorshaha saqafkiisa. Riix sawir si aad uga shaqeysid, ama dooro liiska. Hide wuu damiyaa oo ma tirtiro; Remove (ama Delete) wuxuu ka saaraa moodelka. Sawirada aragtida 3D Sawir kasta waxaa sidoo kale lagu arkaa aragtida 3D sida diyaarad fidsan: sawirka qorshaha wuxuu ku dhacaa dabaqiisa, sawirka diyaarad toosan wuxuu istaagaa khadka qaybta ee korkiisa. Waxaa lagu rinjiyaa korka moodelka adigoon qarinin, moodelkuna wuxuu qariyaa qaybta sawirka ee ku dhuuman. Sawirada isku daboolan waxay u kala soocan masaafada. Iftiinka, Qari, Quful iyo Ka saar isku shaqeeyaan, Show in 3D wuxuu damiyaa diyaaradaha oo dhan aragtida 3D keliya. Dabaq kasta wuxuu hayaa ugu badnaan 8 sawir, si aragtidu u dhaqso. Sawir diyaarad toosan Hoosta Place on dooro A vertical plane (section line), kadibna Insert picture…. Riix labada dhamaad ee khad qorshaha (dhamaadka wejiga darbi ayaa iskiis u isku dhejiya), ama dooro khad qayb oo magac leh oo dabaqa ka mid ah Over a section line wax riix ah looma baahna. Sawirku wuxuu istaagaa dabaqa khadkaas korkiisa, isagoo ballac u dhigan khadka. Ku dhig Width, meeshiisa Along the line iyo Height above level adigoo qoraya; Turn wuxuu wareejiyaa diyaaradiisa gudaheeda. Sawirka toosan ma lagu daabacayo qorshaha hoosteeda; qorshuhu wuxuu tusayaa khadkiisa intaad ku shaqaynayso. BimCraft ma lahan daaqad qayb 2D ah oo isdhexgal leh: qaybaha iyo muuqaalada waxaa lagu sawiraa xaashiyada, sawirrada xaashiyadaas weli kuma daabacmaan. Daabacaadda Print view qorshe kasta wuxuu qorayaa sawirrada dabaqa PDF hoosta sawirka, miisaankooda, rogiddooda iyo ifkooda, oo xaashiga lagu jaray; sawir qarsan ayaa ka baxa. JPEG wuxuu u galaa sida uu yahay; sawirada kale waa la yareeyaa ilaa 200 dpi xaashiga hore. Waxa lagu hayaa moodelka hareeraha Baytiyada sawirka laguma qorin qoraalka IFC. Moodelku wuxuu sawir kasta ku tixraacaa magac (IfcDocumentReference sida pictures/\u003Cid\u003E.png), baytiyadana waxay ku safraan bundle-ka mashruuca. Isticmaal Save as bundle… (ama Save as IFC oo dooro): waxaad heshaa hal fayl .ccbundle oo leh moodelka iyo sawirradiisa; IFC-gu wuu yar yahay, tafatirkuna wuu dhaqso. Fur .ccbundle sawirradii way soo noqonayaan. Hal .ifc oo sade ma haysan karto sawir iyada oo aan weyn noqonin. Markaad kaydiso mid, BimCraft wuxuu sheegaa inta sawir ee ka baxsan lagu kaydiyay oo wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa bundle, ama IFC sade oo ku dhex jira sawirada ilaa 512 KB oo uu ka tago kuwa kale. .ifc sade oo aan bundle-kiisa lagu furin ayaa sawirkaas u muuqda sida maqan, Dhibaatooyinkuna way liistaan; fur .ccbundle-kii lagu kaydiyay. Faylasha nooca koowaad ku kaydiyay, sawirka gudaha IFC-ga, weli way furmaan, kaydinta bundle-na sawirradaas way ka soo saartaa. Sawir waxaa la hayaa sidii uu yahay ilaa 6 MB; ka weyn waa la yareeyaa marka hore, waana laguu sheegaa. Barnaamijyada kale moodelka way furaan, sawirrada way iska indha-tirtaan. Sawir aadan wali miisaan u saarin waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka sida fiiro. Xaashiyada qaybta iyo muuqaalka Sawir diyaarad toosan (dooro Vertical panelka sawirka oo riix labada dhamaad khad, ama dhig khad qayb magac leh korkiisa) waxaa lagu daabacaa xaashiyada aragtiyada ee u eg. Qayb wuxuu muujinayaa sawir kasta oo istaagay khadka goynta, ama kii khad qaybta magaciisa lagu dhigay. Muuqaal dhinac wuxuu muujinayaa sawir kasta oo diyaaradiisu u jeedo. Sawirka waxaa lagu sawiraa hoosta khadadka aragtida, miisaanka aragtida, waxaana lagu jaray aragtida, iftiinkiisana waa uu hayaa. Fur Sheets… si aad u aragto; PDF-ka xaashiga wuxuu u qaadaa sida sawir. Haddii laga eego dhabarka, sawirku waa ka soo rogmaa, sida 3D. Sawirada qarsan waa laga reebay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"panel-drawings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Sawirrada panelka alwaax ama bir fudud ah","summary":"Qaabee darbiyada, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada moodelka sida panelo alwaax ama bir fudud ah, arag tiir kasta, plate, header, joist iyo rafter cabbirka saxda ah, oo kaydi liiska goynta CSV iyo sawirrada dukaanka PDF.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["panel","qaabeyn","sawirka dukaanka","liiska goynta","bir fudud","stud","LGS","alwaax","joist","rafter","header","kayd","PDF"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-panelada","text":"Fur panelada","level":2},{"id":"walxaha-cabbirka-iyo-fogaanta","text":"Walxaha, cabbirka iyo fogaanta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-hesho","text":"Waxa aad hesho","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-sameyn","text":"Waxa aan sameyn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-panelada\"\u003EFur panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel drawings\u003C/span\u003E menyuga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku qor \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003EPANELS\u003C/code\u003E). Liiska wuxuu hayaa darbi kasta oo la sawiray, sagxad kasta iyo saqaf kasta oo moodelka ku jira, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Darbiyada waxaa la socda albaabbadooda iyo daaqadahooda oo ah furmo. Sagxad waxaa loo qaabeeyaa sida durbaan ku wareegsan qaabkeeda, joistkana waxay u socdaan jihada gaaban. Saqaf waxaa loo qaabeeyaa sida gable ku wareegsan qaabka darbiyadiisa, oo leh xagga saqafka; liiska wuu sheegaa taas, sababtoo ah hip ama saqaf murugsan ma aha gable.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"walxaha-cabbirka-iyo-fogaanta\"\u003EWalxaha, cabbirka iyo fogaanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EAlwaax\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBir fudud\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybaha birta waa C-stud oo lagu magacaabay dhererka iyo dhumucda (tusaale C92-1.2), oo leh track loogu talo galay plate-yada. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMember size\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dooranayaa hal cabbir panel kasta oo calaamadsan, ama ka tag Default si aad u qaadato caadiyaha nooc kasta oo panel ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpacing\u003C/span\u003E waa masaafada u dhexaysa stud-ka, joist-ka ama rafter-ka. Kuwani waa qiyam bilow ah oo aad dejiso. Ma aha hubinta xeerka: in stud masaafadaas ah uu qaadayo darbigaas, iyo in header uu dhererkaas qaadayo, waa shaqada miisaska xeerka (add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha wuxuu leeyahay kuwa IRC-ga) iyo injineerkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-hesho\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka calaamadda ah ee ugu horreeya waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbir dhab ah wadahadalka, oo leh cabbirrada. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut list (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaybaha panel kasta sida calaamadda, cabbirka iyo dhererka, iyo dhererka birta ee la iibsado. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShop drawings (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa hal bog A3 panel kasta, qayb kasta oo calaamadsan oo leh liiskeeda goynta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing (SVG)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa panelka koowaad sida sawir. Wax kasta oo qaabeynta aysan qaadi karin (tusaale, furmo ku dhow dhamaadka darbi, header aan ku habboonayn plate-yada hoose, ama qayb ka dheer dheerka ugu dheer ee bir-ka) waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka iyo wadahadalka labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-sameyn\"\u003EWaxa aan sameyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada waa sawiro laga sameeyay moodelka mar kasta oo aad weydiiso: wax lagu qorin moodelka, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waa isku mid. Si aad qaabeynta u geliso moodelka xubno ahaan, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFraming\u003C/span\u003E darbiyada alwaax, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur panelada Dooro Panel drawings menyuga Build (ama ku qor PANELS). Liiska wuxuu hayaa darbi kasta oo la sawiray, sagxad kasta iyo saqaf kasta oo moodelka ku jira, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Darbiyada waxaa la socda albaabbadooda iyo daaqadahooda oo ah furmo. Sagxad waxaa loo qaabeeyaa sida durbaan ku wareegsan qaabkeeda, joistkana waxay u socdaan jihada gaaban. Saqaf waxaa loo qaabeeyaa sida gable ku wareegsan qaabka darbiyadiisa, oo leh xagga saqafka; liiska wuu sheegaa taas, sababtoo ah hip ama saqaf murugsan ma aha gable. Walxaha, cabbirka iyo fogaanta Dooro Material: Alwaax ama Bir fudud. Qaybaha birta waa C-stud oo lagu magacaabay dhererka iyo dhumucda (tusaale C92-1.2), oo leh track loogu talo galay plate-yada. Member size wuxuu dooranayaa hal cabbir panel kasta oo calaamadsan, ama ka tag Default si aad u qaadato caadiyaha nooc kasta oo panel ah. Spacing waa masaafada u dhexaysa stud-ka, joist-ka ama rafter-ka. Kuwani waa qiyam bilow ah oo aad dejiso. Ma aha hubinta xeerka: in stud masaafadaas ah uu qaadayo darbigaas, iyo in header uu dhererkaas qaadayo, waa shaqada miisaska xeerka (add-on-ka Xeerarka dhismaha wuxuu leeyahay kuwa IRC-ga) iyo injineerkaaga. Waxa aad hesho Panelka calaamadda ah ee ugu horreeya waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbir dhab ah wadahadalka, oo leh cabbirrada. Cut list (CSV) wuxuu kaydiyaa qaybaha panel kasta sida calaamadda, cabbirka iyo dhererka, iyo dhererka birta ee la iibsado. Shop drawings (PDF) wuxuu kaydiyaa hal bog A3 panel kasta, qayb kasta oo calaamadsan oo leh liiskeeda goynta. Drawing (SVG) wuxuu kaydiyaa panelka koowaad sida sawir. Wax kasta oo qaabeynta aysan qaadi karin (tusaale, furmo ku dhow dhamaadka darbi, header aan ku habboonayn plate-yada hoose, ama qayb ka dheer dheerka ugu dheer ee bir-ka) waxaa lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka iyo wadahadalka labadaba. Waxa aan sameyn Panelada waa sawiro laga sameeyay moodelka mar kasta oo aad weydiiso: wax lagu qorin moodelka, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer waa isku mid. Si aad qaabeynta u geliso moodelka xubno ahaan, isticmaal Framing darbiyada alwaax, sagxadaha iyo saqafyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"curtain-systems","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Nidaamyada daaqadaha: darbiyo isbiir ah oo shabakad leh, oo kala-qaybiyeyaal leh","summary":"Sawir nidaam daaqado sida derbi, ama dhig mid wajiga, kadibna deji xarriiqyada shabakadda iyo kala-qaybiyeyaasha. Waxa loo kaydiyaa sida IfcCurtainWall oo leh dhalaalladiisa iyo kala-qaybiyeyaashiisa.","section":"tasks","order":172,"keywords":["nidaamka daaqadaha","darbiga daaqadaha","shabakadda daaqadaha","kala-qaybiye","isbiir","panel","dhalaal","wajiga","mass","xarriiqa shabakadda","masaafada","profile","transom","IfcCurtainWall","IfcPlate","IfcMember"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"wajiga","text":"Wajiga","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-cabbiro","text":"Sida loo cabbiro","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee darbi isbiir ah oo ka kooban dhalaallo u dhexeeya kala-qaybiyeyaasha, beddel meesha xarriiqyada shabakadda ku yaalaan, oo dooro xarriiqyada ay kala-qaybiyeyaasha ku yeelan doonaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaar \u003Cstrong\u003ESawir\u003C/strong\u003E oo fur menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003EDhis\u003C/strong\u003E (qaabka ribbon-ka: tab-ka Architecture).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka daaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E. Safkiisa deji sare (dabaqa ka sarreeya, ama dhererka), xarriiq kasta oo dhererka ka dhex jirta masaafo la doortay, iyo xarriiq kasta oo toos u kor socota masaafo la doortay (ka tag madhan haddii aanu jirin), iyo haddii ay leedahay kala-qaybiyeyaal iyo profile-ka kala-qaybiyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha uu ka bilaabmayo iyo meesha uu ku dhamaado, sida aad derbi u sawirto. Shift ayaa ka dhigaa mid toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad shabakadda u beddesho, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda daaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo guji nidaamka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar xarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E: xarriiq toos ah ayaa dhigmaa meesha aad guuto. Xarriiqa sare, marka hore qor dhererkeeda \u003Cstrong\u003EMeel\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri xarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E: guji xarriiqa, kadibna meesha ay tagayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar xarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E: guji xarriiqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDeji masaafo\u003C/strong\u003E: ku qor masaafada \u003Cstrong\u003EMar kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna guji nidaamka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad kala-qaybiyeyaasha u beddesho, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-qaybiye\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro waxa uu shaqeeyo (xarriiqa toosan ee aad guji, xarriiqa sare ee dhererka, cidhifka, ama xarriiq kasta), dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig kala-qaybiyeyaal\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar kala-qaybiyeyaal\u003C/strong\u003E iyo profile, kadibna guji nidaamka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nidaam si aad uga aragto dhammaantiisa \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E: xarriiq kasta oo shabakad leh meeshiisa, calaamad u taal kala-qaybiyeyaashiisa iyo badhanka ka saarista; masaafada; cidhifka; profile-ka; dhumbalka dhalaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wajiga\"\u003EWajiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa nidaam daaqado wajiga siman ee aad guji muuqaalka 3D. Safkiisa wuxuu leeyahay isla deejinta shabakadda iyo kala-qaybiyeyaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu shaqeeyaa wajiga kasta oo siman ee walxaha muuqaalka 3D muujiya: culeys, darbi, dabaq, dusha saqaf, tiir, ama shay la dhigay. Wajiga wuu toosan karaa, dhaadhac karaa, ama siman karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENidaamku wuxuu raacaa dhinaca wajiga. Gable ama qaab kale oo aan caadi ahayn wuxuu jarayaa dhalaalka iyo kala-qaybiyeyaasha si ay ugu habboonaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu sidoo kale samayn karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ederbi\u003C/strong\u003E halkii, oo ku taal salka wajiga toosan oo dhererkiisa ah. Derbigan had iyo jeer wuu toosan yahay, sidaas darteed wajiga dhaadhacan ama siman ma qaadi karo derbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa sameeyo saqaf. Saqaf BimCraft-ka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa dhinaca dabaqa iyo dhaadhaca, ma aha wajiga keli ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWajiga qalloocan waa wajiyo badan oo yaryar oo siman: hal guji wuxuu qaadaa mid ka mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWajiga leh furitaano: nidaamku wuxuu daboolaa dhinaca dibadda ee wajiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-cabbiro\"\u003ESida loo cabbiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga guud\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhinaca nidaamka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga dhalaalka\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhalaallada sida loo sameeyay: mid kasta wuxuu lumiyaa nus ballaca kala-qaybiye dhinac kasta oo leh kala-qaybiye shabakadda, iyo ballaca oo dhan dhinac kasta oo leh kala-qaybiye cidhifka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala-qaybiye toosan wuxuu u socdaa cidhifka ilaa cidhifka. Kala-qaybiye siman wuxuu joogsadaa kala-qaybiye kasta oo toosan iyo cidhifka. Kala-qaybiyeyaasha cidhifka waxay ku jiraan dhinaca gudihiisa; meesha ay labo isku imaan, kan ka toosan ayaa u socda. Isku xidhka waxaa la jaraa xagal-toosan, ma jaro xagal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJadwal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamyada daaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh tirooyinkan marka moodelku leeyahay mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIfcCurtainWall oo ku taal dabaqiisa, oo ka kooban IfcPlate (panel daaqad) mid kasta dhalaal, iyo IfcMember (kala-qaybiye) mid kasta qayb kala-qaybiye, mid kasta leh qaabkiisa, agabkiisa iyo tirooyinkiisa aasaasiga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbir kasta wuu samaysmaa sida aad codsatay. Kaliya wajiga aan aagga lahayn ayaa la diidaa, sababtoo ah ma jiro wax la sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENidaam la sawiray sida derbi wuxuu hayaa dhererka uu lagu sawiray. Haddii aad dabaq dambe u guurisid, dib u deji dhererkiisa Guryaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabka Guuri weli ma guurin nidaamka daaqadaha. Tirtir oo mar kale sawir, ama beddel shabakaddiisa meeshii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa noqo wuxuu soo celiyaa tallaabo kasta: nidaamka oo dhan, hal isbeddel shabakadda, hal isbeddel kala-qaybiye.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Samee darbi isbiir ah oo ka kooban dhalaallo u dhexeeya kala-qaybiyeyaasha, beddel meesha xarriiqyada shabakadda ku yaalaan, oo dooro xarriiqyada ay kala-qaybiyeyaasha ku yeelan doonaan. Tallaabooyin Daar Sawir oo fur menu-ga Dhis (qaabka ribbon-ka: tab-ka Architecture). Dooro Nidaamka daaqadaha. Safkiisa deji sare (dabaqa ka sarreeya, ama dhererka), xarriiq kasta oo dhererka ka dhex jirta masaafo la doortay, iyo xarriiq kasta oo toos u kor socota masaafo la doortay (ka tag madhan haddii aanu jirin), iyo haddii ay leedahay kala-qaybiyeyaal iyo profile-ka kala-qaybiyaha. Guji meesha uu ka bilaabmayo iyo meesha uu ku dhamaado, sida aad derbi u sawirto. Shift ayaa ka dhigaa mid toosan. Si aad shabakadda u beddesho, dooro Shabakadda daaqadaha oo guji nidaamka: Ku dar xarriiq: xarriiq toos ah ayaa dhigmaa meesha aad guuto. Xarriiqa sare, marka hore qor dhererkeeda Meel. Guuri xarriiq: guji xarriiqa, kadibna meesha ay tagayso. Ka saar xarriiq: guji xarriiqa. Deji masaafo: ku qor masaafada Mar kasta, kadibna guji nidaamka. Si aad kala-qaybiyeyaasha u beddesho, dooro Kala-qaybiye, dooro waxa uu shaqeeyo (xarriiqa toosan ee aad guji, xarriiqa sare ee dhererka, cidhifka, ama xarriiq kasta), dooro Dhig kala-qaybiyeyaal ama Ka saar kala-qaybiyeyaal iyo profile, kadibna guji nidaamka. Dooro nidaam si aad uga aragto dhammaantiisa Guryaha: xarriiq kasta oo shabakad leh meeshiisa, calaamad u taal kala-qaybiyeyaashiisa iyo badhanka ka saarista; masaafada; cidhifka; profile-ka; dhumbalka dhalaalka. Wajiga Wajiga wuxuu sameeyaa nidaam daaqado wajiga siman ee aad guji muuqaalka 3D. Safkiisa wuxuu leeyahay isla deejinta shabakadda iyo kala-qaybiyeyaasha. Wuxuu shaqeeyaa wajiga kasta oo siman ee walxaha muuqaalka 3D muujiya: culeys, darbi, dabaq, dusha saqaf, tiir, ama shay la dhigay. Wajiga wuu toosan karaa, dhaadhac karaa, ama siman karaa. Nidaamku wuxuu raacaa dhinaca wajiga. Gable ama qaab kale oo aan caadi ahayn wuxuu jarayaa dhalaalka iyo kala-qaybiyeyaasha si ay ugu habboonaadaan. Wuxuu sidoo kale samayn karaa derbi halkii, oo ku taal salka wajiga toosan oo dhererkiisa ah. Derbigan had iyo jeer wuu toosan yahay, sidaas darteed wajiga dhaadhacan ama siman ma qaadi karo derbi. Ma sameeyo saqaf. Saqaf BimCraft-ka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa dhinaca dabaqa iyo dhaadhaca, ma aha wajiga keli ah. Wajiga qalloocan waa wajiyo badan oo yaryar oo siman: hal guji wuxuu qaadaa mid ka mid ah. Wajiga leh furitaano: nidaamku wuxuu daboolaa dhinaca dibadda ee wajiga. Sida loo cabbiro Aagga guud waa dhinaca nidaamka. Aagga dhalaalka waa dhalaallada sida loo sameeyay: mid kasta wuxuu lumiyaa nus ballaca kala-qaybiye dhinac kasta oo leh kala-qaybiye shabakadda, iyo ballaca oo dhan dhinac kasta oo leh kala-qaybiye cidhifka. Kala-qaybiye toosan wuxuu u socdaa cidhifka ilaa cidhifka. Kala-qaybiye siman wuxuu joogsadaa kala-qaybiye kasta oo toosan iyo cidhifka. Kala-qaybiyeyaasha cidhifka waxay ku jiraan dhinaca gudihiisa; meesha ay labo isku imaan, kan ka toosan ayaa u socda. Isku xidhka waxaa la jaraa xagal-toosan, ma jaro xagal. Jadwal wuxuu leeyahay liis Nidaamyada daaqadaha oo leh tirooyinkan marka moodelku leeyahay mid. Faylka IFC IfcCurtainWall oo ku taal dabaqiisa, oo ka kooban IfcPlate (panel daaqad) mid kasta dhalaal, iyo IfcMember (kala-qaybiye) mid kasta qayb kala-qaybiye, mid kasta leh qaabkiisa, agabkiisa iyo tirooyinkiisa aasaasiga ah. Waxa muhiim ah Cabbir kasta wuu samaysmaa sida aad codsatay. Kaliya wajiga aan aagga lahayn ayaa la diidaa, sababtoo ah ma jiro wax la sameeyo. Nidaam la sawiray sida derbi wuxuu hayaa dhererka uu lagu sawiray. Haddii aad dabaq dambe u guurisid, dib u deji dhererkiisa Guryaha. Qalabka Guuri weli ma guurin nidaamka daaqadaha. Tirtir oo mar kale sawir, ama beddel shabakaddiisa meeshii. Ka noqo wuxuu soo celiyaa tallaabo kasta: nidaamka oo dhan, hal isbeddel shabakadda, hal isbeddel kala-qaybiye.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-plane","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dusha shaqada: deji, muuji, ku eeg si toos ah","summary":"Dusha shaqada waa dusha ay khadadka moodelka, qoraalka moodelka iyo Daawaha Dusha Shaqada isticmaalaan. Dejiso heer, wejiga, dusha tixraac ee magac leh ama khad; muuji muuqaalada; fur daawaha si aad dusha taagan ugu sawirto.","section":"tasks","order":173,"keywords":["dusha shaqada","dejiso dusha shaqada","muuji dusha shaqada","dusha tixraac","daawaha dusha shaqada","dusha magac leh","wejiga","heer","dusha taagan","dusha toosan","dusha darbiga","sawir dhinac","goyn","isku xidh","isku-toosin","ref plane"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"dusha-tixraaca","text":"Dusha tixraaca","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro dusha aad ku sawirto, arag meesha uu ku yaal, oo ku sawir dusha taagan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cstrong\u003ESawir\u003C/strong\u003E oo fur menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003EDhis\u003C/strong\u003E (nidaamka ribbon-ka: tab-ka Naqshadda dhismaha, Dusha shaqada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDejiso dusha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E. Kadib mid ka mid ah samee:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edooro heer ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EDejiso ilaa\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edooro dusha tixraac ee magac leh liiska ku xiga;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eriix khad ku jira qorshaha: derbi, khad shabakad, dusha tixraac, khad moodel ama nidaamka derbiga muraayadda. Dusha shaqada waxay noqonaysaa dusha taagan ee ku dhex marta khadkaas;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eriix wejiga siman ee aragta 3D. Dusha shaqada waxay ku jirtaa wejigaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji dusha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto: xaashi midab leh oo ay ku jiraan grid mitir ah aragta 3D, qaab jajab ah ama khad qorshaha, iyo qaab jajab ah panelka wejiga iyo goynta. Mar kale dooro si aad u qarsato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDaawaha dusha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E si aad si toos ah ugu eegto dusha. Khadadka madow waa moodelka uu dusha goysay. Isticmaal qalabkeeda si aad khad moodel, qoraal moodel ama dusha tixraac ugu sawirto dusha. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu eeg 3D\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u rogaa aragta 3D si ay ugu wajahato dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-tixraaca\"\u003EDusha tixraaca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha tixraaca waa dusha magac leh oo aad khad ahaan u sawirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha tixraac\u003C/strong\u003E. Qor magac safkiisa haddii aad rabto (haddii kale magac ayaa lagu siin doonaa) iyo joog.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo meesha ay ku dhammaanto. Qorshaha tan waxay samaysaa dusha toosan. Daawaha dusha shaqada waxay samaysaa dusha ku taagan dusha shaqada xagal qumman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay u muuqataa khad cagaaran oo jajab ah, magacuna qorshaha ayuu ku yaal; qaab jajab ah ayuu aragta 3D iyo panelka wejiga iyo goynta ku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro si aad u magac bedesho, u beddesho dhererka, joogga iyo saldhigga, ama riix \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal dusha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba dusha tixraac magac isku mid ah ma lahaan karaan, sababtoo ah magacu waa habka aad mid u doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel aan dusha shaqada lahayn wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa heerkiisa ugu hooseeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha shaqada waa la kaydiyaa faylka. Muujinta ama qarinta waxa lagu xusuustaa browser-kan, ma aha faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii dusha shaqada raacdo dusha tixraac oo aad dusha tixraaca guurto, dusha shaqadu way la guurtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha shaqada ee toosan, qalabyada \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka moodelka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka moodelka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay furaan daawaha, sababtoo ah qorshuhu ma tilmaami karo joog.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada sawirka waxay qabtaan dhamaadka dusha tixraaca ee laga sawiray qorshaha si la mid ah sida ay u qabtaan dhamaadka khadadka kale ee daawaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha shaqada waa property set (CadCraft_WorkPlane) ee mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha tixraac waa IfcAnnotation oo leh object type ReferencePlane iyo magaciisa. Qaabkeeda waa xuddunta xidhan ee dusha, si barnaamijyada kale ay u muujiyaan meesha uu ku yaal. Its set CadCraft_ReferencePlane wuxuu haysaa bilowga, jihada, jihada toosan (normal) iyo baaxadda. IFC ma leh fasal u gaar ah dusha tixraaca; annotation-ka lama tirinayo walax dhisme ahaan, ma-na xidho qolalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontaa Dooro dusha aad ku sawirto, arag meesha uu ku yaal, oo ku sawir dusha taagan. Tallaabooyin Shid Sawir oo fur menu-ga Dhis (nidaamka ribbon-ka: tab-ka Naqshadda dhismaha, Dusha shaqada). Dooro Dejiso dusha shaqada. Kadib mid ka mid ah samee: dooro heer ku jira Dejiso ilaa; dooro dusha tixraac ee magac leh liiska ku xiga; riix khad ku jira qorshaha: derbi, khad shabakad, dusha tixraac, khad moodel ama nidaamka derbiga muraayadda. Dusha shaqada waxay noqonaysaa dusha taagan ee ku dhex marta khadkaas; riix wejiga siman ee aragta 3D. Dusha shaqada waxay ku jirtaa wejigaas. Dooro Muuji dusha shaqada si aad u aragto: xaashi midab leh oo ay ku jiraan grid mitir ah aragta 3D, qaab jajab ah ama khad qorshaha, iyo qaab jajab ah panelka wejiga iyo goynta. Mar kale dooro si aad u qarsato. Dooro Daawaha dusha shaqada si aad si toos ah ugu eegto dusha. Khadadka madow waa moodelka uu dusha goysay. Isticmaal qalabkeeda si aad khad moodel, qoraal moodel ama dusha tixraac ugu sawirto dusha. Ku eeg 3D wuxuu u rogaa aragta 3D si ay ugu wajahato dusha. Dusha tixraaca Dusha tixraaca waa dusha magac leh oo aad khad ahaan u sawirto. Dooro Dusha tixraac. Qor magac safkiisa haddii aad rabto (haddii kale magac ayaa lagu siin doonaa) iyo joog. Riix meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo meesha ay ku dhammaanto. Qorshaha tan waxay samaysaa dusha toosan. Daawaha dusha shaqada waxay samaysaa dusha ku taagan dusha shaqada xagal qumman. Waxay u muuqataa khad cagaaran oo jajab ah, magacuna qorshaha ayuu ku yaal; qaab jajab ah ayuu aragta 3D iyo panelka wejiga iyo goynta ku leeyahay. Dooro si aad u magac bedesho, u beddesho dhererka, joogga iyo saldhigga, ama riix Isticmaal dusha shaqada. Laba dusha tixraac magac isku mid ah ma lahaan karaan, sababtoo ah magacu waa habka aad mid u doorato. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Moodel aan dusha shaqada lahayn wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa heerkiisa ugu hooseeya. Dusha shaqada waa la kaydiyaa faylka. Muujinta ama qarinta waxa lagu xusuustaa browser-kan, ma aha faylka. Haddii dusha shaqada raacdo dusha tixraac oo aad dusha tixraaca guurto, dusha shaqadu way la guurtaa. Dusha shaqada ee toosan, qalabyada Khadka moodelka iyo Qoraalka moodelka waxay furaan daawaha, sababtoo ah qorshuhu ma tilmaami karo joog. Qalabyada sawirka waxay qabtaan dhamaadka dusha tixraaca ee laga sawiray qorshaha si la mid ah sida ay u qabtaan dhamaadka khadadka kale ee daawaha. Faylka IFC Dusha shaqada waa property set (CadCraft_WorkPlane) ee mashruuca. Dusha tixraac waa IfcAnnotation oo leh object type ReferencePlane iyo magaciisa. Qaabkeeda waa xuddunta xidhan ee dusha, si barnaamijyada kale ay u muujiyaan meesha uu ku yaal. Its set CadCraft_ReferencePlane wuxuu haysaa bilowga, jihada, jihada toosan (normal) iyo baaxadda. IFC ma leh fasal u gaar ah dusha tixraaca; annotation-ka lama tirinayo walax dhisme ahaan, ma-na xidho qolalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"model-lines-and-text","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Xarriiqyada moodeelka iyo qoraalka moodeelka: lagu sawiray moodeelka, qorshaha shaqada","summary":"Xarriiqda moodeelka waa xarriiq, polilayn ama qaanso oo ku nool moodeelka oo muuqda muuqaal kasta oo arka. Qoraalka moodeelka waa xarfo 3D ah oo qoto dheer leh. Labadooda waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha shaqada.","section":"tasks","order":174,"keywords":["xarriiqda moodeelka","qoraalka moodeelka","qoraal 3D","xarfo","calaamad","xarriiq 3D","qaanso","polilayn","qorshaha shaqada","qoraal soo jiidan","font","qoto dheer","xarriiqda faahfaahinta","xarriiqda sawirka","sharax","IfcAnnotation"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"meesha-ay-ka-muuqdaan","text":"Meesha ay ka muuqdaan","level":2},{"id":"font-ka","text":"Font-ka","level":2},{"id":"faylka-ifc","text":"Faylka IFC","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-og-tahay","text":"Waxa ku habboon inaad og tahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarriiqyo iyo xarfo ah oo qayb ka ah moodelka sawir, ee ma aha muuqaal keli ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore deji \u003Cstrong\u003Eqorshaha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E). Qorshe heer ah waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha; qorshe toosan waxaa lagu sawiraa Work Plane Viewer-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiq ahaan dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EXarriiq moodeel\u003C/strong\u003E menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EXarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPolilayn\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EQaanso (saddex barta)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Exarriiq waa laba guji;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epolilayn waa guji barta kasta, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer guji. Guji barta koowaad wuu xidhaa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqaanso waa saddex guji: bilowga, barta ay marayso, dhamaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraal ahaan dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E. Qor ereyada, deji dhererka xarafka weyn iyo qoto dheerta, kadibna guji meesha qoraalku ka bilaabmo (dhamaadka bidix ee khadka hoose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xarriiq ama qoraal si aad ugu aragto \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E. Ereyada, dhererka iyo qoto dheerta qoraalka halkaas ayaa lagu beddeli karaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka saaraysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-ka-muuqdaan\"\u003EMeesha ay ka muuqdaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiqda moodeelka waxay ka muuqdaa qorshaha heerkeeda, muuqaalka 3D, panelka muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, iyo Work Plane Viewer markay saaran tahay qorshaha shaqada. Xarriiqda sawirka (Annotate, Line) waxay u gaar tahay hal muuqaal oo kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka moodeelka waa geometry adag: wuxuu muuqdaa meel kasta oo moodeelku muuqdo: qorshaha, 3D, muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, iyo xaashiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiqyada moodeelka weli looma sawirin xaashiyada la daabacay. Qoraalka moodeelka waa la sawiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"font-ka\"\u003EFont-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalka moodeelka wuxuu isticmaalaa font isku mid ah sida xaashiyada iyo PDF-yada: Liberation Sans, oo ku hoos jira SIL Open Font License. Xaraf uusan fontku lahayn waxaa lagu sawiraa calaamad su&#039;aal, oo waa laguu sheegayaa kan uu yahay. Waxaa jira hal font iyo hal culeys. Xarfaha waxaa lagu fogeeyaa ballacyada fontka laftiisa, iyada oo aan kerning la isticmaalin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-ifc\"\u003EFaylka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiqda moodeelka waa IfcAnnotation oo nooca walxa yahay ModelLine. Qaabkeedu waa khad 3D ah: polilayn, ama goobo la jaray oo qaanso ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka moodeelka waa IfcBuildingElementProxy oo nooca walxa yahay ModelText. Qaabkeedu waa mid adag oo la soo jiiday xarig kasta, oo leh godadka xarfaha sida O iyo B. Tirooyinkiisu waa bedka wejiga iyo mugga (bedka wejiga oo lagu dhufto qoto dheerta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-habboon-inaad-og-tahay\"\u003EWaxa ku habboon inaad og tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbir kasta waxaa loo sameeyaa sida aad weydiisay. Kaliya xarriiq aan dherer lahayn, qaanso oo saddex barood khad isku mid ah ku jira, ama qoraal aan xarf lahayn ayaa la diidaa, sababtoo ah waxba ma jiro oo la samaysto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiq kasta, iyo qoraal kasta ama wax ka beddel kasta oo qoraalka ku dhacaa, waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Xarriiqyo iyo xarfo ah oo qayb ka ah moodelka sawir, ee ma aha muuqaal keli ah. Tallaabooyin Marka hore deji qorshaha shaqada (eeg Qorshaha shaqada). Qorshe heer ah waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha; qorshe toosan waxaa lagu sawiraa Work Plane Viewer-ka. Xarriiq ahaan dooro Xarriiq moodeel menu-ga Dhismaha oo dooro Xarriiq, Polilayn ama Qaanso (saddex barta): xarriiq waa laba guji; polilayn waa guji barta kasta, kadibna Enter ama laba jeer guji. Guji barta koowaad wuu xidhaa; qaanso waa saddex guji: bilowga, barta ay marayso, dhamaadka. Qoraal ahaan dooro Qoraalka moodeelka. Qor ereyada, deji dhererka xarafka weyn iyo qoto dheerta, kadibna guji meesha qoraalku ka bilaabmo (dhamaadka bidix ee khadka hoose). Dooro xarriiq ama qoraal si aad ugu aragto Sifooyinka. Ereyada, dhererka iyo qoto dheerta qoraalka halkaas ayaa lagu beddeli karaa. Tirtir ayaa ka saaraysa. Meesha ay ka muuqdaan Xarriiqda moodeelka waxay ka muuqdaa qorshaha heerkeeda, muuqaalka 3D, panelka muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, iyo Work Plane Viewer markay saaran tahay qorshaha shaqada. Xarriiqda sawirka (Annotate, Line) waxay u gaar tahay hal muuqaal oo kaliya. Qoraalka moodeelka waa geometry adag: wuxuu muuqdaa meel kasta oo moodeelku muuqdo: qorshaha, 3D, muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, iyo xaashiyada. Xarriiqyada moodeelka weli looma sawirin xaashiyada la daabacay. Qoraalka moodeelka waa la sawiraa. Font-ka Qoraalka moodeelka wuxuu isticmaalaa font isku mid ah sida xaashiyada iyo PDF-yada: Liberation Sans, oo ku hoos jira SIL Open Font License. Xaraf uusan fontku lahayn waxaa lagu sawiraa calaamad su'aal, oo waa laguu sheegayaa kan uu yahay. Waxaa jira hal font iyo hal culeys. Xarfaha waxaa lagu fogeeyaa ballacyada fontka laftiisa, iyada oo aan kerning la isticmaalin. Faylka IFC Xarriiqda moodeelka waa IfcAnnotation oo nooca walxa yahay ModelLine. Qaabkeedu waa khad 3D ah: polilayn, ama goobo la jaray oo qaanso ah. Qoraalka moodeelka waa IfcBuildingElementProxy oo nooca walxa yahay ModelText. Qaabkeedu waa mid adag oo la soo jiiday xarig kasta, oo leh godadka xarfaha sida O iyo B. Tirooyinkiisu waa bedka wejiga iyo mugga (bedka wejiga oo lagu dhufto qoto dheerta). Waxa ku habboon inaad og tahay Cabbir kasta waxaa loo sameeyaa sida aad weydiisay. Kaliya xarriiq aan dherer lahayn, qaanso oo saddex barood khad isku mid ah ku jira, ama qoraal aan xarf lahayn ayaa la diidaa, sababtoo ah waxba ma jiro oo la samaysto. Xarriiq kasta, iyo qoraal kasta ama wax ka beddel kasta oo qoraalka ku dhacaa, waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"audit-the-model","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hubi moodelka: qolalka, tags, LOD, isku dhacyada iyo interfaces-ka","summary":"Ku orod hubinta diyaarka ah ee qolalka aan magac lahayn, tags-ka maqan, walxaha ka hooseeya heerka horumarinta ee marxaladda mashruucu weydiisanayo, isku dhacyada u dhexeeya takhasusyada iyo interfaces-ka LOD 350. Talo oo keliya: waxba lama joojiyo.","section":"tasks","order":175,"keywords":["hubin","hubi","qol aan magac lahayn","tag maqan","calaamad","lod","heerka horumarinta","marxalad","isku dhac","takhasus","isku-xidhnaan","interface","lod 350","furan","lintel","header","dhex-galka","sleeve","tuubo","duct","dhibaatooyin","warbixinta hubinta","talo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"qawaacidyada","text":"Qawaacidyada","level":2},{"id":"lod-ka-uu-marxalad-kasta-weydiisto","text":"LOD-ka uu marxalad kasta weydiisto","level":2},{"id":"wax-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato","text":"Wax wanaagsan inaad ogaato","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg moodelka oo dhan hal mar ka hor intaadan soo saarin. Hubintu waxay ku orodaa qawaacidaha hubinta diyaarka ah, oo natiijooyinkeeda ku riixa liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E sida talo. Waxba lama joojiyo: waxaad hagaajisaa natiijo, ama aad aqbashaa sabab la sheegay, sida dhibaato kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubin\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka bidix, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi moodelka…\u003C/span\u003E (la qoro: \u003Ccode\u003EAUDIT\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarxaladda mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E. Waa marxaladda isku mid ee faahfaahinta sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadee qawaacidaha hubinta si ay u ordaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow hubinta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri safka qawaacid kasta, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur liiska Dhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E. Guji natiijo kasta si walxaha u dooro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixinta hubinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa warbixinta: natiijo kasta, cidda aqbashay waxa iyo sababtiisa, iyo qawaacidyada ordeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qawaacidyada\"\u003EQawaacidyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQolal aan magac lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E: qol aan magac lahayn, ama weli loo yaqaan magaca barnaamijku siiyay (&quot;Room 3&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETags maqan\u003C/strong\u003E: albaab ama daaqad aan calaamad lahayn, qol aan lambar lahayn, qalab koronto aan tag lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha ka hooseeya LOD-ka marxaladda\u003C/strong\u003E: darbi, sagxad, saqaf, roof, albaab iyo daaqad kasta oo LOD-kiisu ka yar yahay wixii marxaladdu weydiisato. Walxu wuxuu akhriyaa tag-ka LOD-ka nooceeda; walax la xaqiijiyay goobta waa LOD 500. Walxaha aan tag lahayn waa la tiriyaa hal ogaysiis, sababtoo ah lama hubin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku dhacyada u dhexeeya takhasusyada\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha laba takhasus (naqshadda, qaab-dhismeedka, mekaanikada, biyo-dhacyada, koronta, sida IFC class) oo is-dhex-galaya. Saqaf ku fadhiya darbiyadiisa lama tirinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInterfaces-ka LOD 350\u003C/strong\u003E: albaab iyo daaqad kasta waxay ku jiraan furan darbigooda, furanku wuxuu ku habboonaadaa gudaha darbiga, labo furan ma isku dhacaan, furan ka ballaaran xadka wuxuu leeyahay lintel ama header (walax kor ku jirta, ama qoraal albaabka ama daaqadda), tuubo, duct ama tray kaableed oo gudbaya darbi ama sagxad wuxuu leeyahay furan halkaas. Natiijooyinka waa la tiriyaa labo takhasus oo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxo la aqoonsaday oo qofna hubin\u003C/strong\u003E: darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado iyo qolal laga akhriyay PDF, scan ama sawir oo weli aan la xaqiijin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lod-ka-uu-marxalad-kasta-weydiisto\"\u003ELOD-ka uu marxalad kasta weydiisto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELOD-ka uu marxalad kasta weydiisto\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto ama u beddesho miiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska iyo ballaadhka lintel-ka waa qiyamka bilowga ee CadCraft. Lama soo qaadan heer caadi ah: mashruuc wuxuu dejiyaa LOD marxalad kasta qorshaha fulinta BIM. Dejiyo kuwaaga. Xafiis wuxuu dejin karaa miiska dadka oo dhan Settings › Default Policies › Audit; beddelka qaybta Audit waxaa lagu kaydiyaa kombiyuutarkan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-wanaagsan-inaad-ogaato\"\u003EWax wanaagsan inaad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELintel waxaa la qori karaa halkii la moodeli lahaa: dooro albaabka ama daaqadda oo buuxi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraalka lintel-ka ama header-ka\u003C/span\u003E hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaqiijin\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubo oo gudubta furan dhab ah ma gudbo wajiga, lama sheego. Mid lagu soo maro darbiga si toos ah waa la sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku dhaca wuxuu joogsadaa dhowr ilbiriqsi moodel aad u weyn, wuuna sheegaa taas. Hubin buuxda oo labo takhasus oo la doortay ah, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHel isku dhacyada u dhexeeya walxaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib u orod hubinta markaad beddesho moodelka. Natiijooyinka la aqbalay way la aqbalaan inta tirooyinkoodu is beddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu akhriyaa moodelka. Ma beddelo dib u eegista isku-xidhnaanta ee dadka mas&#039;uulka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-checks\"\u003EHubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHel isku dhacyada u dhexeeya walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/verification\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/verification\"\u003ECalaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Eeg moodelka oo dhan hal mar ka hor intaadan soo saarin. Hubintu waxay ku orodaa qawaacidaha hubinta diyaarka ah, oo natiijooyinkeeda ku riixa liiska Dhibaatooyin sida talo. Waxba lama joojiyo: waxaad hagaajisaa natiijo, ama aad aqbashaa sabab la sheegay, sida dhibaato kasta. Tallaabooyin Fur Hubinta moodelka › Hubin panel-ka bidix, ama Qalabka › Hubi moodelka… (la qoro: AUDIT). Dooro Marxaladda mashruuca. Waa marxaladda isku mid ee faahfaahinta sawirka. Calaamadee qawaacidaha hubinta si ay u ordaan. Guji Bilow hubinta. Akhri safka qawaacid kasta, kadibna Fur liiska Dhibaatooyinka. Guji natiijo kasta si walxaha u dooro. Warbixinta hubinta wuxuu soo dejiyaa warbixinta: natiijo kasta, cidda aqbashay waxa iyo sababtiisa, iyo qawaacidyada ordeen. Qawaacidyada Qolal aan magac lahayn: qol aan magac lahayn, ama weli loo yaqaan magaca barnaamijku siiyay (\"Room 3\"). Tags maqan: albaab ama daaqad aan calaamad lahayn, qol aan lambar lahayn, qalab koronto aan tag lahayn. Walxaha ka hooseeya LOD-ka marxaladda: darbi, sagxad, saqaf, roof, albaab iyo daaqad kasta oo LOD-kiisu ka yar yahay wixii marxaladdu weydiisato. Walxu wuxuu akhriyaa tag-ka LOD-ka nooceeda; walax la xaqiijiyay goobta waa LOD 500. Walxaha aan tag lahayn waa la tiriyaa hal ogaysiis, sababtoo ah lama hubin karo. Isku dhacyada u dhexeeya takhasusyada: walxaha laba takhasus (naqshadda, qaab-dhismeedka, mekaanikada, biyo-dhacyada, koronta, sida IFC class) oo is-dhex-galaya. Saqaf ku fadhiya darbiyadiisa lama tirinayo. Interfaces-ka LOD 350: albaab iyo daaqad kasta waxay ku jiraan furan darbigooda, furanku wuxuu ku habboonaadaa gudaha darbiga, labo furan ma isku dhacaan, furan ka ballaaran xadka wuxuu leeyahay lintel ama header (walax kor ku jirta, ama qoraal albaabka ama daaqadda), tuubo, duct ama tray kaableed oo gudbaya darbi ama sagxad wuxuu leeyahay furan halkaas. Natiijooyinka waa la tiriyaa labo takhasus oo kasta. Walxo la aqoonsaday oo qofna hubin: darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado iyo qolal laga akhriyay PDF, scan ama sawir oo weli aan la xaqiijin. Eeg Calaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta. LOD-ka uu marxalad kasta weydiisto Fur LOD-ka uu marxalad kasta weydiisto si aad u aragto ama u beddesho miiska. Miiska iyo ballaadhka lintel-ka waa qiyamka bilowga ee CadCraft. Lama soo qaadan heer caadi ah: mashruuc wuxuu dejiyaa LOD marxalad kasta qorshaha fulinta BIM. Dejiyo kuwaaga. Xafiis wuxuu dejin karaa miiska dadka oo dhan Settings › Default Policies › Audit; beddelka qaybta Audit waxaa lagu kaydiyaa kombiyuutarkan. Wax wanaagsan inaad ogaato Lintel waxaa la qori karaa halkii la moodeli lahaa: dooro albaabka ama daaqadda oo buuxi Qoraalka lintel-ka ama header-ka hoos Xaqiijin ee Sifooyinka. Tuubo oo gudubta furan dhab ah ma gudbo wajiga, lama sheego. Mid lagu soo maro darbiga si toos ah waa la sheegaa. Isku dhaca wuxuu joogsadaa dhowr ilbiriqsi moodel aad u weyn, wuuna sheegaa taas. Hubin buuxda oo labo takhasus oo la doortay ah, eeg Hel isku dhacyada u dhexeeya walxaha. Dib u orod hubinta markaad beddesho moodelka. Natiijooyinka la aqbalay way la aqbalaan inta tirooyinkoodu is beddelin. Wuxuu akhriyaa moodelka. Ma beddelo dib u eegista isku-xidhnaanta ee dadka mas'uulka ah. Xiga Hubi moodelka dhibaatooyinka caadiga ah Hel isku dhacyada u dhexeeya walxaha Calaamadee walxaha la hubiyay ama la xaqiijiyay goobta","lang":"so"},{"slug":"verification","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Calaamadee walxaha sida la hubiyay ama goobta laga xaqiijiyay","summary":"Walax laga akhriyay PDF ama scan waa mid aan la xaqiijin ilaa aad hubiso. Calaamadee walxaha sida la hubiyay, ama sida goobta laga xaqiijiyay (LOD 500) oo ay ku jiraan qofka cabbiray, goorta iyo habka, oo soo gudbi moodeel as-built ah oo sheegaya midka kale.","section":"tasks","order":176,"keywords":["aan la xaqiijin","la xaqiijiyay","la hubiyay","goobta laga xaqiijiyay","as built","as-built","lod 500","xidhitaanka","wareejin","goobta lagu cabbiray","fiid cabbir","laser","scan","sahan","dhismo jira","beddel","calaamadee sida la hubiyay","xaqiijin","heerka 7"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"scan-ka","text":"Scan-ka","level":2},{"id":"moodeelka-as-built-iyo-xirmada-wareejinta","text":"Moodeelka as-built iyo xirmada wareejinta","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-kaydiyo-ifc-da","text":"Sida loo kaydiyo IFC-da","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaadi waxa moodeelka ka mid ah oo qof si dhab ah u eegay. Walax waxay leedahay mid ka mid ah saddex calaamadood, ama midna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAan la xaqiijin\u003C/strong\u003E: barnaamijku wuu aqoonsaday marka laga soo akhriyo PDF, naqshad la scan-gareeyay, naqshad la raacay ama scan daruuro dhibcood. Qof weli ma hubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa hubiyay\u003C/strong\u003E: qof ayaa barbar dhigay naqshadda ay ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta laga xaqiijiyay (LOD 500)\u003C/strong\u003E: qof ayaa goobta cabbiray. Yaa, goorta iyo habka waa lagu kaydiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad la&#039;aan\u003C/strong\u003E: qof ayaa sawiray. Moodeelku ma sheego wax ku saabsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro hal walax ama badan (darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, qolal, walax kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVerification\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor yaa hubiyay ama cabbiray. Taariikhdu waa maanta ilaa aad beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as checked\u003C/span\u003E. Cabbirka goobta, dooro sida loo cabbiray (fiid cabbir, mitirka laser-ka, scan, sahan) oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as field-verified (LOD 500)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as unverified\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake the mark off\u003C/span\u003E waxay dib u celiyaan. Guji kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartaa, doorashada oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi degdeg ah u calaamadee doorasho: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark as checked\u003C/span\u003E (qoraalka: \u003Ccode\u003EMARKCHECKED\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu calaamadeeyaa doorashada sida ay adiga hubisay, maanta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha, walax aan la xaqiijin waxay leedahay sanduuq jajab ah iyo &quot;?&quot;; walax goobta laga xaqiijiyay waxay leedahay calaamad hubin. Ka saar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow verification marks in the plan\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E si aad u qariso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESchedules\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVerification\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa walax kasta oo calaamad leh, iyo heerkeeda, xaaladda, qofka, goorta, habka iyo meesha ay ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAudit-ku wuxuu liistaa walaxyada aan la xaqiijin, wuxuuna tiriyaa walaxa goobta laga xaqiijiyay sida LOD 500. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHubi moodeelka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scan-ka\"\u003EScan-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad scan-ka ku barbar dhigayso moodeelka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMark the matching elements as field-verified\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadeeyaa walax kasta oo scan-ku arkay sida la dhisay dulqaadka gudihiisa, habka &quot;scan&quot;, iyo dulqaadka ku jira qoraalka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-scan-with-model\"\u003EIsbarbar dhig scan moodeelka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarbardhiggan wuxuu isku dhigaa sanduuqa walax kasta lambarrada scan-ka. Ma aha sahan rasmi ah. Isticmaal walaxyada aad sidoo kale goob ahaan u eegtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodeelka-as-built-iyo-xirmada-wareejinta\"\u003EMoodeelka as-built iyo xirmada wareejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild the handover package\u003C/span\u003E ee tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssets\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodeelka as-built ku dhex geliyaa zip-ka, oo leh:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqoraal ku saabsan mashruuca oo tirinaya walaxyada goobta laga xaqiijiyay, la hubiyay, aan la xaqiijin iyo kuwa aan calaamad lahayn;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eas-built/verified-elements.csv\u003C/code\u003E: walax kasta iyo qol kasta oo xaaladdooda, qofka, goorta iyo habka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eas-built/as-built-drawings.pdf\u003C/code\u003E: kooxda naqshadaha sida hadda tahay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebuugga isbeddelka naqshadaha, marka moodeelku soo saaray kooxaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\"\u003EHantida iyo dayactirka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-kaydiyo-ifc-da\"\u003ESida loo kaydiyo IFC-da\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalax kasta oo calaamadaysan waxay leedahay habayn sifooyin \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_Verification\u003C/code\u003E: State, By, On, Method, Source, Note, iyo LevelOfDevelopment (\u003Ccode\u003ELOD 500\u003C/code\u003E intii ay goobta laga xaqiijinayso). Waa qoraal fudud, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale way akhrin karaan, Raadi, Midabee sifada ku salaysan iyo jadwallada calaamadaha ayaa isticmaali kara. Qoraalka as-built waa habayn sifooyin \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_AsBuilt\u003C/code\u003E oo mashruuca ku jirta. Walax aan habaynta lahayn lama cabbirin goobta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walls-from-plans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walls-from-plans\"\u003EDarbiyada laga sameeyo qorshayaasha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/audit-the-model\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/audit-the-model\"\u003EHubi moodeelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Raadi waxa moodeelka ka mid ah oo qof si dhab ah u eegay. Walax waxay leedahay mid ka mid ah saddex calaamadood, ama midna: Aan la xaqiijin: barnaamijku wuu aqoonsaday marka laga soo akhriyo PDF, naqshad la scan-gareeyay, naqshad la raacay ama scan daruuro dhibcood. Qof weli ma hubin. La hubiyay: qof ayaa barbar dhigay naqshadda ay ka timid. Goobta laga xaqiijiyay (LOD 500): qof ayaa goobta cabbiray. Yaa, goorta iyo habka waa lagu kaydiyaa. Calaamad la'aan: qof ayaa sawiray. Moodeelku ma sheego wax ku saabsan. Tallaabooyin Dooro hal walax ama badan (darbiyo, albaabo, daaqado, qolal, walax kasta). Panel-ka Properties fur Verification. Ku qor yaa hubiyay ama cabbiray. Taariikhdu waa maanta ilaa aad beddesho. Guji Mark as checked. Cabbirka goobta, dooro sida loo cabbiray (fiid cabbir, mitirka laser-ka, scan, sahan) oo guji Mark as field-verified (LOD 500). Mark as unverified iyo Take the mark off waxay dib u celiyaan. Guji kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon kartaa, doorashada oo dhan. Si degdeg ah u calaamadee doorasho: Tools › Mark as checked (qoraalka: MARKCHECKED) wuxuu calaamadeeyaa doorashada sida ay adiga hubisay, maanta. Waxa aad arkaysaa Qorshaha, walax aan la xaqiijin waxay leedahay sanduuq jajab ah iyo \"?\"; walax goobta laga xaqiijiyay waxay leedahay calaamad hubin. Ka saar Show verification marks in the plan qaybta Audit si aad u qariso. Schedules › Verification wuxuu liistaa walax kasta oo calaamad leh, iyo heerkeeda, xaaladda, qofka, goorta, habka iyo meesha ay ka timid. Audit-ku wuxuu liistaa walaxyada aan la xaqiijin, wuxuuna tiriyaa walaxa goobta laga xaqiijiyay sida LOD 500. Eeg Hubi moodeelka. Scan-ka Markaad scan-ka ku barbar dhigayso moodeelka, Mark the matching elements as field-verified wuxuu calaamadeeyaa walax kasta oo scan-ku arkay sida la dhisay dulqaadka gudihiisa, habka \"scan\", iyo dulqaadka ku jira qoraalka. Eeg Isbarbar dhig scan moodeelka. Barbardhiggan wuxuu isku dhigaa sanduuqa walax kasta lambarrada scan-ka. Ma aha sahan rasmi ah. Isticmaal walaxyada aad sidoo kale goob ahaan u eegtay. Moodeelka as-built iyo xirmada wareejinta Build the handover package ee tab-ka Assets wuxuu moodeelka as-built ku dhex geliyaa zip-ka, oo leh: qoraal ku saabsan mashruuca oo tirinaya walaxyada goobta laga xaqiijiyay, la hubiyay, aan la xaqiijin iyo kuwa aan calaamad lahayn; as-built/verified-elements.csv: walax kasta iyo qol kasta oo xaaladdooda, qofka, goorta iyo habka; as-built/as-built-drawings.pdf: kooxda naqshadaha sida hadda tahay; buugga isbeddelka naqshadaha, marka moodeelku soo saaray kooxaha. Eeg Hantida iyo dayactirka. Sida loo kaydiyo IFC-da Walax kasta oo calaamadaysan waxay leedahay habayn sifooyin CadCraft_Verification: State, By, On, Method, Source, Note, iyo LevelOfDevelopment (LOD 500 intii ay goobta laga xaqiijinayso). Waa qoraal fudud, sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale way akhrin karaan, Raadi, Midabee sifada ku salaysan iyo jadwallada calaamadaha ayaa isticmaali kara. Qoraalka as-built waa habayn sifooyin CadCraft_AsBuilt oo mashruuca ku jirta. Walax aan habaynta lahayn lama cabbirin goobta. Xiga Darbiyada laga sameeyo qorshayaasha Hubi moodeelka","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hal moodel si wadajir ah u shaqee Live TeamWork","summary":"Waxa isbedela BimCraft markaad ku jirto kal-fadhiga Live TeamWork ee CadCraft Studio: tafatirka qof walba ee isla moodelka IFC, ka noqoshadaada gaarka ah, iyo ku biirista browser-ka isla shabakadda.","section":"tasks","order":199,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","wada","wada shaqee","kal-fadhi","wadaag live","ku biir","ifc","sifooyinka","magac bedel","xuddun","pointer","cursor","isku arag","magacyada","midab","xulasho","ka noqo","martigeliye"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa","level":2},{"id":"dhammaantood-isku-mar-bay-tafatiraan","text":"Dhammaantood isku mar bay tafatiraan","level":2},{"id":"isku-arag","text":"Isku arag","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo-waxa-aad-samaysay-keliya","text":"Ka noqo waxa aad samaysay keliya","level":2},{"id":"ku-biir-browser-ka","text":"Ku biir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"marka-kal-fadhigu-dhammaado","text":"Marka kal-fadhigu dhammaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa dhaca moodel IFC marka dhowr qof oo isku mar tafatirayaan. CadCraft Studio ayaa bilaabta oo ku biirta kal-fadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag, Ku biir); bogan waxa uu ku saabsan yahay moodelka laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaantood-isku-mar-bay-tafatiraan\"\u003EDhammaantood isku mar bay tafatiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka martigeliyaha ayaa u imanaya qof walba oo ku biira. Magacyada walxaha u bedel, qiyamka sifooyinkooda beddel, meel dhig, beddel ama ka saar walxaha maktabadda iyo walxaha sida caadiga ah. Tafatirkaaga ayaa isla markiiba muuqda; tafatirka dadka kale wuxuu soo muuqdaa wakhti yar ka dib markay sameeyaan. Marka tafatir uu beddelo waxa aad aragto (walax la meel dhigay ama la saaray), BimCraft wuu dib u sawiraa moodelka wuuna ilaaliyaa aragtidaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba qof oo hal walax beddelaya:\u003C/strong\u003E isbeddelka dambe ee isla khadka moodelka ayaa guuleysta. Qaybta sifooyinka ee dhowr walax wadaagaan waxa loo koobiyeeyaa walaxda aad tafatirayso, sida had iyo jeer, si kuwa kale qiimahooda ay u haraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalax uu qof hadda tirtiray\u003C/strong\u003E mar dambe looma tafatiri karo: tafatirkaaga waa la soo celiyaa, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadadka cusub ee qof walba ee moodelka ayaa lambar u gaar ah helaya, sidaas darteed laba qof ma helaan isla mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-arag\"\u003EIsku arag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof walba oo kal-fadhiga ku jira midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay. Aragga 3D waxaad aragtaa xuddunta qof walba oo ah fallaadh midabkiisa leh, magaciisana dhinacdiisa, oo ku taal walaxda uu tilmaamayo, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkiisa leh oo ku wareegsan walax kasta oo uu xulay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXuddunta, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waxa loogu talagalay kal-fadhiga oo keliya: waligood looma kaydiyo faylka mana gelaan ka noqoshada qofna. Waxay u gudbaan meesha qof walba joogo, si ay u yihiin kuwo siman xitaa xidhiidh gaabani haddii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-waxa-aad-samaysay-keliya\"\u003EKa noqo waxa aad samaysay keliya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka noqonayaa tafatirkaaga ugu dambeeyay wuxuuna daayaa kan dadka kale. Markii qof uu isla shaqadii beddelay ka dib, waxba ma ka noqonayso oo sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa cidda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biir-browser-ka\"\u003EKu biir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaaxiib aan Studio haysan ayaa sawirka ku hoos koodka martigeliyaha ku iskaan gareyn karaa telefoon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isla shabakadda. BimCraft ayaa browser-ka ku furmaa, moodelka martigeliyaha ayuu furaa markii martigeliyuhu kuu ogolaado. Link martiqaad ayaa qof u oggolaanaya inuu ka ku biiro shabakad kale: martigeliyuhu wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qofka kale oo dhan bilaash ayuu ku biiraa, linkigana wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya inta kal-fadhiga martigeliyaha uu furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-kal-fadhigu-dhammaado\"\u003EMarka kal-fadhigu dhammaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMartigeliyaha oo keliya ayaa kaydiya moodelka. Qof kasta oo kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: haddii aad rabto inaad ilaaliso, u kaydi sida IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaliya moodelka ugu horreeya ee muuqaalka ayaa la wadaagaa. Fayl kale oo la furo inta kal-fadhiga socda ayaa kal-fadhiga ka tagaya daaqadaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa Waxa dhaca moodel IFC marka dhowr qof oo isku mar tafatirayaan. CadCraft Studio ayaa bilaabta oo ku biirta kal-fadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag, Ku biir); bogan waxa uu ku saabsan yahay moodelka laftiisa. Dhammaantood isku mar bay tafatiraan Moodelka martigeliyaha ayaa u imanaya qof walba oo ku biira. Magacyada walxaha u bedel, qiyamka sifooyinkooda beddel, meel dhig, beddel ama ka saar walxaha maktabadda iyo walxaha sida caadiga ah. Tafatirkaaga ayaa isla markiiba muuqda; tafatirka dadka kale wuxuu soo muuqdaa wakhti yar ka dib markay sameeyaan. Marka tafatir uu beddelo waxa aad aragto (walax la meel dhigay ama la saaray), BimCraft wuu dib u sawiraa moodelka wuuna ilaaliyaa aragtidaada. Laba qof oo hal walax beddelaya: isbeddelka dambe ee isla khadka moodelka ayaa guuleysta. Qaybta sifooyinka ee dhowr walax wadaagaan waxa loo koobiyeeyaa walaxda aad tafatirayso, sida had iyo jeer, si kuwa kale qiimahooda ay u haraan. Walax uu qof hadda tirtiray mar dambe looma tafatiri karo: tafatirkaaga waa la soo celiyaa, sadarka xaaladdana wuxuu sheegayaa sababta. Khadadka cusub ee qof walba ee moodelka ayaa lambar u gaar ah helaya, sidaas darteed laba qof ma helaan isla mid. Isku arag Qof walba oo kal-fadhiga ku jira midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay. Aragga 3D waxaad aragtaa xuddunta qof walba oo ah fallaadh midabkiisa leh, magaciisana dhinacdiisa, oo ku taal walaxda uu tilmaamayo, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkiisa leh oo ku wareegsan walax kasta oo uu xulay. Xuddunta, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waxa loogu talagalay kal-fadhiga oo keliya: waligood looma kaydiyo faylka mana gelaan ka noqoshada qofna. Waxay u gudbaan meesha qof walba joogo, si ay u yihiin kuwo siman xitaa xidhiidh gaabani haddii. Ka noqo waxa aad samaysay keliya Undo wuxuu ka noqonayaa tafatirkaaga ugu dambeeyay wuxuuna daayaa kan dadka kale. Markii qof uu isla shaqadii beddelay ka dib, waxba ma ka noqonayso oo sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa cidda. Ku biir browser-ka Saaxiib aan Studio haysan ayaa sawirka ku hoos koodka martigeliyaha ku iskaan gareyn karaa telefoon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isla shabakadda. BimCraft ayaa browser-ka ku furmaa, moodelka martigeliyaha ayuu furaa markii martigeliyuhu kuu ogolaado. Link martiqaad ayaa qof u oggolaanaya inuu ka ku biiro shabakad kale: martigeliyuhu wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qofka kale oo dhan bilaash ayuu ku biiraa, linkigana wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya inta kal-fadhiga martigeliyaha uu furan yahay. Marka kal-fadhigu dhammaado Martigeliyaha oo keliya ayaa kaydiya moodelka. Qof kasta oo kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: haddii aad rabto inaad ilaaliso, u kaydi sida IFC. Kaliya moodelka ugu horreeya ee muuqaalka ayaa la wadaagaa. Fayl kale oo la furo inta kal-fadhiga socda ayaa kal-fadhiga ka tagaya daaqadaas.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ka imanaya barnaamijyada BIM iyo naqshadaha kale","summary":"Sida caadooyinka BIM-ka desktop-ka iyo muujinta DWG ugu beddelaan BimCraft, iyo farqiyada dadka hor-taagaya.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["u guur","beddel","caadi ah","bim desktop","qoys","cabbirro","baaraha mashruuca","palette-ka sifooyinka","kuubka muuqaalka","xref","maareeyaha lakabyada","farqi","isbarbardhig"],"headings":[{"id":"dabeecadaha-la-isku-dhigay","text":"Dabeecadaha la isku dhigay","level":2},{"id":"marka-dwg-ga-la-eegayo","text":"Marka DWG-ga la eegayo","level":2},{"id":"farqiyada-dadka-hor-taagaya","text":"Farqiyada dadka hor-taagaya","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad taqaanno Revit, qaybta ugu badan ee BimCraft waxay kuu noqon doontaa mid la yaqaan erayada, laakiin aan la yaqaan xuddunta. Farqiga ugu muhiimsan: \u003Cstrong\u003Edhismahan wuxuu akhriyaa oo baadhaa moodelada, wuxuuna wax ka beddelaa xogta IFC. Weli ma qoro sida Revit.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma taaban kartid derbiyada, ma geli kartid qoysaska, ma samayn kartid aragtiyo ama xaashiyo, ama ma keydin kartid fayl mashruuc. Waxa aad samayn karto waa inaad furto inta badan faylasha dhismaha ee kumbiyuutar kasta oo leh browser, aad aragto waxa ku jira, aad hubiso gal mashruuc oo dhan, iyo inaad xogta moodel IFC ah wax ka saxdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabeecadaha-la-isku-dhigay\"\u003EDabeecadaha la isku dhigay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHaddii aad caadi u tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBimCraft dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuridda \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E Revit si aad moodelka u aragto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft wuxuu \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E ka furaa kaarka fayl: nooca la sii daayay, macluumaadka mashruuca, isku xirnaanta, hordhac. Moodelka 3D, dhoofi IFC kadibna fur taas. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/read-rvt-file\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/read-rvt-file\"\u003EAkhri fayl mashruuc ama qoys\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIn la eego nooca faylku lagu kaydiyay ka hor furidda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaarku wuxuu sare ku sheegaa &quot;saved in Revit …&quot;, isagoo aan cusboonaysiin ama taaban faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaaraha mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro baare aragtiyo iyo xaashiyo. Moodel IFC wuxuu leeyahay liisaska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E; naqshad waxay leedahay tabs-ka xaashiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPalette-ka sifooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca midig, walxaha aad riixday. IFC property sets halkii parameter groups\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirrada tusaalaha iyo nooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESet-yada sifooyinka tusaalaha, iyo set-yada lagu calaamadeeyay &quot;(type)&quot;. Isbeddelka nooca wuxuu ku dhacaa walax kasta oo nooca ah, sida Revit. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EBedel sifada nooca walxaha nooca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit Type\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro daaqad: guji qiimaha set-ka &quot;(type)&quot; oo qor\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro walxo badan, shaandheeyayaasha, Select All Instances\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMid mid. Weli lama dhisin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuubka muuqaalka iyo giraanta socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuubka muuqaalka dhinaca hoose ee midig, afar badhan (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E) iyo wareeg xor ah. Ma jiro giraan socod\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift iyo jiid badhanka dhexe si loo wareego, jiid badhanka dhexe si loo dhaqaajiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid bidix wuxuu wareegaa, jiid midig (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid) wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa, wiishka mouse-ka wuu weyneeyaa. Habka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka BIM\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa dhaqaajinta jiid badhanka dhexe, iyo wareegga \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka dhexe. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshayaasha dabaqa, qaybaha, sanduuqyada qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal diyaarad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E mar (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); ma jiro sanduuq qayb ama qorshe 2D. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoyo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQari aragga, kala saar, muuqaal/garaafyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/span\u003E shid iyo demi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/span\u003E. Weli ma jiro qarin walax kasta gaar ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeelaha IFC, marka hore waa la qariyaa. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi, U kaydi sida, isla-waqtiga xarunta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl IFC cusub. Asalku ma beddelmo. Ma jiro xarun, ma jiro wadaageyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu shaqeeyaa wax ka beddelka IFC ilaa aad kaydiso. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-ifc-properties\"\u003EBeddel sifooyinka IFC oo kaydi nuqul la wax ka beddelay\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaamul isku xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur gal-ka mashruuca: isku xidh kasta waa la hubiyaa oo waxaa lagu calaamadaa \u003Cstrong\u003EGudaha gal-kan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMagac isku mid ah ayaa la helay\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFayl maktabad\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro gudaha gal-kan\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-folder\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-folder\"\u003EFur gal-ka mashruuca oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubinta, ama furida fayl si loo eego inuu qaldan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWarbixinta gal-ka waxay hubisaa nuqul kasta iyo kaydinta inay dhammaatay ama go&#039;day, dhowr ilbiriqsi gudahood. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/check-folder-health\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/check-folder-health\"\u003EHubi gal-ka nuqullada dhaawacan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro faylka saxda ah gal-ka jajaban\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalkan ka bilow\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo jeediyaa mid, oo sababaha ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii inta badan moodelada aad furto si aad u hubiso, sida barnaamij hubinta moodelka ama IFC, dooro habka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEegaha\u003C/span\u003E: qalabyada eegista iyo hubinta ayaa hore u yimaadda, qalabyada dhismaha ayaa ku jira hal liis. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-dwg-ga-la-eegayo\"\u003EMarka DWG-ga la eegayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad DWG ku furto AutoCAD ama DWG viewer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHaddii aad caadi u tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBimCraft dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabs-ka moodelka iyo qaabeynta hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabs-ka sare ee naqshadda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E iyo mid kasta oo xaashi ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZOOM Extents, laba jeer guji wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer guji, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU dhaqaaq badhanka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaareeyaha lakabyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/span\u003E: calaamee si aad u muujiso, ka saar si aad u qariso, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan shid\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan demi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaareeyaha xref\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha isku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca midig, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003ELa muujiyay\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELama helin\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar naqshado isku xidhan…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHore u eegista daabacaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: madow ku qoran cad oo leh culeyska xariiqda. Ma daabacdo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saarista xogta sifooyinka bloogga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E naqshadaha cuntada ee calaamadeeyay, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaas, sawir, wax ka beddel, u kaydi sida\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jirto BimCraft-ka. Barnaamijka naqshadaha CadCraft wuu sawiraa oo wuu wax ka beddelaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"farqiyada-dadka-hor-taagaya\"\u003EFarqiyada dadka hor-taagaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa uu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, browser-kuna wuu ka taxaddaraa faylashaada.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu akhrin karaa kaliya faylasha iyo gallada aad siiso, adigoo doorta ama jiidaya. Ma furi karo fayl isaga kaligiis, ma-na qori karo meel kale. Kaydin kasta waa soo dejin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba lama soo rarin.\u003C/strong\u003E Erayga &quot;upload&quot; ee sanduuqyada gallada browser-ka qaarkood waa erayga browser-ka laftiisa. Faylasha waxay sii joogaan kumbiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC waa qaabka moodelka.\u003C/strong\u003E Fayl mashruuc wuxuu u furmaa kaarka sababta oo ah waxa ku jira 3D aan la qeexin. Ku tixgeli IFC inuu yahay jidka moodelada u galaan BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddelku waa nuqul-ku-qoris.\u003C/strong\u003E Beddelka qiimaha hal walax ma beddelo kuwa ku dhow, xitaa haddii dhoofiyuhu qiimahaas la wadaago. Sifooyinka nooca waa kiiska gaarka ah ee la go&#039;aamiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro mashruuc, ma jiro aragtiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa hal fayl mar, ma xusuusto wax ka mid ah marka aad xirto tab-ka, marka laga reebo magacyada galalka dhowaan ee Chrome iyo Edge.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaasha Mac.\u003C/strong\u003E Meesha gaabinta Windows ee Revit ay isticmaasho Ctrl, gaabinta BimCraft waxay isticmaashaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: Command oo ah Mac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabeecadaha mouse-kaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Wareegidda waa badhanka bidix, ma aha Shift iyo badhanka dhexe, mooyaane haddii aad dooratid habka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka BIM\u003C/span\u003E ama aad badhamada u dejiso adiga laftaadu ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E si aad u ogaato waxa aad maanta isticmaasho.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Haddii aad taqaanno Revit, qaybta ugu badan ee BimCraft waxay kuu noqon doontaa mid la yaqaan erayada, laakiin aan la yaqaan xuddunta. Farqiga ugu muhiimsan: dhismahan wuxuu akhriyaa oo baadhaa moodelada, wuxuuna wax ka beddelaa xogta IFC. Weli ma qoro sida Revit. Ma taaban kartid derbiyada, ma geli kartid qoysaska, ma samayn kartid aragtiyo ama xaashiyo, ama ma keydin kartid fayl mashruuc. Waxa aad samayn karto waa inaad furto inta badan faylasha dhismaha ee kumbiyuutar kasta oo leh browser, aad aragto waxa ku jira, aad hubiso gal mashruuc oo dhan, iyo inaad xogta moodel IFC ah wax ka saxdo. Dabeecadaha la isku dhigay Haddii aad caadi u tahay BimCraft dhexdiisa Furidda .rvt Revit si aad moodelka u aragto BimCraft wuxuu .rvt ka furaa kaarka fayl: nooca la sii daayay, macluumaadka mashruuca, isku xirnaanta, hordhac. Moodelka 3D, dhoofi IFC kadibna fur taas. Akhri fayl mashruuc ama qoys In la eego nooca faylku lagu kaydiyay ka hor furidda Kaarku wuxuu sare ku sheegaa \"saved in Revit …\", isagoo aan cusboonaysiin ama taaban faylka Baaraha mashruuca Ma jiro baare aragtiyo iyo xaashiyo. Moodel IFC wuxuu leeyahay liisaska Dabaqyada iyo Walxaha; naqshad waxay leedahay tabs-ka xaashiyada Palette-ka sifooyinka Panelka Sifooyinka dhinaca midig, walxaha aad riixday. IFC property sets halkii parameter groups Cabbirrada tusaalaha iyo nooca Set-yada sifooyinka tusaalaha, iyo set-yada lagu calaamadeeyay \"(type)\". Isbeddelka nooca wuxuu ku dhacaa walax kasta oo nooca ah, sida Revit. Bedel sifada nooca walxaha nooca oo dhan Edit Type Ma jiro daaqad: guji qiimaha set-ka \"(type)\" oo qor Dooro walxo badan, shaandheeyayaasha, Select All Instances Mid mid. Weli lama dhisin Kuubka muuqaalka iyo giraanta socodka Kuubka muuqaalka dhinaca hoose ee midig, afar badhan (Ku habee, Sare, Hore, Dhinac) iyo wareeg xor ah. Ma jiro giraan socod Shift iyo jiid badhanka dhexe si loo wareego, jiid badhanka dhexe si loo dhaqaajiyo Jiid bidix wuxuu wareegaa, jiid midig (ama Shift iyo jiid) wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa, wiishka mouse-ka wuu weyneeyaa. Habka menu-ga Jadwalka BIM wuxuu u beddelaa dhaqaajinta jiid badhanka dhexe, iyo wareegga Shift oo leh badhanka dhexe. Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka Qorshayaasha dabaqa, qaybaha, sanduuqyada qaybta Hal diyaarad Goyn mar (X); ma jiro sanduuq qayb ama qorshe 2D. Goyo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn ah Qari aragga, kala saar, muuqaal/garaafyo Dabaqyada shid iyo demi, Meelaha iyo Xuduudaha. Weli ma jiro qarin walax kasta gaar ahaan Qolal Meelaha IFC, marka hore waa la qariyaa. Guji Meelaha Kaydi, U kaydi sida, isla-waqtiga xarunta U kaydi sida IFC wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl IFC cusub. Asalku ma beddelmo. Ma jiro xarun, ma jiro wadaageyn Ka noqo Ctrl+Z Wuxuu shaqeeyaa wax ka beddelka IFC ilaa aad kaydiso. Beddel sifooyinka IFC oo kaydi nuqul la wax ka beddelay Maamul isku xidhka Fur gal-ka mashruuca: isku xidh kasta waa la hubiyaa oo waxaa lagu calaamadaa Gudaha gal-kan, Magac isku mid ah ayaa la helay, Fayl maktabad ama Ma jiro gudaha gal-kan. Fur gal-ka mashruuca oo dhan Hubinta, ama furida fayl si loo eego inuu qaldan yahay Warbixinta gal-ka waxay hubisaa nuqul kasta iyo kaydinta inay dhammaatay ama go'day, dhowr ilbiriqsi gudahood. Hubi gal-ka nuqullada dhaawacan Dooro faylka saxda ah gal-ka jajaban Sanduuqa Halkan ka bilow wuxuu soo jeediyaa mid, oo sababaha ku jira Haddii inta badan moodelada aad furto si aad u hubiso, sida barnaamij hubinta moodelka ama IFC, dooro habka menu-ga Eegaha: qalabyada eegista iyo hubinta ayaa hore u yimaadda, qalabyada dhismaha ayaa ku jira hal liis. Eeg Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Marka DWG-ga la eegayo Haddii aad DWG ku furto AutoCAD ama DWG viewer: Haddii aad caadi u tahay BimCraft dhexdiisa Tabs-ka moodelka iyo qaabeynta hoose Tabs-ka sare ee naqshadda: Moodeel iyo mid kasta oo xaashi ah ZOOM Extents, laba jeer guji wheel-ka Laba jeer guji, F ama Ku habee U dhaqaaq badhanka dhexe Jiid badhanka kasta Maareeyaha lakabyada Liiska Lakabyada: calaamee si aad u muujiso, ka saar si aad u qariso, Dhammaan shid iyo Dhammaan demi Maareeyaha xref Naqshadaha isku xidhan dhinaca midig, oo leh La muujiyay ama Lama helin, iyo Ku dar naqshado isku xidhan… Hore u eegista daabacaadda Aragtida daabacaadda ama P: madow ku qoran cad oo leh culeyska xariiqda. Ma daabacdo Soo saarista xogta sifooyinka bloogga Tab-ka Qalabka naqshadaha cuntada ee calaamadeeyay, oo leh Soo deji CSV Qiyaas, sawir, wax ka beddel, u kaydi sida Ma jirto BimCraft-ka. Barnaamijka naqshadaha CadCraft wuu sawiraa oo wuu wax ka beddelaa Farqiyada dadka hor-taagaya Waxa uu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, browser-kuna wuu ka taxaddaraa faylashaada. BimCraft wuxuu akhrin karaa kaliya faylasha iyo gallada aad siiso, adigoo doorta ama jiidaya. Ma furi karo fayl isaga kaligiis, ma-na qori karo meel kale. Kaydin kasta waa soo dejin. Waxba lama soo rarin. Erayga \"upload\" ee sanduuqyada gallada browser-ka qaarkood waa erayga browser-ka laftiisa. Faylasha waxay sii joogaan kumbiyuutarkaaga. IFC waa qaabka moodelka. Fayl mashruuc wuxuu u furmaa kaarka sababta oo ah waxa ku jira 3D aan la qeexin. Ku tixgeli IFC inuu yahay jidka moodelada u galaan BimCraft. Wax ka beddelku waa nuqul-ku-qoris. Beddelka qiimaha hal walax ma beddelo kuwa ku dhow, xitaa haddii dhoofiyuhu qiimahaas la wadaago. Sifooyinka nooca waa kiiska gaarka ah ee la go'aamiyay. Ma jiro mashruuc, ma jiro aragtiyo. BimCraft wuxuu muujiyaa hal fayl mar, ma xusuusto wax ka mid ah marka aad xirto tab-ka, marka laga reebo magacyada galalka dhowaan ee Chrome iyo Edge. Furayaasha Mac. Meesha gaabinta Windows ee Revit ay isticmaasho Ctrl, gaabinta BimCraft waxay isticmaashaa Ctrl: Command oo ah Mac. Dabeecadaha mouse-kaaga. Wareegidda waa badhanka bidix, ma aha Shift iyo badhanka dhexe, mooyaane haddii aad dooratid habka menu-ga Jadwalka BIM ama aad badhamada u dejiso adiga laftaadu ee Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin si aad u ogaato waxa aad maanta isticmaasho.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"two-bim-programs","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Shaqada ka dhex-dhexaysa labo barnaamij oo BIM ah","summary":"U dir moodel barnaamij BIM ah oo kale IFC-ka oo BimCraft dhexda ku jira, ku hay GlobalIds-keeda, kooxaha sifooyinkiisa iyo kala-soocidda, dejiso labada barnaamij si ay u isticmaalaan isla sifooyinka, oo ogow waxa dib u soo noqday.","section":"switching","order":40,"keywords":["ifc","round trip","interoperability","globalid","guid","kooxaha sifooyinka","psets","kala-soocidda","halbeegyada la wadaago","khariidadda sifooyinka","translator","bcf","isku-duwidda","isdhaafsiga"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-bimcraft-hayaa","text":"Waxa BimCraft hayaa","level":2},{"id":"labada-barnaamijba-u-dejiso-isla-sifooyinka","text":"Labada barnaamijba u dejiso isla sifooyinka","level":2},{"id":"moodelka-u-dir-oo-soo-celi","text":"Moodelka u dir oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"akhri-warbixinta","text":"Akhri warbixinta","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-bcf-ayaa-u-safra","text":"Dhibaatooyinka BCF ayaa u safra","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodel u gudbi barnaamij BIM ah oo kale barnaamij BIM ah oo kale, tusaale ahaan Revit ilaa Archicad iyo dib, adigoo maraya IFC, BimCraft dhexda ku jira si uu u hubiyo, wax ugu daro oo uu u sheego waxa badbaaday. Faylka barnaamijkiiba ma akhrisano: wax walba IFC ayuu u safraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-bimcraft-hayaa\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft hayaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad moodel BimCraft ku beddesho oo aad riixdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E, wax kasta oo aanad beddelin ayaa dib loo qoraa sidii ay ahayd. Sidaas darteed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGlobalIds\u003C/strong\u003E way isku mid ahaanayaan, barnaamijka kale wuxuu walax kasta ku isku xidhi karaa midka uu u diray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha sifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo qiimayaashooda way sii jiraan, marka laga reebo qiimayaasha aad beddeshay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-soocidda\u003C/strong\u003E way ku xiran tahay walxahooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"labada-barnaamijba-u-dejiso-isla-sifooyinka\"\u003ELabada barnaamijba u dejiso isla sifooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu fur moodelka BimCraft (iyo bundle-ka mashruuca, haddii aad leedahay: kooxaha sifooyinkiisa waa lagu daraa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca bidix ee panel-ka, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBetween two BIM programs\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKhariidadda sifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, soo deji waxa barnaamij kasta u baahan yahay:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShared parameters\u003C/span\u003E: fayl halbeegyada la wadaago. Revit-ka, ku rar Manage › Shared Parameters oo ku dar halbeegyada qaybaha u baahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC export property sets\u003C/span\u003E: fayl kooxda sifooyinka ee user-defined. Dejinta dhoofinta IFC ee Revit, dooro hoosta user-defined property sets, si IFC-ga la dhoofiyo uu ku qaado isla kooxda iyo magacyada sifooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMapping table (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E: sifo kasta oo leh kooxdeeda IFC iyo magaceeda, nooceeda, iyo magacyada u dhigma barnaamij kasta. Faylasha khariidadda ee Archicad ma aha qaab la daabaco, sidaas darteed IFC translator-keeda iyo property manager-keeda ku dejiso gacanta, miiskan ka soo qaadatay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMapping file\u003C/span\u003E: khariidadda oo dhan hal fayl, si ay mashruuca ula socoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha caadiga ah (Pset_ iyo Qto_) ayaa laga reebay faylka halbeegyada la wadaago: labada barnaamijba xogtooda ayay ka qoraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodelka-u-dir-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EMoodelka u dir oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa dhoofi IFC barnaamijka koowaad iyada oo GlobalIds la hayo (Revit: &quot;Store the IFC GUID in an element parameter after export&quot; waa la shiidaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu fur BimCraft, hubi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel checks\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClash check\u003C/span\u003E), ku dar dhibaatooyin (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E, BCF), beddel qiimayaasha haddii aad u baahan tahay, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu fur IFC-ga la kaydiyay barnaamijka labaad, ka shaqee, kadibna ka dhoofi IFC iyada oo GlobalIds la hayo (translator-ka Archicad: &quot;Global Unique Identifiers: Keep existing&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib BimCraft, ku fur moodelka la diray, kadibna ku dar kii soo laabtay (\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar moodel\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta Models).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBetween two BIM programs\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBaxay\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo laabtay\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the report\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-warbixinta\"\u003EAkhri warbixinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha\u003C/strong\u003E: intee ka soo laabatay GlobalId isku mid ah, intee ka maqan, iyo intee cusub. Walxaha leh GlobalId cusub waxay muuqdaan hal maqan iyo hal cusub: barnaamijka kale ma uu hayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFasalka IFC ee la beddelay\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha soo laabtay nooc kale oo walax ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimayaasha sifooyinka la kaydiyay\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybta qiimayaasha soo laabtay isla sidii ay ahaayeen. Liiska hoose wuxuu muujinayaa sifooyinka leh qiimayaasha ugu badan ee la beddelay ama maqan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-soocidda\u003C/strong\u003E: la kaydiyay, la beddelay (isla nidaam, koodh kale) ama maqan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload the report (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa sifo kasta oo leh tirooyinkeeda. Si aad u aragto walxaha dhaqaaqay ama qaabkooda beddelay, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare versions\u003C/span\u003E isla laba moodel oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft ma shaqeeyo labadaba barnaamijba. Qaabeynta barnaamijkiiba ayaa go&#039;aamisa qiimaha qaabka uu u socdo, warbixinta ayaa muujinaysa waxa dhab ahaan soo laabtay, sidaas darteed isku day qaabayn, dib u dhoof oo isbarbardhig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-bcf-ayaa-u-safra\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka BCF ayaa u safra\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibaatooyinka aad ka keento BimCraft waxay u dhoofaan BCF (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIssues\u003C/span\u003E), kuwaas oo labada barnaamijba akhriyi karaan qalabkooda BCF, si su&#039;aal ku saabsan walax u gaarto qofka ka shaqeeya barnaamijka kale oo muuqaalkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EFur bundle mashruuc\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EMashruuca faylka ka Bimcraft ilaa IFC\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/compare-versions\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/compare-versions\"\u003EBarbardhig labo nooc oo moodel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Moodel u gudbi barnaamij BIM ah oo kale barnaamij BIM ah oo kale, tusaale ahaan Revit ilaa Archicad iyo dib, adigoo maraya IFC, BimCraft dhexda ku jira si uu u hubiyo, wax ugu daro oo uu u sheego waxa badbaaday. Faylka barnaamijkiiba ma akhrisano: wax walba IFC ayuu u safraa. Waxa BimCraft hayaa Markaad moodel BimCraft ku beddesho oo aad riixdo Save as IFC, wax kasta oo aanad beddelin ayaa dib loo qoraa sidii ay ahayd. Sidaas darteed: GlobalIds way isku mid ahaanayaan, barnaamijka kale wuxuu walax kasta ku isku xidhi karaa midka uu u diray. Kooxaha sifooyinka iyo qiimayaashooda way sii jiraan, marka laga reebo qiimayaasha aad beddeshay. Kala-soocidda way ku xiran tahay walxahooda. Labada barnaamijba u dejiso isla sifooyinka Ku fur moodelka BimCraft (iyo bundle-ka mashruuca, haddii aad leedahay: kooxaha sifooyinkiisa waa lagu daraa). Dhinaca bidix ee panel-ka, fur Between two BIM programs. Hoosta Khariidadda sifooyinka, soo deji waxa barnaamij kasta u baahan yahay: Shared parameters: fayl halbeegyada la wadaago. Revit-ka, ku rar Manage › Shared Parameters oo ku dar halbeegyada qaybaha u baahan. IFC export property sets: fayl kooxda sifooyinka ee user-defined. Dejinta dhoofinta IFC ee Revit, dooro hoosta user-defined property sets, si IFC-ga la dhoofiyo uu ku qaado isla kooxda iyo magacyada sifooyinka. Mapping table (CSV): sifo kasta oo leh kooxdeeda IFC iyo magaceeda, nooceeda, iyo magacyada u dhigma barnaamij kasta. Faylasha khariidadda ee Archicad ma aha qaab la daabaco, sidaas darteed IFC translator-keeda iyo property manager-keeda ku dejiso gacanta, miiskan ka soo qaadatay. Mapping file: khariidadda oo dhan hal fayl, si ay mashruuca ula socoto. Kooxaha caadiga ah (Pset_ iyo Qto_) ayaa laga reebay faylka halbeegyada la wadaago: labada barnaamijba xogtooda ayay ka qoraan. Moodelka u dir oo soo celi Ka dhoofi IFC barnaamijka koowaad iyada oo GlobalIds la hayo (Revit: \"Store the IFC GUID in an element parameter after export\" waa la shiidaa). Ku fur BimCraft, hubi (Model checks, Clash check), ku dar dhibaatooyin (Issues, BCF), beddel qiimayaasha haddii aad u baahan tahay, kadibna Save as IFC. Ku fur IFC-ga la kaydiyay barnaamijka labaad, ka shaqee, kadibna ka dhoofi IFC iyada oo GlobalIds la hayo (translator-ka Archicad: \"Global Unique Identifiers: Keep existing\"). Dib BimCraft, ku fur moodelka la diray, kadibna ku dar kii soo laabtay (Ku dar moodel hoosta Models). Hoosta Between two BIM programs, dooro Baxay iyo Soo laabtay, kadibna guji Make the report. Akhri warbixinta Walxaha: intee ka soo laabatay GlobalId isku mid ah, intee ka maqan, iyo intee cusub. Walxaha leh GlobalId cusub waxay muuqdaan hal maqan iyo hal cusub: barnaamijka kale ma uu hayn. Fasalka IFC ee la beddelay: walxaha soo laabtay nooc kale oo walax ah. Qiimayaasha sifooyinka la kaydiyay: qaybta qiimayaasha soo laabtay isla sidii ay ahaayeen. Liiska hoose wuxuu muujinayaa sifooyinka leh qiimayaasha ugu badan ee la beddelay ama maqan. Kala-soocidda: la kaydiyay, la beddelay (isla nidaam, koodh kale) ama maqan. Download the report (CSV) wuxuu siinayaa sifo kasta oo leh tirooyinkeeda. Si aad u aragto walxaha dhaqaaqay ama qaabkooda beddelay, isticmaal Compare versions isla laba moodel oo kale. BimCraft ma shaqeeyo labadaba barnaamijba. Qaabeynta barnaamijkiiba ayaa go'aamisa qiimaha qaabka uu u socdo, warbixinta ayaa muujinaysa waxa dhab ahaan soo laabtay, sidaas darteed isku day qaabayn, dib u dhoof oo isbarbardhig. Dhibaatooyinka BCF ayaa u safra Dhibaatooyinka aad ka keento BimCraft waxay u dhoofaan BCF (Issues), kuwaas oo labada barnaamijba akhriyi karaan qalabkooda BCF, si su'aal ku saabsan walax u gaarto qofka ka shaqeeya barnaamijka kale oo muuqaalkiisa. Eeg sidoo kale Fur bundle mashruuc, Mashruuca faylka ka Bimcraft ilaa IFC iyo Barbardhig labo nooc oo moodel.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Dejinta BimCraft","summary":"Dooro in qolalka iyo meelaha la muujiyo, in geesaha la sawiro iyo aragtida uu moodeelku ku furmo, iyo in darbiga ku dhufo uu bilowgii shidan yahay.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["dejinta","doorashooyin","meelaha","qolalka","ifcspace","geesaha","xariiqyada","waxqabadka","moodeel weyn","aragtida furitaanka","kaamarad","aragtida sare","darbiga ku dhufo","ku dhufo"],"headings":[{"id":"menu-yada-furayaasha-iyo-mouse-ka","text":"Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","level":2},{"id":"marka-moodeel-la-furo","text":"Marka moodeel la furo","level":2},{"id":"sawiruhu-wuxuu-ku-furmaa","text":"Sawiruhu wuxuu ku furmaa","level":2},{"id":"aragtida-furitaanka","text":"Aragtida furitaanka","level":2},{"id":"dhigidda-alaabta-maktabadda","text":"Dhigidda alaabta maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-goynta","text":"Sanduuqa goynta","level":2},{"id":"booska","text":"Booska","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-geeska","text":"Calaamadda geeska","level":2},{"id":"magacaaga-arrimaha","text":"Magacaaga arrimaha","level":2},{"id":"kaaliyaha","text":"Kaaliyaha","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E adigoo riixaya gear-ka ku yaal barta sare ee app-ka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tab-ka koowaad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu hayaa dejinta app-kan gaarka u ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa dejinta ay wadaagaan dhammaan app-yada CadCraft (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, daaqadaha). Dejinta BimCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka keliya: halkan ayaad ku beddeshaa, browser-kanuna waa xasuustaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta daaqadda wuxuu dejintaas iyo kuwa la wadaago labaduba dib ugu celiyaa bilowgii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"menu-yada-furayaasha-iyo-mouse-ka\"\u003EMenu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka menu-ga (toolbar-ka BimCraft, menu bar-ka naqshadda guriga, ribbon-ka BIM ama safka amarka naqshadda), furayaashaaga iyo menu-yadaada, iyo waxa wheel-ka iyo badhamada mouse-ka qabtaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-moodeel-la-furo\"\u003EMarka moodeel la furo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji qolalka iyo meelaha\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowgii waa damis): qolalka iyo meelaha waa sanduuqyo muuqaalkoodu dhex yaal oo qari kara darbiyada ka danbeeya, sidaas darteed bilowgii waa la qariyaa. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeelaha\u003C/span\u003E ee ku yaal moodelka korkiisa ayaa wali shidi kara oo damin kara moodeelka furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesaha shidan\u003C/span\u003E (bilowgii) wuxuu sawiraa xariiqyada geesaha ee bixiya muuqaalka naqshadda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelada yaryar oo keliya\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa kuwa ka yar 300,000 saddexgeesle, taasoo ka dhigta moodeelada waaweyn kuwo dhaqso u beddelma. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesaha damsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodel kasta ku bilaabaa iyada oo aan lahayn. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesaha\u003C/span\u003E wali wuu damin karaa moodeelka furan. Ka sarreeya 1.5 milyan saddexgeesle, geesaha had iyo jeer waa damsan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawiruhu-wuxuu-ku-furmaa\"\u003ESawiruhu wuxuu ku furmaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida sawirka DWG ama DXF uu marka hore u muuqdo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D (ugu dhakhsaha badan)\u003C/span\u003E (bilowgii) wuxuu si dhakhso leh u sawiraa xitaa sawir weyn, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel (2D)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa aragtida laba-geesle ee meesha moodelka. Tabs-ka ka sarreeya sawirka wuxuu u beddelaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E, xaashiyada iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E waqti kasta. Sawir aan waxba ku jirin meesha moodelka, ama browser aan 3D muujin karin, mar walba wuxuu ku furmaa 2D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aragtida-furitaanka\"\u003EAragtida furitaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaamaradda moodelku ku furmo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E (bilowgii, moodelka oo dhan xagga geesaha), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E. Badhamada ka sarreeya moodelka waxay beddeli karaan aragtida waqti kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhismo la rogay goobtiisa\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelo badan waxay yimaaddaan dhismo xagal ka samaysan xagalka faylka (survey ama isku-xirnaanta wadaagga ah). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu toosan dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E (bilowgii) wuxuu muujiyaa dhismahaas oo toosan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinac\u003C/span\u003E, wajiyada kaarka aragtida iyo goyn kasta oo cusub way raacaan darbiyadiisa, qiyaasta kaarka aragtidana wuxuu weli tilmaamaa waqooyiga moodelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida goobta lagu dhigay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa xagalka faylka. Dhismo darbiyadiisu ku jiraan xagalka ayaa labadaba u eg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhigidda-alaabta-maktabadda\"\u003EDhigidda alaabta maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow darbiga ku dhufo oo shidan\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowgii damis): marka dhigidda ama koobiyeynta alaabta maktabadda bilaabanto, dhabarkeeda wuxuu ku dhufaa darbiga ugu dhow, isagoo u jeeda qolka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarbiga ku dhufo\u003C/span\u003E ee barta dhigidda ayaa damiya waqtigaas. Dabaq aan darbi lahayn wuxuu bilaabaa isagoo aan lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-goynta\"\u003ESanduuqa goynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeel ku wareegsan xulashada\u003C/span\u003E waa inta meel ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay\u003C/span\u003E uu ka tago dhinac kasta oo xubnaha la doortay, millimitir ahaan: 300 bilowgii, ilaa 5000. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoyn moodel IFC adigoo isticmaalaya qorshe goynta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"booska\"\u003EBooska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELatitude iyo longitude ku qoran\u003C/span\u003E waxay doorataa nidaamka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E ku bixiyo latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka: WGS 84 (EPSG:4326, bilowgii, sida GPS-ka iyo khariidadaha webka u isticmaalaan), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatum-ka faylka laftiisa\u003C/span\u003E, ama mid ka mid ah ETRS89, NAD83, GDA94, GDA2020, NZGD2000, JGD2011 iyo CGCS2000. Nidaamka khariidadda iyo datum-ka faylka waa had iyo jeer la muujiyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas masaafooyin, bannaanno iyo booska 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-geeska\"\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku yaal geeska hoose ee midig ee aragtida 3D (moodel IFC, iyo sawir loo beddelay 3D): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaarka aragtida\u003C/span\u003E (bilowgii), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadda tooska\u003C/span\u003E (X, Y iyo Z oo yaryar) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidna\u003C/span\u003E. Isla markiiba ayuu beddelaa. Aragtida sawirka 2D weligeed ma muujiso mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarka aragtida, guji wejiga, geesha ama geeska si aad uga aragto dhinacaas, jiid kaarka si uu u wareego, jiid giraanta si aad u leexato, oo guji guriga si aad u aragto aragtida bilowgii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magacaaga-arrimaha\"\u003EMagacaaga arrimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad galto, arrimuhu waxay ku qoran yihiin magaca akoonkaaga, BimCraftna waxba ma weydiinayo: qaybtani waxay muujinaysaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkoonkaaga (&lt;name&gt;)\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal magac kale\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa sanduuq magac kale oo, kaas oo ka guuleysta ilaa aad dooratid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal magaca akoonkayga\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii aadan soo galin, foomka arrimuhu wuxuu weydiin doonaa magac sida hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EArrimaha iyo faylasha BCF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliyaha\"\u003EKaaliyaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOggolow kaaliyaha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E (damis bilowgii) waxay ogolaanaysaa kaaliye kombuyuutarkaaga inuu gaadho moodelka furan isagoo marinaya CadCraft Studio: \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu helaa xubnaha wuxuuna akhrinayaa sifooyinkooda, \u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel aragtida\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kala saaraa, qariyaa oo muujiyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa wicitaankooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EOggolow kaaliyaha AI inuu moodelkaaga ka shaqeeyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintii kale waxay dhacaan marka moodel la furo ama dhigidda bilaabanto. Moodel horey u furan wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaabkiisa ilaa aad isticmaasho badhamada barta qalabka ama aad mar kale furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji oo laba jeer sawir alaabta maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo alaabta guriga maktabadda ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/workspace\"\u003EShaashadda BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assistants\"\u003EOggolow kaaliyaha AI inuu moodelkaaga ka shaqeeyo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Fur Dejinta adigoo riixaya gear-ka ku yaal barta sare ee app-ka ama Ctrl+,. Tab-ka koowaad, BimCraft, wuxuu hayaa dejinta app-kan gaarka u ah; Guud wuxuu hayaa dejinta ay wadaagaan dhammaan app-yada CadCraft (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, daaqadaha). Dejinta BimCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka keliya: halkan ayaad ku beddeshaa, browser-kanuna waa xasuustaa. Dib u deji dejinta BimCraft oo ku yaal hoosta daaqadda wuxuu dejintaas iyo kuwa la wadaago labaduba dib ugu celiyaa bilowgii. Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka Habka menu-ga (toolbar-ka BimCraft, menu bar-ka naqshadda guriga, ribbon-ka BIM ama safka amarka naqshadda), furayaashaaga iyo menu-yadaada, iyo waxa wheel-ka iyo badhamada mouse-ka qabtaan. Eeg Menu-yada, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Marka moodeel la furo Muuji qolalka iyo meelaha (bilowgii waa damis): qolalka iyo meelaha waa sanduuqyo muuqaalkoodu dhex yaal oo qari kara darbiyada ka danbeeya, sidaas darteed bilowgii waa la qariyaa. Badhanka Meelaha ee ku yaal moodelka korkiisa ayaa wali shidi kara oo damin kara moodeelka furan. Geesaha: Geesaha shidan (bilowgii) wuxuu sawiraa xariiqyada geesaha ee bixiya muuqaalka naqshadda. Moodeelada yaryar oo keliya wuxuu sawiraa kuwa ka yar 300,000 saddexgeesle, taasoo ka dhigta moodeelada waaweyn kuwo dhaqso u beddelma. Geesaha damsan wuxuu moodel kasta ku bilaabaa iyada oo aan lahayn. Badhanka Geesaha wali wuu damin karaa moodeelka furan. Ka sarreeya 1.5 milyan saddexgeesle, geesaha had iyo jeer waa damsan yihiin. Sawiruhu wuxuu ku furmaa Sida sawirka DWG ama DXF uu marka hore u muuqdo: 3D (ugu dhakhsaha badan) (bilowgii) wuxuu si dhakhso leh u sawiraa xitaa sawir weyn, ama Moodeel (2D) wuxuu furaa aragtida laba-geesle ee meesha moodelka. Tabs-ka ka sarreeya sawirka wuxuu u beddelaa Moodeel, xaashiyada iyo 3D waqti kasta. Sawir aan waxba ku jirin meesha moodelka, ama browser aan 3D muujin karin, mar walba wuxuu ku furmaa 2D. Aragtida furitaanka Kaamaradda moodelku ku furmo: Ku habee (bilowgii, moodelka oo dhan xagga geesaha), Sare, Hore ama Dhinac. Badhamada ka sarreeya moodelka waxay beddeli karaan aragtida waqti kasta. Dhismo la rogay goobtiisa: moodeelo badan waxay yimaaddaan dhismo xagal ka samaysan xagalka faylka (survey ama isku-xirnaanta wadaagga ah). Ku toosan dhismaha (bilowgii) wuxuu muujiyaa dhismahaas oo toosan: Ku habee, Sare, Hore, Dhinac, wajiyada kaarka aragtida iyo goyn kasta oo cusub way raacaan darbiyadiisa, qiyaasta kaarka aragtidana wuxuu weli tilmaamaa waqooyiga moodelka. Sida goobta lagu dhigay wuxuu ilaaliyaa xagalka faylka. Dhismo darbiyadiisu ku jiraan xagalka ayaa labadaba u eg. Dhigidda alaabta maktabadda Bilow darbiga ku dhufo oo shidan (bilowgii damis): marka dhigidda ama koobiyeynta alaabta maktabadda bilaabanto, dhabarkeeda wuxuu ku dhufaa darbiga ugu dhow, isagoo u jeeda qolka. Tab ama Darbiga ku dhufo ee barta dhigidda ayaa damiya waqtigaas. Dabaq aan darbi lahayn wuxuu bilaabaa isagoo aan lahayn. Sanduuqa goynta Meel ku wareegsan xulashada waa inta meel ee Sanduuq goynta ku wareeg xubta la doortay uu ka tago dhinac kasta oo xubnaha la doortay, millimitir ahaan: 300 bilowgii, ilaa 5000. Eeg Goyn moodel IFC adigoo isticmaalaya qorshe goynta. Booska Latitude iyo longitude ku qoran waxay doorataa nidaamka Qiyaas › Booska ku bixiyo latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka: WGS 84 (EPSG:4326, bilowgii, sida GPS-ka iyo khariidadaha webka u isticmaalaan), Datum-ka faylka laftiisa, ama mid ka mid ah ETRS89, NAD83, GDA94, GDA2020, NZGD2000, JGD2011 iyo CGCS2000. Nidaamka khariidadda iyo datum-ka faylka waa had iyo jeer la muujiyaa. Eeg Qiyaas masaafooyin, bannaanno iyo booska 3D. Calaamadda geeska Waxa ku yaal geeska hoose ee midig ee aragtida 3D (moodel IFC, iyo sawir loo beddelay 3D): Kaarka aragtida (bilowgii), Calaamadda tooska (X, Y iyo Z oo yaryar) ama Midna. Isla markiiba ayuu beddelaa. Aragtida sawirka 2D weligeed ma muujiso mid. Kaarka aragtida, guji wejiga, geesha ama geeska si aad uga aragto dhinacaas, jiid kaarka si uu u wareego, jiid giraanta si aad u leexato, oo guji guriga si aad u aragto aragtida bilowgii. Magacaaga arrimaha Markaad galto, arrimuhu waxay ku qoran yihiin magaca akoonkaaga, BimCraftna waxba ma weydiinayo: qaybtani waxay muujinaysaa Akoonkaaga (\u003Cname\u003E). Isticmaal magac kale wuxuu furaa sanduuq magac kale oo, kaas oo ka guuleysta ilaa aad dooratid Isticmaal magaca akoonkayga. Haddii aadan soo galin, foomka arrimuhu wuxuu weydiin doonaa magac sida hore. Eeg Arrimaha iyo faylasha BCF. Kaaliyaha Oggolow kaaliyaha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan BimCraft (damis bilowgii) waxay ogolaanaysaa kaaliye kombuyuutarkaaga inuu gaadho moodelka furan isagoo marinaya CadCraft Studio: Akhri wuxuu helaa xubnaha wuxuuna akhrinayaa sifooyinkooda, Beddel aragtida wuxuu kala saaraa, qariyaa oo muujiyaa. Dhaqdhaqaaqa wuxuu liistaa wicitaankooda. Eeg Oggolow kaaliyaha AI inuu moodelkaaga ka shaqeeyo. Dejintii kale waxay dhacaan marka moodel la furo ama dhigidda bilaabanto. Moodel horey u furan wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaabkiisa ilaa aad isticmaasho badhamada barta qalabka ama aad mar kale furto. Wax la xiriira Koobiyee, dhaji oo laba jeer sawir alaabta maktabadda Dhig qalabka iyo alaabta guriga maktabadda ka Shaashadda BimCraft Oggolow kaaliyaha AI inuu moodelkaaga ka shaqeeyo","lang":"so"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dooro habka menyuyaasha ee ku habboon siyaabta aad hore ugu shaqeyso, siiso amar kasta furahaaga, u wareeji amarada menyuyaal kale, oo deji waxa shiidku iyo badhan kasta oo mouse-ka ah sameeyo.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["habka menyuyaasha","menyuyaasha","saldhigga menyuga","jadwalka","sadka amarka","furayaasha gaagaaban","hotkeys","furayaasha","habayn","dib u meel dheji","rebind","mouse","shiid","jihada zoom","badhanka dhexe","pan","orbit","furayaasha laba xaraf","export","import","beddelid","la yaqaan"],"headings":[{"id":"shan-habka","text":"Shan habka","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-mid-kaaga","text":"Ka dhig mid kaaga","level":2},{"id":"mouse","text":"Mouse","level":2},{"id":"qaadashada","text":"Qaadashada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmarada BimCraft waa isku mid siyaabkii aad ugu gaadhi lahayd. \u003Cstrong\u003EHabka menyuga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa keliya meesha ay ku taal shaashadda, magacyada ay ku leeyihiin iyo furayaasha ay wax u shaqeeyaan, sidaas darteed waxaad sii haysan kartaa dhaqannadii aad hore u lahayd. Ku dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBimCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E; isbeddelku isla markiiba ayuu dhacaa, browser-kan wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shan-habka\"\u003EShan habka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka iyo furayaasha BimCraft ee gaarka ah (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E darbi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E albaab, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E daaqad, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goyn, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E buuxi). Bilowga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda guriga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaldhig menyu (Fayl, Wax ka beddel, Dhismaha, Maktabad, 3D, CAD, Qalab, Muuqaal) oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka dhismaha, siyaabta barnaamijyada naqshadda guryaha ee caadiga ah ugu habeeyaan. Isla furayaasha keliya, oo ku daraan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command L\"\u003E⌘L\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+L\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E maktabadda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F9\"\u003EF9\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF9\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E muuqaalka 3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F10\"\u003EF10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qorshaha iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F11\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labadaba.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka BIM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabyo badhamo waaweyn leh (Naqshadda, Geli, Qoraal ku dar, Hagaaji, Muuqaal, Soo saar) oo leh menyu Fayl iyo badhamo degdeg ah midig. Furayaasha laba xaraf: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadib \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E darbi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E albaab, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E daaqad, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goyn, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E buuxi. Badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorista qadiimiga ah\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalab yar iyo sadka amarka, oo loogu talagalay dadka amarada qoraa: WALL, DOOR, WINDOW, ROOF, U (ka noqo), ZOOM, SECTION, PLOT, INSERT, HELP. Meel kasta ku bilow qorista, xarfaha waxay gaaraan sadka amarka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu shaqeeyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka wax aan lagu qorin uu soo celinayaa amarkii ugu dambeeyay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu nadiifiyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEegaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELoogu talagalay fur iyo hubinta moodeelada, ma aha sawirkooda: menyuyaasha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka eegista (buuxi, sare, hore, dhinac, goyn, cabbir, qari, kala soo saar, aragti-ka-dhex-gal, muuji dhammaan, socod). Qalabka dhismaha waxay ku sugan yihiin menyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E dhammaadka. Furayaasha isku mid ah habka BimCraft ee gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMenyuyaasha iyo ribbon-ada way muuqdaan marka moodeel la furo ama dhismo cusub la bilaabo; ka hor, panelka bidix wuxuu furaa faylasha oo bilaabaa dhismayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuraha ku jira habka BimCraft ee naqshadiisa laakiin aan ku jirin habka aad dooratay ma samayn doono wax, status line-kuna wuxuu sheegaa halka amarkiisu u gudbay (sida &quot;BIM ribbon-ka, Section waa SC&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer waxay haystaan macnahoodii, qalabka socdana furayaashiisa ayuu haystaa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markii la dhigayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markii la socdo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qalabka albaabka iyo daaqadda, lambarada markaad dherer ku qorayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-mid-kaaga\"\u003EKa dhig mid kaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro habka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabayn…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo menyuyaasha\u003C/span\u003E, hel amar (sanduuqa raadintu wuu caawiyaa). Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E oo taabo furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta furaha laba xaraf. Guji fur si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenyu-saldhig ama ribbon-ka dhexdiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha ay ku taal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu amarka u wareejiyaa menyu ama panel kale, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha oo keliya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, deji shiidka, badhamada qorshaha ku guuraya, iyo waxa badhan kasta ku sameeyo muuqaalada 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu bixi magac oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKeydinta habka dhismaha ku jira waxay samaysaa nuqul kaaga ah (&quot;Naqshaddayda guriga&quot;); kan dhismaha ku jira weligiis ma beddelmo. Furaha loo siiyay laba amar, ama furaha ka horreeya furaha laba xaraf ee la qori karo, waxaa lagu muujiyaa cas, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan keydin karin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse\"\u003EMouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sida ay u dhakhsaha badan tahay. Taabashada trackpad-ka mar walba waxay weyneysaa ama yareysaa siduu faraha u dhaqaaqayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha iyo sawirrada ku guuri\u003C/strong\u003E: badhan kasta oo bidix, dhexe ama midig. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid ayaa sidoo kale guuraya; jiid bidix wuxuu guuraa oo keliya meelaha guji aan ku dooran doonin ama ku sawiri doonin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid muuqaalada 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMid kasta oo aragtiisa leh\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa badhamada BimCraft (bidix wareegaa, midig guuraa). Ama deji badhan kasta inuu wareego, guuro, weynaado ama waxba ha sameynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaa wareegga iyo guurka. Guji aan jiid lahayn wali wuu doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaadashada\"\u003EQaadashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu keydiyaa habka isticmaalka ku jira faylka yar ee \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ku daraa, oo laga yaari karo kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo geliyay wuxuu tilmaamaa amarrada BimCraft ee keliya: waxa kale oo ku jira (amar aan nooca nalkan lahayn, fur halkan shaqeyn waydo) waa la saaraa oo waxaa lagu tiriyaa status line-ka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir qaabkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa midka aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal qaabkan app kasta\u003C/span\u003E hoosta kaararka habka wuxuu ka dhigaa app kasta inuu ku furmo habkiisa la mid ah (toolbar-kiisa, saldhig menyu, ribbon ama Qorista qadiimiga ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEegaha\u003C/span\u003E waa BimCraft keliya oo meel kale ma leh u dhigma), isbeddelladaadana app kasta gaar ahaan. App aan habka u dhigma lahayn wuxuu hayaa habkiisa. Habka kale oo aad doorato hal app ayaa isbeddelaya app-kaas oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii la xiriira: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imanaya barnaamijyada BIM iyo sawirka kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amarada BimCraft waa isku mid siyaabkii aad ugu gaadhi lahayd. Habka menyuga wuxuu go'aaminayaa keliya meesha ay ku taal shaashadda, magacyada ay ku leeyihiin iyo furayaasha ay wax u shaqeeyaan, sidaas darteed waxaad sii haysan kartaa dhaqannadii aad hore u lahayd. Ku dooro Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › BimCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka; isbeddelku isla markiiba ayuu dhacaa, browser-kan wuu xasuustaa. Shan habka Habka Waxa aad heleysaa CadCraft Qalabka iyo furayaasha BimCraft ee gaarka ah (W darbi, D albaab, N daaqad, X goyn, F buuxi). Bilowga. Naqshadda guriga Saldhig menyu (Fayl, Wax ka beddel, Dhismaha, Maktabad, 3D, CAD, Qalab, Muuqaal) oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka dhismaha, siyaabta barnaamijyada naqshadda guryaha ee caadiga ah ugu habeeyaan. Isla furayaasha keliya, oo ku daraan Ctrl+L maktabadda, F9 muuqaalka 3D, F10 qorshaha iyo F11 labadaba. Jadwalka BIM Tabyo badhamo waaweyn leh (Naqshadda, Geli, Qoraal ku dar, Hagaaji, Muuqaal, Soo saar) oo leh menyu Fayl iyo badhamo degdeg ah midig. Furayaasha laba xaraf: W kadib A darbi, D R albaab, W N daaqad, S C goyn, Z F buuxi. Badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa; Shift iyo badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa. Qorista qadiimiga ah Qalab yar iyo sadka amarka, oo loogu talagalay dadka amarada qoraa: WALL, DOOR, WINDOW, ROOF, U (ka noqo), ZOOM, SECTION, PLOT, INSERT, HELP. Meel kasta ku bilow qorista, xarfaha waxay gaaraan sadka amarka; Enter wuu shaqeeyaa, Enter marka wax aan lagu qorin uu soo celinayaa amarkii ugu dambeeyay, Esc wuu nadiifiyaa. Eegaha Loogu talagalay fur iyo hubinta moodeelada, ma aha sawirkooda: menyuyaasha Faylka, Muuqaal, Muuji, Hubi iyo Wax ka beddel oo ku dul yaal safka qalabka eegista (buuxi, sare, hore, dhinac, goyn, cabbir, qari, kala soo saar, aragti-ka-dhex-gal, muuji dhammaan, socod). Qalabka dhismaha waxay ku sugan yihiin menyu Moodeel dhammaadka. Furayaasha isku mid ah habka BimCraft ee gaarka ah. Menyuyaasha iyo ribbon-ada way muuqdaan marka moodeel la furo ama dhismo cusub la bilaabo; ka hor, panelka bidix wuxuu furaa faylasha oo bilaabaa dhismayaasha. Furaha ku jira habka BimCraft ee naqshadiisa laakiin aan ku jirin habka aad dooratay ma samayn doono wax, status line-kuna wuxuu sheegaa halka amarkiisu u gudbay (sida \"BIM ribbon-ka, Section waa SC\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer waxay haystaan macnahoodii, qalabka socdana furayaashiisa ayuu haystaa: R iyo Tab markii la dhigayo, W A S D markii la socdo, H qalabka albaabka iyo daaqadda, lambarada markaad dherer ku qorayso. Ka dhig mid kaaga Dooro habka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji Habayn…. Ku Furayaasha iyo menyuyaasha, hel amar (sanduuqa raadintu wuu caawiyaa). Guji Ku dar fur oo taabo furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta furaha laba xaraf. Guji fur si aad uga saarto. Menyu-saldhig ama ribbon-ka dhexdiisa, Meesha ay ku taal wuxuu amarka u wareejiyaa menyu ama panel kale, ama Furayaasha oo keliya. Ku Mouse, deji shiidka, badhamada qorshaha ku guuraya, iyo waxa badhan kasta ku sameeyo muuqaalada 3D. Ku bixi magac oo guji Kaydi. Keydinta habka dhismaha ku jira waxay samaysaa nuqul kaaga ah (\"Naqshaddayda guriga\"); kan dhismaha ku jira weligiis ma beddelmo. Furaha loo siiyay laba amar, ama furaha ka horreeya furaha laba xaraf ee la qori karo, waxaa lagu muujiyaa cas, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan keydin karin. Mouse Mouse wheel: Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa (bilowga) ama Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa, iyo sida ay u dhakhsaha badan tahay. Taabashada trackpad-ka mar walba waxay weyneysaa ama yareysaa siduu faraha u dhaqaaqayo. Qorshaha iyo sawirrada ku guuri: badhan kasta oo bidix, dhexe ama midig. Space iyo jiid ayaa sidoo kale guuraya; jiid bidix wuxuu guuraa oo keliya meelaha guji aan ku dooran doonin ama ku sawiri doonin. Jiid muuqaalada 3D: Mid kasta oo aragtiisa leh wuxuu hayaa badhamada BimCraft (bidix wareegaa, midig guuraa). Ama deji badhan kasta inuu wareego, guuro, weynaado ama waxba ha sameynin. Shift oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaa wareegga iyo guurka. Guji aan jiid lahayn wali wuu doortaa. Qaadashada Dhoofi wuxuu keydiyaa habka isticmaalka ku jira faylka yar ee .ccinput.json; Soo geli… wuxuu mid ku daraa, oo laga yaari karo kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo geliyay wuxuu tilmaamaa amarrada BimCraft ee keliya: waxa kale oo ku jira (amar aan nooca nalkan lahayn, fur halkan shaqeyn waydo) waa la saaraa oo waxaa lagu tiriyaa status line-ka. Tirtir qaabkan wuxuu ka saaraa midka aad leedahay. Dejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. Isticmaal qaabkan app kasta hoosta kaararka habka wuxuu ka dhigaa app kasta inuu ku furmo habkiisa la mid ah (toolbar-kiisa, saldhig menyu, ribbon ama Qorista qadiimiga ah; Eegaha waa BimCraft keliya oo meel kale ma leh u dhigma), isbeddelladaadana app kasta gaar ahaan. App aan habka u dhigma lahayn wuxuu hayaa habkiisa. Habka kale oo aad doorato hal app ayaa isbeddelaya app-kaas oo keliya. Wixii la xiriira: Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka · Dejinta BimCraft · Ka imanaya barnaamijyada BIM iyo sawirka kale","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Fur kasta, mouse-ka, trackpad-ka iyo taabashada BimCraft, oo lagu kooxeeyay waxa aad eegayso.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["furayaal","gaadho-furayaal","mouse","trackpad","taabasho","wareegid","guuri","weynee","qari","kala saar","ilaali","ka noqo","samee mar kale","koobiyee","dhaji","kaydi","ku habee","escape","dejinta","sawir","darbi","albaab","daaqad","qorshe"],"headings":[{"id":"meel-kasta","text":"Meel kasta","level":2},{"id":"aragtida-3d-moodeelada-ifc","text":"Aragtida 3D (moodeelada IFC)","level":2},{"id":"tafatir","text":"Tafatir","level":2},{"id":"aragta-qorshaha-sawir","text":"Aragta qorshaha (Sawir)","level":2},{"id":"dhigida-iyo-dhajinta-walxaha-maktabadda","text":"Dhigida iyo dhajinta walxaha maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"tafatirka-qiyamka-ifc","text":"Tafatirka qiyamka IFC","level":2},{"id":"sawirada-2d-dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"Sawirada 2D (DWG iyo DXF)","level":2},{"id":"sawirada-3d","text":"Sawirada 3D","level":2},{"id":"faylasha","text":"Faylasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft waxa uu leeyahay gaadho-furayaal yar. Shaqada badan waxaa lagu sameeyaa mouse-ka iyo panels-ka. Gaadho-furayaasha lagu qoro \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay isticmaalaan Command ee Mac iyo Ctrl meelaha kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mice-ka iyo trackpads-ka\u003C/a\u003E si aad u aragto sida furayaasha loogu qoro caawintan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meel-kasta\"\u003EMeel kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji qaababka shaashadda: caadi, shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo bararka qarsan. Ctrl wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa nidaamyada oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan Mac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa bax shaashad buuxa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU dhaqaaq badhamada, sanduuqyada hubinta iyo qiyamka. Kontoroolka oo dhan waxaa laga gaari karaa kiiboodhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aragtida-3d-moodeelada-ifc\"\u003EAragtida 3D (moodeelada IFC)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee moodeelka oo dhan, aragta saddex meelood meel (isku mid sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENadiifi dooridda, ama jooji dhigista ama dhajinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro walxa hoosteeda mouse-ku yaal; guji dhabarka madhan si aad u nadiifiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar walax dooridda, ama ka saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQari walxaha la doortay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/hide-and-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar oo ilaali walxaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji walxaha la doortay oo keliya (kala saar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji walxaha la doortay, wax kale oo dhan ilaa ay ilaali karaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale muuji walax kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama fallaadhaha ayaa socdaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu orodaa, jiidista ayaa eegaysa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/walk\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/walk\"\u003ESoco moodeel\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir masaafooyin iyo aagga wejiyada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ECabbir masaafooyin, aagga wejiyada iyo goobaha 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid batoonka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri (waa fiican trackpad-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka, ama jiid batoonka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScroll laba farood ama pinch trackpad-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegid; taabasho wuu dooraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E| \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E | Diyaarada goynta oo furan iyo xidhan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoy moodeelka IFC diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E | | \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift X\"\u003E⇧X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E | Sanduuqa goynta ee walxaha la doortay, oo qolka lagu dejiyay Dejinta |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiraan furayaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide\u003C/span\u003E; isticmaal badhamada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatir\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla amarradaas waxaa lagu helaa toolbar-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E iyo menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, kaas oo muujinaya fur kasta. Waxay ku shaqeeyaan aragta 3D ee moodeelka IFC, ee ma aha markaad qoraal ku qorayso goob. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul walxaha maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo isbedelkii ugu dambeeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale waxa Ka noqo ka qaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee walxaha la doortay (magacyadooda iyo hantidooda sidoo kale waxay u gudbaan clipboard-ka qoraal ahaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGooy walxaha la doortay: koobiyee, kadibna tirtir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji waxa aad koobiyeeday: wuu raacaa mouse-ka, guji meesha uu tago\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji meeshiisii: meesha ay goynta ka timid, ama dhinaca asalka kadib koobiyeynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul: koobiyee walxaha la doortay oo bilow dhajinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir walxaha la doortay, qaybahooda iyo furitaankooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ETirtir, goo, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro walax kasta oo la muujiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa dooro midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka qoraal bogga lagu doortay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoraalkaas sida caadiga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aragta-qorshaha-sawir\"\u003EAragta qorshaha (Sawir)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay shaqeeyaan intii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw\u003C/span\u003E uu furan yahay oo aanad qoraal ku qorin goob. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003ESawir darbiyada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EAlbaabbada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoor\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWindow\u003C/span\u003E uu furan yahay: loo-ka dhig dhamaadka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka darbi la sawirayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu hay 0°, 90°, 180° ama 270°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambarrada iyo calaamadaha lugta iyo inchiga (\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow qorista dherer sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa isticmaala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji midig ama laba jeer guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamee darbiga aad sawirayso; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir darbiyada, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha la doortay; darbiyada hadhay mar kale way isku xidhmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka mouse-ku qorshaha ku jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee, oo wareeg mouse-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka dhexe ama midig, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri; marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E uu furan yahay, jiid fudud ayaa sidoo kale guuraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid albaab ama daaqad oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU guuri darbigeeda, ama u kaxee darbi kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhigida-iyo-dhajinta-walxaha-maktabadda\"\u003EDhigida iyo dhajinta walxaha maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxa 90° u leexi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu tiirsii darbiga on iyo off: dhabarka walxa wuxuu u soo wada darbiga ugu dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EX, Y (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhig meesha la qoray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji dhigista ama dhajinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatirka-qiyamka-ifc\"\u003ETafatirka qiyamka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay qiimaha aad qortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji oo soo celi qiimihii hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji meel kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay qiimaha aad qortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo isbedelkii ugu dambeeyay. Keliya inta aad isbedel aan la kaydin ku leedahay, oo aadan qoraal ku qorin goob\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale waxa Ka noqo ka qaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi sida IFC. Keliya inta aad isbedel aan la kaydin ku leedahay; haddii kale kaydinta browser-ka ayaa furmaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu tafatirto kiiboodhka keliya: taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qiime la iftiimiyo, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u bilowdo qorista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada-2d-dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003ESawirada 2D (DWG iyo DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee sawirka ama xaashida\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAragta daabacaadda on iyo off\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoon kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScroll-ka tuubada wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mouse-ka ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScroll laba farood ama pinch trackpad-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mouse-ka ku jira. Scroll laba farood ma guurto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri. Pinch weynee sawirada weli lama dhisin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada-3d\"\u003ESawirada 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3D on iyo off (sidoo kale aragta 2D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka: sawirka oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka dhexe ama bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid batoonka midig, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee ilaa wax kasta oo mouse-ku hoosteeda yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood oo trackpad-ka ku dhaqaaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegid; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh, guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch trackpad-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood (taabasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxba ma sameeyaan markaad qoraal ku qorayso sanduuq, marka jadwalka qalabka muuqdo, ama marka aad hayso \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha\"\u003EFaylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid fayl bogga saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid gal bogga saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur sida gal mashruuc, iyadoo aan la weydiin ogolaansho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"BimCraft waxa uu leeyahay gaadho-furayaal yar. Shaqada badan waxaa lagu sameeyaa mouse-ka iyo panels-ka. Gaadho-furayaasha lagu qoro Ctrl waxay isticmaalaan Command ee Mac iyo Ctrl meelaha kale. Eeg Furayaasha, mice-ka iyo trackpads-ka si aad u aragto sida furayaasha loogu qoro caawintan. Meel kasta Fur Waxa uu sameeyo Ctrl+Shift+F Wareeji qaababka shaashadda: caadi, shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo bararka qarsan. Ctrl wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa nidaamyada oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan Mac Esc Ka bax shaashad buuxa Ctrl+, Fur Settings. Eeg Dejinta BimCraft Tab U dhaqaaq badhamada, sanduuqyada hubinta iyo qiyamka. Kontoroolka oo dhan waxaa laga gaari karaa kiiboodhka Aragtida 3D (moodeelada IFC) Fur ama ficil Waxa uu sameeyo F Ku habee moodeelka oo dhan, aragta saddex meelood meel (isku mid sida Fit) Esc Nadiifi dooridda, ama jooji dhigista ama dhajinta Guji Dooro walxa hoosteeda mouse-ku yaal; guji dhabarka madhan si aad u nadiifiso Ctrl+guji ama Shift+guji Ku dar walax dooridda, ama ka saar H Qari walxaha la doortay. Eeg Qari, kala saar oo ilaali walxaha I Muuji walxaha la doortay oo keliya (kala saar) T Muuji walxaha la doortay, wax kale oo dhan ilaa ay ilaali karaan Shift+H Mar kale muuji walax kasta Walk Kadibna W A S D ama fallaadhaha ayaa socdaa, Shift wuu orodaa, jiidista ayaa eegaysa, Esc wuu joojiyaa. Eeg Soco moodeel M Cabbir masaafooyin iyo aagga wejiyada. Eeg Cabbir masaafooyin, aagga wejiyada iyo goobaha 3D Jiid batoonka bidix Wareegid Jiid batoonka midig Guuri Shift ama Ctrl oo jiid batoonka bidix Guuri (waa fiican trackpad-ka) Ku dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka, ama jiid batoonka dhexe Weynee Scroll laba farood ama pinch trackpad-ka Weynee Hal farood (taabasho) Wareegid; taabasho wuu dooraa Laba farood (taabasho) Pinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto | X | Diyaarada goynta oo furan iyo xidhan. Eeg Goy moodeelka IFC diyaarad goyn | | Shift+X | Sanduuqa goynta ee walxaha la doortay, oo qolka lagu dejiyay Dejinta | Ma jiraan furayaal Top, Front iyo Side; isticmaal badhamada. Tafatir Isla amarradaas waxaa lagu helaa toolbar-ka: Undo, Redo, Copy, Paste iyo menu-ga More, kaas oo muujinaya fur kasta. Waxay ku shaqeeyaan aragta 3D ee moodeelka IFC, ee ma aha markaad qoraal ku qorayso goob. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul walxaha maktabadda. Fur Waxa uu sameeyo Ctrl+Z Ka noqo isbedelkii ugu dambeeyay Ctrl+Y ama Ctrl+Shift+Z Samee mar kale waxa Ka noqo ka qaaday Ctrl+C Koobiyee walxaha la doortay (magacyadooda iyo hantidooda sidoo kale waxay u gudbaan clipboard-ka qoraal ahaan) Ctrl+X Gooy walxaha la doortay: koobiyee, kadibna tirtir Ctrl+V Dhaji waxa aad koobiyeeday: wuu raacaa mouse-ka, guji meesha uu tago Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji meeshiisii: meesha ay goynta ka timid, ama dhinaca asalka kadib koobiyeynta Ctrl+D Nuqul: koobiyee walxaha la doortay oo bilow dhajinta Delete Tirtir walxaha la doortay, qaybahooda iyo furitaankooda. Eeg Tirtir, goo, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha Ctrl+A Dooro walax kasta oo la muujiyay Esc Ma dooro midna Marka qoraal bogga lagu doortay, Ctrl+C wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qoraalkaas sida caadiga ah. Aragta qorshaha (Sawir) Kuwan waxay shaqeeyaan intii Draw uu furan yahay oo aanad qoraal ku qorin goob. Eeg Sawir darbiyada iyo Albaabbada iyo daaqadaha. Fur ama ficil Waxa uu sameeyo V Select W Wall D Door N Window H Marka Door ama Window uu furan yahay: loo-ka dhig dhamaadka kale Shift marka darbi la sawirayo Ku hay 0°, 90°, 180° ama 270° Lambarrada iyo calaamadaha lugta iyo inchiga (' iyo \") Bilow qorista dherer sanduuqa Length; Enter ayaa isticmaala Enter, Esc, guji midig ama laba jeer guji Dhamee darbiga aad sawirayso; Esc mar kale wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa Select Delete Tirtir darbiyada, albaabbada iyo daaqadaha la doortay; darbiyada hadhay mar kale way isku xidhmaan F marka mouse-ku qorshaha ku jiro Ku habee qorshaha Ku dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka Weynee, oo wareeg mouse-ka Jiid batoonka dhexe ama midig, ama Space oo jiid Guuri; marka Select uu furan yahay, jiid fudud ayaa sidoo kale guuraa Jiid albaab ama daaqad oo Select furan U guuri darbigeeda, ama u kaxee darbi kale Laba farood (taabasho) Pinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto Dhigida iyo dhajinta walxaha maktabadda Fur Waxa uu sameeyo R Walxa 90° u leexi Tab Ku tiirsii darbiga on iyo off: dhabarka walxa wuxuu u soo wada darbiga ugu dhow Enter ku jira X, Y (mm) Ku dhig meesha la qoray Esc Jooji dhigista ama dhajinta Tafatirka qiyamka IFC Fur Waxa uu sameeyo Enter Hay qiimaha aad qortay Esc Jooji oo soo celi qiimihii hore Guji meel kale Hay qiimaha aad qortay Ctrl+Z Ka noqo isbedelkii ugu dambeeyay. Keliya inta aad isbedel aan la kaydin ku leedahay, oo aadan qoraal ku qorin goob Ctrl+Y Samee mar kale waxa Ka noqo ka qaaday Ctrl+S Kaydi sida IFC. Keliya inta aad isbedel aan la kaydin ku leedahay; haddii kale kaydinta browser-ka ayaa furmaysa Si aad ugu tafatirto kiiboodhka keliya: taabo Tab ilaa qiime la iftiimiyo, kadibna taabo Enter si aad u bilowdo qorista. Sawirada 2D (DWG iyo DXF) Fur ama ficil Waxa uu sameeyo F Ku habee sawirka ama xaashida P Aragta daabacaadda on iyo off Laba jeer guji Ku habee Jiid batoon kasta Guuri Scroll-ka tuubada wheel-ka Weynee mouse-ka ku jira Scroll laba farood ama pinch trackpad-ka Weynee mouse-ka ku jira. Scroll laba farood ma guurto Hal farood (taabasho) Guuri. Pinch weynee sawirada weli lama dhisin Sawirada 3D Fur ama ficil Waxa uu sameeyo 3 3D on iyo off (sidoo kale aragta 2D) F Xadka: sawirka oo dhan Jiid batoonka dhexe ama bidix Wareegid Jiid batoonka midig, ama Shift oo jiid Guuri Ku dhaqaaji tuubada wheel-ka Weynee ilaa wax kasta oo mouse-ku hoosteeda yaal Laba farood oo trackpad-ka ku dhaqaaji Wareegid; Shift oo leh, guuri Pinch trackpad-ka Weynee Hal farood (taabasho) Wareegid Laba farood (taabasho) Pinch si aad u weyneyso, wada dhaqaaq si aad u guurto F, P iyo 3 waxba ma sameeyaan markaad qoraal ku qorayso sanduuq, marka jadwalka qalabka muuqdo, ama marka aad hayso Ctrl ama Alt. Faylasha Ficil Waxa uu sameeyo Jiid fayl bogga saar Fur Jiid gal bogga saar Fur sida gal mashruuc, iyadoo aan la weydiin ogolaansho","lang":"so"},{"slug":"file-formats","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Waxa BimCraft ka akhriyo qaab kasta","summary":"Waxa dhab ah oo BimCraft ka akhriyo faylalka IFC, mashruuca iyo qoysaska, DWG iyo DXF, iyo waxa uu u tago.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["qaababka","ifc","ifc2x3","ifc4","rvt","rfa","rte","rft","dwg","dxf","dgn","ifczip","noocyada","isku-habayn","waxa la akhriyo"],"headings":[{"id":"ifc","text":"IFC","level":2},{"id":"mashruuca-iyo-faylasha-qoysaska","text":"Mashruuca iyo faylasha qoysaska","level":2},{"id":"pln-pla-tpl-iyo-bpn-faylasha-mashruuca","text":".pln, .pla, .tpl iyo .bpn faylasha mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"DWG iyo DXF","level":2},{"id":"galka","text":"Galka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc\"\u003EIFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkhri\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeometry\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement kasta oo leh qaab, midab sida faylku sheegayo. Qolalka iyo meelaha waa la sawiraa si daahsan, oo markii hore waa la qariyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStoreys\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabaqyada dhismaha sida kor loo kala dhigo, iyo elementiyada ku jira dabaq kasta. Elementiyada aan dabaq lahayn waa la kooxeeyaa &quot;Not on a storey&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement counts\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta elementi nooc kasta (darbiyada, albaabbada, dabaqyada…), oo lagu muujiyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject facts\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca mashruuca, magaca dheer iyo marxaladda; schema; barnaamijka soo dhoofiyay, qoraalka iyo taariikhda soo dhoofinta madaxa faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement data\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, nooca, nooca object, calaamadda, sharaxaadda, GlobalId; dhammaan kooxaha sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka elementiga iyo nooceeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax la beddeli karo: magaca, nooca object, calaamadda, sharaxaadda, iyo qiyamka sifo keliya. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa fayl IFC cusub. Schema-yada IFC2X3, IFC4 iyo IFC4X3 way furmaan, BimCraft-ka injineriyadiisa IFC-ga ayaa akhrisa; wax kasta oo weli sawiri waynaan karin waxa lagu liistaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E. Moodeelka waxa loo raraa asalka markii uu furmo, sidaas darteed moodeel meel fog ku yaal wali dhexda shaashadda ayuu ka muuqdaa. \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E ma furmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mashruuca-iyo-faylasha-qoysaska\"\u003EMashruuca iyo faylasha qoysaska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E mashruucyo, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E template-yada mashruuca, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E qoysaska, \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E template-yada qoysaska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkhri\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile information\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERelease iyo build, worksharing, jidka moodeelka dhexe, jidka la kaydiyay ugu dambeeyay, magaca isticmaalaha, locale, GUID-ka dokumentiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject information\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaha mashruuca laftiisa (magac, lambar, macmiil, cinwaan, xaalad…), iyada oo aan lagu darin defaults-ka mashruuca cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFamily information\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca qoyska, qaybta, release, cusboonaysiinta ugu dambeysay, iyo parameters-keeda kooxo ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska moodeelada la xidhay, CAD links, sawirrada iyo miisaska furayaasha faylku u tilmaamo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreview picture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThumbnail-ka ku kaydsan faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELama akhriyo: moodeelka 3D, elementiyada, aragtiyada, xaashiyada iyo jadwallada. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin qaab aan dukumentiyo lahayn. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa dhowr tobaan kiloBytes ah oo keliya faylkasta, sidaas darteed cabbirka faylka wax badan ma muhiimo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pln-pla-tpl-iyo-bpn-faylasha-mashruuca\"\u003E.pln, .pla, .tpl iyo .bpn faylasha mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli lama akhriyo: BimCraft wuu sheegaa markii aad furto. Soo dhoofi IFC moodeelka iyo DWG sawiradaha; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EFur faylasha mashruuca .pln iyo .pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkhri\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpaces\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModel space iyo xaashi kasta (layout), sida tab-kooda u kala horreeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports-ka xaashi kasta, oo leh miisaankooda, leffkooda iyo layers-ka la xiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELayers\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac, midab, on/off, frozen, plot flag iyo culeyska khadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObjects\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo, polylines, arcs, goobo, ellipses, splines, hatches iyo solids, qoraal iyo qoraal badan, blocks iyo attributes, cabbirro, leaders iyo multileaders, miisaska, dhibcaha, sawirro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked drawings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la sawiraa meesha la geliyay, marka faylashooda la helo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImages\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la sawiraa faylasha sawirka marka la helo (PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP; ma aha TIFF)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEquipment tags\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha alaabta cunto-bixinta (\u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E attributes), jadwalka qalabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kale waa lagu tiriyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E, mar la male-awaalin. DWG-yada AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 ayaa la hubiyay (R13 iyo R14 waa la aqbalaa, laakiin midna kuma jirin tijaabada; DWG-yada hore ma furmaan); panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa koodka qaabka (sida AC1032). DXF-yada nooc kasta way furmaan, R12 oo ku jirta. Labaduba waxa akhriya akhristayaasha BimCraft ee u gaarka ah, tab-kan. Waxba lama kaydiyo DWG ama DXF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"galka\"\u003EGalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKordhinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWarbixinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModels\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la kooxeeyaa nuqullada lambaraysan, waa la hubiyaa caafimaadka, kaarka waa la akhriyaa, xiriirrada waa la hubiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la liistaa; wuxuu furmaa 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dgn\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la liistaa, oo leh moodeelada ay xidhaan; DWG iyo DXF waxay furmaan 2D, DGN ma furmo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeftovers\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.ac$\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.lck\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.slog\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHousekeeping folders\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E, galalka qarsoon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E, lama akhrin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/folder-roles\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/folder-roles\"\u003EWarbixinta galka: doorarka, xaaladaha iyo xiriirrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"IFC Akhri Faahfaahin Geometry Element kasta oo leh qaab, midab sida faylku sheegayo. Qolalka iyo meelaha waa la sawiraa si daahsan, oo markii hore waa la qariyaa Storeys Dabaqyada dhismaha sida kor loo kala dhigo, iyo elementiyada ku jira dabaq kasta. Elementiyada aan dabaq lahayn waa la kooxeeyaa \"Not on a storey\" Element counts Inta elementi nooc kasta (darbiyada, albaabbada, dabaqyada…), oo lagu muujiyo Walxaha Project facts Magaca mashruuca, magaca dheer iyo marxaladda; schema; barnaamijka soo dhoofiyay, qoraalka iyo taariikhda soo dhoofinta madaxa faylka Element data Magaca, nooca, nooca object, calaamadda, sharaxaadda, GlobalId; dhammaan kooxaha sifooyinka iyo tirooyinka elementiga iyo nooceeda Wax la beddeli karo: magaca, nooca object, calaamadda, sharaxaadda, iyo qiyamka sifo keliya. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa fayl IFC cusub. Schema-yada IFC2X3, IFC4 iyo IFC4X3 way furmaan, BimCraft-ka injineriyadiisa IFC-ga ayaa akhrisa; wax kasta oo weli sawiri waynaan karin waxa lagu liistaa hoosta Weli lama sawirin panel-ka Faylka. Moodeelka waxa loo raraa asalka markii uu furmo, sidaas darteed moodeel meel fog ku yaal wali dhexda shaashadda ayuu ka muuqdaa. .ifczip iyo .ifcxml ma furmaan. Mashruuca iyo faylasha qoysaska .rvt mashruucyo, .rte template-yada mashruuca, .rfa qoysaska, .rft template-yada qoysaska. Akhri Faahfaahin File information Release iyo build, worksharing, jidka moodeelka dhexe, jidka la kaydiyay ugu dambeeyay, magaca isticmaalaha, locale, GUID-ka dokumentiga Project information Goobaha mashruuca laftiisa (magac, lambar, macmiil, cinwaan, xaalad…), iyada oo aan lagu darin defaults-ka mashruuca cusub Family information Magaca qoyska, qaybta, release, cusboonaysiinta ugu dambeysay, iyo parameters-keeda kooxo ahaan Links Liiska moodeelada la xidhay, CAD links, sawirrada iyo miisaska furayaasha faylku u tilmaamo Preview picture Thumbnail-ka ku kaydsan faylka Lama akhriyo: moodeelka 3D, elementiyada, aragtiyada, xaashiyada iyo jadwallada. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin qaab aan dukumentiyo lahayn. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa dhowr tobaan kiloBytes ah oo keliya faylkasta, sidaas darteed cabbirka faylka wax badan ma muhiimo. .pln, .pla, .tpl iyo .bpn faylasha mashruuca Weli lama akhriyo: BimCraft wuu sheegaa markii aad furto. Soo dhoofi IFC moodeelka iyo DWG sawiradaha; eeg Fur faylasha mashruuca .pln iyo .pla. DWG iyo DXF Akhri Faahfaahin Spaces Model space iyo xaashi kasta (layout), sida tab-kooda u kala horreeyo Viewports Viewports-ka xaashi kasta, oo leh miisaankooda, leffkooda iyo layers-ka la xiray Layers Magac, midab, on/off, frozen, plot flag iyo culeyska khadka Objects Xariiqyo, polylines, arcs, goobo, ellipses, splines, hatches iyo solids, qoraal iyo qoraal badan, blocks iyo attributes, cabbirro, leaders iyo multileaders, miisaska, dhibcaha, sawirro Linked drawings Waa la sawiraa meesha la geliyay, marka faylashooda la helo Images Waa la sawiraa faylasha sawirka marka la helo (PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP; ma aha TIFF) Equipment tags Calaamadaha alaabta cunto-bixinta (KCL-ITEM attributes), jadwalka qalabka Wax kale waa lagu tiriyaa Weli lama sawirin, mar la male-awaalin. DWG-yada AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 ayaa la hubiyay (R13 iyo R14 waa la aqbalaa, laakiin midna kuma jirin tijaabada; DWG-yada hore ma furmaan); panel-ka Naqshadda wuxuu muujiyaa koodka qaabka (sida AC1032). DXF-yada nooc kasta way furmaan, R12 oo ku jirta. Labaduba waxa akhriya akhristayaasha BimCraft ee u gaarka ah, tab-kan. Waxba lama kaydiyo DWG ama DXF. Galka Nooca Kordhinta Warbixinta Models .rvt .rfa .rte .rft Waa la kooxeeyaa nuqullada lambaraysan, waa la hubiyaa caafimaadka, kaarka waa la akhriyaa, xiriirrada waa la hubiyaa IFC .ifc Waa la liistaa; wuxuu furmaa 3D CAD .dwg .dxf .dgn Waa la liistaa, oo leh moodeelada ay xidhaan; DWG iyo DXF waxay furmaan 2D, DGN ma furmo Leftovers .dwl .dwl2 .bak .err .log .tmp .sv$ .ac$ .lck .slog Waxay ku jiraan Dhig dhinac Housekeeping folders *_backup, *_log, Revit_temp, galalka qarsoon Waxay ku jiraan Dhig dhinac, lama akhrin Eeg Warbixinta galka: doorarka, xaaladaha iyo xiriirrada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"point-cloud-formats","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Qaababka daruurta barta: waxa furma, iyo waxa la dhoofiyo","summary":"Faylasha scan-ka laser ee furma muuqaalka 3D, kuwa ah qaabka gaarka ah ee soo saaraha scanner-ka, iyo waxa laga dhoofiyo software-ka scanner-ka si scan-ku halkan u furmo.","section":"reference","order":28,"keywords":["daruurta barta","scan laser","scan","qaababka","e57","las","laz","ply","pcd","ptx","pts","xyz","rcp","rcs","fls","lgs","tzf","zfs","dhoofin","ma furmo","lama akhriyo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-halkan-furma","text":"Waxa halkan furma","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-uu-software-ka-scanner-ka-oo-keliya-akhriyo","text":"Faylasha uu software-ka scanner-ka oo keliya akhriyo","level":2},{"id":"sababta-faylkan-aan-loo-akhrin","text":"Sababta faylkan aan loo akhrin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-halkan-furma\"\u003EWaxa halkan furma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan ku fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuran\u003C/span\u003E ama ku dhig bogga (eeg mawduuca ku saabsan muujinta daruurta barta ee moodeelka ag).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKordhinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la akhriyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELAS, LAZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELAS 1.0–1.4: barooyin, midabo, xoog, fasallada LiDAR, nidaamka isku-xirka. LAZ ilaa 1 GB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE57\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.e57\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkaan kasta oo faylka ku jira, mid kastaa booskiisa ku dhigan; midabo, ama xoog marka faylku midab ma lahayn. Sawirada faylka ku jira waa laga reebay (waa la sheegaa). Ilaa 6 milyan oo bar iyo 512 MB hadda: skaanada waaweyn dhoofi LAS ama LAZ.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPLY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal iyo binary (labada habka byte): kulmada x y z, midabo iyo xoog. Wejiyada waa laga reebay (waa la sheegaa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPCD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pcd\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal iyo binary: x y z, midabo isku dhex jira ama kala go&#039;an, xoog. PCD la isku qabanqaabiyay weli lama akhriyo: u keydi binary ama qoraal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPTX\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ptx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal ama in ka badan oo skaan, mid kasta oo leh isbeddelkiisa; barooyinka scanner-ku ma cabbirin waa laga reebay. Mitir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPTS, XYZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pts\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal: x y z, oo leh xoog iyo midab marka tiirarkaasi jiraan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-uu-software-ka-scanner-ka-oo-keliya-akhriyo\"\u003EFaylasha uu software-ka scanner-ka oo keliya akhriyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah faylasha scan-ka waa qaabka gaarka ah ee soo saaraha scanner-ka, aan la daabicin oo aan lahayn akhriste furan. BimCraft ma akhrin karo, furista mid wuxuu muujinayaa kaarka sheegaya waxa uu yahay iyo waxa la sameeyo. Ka dhoofi scan-ka software-ka soo saaraha sida E57 ama LAS (ama PTX, PTS), kadibna fur faylka la dhoofiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKordhinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKa dhoofi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruuca ReCap\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rcp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap: fur mashruuca oo dhoofi. Mashruucu wuxuu kaliya tilmaamaa skaanadiisa, sidaas darteed koobiyeynta \u003Ccode\u003E.rcp\u003C/code\u003E keliya ma siiso barooyin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan ReCap\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.rcs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReCap: fur mashruuca uu scan-kaasi ku jiro oo dhoofi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan FARO\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.fls\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFARO SCENE.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan Leica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.lgs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeica Cyclone REGISTER 360.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan Trimble\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.tzf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrimble RealWorks ama Trimble Business Center.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan Z+F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.zfs\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ+F LaserControl.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka dhoofintu qaab weyddiiso, LAS ama LAZ waxay hayaan wax kasta oo BimCraft muujiyo (midabada, xoogga, fasallada iyo nidaamka isku-xirka) faylka ugu yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sababta-faylkan-aan-loo-akhrin\"\u003ESababta faylkan aan loo akhrin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababkaas lama daabacin, habka kaliya ee loo akhriyo waa maktabadda software-ka soo saaraha kasta, iyada oo ku xidhan shuruucdeeda. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaababka uu koodkiisa ku akhriyi karo kombiyuutarkaaga, sidaas darteed scan looma baahna in meel loo diro si loo furo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa halkan furma Kuwan ku fur Furan ama ku dhig bogga (eeg mawduuca ku saabsan muujinta daruurta barta ee moodeelka ag). Qaabka Kordhinta Waxa la akhriyo LAS, LAZ .las, .laz LAS 1.0–1.4: barooyin, midabo, xoog, fasallada LiDAR, nidaamka isku-xirka. LAZ ilaa 1 GB. E57 .e57 Skaan kasta oo faylka ku jira, mid kastaa booskiisa ku dhigan; midabo, ama xoog marka faylku midab ma lahayn. Sawirada faylka ku jira waa laga reebay (waa la sheegaa). Ilaa 6 milyan oo bar iyo 512 MB hadda: skaanada waaweyn dhoofi LAS ama LAZ. PLY .ply Qoraal iyo binary (labada habka byte): kulmada x y z, midabo iyo xoog. Wejiyada waa laga reebay (waa la sheegaa). PCD .pcd Qoraal iyo binary: x y z, midabo isku dhex jira ama kala go'an, xoog. PCD la isku qabanqaabiyay weli lama akhriyo: u keydi binary ama qoraal. PTX .ptx Hal ama in ka badan oo skaan, mid kasta oo leh isbeddelkiisa; barooyinka scanner-ku ma cabbirin waa laga reebay. Mitir. PTS, XYZ .pts, .xyz Qoraal: x y z, oo leh xoog iyo midab marka tiirarkaasi jiraan. Faylasha uu software-ka scanner-ka oo keliya akhriyo Qaar ka mid ah faylasha scan-ka waa qaabka gaarka ah ee soo saaraha scanner-ka, aan la daabicin oo aan lahayn akhriste furan. BimCraft ma akhrin karo, furista mid wuxuu muujinayaa kaarka sheegaya waxa uu yahay iyo waxa la sameeyo. Ka dhoofi scan-ka software-ka soo saaraha sida E57 ama LAS (ama PTX, PTS), kadibna fur faylka la dhoofiyay. Faylka Kordhinta Ka dhoofi Mashruuca ReCap .rcp ReCap: fur mashruuca oo dhoofi. Mashruucu wuxuu kaliya tilmaamaa skaanadiisa, sidaas darteed koobiyeynta .rcp keliya ma siiso barooyin. Scan ReCap .rcs ReCap: fur mashruuca uu scan-kaasi ku jiro oo dhoofi. Scan FARO .fls FARO SCENE. Scan Leica .lgs Leica Cyclone REGISTER 360. Scan Trimble .tzf Trimble RealWorks ama Trimble Business Center. Scan Z+F .zfs Z+F LaserControl. Marka dhoofintu qaab weyddiiso, LAS ama LAZ waxay hayaan wax kasta oo BimCraft muujiyo (midabada, xoogga, fasallada iyo nidaamka isku-xirka) faylka ugu yar. Sababta faylkan aan loo akhrin Qaababkaas lama daabacin, habka kaliya ee loo akhriyo waa maktabadda software-ka soo saaraha kasta, iyada oo ku xidhan shuruucdeeda. BimCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo keliya qaababka uu koodkiisa ku akhriyi karo kombiyuutarkaaga, sidaas darteed scan looma baahna in meel loo diro si loo furo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"properties-panel","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Goobaha panelka sifooyinka","summary":"Waxa goob kasta oo ku jirta panelka Sifooyinka iyo panelalka Faylka, Naqshadda iyo Gal ka dhigan yahay, iyo kuwa aad bedeli karto.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["sifooyinka","goobaha","sifooyinka","globalid","guid","koobiyee","koobiyee qiimaha","koobiyee dhammaan","csv","clipboard","lambarka taxanaha","tag","nooca shayga","xariiq","express id","property set","pset","tirooyinka","schema","panelka faylka"],"headings":[{"id":"walax-ifc","text":"Walax IFC","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-qiime","text":"Koobiyee qiime","level":2},{"id":"panelka-faylka-ifc","text":"Panelka Faylka (IFC)","level":2},{"id":"panelka-faylka-faylasha-mashruuca-iyo-qoyska","text":"Panelka Faylka (faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska)","level":2},{"id":"panelka-naqshadda-dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"Panelka Naqshadda (DWG iyo DXF)","level":2},{"id":"panelka-gal","text":"Panelka Gal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"walax-ifc\"\u003EWalax IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare ee panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu muujiyaa nooca walxa iyada oo aan lahayn xarfaha &quot;Ifc&quot; (tusaale &quot;Door&quot;, &quot;WallStandardCase&quot;, &quot;FurnishingElement&quot;) iyo magaciisa, ama &quot;Unnamed&quot; haddii aanu magac lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaa la beddeli karaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca walxaha, inta badan magaca qoyska iyo nooca uu dhoofiyuhu qoro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca nooca walxaha, marka uu leeyahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca shayga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESharaxaad xor ah oo nooca ah oo dhoofiyayaasha qaarkood buuxiyaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadda ama tag-ka walxaha; dhoofiyayaasha badani halkan ayay ku qoraan ID-ga walxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESharaxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal xor ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGlobalId\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAqoonsiga IFC ee joogtada ah ee 22 xaraf ee walxaha, isku mid dhoofinta kasta ee walxahaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambarka xariiqda walxaha (\u003Ccode\u003E#1234\u003C/code\u003E) ee faylka IFC-kan. Wuu isbeddelaa dhoofin kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta waxa yimaada \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybaha sifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo lagu kala saaray magaca:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb kasta way furmaa oo way xirmaa marka aad riixdo magaciisa. Saddexda hore way furan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb lagu calaamadeeyay &quot;(type)&quot; waxay ka tirsan tahay nooca walxaha: &quot;Sifada nooca: isbeddel halkan ayaa ku dhacaya walxaha nooca kasta.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha tirooyinka (dherer, aag, mug, tiro, miisaan) waa kuwo keliya-akhris ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska iyo qiimayaasha la tiriyay waa la muujiyaa, keliya-akhris.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiimayaasha Haa/Maya waxa lagu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHaa\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMaya\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka waxa loo wareejiyaa afar meel oo tobanka ah. Dherer (sifada dhererka ama dherer tiro) wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E ee lagu dhejiyay qalabka sare, oo cutubka ku xiga, waxaadna ku qori kartaa tiro cusub oo cutubkaas ah ama cutub kale oo lagu calaamadeeyay, sida 2.4 m ama 8&#039;-0&quot;: BimCraft wuxuu qoraa tirada faylka mar kale. Tirooyinka kale waxay muujiyaan sida faylku u haysto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiime madhan wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cem\u003Emadhan\u003C/em\u003E. Qiime la tafatiray waa xoog, oo xariiq buluug ah ayaa ku taal dhinacisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-qiime\"\u003EKoobiyee qiime\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiime kasta oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay badhan koobiyeyn yar oo ku xiga: riix si aad qiimaha u dhigto clipboard-ka siday u muuqato, tusaale GlobalId, lambarka taxanaha ama qiime kasta oo qaybta sifada. Koobiyeynta weligeed ma bilaabo wax wax ka beddelid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qiimaha walxaha oo dhan qoraal ahaan, qayb qayb; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee CSV ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa safafka kooxda, sifada iyo qiimaha si aad ugu dhejiso spreadsheet; qiimayaasha madhan waa la hayaa si goob kasta u leedahay safka. Tanu waa isku mid walax moodeel furan kale; marka moodeelo badan la furo, CSV-ga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa tiir Moodeel oo magaca faylkiisa ku qoran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-faylka-ifc\"\u003EPanelka Faylka (IFC)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile, Size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka aad furtay, iyo cabbirkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchema\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca IFC, sida IFC2X3 ama IFC4\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProject\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca mashruuca iyo magaciisa dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPhase\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarxalada mashruuca, haddii dhoofiyuhu qoray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExported from\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka dhoofiyey, laga akhriyay madasha faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAuthor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraaga madasha faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExported\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda iyo waqtiga madasha faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElements\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta walxood oo leh qaab la sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta saddex-geesood ee qaababkoodu sameeyaan; cabbir ah sida uu culus yahay moodeelku\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-faylka-faylasha-mashruuca-iyo-qoyska\"\u003EPanelka Faylka (faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKind\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca: Mashruuc, Qaab mashruuc, Qoys ama Qaab qoys\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiideynta ugu dambaysay ee keydisay faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuild\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha saxda ah ee siideynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta faylka BimCraft akhriyay, marka loo barbardhigo cabbirkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-naqshadda-dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003EPanelka Naqshadda (DWG iyo DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiideynta naqshadda lagu keydiyay, oo leh koodkeeda qaabka, sida AC1032\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnits\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECutubyada geli-ka naqshadda, marka la dejiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEntities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta walxood ee la akhriyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELayers\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta lakabyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta xaashiyood (qaabeynta), ama Midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinked drawings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta naqshad oo xidhiidh ah laga helay oo la soo raray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEquipment\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta qalab oo tag leh ee ku jira xaashiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-gal\"\u003EPanelka Gal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFolder, Files, Size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalka aad furtay, inta faylal ee ku jira, iyo wadarta cabbirkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModels\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska, mid kasta nuqulladiisa oo keliya hal mar la tiriyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECAD drawings, IFC models\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta mid kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProblems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta nuqul moodeel ah oo dhammaystirnayn ama akhri la&#039;aan ah, ama Midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Walax IFC Sare ee panelka Sifooyinka waxa uu muujiyaa nooca walxa iyada oo aan lahayn xarfaha \"Ifc\" (tusaale \"Door\", \"WallStandardCase\", \"FurnishingElement\") iyo magaciisa, ama \"Unnamed\" haddii aanu magac lahayn. Goobta Macnaha Waa la beddeli karaa Magac Magaca walxaha, inta badan magaca qoyska iyo nooca uu dhoofiyuhu qoro Haa Nooca Magaca nooca walxaha, marka uu leeyahay Maya Nooca shayga Sharaxaad xor ah oo nooca ah oo dhoofiyayaasha qaarkood buuxiyaan Haa Tag Calaamadda ama tag-ka walxaha; dhoofiyayaasha badani halkan ayay ku qoraan ID-ga walxaha Haa Sharaxaad Qoraal xor ah Haa GlobalId Aqoonsiga IFC ee joogtada ah ee 22 xaraf ee walxaha, isku mid dhoofinta kasta ee walxahaas Maya Xariiq Lambarka xariiqda walxaha (#1234) ee faylka IFC-kan. Wuu isbeddelaa dhoofin kasta Maya Hoosta waxa yimaada qaybaha sifooyinka, oo lagu kala saaray magaca: Qayb kasta way furmaa oo way xirmaa marka aad riixdo magaciisa. Saddexda hore way furan yihiin. Qayb lagu calaamadeeyay \"(type)\" waxay ka tirsan tahay nooca walxaha: \"Sifada nooca: isbeddel halkan ayaa ku dhacaya walxaha nooca kasta.\" Qaybaha tirooyinka (dherer, aag, mug, tiro, miisaan) waa kuwo keliya-akhris ah. Liisaska iyo qiimayaasha la tiriyay waa la muujiyaa, keliya-akhris. Qiimayaasha Haa/Maya waxa lagu muujiyaa Haa ama Maya. Tirooyinka waxa loo wareejiyaa afar meel oo tobanka ah. Dherer (sifada dhererka ama dherer tiro) wuxuu muujiyaa Cutubyada ee lagu dhejiyay qalabka sare, oo cutubka ku xiga, waxaadna ku qori kartaa tiro cusub oo cutubkaas ah ama cutub kale oo lagu calaamadeeyay, sida 2.4 m ama 8'-0\": BimCraft wuxuu qoraa tirada faylka mar kale. Tirooyinka kale waxay muujiyaan sida faylku u haysto. Qiime madhan wuxuu muujiyaa madhan. Qiime la tafatiray waa xoog, oo xariiq buluug ah ayaa ku taal dhinacisa. Koobiyee qiime Qiime kasta oo Sifooyinka wuxuu leeyahay badhan koobiyeyn yar oo ku xiga: riix si aad qiimaha u dhigto clipboard-ka siday u muuqato, tusaale GlobalId, lambarka taxanaha ama qiime kasta oo qaybta sifada. Koobiyeynta weligeed ma bilaabo wax wax ka beddelid. Sare, Koobiyee dhammaan wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qiimaha walxaha oo dhan qoraal ahaan, qayb qayb; Koobiyee CSV ahaan wuxuu koobiyeeyaa safafka kooxda, sifada iyo qiimaha si aad ugu dhejiso spreadsheet; qiimayaasha madhan waa la hayaa si goob kasta u leedahay safka. Tanu waa isku mid walax moodeel furan kale; marka moodeelo badan la furo, CSV-ga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa tiir Moodeel oo magaca faylkiisa ku qoran. Panelka Faylka (IFC) Goobta Macnaha File, Size Faylka aad furtay, iyo cabbirkiisa Schema Nooca IFC, sida IFC2X3 ama IFC4 Project Magaca mashruuca iyo magaciisa dheer Phase Marxalada mashruuca, haddii dhoofiyuhu qoray Exported from Barnaamijka dhoofiyey, laga akhriyay madasha faylka Author Qoraaga madasha faylka Exported Taariikhda iyo waqtiga madasha faylka Elements Inta walxood oo leh qaab la sawiray Triangles Inta saddex-geesood ee qaababkoodu sameeyaan; cabbir ah sida uu culus yahay moodeelku Panelka Faylka (faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska) Goobta Macnaha Kind Nooca: Mashruuc, Qaab mashruuc, Qoys ama Qaab qoys Saved in Siideynta ugu dambaysay ee keydisay faylka Build Dhismaha saxda ah ee siideynta Read Inta faylka BimCraft akhriyay, marka loo barbardhigo cabbirkiisa Panelka Naqshadda (DWG iyo DXF) Goobta Macnaha Format Siideynta naqshadda lagu keydiyay, oo leh koodkeeda qaabka, sida AC1032 Units Cutubyada geli-ka naqshadda, marka la dejiyo Entities Inta walxood ee la akhriyay Layers Inta lakabyada Sheets Inta xaashiyood (qaabeynta), ama Midna Linked drawings Inta naqshad oo xidhiidh ah laga helay oo la soo raray Equipment Inta qalab oo tag leh ee ku jira xaashiyada Panelka Gal Goobta Macnaha Folder, Files, Size Galka aad furtay, inta faylal ee ku jira, iyo wadarta cabbirkooda Models Faylasha mashruuca iyo qoyska, mid kasta nuqulladiisa oo keliya hal mar la tiriyay CAD drawings, IFC models Inta mid kasta Problems Inta nuqul moodeel ah oo dhammaystirnayn ama akhri la'aan ah, ama Midna","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-engine-addons","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Ku dar injin rendar oo kordhin ah","summary":"Waxa kordhinku ku dari karo liiska Injinka ee wada-hadalka Render, ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay si uu barnaamij u socodsiiyo, iyo waxa Studio hubiyo oo weydiiyo.","section":"reference","order":37,"keywords":["kordhin","addon","injin","injinka rendarka","horumariye","engine.run","ogolaansho","barnaamij","script","saxiixan","studio","api"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKordhin (Dejinta › Kordhinada) wuxuu ku dari karaa injin liiska Injinka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Qoraalka oo dhan ee loogu talagalay qorayaasha kordhinada waa qaybta 16 ee qeexidda kordhinka; si kooban:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKordhinku wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa injin leh id uu ku bilaabmo sidiisa, magac, dejin ikhtiyaari ah, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emid kamid ah\u003C/strong\u003E barnaamij la socodsiiyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eama\u003C/strong\u003E function JavaScript ah oo sawirka sameeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInjin barnaamij socodsiiya wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaanshaha \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eengine.run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo la tusayo ka hor rakibista iyo ku dhex jirta Dejinta. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu u muuqdaa sida fayl la kaydiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKordhinku wuxuu magacaabaa barnaamijka (magac fayl oo fudud oo keliya: ma aha shell), script ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Ekordhinka saxiixa leh\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo arguments oo ka kooban meel-hayeyaal iyo erayo fudud. Studio wuxuu helaa barnaamijka ama wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad hal mar tilmaamto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, \u003Cstrong\u003EStudio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa dialog gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca kordhinka, magaca barnaamijka, iyo in script-ku uu samayn karo wax kasta oo barnaamijku samayn karo. Ogolow kaliya kordhin aad isku kalsoonahay. Jawaabtaadu waa la xasuustaa kordhinkaas iyo barnaamijkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXirmada (muuqaalka sidii USD iyo fayl dejin, iyo fayl glTF marka kordhinku weydiyo) iyo script-ka kordhinku waxay galaan folder cusub oo ku meel gaar ah. Barnaamijku wuxuu ku socdaa halkaas, sawirkuna wuxuu soo noqdaa isagoo calaamad ku leh magaca injinka kordhinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKordhinku wuxuu ku dari karaa injinada rendar oo keliya API kordhinka 1.4 ka bilaabmaya. Tusaale shaqeynaya oo ku saabsan injin amarka-socda oo furan ayaa ku jira kaydkiisa gaarka ah; weli lama isticmaalin injinkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kordhin (Dejinta › Kordhinada) wuxuu ku dari karaa injin liiska Injinka ee Render. Qoraalka oo dhan ee loogu talagalay qorayaasha kordhinada waa qaybta 16 ee qeexidda kordhinka; si kooban: Kordhinku wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa injin leh id uu ku bilaabmo sidiisa, magac, dejin ikhtiyaari ah, iyo mid kamid ah barnaamij la socodsiiyo ama function JavaScript ah oo sawirka sameeya. Injin barnaamij socodsiiya wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaanshaha engine.run, kaas oo la tusayo ka hor rakibista iyo ku dhex jirta Dejinta. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu u muuqdaa sida fayl la kaydiyo. Kordhinku wuxuu magacaabaa barnaamijka (magac fayl oo fudud oo keliya: ma aha shell), script ku jira kordhinka saxiixa leh, iyo arguments oo ka kooban meel-hayeyaal iyo erayo fudud. Studio wuxuu helaa barnaamijka ama wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad hal mar tilmaamto. Markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, Studio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa dialog gaar ah: magaca kordhinka, magaca barnaamijka, iyo in script-ku uu samayn karo wax kasta oo barnaamijku samayn karo. Ogolow kaliya kordhin aad isku kalsoonahay. Jawaabtaadu waa la xasuustaa kordhinkaas iyo barnaamijkaas. Xirmada (muuqaalka sidii USD iyo fayl dejin, iyo fayl glTF marka kordhinku weydiyo) iyo script-ka kordhinku waxay galaan folder cusub oo ku meel gaar ah. Barnaamijku wuxuu ku socdaa halkaas, sawirkuna wuxuu soo noqdaa isagoo calaamad ku leh magaca injinka kordhinka. Kordhinku wuxuu ku dari karaa injinada rendar oo keliya API kordhinka 1.4 ka bilaabmaya. Tusaale shaqeynaya oo ku saabsan injin amarka-socda oo furan ayaa ku jira kaydkiisa gaarka ah; weli lama isticmaalin injinkaas.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"folder-roles","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Warbixinta galka: doorarka, xaaladaha iyo xiriirrada","summary":"Calaamad kasta oo ku jirta warbixinta galka, waxa ay ka dhigan tahay, iyo sida loo doorto talada \"Halkan ka bilow\".","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["warbixinta galka","doorarka","xaaladda","dhammaystiran","aan dhammaystirnayn","aan la akhrin karin","xiran","gadaal","bilow","dhexe","qoys","kaydin kaliya","halkan ka bilow","xaaladda xiriirka"],"headings":[{"id":"xaaladda-nuqulka","text":"Xaaladda nuqulka","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta","text":"Kaydinta","level":2},{"id":"doorarka","text":"Doorarka","level":2},{"id":"sida-halkan-ka-bilow-loo-dooro","text":"Sida \"Halkan ka bilow\" loo dooro","level":2},{"id":"xaaladda-xiriirka","text":"Xaaladda xiriirka","level":2},{"id":"dhinac-u-dhig","text":"Dhinac u dhig","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"xaaladda-nuqulka\"\u003EXaaladda nuqulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqul kasta oo moodel ah, faylka ugu weyn iyo nuqullada lambarka leh ee kaydinta, wuxuu helaa hubin madax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacno\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaystiran\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadaxa faylka iyo index-kiisa way ku dhex jiraan faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAan dhammaystirnayn\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku wuu ka gaaban yahay index-kiisa uu sheegayo: waa la jarey markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo geliyay ama la isku waafajinayay, ama waa fayl daruur ah oo weli yahay &quot;online kaliya&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAan la akhrin karin\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku ma aha fayl compound sax ah, ama lama akhrin karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EXaaladda\u003C/strong\u003E ee moodel wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaystiran\u003C/strong\u003E, ama calaamad jaalle ah oo leh &quot;\u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E aan dhammaystirnayn&quot; marka ugu yaraan hal nuqul uu xun yahay laakiin mid kale uu caafimaad qabo, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EAan dhammaystirnayn\u003C/strong\u003E oo guduudan marka nuqul caafimaad qaba aanu jirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta\"\u003EKaydinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha loo magacaabay sida \u003Ccode\u003EName.0001.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.0002.rvt\u003C/code\u003E iyo kuwa kale waa kaydinta lambarka leh ee \u003Ccode\u003EName.rvt\u003C/code\u003E. Waa la kooxeeyaa moodelkooda hoostiisa, kuwa ugu dambeeyay marka hore, gudaha \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan … nuqullada\u003C/strong\u003E. Kaarka waxaa laga akhriyaa faylka ugu weyn marka uu dhammaystiran yahay, haddii kale kaydinta cusub ee dhammaystiran (&quot;newest complete&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorarka\"\u003EDoorarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa lagu muujiyaa xarfo jiir ah hoosta magaca moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacno\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELagu xiray \u003Cem\u003Emoodel kale\u003C/em\u003E: gadaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel kale oo galka ku jira ayaa xidhay kan, mana badna inuu yahay gadaal qof kale leeyahay, sida moodelka la-taliyaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow ama fayl aan magac lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac sida Blank, Template, Default, Untitled ama Project1: bilow, ama fayl aan si sax ah loo magacaabin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel dhexe oo shaqo wadajir ah. Shaqadu waxay ka dhacdaa nuqul maxalli ah, ma aha halkan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoys (qayb)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E: qayb, ma aha mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta kaliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka ugu weyn waa baabi&#039;ay, waxa haray kaliya kaydinta lambarka leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-halkan-ka-bilow-loo-dooro\"\u003ESida &quot;Halkan ka bilow&quot; loo dooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu raacaa fikirka isticmaale waayo-aragnimo leh:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMusharraxiinta waa faylasha mashruuca ee la akhrin karo (\u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E) ee aan xidhan moodel kale, oo aan ahayn bilow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhexe iyo moodelada kaydinta kaliya waxay tirtirmaan kaliya marka wax ka fiican aan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMusharraxiinta, kan ugu dambeeyay ee la kaydiyay ayaa guuleysta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqu wuxuu liistaa sababihiisa, wuxuuna digayaa marka faylka u muuqda doorashada ugu fiican uu khaldan yahay, marka moodelo kale ay gadaal yihiin, iyo marka doorashadu tahay moodel dhexe. Waa malaha la-saadaasho; la xidhiidh qofka ugu dambeeyay ee shaqeeyay mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaaladda-xiriirka\"\u003EXaaladda xiriirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacno\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGudaha galkan\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la helay jidka xiriirka ee la kaydiyay, ama dhamaadka jidka buuxa ee la kaydiyay gudaha galka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagac isku mid ah ayaa la helay\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa aha jidkiisa, laakiin fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa galka ku jira. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl maktabad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiis furayaasha ama koodka dhismaha. Kuwan waxay ku yimaadaan barnaamijka kombuutar kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalka kuma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama helin meel kasta oo galka ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada la helay\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa inta xiriir moodel kasta oo la helay, marka laga reebo kuwa galka laga filayo (faylasha maktabadda lama tirinayo).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhinac-u-dhig\"\u003EDhinac u dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaybta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacno\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalalka nadaafadda Revit (lama akhrin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*_backup\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*_log\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ERevit_temp\u003C/code\u003E, iyo galalka qarsoon iyo \u003Ccode\u003E__MACOSX\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHadhaaga xidhka, logga iyo kaydinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwl2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.bak\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.err\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.log\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tmp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.sv$\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.ac$\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.lck\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.slog\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylal kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax kasta oo kale (40-ka hore ayaa magacooda la sheegaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Xaaladda nuqulka Nuqul kasta oo moodel ah, faylka ugu weyn iyo nuqullada lambarka leh ee kaydinta, wuxuu helaa hubin madax. Calaamad Macno Dhammaystiran Madaxa faylka iyo index-kiisa way ku dhex jiraan faylka Aan dhammaystirnayn Faylku wuu ka gaaban yahay index-kiisa uu sheegayo: waa la jarey markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo geliyay ama la isku waafajinayay, ama waa fayl daruur ah oo weli yahay \"online kaliya\" Aan la akhrin karin Faylku ma aha fayl compound sax ah, ama lama akhrin karo Tiirka Xaaladda ee moodel wuxuu muujiyaa Dhammaystiran, ama calaamad jaalle ah oo leh \"n aan dhammaystirnayn\" marka ugu yaraan hal nuqul uu xun yahay laakiin mid kale uu caafimaad qabo, ama Aan dhammaystirnayn oo guduudan marka nuqul caafimaad qaba aanu jirin. Kaydinta Faylasha loo magacaabay sida Name.0001.rvt, Name.0002.rvt iyo kuwa kale waa kaydinta lambarka leh ee Name.rvt. Waa la kooxeeyaa moodelkooda hoostiisa, kuwa ugu dambeeyay marka hore, gudaha Dhammaan … nuqullada. Kaarka waxaa laga akhriyaa faylka ugu weyn marka uu dhammaystiran yahay, haddii kale kaydinta cusub ee dhammaystiran (\"newest complete\"). Doorarka Waxaa lagu muujiyaa xarfo jiir ah hoosta magaca moodelka. Doorka Macno Lagu xiray moodel kale: gadaal Moodel kale oo galka ku jira ayaa xidhay kan, mana badna inuu yahay gadaal qof kale leeyahay, sida moodelka la-taliyaha Bilow ama fayl aan magac lahayn Magac sida Blank, Template, Default, Untitled ama Project1: bilow, ama fayl aan si sax ah loo magacaabin Moodel dhexe Moodel dhexe oo shaqo wadajir ah. Shaqadu waxay ka dhacdaa nuqul maxalli ah, ma aha halkan Qoys (qayb) Fayl .rfa ama .rft: qayb, ma aha mashruuca Kaydinta kaliya Faylka ugu weyn waa baabi'ay, waxa haray kaliya kaydinta lambarka leh Sida \"Halkan ka bilow\" loo dooro BimCraft wuxuu raacaa fikirka isticmaale waayo-aragnimo leh: Musharraxiinta waa faylasha mashruuca ee la akhrin karo (.rvt, .rte) ee aan xidhan moodel kale, oo aan ahayn bilow. Dhexe iyo moodelada kaydinta kaliya waxay tirtirmaan kaliya marka wax ka fiican aan jirin. Musharraxiinta, kan ugu dambeeyay ee la kaydiyay ayaa guuleysta. Sanduuqu wuxuu liistaa sababihiisa, wuxuuna digayaa marka faylka u muuqda doorashada ugu fiican uu khaldan yahay, marka moodelo kale ay gadaal yihiin, iyo marka doorashadu tahay moodel dhexe. Waa malaha la-saadaasho; la xidhiidh qofka ugu dambeeyay ee shaqeeyay mashruuca. Xaaladda xiriirka Calaamad Macno Gudaha galkan Waa la helay jidka xiriirka ee la kaydiyay, ama dhamaadka jidka buuxa ee la kaydiyay gudaha galka Magac isku mid ah ayaa la helay Ma aha jidkiisa, laakiin fayl magac isku mid ah ayaa galka ku jira. Hubi inuu yahay mid saxda ah Fayl maktabad Miis furayaasha ama koodka dhismaha. Kuwan waxay ku yimaadaan barnaamijka kombuutar kasta Galka kuma jiro Lama helin meel kasta oo galka ku jirta Tiirka Xiriirrada la helay ee Moodelada wuxuu muujiyaa inta xiriir moodel kasta oo la helay, marka laga reebo kuwa galka laga filayo (faylasha maktabadda lama tirinayo). Dhinac u dhig Qaybta Macno Galalka nadaafadda Revit (lama akhrin) *_backup, *_log iyo Revit_temp, iyo galalka qarsoon iyo __MACOSX Hadhaaga xidhka, logga iyo kaydinta Faylasha .dwl, .dwl2, .bak, .err, .log, .tmp, .sv$, .ac$, .lck iyo .slog Faylal kale Wax kasta oo kale (40-ka hore ayaa magacooda la sheegaa)","lang":"so"},{"slug":"platforms","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Browser-ada, qalabka iyo xusuusta","summary":"Waxa BimCraft ku kala duwan yahay Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari, Mac, Windows iyo Linux, mouse, trackpad ama touch, iyo cabbirka faylka uu qaadi karo.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["browser","chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","phone","touch","trackpad","xusuusta","faylal waaweyn","webgl","waxqabad"],"headings":[{"id":"furidda-folder-ka","text":"Furidda folder-ka","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"mouse-trackpad-iyo-touch","text":"Mouse, trackpad iyo touch","level":2},{"id":"faylalka-waaweyn-iyo-xusuusta","text":"Faylalka waaweyn iyo xusuusta","level":2},{"id":"la-xiriira","text":"La xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa nooca hadda jira ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari, Mac, Windows iyo Linux. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGL, oo browser kasta oo hadda jira leh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowser-yada iyo kombuyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E waxa apps-ka u baahan yahay guud ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furidda-folder-ka\"\u003EFuridda folder-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur gal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJiidida folder-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGalalka dhawaan la furay\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooraha folder-ka ee browser-ka, kadibna &quot;Let site view files?&quot;: guji \u003Cstrong\u003EView files\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, folder-yada la doortay ama la jiiday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooraha folder-ka ee nidaamka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooraha folder-ka ee nidaamka, oo leh badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EUpload\u003C/strong\u003E (wax lama soo rarayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDabadiisa: Chrome iyo Edge waxay isticmaalaan File System Access picker-ka waxayna xusuusan karaan folder-ka. Firefox iyo Safari waxay isticmaalaan dooraha folder-ka hore, kaas oo siiya faylal kasta hal mar, mana xusuusan karo. Folder la jiiday wuxuu akhriyaa entry kasta mid mid browser kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrave iyo browser-yada Chromium kale qaar ayaa damiya dooraha folder-ka. BimCraft markaas wuxuu isticmaalaa dooraha folder-ka nidaamka, browser-kuna wuxuu ku weydiin karaa &quot;Upload \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E files to this site?&quot;. Wax lama soo rarayo; faylalka waxay u gaaraan bogga keliya. Folder-ka jiidida waxay ka fogaysaa su&#039;aasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGaadhooyinka \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa Command Mac-ka, Ctrl Windows iyo Linux-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (habka shaashadda) waa Control dhammaan nidaamyada, oo ay ku jiraan Mac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWada-hadalada faylka iyo folder-ka download-ka waa kuwa nidaamkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-trackpad-iyo-touch\"\u003EMouse, trackpad iyo touch\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGelinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAragtida 3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERasmeynta 2D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMouse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiidida bidix waa wareeg, jiidida midig waa dhex-u-dhaq, tuubada waa zoom, riix waa dooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid kasta waa dhex-u-dhaq, tuubada waa zoom, laba jeer riix waa ku habee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix-jiid waa wareeg; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid waa dhex-u-dhaq; dhex-u-dhaq laba farood ama pinch waa zoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix-jiid waa dhex-u-dhaq; dhex-u-dhaq laba farood ama pinch waa zoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETouch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood waa wareeg, laba farood waa pinch iyo dhex-u-dhaq, tap waa dooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood waa dhex-u-dhaq; weli pinch zoom ma jiro; tap \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka Mac-ka, midig-riix waa laba farood-riix (ama Control-riix). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-ka iyo trackpad-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabletyada iyo telefoonadu waxay furi karaan faylal keli ah oo eegi karaan, laakiin shaashaddu way yar tahay, browser-yo badan oo mobile ah ma dooran karaan folder-yo, moodeelada waaweyn xusuustooda ma ku filan karaan. Kombuyuutarku ayuu ugu fiican yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalka-waaweyn-iyo-xusuusta\"\u003EFaylalka waaweyn iyo xusuusta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo BimCraft akhriyo waxay ku nool yihiin xusuusta tab-ka browser-ka. Inta uu tab-ku qaadi karo waxay ku xidhan tahay browser-ka iyo kombuyuutarkaaga, intaas ka badan BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInta la akhriyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la filan karo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka oo dhan, iyo geometry 3D ee laga dhisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta ay weyn tahay waxay ku xidhan tahay kombuyuutarkaaga iyo browser-ka; moodeel dhowr boqol megabytes ah ayaa laga yaabaa inuu ka badan yahay laptop. Ka badan 1.5 milyan triangle, edges waa la damiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaastii 40 KB ilaa 100 KB, iyadoon loo eegin cabbirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelada dhexe ee waaweyn mar ayay furmaan, xitaa network drive-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada aad u waaweyn waxay muujiyaan &quot;This drawing is very large; only part of it is shown.&quot; (Sawirkan aad buu u weyn yahay; qayb keliya ayaa la muujinayaa.)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFolders\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska faylalka, iyo dhowr kilobyte moodel kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaa 20,000 fayl\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii tab-ku xusuusta ka dhammaado, browser-ku wuxuu muujiyaa bogga khaladkiisa (&quot;Aw, Snap!&quot; Chrome-ka, tusaale ahaan). Xir tabaha kale, dib u bilow BimCraft oo isku day mar kale, ama isticmaal kombuyuutar xusuus badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-xiriira\"\u003ELa xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EOnline iyo offline\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"BimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa nooca hadda jira ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari, Mac, Windows iyo Linux. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGL, oo browser kasta oo hadda jira leh. Eeg Browser-yada iyo kombuyuutarrada waxa apps-ka u baahan yahay guud ahaan. Furidda folder-ka Browser Fur gal wuxuu sameeyaa Jiidida folder-ka Galalka dhawaan la furay Chrome, Edge Dooraha folder-ka ee browser-ka, kadibna \"Let site view files?\": guji View files Wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin Haa, folder-yada la doortay ama la jiiday Firefox Dooraha folder-ka ee nidaamka Wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin Maya Safari Dooraha folder-ka ee nidaamka, oo leh badhanka Upload (wax lama soo rarayo) Wuxuu furmaa iyada oo aan wax la weydiin Maya Dabadiisa: Chrome iyo Edge waxay isticmaalaan File System Access picker-ka waxayna xusuusan karaan folder-ka. Firefox iyo Safari waxay isticmaalaan dooraha folder-ka hore, kaas oo siiya faylal kasta hal mar, mana xusuusan karo. Folder la jiiday wuxuu akhriyaa entry kasta mid mid browser kasta. Brave iyo browser-yada Chromium kale qaar ayaa damiya dooraha folder-ka. BimCraft markaas wuxuu isticmaalaa dooraha folder-ka nidaamka, browser-kuna wuxuu ku weydiin karaa \"Upload n files to this site?\". Wax lama soo rarayo; faylalka waxay u gaaraan bogga keliya. Folder-ka jiidida waxay ka fogaysaa su'aasha. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Gaadhooyinka Ctrl+S iyo Ctrl+Z waa Command Mac-ka, Ctrl Windows iyo Linux-ka. Ctrl+Shift+F (habka shaashadda) waa Control dhammaan nidaamyada, oo ay ku jiraan Mac. Wada-hadalada faylka iyo folder-ka download-ka waa kuwa nidaamkaaga. Mouse, trackpad iyo touch Gelinta Aragtida 3D Rasmeynta 2D Mouse Jiidida bidix waa wareeg, jiidida midig waa dhex-u-dhaq, tuubada waa zoom, riix waa dooro Jiid kasta waa dhex-u-dhaq, tuubada waa zoom, laba jeer riix waa ku habee Trackpad Riix-jiid waa wareeg; Shift ama Ctrl iyo jiid waa dhex-u-dhaq; dhex-u-dhaq laba farood ama pinch waa zoom Riix-jiid waa dhex-u-dhaq; dhex-u-dhaq laba farood ama pinch waa zoom Touch Hal farood waa wareeg, laba farood waa pinch iyo dhex-u-dhaq, tap waa dooro Hal farood waa dhex-u-dhaq; weli pinch zoom ma jiro; tap Ku habee Trackpad-ka Mac-ka, midig-riix waa laba farood-riix (ama Control-riix). Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-ka iyo trackpad-ka. Taabletyada iyo telefoonadu waxay furi karaan faylal keli ah oo eegi karaan, laakiin shaashaddu way yar tahay, browser-yo badan oo mobile ah ma dooran karaan folder-yo, moodeelada waaweyn xusuustooda ma ku filan karaan. Kombuyuutarku ayuu ugu fiican yahay. Faylalka waaweyn iyo xusuusta Wax kasta oo BimCraft akhriyo waxay ku nool yihiin xusuusta tab-ka browser-ka. Inta uu tab-ku qaadi karo waxay ku xidhan tahay browser-ka iyo kombuyuutarkaaga, intaas ka badan BimCraft. Faylka Inta la akhriyo Waxa la filan karo IFC Faylka oo dhan, iyo geometry 3D ee laga dhisay Inta ay weyn tahay waxay ku xidhan tahay kombuyuutarkaaga iyo browser-ka; moodeel dhowr boqol megabytes ah ayaa laga yaabaa inuu ka badan yahay laptop. Ka badan 1.5 milyan triangle, edges waa la damiyaa Faylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska Qiyaastii 40 KB ilaa 100 KB, iyadoon loo eegin cabbirka Moodeelada dhexe ee waaweyn mar ayay furmaan, xitaa network drive-ka DWG iyo DXF Faylka oo dhan Sawirada aad u waaweyn waxay muujiyaan \"This drawing is very large; only part of it is shown.\" (Sawirkan aad buu u weyn yahay; qayb keliya ayaa la muujinayaa.) Folders Liiska faylalka, iyo dhowr kilobyte moodel kasta Ilaa 20,000 fayl Haddii tab-ku xusuusta ka dhammaado, browser-ku wuxuu muujiyaa bogga khaladkiisa (\"Aw, Snap!\" Chrome-ka, tusaale ahaan). Xir tabaha kale, dib u bilow BimCraft oo isku day mar kale, ama isticmaal kombuyuutar xusuus badan. La xiriira Online iyo offline Xallinta dhibaatada","lang":"so"},{"slug":"touch-screens","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Isticmaal BimCraft shaashad taabasho ama tablet","summary":"Ku wareeg, ku weyn oo dooro moodelka 3D, u guuri oo ku qabo naqshadda, dooro dhowr walxood, soco, oo shayada ku dhig farahaaga.","section":"reference","order":52,"keywords":["taabasho","tablet","ipad","android","farta","pinch","riix muddo dheer","taabo","wareeg","soco","gesture","qalinka","pen"],"headings":[{"id":"moodelka-3d","text":"Moodelka 3D","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf","text":"Naqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF)","level":2},{"id":"soco","text":"Soco","level":2},{"id":"shayada-maktabadda-ee-la-dhigo","text":"Shayada maktabadda ee la dhigo","level":2},{"id":"cabbir","text":"Cabbir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa farahaaga iyo sidoo kale mouse-ka. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad shaashadda taabato, badhamada, tabsyada iyo safafka liistada ayaa koraya ilaa cabbirka farta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodelka-3d\"\u003EMoodelka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid hal farta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qabo laba farta isku dhowaysa ama isku fogaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid laba farta oo wada jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro walax\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar walax doorashada, ama ka saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix oo hay nus ilbiriqsi (waa isku mid \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba ha dooran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabo meel bannaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu qabashada iyo jiidista laba farood marna ma dooran wax, xitaa haddii farta ay ka kor kacdo walax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadaha-dwg-iyo-dxf\"\u003ENaqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid hal farta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qabo; barta ka dhex-dhexaysa farahaaga ayaa meeshaa ku sii jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji xaashida oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer taabo, ama taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ee naqshadda, gesture-yada moodelka ayaa dhacaya: hal farta wareeg, laba farood ku qabo oo guuri, taabo ayaa dooro, riix muddo dheer ayaa ku dari doona doorashada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soco\"\u003ESoco\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalk\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna taabo dhulka aad rabto inaad taagnaatid. Safka badhamada fallaadhaha ayaa ka muuqda bar-ka socodka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay fallaadha si aad ugu socoto hore, dib, ama tallaabo dhinac ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGravity\u003C/span\u003E la damiyay, fallaadhaha labajibbaaran ayaa kor iyo hoos u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid hal farta moodelka si aad u eegto wareeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shayada-maktabadda-ee-la-dhigo\"\u003EShayada maktabadda ee la dhigo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo meesha shayga la geynayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn 90°\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal bar-ka dhigidda ayaa leexiya (waa furaha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kiiboodhka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall snap\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhabarka u dhufanaya darbiga ugu dhow, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop placing\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dhammeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo barta koowaad, kadibna tan labaad. Barta ayaa ku dhufata geeska iyo xuduudaha ku dhow taabashadaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodh oo ku xidhan tablet-ka, furaha kasta wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida kombiyuutarka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha gaaban\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"BimCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa farahaaga iyo sidoo kale mouse-ka. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad shaashadda taabato, badhamada, tabsyada iyo safafka liistada ayaa koraya ilaa cabbirka farta. Moodelka 3D Si aad u Samee tan Wareeg Jiid hal farta Weynee Ku qabo laba farta isku dhowaysa ama isku fogaysa Guuri Jiid laba farta oo wada jira Dooro walax Taabo Ku dar walax doorashada, ama ka saar Riix oo hay nus ilbiriqsi (waa isku mid Ctrl+riix) Waxba ha dooran Taabo meel bannaan Ku qabashada iyo jiidista laba farood marna ma dooran wax, xitaa haddii farta ay ka kor kacdo walax. Naqshadaha (DWG iyo DXF) Si aad u Samee tan Guuri Jiid hal farta Weynee Ku qabo; barta ka dhex-dhexaysa farahaaga ayaa meeshaa ku sii jirta Muuji xaashida oo dhan Laba jeer taabo, ama taabo Fit Muuqaalka 3D ee naqshadda, gesture-yada moodelka ayaa dhacaya: hal farta wareeg, laba farood ku qabo oo guuri, taabo ayaa dooro, riix muddo dheer ayaa ku dari doona doorashada. Soco Taabo Walk, kadibna taabo dhulka aad rabto inaad taagnaatid. Safka badhamada fallaadhaha ayaa ka muuqda bar-ka socodka: Hay fallaadha si aad ugu socoto hore, dib, ama tallaabo dhinac ah. Haddii Gravity la damiyay, fallaadhaha labajibbaaran ayaa kor iyo hoos u kaca. Jiid hal farta moodelka si aad u eegto wareeg. Taabo Done si aad u joojiso. Shayada maktabadda ee la dhigo Taabo meesha shayga la geynayo. Turn 90° oo ku yaal bar-ka dhigidda ayaa leexiya (waa furaha R kiiboodhka), Wall snap ayaa dhabarka u dhufanaya darbiga ugu dhow, Stop placing ayaa dhammeeya. Cabbir Taabo barta koowaad, kadibna tan labaad. Barta ayaa ku dhufata geeska iyo xuduudaha ku dhow taabashadaada. Kiiboodh oo ku xidhan tablet-ka, furaha kasta wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida kombiyuutarka. Eeg Furayaasha gaaban.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"online-offline","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Online iyo offline","summary":"Waxa BimCraft ka soo rarta goobta, sida Kaydi khadka ka baxsan u furo moodelada IFC iyo sawirada DWG adigoon xidhiidh lahayn, iyo sababta aan wax faylkaaga ah loo soo rarin.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["offline","online","internet","xidhiidh","shabakad lama heli karo","qaabka diyaaradda","kaydi khadka ka baxsan","khadka ka baxsan diyaar","soo rar","qarsoodi","wasm","webassembly","IFC engine","dwg","cloud"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-bimcraft-ka-soo-rarta-goobta","text":"Waxa BimCraft ka soo rarta goobta","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-bimcraft-si-uu-offline-uga-shaqeeyo","text":"Kaydi BimCraft si uu offline uga shaqeeyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-badhanku-sheegayo","text":"Waxa badhanku sheegayo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-weligiis-xidhiidh-u-baahnayn","text":"Waxa aan weligiis xidhiidh u baahnayn","level":2},{"id":"weli-ma-diyaar-aha","text":"Weli ma diyaar aha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa faylalkaaga gudaha tab-ka browser-ka. Furista, eegista, wax ka beddelka iyo kaydinta faylalkaaga weligood ma diraan meel, online ama offline. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta offline\u003C/a\u003E waxay sharraxaysaa nuqullada offline ee dhammaan app-yada; boggan waxa uu daboolayaa waxa gaar u ah BimCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-bimcraft-ka-soo-rarta-goobta\"\u003EWaxa BimCraft ka soo rarta goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQayb\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoorta ay soo raraan haddii aanu nuqul offline ahayn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp-ka laftiisa, oo ay ku jiraan muuqaalka 3D iyo koodka IFC engine-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkaad furto BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhowr megabytes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta WebAssembly ee IFC engine-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka IFC ee ugu horreeya ee aad furto tab-ka: &quot;Bilaabaya IFC engine-ka…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhawaad 1.6 MB\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirada DWG iyo DXF, faylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska, iyo galalka ma u baahna wax dheeraad ah: akhristooda waa qayb ka ah app-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-bimcraft-si-uu-offline-uga-shaqeeyo\"\u003EKaydi BimCraft si uu offline uga shaqeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur BimCraft inta aad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E baarka app-ka ee sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg badhanka sida uu u kordhayo: tusaale ahaan &quot;Kaydinaya 40 ee 212&quot;. Nuqulka BimCraft wuxuu ku dhawaad yahay 11 MB, sababtoo ah wuxuu ku jiraa IFC engine-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E ay timaado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka ay tibaaxayso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, moodelada IFC, sawirada DWG iyo DXF, faylalka mashruuca, galalka iyo caawimaadan oo dhan waxay ku furmaan xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Ma u baahnid inaad marka hore furto IFC ama DWG si aad akhristayaasha &quot;u kululeeyso&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u cusboonaysiiso ama u saartid nuqulka, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-badhanku-sheegayo\"\u003EWaxa badhanku sheegayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli nuqul offline ah ma jiro browser-kan. Guji si aad mid u kaydiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Kaydinaya \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E ee \u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la kaydinayaa; tab-ka u hay furan ilaa uu dhammaado\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa kaydiyay. Ku dhaw si aad u aragto goorta; guji si aad u hesho menu-ga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylal qaar ma soo degin. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga oo guji si aad mar kale u isku daydo. Nuqulka ugu dambeeya ee wanaagsan, haddii uu jiro, waa la hayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqaddan ma hayn karto nuqul offline ah (daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutar la maamulo). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta offline\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad offline tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii badhanku yidhi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, nooc kasta oo fayl ah ayaa sida caadiga ah u furmaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aanu yidhaahdin, waxa shaqeeya kaliya waxa tab-kan hore u soo rartay: akhrin aan waligiis ku soo rarnayn tab-kan ma bilaabmi karo, furistii nooca faylkaas waxay muujinaysaa qalad ka yimid browser-ka safka xaaladda. Ha dib u cusboonaysiin tab-ka ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-weligiis-xidhiidh-u-baahnayn\"\u003EWaxa aan weligiis xidhiidh u baahnayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii BimCraft la furo tab-ka, waxyaabahan waxay offline ku shaqeeyaan xitaa nuqul la kaydiyay la&#039;aantood:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhrinta faylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska iyo hubinta galalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashada walxaha, akhrinta sifooyinka iyo wax ka beddelka qiyamka IFC moodel hore u furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E: labaduba waa soo dejin lagu sameeyo tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-ma-diyaar-aha\"\u003EWeli ma diyaar aha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylalku waxay ku kaydsamaan kombiyuutarkaaga oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaylalkaagu meeye ayay tagaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"BimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa faylalkaaga gudaha tab-ka browser-ka. Furista, eegista, wax ka beddelka iyo kaydinta faylalkaaga weligood ma diraan meel, online ama offline. Shaqaynta offline waxay sharraxaysaa nuqullada offline ee dhammaan app-yada; boggan waxa uu daboolayaa waxa gaar u ah BimCraft. Waxa BimCraft ka soo rarta goobta Qayb Goorta ay soo raraan haddii aanu nuqul offline ahayn Cabbirka App-ka laftiisa, oo ay ku jiraan muuqaalka 3D iyo koodka IFC engine-ka Markaad furto BimCraft Dhowr megabytes Qaybta WebAssembly ee IFC engine-ka Faylka IFC ee ugu horreeya ee aad furto tab-ka: \"Bilaabaya IFC engine-ka…\" Ku dhawaad 1.6 MB Sawirada DWG iyo DXF, faylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska, iyo galalka ma u baahna wax dheeraad ah: akhristooda waa qayb ka ah app-ka. Kaydi BimCraft si uu offline uga shaqeeyo Fur BimCraft inta aad online tahay. Guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan baarka app-ka ee sare. Eeg badhanka sida uu u kordhayo: tusaale ahaan \"Kaydinaya 40 ee 212\". Nuqulka BimCraft wuxuu ku dhawaad yahay 11 MB, sababtoo ah wuxuu ku jiraa IFC engine-ka. Sug inta Khadka ka baxsan diyaar ay timaado. Marka ay tibaaxayso Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, moodelada IFC, sawirada DWG iyo DXF, faylalka mashruuca, galalka iyo caawimaadan oo dhan waxay ku furmaan xidhiidh la'aan. Ma u baahnid inaad marka hore furto IFC ama DWG si aad akhristayaasha \"u kululeeyso\". Si aad u cusboonaysiiso ama u saartid nuqulka, guji Khadka ka baxsan diyaar oo dooro Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) ama Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Waxa badhanku sheegayo Badhanka Macnaha Kaydi khadka ka baxsan Weli nuqul offline ah ma jiro browser-kan. Guji si aad mid u kaydiso \"Kaydinaya n ee m\" Waa la kaydinayaa; tab-ka u hay furan ilaa uu dhammaado Khadka ka baxsan diyaar La kaydiyay. Ku dhaw si aad u aragto goorta; guji si aad u hesho menu-ga Lama kaydin karin Faylal qaar ma soo degin. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga oo guji si aad mar kale u isku daydo. Nuqulka ugu dambeeya ee wanaagsan, haddii uu jiro, waa la hayaa Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo Daaqaddan ma hayn karto nuqul offline ah (daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutar la maamulo). Eeg Shaqaynta offline Waxaad offline tahay. Haddii badhanku yidhi Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, nooc kasta oo fayl ah ayaa sida caadiga ah u furmaya. Haddii aanu yidhaahdin, waxa shaqeeya kaliya waxa tab-kan hore u soo rartay: akhrin aan waligiis ku soo rarnayn tab-kan ma bilaabmi karo, furistii nooca faylkaas waxay muujinaysaa qalad ka yimid browser-ka safka xaaladda. Ha dib u cusboonaysiin tab-ka ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa aan weligiis xidhiidh u baahnayn Markii BimCraft la furo tab-ka, waxyaabahan waxay offline ku shaqeeyaan xitaa nuqul la kaydiyay la'aantood: Akhrinta faylalka mashruuca iyo qoyska iyo hubinta galalka. Doorashada walxaha, akhrinta sifooyinka iyo wax ka beddelka qiyamka IFC moodel hore u furan. U kaydi sida IFC iyo Soo deji CSV: labaduba waa soo dejin lagu sameeyo tab-ka. Weli ma diyaar aha Kaydinta cloud-ka. Faylalku waxay ku kaydsamaan kombiyuutarkaaga oo keliya. Eeg Faylalkaagu meeye ayay tagaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"your-machine","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Waxa kumbiyuutarkaagu ku rendarayo","summary":"Dejinta › Rendarka wuxuu muujinayaa garaafyada, core-yada processor-ka iyo xusuusta uu browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka, iyo heerka uu rendarku ku bilowdo.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["kumbiyuutarkaaga","kaarka garaafyada","gpu","webgpu","webgl","processor","cpu","cores","threads","xusuusta","ram","xusuus la wadaago","isolation","darajada","heerka","xawaaraha","gaabis","xawaaraha rendarka","laptop"],"headings":[{"id":"heerka","text":"Heerka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ku sii dhig tab-ka app-kan gaarka ah oo hoos u dhaadhac \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendering\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour machine\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxa browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka si uu u rendaro. Waxba ka mid ah ma ka bixi kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaarka garaafyada ee browser-ku sheego. &quot;WebGPU&quot; macnaheedu waa wuu samayn karaa shaqada rendarka; &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; macnaheedu waa ma jiro WebGPU: aragta toosan iyo sawirada tayada sare waxay isticmaalaan kaarka garaafyada iyada oo loo marayo WebGL 2 (sawirada habka WebGL path tracer-ka ee hore, iyada oo aan lahayn waxyaabaha u baahan WebGPU); beddelka software-ka macnaheedu waa wax kasta waxay ku socdaan processor-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta core-ka processor-ka ee browser-ku sheego\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMemory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaas xusuusta kombiyuutarka, marka browser-ku sheego. Browser-radaan ma sheegaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShared memory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaddii bogga uu ogolaado inuu xusuus la wadaago workers-keeda. Marka shaqeynayso, core kasta wuxuu ka shaqayn karaa hal nuqul oo jaanta ah; marka damaysan, mid kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay nuqul u gaar ah, sidaas darteed jaan weyn wuxuu ku habboonaanayaa core yar oo isku mar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFast processor code\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaddii browser-ku socodsiiyo koodka WebAssembly ee degdega ah. Aan lahayn, wuxuu isticmaalaa wax kale oo gaabis ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, basic\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sababta hoosteeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerka\"\u003EHeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeerka waa meesha rendarku ku bilowdo, si kombiyuutar leh chip garaafyo oo dhismaha ku jira ama aan kaarka garaafyo lahayn uu u dhaqmo si degdeg ah. Chip garaafyo oo dhismaha ku jira ama taleefan, ama 4 GB xusuus ama ka yar, waligood ma helaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Isla kombiyuutarka wuxuu muujin karaa WebGPU browser-ka hal, iyo &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; browser-ka kale. Linux-ka inta badan browser-yada weli ma leeyihiin WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Fur Settings (Ctrl+,), ku sii dhig tab-ka app-kan gaarka ah oo hoos u dhaadhac Rendering. Your machine wuxuu liistaa waxa browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka si uu u rendaro. Waxba ka mid ah ma ka bixi kombiyuutarkaaga. Safka Macnaha Graphics Kaarka garaafyada ee browser-ku sheego. \"WebGPU\" macnaheedu waa wuu samayn karaa shaqada rendarka; \"WebGL 2 only\" macnaheedu waa ma jiro WebGPU: aragta toosan iyo sawirada tayada sare waxay isticmaalaan kaarka garaafyada iyada oo loo marayo WebGL 2 (sawirada habka WebGL path tracer-ka ee hore, iyada oo aan lahayn waxyaabaha u baahan WebGPU); beddelka software-ka macnaheedu waa wax kasta waxay ku socdaan processor-ka Processor Inta core-ka processor-ka ee browser-ku sheego Memory Qiyaas xusuusta kombiyuutarka, marka browser-ku sheego. Browser-radaan ma sheegaan Shared memory Haddii bogga uu ogolaado inuu xusuus la wadaago workers-keeda. Marka shaqeynayso, core kasta wuxuu ka shaqayn karaa hal nuqul oo jaanta ah; marka damaysan, mid kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay nuqul u gaar ah, sidaas darteed jaan weyn wuxuu ku habboonaanayaa core yar oo isku mar ah Fast processor code Haddii browser-ku socodsiiyo koodka WebAssembly ee degdega ah. Aan lahayn, wuxuu isticmaalaa wax kale oo gaabis ah Level Graphics card, high, Graphics card, basic ama Processor only, iyo sababta hoosteeda Heerka Heerka waa meesha rendarku ku bilowdo, si kombiyuutar leh chip garaafyo oo dhismaha ku jira ama aan kaarka garaafyo lahayn uu u dhaqmo si degdeg ah. Chip garaafyo oo dhismaha ku jira ama taleefan, ama 4 GB xusuus ama ka yar, waligood ma helaan Graphics card, high. Browser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Isla kombiyuutarka wuxuu muujin karaa WebGPU browser-ka hal, iyo \"WebGL 2 only\" browser-ka kale. Linux-ka inta badan browser-yada weli ma leeyihiin WebGPU.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Hagaajinta dhibaatada","summary":"Fariimaha BimCraft tusa, waxa keena, iyo waxa la sameeyo, marka faylal, fayl-galo, moodelo 3D, naqshado iyo wax-beddel la furayo.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["dhibaato","khalad","ma shaqeeyo","ma furmo","guuldaraystay","dhammaystiran ma aha","qaldan","gaabis","shaashad xumaaday","bannaan","maqan","fariin","caawimaad"],"headings":[{"id":"furista-faylasha","text":"Furista faylasha","level":2},{"id":"furista-fayl-galada","text":"Furista fayl-galada","level":2},{"id":"ifc-engine-ka-wuxuu-soo-socdaa-markii-ugu-horreysay","text":"IFC engine-ka wuxuu soo socdaa markii ugu horreysay","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-si-offline-loo-isticmaalo","text":"Kaydinta si offline loo isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"tafatirka-ifc","text":"Tafatirka IFC","level":2},{"id":"naqshadaha","text":"Naqshadaha","level":2},{"id":"weli-waad-ku-jirtaa-dhibaato","text":"Weli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFariimaha waxay ka muuqdaan status line-ka hoose ee stage-ka, oo cas markii wax fashilmay. Fariinta hoose raadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furista-faylasha\"\u003EFurista faylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagac\u003C/em\u003E ma aha fayl IFC, RVT, RFA, DWG ama DXF.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft ma aqoonin faylka. Hubi kordhinta iyo in faylku aanu madhnayn. Faylasha PDF, sawirrada iyo faylasha xafiisku ma furmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;.ifczip lama taageerin weli. Kaydi ama u dhoofi moodelka sida fayl .ifc caadi ah.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (sidoo kale \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E) Ka fur \u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E (waa zip caadi ah oo ku jira \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E) ama u dhoofi IFC caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… waa fayl mashruuc oo BimCraft weli aan akhrin.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E. Ka dhoofi IFC ama DWG oo ka fur: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EFur faylalka mashruucyada .pln iyo .pla\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Faylkan IFC lama akhrin karin.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka IFC waa jabay ama dhab ahaan uma eka IFC. Ku fur tafatiraha qoraalka: fayl IFC dhab ah wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Ccode\u003EISO-10303-21;\u003C/code\u003E. Mar kale u dhoofi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Faylkan dhammaystiran ma aha: waa … MB, laakiin tilmaamaha u taagan wuxuu u tilmaamaa xog ugu yaraan … MB gudaha. …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka mashruuca ama qoyska ayaa la jaray markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo gudbinayay ama la isku waafajinayay. Fayl ku jira kaydka daruurta oo &quot;oonlaynka keliya&quot; wuxuu u eeg yahay sidaas oo kale. Fayl la furo keligiis ayaa weli furmi doona, fariintan ayaa ku qoran madasha sare ee kaarka, iyo &quot;Waxaa lagu muujinayaa waxa la helay; mar kale koobiyee asalka si aad moodelka oo dhammaystiran u hesho.&quot;: kaarku wuxuu muujinayaa kaliya qaybaha baytyadoodu oo dhan faylka ku jiraan, qaybaha kale waxaa hoos ka qoran \u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiraan faylka\u003C/strong\u003E. Faylka ka dhig mid laga heli karo offline kaydka daruurta, ama mar kale koobiyee asalka oo dib u fur. Gal-galka, BimCraft wuxuu tusaa kaydka ugu cusub ee dhammaystiran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… Liiska nuxurka faylka ayaa sidoo kale qaybta maqan ku jira, sidaas darteed waxba laga furi karo.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka waa la jaray hore intaa aan la helin xitaa liiska nuxurkiisa. Waxba laga soo kabsan karo nuqulkan. Asalka mar kale koobiyee oo dib u fur.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Faylkan BasicFileInfo stream ma leh, sidaas darteed ma aha fayl Revit.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku waa compound file nooc kale ah (dokumentiyada xafiisyada hore isla weelka ayay isticmaalaan). Hubi inaad doorateen faylka saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Weli waxaan ka shaqeynaa midka u dambeeyay…&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft weli wuu mashquulsan yahay faylka ama fayl-galka hore. Sug inta status line-ku dhammaado, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDoorsoomaha faylka wuxuu dhigayaa faylkayga mid aan la dooran karin.\u003C/strong\u003E Doorsoomuhu wuxuu bixiyaa kaliya \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rvt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rfa\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rte\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.rft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E. Faylasha kale ku jiid bogga, BimCraftna wuxuu kuu sheegi doonaa haddii uu akhrin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furista-fayl-galada\"\u003EFurista fayl-galada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Fayl-galkan waxa ku jira in ka badan 20,000 fayl. Dooro fayl-gal yar, sida mashruuc keliya.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Fayl-gal sare ayaa la doortay, sida darawalka oo dhan. Dooro mid mashruuc keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Browser-ku ma siin oggolaansho \u003Cem\u003Emagac\u003C/em\u003E. Mar kale dooro adigoo isticmaalaya Fur fayl-gal.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Gujisay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReopen\u003C/span\u003E fayl-gal dhowaan la isticmaalay, oggolaanshaha browser-ka waa la diiday ama wuu dhacay. Mar kale dooro fayl-galka ama ku jiid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu leeyahay wuxuu &quot;soo gudbin&quot; doonaa faylasha.\u003C/strong\u003E Taasi waa erayga browser-ka u gaar ah ee uu faylasha u wareejiyo bogga. BimCraft ma diro meel. Si aad uga fogaato su&#039;aasha, fayl-galka ku jiid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaleefan ama tablet-ka wax ma dhacaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Browser-ro badan oo mobile ah ma dooran karaan fayl-gallo. Fur faylal keliya, ama isticmaal kombiyuutar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-engine-ka-wuxuu-soo-socdaa-markii-ugu-horreysay\"\u003EIFC engine-ka wuxuu soo socdaa markii ugu horreysay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStatus line-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa &quot;Waxaa bilaabmaya IFC engine…&quot;, ama wuxuu muujinayaa khalad sida &quot;Failed to fetch&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E IFC engine-ka lama soo dejin karin. Waxaad ku jirtaa offline, ama firewall ama content blocker ayaa joojinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaad offline tahay. Haddii badhanka bar-ka app-ka aanu leeyn \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, IFC engine-ka waligiis lama kaydin browser-kan. Isku xidh mar kale, fur faylka mar kale, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E si uu xiligii soo socda offline-ka u shaqeeyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/online-offline\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/online-offline\"\u003EShaqada oonlaynka iyo offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u rar bogga oo mar kale isku day. Shabakadda shaqada, weydii kooxdaada IT inay ogolaadaan faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.wasm\u003C/code\u003E ee goobtan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-si-offline-loo-isticmaalo\"\u003EKaydinta si offline loo isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin, badanaa sababtoo ah xiriirku wuu go&#039;ay. Hubi xiriirkaaga oo mar kale guji badhanka. Nuqulka offline ee hore waa la hayaa ilaa mid cusub uu dhammaystiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Daaqaddan ma kaydin karto nuqul offline, tusaale ahaan daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutar shaqo oo la maamulo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanku wuxuu waqti ku sii jiraa &quot;Kaydinta \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E ee \u003Cem\u003Em\u003C/em\u003E&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Nuqulka BimCraft ku dhow yahay 11 MB, inta badan waa IFC engine-ka. Tab-ka u furan ilaa uu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBimCraft wuxuu offline ku furmay, laakiin wuxuu u eeg yahay mid hore u dhacay.\u003C/strong\u003E Nuqulkaaga kaydsan waa booqashadii hore. Markaad online tahay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelka meesha kuma jiro ee aad filaysay, ama wuu yar yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E. Fit wuxuu had iyo jeer ku wareegaa wax kasta oo moodelka ku jira, oo ay ku jiraan dabaqyada aad ka saartay iyo walxaha fogaanta ka ah dhismaha, sidaas darteed dhismuhu yar ayuu u muuqan karaa. Ka dibna ku weynee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGujinta ma dooranayso wax.\u003C/strong\u003E Gacanta si xasilloon ayaad uga hayn gujinta: jiidis yar ayaa wareega. Walxaha dabaqyada aan la calaamayn ma la dooran karo. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpaces\u003C/span\u003E la shiido, meelaha dhalaalaya ayaa la doortaa ka hor waxa ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdges\u003C/span\u003E wuu madhan yahay: &quot;Xuduudaha waa la damiyay moodelada aad u waaweyn&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Moodelku wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan 1.5 milyan oo saddex-geesood. Xuduudaha waa la daayay si xusuusta loo kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-ku wuu gaabiyaa, cad ama wuxuu muujinayaa bogga khalad ee browser-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Moodelku wuu weyn yahay xusuusta tab-ka browser-ku siiyo. Tabbada kale xir oo dib u rar. Soo dhoof IFC yar: hal dhis, hal qaybood ama dabaqyo yar. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/platforms\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/platforms\"\u003EBrowser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka 3D wuxuu ahaado madhan.\u003C/strong\u003E WebGL waa la damin karaa ama waa la xannibay. Dejinta browser-ka, shid hardware acceleration (ama graphics acceleration) oo browser-ka dib u bilow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatirka-ifc\"\u003ETafatirka IFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Isticmaal tiro.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Qiimuhu waa tiro. Qor tiro caadi ah oo aan unug lahayn, sida \u003Ccode\u003E2.4\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Isticmaal tiro oo dhan.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Qiimuhu waa tiro dhan ama integer. Ka saar meelaha tobanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Sifooyinka keliya ee qiime keliya leh ayaa la tafatiri karaa.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Liisaska, doorashooyinka iyo cabbirrada waa kuwo la akhriyi karo oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqadda browser-ka &quot;Save page&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Isbeddel aan la kaydin ma jiro, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu furaha u daayay browser-ka. Xir daaqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wax ma sameeyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxay shaqeysaa kaliya markaad isbeddello aan la kaydin haysid oo aadan goobta qoraalka ku qorin. Kaydin kadib, waxba ma jiro oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChanges\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu weli muujinayaa tafatirro kadib markaad iska tuurtay oo aad furtay qorshe ama fayl-gal.\u003C/strong\u003E Markaad jawaabta &quot;Ma tuurtaa?&quot; ku jawaabto OK kadibna aad fur wax aan ahayn moodel IFC, tafatirradii hore xusuusta ayay ku sii jiraan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as IFC\u003C/span\u003E ayaa mar kale kaydin doona. Si aad dhab ahaan u bilowdo, fur IFC-ga asalka ah mar kale, ama dib u rar bogga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETafatirkaygu wuxuu beddelay walxo ka badan kuwii aan dooray.\u003C/strong\u003E Waad beddeshay hanti ku jirta set-ka calaamadsan &quot;(nooc)&quot;. Hantida nooca waxay ku dhacdaa walxaha nooca oo dhan. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/type-vs-instance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/type-vs-instance\"\u003EBeddel hantida nooca walxaha nooc kasta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadaha\"\u003ENaqshadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagac\u003C/em\u003E lama akhrin karin. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu waxyeelo yeesho, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay nooc akhristuhu weli wax ka qabanayn (…).&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Naqshadda ka kaydi barnaamijkii samaysay sida DWG hore (2018 ama ka hor) ama sida DXF, kadibna mar kale isku day.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Naqshaddani waxba ma muujin karto.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagac\u003C/em\u003E waa naqshad madhan: ma hayso xarriiqyo, qoraal ama block.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Naqshaddu waa madhan tahay, ama waxay haysaa kaliya waxyaabo BimCraft weli aan sawirin (eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E midig).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Naqshaddani aad bay u weyn tahay; qayb kaliya ayaa la muujinayaa.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E BimCraft wuu joojiyay sawirka si uu u jawaabo. Dami dabaqyada aadan u baahnayn, ama fur xaashiyada aad u baahan tahay naqshad yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo ka mid ah xaashida ayaa maqan.\u003C/strong\u003E Naqshadaha la xidhiidha ayaa maqan yihiin: eeg \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaha la xidhiidha\u003C/strong\u003E midig. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-linked-files\"\u003EHel naqshadaha iyo sawirada la xidhiidha\u003C/a\u003E. Dabaqyada ayaa sidoo kale damin kara: guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAll on\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir wuxuu u muuqdaa frame madhan.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylkiisa lama helin, ama waa TIFF (&quot;TIFF lama muujin karo browser-ka&quot;). Ku dar nuqul PNG ama JPEG ah oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd pictures…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu-dhaqidda trackpad-kaaga wuxuu ku weynaysaa halkii uu naqshadda ku guurin lahaa.\u003C/strong\u003E Taasi waa sida naqshaddu ugu shaqeyso BimCraft. Gujii oo jiid si aad u guurto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-waad-ku-jirtaa-dhibaato\"\u003EWeli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAkhri \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E: wixii aad raadinayso waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan ku jirin dhismahan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fariimaha waxay ka muuqdaan status line-ka hoose ee stage-ka, oo cas markii wax fashilmay. Fariinta hoose raadi. Furista faylasha \"magac ma aha fayl IFC, RVT, RFA, DWG ama DXF.\" BimCraft ma aqoonin faylka. Hubi kordhinta iyo in faylku aanu madhnayn. Faylasha PDF, sawirrada iyo faylasha xafiisku ma furmaan. \".ifczip lama taageerin weli. Kaydi ama u dhoofi moodelka sida fayl .ifc caadi ah.\" (sidoo kale .ifcxml) Ka fur .ifczip (waa zip caadi ah oo ku jira .ifc) ama u dhoofi IFC caadi ah. \"… waa fayl mashruuc oo BimCraft weli aan akhrin.\" Fayl .pln, .pla, .tpl ama .bpn. Ka dhoofi IFC ama DWG oo ka fur: eeg Fur faylalka mashruucyada .pln iyo .pla. \"Faylkan IFC lama akhrin karin.\" Faylka IFC waa jabay ama dhab ahaan uma eka IFC. Ku fur tafatiraha qoraalka: fayl IFC dhab ah wuxuu ku bilaabmaa ISO-10303-21;. Mar kale u dhoofi. \"Faylkan dhammaystiran ma aha: waa … MB, laakiin tilmaamaha u taagan wuxuu u tilmaamaa xog ugu yaraan … MB gudaha. …\" Faylka mashruuca ama qoyska ayaa la jaray markii la koobiyeynayay, la soo gudbinayay ama la isku waafajinayay. Fayl ku jira kaydka daruurta oo \"oonlaynka keliya\" wuxuu u eeg yahay sidaas oo kale. Fayl la furo keligiis ayaa weli furmi doona, fariintan ayaa ku qoran madasha sare ee kaarka, iyo \"Waxaa lagu muujinayaa waxa la helay; mar kale koobiyee asalka si aad moodelka oo dhammaystiran u hesho.\": kaarku wuxuu muujinayaa kaliya qaybaha baytyadoodu oo dhan faylka ku jiraan, qaybaha kale waxaa hoos ka qoran Ma jiraan faylka. Faylka ka dhig mid laga heli karo offline kaydka daruurta, ama mar kale koobiyee asalka oo dib u fur. Gal-galka, BimCraft wuxuu tusaa kaydka ugu cusub ee dhammaystiran. \"… Liiska nuxurka faylka ayaa sidoo kale qaybta maqan ku jira, sidaas darteed waxba laga furi karo.\" Faylka waa la jaray hore intaa aan la helin xitaa liiska nuxurkiisa. Waxba laga soo kabsan karo nuqulkan. Asalka mar kale koobiyee oo dib u fur. \"Faylkan BasicFileInfo stream ma leh, sidaas darteed ma aha fayl Revit.\" Faylku waa compound file nooc kale ah (dokumentiyada xafiisyada hore isla weelka ayay isticmaalaan). Hubi inaad doorateen faylka saxda ah. \"Weli waxaan ka shaqeynaa midka u dambeeyay…\" BimCraft weli wuu mashquulsan yahay faylka ama fayl-galka hore. Sug inta status line-ku dhammaado, kadibna isku day mar kale. Doorsoomaha faylka wuxuu dhigayaa faylkayga mid aan la dooran karin. Doorsoomuhu wuxuu bixiyaa kaliya .ifc, .rvt, .rfa, .rte, .rft, .dwg iyo .dxf. Faylasha kale ku jiid bogga, BimCraftna wuxuu kuu sheegi doonaa haddii uu akhrin karo. Furista fayl-galada \"Fayl-galkan waxa ku jira in ka badan 20,000 fayl. Dooro fayl-gal yar, sida mashruuc keliya.\" Fayl-gal sare ayaa la doortay, sida darawalka oo dhan. Dooro mid mashruuc keliya. \"Browser-ku ma siin oggolaansho magac. Mar kale dooro adigoo isticmaalaya Fur fayl-gal.\" Gujisay Reopen fayl-gal dhowaan la isticmaalay, oggolaanshaha browser-ka waa la diiday ama wuu dhacay. Mar kale dooro fayl-galka ama ku jiid. Browser-ku wuxuu leeyahay wuxuu \"soo gudbin\" doonaa faylasha. Taasi waa erayga browser-ka u gaar ah ee uu faylasha u wareejiyo bogga. BimCraft ma diro meel. Si aad uga fogaato su'aasha, fayl-galka ku jiid. Taleefan ama tablet-ka wax ma dhacaan. Browser-ro badan oo mobile ah ma dooran karaan fayl-gallo. Fur faylal keliya, ama isticmaal kombiyuutar. IFC engine-ka wuxuu soo socdaa markii ugu horreysay Status line-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa \"Waxaa bilaabmaya IFC engine…\", ama wuxuu muujinayaa khalad sida \"Failed to fetch\". IFC engine-ka lama soo dejin karin. Waxaad ku jirtaa offline, ama firewall ama content blocker ayaa joojinaya. Waad offline tahay. Haddii badhanka bar-ka app-ka aanu leeyn Offline ready, IFC engine-ka waligiis lama kaydin browser-kan. Isku xidh mar kale, fur faylka mar kale, kadibna guji Save for offline si uu xiligii soo socda offline-ka u shaqeeyo. Eeg Shaqada oonlaynka iyo offline. Dib u rar bogga oo mar kale isku day. Shabakadda shaqada, weydii kooxdaada IT inay ogolaadaan faylasha .wasm ee goobtan. Kaydinta si offline loo isticmaalo Badhanku wuxuu leeyahay Could not save. Qaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin, badanaa sababtoo ah xiriirku wuu go'ay. Hubi xiriirkaaga oo mar kale guji badhanka. Nuqulka offline ee hore waa la hayaa ilaa mid cusub uu dhammaystiro. Badhanku wuxuu leeyahay Offline not available. Daaqaddan ma kaydin karto nuqul offline, tusaale ahaan daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutar shaqo oo la maamulo. Eeg Shaqada offline. Badhanku wuxuu waqti ku sii jiraa \"Kaydinta n ee m\". Nuqulka BimCraft ku dhow yahay 11 MB, inta badan waa IFC engine-ka. Tab-ka u furan ilaa uu leeyahay Offline ready. BimCraft wuxuu offline ku furmay, laakiin wuxuu u eeg yahay mid hore u dhacay. Nuqulkaaga kaydsan waa booqashadii hore. Markaad online tahay, guji Offline ready oo dooro Save again (get the newest version). Muuqaalka 3D Moodelka meesha kuma jiro ee aad filaysay, ama wuu yar yahay. Riix F ama guji Fit. Fit wuxuu had iyo jeer ku wareegaa wax kasta oo moodelka ku jira, oo ay ku jiraan dabaqyada aad ka saartay iyo walxaha fogaanta ka ah dhismaha, sidaas darteed dhismuhu yar ayuu u muuqan karaa. Ka dibna ku weynee. Gujinta ma dooranayso wax. Gacanta si xasilloon ayaad uga hayn gujinta: jiidis yar ayaa wareega. Walxaha dabaqyada aan la calaamayn ma la dooran karo. Marka Spaces la shiido, meelaha dhalaalaya ayaa la doortaa ka hor waxa ku jira. Badhanka Edges wuu madhan yahay: \"Xuduudaha waa la damiyay moodelada aad u waaweyn\". Moodelku wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan 1.5 milyan oo saddex-geesood. Xuduudaha waa la daayay si xusuusta loo kaydiyo. Tab-ku wuu gaabiyaa, cad ama wuxuu muujinayaa bogga khalad ee browser-ka. Moodelku wuu weyn yahay xusuusta tab-ka browser-ku siiyo. Tabbada kale xir oo dib u rar. Soo dhoof IFC yar: hal dhis, hal qaybood ama dabaqyo yar. Eeg Browser-yada, qalabka iyo xusuusta. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu ahaado madhan. WebGL waa la damin karaa ama waa la xannibay. Dejinta browser-ka, shid hardware acceleration (ama graphics acceleration) oo browser-ka dib u bilow. Tafatirka IFC \"Isticmaal tiro.\" Qiimuhu waa tiro. Qor tiro caadi ah oo aan unug lahayn, sida 2.4. \"Isticmaal tiro oo dhan.\" Qiimuhu waa tiro dhan ama integer. Ka saar meelaha tobanka. \"Sifooyinka keliya ee qiime keliya leh ayaa la tafatiri karaa.\" Liisaska, doorashooyinka iyo cabbirrada waa kuwo la akhriyi karo oo keliya. Ctrl+S wuxuu furaa daaqadda browser-ka \"Save page\". Isbeddel aan la kaydin ma jiro, sidaas darteed BimCraft wuxuu furaha u daayay browser-ka. Xir daaqadda. Ctrl+Z wax ma sameeyo. Waxay shaqeysaa kaliya markaad isbeddello aan la kaydin haysid oo aadan goobta qoraalka ku qorin. Kaydin kadib, waxba ma jiro oo dib loo celin karo. Liiska Changes wuxuu weli muujinayaa tafatirro kadib markaad iska tuurtay oo aad furtay qorshe ama fayl-gal. Markaad jawaabta \"Ma tuurtaa?\" ku jawaabto OK kadibna aad fur wax aan ahayn moodel IFC, tafatirradii hore xusuusta ayay ku sii jiraan, Save as IFC ayaa mar kale kaydin doona. Si aad dhab ahaan u bilowdo, fur IFC-ga asalka ah mar kale, ama dib u rar bogga. Tafatirkaygu wuxuu beddelay walxo ka badan kuwii aan dooray. Waad beddeshay hanti ku jirta set-ka calaamadsan \"(nooc)\". Hantida nooca waxay ku dhacdaa walxaha nooca oo dhan. Guji Undo. Eeg Beddel hantida nooca walxaha nooc kasta. Naqshadaha \"magac lama akhrin karin. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu waxyeelo yeesho, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay nooc akhristuhu weli wax ka qabanayn (…).\" Naqshadda ka kaydi barnaamijkii samaysay sida DWG hore (2018 ama ka hor) ama sida DXF, kadibna mar kale isku day. \"Naqshaddani waxba ma muujin karto.\" ama \"magac waa naqshad madhan: ma hayso xarriiqyo, qoraal ama block.\" Naqshaddu waa madhan tahay, ama waxay haysaa kaliya waxyaabo BimCraft weli aan sawirin (eeg Weli lama sawirin midig). \"Naqshaddani aad bay u weyn tahay; qayb kaliya ayaa la muujinayaa.\" BimCraft wuu joojiyay sawirka si uu u jawaabo. Dami dabaqyada aadan u baahnayn, ama fur xaashiyada aad u baahan tahay naqshad yar. Qaybo ka mid ah xaashida ayaa maqan. Naqshadaha la xidhiidha ayaa maqan yihiin: eeg Naqshadaha la xidhiidha midig. Eeg Hel naqshadaha iyo sawirada la xidhiidha. Dabaqyada ayaa sidoo kale damin kara: guji All on. Sawir wuxuu u muuqdaa frame madhan. Faylkiisa lama helin, ama waa TIFF (\"TIFF lama muujin karo browser-ka\"). Ku dar nuqul PNG ama JPEG ah oo leh Add pictures…. Ku-dhaqidda trackpad-kaaga wuxuu ku weynaysaa halkii uu naqshadda ku guurin lahaa. Taasi waa sida naqshaddu ugu shaqeyso BimCraft. Gujii oo jiid si aad u guurto. Weli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato Akhri Waxa aan weli la dhisin: wixii aad raadinayso waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan ku jirin dhismahan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"bimcraft","title":"Waxa weli aan la dhisin","summary":"Waxa dhismahan BimCraft weli aan samayn, iyo waxa maanta loo isticmaalo halkiisa.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["maqan","xaddidaad","aan la taageerin","waddo","naqshadda","sawir","cabbir","isku-dhac","bcf","daruur","desktop","dhoofin"],"headings":[{"id":"naqshadda-iyo-sawirka","text":"Naqshadda iyo sawirka","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-moodelka","text":"Muuqaalka moodelka","level":2},{"id":"sawirada","text":"Sawirada","level":2},{"id":"faylalka-iyo-nidaamyada","text":"Faylalka iyo nidaamyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft maanta waa akhriye, hubiye iyo tafatire xog IFC ah, oo bilaabay inuu sawiro dhismayaasha: darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha, qolalka, sagxadaha, saqaf hoosaha iyo saqafyada (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDarbiyada sawir\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/doors-and-windows\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/doors-and-windows\"\u003EAlbaabyada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/floors-and-roofs\"\u003EQolalka, sagxadaha, saqafyada\u003C/a\u003E). Kani waa liiska run ee waxa aanu weli samayn, iyo waxa halkiisa lagu sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadda-iyo-sawirka\"\u003ENaqshadda iyo sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli ma diyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaanta, halkii\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka biimaha; tiirarka qaybaha birta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal barnaamijka naqshadda, kadibna halkan fur dhoofinta IFC-kiisa. Tiirarka afar-geesle iyo kuwa wareegsan ayaa halkan la dhigaa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/grids-and-columns\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/grids-and-columns\"\u003EShabakadaha iyo tiirarka\u003C/a\u003E); jaranjarooyinka toosan, L, U, duub-duub iyo spiral-ka iyo gacan-qabsiyada ayaa halkan la sawiraa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/stairs-and-railings\"\u003EJaranjarooyinka iyo gacan-qabsiyada\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad ku taal hore ee saqaf-daaqad; saqaf-daaqadaha diyaaradda saqafka oo gacanta lagu sawiro; saqafyo goobo ah; daboolka saqafka ee la rendar-gareeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaaradaha saqafka oo lagu sawiro geeskooda, iyo saamaynta (pitch) darbi kasta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/roofs\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/roofs\"\u003ESaqafyada: saamaynta darbi kasta, gable-yada, sheds iyo diyaaradaha saqafka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyada, albaabyada ama daaqadaha ay samaysay barnaamij kale wax ka beddelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka naqshaddaada; qalabyada sawirka waxay beddelaan kaliya waxa ay sawireen\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfiilada darbiga oo leh dhamaadyo dhaadhicsan ama godad; furitaanada darbiga oo aan afar-geesle ahayn; ku darista ama ka saarista barta profiilka darbiga muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfile, ku xidh, janjeer iyo furitaanada waxay ku shaqeeyaan Sifooyinka, muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, wejiga darbiga iyo gacan-qabsiyada 3D, darbiyada toosan iyo kuwa wareegsan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-shape\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-shape\"\u003EQaabee darbi: ku xidh, profile, janjeer iyo furitaan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyada wareegsan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar / kordhi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeeska\u003C/span\u003E, qaabeynta, qiyaasaha dhismaha ee toosan, raacista qaybta wareegga (wuxuu raacaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexda qaanso)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiga toosan ku sawir kuwaas, ama isticmaal qaybo toosan: darbiyada wareegsan waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\"\u003EDarbiyada sawir\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalax maktabad oo la dhigay oo muuqaalka 3D lagu jiido\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu jiid qorshaha, ama ku qor X, Y iyo Rotation \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhigidda geedaha oo ka yimid maktabadda geedaha ee CivilCraft&#039;s Landscape workspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu beer CivilCraft, ama dhig geedo iyo dhir maktabadda entourage-ka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdd-on-ka Plant (wuu damaa ilaa aad daaqsho): sawirka tuubo ku socota moodel gudihiisa, lambarrada spool-ka isometrics-kiisa, hubinta habaynta qalabka laga soo qaatay maktabadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubada ku sawir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada\u003C/a\u003E); hubinta habaynta waxay akhrisaa miiska qalabka add-on-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeexinta, muraayad-geynta ama array-geynta darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee gaar ah (darbiyada waxa la guuri karaa, la koobiyeyn karaa, la offset-gareeyn karaa, ama la dheer-gareeyn karaa Box stretch: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka\u003C/a\u003E); nooc isku-xidhka (butt, square off) geesaha darbiga wareegsan ama saddex darbi ama ka badan (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka\u003C/a\u003E); qalab Text; darbiyada daahan (curtain walls)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee wax walba heerka ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee heerkan…\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/draw-walls#levels\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/draw-walls\" data-hash=\"levels\"\u003EDarbiyada sawir\u003C/a\u003E); haddii kale mar kale sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada habaynta darbiga ee lagu sawiro qorshaha iyo goynta; cabbirka goyn iyo muuqaalka dhinaca; tixraac cabbirro albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qaybaha kale; habayno iyo membrane-yada miisaska iyo tirooyinka; maktabad agab la wadaago mashruuco; mudnaanta lakabka goynta, muuqaalka dhinaca, 3D iyo nodes-ka saddex darbi ama ka badan (qorshaha, geeska, isku-xidhka T iyo isku-gudubka laba darbi waxa nadiifiya mudnaanta lakabka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-tools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-tools\"\u003EQaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka\u003C/a\u003E); lakabyada la duubay ama kala duwan; wax ka beddelka habayn darbi ay samaysay barnaamij kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada waxa ku jira nooca darbiga iyo hortiisa (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabaynta darbiga…\u003C/span\u003E); darbiyada waxa lagu cabbiraa hal qolof: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/wall-assemblies\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/wall-assemblies\"\u003EHabaynta darbiga iyo tixraaca cabbirrada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelka qaabka ama cabbirka walax (marka laga reebo darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha halkan lagu sawiro, iyo walxaha laga dhigay qoys)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka naqshaddaada. Tirtir, koobiyee, gooy iyo dhaji halkan way shaqeeyaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-elements\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-elements\"\u003ETirtir, gooy, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtirka dabaqyada, meelaha, dhismayaasha ama goobta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir walxaha ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhajinta walxaha dhismaha moodel kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee oo dhaji moodel gudihiisa; walxaha maktabadda la dhigay waxay dhajin karaan moodel kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darista sifooyin cusub ama kooxo sifooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu buuxi qiyamka jira halkan, ama ku dar parameter-ka barnaamijka naqshaddaada oo mar kale dhoofi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddelka tirooyinka, liisaska, tirinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka naqshaddaada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKeydinta mashruuc faylal barnaamijyo kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft wuxuu keydiyaa IFC (iyo faylalka qoyskiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoysaska: maktabad qoysaska oo laga dhigo qorshaha oo la wadaago mashruucyada (Library), hotspot la jiido muuqaalka 3D ee walax la dhigay (way jiidaan muuqaalka hore ee tafatiraha qoyska iyo qorshaha), heerarka faahfaahinta ee muuqaal kasta lagu doorto (hal heer oo mashruuca), revolve diyaarad toosan gudaha qoys kale oo la rogay rubuc, iyo calaamadaha qorshaha albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee gaarka ah (waxay sawiraan kuwa bilowga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoysaska leh parameter-ro la qoray, formulas, calaamad qorshe gaar ah, hotspots, ku celinta, heerarka faahfaahinta, qoysaska gudaha qoysaska, cabbirro miis ka yimid iyo parameter-ro walxood gaar ah halkan ayaa la sameeyaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/family-editor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/family-editor\"\u003EWax ka beddel qoys\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/families\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/families\"\u003EQoysaska iyo cabbirradooda\u003C/a\u003E. Qoys nuqul ka samee si aad ugu bilowdo mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddelka noocyada barnaamijyada kale ee qoysaska; beddelka alaabta maktabadda qoys\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada barnaamijyada kale waa la liistaa, waa la kooxeeyaa qiyaas ahaan, walxahooda waa la doortaa. Alaabta maktabadda waa la dhigaa sida ay tahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaabta soo saaraha, valve-yada iyo qalabka (awoodaha, miisaska, cabbirrada xidhiidhka soo saaraha); cabbirrada tee iyo reducer ee ASME B16.9 ee spool-yada birta; luminta cadaadiska ee fittings-ka, socodka iyo isu-dheelitirka; sprinklers; cable trays; isku-dhegga dhuumaha iyo godadka sida unugyada fixture; jiidista geesaha tuubada; ka gooyida godadka darbiyada iyo sagxadaha; sii deynta dhamaadka tuubada oo ku xidhan port (marka laga reebo tirtirka qalabka); ports-ka alaabta maktabadda ee laga dhigay panelka Library; miisaska fittings; kala-duwanaanshaha duct-yada, qiyaasaha iyo connectors-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada oo leh fittings-ka caadiga ah, nidaamyada, qorshayaasha, miisaska iyo takeoff-ka halkan ayaa la sawiraa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipes-and-ducts\"\u003ETuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada\u003C/a\u003E. Qalabka guud ee leh ports, tuubooyinka xidhan iyo hubinta Connections: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-equipment\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-equipment\"\u003EQalabka MEP ee leh ports\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-connections\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-connections\"\u003EKu xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka\u003C/a\u003E. Set-yada isku-dhaca, masaafooyinka iyo liiska godadka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka\u003C/a\u003E. Spool-yada birta iyo sheetyada, liiska jarka duct-ka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pipe-spools\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pipe-spools\"\u003ESpool-yada tuubada birta iyo sheetyada spool-ka\u003C/a\u003E. Alaabta soo saaraha ka soo geli barnaamijkaaga MEP oo IFC ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubinta naqshadda ee I-shapes-ka la alxaamay, I-shapes-ka IFC profile-kooda aan loo magacin sida W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB oo la rogay, iyo tuubooyinka, angles-ka iyo channels-ka (way soo laabtaan aan la hubin); buckling ama jawaabta dynamic (natural frequencies waxay ku jiraan Finite elements block) (second order waa P-Delta oo keliya: elastic, flexural, aan la yareyn stiffness); darbiyada iyo sagxadaha falanqaynta; culeysyada laga sameeyo meelo (marka laga reebo hal cadaadis oo ku yaal sagxad kasta oo kulul)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqayn\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa xoogagga, reactions-ka iyo deflections-ka beams, tiirarka iyo braces-ka adigoo isticmaalaya falanqayn heer-kowaad, wuxuuna hubiyaa I-shapes-ka la rogay, caawimaad ilaa injineer uu dib u eego: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/frame-analysis#design-checks\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/frame-analysis\" data-hash=\"design-checks\"\u003EFalanqee qaabka qaabka ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-moodelka\"\u003EMuuqaalka moodelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli ma diyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaanta, halkii\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3D oo ka yimid faylalka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi IFC oo fur. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/rvt-to-ifc\"\u003EHel faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC-da\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada gudaha ee qorshaha sawirka la sameeyay (waa la dhisaa marka laga soo qaado qolka Properties iyo xaashiyadaada); cabbirradaada muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynta (calaamadaha heerka, dherer, ballaca iyo calaamadaha albaabka/daaqadda waa la sawiraa; faallooyinka waxay ku qoran yihiin muuqaalka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/edit-in-elevations\"\u003EWax ka beddel muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynta\u003C/a\u003E); darbi sawirka muuqaalka dhinaca (waxa la sawiraa diyaarada goynta); sigaarrada habaynta ee Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshaha sawirka ee moodelka laga sameeyay: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/sheets\"\u003EMuuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E. Moodel kasta oo IFC ah: hal diyaarad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E, ama sanduuq goyn; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/section-plane\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/section-plane\"\u003EGoo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada soo-wicitaanka, muuqaalada faahfaahinta, muuqaalada sawirka iyo legends; sawirada sawirka; goynta muuqaalka dhinaca; template-yada muuqaalka dhinaca, goynta, qorshaha saqafka iyo 3D; qorshayaasha saqafka ee qorshaha sawirka la sameeyay; xaashiyo gaar ah oo PDF hal mar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshayaasha iyo qorshayaasha saqafka waxay leeyihiin ranges-ka muuqaalka, goob jarid, cabbir iyo underlay (qorshayaashu sidoo kale templates), xaashiyadaada waxay qaataan qorshayaasha, qorshayaasha saqafka, muuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo liisaska, mid kastaa PDF ahaan kaydsan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/views-and-sheets\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/views-and-sheets\"\u003EMuuqaalada, ranges-ka muuqaalka iyo xaashiyadaada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka ee laga soo qaatay sawirka mar dambe; saqaf dhaadhicsan ama tallaabo; qaabab saqaf oo aan ahayn shanta gridka; astaanta iftiinka ee gaarka u ah qorshaha saqafka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cstrong\u003EMount: At the ceiling\u003C/strong\u003E; qorshaha saqafka wuxuu sawiraa qaab-dhismeedka iftiinka isaga: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/place-from-library\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/place-from-library\"\u003EDhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadaagista liisaska raadinta dadka kale, sidoo kale seto gudaha faylka IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESet-yadu waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/find\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/find\"\u003EHel walxaha fasalka, magaca ama sifada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbiridda xagallo, ama dhinac dhowr barood ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir qayb kastaa adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/measure\"\u003ECabbir masaafooyinka, qaybaha iyo meelaha 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETextures ee muuqaalka 3D ee tooska ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabka la rangeeyay midabkooda ayay muujiyaan muuqaalka, texture-kooda sawirada la rendar-gareeyay: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhac jilicsan (soft) oo u dhexeeya laba set, kooxda isku-dhaca, kaydinta natiijooyinka isku-dhaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu shaqee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubinta isku-dhaca\u003C/span\u003E oo ka dhig dhibaatooyinka muhiimka ah: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/clash-check\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/clash-check\"\u003EHubi isku-dhacyada\u003C/a\u003E. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee qaabka ah waxay leeyihiin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi masaafooyinka\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/mep-against-structure\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/mep-against-structure\"\u003EHubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta moodeello dhowr hal set ahaan, ama tafatirka laba moodel mar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir hal moodel mar; mid kastaa faylkiisa ayuu kaydiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagacyada issues-ka, taariikhaha dhammaadka, calaamadaha, viewpoints dhowr issue kasta, tafatirka issue\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal muuqaal issue kasta; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/issues-bcf\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/issues-bcf\"\u003EIssues iyo faylalka BCF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifczip\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.ifcxml\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa fur ama dhoofi \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E caadi ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMap layers ee moodel aan lahayn map conversion, ama muuqaalada sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi moodelka isagoo leh coordinates-kiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/map-layers\"\u003EMap ku yaal dhulka hoostiisa moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScan-yada E57 ka badan 6 milyan oo dhibcood ama 512 MB; faylalka scanner-ka makers-kiisa (RCP, RCS, FLS, LGS, TZF, ZFS); daruurta barta ee muuqaalka 3D ee sawirka; keydinta meesha daruurta moodelka la socota\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi scan-ka sida LAS ama LAZ oo ku fur moodel IFC ah: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-cloud-formats\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-cloud-formats\"\u003EQaababka daruurta barta\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EMuuji daruurta barta dhinaca moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiiwaanka scan-yada: helida bartilmaameedyada (duufaanno, shaxanno) scan-ka gudihiisa, xalinta dhammaan scan-yada wada (bundle adjustment), scale, diiwaan-gelinta moodel ka dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhibcaha isku mid ah ama geli isku-xidhka bartilmaameedka, kadibna hal scan mar hagaaji adigoo isticmaalaya ICP: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/register-scans\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/register-scans\"\u003EDiiwaan-geli dhowr scan hal mid\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurista faylalka mashruuca \u003Ccode\u003E.pln\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pla\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.tpl\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.bpn\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi IFC iyo DWG ka dhig, ama bundle mashruuc: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/pln-project-files\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/pln-project-files\"\u003EFur faylalka mashruuca .pln iyo .pla\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/open-project-bundle\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/open-project-bundle\"\u003EFur bundle mashruuc\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurista liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWalxaha\u003C/span\u003E si aad u doorato fasal ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji kooxda nooca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeedka moodelka\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-tree\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-tree\"\u003EJid u hel geedka moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorista faallo ama cinwaan issue ah VR-ka, qoraallada cod, dhaqaajinta diyaarada goynta gacanta VR-ka, sanduuq goyn VR-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig issue VR-ka, kadibna ku dar erayadiisa tab-ka Issues; deji diyaarad goyn ama sanduuq muuqaalka 3D ka hor intaadan gelin: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/vr-review\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/vr-review\"\u003EDib u eeg moodelka headset VR-ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArkida dadka miiska VR-ka (kaliya dadka VR-ka ku jira ayaa muuqda), duubista socodka VR-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeydii inay ku biiraan VR-ka, ama raac muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka maalinta (climate-based daylight, glare, saacadaha qorraxda), daaqadaha saqafka daylight factor-ka, hubinta BS EN 17037 ama qorshooyinka dhismaha cagaaran; habka tamarta ISO 52016-1, lafaynta tamarta saacadlaha, mass-ka kulaylka iyo xidhka, faylalka cimilada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka naqshadda: daylight factor-ka celceliska ah, sidaad VS (vertical sky component) ee daaqad kasta, qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah iyo daylight factor-ka grid-ka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/daylight-factor\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/daylight-factor\"\u003EQiyaas iftiinka maalinta qol kasta\u003C/a\u003E); lumitaanka kulaylka, sanad degree-day ah iyo qulqulka qabowga qol kasta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/heating-and-cooling-loads\"\u003EQiyaas kulaylka iyo qaboobaha\u003C/a\u003E). Isticmaal barnaamij lafaynta si aad u hubiso waafaqsanaanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETwin dhismo oo martiqaad ah: akhrinta la kaydiyo iyo digniinaha iimaylka la diro markii BimCraft la xirto, iimaylada waqtiga dayactirka; MQTT 5; dib u akhrinta shaqooyinka COBie\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhrinta CSV-ga ama toos broker-kaaga ama cinwaankaaga markii moodelku furan yahay, xadka calaamadinaya hantida, dokumentiyada, COBie ka soo dhoofinta iyo gelinta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/assets-and-maintenance\"\u003EHay xogta hantida iyo diiwaanka dayactirka moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlug-in ama xidhiidh toos ah oo Enscape, Twinmotion ama barnaamijyada kale ee muuqaalka; faylalka FBX ama Datasmith; hal walax hal walax, muuqaalada iyo socodyada la kaydiyay ee .glb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi .glb barnaamijyada rendarka ee akhria glTF, faylka USD (hal walax hal walax, oo leh xogtiisa IFC: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi moodelka USD ahaan\u003C/a\u003E), ama IFC kuwa ku shaqeeya barnaamij naqshadeed kale: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/model-for-rendering\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/model-for-rendering\"\u003EU dir moodelka barnaamijka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EFur muuqaalka barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamij kale oo sawiraya sawirka Render iyada oo aan add-on engine ah (CadCraft waligiis ma shaqeeyo barnaamij raacaya GNU GPL licence); kamaradaha panorama ama stereo iyo sawir sama barnaamij kale; plug-in-ka Unreal Engine (faylalka waa la qoraa, plug-in-ka furaya lama sii daayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEngine-keenna Fast iyo Path tracer; engine-ka add-on-ka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render-other-program\"\u003Esawirka barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E); faylka USD, glTF ama Unreal ee liiska Engine si aad ugu qaaddo barnaamij kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka nool: beerista dhirta iyo dhagaxyada, la wadaagida panorama-yada, socod, muuqaal offline ah ama fiidiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft-ka muuqaalka nool ayaa leh; halkan, sawirada la rendar-gareeyay iyo panorama 360°: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/live-view\"\u003EMuuqaalka nool\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/render\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir moodelka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada\"\u003ESawirada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli ma diyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaanta, halkii\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddelka, cabbirka ama kaydinta DWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka sawirka CadCraft (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel CadCraft\u003C/span\u003E muuqaalka 2D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaabacaadda ama dhoofinta PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa daabac barnaamijka sawirka abuuray; marka hore hubi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka qalinka iyo miisaska qalinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAragtida daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa madow caadi ah oo leh miisaska khadadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalka DWG ka hor R13, iyo DXF binary (BimCraft wuu sheegaa markaad furto mid)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka dib ugu kaydi DWG cusub, ama ASCII DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada lagu xiray gudaha sawirada xiran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi toos ah u fur\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada TIFF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi nuqul PNG ama JPEG ah oo magac isku mid ah ku dar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada DGN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku liisan tahay warbixinnada galalka oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayada ku qoran \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama sawirin\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka ka eeg barnaamijka abuuray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESolids-ka ACIS, bodies, regions iyo surfaces, iyo meshes-ka subdivision ee 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dhoofi IFC ama 3D faces barnaamijka abuuray sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirada, multileaders iyo xaashiyada muuqaalka 3D ee sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa eeg tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E iyo xaashiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorashada shayada muuqaalka 2D ee sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu beddel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E oo halkaas guji shayga: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\" data-topic=\"bimcraft/dwg-in-3d\"\u003EArag sawirka DWG ama DXF 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiisaska qalabka laga soo qaatay sawirada aan lahayn tags-ka \u003Ccode\u003EKCL-ITEM\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiiska qalabka oo ah XLSX ama PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E oo ku fur spreadsheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalka-iyo-nidaamyada\"\u003EFaylalka iyo nidaamyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli ma diyaar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaanta, halkii\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqullada ku kaydi kombiyuutarkaaga ama server-ka xafiiska. Kaydinta cloud-ka weli ma diyaar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXusuusta galalka Firefox iyo Safari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGalka mar kale dooro, ama jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u soo celinta ka dib kaydinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka asalka ah mar kale fur si aad dib u bilowdo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamaystirka qaybta laga jarey faylka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale nuqulka asalka ah koobiyee; galka gudihiisa, BimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa backup-ka ugu dambeeyay ee dhammaystiran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u furista faylalka aad furan u haysay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddelada aan la kaydin waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa &quot;Ma soo celiyaa shaqadaada?&quot; markaad soo noqoto; faylalka mar kale ka fur liiska ugu dambeeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"BimCraft maanta waa akhriye, hubiye iyo tafatire xog IFC ah, oo bilaabay inuu sawiro dhismayaasha: darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha, qolalka, sagxadaha, saqaf hoosaha iyo saqafyada (eeg Darbiyada sawir, Albaabyada iyo daaqadaha iyo Qolalka, sagxadaha, saqafyada). Kani waa liiska run ee waxa aanu weli samayn, iyo waxa halkiisa lagu sameeyo. Naqshadda iyo sawirka Weli ma diyaar Maanta, halkii Sawirka biimaha; tiirarka qaybaha birta Isticmaal barnaamijka naqshadda, kadibna halkan fur dhoofinta IFC-kiisa. Tiirarka afar-geesle iyo kuwa wareegsan ayaa halkan la dhigaa (eeg Shabakadaha iyo tiirarka); jaranjarooyinka toosan, L, U, duub-duub iyo spiral-ka iyo gacan-qabsiyada ayaa halkan la sawiraa (eeg Jaranjarooyinka iyo gacan-qabsiyada) Daaqad ku taal hore ee saqaf-daaqad; saqaf-daaqadaha diyaaradda saqafka oo gacanta lagu sawiro; saqafyo goobo ah; daboolka saqafka ee la rendar-gareeyay Diyaaradaha saqafka oo lagu sawiro geeskooda, iyo saamaynta (pitch) darbi kasta: eeg Saqafyada: saamaynta darbi kasta, gable-yada, sheds iyo diyaaradaha saqafka Darbiyada, albaabyada ama daaqadaha ay samaysay barnaamij kale wax ka beddelka Barnaamijka naqshaddaada; qalabyada sawirka waxay beddelaan kaliya waxa ay sawireen Profiilada darbiga oo leh dhamaadyo dhaadhicsan ama godad; furitaanada darbiga oo aan afar-geesle ahayn; ku darista ama ka saarista barta profiilka darbiga muuqaalka 3D Profile, ku xidh, janjeer iyo furitaanada waxay ku shaqeeyaan Sifooyinka, muuqaalka dhinaca iyo goynta, wejiga darbiga iyo gacan-qabsiyada 3D, darbiyada toosan iyo kuwa wareegsan: eeg Qaabee darbi: ku xidh, profile, janjeer iyo furitaan Darbiyada wareegsan: Jar / kordhi iyo Geeska, qaabeynta, qiyaasaha dhismaha ee toosan, raacista qaybta wareegga (wuxuu raacaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexda qaanso) Darbiga toosan ku sawir kuwaas, ama isticmaal qaybo toosan: darbiyada wareegsan waxay ku jiraan Darbiyada sawir Walax maktabad oo la dhigay oo muuqaalka 3D lagu jiido Ku jiid qorshaha, ama ku qor X, Y iyo Rotation Sifooyinka: eeg Dhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda Dhigidda geedaha oo ka yimid maktabadda geedaha ee CivilCraft's Landscape workspace Ku beer CivilCraft, ama dhig geedo iyo dhir maktabadda entourage-ka: eeg Dhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda Add-on-ka Plant (wuu damaa ilaa aad daaqsho): sawirka tuubo ku socota moodel gudihiisa, lambarrada spool-ka isometrics-kiisa, hubinta habaynta qalabka laga soo qaatay maktabadda Tuubada ku sawir Tuubo (eeg Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada); hubinta habaynta waxay akhrisaa miiska qalabka add-on-ka Leexinta, muraayad-geynta ama array-geynta darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee gaar ah (darbiyada waxa la guuri karaa, la koobiyeyn karaa, la offset-gareeyn karaa, ama la dheer-gareeyn karaa Box stretch: eeg Qaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka); nooc isku-xidhka (butt, square off) geesaha darbiga wareegsan ama saddex darbi ama ka badan (eeg Qaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka); qalab Text; darbiyada daahan (curtain walls) Koobiyee wax walba heerka ku jira Koobiyee heerkan… (eeg Darbiyada sawir); haddii kale mar kale sawir Lakabyada habaynta darbiga ee lagu sawiro qorshaha iyo goynta; cabbirka goyn iyo muuqaalka dhinaca; tixraac cabbirro albaabyada, daaqadaha iyo qaybaha kale; habayno iyo membrane-yada miisaska iyo tirooyinka; maktabad agab la wadaago mashruuco; mudnaanta lakabka goynta, muuqaalka dhinaca, 3D iyo nodes-ka saddex darbi ama ka badan (qorshaha, geeska, isku-xidhka T iyo isku-gudubka laba darbi waxa nadiifiya mudnaanta lakabka: eeg Qaabka darbiga, kala-jarista, offset, dheer-gareenta iyo xidhka); lakabyada la duubay ama kala duwan; wax ka beddelka habayn darbi ay samaysay barnaamij kale Lakabyada waxa ku jira nooca darbiga iyo hortiisa (Habaynta darbiga…); darbiyada waxa lagu cabbiraa hal qolof: eeg Habaynta darbiga iyo tixraaca cabbirrada Beddelka qaabka ama cabbirka walax (marka laga reebo darbiyada, albaabyada iyo daaqadaha halkan lagu sawiro, iyo walxaha laga dhigay qoys) Barnaamijka naqshaddaada. Tirtir, koobiyee, gooy iyo dhaji halkan way shaqeeyaan: eeg Tirtir, gooy, koobiyee iyo dhaji walxaha dhismaha Tirtirka dabaqyada, meelaha, dhismayaasha ama goobta Tirtir walxaha ku jira Dhajinta walxaha dhismaha moodel kale Koobiyee oo dhaji moodel gudihiisa; walxaha maktabadda la dhigay waxay dhajin karaan moodel kasta Ku darista sifooyin cusub ama kooxo sifooyin Ku buuxi qiyamka jira halkan, ama ku dar parameter-ka barnaamijka naqshaddaada oo mar kale dhoofi Wax ka beddelka tirooyinka, liisaska, tirinta Barnaamijka naqshaddaada Keydinta mashruuc faylal barnaamijyo kale BimCraft wuxuu keydiyaa IFC (iyo faylalka qoyskiisa: eeg Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda) Qoysaska: maktabad qoysaska oo laga dhigo qorshaha oo la wadaago mashruucyada (Library), hotspot la jiido muuqaalka 3D ee walax la dhigay (way jiidaan muuqaalka hore ee tafatiraha qoyska iyo qorshaha), heerarka faahfaahinta ee muuqaal kasta lagu doorto (hal heer oo mashruuca), revolve diyaarad toosan gudaha qoys kale oo la rogay rubuc, iyo calaamadaha qorshaha albaabyada iyo daaqadaha ee gaarka ah (waxay sawiraan kuwa bilowga) Qoysaska leh parameter-ro la qoray, formulas, calaamad qorshe gaar ah, hotspots, ku celinta, heerarka faahfaahinta, qoysaska gudaha qoysaska, cabbirro miis ka yimid iyo parameter-ro walxood gaar ah halkan ayaa la sameeyaa: eeg Wax ka beddel qoys iyo Qoysaska iyo cabbirradooda. Qoys nuqul ka samee si aad ugu bilowdo mid Wax ka beddelka noocyada barnaamijyada kale ee qoysaska; beddelka alaabta maktabadda qoys Noocyada barnaamijyada kale waa la liistaa, waa la kooxeeyaa qiyaas ahaan, walxahooda waa la doortaa. Alaabta maktabadda waa la dhigaa sida ay tahay Alaabta soo saaraha, valve-yada iyo qalabka (awoodaha, miisaska, cabbirrada xidhiidhka soo saaraha); cabbirrada tee iyo reducer ee ASME B16.9 ee spool-yada birta; luminta cadaadiska ee fittings-ka, socodka iyo isu-dheelitirka; sprinklers; cable trays; isku-dhegga dhuumaha iyo godadka sida unugyada fixture; jiidista geesaha tuubada; ka gooyida godadka darbiyada iyo sagxadaha; sii deynta dhamaadka tuubada oo ku xidhan port (marka laga reebo tirtirka qalabka); ports-ka alaabta maktabadda ee laga dhigay panelka Library; miisaska fittings; kala-duwanaanshaha duct-yada, qiyaasaha iyo connectors-ka Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada oo leh fittings-ka caadiga ah, nidaamyada, qorshayaasha, miisaska iyo takeoff-ka halkan ayaa la sawiraa: eeg Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada. Qalabka guud ee leh ports, tuubooyinka xidhan iyo hubinta Connections: Qalabka MEP ee leh ports, Ku xidh tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qalabka. Set-yada isku-dhaca, masaafooyinka iyo liiska godadka: Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka. Spool-yada birta iyo sheetyada, liiska jarka duct-ka: Spool-yada tuubada birta iyo sheetyada spool-ka. Alaabta soo saaraha ka soo geli barnaamijkaaga MEP oo IFC ah Hubinta naqshadda ee I-shapes-ka la alxaamay, I-shapes-ka IFC profile-kooda aan loo magacin sida W, S, IPE, HEA ama HEB oo la rogay, iyo tuubooyinka, angles-ka iyo channels-ka (way soo laabtaan aan la hubin); buckling ama jawaabta dynamic (natural frequencies waxay ku jiraan Finite elements block) (second order waa P-Delta oo keliya: elastic, flexural, aan la yareyn stiffness); darbiyada iyo sagxadaha falanqaynta; culeysyada laga sameeyo meelo (marka laga reebo hal cadaadis oo ku yaal sagxad kasta oo kulul) Tab-ka Falanqayn wuxuu siinayaa xoogagga, reactions-ka iyo deflections-ka beams, tiirarka iyo braces-ka adigoo isticmaalaya falanqayn heer-kowaad, wuxuuna hubiyaa I-shapes-ka la rogay, caawimaad ilaa injineer uu dib u eego: eeg Falanqee qaabka qaabka ah Muuqaalka moodelka Weli ma diyaar Maanta, halkii 3D oo ka yimid faylalka mashruuca Dhoofi IFC oo fur. Eeg Hel faylka mashruuca 3D ahaan IFC-da Muuqaalada gudaha ee qorshaha sawirka la sameeyay (waa la dhisaa marka laga soo qaado qolka Properties iyo xaashiyadaada); cabbirradaada muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynta (calaamadaha heerka, dherer, ballaca iyo calaamadaha albaabka/daaqadda waa la sawiraa; faallooyinka waxay ku qoran yihiin muuqaalka: eeg Wax ka beddel muuqaalada dhinaca iyo goynta); darbi sawirka muuqaalka dhinaca (waxa la sawiraa diyaarada goynta); sigaarrada habaynta ee Studio Qorshaha sawirka ee moodelka laga sameeyay: eeg Muuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo xaashiyada. Moodel kasta oo IFC ah: hal diyaarad Goyn, ama sanduuq goyn; eeg Goo moodel IFC oo diyaarad goyn Muuqaalada soo-wicitaanka, muuqaalada faahfaahinta, muuqaalada sawirka iyo legends; sawirada sawirka; goynta muuqaalka dhinaca; template-yada muuqaalka dhinaca, goynta, qorshaha saqafka iyo 3D; qorshayaasha saqafka ee qorshaha sawirka la sameeyay; xaashiyo gaar ah oo PDF hal mar Qorshayaasha iyo qorshayaasha saqafka waxay leeyihiin ranges-ka muuqaalka, goob jarid, cabbir iyo underlay (qorshayaashu sidoo kale templates), xaashiyadaada waxay qaataan qorshayaasha, qorshayaasha saqafka, muuqaalada dhinaca, goynta iyo liisaska, mid kastaa PDF ahaan kaydsan: eeg Muuqaalada, ranges-ka muuqaalka iyo xaashiyadaada Iftiinka ee laga soo qaatay sawirka mar dambe; saqaf dhaadhicsan ama tallaabo; qaabab saqaf oo aan ahayn shanta gridka; astaanta iftiinka ee gaarka u ah qorshaha saqafka Dhig adigoo isticmaalaya Mount: At the ceiling; qorshaha saqafka wuxuu sawiraa qaab-dhismeedka iftiinka isaga: eeg Dhig qalabka iyo qoyska maktabadda Wadaagista liisaska raadinta dadka kale, sidoo kale seto gudaha faylka IFC Set-yadu waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan; eeg Hel walxaha fasalka, magaca ama sifada Cabbiridda xagallo, ama dhinac dhowr barood ah Cabbir qayb kastaa adigoo isticmaalaya Qiyaas: eeg Cabbir masaafooyinka, qaybaha iyo meelaha 3D Textures ee muuqaalka 3D ee tooska ah Agabka la rangeeyay midabkooda ayay muujiyaan muuqaalka, texture-kooda sawirada la rendar-gareeyay: eeg Rendar sawir moodelka Isku-dhac jilicsan (soft) oo u dhexeeya laba set, kooxda isku-dhaca, kaydinta natiijooyinka isku-dhaca Ku shaqee Hubinta isku-dhaca oo ka dhig dhibaatooyinka muhiimka ah: eeg Hubi isku-dhacyada. Tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada ee qaabka ah waxay leeyihiin Hubi masaafooyinka: eeg Hubi tuubooyinka iyo tuubada hawada qaabka Kaydinta moodeello dhowr hal set ahaan, ama tafatirka laba moodel mar Tafatir hal moodel mar; mid kastaa faylkiisa ayuu kaydiyaa Magacyada issues-ka, taariikhaha dhammaadka, calaamadaha, viewpoints dhowr issue kasta, tafatirka issue Hal muuqaal issue kasta; eeg Issues iyo faylalka BCF .ifczip iyo .ifcxml Ka fur ama dhoofi .ifc caadi ah Map layers ee moodel aan lahayn map conversion, ama muuqaalada sawirka Dhoofi moodelka isagoo leh coordinates-kiisa: eeg Map ku yaal dhulka hoostiisa moodelka Scan-yada E57 ka badan 6 milyan oo dhibcood ama 512 MB; faylalka scanner-ka makers-kiisa (RCP, RCS, FLS, LGS, TZF, ZFS); daruurta barta ee muuqaalka 3D ee sawirka; keydinta meesha daruurta moodelka la socota Dhoofi scan-ka sida LAS ama LAZ oo ku fur moodel IFC ah: eeg Qaababka daruurta barta iyo Muuji daruurta barta dhinaca moodelka Diiwaanka scan-yada: helida bartilmaameedyada (duufaanno, shaxanno) scan-ka gudihiisa, xalinta dhammaan scan-yada wada (bundle adjustment), scale, diiwaan-gelinta moodel ka dhan Dooro dhibcaha isku mid ah ama geli isku-xidhka bartilmaameedka, kadibna hal scan mar hagaaji adigoo isticmaalaya ICP: eeg Diiwaan-geli dhowr scan hal mid Furista faylalka mashruuca .pln, .pla, .tpl iyo .bpn Dhoofi IFC iyo DWG ka dhig, ama bundle mashruuc: eeg Fur faylalka mashruuca .pln iyo .pla iyo Fur bundle mashruuc Furista liiska Walxaha si aad u doorato fasal ahaan Guji kooxda nooca Geedka moodelka: eeg Jid u hel geedka moodelka Qorista faallo ama cinwaan issue ah VR-ka, qoraallada cod, dhaqaajinta diyaarada goynta gacanta VR-ka, sanduuq goyn VR-ka Dhig issue VR-ka, kadibna ku dar erayadiisa tab-ka Issues; deji diyaarad goyn ama sanduuq muuqaalka 3D ka hor intaadan gelin: eeg Dib u eeg moodelka headset VR-ka Arkida dadka miiska VR-ka (kaliya dadka VR-ka ku jira ayaa muuqda), duubista socodka VR-ka Weydii inay ku biiraan VR-ka, ama raac muuqaalka 3D Iftiinka maalinta (climate-based daylight, glare, saacadaha qorraxda), daaqadaha saqafka daylight factor-ka, hubinta BS EN 17037 ama qorshooyinka dhismaha cagaaran; habka tamarta ISO 52016-1, lafaynta tamarta saacadlaha, mass-ka kulaylka iyo xidhka, faylalka cimilada Qalabka naqshadda: daylight factor-ka celceliska ah, sidaad VS (vertical sky component) ee daaqad kasta, qorraxda daaqadaha taariikh gaar ah iyo daylight factor-ka grid-ka (Qiyaas iftiinka maalinta qol kasta); lumitaanka kulaylka, sanad degree-day ah iyo qulqulka qabowga qol kasta (Qiyaas kulaylka iyo qaboobaha). Isticmaal barnaamij lafaynta si aad u hubiso waafaqsanaanta Twin dhismo oo martiqaad ah: akhrinta la kaydiyo iyo digniinaha iimaylka la diro markii BimCraft la xirto, iimaylada waqtiga dayactirka; MQTT 5; dib u akhrinta shaqooyinka COBie Akhrinta CSV-ga ama toos broker-kaaga ama cinwaankaaga markii moodelku furan yahay, xadka calaamadinaya hantida, dokumentiyada, COBie ka soo dhoofinta iyo gelinta: eeg Hay xogta hantida iyo diiwaanka dayactirka moodelka Plug-in ama xidhiidh toos ah oo Enscape, Twinmotion ama barnaamijyada kale ee muuqaalka; faylalka FBX ama Datasmith; hal walax hal walax, muuqaalada iyo socodyada la kaydiyay ee .glb Kaydi .glb barnaamijyada rendarka ee akhria glTF, faylka USD (hal walax hal walax, oo leh xogtiisa IFC: eeg Dhoofi moodelka USD ahaan), ama IFC kuwa ku shaqeeya barnaamij naqshadeed kale: eeg U dir moodelka barnaamijka rendarka iyo Fur muuqaalka barnaamij kale Barnaamij kale oo sawiraya sawirka Render iyada oo aan add-on engine ah (CadCraft waligiis ma shaqeeyo barnaamij raacaya GNU GPL licence); kamaradaha panorama ama stereo iyo sawir sama barnaamij kale; plug-in-ka Unreal Engine (faylalka waa la qoraa, plug-in-ka furaya lama sii daayo) Engine-keenna Fast iyo Path tracer; engine-ka add-on-ka (sawirka barnaamij kale); faylka USD, glTF ama Unreal ee liiska Engine si aad ugu qaaddo barnaamij kasta Muuqaalka nool: beerista dhirta iyo dhagaxyada, la wadaagida panorama-yada, socod, muuqaal offline ah ama fiidiyo ModelCraft-ka muuqaalka nool ayaa leh; halkan, sawirada la rendar-gareeyay iyo panorama 360°: eeg Muuqaalka nool iyo Rendar sawir moodelka Sawirada Weli ma diyaar Maanta, halkii Wax ka beddelka, cabbirka ama kaydinta DWG iyo DXF Barnaamijka sawirka CadCraft (Wax ka beddel CadCraft muuqaalka 2D) Daabacaadda ama dhoofinta PDF Ka daabac barnaamijka sawirka abuuray; marka hore hubi Aragtida daabacaadda Qaabka qalinka iyo miisaska qalinka Aragtida daabacaadda wuxuu muujiyaa madow caadi ah oo leh miisaska khadadka Faylalka DWG ka hor R13, iyo DXF binary (BimCraft wuu sheegaa markaad furto mid) Sawirka dib ugu kaydi DWG cusub, ama ASCII DXF Sawirada lagu xiray gudaha sawirada xiran Si toos ah u fur Sawirada TIFF Kaydi nuqul PNG ama JPEG ah oo magac isku mid ah ku dar Sawirada DGN Waxay ku liisan tahay warbixinnada galalka oo keliya Shayada ku qoran Weli lama sawirin Sawirka ka eeg barnaamijka abuuray Solids-ka ACIS, bodies, regions iyo surfaces, iyo meshes-ka subdivision ee 3D Ka dhoofi IFC ama 3D faces barnaamijka abuuray sawirka Sawirada, multileaders iyo xaashiyada muuqaalka 3D ee sawirka Ka eeg tab-ka Moodeel iyo xaashiyada Doorashada shayada muuqaalka 2D ee sawirka Ku beddel 3D oo halkaas guji shayga: eeg Arag sawirka DWG ama DXF 3D Liisaska qalabka laga soo qaatay sawirada aan lahayn tags-ka KCL-ITEM Lama heli karo Miiska qalabka oo ah XLSX ama PDF Soo deji CSV oo ku fur spreadsheet Faylalka iyo nidaamyada Weli ma diyaar Maanta, halkii Kaydinta cloud-ka Nuqullada ku kaydi kombiyuutarkaaga ama server-ka xafiiska. Kaydinta cloud-ka weli ma diyaar Xusuusta galalka Firefox iyo Safari Galka mar kale dooro, ama jiid Dib u soo celinta ka dib kaydinta Faylka asalka ah mar kale fur si aad dib u bilowdo Dhamaystirka qaybta laga jarey faylka mashruuca Mar kale nuqulka asalka ah koobiyee; galka gudihiisa, BimCraft wuxuu akhrinayaa backup-ka ugu dambeeyay ee dhammaystiran Dib u furista faylalka aad furan u haysay Isbeddelada aan la kaydin waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa \"Ma soo celiyaa shaqadaada?\" markaad soo noqoto; faylalka mar kale ka fur liiska ugu dambeeyay","lang":"so"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Isticmaalka caawintan","summary":"Fur caawinta, baadh, oo arag tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["caawin","f1","baadh","casharro","buug"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-caawinta","text":"Fur caawinta","level":2},{"id":"raadi-mawduuc","text":"Raadi mawduuc","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka","text":"Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la&#039;aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-caawinta\"\u003EFur caawinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ee app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la socda furaha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EFurayaasha Mac-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-mawduuc\"\u003ERaadi mawduuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003ETillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go&#039;aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan &quot;Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka\"\u003ECaawintaas oo kale websaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebsaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la'aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa. Fur caawinta Riix F1, ama dooro Caawin barka sare ee app-ka. Riix Esc ama dooro Xir si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix F1 oo la socda furaha fn (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka Caawin. Eeg Furayaasha Mac-ka. Raadi mawduuc Ku qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa. Mawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka. Xiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. Dib u noqo wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid. Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga Qaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go'aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan \"Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online\". Dooro Beddel sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale. Dooro Muuji dhammaan si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Gaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: Ctrl+S wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S. Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka Websaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, Ku fur website-ka oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarada","summary":"Browserrada app-yadu ku shaqeeyaan, waxa ka duwan dhexdooda, iyo waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","browser","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","shuruudaha","xusuusta"],"headings":[{"id":"browserka","text":"Browserka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan","text":"Waxa browserada ku kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan","text":"Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay","text":"Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka\"\u003EBrowserka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan\"\u003EWaxa browserada ku kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ama Edge, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji &quot;File download location&quot; &quot;Ask for each download&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003ETaabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan\"\u003EBrowserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee \u003Cem\u003Ebilaabmo\u003C/em\u003E, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan). Browserka Isticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan: Browser Engine Faahfaahin Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha. Firefox Gecko Way shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah. Safari WebKit Way shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad. Dhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga. Waxa browserada ku kala duwan Furidda folder-ka. Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba. Kaydinta. Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin. Chrome ama Edge, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Firefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Safari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji \"File download location\" \"Ask for each download\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Apps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada Qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro. Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan Waxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo. Nooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo. Tanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee bilaabmo, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo. Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay Kuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray: 8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn). Chip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan. Faylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada","summary":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro, furayaasha function ee Mac-ka, riix midig iyo panning la'aan mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kiiboodh","gaadh","shortcut","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","furayaasha function","trackpad","riix midig","badhanka dhexe","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka","text":"Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka","level":2},{"id":"gaadhka-browserku-hayo","text":"Gaadhka browserku hayo","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka","text":"Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal","text":"Qorista sanduuq qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoran\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows iyo Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. &quot;Kadib&quot; waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha function ee Mac-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehay \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efur \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhka-browserku-hayo\"\u003EGaadhka browserku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-ka iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashadda buuxda ee browserka (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka\"\u003EBadhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal\"\u003EQorista sanduuq qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista &quot;L&quot; waxay qortaa L. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro Caawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo. Qoran Mac-ka Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) iyo S Ctrl iyo S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F Ctrl, Shift iyo F Alt+← Option (⌥) iyo ← Alt iyo ← Backspace furaha Delete Backspace Delete fn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore) Delete Enter Return Enter Calaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. \"Kadib\" waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo. Gaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (Ctrl+Shift+F), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso. Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto: hay fn (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama fur System Settings, kadibna Keyboard, kadibna Keyboard Shortcuts, kadibna Function Keys, oo shid \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Qaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii. Gaadhka browserku hayo Bog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T iyo Ctrl+W had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas. Ctrl+Q Mac-ka iyo Alt+F4 Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Shaashadda buuxda ee browserka (Control-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda / F11) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo Ctrl+Shift+F ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara. Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn: Riix midig: guji labo farood. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings gudaha, kadibna Trackpad, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. Ctrl la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero. Riix midig: guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Qorista sanduuq qoraal Intaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista \"L\" waxay qortaa L. Riix Esc ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Hel qalab ama dejin","summary":"Riix Ctrl+K oo qor xarfo yar si aad u wada fuliso qalab kasta, u beddesho dejin ama furto mawduuc caawin.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["raadi","baadh","palet amarka","furid degdeg","fuli amar","qalab","dejin","gaadh","ctrl k","cmd k"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-oo-fuli","text":"Raadi oo fuli","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-oo-fuli\"\u003ERaadi oo fuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa sanduuqa xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"App kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka. Raadi oo fuli Riix Ctrl+K, ama dooro Raadi barka sare ku jirta. Qor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid. Riix Enter si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. Esc ayaa sanduuqa xidha. Qalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa Dejinta oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa. Waxa aad ogaataa Waxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay. Qalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay. Qalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad","summary":"Ku xidh panelada dhinaca bidix, midig ama hoosta, isku rari, u kooxee sida tab-yo, ku hay ama qari, ku dhaaf naqshadda, ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow, dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo, ama u wareeji daaqad gaar ah shaashad kale.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panelada","ku xidh","ku dhaaf","wareeji panel","jiid","qaabeynta","tab-yada","kooxda tab-ka","isku rari","ku hay","auto-hide","qari panel","xir panel","kooban","cabbirka qaabeynta","dhow","safafka qalabka","lafmeyso","1 safka","2 safka","khadka qalabka","shaashad labaad","laba shaashad","shaashado badan","daaqad","daaqad kor u soo booda","dib u deji qaabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda","text":"Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo","text":"U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo","level":2},{"id":"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi","text":"Pin, qari oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow","text":"Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow","level":2},{"id":"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo","text":"Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-kiiboodhka","text":"Isticmaal kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad","text":"Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad","level":2},{"id":"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan","text":"Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan","level":2},{"id":"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah","text":"Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal","text":"Dhaqaaji wada-hadal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada","text":"Dib u dhig panelada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda\"\u003EDhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo\"\u003EU kooxee panelada sida tab-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove out of the tab group\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EPin, qari oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto-hide\u003C/strong\u003E: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnpin\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u xidho si joogto ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka xidhka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow\"\u003EKa dhig qaabeynta mid dhow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay laba doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComfortable\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo\"\u003EDooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-kiiboodhka\"\u003EIsticmaal kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the left\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock at the bottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloat over the drawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin to the edge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E panel kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha menu-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove all panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su&#039;aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan\"\u003EHal daaqad oo panelo ka badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to panels window 2\u003C/span\u003E (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the next one\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah\"\u003EIsku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E qaybtaas oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal\"\u003EDhaqaaji wada-hadal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot to PDF\u003C/span\u003E ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in its own window\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen it\u003C/span\u003E si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep them here\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan. Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu ⋯, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu ⋯ oo keliya. Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda Jiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare. Intaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa. Ku dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca. Panelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso. Panel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa. Ku jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu ⋯. U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo Laba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa beddela tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Si aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro Move out of the tab group menu ⋯-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro Tab with iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin. Pin, qari oo soo celi Pin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa auto-hide: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix Esc) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro Unpin, si aad u xidho si joogto ah. Badhanka xidhka, ama Hide this panel menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix Enter. Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow Settings › General › Layout density waxay leedahay laba doorasho. Comfortable waa caadiga. Compact wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. Reset layout ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay. Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo Settings › General › Toolbar rows waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. Wrap waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. 2 rows wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, 1 row hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama Tab ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos 2 rows, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta Settings › CadCraft. Isticmaal kiiboodhka Badhanka ⋯ ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: Dock on the left, Dock on the right, Dock at the bottom, Float over the drawing, Pin to the edge, Hide this panel, Tab with panel kale, Move to a new window iyo Put it back. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix Enter, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix Enter. Esc ayaa xidha menu-ga. Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad Dooro ⋯ panel, kadibna Move all panels to a new window. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Move panels to a new window Settings gudahiisa. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto. Sii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad. Furayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su'aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad. Chrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro Put it on my other screen daaqadda panelada (ama Put the panels on my other screen menu ⋯ panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa. Daaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa. Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta. Menu ⋯ ee panel, Move to a new window wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, Move to panels window 2 (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa \"panels 2\". Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa. Daaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada. Markaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro Open the next one mar kasta daaqad kasta. Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah Qaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu ⋯ qaybtaas oo dooro Move to a new window; Put it back (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah. Dhaqaaji wada-hadal Wada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso. Kiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix Alt+Shift+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar Ctrl si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa. Taleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin. Ku dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka Plot to PDF ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, Open in its own window. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha. Dib u dhig panelada Dooro Put the panels back daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Xidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro Open it si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama Keep them here. Settings › General › Reset layout wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen. Haddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale. Qaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka ribbon tab-yo ah oo naqshadda dushiisa ku jira, oo leh Properties iyo baadhe mashruuc dhinaca bidix iyo tab kasta muuqaal furan, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","ribbon","tab-yada ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","baadhe","palet-yada","palet properties","tab-yada muuqaalka","safka xaaladda","degdeg fur","xidh ribbon","qaabka caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn","beddel","dhigan"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka","text":"Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii","text":"Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka magaca:\u003C/strong\u003E magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat each tool does here\u003C/span\u003E (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka xulashada:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka bidix:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore fur fayl&quot;, ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka\"\u003EKa isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii\"\u003ERibbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the ribbon back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Ribbon and project browser. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Safka magaca: magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, What each tool does here (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, Help iyo Settings. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka. Ribbon: qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. File bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa. Safka xulashada: hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay. Panelka bidix: Properties sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto. Tab-yada muuqaalka: hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay. Safka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda: hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale \"Marka hore fur fayl\", ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka Markaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii Laba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka Move the ribbon ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay Collapse the ribbon iyo Keep the ribbon open sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta. Move the ribbon › Move to a new window ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the ribbon back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka tiir qalab ah oo dhinaca bidix ku jira, oo leh meel aad ku kaydiso qalabkaaga, sanduuq macluumaad oo naqshadda sare ku socda oo raacaya qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, socodsiiye dhinaca midig, tab muuqaal kasta, degdeg dooro iyo palet wax-beddel, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","sanduuqa qalabka","tiirka qalabka","sanduuqa macluumaadka","macluumaad","socodsiiye","khariidadda mashruuca","safka degdega ah","degdeg dooro","palet wax-beddel","palet pet","my tools","qalabkayga","tab-yada muuqaalka","daaqadda sanduuqa qalabka","qaabeynta caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa macluumaadka:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Nothing selected&quot;. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMy tools:\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocodsiiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka degdega ah:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalet-ka wax-beddelka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu&#039;aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii\"\u003ESanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the toolbox\u003C/span\u003E ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the toolbox back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Toolbox and info box. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Qalabka: qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa. Sanduuqa macluumaadka: hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay \"Nothing selected\". Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan. Sanduuqa qalabka: tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa. My tools: kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro Add to My tools; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan. Socodsiiyaha: panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, Properties iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig. Tab-yada muuqaalka: tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa. Safka degdega ah: hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada. Palet-ka wax-beddelka: riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu'aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo Properties. Esc, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii Badhanka Move the toolbox ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay Move to a new window: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the toolbox back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Habee qaabeyntaada oo kaydi habayntaada","summary":"Dooro panelka ku muujinaya baadhaha mashruuca, Properties ama waxa panelka u gaar ah, meesha sanduuqa qalabka ku jiro iyo waxa safafka ku jiro, kaydi sida qaabeyntaada, oo kaydi habayn oo dhan magac hoose oo aad ku beddesho.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","habee","u habee","qaabeyntayda","qaabeyntayda gaarka ah","panelada","tafatirayaasha","baadhaha mashruuca","properties","sanduuqa qalabka","safka degdega","sanduuqa macluumaadka","deegaanka shaqada","habayn","profile","kaydi habayn","beddel habayn","dhoofi habayn","soo deji habayn","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-qaabeyntaada","text":"Habee qaabeyntaada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo","text":"Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-qaabeyntaada\"\u003EHabee qaabeyntaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, kadibna dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dushiisa:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhinaceeda:\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeel naqshaddu:\u003C/strong\u003E tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this layout\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo\"\u003EKaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork environments\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave my setup\u003C/span\u003E. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwitch to it\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaag:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport a setup…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejin, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto. Habee qaabeyntaada Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,), dooro Global, kadibna Layout. Dooro Arrange your own layout…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho. Ku sii magac, kadibna dooro: Naqshadda dushiisa: qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo. Naqshadda dhinaceeda: sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo My tools oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda. Meel naqshaddu: tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda. Muuqaalka: cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka. Dooro Use this layout. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya. Waxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa From add-ons and files; Export this layout wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran Habee panelada. Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo Deegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo My tools. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan. Kaydi: qor magac hoosta Work environments oo dooro Save my setup. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas. Beddel: dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro Switch to it. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta. Wadaag: Export wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl .ccenv.json; Import a setup… wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna. Ka saar: dooro dejin, kadibna dooro Remove. Waxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin. Si aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka, qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca iyo qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","summary":"Kaydi app si aad ugu shaqeyso khadka ka baxsan, waxa ku shaqeeya xidhiidh la'aan, iyo waxa u baahan xidhiidh.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","internet la'aan","diyaarad","booqasho goob","cache","service worker","rakib","soo deji","xidhiidh"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan","text":"Waxa xidhiidh u baahan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur app-ka intaad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug &quot;Offline ready&quot;. Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuridda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan\"\u003EWaxa xidhiidh u baahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHelidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada websaydhka, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi&#039;ax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Apps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la'aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo. Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan Fur app-ka intaad online tahay. Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barka sare. Sug \"Offline ready\". Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa. Tan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la'aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa. Hadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya Furidda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga. Caawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda. Waxa xidhiidh u baahan Markii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan. Helidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Xiriirrada websaydhka, sida Ku fur website-ka iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale. Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn. Waxa aad ogaataa Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi'ax. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin. Safari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar. CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan","summary":"Faylalku kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan, sida kaydintu u shaqeyso, iyo waxa browserku xasuusto.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["asturnaan","upload","cloud","kaydi","soo dejin","kaydin","maxalli","amni","sirta"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan","level":2},{"id":"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserku-xasuusto","text":"Waxa browserku xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-cloud-ka","text":"Kaydinta cloud-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan\"\u003EFaylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida kaydintu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejinaya\u003C/strong\u003E fayl cusub:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida &quot;(edited)&quot; ama &quot;(marked up)&quot;, si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserku-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa browserku xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-cloud-ka\"\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan Markaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. Faylka lama soo dirin. Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la'aan. Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso Bog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo soo dejinaya fayl cusub: Soo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada). Apps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida \"(edited)\" ama \"(marked up)\", si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"). Waxa browserku xasuusto Qaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso. Kaydinta cloud-ka Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"so","chain":["so","en"]};
